(3388, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Alexandroupoli', 'alexandroupoli', 1, '40.843007', '25.862916', 'Paralia Astir', 'The beach Paralia Astir is located in the town of Alexandroupoli of the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. It is a sandy beach mixed with pebbles. The parking is only 50 m away and is easy to reach. Next to the beach there is a hotel complex with a swimming pool, the children playground and many other ammenities. It\'s a family beach and suitable for small children.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 3, 2, 12, 4, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d8525d87/alexandroupoli/\" data-label_1=\"ALEXANDROUPOLI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ALEXANDROUPOLI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15917759959926.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5401, 5, '2019-03-16 09:15:44', '2019-03-16 08:15:44', 1, 'alexandroupoli-paralia-astir_5', 1),
(3389, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Alexandroupoli', 'alexandroupoli', 1, '40.8475152', '25.8453414', 'Paralia Reina', 'In the region of Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, near the city Alexandroupoli you can visit with your family the sandy beach Reina. It\'s a very long beach, more than 1 km, with a width of 20 m, and it\'s just perfect running down the sandy beach. There is no natural shadow, so bring your umbrella with you. The accommodation and the restaurants are right on the beach. The parking is huge as well, which makes ideal for motorhomes.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 5, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d8525d87/alexandroupoli/\" data-label_1=\"ALEXANDROUPOLI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ALEXANDROUPOLI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15917759959926.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5831, 5, '2019-03-16 10:35:46', '2019-03-16 09:35:46', 1, 'alexandroupoli-paralia-reina_5', 1),
(3390, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Alexandroupoli', 'alexandroupoli', 1, '40.847692', '25.836459', 'Paralia Alexander', 'A true explorer beach. The path to the beach is difficult. Parts of the stairs are broken, so be careful. The beach is located in the city of Alexandroupoli, which is a part of the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. It\'s a pebble beach with nice reddish 10m high rocks in the backgroud. Be advised to be careful when going down the path. The entry to the water is nice and you can swim rightaway.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 3, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 4, 3, 8, 3, 2, 2, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d8525d87/alexandroupoli/\" data-label_1=\"ALEXANDROUPOLI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ALEXANDROUPOLI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15917759959926.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5468, 5, '2019-03-16 11:42:08', '2019-03-16 10:42:08', 1, 'alexandroupoli-paralia-alexander_5', 1),
(3391, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Alexandroupoli', 'alexandroupoli', 1, '40.848450', '25.830505', 'Paralia Anapafseos', 'You can find this 2 km long beach just outside the town of Alexandroupoli in the region of Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Parking is available down the whole stretch of the beach, motorhomes will also find a place to park. It is a sandy beach with some mixes pebbles. Restaurants and accommodation, also a hotel are right on the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 4, 3, 17, 5, 2, 2, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d8525d87/alexandroupoli/\" data-label_1=\"ALEXANDROUPOLI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ALEXANDROUPOLI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15917759959926.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6213, 5, '2019-03-16 12:08:26', '2019-03-16 11:08:26', 1, 'alexandroupoli-paralia-anapafseos_5', 1),
(3392, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Alexandroupoli', 'alexandroupoli', 1, '40.8484452', '25.7512442', 'Paralia Makri', 'A beach with a harbour, restaurants and a nice sorrounding in the heart of olive trees. It is suitable for families who love sand, pebbles and small shells on the beach. The parking is paved and suitable also for motorhomes. Paralia Makri is still inside the authority ofhe town Alexandroupoli and belongs to the Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki region.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 3, 2, 14, 6, 2, 2, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d8525d87/alexandroupoli/\" data-label_1=\"ALEXANDROUPOLI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ALEXANDROUPOLI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15917759959926.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8468, 5, '2019-03-16 13:48:00', '2019-03-16 12:48:00', 1, 'alexandroupoli-paralia-makri_5', 1),
(3393, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Alexandroupoli', 'alexandroupoli', 1, '40.8478022', '25.7238482', 'Paralia Agías Paraskevís', 'Alexandroupoli and the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki is known for many sandy beaches, and paralia Agías Paraskevís is one if them. This family beach has a lot of infrastructure to make your stay as pleasent as possible. The restaurants are nearby, aswell the parking. The road to the beach is in a good shape.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d8525d87/alexandroupoli/\" data-label_1=\"ALEXANDROUPOLI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ALEXANDROUPOLI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15917759959926.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5508, 5, '2019-03-16 15:09:49', '2019-03-16 14:09:49', 1, 'alexandroupoli-paralia-agias-paraskevis_5', 1),
(3394, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Alexandroupoli', 'alexandroupoli', 1, '40.853880', '25.682571', 'Paralia Dikellon', 'The last very long beach, many kilometres, in Alexandroupoli and the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki is the beach Dikellon. You can park by the road. This family beach has very little infrastructure. The restaurants are nearby alongside the beach. It is a family beach with lots of small pebles, but without the sunshade.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 6, 2, 3, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d8525d87/alexandroupoli/\" data-label_1=\"ALEXANDROUPOLI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ALEXANDROUPOLI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15917759959926.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5550, 5, '2019-03-16 15:09:56', '2019-03-16 14:09:56', 1, 'alexandroupoli-paralia-dikellon_5', 1),
(3395, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Sapes', 'sapes', 1, '40.863944', '25.630122', 'Paralia Sapes', 'The only beach the town Sapes calls its own is the paralia Sapes. Still in the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki this beach is more suitable for the ones who seek adventure, before comfort. Here there is basically no infrastructure, but there is an archeological site just nearby, called Choros Archea. The beach itself is made of mostly pebbles. Parking is only by the roadside, no official parking.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 16, 5, 2, 6, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d0225d70/sapes/\" data-label_1=\"SAPES\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >SAPES WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15917759959926.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3700, 5, '2019-03-16 15:55:30', '2019-03-16 14:55:30', 1, 'sapes-paralia-sapes_5', 1),
(3396, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Maronia', 'maronia', 1, '40.902833', '25.428233', 'Paralia Kryoneri ', 'Welcome to a realy nice sandy family beach. Located in the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, near the town Maronia, it offers a huge parking just in front of the beach. Children will love this beauty, but watch out for the cliffs. The water is shallow, and so perfect for small children to play safely in the water.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 2, 17, 8, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9025d52/maroneia/\" data-label_1=\"MARONIA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >MARONIA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15922136058852.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 4815, 5, '2019-03-17 08:39:02', '2019-03-17 07:39:02', 1, 'maronia-paralia-kryoneri_5', 1),
(3397, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Maronia', 'maronia', 1, '40.909444', '25.385833', 'Paralia Profitis Ilias', 'Natural shades are not very often to find on the beach around the town of Maronia. But this paralia is different. It still belongs to the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, it\'s a family beach with a mixture of sand, pebbles and big stones. Parking is in front of the beach, and motohomes are welcomed aswell. Accommodatin, especially apartments are in the vicinity.', 5, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 15, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9025d52/maroneia/\" data-label_1=\"MARONIA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >MARONIA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15917759959926.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5029, 5, '2019-03-17 09:49:42', '2019-03-17 08:49:42', 1, 'maronia-paralia-profitis-ilias_5', 1),
(3398, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Maronia', 'maronia', 1, '41.2364047', '25.4546365', 'Paralia Profitis Ilias', 'Natural shades are not very often to find on the beach around the town of Maronia. But this paralia is different. It still belongs to the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, it\'s a family beach with a mixture of sand, pebbles and big stones. Parking is in front of the beach, and motohomes are welcomed aswell. Accommodatin, especially apartments are in the vicinity.', 5, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 15, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-17 11:03:49', '2019-03-17 10:03:49', 11, 'maronia-paralia-profitis-ilias_5', 1),
(3399, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Komotini', 'komotini', 1, '40.938056', '25.233611', 'Paralia Glyfada ', 'A true adventure beach. Almost no infrastructure, only a parking, also for motorhomes. The beach surface is predominantly sand, with some pebbles. The nearest city is Komotini in the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, what is the east Greece. Accommodation is far away, aswel the restaurants.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 6, 1, 1, 17, 3, 2, 4, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d1225d41/komotini/\" data-label_1=\"KOMOTINI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KOMOTINI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16055566267547.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 4531, 5, '2019-03-17 12:23:51', '2019-03-17 11:23:51', 1, 'komotini-paralia-glyfada_5', 1),
(3400, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Komotini', 'komotini', 1, '40.942117', '25.194629', 'Paralia Mésis', 'A lot of sand, grass, trees and many kilometrs of pure beach fealings you can expect at the beach Mesis. It\'s located in the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Families will love the beach, especially if you are with small children, and you need some shadow for your youngsters. The parking is huge and it is paved, and you can easy reach the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 2, 17, 8, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d1225d41/komotini/\" data-label_1=\"KOMOTINI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KOMOTINI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16053486085269.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 4099, 5, '2019-03-17 13:35:16', '2019-03-17 12:35:16', 1, 'komotini-paralia-mesis_5', 1),
(3401, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Komotini', 'komotini', 1, '40.948194', '25.166908', 'Paralia Arogi Fanari', 'The town Fanari is well known for its beautiful beaches. One of them, the Arogi Fanari is a true beauty. It\'s more km long, very wide, with lots of sand, and some natural shadow is as well present. Head there if you are a family type beach friend. A hotel and some beach bars are as well in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 9, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d1225d41/komotini/\" data-label_1=\"KOMOTINI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KOMOTINI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16053486085269.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6859, 5, '2019-03-17 14:12:06', '2019-03-17 13:12:06', 1, 'komotini-paralia-arogi-fanari_5', 1),
(3402, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Komotini', 'komotini', 1, '40.955793', '25.133740', 'Paralia Fanari kéntro', 'The second beach in Fanari has a mix of sand and pebbles to offer. The parking is very large, and there is a auto camp in the vicinity. Beach infrastructure is poor, so don\'t expect a high comfort. It\'s more siutet for an adventurer type than the family type.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 14, 7, 2, 6, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d1225d41/komotini/\" data-label_1=\"KOMOTINI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KOMOTINI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16053486085269.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3580, 5, '2019-03-17 14:44:23', '2019-03-17 13:44:23', 1, 'komotini-paralia-fanari-kentro_5', 1),
(3403, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Komotini', 'komotini', 1, '40.962212', '25.125449', 'Paralia Fanari  ', 'A true city beach, with lots of infrastructure to please all your needs, this is paralia Fanari. The marina is nearby, there is even a small park to give you some protection from the summer sun. The parking is all around the beach, with plenty of spaces. Beach bars and other types are as well in the vicinity. The beach surface is a mix of sand, pebbles and some rocks.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 14, 6, 5, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d1225d41/komotini/\" data-label_1=\"KOMOTINI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KOMOTINI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16053486085269.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5494, 5, '2019-03-17 15:52:11', '2019-03-17 14:52:11', 1, 'komotini-paralia-fanari_5', 1),
(3404, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Avdira', 'avdira', 1, '40.968668', '25.013817', 'Paralia Mandra ', 'The paralia Mandra beach is one of a few beaches in this region, which is Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, that is really suitable for small children. The shallow water is present everywhere along the beach coastline. It is a sandy beach, with some natural shade and many beach infrastructure. An autocamp is just nearby, so no need to search for accommodation in the sorrounding.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 2, 1, 17, 7, 1, 11, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9824d95/abdera/\" data-label_1=\"AVDIRA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >AVDIRA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16053486085269.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 4941, 5, '2019-03-17 16:43:51', '2019-03-17 15:43:51', 1, 'avdira-paralia-mandra_5', 1),
(3405, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Avdira', 'avdira', 1, '40.9393744', '24.9909434', 'Paralia Ai Giannis', 'Avdira has many sandy beaches. Most of them are long, but paralia Ai Giannis is only 200 m long, and has a nice curve. There are some rocks on the edges, there is a beach bar, and some infrastructure. Parking is not big, but enough for 20 cars. Some apartments are nearby, but no hotels.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 4, 1, 2, 10, 4, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9824d95/abdera/\" data-label_1=\"AVDIRA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >AVDIRA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16055566267547.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3630, 5, '2019-03-17 16:59:32', '2019-03-17 15:59:32', 1, 'avdira-paralia-ai-giannis_5', 1),
(3406, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Avdira', 'avdira', 1, '40.930295', '24.945447', 'Paralia Mirodato ', 'You need to visit this beach. I was very pleased with it. There is a lot of beach infrastructure here. Kids, especialy small children will love this beach. The entry into water is very shalow, and there are lots of children play grounds and sportfields around. The parking is paved and very large. Restaurants and beach bars are as well there.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 11, 1, 10, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9824d95/abdera/\" data-label_1=\"AVDIRA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >AVDIRA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16199878311309.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5781, 5, '2019-03-18 10:35:58', '2019-03-18 09:35:58', 1, 'avdira-paralia-mirodato_5', 1),
(3407, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Topeiros', 'topeiros', 1, '40.914459', '24.890485', 'Paralia Mangana ', 'Sand is here at home. This beach has lots of it. It is very long and more than 100 m wide, so plenty of space to find a spot for you. The parking space is very large, and can also host motorhomes. The beach is in the middle of a swamp, so don\' t expect any accommodation in the vicinity. Swimming can be done after 30m of entry into the water.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 12, 1, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9824d95/abdera/\" data-label_1=\"ABDERA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ABDERA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3631, 5, '2019-03-18 10:36:21', '2019-03-18 09:36:21', 1, 'topeiros-paralia-mangana_5', 1),
(3408, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Keramoti', 'keramoti', 1, '40.8529422', '24.7004829', 'Paralia Keramoti', 'The town of Keramoti, where you need to embark on a ferry to reach the island Thassoss, hosts a very long and wide sandy beach. It has some natural shade, many parking spots, many beach bars and other beach infrastructure. The town itself is also nearby, where you will finf even more shops, bars and markets. Accommodations are predominantly apartments and hotels.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 11, 1, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d8624d71/keramoti/\" data-label_1=\"KERAMOTI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KERAMOTI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16203759967761.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5068, 5, '2019-03-18 12:38:11', '2019-03-18 11:38:11', 1, 'keramoti-paralia-keramoti_5', 1),
(3409, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Chrysoupoli', 'chrysoupoli', 1, '40.937118', '24.564278', 'Paralia Timari', 'Near the Kavala airport, on the brinks of the agricultural fields there is a nice sandy beach called Tirala. It offers many natural shade, a large parking, some beach infrastructure and a nice view of the aegean sea. The water entry is steep, not really for small children to play in.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 4, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9924d70/chrysoupoli/\" data-label_1=\"CHRYSOUPOLI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-theme=\"original\" >CHRYSOUPOLI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16057340324874.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5324, 5, '2019-03-18 13:15:46', '2019-03-18 12:15:46', 1, 'nestos-paralia-timari_5', 1),
(3410, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Kavala', 'kavala', 1, '40.945339', '24.454465', 'Paralia Aspri Ammos', 'The Kavala town has many beaches to offer. The first one from the east side is the paralia Aspri Ammos. Altough the beach is already located near the mountains, it is a sandy beach, mostly for families. The parking is very large, and welcomes as well motorhomes. In the vicinity there is a restaurant and some appartments ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 12, 6, 2, 5, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9424d41/kavala/\" data-label_1=\"KAVALA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KAVALA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16060485197436.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6936, 5, '2019-03-18 14:51:15', '2019-03-18 13:51:15', 1, 'kavala-paralia-aspri-ammos_5', 1),
(3411, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Kavala', 'kavala', 1, '40.945908', '24.436085', 'Paralia Perigiali', 'This sandy beach is located just outside the Kavala centre. The parking is next to the road, which makes the beach easy to reach. Families are here welcome, since there is some beach infrastructure. Some beach bars are as well on the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 16, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9424d41/kavala/\" data-label_1=\"KAVALA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KAVALA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16060485197436.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6507, 5, '2019-03-18 15:22:40', '2019-03-18 14:22:40', 1, 'kavala-paralia-perigiali_5', 1),
(3412, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Kavala', 'kavala', 1, '40.922080', '24.384903', 'Paralia Kalamitsa', 'A true city beach in the middle of the Kavala town. It is a sandy beach suitable for families. It offers all kind of beach infrastructure, a huge parking space, witch has a height barrier, but some low motorhomes can pas trough it. Children will also love this place, as well the sport enthusiats. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 2, 15, 4, 3, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9424d41/kavala/\" data-label_1=\"KAVALA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KAVALA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16210654411126.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6682, 5, '2019-03-19 10:41:35', '2019-03-19 09:41:35', 1, 'kavala-paralia-kalamitsa_5', 1),
(3413, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Kavala', 'kavala', 1, '40.9155495', '24.3791816', 'Paralia Batis', 'A true beauty she is, the paralia Batis. It\'s a sandy beach, suitable for families and thise one who love to camp. The camp, with all possible beach infrastructure is right next to the beach, as well as some restaurants and beach bars. The parking space is a little bit higher and some 100 m away, but it is big and you can reach the beach by stairs.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 4, 10, 6, 3, 2, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/oor8Ik8lw40', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9424d41/kavala/\" data-label_1=\"KAVALA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KAVALA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15607701525849.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 9521, 5, '2019-03-19 10:41:40', '2019-03-19 09:41:40', 1, 'kavala-paralia-batis_5', 1),
(3414, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Paleo Tsifliki', 'paleo-tsifliki', 1, '40.9034212', '24.3516129', 'Paralia Paleo Tsifliki', 'A nice sandy beach in the middle of the village Paleo Tsifiki. It is sorunded with many apartments, but parking is difficult to find. There is also a beach bar present, where you can rent some deckchairs and sunshades. Special about this beach are the wawes which can be also used for surfing or othe water sports.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 14, 2, 2, 8, 5, 1, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d9024d35/palio-kavala/\" data-label_1=\"PALEO TSIFLIKI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >PALEO TSIFLIKI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16207638999397.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 4465, 5, '2019-03-19 10:41:46', '2019-03-19 09:41:46', 1, 'paleo-tsifliki-paralia-paleo-tsifliki_5', 1),
(3415, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Pangaio', 'pangaio', 1, '40.876944', '24.316389', 'Paralia Iraklitsa', 'If you like long sandy beaches, the paralia Iraklitsa is the one for you. Parking is free and there is really lots of it, also for motorhomes. There are some sport fields and some children playgrounds available. Beach bars and other catareing, as well as apartments are also in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 7, 2, 4, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/bM80UuYkaGw', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d8624d32/nea-iraklitsa/\" data-label_1=\"NEA IRAKLITSA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >NEA IRAKLITSA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15608423943711.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5637, 5, '2019-03-19 11:14:21', '2019-03-19 10:14:21', 1, 'pangaio-paralia-iraklitsa_5', 1),
(3416, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Nea Peramos', 'nea-peramos', 1, '40.844428', '24.307438', 'Paralia Nea Peramos Kavalas', 'A true city beach with lots of beach infrastructure. Located in the Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki region this beach belongs to the town of Nea Peramos. It has a lot of sand, is very long but only maximu 10m wide. Food and accommodation are available in the vicinity. For children there is also a playground.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 1, 1, 17, 3, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d8424d30/nea-peramos/\" data-label_1=\"NEA PERAMOS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >NEA PERAMOS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16203818104408.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5358, 5, '2019-03-19 14:49:27', '2019-03-19 13:49:27', 1, 'nea-peramos-paralia-nea-peramos-kavalas_5', 1),
(3417, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Pangaio', 'pangaio', 1, '40.812384', '24.292155', 'Paralia Ammolofoi ', 'This one is a true beauty. This sandy beach, with its nice curves and crystal clear water will stay in your memmory. Parking is large and made of dirt. Beach bars are also present here, as well some beach infrastructure. The sorrounding is more natural than urban, so expect more peace there.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 1, 1, 17, 6, 2, 2, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/5wRbV5s5BzU', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d7222d73/agios-athanasios/\" data-label_1=\"AGIOS ATHANASIOS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >AGIOS ATHANASIOS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15607184011599.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6597, 5, '2019-03-19 16:40:34', '2019-03-19 15:40:34', 1, 'pangaio-paralia-ammolofoi_5', 1),
(3418, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Pangaio', 'pangaio', 1, '40.719722', '24.075000', 'Paralia Akrotiri Apollonias', 'This beach is a true adventurer beach. There is practicaly no beach infrastructure, except the parking, which consists of dirt. On the beach itself there is a mixture of sand and rocks, could be slippery. The water entry is easy, except where there are rocks. Dogs are going to love this place.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 8, 1, 2, 14, 6, 2, 2, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d8124d00/kokkinochori/\" data-label_1=\"KOKKINOCHORI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KOKKINOCHORI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16203898142825.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2307, 5, '2019-03-19 16:40:39', '2019-03-19 15:40:39', 1, 'pangaio-paralia-akrotiri-apollonias_5', 1),
(3419, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Pangaio', 'pangaio', 1, '40.727778', '24.018056', 'Paralia Vrisi', 'A true motorhome beach. The parking is flat and very wide. You can access the beach almost directly from your car. It is a sandy beach, with some beach infrastructure. A beach bar is also here. Here is no natural shade so bring your sunshades with you, or rent them at the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 7, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/undefined/\" data-label_1=\"NEA PERAMOS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >NEA PERAMOS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16203898142825.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3126, 5, '2019-03-19 16:40:45', '2019-03-19 15:40:45', 1, 'pangaio-paralia-vrisi_5', 1),
(3420, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'anatoliki-makedonia-kai-thraki', 'Paralia Ofriniou', 'paralia-ofriniou', 1, '40.761267', '23.904177', 'Paralia Ofryniou', 'On this sandy, very long beach, you will find whatever you are looking for. The beach is more km long, very wide, with lots ob beach infrastructure, there is even grass and and some trees to hide you from the sun. The number of shops and bars is amazing, there are so many, a true turistic place. You will love this place.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 10, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d7723d90/paralia-ofriniou/\" data-label_1=\"PARALIA OFRINIOU\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >PARALIA OFRINIOU WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16207330857545.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5970, 5, '2019-03-19 17:47:53', '2019-03-19 16:47:53', 1, 'paralia-ofriniou-paralia-ofryniou_5', 1),
(3421, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Logkari', 'logkari', 1, '40.762354', '23.7712788', 'Paralia Lonkaríou', 'This sandy beach, which is one of the first touristic beaches in the region Kentriki Makedonia, is located near the town of Logkari. The parking lot is huge and offers a parking of the motorhome as well. There are even some trees on the parking to keep your car cold during the hot summer. On the beach there is even some grass.  There is a beach bar and some basic beach infrastructure.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 8, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d7623d77/logkari/\" data-label_1=\"LOGKARI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >LOGKARI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16363733897995.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2709, 5, '2019-03-20 10:25:19', '2019-03-20 09:25:19', 1, 'logkari-paralia-lonkariou_5', 1),
(3422, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Asprovalta', 'asprovalta', 1, '40.720278', '23.710556', 'Paralia Asprovalta ', 'Paralia Asprovalta is the perfect beach for you family. Located in the region of Kentriki Makedonia in the town of Asprovalta it has almost the maximum beach infrastructure you can imagine. Sand, natural sunshade and grass is what you will find here, not to mention the more km long beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 10, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d7223d71/asprovalta/\" data-label_1=\"ASPROVALTA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ASPROVALTA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16363733897995.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 4351, 5, '2019-03-20 10:25:25', '2019-03-20 09:25:25', 1, 'asprovalta-paralia-asprovalta_5', 1),
(3423, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Stavros', 'stavros', 1, '40.665942', '23.702861', 'Paralia Stavros', 'The town of Stavros has a sandy beach with the same name to offer. Here is a harbour, a nice park, some natural shade and grass nearby the beach. The parking is paved and welcomes as well motorhomes. The beach infrastructure is as well present, as well the accommodation and some restaurants.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 2, 1, 13, 11, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d6823d56/volvi/\" data-label_1=\"VOLVI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >VOLVI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16362179252214.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2994, 5, '2019-03-20 10:25:31', '2019-03-20 09:25:31', 1, 'volvi-paralia-stavros_5', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach` (`id`, `waterbody_id`, `continent_code`, `country_code`, `country_code_nice_url`, `region`, `region_nice_url`, `region_full_name_nice_url`, `city`, `city_nice_url`, `location_id`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `name`, `description`, `beach_type_id`, `location_pay_id`, `price_per_day`, `currency`, `area_description_id`, `accessibility_id`, `parking`, `payable_parking`, `road_to_parking_type_id`, `parking_capacity_id`, `parking_beach_distance_id`, `parking_beach_height_id`, `location_length_id`, `bay_length_id`, `beach_inclination_id`, `swimming_depth_of_one_m`, `occupancy_rate_id`, `tourist_facilities_id`, `video_url`, `webcam`, `path_to_beach_map_url`, `beach_weather`, `water_temperature`, `island_name`, `island_name_nice_url`, `river_name`, `river_name_nice_url`, `lake_name`, `lake_name_nice_url`, `boat_only`, `beach_views`, `user_id`, `datetime`, `datetime_ut`, `status_id`, `folder_name`, `mobile_upload`) VALUES
(3424, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Olimpiada', 'olimpiada', 1, '40.5944774', '23.7814462', 'Paralia Olympiada ', 'If you want to feel the olympic spirit, you should visit this sandy beach in the east part of the region Kentraki Makedonia. The town where this beach avaits you is called Olimpiada. Of course here are many sport fields as well some children playgrounds. A park woth lots of grass is also near the beach, as well the apartments and beach bars.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 3, 1, 15, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d5923d78/olimpiada/\" data-label_1=\"OLIMPIADA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >OLIMPIADA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16363831737256.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 4112, 5, '2019-03-20 12:11:19', '2019-03-20 11:11:19', 1, 'olimpiada-paralia-olympiada_5', 1),
(3425, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Stratoni', 'stratoni', 1, '40.513938', '23.828298', 'Paralia Stratoníou', 'Do you seek lots of children playgrounds and natural shadow, with a sandy beach for your family when going to the beach? If so, the paralia Stratoniu is just the right for you, you want be dissapointed, believe me, I have seen many beaches, and these one I would recommend every family. There is even a small park right on the beach. The parking is big enough to welcome even motorhomes. Restaurants and some apartments are also in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 15, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d5123d83/stratoni/\" data-label_1=\"STRATONI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >STRATONI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16365512015352.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2945, 5, '2019-03-20 12:35:12', '2019-03-20 11:35:12', 1, 'stratoni-paralia-stratoniou_5', 1),
(3426, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Aristotelis', 'aristotelis', 1, '40.413333', '23.865833', 'Paralia Kakoudia ', 'This beach is a true adventurer Beach. It is very long and wide. Parking itself is very huge and you can even park under the trees. The beach infrastructure is very poor, but the beach itself is worth visiting. There are so many trees which give you shelter in the case the sun gets too hot. But be aware cannot camp here.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 3, 1, 17, 6, 2, 3, 1, 0, 'https://youtu.be/3Je42rGCmWA', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d4023d88/ierissos/\" data-label_1=\"IERISSOS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >IERISSOS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15608466915845.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8936, 5, '2019-03-20 14:57:52', '2019-03-20 13:57:52', 1, 'aristotelis-paralia-kakoudia_5', 1),
(3427, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Ierissos', 'ierissos', 1, '40.402870', '23.878017', 'Paralia Ierissoú', 'The Halkidiki Peninsula is full of nice beaches. in the town of Lerissos there is a very Long beach which is made of sand and partly small very small stones. Next to the beach there is a camping place and in the front of the camping a large parking place. The beach infrastructure is on a high level and around the beach there are many beach bars and a lot of accommodation. On the beach there is also a pier from which you can jump into the water or go catch some fish.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d4023d88/ierissos/\" data-label_1=\"IERISSOS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >IERISSOS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16210684267494.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 4721, 5, '2019-03-20 15:21:41', '2019-03-20 14:21:41', 1, 'ierissos-paralia-ierissou_5', 1),
(3428, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Nea Roda', 'nea-roda', 1, '40.381467', '23.928480', 'Paralia Néon Ródon', 'One of the last beaches on Halkidiki Peninsula before you reach the border with Mount Athos is the beach  Nea Roda. On the beach itself there is predominantly sand. The parking is just next to the beach and the parking lot it\'s very large. In the surrounding there are many restaurants and a lot of accommodation. Next to the beach there is also a pier and a marina. There is also some beach infrastructure and the beach itself is suitable for families.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 14, 4, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d3823d92/nea-roda/\" data-label_1=\"NEA RODA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >NEA RODA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16210738796256.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3453, 5, '2019-03-20 16:04:25', '2019-03-20 15:04:25', 1, 'nea-roda-paralia-neon-rodon_5', 1),
(3429, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Ouranoupoli', 'ouranoupoli', 1, '40.324425', '23.981337', 'Paralia Ouranoupoli', 'The town of in the middle of the halkidiki peninsula it\'s a very special Beach. It\'s one of the last places before you hike to the region of Mount Athos. The beach itself it\'s a mixture of small Pebbles, sand and concrete. It is around 500 meters long, 20 m wide and offers many Beach infrastructure. Parking is all around the beach, for some you need to pay, some are free. In the town itself there are many many restaurants beach bars and a lot of accommodation. It is a family beach and dogs are allowed to go as well on the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 5, 2, 13, 5, 2, 13, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d3323d98/ouranoupoli/\" data-label_1=\"OURANOUPOLI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >OURANOUPOLI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16368099531097.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2771, 5, '2019-03-21 08:25:29', '2019-03-21 07:25:29', 1, 'ouranoupoli-paralia-ouranoupoli_5', 1),
(3430, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Aristotelis', 'aristotelis', 1, '40.344790', '23.964955', 'Paralia Akrathos', 'In the region of Kentriki Makedonija there is another stunning beautiful beach called Paralia Akrathos. It\'s a very nice sandy beach with very interesting curves. It is definitely suited for families with children since there is also some natural shadow, the parking lot is very large and here are many hotels which are just next to the beach. On the beach itself you can\'t rent some boats or other water equipment. If you are thirsty or hungry there is even a beach bar and restaurant directly on the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 2, 15, 8, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/pMumbXalPuM', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d3323d98/ouranoupoli/\" data-label_1=\"OURANOUPOLI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >OURANOUPOLI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15608718867998.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8688, 5, '2019-03-21 10:57:00', '2019-03-21 09:57:00', 1, 'aristotelis-paralia-akrathos_5', 1),
(3431, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Salonikiou', 'salonikiou', 1, '40.309167', '23.696111', 'Paralia Metagkitsi', 'Another sandy the beach in Kentriki Macedonia. It\'s located between the first and the second peninsula of halkidiki region. The nearest town is Salonikiou. The parking space is made of dirt and it\'s large enough to motorhomes. Nearby there are some apartments and there is even a beach bar on the beach. There is some beach infrastructure so families are welcome here.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 3, 1, 16, 9, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d3023d69/salonikiou/\" data-label_1=\"SALONIKIOU\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >SALONIKIOU WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16368226709826.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2376, 5, '2019-03-21 11:46:06', '2019-03-21 10:46:06', 1, 'salonikiou-paralia-metagkitsi_5', 1),
(3432, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Ormos Panagias', 'ormos-panagias', 1, '40.244732', '23.7238918', 'Paralia Livrohio', 'You will love this amazing Sandy Beach with its waters a slight torquise color. The beach belongs to the region of Kentriki Macedonia, and brlongs to the town of Ormos Panagias. It\'s more than one kilometer long, parking is located just next to the beach. In Stormy Weathers it\'s going to be a perfect spot for windsurfing or kiting. Accommodation like apartments and free rooms are also in the vicinity. The water entry is nice and you can already swim after 10 meters of going into the water.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 4, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/gCFhrHeW0nI', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d2323d73/ormos-panagias/\" data-label_1=\"ORMOS PANAGIAS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ORMOS PANAGIAS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15608495247503.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 9685, 5, '2019-03-21 14:27:10', '2019-03-21 13:27:10', 1, 'ormos-panagias-paralia-livrohio_5', 1),
(3433, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Lagonisi', 'lagonisi', 1, '40.2301053', '23.7457405', 'Paralia Lagonisi', 'Once you visit this beach certainly be your dream Beach. It is one of the most beautiful beaches you will visit. It has everything you are looking for. It has a lot of sand, the water is crystal clear, there is even some natural shadow and some grass. The entry into the water is nice and comfortable. It is a true marble if the Halkidiki region. Parking is also here but you need to drive on a dirt road and it can be sometimes tricky to reach the parking space. There are maybe 20 spaces available for free or more if you go to a beach resort, where you need to pay for the parking. In a restaurant is also here and there are some apartments in the vicinity of the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 4, 1, 1, 10, 6, 2, 5, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/7C3gCOlVxhc', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/37d7823d89/lagonisi/\" data-label_1=\"LAGONISI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >LAGONISI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15608495247503.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 7907, 5, '2019-03-21 14:27:16', '2019-03-21 13:27:16', 1, 'lagonisi-paralia-lagonisi_5', 1),
(3434, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Fteroti', 'fteroti', 1, '40.199741', '23.770146', 'Paralia Fteroti', 'The beach Fteroti is true adventurer beach. It is located in the region Kantriki Makedonia, near the village Fteroti. You will not find here any Beach infrastructure because the beach and the surrounding are completely wild. The parking is next to the beach but you need to take a dirt road to reach the beach. On the beach itself you can rent a boat and discover the islands in the vicinity. Restaurants or other beach bars on not present here, but there is some accommodation like apartments and rooms. You can also bring your dog with you and if you have small children you can put your towel under the tree. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 12, 1, 1, 17, 3, 2, 4, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d1923d80/vourvourou/\" data-label_1=\"VOURVOUROU\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >VOURVOUROU WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16366105025261.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 4656, 5, '2019-03-21 14:39:41', '2019-03-21 13:39:41', 1, 'fteroti-paralia-fteroti_5', 1),
(3435, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Karidi', 'karidi', 1, '40.193088', '23.808477', 'Paralia Karidi', 'The Karidi Beach is a white sand beach. And with the crystal clear water you can imagine the beauty of this place. This beach is one of the most beautiful in the Halkidiki area. The parking surface is made of dirt but you can leave your car under the trees where it will stay cold. On the beach itself there are many trees to lay down your towel. Accommodation is near by, as well restaurants and other catering. The whole area around the beach it\'s very pictures so you will find many places to take beautiful pictures of you with the beach in the background.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 6, 2, 2, 9, 6, 2, 6, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/vB6RJqLTdOc', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d1923d80/vourvourou/\" data-label_1=\"VOURVOUROU\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >VOURVOUROU WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15608495247503.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11708, 5, '2019-03-21 16:32:10', '2019-03-21 15:32:10', 1, 'karidi-paralia-karidi_5', 1),
(3436, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Sarti', 'sarti', 1, '40.088323', '23.978808', 'Paralia Sarti', 'The Sarti Beach in Halkidiki is a very long sandy Beach with of a very spectacular View on the mount Athos. It\'s a part of the region Kentriki makedonija.Here you will find many Beach infrastructure, apartments rooms and hotels are just next to the beach. The parking it\'s also nearby and you need to walk only 100 meters to reach the beach. Restaurants and other bars are plenty and you have a big variety of different cuisine. Because of the beach formation and in Stormy Weather big waves can form here.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 1, 17, 9, 2, 2, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/MoHlefxRr_4', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0923d98/sarti/\" data-label_1=\"SARTI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SARTI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15608616137249.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 7575, 5, '2019-03-21 16:46:59', '2019-03-21 15:46:59', 1, 'sarti-paralia-sarti_5', 1),
(3437, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Sarti', 'sarti', 1, '40.075427', '23.985223', 'Paralia Platania ', 'Another beautiful beach with an amazing view on Mount Athos. It is a sandy Beach, right for families. The parking is just next to the beach and you can also arrive here with a motorhome. Grass is also present here, some rock formations. For your accommodation you can choose apartments which are located on this location. A restaurant is also present here. And of course like everywhere in Greece dogs are welcomed here.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 1, 1, 10, 5, 3, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0923d98/sarti/\" data-label_1=\"SARTI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >SARTI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16580018337356.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2398, 5, '2019-03-22 07:50:22', '2019-03-22 06:50:22', 1, 'sarti-paralia-platania_5', 1),
(3438, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Valti', 'valti', 1, '40.048889', '23.989444', 'Paralia Katerina', 'The paralia Katerina is located on the second peninsula of the halkidiki region, named Sithonia. This region belongs to the Kantriki makedonija. It\'s a Sandy Beach and it\'s best for a family type of visitor. Next to the beach there\'s a camping with some basic infrastructure otherwise the whole area is more natural. On the beach itself there is no catering option.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 2, 12, 5, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0524d00/valti/\" data-label_1=\"VALTI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >VALTI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16584233382189.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1742, 5, '2019-03-22 09:13:41', '2019-03-22 08:13:41', 1, 'valti-paralia-katerina_5', 1),
(3439, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Paralia Sikias', 'paralia-sikias', 1, '40.0412245', '23.9852099', 'Paralia Sikia', 'Paralia Sikia is located on the peninsula Sithonia in the region Kentriki Makedonija. It\'s a Very long Sandy Beach with a very large parking space, which you reach by a dirt road, and where you can also leave your motorhome. Some beach infrastructure is present here as well, and there are some camps and apartments in the background of the beach. The beach is suitable for dogs, where they have plenty Space to run around. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 1, 1, 17, 12, 3, 2, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0423d98/paralia-sikias/\" data-label_1=\"PARALIA SIKIAS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >PARALIA SIKIAS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16584233382189.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2029, 5, '2019-03-22 09:27:42', '2019-03-22 08:27:42', 1, 'paralia-sikias-paralia-sikia_5', 1),
(3440, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Kalamitsi', 'kalamitsi', 1, '39.9911362', '23.9905592', 'Paralia Kalamitsi', 'On the south point of the peninsula Sithonia there is the sandy beach paralia Kalamitsi. It belongs to the region of Kantriki makedonia. It is suitable for families and for those one who have dogd with them. The beach itself is around 750 meters long and 30 meters wide. Next to the beach there is a parking lot and there are many beach bars, apartments and some camping grounds in the vicinity. The water entry is comfortable you can swim already after 3 meters of entering the water.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 15, 7, 3, 2, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/2e0LBEYWX7c', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d9923d99/kalamitsi/\" data-label_1=\"KALAMITSI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KALAMITSI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15613217461126.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8283, 5, '2019-03-22 11:16:14', '2019-03-22 10:16:14', 1, 'kalamitsi-paralia-kalamitsi_5', 1),
(3441, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Toroni', 'toroni', 1, '39.986187', '23.9024927', 'Paralia Toroni', 'Located on the west side of the peninsula Sithonia, this Sandy Beach will surprise you. It\'s a very long and very romantic Beach. The beach infrastructure is on a hi standard. Benches are located along the whole stretch of the beach as well as Lightning poles, which makes a walk in the night even more romantic. There is even some grass and some natural Shadow available on the beach. But you need to park your along the road. Restaurants and apartments as well as some hotels are available  along the whole stretch of the beach. Children Will also love this beach since there are some playgrounds located on the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 1, 17, 5, 3, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d9923d90/toroni/\" data-label_1=\"TORONI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >TORONI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16585805502281.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1788, 5, '2019-03-22 11:16:18', '2019-03-22 10:16:18', 1, 'toroni-paralia-toroni_5', 1),
(3442, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Destenika', 'destenika', 1, '39.995278', '23.884167', 'Paralia  Tristinika', 'Another Beach where you can park your vehicle right in front of the beach. The Haldikiki peninsula it\'s known for its beautiful beaches and the beach Tristinika is one of them. It\'s around 750 meters long up to 40 meters wide and offers a lot of sand some grass and even some natural shadow. Right next to the beach there is a camping and some apartments. The water entry is comfortable and you can swim right away.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 12, 1, 1, 16, 8, 3, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0023d89/destenika/\" data-label_1=\"DESTENIKA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >DESTENIKA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16368307515009.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3363, 5, '2019-03-22 15:47:58', '2019-03-22 14:47:58', 1, 'destenika-paralia-tristinika_5', 1),
(3443, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Azapiko', 'azapiko', 1, '40.010812', '23.863628', 'Paralia Azapiko', 'A true Adventurer Beach for those one who like the nature. The flat Terrain seems like this beach was made for motorhomes. The parking is very flat and huge, and you can park right in front of the beach. The roads to the beach is a mixture of half paved and half dirt. On the beach itself there is almost no infrastructure. The beach underground is made of sand and there is also enough grass there if you like this surface more.\n', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 1, 1, 13, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, 'https://youtu.be/pS1qPJXElME', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0223d86/azapiko/\" data-label_1=\"AZAPIKO\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >AZAPIKO WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15613217461126.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8088, 5, '2019-03-22 15:48:06', '2019-03-22 14:48:06', 1, 'azapiko-paralia-azapiko_5', 1),
(3444, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Stiladari', 'stiladari', 1, '40.024167', '23.835556', 'Paralia Stiladari', 'The paralia Stiladari is a sandy and a family beach located on the west side of the second peninsula of the halkidiki region. You can park your vehicle directly to the beach and the parking place is big enough to host several vehicles. On the beach itself there are some trees to give you shelter from the hot summer Sun. A beach bar and a hotel are also present on this beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 8, 2, 1, 14, 6, 2, 2, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/3Kp1M3JoKEg', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0223d85/stiladari/\" data-label_1=\"STILADARI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >STILADARI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15608824547873.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5659, 5, '2019-03-22 15:48:12', '2019-03-22 14:48:12', 1, 'stiladari-paralia-stiladari_5', 1),
(3445, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Neos Marmaras', 'neos-marmaras', 1, '40.0867055', '23.792754', 'Paralia Neos Marmaras', 'Located on the west side of the peninsula Sithonia, in the town Neos Marmaras this Sandy Beach is a true family beach. You Can park your car directly at the beach and go directly into the water or put your towel under a tree. Around the beach there are many beach bars and a lot of accommodation. If you want you can also play volleyball on the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 6, 1, 1, 17, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0923d79/neos-marmaras/\" data-label_1=\"NEOS MARMARAS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >NEOS MARMARAS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16368390467690.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 3103, 5, '2019-03-22 16:55:03', '2019-03-22 15:55:03', 1, 'neos-marmaras-paralia-neos-marmaras_5', 1),
(3446, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Elia Nikitis', 'elia-nikitis', 1, '40.133818', '23.751305', 'Paralia Lagómandra', 'If you love beaches with natural shadow or you need the shade of the trees to protect you or your children from the Sun you need to visit the beach Lagomandra on the Halkidiki peninsula in the Kantriki Makedonia region. Your car, maybe also motorhome will also love the parking because the whole parking is in the shadow. The beach itself is made of sand, the water entry is nice and comfortable and there are some apartments and a hotel nearby. On the neighboring Beach there is also a beach bar and restaurant.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 3, 1, 14, 5, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d1523d74/elia-nikitis/\" data-label_1=\"ELIA NIKITIS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ELIA NIKITIS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16597192792243.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2488, 5, '2019-03-23 09:52:25', '2019-03-23 08:52:25', 1, 'elia-nikitis-paralia-lagomandra_5', 1),
(3447, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Nikíti', 'nikiti', 1, '40.192148', '23.692947', 'Paralia Agios Ioannis', '', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 2, 3, 15, 8, 2, 7, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/6PYLmD6t24A', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d2223d67//\" data-label_1=\"NIKITI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >NIKITI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15613279313060.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 21203, 5, '2019-03-23 09:52:25', '2019-03-23 08:52:25', 1, 'nikiti-paralia-agios-ioannis_5', 1),
(3448, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Nikíti', 'nikiti', 1, '40.2124948', '23.6713436', 'Paralia Nikitis', 'The town of Nikitis is located on the second peninsula of the Halkidiki region. Along the coastline there is a very long Sandy Beach which stretches over a few kilometers. You can park by the road and to reach the beach easily. In the background of the beach there is a city with the same name and lots of restaurants and all types of accommodation.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 4, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-23 12:11:40', '2019-03-23 11:11:40', 11, 'nikiti-paralia-nikitis_5', 1),
(3449, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Metamorfosi', 'metamorfosi', 1, '40.2284702', '23.5827695', 'Paralia Ekklēsáki', 'This sandy beach is located on the halkidiki peninsula. The nearest town is called Metamorfosi. You can park your vehicle directly at the beach. It\'s also suitable for motorhomes. On the beach itself There is almost no beach infrastructure but there are some apartments, Resortsand hotels in the background of the beach. You can find also some trees on the beach to protect you from the Sun.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 10, 9, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-23 12:11:43', '2019-03-23 11:11:43', 11, 'metamorfosi-paralia-ekklesaki_5', 1),
(3450, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Psakoudia', 'psakoudia', 1, '40.258570', '23.497817', 'Paralia Psakudia ', 'Do you search for a sandy beach with a lot of beach infrastructure? If so, than the paralia Psakudia is the one for you. It\'s located on the Halkidiki Peninsula, which belongs to the Kentriki makedonia. The parking is just next to the beach and it\'s big enough to welcome motorhomes. On the beach itself beach Bar and some hotels and apartments in the vicinity. You will also find a lot of children playgrounds directly on the beach, and there\'s even a small Park with lots of grass.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 7, 2, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d2623d50/psakoudia/\" data-label_1=\"PSAKOUDIA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >PSAKOUDIA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16591714535245.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1407, 5, '2019-03-23 15:37:58', '2019-03-23 14:37:58', 1, 'psakoudia-paralia-psakudia_5', 1),
(3451, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Psakoudia', 'psakoudia', 1, '40.259919', '23.478972', 'Paralia Gkarlis', 'If on this Beach there would not be the beach bar, this would be a beach recommended for adventurers, but since there is one I would recommend it to families. The parking is around 15m above the beach and it\'s large enough to host even motorhomes. The path to the beach is 100 meters and you need to use stairs. The beach itself is a mixture of sand and some rocks but there is only basic Beach infrastructure what should be enough to make you happy. Some apartments are also in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 4, 4, 9, 5, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d2623d50/psakoudia/\" data-label_1=\"PSAKOUDIA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >PSAKOUDIA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16585900616096.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2521, 5, '2019-03-23 15:37:59', '2019-03-23 14:37:59', 1, 'psakoudia-paralia-gkarlis_5', 1),
(3452, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Psakoudia', 'psakoudia', 1, '40.261920', '23.470835', 'Paralia Kouyoni', 'The Sandy Beach of Kouyoni is best for families with children. In the background of the beach there is a park with children playground and a basketball field. The park is in full shadow and has a lot of grass. In the park there is also a restaurant and a Beach Bar, and some apartments and a hotel, and a little bit far away there is even campground. The entry into the water is comfortable and sometimes you can swim right away and on some places you need to walk 20 meters before you can start to swim.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 4, 2, 12, 4, 2, 16, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d2623d50/psakoudia/\" data-label_1=\"PSAKOUDIA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >PSAKOUDIA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16591788951859.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1525, 5, '2019-03-23 15:38:02', '2019-03-23 14:38:02', 1, 'psakoudia-paralia-kouyoni_5', 1),
(3453, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Paralia Gerakinis', 'paralia-gerakinis', 1, '40.269339', '23.446262', 'Paralia Gerakinis', 'A lot of hotels, apartments, rooms, restaurants, sports fields and other Beach infrastructure is what you can expect from paralia Gerakinis. The beach itself is made of sand end belongs to the region of Kantriki makedonija. It\'s predominantly for families. And in the summer time you can also rent a deckchair and a sunshade here. If you want you can also play basketball directly on the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 15, 8, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d2923d39/kalyves-polygyrou/\" data-label_1=\"KALYVES POLYGYROU\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KALYVES POLYGYROU WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16591714535245.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1610, 5, '2019-03-23 15:38:05', '2019-03-23 14:38:05', 1, 'paralia-gerakinis-paralia-gerakinis_5', 1),
(3454, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Kalives Poligirou', 'kalives-poligirou', 1, '40.279465', '23.402241', 'Paralia Kalives ', 'Paralia Kalives is located in the town of Kalives Poligirou, which is a part of the region Kentriki Makedonia. It\'s a Sandy Beach, almost 1 kilometer long, with the parking just next to the beach, also suitable for motorhomes. Beach infrastructure is also present here and you can expect some showers, children playground, Sports fields and some restaurants and a lot of accommodation of a type apartment or free room. A pier present here and if you like to catch fish you can do it from this structure.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 8, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d2923d39/kalyves-polygyrou/\" data-label_1=\"KALIVES POLIGIROU\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KALIVES POLIGIROU WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16594654742738.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 2403, 5, '2019-03-23 16:40:12', '2019-03-23 15:40:12', 1, 'kalives-poligirou-paralia-kalives_5', 1),
(3455, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Portes', 'portes', 1, '40.210278', '23.330833', 'Paralia Portes', 'The beach Portes is one of the longest sandy beaches in Greece. It\'s more than 10 kilometers long, and offers many different options to spend your day on the beach. It\'s definitely suitable for motorhome owners as well for families and for those who love to have some peace on the beach. The road to the beach it\'s mostly made of dirt and you need to drive more kilometers to reach your preferable place. On some part of the beach there are beach bars  but on the most length there is nothing. So some places have some beach infrastructure but most have zero. Accommodation is also available behind the beach but mostly in the type of apartment or free rooms. Water entry is comfortable and you can already swim away after three meters.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 2, 1, 17, 3, 2, 2, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/37d9421d57/portes/\" data-label_1=\"PORTES\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >PORTES WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/16594714453416.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1545, 5, '2019-03-23 17:12:02', '2019-03-23 16:12:02', 1, 'portes-paralia-portes_5', 1),
(3456, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Afytos', 'afytos', 1, '40.0997607', '23.4385928', 'Paralia Afytos', 'On the Kassandra peninsula in the region Kentriki Makedonia there are many beautiful beaches. The city of Afytos hosts 500 meter long Sandy Beach. You can reach the beach by a paved Road where a large parking place awaits you. The parking itself is done directly onto the beach. Here you will find some beach infrastructure, some beach bars restaurants, and in the vicinity there are some apartments. On the beach there is a mixture of sand and rocks and the entry into the water is not as comfortable as on other beaches. You need to walk over some rocks to reach the point of swim.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 14, 3, 2, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-24 08:57:10', '2019-03-24 07:57:10', 11, 'afytos-paralia-afytos_5', 1),
(3457, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Kallithea', 'kallithea', 1, '40.0795533', '23.4476297', 'Paralia Kalithea', 'The paralia Kalithea it\'s very interesting. Not Only is the sand here White, the water crystal clear and the water is really shallow which makes it suitable for small children, the beach hosts also the Temple of zeus. Otherwise the beach belongs to the peninsula of Kassandra, or better known as the Halkidiki region. \nOn the beach itself you will find  many beach infrastructure, many restaurants and a lot of apartments and other type of accommodation. Sunshades and deckchairs can also be rented her, as well as some water equipment.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 2, 2, 16, 5, 2, 8, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-24 09:53:16', '2019-03-24 08:53:16', 11, 'kallithea-paralia-kalithea_5', 1),
(3458, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Kriopigi', 'kriopigi', 1, '40.0857511', '23.4409605', 'Paralia Kriopigi', 'On this beach you will find a lot of nature. The Cliffs behind the beach with it\'s trees provide you with some natural shadow, but only for the half day. The beach itself is made of sand and it\'s a few kilometers long end around 15 meters wide. Near the parking, which is pretty large and can host also motorhomes, there is also a beach bar and a shower. A camping place some apartments are also in the vicinity of the beach. Find the beach near the town of Kriopigi which is located on the peninsula Kassandra.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 2, 17, 4, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-24 11:11:31', '2019-03-24 10:11:31', 11, 'kriopigi-paralia-kriopigi_5', 1),
(3459, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Polychrono', 'polychrono', 1, '40.0152488', '23.5328663', 'Paralia Polychrono', 'The paralia Polychrono is a true City Beach. The apartments and restaurants as well beach bars are directly on the beach which is only separated by a road. The beach itself is made of sand. The water entry is on some places comfortable on some you need to walk on stones. And because of the shallow water the point of swimming starts between 20 and 30 meters. The city of polychrono it\'s part of the peninsula Kassandra, which belongs to the region Kantriki makedonija.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 4, 2, 17, 4, 2, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-24 11:11:32', '2019-03-24 10:11:32', 11, 'polychrono-paralia-polychrono_5', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach` (`id`, `waterbody_id`, `continent_code`, `country_code`, `country_code_nice_url`, `region`, `region_nice_url`, `region_full_name_nice_url`, `city`, `city_nice_url`, `location_id`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `name`, `description`, `beach_type_id`, `location_pay_id`, `price_per_day`, `currency`, `area_description_id`, `accessibility_id`, `parking`, `payable_parking`, `road_to_parking_type_id`, `parking_capacity_id`, `parking_beach_distance_id`, `parking_beach_height_id`, `location_length_id`, `bay_length_id`, `beach_inclination_id`, `swimming_depth_of_one_m`, `occupancy_rate_id`, `tourist_facilities_id`, `video_url`, `webcam`, `path_to_beach_map_url`, `beach_weather`, `water_temperature`, `island_name`, `island_name_nice_url`, `river_name`, `river_name_nice_url`, `lake_name`, `lake_name_nice_url`, `boat_only`, `beach_views`, `user_id`, `datetime`, `datetime_ut`, `status_id`, `folder_name`, `mobile_upload`) VALUES
(3460, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Pefkochori', 'pefkochori', 1, '39.999073', '23.584179', 'Paralia Pefkochori Dytika', 'The crystal clear water on this beach will leave you speechless. Predominantly because of the white sand it gets a special torquise tone. The beach itself is made of small stones and predominantly sand. Swim is already after five meters. In the vicinity of the beach there are many beach bars and a lot of apartments the swell s hotels. Parking is done either on a large parking space 100 meters away, or if you park in a private house. The large parking space can host also motorhomes.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 4, 2, 17, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/GmpKrayQuCA', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d9923d61/pefkochori/\" data-label_1=\"PEFKOCHORI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >PEFKOCHORI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15613622181278.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10471, 5, '2019-03-24 14:54:58', '2019-03-24 13:54:58', 1, 'pefkochori-paralia-pefkochori-dytika_5', 1),
(3461, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Pefkochori', 'pefkochori', 1, '39.9886783', '23.6205778', 'Paralia Pefkochori Anatolika', 'You won\'t find as many luxury apartments so close to the beach anywhere else in Greece. The Paralia Pefkochori Anatolika, which is located on the peninsula Kassandra in the well-known region of Halkidiki is a Sandy Beach with some Pebbles added to it. The parking is done either by the road or you can use a large parking place on the right side to the beach. The water entery is comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters. If you\'ll get hungry there are plenty of restaurants available there, as well as Apartments. Some beach bars are more luxurious and probably offer also dance floor.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 2, 1, 16, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-24 14:54:58', '2019-03-24 13:54:58', 11, 'pefkochori-paralia-pefkochori-anatolika_5', 1),
(3462, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Pefkochori', 'pefkochori', 1, '39.982396', '23.658844', 'Paralia Glarokabos', 'On the peninsula Kassandra there is one Special, almost natural Beach, just outside the town of Pefkochori. It\'s several kilometers long, around 20 meters wide, and offers plenty of natural shadow along the road. You can reach the beach by a dirt road which goes nearby the beach. On some part of the beach there are also some beach bars, which offer some basic infrastructure, otherwise there is none. When you go to the water tonic water you can already swim after 5 meters. The beach itself is made partly of sand partly of small pebbles. Just next to the beach a beautiful Lagoon.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 1, 1, 17, 6, 2, 3, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/L6LnBY_O-nw', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d9923d61/pefkochori/\" data-label_1=\"PEFKOCHORI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >PEFKOCHORI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15613622181278.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 15285, 5, '2019-03-24 20:42:47', '2019-03-24 19:42:47', 1, 'pefkochori-paralia-glarokabos_5', 1),
(3463, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Chrousou', 'chrousou', 1, '40.0070334', '23.5413596', 'Paralia Paragga', 'Wild & Free this is what she is, the paralia Paragga. The peninsula Kassandra full of surprises, and this beach is no exception. It\'s a sandy beach, more than one kilometer long, around 20 meters wide and it is suitable for families. On the beach itself there are many trees which give you some natural shadow. The parking is very large and welcomes also motorhomes, the road is made of dirt, and you can park almost directly at the beach. Here are also some improvised beach bars and toilets.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 2, 1, 17, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-25 09:27:54', '2019-03-25 08:27:54', 11, 'chrousou-paralia-paragga_5', 1),
(3464, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Chrousou', 'chrousou', 1, '39.958056', '23.679167', 'Paralia Paliouri', 'One of the last beaches on the peninsula Kassandra which is facing the city of Marmaras on the opposite peninsula is the beach Paliouri. It\'s located near the town of Chrousou. It is more than one kilometer long Sandy Beach, with some beach infrastructure. Parking itself is very large and can host also motorhomes. You can also bring your dog to the beach as long as you respect the rules. Some beach bars, a camping ground, some apartments are also on the beach or near the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 2, 1, 17, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/IibJsauc1hY', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d9623d67/chrousou/\" data-label_1=\"CHROUSOU\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >CHROUSOU WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15614098941047.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 17686, 5, '2019-03-25 09:27:59', '2019-03-25 08:27:59', 1, 'chrousou-paralia-paliouri_5', 1),
(3465, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Loutra', 'loutra', 1, '39.9282358', '23.5849226', 'Paralia Loutra ', 'The small village of Loutra on the Kassandra peninsula, has one interesting Beach to offer. The beach is a mixture of sand, small Pebbles, big stones, grass and some natural shadow. You can park almost directly at the beach. There are more than 100 places available, on some you can also leave your car under the shadow. In the vicinity some apartments in free rooms and on the beach itself there are some restaurants and beach bars. Peach has also a pier, you can either jump or catch some fish.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 2, 9, 4, 5, 14, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-25 09:55:36', '2019-03-25 08:55:36', 11, 'loutra-paralia-loutra_5', 1),
(3466, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Nea Skioni', 'nea-skioni', 1, '39.9455358', '23.5319132', 'Paralia néas Skiónis', 'The beach in the town of Nea Skioni in the peninsula Kassandra will provide you with many Beach infrastructure. On Such a small place there is plenty of it. Just next to the beach there is a marina all around the beach there are parking spaces, restaurants and all kinds of accommodation types. The beach itself is made of sand, the entry into the water is comfortable and you can start swimming already after five meters. Good about this beach are the child playgrounds and some sport equipment.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 11, 9, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-25 12:38:48', '2019-03-25 11:38:48', 11, 'nea-skioni-paralia-neas-skionis_5', 1),
(3467, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Posidi', 'posidi', 1, '39.962888', '23.379548', 'Paralia Posidi', 'I could almost say just another beautiful beach in Greece. This sandy beach is made of white sand, has some shallow water, which is crystal clear and welcomes families. There are plenty of restaurants arround, as well as some apartments, rooms and hotels. The beach is located on the peninsula Kassandra, which is a part of the Halkidiki region, or a wider region the Kantriki Makedonia.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 2, 1, 14, 4, 2, 6, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/TU1mS0pqoG4', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d9623d38/posidi/\" data-label_1=\"POSIDI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >POSIDI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15614905349994.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 7132, 5, '2019-03-25 12:38:54', '2019-03-25 11:38:54', 1, 'posidi-paralia-posidi_5', 1),
(3468, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Aploma', 'aploma', 1, '39.956359', '23.356954', 'Paralia Mýti Poseidíou', 'Another Beach on the peninsula Cassandra which will leave you speechless. It\'s more Wild and Free then other ones, since here is almost no beach infrastructure. There is a big parking space which is made of dirt and it\'s large enough to welcome even motorhomes. The beach is made partly of sand and partly of small Pebbles, water entry is on some places comfortable, on some you need to walk over the rocks. A little bit further away from the beach you can also find some natural shadow.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 1, 1, 17, 12, 2, 5, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/Koe580FQ0x4', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d9623d36/aploma/\" data-label_1=\"APLOMA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >APLOMA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15614867008164.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8955, 5, '2019-03-25 12:38:59', '2019-03-25 11:38:59', 1, 'aploma-paralia-myti-poseidiou_5', 1),
(3469, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Skala Fourkas', 'skala-fourkas', 1, '39.994722', '23.381389', 'Paralia Skala Fourkas', 'You won\'t have Any problems with parking on this beach. Motorhomes welcomed for sure. The beach Skala Fourkas on the peninsula Cassandra is a Sandy Beach, with some basic beach infrastructure. The water entry is comfortable and the water is crystal clear. On the beach itself there are some beach bars and in the background many apartments and rooms.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 16, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/9nfSbmhsyK4', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0023d39/skala-fourkas/\" data-label_1=\"SKALA FOURKAS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SKALA FOURKAS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15613803018986.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11778, 5, '2019-03-25 14:34:36', '2019-03-25 13:34:36', 1, 'skala-fourkas-paralia-skala-fourkas_5', 1),
(3470, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Siviri', 'siviri', 1, '40.0343896', '23.360559', 'Paralia Siviris', 'sand, crystal clear torquise water and restaurants right next to the beach, this is what you get when you visit the beach Siviris. Located on the peninsula of Kassandra in the region of Kentriki makedonia this beach offers you a parking space only 50 meters away from the beach. In the town itself there are many apartments rooms and hotels. In the summertime the whole Beach can get crowded, so be aware of that fact.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 2, 17, 7, 2, 14, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/mV1R3_VS_MM', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0423d36/siviri/\" data-label_1=\"SIVIRI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SIVIRI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15613762028901.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 15794, 5, '2019-03-25 14:34:41', '2019-03-25 13:34:41', 1, 'siviri-paralia-siviris_5', 1),
(3471, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Sane', 'sane', 1, '40.071944', '23.334444', 'Paralia Simántrou', 'A true Explorer Adventurer Beach. On this beach you not only can swim and enjoy the Sun you also can explore an ancient roman city next to the beach. The whole peninsula of Kassandra is full of seach sites. The road to the beach is a dirt one, and here are around 40 parking places for you available. The beach is quite shallow as well as the water entry which means that small children can play quite safely. On the beach there is also a hotel with a lot of beach infrastructure.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 6, 1, 1, 14, 5, 1, 6, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/H526UB-GXFA', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0923d31/sane/\" data-label_1=\"SANE\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SANE WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15614041966906.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5118, 5, '2019-03-25 17:04:19', '2019-03-25 16:04:19', 1, 'sane-paralia-simantrou_5', 1),
(3472, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Pirgos Sani', 'pirgos-sani', 1, '40.0969847', '23.312018', 'Paralia Sani', 'If you\'re the one who likes luxury on the beach, who doesn\'t take any compromises then the beach Sani is the one for you. The beach infrastructure is on the highest level, you even have a marina in the middle of the beach to moore your yacht here. The parking spaces here are plenty, but motorhomes are not allowed here. The beach itself is made of white sand. The water entry is comfortable and you can swim already after five meters. If you don\'t like the see you have a swimming pool also here. The whole Beach is a part of the Sani resort, which will provide you with all kinds off accommodation types.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 5, 1, 14, 9, 1, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-25 17:04:23', '2019-03-25 16:04:23', 11, 'pirgos-sani-paralia-sani_5', 1),
(3473, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Nea Moudania', 'nea-moudania', 1, '40.2413727', '23.2744742', 'Paralia Nea Mounadia', 'The paralia Nea Mounadia it\'s a typical sandy city Beach. It\'s more than one kilometer long on the widest part it\'s measures around 50 meters. It has a lot of beach infrastructure, the parking is only 100 meters away, and you can leave your motorhome as well on this parking. The water entry is comfortable. Next to the beach there are children playgrounds, as well as many beach bars and some apartments and hotels in the background.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 4, 2, 17, 9, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-26 08:16:50', '2019-03-26 07:16:50', 11, 'nea-moudania-paralia-nea-mounadia_5', 1),
(3474, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Paralia Dionisiou', 'paralia-dionisiou', 1, '40.2495805', '23.2493181', 'Paralia Dionysou', 'In the middle of the sea of olives you will find a village named Paralia Dionisiou. It is located in the region of Kantriki makedonia, near the big city of Thessaloniki. It\'s a very modern Sandy Beach, with a park covered in grass and with natural shadow in the background, where the children playgrounds are located. Along the beach there are many beach bars and in the vicinity also some apartments and other types of accommodation. The water entry is comfortable and you can already swim away after around 20 meters.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 4, 1, 17, 6, 2, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-26 08:16:55', '2019-03-26 07:16:55', 11, 'paralia-dionisiou-paralia-dionysou_5', 1),
(3475, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Flogita', 'flogita', 1, '40.2571976', '23.2189029', 'Paralia Flogita', 'The region Kantriki makedonia is well known for its very long sandy beaches, and the beach Flogita is no exception here. The beach is made of sand and partly of small Pebbles. You have the beach infrastructure along the whole length of the beach. The Parking space is very large and around 100 meters away from the beach. You can also Park a motorhome on this parking space. Beach bars and other types of catering are as well present here, as well as apartments and hotels.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 1, 17, 8, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-26 10:20:00', '2019-03-26 09:20:00', 11, 'flogita-paralia-flogita_5', 1),
(3476, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Metochi', 'metochi', 1, '40.2728775', '23.1626691', 'Paralia Metochi', 'The paralia Metochi in the region of Kantriki Makedonia it\'s a very long Sandy Beach with lots of infrastructure in the background. You will find many sports fields and a large children playground right next to the beach. There are also some Beach bars where you can rent your  sunshade or deckchair. Parking is done by the road since here are no larger parking places. In the Village itself there are some apartments and a hotel. You can also bring your dog with you as long as you respect the rules.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 6, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-26 10:32:56', '2019-03-26 09:32:56', 11, 'metochi-paralia-metochi_5', 1),
(3477, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Sozopoli', 'sozopoli', 1, '40.2912608', '23.1236436', 'Paralia Vergiás', 'The village of Sozopoli welcomes you on the beach Paralia Vergiás. It\'s a family-type beach, with some beach infrastructure, with lots of sand, some grass, a big parking space, which welcomes also motorhomes, some beach bars and other types off restaurants, as well as some apartments and rooms in the vicinity. Nice about this beach are the benches which are directly located on the beach from where you can enjoy the visit of the see with Mount Olympus in the background.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 14, 8, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-26 10:33:00', '2019-03-26 09:33:00', 11, 'sozopoli-paralia-vergias_5', 1),
(3478, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Nea Kallikratia', 'nea-kallikratia', 1, '40.3008563', '23.0963203', 'Paralia Kyani', 'The children playground Beach or the beach of benches, this is the paralia Kyani. You won\'t find anywhere else this much children playgrounds and benches right next to the beach as here. The beach itself is made of sand, is around 1 km long, the water entry is nice and comfortable. Next to the beach you have any beach bars all kinds of accommodation types, there is even one camping ground. So if you are a family with lots of kids and if you maybe have dogs this beach will certainly Suit You.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 6, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-26 11:41:48', '2019-03-26 10:41:48', 11, 'nea-kallikratia-paralia-kyani_5', 1),
(3479, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Nea Kallikratia', 'nea-kallikratia', 1, '40.3107431', '23.0635558', 'Paralia Neas Kallikrateias', 'If you like beaches which are close to a city, with all the necessary infrastructure on the beach as well in the background you should visit the beach Paralia Neas Kallikrateias, which is located in the region of Kantriki macedonia. It\'s a Sandy Beach with a nice water entry, with a park in the background, where some children playgrounds are available, ant with a lot of beach bars along the whole stretch of the beach. If you are looking for accommodation on this beach you will find many apartments and hotels in the city.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 1, 15, 9, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-26 11:41:52', '2019-03-26 10:41:52', 11, 'nea-kallikratia-paralia-neas-kallikrateias_5', 1),
(3480, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Kampos', 'kampos', 1, '40.3522222', '23.0505294', 'Paralia Sahara', 'If you like to party and see where are the greek youth is having fun late Into the Night you should visit the beach Sahara. The nearest Village is Kampos, which is located in the region of Kantriki Macedonia. The whole party place is around 30 km outside of thessaloniki. You will find a large parking place here which is just next to the beach. The beach itself is made of sand and has all the necessary Beach infrastructure for such a partyplace. You won\'t have to bring deckchairs and sunshades with you since they are already present here. Accommodation is in the next Village around one kilometer away.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 11, 1, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-26 13:21:38', '2019-03-26 12:21:38', 11, 'kampos-paralia-sahara_5', 1),
(3481, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Ag. Sotiras', 'ag-sotiras', 1, '40.3816341', '22.9223762', 'Paralia Potamos', 'The Paralia Potamos is a several kilometers long sandy Beach, located near the town of Ag. Sotiras in the region Kentriki macedonia. From this place you can walk several kilometers along the beach to reach the highest point of the peninsula called Akra Epanomis. On the beach itself you have many Beach infrastructure, the parking is very large and it\'s also suitable for motorhomes. Along the beach here are many beach bars where are you can also rent a deck chair or a sunshade. Accommodation is a little bit far away, and comes mostly in the shape of an apartment.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 9, 2, 5, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-26 15:36:10', '2019-03-26 14:36:10', 11, 'ag-sotiras-paralia-potamos_5', 1),
(3482, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Epanomi', 'epanomi', 1, '40.4271993', '22.8825224', 'Paralia Ikismos Lefkes', 'In the Kentriki Makedonia, near the city of Epanomi, you will find the sandy beach Paralia Ikismos Lefkes. The beach itself this a few kilometers long around 15 meters wide. The Parking is around 100 meters away and can hold a few hundred cars. Next to the beach there are two beach bars, which can supply you with the necessary food and drinks. Here You can also rent a deckchair and the sun shade. Apartments also in the vicinity if you need an accommodation.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 2, 17, 4, 2, 5, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-26 15:36:25', '2019-03-26 14:36:25', 11, 'epanomi-paralia-ikismos-lefkes_5', 1),
(3483, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Neoi Epivates', 'neoi-epivates', 1, '40.5021961', '22.8969334', 'Paralia Neoi Epivates', 'One of the last big sandy beaches, before you reach thessaloniki from the Kalkidiki peninsula is the beach Paralia Neoi Epivates. It\'s located in the region of Kantriki Macedonia, which means Central macedonija. It\'s a few kilometers long beach, with an average wide of 15 meters. You can Park your car directly at the beach. If you get hungry or thirsty here are plenty of beach bars and restaurants available. Some hotels and apartments are also near the beach. If you travel with an airplane an airport is just nearby. It\'s a good starting point for a visit to Thessaloniki.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-26 16:59:06', '2019-03-26 15:59:06', 11, 'neoi-epivates-paralia-neoi-epivates_5', 1),
(3484, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Aliki', 'aliki', 1, '40.384056', '22.6224024', 'Paralia Aliki', 'Near the village of Aliki in the region Kentriki makedonija, between Thessaloniki and Katerini, you you will find this Hidden Beach in the middle of nowhere. It\'s a sandy beach, with a huge parking space, which can welcome even motorhomes. Near the beach you will find a lot of trees, which will give you some protection from the Sun. There is even some grass under the trees. A beach bar and and some apartments are also present here.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 2, NULL, 3, 8, 2, 1, 14, 9, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-28 10:09:41', '2019-03-28 09:09:41', 11, 'aliki-paralia-aliki_5', 1),
(3485, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Aliki', 'aliki', 1, '40.3932291', '22.602545', 'Paralia Pydna ', 'Have you ever been to a beach which neighbors to Salt Pitt. Most of you haven\'t, but on the paralia Pydna, you actually can have such an experience. The beaches located near the village of Aliki in the region of Kentriki Macedonia. The beach itself it\'s made of sand, here you will find some basic beach infrastructure, beach Bar, some accommodation nearby, a marina. It is suitable for families with small children, since the water is quite shallow, which means that you can start swimming after around 30 meters or more.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 12, 7, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-28 10:42:21', '2019-03-28 09:42:21', 11, 'aliki-paralia-pydna_5', 1),
(3486, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Katerini', 'katerini', 1, '40.3058524', '22.617505', 'Paralia Korinos', 'If you drive down to the town of Katerini in the region of Kentriki Macedonia, you will find the beach paralia Korinos. It\'s a more kilometers Long Beach, which reaches around 50 meters of widness. You won\'t have any problems with parking here, since here is a large parking place, which can hold more hundred cars or motorhomes. There is also a campsite, there are apartments, hotels and of course many beach bars. A lifeguard is also present here during the summer time and here are a few sports fields to keep you active.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-28 11:28:31', '2019-03-28 10:28:31', 11, 'katerini-paralia-korinos_5', 1),
(3487, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Paralia', 'paralia', 1, '40.2845894', '22.6052775', 'Paralia Sentido', 'How about a beach Resort next to the beach, well you can have it on the paralia Sentido, in the village of Paralia, near the town of Katerini in the region of Kentriki Macedonia. The whole Beach infrastructure because of the resort is on a high level and is more for those one who seek luxury. The beach is made of sand, it\'s more kilometers long, and around 75 meters wide. The parking is also near, only 100 meters away. Disabled people can also reach the beach, otherwise it\'s a typical family beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 1, 17, 10, 1, 8, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-28 14:06:05', '2019-03-28 13:06:05', 11, 'paralia-paralia-sentido_5', 1),
(3488, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Paralia', 'paralia', 1, '40.2688726', '22.597405', 'Paralia Paralia', '', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 7, 2, 8, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-28 14:06:05', '2019-03-28 13:06:05', 11, 'paralia-paralia-paralia_5', 1),
(3489, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Olympiaki Akti', 'olympiaki-akti', 1, '40.2412358', '22.5877197', 'Paralia Olympiaki Akti', 'This beach is really Olympic, not only is the name of the city olympia, the beach the same name and in the background there is even the mountain Olympus. It is located in the region Kantriki makedonia. It\'s a sandy Beach, a few kilometers long, around 50 meters wide and has a lot of beach infrastructure to offer. In the  park next to the beach, there are even some trees and a grass surface. The parking space is very large and also suitable for motorhomes, beach bars,  restaurants, cake shops and all kinds of accommodation is also available here. If you have small children the park has many playgrounds to offer, so a true family beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-28 14:06:05', '2019-03-28 13:06:05', 11, 'olympiaki-akti-paralia-olympiaki-akti_5', 1),
(3490, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Kalivia Varikou', 'kalivia-varikou', 1, '40.2390095', '22.5299346', 'Paralia Varikou', 'If you like spending your Beach holidays in a camp, just next to the beach, the paralia Varikou would be the one. It\'s a very long, a few kilometers long Sandy Beach, with some basic beach infrastructure. You will be surprised by the amazing look you will get when you look in the background of the beach. Here is the highest mountain of Greece, called Olimbos or Olympus, with a height of 2917 meters. To get to the beach you can drive on a paved road and park your car directly at the beach, where are large parking place awaits you. The water entry is quite shallow, which means is also more suitable for children.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 8, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-28 15:12:14', '2019-03-28 14:12:14', 11, 'kalivia-varikou-paralia-varikou_5', 1),
(3491, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Limani Litochorou', 'limani-litochorou', 1, '40.1523766', '22.5471267', 'Paralia Gritsa', 'You won\'t find any sand on this beach but much of small Pebbles. Be aware that Mount Olympus has your back covered so you can enjoy the look at the sea. The beach is located in the region Kentriki Makedonia, near the town of Limani Litochorou. You can reach this beach by a paved Road and the parking place is large enough to host a few 100 Cars. Around the beach you have different accommodation options, even a Resort, and of course many restaurants and Beach bars. Dogs are also allowed on this beach as long as you respect the rules.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 9, 2, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-28 16:40:40', '2019-03-28 15:40:40', 11, 'limani-litochorou-paralia-gritsa_5', 1),
(3492, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Plaka', 'plaka', 1, '40.1019132', '22.5636966', 'Paralia Litochoro', 'The beaches around the mountain Olympus are a mixture between sand, big stones and Pebbles. all are easy to reach and you can park almost directly at the beach and in the most cases a large parking place awaits you. Most of the beaches are a family-type beach, they all have a good degree of beach infrastructure and in the most cases a Beach Bar and the accommodation is directly at the beach. All mentioned above is also true for the beach Litochoro which is located near the town of Plaka, which is still in the region Kan is there actually Kantriki makedonia.', 5, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 5, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-28 16:40:40', '2019-03-28 15:40:40', 11, 'plaka-paralia-litochoro_5', 1),
(3493, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Leptokarya', 'leptokarya', 1, '40.0726502', '22.565998', 'Paralia Leptokarya', 'Beaches which are located near the town of Leptokarya still belong to the region of Kentriki makedonia. The beach of Leptokarya is a sandy Beach, it\'s a few kilometers long and on some places it can even be up to 50 meters wide. You can park your vehicle almost directly at the beach. The water entry is comfortable. All along the beach there are some Beach bars, a few apartments, hotel resorts, apartment complex. And in the background you can enjoy The View of the mountain Olympus.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 9, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-28 16:54:03', '2019-03-28 15:54:03', 11, 'leptokarya-paralia-leptokarya_5', 1),
(3494, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Paralia Skotinas', 'paralia-skotinas', 1, '40.0388764', '22.5835342', 'Paralia Rema Dervinas', 'In this place of the region Kentriki makedonija the beaches are typically a mixture of sand and many stones. The paralia Rema Dervinas which is located near the village of Paralia Skotinas is just one of a kind where it is difficult to figure out what type of surface it actually is. Nevertheless I think it\'s more a sand Beach, and with the whole Beach infrastructure on the beach and in the background it\'s a very interesting Beach. You can park Directly at the beach, and in the vicinity there is also a Resort.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 1, 1, 14, 4, 2, 8, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-29 08:28:40', '2019-03-29 07:28:40', 11, 'paralia-skotinas-paralia-rema-dervinas_5', 1),
(3495, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Paralia Skotinas', 'paralia-skotinas', 1, '40.0283639', '22.5877524', 'Paralia Skotina', 'This more than one kilometer long sandy beach it\'s located near the village of Paralia Skotinas, which still belongs to the region of Kantriki macedonia. In the background you can enjoy The View on the mountain Olympus, but on the beach itself you have plenty of grass and natural Shadow available. Parking it\'s very comfortable since you can park directly at the beach. There is also a lot of accommodation nearby as well some beach bars restaurants and so on. For those one who like more a camp, there is also one available in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-29 09:21:08', '2019-03-29 08:21:08', 11, 'paralia-skotinas-paralia-skotina_5', 1),
(3496, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Paralia Panteleimonos', 'paralia-panteleimonos', 1, '40.0084173', '22.598507', 'Paralia Panteleimonos', 'This beach is all about camps and sand. The beach Paralia Panteleimonos which is located in the village with the same name is a part of the region Kentriki makedonia. The beach itself is more kilometers long and it\'s up to 40 meters wide. The water entry is nice and comfortable and you can already swim after 10 meters. Beach infrastructure it\'s also on a high level so all your needs will be Suited. If you\'ll get hungry there\'s plenty of beach bars and restaurants available. Parking is also possible almost near the beach and there is also one large parking space available in the vicinity of the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-29 10:55:22', '2019-03-29 09:55:22', 11, 'paralia-panteleimonos-paralia-panteleimonos_5', 1),
(3497, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Kentriki Makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'kentriki-makedonia', 'Platamon', 'platamon', 1, '39.9846145', '22.6345555', 'Paralia Platamonas', 'This is the last Big Sandy Beach in the region of Kantriki macadonia before you step into the new region of the Thessalia. It\'s located near the town of Platamon and it\'s called Paralia Platamonas. You have a very large parking space available for your vehicle, and motorhomes can park as well here. The beach itself is a few kilometers long and can be up to 100 meters wide. You will find all kinds of accommodation here even camps apartment complexes and hotel resorts. Beach bars and restaurants are also on the beach. If you seek some natural shadow it\'s also available here. The water entry is comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 11, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-29 10:55:26', '2019-03-29 09:55:26', 11, 'platamon-paralia-platamonas_5', 1),
(3498, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Neoi Poroi', 'neoi-poroi', 1, '39.978971', '22.6482706', 'Paralia Neoi Poroi', 'If you want the best possible View on the mountain olympus while enjoying your day on a Sandy Beach you need to visit the beach Paralia Neoi Poroi. It\'s the first Beach in Thessalia when coming from the region of Kentriki macedonia. The beach itself is very long and can sometimes be up to 100 meters wide. The parking space is just next to the beach and can hold several hundred vehicles. The beach infrastructure is on high level so almost all your needs will be pleased. You don\'t need to worry about accommodation or food, there\'s plenty of it directly at the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 11, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-29 12:50:45', '2019-03-29 11:50:45', 11, 'neoi-poroi-paralia-neoi-poroi_5', 1),
(3499, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Stomio', 'stomio', 1, '39.869973', '22.735320', 'Paralia Stomio', 'On the right side of the delta Piniou in the region Thessalia you can experience the beauties of the sandy beach Stomio. It\'s a very long and quiet wide beach. The whole surrounding is very green, with lots of natural shadow. In Stormy Weathers the waves forming here could also be used for surfing. The parking is available almost everywhere around the beach and you need to walk over a bridge to reach the beach. The beach infrastructure is also present here and it\'s on a quiet pleasant level. Apartments, hotels and camps are also in the vicinity, and if you get hungry there\'s plenty of restaurants, beach bars and other types available. If you have children they can play on a child playground, which is also here available.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 9, 2, 17, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/UcacB1WzEmA', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d8722d73/stomio/\" data-label_1=\"STOMIO\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >STOMIO WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15616658301837.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11961, 5, '2019-03-29 14:43:36', '2019-03-29 13:43:36', 1, 'stomio-paralia-stomio_5', 1),
(3500, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Platia Ammos', 'platia-ammos', 1, '39.8408723', '22.7835286', 'Paralia Platia Ammos', 'Everything about this beach is special. First of all the road to reach the beach it\'s quite unique and has a lot of turns, but it should be okay for a motorhome go down here. The parking itself is not flat but falls sideways. Some parking spots are to be paid some are free. The beach is located in the village of Platia Ammos, which is part of the region Thessalia. It\'s a Sandy Beach around four hundred meters long and up to 20 meters wide. Beach infrastructure is also present here so you will find what you need. Beach bars and restaurants near the beach, as well some apartments. In Stormy Weather big waves can form here, maybe some Surfer will like it.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 2, 13, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-29 15:10:47', '2019-03-29 14:10:47', 11, 'platia-ammos-paralia-platia-ammos_5', 1),
(3501, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Koutsoupia', 'koutsoupia', 1, '39.8192973', '22.8057333', 'Paralia Chrysi Akti Koutsoupias', 'Just beneath the mountain Ossa Oros you will find this amazing Sandy Beach in the middle of the village Koutsoupia, which is a part of the region Thessalia. The parking can be done either on a large parking space or by the road. The water entry is comfortable and you can already start swimming 5 meters. If you want to rent an apartment you have plenty options in this Village. As well if you get hungry here are many beach bars and restaurants. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 2, 2, 15, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-29 16:01:20', '2019-03-29 15:01:20', 11, 'koutsoupia-paralia-chrysi-akti-koutsoupias_5', 1),
(3502, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Velika', 'velika', 1, '39.7603544', '22.8602418', 'Paralia Melivoia Velika', 'How about a long very long beach with black sand. Well it\'s not only sand there are also stones mixed within the sand, and some grass is also present here. This beach is located in the village Velika, the region it belongs to is called Thessalia. You won\'t have any problems with parking, you can just park your vehicle next to the road and step right on to the beach. Along the beach you will find some apartments as well as some beach bars and restaurants.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 6, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-29 16:35:23', '2019-03-29 15:35:23', 11, 'velika-paralia-melivoia-velika_5', 1),
(3503, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Kato Sotiritsa', 'kato-sotiritsa', 1, '39.7223359', '22.8688107', 'Paralia Sotiritsa', 'You certainly won\'t have any problems finding your spot on this almost 10 km Long Beach. It\'s made almost completely of black sand, here and there some Pebbles are mixed within. The beach is located in the region of Thessalia, near the village of Kato Sotiritsa. Parking your vehicle here won\'t be any problem not even for motorhomes. Beach infrastructure here is more or less on a basic level, but you have some restaurants and beach bars at your disposal. Some apartments and a camping ground are also near.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 9, 3, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-29 17:14:03', '2019-03-29 16:14:03', 11, 'kato-sotiritsa-paralia-sotiritsa_5', 1),
(3504, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Kato Polidendri', 'kato-polidendri', 1, '39.6604535', '22.8915442', 'Paralia Pyrgou Polydendriou', 'Not far away from the town of Larissa when you drive over the mountains you will find this nice sandy beach. The nearest Village is called Kato Polinderi and it\'s a part of the region Thessalia. The beach it\'s easy to reach by Road and a large parking space which can hold also motorhomes awaits you here. On the beach you will be served by a beach bar and here are also toilets and showers. Right next to the beach there is no accommodation but there is some around one kilometer away in the form of apartments. The water entry on some places can be tricky because there are rocks in the water but on some there are none.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 1, 1, 14, 7, 3, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-30 12:37:06', '2019-03-30 11:37:06', 11, 'kato-polidendri-paralia-pyrgou-polydendriou_5', 1),
(3505, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Afissos', 'afissos', 1, '39.2735298', '23.1815658', 'Paralia Kalifteri', 'What a nice surprise this beach is. The Only problem is that it\'s quite difficult to reach, but not so much by the path, but by finding a parking place. The only option is on a private parking place where there are quite many around the beach. It\'s located near the Big Town Volos, a part of the region Thessalia, but more precisely near the village Afissos. The name of the beach is Kalifteri. The beach itself is a mixture off sand and small Pebbles. The water entry is comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters. You can Find a beach bar on the beach, and many apartments in the vicinity. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 14, 3, 3, 14, 3, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-30 12:37:09', '2019-03-30 11:37:09', 11, 'afissos-paralia-kalifteri_5', 1),
(3506, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Malaki', 'malaki', 1, '39.3486146', '23.0032466', 'Paralia Malaki', 'The village of Malaki in the region of Thessalia has a beach to offer which is just next to the road. You can park on the other side of the road, cross the road and you are already at the beach. You will find a mixture of sand and small Pebbles on the beach as well as some basic Beach infrastructure, a beach bar and a few apartments in the vicinity of the Beach. The beach is approximately 750 m long and it\'s only about 10 meters wide.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 6, 2, 1, 15, 3, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-30 12:37:16', '2019-03-30 11:37:16', 11, 'malaki-paralia-malaki_5', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach` (`id`, `waterbody_id`, `continent_code`, `country_code`, `country_code_nice_url`, `region`, `region_nice_url`, `region_full_name_nice_url`, `city`, `city_nice_url`, `location_id`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `name`, `description`, `beach_type_id`, `location_pay_id`, `price_per_day`, `currency`, `area_description_id`, `accessibility_id`, `parking`, `payable_parking`, `road_to_parking_type_id`, `parking_capacity_id`, `parking_beach_distance_id`, `parking_beach_height_id`, `location_length_id`, `bay_length_id`, `beach_inclination_id`, `swimming_depth_of_one_m`, `occupancy_rate_id`, `tourist_facilities_id`, `video_url`, `webcam`, `path_to_beach_map_url`, `beach_weather`, `water_temperature`, `island_name`, `island_name_nice_url`, `river_name`, `river_name_nice_url`, `lake_name`, `lake_name_nice_url`, `boat_only`, `beach_views`, `user_id`, `datetime`, `datetime_ut`, `status_id`, `folder_name`, `mobile_upload`) VALUES
(3507, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Ag. Minas', 'ag-minas', 1, '39.3191545', '23.0173538', 'Paralia Kalamiés', 'How about a beach with a River next to it? This beach is really special, one of a kind. It\'s located near city of Volos, which is a part of the region Thessalia.Parking is really generous, you can park directly at the beach and it\'s large enough to accompany even motorhomes. The water entry is comfortable and since the water depth false quickly you can almost start swimming right away. A beach bar is also present here in the summertime, but you won\'t find any accommodation in the vicinity, but a little bit far away there is enough. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 14, 5, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-30 13:27:46', '2019-03-30 12:27:46', 11, 'ag-minas-paralia-kalamies_5', 1),
(3508, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Volos', 'volos', 1, '39.3509189', '22.9622596', 'Paralia Ánauros', 'The city of Volos, located in the region of Thessalia, has its own City Beach. You will find sand here, some natural shadow, lots of sunshade and deckchairs and of course lots of people. The beach infrastructure is on a high level, parking is available just next to the beach. If you get hungry here are plenty restaurants and beach bars, as well as some apartments and hotels in the city itself. The water entry is comfortable and you can start swimming immediately. A city park is also available next to the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 12, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-30 14:24:20', '2019-03-30 13:24:20', 11, 'volos-paralia-anauros_5', 1),
(3509, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Nees Pagases', 'nees-pagases', 1, '39.3338054', '22.933049', 'Paralia Alykes', 'Just outside the City of Volos you can enjoy another Sandy Beach in the region of Thessalia. The beach is well equipped with all necessary infrastructure, it even has a pier from which you can either jump or catch some fish. Outside the beach there is a large parking space picture needs to walk only 50 meters to reach the beach. If you get hungry a fast food restaurant available at your disposal. The water here is crystal clear and the water entry is comfortable. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 3, 1, 13, 5, 2, 14, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-30 14:53:47', '2019-03-30 13:53:47', 11, 'nees-pagases-paralia-alykes_5', 1),
(3510, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Nees Pagases', 'nees-pagases', 1, '39.3211419', '22.9252211', 'Paralia Pagason', 'We could almost say an all-inclusive Beach. There simply are little things that are missing, except you visiting the Beach. The beach is located in the town of Nees Pagases and belongs to the region of Thessalia.\nTo park your vehicle it\'s very simple since here are lots of parking places which are directly at the beach. Families with lots of children we love this beach because here you can find countless children playgrounds. To find a restaurant or a beachbar at this place is no problem as well as not to get an apartment. This beach is also known for very long piers, and there are a few of them, from which you can admire the crystal clear water.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-30 16:16:26', '2019-03-30 15:16:26', 11, 'nees-pagases-paralia-pagason_5', 1),
(3511, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Thessalia', 'thessalia', 'thessalia', 'Nea Anchialos', 'nea-anchialos', 1, '39.2733372', '22.8183187', 'Paralia Maltezou', 'How about a beach with red sand? For sure there are not that many in the world. This special Beach is located in the region of Thessalia, in the town of Nea Anchialos. You can park your vehicle by the road and head directly to the beach. Beach infrastructure on this place is also on the high level and you won\'t get as much natural shadow anywhere else. The trees are located trough the whole stretch of the beach. Because this beach is so special you can imagine that\'s finding a Beach Bar a restaurant is here no problem. The same goes for hotels and apartments. The water entry is comfortable and you can start swimming right away.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 3, 1, 15, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-30 18:59:47', '2019-03-30 17:59:47', 11, 'nea-anchialos-paralia-maltezou_5', 1),
(3512, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Glifa', 'glifa', 1, '38.9524881', '22.9670316', 'Paralia Glyfa', 'The village of Gliva is a true fisheries location. Here are plenty of piers, a ferry station and of course a village Beach. You can park your car in the center of the village near the piers, and walk around 200 meters till you reach the beach. The beach is made of sand and Pebbles and it\'s suitable for families. Almost on the beach you even have a children playground and some Sports fields. The water is quite shallow which makes it ideal for small children. If you get hungry here are plenty of options to have a meal or just to have a drink or an ice cream. Accommodation is also nearby in the form of apartments and hotels.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 5, 1, 13, 3, 2, 17, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-31 13:00:33', '2019-03-31 11:00:33', 11, 'glifa-paralia-glyfa_5', 1),
(3513, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Achladi', 'achladi', 1, '38.8863741', '22.8072636', 'Paralia Achladi', 'The village of Achladi, just located in the region of Sterea Ellada has a very nice Beach to offer. The beach is quite special, because the surface material has a red tone, no matter if it is sand or stones. You will Find also some natural Shadow Here. Sports fields and children playgrounds are also directly at the beach. The water entry is on some spots very comfortable on some you need to walk on big stones, the water itself is quite shallow so be prepared to walk a few 10 meters before you can start to swim. In the vicinity a little bit further away in the village Center you can also find some restaurants and some apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 2, 1, 12, 3, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-31 13:00:40', '2019-03-31 11:00:40', 11, 'achladi-paralia-achladi_5', 1),
(3514, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Paralia Rachon', 'paralia-rachon', 1, '38.8897257', '22.7969585', 'Paralia Rachon', 'In the region of Sterea Ellada there is a village called Paralia Rachon where you will find around 750 meters Long Beach. To park your car in this Village is quite difficult but there are some places on the end of the beach which can hold around 20 cars, otherwise you park either by the road or on private accommodation. Along the beach which is around 10 metres wide, you will find many beach bars and restaurants where you can also rent sunshade or deckchair. Some hotels and apartments are also available here for accommodation. The water entry is also comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 4, 3, 1, 15, 3, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-31 13:10:20', '2019-03-31 11:10:20', 11, 'paralia-rachon-paralia-rachon_5', 1),
(3515, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Drepano', 'drepano', 1, '38.866389', '22.758333', 'Paralia Drepano', 'The village of Drepano which is located in the region of Sterea Ellada can be proud on a very special Beach.  The beach has a special shape and it\'s more like a small peninsula made of red sand. Kiters will love this beach, it\'s also an official kitesurf training area. To park your car here is no problem, the space is very large and can welcome several hundred cars. Not only will the nice Beach amaze you, you will also have a stunning View on the mountains in the background. A beach bar it\'s also located here and in the vicinity there are some apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 3, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/Mi_K-sTJlzk', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d3221d85/drepano/\" data-label_1=\"DREPANO\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DREPANO WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15617131022199.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 7246, 5, '2019-03-31 16:07:50', '2019-03-31 14:07:50', 1, 'drepano-paralia-drepano_5', 1),
(3516, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Ag. Marina', 'ag-marina', 1, '38.8978032', '22.5865344', 'Paralia Agia Marina', 'How about a green grass Beach? For sure there aren\'t many. One is located in the town of Agia Marina, which belongs to the region of Sterea Ellada. Not only will you find a lot of grass on this beach you will also be under the cover of trees. The parking space is very large and it\'s only 30 meters away, motorhomes can also park here. On the beach itself there are quite many benches, most of them in a nice shadow. If you get  hungry restaurants and a beachbar are nearby. For accommodation you have a few apartments at your disposal.', 7, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 12, 7, 2, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-31 17:03:38', '2019-03-31 15:03:38', 11, 'ag-marina-paralia-agia-marina_5', 1),
(3517, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Kamena Vourla', 'kamena-vourla', 1, '38.7772755', '22.7707207', 'Paralia Kammena Vourla', 'In the region of Sterea Ellada there is a city called Kamena Vourla. Here you can find a one kilometer long red sand beach with lots of beach infrastructure. The beach also has a lot of trees, to protect you from the Sun. Because it\'s a City Beach you can be sure to have a lot of restaurants, shops an other amusement facilities at your disposal. Here are all so many hotels and apartments available for your stay. The only problem is the parking which is done by the road, since there are almost no parking places.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 2, 17, 4, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-31 18:13:05', '2019-03-31 16:13:05', 11, 'kamena-vourla-paralia-kammena-vourla_5', 1),
(3518, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Asproneri', 'asproneri', 1, '38.7875418', '22.8223806', 'Paralia Asproneri', 'The beach of asproneri is a very special one. Here you won\'t find any sand but instead a lot of Pebbles and stones. The beach stretches through several kilometers it\'s on the widest part around 25 metres wide. The water entry is very comfortable and swimming starts already after five meters. On the tip of the beach there can be strong currents so watch out were you swim. A beach bar is also present here, and there you can rent some beach equipment. Parking is done by the road which goes all around this small peninsula. You almostly step from your car onto the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 12, 1, 1, 17, 6, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-03-31 19:52:28', '2019-03-31 17:52:28', 11, 'asproneri-paralia-asproneri_5', 1),
(3519, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Agios Konstantinos', 'agios-konstantinos', 1, '38.7537459', '22.8654783', 'Paralia Neochori', 'A true Adventurer Beach. Are you one of those who love peace on the beach, with almost no people beside you? If so then I suggest you to visit the beach Paralia Neochori, located near the town of Agios Konstantinos. The region in which this beach wait you is called Sterea Ellada. If you are looking for beach infrastructure, well here you won\'t find any, although here is a large parking place, suitable also for motorhomes. The path to the beach is a little bit difficult, so you need to watch out where you\'re stepping. The composition of the surface on the beach is a mixture of Pebbles and sand.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 3, 14, 3, 2, 4, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-01 09:39:37', '2019-04-01 07:39:37', 11, 'agios-konstantinos-paralia-neochori_5', 1),
(3520, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Aktí', 'akti', 1, '38.776111', '22.898056', 'Paralia Kalamos Longoú', 'Right in the middle of the sea of the olives trees this nice shaped Beach awaits you. It\'s made of sand and of Pebbles and it\'s suitable for families. It\'s located near the village of Akti, which is a part of the region Sterea Ellada. The road to the beach which leads you through the olive trees fields is paved, and also suitable for motorhomes to drive through. On the beach itself there is some beach infrastructure to fulfill your basic needs. The water here drops pretty quickly so you can start swimming right away. If you get hungry or thirsty here\'s even a beach bar available for you.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 15, 7, 2, 2, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/mtFVt4QDywo', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d7722d90/akti/\" data-label_1=\"AKTI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >AKTI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15617131022199.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 4778, 5, '2019-04-01 10:14:21', '2019-04-01 08:14:21', 1, 'akti-paralia-kalamos-longou_5', 1),
(3521, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Loggos', 'loggos', 1, '38.9047592', '22.6781545', 'Paralia Loggos', 'The paralia Loggos has its name from the neighboring Village of Loggos. It\'s located in the region of Sterea Ellada. It\'s a 500 meters long Beach with a surface which is a mixture of sand and small Pebbles. You can park your vehicle directly at the beach and it\'s also suitable for motorhomes. The water entry is nice and comfortable but you need to walk on stones to reach the point of swim after 10 meters. On the beach is also a beach bar and some apartments are also nearby.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 14, 4, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-01 10:35:21', '2019-04-01 08:35:21', 11, 'loggos-paralia-loggos_5', 1),
(3522, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Arkitsa', 'arkitsa', 1, '38.755278', '23.030833', 'Paralia Souvala Arkitsa', 'A lot of natural shadow as well as some grass under the trees awaits you at this nice Beach. Located in the region of Sterea Ellada, near the town of Arkitsa with a nice view on the island of Evvia this beach will stay in your memory forever. The surface is a mixture of sand, pebbles and rocks. The water entry is very comfortable and enables you to swim right away. Parking your vehicle here is no problem, since here are plenty of spaces available at your disposal. You also won\'t be hungry on this beach, as well you won\'t have any problems finding an apartment.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 4, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/KVC7aNbabHc', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d7423d03/arkitsa/\" data-label_1=\"ARKITSA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ARKITSA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15617131022199.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8217, 5, '2019-04-01 12:39:21', '2019-04-01 10:39:21', 1, 'arkitsa-paralia-souvala-arkitsa_5', 1),
(3523, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Livanates', 'livanates', 1, '38.7084084', '23.0616476', 'Paralia Kyani Akti', 'If you have small children you will be amazed by these Beach. Not only is the water here very shallow, the beach is a sendy type Beach, you also have a large children playground directly at the beach. The town where the beach is located is called Livanates, and it\'s a part of the region Sterea Ellada. The parking is directly at the beach and it\'s paved. On the beach itself you have many beach infrastructure and of course a lot of bars, restaurants, fast food and so on. Hotels and apartments are also directly at the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 2, 1, 12, 7, 2, 8, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-01 13:21:14', '2019-04-01 11:21:14', 11, 'livanates-paralia-kyani-akti_5', 1),
(3524, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Skala', 'skala', 1, '38.6720929', '23.0734665', 'Paralia Skala Atalantis', 'Pure Sand is what you will find on the beach Skala Atalantis. The region it belongs to is Sterea Ellada and it is a part of the municipality of Skala. Parking here Your vehicle is not a problem as well as it is not a problem to reach the beach from the parking. You will find a lot of beach infrastructure here, as well as many children playgrounds. The water is quite shallow here and the swimming point is between 20 and 30 meters. The beach is around 400 meters long and 30 meters wide. Having a glass of beer or eating something is here no problem as well as finding a free room for an apartment.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 13, 7, 2, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-01 15:37:54', '2019-04-01 13:37:54', 11, 'skala-paralia-skala-atalantis_5', 1),
(3525, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Kiparissi', 'kiparissi', 1, '38.651627', '23.0769619', 'Paralia Paliomagaza', 'This beach is certainly more for those one who don\'t need as much Beach infrastructures as normal user does and who seek more piece then entertainment.  It\'s a few kilometers long and up to 25 meters wide Beach.  Parking place is quite huge and can hold several hundred vehicles.  the water entery is comfortable and you can start swimming after 20 meters.  you won\'t find any restaurants or beach bars as well as no accommodation here.  The region where this Beach is located  is called Sterea Ellada  and the nearest town Kiparissi.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 6, 2, 7, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-01 15:38:26', '2019-04-01 13:38:26', 11, 'kiparissi-paralia-paliomagaza_5', 1),
(3526, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Theologos', 'theologos', 1, '38.7721585', '23.311834', 'Paralia Vlycháda Malesinas', 'Crystal clear water and many Pebbles, white Pebbles awaits you on this Beach.  You won\'t get any better View of the Island Evvia  from any place then from this beach.  The nearest Village or town is called Theologos and it belongs to the region of Sterea Ellada. To park your vehicle here is not a problem and the road to the beach is really nice.  The beach itself  is around 300 meters long and 5 meters wide. Here you will find a beach bar and restaurant but no accommodation is available directly at the beach. Some basic Beach infrastructure  is also here at your disposal.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 2, 1, 12, 2, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-01 16:14:00', '2019-04-01 14:14:00', 11, 'theologos-paralia-vlychada-malesinas_5', 1),
(3527, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Paximada', 'paximada', 1, '38.4859446', '23.4465417', 'Paralia Paximada', 'In the village of Paximida you will find a very long Pebbles Beach  which is facing onto the island of Evvia. Paximida belongs to the region of Sterea Ellada. Parking Your car on this beach it\'s not a problem, you only need to park it by the road. The beach has some basic beach infrastructure and here are a few  Beachbars restaurants at your disposal.  A few apartments are also available here for your stay. The water entry  is a little bit tricky since you need to walk over some rocks but after that you can already start swimming.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 4, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-02 09:34:46', '2019-04-02 07:34:46', 11, 'paximada-paralia-paximada_5', 1),
(3528, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Vrisoui', 'vrisoui', 1, '38.5529731', '23.6310654', 'Paralia Vrisoui', 'Well if you like romantic beaches and you would like to spend your precious moments with your loved ones those beaches down here are just right for you. They are located in the region of Sterea Ellada, near the village of Vrisoui. You can park your vehicle next to the road and head down a 50 meters long path, where you have more small beaches to choose from. Either go left or right and find your perfect place. The beaches are very small and are not suitable for families but more for adventurers. On the beaches there is no beach infrastructure but some apartments are by the road.', 5, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 3, 2, 3, 2, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-02 09:34:51', '2019-04-02 07:34:51', 11, 'vrisoui-paralia-vrisoui_5', 1),
(3529, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Fities', 'fities', 1, '38.4962587', '23.5301176', 'Paralia Alykes', 'This beach will leave you speechless, so much Beauty on one kilometer of coastline melts your heart away. When you\'re in Greece head for the region of Sterea Ellada and the Village Fities. The name of the beach is Paralia Alykes. This beauty is a mixture of sand and trucks but the entry into the water is comfortable there should be no problem. The water is also quite shallow and the point of swim starts around 30 meters. Parking is done either by the road or on some large parking places nearby. Beach bars and restaurants are also on the beach and provide a high standards of services. You can also rent deckchairs and sunshades at the beach. If you like to play volleyball you have many options here as well as some water sports. Accommodation is possible here, but there are not that many apartments so possibly you need to search in the larger area to stay there.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 9, 2, 7, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/ji1rfzEHsGM', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d7021d19/fyteies/\" data-label_1=\"FITIES\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >FITIES WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15617467932318.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6825, 5, '2019-04-02 11:12:15', '2019-04-02 09:12:15', 1, 'fities-paralia-alykes_5', 1),
(3530, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Ag. Minas', 'ag-minas', 1, '38.4905981', '23.5677683', 'Paralia Valopoulos', 'Although the beach has very little beach infrastructure, a shower and parking, it is suitable for families with small children, because of the shallow water. The point of swim is around 40 meters from the beach. The beach itself is located in the region of Sterea Ellada, near the village of Ag. Minas. You can park your car by the road, since here are no official parking places. Beach bars and restaurants are also not available on this beach, and for accommodation you need to search a little bit far away.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 10, 4, 2, 8, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-02 11:42:14', '2019-04-02 09:42:14', 11, 'ag-minas-paralia-valopoulos_5', 1),
(3531, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Xirovrisi', 'xirovrisi', 1, '38.467091', '23.5881612', 'Paralia Asteria', 'A true City Beach. The beach itself is located in the city Xirovrisi, but the view faces in the direction of the city  Halkida. Both cities are located in the region of Sterea Ellada. You can park your car directly by the road and after 50  meters you can already be at the beach. On the beach you will find a lot of sand and concrete stairs. Entry is comfortable either by the stairs or via the sand beach. A beach bar is located directly at the beach, and many apartments and hotels are around it. Nearby you can find a park with children playgrounds.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 2, 9, 5, 5, 15, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-02 13:04:23', '2019-04-02 11:04:23', 11, 'xirovrisi-paralia-asteria_5', 1),
(3532, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Halkída', 'halkida', 1, '38.470207', '23.5985685', 'Paralia Drakopoulou', 'A nice hidden beach in the middle of the town Halkida. If you would like to visit this beach you need to go to the region of Sterea Ellada and visit the island Evvia. To park your vehicle next to the beach is not the problem only in the summertime when it can get crowded. The beach is a mixture rocks, pebbles and sand. You have a shower and some benches here otherwise the beach is without other beach infrastructure. A restaurant is also nearby and you can rent an apartment in the neighboring buildings.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 2, 2, 8, 3, 2, 5, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-02 13:24:20', '2019-04-02 11:24:20', 11, 'halkida-paralia-drakopoulou_5', 1),
(3533, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Halkída', 'halkida', 1, '38.4717301', '23.6028126', 'Paralia Kourénti', 'In the town of Halkida you can find many City beaches. But the beach Paralia Kourénti seems like it is the best one. There simply are many reasons why it is so. First of all you won\'t have any problem with the parking, here is a really large parking place which can hold many hundred vehicles. You you can get directly from the parking lot to the beach. On the beach itself you have a lot of beach infrastructure, also a playground for the children, showers and a beach bar where you can rent your beach equipment. The beach is made partly of sand, partly of Pebbles, it\'s around 200 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The water entry is comfortable and you can swim after 20 meters of entering the water. Around the beach restaurants, a beach bar, cake shop and others and of course many apartments and rooms.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 10, 5, 2, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-02 14:29:08', '2019-04-02 12:29:08', 11, 'halkida-paralia-kourenti_5', 1),
(3534, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Halkída', 'halkida', 1, '38.474152', '23.6054045', 'Paralia Papathanasíou', 'On the island of Evvia in the town of Halkida this is one of many city beaches here. It is easy to reach with your vehicle and the parking place is large enough to welcome even motorhomes. The city is located in region of Sterea Ellada. The beach surface is a mixture off Pebbles, rocks and sand. It\'s a family beach with some basic Beach infrastructure, some restaurants nearby and some apartments in the city itself. Start swimming is possible after 15 meters, but only after you walk over some rocks in the water.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 10, 5, 2, 5, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-02 15:14:24', '2019-04-02 13:14:24', 11, 'halkida-paralia-papathanasiou_5', 1),
(3535, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Nea Artaki', 'nea-artaki', 1, '38.5291118', '23.6304422', 'Paralia Zayfros', 'On the island of Evvia, which is a part of region Sterea Ellada, near the village of Nea Artaki you have a very nice little sandy the beach to go to. It\'s around 100 meters long and about 20 meters wide. The water here is pretty shallow which makes it a perfect place for small children to play in it safely. On the beach itself you also have a children playground and a sport field where you can play basketball. Parking your vehicle here is quite easy. You have around 100 places for the car. On the beach itself you have a restaurant, a coffeebar and a Beach Bar. In the surrounding there are a few apartments for you available.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 4, 1, 8, 5, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-03 08:47:25', '2019-04-03 06:47:25', 11, 'nea-artaki-paralia-zayfros_5', 1),
(3536, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Sipiada', 'sipiada', 2, '38.7859646', '23.274745', 'Paralia  Sipiada', 'A true Adventurer Beach. Almost no beach infrastructure, only a few visitors, hard to reach with the vehicle, and no apartments in the vicinity, this is the beach Sipiada. It\'s located on the island of Euboea, and belongs to the region of Sterea Ellada. You can reach the beach by a dirt road but it\'s quite difficult and you need to park your car on a pebble surface. From the parking lot to the beach it\'s only 10 meters, and it\'s a Pebbles Beach. The water falls quite fast so you can swim right away.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 7, 1, 1, 16, 5, 3, 3, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-03 10:58:43', '2019-04-03 08:58:43', 11, 'sipiada-paralia-sipiada_5', 1),
(3537, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Rovies', 'rovies', 2, '38.799959', '23.234199', 'Paralia Rovies', 'This beach is called Paralia Rovies and it\'s located on the island Euboea. It\'s a Pebble Beach, a few kilometers long and up to 20 meters wide. To reach the beach you need to drive on a dirt road, but once here you can park directly at the beach. Beach infrastructure is here almost not present, but there is some in the beach Bar along the beach. Some natural Shadow is also here, end when going to the water you can already start swimming after 3 meters. Apartments are also in the vicinity, if you would like to stay here. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 12, 1, 1, 17, 5, 3, 2, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/P4bdJBQlSKA', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d8123d23/rovies/\" data-label_1=\"ROVIES\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ROVIES WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15617499576078.png', 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11895, 5, '2019-04-03 12:39:41', '2019-04-03 10:39:41', 1, 'rovies-paralia-rovies_5', 1),
(3538, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Ilia', 'ilia', 2, '38.6113555', '23.1808213', 'Paralia ilia eyvoias', 'When visiting the island of Euboea you need to drive to the Village of Ilia to discover this unique pebbles Beach. Parking your vehicle here it\'s quite the challenge, either you do it by the road, or you drive through the whole village to park your vehicle on a small parking place next to the harbour. The beach itself has almost no infrastructure, but there is some in the village. The water here is very deep, so you can already start swimming after three meters. The slope of the beach is also quite steep. When you get hungry or you want to spent the night or even your holidays here you should go to the Village which is just nextby.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 1, 8, 2, 3, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-03 14:30:23', '2019-04-03 12:30:23', 11, 'ilia-paralia-ilia-eyvoias_5', 1),
(3539, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Loutra Edipsou', 'loutra-edipsou', 2, '38.85327217', '23.04810454', 'Paralia Makedonomachon', 'You can reach the island Euboea either by a fairy or a bridge. If You choose the fairy you are probably going to disembark in the town of Loutra Edipsou. Here you can find a sandy beach which goes by the name Paralia Makedonomachon. The beach is around 75 meters long and 5 meters wide. Parking is available all around the beach. You have a park in the vicinity and some children playground. The water entry is comfortable and swimming starts already after five meters. A coffee bar, restaurants, hotels and apartments also nearby.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 6, 2, 2, 7, 2, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-03 16:21:29', '2019-04-03 14:21:29', 11, 'loutra-edipsou-paralia-makedonomachon_5', 1),
(3540, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Neos Pirgos', 'neos-pirgos', 2, '38.94080997', '23.05736875', 'Paralia Nisiotissa', 'On the north side of the island Euboea you can find a 300 meter long Sandy Beach, just near the town off Neos Pirgos. To park your car on this beach is easy and not stressful because of the large space. You can access the beach directly from your car. On the beach itself you will find some basic beach infrastructure. A beach bar is also present here, and you can rent some beach equipment here. Accommodation is available only in the town itself, around 1 kilometer away. To start swimming you only need to go around five meters into the water.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 12, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-03 16:21:38', '2019-04-03 14:21:38', 11, 'neos-pirgos-paralia-nisiotissa_5', 1),
(3541, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Neos Pirgos', 'neos-pirgos', 2, '38.9379981', '23.0726225', 'Paralia Neos Pirgos', 'In the town of Neos Pirgos a one kilometer-long sandy beach awaits you. But before you reach the beach you need to take a ferry or drive over the bridge to the island of Euboea. It\'s a family-type beach with lots of hi standard beach infrastructure. Parking is available along the beach and can hold several hundred vehicles. The water entry it\'s very pleasant and you can already start swimming 5 meters. You even have a pier on the beach either to catch some fish or to jump from it into the water. A lot of restaurants and other types of catering are available along Beach, as well as many types of accommodation.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 4, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-03 17:32:01', '2019-04-03 15:32:01', 11, 'neos-pirgos-paralia-neos-pirgos_5', 1),
(3542, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Kanatadika', 'kanatadika', 2, '38.9759945869', '23.0934870243', 'Paralia kanatadika istiaias', 'If you like a more natural Beach then the touristic type you are on the right spot. The island of Euboea has many similar beaches to the one which I am describing right now. The closest town is Kanatadika and it\'s a few kilometers away. Parking your vehicle or motorhome on this spot is not the big challenge, you have plenty space beside the road. You will not find any Beach infrastructure here, but many peaceful and Quiet Moments. In the village nearby if you are looking for accommodation there are some apartments available. The water here has a big depth, that\'s why you can start swimming after around 10 meters. in the Summertime some beach or improvised beach bars are available here, and you can rent also some beach equipment there.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 3, 2, 4, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-03 18:05:13', '2019-04-03 16:05:13', 11, 'kanatadika-paralia-kanatadika-istiaias_5', 1),
(3543, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Kanatadika', 'kanatadika', 2, '38.9973986149', '23.1195902824', 'Paralia Kanatadika', 'On the north part of the island Euboea you will find this long Sandy Beach facing towards the city of Volos. The Village the beach is located is called Kanatadika. This beautiful Island belongs to the region of Sterea Ellada. To park your vehicle on this beach it\'s quite easy, because you have many parking spaces for you available, also motorhomes are welcomed here. On the beach itself there is some basic infrastructure. In the summertime you also have the option to rent some beach equipment. Showers are also available. In the case you like to have some natural shadow you will find some here. The water entery is nice and comfortable. Beach bars are all secure as well as some apartments in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 4, 2, 5, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-04 09:40:01', '2019-04-04 07:40:01', 11, 'kanatadika-paralia-kanatadika_5', 1),
(3544, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Pefki', 'pefki', 2, '39.01267114', '23.21223094', 'Paralia peykiou', 'In the village of Pefki, a very long, a few kilometers long, pebbles Beach awaits you. In the region of Sterea Ellada you need to drive to the island of Euboea to reach this place. Parking for vehicle here is not a problem and you have your Beach directly at your feet. You won\'t find any sand here but lots of different sizes of pebbles. The beach infrastructure here is on a high level. Almost everything is here to fulfill your needs. Beach bars and restaurants also available here and are stretching along the beach. For accommodation you have hotels, apartments and camping grounds available for you. The water falls also quite fast which makes it perfect to start your swim right away.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-04 09:40:04', '2019-04-04 07:40:04', 11, 'pefki-paralia-peykiou_5', 1),
(3545, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Psaropouli', 'psaropouli', 2, '38.97758534', '23.37279745', 'Paralia Psaropouli Vasilikon', 'On the northwest side of the island Euboea there is a small village with a very long pebbles Beach, called Psaropouli. The beach is several kilometers long up to 30 meters wide and the surface is a mixture of black and brown sand with small Pebbles. You can park your vehicle by the road, here you won\'t find any official parking spots. Along the beach there is some basic Beach infrastructure available. The water entry is fine and comfortable. Apartments and Studios are available along the whole stretch of the beach. Beach bars and restaurants are more concentrated around the Harbour.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 7, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-04 14:05:30', '2019-04-04 12:05:30', 11, 'psaropouli-paralia-psaropouli-vasilikon_5', 1),
(3546, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Agkali', 'agkali', 2, '38.8690926', '23.4403792', 'Paralia Agías Ánnas', 'A very special Beach awaits you in the village of Agkali, which is located on the west side of the island Euboea. Greece is quite big and to get to this beach head for the region of Sterea Ellada. When you arrive to the beach parking is not a problem, you can simply park your car beside the road, which goes directly by these beach. The surface of the beach is special, it\'s a mixture off Pebbles and sand, especially of red and black color. You will love the beach color with the color of the sea. Beach infrastructure is only basic here, but more are around the restaurants. If you have a dog you can also bring him to the beach. If you would Like to stay here for longer, you have some apartments and a camping ground at your disposal.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 9, 2, 3, 1, 0, 'https://youtu.be/UMJcPiLGb2c', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d8823d44/agkali/\" data-label_1=\"AGKALI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >AGKALI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15617531351538.png', 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5558, 5, '2019-04-04 14:05:36', '2019-04-04 12:05:36', 1, 'agkali-paralia-agias-annas_5', 1),
(3547, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Kria Vrisi', 'kria-vrisi', 2, '38.8297328', '23.4100767', 'Paralia kryas vrysis', 'In the middle of the fields there is a small village called Kria Vrisi, which is located on the east side of the island Euboea. It\'s an almost 1 km long sandy pebbles beach suitable for families and for adventorours. You have some basic basic infrastructure here, like showers but otherwise there is not much here. You can park your vehicle or motorhome direct at the beach. Parking places are abundant here. In the summertime a beach bar is also here where you can rent some beach equipment. And the little bit in the background you have some apartments and restaurants.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 7, 2, 4, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-04 18:23:25', '2019-04-04 16:23:25', 11, 'kria-vrisi-paralia-kryas-vrysis_5', 1),
(3548, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Pilio', 'pilio', 2, '38.7637674809', '23.5894542933', 'Paralia Pilíou', 'In the village of Pilio, on the west side of the island Euboea you have a nice pebbles sandy Beach to go to. The beach is around 500 meters long and up to 30 meters wide. Parking here is no problem. Either you Park on the large paved parking place or in a small Park. You can access the beach directly from the parking. Here is some basic Beach infrastructure, many restaurants and beach bars are in the vicinity. For accommodation you have some apartments near the village itself and around the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 14, 7, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-04 18:23:25', '2019-04-04 16:23:25', 11, 'pilio-paralia-piliou_5', 1),
(3549, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Kalamos', 'kalamos', 2, '38.4496689', '24.1838314', 'Paralia Kalamos', 'This beach will simply leave you speechless. So much beauty on one place melts your heart away. There\'s no other place on the earth to have a more crystal clear water then this Beach. The name of the beach is paralia Kalamos and it\'s located on the east side of the island Euboea or Evvia. You can reach the beach by a paved road, where a large paved parking place awaits you. The surface of the beach is made of white pebbles, some sand and rocks. The water entry is very nice and comfortable and you either start swimming after 5 meters or you can jump from the cliffs into the blue water. You have a lot of apartments and rooms on the beach, as well as restaurants and beachbars. Bring your mask, snorkel and fins with you to do some snorkeling, you won\'t regret it.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 5, 2, 10, 7, 2, 13, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d4124d04/aliveri/\" data-label_1=\"ALIVERI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ALIVERI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15617531351538.png', 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 12545, 5, '2019-04-05 14:25:28', '2019-04-05 12:25:28', 1, 'kalamos-paralia-kalamos_5', 1),
(3550, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Paralia Zarakon', 'paralia-zarakon', 2, '38.3159941435', '24.2262643576', 'Paralia zarákon', 'Another special Beach on the east side of the island Euboea. The Paralia Zarakon it\'s quite unique. What makes it so unique is the large wawe barrier right in front of the beach to protect you from the wawes. You have a very large parking place right on the beach, which welcomes also motorhomes. It\'s a family type Beach with some basic beach infrastructure. You will love the crystal Clear water and the white pebbles on the beach. You also have sunshades on the beachs, and if you would like to stay there for a few days you have some apartments and rooms in the vicinity. Restaurants in beachbars are not present on this beach, maybe there is some improvised catering during the summer time.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 10, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-05 15:56:25', '2019-04-05 13:56:25', 11, 'paralia-zarakon-paralia-zarakon_5', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach` (`id`, `waterbody_id`, `continent_code`, `country_code`, `country_code_nice_url`, `region`, `region_nice_url`, `region_full_name_nice_url`, `city`, `city_nice_url`, `location_id`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `name`, `description`, `beach_type_id`, `location_pay_id`, `price_per_day`, `currency`, `area_description_id`, `accessibility_id`, `parking`, `payable_parking`, `road_to_parking_type_id`, `parking_capacity_id`, `parking_beach_distance_id`, `parking_beach_height_id`, `location_length_id`, `bay_length_id`, `beach_inclination_id`, `swimming_depth_of_one_m`, `occupancy_rate_id`, `tourist_facilities_id`, `video_url`, `webcam`, `path_to_beach_map_url`, `beach_weather`, `water_temperature`, `island_name`, `island_name_nice_url`, `river_name`, `river_name_nice_url`, `lake_name`, `lake_name_nice_url`, `boat_only`, `beach_views`, `user_id`, `datetime`, `datetime_ut`, `status_id`, `folder_name`, `mobile_upload`) VALUES
(3551, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Mesochoria', 'mesochoria', 2, '38.261667', '24.251667', 'Paralia Armyríchi', 'If you are on the island Euboea you certainly don\'t want to miss this beautiful Beach. It\'s located in the region of Sterea Ellada, near the village of Mesochoria. When driving on the paved road down to the beach, you need to know that the road has many turns, sometimes it can get narrow and tricky, so drive carefully. You can park your vehicle directly on the beach. Here a small pebbles beach awaits you. The water is very clear and has a nice blue tone. The water entry is comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters. Here you have some basic beach infrastructure,  a beach bar is also available here, but in the vicinity there are no apartments, so you need to stay in the village above the beach, and try to find an apartment there. Bring your snorkeling equipment with you, you won\'t regret it.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 1, 1, 7, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/i1xq99qROYc', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d2524d21/mesochoria/\" data-label_1=\"MESOCHORIA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >MESOCHORIA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15618379124635.png', 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5661, 5, '2019-04-05 15:56:34', '2019-04-05 13:56:34', 1, 'mesochoria-paralia-armyrichi_5', 1),
(3552, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Tsakei', 'tsakei', 2, '38.243107', '24.247350', 'Paralia Limiona Mesochorion', 'White small pebbles and some gray sand is what you will find on the beach paralia limiona Mesochorion. It\'s located on the island of Euboea, near the village Tsakei. The road to the beach is paved and in a good condition, motorhomes can also drive here. The parking, once on the beach, is of dirt and you need to to park your vehicle by the road. You have some beach infrastructure here and it\'s suitable for families. The water is obviously crystal clear which makes it prairie attractive for snorkeling. You have some beach bars and restaurants here as well as a camping ground and some apartments. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 2, 11, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/hhLiBT_eBxY', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d2424d22/tsakei/\" data-label_1=\"TSAKEI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >TSAKEI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15618118212108.png', 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5802, 5, '2019-04-05 15:56:52', '2019-04-05 13:56:52', 1, 'tsakei-paralia-limiona-mesochorion_5', 1),
(3553, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Ag. Dimitrios', 'ag-dimitrios', 2, '38.28114167', '24.15037438', 'Paralia Aghios Dimitrios', 'If you are searching on the island Euboea for a nice day camp location under trees with sand on the beach which is one kilometer long you are on the right spot. The beach is located on the west side of the island, near the village Ag. Dimitrios. The island and the village or a part of the region Sterea Ellada. You can park your vehicle along the whole stretch of the beach, mostly under the trees with a Direct beach access. Surface is a mixture of sand, pebbles and grass. Water entry is nice and comfortable, but Beach infrastructure it\'s almost zero. In the surrounding area there are some apartments for you available. If you get hungry a beach bar is also available here.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 3, 2, 4, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-05 18:04:44', '2019-04-05 16:04:44', 11, 'ag-dimitrios-paralia-aghios-dimitrios_5', 1),
(3554, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Akti Nireos', 'akti-nireos', 2, '38.40493083', '23.9976328611', 'Paralia kalámi', 'Near the village of Akti Nireos on the west side of the island Euboea, you have a nice little Beach right besides the main road at your disposal. It\'s made of Pebbles and it\'s suitable for families. You can park your car directly at the beach and almost step directly into the water. Here you have some beach infrastructure, even some children playgrounds. The water false quite slow, it\'s shallow bay. You have a restaurant on the beach and some apartments in the vicinity.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 10, 1, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-05 18:04:46', '2019-04-05 16:04:46', 11, 'akti-nireos-paralia-kalami_5', 1),
(3555, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Malakonta', 'malakonta', 2, '38.3960044384', '23.760766983', 'Paralia Palmariva', 'How about a sandy beach located between two hotels? It\'s possible but you need to drive to the island of Euboea and head to the Village of Malakonta. You have a quite large parking space here available which is located directly at the beach. On the beach accept from the sand here is also some grass and some natural shadow. You can also use a pier, either to catch some fish or to jump into the water. Except on the beaches from the hotels here is almost no beach infrastructure, but there\'s a lot on the beaches of the hotels. Restaurants in beachbars are not  present here, there is some catering on the beach hotel, and of course you can stay for your holidays either in the hotels or in the neighboring Apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 12, 3, 2, 14, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-07 08:18:58', '2019-04-07 06:18:58', 11, 'malakonta-paralia-palmariva_5', 1),
(3556, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Pagorama', 'pagorama', 2, '38.401068449', '23.7356775999', 'Paralia Pagorama', 'A very large parking place through the whole stretch of the beach awaits you on the paralia Pagorama. The beach is located on the island Euboea, near the village Pagorama. You need to go to the region of Sterea Ellada to enjoy this beach. The surface of the beach are Pebbles, which are located on the whole 400 meters of the beaches length. The widness of the beach is only 5 meters, but you can already start swimming after a few meters. Here is a Beach Bar and Restaurant for you available and some apartments are nearby. Showers and toilets are also available here.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 13, 2, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-07 09:48:09', '2019-04-07 07:48:09', 11, 'pagorama-paralia-pagorama_5', 1),
(3557, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Faros', 'faros', 2, '38.40229892', '23.65313616', 'Paralia Faros', 'If you are a family with children you will love this beach. Located on the island Euboea, near the village of Faros it offers you a nice Beach holiday. Getting here by Road is easy, as well as it is the parking. You can either Park your vehicle on the large parking place or by the road. The surface of the beach is a mixture of sand and grass, some trees are also here, a children\'s playground is as well available. You certainly will love the nice shaped benches which can turn into a small tent. Bring your food  with you, since there are no restaurants or beach bars, but if you would like to spend more days here there are some apartments in the vicinity available. The water falls quite quick which makes the beach not really suitable for very small children.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 14, 7, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Euboea', 'euboea', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-07 09:48:12', '2019-04-07 07:48:12', 11, 'faros-paralia-faros_5', 1),
(3558, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Sterea Ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'sterea-ellada', 'Plaka Dilesi', 'plaka-dilesi', 1, '38.3495861292', '23.6640357971', 'Paralia plaka Dilesiou', 'One of the last beaches in the region of Sterea Ellada, when going down the coastline from the north to the south region of Attiki is the family beach called Paralia plaka Dilesiou. It\'s a true family beach, with lots of children playgrounds, lots of natural shadow, which is great for your babies, and some beach infrastructure to service your needs. To park your vehicle here is not the problem, you either do it on the large parking place or by the road. Restaurants and beach bars or here not present, so bring your food with you. When you\'re looking for accommodation there are a few apartments in the vicinity. The water entry is on some places nice, on some you need to walk over the rocks.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 14, 3, 2, 4, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/g60JnEzhc7s', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d3423d65/plaka-dilesi/\" data-label_1=\"PLAKA DILESI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >PLAKA DILESI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15623581569323.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 9269, 5, '2019-04-07 12:01:32', '2019-04-07 10:01:32', 1, 'plaka-dilesi-paralia-plaka-dilesiou_5', 1),
(3559, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Chalkoutsi', 'chalkoutsi', 1, '38.3358210325', '23.7178730965', 'Paralia Pigathakia ', 'If you are searching for a beach with pebbles and natural shadow along the whole one kilometer Long Beach, you are on the right spot with this beach. It\'s located in the region of Attiki, near the village of Chalkoutsi and it\'s called Paralia Pigathakia. You have a large parking space available here even for motorhomes. Access to the beach is directly from the parking.  Beach bars and apartments are available along the whole stretch of the beach. You can also rent some beach equipment here. The water fals quite quickly, you can swim right away.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 16, 2, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-07 12:01:40', '2019-04-07 10:01:40', 11, 'chalkoutsi-paralia-pigathakia_5', 1),
(3560, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Ag. Konstantinos', 'ag-konstantinos', 1, '38.3319371939', '23.7779277563', 'Paralia Paraskevis', 'This beach is a true adventurer beach. Except from the parking space and some benches almost no beach infrastructure is here available. It\'s a few kilometers long Sandy beach with very shallow water. It\'s located in the region of Attiki, near the town Ag. Konstantinos. So if you can live without the beach infrastructure and you have small children who like to play in the water safefly this Beach is for you. Bring your drinks and food with you, because here are no options to get any. Accommodations like apartments are available in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 2, 2, 8, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-07 12:59:03', '2019-04-07 10:59:03', 11, 'ag-konstantinos-paralia-paraskevis_5', 1),
(3561, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Nea Palatia', 'nea-palatia', 1, '38.32534983', '23.80448998', 'Paralia markopoulou oropou', 'A beach full of white Pebbles as long as the eye can see. If you like this kind of beach head for the region of Attiki towards the town Nea Palatia. From the beach you have a wonderful View on the island Euboea. Parking your vehicle is possible by the road or on a very large parking place, motorhomes are also welcomed. Because of the Pebbles the water here is very clear and clean, but falls very fast, so you can swim immediately. You have many restaurants and beach bars along the whole stretch of the beach, as well as some apartments in the vicinity. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 7, 2, 2, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/ooZEYZBIZlo', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d3223d80/nea-palatia/\" data-label_1=\"NEA PALATIA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >NEA PALATIA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15623499169448.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10699, 5, '2019-04-07 16:53:52', '2019-04-07 14:53:52', 1, 'nea-palatia-paralia-markopoulou-oropou_5', 1),
(3562, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Agii Apostoli', 'agii-apostoli', 1, '38.2978355885', '23.9026075602', 'Paralia kentro kalamou', 'Near the town of Agii Apostoli you have a white pebble beach at your disposal. It\'s located in the region of Attiki and offers you fantastic views of the island Euboea. The beach is around 500 meters long, and up to 10 meters wide, and has a lot of beach infrastructure on the highest level. Parking is done either by the road or on a large parking space near the harbor. It\'s a family beach and near the harbor there are also children playgrounds. You can start swimming after 10 meters of entering the water. Near the harbor there is also a large concentration of different beach bars and restaurants, and many apartments are in the vicinity of the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 14, 3, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-07 16:54:03', '2019-04-07 14:54:03', 11, 'agii-apostoli-paralia-kentro-kalamou_5', 1),
(3563, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Dikastika', 'dikastika', 1, '38.14293508', '24.03992197', 'Paralia Schoiniá', 'In the region of Attiki, north from the famous city Athens, near the village Dikastika you have a very long sandy beach available for your Beach holidays. It\'s more kilometers long and around 20 meters wide, and has along the whole stretch of the beach therese everywhere. So much natural Shadow you won\'t find anywhere else. To get here with your vehicle is quite easy, the roads are paved, only around 200 meters you need to drive on a dirt road, all the way to the beach. You can park your vehicle under the trees, there is space everywhere. Beach bars are here available during the summer time, but unfortunately there is almost no accommodation nearby. Beach infrastructure, because the beach is so wild is also not present on a high level, take that into account. Water entry is very nice and you can already swim after 5 meters.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 1, 1, 17, 5, 2, 4, 1, 0, 'https://youtu.be/WcflluG2B1E', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d1624d06/dikastika/\" data-label_1=\"DIKASTIKA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DIKASTIKA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15623554118245.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8063, 5, '2019-04-07 17:47:55', '2019-04-07 15:47:55', 1, 'dikastika-paralia-schoinia_5', 1),
(3564, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Nea Makri', 'nea-makri', 1, '38.0892241001', '23.9826285839', 'Paralia Nea Makri', 'The city of Nea Makri is a very touristic City. Located the region of Attiki, it also has its own Beach, which is quite unique. The beach is a mixture of grass, sand, pebbles and rocks. On the most part of the beach when you go to the water, you need to walk over some Flat Rocks, but after 15 meters you can already swim. You will find also some natural shadow here, or rent some beach equipment. Families with children will love this beach, because you will find a lot of children playgrounds here. You can park your vehicle by the road, where there are manny signed parking lots. You can get all kinds of food  along the whole stretch of the beach, and in the vicinity you will also find all kinds of apartments and hotels.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 14, 6, 2, 5, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-08 11:47:20', '2019-04-08 09:47:20', 11, 'nea-makri-paralia-nea-makri_5', 1),
(3565, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Rafina', 'rafina', 1, '38.0196046829', '24.0115427971', 'Paralia Rafina', 'In the Region of Attiki, in the town Rafina you have a true City Beach to spend your Beach holidays at. The surface is a mixture of sand, pebbles and grass. The beach infrastructure is on a high level, and you have so many things to do there. Rafina is also a major port which connects you with 4 neighboring Islands. Parking your vehicle here is not a problem, and you can access the beach directly from the parking. The beach itself is around 400 meters long and up to 50 meters wide. You have many beach bars and some apartments and hotels in the background. Children playgrounds are as well here. Water entry is very comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 13, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-08 18:04:43', '2019-04-08 16:04:43', 11, 'rafina-paralia-rafina_5', 1),
(3566, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Rafina', 'rafina', 1, '38.0118584633', '24.0177279711', 'Paralia Marikes', 'In Greece you will find many unique beaches, and this is also the case for the beach named Paralia Marikes. The thing that the so special about it is the water entry, it\'s quite unique, because although it is not comfortable on some places, you can actually after around 10 meters jump into the sea. You walk around 10 meters on a rocky plate and then it false sharply to a few minutes of depth. The surface here is made of sand, some natural Shadow is a swell here. For the Parking you have two large parking places available, which can hold as well motorhomes. A beach bar is also present here and if you would like to stay here longer you have some apartments in the background.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 2, 1, 14, 3, 1, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-09 09:31:18', '2019-04-09 07:31:18', 11, 'rafina-paralia-marikes_5', 1),
(3567, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Artemida', 'artemida', 1, '37.9831375', '24.0106252', 'Paralia Artémida', 'Very close to the city of Athens, there is a Town called Artemida. Here you will find a few kilometers long sandy beach, which has a very high beach infrastructure level. Whatever you\'re looking for you\'re certainly will find it here, also children playgrounds as well as sport fields. You can park your vehicle along the whole stretch of the beach, and access the beach directly from the parking. Here are many Beachbars and restaurants and you can rent some beach equipment there. The angle of the beach is quite flat but not the water entry, so swimming starts at the around 15 meters. If you\'re looking for some accommodation you have plenty of apartments in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 8, 1, 5, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-09 09:31:22', '2019-04-09 07:31:22', 11, 'artemida-paralia-artemida_5', 1),
(3568, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Porto Rafti', 'porto-rafti', 1, '37.89178721', '24.02463388', 'Paralia Agiou spyridona', 'Near Athens in the region of Attiki you will find the Village Porto Rafti. It\'s located just east from the famous ancient city and offers youa pebbles Beach to enjoy the crystal clear water here. You have a very large parking place here from which you can access the beach directly. Some beach infrastructure is also present here, as well as some restaurants and apartments in the vicinity. The water falls here pretty quickly, so you can already start swimming after three meters. If you like land Sports some fields are also here available. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 9, 7, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-09 10:35:00', '2019-04-09 08:35:00', 11, 'porto-rafti-paralia-agiou-spyridona_5', 1),
(3569, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Porto Rafti', 'porto-rafti', 1, '37.867139', '24.0393752', 'Paralia Aylaki', 'When you are in Athens and you have some free time to visit beaches or you are here because of the beaches, you should go to the Village of Porto Rafti, and visit the beach named Paralia Aylaki. It\'s really a special Beach, it\'s fully covered with sun shades and has a beach infrastructure on the highest level. Sports fields and some children playgrounds are also in the vicinity, not on the beach itself, but near the parking. You also have a very large parking place only 100 metres away. The beach is made of sand, the point of swim is around 15 meters from entering the water. A Beach bar and some restaurants are available here and for accommodation you have some apartments in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 1, 10, 8, 1, 5, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-09 11:52:25', '2019-04-09 09:52:25', 11, 'porto-rafti-paralia-aylaki_5', 1),
(3570, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Paralia Kakis Thalassis', 'paralia-kakis-thalassis', 1, '37.8346127272', '24.0495121479', 'Paralia Kakis Thalassis', 'Not far away from the ancient city of Athens you should visit the Village Paralia Kakis Thalassis. Why? Because it is an amazing Beach with one of the highest beach infrastructure standards in the region of Attiki. Right in front of the beach you can park your vehicle and after only 50 meters you are already at the beach. The beaches is around 150 meters long and up to 30 meters wide and it\'s partially made of sand and of Pebbles, which are also the surface in the sea. The depth rises quickly so only after 3 meters you can already swim. On the beach there are not only children playgrounds and sports fields you even have a swimming pool. BeachBars and restaurants are also here. Apartments are in the vicinity but not in a huge number.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 3, 1, 9, 7, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-09 13:44:33', '2019-04-09 11:44:33', 11, 'paralia-kakis-thalassis-paralia-kakis-thalassis_5', 1),
(3571, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Posidonia', 'posidonia', 1, '37.6816731691', '24.0643179417', 'Paralia Pountazéza', 'Just outside, towards southeast from Athens, you have a village called Posidonia. There\'s no pretty much around the village, but a beautiful sandy Beach with lots of natural shadow to protect you from the hot greece Sun. You can reach the beach by a paved Road, and park your vehicle by the road, directly at the beach. You have around 400 meters of length and up to 30 meters of whidness available on the beach. Here is some basic Beach infrastructure, but there is more inside a camp, just next to the beach. Taking a swim here is easy and you can already swim after 5 meters. On The beach directly there are no beach parts, but there is some catering in the camp. If you want to stay here for longer you either have the camp or the neighboring apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 13, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-09 16:39:57', '2019-04-09 14:39:57', 11, 'posidonia-paralia-pountazeza_5', 1),
(3572, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Kato Sounio', 'kato-sounio', 1, '37.6551246643', '24.0245461464', 'Paralia Souníou', 'The region Attiki is full of surprises. A beach which goes by the name Paralia Souníou hess even got a temple on one of the neighboring Hills. The temple is dedicated to the god Poseidon. Right next to it there\'s a second temple, called the temple of Athina Sounias. So if you get bored of this wonderful Beach, you can explore some greek culture here. The beach itself is made of sand, is around 200 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. Because of the vicinity of a hotel you have a lot of beach infrastructure here. You can also park your vehicle next to the beach on the large parking place, which is not quite flat but goes a little bit into the hill. Restaurants in beachbars are also present here, as well as a luxury hotel hotel and some apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 3, 1, 10, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-09 16:40:04', '2019-04-09 14:40:04', 11, 'kato-sounio-paralia-souniou_5', 1),
(3573, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Sounion', 'sounion', 1, '37.6595691', '24.0155187', 'Paralia Cape Sounio', 'Have you ever thought how it will be to be on a beach and to watch one of mythiest gods, Poseidon, almost right in front of you? Well, we can help you. You need to go to the region of Attiki, which is quite easy to find, since Athens, the capital of Greece is present there and then head to the Village Sounion in the south. The roads to the beach are paved and you can park your vehicle next to the road dirt parking place. After 100 meters of walk you are here. The beach belongs to a resortand is very occupied and is equipped with the highest possible beach infrastructure standard. Everything here is luxurious, so are the prices for a sunshade and a deck chair, around 25 Euros per person in 2019. The surface of the beach is sand, the water entry is comfortable and you have a beach bar on the beach and in the background a resort with lots of additional services.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 4, 3, 9, 6, 5, 13, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-09 18:35:36', '2019-04-09 16:35:36', 11, 'sounion-paralia-cape-sounio_5', 1),
(3574, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Palaia Fokaia', 'palaia-fokaia', 1, '37.680842', '23.941402', 'Paralia Katafygi', 'Located in the region of Attiki, in the village Saronikos, just south from the ancient city of Athens, you have this beautiful pebbles Beach to discover. It\'s a special one because it\'s actually made of two beaches, and a little church in the middle of them. The surface is a mixture of pebbles and rocks and on some places the water entry can be tricky. Parking your vehicle here is quite a challenge. You either do it by the road or private parking. Restaurants and beach bars on not present here, but on the other side you have many many apartments available. The beach infrastructure is only basic.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 10, 4, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/ppugEt6uHcY', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/37d7223d95/palaia-fokaia/\" data-label_1=\"PALAIA FOKAIA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >PALAIA FOKAIA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15624153142621.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 9760, 5, '2019-04-09 18:39:14', '2019-04-09 16:39:14', 1, 'palaia-fokaia-paralia-katafygi_5', 1),
(3575, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Anavyssos', 'anavyssos', 1, '37.7228343487', '23.9438331127', 'Paralia Fókaias', 'A true family beach you will find in the village of Anavyssos. It\'s located just south from the famous city of Athens in the region of Attiki. The surface is made of sand and some small Pebbles, you also have some trees here to protect you from the Sun, and you can also rent some beach equipment. The parking is very large and you can park directly at the beach. If you would like to stay in a hotel with a swimming pool directly at the beach you can do so or you can rent some apartment in the village. Swimming can be done already after five meters and if you get hungry here are plenty of beach bars and restaurants for you available.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 8, 1, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-10 11:15:32', '2019-04-10 09:15:32', 11, 'anavyssos-paralia-fokaias_5', 1),
(3576, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Anavyssos', 'anavyssos', 1, '37.71833312', '23.92275031', 'Paralia Agios Nikolaos', 'When you\'re in Greece you should visit the region Attiki and head South in the Direction of the village Anavyssos. Here are very beautiful sandy Beach with very special curves awaits you. You can park your vehicle on a large parking place which is made of dirt but the road towards it is paved. The beach is around 300 meters long and up to 40 meters wide. The point of swim starts already after five meters. You have a beach bar here and some apartments in the vicinity. The beach infrastructure here is basic most of it is concentrated around the beach bar.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 12, 8, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/FiKsxmsaw7w', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/37d7323d94/anavyssos/\" data-label_1=\"ANAVYSSOS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ANAVYSSOS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15624153142621.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 17847, 5, '2019-04-10 12:13:23', '2019-04-10 10:13:23', 1, 'anavyssos-paralia-agios-nikolaos_5', 1),
(3577, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Anavyssos', 'anavyssos', 1, '37.73512767', '23.90419867', 'Paralia Mavro Lithari', 'Crystal clear water awaits you on the beach Paralia Mavro Lithari. The beaches is located in the region of Attiki, a little bit outside of the ancient city Athens, near the village of Anavyssos. Parking your vehicle here is not the big challenge, you have so many places available and it\'s even large enough for motorhomes. You can access the beach directly from the parking. This beauty is around 250 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The water false quite quickly so you can almost jump into it and start swimming immediately. You have plenty of beach infrastructure here, also children playgrounds and sports fields. Beach bars are also here and for accommodation you have some apartments in the vicinity.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 11, 5, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-10 13:53:57', '2019-04-10 11:53:57', 11, 'anavyssos-paralia-mavro-lithari_5', 1),
(3578, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Ag. Dimitrios', 'ag-dimitrios', 1, '37.8017234802', '23.8659471273', 'Paralia Apeiranthou', 'Just south from the ancient City of Athens you can have a very beautiful beach facing towards the peloponnese peninsula. The surface here is a mixture of sand and Pebbles   and what it makes it unique are the little trees on the beach which give you some protection from the Sun. You need to go to the Village of Ag. Dimitrios in the region of Attiki to spend your beach day here. Parking your vehicle here is easy and it can be done directly on the beach where do you have a dirt Park Place. The water entry on some places can be tricky because you need to walk over some rocks. Beach Infrastructure here is basic, but you have one beach bar and some apartments in the vicinity.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 15, 8, 2, 3, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/cbYOpupts4E', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/37d9423d73/agios-dimitrios/\" data-label_1=\"AG. DIMITRIOS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >AG. DIMITRIOS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15624153142621.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8266, 5, '2019-04-10 14:04:40', '2019-04-10 12:04:40', 1, 'ag-dimitrios-paralia-apeiranthou_5', 1),
(3579, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Ag. Marina', 'ag-marina', 1, '37.8186321259', '23.8363838196', 'Paralia Loumpárdas', 'In the village of Ag. Marina, which is located in the region Attiki, just south  from the famous city Athens a very unique sandy beach awaits you. The whole area is very colorful and it\'s made in a shape of a narrow bay. You can reach the beach by a paved Road which goes all the way down from Athens to the South and Park on a dirt park Place. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here and also a beach bar which will provide you whit some food and drinks. The water gets deep quite fast, so you can start swimming immediately. A little bit outside from the beach you have some apartments available for your accommodation.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 2, 11, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-10 15:22:24', '2019-04-10 13:22:24', 11, 'ag-marina-paralia-loumpardas_5', 1),
(3580, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Vari', 'vari', 1, '37.8208047152', '23.8104790449', 'Paralia Varkizas', 'This Sandy Beach it\'s almost 1 kilometer long and up to 50 meters wide. It is located in the region of Attiki in the town Vari, which is just south from the ancient city of Athens. You have a very big parking place here at your disposal, even motorhomes can park here. Because the water falls quite slowly this beach is vary popular with the surfers. On one part of the beach the beach infrastructure is on a high level one half of it it\'s a little bit more wild. You have some beach bars and restaurants also available as well a city with all its services in the background. For acommendation you have mainly Apartments available.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 9, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-10 17:20:37', '2019-04-10 15:20:37', 11, 'vari-paralia-varkizas_5', 1),
(3581, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Vouliagmeni', 'vouliagmeni', 3, '37.8076243401', '23.7851160765', 'Paralia Límni Vouliagménis', 'If you are a beach enthusiast you need to visit this beach. It will blow your mind. So much Beauty on one place, never else in the world. Where is it located? You need to go the region of Attiki, just south from Athens and near the village Vouliagmeni you will find your Unforgettable experience and memories. It\'s actually it\'s not a beach made By the Sea, but it was a cave that formed this beauty. The water inside the lake is a mixture of sea Water and Lake water. Because of the wells inside, the water has all year a constant temperature of around 21 degrees. Because of the wells the water is also very healthy, so a lot of people come here for medical reasons. For swimming you need to jump into the water or you can use the letters, because the water fals rapidly. You can park your vehicle onto large parking places. Beach infrastructure obviously here is on a high level as swell as are the entry prices. In the year 2019 you need to pay 12 euros for a daily ticket. A restaurant is also available here and the coffee bar and of course lots of beach equipment. You can rent here a lot of things but be aware that they have a high price. Accommodation is available in the surrounding of the lake in aform of apartments and hotel. ', 8, 2, '12', 47, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 3, 2, 10, 5, 4, 1, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Límni Vouliagménis', 'limni-vouliagmenis', 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-10 17:20:44', '2019-04-10 15:20:44', 11, 'vouliagmeni-paralia-limni-vouliagmenis_5', 1),
(3582, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Vouliagmeni', 'vouliagmeni', 1, '37.81441797', '23.78043847', 'Paralia Aktí Vouliagménis', 'The beaches around the town of Vouliagmeni are very unique and very popular in Greece. This Beach, which is located in the region of Attiki, is a Sandy beach, with the total length 500 meters and up to 30 meters wide. If you don\'t like scent and you prefer more grass you also have plenty of it here. In the summertime this is not a free beach but a beach who charges you a fee of around 5 Euros per person per day. The beach infrastructure is on a high level, you have plenty of sport fields as well as children playgrounds and all the possible beach equipment to protect you from the Sun. You can park your vehicle directly at the entrance and after 100 meters of walking you are on your Beach. Beach bars and restaurants are also here and accommodation is available in the city in the form of apartments or hotels.', 1, 2, '5', 47, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 2, 14, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-10 19:42:15', '2019-04-10 17:42:15', 11, 'vouliagmeni-paralia-akti-vouliagmenis_5', 1),
(3583, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Vouliagmeni', 'vouliagmeni', 1, '37.8175216913', '23.7684005499', 'Paralia Kavouri', 'Not far away from Athens, you have a town named Vouliagmeni. Facing towards north here is a sandy beach, with a length of 500 meters and up to 30 meters wide. The name of the beach is Paralia Kavouri. You can park your vehicle beside the road where there are many parking lots. After 50 meters of walking you\'re on the beach. The water here is quite flat which makes it ideal for small children. You also have a large children playground as well on the beach. You also have many Beach infrastructure here to please your needs. Some beach bars are also available here, where you can rent the beach equipment. For accommodation there are apartments and hotels in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 14, 7, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-11 09:17:42', '2019-04-11 07:17:42', 11, 'vouliagmeni-paralia-kavouri_5', 1),
(3584, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Voula', 'voula', 1, '37.8493273258', '23.750692606', 'Paralia Voúlas', 'How about a little bit more sporty beach? No problem just outside of Athens in the Metro region you have such a beach. It\'s located in the region Attikiin the town  of Voula. You have a very large parking place here,  which is paved, and it takes you only 100 meters of walking to reach the beach. The beach is made of sand, is 500 meters long and up to 50 meters wide. You have a lot of Beach infrastructure here, as well as a water park. Sports fields are allso here and they are of all kinds of types. You have a beach bar available here and if you would like to stay longer some apartments are available in the city.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 1, 14, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-11 10:26:44', '2019-04-11 08:26:44', 11, 'voula-paralia-voulas_5', 1),
(3585, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Voula', 'voula', 1, '37.8576797247', '23.7504190207', 'Paralia Asteras ', 'If you are looking for a large children playground directly on the beach and you also like to enjoy luxurious beach bars you are on the right spot. Paralia Asteras is the name of the beach and it is located in the region Attiki, just a little bit outside of Athens in the town of Voula. Getting here with your vehicle is not a problem, you can either Park your vehicle outside the resort or inside. Here is Plenty of grass, palms and other exotic trees to wonder. The beach is around 300 meters long, it is a Sandy Beach and it can be up to 40 meters wide. The water enter is very nice and it\'s quite flat so swimming starts a little bit late. The beach infrastructure is here on a high level and if you would like to spend you have plenty of apartments in the city itself.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 4, 1, 12, 8, 2, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-11 11:37:30', '2019-04-11 09:37:30', 11, 'voula-paralia-asteras_5', 1),
(3586, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Alimos', 'alimos', 1, '37.9101016', '23.7128739', 'Paralia Kalamaki', 'If you are in Athens and you would like to go to the beach this is the right spot for you. It\'s a true City Beach with lots of beach infrastructure on the highest level. The entrance is not for free in the year 2019 you\'ll have to pay 5 euros for a full day ticket. The beaches is around 500 meters long and up to 40 meters wide. The surface of the beach is made partly of sand and partly of small Pebbles. The water here is very clear and has a nice blue tone. The water entry is very nice and because the water gets deep so quick you can already start swimming after three meters. You can park your car directly at the beach. Of course beach bars and restaurants are available here as well. If you would like just take it for longer in the city there are many options to rent an apartment or stay in a hotel.', 1, 2, '5', 47, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 14, 8, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-11 12:41:58', '2019-04-11 10:41:58', 11, 'alimos-paralia-kalamaki_5', 1),
(3587, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attika', 'attika', 'attika', 'Kineta', 'kineta', 1, '37.9762063', '23.2880154', 'Paralia Kinetta', 'If you are the one who likes Pebbles on the beach and crystal clear water you should visit the town of Kineta, which is located west from Athens. It\'s a 750 meters long Beach which can get on some places up to 20 meters wide. The water on this beach gets deep quite quickly, so only after three meters you can already swim away. You can park your vehicle by the road or private parking. The beach infrastructure is here basic more is located near the hotel. You have many beachbars and restaurants here, as well as a hotel and some apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 15, 5, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-12 09:26:12', '2019-04-12 07:26:12', 11, 'kineta-paralia-kinetta_5', 1),
(3588, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Kechries', 'kechries', 1, '37.8795', '22.9918967', 'Paralia Kechrión', 'One of the first beaches in the region of Peloponnisos when you cross the Corinth canal is located in Kechries. It\'s a Sandy Beach with some Pebbles mixed in the sand. The beach is around 400 meters long end up to 15 meters wide. The point of swim starts after 15 meters and it\'s quite comfortable. You can park your vehicle directly at the beach. Here you have some basic beach infrastructure, as well as 2 beach bars and some apartments in the background. Dogs are also welcomed on this beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 13, 4, 2, 5, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-12 16:40:57', '2019-04-12 14:40:57', 11, 'kechries-paralia-kechrion_5', 1),
(3589, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Nea Epidavros', 'nea-epidavros', 1, '37.6708424091', '23.1525760889', 'Paralia Aliótou', 'How about a beach with brown and black Cent mixed with white Pebbles. You think such a beach does not exist? But it does. It\'s located in the region of Peloponnisos, near the village Nea Epidavros. This location is more than 1,000 kilometers long and can be up to 10 meters wide. Parking is done on the side of the road or private parking. You can start swimming after 5 meters and the water entry is very nice. Along the whole Beach there is some beach infrastructure but mostly located around beach bars restaurants, where you can also rent some beach equipment. If you\'re looking for accommodation it is also available here but mostly in the form of apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 3, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-13 14:59:31', '2019-04-13 12:59:31', 11, 'nea-epidavros-paralia-aliotou_5', 1),
(3590, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Panagia', 'panagia', 1, '37.6195532084', '23.1570661068', 'Paralia Gialási', 'Most camps are not directly at the beach, but the Paralia Gialási, located in the region Peloponnisos, near the village Panagia it\'s different. This location is also famous for the sunken city of epidaurus, which is only 500 meters away from the beach. One think that is so special for this location are also the orange trees which are everywhere in the valley. The beach is partly made of sand partly of Pebbles. It\'s around 1 km long then 10 meterse wide. You can leave your vehicle either in the parking lots of the beach bars or the campsites. The location is ideal for motorhomes which can be parked directly at the beach on the campsite. On The beach the point of swim is after 5 meters. You have many beach bars and restaurants available here. And for accommodation truce between campsite, apartments and even some hotels. There is some beach infrastructure directly on the beach, but most of it is in the campsites.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 16, 3, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/NsYt6OxbDn8', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d7324d73/panagia-thasos/\" data-label_1=\"PANAGIA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >PANAGIA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15625003684382.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5694, 5, '2019-04-13 14:59:41', '2019-04-13 12:59:41', 1, 'panagia-paralia-gialasi_5', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach` (`id`, `waterbody_id`, `continent_code`, `country_code`, `country_code_nice_url`, `region`, `region_nice_url`, `region_full_name_nice_url`, `city`, `city_nice_url`, `location_id`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `name`, `description`, `beach_type_id`, `location_pay_id`, `price_per_day`, `currency`, `area_description_id`, `accessibility_id`, `parking`, `payable_parking`, `road_to_parking_type_id`, `parking_capacity_id`, `parking_beach_distance_id`, `parking_beach_height_id`, `location_length_id`, `bay_length_id`, `beach_inclination_id`, `swimming_depth_of_one_m`, `occupancy_rate_id`, `tourist_facilities_id`, `video_url`, `webcam`, `path_to_beach_map_url`, `beach_weather`, `water_temperature`, `island_name`, `island_name_nice_url`, `river_name`, `river_name_nice_url`, `lake_name`, `lake_name_nice_url`, `boat_only`, `beach_views`, `user_id`, `datetime`, `datetime_ut`, `status_id`, `folder_name`, `mobile_upload`) VALUES
(3591, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Attiki', 'attiki', 'attiki', 'Metamorfosi', 'metamorfosi', 1, '37.5364347', '23.3454904', 'Paralia Dáriza Metamórfosis', 'Although we are on the peninsula Peloponnisos, this beach is a part of the region Attiki. The closest Village to the beach has a famous name Metamorfosi, what is also the name of the beach, which is Paralia Dáriza Metamórfosis. You can reach the beach by a paved Road, and park your vehicle by the road or on a small parking place. The beach is made of black pebbles, it is 750 meters long up to 20 meters wide. The water and entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 15 meters. You have some basic Beach infrastructure here as well as a beach bar and some apartments in the village above.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 15, 5, 2, 5, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-13 18:02:14', '2019-04-13 16:02:14', 11, 'metamorfosi-paralia-dariza-metamorfosis_5', 1),
(3592, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Akti Idras', 'akti-idras', 1, '37.412905097', '23.3342689276', 'Paralia Plepi', 'This special Beach belongs to the luxurious Village Akti Idras. Wherever you step wherever you go you will feel special, you will feel the quality and you will feel the highest standard of services this Village is providing you. Access to the beach is limited to the ones who either have a house here or the ones who have booked their place In the resort. The beach itself it\'s artificial shaped and has on the most part sand and on some places concrete as the surface. You can park your vehicle either inside the resort or outside by the road. The beach Infrastructure here is on a high level and services are provided on the highest possible standard to fulfill all your needs. The water entry is very fast because of the deep water you can already start swimming after 5 meters. Restaurants in beach bars are available along the whole stretch of the beach. For your accommodation you can either choose the resort or some apartments near the marina. Sports fields are also here planty but are more concentrated around the marina.', 1, 2, '10', 47, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 2, 16, 7, 5, 13, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-13 19:45:15', '2019-04-13 17:45:15', 11, 'akti-idras-paralia-plepi_5', 1),
(3593, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Agioi Anargiri', 'agioi-anargiri', 1, '37.323043', '23.1715155', 'Paralia Petrothálassa', 'A mixture of red Pebbles and reddish sand is what you can expect to have as a surface on this beach. To reach reach this beach you need to visit the peninsula Peloponnisos and head towards the village of Agioi Anargiri. The beach is easy to reach with the vehicle by a paved Road, and parking can be done directly on the beach, where are dirt surface awaits you. The beach is around 150 meters long and up to 15 metres wide. The water Entry is very nice and swimming starts immediately at around 3 meters. You have some beach infrastructure here but it\'s only basic. A beach bar and a restaurant are also here where you can rent some beach equipment. Accommodation is not nearby a little bit more far away and only in the form of apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 9, 4, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-14 09:24:50', '2019-04-14 07:24:50', 11, 'agioi-anargiri-paralia-petrothalassa_5', 1),
(3594, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Ververouda', 'ververouda', 1, '37.34023959', '23.12613602', 'Paralia berberonta', 'A Very unique beach awaits you near the village Ververouda. It is located in the region Peloponnisos in a beautiful crystal clear water bay. You can reach it by a paved road with your vehicle, where you can park it by three major parking spaces all in the vicinity of beachbars. The surface of the beach are white pebbles, the length is around 750 meters and up to 15 meters wide. The water entry is comfortable and you can start swimming already after 3 meters. Beach infrastructure is located mainly around the beach bars. You also have some accommodation here, but mainly in the form of apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 2, 1, 15, 4, 2, 2, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-14 10:54:24', '2019-04-14 08:54:24', 11, 'ververouda-paralia-berberonta_5', 1),
(3595, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Kantia', 'kantia', 1, '37.5178661', '22.9712617', 'Paralia kantias', 'These beach is called Paralia kantias and it\'s located near the village Kantia. It\'s a part of the region Peloponnisos. The beach is more than 1 kilometer long and can be up to 15 meters wide. The surface is made mostly of sand, with some pebbles mixed in. The point of swim starts at around 5 meters. You have some beach infrastructure as well here, but it\'s mostly located around the beach bars. Is also available for your vehicle. Larger Places are available around the beach bars. For accommodation on this location you have many options. Apartments Are standard, you even have a campsite, and there is also a hotel Resort in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 4, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-14 11:23:35', '2019-04-14 09:23:35', 11, 'kantia-paralia-kantias_5', 1),
(3596, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Tolo', 'tolo', 1, '37.5273817778', '22.8670871258', 'Paralia Tolo', 'Most beaches on the peninsula peloponnese are a mixture of sand and Pebbles, but this beach in the village of Tolo is different. It\'s completely made of sand and it\'s about five hundred meters long and up to 25 meters wide. You can park your vehicle almost directly at the beach and motorhomes are welcome as well. The water entry is very nice and comfortable and you can start swimming after around 20 meters. Beach infrastructure is also present here and because of this being a village Beach you have a much higher standard than elsewhere. If you get hungry here are some beach bars and restaurants and for your accommodation you can choose between Apartments, hotels and even a campsite. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 3, 2, 14, 6, 2, 6, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-14 12:26:00', '2019-04-14 10:26:00', 11, 'tolo-paralia-tolo_5', 1),
(3597, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Navplion', 'navplion', 1, '37.5455745', '22.8213187', 'Paralia Karathona', 'A very long Sandy Beach with an enormous parking space  awaits you near the town of Navpilon, which belongs to the region Peloponnisos. You can reach the beach by a quality paved Road and park your vehicle almost directly at the beach. The beach is a few kilometers long and up to 50 meters wide. You also have a lot of trees and grass on the beach. The trees are more concentrated in the background by the parking space. The point of swim starts already after 3 meters and you have some beach infrastructure located around the beachbars. Accommodation is not available directly at the beach but it\'s a little bit far away mostly in the town of Navpilon.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 2, 17, 9, 2, 2, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-14 14:05:45', '2019-04-14 12:05:45', 11, 'navplion-paralia-karathona_5', 1),
(3598, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Kiveri', 'kiveri', 1, '37.5265995', '22.7308103', 'Paralia Kiveríou', 'If you like white big pebbles, almost stones on the beach you should visit the village Kiveri in the region Peloponnisos. It\'s easy to reach by the road, and the parking is just next to the beach. The beach is 200 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here, as well a pier, a small Marina and some children playgrounds. To get into the water and start swimming you can choose the beach or use some water stairs from the pier. In the village and on the beach you have some coffee bars, restaurant and beach bars. Accommodation is provided in the village in the form of apartments or Studios.', 5, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 6, 1, 1, 10, 5, 5, 13, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-14 15:22:18', '2019-04-14 13:22:18', 11, 'kiveri-paralia-kiveriou_5', 1),
(3599, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Kato Vervena', 'kato-vervena', 1, '37.4242546', '22.7537587', 'Paralia Paliochano ', 'Kato Vervena is the name of the village the beach Paralia Paliochano is located. It\'s a 500 meters long and up to 20 meters wide Beach. It\'s suitable for those one who don\'t like a lot of neighbors and a lot of beach infrastructure, because here you will find only the basic. The beach has a very large parking place and you can park your vehicle directly at the beach. The point of swim starts pretty early, after three meters. The surface is predominantly sand with some white Pebbles mixed with in. A Beach Bar and Restaurant are available on the far end of the beach, where you can also rent some beach equipment. Accommodation is not on the beach, but more near to the Village in the form of apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 14, 5, 2, 2, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-14 15:51:58', '2019-04-14 13:51:58', 11, 'kato-vervena-paralia-paliochano_5', 1),
(3600, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Paralio Astros', 'paralio-astros', 1, '37.4104431', '22.7598484', 'Paralia Kallisto', 'Have you ever been to a true City Beach, a Long Beach, with lots of small Pebbles, and the amphitheater overlooking the beach and the City. If you would like to have this experience you need to visit the city Paralio Astros, which is located in the region Peloponnisos. The beach is a few kilometers long and up to 30 meters wide. Most of the beach infrastructure is located in the town and around the beach bars which are available along the whole stretch of the beach. You can park your vehicle directly at the beach, but mostly by the side of the road. The water here false quite quickly, which makes the point of swim almost immediately. You have plenty of all kinds of restaurants and similar services available in the city, where you will also find accommodation in the form of apartments. And a little bit outside the city you also have a campsite.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 7, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-14 19:13:35', '2019-04-14 17:13:35', 11, 'paralio-astros-paralia-kallisto_5', 1),
(3601, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Krioneri', 'krioneri', 1, '37.3126870394', '22.821226716', 'Paralia Kryoneri', 'This beach is all about pebbles, white pebbles. On some part of the beach they are almost stones on some parts small stones and on some you even have some sand. The beach is located near the village Krioneri on the Peninsula Peloponnisos. The road to reach this Beach goes down to coastland, and you can park your vehicle almost directly at the beach beside the road. The beach is around 500 long and up to 20 meters wide. The water falls here very quickly which makes the point of swim at 3 meters. You have some beach infrastructure here, but only basic, more is located near the beach bar and restaurant. If you would like to stay here you can rent some rooms in the bay.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 14, 5, 2, 2, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-14 19:13:37', '2019-04-14 17:13:37', 11, 'krioneri-paralia-kryoneri_5', 1),
(3602, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Plaka', 'plaka', 1, '37.1473234892', '22.8935980797', 'Paralia Plakas', 'In the middle of the peloponnese mountains by the coastline you have a very long pebbles Beach to explore. It\'s Located in the village Plaka. The beach itself is a mixture of brown sand and Pebbles. It\'s around one kilometer long and up to 30 meters wide. The point of swim starts already at 5 meters. You can park your vehicle almost directly at the beach. The parking space is very large and most has a height restriction, but a few motorhomes can park here as well. The beach Infrastructure is concentrated around the village are further out there is none. You have a lot of beach bars and restaurants in the village as well as some apartments and a camping ground if you would like to spend your holidays here.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 16, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-15 09:46:49', '2019-04-15 07:46:49', 11, 'plaka-paralia-plakas_5', 1),
(3603, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Gefira', 'gefira', 1, '36.6886228323', '23.0371713638', 'Paralia Gefira', 'This place is all about crystal clear water and Pebbles on the beach. It\'s a unique place with a special Beach and a special surrounding. To reach this beach you need to go to the peninsula Peloponnisos and search for the village Gefira. The beach is a mixture of white Pebbles, rocks and on some places even Brown sand. It\'s 400 meters long and can be up to 15 metres wide. The water falls here very quickly which makes the point of swim at 3 meters. Have some beach infrastructure as well here and of course a lot of restaurants and similar and in the village itself there are many options to rent an apartment or to stay in a hotel.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 13, 4, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-15 11:16:06', '2019-04-15 09:16:06', 11, 'gefira-paralia-gefira_5', 1),
(3604, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Neapoli Voion', 'neapoli-voion', 1, '36.5125465393', '23.05531919', 'Paralia Neápolis', 'A true Little City sandy Beach awaits you in the far south off the peninsula peloponnese. The roads to reach this city are in a good shape and provide you with a lot of comfort. You can park your vehicle by the road where there are parking lots available. The beach is around 500 meters long and can be up to 30 meters wide. You will also find some small Pebbles on the beach, but mostly it is made of sand, sometimes even black sand. Because it is a City Beach you also have a lot of beach infrastructure here. The point of swim starts at around 5 meters. Along the whole stretch of the beach as well in the city itself you have a lot of beach bars, restaurants and other types. A children playground and some sports fields are also available. For accommodation you have apartments and hotels at your disposal.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 2, 14, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-15 11:40:01', '2019-04-15 09:40:01', 11, 'neapoli-voion-paralia-neapolis_5', 1),
(3605, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Pounta', 'pounta', 1, '36.5198475122', '22.983918786', 'Paralia Paulopetri', 'The peninsula peloponnese is full of surprises. You Have so many different types of beaches here, that it\'s hard to believe. On the far south of the peninsula you can even enjoy some sand dunes. They are located near the village Pounta and have a name, they are called Paralia Paulopetri. The whole area here is easy to reach by a quality paved Road, only a few hundred meters you need to drive on a dirt road. The parking here is very large but it\'s made out of dirt. It\'s very flat and so very good for motorhomes. You need to walk around 100 to 200 meters from your parking to reach the beach. The water entry is very nice and swimming on the beach starts at around 15 meters. On the beach itself you don\'t have any Beach infrastructure, except the parking. The beach is a few kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide, but it\'s very flat. A little bit in the background you have some restaurants and some apartments but on the beach itself there are none.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 4, 1, 17, 12, 1, 5, 1, 0, 'https://youtu.be/qVcXo8p4TGI', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/37d0425d10/pounta/\" data-label_1=\"POUNTA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >POUNTA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15625257899016.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 7378, 5, '2019-04-15 12:56:23', '2019-04-15 10:56:23', 1, 'pounta-paralia-paulopetri_5', 1),
(3606, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Glifada', 'glifada', 1, '36.73854176', '22.81098816', 'Paralia Glifada', 'The beach Paralia Glifada is the place you want to go in the summer if you like a Pebble Beach and also listen to some amazing electronic music. It is located in the region Peloponnisos on the peninsula peloponnese. The closest Village is called Glifada. The beach is around 300 meters long and can be up to 25 meters wide. On the most part of the beach as a surface you have Pebbles, some sand and rocks. On the Most part of the beach the water entrance is quite pleasant. The beach is rewarded with a blue flag sign, which means it has on a specific part all the necessary Beach infrastructure. You also have a beach bar on the beach where you can rent some beach equipment. In the Summertime this is also a good place to dance and to listen to music. And if you would like to stay in an apartment on the beach itself and in the surrounding there are none. The closest are in Elea. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 12, 6, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-15 14:38:46', '2019-04-15 12:38:46', 11, 'glifada-paralia-glifada_5', 1),
(3607, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Valtaki', 'valtaki', 1, '36.7888408899', '22.5820219517', 'Paralia Valtaki', 'How about a Sandy Beach with the Shipwreck stranded on the beach. Well, even that is possible in Greece. To see it by yourself you need to visit the peninsula peloponnese and head to the Village of Valtaki. The beach is easy to reach by a paved Road and you can leave your vehicle, also motorhome directly on the beach on a large parking space. The beach is around one kilometer long and up to 40 minutes wide. The water entry has on some spots rock inside on some spots there\'s only sand. Beach infrastructure is located only around the beach bar and restaurant, which is directly at the beach, elsewhere there is non. You also won\'t find any accommodation near the beach so look in the neighboring villages or towns for it.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 3, 1, 16, 8, 2, 4, 1, 0, 'https://youtu.be/mkhq9UmDsv4', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/36d7922d59/valtaki/\" data-label_1=\"VALTAKI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >VALTAKI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15625040816423.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 6349, 5, '2019-04-15 17:09:52', '2019-04-15 15:09:52', 1, 'valtaki-paralia-valtaki_5', 1),
(3608, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Mavrovouni', 'mavrovouni', 1, '36.7330992222', '22.5686591864', 'Paralia Mavrovouni', 'How about a four kilometer sandy beach in the South part of the peninsula peloponnese. Not only is this beach very long it can be also on some parts up to 50 meters wide. To spend a day or your holidays on it you shoot visit the village Mavrovouni in the region Peloponnisos. Parking your vehicle here is very easy and you can park directly at the beach. Here are many hundred parking places available. When on the beach if you would like to swim you can do it already after 3 meters since the water falls very fast into the depth. You also have some beach infrastructure here but it\'s mostly located around the beach bars. Restaurants are also available on the beach and if you would like to stay in an apartment you can also do it directly on the beach. A camping ground is also available.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 9, 2, 2, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-15 18:14:10', '2019-04-15 16:14:10', 11, 'mavrovouni-paralia-mavrovouni_5', 1),
(3609, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Vathý', 'vathy', 1, '36.710278', '22.523889', 'Paralia Vathý', 'This very long sandy beach is suitable for all of you like to spend your holidays in a camp and have a sandy beach right in front of you. It\'s located on the peninsula Pelepones near the village Vathý. The beach is more kilometers long and on some places up to 40 meters wide. The water here false very quickly, so you can start swimming right away. You can park your vehicle in the camps, by the road next to the beach or around the beach bars. You also have some beach infrastructure here but it\'s more located around the camps. A restaurant which is also isle Beach Bar is just next to the camp. For accommodation you have in the vicinity Apartments, a hotel and a few camps.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 2, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/ZTc2np_cuNg', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/37d7526d98/samos/\" data-label_1=\"VATHY\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >VATHY WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15625309689223.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 5488, 5, '2019-04-16 15:17:01', '2019-04-16 13:17:01', 1, 'vathy-paralia-vathy_5', 1),
(3610, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Korinthos', 'korinthos', 1, '37.9391886', '22.9209066', 'Paralia kalamia', 'When you cross the famous corinth canal, it\'s really worth a visit, you can also wisit the beach in the city Corinthos, which is only a few kilometers away. It\'s a true City Beach where the surface is a mixture of pebbles and sand. The beach itself is around 1 km long and up to 25 meters wide. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here, as well as many types of restaurants and a lot of apartments in the city itself. To park your vehicle here is not the problem. You have many places available, some of them are almost directly at the beach and are very large, some of them are in the city by the road. The water entry is very nice and comfortable the point of swim starts already at 3 meters.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 2, 16, 6, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-19 11:47:14', '2019-04-19 09:47:14', 11, 'korinthos-paralia-kalamia_5', 1),
(3611, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Vrachati', 'vrachati', 1, '37.9627661', '22.8046806', 'Paralia Vrachati', 'On the peninsula peloponnese, in the North Park there is small town called Vrachati. You have a pebbles beach here, which is around 750 meters long and can be on some parts up to 50 meters wide. It\'s a true family beach with lots of beach infrastructure. It\'s very suitable for families with children and for those one who love to do some sport on the beach. The parking of your vehicle is very easy here and it can be done directly on the beach where there are many hundred parking places available. The water entry is nice and comfortable although the beach is on some parts quite steep, but you can swim away already after five meters. If your get hungry you have many beach bars and restaurants available here. On the beach itself you can also rent some beach equipment. If you would like to stay here for longer there are many apartments and Studios available in the town itself.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 15, 9, 3, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-19 13:43:53', '2019-04-19 11:43:53', 11, 'vrachati-paralia-vrachati_5', 1),
(3612, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Kato Diminio', 'kato-diminio', 1, '38.0242985487', '22.7351331711', 'Paralia Pefkias', 'If you like to have the beach infrastructure on a very high level with a lot of services available to fulfill your needs you should visit the Paralia Pefkias in the town Kato Diminio. The region the beaches located is called Peloponnisos. It\'s a very long pebbles Beach, a few kilometers long and up to 25 meters wide. In the middle of the beach you also have a park with lots of grass and natural shadow to protect you from the Sun. If you have children this beach is also suitable for you because you have some playgrounds in the park, as well as some sport fields. On some places the beach is quite steep, and swimming starts already after 5 meters. Beach bars and other types of restaurants are also available here, and if you would like to sleep in the city there are many apartments and hotels available.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 2, 1, 17, 5, 3, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-19 14:18:41', '2019-04-19 12:18:41', 11, 'kato-diminio-paralia-pefkias_5', 1),
(3613, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Likoporia', 'likoporia', 1, '38.1355887651', '22.4848937988', 'Paralia Likoporia', 'In the region Peloponnisos, in the village named Likoporia you can find a unique pebbles Beach with a total length of 300 meters and up to 10 meters wide. It\'s a family beach with some beach infrastructure, a beach bar and accommodation in the vicinity, but mostly in the form of apartments or Studios. The beach is partly separated by rocks to prevent the waves crashing into the beach. You have also grass here and some trees, but you can as well rent some sunshade and deckchairs at the beach bar. Parking is also done directly at the beach, and around 30 to 50 vehicles can park here. The point of swim starts already at 5 meters and the entry is very nice.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 12, 3, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-19 15:47:49', '2019-04-19 13:47:49', 11, 'likoporia-paralia-likoporia_5', 1),
(3614, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Kráthi', 'krathi', 1, '38.1657918', '22.3407232', 'Paralia Akrata', 'One of the first very long pebbles beaches in the region Dytiki Ellada when coming from the ancient town of Athens is the Paralia Akrata. It is located in the village Kráthi where you will find a lot of beach infrastructure. You can park your vehicle on a very large parking place, which is located almost directly at the beach. The beach itself is a few kilometers long end up to 20 meters wide. The slope is on some spots quite steep, which means that the point of swim starts also very early at around 5 meters. He also have a children playground here, also some sport fields. Along the whole Beach there are also trees for some shade. Beach bars and restaurants are as well here, also many apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 5, 3, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-19 17:16:02', '2019-04-19 15:16:02', 11, 'krathi-paralia-akrata_5', 1),
(3615, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Paralia Trapezis', 'paralia-trapezis', 1, '38.1786173', '22.2331205', 'Paralia Trapezis', 'The Paralia Trapezis is the name of the village and the name of the beach located in the region Dytiki Ellada. If you like pebbles on the beach as well in the water and if you like to start swimming immediately after entering the water you are on the right place. You can park your vehicle by the road which is directly beach. Here you have Some beach infrastructure along the whole stretch of the beach. If you like some natural shadow you have many trees here available to protect you from the Sun otherwise you can rent some beach equipment around the beach bar. A restaurant is also available here, some apartments are as well directly on the beach, but more are in the background up in the hills.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 14, 5, 3, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-19 18:46:52', '2019-04-19 16:46:52', 11, 'paralia-trapezis-paralia-trapezis_5', 1),
(3616, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Elaionas', 'elaionas', 1, '38.2003049', '22.1792868', 'Paralia elaiona', 'The beach Paralia elaiona it\'s a true family beach. You have lots of space here to find your spot either on the beach or under the trees. The trees are arranged how along the whole stretch of the beach. But if you don\'t find any natural shadow you can still rent some sunshades by the beach bars. The beaches is around one kilometer long and can be up to 25 meters wide. The surface you are going to find here are Pebbles on some places even grass. The water falls quiet fast, which means the point of swim starts at around 3 meters. Here are many sport fields available, in the summertime also maybe children playgrounds. Restaurants in beach bars are as well here and if you would like to stay here for the holidays you have apartments and hotels to stay in. Parking is very convenient Care and can be done almost directly on the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 6, 5, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-20 10:54:37', '2019-04-20 08:54:37', 11, 'elaionas-paralia-elaiona_5', 1),
(3617, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Nikolaiika', 'nikolaiika', 1, '38.2204002142', '22.147718668', 'Paralia rizomylos', 'Pebbles, pebbles, pebbles. Some are small, some are tiny, some large. But altogether they are white and are located on the beach Paralia rizomylos. The region this beach is located is called Dytiki Ellada, still part of the peninsula peloponnese. You should drive to the Village Nikolaiika to get to this one kilometer beach, which is on some parts up to 40 meters wide. Leaving your vehicle on this beach is not a problem since you can park your vehicle by the road. You have some beach infrastructure here but it\'s mostly located around the beach bars. The slope on this beach is not as steep as on other beaches, but still you can expect to start swimming after 5 meters of entering the water. If you would like to enjoy some Greek cuisine here are many options as well as there are many options to stay here for longer in the apartments which are a little bit more in the background.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 16, 8, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-20 10:54:45', '2019-04-20 08:54:45', 11, 'nikolaiika-paralia-rizomylos_5', 1),
(3618, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Aigio', 'aigio', 1, '38.26244783', '22.10334746', 'Paralia Alyki', 'Aigio is a town located in the region Dytiki Ellada on the peninsula peloponnese. You have a very beautiful white Pebbles Beach just next to the town. It\'s approximately one kilometer long and up to 20 meters wide. Some beach infrastructure is available here, More of it around restaurants in beach bars. The slope is very steep and swimming starts already after 3 meters. To protect you from the Sun you have some trees here or you can rent the sun shades by the Beachbars. You can park your vehicle on a small a place or either by the road. Both of them are directly at the beach. Accommodation is available here but more of it is in the town itself. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 1, 1, 16, 5, 3, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-20 12:13:06', '2019-04-20 10:13:06', 11, 'aigio-paralia-alyki_5', 1),
(3619, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Fasouleika', 'fasouleika', 1, '38.2784700394', '22.0507514477', 'Paralia Akoli', 'The beach Paralia Akoli is another beautiful pebbles Beach in the Corinth Bay. From here you have an amazing view on the mountains of the Bay. The beach is located on the peninsula peloponnese in the region Dytiki Ellada, or Western Greece. You need to go to the Village Fasouleika to enjoy this View. Parking here is very easy and can be done directly on the Beach. You have some beach infrastructure here, but not on the whole stretch of the beach, but only around the Beachbars. The water here is very deep and falls quite Sharp, which means you can start swimming immediately. Some natural Shadow is also available here, and if you don\'t find any you can rent some sunshades and deckchairs at the beachbars. Not only are beach bars at your disposal but also some restaurants, and for accommodation you will find some apartments in the vicinity.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 3, 5, 2, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-20 13:51:35', '2019-04-20 11:51:35', 11, 'fasouleika-paralia-akoli_5', 1),
(3620, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Rίο', 'rio', 1, '38.2991349', '21.7721525', 'Paralia Rίο', 'How about a beach right next to the Greece most famous bridge, Rio- Antirion bridge? Maybe? If you would like to have this experience and have a day and night special bridge view you need to visit the region Dytiki Ellada and head to the town Rio. On the beach itself you have a large parking place, which can hold also motorhomes and sparking is done directly on the beach. The Beach is predominantly made of all kind of pebble sizes and some brown sand. The water entry on some places it\'s not comfortable, because you need to walk over large stones, but on some it is. Beach infrastructure here is only basic. Beach Bar and Restaurant are here but only inside a hotel which is directly on the beach. For accommodation you have many options, besides the regularar apartments you also have a hotel right on the beach itself.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 1, 1, 14, 10, 5, 13, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-20 15:10:21', '2019-04-20 13:10:21', 11, 'rio-paralia-rio_5', 1),
(3621, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Patras', 'patras', 1, '38.2818764448', '21.7501080036', 'Paralia Agyia', 'This beach is one of the official beaches of the city patras . it is situated on the northern part of the city with the nice view on the bridge Rio. Here you can find nice Pebble Beach about 700 meters long and approximately 50 meters wide. Various Beach infrastructure is available, there is also a restaurant and some beach bars. near the beach is a park where you can find some shade. On the beach is also mediterranean vegetation which can offer you also some shade. Near the beach you can find apartments or other kind of accommodation. The beach is reachable with a vehicle of all kinds. There are plenty park places directly near the beach and along the beach. Enjoy all possibilities of the beach such as swimming sunbathing and also windsurfing in case the wind conditions are appropriate. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 15, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-21 14:48:43', '2019-04-21 12:48:43', 11, 'patras-paralia-agyia_5', 1),
(3622, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Paralia Kato Achaias', 'paralia-kato-achaias', 1, '38.3812181', '21.5477617', 'Paralia Kato Achaias', 'Most of the beaches in the region Dytiki Ellada are made of pebbles, but these Beach which is located in Paralia Kato Achaias is different and it\'s predominantly made of sand. To reach it it\'s very easy. You can park your vehicle by the road and in 10 meters you are on the beach. The total length of the beach it\'s a few kilometers and on the widest part it\'s measures around 100 meters. You have some beach infrastructure here to make your life easier. Natural shadow and grass is also on the beach. The water entry is nice and comfortable and swimming starts at around 10 meters. A beach bar is also here. Accommodation is a little bit far away and mostly in the form of apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 11, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-21 14:48:46', '2019-04-21 12:48:46', 11, 'paralia-kato-achaias-paralia-kato-achaias_5', 1),
(3623, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Kalogria', 'kalogria', 1, '38.1566053', '21.3678525', 'Paralia Kalogriás', 'The village Kalogria can be very proud on the sandy beach it can offer to its guest or tourists. It is located in the region Dytiki Ellada on the Peninsula Peleponez. The beach is easy to reach by a quality paved road which leads trough a pine forest between the village and the beach itself. The beaches is a few kilometers long and up to 50 meters wide. You can park your vehicle on the large parking space right in front of the beach.You have some beach infrastructure here. The sea is here quite flat and the point of swim starts at around 30 meters, which makes it ideal for small children to safely play in the water. A beach bar where you can rent some beach equipment is presents here and for accommodation in the form of apartments and hotels you need to go to the village before the pine forest.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 1, 17, 9, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-21 14:48:50', '2019-04-21 12:48:50', 11, 'kalogria-paralia-kalogrias_5', 1),
(3624, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Loutra imenis', 'loutra-imenis', 1, '38.0935692787', '21.3402074575', 'Paralia Kounoupelaki', 'When visiting this Beach you will certainly remember it for your lifetime. It\'s a very romantic and beautiful beach. What it makes it so special is a small rocky horn in the middle of the very long sandy beach. In Greece this beach is located on the peninsula Peleponez in the region Dytiki Ellada near the village Loutra imenis. It\'s easy to reach by any kind of vehicle even motorhome, and you can park either directly on the beach or by the road. Because of the flat water these beach is also suitable for families with small children. The point of swim starts at around 30 meters. The beach is many kilometers long and up to 15 meters wide. You have a beach bar here and some basic Beach infrastructure otherwise you\'re in a complete nature environment. Here is no accommodation around, only pine forest. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 12, 3, 1, 17, 4, 2, 7, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/hiDREPQYXyE', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/35d3524d59/loutra/\" data-label_1=\"LOUTRA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >LOUTRA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15625739497497.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 7112, 5, '2019-04-21 14:49:06', '2019-04-21 12:49:06', 1, 'loutra-imenis-paralia-kounoupelaki_5', 1),
(3625, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Kyllini', 'kyllini', 1, '37.9371247', '21.1447916', 'Paralia Kyllini', 'The Small Town Kyllini is your Ferry Center for the islands of zakynthos and kefalonia. But it\'s not Only that it also can be your holiday destination if you like the sandy beach just next to the port. The region here is called Dytiki Ellada and it\'s a part of the peninsula peloponnese. The beach is 400 meters long and up to 75 meters wide. It\'s a very flat Beach, the same goes also for the see where the point of swim is far away out in the sea, which makes it ideal for small children to play in. Parking is done next to the beach by the road. You have some beach infrastructure here and many restaurants and other types of catering in the surrounding. Some accommodation is also available directly on the beach like apartments and a hotel.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 13, 10, 2, 10, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-21 15:23:21', '2019-04-21 13:23:21', 11, 'kyllini-paralia-kyllini_5', 1),
(3626, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Kalamia', 'kalamia', 1, '37.8830046', '21.1140371', 'Paralia Kalamia', 'This sandy beach is a few kilometers long and up to 30 meters wide. It\'s suitable for families with small children, especially because of the flat seebad which is very shallow. The point of swim starts at around 40 meters, so your child can safely play in the shallow water. To reach this beach head for the peninsula peloponnese and then to the region \nDytiki Ellada. Near the village Kalamia you will find a verylarge parking place where you can park directly at the beach. A beach bar is as well on the beach and some basic Beach infrastructure. You have many options to stay here for longer. In the vicinity you have Apartments, a hotel Resort and a campsite.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 2, 2, 17, 7, 2, 8, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-21 16:34:10', '2019-04-21 14:34:10', 11, 'kalamia-paralia-kalamia_5', 1),
(3627, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Thínes', 'thines', 1, '37.8202468157', '21.1990964413', 'Paralia Thines', 'How about an almost endless sandy Beach on the peninsula peloponnese? Even that is possible when you visit the region Dytiki Ellada. The nearest Village the beach is located is called Thínes. It\'s easy to get to the beach with a vehicle where a large parking place directly on the beach awaits you. About 100 Vehicles can park here. The beach is awarded with the blue flag award, which means you have quite a high standard of services. Wideness of the beach is around 30 meters and the point of swim starts already at 5 meters. You have and a beach Bar and a restaurant here. Accommodation is not available on the beach directly, but a few kilometers away around the towns and villages.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 3, 2, 17, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-22 09:26:26', '2019-04-22 07:26:26', 11, 'thines-paralia-thines_5', 1),
(3628, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Kourouta', 'kourouta', 1, '37.77114441', '21.29193963', 'Paralia Kourouta', 'The beach Paralia Kourouta is one of a very long sandy beaches so typical for the peninsula peloponnese. You can find it in the region Dytiki Ellada near the Village Kourouta. Because the parking is located directly on the beach its very easy to access. It is up to 25 meters wide and several kilometers long. Your answer is very nice and swimming starts almost right away. Some beach infrastructure is also located here, as well as children playgrounds. You don\'t need to worry about food or drinks, because you will find many beach bars and restaurants here. Accommodation is available in the form off apartments and Studios some directly on the beach some a little bit more in the background.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 1, 2, 17, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-22 13:43:08', '2019-04-22 11:43:08', 11, 'kourouta-paralia-kourouta_5', 1),
(3629, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Patronikoleika', 'patronikoleika', 1, '37.7078944445', '21.3189482689', 'Paralia Patronikoleika', 'If you are the one who seeks a lot of beach infrastructure on the highest level with a very long Sandy beach right in front of your Resort you are on the right place. On the beach itself there is some infrastructure But more is in the Resort. The beach is located on the greek peninsula peloponnese, in the region Dytiki Ellada in the village Patronikoleika. If you\'re going to stay in the resort you can park your vehicle there, otherwise there is a large parking place just beside the resort. The beach is few kilometers long and up to 75 meters wide. On some places it is quite steep on some more normal. The water entry it\'s very nice and on some places the seabed is very flat, which is ideal for small children, on some the depth increases more rapidly. The point of swim is between 20 and 40 meters. All the necessary restaurants and beach bars are on the beach or in the resort and the accommodation is either in the resort or in the neighboring Apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 2, 2, 17, 10, 3, 8, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-22 13:43:11', '2019-04-22 11:43:11', 11, 'patronikoleika-paralia-patronikoleika_5', 1),
(3630, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Skafidia', 'skafidia', 1, '37.6925468445', '21.3175320625', 'Paralia Leventochori', 'A true Adventurer Beach awaits you on the west side off the peninsula peloponnese. It has very little beach infrastructure, only the parking and a shower, but on the other hand it will reward you with an amazing beach experience. The combination of sand and rocks the shallow crystal clear water creates a special beach atmosphere. To find it you need to go to the region Dytiki Ellada and drive towards the village Skafidia. Parking can be done directly on the beach, but it\'s a dirt park Place, which is not flat and has a little inclination. The last part of the road is also quite steep so drive down only in rain free conditions. The beach is 400 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. You don\'t have any restaurants or beach bars here and for accommodation there is a hotel Resort nearby.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 6, 2, 2, 13, 5, 2, 17, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-22 13:43:24', '2019-04-22 11:43:24', 11, 'skafidia-paralia-leventochori_5', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach` (`id`, `waterbody_id`, `continent_code`, `country_code`, `country_code_nice_url`, `region`, `region_nice_url`, `region_full_name_nice_url`, `city`, `city_nice_url`, `location_id`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `name`, `description`, `beach_type_id`, `location_pay_id`, `price_per_day`, `currency`, `area_description_id`, `accessibility_id`, `parking`, `payable_parking`, `road_to_parking_type_id`, `parking_capacity_id`, `parking_beach_distance_id`, `parking_beach_height_id`, `location_length_id`, `bay_length_id`, `beach_inclination_id`, `swimming_depth_of_one_m`, `occupancy_rate_id`, `tourist_facilities_id`, `video_url`, `webcam`, `path_to_beach_map_url`, `beach_weather`, `water_temperature`, `island_name`, `island_name_nice_url`, `river_name`, `river_name_nice_url`, `lake_name`, `lake_name_nice_url`, `boat_only`, `beach_views`, `user_id`, `datetime`, `datetime_ut`, `status_id`, `folder_name`, `mobile_upload`) VALUES
(3631, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Klidi', 'klidi', 1, '37.5312012434', '21.5753728151', 'Paralia Kato Samiko', 'This beach which is located almost out in nowhere is a never-ending sendy beach which can be up to 50 meters wide. The Greek peninsula peloponnese has many similar beaches but here you almost don\'t see the beginning and the ending. To find this beach you need to go to the region Dytiki Ellada and head for the village Klidi. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle, even motor homes are welcome here. You can park directly at the beach. Some basic Beach infrastructure is available here, otherwise all around this place there\'s nothing going on. A Beach Bar is all also here but no accommodation for many many kilometers. Besides sand you will also find grass here and some trees to protect you from the Sun. Water entry is very nice and the point of swim starts at around 30 meters.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 17, 9, 2, 7, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-22 14:42:11', '2019-04-22 12:42:11', 11, 'klidi-paralia-kato-samiko_5', 1),
(3632, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Ag. Nikolaos', 'ag-nikolaos', 1, '37.4779272079', '21.6225796938', 'Paralia Zacharos', 'The Village Ag. Nikolaos is one of many entry points to go on an almost 50 kilometers Long sandy Beach. On this place the beach is about 50 meters wide. It is located on the Greek peninsula peloponnese and on this part of the beach it goes by the name Paralia Zacharos. Parking can be done directly on the beach where you have a very large parking place available. You have some beach infrastructure available here, as well as some beach bars, where you can rent some beach equipment. The water falls here quite fast which means you can start swimming almost immediately. Accommodation is also available here in the form of apartments and Studios. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-22 15:17:03', '2019-04-22 13:17:03', 11, 'ag-nikolaos-paralia-zacharos_5', 1),
(3633, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Kakovatos', 'kakovatos', 1, '37.4562871456', '21.6381150484', 'Paralia kakobatou', 'The village of Kakovatos is one of many villages located along this 50 kilometers long Sandy Beach. This beach is a very unique place in whole greece and to take a memory with you you need to visit peloponnese peninsula in the region Dytiki Ellada. You can leave your vehicle on park Place which is directly by the beach. Up to 50 vehicles can park here. Some beach infrastructure is available here, more around the restaurant which is just left to the parking place. Near the restaurant you will also find a hotel and some apartments in the vicinity. To start swimming you need to go only 5 meters into the water.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 3, 1, 17, 9, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-22 16:19:38', '2019-04-22 14:19:38', 11, 'kakovatos-paralia-kakobatou_5', 1),
(3634, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Giannitsochori', 'giannitsochori', 1, '37.3922418', '21.6922616', 'Paralia Giannitsochori', 'On the beach Paralia Giannitsochori you have many options to choose on which surface you would like to put your Towell. The beach itself is made of sand, the background you also have grass and some trese to protect you from the Sun. The beach is located on the Greek peninsula peloponnese in the region Dytiki Ellada near the village Giannitsochori.  You can leave your vehicle on a very large parking place directly on the beach. The access the beach is easy. You have some basic beach infrastructure here, as well as beach Bar. Accommodation in the form of apartments is nearby. Nearby is also a campsite. The point of swim starts almost immediately and it\'s very comfortable.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 9, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-22 16:44:37', '2019-04-22 14:44:37', 11, 'giannitsochori-paralia-giannitsochori_5', 1),
(3635, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Kalo Nero', 'kalo-nero', 1, '37.29722313', '21.69457754', 'Paralia Kalo Nero', 'On the greek peninsula peloponnese you have two regions. In the south there is the region Peloponnisos. When coming from the region Dytiki Ellada on the west side down to the region Peloponnisos the beach  become different. Besides the sand you also have a lot of small and large Pebbles mixed into the surface of the beach. To find such a beach you need to go to the Village Kalo Nero. If you are traveling in Greece with your motorhome the parking on this beach is very popular for such a vehicle. The beach itself is a few kilometers long and up to 30 meters wide. The point of swim because of the deep water starts almost immediately, turn on some places it\'s not that\'s nice because you need to go over some large stones. Around the parking place you also have a lot of trees and if you don\'t find your place here you can rent some sunshades by the beach bars. Restaurants are also available here, for accommodation you have a few hotels and some apartments at your disposal.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-22 17:59:20', '2019-04-22 15:59:20', 11, 'kalo-nero-paralia-kalo-nero_5', 1),
(3636, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Kyparissia', 'kyparissia', 1, '37.2542631626', '21.6606777906', 'Paralia Ae Lagoudes', 'The Paralia Ae Lagoudes east very interesting Beach. Why? Because you have so many options to choose on which type of Beach on one Beach you would like to lay down your towel. On some places you have sand, on some you have rocks, on some Pebbles and on some a mixture of everything. The beach is located on the peninsula  peloponnese in the region Peloponnisos in the town Kyparissia. Because the beach is located in a small town you also have some beach infrastructure here. Altogether the beaches around 400 meters long and on some places up to 75 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. Some Beachbars end many restaurants are available here. And for accommodation you have Apartments, studious and hotels at Your Service.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 2, 13, 10, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-23 09:36:42', '2019-04-23 07:36:42', 11, 'kyparissia-paralia-ae-lagoudes_5', 1),
(3637, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Stomio', 'stomio', 1, '37.18386114', '21.57553651', 'Paralia Stomio', 'In this part of the Peninsula peloponnese it\'s quite difficult to find a beach. The coastline here is mostly made of rocks so it\'s really a miracle that a beach exist here. This Greek region is called Peloponnisos and the closest Village goes by the name Stomio. The beach is suitable for adventurous type of people, not so much for families, since you have very little beach infrastructure. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle where you can park directly at the beach on a paved parking place. You just need to take the steps to step on the beach. The surface here is a mixture of pebbles and big stones and some rocks on the sites. The water heater gets deep very fast so you can start swimming immediately. In the summertime a beach bar possibly exist here and you have some apartments in the surrounding area for your accommodation.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 2, 2, 8, 9, 3, 2, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-23 10:16:42', '2019-04-23 08:16:42', 11, 'stomio-paralia-stomio_5', 1),
(3638, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Ag. Kiriaki', 'ag-kiriaki', 1, '37.1192908', '21.5761109', 'Paralia Agías Kyriakís', 'On the Greek peninsula peloponnese in the region  Peloponnisos there is a village called Ag. Kiriaki. Here they have a very unique beach which is a combination of a small Harbor and a Sandy Beach. All around the coastline it\'s very rocky except for this small Beach. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle where you can park your vehicle directly on the beach. The predominantly material on the beach is sand you have a lot of concrete on the piers which surround the whole Beach. A lot of Beach infrastructure is available here even some children playgrounds. The water entry is very nice and you can choose how to start your swimming. Either you can go into the water on the beach or you can jump from the pier. A restaurant is also available here and some apartments in the vicinity if you would like to stay here for longer.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 8, 8, 5, 14, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-23 10:53:01', '2019-04-23 08:53:01', 11, 'ag-kiriaki-paralia-agias-kyriakis_5', 1),
(3639, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Lagouvardos', 'lagouvardos', 1, '37.08920165', '21.58184985', 'Paralia Lagkouvardos', 'These 400 meters long and up to 75 meters wide sandy Beach is located on the Greek peninsula peloponnese in the region Peloponnisos near the village Lagouvardos. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle. To park there you have around 20 places. The terain is not flat it has a small inclination and is made of dirt and rocks. You have very little beach infrastructure on the beach. The slope of the beach is normal on some places a little steep. The water entry is nice and comfortable and you can start swimming immediately. In the summertime a beach bar maybe here installed. In the surrounding of the beach there are some apartments and a hotel available.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 4, 1, 1, 14, 10, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-23 14:06:02', '2019-04-23 12:06:02', 11, 'lagouvardos-paralia-lagkouvardos_5', 1),
(3640, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Vromoneri', 'vromoneri', 1, '37.0177620649', '21.6209167242', 'Paralia Vromoneri', 'The whole area on the southwest side of the greek peninsula peloponnese is very unique. The same goes for the beach Vromoneri which is located in the region Peloponnisos in the village Vromoneri. The beach is made of sand, pebbles and rocks. It has a special shape and it\'s hidden in a small Bay and so protected from the big waves. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle. You can either Park on a parking place next to the road or you can drive down directly to the beach and park there. The whole area is around 300 meters long and up to 15 meters wide. The point of swim is different on some places but after 20 meters you can certainly swim away. You have also a beach bar there for drinks or some small snack, but as well you can rent some sunshades and deckchairs there. Apartments and rooms are also available around the beach if you would like to stay here for longer.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 4, 3, 3, 12, 4, 2, 17, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-23 14:06:06', '2019-04-23 12:06:06', 11, 'vromoneri-paralia-vromoneri_5', 1),
(3641, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Rikia', 'rikia', 1, '37.00892153', '21.6360038', 'Paralia mati', 'On the southwest part of the Greek peninsula peloponnese the coast is mostly made of rocks, but not on this part. Here you have a few kilometers long Sandy Beach which is an exception for this region. The region here is called Peloponnisos and the closest Village is Rikia. This place is also known for organizing some party events which makes it ideal for youth to have a great time here. You can get here by a vehicle which you can park directly on the beach and either go to the beach bar and have some fun or just go directly to the beach. On the widest part the beach is 30 meters wide. Around the beach bar there is some beach infrastructure, but more is inside the party place. In Stormy Weather this location could be also a perfect spot for Surfers since the waves get here really big. In normal conditions you can also swim here and the point of swim start almost immediately. If you would like to spend here your holidays you have some apartments in the surrounding.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 2, 17, 7, 2, 4, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-23 14:17:01', '2019-04-23 12:17:01', 11, 'rikia-paralia-mati_5', 1),
(3642, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Paleokastro', 'paleokastro', 1, '36.9654321671', '21.6623461246', 'Paralia Voidokilia', 'This certainly must be one of the most unique beaches in whole Greece. The whole surrounding, the swamp, the way the beach is formed and shaped, the crystal clear water Lagoon and the mountains and rocks surrounding is one of a kind in the whole world. To have this experience by yourself the Greek peninsula peloponnese and head for the region Peloponnisos to the Village Paleokastro. The whole site is easy to reach by a vehicle and you can leave your transportation 100 meters away from the beach on a dirt park Place. The beach is made of sand is 750 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The slope is on some places quite steep on some normal. The whole Bay is quite shallow which means that the point of swim starts at around 50 meters. You don\'t have any Beach infrastructure here, no accommodation and no beach bars or restaurants, makes the beach more suitable for the ones seeking quiet and peace beach holidays.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 4, 1, 15, 5, 3, 9, 1, 0, 'https://youtu.be/oPOWcCEZ_98', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/35d3725d04/palaiokastro/\" data-label_1=\"PALEOKASTRO\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >PALEOKASTRO WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15625803052920.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 9076, 5, '2019-04-24 15:09:02', '2019-04-24 13:09:02', 1, 'paleokastro-paralia-voidokilia_5', 1),
(3643, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Gialova', 'gialova', 1, '36.9501888', '21.7021408', 'Paralia Gialova', 'The beach Paralia Gialova it\'s a very nice little village sandy beach located in the Southwest part of the Greek peninsula peloponnese. This part belongs to the region Peloponnisos. The beach itself is a few kilometers long and up to 25 meters wide and has a very long pier in the middle which divides the beach. You have a lot of beach infrastructure in the village where the beach is located. Here you will find types of restaurants, hotels, apartments and in the vicinity also a campsite. On one part of the beach you even have a little Park with some trees to protect you from the Sun. The water entry on most part of the beach is very nice and swimming starts at around 20 to 25 meters. You can also start to swim if you jump from the pier.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 4, 1, 17, 6, 5, 16, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-24 17:52:24', '2019-04-24 15:52:24', 11, 'gialova-paralia-gialova_5', 1),
(3644, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Methoni', 'methoni', 1, '36.8181352', '21.7079354', 'Paralia methones', 'The small town Methoni is one of the most South points on the Greek peninsula peloponnese. It is located in the region Peloponnisos  can offer you a 400-meter long and up to 30 meters wide sandy Beach. What\'s unique about this beach is the flat surface outside the water and inside the water. This fact makes the beach more suitable for families with small children, since they can play safely in the shallow water. In the times of Stormy Weather the beach is more suitable for windsurfers and kyters. Children will also love this place because of the large children playground. The beach is easy to reach and you can leave your vehicle directly on the beach. The point of swim starts pretty late at around 50 meters. If you get hungry you have plenty of all types off restaurants available and for accommodation You have Apartments, hotels and even a campsite. This place is also interesting because of the ancient and medieval buildings like castles and walls.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 6, 2, 1, 13, 7, 1, 8, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-24 17:52:29', '2019-04-24 15:52:29', 11, 'methoni-paralia-methones_5', 1),
(3645, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Finiki', 'finiki', 1, '36.7994838953', '21.7482197285', 'Paralia Finiki', 'A nice sandy beach with a very large parking place awaits you in one of the most southern part of the Greek Peninsula . The region this beaches is located is called Peloponnisos, and the nearest Village goes by the name Finiki. It\'s a 750 meters Long Beach which is up to 20 meters wide. The water here is very shallow and swimming starts at around 40 to 50 meters. On the beach yourself there is very little beach infrastructure, except around the beach bar. The parking place here is very large, but it\'s made of dirt and can host several hundred vehicles. A restaurantst, together with the beach bar is also available here. And for a longer stay you have some apartments at your disposal.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 15, 5, 2, 7, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-24 17:52:33', '2019-04-24 15:52:33', 11, 'finiki-paralia-finiki_5', 1),
(3646, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Kamaria', 'kamaria', 1, '36.8013936281', '21.7832869291', 'Paralia Kamaria', 'If you\'re looking for a Sandy Beach which is more kilometers long and has a lot of campsites you are on the right place. It\'s located on the Greek peninsula peloponnese in the region Peloponnisos by the town Kamaria. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle and you can park directly on the beach. You have many options along the whole stretch of the beach to park. Access to the beach is easy, and you can choose if you would like to have no beach infrastructure or a lot of it, which is located more around the campsites. The water answer is very nice and swimming starts at around 20 meters. On the widest part the beach measures around 40 meters on the most narrow around 20. You have many Beach bars and restaurants on the beach directly or in the vicinity. For a Longer stay how many campsites, apartments and a hotel resort are available. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 6, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-24 18:39:11', '2019-04-24 16:39:11', 11, 'kamaria-paralia-kamaria_5', 1),
(3647, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Anatolikos Sinikismos', 'anatolikos-sinikismos', 1, '37.0228153467', '22.1327626705', 'Paralia Anatolikos Sinikismos', 'Near the Greek city of Kalamata there is a village called Anatolikos Sinikismos which is connected with the main city by a Very Long sandy beach. It is located in the region Peloponnisos which is part of the Greek peninsula peloponnese. The beach is more kilometers long and up to 20 meters wide. On the surface of the beach you have 2 materials which are exchanging their dominance, the one is sand the other one are Pebbles. The water and to here it\'s very nice and on the most places you need to go over Pebbles to reach the water. The point of swim starts almost immediately. Because this is a City Beach you also have lots of beach infrastructure here. Along the whole stretch there are many types of restaurants, coffee bars and beach bars available. And for accommodation you have many options, like Apartments, hotels, resorts and even a campsite. For parking your vehicle you have a large parking place just next to the beach which is located somewhere in the middle of the Long Beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 2, 2, 17, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-25 15:31:11', '2019-04-25 13:31:11', 11, 'anatolikos-sinikismos-paralia-anatolikos-sinikismos_5', 1),
(3648, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Peroulia', 'peroulia', 1, '36.8265366554', '21.9316023588', 'Paralia Peroúlia', 'This sandy Beach is located on a special place, but it\'s very hard to reach. From the main road you need to drive around two kilometers on a very curvy and Narrow road and when you get to the beach a small parking place, for around 15 cars awaits you. You can either leave your vehicle there or do private parking in the apartments. The beach itself is around 750 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The slope of the beach is quite normal and swimming starts immediately. Next to the parking place you have a beach bar and a restaurant and in the vicinity, more up the hills you have many apartments for your accommodation available. On the beach bar you can also rent some beach equipment , we\'re also the main Beach infrastructure is located, otherwise there is none.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 3, 1, 1, 15, 5, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-25 15:39:23', '2019-04-25 13:39:23', 11, 'peroulia-paralia-peroulia_5', 1),
(3649, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'peloponnisos', 'Ag. Konstantinos', 'ag-konstantinos', 1, '37.0130252838', '21.9942212105', 'Paralia Mpoykas Messinis', 'On the south part of the Greek peninsula peloponnese, near the town of Kalamata there is a village Ag. Konstantinos. The beach here is made of sand and has a total length of around 15 km. On the widest part it is up to 75 m wide. Here and there there is a river floating into the sea which cuts the beach into more parts. On some parts the beach is easy to reach by a vehicle and normally a large paved parking place awaits you. Most of the beach infrastructure is located around beach bars and hotel resorts, otherwise there is none. On some parts of the beach you even have sports fields and children playground like it was the case on the place we stayed. When going to the water the beach gets quite steep but the water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. Among beach bars, restaurants are as well available, and if you would like to stay here longer you have many options like Apartments, hotels, a campsite and many hotel resorts.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 17, 9, 3, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-25 17:01:04', '2019-04-25 15:01:04', 11, 'ag-konstantinos-paralia-mpoykas-messinis_5', 1),
(3650, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Nafpaktos', 'nafpaktos', 1, '38.3888039', '21.8235372', 'Paralia Nafpaktos', 'When crossing the Corinth Bay from the Greek peninsula peloponnese to the other side of the region Dytiki Ellada one of the very first long pebbles beaches is the beach Paralia Nafpaktos. It\'s a part of the small city Nafpaktos. The beach is more kilometers long and up to 25 meters wide and you can park your vehicle by the road directly on the beach. The main surface here are small Pebbles, but you also have a lot of trees and some grass. To get into the water you need to step on some stones and the point of swim starts ar around 5 meters. On the whole stretch of the beach you have a lot of beach infrastructure, but more is located around the center where you also have children playgrounds and sports fields directly on the beach. Many restaurants and beach bars are located on the whole stretch of the beach, and for your accommodation your have here apartments, rooms and hotels.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-27 11:08:21', '2019-04-27 09:08:21', 11, 'nafpaktos-paralia-nafpaktos_5', 1),
(3651, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Kato Vasiliki', 'kato-vasiliki', 1, '38.3503478765', '21.6245806217', 'Paralia Kato Vasiliki', 'And this part of the Greek region Dytiki Ellada you want find many beaches. Hear the mountains are very high and go directly into the sea so not many beaches have formed yet. But in the small village Kato Vasiliki you have a Pebbles beach which is 200 meters long and up to 15 meters wide and is suitable for families. Some trees and a grass surface is also located on the beach. The water entry is nice and swimming starts immediately. You can leave your vehicle either by the road or on a small parking place next to the beach. A lot of Beach Infrastructure is located on this beach, you also have some beach bars and restaurants and for your accommodation you have apartments and a hotel in the village.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 4, 1, 1, 10, 4, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-27 12:10:16', '2019-04-27 10:10:16', 11, 'kato-vasiliki-paralia-kato-vasiliki_5', 1),
(3652, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Kryoneri', 'kryoneri', 1, '38.34426436', '21.59469359', 'Paralia kryoneri', 'The Greek Coastline has many unique beaches. And the beach in the small village Kryoneri is no exception. What it makes it so special is the over 1,000 meters high mountain directly at the beach. It is Basically a huge Rock like the El Capitan in USA, it is located in the Greek region Dytiki Ellada. Another great characteristics is the very flat seabed which makes the beach perfect for small children to play safely in the water. On the beach itself the surface are small Pebbles and the beach is 250 meters long and around 10 meters wide. To protect you from the Sun can you rent some beach equipment directly on the beach. This beach is a blue flag beach which means you have also a lot of beach infrastructure. You can leave your car on a very long pier, from which you can also jump or try to catch some fish. Some beach bars and restaurants are available directly on the beach and for your accommodation you have apartments and the hotel available.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 11, 3, 2, 10, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-27 15:06:47', '2019-04-27 13:06:47', 11, 'kryoneri-paralia-kryoneri_5', 1),
(3653, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Tourlida', 'tourlida', 1, '38.3257359266', '21.4185386896', 'Paralia Tourlida', 'The town of missolonghi is famous it\'s lagoons, swamp and the salinas. A few kilometers outside the town you have the small village Tourlida which is famous for it\'s 400 meters long Sandy Beach. On this location you have also have the opportunity be amazed by the pictures houses on the water. On some parts the beach can be up to 50 meters wide and besides the sand you also have some grass under the trees to lay your  towel down. The water entry here is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. Some beach infrastructure is also available here as well as a restaurant and a beach bar. A beach equipment can be also rent here. Accommodation is available either in the town missolonghi and possibly also around the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 13, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/aeID4FkidBg', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d3321d42/tourlida/\" data-label_1=\"TOURLIDA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >TOURLIDA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15625825972193.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 7598, 5, '2019-04-27 15:17:44', '2019-04-27 13:17:44', 1, 'tourlida-paralia-tourlida_5', 1),
(3654, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Prokopanistos', 'prokopanistos', 1, '38.2901997', '21.2116575', 'Paralia louros', 'Far away from any civilization on the Brinks of a large swamp this sandy beach called Paralia louros is located.    The closest Village is Prokopanistos and belongs to the Greek region Dytiki Ellada. The beach is more kilometers long and up to 50 meters wide. It\'s suitable for families with small children, especially for those one would like to play in the shallow water. Along the whole beach you can find also many trees to protect you from the Sun, or you can rent some sunshades at the beachbars. You will also find some beach infrastructure here especially around the beachbars, from which there are many. You also have many options to park your vehicle here, either you do it on the central parking, or you Park between the beach line and the swamp line which stretches along the beach. With the beachbars also some restaurants are available. Accommodation is officially not available here, but some kilometers away.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 9, 2, 9, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-27 19:08:05', '2019-04-27 17:08:05', 11, 'prokopanistos-paralia-louros_5', 1),
(3655, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Mytikas', 'mytikas', 1, '38.6726842', '20.9534577', 'Paralia Mytikas', 'If you\'re a fan of Pebbles beaches and you are in the Greece region Dytiki Ellada in the small town Mytikas you will find a few kilometers long white Pebbles Beach. The beach is from 10 meters wide up to 30+ meters near the marina. You can leave your vehicle on many spots. Either you park by the road directly on the beach or you park on a large parking place, which is also directly by the beach, a little bit more close to the town center. The beach infrastructure is located predominantly around the marina but you will find also some around the beach bars, restaurants and the campsites. The water here falls quite fast which makes also the point of swim immediately when entering the water. You have many options to spend your holidays here, for example in apartments, hotels, campsites and an apartment complex.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 7, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-28 09:14:15', '2019-04-28 07:14:15', 11, 'mytikas-paralia-mytikas_5', 1),
(3656, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Pogonia', 'pogonia', 1, '38.7963977', '20.85914136', 'Paralia Potamáki', 'The sandy beach Paralia Potamáki it\'s a very special greek Beach for all the ones who love long beaches with shallow water. It is located in the Greek region Dytiki Ellada just opposite the famous Islands lefkada. The beach is easy to reach with a vehicle and you can park your car directly on the beach just a few meters away from the crystal clear water. The water entry here is very nice and comfortable and because of the shallow water the point of swim starts very late, at around 75 meters, which makes this place ideal for small children playing safely in the water. You have some beach infrastructure here but it\'s more located around the beach bars. If you are looking to stay here for longer you can find some accommodationin the form of apartments and a hotel. The beachbars here are serving drinks and some fast food, and you can also rent sunshade and a deckchair there.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 4, 2, 10, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/j3lqUtLoBmc', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d7920d84/pogonia/\" data-label_1=\"POGONIA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >POGONIA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15625882756079.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10387, 5, '2019-04-28 13:01:49', '2019-04-28 11:01:49', 1, 'pogonia-paralia-potamaki_5', 1),
(3657, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Varko', 'varko', 1, '38.7643200159', '20.7903331518', 'Paralia Vatheiavali', 'This beach belongs in the top five most beautiful beaches of Greece. At this place nature gave its best to create a perfect harmony between white Pebbles, trees and a crystal clear torquize colored water. But the Beauty has its price since it\'s quite heart to reach and has no beach infrastructure installed here. The road to the beach is very narrow and in a bad condition, with lots of holes and dirt on the track. Once you get here you have a dirt park with around 20 to 30 parking lots. The beach is around 500 meters long and 20 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 5 meters. You also have some trees here to give you cover from the Sun. On the beach there is no beach infrastructure, no Beach bars or restaurants and no accommodation. Some accommodation in the form of appartments is available in a bay next to the beach. We also need to mention that at the time we visited the beach, late April 2019 there were no beach bars or any other beach infrastructure installed on the beach, but this may change in the summertime and you might have a beach bar there and some beach infrastructure.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 4, 3, 14, 5, 2, 3, 1, 0, 'https://youtu.be/5CbnldsGyHo', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d7720d80/varko/\" data-label_1=\"VARKO\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >VARKO WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15625882756079.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8114, 5, '2019-04-28 13:01:54', '2019-04-28 11:01:54', 1, 'varko-paralia-vatheiavali_5', 1),
(3658, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Dytiki Ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'dytiki-ellada', 'Ag. Nikolaos', 'ag-nikolaos', 1, '38.8776862621', '20.7798564434', 'Paralia Ag. Nikolaos', 'If you are a fan of kitesurfing, on this Greek beach you are on the right place. The wind is blowing almost constantly and the flat water makes it just perfect for this kind of sport. To get to this place you need to visit the Greek region Dytiki Ellada and head to the Village Ag. Nikolaos. This location is easy to reach with a vehicle and on the end of the road right directly on the beach you can park. Here are not many parking places available, some are on the tharmac some directly on the sand. The beach is more kilometers long and up to 30 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim because of the flat water starts at around 30 meters. A beach bar is here, where also the main beach infrastructure is located. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but in the village a few kilometers away.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 2, 1, 17, 7, 1, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-28 16:28:53', '2019-04-28 14:28:53', 11, 'ag-nikolaos-paralia-ag-nikolaos_5', 1),
(3659, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Iónioi Nísoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'Lefkada', 'lefkada', 2, '38.8279017', '20.6721256', 'Paralia ae giannes', 'One of the most famous greek beaches for kitesurfing is located on the island Lefkada. The Greek Island Lefkada is accessible via a Bridge or by a ferry. In the city lefkada you have a very large Lagoon and a more kilometers long Sandy Beach. The beach is on some parts up to 40 meters wide. The most of the beach is a protected area so you won\'t find any Beach infrastructure there. Most of it is located around the beach bars and restaurants. You can park your vehicle by the road, cross the road and you are on the beach. Most of the time the wind is blowing pretty strong which makes it ideal for kitesurfing. The water entry is on the most places very nice, on some you need to go over some rocks and the point of swim starts at around 20 meters. Accommodation is available around the restaurants in beach bars as well as in the city itself but on the most part there is no accommodation.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 3, 1, 17, 8, 2, 6, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lefkada', 'lefkada', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-28 16:28:57', '2019-04-28 14:28:57', 11, 'lefkada-paralia-ae-giannes_5', 1),
(3660, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Iónioi Nísoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'Kalavros', 'kalavros', 2, '38.7971487', '20.6234102', 'Paralia Pefkoulia ', 'The Greek Island lefkada is famous for its beautiful beaches, and the beach Paralia Pefkoulia is one amongst them. It is located in the Greek region Iónioi Nísoi near the village Kalavros. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle, which you can park on two places. One is located directly at the beach and one is up by the road. Both parking place can hold between 70 to 100 vehicles. The beach itself is a few kilometers long and on some places up to 40 meters wide. It is predominantly made of sand and of some pebbles and rocks. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. At the beach you have a beach bar which is also a restaurant and can service you with a lot of beach infrastructure, they even have a swimming pool. On the same spot you can also rent some rooms if you would like to stay here for longer.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 1, 2, 17, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lefkada', 'lefkada', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-28 19:16:41', '2019-04-28 17:16:41', 11, 'kalavros-paralia-pefkoulia_5', 1),
(3661, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Iónioi Nísoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'Agios Nikitas', 'agios-nikitas', 2, '38.77621876', '20.59948889', 'Paralia Kathisma', 'On the Greek island lefkada no matter which beach you visit you certainly will be amazed by it\'s Beauty. The same goes for Paralia Kathisma which is located near the small town Agios Nikitas. The location where the beach is located belongs to the region of Ionian Island or in Greece Iónioi Nísoi. The beach is 1 kilometer long and up to 50 meters wide. The main surface are Pebbles mixed with a little of sand. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts immediately. You can park your vehicle very easy here, either on a large parking place or directly by the road at the beach, like most motorhomes do. The beach infrastructure is located along the whole stretch of the beach and you have here many beach bars and restaurants. You can also have your holidays here because many apartments and a hotel are located directly on the beach. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 2, 14, 9, 2, 2, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/7UAh7Yl0xps', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d7920d61/agios-nikitas/\" data-label_1=\"AGIOS NIKITAS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >AGIOS NIKITAS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15626643226399.png', 'Lefkada', 'lefkada', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 17301, 5, '2019-04-29 09:56:34', '2019-04-29 07:56:34', 1, 'agios-nikitas-paralia-kathisma_5', 1),
(3662, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Iónioi Nísoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'Agios Nikitas', 'agios-nikitas', 2, '38.78727858', '20.6131253', 'Paralia Agios Nikitas', 'This Village and the beach underneath it is all about romantic. The Architecture of the buildings and the streets is ful of collors, very inviting restaurants and coffee bars. To have this experience by yourself you needs to visit the Greek Island lefkada which is located in the ionian islands or in greek language Agios Nikitas. This beautiful village is called Agios Nikitas. The village is very easy accessible with a vehicle of any kind. Parking is done by the road up in the village, some 400 meters away and with a height difference between the parking and the beach of around 40 meters. The beach itself is 100 meters long and up to 15 meters wide. The water here is crystal clear and it gets deep very quickly which means you can start swimming immediately. The main surface are pebbles but some rocks are as well on the beach. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here except from some sports fields for children playgrounds. In the village and by the beach you have a lot of coffeebars and restaurants and as well many types of accommodation like apartments and hotels.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 6, 9, 8, 4, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lefkada', 'lefkada', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-29 09:56:40', '2019-04-29 07:56:40', 11, 'agios-nikitas-paralia-agios-nikitas_5', 1),
(3663, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Iónioi Nísoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'Ag. Nikolaos Niras', 'ag-nikolaos-niras', 2, '38.601764', '20.550362', 'Paralia Porto Katsiki', 'It\'s very hard to find words to describe this beauty the Greek Island lefkada has produced over millions of years. We are talking about the beach, but not any kind of Beach, probably top 3 beaches in whole Greece and in the top 10 of the whole world. To reach this beauty Beach you need to go to the region of ionian islands and visit the island lefkada. The closest Village is called Ag. Nikolaos Niras and the beach itself has the famous name of porto katsiki. The beach is located on a remote place in the middle of nowhere between high heels. The road to the beach is paved but it is very steep and on some places very narrow. Because the beach is very famous and very crowded in the summertime you also have parking places available. From the parking place to the beach you need to take a  200 meter long path which is 30 meters in height difference from the beach itself. The beach because of the steep pathway and no beach infrastructure is more suitable for adventurer type of visitors. The main surface on the beach are whites Pebbles and some rocks. The water here has a special color, which is unique in the whole world, what makes this place even more attractive. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts immediately. On the beach itself you have zero Beach infrastructure, but more is located around the parking place, where you we\'ll find also some fast food restaurants, shops and bars. Accommodation in this remote place it\'s not available.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 5, 8, 13, 7, 2, 2, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/CfKzFF_oCZk', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/38d5920d56/agios-nikolaos-niras/\" data-label_1=\"AG. NIKOLAOS NIRAS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >AG. NIKOLAOS NIRAS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15626216493482.png', 'Lefkada', 'lefkada', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 15080, 5, '2019-04-29 13:37:00', '2019-04-29 11:37:00', 1, 'ag-nikolaos-niras-paralia-porto-katsiki_5', 1),
(3664, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Iónioi Nísoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'Vasiliki', 'vasiliki', 2, '38.62946536', '20.60512498', 'Paralia Vasilikís', 'On the south Part of the Greek Island lefkada you have a small Village called Vasiliki. The island is a part of the Greek region ionian Islands or in Greek Iónioi Nísoi. This place is easy to reach with a vehicle of any kind. You can park your vehicle by the road directly at the beach or at the private apartments and hotels. The beach itself is 1 kilometer long and up to 25 meters wide. The main surface are pebbles of different sizes and shapes. The water gets here deep very fast which makes the point of swim at 5 meters. The slope of the beach is on some places quite steep but the water entry is very nice. Many Beach infrastructure is available here but it\'s more around the Beachbars. Restaurants of different types are as well available and so is the accommodation mainly in the form of apartments, hotels and a campsite.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 16, 6, 3, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lefkada', 'lefkada', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-29 14:35:44', '2019-04-29 12:35:44', 11, 'vasiliki-paralia-vasilikis_5', 1),
(3665, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Iónioi Nísoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'Vasiliki', 'vasiliki', 2, '38.4419794', '20.5571134', 'Paralia Agiofili ', 'To be able to see this beauty on the Greek Island lefkada you need to have a very good car, you need to be brave and you need a lot of luck. The beach is called Paralia Agiofili and belongs to the village Vasiliki in the region of the ionion Islands. With its beauty it belongs certainly to one of the most beautiful beaches in Greek. First of all the road to the beach is very narrow, made of dirt and rocks and on some places unstable. It\'s possible to go to the beach with regular car but and off-road vehicle is much more suitable. At the end of the road there is a private paved parking place, where you need to purchase a parking ticket. Take Into consideration that you need to walk around 100 meters on a very steep path with steps which has a height a difference of 30 meters between the parking and the beach. The beach is predominantly made of white small pebbles and some rocks, has a crystal Clear water, is 100 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The water here is very deep and you can swim away instantly. On the beach you have some sunshades and deckchairs to rent, otherwise there\'s nothing on the beach. A toilet and a small bar is by the parking place. Accommodation is not available here but in the village Vasiliki.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 2, 2, NULL, 4, 6, 4, 7, 8, 5, 3, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lefkada', 'lefkada', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-29 16:44:29', '2019-04-29 14:44:29', 11, 'vasiliki-paralia-agiofili_5', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach` (`id`, `waterbody_id`, `continent_code`, `country_code`, `country_code_nice_url`, `region`, `region_nice_url`, `region_full_name_nice_url`, `city`, `city_nice_url`, `location_id`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `name`, `description`, `beach_type_id`, `location_pay_id`, `price_per_day`, `currency`, `area_description_id`, `accessibility_id`, `parking`, `payable_parking`, `road_to_parking_type_id`, `parking_capacity_id`, `parking_beach_distance_id`, `parking_beach_height_id`, `location_length_id`, `bay_length_id`, `beach_inclination_id`, `swimming_depth_of_one_m`, `occupancy_rate_id`, `tourist_facilities_id`, `video_url`, `webcam`, `path_to_beach_map_url`, `beach_weather`, `water_temperature`, `island_name`, `island_name_nice_url`, `river_name`, `river_name_nice_url`, `lake_name`, `lake_name_nice_url`, `boat_only`, `beach_views`, `user_id`, `datetime`, `datetime_ut`, `status_id`, `folder_name`, `mobile_upload`) VALUES
(3666, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Iónioi Nísoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'ionioi-nisoi', 'Mikros Gialos', 'mikros-gialos', 1, '38.6401104', '20.6955178', 'Paralia Mikros Gialos', 'If you\'re in Greece and you are looking for a white pebbles Beach with crystal clear water, parking directly on the beach as well as restaurants and accommodation just a few steps away the the beach Paralia Mikros Gialos you are on the right spot. It is located on the Greek Island lefkada which is part of the region ionian Islands or like the Greeks say Iónioi Nísoi. When coming here with your vehicle you can leave it by the road and almost step directly on the beach. The beach is a mixture of small and large white pebbles. It\'s 200 meters long and around 30 meters wide. The water gets deep Very quickly which makes the point of swim at around 3 meters of entering the water. You have some beach infrastructure here, you can also rent some beach equipment and restaurants and bars as well as different types of accommodation are all nearby.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 10, 7, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-29 17:27:09', '2019-04-29 15:27:09', 11, 'mikros-gialos-paralia-mikros-gialos_5', 1),
(3667, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Nikopolis', 'nikopolis', 1, '39.02741712', '20.71452558', 'Paralia Mytika', 'This a few kilometers long Sandy Beach goes by the name Paralia Mytika. It is located in the Greek region Ipeiros near the town Nikopolis. The beach is easy to reach with the vehicle and the road where you can park ghost directly alongside the beach so you can access it immediately. You also have a three-line behind the road where are you can seek for natural shadow to protect you from the Sun. On The widest part the beach is around 40 meters wide, the inclination of the slope it\'s normal, the water answer very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. You also have some beach infrastructure here, but most of it is located around the Beach bars. Not much accommodation is available here around, only in the form of apartments and mainly as a campsite. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 3, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-30 09:17:18', '2019-04-30 07:17:18', 11, 'nikopolis-paralia-mytika_5', 1),
(3668, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Pidima Kiras', 'pidima-kiras', 1, '39.0882074833', '20.6606483459', 'Paralia Pidima Kiras', 'Between the town Mitikas and the village Pidima Kiras in the Greek region Ipeiros you have a very long, more kilometers, sandy beach, where are you have many options to access it. On this part it is called Paralia Pidima Kiras. It\'s easy to access the beach with your vehicle, you have a large parking place directly on the beach and you can also park at the beach bars. The beach is around 40 meters wide, the water entry is nice and swimming starts immediately. If you would like to have a lot of beach services you should Park closely to the beach bars, otherwise there is none beach infrastructure. Most of the beach bars also provide you with some food, at least fast food some are also a restaurants type. On this Part of the beach you also have many options to find an accommodation. Many hotels and Resort like hotels are available here, as well as Apartments. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 3, 1, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-30 09:33:10', '2019-04-30 07:33:10', 11, 'pidima-kiras-paralia-pidima-kiras_5', 1),
(3669, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Paralia', 'paralia', 1, '39.14384787', '20.57460656', 'Paralia Paralias', 'A very special Beach awaits you near the village of Paralia in the Greek region Ipeiros. The beach is a few kilometers long and on some places 50 meters wide. It is made of sand but you also have some rocks on the beach which makes it quite unique in the whole of Greece. You can access the beach with your vehicle almost directly on the beach itself where can park by the road. Because of the rocks on the beach as well under the sea on some places the water entry is not very comfortable and sometimes quite dangerous. But on some parts you don\'t have any rocks in the sea so you can enter very nice and almost start swimming immediately. Along the whole stretch of the beach you have many apartments, restaurants and beach bars, and this is also place where you get the most Beach services. Besides the apartments and rooms to let you also have a hotel near the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 1, 17, 9, 2, 17, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-30 10:58:13', '2019-04-30 08:58:13', 11, 'paralia-paralia-paralias_5', 1),
(3670, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Ligia', 'ligia', 1, '39.1572494', '20.5631075', 'Paralia lygias', 'The Village Ligia is very small but it has in its surrounding very unique beaches. The beaches are located in the Greek region Ipeiros. One of them it\'s called Paralia lygias. It\'s a few kilometers Long Beach which can be up to 30 meters wide. Very unique about the beach is the fact that the surface it\'s a mixture of small Pebbles and rocks. The inclination of the slope is pretty high and because of it the swimming, when entering the water, start almost immediately. You have to choose your water entry wisely, because on some spots you have many rocks to go over before start swimming, but on some you have a very nice entry and no rocks. Parking your vehicle here is easy and can be done directly on the beach beside the road. Some restaurants and beach bars are available on the beach and this is also the point where you have the most Beach infrastructure. If you would like to stay here for longer you can rent some apartments or rooms. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 1, 17, 7, 3, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-30 11:41:21', '2019-04-30 09:41:21', 11, 'ligia-paralia-lygias_5', 1),
(3671, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Paralia', 'paralia', 1, '39.1743872', '20.5497925', 'Paralia brachos', 'If you are the one who adores a very long Sandy Beach with Beach services all around you need to visit the Paralia brachos located in the Greek region Ipeiros. It\'s very easy to reach with the vehicle but parking is only possible by the road or on some private parking lots. Because the road goes alongside the beach you access the beach almost from your vehicle. The beach is a few kilometers long and on some places up to 50 meters wide. The inclination of the slope is normal on some places a little bit steep. The water entry is very nice and you can already swim away after 5 meters. Beach bars, restaurants, fast food and other types of catering are available here, and so are the beach services which are available along the whole stretch of the beach. Renting a deck chair and a sun shade here is no problem. If you would like to spent your holidays here you can do it in many kinds of accommodation types, predominantly apartments, rooms and hotels.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-30 13:21:53', '2019-04-30 11:21:53', 11, 'paralia-paralia-brachos_5', 1),
(3672, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Ammoudia', 'ammoudia', 1, '39.2203012', '20.5168905', 'Paralia kerentza', 'This beach is not only beautiful it is one of the most beautiful in Greece. The name you need to remember is Paralia kerentza and it belongs to the city of Ammoudia. In this part of the Greek region Ipeiros you have many similar beaches, but this one is the most free of tourist infrastructure. This is also the reason why it is so popular amongst the motorhome enthusiast. The main surface of the beach is sand, you also have some trees and a little bit of grass. The water entry here is very pleasant and because of the shallow water the point of swim starts very late at around 50 meters. Parking your vehicle or motorhome here is easy, either you do it by the road or on a large parking place a little bit behind the beach. Very little beach infrastructure is available here, only a shower and on marina. A restaurant is also present here but on some years it is closed. Accommodation is not available around the beach but in the neighboring villages.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 2, 1, 14, 5, 2, 9, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-30 14:31:14', '2019-04-30 12:31:14', 11, 'ammoudia-paralia-kerentza_5', 1),
(3673, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Ammoudia', 'ammoudia', 1, '39.2404008', '20.4818016', 'Paralia ammoudia', 'The Greek region Ipeiros is full of surprises and of unique beaches. The same goes for this awesome greek Beach called Paralia ammoudia. What is so special about it is the fact that it is shaped like a lagoon, it has a 750 meters long Sandy Beach and all around the beach you have lots off trees and gras to park your vehicle or lay down your Towel, besides that you also have a very shallow water, the fact families with small children will consider the most. For this region and the whole of Greece these are really unique characteristics. On the widest part the beach measures 100 meters. The water entry is very nice but swimming starts very late at around 75 meters. In the summertime you have lots of beach Services here and all around the place you have restaurants, beach bars and other type of catering. Accommodation here is also available in the form of apartments, rooms and hotels.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 15, 11, 2, 10, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-30 17:25:05', '2019-04-30 15:25:05', 11, 'ammoudia-paralia-ammoudia_5', 1),
(3674, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Lýchnas', 'lychnas', 1, '39.2814945', '20.4346458', 'Paralia Lichnos', 'The Village Lýchnas it\'s quite a unique place. It has a very beautiful beach to offer, with lots of beach infrastructure and services but because of the high inclination of the village itself there is very little space for an official parking place. Most of the space is used for acommendation. The only place you can really Park is inside the autocamp, but to park here for free you either have to be a customer of the camp, the restaurant or the only official Market in this Village. The beach itself it\'s made of sand, is 750 m long and up to 40 meters wide. You have a very clear sea here, which gets deep very fast and on some places you can almost jump into the water to start swimming, but normally after three meters you can start swimming. You have a few beach bars, restaurants and a market and because of that also some beach services. Umbrellas and deckchairs can also be rented here. Accommodation is available in many forms, like apartments, rooms, hotel and autocamp.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 14, 2, 2, 15, 8, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-04-30 17:25:13', '2019-04-30 15:25:13', 11, 'lychnas-paralia-lichnos_5', 1),
(3675, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Parga', 'parga', 1, '39.281966', '20.407146', 'Paralia Piso Krioneri', 'The Greek city of Parga with its beautiful architecture and even more amazing, romantic beaches is a must visit if you are in the region Ipeiros.  Here you have two amazing beaches, one more beautiful than the other. This city is easy to reach by a road, but the biggest challenge used to find a free parking place. Even outside the high season it\'s very crowded in the summertime even more. You have many options to park your vehicle, either you do it on some free public places or you just parked by the road. The first one is called Paralia Piso Krioneri. From the main road the beaches around 200 meters away. It is a small Beach and it measures around 75 m in the length and is 30 meters wide. The main surface are small Pebbles mixed with sand. The water entry is very nice can swimming starts almost immediately.  You have some beach services available on the beach, more is in the town itself. A restaurant and a beach bar are located directly on the beach, as well as some apartments and a hotel. The whole area is very special, on the one side you have a lot of colorful houses, and when looking to the Sea you have a lot of rocks with trees standing alone in the sea and providing you an amazing view.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 5, 3, 7, 7, 2, 2, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/3REFh_lfYls', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d2920d40/parga/\" data-label_1=\"PARGA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >PARGA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15626704976232.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 13552, 5, '2019-04-30 20:10:54', '2019-04-30 18:10:54', 1, 'parga-paralia-piso-krioneri_5', 1),
(3676, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Parga', 'parga', 1, '39.2831055', '20.4045089', 'Paralia Krioneri', 'The Greek city of Parga with its beautiful architecture and even more amazing, romantic beaches is a must visit if you are in the region Ipeiros.  Here you have two amazing beaches, one more beautiful than the other. This city is easy to reach by a road, but the biggest challenge used to find a free parking place. Even outside the high season it\'s very crowded in the summertime even more. You have many options to park your vehicle, either you do it on some free public places or you just parked by the road. The second beach is called Paralia Krioneri. From the main road the beaches is around 400 meters away. You also have the option to park directly on the beach but there are very few parking places to park. The Beach measures around 200 m in the length and is 20 meters wide. It is completely made of sand with some rocks on the border and some concrete. The water entry is very nice can swimming starts almost immediately.  You have many beach services available on the beach. Many restaurants and a bars are located directly on the beach, as well as some apartments and a hotel. Many shops are as well nearby. On the beach you can also rent some umbrellas and deckchairs. The whole area is very special, on the one side you have a lot of colorful houses, and when looking to the Sea you have a lot of rocks with trees standing alone in the sea and providing you an amazing view. Many times also sailboats anker here, which makes the scene even more special.\n', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 2, 10, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/Ho5FEzSH2tA', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d2920d40/parga/\" data-label_1=\"PARGA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >PARGA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15626704976232.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 13714, 5, '2019-04-30 20:25:03', '2019-04-30 18:25:03', 1, 'parga-paralia-krioneri_5', 1),
(3677, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Chrisogiali', 'chrisogiali', 1, '39.2852693796', '20.3922826052', 'Paralia Valtos', 'Just next to the famous city Parga you have a very touristic village Chrisogiali. Like the beaches in the town parga this one is also quite unique. The Region the beach belongs to is the Greek region Ipeiros. This spot is easy to reach with all kinds of vehicles, even motorhomes. The most easy way to park your vehicle is just beside the road which goes directly by the beach. All other types of parking are private. The length of the beach is 1,000 meters and it is up to 40 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and because of the deep water swimming starts immediately. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here. You can also rent some beach equipment here, like umbrellas and deckchairs. Various types of restaurants are available, as well as many different types of accommodation, even a campsite. This place is also popular for sailing boats to Anchor.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 16, 8, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-01 08:57:55', '2019-05-01 06:57:55', 11, 'chrisogiali-paralia-valtos_5', 1),
(3678, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Sarakiniko', 'sarakiniko', 1, '39.2872112989', '20.3395450115', 'Paralia Sarakiniko', 'This beach really has a lot to offer. First of all it is very romantic, very beautiful, with sand on the beach, crystal Clear water and a lot of beach services al available to you to fulfill your needs. The name of the beach Paralia Sarakinikois and it is located in the Greek region Ipeiros. It is really I must go if you are near it. But you have to be adviced about the type of the road which leads to the beach. It is paved but it is very narrow on some places, uneven, somewhere also unstable, and on some places very steep. Nonthelese it is very popular also by motorhome owners. The public parking is quite small but more place is available in private parking. The beach is around 100 meters long and up to 25 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts immediately. You have some beach bars find restaurants available here. And for accommodation  you  can choose between apartments, rooms and a hotel.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 4, 1, 1, 8, 6, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-01 11:08:55', '2019-05-01 09:08:55', 11, 'sarakiniko-paralia-sarakiniko_5', 1),
(3679, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Karavostasi', 'karavostasi', 1, '39.33692381', '20.28799434', 'Paralia Karavostasi', 'The beach Paralia Karavostasi it\'s located in the Greek region Ipeiros and it\'s very popular among the locals as well as the tourist. The one traveling with motorhomes also love this place so many options to park your vehicle here. Parking is done by the road directly on the beach.  The beach is made predominantly of sand and some Pebbles mixed with in. It is 750 meters long and up to 50 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts immediately because of the deep water. Treese are as well on the beach and if you can\'t find any you can rent some umbrellas. Some restaurants and beach bars are located here, some even have a swimming pool and because of that you have a lot of beach infrastructure and many Beach services. Accommodation here is also not a problem, here you have many apartments, hotels and romes.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 15, 9, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-01 12:00:37', '2019-05-01 10:00:37', 11, 'karavostasi-paralia-karavostasi_5', 1),
(3680, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Arillas', 'arillas', 1, '39.35467905', '20.28802308', 'Paralia Arilla ', 'If you are the one who adores sand on the beach and you would like to go to the Greek region Ipeiros with the beach Paralia Arilla you have a match. With the vehicle it\'s very easy to reach and you can park directly on the beach. Because of the geographical shape not so many parking places are available. You can enjoy the the sand on a total length of 750 m and on the widest part being at around 20 m. The water is not very deep here and the first few meters are safe for children to play in. The point of Swim is at around 30 to 40 meters. Many Beach services are available here. A restaurant and a beach Bar is present directly on the beach and more are in the background. For a longer stay you have apartments and rooms available for your accommodation.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 1, 2, 15, 5, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-01 15:55:22', '2019-05-01 13:55:22', 11, 'arillas-paralia-arilla_5', 1),
(3681, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Perdika', 'perdika', 1, '39.3866952', '20.2745626', 'Paralia Agia Paraskevi', 'If you\'re the one who likes to spent your holidays in luxurious accommodation and would also like to have a beautiful beach to view at from your balcony, with the beach Paralia Agia Paraskevi you are on the right location. The closest Village is called Perdika and it\'s a part of the Greek region Ipeiros. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle, also Motorhome, where a large, flat parking place awaits you. The beach is 250 meters long and can be up to 20 meters wide. It\'s predominantly made of sand and small pebbles. The water entry is different from spot to spot, on some you need to walk over flat rocks on some you can almost swim immediately. The beach infrastructure on the beach itself is basic but more is inside the beach bars, like a swimming pool. You have many options to stay here for longer, luxurious studios, a hotel and even a resort awaits you.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 2, 1, 11, 5, 2, 15, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-01 15:55:27', '2019-05-01 13:55:27', 11, 'perdika-paralia-agia-paraskevi_5', 1),
(3682, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Syvota', 'syvota', 1, '39.3865966', '20.275912', 'Paralia mega ntraphi', 'The Greek village Syvota is famous for its small and very romantic beaches. Quite a few are available when you visit this location. The village is located in the Greek region Ipeiros on the West Greek coastline. It\'s easy to reach by a road, the only problem is the parking, where you have only 20 parking places available on a dirt surface, which also has quite a strong inclination. From the parking you can reach the beach via steps and in around 30 meters you\'re on the beach. The beach is made of pebbles and some sand, it is 100 meters long and 20 meters wide. The water falls quite fast and makes the point of swim almost immideatly. You have no accommodation on the beach available but there is a beach bar which also serves some food.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 4, 2, 3, 8, 5, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-01 15:55:32', '2019-05-01 13:55:32', 11, 'syvota-paralia-mega-ntraphi_5', 1),
(3683, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Syvota', 'syvota', 1, '39.3965917826', '20.2629894018', 'Paralia Mikri Ammos', 'The Greek village Syvota is famous for its small and very romantic beaches. Quite a few are available when you visit this location. The village is located in the Greek region Ipeiros on the West Greek coastline. It\'s easy to reach by a road, the only problem is the parking, where you have only 30 parking places available on a dirt surface, which also has quite a strong inclination. If you would like to visit this Beach with your Motorhome you can leave your vehicle on a larger parking place beside the road some 300 meters away. The beach is 75 meters long and up the 15 meters wide. The main surface here is sand mixed with some pebbles and rocks on the sites. The water entry is very nice and you can choose either to jump from the rocks or to go slowly into the water and start swimming at around 5 meters. No accommodation is available here, but you have a lounge beach bar with some beach infrastructure available.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 3, 2, 7, 4, 2, 14, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-01 15:55:52', '2019-05-01 13:55:52', 11, 'syvota-paralia-mikri-ammos_5', 1),
(3684, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Syvota', 'syvota', 1, '39.398265481', '20.2568739653', 'Paralia Megali Ammos ', 'The Greek village Syvota is famous for its small and very romantic beaches. Quite a few are available when you visit this location. The village is located in the Greek region Ipeiros on the West Greek coastline. When with other you had a problem with parking on the beach Paralia Megali Ammos you have not such a problems. It\'s easy to reach by a road where you have around 100 parking places available. Other beaches in this region are quite small but this is not the case here, the beach is 200 meters long and up to 40 meters wide. Like on other beaches here you also have as a surface a mixture of pebbles and sand. The water gets deep very fast and the point of swim is already at 3 meters. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here, many restaurants and beach bars. Accommodation is also available here, mainly in the form of apartments, hotels and resorts.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 1, 1, 10, 8, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-01 17:27:11', '2019-05-01 15:27:11', 11, 'syvota-paralia-megali-ammos_5', 1),
(3685, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Plataria', 'plataria', 1, '39.4444155693', '20.263928175', 'Paralia Aristaeus', 'This beach is a true motorhome heaven and it is suitable for those who have an adventurous spirit. You will not find any beach infrastructure here, no accommodation, but only a parking place and the beach. The beach is totally free of any touristic activities. It is located in the Greek region Ipeiros near the village Plataria. The beach is made of pebbles, you have some trees here and some grass. It is 150 meters long and up to 15 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 1, 1, 9, 4, 2, 4, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-01 17:27:15', '2019-05-01 15:27:15', 11, 'plataria-paralia-aristaeus_5', 1),
(3686, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Plataria', 'plataria', 1, '39.44924891', '20.275477767', 'Paralia Plataria', 'Just next to the greek island of Corfu in the region Ipeiros there is a village Plataria. Here you will find a sandy beach which is 1 km long and 20 meters wide. Among sand you will also find a lot of trees to protect you from the Sun. The water entry here is very nice swimming starts at around 10 meters. It\'s easy to reach this place with a vehicle and you can park directly on the beach beside the road. You have some beach infrastructure here and it\'s predominantly located around the beach bars. If you\'ll get hungry you also have many restaurants available here. Some accommodation is also available, mainly in the form of apartments and rooms. If you have a boat, a harbor is also nearby. On the one spot of the beach there is also a large children playground.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 16, 5, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-01 19:05:45', '2019-05-01 17:05:45', 11, 'plataria-paralia-plataria_5', 1),
(3687, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Nea Selefkia', 'nea-selefkia', 1, '39.5108109713', '20.2199077606', 'Paralia Drepano', 'Not far away from the Greek Port city of Igoumenitsa you can enjoy this very long sandy beach. On one part of the beach you can enjoy the view of island Corfu on the other site you can take a look at the famous port. The beach belongs to the Greek region Ipeiros which is located on the western part of Greece. The closest village to the beach is called Nea Selefkia. The site is easy to reach with the vehicle you can park directly on the beach by the road. The beach is a few kilometres long and up to 50 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 15 metres. What\'s so special about this beach is the fact that you have lots of  trees here, which stretch along the whole beach. Some beach bars and restaurants are also here, and these are also the points where you have the most beach infrastructure. Accommodation is also available directly on the beach but only for those ones who prefer staying in a camp.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 4, 2, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-02 21:42:21', '2019-05-02 19:42:21', 11, 'nea-selefkia-paralia-drepano_5', 1),
(3688, 3, 'EU', 'GR', 'greece', 'Ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'ipeiros', 'Sagiada', 'sagiada', 1, '39.6389883757', '20.1570743322', 'Paralia Keramídi', 'One of the last beaches in Greece before you enter Albania in the south is called Paralia Keramídi. It is located in the Greek region Ipeiros and the closest village is Sagiada. The beach is suitable for those one who love to have a lot of beach services directly on the beach, even our children playground and trees included. It is easy to reach with the vehicle and to have a very large parking place at your disposal. It is a very clean and thoughtful made beach area where you have all you need almost directly at your feet. The main surface here are small pebbles, but some grass is also available, where you have a volleyball playground. The beach is around 200 metres long and up to 20 metres wide. The point of swim starts at around 5 and the water entry is very nice. You also have a beach bar and I a mini restaurant there. Accommodation is not available in this area but more in the villages before the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 3, 2, 10, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 5, '2019-05-02 22:00:59', '2019-05-02 20:00:59', 11, 'sagiada-paralia-keramidi_5', 1),
(3689, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Ksamil', 'ksamil', 1, '39.76570487', '19.99623697', 'Plazhi Paradise', 'Albania is full of beautiful beaches, and one of the first one in the south of the country is located in the town Ksamil in the region Vlorë. The name of the beach is Plazhi Paradise and it truly deserves this naming. The combination of the Clearwater, white sand, trees and specially shaped coastline create a truly paradise feeling. It is easy to reach by a Road and to have directly on the beach a quite large parking place. The beach is 150m long and up to 40 metres wide. The main surface on the beach is white sand, but you also have some grass and some trees to hide under. The water entry is very nice and you can either jump from a small Pier or start swimming after around 10 metres of going into the water. You also have some beach services here, a restaurant and beach bar Also on the beach, and in the neighbourhood you have lots of apartments, rooms and hotels to stay in for your holidays.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 1, 1, 9, 8, 2, 15, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/MfEusQ8CRzU', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d7619d99/ksamil/\" data-label_1=\"KSAMIL\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KSAMIL WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15637876433789.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 25691, 5, '2019-05-03 10:47:06', '2019-05-03 08:47:06', 1, 'ksamil-plazhi-paradise_5', 1),
(3690, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Ksamil', 'ksamil', 1, '39.767247', '19.993552', 'Plazhi Puerto Rico', 'The Albanian town Ksamil has really a lot of beautiful beaches. This one is called Plazhi Puerto Rico and it\'s a part of the Albanian region Vlorë. It is easy to reach with vehicle, but the last 200 m of the road are made of dirt and rocks and you have a parking place directly on the beach. It is not large but can hold around 30 vehicles. The main surface on this beach is white sand, but you also have some small stones and a concrete Pier available. Some trees are also here and you can also rent an umbrella and a sunbed. The water entry is very nice and either you can jump from the pier or you walk around 15 metres to start swimming. Some beach infrastructure is as well here but more or less basic. You also have beach bar here and if you would like to stay for longer you can rent an apartment, rooms or stay in a hotel. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 4, 5, 2, 2, 9, 7, 2, 15, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/MAnSmUqjiAY', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d7619d99/ksamil/\" data-label_1=\"KSAMIL\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KSAMIL WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15637876433789.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 17999, 5, '2019-05-03 13:19:18', '2019-05-03 11:19:18', 1, 'ksamil-plazhi-puerto-rico_5', 1),
(3691, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Ksamil', 'ksamil', 1, '39.766110', '19.994473', 'Plazhi Lori', 'The Albanian town Ksamil has really a lot of beautiful beaches. This one is called Plazhi Lori and it\'s a part of the Albanian region Vlorë. It is easy to reach with vehicle and you have a parking place directly on the beach. It is not large but can hold around 30 vehicles. The main surface on this beach is white sand, but you also have some small stones and some concrete available. You can also rent an umbrella and a sunbed. The water entry is very nice and after 5 metres  you can start swimming. Some beach infrastructure is as well here but more or less basic. You also have beach bar here and if you would like to stay for longer you can rent an apartment, rooms or stay in a hotel. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 3, 2, 6, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/kSG5xzbEd6M', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d7619d99/ksamil/\" data-label_1=\"KSAMIL\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KSAMIL WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15637876433789.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 14216, 5, '2019-05-03 13:19:24', '2019-05-03 11:19:24', 1, 'ksamil-plazhi-lori_5', 1),
(3692, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Ksamil', 'ksamil', 1, '39.771111', '19.998333', 'Plazhi Bora Bora', 'The Albanian town Ksamil in the region Vlorë is famous for its beautiful beaches. The beach Plazhi Bora Bora is no exception here. It\'s very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park only 50 m away from the beach. The parking place can hold around 30 vehicles. The main surface on the beach is white sand but you also have a lot of small concrete piers. It is around 100 metres long and up to 25 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts very fast, either you jump from a pier or you go into the water and start swimming already after 5 metres. Many beach infrastructure is available here. You can rent many things here, sunbeds, umbrellas and some pedal boats. Restaurants and and beach bars are directly on the beach and you have many Apartments and hotels in the vicinity if you plan this place to be your holiday.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 3, 2, 8, 6, 5, 13, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/kqwTbA-1DY0', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d7619d99/ksamil/\" data-label_1=\"KSAMIL\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KSAMIL WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15637876433789.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 26814, 5, '2019-05-03 14:18:36', '2019-05-03 12:18:36', 1, 'ksamil-plazhi-bora-bora_5', 1),
(3693, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Ksamil', 'ksamil', 1, '39.773063', '19.9982212', 'Plazhi Ksamil 7', 'The Albanian town Ksamil in the region Vlorë is famous for its beautiful beaches. The beach Plazhi Ksamil 7 is no exception here. It\'s very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park by the road directly at the beach. The main surface on the beach is white sand but you also have a lot of small concrete piers, which divide the beach into many quarters. It is around 100 metres long and up to 20 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts very fast, either you jump from a pier or you go into the water and start swimming already after 5 metres. On some places you have rocks in the water, so take a look before you go inside. Many beach infrastructure is available here. You can rent many things here, sunbeds, umbrellas and some pedal boats. Restaurants and and beach bars are directly on the beach and you have many Apartments and hotels in the vicinity if you plan this beach or the many here around to be your next holiday.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 2, 8, 5, 5, 14, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/cN55DPb8rsM', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d7619d99/ksamil/\" data-label_1=\"KSAMIL\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KSAMIL WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15637876433789.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 17562, 5, '2019-05-03 15:41:37', '2019-05-03 13:41:37', 1, 'ksamil-plazhi-ksamil-7_5', 1),
(3694, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Ksamil', 'ksamil', 1, '39.77283895', '20.00201001', 'Plazhi Ksamil 4', 'The Albanian town Ksamil in the region Vlorë is one of the first tourist villages famous for its beautiful beaches. The beach Plazhi Ksamil 4 is no exception here. It\'s very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park on some public parking places sorounding the beach or directly at the beach on private parking places.  The main surface on the beach is white sand but you also have a lot of small concrete piers, which divide the beach into many quarters. It is around 150 metres long and up to 25 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts very fast, either you jump from a pier or you go into the water and start swimming already after 5 metres. Many beach infrastructure is available here. You can rent many things here, sunbeds, umbrellas and some pedal boats. Restaurants and and beach bars are directly on the beach and you have many Apartments and hotels in the vicinity if you plan this beach or the many here around to be your next holiday.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 1, 2, 9, 6, 5, 13, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/1alCc0IU6VE', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d7619d99/ksamil/\" data-label_1=\"KSAMIL\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KSAMIL WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15637876433789.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 9525, 5, '2019-05-03 18:28:26', '2019-05-03 16:28:26', 1, 'ksamil-plazhi-ksamil-4_5', 1),
(3695, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Ksamil', 'ksamil', 1, '39.7794288397', '20.0069993734', 'Plazhi Ksamil 2', 'The Albanian town Ksamil in the region Vlorë is one of the first tourist villages famous for its beautiful beaches. The beach Plazhi Ksamil 2 is a little bit special, namely the beach is formed out of many terrases. It\'s very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park on some public parking places sorounding the beach or directly at the beach on private parking places.  The main surface on the beach is white sand but you also have a lot of small concrete piers, which divide the beach into many quarters. It is around 150 metres long and up to 25 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts very fast, either you jump from a pier or you go into the water and start swimming already after 5 metres. Many beach infrastructure is available here. You can rent a sunbed or an umbrella here. Restaurants and and beach bars are directly on the beach and you have many Apartments and hotels in the vicinity and also a campsite if you travel with your motorhome or like this kind of a holiday. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 6, 1, 2, 9, 5, 5, 13, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/ddQpsweabHY', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d7619d99/ksamil/\" data-label_1=\"KSAMIL\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KSAMIL WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15637876433789.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8396, 5, '2019-05-03 18:28:36', '2019-05-03 16:28:36', 1, 'ksamil-plazhi-ksamil-2_5', 1),
(3696, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Ksamil', 'ksamil', 1, '39.7922873497', '20.0018173456', 'Plazhi Ksamil 1', 'This beach is located a little bit outside the Albanian town Ksamil and it belongs to the region Vlorë. It\'s easy to reach with a vehicle and you can park directly on the beach on a dirt Park Place, which is not flat but has quite a strong inclination. You have around 100 m of beach length and 30 metres widness to enjoy. The water entry is nice and swimming starts immediately. The main surface are pebbles, you also have some trees there and you can rent sunbeds and umbrellas. This beach is very organised and you have many beach services available. A Restaurant is also present on the beach. Accommodation is not directly on the beach available but a few hundred metres you have one apartment Complex to stay in.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 2, 2, 8, 7, 2, 2, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/NWXKRTyqkiM', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d7619d99/ksamil/\" data-label_1=\"KSAMIL\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KSAMIL WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15637876433789.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10005, 5, '2019-05-03 18:28:38', '2019-05-03 16:28:38', 1, 'ksamil-plazhi-ksamil-1_5', 1),
(3697, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Ksamil', 'ksamil', 1, '39.767964', '19.998363', 'Plazhi Ksamil 9', 'If you are in south Albania in the region Vlorë and you like beautiful small beaches you need to visit the small town Ksamil. Ksamil is also famous for the most important Albanian archaeological site called Butrint. The beach we are presenting here is Plazhi Ksamil 9. It is easy to reach with a vehicle and you can park directly on the beach beside the road. The Beech is 100 metres long and up to 25 metres wide. Surface is white sand. The water entry is nice except on a few spots where you have some rocks in the water, so try to avoid them. Swimming starts either by jumping from the pier or after around 10 metres of going into the water. You have many beach services is here, a restaurants is also present here. Up by the road you have a small children playground. For accommodation you have many options like hotels and apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 2, 8, 6, 2, 14, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/oFSLKn15lls', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d7619d99/ksamil/\" data-label_1=\"KSAMIL\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KSAMIL WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15637876433789.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 20877, 5, '2019-05-04 11:44:38', '2019-05-04 09:44:38', 1, 'ksamil-plazhi-ksamil-9_5', 1),
(3698, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Ksamil', 'ksamil', 1, '39.8042231798', '20.0054973364', 'Plazhi i Pasqyrave', 'One of the very first beaches near the town  Ksamil when travelling to the south of Albania is the beach Plazhi i Pasqyrave located in the region Vlorë. The beach is not that easy to reach because you need to take a narrow and quite steep road which is in the last part made of dirt and rocks. Motorhomes can also go there but it should be a small one and if possible a four to four wheel drive, because some parts are quite tricky. You have a large parking place directly on the beach. The main surface on the beach are small pebbles mixed with some sand. The Beeches 150 metres long and up to 25 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. You have some Beach infrastructure here, but it\'s more basic. A Beach bar and restaurant are as well present here. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but in the village above in the form of apartments and rooms.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 4, 8, 1, 2, 9, 6, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/M-o1bGR2YbA', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d7619d99/ksamil/\" data-label_1=\"KSAMIL\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KSAMIL WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15638663675561.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 15655, 5, '2019-05-04 11:44:55', '2019-05-04 09:44:55', 1, 'ksamil-plazhi-i-pasqyrave_5', 1);
