(3699, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Sarandë', 'sarande', 1, '39.8132997751', '20.0103735924', 'Plazhi i Manastirit', 'One of the very first beaches when travelling from south of Albania towards the town of Sarandë is the beach Plazhi Manastirit located in the region Vlorë. The beach is not that easy to reach because you need to take a narrow and quite steep road but it is made of concrete, so you have a better traction. Motorhomes can also go there but it should be a small one and if possible a four to four wheel drive, because some parts are quite tricky. You have a large parking place directly on the beach. The main surface on the beach are small pebbles mixed with some sand. The Beeches is 75 metres long and up to 15 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. You have some Beach infrastructure here, even a small children playground. A Beach bar and restaurant are as well present here. Accommodation is also available directly on the beach in the form of a hotel and you also have a small camping.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 1, 2, 7, 4, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/4xRXbmD2Cow', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d7619d99/ksamil/\" data-label_1=\"KSAMIL\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >KSAMIL WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15638663675561.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 13282, 5, '2019-05-04 11:54:02', '2019-05-04 09:54:02', 1, 'sarande-plazhi-i-manastirit_5', 1),
(3700, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Sarandë', 'sarande', 1, '39.8535221815', '20.0201904774', 'Plazhi Mango', 'The Albanian City Sarandë is located in the region Vlorë. The beaches in This City are famous for a lot of beach services they provide to The Tourists. If you\'re the one who likes to spend their holiday in a hotel directly on the beach this city is the right one for you. The beach Plazhi Mango also belongs into this category. It is very Easy accessible with a vehicle and parking can be done directly on the beach, but in most cases only private parking on a large hotel private parking place. The beaches around 300 m long and up to 50 metres wide. It is separated by many piers. The main surface on the beach are pebbles and you have also some concrete. The the slope of the beach is on the water entry Spot very steep, but you can swim away immediately. You have many beach services here available. Restaurants and beach bars are also available here. For accommodation you have many hotels and apartments available.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 3, 12, 9, 3, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/JPft1Di4mk0', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d8620d03/sarande/\" data-label_1=\"SARANDË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SARANDË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15638682112948.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 21262, 5, '2019-05-04 13:42:06', '2019-05-04 11:42:06', 1, 'sarande-plazhi-mango_5', 1),
(3701, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Sarandë', 'sarande', 1, '39.8729145527', '20.0121974945', 'Plazhi Sarandë 7', '', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 2, 10, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/b83oIM9EIWA', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d8620d03/sarande/\" data-label_1=\"SARANDË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SARANDË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15638682112948.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 7283, 5, '2019-05-04 13:42:23', '2019-05-04 11:42:23', 1, 'sarande-plazhi-sarande-7_5', 1),
(3702, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Sarandë', 'sarande', 1, '39.8687034845', '20.0017422438', 'Plazhi Sarandë 4', 'The Albanian City Sarandë is located in the region Vlorë. The beaches in This City are famous for a lot of beach services they provide to The Tourists. If you\'re the one who likes to spend their holiday in a hotel directly on the beach this city is the right one for you. The beach Plazhi Sarandë 4 also belongs into this category. It is very Easy accessible with a vehicle and parking can be done either directly on the beach on a private parking or a little bit up by the road. The beaches is around 400 m long and up to 20 metres wide and it is divided in several parts. The main surface on the beach are pebbles and you have also some concrete. The inclinatation of the slope is normal and you can swim away immediately. You have many beach services here available. Restaurants and beach bars are also available here. For accommodation you have many hotels and apartments available. A party spot with a dancefloor is also here.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 13, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/ZOW6tv2LANo', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d8620d03/sarande/\" data-label_1=\"SARANDË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SARANDË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15638682112948.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8202, 5, '2019-05-04 17:16:59', '2019-05-04 15:16:59', 1, 'sarande-plazhi-sarande-4_5', 1),
(3703, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Sarandë', 'sarande', 1, '39.871353507', '19.9938189983', 'Plazhi Sarandë 2', 'The Albanian City Sarandë is located in the region Vlorë. The beaches in This City are famous for a lot of beach services they provide to The Tourists. If you\'re the one who likes to spend their holiday in a hotel directly on the beach this city is the right one for you. The beach Plazhi Sarandë 2 also belongs into this category. It is very Easy accessible with a vehicle and parking can be done either directly on the beach on a private parking or a little bit up by the road. The beaches is around 300 m long and up to 30 metres wide and it is divided in several parts. The main surface on the beach are pebbles and you have also some concrete. The inclinatation of the slope is normal and you can swim away immediately. You also have a pier here wich is in the summertime used for jumping into the water. The water here is very deep so it\'s safe to jump. You have many beach services here available, you can also rent a sunbed and umbrella. Restaurants and beach bars are also available here. For accommodation you have many hotels and apartments available directly on the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 2, 12, 7, 5, 13, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/qTT13GzgOTg', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d8620d03/sarande/\" data-label_1=\"SARANDË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SARANDË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15638682112948.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 7906, 5, '2019-05-04 17:17:05', '2019-05-04 15:17:05', 1, 'sarande-plazhi-sarande-2_5', 1),
(3704, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Sarandë', 'sarande', 1, '39.8764014244', '19.9812877178', 'Plazhi Gjiri Sarandë', 'Just a little bit outside the Albanian City Sarandë you have a very beautiful beach with the name Plazhi Gjiri Sarandë to spend your holidays. Because of the way it is made, the different  shapes that define it, the white sand it makes it very special and very attractive. It is a perfect spot for taking a special photo with you on the beach. It is located in the region Vlorë. If you\'re the one who likes to spend your holiday in a hotel directly on the beach this beach is the right one for you. It is very Easy accessible with a vehicle and parking can be done directly on the beach on a private parking. The beach is around 100 m long and up to 50 metres wide. The main surface on the beach is white sand as well as concrete. The inclinatation of the slope is normal and you can swim away immediately. You also have a pier here wich is in the summertime used for jumping into the water. The water here is very deep so it\'s safe to jump. You have many beach services here available, you can also rent a sunbed and umbrella. A hotel Restaurant and a beachbar is also available here. For accommodation you have a hotel directly on the beach and some apartments available in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 14, 2, 1, 8, 9, 5, 14, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/IFcoNwoKIx4', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/39d8620d03/sarande/\" data-label_1=\"SARANDË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SARANDË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15638682112948.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 15073, 5, '2019-05-04 17:17:10', '2019-05-04 15:17:10', 1, 'sarande-plazhi-gjiri-sarande_5', 1),
(3705, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Borsh', 'borsh', 1, '40.0461906195', '19.8501223326', 'Plazhi Borsh', 'Near the Albanian village Borsh you have a  few kilometres long white pebbles beach to enjoy your well deserved holidays. The location of the beach is in the region Vlorë. The beach is easy to reach with a vehicle,  also motorhomes are welcomed here, and you can park directly on the Beach by the road. The beach is around 30 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim starts almost immediately. You have Many beach services available, especially around the beachbars and restaurants. Accommodation is also available directly on the beach, in the form of apartments, a hotel is also here and you even have a campsite.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 7, 2, 3, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/GVG4BLeIQdQ', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0619d85/borsh/\" data-label_1=\"BORSH\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >BORSH WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15638782358651.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 13132, 5, '2019-05-04 18:05:16', '2019-05-04 16:05:16', 1, 'borsh-plazhi-borsh_5', 1),
(3706, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Qeparo', 'qeparo', 1, '40.0527727604', '19.8253494501', 'Plazhi Qeparo', 'In Albania on some parts the country has a lot of mountains all the way to the coastline. Here and there the mountains have a break and a beautiful beach opens to the sea. In This part of Albania you have the region Vlorë and the village Qeparo. The beach here is called plazhi Qeparo. The beach is easy to reach with a vehicle and you can park directly beside the beach on a large parking place. On some places they will charge you for the parking. It is around 2 kilometres long and up to 25 metres wide. What\'s the main surface of the Beach is quite hard to determine, because it is a mixture of brown sand, pebbles and big stones. The water entry is very nice are swimming starts at around 15 metres. Along the whole stretch of the beach you have many restaurants and beach bars and this is also the place where you have the most beach infrastructure and services. You have many options to stay here for longer. Accommodation is available in various types, mostly in the form of apartments, rooms, hotels and even campsites.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 2, 2, 17, 6, 2, 6, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/xJjfW3Q4U6g', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0519d83/qeparo/\" data-label_1=\"QEPARO\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >QEPARO WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643428171888.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11624, 5, '2019-05-05 14:18:32', '2019-05-05 12:18:32', 1, 'qeparo-plazhi-qeparo_5', 1),
(3707, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Qeparo', 'qeparo', 1, '40.0524830818', '19.8029208183', 'Plazhi Porto Palermos 3', 'When travelling down the Albanian coastline in the region Vlorë from the town Qeparo to the North, just beside the coastline there is a very nice beach with the name Plazhi Porto Palermos 3. It\'s easy to reach with vehicle and you can leave your car on a parking place beside the road. After you go around 30 metres down the stairs, passing a restaurant you will see this 50 m long and 10 metres wide pebbles beach. As a surface you also have some concrete. The water entry is either from the beach or you jump from a platform which makes the point of swim either immediately or at around 5 metres. This place is very organised and you have a restaurant and some accommodation directly on the beach and because of that you have here many beach services.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 3, 3, 6, 3, 5, 13, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/uEe4FfSBZT4', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0519d83/qeparo/\" data-label_1=\"QEPARO\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >QEPARO WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643428171888.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8082, 5, '2019-05-05 14:18:37', '2019-05-05 12:18:37', 1, 'qeparo-plazhi-porto-palermos-3_5', 1),
(3708, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Porto Palermo', 'porto-palermo', 1, '40.0629883', '19.7945364', 'Plazhi Porto Palermos 2', 'When travelling down the Albanian coastline in the region Vlorë from the town Qeparo to the North, just beside the coastline there is a very specialy shaped beach with the castle Ali Pasha nearby. The name of the beach is Plazhi Porto Palermos 2. It\'s easy to reach with a vehicle and you can leave your car on a parking place directly on the beach or up by the restaurant beside the road. The road down to the beach is made of dirt and rocks but it\'s very short and incline is quite normal. The beach is 100 m long and 10 metres wide in the main surface or pebbles. As a surface you also have some concrete. The water entry is either from the beach or you jump from a pier nearby, which makes the point of swim either immediately or at around 5 metres. On the beach itself there is little beach infrastructure. You have a restaurant and some accommodation in the form of bungalows up by the road some 50 m away from the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 4, 7, 1, 1, 8, 3, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/y8j1OtnOnYc', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d0719d78/porto-palermo/\" data-label_1=\"PORTO PALERMO\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >PORTO PALERMO WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643428171888.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10332, 5, '2019-05-05 15:50:02', '2019-05-05 13:50:02', 1, 'porto-palermo-plazhi-porto-palermos-2_5', 1),
(3709, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Himarë', 'himare', 1, '40.08056629', '19.76658157', 'Plazhi i Llamanit', 'If you\'re the one who likes very beautiful albanian beach with lots of beach services, even a party Place you need to visit the beach Plazhi i Llamanit. It is Located in the region Vlorë near the town Himarë. It is a very accessible beach with a vehicle. The roads to this spot are from the highest quality and you have a very beautiful scenery when driving down the coastline. The last few hundret metres are made of dirt and when you reach the spot you can park directly on the beach. The beach Maine surface or pebbles mixed with some sand. It is a 200 metres long and up to 40 metres wide beach. The water entry is very nice and you can swim away almost immediately. You have lots of beach services available, you can also rent a pedal boat. A Beachbar, a restaurant and even a club is located here. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but there is a hotel near the main road.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 7, 3, 1, 10, 8, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/0rQVEltMNJ8', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d1019d75/himare/\" data-label_1=\"HIMARË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >HIMARË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643448002345.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10427, 5, '2019-05-05 15:50:04', '2019-05-05 13:50:04', 1, 'himare-plazhi-i-llamanit_5', 1),
(3710, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Himarë', 'himare', 1, '40.0971204042', '19.7528386116', 'Plazhi Guma', 'The Albanian town Himarë, which is located in the region Vlorë is very popular amongst the tourist. No wonder because it has many beautiful beaches, and one of them is beach Plazhi Guma. The road which leads down the coastline is in a very good condition and it leads you also to this spot where you can park directly at the beach by the road. The beach is 400 m long and up to 50 m wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming immediately.  You have some beach services available here as well as many restaurants, pizzerias and similar catering. Accommodation is also not a problem, here you have many apartments and hotels.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 2, 13, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/Wa3F6eoe0Lw', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d1019d75/himare/\" data-label_1=\"HIMARË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >HIMARË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643448002345.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 12250, 5, '2019-05-05 17:27:07', '2019-05-05 15:27:07', 1, 'himare-plazhi-guma_5', 1),
(3711, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Himarë', 'himare', 1, '40.0929344', '19.7555823', 'Plazhi Potam', 'The Albanian town Himarë, which is located in the region Vlorë is very popular amongst the tourist. No wonder because it has many beautiful beaches, and one of them is beach Plazhi Potam. The road which leads down the coastline is in a very good condition and it leads you also to this spot where you can park directly at the beach by the road. The beach is 750 m long and up to 40 m wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming immediately.  You have some beach services available here as well as many restaurants, pizzerias and similar catering. Accommodation is also not a problem, here you have many apartments and hotels, even a campsite. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 15, 8, 3, 2, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/HUpUAVEqpXg', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d1019d75/himare/\" data-label_1=\"HIMARË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >HIMARË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643448002345.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11955, 5, '2019-05-05 17:27:11', '2019-05-05 15:27:11', 1, 'himare-plazhi-potam_5', 1),
(3712, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Himarë', 'himare', 1, '40.1010793447', '19.7439926863', 'Plazhi i Spilesë', 'The Albanian town Himarë, which is located in the region Vlorë is very popular amongst the tourist. No wonder because it has many beautiful beaches, and one of them, which is also the beach of the centre of the city is beach Plazhi i Spilesë. The road which leads down the coastline is in a very good condition and it leads write to the centre of the city you can park either by the road or by some public park places. The beach is 500 m long and up to 20 m wide. The main surface of the beach is sand with some concrete terasses. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming immediately or you can jump from the pier. You have some beach services available here as well as many restaurants, pizzerias and similar catering. Accommodation is also not a problem, here you have many apartments and hotels.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 3, 1, 14, 5, 2, 13, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/TNXWrlizkW8', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d1019d75/himare/\" data-label_1=\"HIMARË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >HIMARË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643448002345.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 9206, 5, '2019-05-05 20:19:35', '2019-05-05 18:19:35', 1, 'himare-plazhi-i-spilese_5', 1),
(3713, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Jala', 'jala', 1, '40.1088738441', '19.7233074903', 'Plazhi Jalë 2', 'Near the Albanian town Himarë there is a village Jala which is known for its 1 km long pebbles beach called Plazhi Jalë 2. It is located in the region Vlorë and is very popular amongst motorhome enthusiast and those one who like to camp. The road which leads down the coastline is in a very good condition and you can park either by the road or on some private parkings.The beach is 1000 m long and up to 50 m wide. The main surface of the beach are white pebbles with a little sand mixed within. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming immediately. You have some beach services available here as well as many restaurants, beach bars, pizzerias and similar catering. Accommodation is also not a problem, here you have many apartments and hotels and also many campsites. Many small supermarkets are as well available.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 16, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/o9QsG4dWqqs', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d1219d70/jala/\" data-label_1=\"JALA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >JALA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643448002345.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 9966, 5, '2019-05-05 20:37:57', '2019-05-05 18:37:57', 1, 'jala-plazhi-jale-2_5', 1),
(3714, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Dhërmi', 'dhermi', 1, '40.1419562101', '19.6386086941', 'Plazhi Dhërmi', 'In the Albanian region Vlorë in the middle of the mountanian coastline there is a very special village Dhërmi. In front of the village you have a 1 kilometre long and up to 50 metres wide pebbles beach. The whole beach is very organised, with many Beach Bars at your service, with lots of benches and a long promenade. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle you can park beside the road directly on the beach. When going to swim you have a very nice water entry and you can start swimming almost immediately. Much beach infrastructure is here with lots of services. Accommodation is also available directly at the beach mostly in the form of apartments, rooms and hotels.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 16, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/XP_U_p5fdbA', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d1519d64/dhermi/\" data-label_1=\"DHËRMI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DHËRMI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643817563902.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 14427, 5, '2019-05-06 13:59:11', '2019-05-06 11:59:11', 1, 'dhermi-plazhi-dhermi_5', 1),
(3715, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Gjilekë', 'gjileke', 1, '40.15599311', '19.60832177', 'Plazhi Drymades', 'In the Albanian region Vlorë in the middle of the mountanian coastline before the roads lead you into the mountains there is a village Gjilekë. In the month of May 2019 this beach was special because there was a fighter jet directly on the beach. Like the neighbouring Village it also has a very long Beach which is called Plazhi Drymades. It is Made of pebbles and is 2 kilometres long and up to 50 metres wide. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle you and you can park beside the road directly on the beach. When going to swim you have a very nice water entry and you can start swimming almost immediately. Much beach infrastructure is here with lots of services. Accommodation is also available directly at the beach mostly in the form of apartments, rooms and hotels, some resorts are also here present. A camp is also present here. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/2WopltV4IHw', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d1619d62/gjileke/\" data-label_1=\"GJILEKË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >GJILEKË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643817563902.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 9220, 5, '2019-05-06 13:59:31', '2019-05-06 11:59:31', 1, 'gjileke-plazhi-drymades_5', 1),
(3716, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Palasa', 'palasa', 1, '40.1692128181', '19.5840096474', 'Plazhi Palasës', 'When you\'re travelling up the Albanian coastline from the South to the North towards the town Vlorë before the road turns up into the mountains the very last beach you will Encounter is Plazhi Palasës in the village Palasa. It is located in the region Vlorë. The beach is very easy to reach with your vehicle and the road is completely new. You can park directly on the beach on a parking place, but it\'s not for free, they will charge you around €2 per day. The main surface of the beach are pebbles mixed with some sand. The beach is around 2 kilometres long and up to 100 metres wide. You really have plenty of space find your spot. The whole area is made completely new it is still in the making. Everything is very organised and on the highest level, so are the beach services and the beach infrastructure. A Children playground is also available directly on the beach. Many beach bars and restaurants are available here, and you can also rent some beach equipment there. Some accommodation is already available directly on the beach some is still in the making. Many luxury apartments and houses are built here.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 2, 2, 17, 11, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/UW8TkS_j2xU', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d1719d62/palase/\" data-label_1=\"PALASA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >PALASA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643817563902.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 14950, 5, '2019-05-06 13:59:33', '2019-05-06 11:59:33', 1, 'palasa-plazhi-palases_5', 1),
(3717, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Orikum', 'orikum', 1, '40.3268033266', '19.453112483', 'Plazhi Orikum 3', 'The first Beach you will Encounter when driving up the coastline from South to North part of Albania in the region Vlorë, after you cross the seaside mountains and drive down the 1000 metres high mountain pass is the beach in the small town Orikum. The beach Is a few kilometres long and up to 40 metres wide. To park your vehicle also motorhomes here is not a problem, you simply leave your car beside the road. The main surface are pebbles mixed with sand. The water entry here is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 metres. Along the whole stretch of the beach you have many restaurants and beach bars and so are also the beach services available around those spots. Because of a few hotels directly on the beach you can also plan to stay here for your holidays.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 4, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/fCBqtmcfdLY', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d3319d47/orikum/\" data-label_1=\"ORIKUM\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ORIKUM WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643860768220.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 13817, 5, '2019-05-07 11:31:42', '2019-05-07 09:31:42', 1, 'orikum-plazhi-orikum-3_5', 1),
(3718, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Orikum', 'orikum', 1, '40.3457611799', '19.4841295481', 'Plazhi Bojo', 'One of the best organised, beautiful, family friendly, green, with high quality beach services beaches in Albania. When visitting this beach you can be sure it will stay in your memory forever. You will find it in the small town Orikum when driving up the coastline from South to North part of Albania in the region Vlorë, after you cross the seaside mountains and drive down the 1000 metres high mountain pass. The beach Is 500 metres long and up to 30 metres wide. To park your vehicle also motorhomes here is not a problem, you simply leave your car beside the road. The main surface are pebbles mixed with sand, and you also have a lot of grass here, even some trees. The water entry here is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 metres. This is actually a beach resort with lots of beach services as well as many beach bars and restaurants. It\'s a truly family type beach, you have so many space for your children to play safely on the high quality children\'s playgrounds or just simply enjoying the green grass fields. Because of a few hotels, apartments and resorts directly on the beach you can also plan to stay here for your holidays, you certainly won\'t regret it.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 1, 14, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/P7sEMlEm4Mo', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d3319d47/orikum/\" data-label_1=\"ORIKUM\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ORIKUM WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643860768220.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 15816, 5, '2019-05-07 11:31:46', '2019-05-07 09:31:46', 1, 'orikum-plazhi-bojo_5', 1),
(3719, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 1, '40.3942394257', '19.4780677557', 'Plazhi Vega', 'When driving up the coastline from Orikum towards the city Vlorë you have many artificial made beaches right beside the road. The same goes for the beach Vega which is very easy to reach with your vehicle. You can simply Park beside the road or Park on the parking places the beach provides. The Beeches 150 metres long and up to 15 metres wide. The main surface are pebbles and concrete and you also have some rocks. The water entry here is done either by using the water steps or the beach. Swimming starts at around 10 metres. The beach is very organised and you have many beach services here available. A restaurant and a beach bar are located as well directly on the beach. Nearby you also have a hotel and some apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 3, 3, 9, 4, 5, 14, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/SIiPBzn5hJ8', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d4719d49/vlore/\" data-label_1=\"VLORË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >VLORË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643876104001.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 19853, 5, '2019-05-07 11:31:51', '2019-05-07 09:31:51', 1, 'vlore-plazhi-vega_5', 1),
(3720, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 1, '40.4347676039', '19.4944506884', 'Plazhi Vlorës 1', 'If you are nearby the albanian city Vlorë or you plan to spent your vacation in Albania and you also like beautiful long sandy beaches you have to visit this city beach. It\'s very easy to reach with your vehicle can you can park directly on the beach, where you need to be the customer of the beach bar, or in the vicinity. The beach is around 2 kilometres long up to 75 m wide. The inclination of the beach is very low, it\'s almost flat. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 50 m. This whole area is very organised and you have many benches and paths to walk around. Many beach services are available here, even sport fields and children playgrounds. Around the whole area you have a lot of restaurants and beach bars, also other type of Catering to please your needs.You will find many types of accommodation here, the most present are certainly hotels which are available directly at the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 1, 1, 17, 10, 1, 9, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/tgklynjd4cg', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d4719d49/vlore/\" data-label_1=\"VLORË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >VLORË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643876104001.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 19168, 5, '2019-05-07 15:44:05', '2019-05-07 13:44:05', 1, 'vlore-plazhi-vlores-1_5', 1),
(3721, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 1, '40.4549914598', '19.4721615314', 'Plazhi Vjetër', 'If you are nearby the albanian city Vlorë or you plan to spent your vacation in Albania and you also like beautiful long sandy beaches you have to visit this city beach. It\'s very easy to reach with your vehicle and can you can park directly on the beach, literally on the beach. The beach is several kilometres long and on some places even more than to 100 m wide. The inclination of the beach is very low, it\'s almost flat. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 75 m. Many beach services are available here. Around the whole area you have a lot of restaurants and beach bars, also other type of Catering to please your needs.You will find many types of accommodation here, the most present are certainly hotels which are available directly at the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 11, 1, 10, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/mnx1yYU_XEI', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d4719d49/vlore/\" data-label_1=\"VLORË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >VLORË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643876104001.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 24731, 5, '2019-05-07 15:44:08', '2019-05-07 13:44:08', 1, 'vlore-plazhi-vjeter_5', 1),
(3722, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Vlorë', 'vlore', 'vlore', 'Nartë', 'narte', 1, '40.4941999912', '19.4279748201', 'Plazhi Narta', 'If you are nearby the albanian city Vlorë or you plan to spent your vacation in Albania and you also like beautiful long sandy beaches you have to visit the neighbouring small town Narta and its long sandy beach. It\'s very easy to reach with your vehicle and can you can park directly on the beach, beside the road. The beach is several kilometres long and on some places even more than to 100 m wide. The inclination of the beach is very low, it\'s almost flat. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 75 m. Because the water is so shallow here it is also suitable for small children to play in water. Many beach services are available here. Around the whole area you have a lot of restaurants and beach bars, also other type of Catering to please your needs. Directly on the beach you don\'t have any accommodation, but more is available in the town Narta or the town Vlorë. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 12, 1, 10, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/1HkNr74ZYX4', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d5019d46/narte/\" data-label_1=\"NARTA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >NARTA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15643876104001.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 19698, 5, '2019-05-07 20:10:52', '2019-05-07 18:10:52', 1, 'narte-plazhi-narta_5', 1),
(3723, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Fier', 'fier', 'fier', 'Darëzezë e Re', 'darezeze-e-re', 1, '40.715380311', '19.3636983633', 'Plazhi Darëzezë e Re', 'In the Albanian region Fier there are not many beaches, but those one who exist will take your breath away. This one is located near the village Darëzezë e Re and is called Plazhi Darëzezë e Re. It\'s a very long sandy beach which is several kilometres long and more than 100 metres wide. You really have a lot of space here. The whole beach is almost flat and so is the shallow water. It takes really a long time before you reach the point of swim, probably more than 100 metres. But the shallow water is excellent for small children to play safely in it. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park directly on the beach itself. If you get hungry or thirsty you have many restaurants and beach bars directly on the beach available. Accommodation is not available on the beach and is probably more kilometres away into the inland. This place because of the flat water and strong wins it\'s also very popular amongst kiteboarders.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 12, 1, 12, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/Z7VkYqzKLmE', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/40d7219d38/darezeze-e-re/\" data-label_1=\"DARËZEZË E RE\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DARËZEZË E RE WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646508052875.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 14844, 5, '2019-05-07 20:10:56', '2019-05-07 18:10:56', 1, 'darezeze-e-re-plazhi-darezeze-e-re_5', 1),
(3724, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Fier', 'fier', 'fier', 'Divjakë', 'divjake', 1, '40.9669172', '19.4744362', 'Plazhi Divjakës', 'The Albanian region Fier has a very special coastline which mainly consist of very long sandy beaches. Near the small town Divjakë you have such a beach called Plazhi Divjakës. It is not only famous because of the beach, but also because of the beautiful nature protected area, woth lots of birds, especially pelicans and flamingos. It\'s easy to reach with all kind of vehicles even motorhomes and you can park directly on the beach itself. From the point where you have the largest accommodation concentration to the point where you actually come to the beach you need to drive on Sandy roads, it is safe because they are very stable. The beach itself is several kilometres long and more than 100 metres wide. The inclination of the beach is very low, it\'s almost flat and so is the water where you need to go more then 100 metres to reach the point of swim. This makes this beach, except from the fact that on the beach itself this little beach infrastructure, Perfect for small children to play safely in the water. On the beach itself there is almost no infrastructure but more is around the restaurants and accommodation which are also located on the beach. You have many types of accommodation to choose from. Here is a hotel, a resort and some apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 1, 1, 17, 12, 1, 12, 1, 0, 'https://youtu.be/Ztf-o0lX8DE', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d0019d53/divjake/\" data-label_1=\"DIVJAKË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DIVJAKË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646519304925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 13295, 5, '2019-05-08 11:35:07', '2019-05-08 09:35:07', 1, 'divjake-plazhi-divjakes_5', 1),
(3725, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Tiranë', 'tirane', 'tirane', 'Spille', 'spille', 1, '41.0833740234', '19.4572484493', 'Plazhi Spille', 'One Of the very first beaches in the region Tiranë when travelling from the south part of the country towards the north is the very long sandy beach called Plazhi Spille. The beach is very organised and is a popular touristic spot suitable for families. It is very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park directly on the beach in front of the Beach Bars. The whole parking area is very large and can hold many hundreds cars. You have a lot of beach infrastructure and beach services available here. The whole beach is several kilometres long and can be on some places up to 75 m wide. You really have a lot of space here to find your spot. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 50 metres, which makes this place ideal for small children to play in the water safely. You can rent here a sunbed and an umbrella, which can be done by the restaurants or beach bars who are located along the whole stretch of the beach. Accommodation is also in the vicinity, mainly in the form of hotels, some apartments are also available.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 1, 1, 17, 10, 2, 9, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/jo98XEL-TRE', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d1019d47/spille/\" data-label_1=\"SPILLE\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SPILLE WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646519304925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 19553, 5, '2019-05-08 15:43:47', '2019-05-08 13:43:47', 1, 'spille-plazhi-spille_5', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach` (`id`, `waterbody_id`, `continent_code`, `country_code`, `country_code_nice_url`, `region`, `region_nice_url`, `region_full_name_nice_url`, `city`, `city_nice_url`, `location_id`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `name`, `description`, `beach_type_id`, `location_pay_id`, `price_per_day`, `currency`, `area_description_id`, `accessibility_id`, `parking`, `payable_parking`, `road_to_parking_type_id`, `parking_capacity_id`, `parking_beach_distance_id`, `parking_beach_height_id`, `location_length_id`, `bay_length_id`, `beach_inclination_id`, `swimming_depth_of_one_m`, `occupancy_rate_id`, `tourist_facilities_id`, `video_url`, `webcam`, `path_to_beach_map_url`, `beach_weather`, `water_temperature`, `island_name`, `island_name_nice_url`, `river_name`, `river_name_nice_url`, `lake_name`, `lake_name_nice_url`, `boat_only`, `beach_views`, `user_id`, `datetime`, `datetime_ut`, `status_id`, `folder_name`, `mobile_upload`) VALUES
(3726, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Tiranë', 'tirane', 'tirane', 'Golem', 'golem', 1, '41.1823475361', '19.4777244329', 'Plazhi Karpen', 'In Albania there are many beautiful places to take your breath away and the same goes for the beach Plazhi Karpen, located in the region Tiranë near the city Golem. What is makes it so special is the view you will have wenn walking on a wooden pier to a small island not far away send send send eligible on from the beach. Because of the shallow water, the trees on the beach and the sand all around it is one of the most pictures sights I have ever been. The place is easy to reach with a vehicle, also a Motorhome, especially because of the camp which is located directly on the Beach. You can park beside the road or in the camp. The beach main surface is sand. Many trees are here available to protect you from the Sun. The beach like the water are very flat, which makes it ideal for small children. Put together the beach is around 750 metres long and up to 40 m wide and is separated in many sectors. The point of swim is very far away, probably more than 100 meters. Your have Many Beach services available here, the same goes for beach bars and restaurants, as well as a campsite, apartments and a hotel if you would like to spent your holidays here.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 12, 1, 1, 15, 8, 1, 12, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d2319d54/golem/\" data-label_1=\"GOLEM\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >GOLEM WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646519304925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 20663, 5, '2019-05-08 15:43:56', '2019-05-08 13:43:56', 1, 'golem-plazhi-karpen_5', 1),
(3727, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Tiranë', 'tirane', 'tirane', 'Golem', 'golem', 1, '41.2288409472', '19.5119065046', 'Plazhi Qerret', 'If you Like to have a sandy beach on your vacation and at the same time you would like to stay in the Shadow of the pine trees with the Albanian beach Plazhi Qerret you are on the right spot.  It is located in the region Tiranë near the city Golem. This location is very easy to reach with vehicle. You can park directly on the beach in a pine tree forest, this way your car will be cool whole day. The beach is around 1000 m long and on some places up to 100m wide. It is separated in many sectors, dependent at which resort your stay. The incline is quite normal, the water entry is very nice and swimming starts quite late at around 50 m. You have a lot of beach infrastructure through the whole stretch of the beach, and on some parts there are really premium services. You won\'t be hungry on this beach, there are many beach bars and restaurants available, the same goes for all kind of accommodation, from simple rooms, camping all the way to the Premium resorts. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 11, 2, 9, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/OTJVGTbvV4E', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d2319d54/golem/\" data-label_1=\"GOLEM\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >GOLEM WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646519304925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 24004, 5, '2019-05-08 19:49:16', '2019-05-08 17:49:16', 1, 'golem-plazhi-qerret_5', 1),
(3728, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Tiranë', 'tirane', 'tirane', 'Golem', 'golem', 1, '41.2570202351', '19.5191967487', 'Plazhi Golem', 'In the region Tiranë, near to the famous city Durrës you have another typical beach for this region. The beaches which are located in this spot are Sandy and in the background you have a lot of pine trees. This bech belongs to the city Golem. It is easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park directly on the beach beside the road, mostly under some pine trees. It is several kilometres long and on the widest part around 100 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 30 metres. Because this place is very popular among The Tourists you have a lot of beach services available on the beach. Hear you have also plenty of beach bars,  restaurants. Accommodation Is available in all kind of forms, mainly as hotels or even resorts.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 12, 1, 1, 17, 11, 1, 7, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/6NvBewQ5kpE', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d2319d54/golem/\" data-label_1=\"GOLEM\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >GOLEM WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646519304925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 20971, 5, '2019-05-08 19:49:24', '2019-05-08 17:49:24', 1, 'golem-plazhi-golem_5', 1),
(3729, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Tiranë', 'tirane', 'tirane', 'Shkëmbi i Kavajës', 'shkembi-i-kavajes', 1, '41.2635433674', '19.5185798407', 'Plazhi Shkëmbi i Kavajës', 'If you like long sandy beaches with lots of space, with the beach infrastructure, beach services on the highest level and you also would like to have your apartment in the premium Hotel right in front of the beach with the beach Plazhi Shkëmbi i Kavajës you are on the right spot. The beach is located on the border between two regions, those are the region Tiranë and the region Durrës. The closest city is named Shkëmbi i Kavajës. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle and you can either park directly on the beach on a public park place or on a private place belonging to a Hotel. The beach is a few kilometres long and 100m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 50 metres. You Have lots of beach services available, included children\'s playgrounds and sports Fields. Beach bars and different types of restaurants are available along the whole beach. The same goes for accommodation which is present here mainly in the form of premium hotels, but some apartments and other types of accommodation are as well available.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 2, 1, 17, 11, 2, 9, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/XXR_hwj2t8o', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d2819d52/shkembi-i-kavajes/\" data-label_1=\"SHKËMBI I KAVAJËS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SHKËMBI I KAVAJËS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646519304925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 17837, 5, '2019-05-09 11:26:50', '2019-05-09 09:26:50', 1, 'shkembi-i-kavajes-plazhi-shkembi-i-kavajes_5', 1),
(3730, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Durrës', 'durres', 'durres', 'Durrës', 'durres', 1, '41.302654', '19.493190', 'Plazhi Durrës', 'If you would like to have the experience with the Albanian biggest seaside touristic City you have to visit Durrës. This place is famous for its very long sandy beach, more kilometres long and up to 75 metres wide. This place is very easy to reach with a vehicle of any kind and you can simply Park beside the road. On the beach itself you have lots of space. The water entry is very nice and because the water is very shallow the point of swim starts around 75m to 100m. Because this is a true City Beach Many beach infrastructure is available here and lots of services. All around the place you have many shops, beach bars and restaurants of all kind. Accommodation is available on every corner of the beach in all kind of forms, predominantly as hotels.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 4, 1, 17, 10, 2, 10, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d3219d46/durres/\" data-label_1=\"DURRËS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DURRËS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646519304925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 14088, 5, '2019-05-09 11:26:54', '2019-05-09 09:26:54', 1, 'durres-plazhi-durres_5', 1),
(3731, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Durrës', 'durres', 'durres', 'Durrës', 'durres', 1, '41.312097', '19.433877', 'Plazhi ke Aragosta', 'If you would like to have the experience with the Albanian biggest seaside touristic City you have to visit Durrës. This place is famous for its very long sandy beach but on some parts you also have a little bit more private small beaches. This one is called Plazhi ke Aragosta and its 300 metres long and up to 30 metres wide. This place is very easy to reach with a vehicle of any kind and you can simply Park beside the road. The main beach surface is sand, the water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately, but if you prefer to jump into the water you can also do it from a pier. Because this is a true City Beach Many beach infrastructure is available here and lots of services. All around the place you have many shops, beach bars and restaurants of all kind. Accommodation is available  in all kind of forms, predominantly as hotels.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 3, 2, 12, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d3219d46/durres/\" data-label_1=\"DURRËS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DURRËS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646519304925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 8998, 5, '2019-05-09 11:47:13', '2019-05-09 09:47:13', 1, 'durres-plazhi-ke-aragosta_5', 1),
(3732, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Durrës', 'durres', 'durres', 'Durrës', 'durres', 1, '41.319245', '19.431565', 'Plazhi Currila', 'One of the last beaches you can visit in the seaside touristic City Durrës before going to the North is the beach Plazhi Currila. Is located in the region Durrës and it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can either Park by the road or on the private parking place from the hotel. The beach surface is sand, but you also have other types mixed within, like pebbles, and to even have some concrete parts. Altogether the beach is 500 metres long up to 25 metres wide. The water entry changes along the stretch of the beach and on some points you can start swimming after 5 metres or you can either jump from the pier. You have many beach infrastructure here and lots of beach services, the same goes also for the different types of restaurants and beach bars. There is also a party Place located in the vicinity of the beach. If you are searching for accommodation you have a hotel directly on the beach and some apartments in the vicinity.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 14, 1, 1, 14, 6, 5, 14, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d3219d46/durres/\" data-label_1=\"DURRËS\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DURRËS WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646519304925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 19388, 5, '2019-05-09 12:29:26', '2019-05-09 10:29:26', 1, 'durres-plazhi-currila_5', 1),
(3733, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Durrës', 'durres', 'durres', 'Hamallaj', 'hamallaj', 1, '41.4865341', '19.5096302', 'Plazhi Hamallaj', 'The Albanian beach Plazhi Hamallaj is located it in the region Durrës. It is a very long sandy beach suitable for families. It is very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park directly on the beach just next to the beach bars and restaurants. The beach itself is several kilometers long and up to 75 meters wide. The inclination of the beach is very moderate, quite normal, so is the water entry thanks swimming starts between 30 and 40 meters. You have some beach services available directly on the beach, where you can also rent some beach equipment. Beach bars and restaurants are available as well on the beach. The same goes for accommodation where you have a new apartment complex located directly on the beach and a campsite nearby.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 10, 2, 7, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/VZ-zB38qFgI', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d4719d53/hamallaj/\" data-label_1=\"HAMALLAJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >HAMALLAJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646519304925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 18112, 5, '2019-05-10 09:04:11', '2019-05-10 07:04:11', 1, 'hamallaj-plazhi-hamallaj_5', 1),
(3734, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Durrës', 'durres', 'durres', 'Plazhi San Pietro', 'plazhi-san-pietro', 1, '41.5104563', '19.5158444', 'Plazhi Gjiri i Lalëzit 1', 'The Albanian beach Plazhi Gjiri i Lalëzit 1 is located it in the region Durrës and is one of the last very long beaches in this region before you go to the North. It is a very long sandy beach suitable for families, many children playgrounds are located here. It is very easy to reach with your vehicle and you have so much space where are you can park directly on the beach just in front of the beach bars and restaurants. The beach itself is several kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide. The inclination of the beach is very moderate, quite normal, so is the water entry thanks swimming starts between 30 and 40 meters. You have a lot of high quality beach services available directly on the beach, where you can also rent some beach equipment, padle boats. Beach bars and restaurants are available as well on the beach. The same goes for accommodation where you have many new apartment complex, resorts, hotels, apartments located in the background of the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 12, 2, 8, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/xqiAIzldRgI', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d5219d52/plazhi-san-pietro/\" data-label_1=\"PLAZHI SAN PIETRO\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >PLAZHI SAN PIETRO WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646519304925.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 16520, 5, '2019-05-10 14:55:49', '2019-05-10 12:55:49', 1, 'plazhi-san-pietro-plazhi-gjiri-i-lalezit-1_5', 1),
(3735, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Lezhë', 'lezhe', 'lezhe', 'Tale', 'tale', 1, '41.691667', '19.580556', 'Plazhi Talë', 'One of the first very long sandy beaches when travelling up the albanian coastline from South to the North in the region Lezhë is the beach called Plazhi Talë. It is very easy to reach it with your vehicle, any kind. From the main road you only need to drive a few hundred meters on a dirt road before you reach the sandy beach on which you can drive further and choose your parking place anywhere you want directly on the sand. The beach is completely made of sand, it is several kilometers long and up to 100 metal wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming start immediately. A lot of beach infrastructure here and many services. Restaurants and beach bars are also here, as well as many fast food stores. Some restaurants are located also on Piers to give you even a more special dining experience. Accommodation is available on the beach mainly in the form of apartments, hotels and some apartment complexes.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 1, 1, 17, 11, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/f32DBBo6f7s', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d7019d60/tale/\" data-label_1=\"TALE\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >TALE WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646704272405.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 23451, 5, '2019-05-10 14:55:55', '2019-05-10 12:55:55', 1, 'tale-plazhi-tale_5', 1),
(3736, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Lezhë', 'lezhe', 'lezhe', 'Stomi i Madh', 'stomi-i-madh', 1, '41.7700731754', '19.6002745628', 'Plazhi Kunë', 'In the Albanian region Lezhë, near to the village Stomi i Madh there is a very long sandy beach with the name Plazhi Kunë. It is very easy to reach with a vehicle and you can leave your car beside the road directly at the beach. The Beach is more kilometres long and up to 40 metres wide. It is Separated into many quarters where you have a lot of beach bars located. The water entry is very nice and  swimming starts at around 40 m. Most of the beach infrastructure and services are available where the beach bars and restaurants are located on other parts you have no service. Accommodation is also available but not on the beach directly, the first hotel is around 2 kilometres away.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 8, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/XUjR1AvRH00', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d8119d59/shengjin/\" data-label_1=\"SHËNGJIN\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SHËNGJIN WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646731306097.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11854, 5, '2019-05-10 20:36:11', '2019-05-10 18:36:11', 1, 'stomi-i-madh-plazhi-kune_5', 1),
(3737, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Lezhë', 'lezhe', 'lezhe', 'Shëngjin', 'shengjin', 1, '41.8069488', '19.5986851', 'Plazhi Shëngjin', 'The city Shëngjin is a popular  Albanian tourist destination where you have a very long sandy beach with lots of hotels and other tourist services. It is located in the Albanian region Lezhë. No matter what kind of a vehicle you have you will easy reach this location where you can park either beside the road or on some public parking places. The beach itself is several kilometres long and up to 75 metres wide. The water entrance is very nice and swimming starts at around 30 metres. On some part of the beach you also have a pine tree forest which will give you some natural shadow. Because this is a very popular tourist destination you have a lot of beach services available. You won\'t have any problems finding accommodation, here are plenty of all kind hotels, apartments and similar.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 10, 2, 7, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/BgdGghhAM0I', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d8119d59/shengjin/\" data-label_1=\"SHËNGJIN\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >SHËNGJIN WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646731306097.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 18217, 5, '2019-05-10 20:36:28', '2019-05-10 18:36:28', 1, 'shengjin-plazhi-shengjin_5', 1),
(3738, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Lezhë', 'lezhe', 'lezhe', 'Celaj', 'celaj', 1, '41.8242027', '19.5576856', 'Plazhi Rana e Medhun', 'The last beach in the north part of the Albanian region Lezhë is the beach Plazhi Rana e Medhun. The closest city to this location is Shëngjin. You should to visit this beach if you are with family and you like a long sandy beach with hotels and pine trees located directly on the beach. Then location is easy to reach with a vehicle. Parking can be done directly on the beach, mostly on the private parking places from the restaurants or hotels. The beach is several kilometers long and on some parts even hundred meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at the around 10 meters. You have plenty of beach infrastructure available here. Restaurants and beach bars are also located here, as well as a few hotels and a resort.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 11, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/hF9tzC81Dcg', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2519d78/celaj/\" data-label_1=\"CELAJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >CELAJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646731306097.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11100, 5, '2019-05-10 20:36:36', '2019-05-10 18:36:36', 1, 'celaj-plazhi-rana-e-medhun_5', 1),
(3739, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Shkodër', 'shkoder', 'shkoder', 'Baks-Rrjollë', 'baks-rrjolle', 1, '41.854686141', '19.4692915678', 'Plazhi Rrjollit', 'The very first region you enter when arriving to Albania from Montenegro at the coastline is the region Shkodër. This region is famous for its beautiful sandy beaches who stretch over several kilometres. The last beach before going to the next region down the coastline is located in the village Baks-Rrjollë. It is several kilometres long and up to 100 metres wide. You really have a lot of space here. It is especially beautiful at the sunset. The beach is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can simply Park directly on the beach itself or at the resort, if you are a guest there. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 20 metres. You don\'t Have much beach infrastructure here only at the beach resort. A Restaurant is also available here, as well as an accommodation in the form of a hotel.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 2, 1, 17, 11, 2, 6, 2, 0, 'https://youtu.be/GGmK0PNHdqg', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d8619d47/baks-rrjolle/\" data-label_1=\"BAKS-RRJOLLË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >BAKS-RRJOLLË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646775724763.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 12312, 5, '2019-05-10 21:13:50', '2019-05-10 19:13:50', 1, 'baks-rrjolle-plazhi-rrjollit_5', 1),
(3740, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Shkodër', 'shkoder', 'shkoder', 'Velipojë', 'velipoje', 1, '41.8630086', '19.4237502', 'Plazhi Velipojës', 'If you\'re a family, the one who loves very long, very wide and very touristic sandy beaches, with spending your holidays on the Albanian beach Plazhi Velipojës you can\'t go wrong. The beach is located in the region Shkodër and it is very easy to reach with your vehicle, any kind, and you can park on multiple parking spots almost directly at the beach. The beach is several kilometres long and more than 100 m wide, the water entrance is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. Because of this being a very popular tourist destination you can expect to have many beach services and beach infrastructure available on the beach. Many restaurants, beach bars, fast food and similar are available at the beach or in its vicinity. Accommodation is present here, mainly in the form of hotels and apartments and on one end of the beach you even have a resort.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 12, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/ZJMtE4-lMOw', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d8719d42/velipoje/\" data-label_1=\"VELIPOJË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >VELIPOJË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646775724763.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 21156, 5, '2019-05-11 10:18:26', '2019-05-11 08:18:26', 1, 'velipoje-plazhi-velipojes_5', 1),
(3741, 3, 'EU', 'AL', 'albania', 'Shkodër', 'shkoder', 'shkoder', 'Velipojë', 'velipoje', 1, '41.856713891', '19.4072145224', 'Plazhi Ada', 'The Albanian beaches are amazing. The beach Plazhi Ada even has got an aqua park directly on the beach, but not only that, behind the Aqua Park you have a luxury resort in ancient Greek architecture style, where you can spent your holidays. The region this beach is located is called Shkodër the closest city this Velipojë. The location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. In the summertime the parking places which leads directly to the beach and to the aquapark are open to the public. The beach itself is few kilometres long and up to 75 m wide. The inclination is normal, the water entry is nice and swimming starts almost immediately. You have some beach infrastructure available on the beach and even more in the Aqua Park. A few beach bars and restaurants are located directly on the beach. The Closest accommodation is in a form of a luxury resort just behind the Aqua Park.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 10, 2, 3, 3, 0, 'https://youtu.be/jQWYzN_EXOM', NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d8719d42/velipoje/\" data-label_1=\"VELIPOJË\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >VELIPOJË WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15646775724763.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 18789, 5, '2019-05-11 11:20:01', '2019-05-11 09:20:01', 1, 'velipoje-plazhi-ada_5', 1),
(3742, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Doni Štoj', 'doni-stoj', 1, '41.8628025055', '19.342058301', 'Beach Ada Bojana', 'Montenegro is famous for its beautiful beaches. In the south of the country in the region Ulcinj there is a very long Sandy Beach Ada Bojana. The beach is special because it is specialized for the naturist/FKK/nudist type of tourist. The closest Village is Doni Štoj. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, and you can park on multiple parking places. The walk from The Parking Place to the beach is only 100 meters long. The beach itself is several kilometers long and up to 50 meters wide. The inclination of the slope is normal, so is the water entry and swimming starts at around 10 meters. You have many Beach infrastructure and services available here. Accommodation is also nearby and it comes in many shapes and forms, like bungalows, apartments, a hotel and even a campsite.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 1, 17, 9, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9119d30/doni-stoj/\" data-label_1=\"DONI ŠTOJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DONI ŠTOJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15662499072154.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 24357, 5, '2019-05-11 16:44:16', '2019-05-11 14:44:16', 1, 'doni-stoj-plaza-ada-bojana_5', 1),
(3743, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Doni Štoj', 'doni-stoj', 1, '41.8868511915', '19.307141304', 'Velika beach', 'Montenegro is famous for its beautiful beaches. In the south of the country in the region Ulcinj there are a few very long Sandy Beaches. The beach plaža Velika is several kilometers long and up to 100 meters wide. The closest Village is Doni Štoj. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, and you can park on multiple parking places. The walk from The Parking Place to the beach is only 50 meters long. The inclination of the slope is normal, so is the water entry and swimming starts at around 10 meters. You have many Beach infrastructure and services available here. Accommodation is also available on the beach directly, where you can rent some apartments or bungalows. A campsite is also present here.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 11, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9119d30/doni-stoj/\" data-label_1=\"DONI ŠTOJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DONI ŠTOJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15662499072154.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 13987, 5, '2019-05-11 18:30:45', '2019-05-11 16:30:45', 1, 'doni-stoj-velika-plaza_5', 1),
(3744, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Doni Štoj', 'doni-stoj', 1, '41.8779730797', '19.3230307102', 'Beach Kite', 'In Montenegro you also have a special Beach near the town Ulcinj specialized for the kiteboarding sport. The closest Village goes by the name Doni Štoj. This place is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. From the main road you take a dirt road which is in a quiet good condition and after one kilometer you are on the beach. Parking can be done directly on the beach. The beach itself is several kilometers long and even more than 100 meters Wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters. You have some beach infrastructure here but it\'s mainly concentrated around the beach bar or the kiteboarding Center. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach, but more in the background of their surrounding.\n', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 9, 1, 1, 17, 12, 2, 4, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9119d30/doni-stoj/\" data-label_1=\"DONI ŠTOJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DONI ŠTOJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15662499072154.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10555, 5, '2019-05-11 19:07:41', '2019-05-11 17:07:41', 1, 'doni-stoj-plaza-kite_5', 1),
(3745, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Doni Štoj', 'doni-stoj', 1, '41.8939858675', '19.2901307344', 'beach Noki', 'Near the town and the region Ulcinj there is a village Doni Štoj. It is a family beach which is known for its very long Sandy Beach with many many beach bars directly on the beach. This place is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. From the main road you take a paved road and after one kilometer you are on the beach. Parking can be done directly on the beach. The beach itself is several kilometers long and even more than 100 meters Wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters. You have many beach infrastructure and services here. The BeachBars are sometimes also restaurants or fast food locations. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach, but more in the background of their surrounding.\n    ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 11, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9119d30/doni-stoj/\" data-label_1=\"DONI ŠTOJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DONI ŠTOJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15663025838169.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10452, 5, '2019-05-11 20:02:19', '2019-05-11 18:02:19', 1, 'doni-stoj-plaza-noki_5', 1),
(3746, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Doni Štoj', 'doni-stoj', 1, '41.9034298', '19.2666848', 'beach Safari', 'If you\'re the one who likes long sandy beaches and you also would like to have pine trees on the beach to protect you from the Sun the Beach plaža Safari in Montenegro is the one for you. It is located in the region Ulcinj near the village Doni Štoj. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, because of the campsite, which is located directly at the beach, motorhomes and Caravans are also welcomed. You also have parking place for normal cars directly at the beach. The access to the beach is very easy. The beach is more kilometers long and up to 100 meters wide. The inclination of the slope small, it\'s almost flat, because of that you also have a very shallow water, which with the pine trees it makes it ideal for small children. The point of swim starts very late, at around 50 meters. You have a lot of beach infrastructure and services available on the beach. Many types of accommodation are available here. On the beach you have a campsite and in the background many apartments and hotels. If you are a family with small children and you travel with a motorhome this Beach it\'s perfect for your next vacation.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 11, 1, 9, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9119d30/doni-stoj/\" data-label_1=\"DONI ŠTOJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >DONI ŠTOJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15663025838169.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10565, 5, '2019-05-11 20:10:40', '2019-05-11 18:10:40', 1, 'doni-stoj-plaza-safari_5', 1),
(3747, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Gjerana', 'gjerana', 1, '41.9073797', '19.2503023', 'beach Miami', 'This sandy Montenegro Beach which stretches from the town Ulcinj all the way down to the Albanian border is very special and unique. The main surface, which is here sand, has a healing effect for some illnesses. Because here is no industry the water is very clean and the sand has a special mineral mixture of 30 elements, some of them slightly Radioactive, which makes them also bioactive. The beach is located in the region Ulcinj, near the village Gjerana goes by the name beach Miami. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle even under some trees. Because of so many camping grounds here around it is also very popular amongst motorhomes. The whole area around the beach it\'s very organized and on the highest level. You have really a lot of beach infrastructure and services here. The beach is several kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide. The inclination of the beach is quite flat and because of that you also have a shallow water, which makes it ideal for small children. Because of the shallow water the point of swim starts at around 50 to 75 meters. Accommodation is on the beach directly available only in the form of a camping ground. Hotels and apartments are more in the background, but not far away.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 1, 17, 12, 1, 9, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9319d21/ulcinj/\" data-label_1=\"ULCINJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ULCINJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15663025838169.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 14701, 5, '2019-05-12 11:52:58', '2019-05-12 09:52:58', 1, 'gjerana-plaza-miami_5', 1),
(3748, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 1, '41.918743', '19.215186', 'Beach Albatros', 'The South part of montenegro in the turistic town Ulcinj you have very unique and special beaches which you won\'t find anywhere in the world. This whole area has a very Rocky coastline and to enable The Tourist to take a swim in the sea the Locals have created very special concrete beaches, with many terraces and wooden podiums. There are five of such beaches which are all a more adventurer type of user oriented, because of the high cliffs and the first one is called Plaža Albatros. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. Either you do it by the road or on some private large parking places which cost a few euros per day. The length of the path to the beach depends on where you have parked your vehicle and it can be up to 500 meters away or only 100 meters. From the road to the beach you have to descent about 15 meters in height. This beach is separated in three smaller parts, the main surface is concrete on rocks, what is also the material of the terraces. You also have some pine trees there. All together the beach is around 150 meters long and up to 30 meters wide. The inclination is on some parts normal on some parts steep and on some parts it falls abrupt into the sea. You can reach the water by a ladder, by concrete steps or by jumping into the water. A beach bar and a restaurant are directly on the beach. You also have the main beach infrastructure and services available on the beach. Accommodation is also available in the background of the beach, where you have a hotel. Apartments are available in the city itself.', 8, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 4, 4, 9, 7, 5, 1, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9319d21/ulcinj/\" data-label_1=\"ULCINJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ULCINJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15663025838169.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 13947, 5, '2019-05-13 20:34:19', '2019-05-13 18:34:19', 1, 'ulcinj-plaza-albatros_5', 1),
(3749, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 1, '41.920058', '19.213697', 'Beach Ženska', 'The South part of montenegro in the turistic town Ulcinj you have very unique and special beaches which you won\'t find anywhere in the world. This whole area has a very Rocky coastline and to enable The Tourist to take a swim in the sea the Locals have created very special concrete beaches, with many terraces and wooden podiums. There are five of such beaches which are all a more adventurer type of user oriented, because of the high cliffs and the second one is called Plaža Ženska. This beach is even more special than the other ones, because it has a special smell. On the beach you have sulfur springs which are known in this location to have a healing effect. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. Either you do it by the road or on some private large parking places which cost a few euros per day. The length of the path to the beach depends on where you have parked your vehicle and it can be up to 500 meters away or only 100 meters. From the road to the beach you have to descent about 15 meters in height. This beach is separated into a few smaller parts, the main surface is concrete on rocks and some wooden terraces. The beach also has a small Bay made of big white stones. All together the beach is around 75 meters long and up to 15 meters wide. The inclination is on some parts normal on some parts steep and on some parts it falls abrupt into the sea. You can reach the water by a ladder, by concrete steps, via the small Beach, or by jumping into the water. A beach bar and a restaurant are directly on the beach. You also have the main beach infrastructure and services available on the beach. Accommodation is also available in the background of the beach, where you have a hotel. Apartments are available in the city itself.', 8, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 4, 4, 7, 4, 5, 13, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9319d21/ulcinj/\" data-label_1=\"ULCINJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ULCINJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15663025838169.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11656, 5, '2019-05-13 20:34:28', '2019-05-13 18:34:28', 1, 'ulcinj-plaza-zenska_5', 1),
(3750, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 1, '41.9196438789', '19.211204052', 'Beach Sapore di Mare', 'The South part of montenegro in the turistic town Ulcinj you have very unique and special beaches which you won\'t find anywhere in the world. This whole area has a very Rocky coastline and to enable The Tourist to take a swim in the sea the Locals have created very special concrete beaches, with many terraces and wooden podiums. There are five of such beaches which are all a more adventurer type of user oriented, because of the high cliffs and the third one is called Plaža  Sapore di Mare. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. Either you do it by the road or on some private large parking places which cost a few euros per day. The length of the path to the beach depends on where you have parked your vehicle and it can be up to 500 meters away or only 20 meters. From the road to the beach you have to descent about 15 meters in height. This beach is separated into a few smaller parts, the main surface is concrete on rocks and some wooden terraces on steel foundation. On some parts it is quite challenging to get around. Some pine trees are as well there. All together the beach is around 75 meters long and up to 25 meters wide. The inclination is on some parts normal on some parts steep and on some parts it falls abrupt into the sea. You can reach the water by a ladder, by concrete steps, or by jumping into the water. A beach bar and a restaurant are directly on the beach. You also have the main beach infrastructure and services available on the beach. Accommodation is also available in the background of the beach, where you have a hotel. Apartments are available in the city itself.', 8, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 3, 3, 7, 6, 5, 1, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9319d21/ulcinj/\" data-label_1=\"ULCINJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ULCINJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15663025838169.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11241, 5, '2019-05-13 20:55:57', '2019-05-13 18:55:57', 1, 'ulcinj-plaza-sapore-di-mare_5', 1);
