(3751, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 1, '41.921043992', '19.2094177008', 'Beach Aquarius', 'The South part of Montenegro in the turistic town Ulcinj you have very unique and special beaches which you won\'t find anywhere in the world. This whole area has a very Rocky coastline and to enable The Tourist to take a swim in the sea the Locals have created very special concrete beaches, with many terraces and wooden podiums. There are five of such beaches which are all a more adventurer type of user oriented, because of the high cliffs and the fourth one is called Plaža Aquarius. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. Either you do it by the road or on some private large parking places which cost a few euros per day. The length of the path to the beach depends on where you have parked your vehicle and it can be up to 500 meters away or only a few meters if you find one free place near the entrance. From the road to the beach you have to descent about 15 meters in height till you reach the sea. This beach is separated into a few smaller parts, the main surface is concrete on rocks and some wooden terraces on steel foundation which are also installed on the rocks. On some parts it is quite challenging to get around. Some pine trees are as well there and also some grass. All together the beach is around 150 meters long and up to 40 meters wide. The inclination is on some parts normal on some parts steep and on some parts it falls abrupt into the sea. You can reach the water by a ladder, by concrete steps, or by jumping into the water. A beach bar and a restaurant are directly on the beach. You also have the main beach infrastructure and services available on the beach. Accommodation is also available in the background of the beach, where you have a hotel, Apartments and rooms available for your vacation time in Montenegro.', 8, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 1, 9, 8, 5, 1, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9319d21/ulcinj/\" data-label_1=\"ULCINJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ULCINJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15663025838169.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 12765, 5, '2019-05-13 21:09:09', '2019-05-13 19:09:09', 1, 'ulcinj-plaza-aquarius_5', 1),
(3752, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 1, '41.921050', '19.208490', 'Beach Far', 'The South part of Montenegro in the turistic town Ulcinj you have very unique and special beaches which you won\'t find anywhere in the world. This whole area has a very Rocky coastline and to enable The Tourist to take a swim in the sea the Locals have created very special concrete beaches, with many terraces and wooden podiums. There are five of such beaches which are all a more adventurer type of user oriented, because of the high cliffs and the fifth one is called Plaža Far. This location is really unique. The place is more like a party location, with many pools and beach bars and even a dancing floor on the top. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. Either you do it by the road or on some private large parking places which cost a few euros per day. The length of the path to the beach depends on where you have parked your vehicle and it can be up to 200 meters away or only a few meters if you find one free place near the entrance. From the road to the beach you have to descent about 20 meters in height till you reach the sea. This beach is separated into a few smaller parts, the main surface are concrete terraces. All together the beach is around 100 meters long and up to 50 meters wide. The inclination is on some parts normal on some parts steep and on some parts it falls abrupt into the sea. You can reach the water by a ladder, by concrete steps, or by jumping into the water. A beach bar and a restaurant as well as a dancing floor are directly on the beach. You have manny beach infrastructure and services available on the beach, even a few swimming pools. Accommodation is also available in the background of the beach, where you have a hotel, Apartments and rooms available for your vacation time in Ulcinj Montenegro.', 8, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 5, 8, 9, 5, 1, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9319d21/ulcinj/\" data-label_1=\"ULCINJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"weather_one\" >ULCINJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15663025838169.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 12028, 5, '2019-05-13 21:23:11', '2019-05-13 19:23:11', 1, 'ulcinj-plaza-far_5', 1),
(3753, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 1, '41.9236672', '19.2053299', 'Mala plaža', 'In the Montenegro town Ulcinj you have a sandy beach right in the center of the town. Ulcinj is located in the South Part of montenegro, not far away from the Albanian border. This location is very easy to reach. The name of the beach is mala Plaža and it is a family-type beach. You can park your vehicle on multiple park places. The closest one is just beside the road directly on the beach or a little bit far away where you have larger private parking places available. The beach is 400 meters long and on some places up to 50 meters wide. The inclination of the beach is normal. The water Here is quite shallow and swimming starts at around 50 meters. You have a lot of beach infrastructure and services available directly on the beach. Many restaurants, coffee bars and all kind of shops are available directly on the beach. Accommodation is also here, mainly in the form of hotels and apartments. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 1, 1, 13, 9, 2, 9, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9319d21/ulcinj/\" data-label_1=\"ULCINJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ULCINJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15864178574585.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 19419, 5, '2019-05-14 11:39:12', '2019-05-14 09:39:12', 1, 'ulcinj-mala-plaza_5', 1),
(3754, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'ulcinj', 'Bratica', 'bratica', 1, '41.951114', '19.165304', 'Beach Valdanos', 'When traveling in the country Montenegro from south to the north the very first pebbles Beach in the region Ulcinj is the beach Valdanos. The closest Village to the beach is Bratica. This place is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can park directly on the beach on a large parking place. The beachs main surface are pebbles with big stones and to also have some concrete terraces. All together the beach is 500 meters long end up to 15 meters wide. The Inclination of the slope is on some places steep on some normal. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters. Beach infrastructure and some services are also available here. A beach bar is directly on the beach. Accommodation in this location it\'s not available, the closest one is in the town Ulcinj.', 5, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 14, 4, 3, 4, 3, 0, NULL, '<a name=\"windy-webcam-timelapse-player\" data-id=\"1270759331\" data-play=\"day\" href=\"https://windy.com/webcams/1270759331\" target=\"_blank\">Busat › North-West: Uvala maslina - Utjeha - Adriatic Sea</a><script async type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://webcams.windy.com/webcams/public/embed/script/player.js\"></script>', NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/41d9519d20/bratica/\" data-label_1=\"BRATICA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BRATICA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15864178574585.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 15274, 5, '2019-05-14 11:39:22', '2019-05-14 09:39:22', 1, 'bratica-plaza-valdanos_5', 1),
(3755, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Utjeha', 'utjeha', 1, '42.0087575912', '19.148966074', 'Beach Perla', 'In the Montenegro region Bar in the small town Utjeha there is a very special Beach suitable for a more adventurer user type. This beach is really special. It is made of several concrete Terraces and in the bottom near the sea there is a small white Pebbles beach. On the Terraces you even have some trees. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can park directly at the beach on a large parking place which is 10 meters above the beach. In the bottom the beach is 10 meters long and more up in the hill 20 meters. The whidness of the beach is around 30 meters. You don\'t have much Beach infrastructure on this beach but there is a beach bar and all around the beach there are apartments where you can stay for your holiday in Montenegro.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 4, 3, 3, 3, 7, 5, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d0119d15/utjeha-busat/\" data-label_1=\"UTJEHA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >UTJEHA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15864336606398.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 11710, 5, '2019-05-14 11:43:09', '2019-05-14 09:43:09', 1, 'utjeha-plaza-perla_5', 1),
(3756, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Utjeha', 'utjeha', 1, '42.011814', '19.151108', 'Beach Rocky', 'In the Montenegro region Bar in the small town Utjeha there is a very special concrete beach suitable for families. This beach is really special. It is made of several concrete Terraces on rocks and you even have some swimming pools there. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can park directly at the beach on a private large parking place. The beach is 100 meters long with cliffs all around it and it is 15 meters wide. To get into the crystal clear water you can either use some steps for simply jump into the blue. This beach is very organized and the beach infrastructure is on the highest level with many services. You have a beach bar and a restaurant directly on the beach. All around the beach there are some campsites as well as apartments which are available in the vicinity.', 8, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 2, 8, 4, 5, 1, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d0119d15/utjeha-busat/\" data-label_1=\"UTJEHA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >UTJEHA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15864336606398.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 12657, 5, '2019-05-14 14:27:16', '2019-05-14 12:27:16', 1, 'utjeha-plaza-rocky-beach_5', 1),
(3757, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Utjeha', 'utjeha', 1, '42.010458', '19.150986', 'Beach Paradiso - Utjeha', 'In the Montenegro region Bar in the small town Utjeha You have a white big stone beach suitable for families. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. Parking is possible only on  a private large parking place or in the camps. The beach is 150 meters long and up to 25 meters wide.  On one side of the beach you also have concrete terraces and a swimming pool. To Get into the crystal clear water you can either go by the beach,  use some steps or simply jump into the blue. The point of swim starts very fast and you can swim away already after 5 meters. On the beach you have some beach infrastructure and some services. You have a beach bar and a restaurant directly on the beach. All around the beach there are some campsites as well as apartments which are available in the vicinity.', 5, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 14, 3, 1, 9, 6, 3, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d0119d15/utjeha-busat/\" data-label_1=\"UTJEHA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >UTJEHA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15864336606398.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 12608, 5, '2019-05-14 14:27:21', '2019-05-14 12:27:21', 1, 'utjeha-plaza-paradiso-utjeha_5', 1),
(3758, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Utjeha', 'utjeha', 1, '42.0133274', '19.151411', 'Beach Uvala Maslina', 'If you like small pebbles Beaches with almost no beach infrastructure but some accommodation in the vicinity with the beach Uvala Maslina near the small town Utjeha you are on the right place. It is located in the Montenegro region Bar. It\'s very easy to reach with your vehicle. There are Some parking places by the road, more are by private parking. To reach the beach from the parking you need to descent 25 meters in height and around 100 meters in length. The path is medium difficult and the beach is suitable for an adventurer user type. The main Surface on the beach are white Pebbles and you also have some concrete terraces. The beach is 20 meters long and around 10 meters wide. The water entry is nice and you can also jump from the concrete terrace. Swimming starts almost immediately. On the beach itself you don\'t have any beach infrastructure. Accommodation is available near the parking in the form of apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 14, 4, 6, 3, 3, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d0119d15/utjeha-busat/\" data-label_1=\"UTJEHA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >UTJEHA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15864336606398.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 15589, 5, '2019-05-14 14:45:28', '2019-05-14 12:45:28', 1, 'utjeha-plaza-uvala-maslina_5', 1),
(3759, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Dobra Voda', 'dobra-voda', 1, '42.034367', '19.142985', 'Beach Veliki Pijesak', 'In the Montenegro town Dobra Voda which means good water you have a very large white pebble Beach. Altough the main surface are pebbles you also have some brown sand mixed within. The beach is located in the region Bar and is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You have 2 large public parking places available almost directly at the beach. They are not for free and will cost you a few euros per day. The beach is 400 meters long and up to 50 meters wide. On one part of the beach you also have concrete terraces. The Water falls here quite quickly which makes the point off swim almost immediately. The water entry is nice and you can also jump from the small pier or use the ladder to go in it. Because this is the town main Beach you have many Beach services available here. If you get hungry or thirsty do you have many restaurants and similar available directly on the beach. Accommodation is also not a problem here, you have plenty of hotels and apartments all around the beach available for your vacation.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 13, 8, 2, 13, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d0519d14/dobra-voda/\" data-label_1=\"DOBRA VODA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >DOBRA VODA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15864519778838.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 30884, 5, '2019-05-14 16:31:46', '2019-05-14 14:31:46', 1, 'dobra-voda-plaza-veliki-pijesak_5', 1),
(3760, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Dobra Voda', 'dobra-voda', 1, '42.0370066166', '19.1429847479', 'Beach Dobra voda', 'In the Montenegro town Dobra Voda which means good water you have two popular beaches. The one we are describing here is the smaller one and since it has no official name we gave it the name Dobra Voda. Altough the main surface are pebbles you also have some brown sand mixed within. You also have some concrete terraces on each side of the main Beach. The beach is located in the region Bar and is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You have 2 large public parking places available almost directly at the beach. They are not for free and will cost you a few euros per day. The first one is only 200 meters away the second one around 500 meters. The beach is 200 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. On one part of the beach you also have concrete terraces. The Water falls here quite quickly which makes the point off swim almost immediately. The water entry is nice and you can also jump from the small pier or use the ladder to go in it. This small Beach is not as well equipped as the bigger one but you have some basic services available. If you get hungry or thirsty you have many restaurants and beach bars or similar available on the bigger beach only a few meters away. Accommodation is also not a problem here, you have plenty of hotels and apartments all around the beach available for your vacation.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 5, 1, 10, 5, 5, 14, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d0519d14/dobra-voda/\" data-label_1=\"DOBRA VODA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >DOBRA VODA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15864519778838.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 16947, 5, '2019-05-14 18:33:37', '2019-05-14 16:33:37', 1, 'dobra-voda-plaza-dobra-voda_5', 1),
(3761, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Bar', 'bar', 1, '42.1003013849', '19.0901023149', 'Beach Topolica', 'If you would like to visit a Montenegro Beach which is located in a town with lots of beach services and many children playgrounds on the beach you should visit the city Bar and the beach Topolica. It is located in the South part of the country montenegro in the region Bar. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park on multiple parking places, some even only a few meters away from the beach. The beach is located near the marina and also near a park where you have lots of trees and grass. The main surface on the beach are Pebbles, but there is even some sand and large stones mixed with in. The beach is 300 meters long can be up to 100 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters. This beach is a true family beach where you have lots of services all around the place. The whole area is very organized and clean. You also have a beach bar, some restaurants and pizzerias near the beach. A luxury hotel is also available directly on the beach and many apartments are nearby.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 12, 11, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d0919d09/bar/\" data-label_1=\"BAR\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BAR WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15865090868790.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 16873, 5, '2019-05-14 20:23:25', '2019-05-14 18:23:25', 1, 'bar-plaza-topolica_5', 1),
(3762, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Bar', 'bar', 1, '42.1042925119', '19.0886378288', 'Beach Žukotrlica', 'Then Montenegro town Bar it\'s known for its commercial Harbor but beside that it\'s also known to have a public beach with many sports fields nearby. Only 20 meters away from the beach you have an actual athletic stadium. The region this beach is located it\'s called Bar, like the town itself. It is very easy To reach this location with any kind of vehicle. You have a very large parking place directly at the beach which can hold more than one hundres vehicles. The beach main surface are large stones, but you also have some Pebbles and some sand. This location is 400 meters long and up to 40 meters wide. The best way to get into the water comfortably is on the little Spots with the sand otherwise you need to go over some large stones. The point of Swimming starts very fast at around 5 meters. On the location you also have a beach bar and a restaurant and this is also the point where you have the most Beach infrastructure. Near the location you also have a hotel and some apartments if you would like to spend your holidays here.', 5, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 1, 13, 8, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d0919d09/bar/\" data-label_1=\"BAR\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BAR WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15865090868790.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 13587, 5, '2019-05-15 09:26:35', '2019-05-15 07:26:35', 1, 'bar-plaza-zukotrlica_5', 1),
(3763, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Bar', 'bar', 1, '42.1113520861', '19.0847539902', 'Beach Šušanj', 'In Montenegro you have many beaches you can select according to your wishes. This Beach which is located in the town Bar and also the region Bar it\'s very unique because of the Pine Forest directly on the beach. There are not many of such kind here around. The name of the beach is Plaža Šušanj and it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can park directly on the beach where you have a large parking place. The main surface of the beach are small Pebbles but you also have some sand mixed with in. You also have a lot of pine trees directly on the beach to protect you from the Sun. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. The total length of the beach is one kilometer and it can be up to 20 meters wide. You have a lot of beach infrastructure and services available directly on the beach. Accommodation is also nearby, mainly in the form of apartments and a few hotels.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 2, 2, 16, 5, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d0919d09/bar/\" data-label_1=\"BAR\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BAR WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15873947049534.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 29448, 5, '2019-05-15 13:10:01', '2019-05-15 11:10:01', 1, 'bar-plaza-susanj_5', 1),
(3764, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Bar', 'bar', 1, '42.116265893', '19.0764015913', 'Beach Mrčele', 'The beach with the name Plaža Mrčele belongs into the category of special beaches. It is very unique the way it presents itself and what surrounds her. It is located in the montenegro region Bar just a little bit outside the town Bar. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options your vehicle. Either You do it by the road or on some private parking places near the beach. From the road you need to descent around 20 in Height to reach the beach. The main surface of the beach are small Pebbles. The total length is 200 meters and it is only 5 meter wide. The inclination of the slope is normal to too steep and swimming starts almost immediately. The beach is surrounded by 2 buildings which are beach bars and there you also have the beach infrastructure and services. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but in the background on the other side of the road, mainly in the form of apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 3, 5, 10, 2, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d0919d09/bar/\" data-label_1=\"BAR\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BAR WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15873947049534.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10255, 5, '2019-05-15 13:11:32', '2019-05-15 11:11:32', 1, 'bar-plaza-mrcele_5', 1),
(3765, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Bar', 'bar', 1, '42.1201550961', '19.0700125694', 'Beach Crvena', 'The beaches in Montenegro are usually made of white Pebbles, but this beach with the name Plaža Crvena is special, it is different, because the Pebbles here are red colored. It is located in the region Bar and it\'s not far away from the town Bar. The beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a parking place just beside the road directly at the beach. To get to the beach you need to take some steps with a height difference of 15 meters.   The main surface on the beach are red small pebbles. The location is 100 meters long and up to 10 meters wide. The water entry is nice and you can swim right away. You have a beach bar directly on the beach where you also have some beach services. Directly on the beach you also have an option to rent some apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 4, 2, 4, 8, 3, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d0919d09/bar/\" data-label_1=\"BAR\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BAR WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15873947049534.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 14482, 5, '2019-05-15 13:12:00', '2019-05-15 11:12:00', 1, 'bar-plaza-crvena_5', 1),
(3766, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Sutomore', 'sutomore', 1, '42.122342', '19.067030', 'Beach Črvanj', 'In this part of Montenegro you have a lot of beaches located just next to the main road. More or less they are pebbles beaches, they are small but very romantic. The same goes for the beach Črvanj. It is located in the region Bar near the village Sutomore. It is very easy to reach with a vehicle and you can park beside the road. The entrance to the beach is very organized and so is the whole place which manages this Beach. The total length of the beach is 200 meters and it is 5 meters wide. The main Surface are pebbles, but you also have some rocks and sand. The water entry is very nice and you can swim right away. You have many Beach services available directly on the beach, as well as restaurant which is famous for good sea food. Apartments on Not available directly on the beach but in the surrounding area.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 2, 10, 2, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d1419d04/sutomore/\" data-label_1=\"SUTOMORE\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >SUTOMORE WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15874038876395.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 12747, 5, '2019-05-15 13:12:36', '2019-05-15 11:12:36', 1, 'sutomore-plaza-crvanj_5', 1),
(3767, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Sutomore', 'sutomore', 1, '42.135502696', '19.0581196547', 'Beach Sutomore', 'The Montenegro town Sutomore is known for its touristic character. It has a very beautiful, one kilometer long sandy Beach which is very attractive to the human eye. The region where the beach is located is called Bar. It\'s very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park. Some do it on the large public parking place, some by the road and some on private places. Altough the main surface is sand you also have some pebbles mixed with in. The maximum wide of the beach is 40 meters. The inclination of the slope is normal so is the water entry and the point of swim is at around 5 meters. You have many Beach infrastructure and beach services available along the whole stretch of the beach. Many different types of restaurants and beach bars are available here. Accommodation is also directly on the beach mainly as hotels or apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 8, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d1419d04/sutomore/\" data-label_1=\"SUTOMORE\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >SUTOMORE WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15874038876395.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 20802, 5, '2019-05-15 14:47:17', '2019-05-15 12:47:17', 1, 'sutomore-plaza-sutomore_5', 1),
(3768, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Sutomore', 'sutomore', 1, '42.139164', '19.029815', 'Beach Štrbina', 'Not far away from the town Sutomore you have a very special Beach called Plaža Štrbina. It is located in the region Bar and is suitable for the adventure usertype. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can leave your car on a  dirt parking ground almost directly on the beach. To access the beach you can use some concrete steps which go around 25 meters of height difference to the beach. The main surface are small Pebbles but you also have some rocks from which you can also jump into the crystal clear water. The total length of the beach is 100 meters and the widness is 15 meters. You have multiple options to enter the water. You can either jump or go by the beach and can start swimming almost immediately. Some beach services are available on the beach but only basic. In the summertime you maybe have here a Beach Bar. Accommodation is also available but only in the form of apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 2, 2, NULL, 3, 12, 4, 6, 8, 4, 2, 13, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d1419d04/sutomore/\" data-label_1=\"SUTOMORE\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >SUTOMORE WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15874038876395.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 14893, 5, '2019-05-15 19:02:42', '2019-05-15 17:02:42', 1, 'sutomore-plaza-strbina_5', 1),
(3769, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Sutomore', 'sutomore', 1, '42.1407061815', '19.0238517523', 'Beach Maljevik', 'Not far away from the town Sutomore you have a very special Beach called Plaža Maljevik. It is special also because of the fact that on the far end the beach is reserved for nudists/ naturists. It is located in the region Bar and is suitable for the adventure usertype. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can leave your car on a  dirt parking ground almost directly on the beach. To access the beach you can use some concrete steps which go around 25 meters of height difference to the beach and about 100 meters in length. The main surface are small Pebbles but you also have some rocks. On some parts you even have some trees. The total length of the beach is 300 meters and the widness is 10 meters. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts dependent on where you are between 10 and 20 meters. Some beach services are available on the beach but only basic. In the summertime you maybe also havehere a Beach Bar. Accommodation is also available but only in the form of apartments and hotels in the neighborhood of the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 3, 10, 4, 6, 12, 3, 2, 16, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d1419d04/sutomore/\" data-label_1=\"SUTOMORE\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >SUTOMORE WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15874038876395.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 19353, 5, '2019-05-15 19:42:28', '2019-05-15 17:42:28', 1, 'sutomore-plaza-maljevik_5', 1),
(3770, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Bar', 'bar', 'bar', 'Čanj', 'canj', 1, '42.1599322557', '19.0005540848', 'Beach Čanj', 'One of the last beaches in the north part of the Montenegro region Bar is the beach Čanj. Here you have a 1 km long sandy beach which can be on some places up to 75 meters wide. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park. Either directly on the beach or on some private parking places. The main surface on the beach is sand, but you have as well some Pebbles and stones mixed with in. The slope on this beach has a normal inclination, the water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 5 meters. You have a lot of beach infrastructure directly on the beach, as well as many types of restaurants and beach bars. If you would like to stay here for longer you have many options, like a hotel directly on the beach for some apartments in the vicinity. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 16, 10, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d1619d00/canj/\" data-label_1=\"ČANJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ČANJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15874748914882.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 25980, 5, '2019-05-15 19:42:34', '2019-05-15 17:42:34', 1, 'canj-plaza-canj_5', 1),
(3771, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Kaluđerac', 'kaluderac', 1, '42.1936315298', '18.9646232128', 'Beach Buljarica', 'In the Montenegro region Budva near the village Kaluderac you have a very nice Beach called Plaža Buljarica. It is a little bit unique because you can actually park directly on the beach, that\'s also the reason why it is very popular amongst the motorhome owners. This whole location is very easy to reach whit any kind of vehicle. Because this area is so huge you don\'t have any problem to park your car directly on the beach. the main Surface on the beach is brown sand but you also have some Pebbles mixed with in. The total Length is a few kilometers and on some places it can be up to 40 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming at around 10 meters. You also have some beach services available, but not on the whole stretch of the beach only near the village. Restaurants and beach bars are available directly on the beach. You have many options to stay here for longer, where you can choose either to stay in apartments or on a campsite.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 17, 8, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2118d97/kaluderac/\" data-label_1=\"KALUĐERAC\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KALUĐERAC WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15874787366603.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 20113, 5, '2019-05-16 11:06:54', '2019-05-16 09:06:54', 1, 'kaluderac-plaza-buljarica_5', 1),
(3772, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Petrovac na Moru', 'petrovac-na-moru', 1, '42.2006589174', '18.9506059885', 'Beach Lučice', 'The Montenegro Beach Lučice has got to be one of the most beautiful beaches of this Mediterranean country. You have here a perfect harmony between crystal clear water, brown sand and pine trees all around it. It is located in the region Budva, near the town Petrovac na Moru. It is very easy to reach any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park. A large parking place is located directly at the beach with some pine trees, one is a little bit far away. Beside the brown sand you will also find some small pebbles on the beach and rocks on the edges. This beauty is 200 meters long and can be up to 40 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming right away. You have lots of beach Services here, our children playground is also available. Renting a sunbed and a umbrella is not the problem here. You also have a beach bar and a restaurant directly on the beach. Accommodation, mainly in the form of apartments and hotels is on the beach not available but in the city itself some 500 meters away.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 2, 10, 8, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2118d95/petrovac/\" data-label_1=\"PETROVAC NA MORU\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >PETROVAC NA MORU WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15874787366603.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 26448, 5, '2019-05-16 12:09:58', '2019-05-16 10:09:58', 1, 'petrovac-na-moru-plaza-lucice_5', 1),
(3773, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Petrovac na Moru', 'petrovac-na-moru', 1, '42.2061387', '18.9386159', 'Beach Petrovac', 'The Montenegro Beach Petrovac na more belongs to one of the most beautiful beaches of this Mediterranean country. It is a very famous and popular destination for the tourists. The water Here is crystal clear and the sand has a little bit of a red tone. It is located in the region Budva, directly in the town Petrovac na Moru. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large public ground 200 meters away from the beach. In the summertime account to pay parking fees. Beside the red sand you will also find some small pebbles on the beach and rocks on the edges. This beauty is 500 meters long and can be up to 20 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming right away. You have lots of beach Services here. Renting a sunbed and a umbrella is not the problem here. You also have a beach bar and many types of restaurants directly ot the beach. Accommodation is available here in many forms.  You have lots of apartments and hotels to choose from. ', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 9, 5, 3, 14, 5, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2118d95/petrovac/\" data-label_1=\"PETROVAC NA MORU\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >PETROVAC NA MORU WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15885840154144.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 27996, 5, '2019-05-16 14:49:57', '2019-05-16 12:49:57', 1, 'petrovac-na-moru-plaza-petrovac_5', 1),
(3774, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Drobnići', 'drobnici', 1, '42.2341363', '18.9031095', 'Beach Drobni Pijesak', 'Some beaches in Montenegro really take your breath, words are hard to find to describe these Beauty. The beach plaža Drobni Pijesak is one of them and it belongs to the top five beaches of Montenegro. It is located in the region Budva near the village Drobnići. It is very easy to reach with your vehicle but be advised that the road, which is paved, to the parking place is very steep. You have two parking places here. From The Parking Place to the beach it will take you 200 meters and 40 meters of height difference. The beach is 200 meters long and can be up to 30 meters wide. The main surface are small white pebbles mixed with some brown sand and some rocks on the edges. With the Crystal clear water the beach is really and attraction. The water entry is very nice and you can swim away almost immediately. You have some beach infrastructure available here, as well as a few restaurants and a beach bar. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but in the vicinity of the main road.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 5, 9, 10, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2418d90/drobnici/\" data-label_1=\"DROBNIĆI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >DROBNIĆI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15885870165773.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 25166, 5, '2019-05-16 19:02:24', '2019-05-16 17:02:24', 1, 'drobnici-plaza-drobni-pijesak_5', 1),
(3775, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Sveti Stefan', 'sveti-stefan', 1, '42.24529004', '18.89709278', 'Beach Crvena Glavica', 'The beaches in Montenegro, especially in the region Budva are famous for its beauty and are very popular among the beach ehusiasts. Although the coastline here is very steep and rocky there are some places where the nature has created some eye catching beauty. This is also true for the beach plaža Crvena Glavica which is located near the famous village Sveti Stefan. The beach is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. In the Summertime you need to trespass a camp before you reach the final parking place. The road to the parking is made partly of concrete partly of dirt and is sometimes narrow and Steep. To get to the beach from the parking you need to take a small path some 20 meters in height difference. On the beach itself you have as a surface small pebbles, some rocks and also a concrete Terrace. All together the beach is 100 m long and some 15 meters Wide. The water entry is very nice and You have multiple options to get into the water and swimming starts immediately. The beach is very organized and you have some beach infrastructure available as well as a restaurant directly on the beach. The closest accommodation is in the form of a camp or some apartments nearby the road to the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 2, 7, 4, 5, 8, 4, 2, 13, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2518d90/sveti-stefan/\" data-label_1=\"SVETI STEFAN\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >SVETI STEFAN WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15885943073518.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 18796, 5, '2019-05-16 19:02:29', '2019-05-16 17:02:29', 1, 'sveti-stefan-plaza-crvena-glavica_5', 1);
