(3776, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Sveti Stefan', 'sveti-stefan', 1, '42.2561277', '18.8948571', 'Beach Sveti Stefan', 'The most famous beach in Montenegro has got to be the beach Sveti Stefan. It is a real tourist magnet and a very special Beach but also a very expensive one. it\'s located in the region Budva. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park directly on the beach, but be advised that the parking fee is pretty high. For a normal car they charge 2 euros per hour, for a van or a motorhome you pay 10 euros per hour. For a bus you pay even more. The beach itself is a red Pebble Beach with some sand mix between, and also some rocks on the borders. Here you have actually two beaches one is open for the public the other one is only open for hotel guests. The total length is 750 meters and it can be up to 30 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming almost immediately. You can also rent some beach equipment here, but be advised that this is the most expensive beach and renting a first row sunbeds and umbrella will cost you 50 Euros. Beach services are also available here and are on the highest level. Restaurants and beach bars are as well located on the beach directly. You also have many options for accommodation mainly in the form of hotels and apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 2, 2, 15, 7, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2518d90/sveti-stefan/\" data-label_1=\"SVETI STEFAN\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >SVETI STEFAN WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15885943073518.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 22940, 5, '2019-05-16 20:49:56', '2019-05-16 18:49:56', 1, 'sveti-stefan-plaza-sveti-stefan_5', 1),
(3777, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Pržno', 'przno', 1, '42.268724', '18.892268', 'Beach Pržno', 'Not far away from the most famous Beach in Montenegro you have the small town Pržno. The whole region Budva is full of one of the most beautiful beaches in Montenegro. The beach Pržno, although it is not as famous it is also an eye catcher. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can leave your car on some public parking places some 200 meters away around 20 meters in height difference from the beach. The main surface on the beach is sand but you also have other materials like pebbles mixed with in. On one side of the beach you also have wooden Terraces. The water entry on this beach is very nice and you also can start swimming almost immediately. Many Beach services are available directly on the beach. You even have a swimming pool close to the beach which you can use if you are a hotel guest. The one thing what makes this beach special are the restaurants which are placed very close the beach and with their decoration they create a very romantic atmosphere. Many types of accommodation is available all around the beach, mainly as hotels or apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 4, 5, 11, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2718d89/przno/\" data-label_1=\"PRŽNO\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >PRŽNO WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15922212083082.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 30538, 5, '2019-05-16 21:12:59', '2019-05-16 19:12:59', 1, 'przno-plaza-przno_5', 1),
(3778, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Pržno', 'przno', 1, '42.275194', '18.887131', 'Beach Kamenovo', 'The beach Kamenovo is located on the famous coastline of the region Budva. The nearest small town is Pržno which is not far away from the most famous Beach in montenegro, the beach Sveti Stefan. It is located by the main road from which you can also access the public parking place, which is payable in the summertime. To get to the beach you need to take a 200 meter long path which has a height difference of 15 meters. Total length of the beach is 300 meters and maximum width is 50 meters. The main surface on the beach is brown Sand, but pebbles are also mixed withinn. You have a very nice water entry here and you can start swimming almost immediately. Beach services are available in many forms on the beach itself. You also have a beach bar and a restaurant on the beach but no accommodation is available here directly but in the small town Pržno, where you have many hotels and apartments at your disposal.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 5, 4, 12, 9, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2718d89/przno/\" data-label_1=\"PRŽNO\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >PRŽNO WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15886034695145.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 16979, 5, '2019-05-16 21:31:27', '2019-05-16 19:31:27', 1, 'przno-plaza-kamenovo_5', 1),
(3779, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Bečići', 'becici', 1, '42.2808140516', '18.8730043173', 'Beach Bečićka', 'In Montenegro you can have very different beaches. This Montenegro Beach it\'s actually 2 kilometers long and up to 50 meters wide so you really have lots of space to find your spot. There are not many such beaches in this country so if you prefer such a beach you should visit the the small town Bečići located in the Budva region. This beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can actually Park directly on the beach where to have lots of space, but in the summer time it is payable. The main surface on the beach is sand but you also have small Pebbles of different sizes and colors mixed with in. The water entry is very nice here and you can start swimming already after 10 meters. This is a very popular area you have lots of beach services and Beach infrastructure available on the whole stretch of the beach. Children will also love this place, just next to the beach a large children playground. Many types of restaurants and beach bars are present here. Accommodation is available also in many different forms. You have lots of luxury Apartments and hotels as well some resorts located directly on the beach.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 9, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2818d87/becici/\" data-label_1=\"BEČIĆI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BEČIĆI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15886656324210.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 25885, 5, '2019-05-17 09:33:02', '2019-05-17 07:33:02', 1, 'becici-plaza-becicka_5', 1),
(3780, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Budva', 'budva', 1, '42.2851094', '18.848943', 'Beach Slovenska', 'The town budva is famous for its very long white Pebbles beach with a very clear and blue water. This Montenegro Beach is located in the region of budva and it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can actually Park directly on the beach where you have a very large parking place available. Access to the beach it\'s easy. The main surface on the beach white Pebbles but you also have some large stones, concrete and some small amount of sand. The water entry no matter where you are it\'s very easy and you can swim away after only 10 meters. The beach is more than one kilometer long and on some places up to 30 meters wide. All along the beach you have many beach services and beach infrastructure available. You don\'t need to worry about beach bars and restaurants, here you have plenty of them and they come in all forms and shapes. The same is true if you intend to spend your vacation here, you have a lot of accommodation available, where you can choose a variety of hotels and apartments, some very close to the beach.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 2, 1, 17, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2918d84/budva/\" data-label_1=\"BUDVA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BUDVA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15886694516512.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 21156, 5, '2019-05-17 10:49:54', '2019-05-17 08:49:54', 1, 'budva-plaza-slovenska_5', 1),
(3781, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Budva', 'budva', 1, '42.278031', '18.836361', 'Beach Ričardova glava', 'The montenegro town Budva has got to be the most famous town in this beautiful Mediterranean country. Not only is the town very attractive you also have a few beaches that will  blow your mind. The beach we are describing here is called Plaža Ričardova glava and it is located in the center of the town Budva. It is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a few public payable parking places where you can leave your car. It takes you 200 meters to reach the beach. The beach is 150 meters long and on some places 25 meters wide. The main surface are Pebbles, but you also have some concrete and some sand. The water entry is on some places not that comfortable, because you have a lot of stones and rocks on the bottom. You can either go into the water from the beach or you can jump from the pier. You have some beach infrastructure and Beach services available here. Many restaurants and beach bars are on the beach or near the beach, as well as a hotel and some apartments. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 5, 1, 9, 6, 2, 16, 3, 0, NULL, '<a name=\"windy-webcam-timelapse-player\" data-id=\"1494589401\" data-play=\"day\" href=\"https://windy.com/webcams/1494589401\" target=\"_blank\">Bečići: Будванская Ривьера</a><script async type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://webcams.windy.com/webcams/public/embed/script/player.js\"></script>', NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2918d84/budva/\" data-label_1=\"BUDVA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BUDVA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15886694516512.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 16643, 5, '2019-05-17 13:46:05', '2019-05-17 11:46:05', 1, 'budva-plaza-ricardova-glava_5', 1),
(3782, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Budva', 'budva', 'budva', 'Budva', 'budva', 1, '42.276995', '18.831889', 'Beach Mogren', 'The montenegro town Budva has got to be the most famous town in this beautiful Mediterranean country. Not only is the town very attractive you also have a few beaches that will  blow your mind. The beach we are describing here is called Plaža Mogren and it is located near the center of the town Budva. It is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a few public payable parking places where you can leave your car. It takes you 500 meters to reach the beach and path to the beach is very attractive and stretches along the rocky coastline. The beach is 300 meters long and on some places 30 meters wide. It is Divided Into two parts and you need to take a cave Bridge to reach the second small Beach. The main surface here is sand but you also have some pebbles and some rocks. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters. You can also jump from some Cliffs into the crystal blue water. You have some beach infrastructure and Beach services available here. A beach bar is also located directly on the beach. Accommodation is on the beach not available but in the center of the town not far away, mainly in the form of hotels and apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 8, 1, 12, 7, 2, 4, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2918d84/budva/\" data-label_1=\"BUDVA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BUDVA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15886694516512.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 29833, 5, '2019-05-17 13:56:21', '2019-05-17 11:56:21', 1, 'budva-plaza-mogren_5', 1),
(3783, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Kotor', 'kotor', 'kotor', 'Prijevor', 'prijevor', 1, '42.283180', '18.803578', 'Beach Jaz', 'The Montenegro region Kotor near the village Prijevor has very nice and attractive pebbles Beach to offer. The beach is very accessible with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road directly at the beach. The beach is 1 kilometers long and up to 40 meters wide. Although the main surface on the beach are small Pebbles you also have some sand and on some parts even rocks at the beach. The water entry here is very nice and because the water gets here deep very fast swimming starts almost immediately. Because of so many beach bars and different types of restaurants available on the beach he also have many beach infrastructure and different services available. Not only can you rent here a sunbed you also have many water equipment to rent, like sea scooter and similar. In the background of the beach there is also a camping ground and you have a hotel and some apartments available for your location. ', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 1, 16, 8, 2, 2, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2918d84/budva/\" data-label_1=\"BUDVA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BUDVA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15902397862287.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 16325, 5, '2019-05-17 14:30:06', '2019-05-17 12:30:06', 1, 'prijevor-plaza-jaz_5', 1),
(3784, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Kotor', 'kotor', 'kotor', 'Krimovica', 'krimovica', 1, '42.2692322731', '18.7843948603', 'Beach Ploče', 'This Montenegro Beach has got to be one of the most attractive beaches in this mediterranean country. Organization on this beach is on the highest level. It is suitable for many generations, from small children, to party enthusiast, families and even the ones who just love to have some peace on the beach and enjoy the high-end beach services. It is located in the region Kotar, near the village Krimovica. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you have a few hundred parking places at your disposal. The main surface on the beach is concrete, but you also have some parts with rocks and Pebbles. The water entry it\'s very nice and you either can jump into the crystal clear water or use the beach for entry. Swimming starts almost immediately. You have lots of beach services and Beach infrastructure available on this nice location. In the summertime, the ones who love to party, a part of the beach is reserved also for this activity. You also have many swimming pools here, some of them suitable for small children, some for adults. A restaurant and many beach bars of different types are available on the beach directly. Accommodation is not available on the beach but you can arrange with the owners to rent some apartments or other similar facilities.', 8, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 3, 12, 6, 5, 13, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d2818d77/krimovica/\" data-label_1=\"KRIMOVICA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KRIMOVICA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15902418011108.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10142, 5, '2019-05-17 17:31:01', '2019-05-17 15:31:01', 1, 'krimovica-plaza-ploce_5', 1),
(3785, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Tivat', 'tivat', 'tivat', 'Đuraševići', 'đurasevici', 1, '42.3855543137', '18.6843377352', 'Beach Pržno', 'The Montenegro region Tivat has a very short mediterranean coastline and not many beaches. The one beach we have visited is called plaža Pržno and it is located near the Village Đuraševići. It is Sandy Beach with one of the most purest beach sands in Montenegro, what it makes it really unique. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have lots of parking spaces almost directly at the beach. It is a 300 meters long and up to 30 meters wide beach with a very small incline. Some pine trees are also on the beach and are located around the restaurant. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts pretty late at around 50 meters, which makes this beach ideal for small children to play in safely. You have lots of beach infrastructure available here. A restaurant and a beach bar are as well located directly on the beach. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but in the village nearby in the form of apartments.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 4, 2, 12, 7, 1, 9, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d3918d69/durasevici/\" data-label_1=\"ĐURAŠEVIĆI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >ĐURAŠEVIĆI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15922268969914.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 52, 5, '2019-05-17 18:20:43', '2019-05-17 16:20:43', 1, 'durasevici-plaza-przno_5', 1),
(3786, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Herceg Novi', 'herceg-novi', 'herceg-novi', 'Radovići', 'radovici', 1, '42.386282', '18.666523', 'Beach Luštica', 'The beach Plaža Luštica, which is located in the region Herceg Novi is located on a very special location. It is part of a new luxury village with a modern marina and harbor. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park on multiple parking places near the marina itself. This is the only option where you can park, the Village itself is private property. To get to the beach from the parking you need to walk through the marina for around 400 meters. The main surface of the beach are small Pebbles with some larger mixed with in, and you also have some rocks. The total length of the beach is 200 meters and it can be up to 30 meters wide. In some places the inclination of the slope is a little bit steep on some normal. The water entry is nice and you can start swimming immediately. You have many Beach services available on the beach directly. A beach bar is also located. Restaurants and other similar types, as well as shops are located in the marina itself. Accommodation is also possible in the village in the form of apartments, but you can actually buy a new apartment yourself.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 5, 7, 1, 10, 7, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d3918d67/radovici/\" data-label_1=\"RADOVIĆI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >RADOVIĆI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15903491451338.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 12477, 5, '2019-05-17 20:44:10', '2019-05-17 18:44:10', 1, 'radovici-plaza-lustica_5', 1),
(3787, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Herceg Novi', 'herceg-novi', 'herceg-novi', 'Merdari', 'merdari', 1, '42.3776042461', '18.6523979902', 'Beach Velja Špilja', 'The beach Velja Špilja is for the ones who love to be in the nature without any services available nearby. It is located in the region Herceg Novi near the village Merdari. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. The final part of the road is a dirt one. You can park the vehicle directly at the beach and take a 100 meter walk some 50 meters in height difference to the beach. The path itself is on one part a little bit tricky and dangerous but with enough caution it is possible to manage it. The main surface on the beach is brown sand but you also have some small Pebbles. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. On the beach itself and in the surrounding you don\'t have any Beach infrastructure or any beach services available. The same is true for accommodation which can be found in the neighboring villages.', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 2, 2, NULL, 3, 7, 4, 4, 8, 6, 2, 3, 2, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d3918d62/merdari/\" data-label_1=\"MERDARI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >MERDARI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15903898095003.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10775, 5, '2019-05-18 10:06:18', '2019-05-18 08:06:18', 1, 'merdari-plaza-velja-spilja_5', 1),
(3788, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Herceg Novi', 'herceg-novi', 'herceg-novi', 'Merdari', 'merdari', 1, '42.382423', '18.652483', 'Beach Almara', 'Near the village Mardari in the Montenegro region Herceg Novi there is a 200 meters long pebbles beach with a luxury Beach Club. If you\'re the one who likes a small Pebble Beach and you also like to have lots of high standard Beach services available on the beach this beach is the right one for you. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and to have the parking directly by the beach. This location is separated into three parts. In the middle you have the beach club and on the borders the two pebbles beaches. On the beach you have 10 meters of widness. The water entry here is very nice swimming starts at around 30 to 40 meters where are you have some sand on the bottom. Some infrastructure is on the beach but more is in the beach club itself. You also have a very nice Beach Bar and a restaurant here. Accommodation is not available here but on the beach Luštica around 1 km away.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 2, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 2, 2, 10, 3, 5, 7, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d3918d62/merdari/\" data-label_1=\"MERDARI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >MERDARI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15903898095003.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10709, 5, '2019-05-18 10:06:22', '2019-05-18 08:06:22', 1, 'merdari-plaza-almara_5', 1),
(3789, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Kotar', 'kotar', 'kotar', 'Kotar', 'kotar', 1, '42.4296230078', '18.7678080797', 'Beach Žuta', 'If you intend to visit Montenegro the town Kotor which is located in the famous Kotor Bay should be on your list. The whole Bay is very unique and offers you spectacular views, but you can also visit the famous Kotor Old Town and after that of course enjoy also some time on the beach. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place, which is payable, directly on the beach and near the attractions. Itself is made of several material, on some part you have Pebbles on some you have concrete.  Alltogether it is 300 meters long and up to 15 meters wide. The water entry is very nice no matter where you are and you can either go into the water by the beach or you can jump from a pier. The point of swim starts immediately. You have some beach infrastructure and services available directly on the beach. It\'s also possible to rent some water sport equipment. A restaurant and beach bars are also located here. For your accommodation you have here mainly hotels and apartments nearby.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 1, 1, 12, 4, 5, 14, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d4218d77/kotor/\" data-label_1=\"KOTOR\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >KOTOR WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15903985775459.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 9204, 5, '2019-05-18 13:50:41', '2019-05-18 11:50:41', 1, 'kotar-plaza-zuta_5', 1),
(3790, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Herceg Novi', 'herceg-novi', 'herceg-novi', 'Morinj', 'morinj', 1, '42.488260', '18.651181', 'Beach Morinj', 'In the famous  Montenegro Kotor Bay which should be on your list is a must visit if you like nice beaches. The whole Bay is very unique and offers you spectacular views. The best to explore It Is by a boat which will take you to all sightseeing\'s here around. Around The Bay you don\'t have much beaches but there are some you can visit if you are in this region. One of them is called Plaža Morinj. The beach is very interesting mainly because of the forms and shapes it offers you to enjoy. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place directly on the beach. The Beach Maine surface are small Pebbles but you also have a lot of grass and some trees. it is 200 meters long and up to 25 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and The point of swim starts at around 40 meters. You have some beach puerto Rico infrastructure and services available directly on the beach. A restaurant and a beach bar are also located here. For your accommodation you have here mainly hotels and apartments nearby and if you would like to stay in a camp you also have this option.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 8, 2, 1, 10, 6, 1, 8, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d4818d64/morinj/\" data-label_1=\"MORINJ\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >MORINJ WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15904073055302.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 21480, 5, '2019-05-18 16:11:27', '2019-05-18 14:11:27', 1, 'morinj-plaza-morinj_5', 1),
(3791, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Herceg Novi', 'herceg-novi', 'herceg-novi', 'Jošice', 'josice', 1, '42.4600411', '18.6757248', 'Beach Adriatica', 'If you would like to enjoy the best possible views on large ocean cruiser ships passing by in the Kotor bay and you would also like to be on a very special and attractive Beach, then the beach Adriatica is the one for you. It is located in the montenegro region Herceg Novi near the village Jošice. It is very easy to reach any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road directly on the beach. Here you have many different surface on the beach. The main surfaced are Pebbles, but you also have some white sand and concrete. The total length is 100 meters and it can be up to 50 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts between 0 and 15 meters. On the beach you have all the beach infrastructure needed to give you a comfortable stay. A restaurant and a beach bar are located directly on the beach. Accommodation is available in the vicinity of the beach in the form of apartments.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 1, 8, 9, 1, 15, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d4618d67/josice/\" data-label_1=\"JOŠICE\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >JOŠICE WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15904118689943.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 16440, 5, '2019-05-18 17:07:00', '2019-05-18 15:07:00', 1, 'josice-plaza-adriatica_5', 1),
(3792, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Herceg Novi', 'herceg-novi', 'herceg-novi', 'Bijela', 'bijela', 1, '42.4526631832', '18.6585241556', 'Beach Bijela', 'The beach Bijela is located in the region Herceg Novi on the coastline of the Kotor bay. It is very easy to reach the beach but more difficult to find a parking place. The most recommended way to park is on a private ground. The beach main surface are Pebbles but you also have some concrete. All together it is 200 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The Inclination of the beach is very small. You have a very nice water entry and the point of swim is between 0 and 15 meters. You have some basic beach infrastructure available here. A restaurant is also located near the beach and for accommodation you have apartments and a few hotels at your disposal.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 14, 2, 1, 10, 5, 1, 15, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d4618d64/bijela/\" data-label_1=\"BIJELA\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >BIJELA WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15904756644463.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 27412, 5, '2019-05-18 19:15:22', '2019-05-18 17:15:22', 1, 'bijela-plaza-bijela_5', 1),
(3793, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Herceg Novi', 'herceg-novi', 'herceg-novi', 'Sasovići', 'sasovici', 1, '42.4532586336', '18.5662078857', 'Beach Authentic', 'Most of the beaches in the Montenegro Kotar bay are less or more artificial, but this Beach, which is located near the village Sasovići in the region Herceg Novi is very different and it\'s totally nature made. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road. The path to the beach is 50 meters long and has a height difference of 15 meters. This beach is more suitable for the adventurer type of user. It is 75 meters long and only 5 meters wide. The main surface are small pebbles but you also have some rocks and some concrete. Trees are also residing on the beach. The water entry is nice and swimming starts at 5 meters. You don\'t have any Beach infrastructure here also no restaurants or beach bars but some accommodation in the form of apartments and hotels in the vicinity.', 4, 1, NULL, NULL, 3, 2, 2, NULL, 1, 12, 2, 4, 7, 2, 2, 3, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d4718d57/sasovici/\" data-label_1=\"SASOVIĆI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >SASOVIĆI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15904813957470.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10386, 5, '2019-05-18 20:48:44', '2019-05-18 18:48:44', 1, 'sasovici-plaza-authentic_5', 1),
(3794, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Herceg Novi', 'herceg-novi', 'herceg-novi', 'Meljine', 'meljine', 1, '42.4543372', '18.5633732', 'Beach Meljine', 'In the small town Meljine which is located in the Montenegro region Herceg Novi there is a beach with the same name as the town which is suitable for families. No matter what kind of vehicle you are driving you will find many options to park it close to the beach. On the beach there are a few different surfaces like the brown sand and some concrete plate. The total length of the beach is 200 meters and it can be 10 meters wide. The slope has a small inclination here and you can either jump from the concrete plate to the water or use the beach and start swimming after around 10 meters. The water entry is very nice and you have small stones on the bottom. Some beach infrastructure is also available here and nearby is also a Marina/ harbor. If you get hungry or thirsty you have a beach bar and a restaurant directly on the beach itself. Accommodation is here available in the form of apartments and hotels and it is only a few meters away.\n', 1, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 7, 2, 1, 10, 3, 5, 15, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d4618d56/meljine/\" data-label_1=\"MELJINE\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >MELJINE WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15904813957470.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 24274, 5, '2019-05-18 21:00:50', '2019-05-18 19:00:50', 1, 'meljine-plaza-meljine_5', 1),
(3795, 3, 'EU', 'ME', 'montenegro', 'Herceg Novi', 'herceg-novi', 'herceg-novi', 'Igalo', 'igalo', 1, '42.4583431', '18.5195988', 'Beach Igalo', 'The beach in the town igalo is a true City Beach with lots of beach infrastructure and services all around the beach. It is famous for being the former residence of the Yugoslavian leader Tito, where also a villa is located. The beach belongs to the region Herceg Novi and it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can park on a large payable parking place almost directly at the beach. The beach is artificial made and has a lot of shapes and forms. The main surface here is concrete. The beach is totally flat cancel but at the water entry point there is a sudden drop. So you can either use the ledder or simply jump into the water. The total length of the beach is 500 meters and it is up to 20 meters wide. The beach is separated into a few parts. You have lots of beach infrastructure and services available here. Many beach bars and restaurants as well as shops are present on the beach or near the Beach. Accommodation is available here in the form of hotels and apartments.', 8, 1, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, 2, NULL, 1, 10, 3, 2, 14, 5, 4, 15, 3, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<a class=\"weatherwidget-io\" href=\"https://forecast7.com/en/42d4618d53/herceg-novi/\" data-label_1=\"HERCEG NOVI\" data-label_2=\"WEATHER\" data-icons=\"Climacons Animated\" data-theme=\"original\" >HERCEG NOVI WEATHER</a>\n<script>\n!function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(!d.getElementById(id)){js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\'https://weatherwidget.io/js/widget.min.js\';fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}}(document,\'script\',\'weatherwidget-io-js\');\n</script>', 'https://seatemperature.info/widget/15904813957470.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 26441, 5, '2019-05-18 21:27:33', '2019-05-18 19:27:33', 1, 'igalo-plaza-igalo_5', 1),
