INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1, 'Beach Zambratija is a 500 meter long beach and is located in the village of the same name. Along the beach you can find a campsite with mobile homes, a parking lot with a total space for 50 vehicles, and only 10 m distance from the beach, lots of accommodation facilities and of course some catering options. \r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\nThe beach itself is made of sand, so if you like the feel of sand on the body it\'s just perfect for you. Because of the infrastructure it is especially suitable for families with children, so you can compete with your youth in some beach building art.  To reach the point of swim take into account to walk a distance of at least 30 meters. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nOn the beach you can of course enjoy the beach volleyball, football or compete in basketball. Those one who don\'t admire the sand, also have the opportunity to spread their towel on the concrete ramp, which is near the former holiday home. If you like some rocky beaches, there are plenty in the vicinity. There you will find some privacy and some shade under the bushy pine trees, as well as some soft grass, when you get tired of hard surfaces. The beach water is very clean, some times crystal blue. If you are a naturist beach lover, you will even find this type of the beach in the vicinity. \r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\nIn the nearby village of Katoro there are yet slides available, pools, tennis courts, table tennis, mini golf, in short, a plenty of fun and sport options. When you get tired under the sun, don\'t worry, you can find refreshment and coolness in restaurants, hotels or the numerous bars where fresh fish never  runs out. They also serve lots of domestic and foreign specialities, and of course all kind of pizzas.  However, for the case you run out of something there is a small store in Zambratija. If the small store is not enough for you, just go towards Katoro or  Bašanija, in the direction of Savudrija, to find a super store. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nThe city is known for an evening of musical entertainment. The tourist association organizes many  various animations, like \"fisherman Evening\", city walks, trips by bicycle, even a golf courses is nearby. We also recommend a visit to the wine road. For those one, who are scuba divers lovers, and enjoy researching the underwater world, the beach has some attractive locations to offer, as well as marina nearby.\r\n', 7, 'en', 1),
(4, 'Welcome to the beach Paralia Astir. It is located in the town of Alexandroupoli of the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. It is a sandy beach, but you also have some pebbles mixed with in. The parking is only 50 m away from the beach, has a capacity of 70 vehicles, and it is located next to the road. The access to the parking is very easy, no matter what the vehicle. The tottal length of the beach is 300 meters, the maximum width is 15 meters. Inclination on the beach is normal, the water entry is comfortable and the point of swim is already at 3 meters.&nbsp; Next to the beach there is a hotel complex with a swimming pool, a children playground and many other amenities. It&#39;s a family beach and suitable for older children, not so much for the small ones, because of the deep water. Accommodation is also available in apartments, rooms or in a camp, which is nearby. Some beach infrastructure is also available on the beach, but more is at your disposal in the hotel complex. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3388, 'en', 1),
(5, 'Welcome to the beach Paralia Reina. In the region of Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, near the city Alexandroupoli, you can visit with your family the sandy beach Reina. It&#39;s a very long beach, more than 1 km long, with a width of 20 m, and it&#39;s just perfect running down the sandy beach. There is no natural shadow, so bring your parasol with you. The accommodation and the restaurants are right next to the beach. Accommodation is available in many forms, mainly as hotels and apartments, some rooms and even a camp are as well available. The parking is huge as well, which makes it ideal for motorhomes, and you can park right in front of the beach, only a few meters away. Inclination on the beach is normal, and you have a very nice water entry. The water gets deep very quickly, and you can start swimming almost right away. All the necessary beach infrastructure is available here, but don&#39;t expect too much, it&#39;s only basic. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3389, 'en', 1),
(6, 'Welcome to the beach Alexander. This beach is a true explorer beach. Why, because the path to the beach is difficult. Parts of the stairs are broken, so be careful.&nbsp;Be advised to be careful when going down the path.&nbsp;The beach is located in the city of Alexandroupoli, which is part of the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Right in front of the beach you have a very large parking place, which is also very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, even a motorhome. It&#39;s a pebble beach with nice reddish 10m high rocks in the background. It&#39;s a really unique beach. 100 meters is the length and 10 meters the widthness of the beach. The entry to the water is nice and you can swim right away. Beach infrastructure is not present on the beach. Accommodation is available only a few meters away in the form of a hotel, which is also a casino. If you prefer apartments, they are also available nearby. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3390, 'en', 1),
(7, 'Welcome to the beach Anapafseos.&nbsp;You can find this 2 km long and 20 wide beach just outside the town of Alexandroupoli in the region of Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, which located in the far east part of Greece. Parking is available down the whole stretch of the beach, motorhomes will also find a place to park. Some parking spots are organized; some are more free. It is a sandy beach with some&nbsp;pebbles, and a red rock formation, of around 5 to 10 meters&rsquo; height in the background.&nbsp;Restaurants and accommodation, also a hotel are right on the beach. Some beach infrastructure is available here, but it is mostly concentrated around the restaurants. The slope inclination is normal, you have a nice water entry, and swimming starts already at 3 metres. If you prefer apartments for your accommodation, the closest ones are only 100 metres away. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3391, 'en', 1),
(8, 'Welcome to the Greek beach Makri.&nbsp;Paralia Makri is still inside the authority of the town Alexandroupoli and belongs to the Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki region. It is a&nbsp;beach with a harbour, restaurants and a very nice surrounding in the heart of many olive trees. It is suitable for families who love sand, pebbles and small shells on the beach. The parking is paved and suitable also for motorhomes. It&#39;s only 50 metres away from the beach. If you like long beaches, this one will be just right for you, since it&#39;s 500 metres long and has a maximum width of 25 metres. The slope on the beach is normal, and the point of swim is already at 3 metres. You also have some beach infrastructure here, more is available near the restaurants and beach bars. Accommodation is only available in the form of apartments and rooms, and is a few hundred metres away in the village Makri. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3392, 'en', 1),
(9, 'Welcome to the Greek beach&nbsp;Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s. The city&nbsp;Alexandroupoli and the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki is known for many sandy beaches, and paralia Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s is one of them. This family beach has a lot of beach infrastructure to offer, which will make your stay as pleasant as possible. Because there is no natural shade available on the beach, you can rent some deckchairs and parasols by the beach bars. It is a very long beach, around 2 kilometres, with a maximum width of 40 meters. The restaurants and the beach bars are located directly on the beach. The road to the beach is in a good shape and you can park right in front of the beach, only a few meters away. This beach has a normal slope, a very nice water entry and you can expect to start swimming already at only 5 meters. Accommodation is also available nearby, mainly as apartments and rooms. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3393, 'en', 1),
(10, 'Welcome to the Greek beach Dikellon. The last very long beach, many kilometres long with a width of 25 metres, in Alexandroupoli, and the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki is the beach Dikellon. This beach is very easy to reach and you can park by the road, right in front of the beach. This family beach has very little infrastructure, most of it is concentrated around the beach bars. The restaurants and beach bars are located either on the beach, or near, and are available alongside the whole stretch of the beach. The main surface on the beach are small pebbles, natural shadow, like trees, are not present here. Beach slope is normal, water entry is comfortable and the point of swim is at around 5 metres. Some accommodation is also available here, but only as apartments or rooms. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3394, 'en', 1),
(11, 'Welcome to be Greek gravel beach Sapes. The only beach the town Sapes calls its own is the paralia Sapes. Still in the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki this beach is more suitable for the ones who seek adventure, before comfort. Here there is basically no infrastructure, but there is an archaeological site just nearby, called Choros Archea. The beach itself is made of mostly pebbles. Parking is only by the roadside, no official parking.&nbsp;It has a length of 1 kilometre and the maximum width is 20 metres. The inclination on the beach is normal, the water entry is comfortable and the point of swim is at 20 metres. No accommodation is available for this beach, not nearby, but a few kilometres away. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3395, 'en', 1),
(12, 'Welcome to a really nice sandy family beach, called Paralia Kryoneri.. Located in the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, near the town Maronia, it offers a huge parking place just in front of the beach. Children will love this beauty, but watch out for the cliffs, on some parts they get really high. The water is shallow, and so perfect for small children to play safely in the water. The beach is very long, more than 1 kilometre, and has a maximum width of 40 metres. When it comes to beach infrastructure you can be sure, to have many items on the list. Some sport fields are available here and in the summer a lifeguard is watching out for your safety. No trees are located on the beach, but don&#39;t worry, you can rent some parasol and a deckchair as well here. Once you get hungry you have a few options to be served, a restaurant, a beach bar, and a fast food kiosk are available here. If you like this beach and you would like to stay here for your summer holidays, you have a few accommodation options, mainly in apartments and rooms, and nearby there is even a camp. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3396, 'en', 1),
(13, 'Welcome to the Greek beach&nbsp;Profitis Ilias.&nbsp;Natural shades are not very often to find on the beaches around the town of Maronia. But this paralia, or beach in English, is different. It still belongs to the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, it&#39;s a family beach with a mixture of sand, pebbles and big stones. Parking is possible in front of the beach, and motorhomes are welcomed as well. Some basic beach infrastructure is available here, but don&#39;t expect too much. A beach bar is available here, a restaurant is not available. The beach has a length of 750 metres, a width of 30 metres, the beach inclination is normal. When going to the water you have a comfortable water entry, you can expect to start swimming already at 5 metres. Accommodation, especially apartments are available in the vicinity. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3397, 'en', 1),
(14, 'Natural shades are not very often to find on the beach around the town of Maronia. But this paralia is different. It still belongs to the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, it\'s a family beach with a mixture of sand, pebbles and big stones. Parking is in front of the beach, and motohomes are welcomed aswell. Accommodatin, especially apartments are in the vicinity.', 3398, 'en', 2),
(15, 'A true adventure beach is what you can expect when visiting the Greek beach Paralia Glyfada. It is located in the region&nbsp;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, which is the north east part of this famous country, and is part of the municipality of the town Komotini. The road which leads to the beach is paved and you can park directly in front of the beach. If you are a fan of a beach with almost no infrastructure, only a parking, also for motorhomes, then this beach is the one for you. If you are not, you should avoid it, and visit some beach closer to the small town Fanari. The beach main surface is predominantly made of sand, but you also have some pebbles mixed with in. This beach is very long, more than 1 kilometre, and the maximum width is only 10 metres. The point of swim is already at 10 metres. One characteristics which makes this beach a little special are the small cliffs, in red colour, in the background of the beach. Accommodation is far away, as well the restaurants. Enjoy this special beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3399, 'en', 1),
(16, 'Welcome to the beautiful sandy beach Mesis.&nbsp;It&#39;s located in the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, between the cities Aleksandroupoli and the city Kavala. The access to this beach with a vehicle is very easy, also with a motorhome. A very big parking place is available directly in front of the beach, only some 30 metres away. The main beach surface is sand, but you also have some&nbsp;grass on the beach and some trees behind the parking place. The total length of the beach is a few kilometres and on the widest part it is 40 metres wide. If you are a family, with small children, who need a little bit more protection from the sun, you will love this beach, because you can safely stay under the natural shadow of the trees. On the beach you have all the essential beach infrastructure, a restaurant and a cafe bar are also available directly on the beach. If you fall in love with the beach Mesis, and you would like to spend your summer vacation here, you have some accommodation, in the form of apartments and rooms, only a few hundred metres away. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3400, 'en', 1),
(17, 'Welcome to the sandy beach Arogi Fanari. The Greek town Fanari is well known for its beautiful sandy beaches. Many special beaches are available here. One of them, the Arogi Fanari is a true beauty. The road which leads to the beach is paved. You can arrive here with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome. The parking place is directly in front of the beach, is very large and is paved. The beach is a few kilometres long, 50 metres wide and has a nice water entry, after only 3 metres you can already start swimming. The main surface is sand, but you also have some natural shadow from some small trees present here. All the essential beach infrastructure is available here, a beach sport field included. You certainly will not be hungry or thirsty on this beach, many restaurants and beach bars are present here. Accommodation is also available, mostly as apartments, and you even have a hotel in the vicinity. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3401, 'en', 1),
(18, 'Welcome to the Greek beach Paralia Fanari kentro. The small town Fanari has many nice beaches to offer. The one we are presenting here is a beach with the main surface being a mix a of sand and pebbles. You can drive to this beach with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome. The parking place is very large, and there is also a auto camp in the vicinity. The beach characteristics are as followed: the total length is 500 metres, the maximum width is 30 metres and the point of swim is at 20 metres. It is not a family beach, but it is more suitable for an adventurer type of beach user.&nbsp;Beach infrastructure is very poor, so don&#39;t expect a high comfort, no toilets or showers are available. On the beach itself there are none restaurants or bars available, except one restaurant which is close to the beach, some 200 metres away, more bars and similar are available towards the town. You certainly have more service when it comes to accommodation. A whole variety is available, from apartments, rooms, a hotel and even a campsite. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3402, 'en', 1),
(19, 'Welcome to the Greek city beach Fanari. Located in the Greek region&nbsp;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, this beach is a must go if you like some beach diversity on the beach. Although the main surface is sand, you also have some pebbles and even rocks here. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, even with a motorhome, and you have a parking place directly in front of the beach. The total length of the beach is 500 metres, with a width of 25 metres. The point of swim is at 10 metres and you have a very diverse slope inclination. This beach is not straight, but presents itself to you in many different shapes, some very romantic.&nbsp;&nbsp;Because it is located directly in the town, you have many beach services available here, to please all your needs. Close by is also the city marina and the port. If you like to have some natural shadow on the beach, you can even go to a small park to give you some protection from the summer sun. Catering is available in many different forms. Accommodation is also close by, mainly as apartments or rooms, a camping ground is also not far away. We wish you a good vacation on the Paralia Fanari with BeachRex.', 3403, 'en', 1),
(20, 'Welcome to the Greek sandy children beach, paralia Mandra. This beach is one of a few beaches in the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, that is really suitable for small children. The shallow water is present everywhere along the beach coastline. It is especially suitable for small children because of the fact, that the point of swim is at 100 metres of more, the water is really shallow here. The road, which leads to the beach is paved and is in a good condition. The parking place is right in front of the beach and can hold several vehicles, also motorhomes. It is a sandy beach, with some natural shade and many beach infrastructures. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it has a width of 30 metres. The inclination on the beach is very small, it is almost flat, and so is the seabed, which makes this beach a very safe beach for small children. All the essential beach infrastructure is available here, a children playground included as well as some sport fields. An auto camp is just nearby, so no need to search for accommodation in the surrounding. On the beach you also have a beach bar and a restaurant. So, if you are a family with small children you should visit the beach Mandra, you will not regret it. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3404, 'en', 1),
(21, 'Welcome to the Greek beach Ai Giannis. Greece has all kind of beaches to offer. They come in different shapes and sizes. A special kind of a beach is the one, where you drive on a road for kilometres, with the beach being next to the road, only a few metres away. Well, if you like that kind of beaches, we suggest you to visit the beach Paralia Ai Giannis. The closest small town is called Avdira, and it is famous for having many sandy beaches in the surrounding area. Most of them are long, but paralia Ai Giannis is only 200 m long, has a maximum width of 15 metres and has a nice and attractive beach curve. Here you don&#39;t have many parking options, some are available right in front of the beach. There are some rocks on the edges of the beach and the swimming point is already at 3 metres. All the essential beach infrastructure is present here, you also have a beach bar directly on the beach. Accommodation is also available very close to the beach, mainly as apartments and rooms, but you don&#39;t have any hotels. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3405, 'en', 1),
(22, 'Welcome to the sandy beach Paralia Mirodato. It is located close to the small town Avdira in the Greek eastern region&nbsp;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. You can drive here with all kind of vehicles and a very large parking place awaits you right in front of the beach.&nbsp;The parking is paved and very large.&nbsp;This beach is not very touristic, it is more quiet and almost no tourist infrastructure is present in the surrounding of the beach. The total length of the beach is more than 1 kilometre; it is 100 metres width. You still have&nbsp;lot of beach infrastructure present here. Kids, especially small children will love this beach. The entry into water is very shallow, the point of swim is at 75 metres, and there are lots of children playgrounds and sport fields around. If you are a fan of beach volleyball you will love this sandy beach. Restaurants and beach bars are as well here and will serve you with some of the finest Greek cuisine. If you would like to stay here for longer you can stay in a hotel or in an apartment, which are all very close to the beach. Enjoy your Greek holiday with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3406, 'en', 1),
(23, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to the beautiful sandy beach Paralia Mangana. If you love sand on the beach you will feel here, like at home. This beach is located in the Greek county Topeiros, which is located in the eastern part of Greece&nbsp;in the region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki.&nbsp; The total length of the beach is more than 1 kilometre and it is very wide, more than 100 m, so you really have plenty of space to find a spot for you. The parking space is located directly in front of the beach, it is very large, and it is very suitable also for motorhomes. The beach is surrounded with a swamp, so don&#39; t expect any accommodation in the vicinity. Although it is so remote from any tourist industry, you really have lots of beach infrastructure here, beach volleyball fields included. If you get hungry or thirsty you can enjoy some Greek cuisine right on the beach in a beach bar. Swimming can be done after 30m of entry into the water. And remember, always enjoy your beach holiday with BeachRex.&nbsp;</div>\n&nbsp;\n\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3407, 'en', 1),
(24, 'Welcome to the beautiful sandy beach of the town Keramoti. It is located in the eastern part of Greece in the region&nbsp;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. If you would like to visit the neighbouring island Thassos,&nbsp;you can embark on a ferry from the harbour which is very close to the beach. To access the beach with a vehicle, also a motorhome is very easy and you have a very large parking place right in front of the beach. Once you are on the beach, you have a total of more than 1000 metres of beach length and 100 metres plus of beach width available. If you prefer some natural shadow on the beach, you have plenty of that kind available here. Beach infrastructure is here not only basic, but more advanced, you even have some sport fields. A few beach bars and restaurants are as well available directly on the beach. Once you finish you beach time, you can visit the town where you will find even more shops, bars and markets. Accommodations are available very close to the beach, some less than 100 metres away, predominantly apartments and a few hotels. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach.&nbsp;', 3408, 'en', 1),
(25, 'Near the Kavala airport, on the brinks of the agricultural fields there is a nice sandy beach called Tirala. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome, and you can park almost directly in front of the beach. This beach is very long, a few kilometres, and it has a maximum width of 15 metres. The swimming point begins very quickly, already after only 5 metres. The water entry is steep, not really for small children to play in.&nbsp;Another good beach characteristics is the fact, that it offers many natural shade, so you are protected from the hot south Mediterranean sun. All the essential beach infrastructure is located here and you also have a nice beach bar to enjoy a nice view of the Aegean Sea. Accommodation is not available in the vicinity, but is further away, a few kilometres. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3409, 'en', 1),
(26, 'Welcome to the beautiful sandy beach paralia Aspri Ammos. If you are near the Greek town&nbsp;Kavala, which is with its 70.000 inhabitants a very crowded place, and you would like to spend a day on a peaceful beach, with very little tourists, we suggest you to visit this beach, only a few kilometres away from the Kavala centre. The town Kavala has many beaches to offer. The first one from the east side of the town is the paralia Aspri Ammos. It is located between two small hills and the main surface is sand. Because of its beach characteristics it is mostly recommended for families. The access to the beach with a vehicle is very easy, you can also arrive with a motorhome, and you have a large parking place just in front of the beach. The total length of the beach is 300 metres, it has a maximum width of 25 metres, has a normal slope and the swimming point stars at 15 metres. All the essential beach infrastructure is present here, and if you are a dog owner, you can bring your dog as well on the beach. In the vicinity there is a restaurant and some apartments. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3410, 'en', 1),
(27, 'Welcome to the longest sandy beach of the Greek town Kavala. This sandy beach is located just outside the Kavala centre, next to a sport centre and an athletic/football stadium. The beach is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, and you have the parking ground directly in front of the beach. It is a family beach, suitable also for those ones with dogs. All the essential beach infrastructure is available here and you even have some sport fields nearby. 1 km is the total length of the beach, with a maximum width of 25 metres. The water gets here very fast deep, so you can begin to swim already after 5 metres. Some beach bars are as well on the beach, restaurants are also not far away, so no need to take all the food with you. Accommodation is also available nearby, mainly as apartments or rooms. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3411, 'en', 1),
(28, 'Welcome to Kavala and the city beach Paralia Kalamitsa. It is a true city beach in the middle of the Kavala town. Kavala is located in the eastern part of Greece in the region&nbsp;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. The main surface on the beach is sand and because of the beach characteristics it is best&nbsp;suitable for families. Parking your vehicle here is not a problem, you can do that directly in front of the beach, but be aware that the parking&nbsp;has a height barrier, but some low motorhomes can pass through it. The total length of the beach is 750 metres, 15 metres is the maximal width and the slope inclination is a little bit increased, which means that you can already start to swim after only 5 metres after entering the water. You have all kind of beach infrastructure available here, to see the whole list please check our beach infrastructure description. Children will also love this place; you have many children playgrounds here. In the background of the beach there is a large sports centre, with many different sport fields. Hotel, apartments and free rooms are available in the vicinity. As it is usual on a city beach you can try out some Greek cuisine directly on the beach, many restaurants and beach bars are at your disposal. Enjoy your beach, and remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach.&nbsp;', 3412, 'en', 1),
(29, 'A true beauty she is, the paralia Batis. It&#39;s a sandy beach, suitable for families and those one who love to camp near a beach. It is 200 m long and up to 25 m wide. The incline of the slope is on some places a little bit steep, but mostly normal. The camp, with all possible beach infrastructure is right next to the beach, as well as some restaurants and beach bars. The parking space is a little bit higher and some 100 m away, but it is very large and you can reach the beach from the parking by stairs, but take into account the 15 m hight difference..', 3413, 'en', 1),
(30, 'Close to the ancient Greek town Kavala there is a small tourist village, Paleo Tsifliki, with amazing sandy beaches. The sand has on the beaches a special yellow colour, really unique. This beach in located in the region&nbsp;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki and is easy to reach with your vehicle. Although you don&#39;t have very large parking places around, the most common way to park is by the street, but you should be aware of the fact that the parking is hard to find. This sandy beauty&nbsp;is surrounded with many apartments and some nice restaurants. On the beach you also have a beach bar where you can rent some deckchairs and sunshades. Special about this beach are the waves, which can be also used for surfing or other water sports. You have here 100 metres of length available and 20 metres of width, the inclination on the beach is quite flat and the point of swim is at 20 metres. Beach infrastructure on the beach is decent and you have all the necessary services available. Accommodation, if you are looking for one, is in the vicinity, only a few metres away. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3414, 'en', 1),
(31, 'If you like long sandy beaches, the paralia Iraklitsa is the one for you. It is suitable for families and you have a more than 1 km long and up to 30 m wide beach available almost directly from your car. The point of swim starts already at 10 m. Parking is free and there is really lots of space availabe, also for motorhomes. There are some sport fields and a children playground available. Beach bars and other catareing, as well as apartments are also in the vicinity or directly on the beach.', 3415, 'en', 1),
(32, 'If you are searching for a nice small village sandy beach, located in the Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki region, you should visit the Greek beach Paralia Nea Peramos Kavalas. It is a&nbsp;true city beach with lots of beach infrastructure, beach bars and off course many very close by types of accommodation. This beach is the main beach in the village Nea Peramos. You have lot of brown sand here, a total length of more than 1 km, but only 10 metres of width. Many park options are available, some directly in front of the beach. The surrounding is very touristic, so you can visit many different restaurants and beach bars. Accommodation, mostly as apartments and hotels are available in the vicinity. Beach infrastructure is also on a high level and you have many beach services available. For children there is also a playground, as well some sport fields for the ones who like to enjoy some beach volleyball.&nbsp;The beach inclination is normal, but the point of swim starts very fast, you can swim away already after only 5 meters after entering the water.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach.', 3416, 'en', 1),
(33, 'This one is a true beauty. This sandy beach, with its nice curves and crystal clear water will stay in your memmory for a very long time, even at home when you will be far away from it, but you will probably want to return to it for another time. Parking is large and made of dirt and you can park almost directly at the beach. The beach itself is more kilometrs long and up to 25 m wide. The point of swim starts already at 3 m, which means that you can start swimming almost instantly after entering the water. Beach bars are also present here, as well some beach infrastructure. Accommodation is not available directly at the beach but in the surrounding villages. The whole beach area is more natural than urban, so you can expect more peace there.', 3417, 'en', 1),
(34, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">If you are searching for a Mediterranean country with lots of beautiful beaches, you can&#39;t go wrong with Greece. Greece beaches are known to have at least some small level of tourism industry around the beach. Well, if you like the opposite, a beach with no tourist industry, a true adventurer beach, we recommend you to visit the paralia Akrotirir Apollonias. It is located in the eastern part of Greece in the region&nbsp;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki.&nbsp;On the beach you don&#39;t have practically no beach infrastructure, except the parking, which consists of dirt. You can park almost directly in front of the beach On the beach itself there is a mixture of sand and rocks, and some parts on the beach could be slippery because of the wet rocks. The water entry is easy, except where there are rocks. Dogs are going to love this place. The total length of the beach is 500 metres, it is 25 metres wide, it has a normal inclination and you can start swimming already after only 3 metres of entering the water. Some parts of the beach are also reserved for the nudists. Bring all your food and drinks with you, because here are no beach bars or restaurants. The same goes also for accommodation, none is available in the vicinity. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3418, 'en', 1),
(35, 'How about a Greek sandy beach where you can park your motorhome, or any other vehicle right in front of the beach. If you are searching for such a beach in the Greek region&nbsp;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki we recommend you to visit the beach paralia Vrisi.&nbsp;The parking here is very flat and very wide, you really have lots of space to park. Some beach infrastructure is present here, a children playground and a sport field included. A beach bar is also here. And like it is usual in Greece you can also bring your dog with you to the beach. The total length of the beach is more than 1 km, it is also quite wide, 30 metres. It has a normal inclination and the point of swim is already at 5 metres after entering the water. Here is no natural shade so bring your sunshades with you, or rent them at the beach. Accommodation is available here, but not close to the beach. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach.&nbsp;', 3419, 'en', 1),
(36, 'Welcome to the Paralia Ofryniu, a very special sandy beach. If you are searching for sandy beaches in Greece, you will soon find out that there are many. In fact, most of them are a sand type. The one we are describing here is located in the eastern part of Greece, in the region&nbsp;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. It is the main beach in the village Paralia Ofryniou. Like it is usual in Greece, also this beach is very easy accessible with and kind of vehicle, also a motorhome, and you can park directly in front of the beach. The characteristics of the beach are awesome, it is a&nbsp;very long beach, more than 1 km, and it is also very wide, 75 metres. The inclination on the beach is normal, almost flat and the swimming point is already at 3 metres. You will find lots of beach infrastructure here, many different sport fields are available here, of course the usual beach volleyball and of course a basketball field. On some parts there is even grass and you have some trees to protect you from the sun. The number of shops and bars is amazing, there are so many, you really have so many cuisine options, a true touristic place. You will just love this place. And if you own a dog, you can bring him also to the beach. No need to worry about an accommodation here, many different options are available, mostly apartments and some hotels. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach.&nbsp;', 3420, 'en', 1),
(37, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">This sandy beach, which is one of the first touristic beaches in the region Kentriki Makedonia, is located near the town of Logkari. The parking lot is huge and offers a parking for normal vehicles as well for the motorhome. Because you can park in front of the beach, you really need to walk only a few metres to access the beach.&nbsp;There are even some trees on the parking to keep your car cold during the hot summer.&nbsp;Families will love this beach. The total length is around 1 kilometre and the maximum width is 40 metres. Beach inclination is normal and the point of swim is at around 30 metres. On the beach there is even some grass. Like it is usual in Greece you can bring your dog also on this beach. If you like beach volleyball you have a filed here. A lifeguard is also watching for your safety. There is a beach bar and some basic beach infrastructure present on the beach. Accommodation is available only in the form of apartments.&nbsp;So, what are you waiting for. Find the right accommodation for you and up you go to your new beach adventure. And remember, always use BeachRex if you would like to find the perfect beach for you. Enjoy your beach.&nbsp;​</div>\n', 3421, 'en', 1),
(38, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Paralia Asprovalta is the perfect beach for your family. Located in the region of Kentriki Makedonia in the town of Asprovalta, it has almost the maximum beach infrastructure you can imagine or wish to have on a beach. Sand, natural sunshade and grass is what you will find here, not to mention the a few kilometres long beach, which can stretch to a maximum width of 75 metres. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome, and you can park almost directly in front of the beach, only 50 metres away. Because this beach is located in the middle of a tourist destination, you can expect to have many tourist services available for you. In the high season the beach occupancy is high. Beach slope has a normal inclination, which falls quite fast after entering the water, you can start swimming already after 5 metres when entering the water. If you are a fan of natural shadow, you will find some here. Many different types of accommodation are available here, some only a few metres away, a hotel and a camp are also on the list. The list for all kind of food options is also long, which is also true for all kind of beach bars. If you own a dog, you are welcomed here. The ones who like to party will also find some spots. Because many tourists like to do some beach sport, this beach is equipped also with some typical beach sport fields, like beach volleyball. So, what are you waiting for. Find the right accommodation for you and up you go to your new beach adventure. And remember, always use BeachRex if you would like to find the perfect beach for you. Enjoy your beach.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3422, 'en', 1),
(39, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to another beautiful sandy beach in the Greek province Kentriki Makedonia. It is located in the town Stavros, next to the city harbour. The parking, which is paved, is located directly in front of the beach&nbsp;and welcomes as well motorhomes.&nbsp;Close to the beach you have a nice park, with many shady trees, and you also have some grass on the beach itself. The total length of the&nbsp;beach is 400 metres and on the widest part the beach is 100 metres width. The slope on the beach is very flat, which is not the case for the water entry. You can expect to start swimming already after only 5 meters of entering the water. On the seabed your will mainly find sand and small stones. It is a free accessible beach and if you own a dog, you will not have any problem if you bring him with you. The beach infrastructure standard is here on a high level and it is a full list of amenities. Because this is a city beach, you will find many different accommodation types here, some only a few metres away. You also will not be hungry or thirsty here, many different types of restaurants are available in the vicinity. You need to try the delicious Greek cuisine. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach. Enjoy your beach.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3423, 'en', 1),
(40, 'If you want to feel some Olympic Greek spirit, you should visit this sandy beach paralia Olympiada in the east part of the region Kentraki Makedonia. The town where this beach awaits you is called Olimpiada. The access to the beach is very easy and you can park almost directly in front of the beach, only a few metres away, motorhomes are also welcomed. The main beach surface is sand and it stretches for 750 metres in length and 30 metres in width. Beach inclination is normal and you can start swimming already at 5 metres, the depth increases really fast. Natural shadow in the form of trees is not available here, but you can rent some parasols. The beach surrounding is quite touristic, not too much, like a small tourist town, so you can expect to have some tourist services available around. Beach infrastructure is enormous; you have many beach services available. Of course here are many sport fields as well some children playgrounds. A park with lots of grass is also near the beach. Beach bars and restaurants are either on the beach available or closebye, at most 50 metres away from the beach. If you would like to stay here for longer you can stay in some apartments, located very near the beach.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach. Enjoy your beach.&nbsp;​', 3424, 'en', 1),
(41, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Do you seek for lots of children playgrounds and natural shadow, with a sandy beach for your family, when going to the beach? If so, the paralia Stratoniu is just the right for you, you wont be disappointed, believe me, I have seen many beaches, and these one I would recommend every family. There is even a small park right on the beach. Like it is usual in Greece also this beach is easy accessible and you can park directly in front of the beach. The parking is big enough to welcome even motorhomes. The small town Stratoniu is famous for its underground silver-lead-zinc mine. The beach has a total length of 750 metres and is up to 50 metres width. Beach inclination is normal and you can start swimming already at 5 metres after entering the water. You have many beach facilities and services available here. Restaurants and some beach bars are either available on the beach directly or in its vicinity. Accommodation is available mainly in the form of apartments or free rooms, which are also in the vicinity.&nbsp;So, what are you waiting for. Find the right accommodation for you and up you go to your new beach adventure. And remember, always use BeachRex if you would like to find the perfect beach for you. Enjoy your beach.&nbsp;​</div>\n', 3425, 'en', 1),
(42, 'This beach is a true adventurer beach. It is very long, more kilometers and up to 25 m wide. The parking space itself is very large and you can even park under the trees. The road to the beach is on the end a dirt one and on some places a little steep. The beach access is very easy, there is no beach entrance fee to be paid, the beach slope is normal and you can start swimming already after 5 m of entering the water. The beach infrastructure is almost not present, but the beach itself is worth visiting. There are so many trees which give you shelter in the case the sun gets too hot. But be aware that you cannot camp there officialy.', 3426, 'en', 1),
(43, 'Welcome to the beautiful Greek fine gravel beach Paralia Ierissou.&nbsp;The Halkidiki Peninsula is full of nice beaches. In the town of Ierissos there is a very long beach, more than 1 km long, which is made of sand and partly of small and very small stones. Maximum width of the beach is 25 metres and the beach has a normal inclination. The water drops here quite quickly; you can start swimming already after 5 metres after entering the water. It is recommended for families. Parking, for all kind of vehicles, also motorhomes, is available directly in front of the beach. Next to the beach there is a camping place and in the front of the camping a large parking place. The beach infrastructure is on a high level and around the beach there are many beach bars and a lot of options for accommodation. The total list of beach infrastructure is very long. If you own a dog, you are allowed to bring him with you to the beach. Children can play on the children playgrounds, and the ones who like to be sporty, they can exercise on some sport fields. On the beach there is also a pier from which you can jump into the water or go catch some fish. Accommodation and Greek cuisine are on the beach, or in the vicinity, available in many different forms.&nbsp;​Enjoy your beach, and remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach.&nbsp;', 3427, 'en', 1),
(44, 'One of the last beaches on Halkidiki Peninsula before you reach the border with Mount Athos is the beach Nea Roda. It is located in the region&nbsp;Kentriki Makedonia, which is located in the eastern part of Greece. It is a family type beach and because of the children playgrounds your children will love this beach.&nbsp;The parking is in front of to the beach and the parking lot is very large, you can also park your motorhome here.&nbsp;On the beach itself there is predominantly sand. You can lay down your towel on a very large beach surface, the length is 500 metres, it is 15 metres width and has a normal inclination. You can start swimming after 10 metres of entering the water.&nbsp;In the surrounding there are many restaurants and a lot of accommodation types. You have many beach infrastructures at your disposal here, many beach services are available. Next to the beach there is also a pier and a marina. If you own a dog, he is welcomed here.&nbsp;Enjoy your beach, and remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach.&nbsp;<br />\n&nbsp;', 3428, 'en', 1),
(45, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">The whole Halkidiki regions is very interesting, not only because of the beautiful beaches, but also because of the its history, culture and cuisine. In the small village Ouranoupoli you can visit a sandy beach, which is famous for its special shapes and historical buildings surrounding it. This beach and the area surrounding it is also one of the last places before you take a hike to the region of Mount Athos.&nbsp;&nbsp;It is a family beach and dogs are allowed to go as well on the beach.&nbsp;The beach itself is a mixture of small pebbles, sand and concrete. It is around 400 meters long, 20 m wide and offers many beach infrastructure and beach services. Parking is available all around the beach, for some you need to pay, some are free, but it will take you less than a minute to get to the beach. Beach inclination is normal and you can start swimming almost immediately, on some spots you can even jump into the water, of course from the pier. In the town itself there are many restaurants and beach bars, some of them are available directly on the beach. In the town centre there is also a ferry point. From&nbsp;Ouranoupoli you can get via the ferry to Tripiti, Dafni and Ammouliani. If you would like to stay here for longer, you have some accommodation available, mainly as apartments, or you stay in a hotel, which is also close by. Enjoy your beach day and remember, always use BeachRex to find you next perfect beach.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3429, 'en', 1),
(46, 'In the region of Kentriki Makedonija there is another stunning beautiful beach called Paralia Akrathos. It&#39;s a very nice sandy beach with very interesting curves. It is definitely suited for families with children since there is also some natural shadow, the parking lot is very large and here are many hotels which are just next to the beach. On the beach itself you can rent some boats or other water equipment. If you are thirsty or hungry there is even a beach bar and restaurant directly on the beach. You can find more beautiful and attractive beaches in our extensive database of European beaches. And remember, the fastest and easiest way to find your dream beach is with BeachRex.', 3430, 'en', 1),
(47, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">The sound of joy starts playing in your ears when you take your first look of the beach Metagkitsi. It is another beautiful and romantic sandy beach, with a very attractive water colour in Kentriki Macedonia region. It&#39;s located between the first and the second peninsula of Chalkidiki region. The nearest town is Salonikiou. This beach is very easy accessible, the parking space is made of dirt and it&#39;s large enough to welcome also motorhomes. You can park almost directly in front of the beach. Once you enter the beach you can enjoy all the 1 kilometre of length and a maximum of 50 widths available to you. The beach area is really huge. Beach inclination is normal, it falls a little bit more towards the sea, where you can start swimming already after only 10 metres. All the essential beach infrastructure is available here and some beach services. It is a family beach, and if you own a dog, you can bring him with you. Nearby there are some apartments and there is even a beach bar on the beach. So what are you waiting for. Pack your stuff and let&#39;s go to the beach. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach. Have a great time on the beach. Your BeachRex team.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3431, 'en', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(48, 'This amazing sandy beach with crystal clear water with a slight turquoise color will take you by surprise and you will surely fall in love. The beach belongs to the region of Kentriki Macedonia and belongs to the city of Ormos Panagias. It is more than one kilometer long and up to 40 meters wide, the parking lot is located right next to the beach. In stormy weather, this will be an ideal place for windsurfing or kiting. Accommodation such as apartments and vacant rooms are also nearby. Some beach infrastructure is also available directly on the beach, but is mostly concentrated around beach bars or similar restaurants. Entering the water is very pleasant and after only 10 meters of entering the water you can start swimming. The whole area is also very attractive for some nice shots for your instagram account, so have your best photo or video equipment with you. You can find more beautiful and attractive beaches in our extensive base of European beaches. And remember, the fastest and easiest way to find your dream beach is with BeachRex.', 3432, 'en', 1),
(49, 'Once you visit this beach it certainly will become your dream beach to visit for many many times. It is one of the most beautiful beaches you will ever visit in your life. It has everything you are looking for. It has a lot of sand, the water is crystal clear, there is even some natural shadow and some grass available directly on the beach. The entry into the water is nice and comfortable. It is a true marble in the Halkidiki region. Parking is also available here but you need to drive on a dirt road and it can be sometimes tricky to reach the parking space. There are maybe 20 spaces available for free or more if you go to a beach resort, where you need to pay for the parking. A restaurant is also here and there are some apartments in the vicinity of the beach if you would like to stay here for your summer vacation. The whole area is very attractive also for some nice shots on your instagram account, so bring your best photo or video equipment with you.&nbsp;', 3433, 'en', 1),
(50, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to the perfect motorhome beach. If you are searching for a perfect sandy beach, with lots of shadow and where you can park your vehicle or motorhome directly on the beach, you will be pleased with this Greek beauty. The beach Fteroti is true adventurer beach. It is located in the region Kantriki Makedonia, near the village Fteroti. In total you have here 1 kilometre of beach length available, the maximum width is 10 metres. Beach inclination is normal, almost flat. When entering the water, it gets quickly deep, you can start swimming already after 10 metres after your feet touch the water.&nbsp;You will not find here any beach infrastructure because the beach and the surrounding are completely wild. The parking is next to the beach but you need to take a dirt road to reach the beach. On the beach itself you can rent a boat and discover the islands in the vicinity, which are gorgeous and offer you even more remote and peaceful beaches, most of them is only reachable by boat. Restaurants or beach bars on not present here, but there is some accommodation like apartments and rooms available in the vicinity, most of them in the form of apartments. You can also bring your dog with you and if you have small children you can put your towel under the tree and protect them from the hot Greek sun.&nbsp;So, what are you waiting for. Find the right accommodation for you and up you go to your new beach adventure. And remember, always use BeachRex if you would like to find the perfect beach for you. Enjoy your beach.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3434, 'en', 1),
(51, 'The Karidi beach is a white sand beach. And with the crystal clear water you can imagine the beauty of this place. This beach is one of the most beautiful in the Halkidiki area and it&#39;s a must visit if you are near this area or simply like stunning beaches. The parking surface is made of dirt and you can leave your car under the trees where it will stay cold only a few meters away from the beach. On the beach itself there are many trees to lay down your towel and stay protected from the hot sun. Accommodation is nearby, mostly in the form of appartments and hotels. Restaurants and other catering is also available in the vicinity. The whole area around the beach is very pictures so you will find many places to take beautiful pictures of you with the beach in the background for your memories or your instagram account.&nbsp;You can find more beautiful and attractive beaches in our extensive database of European beaches. And remember, the fastest and easiest way to find your dream beach is with BeachRex.', 3435, 'en', 1),
(52, 'The Sarti beach, which is located in the Greece Halkidiki region, is a very long sandy beach with a very spectacular view on the mount Athos. It&#39;s a part of the region Kentriki Makedonija. Here you will find many beach infrastructure, a children playground is included as well as some sport fields. Apartments, rooms and hotels are just next to the beach. The parking is also nearby and you need to walk only 100 meters to reach the beach. Restaurants and other bars are plenty and you have a big variety of different cuisine available here. The total lenght of the beach is more than 1 kilometre, it is also very widht, 50 metres, the beach inclination is normal, but falls sharp towards the water, so you can start to swim already at 3 metres after entering the water. Because of the beach formation and in stormy weather, big waves can form here, which can be very attractive for some surfers. You can find more beautiful and attractive beaches in our extensive database of European beaches. And remember, the fastest and easiest way to find your dream beach is with BeachRex.', 3436, 'en', 1),
(53, 'The Khalkidhiki peninsula is one of the most beautiful places in Greece. You will find the most beautiful beaches and amazing nature here. It is divided into three smaller peninsulas, one of them being the peninsula Sithonia. From Sithonia you can see the other two peninsulas, one of them being the Mount Athos, which is located to the east, and to the west you have the peninsula Kassandra. The beach Platania offers you a direct view on Mount Athos, it is a sandy beach and is best suitable for families. What is good about the beach is the fact, that you can park directly on the beach, and if you want you can stay here also with a motorhome. But sand is not the only surface you will find here, grass is also present here as well as some rock formations. The total length of the beach is 200 metres and it can be up to 20 metres wide. The slope inclination has here a large angle, it is more than usually, which also means that you can start swimming almost immediately, already at 5 metres. Beach infrastructure is also available, but it is more or less basic. Accommodation is available in the vicinity, mainly in the form of apartments, studios and rooms. You also don&#39;t need to worry about food or drinks here, a Taverna or a restaurant, with delicious food, is just nearby. And of course, if you are a dog owner, you&nbsp;are welcomed here,&nbsp;like everywhere else in Greece. So, what are you waiting for, book an apartment on the beach, organize everything and visit your next dream beach. And remember, always use BeachRex and our advanced filter to find your next unforgettable beach experience.&nbsp;', 3437, 'en', 1),
(54, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">The most beautiful beaches in Greece are certainly located on the&nbsp;Khalkidhiki peninsula. If you are looking for beautiful beaches and astonishing nature you simply have to visit this place, so many people talk about it, and after your visit, you will be one of them, for sure. The&nbsp;Khalkidhiki peninsula&nbsp;is divided into three smaller peninsulas, one of them is the peninsula Sithonia, than there is&nbsp;the Mount Athos peninsula and the peninsula Kassandra.&nbsp;The paralia Katerina is located on the second peninsula of the&nbsp;Khalkidhiki, named Sithonia. This region belongs to the Kantriki makedonia. The beach itself is a sandy beach and it&#39;s best suitable for a family type of visitor. The closest town to the beach is Sykia, a few kilometres away from the seaside. You will not have any problems with parking here, you can simply park next to the beach, like you can see on our pictures, honestly, there are not many beaches in the world with this parking feature. The beach is 300 metres long and up to 20 metres wide. You have a lot of nice shapes on the beach, some smaller beaches, which are divided by some rock formations. The beach inclination is normal and you can start swimming almost immediately, already after only three metres. Some beach infrastructure is also present here, but it is more or less only basic. Next to the beach there&#39;s a camping with some basic infrastructure, otherwise the whole area is more natural. On the beach itself there is no catering option, but you have some restaurants on the neighbouring beach, some 300 metres away. If you are a dog owner, your pet is welcomed here. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and remember to always use our BeachRex filter to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3438, 'en', 1),
(55, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">This beautiful sandy beach, called Paralia Sikia is located on the peninsula Sithonia in the region Kentriki Makedonija. Being part of the&nbsp;Khalkidhiki peninsula means it certainly one of the most amazing and&nbsp;most beautiful beaches in Greece.&nbsp;It&#39;s a very long sandy beach with a very large parking space, which you reach by a dirt road. You can park directly on the beach, total freedom, this fact makes Greece very unique, when we compared to other countries, where the parking regime is very strict. Of course you can also leave your motorhome on the beach, some even stay overnight. It is a family beach, but it is not suitable for the very small children, the water gets deep too fast. The whole beach area is very big, the beach itself is more than 1000 metres long, 100 metres wide and the beach inclination is slightly increased. Because of the increased slope angle the point of swim is already at 3 metres. Some beach infrastructure is present here as well. You will find all the essential amenities here, as well as children playgrounds, some sport fields, one of them a tennis ground, a volleyball ground and a basketball field. If you like all these beach features you will also find some accommodation here, some camps and apartments are available in the background of the beach. The beach is suitable for dogs, where they have plenty space to run around.&nbsp;Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and remember to always use our BeachRex filter to find your next dream beach.</div>\n', 3439, 'en', 1),
(56, 'On the south point of the Greece peninsula Sithonia there is the sandy beach paralia Kalamitsi. It belongs to the region of Kantriki makedonia and is a must go if you are in this region. It is suitable for families and for those one who have dogs with them. The beach itself is around 750 meters long and 30 meters wide. Next to the beach there is a parking lot and there are many beach bars, apartments and some camping grounds in the vicinity. The water entry is comfortable you can swim already after 3 meters of entering the water.', 3440, 'en', 1),
(57, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Located on the west side of the peninsula Sithonia, this sandy beach will surprise you with its incomparable beauty. It&#39;s a very long and very romantic beach, mostly suitable for families. More than 1000 metres is the length of the beach, and you have a 20 metres of width available. Beach inclination is increased, so you can expect that you can already begin with the swimming after around 3 metres. The beach infrastructure is on a high standard. Benches are located along the whole stretch of the beach as well as lightning poles, which makes a walk in the night even more romantic. There is even some grass and some natural shadow available on the beach, which is perfect if you would like to protect your small kids from the hot sun. But you need to park your vehicle along the road, which is also only a few metres away from the beach, so don&#39;t worry about carrying your stuff a long way. You can also play basketball on the beach, there is a sports field for this sport available. Children can play on the children&rsquo;s playground. A lifeguard is also present here, so you are always guarded in the case something happens in the sea. A very good cuisine is available in many different restaurants, which are available either on the beach itself, or nearby. Accommodation is available in many different forms. You have a lot of apartments as well as some hotels&nbsp;available along the whole stretch of the beach. Your pet, which makes how is also welcomed here, like it is usual in Greece.&nbsp;Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and remember to always use our advanced BeachRex filter to find your next amazing beach.</div>\n', 3441, 'en', 1),
(58, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Another beach where you can park your vehicle right in front of the beach, you can park it so close, that you could almost jump from your car hood into the water. The Haldikiki peninsula is known for its beautiful beaches and the beach Tristinika is one of them, for sure, I would rate it among top 10 or this region. It&#39;s around 750 meters long up to 40 meters wide and offers a lot of sand, some grass and even some natural shadow. It is also different from other beaches, because its slope has a higher angle of inclination, this is also the reason why you can start swimming almost instantly, after getting into the water. All the essential beach infrastructure is present here, but you shouldn&#39;t expect too much, because this is not a very touristic beach. Right next to the beach there is a camping site and some apartment, and even one hotel. A beach bar and a restaurant are also available on the beach, but it is not centred, but on one edge of the beach.&nbsp;So what are you waiting for. Pack your stuff and let&#39;s go to the beach. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach. Have a great time on the beach. Your BeachRex team.&nbsp;​</div>\n', 3442, 'en', 1),
(59, 'A true adventurer sandy beach for those one who like the wild nature. The flat terrain seems like this beach was made for motorhomes. The parking is very flat and huge, and you can park right in front of the beach. The road to the beach is a mixture of different surfaces. Half of it is paved and half is made of dirt. On the beach itself there is almost no infrastructure, but only a pure freedom feeling. Some accommodation in the form of apartments is available in the vicinity but not directly on the beach.The beach underground is made of sand and there is also enough grass there if you like this surface more than other typical beach ypes.', 3443, 'en', 1),
(60, 'Paralia Stiladari is a sandy and family beach on the west side of the second peninsula, the Sithonia peninsula, in the beautiful and very interesting Greek region of Halkidiki. You can park your vehicle directly in front of the beach, and the parking lot is large enough to accommodate more vehicles, motorhomes are also welcome here. There are a few trees on the beach that offer you shelter from the hot summer sun, and shade is especially welcome if you come to the beach with small children, who need to be protected from the sun most of the time. There is a lot of beach infrastructure on or near the beach, and there is also a beach bar and a hotel on this beautiful beach. At most points along the beach, the entrance to the water is very nice and you can start swimming after 3 m. In some places, just be careful how you enter the water, as there are also quite a few unpleasant rocks. Due to these facts about the beach and the very picturesque surroundings, this location is very popular among tourists. The total length of the beach is 500 meters and its width is 25 meters. In our extensive collection of European beaches you will find other beautiful and attractive beaches. And don&rsquo;t forget: the fastest and easiest way to find your dream beach is with BeachRex.', 3444, 'en', 1),
(61, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Located on the west side of the peninsula Sithonia, in the town Neos Marmaras this sandy beach is a true family beach. You can park your vehicle, also a motorhome, directly in front of the beach and go directly into the water or put your towel under a tree. The beach characteristics are as followed: it is more than 1-kilometre-long and up to&nbsp;25 metres width, the inclination on the beach is normal and you can start swimming almost immediately, because the water drops into the depth quite quickly. On one hand this beach is recommended for families, a children playground is available here, but I would recommend it also to the ones who like to party. You really have lots of amazing beach bars / lounge bars / beach party bars here, of course we also need to mention the different restaurants with its amazing Greek cuisine. Because this beach is very touristic and attracts many beach fans you also have lots of different accommodation options to choose from, very close to the beach there are some beautiful resorts. If you want you can also play volleyball on the beach, start a diving course, rent some water sports gear or play golf on a nearby course.&nbsp;So what are you waiting for. Choose the right accommodation for you, reserve a date and up you go to your next dream beach. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach. Have a great time on the beach. Your BeachRex team.&nbsp;​</div>\n', 3445, 'en', 1),
(62, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">If you love beaches with natural shadow or you need the shade of the trees to protect you or your children from the sun, you need to visit the beach Lagomandra on the Halkidiki peninsula in the Kantriki Makedonia region. Your car, maybe also a motorhome will also love the beach parking because the whole parking is in the shadow, so you can always be sure that a cool car awaits you, when you return back to it. The beach itself is made of sand and it is best recommended for families, especially for the ones with small children, your children will be really protected if stay under the trees. Total length of the beach is 500 metres, it is 20 metres width, the water entry is nice and comfortable and you can start swimming already after 10 metres of entering the water. Beach infrastructure here is on an average Greece standard, which is OK, if you are not too demanding. In the summer time you also have a lifeguard on the beach. A beach bar is also here, and some restaurants in the vicinity, but not on the beach directly. You can also rent some beach equipment here, some small boats, a sup, kayak, and similar. There are some apartments and a very special and for sure a very beautiful hotel nearby. We wish you a great beach experience with BeachRex.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3446, 'en', 1),
(63, 'The Greece Halkidiki region is famous for its beautiful sandy beaches. The second or middle peninsula in this region is called Sithonia and is a must go if you would like to experience one of the most beautiful beaches of Greece. This place, which is near to the city of Nikiti is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, which you can park on a park place just next to the road and some 100 m away from the beach. This beauty is some 750 m long and up to 40 m wide. The inclination of the slope is normal and becuase of the point of swim beeing at around 30 m it is also suitable for small children. You will find many beach infrastructure here, and even a hotel soon and some beach catering.&nbsp;', 3447, 'en', 1),
(64, 'The town of Nikitis is located on the second peninsula of the Halkidiki region. Along the coastline there is a very long Sandy Beach which stretches over a few kilometers. You can park by the road and to reach the beach easily. In the background of the beach there is a city with the same name and lots of restaurants and all types of accommodation.', 3448, 'en', 2),
(65, 'This sandy beach is located on the halkidiki peninsula. The nearest town is called Metamorfosi. You can park your vehicle directly at the beach. It\'s also suitable for motorhomes. On the beach itself There is almost no beach infrastructure but there are some apartments, Resortsand hotels in the background of the beach. You can find also some trees on the beach to protect you from the Sun.', 3449, 'en', 2),
(66, 'Do you search for a sandy beach with a lot of beach infrastructure? If so, than the paralia Psakudia is the one for you. It&#39;s located on the Halkidiki Peninsula, between Kassandra and Sithonia, which belongs to the Kentriki makedonia. The parking is just next to the beach and it&#39;s big enough to welcome also motorhomes. Families will love this beach, beacuse you the whole beach is more family oriented, a children playground is ofcours here, as well as a few natural shadow options under the trees,&nbsp;and there&#39;s even a small park with lots of grass. It is a very long beach, more than 1000 metres, and it is also very wide, more than 30 metres. The slope inclination is normal and the point of swim is at 20 metres. A pier is also on the beach, but it is too short, so you can&#39;t jump from it into the water. A sport field is also here and you can even rent a sunshade and a deckchair if you would like to. Would you like to have some water sport on the beach, no problem, you can rent some kayak, sup boards, padle boats and simmilar. On the beach itself there is a beach bar and some restaurants, some are available just across the street. You can also stay here for longer, or even spend a vacation here because a resort, some hotels and apartments are available in the vicinity. So what are you waiting for, book an accommodation on our website, book a flight or take your car and head towards your dream beach. We wish you an amazing beach experience, and remember, always use our BeachRex advanced filter, to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 3450, 'en', 1),
(67, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">If on this beach there would not be the beach bar, this would be a beach recommended for adventurers, but since there is one I would recommend it to families. You would not even see, when driving on the road, that there is a beach beside the road. The exact location of the beach is between the peninsula Kassandra in the west, and the peninsula Sithonia on the south. The parking is around 15m above the beach and it&#39;s large enough to host even motorhomes. The path to the beach is 100 meters and you need to use some stairs. The beach itself is a mixture of sand and some rocks but there is only basic beach infrastructure, what should be enough to make you happy. The total length is 150 metres, and the maximum width is 20 metres. Beach inclination is quite small, normal. You can start swimming already at 3 metres, after entering the water. Beach infrastructure is here only basic, don&#39;t expect too much. You can get some drinks and some fast-food on the beach directly. Accommodation is not available on the beach itself, but in the vicinity, where you have some apartments and hotels available.&nbsp;Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and remember to always use our advanced BeachRex filter to find your next beach.</div>\n', 3451, 'en', 1),
(68, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to the very special beach, the paralia Kouyoni. If we told you that this beach is a part of the Chalkidiki peninsula, you can already figure it out, if you are an insider, that we are talking about a beautiful beach, like the beaches of the Chalkidiki region certainly are. This beach is best for families with children, especially because In the background of the beach there is a park with children playground and a basketball field, and they are both surrounded with trees, to give you some sun protection. The park is in full shadow and has a lot of grass. In the park there is also a restaurant and a beach bar, and some apartments and a hotel are in the vicinity, and a little bit far away there is even campground. Once you come here with your vehicle you can leave it beside the street. It takes only 100 metres of walking to reach the beach. Total length of the beach is 300 metres, it is 15 metres width, it has a normal inclination and you can start swimming after only 20 metres of entering the water, in some cases even more. The entry into the water is comfortable and sometimes you can swim right away and on some places you need to walk 20 meters before you can start to swim. All the essential beach amenities are present here.&nbsp;So what are you waiting for, book an accommodation on our website, book a flight or take your car and head towards your dream beach. We wish you an amazing beach experience, and remember, always use our BeachRex advanced filter, to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;​</div>\n', 3452, 'en', 1),
(69, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to the beautiful family Greek beach&nbsp;paralia Gerakinis. If you are a sandy beach enthusiast, and you have small children who like to play in the sand, you should put this beach on yours TO DO list. It&nbsp;belongs to the region of Kentriki makedonia.&nbsp;The access to this beach is very easy, you can park your vehicle on a public parking place, only a few metres away from the beach, motorhomes are also welcomed. The beach characteristics are as followed: the total length is 750 metres, the maximum width is 40 metres, the beach inclination is normal and the point of swim is already at 5 metres. Take the point of swim into account when you have small children, they should play close to the water only with adults.&nbsp;&nbsp;A lot of hotels, apartments, rooms, restaurants, sports fields and other beach infrastructure is what you can expect here. During the summer season, you can rent some sunshades and deckchairs. And if you are a basketball fan, you can even play a match on the basketball field directly on the beach. Accommodation is really not a problem on this beach, many hotels are available, even a 5-star hotel with beautiful private swimming pools. If you prefer an apartment, you will also find many here. Once you have enough of the beach, and you would like to see or to walk between some olive trees, you can even do that, the whole backyard of the beach is covered with them. If you have such a touristic beach, you can be sure, that you will have many beach bars and restaurants available to satisfy your hunger.&nbsp;So, don&#39;t lose any time, book an accommodation right on our website, search for a flight or come with your car and head towards your dream beach. We wish you an unforgettable beach experience, and remember, when you think about beaches, think of us, and always use our BeachRex advanced filter, to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3453, 'en', 1),
(70, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Paralia Kalives is located in the town of Kalives Poligirou, which is a part of the region Kentriki Makedonia. It&#39;s a sandy beach, best suitable for families, almost 1-kilometre-long, 40 metres wide, has a normal inclination and you can already start swimming after 10 metres. If you don&#39;t like to walk for a longer period of time from your car till you reach the beach, you will love this beach, because the parking is just next to the beach, and it is also suitable for motorhomes. Beach infrastructure is also present here and it is on a good level. You can expect some showers, children playground, sports fields and so on. Some restaurants and beach bars are also available on the beach or in the vicinity. You can also stay here for longer and get yourself an accommodation, mostly in the form of an apartment or a free room. In the vicinity you also have a hotel and a resort at your disposal. A pier is also present here and if you like to catch some fish you can do it from this structure. Do you own a dog, and you would like to bring him with you, no problem on this beach? This is from our side, now it is up to you. If you like this beach, go on, make a hotel reservation on our website, organize everything and enjoy your summer vacation. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and don&#39;t forget to always use our BeachRex advanced beach filter, to find your next dream beach in a matter of seconds.</div>\n', 3454, 'en', 1),
(71, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">The beach Portes is one of the longest sandy beaches in Greece. It&#39;s more than 10 kilometres long, and offers many different options to spend your day on the beach. Because it is located on the peninsula Chalkidiki, more precisely on the beginning of the Kassandra peninsula, you can be sure that you will get a very unique beach experience. The Chalkidiki peninsula is for the beaches like a quality seal. It&#39;s definitely suitable for motorhome owners as well for families and for those who love to have some peace on the beach. The road to the beach is mostly made of dirt and you need to drive more kilometres to reach your preferable place, but you can of course stop earlier. On some part of the beach there are beach bars, but on the most length of the beach there is no tourist infrastructure. So some places have some beach infrastructure but most have zero. Accommodation is also available behind the beach but mostly in the type of apartment or free rooms. The beach width is only 10 metres, beach inclination is normal, water entry is comfortable and you can already start to swim away after three meters. If you own a dog, he is welcome here, like anywhere else on Greece beaches. Next time when you are searching for another quality beach try out our advanced BeachRex filter, you will be amazed how quickly it will show you the right beach for you. We wish you a great beach experience.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3455, 'en', 1),
(72, 'On the Kassandra peninsula in the region Kentriki Makedonia there are many beautiful beaches. The city of Afytos hosts 500 meter long Sandy Beach. You can reach the beach by a paved Road where a large parking place awaits you. The parking itself is done directly onto the beach. Here you will find some beach infrastructure, some beach bars restaurants, and in the vicinity there are some apartments. On the beach there is a mixture of sand and rocks and the entry into the water is not as comfortable as on other beaches. You need to walk over some rocks to reach the point of swim.', 3456, 'en', 2),
(73, 'The paralia Kalithea it\'s very interesting. Not Only is the sand here White, the water crystal clear and the water is really shallow which makes it suitable for small children, the beach hosts also the Temple of zeus. Otherwise the beach belongs to the peninsula of Kassandra, or better known as the Halkidiki region. \nOn the beach itself you will find  many beach infrastructure, many restaurants and a lot of apartments and other type of accommodation. Sunshades and deckchairs can also be rented her, as well as some water equipment.', 3457, 'en', 2),
(74, 'On this beach you will find a lot of nature. The Cliffs behind the beach with it\'s trees provide you with some natural shadow, but only for the half day. The beach itself is made of sand and it\'s a few kilometers long end around 15 meters wide. Near the parking, which is pretty large and can host also motorhomes, there is also a beach bar and a shower. A camping place some apartments are also in the vicinity of the beach. Find the beach near the town of Kriopigi which is located on the peninsula Kassandra.', 3458, 'en', 2),
(75, 'The paralia Polychrono is a true City Beach. The apartments and restaurants as well beach bars are directly on the beach which is only separated by a road. The beach itself is made of sand. The water entry is on some places comfortable on some you need to walk on stones. And because of the shallow water the point of swimming starts between 20 and 30 meters. The city of polychrono it\'s part of the peninsula Kassandra, which belongs to the region Kantriki makedonija.', 3459, 'en', 2),
(76, 'The crystal clear water on this beach will leave you speechless. Predominantly because of the white sand which gives the beach a special torquise water color tone. The beach itself is made of small stones and predominantly sand. Swimming is possible already after five meters of entering the water. In the vicinity of the beach there are many beach bars and a lot of apartments as well some hotels. The beach infrastructure is on a high level and there is plenty of it along the whole stretch of the beach. Parking is done either on a large parking space 100 meters away, or you can park in a private house just next to the beach. The large parking space can host also motorhomes, and you even have some shadow there if you get the premium spot..', 3460, 'en', 1),
(77, 'You won\'t find as many luxury apartments so close to the beach anywhere else in Greece. The Paralia Pefkochori Anatolika, which is located on the peninsula Kassandra in the well-known region of Halkidiki is a Sandy Beach with some Pebbles added to it. The parking is done either by the road or you can use a large parking place on the right side to the beach. The water entery is comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters. If you\'ll get hungry there are plenty of restaurants available there, as well as Apartments. Some beach bars are more luxurious and probably offer also dance floor.', 3461, 'en', 2),
(78, 'On the Greece peninsula Kassandra in the beautiful region Halkidiki there is one special, almost completely natural beach, just outside the town of Pefkochori. It&#39;s several kilometers long, around 20 meters wide, and offers plenty of natural shadow along the road by the beach. You can reach the beach by a dirt road which goes nearby the beach. On some part of the beach there are also some beach bars, which offer some basic infrastructure, otherwise there is none. When you go to take a swim in the crystal clear water you can already swim after 5 meters. The beach itself is made partly of sand, partly of small pebbles. Just next to the beach there is a beautiful Lagoon which you should explore either with a boat or snorkelling.', 3462, 'en', 1),
(79, 'Wild & Free this is what she is, the paralia Paragga. The peninsula Kassandra full of surprises, and this beach is no exception. It\'s a sandy beach, more than one kilometer long, around 20 meters wide and it is suitable for families. On the beach itself there are many trees which give you some natural shadow. The parking is very large and welcomes also motorhomes, the road is made of dirt, and you can park almost directly at the beach. Here are also some improvised beach bars and toilets.', 3463, 'en', 2),
(80, 'One of the last beaches on the peninsula Kassandra which is facing the city of Marmaras on the opposite peninsula Sithonia is the beach Paliouri. It&#39;s located near the town of Chrousou. It is more than one kilometer long sandy beach, with some beach infrastructure. The parking place is very large and can host also motorhomes. You can also bring your dog to the beach as long as you respect the rules. Some beach bars, a camping ground and some apartments are also on the beach or near the beach.', 3464, 'en', 1),
(81, 'The small village of Loutra on the Kassandra peninsula, has one interesting Beach to offer. The beach is a mixture of sand, small Pebbles, big stones, grass and some natural shadow. You can park almost directly at the beach. There are more than 100 places available, on some you can also leave your car under the shadow. In the vicinity some apartments in free rooms and on the beach itself there are some restaurants and beach bars. Peach has also a pier, you can either jump or catch some fish.', 3465, 'en', 2),
(82, 'The beach in the town of Nea Skioni in the peninsula Kassandra will provide you with many Beach infrastructure. On Such a small place there is plenty of it. Just next to the beach there is a marina all around the beach there are parking spaces, restaurants and all kinds of accommodation types. The beach itself is made of sand, the entry into the water is comfortable and you can start swimming already after five meters. Good about this beach are the child playgrounds and some sport equipment.', 3466, 'en', 2),
(83, 'I could almost say just another beautiful beach in Greece. This sandy beach is made of white sand, has some shallow water, which is crystal clear and welcomes families. There are plenty of restaurants arround, as well as some apartments, rooms and hotels. The beach is located on the peninsula Kassandra, which is a part of the Halkidiki region, or a wider region the Kantriki Makedonia.', 3467, 'en', 1),
(84, 'Another beach on the peninsula Kassandra which will leave you speechless awaits you near the village Aploma. It&#39;s more wild and free then other ones, since here is almost no beach infrastructure. There is a big parking space which is made of dirt and it&#39;s large enough to welcome even motorhomes. The beach is made partly of sand and partly of small pebbles, water entry is on some places comfortable, on some you need to walk over the rocks. A little bit further away from the beach you can also find some natural shadow.', 3468, 'en', 1),
(85, 'You won&#39;t have any problems with parking on this beach. Motorhomes are welcomed for sure. The beach Skala Fourkas on the peninsula Kassandra is a sandy beach, with some basic beach infrastructure. The water entry is comfortable and the water is crystal clear. On the beach itself there are some beach bars and in the background many apartments and rooms.', 3469, 'en', 1),
(86, 'Sand, crystal clear torquise water and restaurants right next to the beach, this is what you get when you visit the beach Siviris. Located on the peninsula of Kassandra in the region of Kentriki makedonia this beach offers you a parking space only 50 meters away from the beach. In the town itself there are many apartments, rooms and hotels. In the summertime the whole Beach can get crowded, so be aware of that fact. Because this location is so popular amongst tourists you also have plenty of beach infrastructure here. The point of swim starts very early, at around 10 m if you go inside the water from the beach or instantly if you jump from the pier.&nbsp;', 3470, 'en', 1),
(87, 'A true explorer adventurer beach awaits you on this special location. On this beach you not only can swim and enjoy the sun you also can explore an ancient roman city next to the beach. The whole peninsula of Kassandra is full of seach sites. The road to the beach is a dirt one, and here are around 40 parking places for you available. The beach is quite shallow as well as the water entry which means that small children can play here quite safely. On the beach there is also a hotel with lots of beach infrastructure.', 3471, 'en', 1),
(88, 'If you\'re the one who likes luxury on the beach, who doesn\'t take any compromises then the beach Sani is the one for you. The beach infrastructure is on the highest level, you even have a marina in the middle of the beach to moore your yacht here. The parking spaces here are plenty, but motorhomes are not allowed here. The beach itself is made of white sand. The water entry is comfortable and you can swim already after five meters. If you don\'t like the see you have a swimming pool also here. The whole Beach is a part of the Sani resort, which will provide you with all kinds off accommodation types.', 3472, 'en', 2),
(89, 'The paralia Nea Mounadia it\'s a typical sandy city Beach. It\'s more than one kilometer long on the widest part it\'s measures around 50 meters. It has a lot of beach infrastructure, the parking is only 100 meters away, and you can leave your motorhome as well on this parking. The water entry is comfortable. Next to the beach there are children playgrounds, as well as many beach bars and some apartments and hotels in the background.', 3473, 'en', 2),
(90, 'In the middle of the sea of olives you will find a village named Paralia Dionisiou. It is located in the region of Kantriki makedonia, near the big city of Thessaloniki. It\'s a very modern Sandy Beach, with a park covered in grass and with natural shadow in the background, where the children playgrounds are located. Along the beach there are many beach bars and in the vicinity also some apartments and other types of accommodation. The water entry is comfortable and you can already swim away after around 20 meters.', 3474, 'en', 2),
(91, 'The region Kantriki makedonia is well known for its very long sandy beaches, and the beach Flogita is no exception here. The beach is made of sand and partly of small Pebbles. You have the beach infrastructure along the whole length of the beach. The Parking space is very large and around 100 meters away from the beach. You can also Park a motorhome on this parking space. Beach bars and other types of catering are as well present here, as well as apartments and hotels.', 3475, 'en', 2),
(92, 'The paralia Metochi in the region of Kantriki Makedonia it\'s a very long Sandy Beach with lots of infrastructure in the background. You will find many sports fields and a large children playground right next to the beach. There are also some Beach bars where you can rent your  sunshade or deckchair. Parking is done by the road since here are no larger parking places. In the Village itself there are some apartments and a hotel. You can also bring your dog with you as long as you respect the rules.', 3476, 'en', 2),
(93, 'The village of Sozopoli welcomes you on the beach Paralia Vergiás. It\'s a family-type beach, with some beach infrastructure, with lots of sand, some grass, a big parking space, which welcomes also motorhomes, some beach bars and other types off restaurants, as well as some apartments and rooms in the vicinity. Nice about this beach are the benches which are directly located on the beach from where you can enjoy the visit of the see with Mount Olympus in the background.', 3477, 'en', 2),
(94, 'The children playground Beach or the beach of benches, this is the paralia Kyani. You won\'t find anywhere else this much children playgrounds and benches right next to the beach as here. The beach itself is made of sand, is around 1 km long, the water entry is nice and comfortable. Next to the beach you have any beach bars all kinds of accommodation types, there is even one camping ground. So if you are a family with lots of kids and if you maybe have dogs this beach will certainly Suit You.', 3478, 'en', 2),
(95, 'If you like beaches which are close to a city, with all the necessary infrastructure on the beach as well in the background you should visit the beach Paralia Neas Kallikrateias, which is located in the region of Kantriki macedonia. It\'s a Sandy Beach with a nice water entry, with a park in the background, where some children playgrounds are available, ant with a lot of beach bars along the whole stretch of the beach. If you are looking for accommodation on this beach you will find many apartments and hotels in the city.', 3479, 'en', 2),
(96, 'If you like to party and see where are the greek youth is having fun late Into the Night you should visit the beach Sahara. The nearest Village is Kampos, which is located in the region of Kantriki Macedonia. The whole party place is around 30 km outside of thessaloniki. You will find a large parking place here which is just next to the beach. The beach itself is made of sand and has all the necessary Beach infrastructure for such a partyplace. You won\'t have to bring deckchairs and sunshades with you since they are already present here. Accommodation is in the next Village around one kilometer away.', 3480, 'en', 2),
(97, 'The Paralia Potamos is a several kilometers long sandy Beach, located near the town of Ag. Sotiras in the region Kentriki macedonia. From this place you can walk several kilometers along the beach to reach the highest point of the peninsula called Akra Epanomis. On the beach itself you have many Beach infrastructure, the parking is very large and it\'s also suitable for motorhomes. Along the beach here are many beach bars where are you can also rent a deck chair or a sunshade. Accommodation is a little bit far away, and comes mostly in the shape of an apartment.', 3481, 'en', 2),
(98, 'In the Kentriki Makedonia, near the city of Epanomi, you will find the sandy beach Paralia Ikismos Lefkes. The beach itself this a few kilometers long around 15 meters wide. The Parking is around 100 meters away and can hold a few hundred cars. Next to the beach there are two beach bars, which can supply you with the necessary food and drinks. Here You can also rent a deckchair and the sun shade. Apartments also in the vicinity if you need an accommodation.', 3482, 'en', 2),
(99, 'One of the last big sandy beaches, before you reach thessaloniki from the Kalkidiki peninsula is the beach Paralia Neoi Epivates. It\'s located in the region of Kantriki Macedonia, which means Central macedonija. It\'s a few kilometers long beach, with an average wide of 15 meters. You can Park your car directly at the beach. If you get hungry or thirsty here are plenty of beach bars and restaurants available. Some hotels and apartments are also near the beach. If you travel with an airplane an airport is just nearby. It\'s a good starting point for a visit to Thessaloniki.', 3483, 'en', 2),
(100, 'Near the village of Aliki in the region Kentriki makedonija, between Thessaloniki and Katerini, you you will find this Hidden Beach in the middle of nowhere. It\'s a sandy beach, with a huge parking space, which can welcome even motorhomes. Near the beach you will find a lot of trees, which will give you some protection from the Sun. There is even some grass under the trees. A beach bar and and some apartments are also present here.', 3484, 'en', 2),
(101, 'Have you ever been to a beach which neighbors to Salt Pitt. Most of you haven\'t, but on the paralia Pydna, you actually can have such an experience. The beaches located near the village of Aliki in the region of Kentriki Macedonia. The beach itself it\'s made of sand, here you will find some basic beach infrastructure, beach Bar, some accommodation nearby, a marina. It is suitable for families with small children, since the water is quite shallow, which means that you can start swimming after around 30 meters or more.', 3485, 'en', 2),
(102, 'If you drive down to the town of Katerini in the region of Kentriki Macedonia, you will find the beach paralia Korinos. It\'s a more kilometers Long Beach, which reaches around 50 meters of widness. You won\'t have any problems with parking here, since here is a large parking place, which can hold more hundred cars or motorhomes. There is also a campsite, there are apartments, hotels and of course many beach bars. A lifeguard is also present here during the summer time and here are a few sports fields to keep you active.', 3486, 'en', 2),
(103, 'How about a beach Resort next to the beach, well you can have it on the paralia Sentido, in the village of Paralia, near the town of Katerini in the region of Kentriki Macedonia. The whole Beach infrastructure because of the resort is on a high level and is more for those one who seek luxury. The beach is made of sand, it\'s more kilometers long, and around 75 meters wide. The parking is also near, only 100 meters away. Disabled people can also reach the beach, otherwise it\'s a typical family beach.', 3487, 'en', 2),
(104, '', 3488, 'en', 2),
(105, 'This beach is really Olympic, not only is the name of the city olympia, the beach the same name and in the background there is even the mountain Olympus. It is located in the region Kantriki makedonia. It\'s a sandy Beach, a few kilometers long, around 50 meters wide and has a lot of beach infrastructure to offer. In the  park next to the beach, there are even some trees and a grass surface. The parking space is very large and also suitable for motorhomes, beach bars,  restaurants, cake shops and all kinds of accommodation is also available here. If you have small children the park has many playgrounds to offer, so a true family beach.', 3489, 'en', 2),
(106, 'If you like spending your Beach holidays in a camp, just next to the beach, the paralia Varikou would be the one. It\'s a very long, a few kilometers long Sandy Beach, with some basic beach infrastructure. You will be surprised by the amazing look you will get when you look in the background of the beach. Here is the highest mountain of Greece, called Olimbos or Olympus, with a height of 2917 meters. To get to the beach you can drive on a paved road and park your car directly at the beach, where are large parking place awaits you. The water entry is quite shallow, which means is also more suitable for children.', 3490, 'en', 2),
(107, 'You won\'t find any sand on this beach but much of small Pebbles. Be aware that Mount Olympus has your back covered so you can enjoy the look at the sea. The beach is located in the region Kentriki Makedonia, near the town of Limani Litochorou. You can reach this beach by a paved Road and the parking place is large enough to host a few 100 Cars. Around the beach you have different accommodation options, even a Resort, and of course many restaurants and Beach bars. Dogs are also allowed on this beach as long as you respect the rules.', 3491, 'en', 2);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(108, 'The beaches around the mountain Olympus are a mixture between sand, big stones and Pebbles. all are easy to reach and you can park almost directly at the beach and in the most cases a large parking place awaits you. Most of the beaches are a family-type beach, they all have a good degree of beach infrastructure and in the most cases a Beach Bar and the accommodation is directly at the beach. All mentioned above is also true for the beach Litochoro which is located near the town of Plaka, which is still in the region Kan is there actually Kantriki makedonia.', 3492, 'en', 2),
(109, 'Beaches which are located near the town of Leptokarya still belong to the region of Kentriki makedonia. The beach of Leptokarya is a sandy Beach, it\'s a few kilometers long and on some places it can even be up to 50 meters wide. You can park your vehicle almost directly at the beach. The water entry is comfortable. All along the beach there are some Beach bars, a few apartments, hotel resorts, apartment complex. And in the background you can enjoy The View of the mountain Olympus.', 3493, 'en', 2),
(110, 'In this place of the region Kentriki makedonija the beaches are typically a mixture of sand and many stones. The paralia Rema Dervinas which is located near the village of Paralia Skotinas is just one of a kind where it is difficult to figure out what type of surface it actually is. Nevertheless I think it\'s more a sand Beach, and with the whole Beach infrastructure on the beach and in the background it\'s a very interesting Beach. You can park Directly at the beach, and in the vicinity there is also a Resort.', 3494, 'en', 2),
(111, 'This more than one kilometer long sandy beach it\'s located near the village of Paralia Skotinas, which still belongs to the region of Kantriki macedonia. In the background you can enjoy The View on the mountain Olympus, but on the beach itself you have plenty of grass and natural Shadow available. Parking it\'s very comfortable since you can park directly at the beach. There is also a lot of accommodation nearby as well some beach bars restaurants and so on. For those one who like more a camp, there is also one available in the vicinity.', 3495, 'en', 2),
(112, 'This beach is all about camps and sand. The beach Paralia Panteleimonos which is located in the village with the same name is a part of the region Kentriki makedonia. The beach itself is more kilometers long and it\'s up to 40 meters wide. The water entry is nice and comfortable and you can already swim after 10 meters. Beach infrastructure it\'s also on a high level so all your needs will be Suited. If you\'ll get hungry there\'s plenty of beach bars and restaurants available. Parking is also possible almost near the beach and there is also one large parking space available in the vicinity of the beach.', 3496, 'en', 2),
(113, 'This is the last Big Sandy Beach in the region of Kantriki macadonia before you step into the new region of the Thessalia. It\'s located near the town of Platamon and it\'s called Paralia Platamonas. You have a very large parking space available for your vehicle, and motorhomes can park as well here. The beach itself is a few kilometers long and can be up to 100 meters wide. You will find all kinds of accommodation here even camps apartment complexes and hotel resorts. Beach bars and restaurants are also on the beach. If you seek some natural shadow it\'s also available here. The water entry is comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters. ', 3497, 'en', 2),
(114, 'If you want the best possible View on the mountain olympus while enjoying your day on a Sandy Beach you need to visit the beach Paralia Neoi Poroi. It\'s the first Beach in Thessalia when coming from the region of Kentriki macedonia. The beach itself is very long and can sometimes be up to 100 meters wide. The parking space is just next to the beach and can hold several hundred vehicles. The beach infrastructure is on high level so almost all your needs will be pleased. You don\'t need to worry about accommodation or food, there\'s plenty of it directly at the beach.', 3498, 'en', 2),
(115, 'On the right side of the delta Piniou in the region Thessalia you can experience the beauties of the sandy beach Stomio. It&#39;s a very long and quiet wide beach. The whole surrounding is very green, with lots of natural shadow. In stormy weathers the waves forming here could also be used for surfing. The parking is available almost everywhere around the beach and you need to walk over a bridge to reach the beach. The beach infrastructure is also present here and it&#39;s on a quiet pleasant level. Apartments, hotels and camps are also in the vicinity, and if you get hungry there&#39;s plenty of restaurants, beach bars and other types available. If you have children they can play on a child playground, which is also here available.', 3499, 'en', 1),
(116, 'Everything about this beach is special. First of all the road to reach the beach it\'s quite unique and has a lot of turns, but it should be okay for a motorhome go down here. The parking itself is not flat but falls sideways. Some parking spots are to be paid some are free. The beach is located in the village of Platia Ammos, which is part of the region Thessalia. It\'s a Sandy Beach around four hundred meters long and up to 20 meters wide. Beach infrastructure is also present here so you will find what you need. Beach bars and restaurants near the beach, as well some apartments. In Stormy Weather big waves can form here, maybe some Surfer will like it.', 3500, 'en', 2),
(117, 'Just beneath the mountain Ossa Oros you will find this amazing Sandy Beach in the middle of the village Koutsoupia, which is a part of the region Thessalia. The parking can be done either on a large parking space or by the road. The water entry is comfortable and you can already start swimming 5 meters. If you want to rent an apartment you have plenty options in this Village. As well if you get hungry here are many beach bars and restaurants. ', 3501, 'en', 2),
(118, 'How about a long very long beach with black sand. Well it\'s not only sand there are also stones mixed within the sand, and some grass is also present here. This beach is located in the village Velika, the region it belongs to is called Thessalia. You won\'t have any problems with parking, you can just park your vehicle next to the road and step right on to the beach. Along the beach you will find some apartments as well as some beach bars and restaurants.', 3502, 'en', 2),
(119, 'You certainly won\'t have any problems finding your spot on this almost 10 km Long Beach. It\'s made almost completely of black sand, here and there some Pebbles are mixed within. The beach is located in the region of Thessalia, near the village of Kato Sotiritsa. Parking your vehicle here won\'t be any problem not even for motorhomes. Beach infrastructure here is more or less on a basic level, but you have some restaurants and beach bars at your disposal. Some apartments and a camping ground are also near.', 3503, 'en', 2),
(120, 'Not far away from the town of Larissa when you drive over the mountains you will find this nice sandy beach. The nearest Village is called Kato Polinderi and it\'s a part of the region Thessalia. The beach it\'s easy to reach by Road and a large parking space which can hold also motorhomes awaits you here. On the beach you will be served by a beach bar and here are also toilets and showers. Right next to the beach there is no accommodation but there is some around one kilometer away in the form of apartments. The water entry on some places can be tricky because there are rocks in the water but on some there are none.', 3504, 'en', 2),
(121, 'What a nice surprise this beach is. The Only problem is that it\'s quite difficult to reach, but not so much by the path, but by finding a parking place. The only option is on a private parking place where there are quite many around the beach. It\'s located near the Big Town Volos, a part of the region Thessalia, but more precisely near the village Afissos. The name of the beach is Kalifteri. The beach itself is a mixture off sand and small Pebbles. The water entry is comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters. You can Find a beach bar on the beach, and many apartments in the vicinity. ', 3505, 'en', 2),
(122, 'The village of Malaki in the region of Thessalia has a beach to offer which is just next to the road. You can park on the other side of the road, cross the road and you are already at the beach. You will find a mixture of sand and small Pebbles on the beach as well as some basic Beach infrastructure, a beach bar and a few apartments in the vicinity of the Beach. The beach is approximately 750 m long and it\'s only about 10 meters wide.', 3506, 'en', 2),
(123, 'How about a beach with a River next to it? This beach is really special, one of a kind. It\'s located near city of Volos, which is a part of the region Thessalia.Parking is really generous, you can park directly at the beach and it\'s large enough to accompany even motorhomes. The water entry is comfortable and since the water depth false quickly you can almost start swimming right away. A beach bar is also present here in the summertime, but you won\'t find any accommodation in the vicinity, but a little bit far away there is enough. ', 3507, 'en', 2),
(124, 'The city of Volos, located in the region of Thessalia, has its own City Beach. You will find sand here, some natural shadow, lots of sunshade and deckchairs and of course lots of people. The beach infrastructure is on a high level, parking is available just next to the beach. If you get hungry here are plenty restaurants and beach bars, as well as some apartments and hotels in the city itself. The water entry is comfortable and you can start swimming immediately. A city park is also available next to the beach.', 3508, 'en', 2),
(125, 'Just outside the City of Volos you can enjoy another Sandy Beach in the region of Thessalia. The beach is well equipped with all necessary infrastructure, it even has a pier from which you can either jump or catch some fish. Outside the beach there is a large parking space picture needs to walk only 50 meters to reach the beach. If you get hungry a fast food restaurant available at your disposal. The water here is crystal clear and the water entry is comfortable. ', 3509, 'en', 2),
(126, 'We could almost say an all-inclusive Beach. There simply are little things that are missing, except you visiting the Beach. The beach is located in the town of Nees Pagases and belongs to the region of Thessalia.\nTo park your vehicle it\'s very simple since here are lots of parking places which are directly at the beach. Families with lots of children we love this beach because here you can find countless children playgrounds. To find a restaurant or a beachbar at this place is no problem as well as not to get an apartment. This beach is also known for very long piers, and there are a few of them, from which you can admire the crystal clear water.', 3510, 'en', 2),
(127, 'How about a beach with red sand? For sure there are not that many in the world. This special Beach is located in the region of Thessalia, in the town of Nea Anchialos. You can park your vehicle by the road and head directly to the beach. Beach infrastructure on this place is also on the high level and you won\'t get as much natural shadow anywhere else. The trees are located trough the whole stretch of the beach. Because this beach is so special you can imagine that\'s finding a Beach Bar a restaurant is here no problem. The same goes for hotels and apartments. The water entry is comfortable and you can start swimming right away.', 3511, 'en', 2),
(128, 'The village of Gliva is a true fisheries location. Here are plenty of piers, a ferry station and of course a village Beach. You can park your car in the center of the village near the piers, and walk around 200 meters till you reach the beach. The beach is made of sand and Pebbles and it\'s suitable for families. Almost on the beach you even have a children playground and some Sports fields. The water is quite shallow which makes it ideal for small children. If you get hungry here are plenty of options to have a meal or just to have a drink or an ice cream. Accommodation is also nearby in the form of apartments and hotels.', 3512, 'en', 2),
(129, 'The village of Achladi, just located in the region of Sterea Ellada has a very nice Beach to offer. The beach is quite special, because the surface material has a red tone, no matter if it is sand or stones. You will Find also some natural Shadow Here. Sports fields and children playgrounds are also directly at the beach. The water entry is on some spots very comfortable on some you need to walk on big stones, the water itself is quite shallow so be prepared to walk a few 10 meters before you can start to swim. In the vicinity a little bit further away in the village Center you can also find some restaurants and some apartments.', 3513, 'en', 2),
(130, 'In the region of Sterea Ellada there is a village called Paralia Rachon where you will find around 750 meters Long Beach. To park your car in this Village is quite difficult but there are some places on the end of the beach which can hold around 20 cars, otherwise you park either by the road or on private accommodation. Along the beach which is around 10 metres wide, you will find many beach bars and restaurants where you can also rent sunshade or deckchair. Some hotels and apartments are also available here for accommodation. The water entry is also comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters.', 3514, 'en', 2),
(131, 'The village of Drepano which is located in the region of Sterea Ellada can be proud on a very special beach. The beach has a special shape and it&#39;s more like a small peninsula made of red sand. Kiters will love this beach, it&#39;s also an official kitesurf training area. To park your car here is no problem, the space is very large and can welcome several hundred cars. Not only will the nice beach amaze you will also have a stunning view on the mountains in the background. A beach bar is also located here and in the vicinity there are some apartments where you can stay for longer if you would like to explore the Malian Gulf.', 3515, 'en', 1),
(132, 'How about a green grass Beach? For sure there aren\'t many. One is located in the town of Agia Marina, which belongs to the region of Sterea Ellada. Not only will you find a lot of grass on this beach you will also be under the cover of trees. The parking space is very large and it\'s only 30 meters away, motorhomes can also park here. On the beach itself there are quite many benches, most of them in a nice shadow. If you get  hungry restaurants and a beachbar are nearby. For accommodation you have a few apartments at your disposal.', 3516, 'en', 2),
(133, 'In the region of Sterea Ellada there is a city called Kamena Vourla. Here you can find a one kilometer long red sand beach with lots of beach infrastructure. The beach also has a lot of trees, to protect you from the Sun. Because it\'s a City Beach you can be sure to have a lot of restaurants, shops an other amusement facilities at your disposal. Here are all so many hotels and apartments available for your stay. The only problem is the parking which is done by the road, since there are almost no parking places.', 3517, 'en', 2),
(134, 'The beach of asproneri is a very special one. Here you won\'t find any sand but instead a lot of Pebbles and stones. The beach stretches through several kilometers it\'s on the widest part around 25 metres wide. The water entry is very comfortable and swimming starts already after five meters. On the tip of the beach there can be strong currents so watch out were you swim. A beach bar is also present here, and there you can rent some beach equipment. Parking is done by the road which goes all around this small peninsula. You almostly step from your car onto the beach.', 3518, 'en', 2),
(135, 'A true Adventurer Beach. Are you one of those who love peace on the beach, with almost no people beside you? If so then I suggest you to visit the beach Paralia Neochori, located near the town of Agios Konstantinos. The region in which this beach wait you is called Sterea Ellada. If you are looking for beach infrastructure, well here you won\'t find any, although here is a large parking place, suitable also for motorhomes. The path to the beach is a little bit difficult, so you need to watch out where you\'re stepping. The composition of the surface on the beach is a mixture of Pebbles and sand.', 3519, 'en', 2),
(136, 'Right in the middle of the sea of the olives trees this nice shaped beach awaits you. It&#39;s made of sand and of pebbles and it&#39;s suitable for families. It&#39;s located near the village of Akti, which is a part of the region Sterea Ellada or Central Greece. For the ones who love to sail or take a boat to the beach you need to enter the North Euboea Gulf to reach it.The road to the beach which leads you through the olive trees fields is paved, and also suitable for motorhomes to drive through. On the beach itself there is some beach infrastructure to fulfill your basic needs. The water here drops pretty quickly so you can start swimming right away. If you get hungry or thirsty here&#39;s even a beach bar available for you.&nbsp;', 3520, 'en', 1),
(137, 'The paralia Loggos has its name from the neighboring Village of Loggos. It\'s located in the region of Sterea Ellada. It\'s a 500 meters long Beach with a surface which is a mixture of sand and small Pebbles. You can park your vehicle directly at the beach and it\'s also suitable for motorhomes. The water entry is nice and comfortable but you need to walk on stones to reach the point of swim after 10 meters. On the beach is also a beach bar and some apartments are also nearby.', 3521, 'en', 2),
(138, 'A lot of natural shadow as well as some grass under the trees awaits you at this nice beach. Located in the region of Sterea Ellada or Central Greece in the North Euboean Gulf, near the town of Arkitsa it provides you a nice view on the island of Evvia/ Euboea. Because of the beautiful location this beach will stay in your memory forever. The surface is a mixture of sand, pebbles and rocks. The water entry is very comfortable and enables you to swim right away. Parking your vehicle here is no problem, since here are plenty of spaces available wherever you park. You also won&#39;t be hungry on this beach, as well you won&#39;t have any problems finding an apartment or similar accommodation.', 3522, 'en', 1),
(139, 'If you have small children you will be amazed by these Beach. Not only is the water here very shallow, the beach is a sendy type Beach, you also have a large children playground directly at the beach. The town where the beach is located is called Livanates, and it\'s a part of the region Sterea Ellada. The parking is directly at the beach and it\'s paved. On the beach itself you have many beach infrastructure and of course a lot of bars, restaurants, fast food and so on. Hotels and apartments are also directly at the beach.', 3523, 'en', 2),
(140, 'Pure Sand is what you will find on the beach Skala Atalantis. The region it belongs to is Sterea Ellada and it is a part of the municipality of Skala. Parking here Your vehicle is not a problem as well as it is not a problem to reach the beach from the parking. You will find a lot of beach infrastructure here, as well as many children playgrounds. The water is quite shallow here and the swimming point is between 20 and 30 meters. The beach is around 400 meters long and 30 meters wide. Having a glass of beer or eating something is here no problem as well as finding a free room for an apartment.', 3524, 'en', 2),
(141, 'This beach is certainly more for those one who don\'t need as much Beach infrastructures as normal user does and who seek more piece then entertainment.  It\'s a few kilometers long and up to 25 meters wide Beach.  Parking place is quite huge and can hold several hundred vehicles.  the water entery is comfortable and you can start swimming after 20 meters.  you won\'t find any restaurants or beach bars as well as no accommodation here.  The region where this Beach is located  is called Sterea Ellada  and the nearest town Kiparissi.', 3525, 'en', 2),
(142, 'Crystal clear water and many Pebbles, white Pebbles awaits you on this Beach.  You won\'t get any better View of the Island Evvia  from any place then from this beach.  The nearest Village or town is called Theologos and it belongs to the region of Sterea Ellada. To park your vehicle here is not a problem and the road to the beach is really nice.  The beach itself  is around 300 meters long and 5 meters wide. Here you will find a beach bar and restaurant but no accommodation is available directly at the beach. Some basic Beach infrastructure  is also here at your disposal.', 3526, 'en', 2),
(143, 'In the village of Paximida you will find a very long Pebbles Beach  which is facing onto the island of Evvia. Paximida belongs to the region of Sterea Ellada. Parking Your car on this beach it\'s not a problem, you only need to park it by the road. The beach has some basic beach infrastructure and here are a few  Beachbars restaurants at your disposal.  A few apartments are also available here for your stay. The water entry  is a little bit tricky since you need to walk over some rocks but after that you can already start swimming.', 3527, 'en', 2),
(144, 'Well if you like romantic beaches and you would like to spend your precious moments with your loved ones those beaches down here are just right for you. They are located in the region of Sterea Ellada, near the village of Vrisoui. You can park your vehicle next to the road and head down a 50 meters long path, where you have more small beaches to choose from. Either go left or right and find your perfect place. The beaches are very small and are not suitable for families but more for adventurers. On the beaches there is no beach infrastructure but some apartments are by the road.', 3528, 'en', 2),
(145, 'This beach will leave you speechless, so much beauty on one kilometer of coastline melts your heart away. When you&#39;re in Greece head for the region of Sterea Ellada and the Village Fities. You can also reach this beach with a boat when entering the North Euboean Gulf. The name of the beach is Paralia Alykes. This beauty is a mixture of sand and rocks. The entry into the water is comfortable and there should be no problem, except on some spots where you have rocks under the water surface. The water is also quite shallow and the point of swim starts at around 30 meters. Parking is done either by the road or on some large parking places nearby. Beach bars and restaurants are also on the beach and provide a high standard of services. You can also rent deckchairs and sunshades at the beach. If you like to play volleyball you have many options here as well as some water sports. Accommodation is possible here, but there are not that many apartments nearby so possibly you need to search in the larger area to stay near this amazing beach.', 3529, 'en', 1),
(146, 'Although the beach has very little beach infrastructure, a shower and parking, it is suitable for families with small children, because of the shallow water. The point of swim is around 40 meters from the beach. The beach itself is located in the region of Sterea Ellada, near the village of Ag. Minas. You can park your car by the road, since here are no official parking places. Beach bars and restaurants are also not available on this beach, and for accommodation you need to search a little bit far away.', 3530, 'en', 2),
(147, 'A true City Beach. The beach itself is located in the city Xirovrisi, but the view faces in the direction of the city  Halkida. Both cities are located in the region of Sterea Ellada. You can park your car directly by the road and after 50  meters you can already be at the beach. On the beach you will find a lot of sand and concrete stairs. Entry is comfortable either by the stairs or via the sand beach. A beach bar is located directly at the beach, and many apartments and hotels are around it. Nearby you can find a park with children playgrounds.', 3531, 'en', 2),
(148, 'A nice hidden beach in the middle of the town Halkida. If you would like to visit this beach you need to go to the region of Sterea Ellada and visit the island Evvia. To park your vehicle next to the beach is not the problem only in the summertime when it can get crowded. The beach is a mixture rocks, pebbles and sand. You have a shower and some benches here otherwise the beach is without other beach infrastructure. A restaurant is also nearby and you can rent an apartment in the neighboring buildings.', 3532, 'en', 2),
(149, 'In the town of Halkida you can find many City beaches. But the beach Paralia Kourénti seems like it is the best one. There simply are many reasons why it is so. First of all you won\'t have any problem with the parking, here is a really large parking place which can hold many hundred vehicles. You you can get directly from the parking lot to the beach. On the beach itself you have a lot of beach infrastructure, also a playground for the children, showers and a beach bar where you can rent your beach equipment. The beach is made partly of sand, partly of Pebbles, it\'s around 200 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The water entry is comfortable and you can swim after 20 meters of entering the water. Around the beach restaurants, a beach bar, cake shop and others and of course many apartments and rooms.', 3533, 'en', 2),
(150, 'On the island of Evvia in the town of Halkida this is one of many city beaches here. It is easy to reach with your vehicle and the parking place is large enough to welcome even motorhomes. The city is located in region of Sterea Ellada. The beach surface is a mixture off Pebbles, rocks and sand. It\'s a family beach with some basic Beach infrastructure, some restaurants nearby and some apartments in the city itself. Start swimming is possible after 15 meters, but only after you walk over some rocks in the water.', 3534, 'en', 2),
(151, 'On the island of Evvia, which is a part of region Sterea Ellada, near the village of Nea Artaki you have a very nice little sandy the beach to go to. It\'s around 100 meters long and about 20 meters wide. The water here is pretty shallow which makes it a perfect place for small children to play in it safely. On the beach itself you also have a children playground and a sport field where you can play basketball. Parking your vehicle here is quite easy. You have around 100 places for the car. On the beach itself you have a restaurant, a coffeebar and a Beach Bar. In the surrounding there are a few apartments for you available.', 3535, 'en', 2),
(152, 'A true Adventurer Beach. Almost no beach infrastructure, only a few visitors, hard to reach with the vehicle, and no apartments in the vicinity, this is the beach Sipiada. It\'s located on the island of Euboea, and belongs to the region of Sterea Ellada. You can reach the beach by a dirt road but it\'s quite difficult and you need to park your car on a pebble surface. From the parking lot to the beach it\'s only 10 meters, and it\'s a Pebbles Beach. The water falls quite fast so you can swim right away.', 3536, 'en', 2),
(153, 'This beach is called Paralia Rovies and it&#39;s located on the island Euboea, near the village Rovia. It is aslo a part of the North Euboea gulf. It&#39;s a pebble beach, a few kilometers long and up to 20 meters wide. To reach the beach you need to drive on a dirt road, but once there you can park directly at the beach. Beach infrastructure is here almost not present, but there is some in the beach bar along the beach. Some natural shadow is also here, end when going to the water you can already start swimming after 3 meters. Apartments are also in the vicinity, if you would like to stay here for longer.', 3537, 'en', 1),
(154, 'When visiting the island of Euboea you need to drive to the Village of Ilia to discover this unique pebbles Beach. Parking your vehicle here it\'s quite the challenge, either you do it by the road, or you drive through the whole village to park your vehicle on a small parking place next to the harbour. The beach itself has almost no infrastructure, but there is some in the village. The water here is very deep, so you can already start swimming after three meters. The slope of the beach is also quite steep. When you get hungry or you want to spent the night or even your holidays here you should go to the Village which is just nextby.', 3538, 'en', 2),
(155, 'You can reach the island Euboea either by a fairy or a bridge. If You choose the fairy you are probably going to disembark in the town of Loutra Edipsou. Here you can find a sandy beach which goes by the name Paralia Makedonomachon. The beach is around 75 meters long and 5 meters wide. Parking is available all around the beach. You have a park in the vicinity and some children playground. The water entry is comfortable and swimming starts already after five meters. A coffee bar, restaurants, hotels and apartments also nearby.', 3539, 'en', 2),
(156, 'On the north side of the island Euboea you can find a 300 meter long Sandy Beach, just near the town off Neos Pirgos. To park your car on this beach is easy and not stressful because of the large space. You can access the beach directly from your car. On the beach itself you will find some basic beach infrastructure. A beach bar is also present here, and you can rent some beach equipment here. Accommodation is available only in the town itself, around 1 kilometer away. To start swimming you only need to go around five meters into the water.', 3540, 'en', 2),
(157, 'In the town of Neos Pirgos a one kilometer-long sandy beach awaits you. But before you reach the beach you need to take a ferry or drive over the bridge to the island of Euboea. It\'s a family-type beach with lots of hi standard beach infrastructure. Parking is available along the beach and can hold several hundred vehicles. The water entry it\'s very pleasant and you can already start swimming 5 meters. You even have a pier on the beach either to catch some fish or to jump from it into the water. A lot of restaurants and other types of catering are available along Beach, as well as many types of accommodation.', 3541, 'en', 2),
(158, 'If you like a more natural Beach then the touristic type you are on the right spot. The island of Euboea has many similar beaches to the one which I am describing right now. The closest town is Kanatadika and it\'s a few kilometers away. Parking your vehicle or motorhome on this spot is not the big challenge, you have plenty space beside the road. You will not find any Beach infrastructure here, but many peaceful and Quiet Moments. In the village nearby if you are looking for accommodation there are some apartments available. The water here has a big depth, that\'s why you can start swimming after around 10 meters. in the Summertime some beach or improvised beach bars are available here, and you can rent also some beach equipment there.', 3542, 'en', 2),
(159, 'On the north part of the island Euboea you will find this long Sandy Beach facing towards the city of Volos. The Village the beach is located is called Kanatadika. This beautiful Island belongs to the region of Sterea Ellada. To park your vehicle on this beach it\'s quite easy, because you have many parking spaces for you available, also motorhomes are welcomed here. On the beach itself there is some basic infrastructure. In the summertime you also have the option to rent some beach equipment. Showers are also available. In the case you like to have some natural shadow you will find some here. The water entery is nice and comfortable. Beach bars are all secure as well as some apartments in the vicinity.', 3543, 'en', 2),
(160, 'In the village of Pefki, a very long, a few kilometers long, pebbles Beach awaits you. In the region of Sterea Ellada you need to drive to the island of Euboea to reach this place. Parking for vehicle here is not a problem and you have your Beach directly at your feet. You won\'t find any sand here but lots of different sizes of pebbles. The beach infrastructure here is on a high level. Almost everything is here to fulfill your needs. Beach bars and restaurants also available here and are stretching along the beach. For accommodation you have hotels, apartments and camping grounds available for you. The water falls also quite fast which makes it perfect to start your swim right away.', 3544, 'en', 2),
(161, 'On the northwest side of the island Euboea there is a small village with a very long pebbles Beach, called Psaropouli. The beach is several kilometers long up to 30 meters wide and the surface is a mixture of black and brown sand with small Pebbles. You can park your vehicle by the road, here you won\'t find any official parking spots. Along the beach there is some basic Beach infrastructure available. The water entry is fine and comfortable. Apartments and Studios are available along the whole stretch of the beach. Beach bars and restaurants are more concentrated around the Harbour.', 3545, 'en', 2),
(162, 'A very special beach awaits you in the village of Agkali, which is located on the west side of the island Euboea or the island Evia. Greece is quite big and to get to this beach head for the region of Sterea Ellada or Central Greece. When you arrive to the beach parking is not a problem, you can simply park your car beside the road, which goes directly by the beach. The surface of the beach is special, it&#39;s a mixture off pebbles and sand, especially of red and black color. You will love the beach color with the color of the sea. Beach infrastructure is only basic here, but more is around the restaurants. If you have a dog you can also bring him to the beach. If you would like to stay here for longer, you have some apartments and a camping ground at your disposal.', 3546, 'en', 1),
(163, 'In the middle of the fields there is a small village called Kria Vrisi, which is located on the east side of the island Euboea. It\'s an almost 1 km long sandy pebbles beach suitable for families and for adventorours. You have some basic basic infrastructure here, like showers but otherwise there is not much here. You can park your vehicle or motorhome direct at the beach. Parking places are abundant here. In the summertime a beach bar is also here where you can rent some beach equipment. And the little bit in the background you have some apartments and restaurants.', 3547, 'en', 2),
(164, 'In the village of Pilio, on the west side of the island Euboea you have a nice pebbles sandy Beach to go to. The beach is around 500 meters long and up to 30 meters wide. Parking here is no problem. Either you Park on the large paved parking place or in a small Park. You can access the beach directly from the parking. Here is some basic Beach infrastructure, many restaurants and beach bars are in the vicinity. For accommodation you have some apartments near the village itself and around the beach.', 3548, 'en', 2),
(165, 'This beach will simply leave you speechless. So much beauty on one place melts your heart away. There&#39;s no other place on the earth to have a more crystal clear water than this beach. The name of the beach is paralia Kalamos and it&#39;s located on the east side of the island Euboea or Evia. You can reach the beach by a paved road, where a large paved parking place awaits you. The surface of the beach is made of white pebbles, some sand and rocks. The water entry is very nice and comfortable and you either start swimming after 5 meters or you can jump from the cliffs into the blue water. You have a lot of apartments and rooms on the beach, as well as restaurants and beach bars. Bring your mask, snorkel and fins with you to do some snorkeling, you won&#39;t regret it.', 3549, 'en', 1),
(166, 'Another special Beach on the east side of the island Euboea. The Paralia Zarakon it\'s quite unique. What makes it so unique is the large wawe barrier right in front of the beach to protect you from the wawes. You have a very large parking place right on the beach, which welcomes also motorhomes. It\'s a family type Beach with some basic beach infrastructure. You will love the crystal Clear water and the white pebbles on the beach. You also have sunshades on the beachs, and if you would like to stay there for a few days you have some apartments and rooms in the vicinity. Restaurants in beachbars are not present on this beach, maybe there is some improvised catering during the summer time.', 3550, 'en', 2),
(167, 'If you are on the island Euboea you certainly don&#39;t want to miss this beautiful beach. It&#39;s located in the region of Sterea Ellada, near the village of Mesochoria. When driving on the paved road down to the beach, you need to know that the road has many turns, sometimes it can get narrow and tricky, so drive carefully. You can park your vehicle directly on the beach. Here a small pebbles beach awaits you. The water is very clear and has a nice blue tone. The water entry is comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters. Here you have some basic beach infrastructure, a beach bar is also available here, but in the vicinity there are no apartments, so you need to stay in the village above the beach, and try to find an apartment there. Bring your snorkeling equipment with you, you won&#39;t regret it.', 3551, 'en', 1),
(168, 'White small pebbles and some gray sand is what you will find on the beach paralia limiona Mesochorion. It&#39;s located on the island Euboea, near the village Tsakei. The road to the beach is paved and in a good condition, motorhomes can also drive here. The parking, once on the beach, is on a dirt road and you need to to park your vehicle by the road. You have some beach infrastructure here and the beach is suitable for families. The water is obviously crystal clear which makes it very attractive for snorkeling and other similar activities. You have some beach bars and restaurants here as well as a camping ground and some apartments.', 3552, 'en', 1),
(169, 'If you are searching on the island Euboea for a nice day camp location under trees with sand on the beach which is one kilometer long you are on the right spot. The beach is located on the west side of the island, near the village Ag. Dimitrios. The island and the village or a part of the region Sterea Ellada. You can park your vehicle along the whole stretch of the beach, mostly under the trees with a Direct beach access. Surface is a mixture of sand, pebbles and grass. Water entry is nice and comfortable, but Beach infrastructure it\'s almost zero. In the surrounding area there are some apartments for you available. If you get hungry a beach bar is also available here.', 3553, 'en', 2),
(170, 'Near the village of Akti Nireos on the west side of the island Euboea, you have a nice little Beach right besides the main road at your disposal. It\'s made of Pebbles and it\'s suitable for families. You can park your car directly at the beach and almost step directly into the water. Here you have some beach infrastructure, even some children playgrounds. The water false quite slow, it\'s shallow bay. You have a restaurant on the beach and some apartments in the vicinity.', 3554, 'en', 2),
(171, 'How about a sandy beach located between two hotels? It\'s possible but you need to drive to the island of Euboea and head to the Village of Malakonta. You have a quite large parking space here available which is located directly at the beach. On the beach accept from the sand here is also some grass and some natural shadow. You can also use a pier, either to catch some fish or to jump into the water. Except on the beaches from the hotels here is almost no beach infrastructure, but there\'s a lot on the beaches of the hotels. Restaurants in beachbars are not  present here, there is some catering on the beach hotel, and of course you can stay for your holidays either in the hotels or in the neighboring Apartments.', 3555, 'en', 2),
(172, 'A very large parking place through the whole stretch of the beach awaits you on the paralia Pagorama. The beach is located on the island Euboea, near the village Pagorama. You need to go to the region of Sterea Ellada to enjoy this beach. The surface of the beach are Pebbles, which are located on the whole 400 meters of the beaches length. The widness of the beach is only 5 meters, but you can already start swimming after a few meters. Here is a Beach Bar and Restaurant for you available and some apartments are nearby. Showers and toilets are also available here.', 3556, 'en', 2),
(173, 'If you are a family with children you will love this beach. Located on the island Euboea, near the village of Faros it offers you a nice Beach holiday. Getting here by Road is easy, as well as it is the parking. You can either Park your vehicle on the large parking place or by the road. The surface of the beach is a mixture of sand and grass, some trees are also here, a children\'s playground is as well available. You certainly will love the nice shaped benches which can turn into a small tent. Bring your food  with you, since there are no restaurants or beach bars, but if you would like to spend more days here there are some apartments in the vicinity available. The water falls quite quick which makes the beach not really suitable for very small children.', 3557, 'en', 2),
(174, 'One of the last beaches in the region of Sterea Ellada, when going down the coastline from the north to the south region of Attiki is the family beach called paralia plaka Dilesiou. It&#39;s a true family beach, with lots of children playgrounds, lots of natural shadow, which is great for your babies, and some beach infrastructure to service your needs. To park your vehicle here is not a problem, you either do it on the large parking place or by the road. Restaurants and beach bars or here not present, so bring your food with you. When you&#39;re looking for accommodation there are a few apartments in the vicinity. The water entry is on some places nice, on some you need to walk over the rocks.', 3558, 'en', 1),
(175, 'If you are searching for a beach with pebbles and natural shadow along the whole one kilometer Long Beach, you are on the right spot with this beach. It\'s located in the region of Attiki, near the village of Chalkoutsi and it\'s called Paralia Pigathakia. You have a large parking space available here even for motorhomes. Access to the beach is directly from the parking.  Beach bars and apartments are available along the whole stretch of the beach. You can also rent some beach equipment here. The water fals quite quickly, you can swim right away.', 3559, 'en', 2),
(176, 'This beach is a true adventurer beach. Except from the parking space and some benches almost no beach infrastructure is here available. It\'s a few kilometers long Sandy beach with very shallow water. It\'s located in the region of Attiki, near the town Ag. Konstantinos. So if you can live without the beach infrastructure and you have small children who like to play in the water safefly this Beach is for you. Bring your drinks and food with you, because here are no options to get any. Accommodations like apartments are available in the vicinity.', 3560, 'en', 2),
(177, 'A beach full of white pebbles as long as the eye can see awaits you on this location. If you like this kind of beach head for the region of Attiki towards the town Nea Palatia. From the beach you have a wonderful view on the Greek Island Euboea or Evia. Parking your vehicle is possible by the road or on a very large parking place, motorhomes are also welcomed. Because of the pebbles the water here is very clear and clean, but falls very fast, so you can swim immediately. You have many restaurants and beach bars along the whole stretch of the beach, as well as some apartments in the vicinity.', 3561, 'en', 1),
(178, 'Near the town of Agii Apostoli you have a white pebble beach at your disposal. It\'s located in the region of Attiki and offers you fantastic views of the island Euboea. The beach is around 500 meters long, and up to 10 meters wide, and has a lot of beach infrastructure on the highest level. Parking is done either by the road or on a large parking space near the harbor. It\'s a family beach and near the harbor there are also children playgrounds. You can start swimming after 10 meters of entering the water. Near the harbor there is also a large concentration of different beach bars and restaurants, and many apartments are in the vicinity of the beach.', 3562, 'en', 2),
(179, 'In the region of Attiki, north from the famous city Athens, near the village Dikastika, you have a very long sandy beach available for your beach holidays. It&#39;s more kilometers long and around 20 meters wide, and has along the whole stretch of the beach trees everywhere. So much natural shadow you won&#39;t find anywhere else. To get here with your vehicle is quite easy, the roads are paved, only the last around 200 meters you need to drive on a dirt road, all the way to the beach. You can park your vehicle under the trees, there is space everywhere. Beach bars are here available during the summer time, but unfortunately there is almost no accommodation nearby. Beach infrastructure, because the beach is so wild, is also not present on a high level, take that into account. Water entry is very nice and you can already start swimming after 5 meters.', 3563, 'en', 1),
(180, 'The city of Nea Makri is a very touristic City. Located the region of Attiki, it also has its own Beach, which is quite unique. The beach is a mixture of grass, sand, pebbles and rocks. On the most part of the beach when you go to the water, you need to walk over some Flat Rocks, but after 15 meters you can already swim. You will find also some natural shadow here, or rent some beach equipment. Families with children will love this beach, because you will find a lot of children playgrounds here. You can park your vehicle by the road, where there are manny signed parking lots. You can get all kinds of food  along the whole stretch of the beach, and in the vicinity you will also find all kinds of apartments and hotels.', 3564, 'en', 2),
(181, 'In the Region of Attiki, in the town Rafina you have a true City Beach to spend your Beach holidays at. The surface is a mixture of sand, pebbles and grass. The beach infrastructure is on a high level, and you have so many things to do there. Rafina is also a major port which connects you with 4 neighboring Islands. Parking your vehicle here is not a problem, and you can access the beach directly from the parking. The beach itself is around 400 meters long and up to 50 meters wide. You have many beach bars and some apartments and hotels in the background. Children playgrounds are as well here. Water entry is very comfortable and you can already start swimming after 5 meters.', 3565, 'en', 2),
(182, 'In Greece you will find many unique beaches, and this is also the case for the beach named Paralia Marikes. The thing that the so special about it is the water entry, it\'s quite unique, because although it is not comfortable on some places, you can actually after around 10 meters jump into the sea. You walk around 10 meters on a rocky plate and then it false sharply to a few minutes of depth. The surface here is made of sand, some natural Shadow is a swell here. For the Parking you have two large parking places available, which can hold as well motorhomes. A beach bar is also present here and if you would like to stay here longer you have some apartments in the background.', 3566, 'en', 2),
(183, 'Very close to the city of Athens, there is a Town called Artemida. Here you will find a few kilometers long sandy beach, which has a very high beach infrastructure level. Whatever you\'re looking for you\'re certainly will find it here, also children playgrounds as well as sport fields. You can park your vehicle along the whole stretch of the beach, and access the beach directly from the parking. Here are many Beachbars and restaurants and you can rent some beach equipment there. The angle of the beach is quite flat but not the water entry, so swimming starts at the around 15 meters. If you\'re looking for some accommodation you have plenty of apartments in the vicinity.', 3567, 'en', 2),
(184, 'Near Athens in the region of Attiki you will find the Village Porto Rafti. It\'s located just east from the famous ancient city and offers youa pebbles Beach to enjoy the crystal clear water here. You have a very large parking place here from which you can access the beach directly. Some beach infrastructure is also present here, as well as some restaurants and apartments in the vicinity. The water falls here pretty quickly, so you can already start swimming after three meters. If you like land Sports some fields are also here available. ', 3568, 'en', 2);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(185, 'When you are in Athens and you have some free time to visit beaches or you are here because of the beaches, you should go to the Village of Porto Rafti, and visit the beach named Paralia Aylaki. It\'s really a special Beach, it\'s fully covered with sun shades and has a beach infrastructure on the highest level. Sports fields and some children playgrounds are also in the vicinity, not on the beach itself, but near the parking. You also have a very large parking place only 100 metres away. The beach is made of sand, the point of swim is around 15 meters from entering the water. A Beach bar and some restaurants are available here and for accommodation you have some apartments in the vicinity.', 3569, 'en', 2),
(186, 'Not far away from the ancient city of Athens you should visit the Village Paralia Kakis Thalassis. Why? Because it is an amazing Beach with one of the highest beach infrastructure standards in the region of Attiki. Right in front of the beach you can park your vehicle and after only 50 meters you are already at the beach. The beaches is around 150 meters long and up to 30 meters wide and it\'s partially made of sand and of Pebbles, which are also the surface in the sea. The depth rises quickly so only after 3 meters you can already swim. On the beach there are not only children playgrounds and sports fields you even have a swimming pool. BeachBars and restaurants are also here. Apartments are in the vicinity but not in a huge number.', 3570, 'en', 2),
(187, 'Just outside, towards southeast from Athens, you have a village called Posidonia. There\'s no pretty much around the village, but a beautiful sandy Beach with lots of natural shadow to protect you from the hot greece Sun. You can reach the beach by a paved Road, and park your vehicle by the road, directly at the beach. You have around 400 meters of length and up to 30 meters of whidness available on the beach. Here is some basic Beach infrastructure, but there is more inside a camp, just next to the beach. Taking a swim here is easy and you can already swim after 5 meters. On The beach directly there are no beach parts, but there is some catering in the camp. If you want to stay here for longer you either have the camp or the neighboring apartments.', 3571, 'en', 2),
(188, 'The region Attiki is full of surprises. A beach which goes by the name Paralia Souníou hess even got a temple on one of the neighboring Hills. The temple is dedicated to the god Poseidon. Right next to it there\'s a second temple, called the temple of Athina Sounias. So if you get bored of this wonderful Beach, you can explore some greek culture here. The beach itself is made of sand, is around 200 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. Because of the vicinity of a hotel you have a lot of beach infrastructure here. You can also park your vehicle next to the beach on the large parking place, which is not quite flat but goes a little bit into the hill. Restaurants in beachbars are also present here, as well as a luxury hotel hotel and some apartments.', 3572, 'en', 2),
(189, 'Have you ever thought how it will be to be on a beach and to watch one of mythiest gods, Poseidon, almost right in front of you? Well, we can help you. You need to go to the region of Attiki, which is quite easy to find, since Athens, the capital of Greece is present there and then head to the Village Sounion in the south. The roads to the beach are paved and you can park your vehicle next to the road dirt parking place. After 100 meters of walk you are here. The beach belongs to a resortand is very occupied and is equipped with the highest possible beach infrastructure standard. Everything here is luxurious, so are the prices for a sunshade and a deck chair, around 25 Euros per person in 2019. The surface of the beach is sand, the water entry is comfortable and you have a beach bar on the beach and in the background a resort with lots of additional services.', 3573, 'en', 2),
(190, 'Located in the region of Attiki, in the village Saronikos, just south from the ancient city of Athens, you have this beautiful pebbles beach to discover. It&#39;s a special one because it&#39;s actually made of two beaches, and a little church in the middle of them. The surface is a mixture of pebbles and rocks and on some places the water entry can be tricky. Parking your vehicle here is quite a challenge. You either do it by the road or on private parking. Restaurants and beach bars on not present here, but on the other side you have many many apartments available. The beach infrastructure is only basic.', 3574, 'en', 1),
(191, 'A true family beach you will find in the village of Anavyssos. It\'s located just south from the famous city of Athens in the region of Attiki. The surface is made of sand and some small Pebbles, you also have some trees here to protect you from the Sun, and you can also rent some beach equipment. The parking is very large and you can park directly at the beach. If you would like to stay in a hotel with a swimming pool directly at the beach you can do so or you can rent some apartment in the village. Swimming can be done already after five meters and if you get hungry here are plenty of beach bars and restaurants for you available.', 3575, 'en', 2),
(192, 'When you are in Greece you should visit the region Attiki and head south in the direction of the village Anavyssos. Here. a very beautiful sandy beach with very special curves awaits you. You can park your vehicle on a large parking place which is made of dirt but the road towards it is paved. The beach is around 300 meters long and up to 40 meters wide. The point of swim starts already after five meters of entering the water. You have a beach bar here and some apartments in the vicinity. The beach infrastructure here is basic and most of it is concentrated around the beach bar.', 3576, 'en', 1),
(193, 'Crystal clear water awaits you on the beach Paralia Mavro Lithari. The beaches is located in the region of Attiki, a little bit outside of the ancient city Athens, near the village of Anavyssos. Parking your vehicle here is not the big challenge, you have so many places available and it\'s even large enough for motorhomes. You can access the beach directly from the parking. This beauty is around 250 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The water false quite quickly so you can almost jump into it and start swimming immediately. You have plenty of beach infrastructure here, also children playgrounds and sports fields. Beach bars are also here and for accommodation you have some apartments in the vicinity.', 3577, 'en', 2),
(194, 'Just south from the ancient City of Athens you can visit a very beautiful beach facing towards the Peloponnese peninsula. The surface here is a mixture of sand and pebbles and what it makes it unique are the little trees on the beach which give you some protection from the sun. You need to go to the village of Ag. Dimitrios in the region of Attiki to spend your beach day here. Parking your vehicle here is easy and it can be done directly on the beach where you have a dirt park place. The water entry on some places can be tricky because you need to walk over some rocks. Beach Infrastructure here is basic, but you have one beach bar and some apartments in the vicinity.', 3578, 'en', 1),
(195, 'In the village of Ag. Marina, which is located in the region Attiki, just south  from the famous city Athens a very unique sandy beach awaits you. The whole area is very colorful and it\'s made in a shape of a narrow bay. You can reach the beach by a paved Road which goes all the way down from Athens to the South and Park on a dirt park Place. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here and also a beach bar which will provide you whit some food and drinks. The water gets deep quite fast, so you can start swimming immediately. A little bit outside from the beach you have some apartments available for your accommodation.', 3579, 'en', 2),
(196, 'This Sandy Beach it\'s almost 1 kilometer long and up to 50 meters wide. It is located in the region of Attiki in the town Vari, which is just south from the ancient city of Athens. You have a very big parking place here at your disposal, even motorhomes can park here. Because the water falls quite slowly this beach is vary popular with the surfers. On one part of the beach the beach infrastructure is on a high level one half of it it\'s a little bit more wild. You have some beach bars and restaurants also available as well a city with all its services in the background. For acommendation you have mainly Apartments available.', 3580, 'en', 2),
(197, 'If you are a beach enthusiast you need to visit this beach. It will blow your mind. So much Beauty on one place, never else in the world. Where is it located? You need to go the region of Attiki, just south from Athens and near the village Vouliagmeni you will find your Unforgettable experience and memories. It\'s actually it\'s not a beach made By the Sea, but it was a cave that formed this beauty. The water inside the lake is a mixture of sea Water and Lake water. Because of the wells inside, the water has all year a constant temperature of around 21 degrees. Because of the wells the water is also very healthy, so a lot of people come here for medical reasons. For swimming you need to jump into the water or you can use the letters, because the water fals rapidly. You can park your vehicle onto large parking places. Beach infrastructure obviously here is on a high level as swell as are the entry prices. In the year 2019 you need to pay 12 euros for a daily ticket. A restaurant is also available here and the coffee bar and of course lots of beach equipment. You can rent here a lot of things but be aware that they have a high price. Accommodation is available in the surrounding of the lake in aform of apartments and hotel. ', 3581, 'en', 2),
(198, 'The beaches around the town of Vouliagmeni are very unique and very popular in Greece. This Beach, which is located in the region of Attiki, is a Sandy beach, with the total length 500 meters and up to 30 meters wide. If you don\'t like scent and you prefer more grass you also have plenty of it here. In the summertime this is not a free beach but a beach who charges you a fee of around 5 Euros per person per day. The beach infrastructure is on a high level, you have plenty of sport fields as well as children playgrounds and all the possible beach equipment to protect you from the Sun. You can park your vehicle directly at the entrance and after 100 meters of walking you are on your Beach. Beach bars and restaurants are also here and accommodation is available in the city in the form of apartments or hotels.', 3582, 'en', 2),
(199, 'Not far away from Athens, you have a town named Vouliagmeni. Facing towards north here is a sandy beach, with a length of 500 meters and up to 30 meters wide. The name of the beach is Paralia Kavouri. You can park your vehicle beside the road where there are many parking lots. After 50 meters of walking you\'re on the beach. The water here is quite flat which makes it ideal for small children. You also have a large children playground as well on the beach. You also have many Beach infrastructure here to please your needs. Some beach bars are also available here, where you can rent the beach equipment. For accommodation there are apartments and hotels in the vicinity.', 3583, 'en', 2),
(200, 'How about a little bit more sporty beach? No problem just outside of Athens in the Metro region you have such a beach. It\'s located in the region Attikiin the town  of Voula. You have a very large parking place here,  which is paved, and it takes you only 100 meters of walking to reach the beach. The beach is made of sand, is 500 meters long and up to 50 meters wide. You have a lot of Beach infrastructure here, as well as a water park. Sports fields are allso here and they are of all kinds of types. You have a beach bar available here and if you would like to stay longer some apartments are available in the city.', 3584, 'en', 2),
(201, 'If you are looking for a large children playground directly on the beach and you also like to enjoy luxurious beach bars you are on the right spot. Paralia Asteras is the name of the beach and it is located in the region Attiki, just a little bit outside of Athens in the town of Voula. Getting here with your vehicle is not a problem, you can either Park your vehicle outside the resort or inside. Here is Plenty of grass, palms and other exotic trees to wonder. The beach is around 300 meters long, it is a Sandy Beach and it can be up to 40 meters wide. The water enter is very nice and it\'s quite flat so swimming starts a little bit late. The beach infrastructure is here on a high level and if you would like to spend you have plenty of apartments in the city itself.', 3585, 'en', 2),
(202, 'If you are in Athens and you would like to go to the beach this is the right spot for you. It\'s a true City Beach with lots of beach infrastructure on the highest level. The entrance is not for free in the year 2019 you\'ll have to pay 5 euros for a full day ticket. The beaches is around 500 meters long and up to 40 meters wide. The surface of the beach is made partly of sand and partly of small Pebbles. The water here is very clear and has a nice blue tone. The water entry is very nice and because the water gets deep so quick you can already start swimming after three meters. You can park your car directly at the beach. Of course beach bars and restaurants are available here as well. If you would like just take it for longer in the city there are many options to rent an apartment or stay in a hotel.', 3586, 'en', 2),
(203, 'If you are the one who likes Pebbles on the beach and crystal clear water you should visit the town of Kineta, which is located west from Athens. It\'s a 750 meters long Beach which can get on some places up to 20 meters wide. The water on this beach gets deep quite quickly, so only after three meters you can already swim away. You can park your vehicle by the road or private parking. The beach infrastructure is here basic more is located near the hotel. You have many beachbars and restaurants here, as well as a hotel and some apartments.', 3587, 'en', 2),
(204, 'One of the first beaches in the region of Peloponnisos when you cross the Corinth canal is located in Kechries. It\'s a Sandy Beach with some Pebbles mixed in the sand. The beach is around 400 meters long end up to 15 meters wide. The point of swim starts after 15 meters and it\'s quite comfortable. You can park your vehicle directly at the beach. Here you have some basic beach infrastructure, as well as 2 beach bars and some apartments in the background. Dogs are also welcomed on this beach.', 3588, 'en', 2),
(205, 'How about a beach with brown and black Cent mixed with white Pebbles. You think such a beach does not exist? But it does. It\'s located in the region of Peloponnisos, near the village Nea Epidavros. This location is more than 1,000 kilometers long and can be up to 10 meters wide. Parking is done on the side of the road or private parking. You can start swimming after 5 meters and the water entry is very nice. Along the whole Beach there is some beach infrastructure but mostly located around beach bars restaurants, where you can also rent some beach equipment. If you\'re looking for accommodation it is also available here but mostly in the form of apartments.', 3589, 'en', 2),
(206, 'Most camps are not directly at the beach, but the Paralia Gial&aacute;si, located in the region Peloponnisos, near the village Panagia is different. This location is also famous for the sunken city of Epidaurus, which is only 500 meters away from the beach. One thing that is so special for this location are also the orange trees which are everywhere in the valley which leads to the beach. The beach is partly made of sand partly of pebbles. It&#39;s around 1 km long and up to 10 meterse wide. You can leave your vehicle either in the parking lots of the beach bars or on the campsites. The location is ideal for motorhomes which can be parked directly at the beach on the campsite. On the beach the point of swim is after 5 meters of entering the water. You have many beach bars and restaurants available here. For your accommodation you can choose between campsites, apartments and even some hotels. There is some beach infrastructure directly on the beach, but most of it is in the campsites.', 3590, 'en', 1),
(207, 'Although we are on the peninsula Peloponnisos, this beach is a part of the region Attiki. The closest Village to the beach has a famous name Metamorfosi, what is also the name of the beach, which is Paralia Dáriza Metamórfosis. You can reach the beach by a paved Road, and park your vehicle by the road or on a small parking place. The beach is made of black pebbles, it is 750 meters long up to 20 meters wide. The water and entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 15 meters. You have some basic Beach infrastructure here as well as a beach bar and some apartments in the village above.', 3591, 'en', 2),
(208, 'This special Beach belongs to the luxurious Village Akti Idras. Wherever you step wherever you go you will feel special, you will feel the quality and you will feel the highest standard of services this Village is providing you. Access to the beach is limited to the ones who either have a house here or the ones who have booked their place In the resort. The beach itself it\'s artificial shaped and has on the most part sand and on some places concrete as the surface. You can park your vehicle either inside the resort or outside by the road. The beach Infrastructure here is on a high level and services are provided on the highest possible standard to fulfill all your needs. The water entry is very fast because of the deep water you can already start swimming after 5 meters. Restaurants in beach bars are available along the whole stretch of the beach. For your accommodation you can either choose the resort or some apartments near the marina. Sports fields are also here planty but are more concentrated around the marina.', 3592, 'en', 2),
(209, 'A mixture of red Pebbles and reddish sand is what you can expect to have as a surface on this beach. To reach reach this beach you need to visit the peninsula Peloponnisos and head towards the village of Agioi Anargiri. The beach is easy to reach with the vehicle by a paved Road, and parking can be done directly on the beach, where are dirt surface awaits you. The beach is around 150 meters long and up to 15 metres wide. The water Entry is very nice and swimming starts immediately at around 3 meters. You have some beach infrastructure here but it\'s only basic. A beach bar and a restaurant are also here where you can rent some beach equipment. Accommodation is not nearby a little bit more far away and only in the form of apartments.', 3593, 'en', 2),
(210, 'A Very unique beach awaits you near the village Ververouda. It is located in the region Peloponnisos in a beautiful crystal clear water bay. You can reach it by a paved road with your vehicle, where you can park it by three major parking spaces all in the vicinity of beachbars. The surface of the beach are white pebbles, the length is around 750 meters and up to 15 meters wide. The water entry is comfortable and you can start swimming already after 3 meters. Beach infrastructure is located mainly around the beach bars. You also have some accommodation here, but mainly in the form of apartments.', 3594, 'en', 2),
(211, 'These beach is called Paralia kantias and it\'s located near the village Kantia. It\'s a part of the region Peloponnisos. The beach is more than 1 kilometer long and can be up to 15 meters wide. The surface is made mostly of sand, with some pebbles mixed in. The point of swim starts at around 5 meters. You have some beach infrastructure as well here, but it\'s mostly located around the beach bars. Is also available for your vehicle. Larger Places are available around the beach bars. For accommodation on this location you have many options. Apartments Are standard, you even have a campsite, and there is also a hotel Resort in the vicinity.', 3595, 'en', 2),
(212, 'Most beaches on the peninsula peloponnese are a mixture of sand and Pebbles, but this beach in the village of Tolo is different. It\'s completely made of sand and it\'s about five hundred meters long and up to 25 meters wide. You can park your vehicle almost directly at the beach and motorhomes are welcome as well. The water entry is very nice and comfortable and you can start swimming after around 20 meters. Beach infrastructure is also present here and because of this being a village Beach you have a much higher standard than elsewhere. If you get hungry here are some beach bars and restaurants and for your accommodation you can choose between Apartments, hotels and even a campsite. ', 3596, 'en', 2),
(213, 'A very long Sandy Beach with an enormous parking space  awaits you near the town of Navpilon, which belongs to the region Peloponnisos. You can reach the beach by a quality paved Road and park your vehicle almost directly at the beach. The beach is a few kilometers long and up to 50 meters wide. You also have a lot of trees and grass on the beach. The trees are more concentrated in the background by the parking space. The point of swim starts already after 3 meters and you have some beach infrastructure located around the beachbars. Accommodation is not available directly at the beach but it\'s a little bit far away mostly in the town of Navpilon.', 3597, 'en', 2),
(214, 'If you like white big pebbles, almost stones on the beach you should visit the village Kiveri in the region Peloponnisos. It\'s easy to reach by the road, and the parking is just next to the beach. The beach is 200 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here, as well a pier, a small Marina and some children playgrounds. To get into the water and start swimming you can choose the beach or use some water stairs from the pier. In the village and on the beach you have some coffee bars, restaurant and beach bars. Accommodation is provided in the village in the form of apartments or Studios.', 3598, 'en', 2),
(215, 'Kato Vervena is the name of the village the beach Paralia Paliochano is located. It\'s a 500 meters long and up to 20 meters wide Beach. It\'s suitable for those one who don\'t like a lot of neighbors and a lot of beach infrastructure, because here you will find only the basic. The beach has a very large parking place and you can park your vehicle directly at the beach. The point of swim starts pretty early, after three meters. The surface is predominantly sand with some white Pebbles mixed with in. A Beach Bar and Restaurant are available on the far end of the beach, where you can also rent some beach equipment. Accommodation is not on the beach, but more near to the Village in the form of apartments.', 3599, 'en', 2),
(216, 'Have you ever been to a true City Beach, a Long Beach, with lots of small Pebbles, and the amphitheater overlooking the beach and the City. If you would like to have this experience you need to visit the city Paralio Astros, which is located in the region Peloponnisos. The beach is a few kilometers long and up to 30 meters wide. Most of the beach infrastructure is located in the town and around the beach bars which are available along the whole stretch of the beach. You can park your vehicle directly at the beach, but mostly by the side of the road. The water here false quite quickly, which makes the point of swim almost immediately. You have plenty of all kinds of restaurants and similar services available in the city, where you will also find accommodation in the form of apartments. And a little bit outside the city you also have a campsite.', 3600, 'en', 2),
(217, 'This beach is all about pebbles, white pebbles. On some part of the beach they are almost stones on some parts small stones and on some you even have some sand. The beach is located near the village Krioneri on the Peninsula Peloponnisos. The road to reach this Beach goes down to coastland, and you can park your vehicle almost directly at the beach beside the road. The beach is around 500 long and up to 20 meters wide. The water falls here very quickly which makes the point of swim at 3 meters. You have some beach infrastructure here, but only basic, more is located near the beach bar and restaurant. If you would like to stay here you can rent some rooms in the bay.', 3601, 'en', 2),
(218, 'In the middle of the peloponnese mountains by the coastline you have a very long pebbles Beach to explore. It\'s Located in the village Plaka. The beach itself is a mixture of brown sand and Pebbles. It\'s around one kilometer long and up to 30 meters wide. The point of swim starts already at 5 meters. You can park your vehicle almost directly at the beach. The parking space is very large and most has a height restriction, but a few motorhomes can park here as well. The beach Infrastructure is concentrated around the village are further out there is none. You have a lot of beach bars and restaurants in the village as well as some apartments and a camping ground if you would like to spend your holidays here.', 3602, 'en', 2),
(219, 'This place is all about crystal clear water and Pebbles on the beach. It\'s a unique place with a special Beach and a special surrounding. To reach this beach you need to go to the peninsula Peloponnisos and search for the village Gefira. The beach is a mixture of white Pebbles, rocks and on some places even Brown sand. It\'s 400 meters long and can be up to 15 metres wide. The water falls here very quickly which makes the point of swim at 3 meters. Have some beach infrastructure as well here and of course a lot of restaurants and similar and in the village itself there are many options to rent an apartment or to stay in a hotel.', 3603, 'en', 2),
(220, 'A true Little City sandy Beach awaits you in the far south off the peninsula peloponnese. The roads to reach this city are in a good shape and provide you with a lot of comfort. You can park your vehicle by the road where there are parking lots available. The beach is around 500 meters long and can be up to 30 meters wide. You will also find some small Pebbles on the beach, but mostly it is made of sand, sometimes even black sand. Because it is a City Beach you also have a lot of beach infrastructure here. The point of swim starts at around 5 meters. Along the whole stretch of the beach as well in the city itself you have a lot of beach bars, restaurants and other types. A children playground and some sports fields are also available. For accommodation you have apartments and hotels at your disposal.', 3604, 'en', 2),
(221, 'The peninsula peloponnese is full of surprises. You have so many different types of beaches here, that it&#39;s hard to choose which one to visit. On the far south of the peninsula you can even enjoy some sand dunes. They are located near the village Pounta and have a name, they are called Paralia Paulopetri. The whole area here is easy to reach by a quality paved road, only a few hundred meters you need to drive on a dirt road. The parking here is very large but it&#39;s made out of dirt. It&#39;s very flat and so very good for motorhomes. You need to walk around 100 to 200 meters from your parking to reach the beach. The water entry is very nice and swimming on the beach starts at around 15 meters. On the beach itself you don&#39;t have any beach infrastructure, except the parking. The beach is a few kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide, but it&#39;s very flat. A little bit in the background you have some restaurants and some apartments but on the beach itself there are none.', 3605, 'en', 1),
(222, 'The beach Paralia Glifada is the place you want to go in the summer if you like a Pebble Beach and also listen to some amazing electronic music. It is located in the region Peloponnisos on the peninsula peloponnese. The closest Village is called Glifada. The beach is around 300 meters long and can be up to 25 meters wide. On the most part of the beach as a surface you have Pebbles, some sand and rocks. On the Most part of the beach the water entrance is quite pleasant. The beach is rewarded with a blue flag sign, which means it has on a specific part all the necessary Beach infrastructure. You also have a beach bar on the beach where you can rent some beach equipment. In the Summertime this is also a good place to dance and to listen to music. And if you would like to stay in an apartment on the beach itself and in the surrounding there are none. The closest are in Elea. ', 3606, 'en', 2),
(223, 'How about a sandy beach with a shipwreck stranded on the beach. Well, even that is possible in Greece. To see it by yourself you need to visit the peninsula Peloponnese and head to the village of Valtaki. The beach is easy to reach by a paved road and you can leave your vehicle, also motorhome, directly on the beach on a large parking space. The beach is around one kilometer long and up to 40 meters wide. The water entry has on some spots some rocks in the water, on some spots there&#39;s only sand. Beach infrastructure is located only around the beach bar and the restaurant, which is directly at the beach, elsewhere there is non. You also won&#39;t find any accommodation near the beach so look in the neighboring villages or towns for it.', 3607, 'en', 1),
(224, 'How about a four kilometer sandy beach in the South part of the peninsula peloponnese. Not only is this beach very long it can be also on some parts up to 50 meters wide. To spend a day or your holidays on it you shoot visit the village Mavrovouni in the region Peloponnisos. Parking your vehicle here is very easy and you can park directly at the beach. Here are many hundred parking places available. When on the beach if you would like to swim you can do it already after 3 meters since the water falls very fast into the depth. You also have some beach infrastructure here but it\'s mostly located around the beach bars. Restaurants are also available on the beach and if you would like to stay in an apartment you can also do it directly on the beach. A camping ground is also available.', 3608, 'en', 2),
(225, 'This very long sandy beach is suitable for all of you who like to spend your holidays in a camp and have a sandy beach right in front of you. It&#39;s located on the peninsula Peleponnes near the village Vath&yacute;. The beach is more kilometers long and on some places up to 40 meters wide. The water here falls very quickly, so you can start swimming right away. You can park your vehicle in the camps, by the road next to the beach or around the beach bars. You also have some beach infrastructure here but it&#39;s located around the camps. A restaurant which is also a beach bar is just next to the camp. For accommodation you have in the vicinity apartments, a hotel and a few camps.', 3609, 'en', 1),
(226, 'When you cross the famous corinth canal, it\'s really worth a visit, you can also wisit the beach in the city Corinthos, which is only a few kilometers away. It\'s a true City Beach where the surface is a mixture of pebbles and sand. The beach itself is around 1 km long and up to 25 meters wide. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here, as well as many types of restaurants and a lot of apartments in the city itself. To park your vehicle here is not the problem. You have many places available, some of them are almost directly at the beach and are very large, some of them are in the city by the road. The water entry is very nice and comfortable the point of swim starts already at 3 meters.', 3610, 'en', 2),
(227, 'On the peninsula peloponnese, in the North Park there is small town called Vrachati. You have a pebbles beach here, which is around 750 meters long and can be on some parts up to 50 meters wide. It\'s a true family beach with lots of beach infrastructure. It\'s very suitable for families with children and for those one who love to do some sport on the beach. The parking of your vehicle is very easy here and it can be done directly on the beach where there are many hundred parking places available. The water entry is nice and comfortable although the beach is on some parts quite steep, but you can swim away already after five meters. If your get hungry you have many beach bars and restaurants available here. On the beach itself you can also rent some beach equipment. If you would like to stay here for longer there are many apartments and Studios available in the town itself.', 3611, 'en', 2),
(228, 'If you like to have the beach infrastructure on a very high level with a lot of services available to fulfill your needs you should visit the Paralia Pefkias in the town Kato Diminio. The region the beaches located is called Peloponnisos. It\'s a very long pebbles Beach, a few kilometers long and up to 25 meters wide. In the middle of the beach you also have a park with lots of grass and natural shadow to protect you from the Sun. If you have children this beach is also suitable for you because you have some playgrounds in the park, as well as some sport fields. On some places the beach is quite steep, and swimming starts already after 5 meters. Beach bars and other types of restaurants are also available here, and if you would like to sleep in the city there are many apartments and hotels available.', 3612, 'en', 2),
(229, 'In the region Peloponnisos, in the village named Likoporia you can find a unique pebbles Beach with a total length of 300 meters and up to 10 meters wide. It\'s a family beach with some beach infrastructure, a beach bar and accommodation in the vicinity, but mostly in the form of apartments or Studios. The beach is partly separated by rocks to prevent the waves crashing into the beach. You have also grass here and some trees, but you can as well rent some sunshade and deckchairs at the beach bar. Parking is also done directly at the beach, and around 30 to 50 vehicles can park here. The point of swim starts already at 5 meters and the entry is very nice.', 3613, 'en', 2),
(230, 'One of the first very long pebbles beaches in the region Dytiki Ellada when coming from the ancient town of Athens is the Paralia Akrata. It is located in the village Kráthi where you will find a lot of beach infrastructure. You can park your vehicle on a very large parking place, which is located almost directly at the beach. The beach itself is a few kilometers long end up to 20 meters wide. The slope is on some spots quite steep, which means that the point of swim starts also very early at around 5 meters. He also have a children playground here, also some sport fields. Along the whole Beach there are also trees for some shade. Beach bars and restaurants are as well here, also many apartments.', 3614, 'en', 2),
(231, 'The Paralia Trapezis is the name of the village and the name of the beach located in the region Dytiki Ellada. If you like pebbles on the beach as well in the water and if you like to start swimming immediately after entering the water you are on the right place. You can park your vehicle by the road which is directly beach. Here you have Some beach infrastructure along the whole stretch of the beach. If you like some natural shadow you have many trees here available to protect you from the Sun otherwise you can rent some beach equipment around the beach bar. A restaurant is also available here, some apartments are as well directly on the beach, but more are in the background up in the hills.', 3615, 'en', 2),
(232, 'The beach Paralia elaiona it\'s a true family beach. You have lots of space here to find your spot either on the beach or under the trees. The trees are arranged how along the whole stretch of the beach. But if you don\'t find any natural shadow you can still rent some sunshades by the beach bars. The beaches is around one kilometer long and can be up to 25 meters wide. The surface you are going to find here are Pebbles on some places even grass. The water falls quiet fast, which means the point of swim starts at around 3 meters. Here are many sport fields available, in the summertime also maybe children playgrounds. Restaurants in beach bars are as well here and if you would like to stay here for the holidays you have apartments and hotels to stay in. Parking is very convenient Care and can be done almost directly on the beach.', 3616, 'en', 2),
(233, 'Pebbles, pebbles, pebbles. Some are small, some are tiny, some large. But altogether they are white and are located on the beach Paralia rizomylos. The region this beach is located is called Dytiki Ellada, still part of the peninsula peloponnese. You should drive to the Village Nikolaiika to get to this one kilometer beach, which is on some parts up to 40 meters wide. Leaving your vehicle on this beach is not a problem since you can park your vehicle by the road. You have some beach infrastructure here but it\'s mostly located around the beach bars. The slope on this beach is not as steep as on other beaches, but still you can expect to start swimming after 5 meters of entering the water. If you would like to enjoy some Greek cuisine here are many options as well as there are many options to stay here for longer in the apartments which are a little bit more in the background.', 3617, 'en', 2),
(234, 'Aigio is a town located in the region Dytiki Ellada on the peninsula peloponnese. You have a very beautiful white Pebbles Beach just next to the town. It\'s approximately one kilometer long and up to 20 meters wide. Some beach infrastructure is available here, More of it around restaurants in beach bars. The slope is very steep and swimming starts already after 3 meters. To protect you from the Sun you have some trees here or you can rent the sun shades by the Beachbars. You can park your vehicle on a small a place or either by the road. Both of them are directly at the beach. Accommodation is available here but more of it is in the town itself. ', 3618, 'en', 2),
(235, 'The beach Paralia Akoli is another beautiful pebbles Beach in the Corinth Bay. From here you have an amazing view on the mountains of the Bay. The beach is located on the peninsula peloponnese in the region Dytiki Ellada, or Western Greece. You need to go to the Village Fasouleika to enjoy this View. Parking here is very easy and can be done directly on the Beach. You have some beach infrastructure here, but not on the whole stretch of the beach, but only around the Beachbars. The water here is very deep and falls quite Sharp, which means you can start swimming immediately. Some natural Shadow is also available here, and if you don\'t find any you can rent some sunshades and deckchairs at the beachbars. Not only are beach bars at your disposal but also some restaurants, and for accommodation you will find some apartments in the vicinity.', 3619, 'en', 2),
(236, 'How about a beach right next to the Greece most famous bridge, Rio- Antirion bridge? Maybe? If you would like to have this experience and have a day and night special bridge view you need to visit the region Dytiki Ellada and head to the town Rio. On the beach itself you have a large parking place, which can hold also motorhomes and sparking is done directly on the beach. The Beach is predominantly made of all kind of pebble sizes and some brown sand. The water entry on some places it\'s not comfortable, because you need to walk over large stones, but on some it is. Beach infrastructure here is only basic. Beach Bar and Restaurant are here but only inside a hotel which is directly on the beach. For accommodation you have many options, besides the regularar apartments you also have a hotel right on the beach itself.', 3620, 'en', 2),
(237, 'This beach is one of the official beaches of the city patras . it is situated on the northern part of the city with the nice view on the bridge Rio. Here you can find nice Pebble Beach about 700 meters long and approximately 50 meters wide. Various Beach infrastructure is available, there is also a restaurant and some beach bars. near the beach is a park where you can find some shade. On the beach is also mediterranean vegetation which can offer you also some shade. Near the beach you can find apartments or other kind of accommodation. The beach is reachable with a vehicle of all kinds. There are plenty park places directly near the beach and along the beach. Enjoy all possibilities of the beach such as swimming sunbathing and also windsurfing in case the wind conditions are appropriate. ', 3621, 'en', 2),
(238, 'Most of the beaches in the region Dytiki Ellada are made of pebbles, but these Beach which is located in Paralia Kato Achaias is different and it\'s predominantly made of sand. To reach it it\'s very easy. You can park your vehicle by the road and in 10 meters you are on the beach. The total length of the beach it\'s a few kilometers and on the widest part it\'s measures around 100 meters. You have some beach infrastructure here to make your life easier. Natural shadow and grass is also on the beach. The water entry is nice and comfortable and swimming starts at around 10 meters. A beach bar is also here. Accommodation is a little bit far away and mostly in the form of apartments.', 3622, 'en', 2),
(239, 'The village Kalogria can be very proud on the sandy beach it can offer to its guest or tourists. It is located in the region Dytiki Ellada on the Peninsula Peleponez. The beach is easy to reach by a quality paved road which leads trough a pine forest between the village and the beach itself. The beaches is a few kilometers long and up to 50 meters wide. You can park your vehicle on the large parking space right in front of the beach.You have some beach infrastructure here. The sea is here quite flat and the point of swim starts at around 30 meters, which makes it ideal for small children to safely play in the water. A beach bar where you can rent some beach equipment is presents here and for accommodation in the form of apartments and hotels you need to go to the village before the pine forest.', 3623, 'en', 2),
(240, 'When visiting this beach you will certainly remember it for your lifetime. It&#39;s a very romantic and beautiful Greece beach. What it makes it so special is a small rocky horn in the middle of the very long sandy beach. In Greece this beach is located on the peninsula Peleponnese in the region Dytiki Ellada or West Greece near the village Loutra imenis. It&#39;s easy to reach by any kind of vehicle,&nbsp; even motorhome, and you can park either directly on the beach or by the road. Because of the flat water this beach is also suitable for families with small children. The point of swim starts at around 30 meters. The beach is many kilometers long and up to 15 meters wide. You have a beach bar here and some basic beach infrastructure otherwise you&#39;re in a complete nature environment. Here is no accommodation around, only pine forest.', 3624, 'en', 1),
(241, 'The Small Town Kyllini is your Ferry Center for the islands of zakynthos and kefalonia. But it\'s not Only that it also can be your holiday destination if you like the sandy beach just next to the port. The region here is called Dytiki Ellada and it\'s a part of the peninsula peloponnese. The beach is 400 meters long and up to 75 meters wide. It\'s a very flat Beach, the same goes also for the see where the point of swim is far away out in the sea, which makes it ideal for small children to play in. Parking is done next to the beach by the road. You have some beach infrastructure here and many restaurants and other types of catering in the surrounding. Some accommodation is also available directly on the beach like apartments and a hotel.', 3625, 'en', 2),
(242, 'This sandy beach is a few kilometers long and up to 30 meters wide. It\'s suitable for families with small children, especially because of the flat seebad which is very shallow. The point of swim starts at around 40 meters, so your child can safely play in the shallow water. To reach this beach head for the peninsula peloponnese and then to the region \nDytiki Ellada. Near the village Kalamia you will find a verylarge parking place where you can park directly at the beach. A beach bar is as well on the beach and some basic Beach infrastructure. You have many options to stay here for longer. In the vicinity you have Apartments, a hotel Resort and a campsite.', 3626, 'en', 2),
(243, 'How about an almost endless sandy Beach on the peninsula peloponnese? Even that is possible when you visit the region Dytiki Ellada. The nearest Village the beach is located is called Thínes. It\'s easy to get to the beach with a vehicle where a large parking place directly on the beach awaits you. About 100 Vehicles can park here. The beach is awarded with the blue flag award, which means you have quite a high standard of services. Wideness of the beach is around 30 meters and the point of swim starts already at 5 meters. You have and a beach Bar and a restaurant here. Accommodation is not available on the beach directly, but a few kilometers away around the towns and villages.', 3627, 'en', 2),
(244, 'The beach Paralia Kourouta is one of a very long sandy beaches so typical for the peninsula peloponnese. You can find it in the region Dytiki Ellada near the Village Kourouta. Because the parking is located directly on the beach its very easy to access. It is up to 25 meters wide and several kilometers long. Your answer is very nice and swimming starts almost right away. Some beach infrastructure is also located here, as well as children playgrounds. You don\'t need to worry about food or drinks, because you will find many beach bars and restaurants here. Accommodation is available in the form off apartments and Studios some directly on the beach some a little bit more in the background.', 3628, 'en', 2),
(245, 'If you are the one who seeks a lot of beach infrastructure on the highest level with a very long Sandy beach right in front of your Resort you are on the right place. On the beach itself there is some infrastructure But more is in the Resort. The beach is located on the greek peninsula peloponnese, in the region Dytiki Ellada in the village Patronikoleika. If you\'re going to stay in the resort you can park your vehicle there, otherwise there is a large parking place just beside the resort. The beach is few kilometers long and up to 75 meters wide. On some places it is quite steep on some more normal. The water entry it\'s very nice and on some places the seabed is very flat, which is ideal for small children, on some the depth increases more rapidly. The point of swim is between 20 and 40 meters. All the necessary restaurants and beach bars are on the beach or in the resort and the accommodation is either in the resort or in the neighboring Apartments.', 3629, 'en', 2),
(246, 'A true Adventurer Beach awaits you on the west side off the peninsula peloponnese. It has very little beach infrastructure, only the parking and a shower, but on the other hand it will reward you with an amazing beach experience. The combination of sand and rocks the shallow crystal clear water creates a special beach atmosphere. To find it you need to go to the region Dytiki Ellada and drive towards the village Skafidia. Parking can be done directly on the beach, but it\'s a dirt park Place, which is not flat and has a little inclination. The last part of the road is also quite steep so drive down only in rain free conditions. The beach is 400 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. You don\'t have any restaurants or beach bars here and for accommodation there is a hotel Resort nearby.', 3630, 'en', 2),
(247, 'This beach which is located almost out in nowhere is a never-ending sendy beach which can be up to 50 meters wide. The Greek peninsula peloponnese has many similar beaches but here you almost don\'t see the beginning and the ending. To find this beach you need to go to the region Dytiki Ellada and head for the village Klidi. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle, even motor homes are welcome here. You can park directly at the beach. Some basic Beach infrastructure is available here, otherwise all around this place there\'s nothing going on. A Beach Bar is all also here but no accommodation for many many kilometers. Besides sand you will also find grass here and some trees to protect you from the Sun. Water entry is very nice and the point of swim starts at around 30 meters.', 3631, 'en', 2),
(248, 'The Village Ag. Nikolaos is one of many entry points to go on an almost 50 kilometers Long sandy Beach. On this place the beach is about 50 meters wide. It is located on the Greek peninsula peloponnese and on this part of the beach it goes by the name Paralia Zacharos. Parking can be done directly on the beach where you have a very large parking place available. You have some beach infrastructure available here, as well as some beach bars, where you can rent some beach equipment. The water falls here quite fast which means you can start swimming almost immediately. Accommodation is also available here in the form of apartments and Studios. ', 3632, 'en', 2);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(249, 'The village of Kakovatos is one of many villages located along this 50 kilometers long Sandy Beach. This beach is a very unique place in whole greece and to take a memory with you you need to visit peloponnese peninsula in the region Dytiki Ellada. You can leave your vehicle on park Place which is directly by the beach. Up to 50 vehicles can park here. Some beach infrastructure is available here, more around the restaurant which is just left to the parking place. Near the restaurant you will also find a hotel and some apartments in the vicinity. To start swimming you need to go only 5 meters into the water.', 3633, 'en', 2),
(250, 'On the beach Paralia Giannitsochori you have many options to choose on which surface you would like to put your Towell. The beach itself is made of sand, the background you also have grass and some trese to protect you from the Sun. The beach is located on the Greek peninsula peloponnese in the region Dytiki Ellada near the village Giannitsochori.  You can leave your vehicle on a very large parking place directly on the beach. The access the beach is easy. You have some basic beach infrastructure here, as well as beach Bar. Accommodation in the form of apartments is nearby. Nearby is also a campsite. The point of swim starts almost immediately and it\'s very comfortable.', 3634, 'en', 2),
(251, 'On the greek peninsula peloponnese you have two regions. In the south there is the region Peloponnisos. When coming from the region Dytiki Ellada on the west side down to the region Peloponnisos the beach  become different. Besides the sand you also have a lot of small and large Pebbles mixed into the surface of the beach. To find such a beach you need to go to the Village Kalo Nero. If you are traveling in Greece with your motorhome the parking on this beach is very popular for such a vehicle. The beach itself is a few kilometers long and up to 30 meters wide. The point of swim because of the deep water starts almost immediately, turn on some places it\'s not that\'s nice because you need to go over some large stones. Around the parking place you also have a lot of trees and if you don\'t find your place here you can rent some sunshades by the beach bars. Restaurants are also available here, for accommodation you have a few hotels and some apartments at your disposal.', 3635, 'en', 2),
(252, 'The Paralia Ae Lagoudes east very interesting Beach. Why? Because you have so many options to choose on which type of Beach on one Beach you would like to lay down your towel. On some places you have sand, on some you have rocks, on some Pebbles and on some a mixture of everything. The beach is located on the peninsula  peloponnese in the region Peloponnisos in the town Kyparissia. Because the beach is located in a small town you also have some beach infrastructure here. Altogether the beaches around 400 meters long and on some places up to 75 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. Some Beachbars end many restaurants are available here. And for accommodation you have Apartments, studious and hotels at Your Service.', 3636, 'en', 2),
(253, 'In this part of the Peninsula peloponnese it\'s quite difficult to find a beach. The coastline here is mostly made of rocks so it\'s really a miracle that a beach exist here. This Greek region is called Peloponnisos and the closest Village goes by the name Stomio. The beach is suitable for adventurous type of people, not so much for families, since you have very little beach infrastructure. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle where you can park directly at the beach on a paved parking place. You just need to take the steps to step on the beach. The surface here is a mixture of pebbles and big stones and some rocks on the sites. The water heater gets deep very fast so you can start swimming immediately. In the summertime a beach bar possibly exist here and you have some apartments in the surrounding area for your accommodation.', 3637, 'en', 2),
(254, 'On the Greek peninsula peloponnese in the region  Peloponnisos there is a village called Ag. Kiriaki. Here they have a very unique beach which is a combination of a small Harbor and a Sandy Beach. All around the coastline it\'s very rocky except for this small Beach. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle where you can park your vehicle directly on the beach. The predominantly material on the beach is sand you have a lot of concrete on the piers which surround the whole Beach. A lot of Beach infrastructure is available here even some children playgrounds. The water entry is very nice and you can choose how to start your swimming. Either you can go into the water on the beach or you can jump from the pier. A restaurant is also available here and some apartments in the vicinity if you would like to stay here for longer.', 3638, 'en', 2),
(255, 'These 400 meters long and up to 75 meters wide sandy Beach is located on the Greek peninsula peloponnese in the region Peloponnisos near the village Lagouvardos. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle. To park there you have around 20 places. The terain is not flat it has a small inclination and is made of dirt and rocks. You have very little beach infrastructure on the beach. The slope of the beach is normal on some places a little steep. The water entry is nice and comfortable and you can start swimming immediately. In the summertime a beach bar maybe here installed. In the surrounding of the beach there are some apartments and a hotel available.', 3639, 'en', 2),
(256, 'The whole area on the southwest side of the greek peninsula peloponnese is very unique. The same goes for the beach Vromoneri which is located in the region Peloponnisos in the village Vromoneri. The beach is made of sand, pebbles and rocks. It has a special shape and it\'s hidden in a small Bay and so protected from the big waves. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle. You can either Park on a parking place next to the road or you can drive down directly to the beach and park there. The whole area is around 300 meters long and up to 15 meters wide. The point of swim is different on some places but after 20 meters you can certainly swim away. You have also a beach bar there for drinks or some small snack, but as well you can rent some sunshades and deckchairs there. Apartments and rooms are also available around the beach if you would like to stay here for longer.', 3640, 'en', 2),
(257, 'On the southwest part of the Greek peninsula peloponnese the coast is mostly made of rocks, but not on this part. Here you have a few kilometers long Sandy Beach which is an exception for this region. The region here is called Peloponnisos and the closest Village is Rikia. This place is also known for organizing some party events which makes it ideal for youth to have a great time here. You can get here by a vehicle which you can park directly on the beach and either go to the beach bar and have some fun or just go directly to the beach. On the widest part the beach is 30 meters wide. Around the beach bar there is some beach infrastructure, but more is inside the party place. In Stormy Weather this location could be also a perfect spot for Surfers since the waves get here really big. In normal conditions you can also swim here and the point of swim start almost immediately. If you would like to spend here your holidays you have some apartments in the surrounding.', 3641, 'en', 2),
(258, 'This certainly must be one of the most unique beaches in whole Greece. The whole surrounding, the swamp, the way the beach is formed and shaped, the crystal clear water lagoon and the mountains and rocks surrounding it is one of a kind in the whole world. To have this experience by yourself you need to go to the Greek peninsula Peloponnese and head for the region Peloponnisos and then to the village Paleokastro. The whole site is easy to reach by a vehicle and you can leave your transportation 100 meters away from the beach on a dirt park place. The each is made of sand and it is 750 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The slope is on some places quite steep on some normal. The whole bay is quite shallow which means that the point of swim starts at around 50 meters. You don&#39;t have any beach infrastructure here, no accommodation and no beach bars or restaurants, which makes the beach more suitable for the ones seeking quiet and peace beach holidays.', 3642, 'en', 1),
(259, 'The beach Paralia Gialova it\'s a very nice little village sandy beach located in the Southwest part of the Greek peninsula peloponnese. This part belongs to the region Peloponnisos. The beach itself is a few kilometers long and up to 25 meters wide and has a very long pier in the middle which divides the beach. You have a lot of beach infrastructure in the village where the beach is located. Here you will find types of restaurants, hotels, apartments and in the vicinity also a campsite. On one part of the beach you even have a little Park with some trees to protect you from the Sun. The water entry on most part of the beach is very nice and swimming starts at around 20 to 25 meters. You can also start to swim if you jump from the pier.', 3643, 'en', 2),
(260, 'The small town Methoni is one of the most South points on the Greek peninsula peloponnese. It is located in the region Peloponnisos  can offer you a 400-meter long and up to 30 meters wide sandy Beach. What\'s unique about this beach is the flat surface outside the water and inside the water. This fact makes the beach more suitable for families with small children, since they can play safely in the shallow water. In the times of Stormy Weather the beach is more suitable for windsurfers and kyters. Children will also love this place because of the large children playground. The beach is easy to reach and you can leave your vehicle directly on the beach. The point of swim starts pretty late at around 50 meters. If you get hungry you have plenty of all types off restaurants available and for accommodation You have Apartments, hotels and even a campsite. This place is also interesting because of the ancient and medieval buildings like castles and walls.', 3644, 'en', 2),
(261, 'A nice sandy beach with a very large parking place awaits you in one of the most southern part of the Greek Peninsula . The region this beaches is located is called Peloponnisos, and the nearest Village goes by the name Finiki. It\'s a 750 meters Long Beach which is up to 20 meters wide. The water here is very shallow and swimming starts at around 40 to 50 meters. On the beach yourself there is very little beach infrastructure, except around the beach bar. The parking place here is very large, but it\'s made of dirt and can host several hundred vehicles. A restaurantst, together with the beach bar is also available here. And for a longer stay you have some apartments at your disposal.', 3645, 'en', 2),
(262, 'If you\'re looking for a Sandy Beach which is more kilometers long and has a lot of campsites you are on the right place. It\'s located on the Greek peninsula peloponnese in the region Peloponnisos by the town Kamaria. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle and you can park directly on the beach. You have many options along the whole stretch of the beach to park. Access to the beach is easy, and you can choose if you would like to have no beach infrastructure or a lot of it, which is located more around the campsites. The water answer is very nice and swimming starts at around 20 meters. On the widest part the beach measures around 40 meters on the most narrow around 20. You have many Beach bars and restaurants on the beach directly or in the vicinity. For a Longer stay how many campsites, apartments and a hotel resort are available. ', 3646, 'en', 2),
(263, 'Near the Greek city of Kalamata there is a village called Anatolikos Sinikismos which is connected with the main city by a Very Long sandy beach. It is located in the region Peloponnisos which is part of the Greek peninsula peloponnese. The beach is more kilometers long and up to 20 meters wide. On the surface of the beach you have 2 materials which are exchanging their dominance, the one is sand the other one are Pebbles. The water and to here it\'s very nice and on the most places you need to go over Pebbles to reach the water. The point of swim starts almost immediately. Because this is a City Beach you also have lots of beach infrastructure here. Along the whole stretch there are many types of restaurants, coffee bars and beach bars available. And for accommodation you have many options, like Apartments, hotels, resorts and even a campsite. For parking your vehicle you have a large parking place just next to the beach which is located somewhere in the middle of the Long Beach.', 3647, 'en', 2),
(264, 'This sandy Beach is located on a special place, but it\'s very hard to reach. From the main road you need to drive around two kilometers on a very curvy and Narrow road and when you get to the beach a small parking place, for around 15 cars awaits you. You can either leave your vehicle there or do private parking in the apartments. The beach itself is around 750 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The slope of the beach is quite normal and swimming starts immediately. Next to the parking place you have a beach bar and a restaurant and in the vicinity, more up the hills you have many apartments for your accommodation available. On the beach bar you can also rent some beach equipment , we\'re also the main Beach infrastructure is located, otherwise there is none.', 3648, 'en', 2),
(265, 'On the south part of the Greek peninsula peloponnese, near the town of Kalamata there is a village Ag. Konstantinos. The beach here is made of sand and has a total length of around 15 km. On the widest part it is up to 75 m wide. Here and there there is a river floating into the sea which cuts the beach into more parts. On some parts the beach is easy to reach by a vehicle and normally a large paved parking place awaits you. Most of the beach infrastructure is located around beach bars and hotel resorts, otherwise there is none. On some parts of the beach you even have sports fields and children playground like it was the case on the place we stayed. When going to the water the beach gets quite steep but the water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. Among beach bars, restaurants are as well available, and if you would like to stay here longer you have many options like Apartments, hotels, a campsite and many hotel resorts.', 3649, 'en', 2),
(266, 'When crossing the Corinth Bay from the Greek peninsula peloponnese to the other side of the region Dytiki Ellada one of the very first long pebbles beaches is the beach Paralia Nafpaktos. It\'s a part of the small city Nafpaktos. The beach is more kilometers long and up to 25 meters wide and you can park your vehicle by the road directly on the beach. The main surface here are small Pebbles, but you also have a lot of trees and some grass. To get into the water you need to step on some stones and the point of swim starts ar around 5 meters. On the whole stretch of the beach you have a lot of beach infrastructure, but more is located around the center where you also have children playgrounds and sports fields directly on the beach. Many restaurants and beach bars are located on the whole stretch of the beach, and for your accommodation your have here apartments, rooms and hotels.', 3650, 'en', 2),
(267, 'And this part of the Greek region Dytiki Ellada you want find many beaches. Hear the mountains are very high and go directly into the sea so not many beaches have formed yet. But in the small village Kato Vasiliki you have a Pebbles beach which is 200 meters long and up to 15 meters wide and is suitable for families. Some trees and a grass surface is also located on the beach. The water entry is nice and swimming starts immediately. You can leave your vehicle either by the road or on a small parking place next to the beach. A lot of Beach Infrastructure is located on this beach, you also have some beach bars and restaurants and for your accommodation you have apartments and a hotel in the village.', 3651, 'en', 2),
(268, 'The Greek Coastline has many unique beaches. And the beach in the small village Kryoneri is no exception. What it makes it so special is the over 1,000 meters high mountain directly at the beach. It is Basically a huge Rock like the El Capitan in USA, it is located in the Greek region Dytiki Ellada. Another great characteristics is the very flat seabed which makes the beach perfect for small children to play safely in the water. On the beach itself the surface are small Pebbles and the beach is 250 meters long and around 10 meters wide. To protect you from the Sun can you rent some beach equipment directly on the beach. This beach is a blue flag beach which means you have also a lot of beach infrastructure. You can leave your car on a very long pier, from which you can also jump or try to catch some fish. Some beach bars and restaurants are available directly on the beach and for your accommodation you have apartments and the hotel available.', 3652, 'en', 2),
(269, 'The town of Missolonghi is famous for it&#39;s lagoons, swamp and the salinas. A few kilometers outside the town you have the small village Tourlida which is famous for it&#39;s 400 meters long sandy beach. On this location you have also the opportunity to be amazed by the pictures houses on the water. On some parts the beach can be up to 50 meters wide and besides the sand you also have some grass under the trees to lay your towel down. The water entry here is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. Some beach infrastructure is also available here as well as a restaurant and a beach bar. The beach equipment can be also rented here. Accommodation is available either in the town Missolonghi and possibly also around the beach.', 3653, 'en', 1),
(270, 'Far away from any civilization on the Brinks of a large swamp this sandy beach called Paralia louros is located.    The closest Village is Prokopanistos and belongs to the Greek region Dytiki Ellada. The beach is more kilometers long and up to 50 meters wide. It\'s suitable for families with small children, especially for those one would like to play in the shallow water. Along the whole beach you can find also many trees to protect you from the Sun, or you can rent some sunshades at the beachbars. You will also find some beach infrastructure here especially around the beachbars, from which there are many. You also have many options to park your vehicle here, either you do it on the central parking, or you Park between the beach line and the swamp line which stretches along the beach. With the beachbars also some restaurants are available. Accommodation is officially not available here, but some kilometers away.', 3654, 'en', 2),
(271, 'If you\'re a fan of Pebbles beaches and you are in the Greece region Dytiki Ellada in the small town Mytikas you will find a few kilometers long white Pebbles Beach. The beach is from 10 meters wide up to 30+ meters near the marina. You can leave your vehicle on many spots. Either you park by the road directly on the beach or you park on a large parking place, which is also directly by the beach, a little bit more close to the town center. The beach infrastructure is located predominantly around the marina but you will find also some around the beach bars, restaurants and the campsites. The water here falls quite fast which makes also the point of swim immediately when entering the water. You have many options to spend your holidays here, for example in apartments, hotels, campsites and an apartment complex.', 3655, 'en', 2),
(272, 'The sandy beach paralia Potam&aacute;ki is a very special Greek beach for all the ones who love long beaches with shallow water. It is located in the Greek region Dytiki Ellada just opposite the famous Island Lefkada. The beach is easy to reach with a vehicle and you can park your car directly on the beach just a few meters away from the crystal clear water. The water entry here is very nice and comfortable and because of the shallow water the point of swim starts very late, at around 75 meters, which makes this place ideal for small children playing safely in the water. You have some beach infrastructure here but it&#39;s more located around the beach bars. If you are looking to stay here for longer you can find some accommodationin the form of apartments and a hotel. The beach bars here are serving drinks and some fast food, and you can also rent sunshade and a deckchair there.', 3656, 'en', 1),
(273, 'This beach belongs in the top five most beautiful beaches of Greece. At this place nature gave its best to create a perfect harmony between white pebbles, trees and a crystal clear torquize colored water. But the beauty has its price since it&#39;s quite difficult to reach and the beach has no beach infrastructure installed. The road to the beach is very narrow and in a bad condition, with lots of holes and dirt on the track. Once you get here you have a dirt park with around 20 to 30 parking lots. The beach is around 500 meters long and 20 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 5 meters. You also have some trees here to give you cover from the Sun. On the beach there is no beach infrastructure, no beach bars or restaurants and no accommodation. Some accommodation in the form of appartments is available in a bay next to the beach. We also need to mention that at the time we visited the beach, late April 2019 there were no beach bars or any other beach infrastructure installed on the beach, but this may change in the summertime and you might have a beach bar there and some beach infrastructure.', 3657, 'en', 1),
(274, 'If you are a fan of kitesurfing, on this Greek beach you are on the right place. The wind is blowing almost constantly and the flat water makes it just perfect for this kind of sport. To get to this place you need to visit the Greek region Dytiki Ellada and head to the Village Ag. Nikolaos. This location is easy to reach with a vehicle and on the end of the road right directly on the beach you can park. Here are not many parking places available, some are on the tharmac some directly on the sand. The beach is more kilometers long and up to 30 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim because of the flat water starts at around 30 meters. A beach bar is here, where also the main beach infrastructure is located. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but in the village a few kilometers away.', 3658, 'en', 2),
(275, 'One of the most famous greek beaches for kitesurfing is located on the island Lefkada. The Greek Island Lefkada is accessible via a Bridge or by a ferry. In the city lefkada you have a very large Lagoon and a more kilometers long Sandy Beach. The beach is on some parts up to 40 meters wide. The most of the beach is a protected area so you won\'t find any Beach infrastructure there. Most of it is located around the beach bars and restaurants. You can park your vehicle by the road, cross the road and you are on the beach. Most of the time the wind is blowing pretty strong which makes it ideal for kitesurfing. The water entry is on the most places very nice, on some you need to go over some rocks and the point of swim starts at around 20 meters. Accommodation is available around the restaurants in beach bars as well as in the city itself but on the most part there is no accommodation.', 3659, 'en', 2),
(276, 'The Greek Island lefkada is famous for its beautiful beaches, and the beach Paralia Pefkoulia is one amongst them. It is located in the Greek region Iónioi Nísoi near the village Kalavros. It\'s easy to reach by a vehicle, which you can park on two places. One is located directly at the beach and one is up by the road. Both parking place can hold between 70 to 100 vehicles. The beach itself is a few kilometers long and on some places up to 40 meters wide. It is predominantly made of sand and of some pebbles and rocks. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. At the beach you have a beach bar which is also a restaurant and can service you with a lot of beach infrastructure, they even have a swimming pool. On the same spot you can also rent some rooms if you would like to stay here for longer.', 3660, 'en', 2),
(277, 'On the Greek island Lefkada no matter which beach you visit you certainly will be amazed by it&#39;s beauty. The same goes for Paralia Kathisma which is located near the small town Agios Nikitas. The location where the beach is located belongs to the region of Ionian Island or in Greece I&oacute;nioi N&iacute;soi. The beach is 1 kilometer long and up to 50 meters wide. The main surface are pebbles mixed with a little of sand. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts immediately. You can park your vehicle very easy here, either on a large parking place or directly by the road at the beach, like most motorhomes do. The beach infrastructure is located along the whole stretch of the beach and you have here many beach bars and restaurants. You can also spend your holidays here because many apartments and a hotel are located directly on the beach.', 3661, 'en', 1),
(278, 'This Village and the beach underneath it is all about romantic. The Architecture of the buildings and the streets is ful of collors, very inviting restaurants and coffee bars. To have this experience by yourself you needs to visit the Greek Island lefkada which is located in the ionian islands or in greek language Agios Nikitas. This beautiful village is called Agios Nikitas. The village is very easy accessible with a vehicle of any kind. Parking is done by the road up in the village, some 400 meters away and with a height difference between the parking and the beach of around 40 meters. The beach itself is 100 meters long and up to 15 meters wide. The water here is crystal clear and it gets deep very quickly which means you can start swimming immediately. The main surface are pebbles but some rocks are as well on the beach. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here except from some sports fields for children playgrounds. In the village and by the beach you have a lot of coffeebars and restaurants and as well many types of accommodation like apartments and hotels.', 3662, 'en', 2),
(279, 'It&#39;s very hard to find words to describe this beauty, the Greek Island Lefkada has produced over millions of years. We are talking about the beach, but not any kind of beach, probably top 3 beaches in whole Greece and in the top 10 of the whole world. To reach this beauty beach you need to go to the region of Ionian islands and visit the island Lefkada. The closest village is called Ag. Nikolaos Niras and the beach itself has the famous name of Porto Katsiki. The beach is located on a remote place in the middle of nowhere between high hills. The road to the beach is paved but it is very steep and on some places very narrow. Because the beach is very famous all around the world and very crowded in the summertime, you also have a lot of parking places available. From the parking place to the beach you need to take a 200 meter long path which is 30 meters in height difference from the beach itself. The beach, because of the steep pathway and no beach infrastructure is more suitable for adventurer type of visitors. The main surface on the beach are whites pebbles and some rocks. The water here has a special color, which is unique in the whole world, what makes this place even more attractive. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts immediately. On the beach itself you have zero beach infrastructure, but more is located around the parking place, where you will find also some fast food restaurants, shops and bars. Accommodation in this remote place is not available.', 3663, 'en', 1),
(280, 'On the south Part of the Greek Island lefkada you have a small Village called Vasiliki. The island is a part of the Greek region ionian Islands or in Greek Iónioi Nísoi. This place is easy to reach with a vehicle of any kind. You can park your vehicle by the road directly at the beach or at the private apartments and hotels. The beach itself is 1 kilometer long and up to 25 meters wide. The main surface are pebbles of different sizes and shapes. The water gets here deep very fast which makes the point of swim at 5 meters. The slope of the beach is on some places quite steep but the water entry is very nice. Many Beach infrastructure is available here but it\'s more around the Beachbars. Restaurants of different types are as well available and so is the accommodation mainly in the form of apartments, hotels and a campsite.', 3664, 'en', 2),
(281, 'To be able to see this beauty on the Greek Island lefkada you need to have a very good car, you need to be brave and you need a lot of luck. The beach is called Paralia Agiofili and belongs to the village Vasiliki in the region of the ionion Islands. With its beauty it belongs certainly to one of the most beautiful beaches in Greek. First of all the road to the beach is very narrow, made of dirt and rocks and on some places unstable. It\'s possible to go to the beach with regular car but and off-road vehicle is much more suitable. At the end of the road there is a private paved parking place, where you need to purchase a parking ticket. Take Into consideration that you need to walk around 100 meters on a very steep path with steps which has a height a difference of 30 meters between the parking and the beach. The beach is predominantly made of white small pebbles and some rocks, has a crystal Clear water, is 100 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The water here is very deep and you can swim away instantly. On the beach you have some sunshades and deckchairs to rent, otherwise there\'s nothing on the beach. A toilet and a small bar is by the parking place. Accommodation is not available here but in the village Vasiliki.', 3665, 'en', 2),
(282, 'If you\'re in Greece and you are looking for a white pebbles Beach with crystal clear water, parking directly on the beach as well as restaurants and accommodation just a few steps away the the beach Paralia Mikros Gialos you are on the right spot. It is located on the Greek Island lefkada which is part of the region ionian Islands or like the Greeks say Iónioi Nísoi. When coming here with your vehicle you can leave it by the road and almost step directly on the beach. The beach is a mixture of small and large white pebbles. It\'s 200 meters long and around 30 meters wide. The water gets deep Very quickly which makes the point of swim at around 3 meters of entering the water. You have some beach infrastructure here, you can also rent some beach equipment and restaurants and bars as well as different types of accommodation are all nearby.', 3666, 'en', 2),
(283, 'This a few kilometers long Sandy Beach goes by the name Paralia Mytika. It is located in the Greek region Ipeiros near the town Nikopolis. The beach is easy to reach with the vehicle and the road where you can park ghost directly alongside the beach so you can access it immediately. You also have a three-line behind the road where are you can seek for natural shadow to protect you from the Sun. On The widest part the beach is around 40 meters wide, the inclination of the slope it\'s normal, the water answer very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. You also have some beach infrastructure here, but most of it is located around the Beach bars. Not much accommodation is available here around, only in the form of apartments and mainly as a campsite. ', 3667, 'en', 2),
(284, 'Between the town Mitikas and the village Pidima Kiras in the Greek region Ipeiros you have a very long, more kilometers, sandy beach, where are you have many options to access it. On this part it is called Paralia Pidima Kiras. It\'s easy to access the beach with your vehicle, you have a large parking place directly on the beach and you can also park at the beach bars. The beach is around 40 meters wide, the water entry is nice and swimming starts immediately. If you would like to have a lot of beach services you should Park closely to the beach bars, otherwise there is none beach infrastructure. Most of the beach bars also provide you with some food, at least fast food some are also a restaurants type. On this Part of the beach you also have many options to find an accommodation. Many hotels and Resort like hotels are available here, as well as Apartments. ', 3668, 'en', 2),
(285, 'A very special Beach awaits you near the village of Paralia in the Greek region Ipeiros. The beach is a few kilometers long and on some places 50 meters wide. It is made of sand but you also have some rocks on the beach which makes it quite unique in the whole of Greece. You can access the beach with your vehicle almost directly on the beach itself where can park by the road. Because of the rocks on the beach as well under the sea on some places the water entry is not very comfortable and sometimes quite dangerous. But on some parts you don\'t have any rocks in the sea so you can enter very nice and almost start swimming immediately. Along the whole stretch of the beach you have many apartments, restaurants and beach bars, and this is also place where you get the most Beach services. Besides the apartments and rooms to let you also have a hotel near the beach.', 3669, 'en', 2),
(286, 'The Village Ligia is very small but it has in its surrounding very unique beaches. The beaches are located in the Greek region Ipeiros. One of them it\'s called Paralia lygias. It\'s a few kilometers Long Beach which can be up to 30 meters wide. Very unique about the beach is the fact that the surface it\'s a mixture of small Pebbles and rocks. The inclination of the slope is pretty high and because of it the swimming, when entering the water, start almost immediately. You have to choose your water entry wisely, because on some spots you have many rocks to go over before start swimming, but on some you have a very nice entry and no rocks. Parking your vehicle here is easy and can be done directly on the beach beside the road. Some restaurants and beach bars are available on the beach and this is also the point where you have the most Beach infrastructure. If you would like to stay here for longer you can rent some apartments or rooms. ', 3670, 'en', 2),
(287, 'If you are the one who adores a very long Sandy Beach with Beach services all around you need to visit the Paralia brachos located in the Greek region Ipeiros. It\'s very easy to reach with the vehicle but parking is only possible by the road or on some private parking lots. Because the road goes alongside the beach you access the beach almost from your vehicle. The beach is a few kilometers long and on some places up to 50 meters wide. The inclination of the slope is normal on some places a little bit steep. The water entry is very nice and you can already swim away after 5 meters. Beach bars, restaurants, fast food and other types of catering are available here, and so are the beach services which are available along the whole stretch of the beach. Renting a deck chair and a sun shade here is no problem. If you would like to spent your holidays here you can do it in many kinds of accommodation types, predominantly apartments, rooms and hotels.', 3671, 'en', 2),
(288, 'This beach is not only beautiful it is one of the most beautiful in Greece. The name you need to remember is Paralia kerentza and it belongs to the city of Ammoudia. In this part of the Greek region Ipeiros you have many similar beaches, but this one is the most free of tourist infrastructure. This is also the reason why it is so popular amongst the motorhome enthusiast. The main surface of the beach is sand, you also have some trees and a little bit of grass. The water entry here is very pleasant and because of the shallow water the point of swim starts very late at around 50 meters. Parking your vehicle or motorhome here is easy, either you do it by the road or on a large parking place a little bit behind the beach. Very little beach infrastructure is available here, only a shower and on marina. A restaurant is also present here but on some years it is closed. Accommodation is not available around the beach but in the neighboring villages.', 3672, 'en', 2),
(289, 'The Greek region Ipeiros is full of surprises and of unique beaches. The same goes for this awesome greek Beach called Paralia ammoudia. What is so special about it is the fact that it is shaped like a lagoon, it has a 750 meters long Sandy Beach and all around the beach you have lots off trees and gras to park your vehicle or lay down your Towel, besides that you also have a very shallow water, the fact families with small children will consider the most. For this region and the whole of Greece these are really unique characteristics. On the widest part the beach measures 100 meters. The water entry is very nice but swimming starts very late at around 75 meters. In the summertime you have lots of beach Services here and all around the place you have restaurants, beach bars and other type of catering. Accommodation here is also available in the form of apartments, rooms and hotels.', 3673, 'en', 2),
(290, 'The Village Lýchnas it\'s quite a unique place. It has a very beautiful beach to offer, with lots of beach infrastructure and services but because of the high inclination of the village itself there is very little space for an official parking place. Most of the space is used for acommendation. The only place you can really Park is inside the autocamp, but to park here for free you either have to be a customer of the camp, the restaurant or the only official Market in this Village. The beach itself it\'s made of sand, is 750 m long and up to 40 meters wide. You have a very clear sea here, which gets deep very fast and on some places you can almost jump into the water to start swimming, but normally after three meters you can start swimming. You have a few beach bars, restaurants and a market and because of that also some beach services. Umbrellas and deckchairs can also be rented here. Accommodation is available in many forms, like apartments, rooms, hotel and autocamp.', 3674, 'en', 2),
(291, 'The Greek city of Parga with its beautiful architecture and even more amazing, romantic beaches is a must visit if you are in the region Ipeiros. Here you have two amazing beaches, one more beautiful than the other. This city is easy to reach by a road, but the biggest challenge is to find a free parking place. Even outside the high season it&#39;s very crowded, in the summertime even more. You have many options to park your vehicle, either you do it on some free public places or you just park by the road. The first one is called Paralia Piso Krioneri. From the main road the beach is around 200 meters away. It is a small beach and it measures around 75 m in the length and is 30 meters wide. The main surface are small pebbles mixed with sand. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. You have some beach services available on the beach, more is in the town itself. A restaurant and a beach bar are located directly on the beach, as well as some apartments and a hotel. The whole area is very special, on the one side you have a lot of colorful houses, and when looking to the sea you have a lot of rocks with trees standing alone in the sea and providing you an amazing view.', 3675, 'en', 1),
(292, 'The Greek city of Parga with its beautiful architecture and even more amazing, romantic beaches is a must visit if you are in the region Ipeiros. Here you have two amazing beaches, one more beautiful than the other. This city is easy to reach by a road, but the biggest challenge is to find a free parking place. Even outside the high season it&#39;s very crowded and in the summertime even more. You have many options to park your vehicle, either you do it on some free public places or you just park by the road. This beach is called Paralia Krioneri. From the main road the beach is around 400 meters away. You also have the option to park directly on the beach but there are very few parking places available. The beach measures around 200 m in the length and is 20 meters wide. It is completely made of sand with some rocks and concrete on the border. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming almost immediately. You have many beach services available on the beach. Many restaurants and bars are located directly on the beach, as well as some apartments and a hotel. Many shops are as well nearby. On the beach you can also rent some umbrellas and deckchairs. The whole area is very special, on the one side you have a lot of colorful houses, and when looking to the sea you have a lot of small islands covered with trees standing alone in the sea not far away from the beach. The beach certainly is providing you an amazing view. Many times also sailboats anker here, which makes the scene even more special.', 3676, 'en', 1),
(293, 'Just next to the famous city Parga you have a very touristic village Chrisogiali. Like the beaches in the town parga this one is also quite unique. The Region the beach belongs to is the Greek region Ipeiros. This spot is easy to reach with all kinds of vehicles, even motorhomes. The most easy way to park your vehicle is just beside the road which goes directly by the beach. All other types of parking are private. The length of the beach is 1,000 meters and it is up to 40 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and because of the deep water swimming starts immediately. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here. You can also rent some beach equipment here, like umbrellas and deckchairs. Various types of restaurants are available, as well as many different types of accommodation, even a campsite. This place is also popular for sailing boats to Anchor.', 3677, 'en', 2),
(294, 'This beach really has a lot to offer. First of all it is very romantic, very beautiful, with sand on the beach, crystal Clear water and a lot of beach services al available to you to fulfill your needs. The name of the beach Paralia Sarakinikois and it is located in the Greek region Ipeiros. It is really I must go if you are near it. But you have to be adviced about the type of the road which leads to the beach. It is paved but it is very narrow on some places, uneven, somewhere also unstable, and on some places very steep. Nonthelese it is very popular also by motorhome owners. The public parking is quite small but more place is available in private parking. The beach is around 100 meters long and up to 25 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts immediately. You have some beach bars find restaurants available here. And for accommodation  you  can choose between apartments, rooms and a hotel.', 3678, 'en', 2),
(295, 'The beach Paralia Karavostasi it\'s located in the Greek region Ipeiros and it\'s very popular among the locals as well as the tourist. The one traveling with motorhomes also love this place so many options to park your vehicle here. Parking is done by the road directly on the beach.  The beach is made predominantly of sand and some Pebbles mixed with in. It is 750 meters long and up to 50 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts immediately because of the deep water. Treese are as well on the beach and if you can\'t find any you can rent some umbrellas. Some restaurants and beach bars are located here, some even have a swimming pool and because of that you have a lot of beach infrastructure and many Beach services. Accommodation here is also not a problem, here you have many apartments, hotels and romes.', 3679, 'en', 2),
(296, 'If you are the one who adores sand on the beach and you would like to go to the Greek region Ipeiros with the beach Paralia Arilla you have a match. With the vehicle it\'s very easy to reach and you can park directly on the beach. Because of the geographical shape not so many parking places are available. You can enjoy the the sand on a total length of 750 m and on the widest part being at around 20 m. The water is not very deep here and the first few meters are safe for children to play in. The point of Swim is at around 30 to 40 meters. Many Beach services are available here. A restaurant and a beach Bar is present directly on the beach and more are in the background. For a longer stay you have apartments and rooms available for your accommodation.', 3680, 'en', 2),
(297, 'If you\'re the one who likes to spent your holidays in luxurious accommodation and would also like to have a beautiful beach to view at from your balcony, with the beach Paralia Agia Paraskevi you are on the right location. The closest Village is called Perdika and it\'s a part of the Greek region Ipeiros. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle, also Motorhome, where a large, flat parking place awaits you. The beach is 250 meters long and can be up to 20 meters wide. It\'s predominantly made of sand and small pebbles. The water entry is different from spot to spot, on some you need to walk over flat rocks on some you can almost swim immediately. The beach infrastructure on the beach itself is basic but more is inside the beach bars, like a swimming pool. You have many options to stay here for longer, luxurious studios, a hotel and even a resort awaits you.', 3681, 'en', 2),
(298, 'The Greek village Syvota is famous for its small and very romantic beaches. Quite a few are available when you visit this location. The village is located in the Greek region Ipeiros on the West Greek coastline. It\'s easy to reach by a road, the only problem is the parking, where you have only 20 parking places available on a dirt surface, which also has quite a strong inclination. From the parking you can reach the beach via steps and in around 30 meters you\'re on the beach. The beach is made of pebbles and some sand, it is 100 meters long and 20 meters wide. The water falls quite fast and makes the point of swim almost immideatly. You have no accommodation on the beach available but there is a beach bar which also serves some food.', 3682, 'en', 2),
(299, 'The Greek village Syvota is famous for its small and very romantic beaches. Quite a few are available when you visit this location. The village is located in the Greek region Ipeiros on the West Greek coastline. It\'s easy to reach by a road, the only problem is the parking, where you have only 30 parking places available on a dirt surface, which also has quite a strong inclination. If you would like to visit this Beach with your Motorhome you can leave your vehicle on a larger parking place beside the road some 300 meters away. The beach is 75 meters long and up the 15 meters wide. The main surface here is sand mixed with some pebbles and rocks on the sites. The water entry is very nice and you can choose either to jump from the rocks or to go slowly into the water and start swimming at around 5 meters. No accommodation is available here, but you have a lounge beach bar with some beach infrastructure available.', 3683, 'en', 2),
(300, 'The Greek village Syvota is famous for its small and very romantic beaches. Quite a few are available when you visit this location. The village is located in the Greek region Ipeiros on the West Greek coastline. When with other you had a problem with parking on the beach Paralia Megali Ammos you have not such a problems. It\'s easy to reach by a road where you have around 100 parking places available. Other beaches in this region are quite small but this is not the case here, the beach is 200 meters long and up to 40 meters wide. Like on other beaches here you also have as a surface a mixture of pebbles and sand. The water gets deep very fast and the point of swim is already at 3 meters. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here, many restaurants and beach bars. Accommodation is also available here, mainly in the form of apartments, hotels and resorts.', 3684, 'en', 2),
(301, 'This beach is a true motorhome heaven and it is suitable for those who have an adventurous spirit. You will not find any beach infrastructure here, no accommodation, but only a parking place and the beach. The beach is totally free of any touristic activities. It is located in the Greek region Ipeiros near the village Plataria. The beach is made of pebbles, you have some trees here and some grass. It is 150 meters long and up to 15 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters.', 3685, 'en', 2),
(302, 'Just next to the greek island of Corfu in the region Ipeiros there is a village Plataria. Here you will find a sandy beach which is 1 km long and 20 meters wide. Among sand you will also find a lot of trees to protect you from the Sun. The water entry here is very nice swimming starts at around 10 meters. It\'s easy to reach this place with a vehicle and you can park directly on the beach beside the road. You have some beach infrastructure here and it\'s predominantly located around the beach bars. If you\'ll get hungry you also have many restaurants available here. Some accommodation is also available, mainly in the form of apartments and rooms. If you have a boat, a harbor is also nearby. On the one spot of the beach there is also a large children playground.', 3686, 'en', 2);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(303, 'Not far away from the Greek Port city of Igoumenitsa you can enjoy this very long sandy beach. On one part of the beach you can enjoy the view of island Corfu on the other site you can take a look at the famous port. The beach belongs to the Greek region Ipeiros which is located on the western part of Greece. The closest village to the beach is called Nea Selefkia. The site is easy to reach with the vehicle you can park directly on the beach by the road. The beach is a few kilometres long and up to 50 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 15 metres. What\'s so special about this beach is the fact that you have lots of  trees here, which stretch along the whole beach. Some beach bars and restaurants are also here, and these are also the points where you have the most beach infrastructure. Accommodation is also available directly on the beach but only for those ones who prefer staying in a camp.', 3687, 'en', 2),
(304, 'One of the last beaches in Greece before you enter Albania in the south is called Paralia Keramídi. It is located in the Greek region Ipeiros and the closest village is Sagiada. The beach is suitable for those one who love to have a lot of beach services directly on the beach, even our children playground and trees included. It is easy to reach with the vehicle and to have a very large parking place at your disposal. It is a very clean and thoughtful made beach area where you have all you need almost directly at your feet. The main surface here are small pebbles, but some grass is also available, where you have a volleyball playground. The beach is around 200 metres long and up to 20 metres wide. The point of swim starts at around 5 and the water entry is very nice. You also have a beach bar and I a mini restaurant there. Accommodation is not available in this area but more in the villages before the beach.', 3688, 'en', 2),
(305, 'Albania is full of beautiful beaches, and one of the first one in the south of the country is located in the town Ksamil in the region Vlor&euml;. The name of the beach is Plazhi Paradise and it truly deserves this naming. The combination of the clear water, white sand, trees and specially shaped coastline create a truly paradise feeling. It is easy to reach by a road and you have directly on the beach a quite large parking place. The beach is 150m long and up to 40 metres wide. The main surface on the beach is white sand, but you also have some grass and some trees to hide under the sun. The water entry is very nice and you can either jump from a small pier or start swimming after around 10 metres of going into the water. You also have some beach services here, a restaurant and a beach bar. Also on the beach, and in the neighbourhood you have lots of apartments, rooms and hotels to stay in for your holidays.', 3689, 'en', 1),
(306, 'The Albanian town Ksamil has really a lot of beautiful beaches. This one is called Plazhi Puerto Rico and it&#39;s a part of the Albanian region Vlor&euml;. It is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, but the last 200 m of the road are made of dirt and rocks and you have a parking place directly on the beach. It is not large but can hold around 30 vehicles. The main surface on this beach is white sand, but you also have some small stones and a concrete pier available. Some trees are also here and you can also rent an umbrella and a sunbed. The water entry is very nice and either you can jump from the pier or you walk around 15 metres to start swimming. Some beach infrastructure is as well here but more or less basic. You also have beach bar here and if you would like to stay for longer you can rent an apartment, rooms or stay in a hotel.', 3690, 'en', 1),
(307, 'The Albanian town Ksamil has really a lot of beautiful beaches. This one is called Plazhi Lori and it&#39;s a part of the Albanian region Vlor&euml;. It is easy to reach with vehicle and you have a parking place directly on the beach. It is not large but can hold around 30 vehicles. The main surface on this beach is white sand, but you also have some small stones and some concrete available. You can also rent an umbrella and a sunbed. The water entry is very nice and after 5 metres you can start swimming. Some beach infrastructure is as well here but more or less basic. You also have a&nbsp; beach bar here and if you would like to stay for longer you can rent an apartment, rooms or stay in a hotel.', 3691, 'en', 1),
(308, 'The Albanian town Ksamil in the region Vlor&euml; is famous for its beautiful beaches. The beach Plazhi Bora Bora is no exception here. It&#39;s very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park only 50 m away from the beach. The parking place can hold around 30 vehicles. The main surface on the beach is white sand but you also have a lot of small concrete piers. It is around 100 metres long and up to 25 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts very fast, either you jump from a pier or you go into the water and start swimming already after 5 metres. Many beach infrastructure is available here. You can rent many things here, sunbeds, umbrellas and some pedal boats. Restaurants and and beach bars are directly on the beach and you have many apartments and hotels in the vicinity if you plan this place to be your holiday destination in Albania.', 3692, 'en', 1),
(309, 'The Albanian town Ksamil in the region Vlor&euml; is famous for its beautiful beaches. The beach Plazhi Ksamil 7 is no exception here. It&#39;s very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park by the road directly at the beach. The main surface on the beach is white sand but you also have a lot of small concrete piers, which divide the beach into many quarters. It is around 100 metres long and up to 20 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts very fast, either you jump from a pier or you go into the water and start swimming already after 5 metres. On some places you have rocks in the water, so take a look before you go inside. Many beach infrastructure is available here. You can rent many things here, sunbeds, umbrellas and some pedal boats. Restaurants and and beach bars are directly on the beach and you have many apartments and hotels in the vicinity if you plan this beach or the many here around to be your next Albania holiday.', 3693, 'en', 1),
(310, 'The Albanian town Ksamil in the region Vlor&euml; is one of the first tourist villages famous for its beautiful beaches. The beach Plazhi Ksamil 4 is no exception here. It&#39;s very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park on some public parking places sorounding the beach or directly at the beach on private parking places. The main surface on the beach is white sand but you also have a lot of small concrete piers, which divide the beach into many quarters. It is around 150 metres long and up to 25 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts very fast, either you jump from a pier or you go into the water and start swimming already after 5 metres. Many beach infrastructure is available here. You can rent many things here, sunbeds, umbrellas and some pedal boats. Restaurants and and beach bars are directly on the beach and you have many apartments and hotels in the vicinity if you plan this beach or the many here around to be your next Albania summer holiday.', 3694, 'en', 1),
(311, 'The Albanian town Ksamil in the region Vlor&euml; is one of the first tourist villages famous for its beautiful beaches. The beach Plazhi Ksamil 2 is a little bit special, namely the beach is formed out of many terrases. It&#39;s very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park on some public parking places sorounding the beach or directly at the beach on private parking places. The main surface on the beach is white sand but you also have a lot of small concrete piers, which divide the beach into many quarters. It is around 150 metres long and up to 25 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts very fast, either you jump from a pier or you go into the water and start swimming already after 5 metres. Many beach infrastructure is available here. You can rent a sunbed or an umbrella here. Restaurants and and beach bars are directly on the beach and you have many apartments and hotels in the vicinity and also a campsite if you travel with your motorhome or like this kind of a summer holiday.', 3695, 'en', 1),
(312, 'This beach is located a little bit outside the Albanian town Ksamil and it belongs to the region Vlor&euml;. It&#39;s easy to reach with a vehicle and you can park directly at the beach on a dirt parking ground, which is not flat but has quite a strong inclination, so be aware of that fact. You have around 100 m of beach length and 30 metres widness to enjoy. The water entry is nice and swimming starts immediately. The main surface are pebbles, you also have some trees there and you can rent sunbeds and umbrellas. This beach is very organised and you have many beach services available. A restaurant is also present on the beach. Accommodation is not directly on the beach available but a few hundred metres you have one apartment complex to stay in.', 3696, 'en', 1),
(313, 'If you are in south Albania in the region Vlor&euml; and you like beautiful small beaches you need to visit the small town Ksamil. Ksamil is also famous for the most important Albanian archaeological site called Butrint. The beach we are presenting here is Plazhi Ksamil 9. It is easy to reach with a vehicle and you can park directly by the beach beside the road. The beech is 100 metres long and up to 25 metres wide. Surface is white sand. The water entry is nice except on a few spots where you have some rocks in the water, so try to avoid them. Swimming starts either by jumping from the pier or after around 10 metres of going into the water. You have many beach services is here, a restaurants is also present here. Up by the road you have a small children playground. For accommodation you have many options like hotels and apartments.', 3697, 'en', 1),
(314, 'One of the very first beaches near the town Ksamil when travelling to the south of Albania is the beach Plazhi i Pasqyrave located in the region Vlor&euml;. The beach is not that easy to reach because you need to take a narrow and quite steep road which is in the last part made of dirt and rocks. Motorhomes can also go there but it should be a small one and if possible a four to four wheel drive, because some parts are quite tricky. You have a large parking place directly on the beach. The main surface on the beach are small pebbles mixed with some sand. The beach is 150 metres long and up to 25 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. You have some beach infrastructure here, but it&#39;s more basic. A beach bar and restaurant are as well present here. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but in the village above in the form of apartments and rooms.', 3698, 'en', 1),
(315, 'One of the very first beaches when travelling from south of Albania towards the town of Sarand&euml; is the beach Plazhi Manastirit located in the region Vlor&euml;. The beach is not that easy to reach because you need to take a narrow and quite steep road but it is made of concrete, so you have a better traction. Motorhomes can also go there but it should be a small one and if possible a four to four wheel drive, because some parts are quite tricky. You have a large parking place directly on the beach. The main surface on the beach are small pebbles mixed with some sand. The beaech is is 75 metres long and up to 15 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. You have some beach infrastructure here, even a small children playground. A beach bar and restaurant are as well present here. Accommodation is also available directly on the beach in the form of a hotel and you also have a small camping.', 3699, 'en', 1),
(316, 'The Albanian city Sarand&euml; is located in the region Vlor&euml;. The beaches in this city are famous for a lot of beach services they provide to the tourists. If you&#39;re the one who likes to spend their holiday in a hotel directly on the beach this city is the right one for you. The beach Plazhi Mango also belongs into this category. It is very easy accessible with a vehicle and parking can be done directly on the beach, but in most cases only private parking on a large hotel private parking place. The beach is around 300 m long and up to 50 metres wide. It is separated by many piers. The main surface on the beach are pebbles and you have also some concrete. The slope of the beach is on the water entry spot very steep, but you can swim away immediately. You have many beach services here available. Restaurants and beach bars are also available here. For accommodation you have many hotels and apartments of all kind of types available in the whole surrounding.', 3700, 'en', 1),
(317, 'The Albanian city&nbsp;Sarand&euml; is famous for its touristic impulse. The hotel concentration here is very high, as well as the number of beaches and other touristic facilities, to make your stay as pleasant as possible. We have visited the beach&nbsp;Sarand&euml; nr. 7 which is located right in the centre of the city and is categorized as a family beach. You can park your car by the road or on some private parking places. On the promenade, which divides the beach from the street, you will find lots of shops, restaurants, bars and the famous Albanian fast food bistros. The main beach surface is gravel and you have 200 m of length and up to 30 m wideness of it available. The water entry is very nice and comfortable and swimming starts already after 5 m of entering the water. All kind of beach infrastructure is here at your disposal. You won&rsquo;t have a problem to find an accommodation here, there are so many and you have many different types to choose from, and the best fact is, that they are all only a few meters away from your beach.', 3701, 'en', 1),
(318, 'The Albanian City Sarand&euml; is located in the region Vlor&euml;. The beaches in This city are famous for a lot of beach services they provide to the tourists. If you&#39;re the one who likes to spend their holiday in a hotel directly on the beach this city is the right one for you. The beach Plazhi Sarand&euml; 4 also belongs into this category. It is very easy accessible with a vehicle and parking can be done either directly on the beach on a private parking or a little bit up by the road. The beach is is around 400 m long and up to 20 metres wide and it is divided in several parts. The main surface on the beach is gravel and you have also some concrete on some spots. The inclinatation of the slope is normal and you can swim away immediately. Here you have many beach services available. Restaurants and beach bars are also available here. For accommodation you have many hotels and apartments available. A disco bar with a dancefloor is also nearby, so if you like to party, you are welcomed.&nbsp;', 3702, 'en', 1),
(319, 'The Albanian City Sarand&euml; is located in the region Vlor&euml;. The beaches in this city are famous for a lot of beach services they provide to the tourists. If you&#39;re the one who likes to spend their holiday in a hotel directly on the beach this city is the right one for you. The beach Plazhi Sarand&euml; 2 also belongs into this category. It is very easy accessible with a vehicle and parking can be done either directly on the beach on a private parking or a little bit up by the road. The beach is is around 300 m long and up to 30 metres wide and it is divided in several parts. The main surface on the beach is fine gravel and you have also some concrete spots, which very common for beaches in this city. The inclinatation of the slope is normal and you can swim away immediately. You also have a pier here wich is in the summertime used for jumping into the water. The water here is very deep so it&#39;s safe to jump. You have many beach services here available, you can also rent a sunbed and an umbrella. Restaurants and beach bars are also available here. For accommodation you have many hotels and apartments available directly on the beach.', 3703, 'en', 1),
(320, 'Just a little bit outside the Albanian city Sarand&euml; you have a very beautiful beach with the name Plazhi Gjiri Sarand&euml; to spend your summer holidays in Albania. Because of the way it is made, the different shapes that define it, the white sand, it makes it very special and very attractive. Taking a special photo with you on the beach this is beach is just perfect. It is located in the region Vlor&euml;. If you&#39;re the one who likes to spend your holiday in a hotel directly on the beach this beach is the right one for you. The accessibilty with a vehicle is easy and parking can be done directly at the beach on a private parking. The beach is around 100 m long and up to 50 metres wide. Main surface on the beach is white sand as well as concrete. The inclinatation of the slope is normal and you can swim away immediately. You also have a pier here wich is in the summertime used for jumping into the water. The water here is very deep so it&#39;s safe to jump. You have many beach services here available, you can also rent a sunbed and umbrella. A hotel restaurant and a beach bar is also available here. For accommodation you have a hotel directly on the beach and some apartments available in the vicinity.', 3704, 'en', 1),
(321, 'Near the Albanian village Borsh you have a few kilometres long white fine gravel beach to enjoy your well deserved holidays. The location of the beach is in the region Vlor&euml;. The beach is easy to reach with a vehicle, also motorhomes are welcomed here, and you can park directly on the beach by the road. The beach is around 30 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim starts almost immediately. You have many beach services available, especially around the beach bars and restaurants. Accommodation is also available directly on the beach, in the form of apartments, a hotel is also here and you even have a campsite.', 3705, 'en', 1),
(322, 'In Albania, on some parts, the country has a lot of mountains all the way to the coastline. Here and there the mountains have a break and a beautiful beaches open to the sea. In This part of Albania you have the region Vlor&euml; and the village Qeparo. The beach here is called plazhi Qeparo. The beach is easy to reach with a vehicle and you can park directly beside the beach on a large parking place. On some places they will charge you for the parking. The beach is around 2 kilometres long and up to 25 metres wide. What&#39;s the main surface of the beach is quite hard to determine, because it is a mixture of brown sand, pebbles and big stones. The water entry is very nice are swimming starts at around 15 metres. Along the whole stretch of the beach you have many restaurants and beach bars and this is also the place where you have the most beach infrastructure and services. You have many options to stay here for longer. Accommodation is available in various types, mostly in the form of apartments, rooms, hotels and even campsites.', 3706, 'en', 1),
(323, 'When travelling down the Albanian coastline in the region Vlor&euml; from the town Qeparo to the north part of Albania, just beside the coastline there is a very nice beach with the name Plazhi Porto Palermos 3. It&#39;s easy to reach with vehicle and you can leave your car on a parking place beside the road. After you go around 30 metres down the stairs, passing a restaurant you will see this 50 m long and 10 metres wide fine gravel beach. As a surface you also have some concrete. The water entry is either from the beach or you jump from a platform which makes the point of swim either immediately or at around 5 metres. This place is very organised and you have a restaurant and some accommodation directly on the beach and because of that you have here many beach services.', 3707, 'en', 1),
(324, 'When travelling down the Albanian coastline in the region Vlor&euml; from the town Qeparo to the north, just beside the coastline there is a very specialy shaped beach with the castle Ali Pasha nearby. The name of the beach is Plazhi Porto Palermos 2. It&#39;s easy to reach with a vehicle and you can leave your car on a parking place directly on the beach or up by the restaurant beside the road. The road down to the beach is made of dirt and rocks but it&#39;s very short and incline is quite normal. The beach is 100 m long and 10 metres wide and the main surface is fine gravel. As a surface you also have some concrete and some rocks on the edges. The water entry is either from the beach or you jump from a pier nearby, which makes the point of swim either immediately or at around 5 metres. On the beach itself there is little beach infrastructure. You have a restaurant and some accommodation in the form of bungalows up by the road some 50 m away from the beach.', 3708, 'en', 1),
(325, 'If you&#39;re the one who likes a very beautiful Albanian beach with lots of beach services, even a party place you need to visit the beach Plazhi i Llamanit. It is located in the region Vlor&euml; near the town Himar&euml;. It is a very accessible beach, with any kind of vehicle. The roads to this spot are from the highest quality and you have a very beautiful scenery when driving down the coastline. The last few hundret metres are made of dirt and when you reach the spot you can park directly on the beach. The beach main surface is fine gravel mixed with some sand. It is a 200 metres long and up to 40 metres wide beach. The water entry is very nice and you can swim away almost immediately. You have lots of beach services available, you can also rent a pedal boat. A beach bar, a restaurant and even a club is located here. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but there is a hotel near the main road.', 3709, 'en', 1),
(326, 'The Albanian town Himar&euml;, which is located in the region Vlor&euml; is very popular amongst the tourist. No wonder, because it has many beautiful beaches, and one of them is beach Plazhi Guma. The road which leads down the coastline is in a very good condition and it leads you also to this spot where you can park directly at the beach by the road. The beach is 400 m long and up to 50 m wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming immediately. You have some beach services available here, as well as many restaurants, pizzerias and similar catering. Accommodation is also not a problem, here you have many apartments and hotels.', 3710, 'en', 1),
(327, 'The Albanian town Himar&euml;, which is located in the region Vlor&euml; is very popular amongst the tourist. No wonder because it has many beautiful beaches, and one of them is beach Plazhi Potam. The road which leads down the coastline is in a very good condition and it leads you also to this spot where you can park directly at the beach by the road. The beach is 750 m long and up to 40 m wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming immediately. You have some beach services available here as well as many restaurants, pizzerias and similar catering. Accommodation is also not a problem, here you have many apartments and hotels, even a campsite.', 3711, 'en', 1),
(328, 'The Albanian town Himar&euml;, which is located in the region Vlor&euml; is very popular amongst the tourist. No wonder because it has many beautiful beaches, and one of them, which is also the beach of the centre of the city is beach Plazhi i Spiles&euml;. The road which leads down the coastline is in a very good condition and it leads right to the centre of the city and you can park either by the road or at some public park places. The beach is 500 m long and up to 20 m wide. The main surface of the beach is sand with some concrete terasses. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming immediately or you can jump from the pier. You have some beach services available here as well as many restaurants, pizzerias and similar catering. Accommodation is also not a problem, here you have many apartments and hotels.', 3712, 'en', 1),
(329, 'Near the Albanian town Himar&euml; there is a village Jala which is known for its 1 km long fine gravel beach called Plazhi Jal&euml; 2. It is located in the region Vlor&euml; and is very popular amongst motorhome enthusiast and those one who like to camp. The road which leads down the coastline is in a very good condition and you can park either by the road or on some private parkings.The beach is 1000 m long and up to 50 m wide. The main surface of the beach is fine gravel with a little sand mixed within. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming immediately. You have some beach services available here as well as many restaurants, beach bars, pizzerias and similar catering. Accommodation is also not a problem, here you have many apartments and hotels and also many campsites. Many small supermarkets are as well available.', 3713, 'en', 1),
(330, 'In the Albanian region Vlor&euml; in the middle of the mountanian coastline there is a very special village Dh&euml;rmi. In front of the village you have a 1 kilometre long and up to 50 metres wide fine gravel beach. The whole beach is very organised, with many beach bars at your service, with lots of benches and a long promenade. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park beside the road directly on the beach or on some private parking grounds. When going to swim you have a very nice water entry and you can start swimming almost immediately. Much beach infrastructure is here with lots of services. Accommodation is also available directly at the beach mostly in the form of apartments, rooms and hotels.', 3714, 'en', 1),
(331, 'In the Albanian region Vlor&euml; in the middle of the mountanian coastline before the roads lead you into the mountains there is a village Gjilek&euml;. In the month of May 2019 this beach was special because there was a fighter jet directly on the beach. Like the neighbouring village it also has a very long beach which is called Plazhi Drymades. It is made of fine gravel and is 2 kilometres long and up to 50 metres wide. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle you and you can park beside the road directly on the beach. When going to swim you have a very nice water entry and you can start swimming almost immediately. A lot of beach infrastructure is here with lots of services. Accommodation is also available directly at the beach mostly in the form of apartments, rooms and hotels, some resorts are also here present. And if you like to camp, you even have this option available here.', 3715, 'en', 1),
(332, 'When you&#39;re travelling up the Albanian coastline from the south to the north towards the town Vlor&euml;, before the road turns up into the mountains, the very last beach you will encounter is Plazhi Palas&euml;s in the village Palasa. It is located in the region Vlor&euml;. The beach is very easy to reach with your vehicle and the road is completely new. You can park directly on the beach on a parking place, but it&#39;s not for free, they will charge you around &euro;2 per day. The main surface of the beach is fine gravel mixed with some sand. The beach is around 2 kilometres long and up to 100 metres wide. You really have plenty of space&nbsp; to find your spot. The whole area is made completely new and it is still in the making by the year 2019, when we visited it. Everything is very organised and on the highest level, so are the beach services and the beach infrastructure. A children playground is also available directly on the beach. Many beach bars and restaurants are available here, and you can also rent some beach equipment there. Some accommodation is already available directly on the beach some is still in the making. Many luxury apartments and houses are built here. A very luxurious and high quality beach indeed, higlhy recommended by our team.', 3716, 'en', 1),
(333, 'The first beach you will encounter when driving up the coastline from south to the north part of Albania in the region Vlor&euml;, after you cross the seaside mountains and drive down the 1000 metres high mountain pass, is the beach in the small town Orikum. The beach is a few kilometres long and up to 40 metres wide. To park your vehicle, also motorhomes, here is not a problem, you simply leave your car beside the road. The main surface is fine gravel mixed with sand. The water entry here is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 metres. Along the whole stretch of the beach you have many restaurants and beach bars and so are also the beach services available around those spots. Because of a few hotels directly on the beach you can also plan to stay here for your holidays.', 3717, 'en', 1),
(334, 'This beach has got to be one of the best organised, beautiful, family friendly, green, with high quality beach services beaches in Albania. When visitting this beach you can be sure it will stay in your memory forever. You will find it in the small town Orikum when driving up the coastline from south to north part of Albania in the region Vlor&euml;, after you cross the seaside mountains and drive down the 1000 metres high mountain pass. The beach Is 500 metres long and up to 30 metres wide. To park your vehicle also motorhomes here is not a problem, you simply leave your car beside the road. The main surface is fine gravel mixed with sand, and you also have a lot of grass here, even some trees. The water entry here is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 metres. This is actually a beach resort with lots of beach services as well as many beach bars and restaurants. It&#39;s a truly family type beach, you have so many space for your children to play safely on the high quality children&#39;s playgrounds or just simply enjoying the green grass fields. Because of a few hotels, apartments and resorts directly on the beach you can also plan to stay here for your holidays, you certainly won&#39;t regret it.', 3718, 'en', 1),
(335, 'When driving up the coastline from Orikum towards the city Vlor&euml; you have many artificial made beaches right beside the road. The same goes for the beach Vega which is very easy to reach with your vehicle. You can simply park beside the road or park on the parking places the beach provides. The beach is 150 metres long and up to 15 metres wide. The main surface is fine gravel, concrete and you also have some rocks. The water entry here is done either by using the water steps or by the beach. Swimming starts at around 10 metres. The beach is very organised and you have many beach services here available. A restaurant and a beach bar are located as well directly on the beach. Nearby you also have a hotel and some apartments.', 3719, 'en', 1),
(336, 'If you are nearby the albanian city Vlor&euml; or you plan to spent your vacation in Albania and you also like beautiful long sandy beaches you have to visit this city beach. It&#39;s very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park directly on the beach, where you need to be the customer of the beach bar, or in the vicinity. The beach is around 2 kilometres long up to 75 m wide. The inclination of the beach is very low, it&#39;s almost flat. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 50 m, which makes it a perfect beach for small children to play safely at the shoreline. This whole area is very organised and you have many benches and paths to walk around. Many beach services are available here, even sport fields and children playgrounds. Around the whole area you have a lot of restaurants and beach bars, also other type of catering to please your needs.You will find many types of accommodation here, the most present are certainly hotels which are available directly at the beach.', 3720, 'en', 1),
(337, 'If you are nearby the Albanian city Vlor&euml; or you plan to spent your vacation in Albania and you also like beautiful long sandy beaches, you have to visit this city beach. It&#39;s very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park directly on the beach, literally on the beach. The beach is several kilometres long and on some places even more than to 100 m wide. The inclination of the beach is very low, it&#39;s almost flat. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 75 m, which makes this beach ideal for your youngsters to play safely at the shoreline. Many beach services are available here. Around the whole area you have a lot of restaurants and beach bars, also other type of catering to please your needs.You will find many types of accommodation here, the most present are certainly hotels which are available directly at the beach.', 3721, 'en', 1),
(338, 'If you are nearby the albanian city Vlor&euml; or you plan to spent your vacation in Albania and you also like beautiful long sandy beaches you have to visit the neighbouring small town Narta and its long sandy beach. It&#39;s very easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park directly on the beach, beside the road. The beach is several kilometres long and on some places even more than 100 meters wide. The inclination of the beach is very low, it&#39;s almost flat. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 75 m. Because the water is so shallow here it is also suitable for small children to play in the water. Many beach services are available here. Around the whole area you have a lot of restaurants and beach bars, also other type of catering to please your needs. Directly on the beach you don&#39;t have any accommodation, but more is available in the town Narta or the town Vlor&euml;.', 3722, 'en', 1),
(339, 'In the Albanian region Fier there are not many beaches, but those one who exist will take your breath away. This one is located near the village Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re and is called Plazhi Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re. It&#39;s a very long sandy beach which is several kilometres long and more than 100 metres wide. You really have a lot of space here. The whole beach is almost flat and so is the shallow water. It takes really a long time before you reach the point of swim, probably more than 100 metres. But the shallow water is excellent for small children to play safely in it. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle and you can park directly on the beach itself. If you get hungry or thirsty you have many restaurants and beach bars directly on the beach available. Accommodation is not available on the beach and is probably more kilometres away into the inland. This place because of the flat water and strong winds is also very popular amongst kiteboarders.', 3723, 'en', 1),
(340, 'Welcome to the beach Divjak&euml;s. The Albanian region Fier has a very special coastline which mainly consist of very long sandy beaches. Near the small town Divjak&euml; you have such a beach, called Plazhi Divjak&euml;s. It is not only famous because of the beach, but also because of the beautiful nature protected area, with lots of birds, especially pelicans and flamingos. It&#39;s easy to reach it with all kind of vehicles, even motorhomes and you can park directly on the beach itself. From the point where you have the largest accommodation concentration to the point where you actually come to the beach, you need to drive on sandy roads, it is safe, because they are very stable, especially when they are dry, not so much after the rain. The beach itself is several kilometres long and more than 100 metres wide. The inclination of the beach is very low, it&#39;s almost flat and so is the water where you need to walk for 100 metres to reach the point of swim. This makes this beach, except from the fact that on the beach itself there is little beach infrastructure, perfect for small children to play safely in the water. On the beach itself there is almost no infrastructure, but more is around the restaurants and accommodation, which are also located on the beach. You have many types of accommodation to choose from. Here is a hotel, a resort and some apartments.', 3724, 'en', 1),
(341, 'Welcome to the beach Spille. One of the very first beaches in the region Tiran&euml;, when travelling from the south part of the country towards the north, there is a very long sandy beach, called Plazhi Spille. The beach is very organised and is a popular touristic spot suitable for families. It is very easy to reach it with your vehicle and you can park directly in front of the beach, next to the beach bars. The whole parking area is very large and can hold many hundred cars. You have a lot of beach infrastructure and beach services available here. The whole beach is several kilometres long and can be on some places up to 75 m wide. You really have a lot of space here to find your spot. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 50 metres, which makes this place ideal for small children to play in the water safely. You can rent here a sunbed and an umbrella, which can be done by the restaurants or beach bars who are located along the whole stretch of the beach. Accommodation is also in the vicinity, mainly in the form of hotels, some apartments are also available.', 3725, 'en', 1),
(342, 'Welcome to the beach Karpen. In Albania there are many beautiful places to take your breath away, and the same goes for the beach Plazhi Karpen, which is located in the region Tiran&euml; near the city Golem. What it makes it so special is the view you will have wenn walking on a wooden pier to a small island, not far away from the shoreline. Because of the shallow water, the trees on the beach and the sand all around it, it is one of the most pictures sights I have ever been. The place is easy to reach with a vehicle, also a motorhome, especially because of the camp which is located directly on the beach. You can park beside the road or in the camp. The beach main surface is sand. Many trees are here available to protect you from the sun. The beach, like the water, are very flat, which makes it ideal for small children. All together the beach is around 750 metres long and up to 40 m wide, and is separated in many beach sectors. The point of swim is very far away, probably more than 100 meters. You have many beach services available here, the same goes for beach bars and restaurants. If you like this beach characteristics and you would like to spent your vacation here, a campsite, apartments and a hotel are at your disposal just next to the beach. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3726, 'en', 1),
(343, 'Welcome to the Albanian beach Qerret. If you like to have a sandy beach on your vacation and at the same time you would like to stay in the shadow of the pine trees, with the Albanian beach Plazhi Qerret you are on the right spot. It is located in the region Tiran&euml; near the city Golem. This location is very easy to reach with a vehicle. You can park directly in front of the beach in a pine tree forest, this way your car will be cool the whole day. The beach is around 1000 m long and on some places up to 100m wide. It is separated in many sectors, it depends at which resort your stay. The incline is quite normal, the water entry is very nice and swimming starts quite late, at around 50 m. You have a lot of beach infrastructure available through the whole stretch of the beach, and on some parts there are really premium services. You won&#39;t be hungry on this beach, there are many beach bars and restaurants available, the same goes for all kind of accommodation, from simple rooms, camping all the way to the premium resorts and hotels. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3727, 'en', 1),
(344, 'Welcome to the beach Golem. In the region Tiran&euml;, near to the famous city Durr&euml;s you have another typical beach for this region. The beaches, which are located in this region, are all a sandy type, with the pine trees in the background. This beach belongs to the city Golem. It is easy to reach it with your vehicle and you can park directly in front of the beach, beside the road, mostly under some pine trees. It is several kilometres long and on the widest part around 100 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 30 metres. Because this place is very popular among the tourists, you have a lot of beach services available on the beach. Hear you have also plenty of beach bars, restaurants and similar. Accommodation Is available in all kind of forms, mainly as hotels, and even as resorts. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3728, 'en', 1),
(345, 'If you like long sandy beaches with lots of space, with the beach infrastructure, beach services on the highest level and you also would like to have your apartment in a premium hotel right in front of the beach, with the beach Plazhi Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s you are on the right spot. The beach is located on the border between two regions, those are the region Tiran&euml; and the region Durr&euml;s. The closest city is named Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. This place is easy to reach with your vehicle and you can either park directly on the beach on a public park place or on a private place belonging to a hotel. The beach is a few kilometres long and 100m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 50 metres. You have lots of beach services available, included children&#39;s playgrounds and sports fields. Beach bars and different types of restaurants are available along the whole beach. The same goes for accommodation which is present here mainly in the form of premium hotels, but some apartments and other types of accommodation are as well available.', 3729, 'en', 1),
(346, 'If you would like to have the experience with the Albanian biggest seaside touristic city you have to visit Durr&euml;s. This place is famous for its very long sandy beach, more kilometres long and up to 75 metres wide. It is very easy to reach with a vehicle of any kind and you can simply park beside the road. On the beach itself you have lots of space. The water entry is very nice and because the water is very shallow the point of swim starts around 75m to 100m. This fact makes this beach ideal for families with small children. Because this is a true city beach many beach infrastructure is available here and lots of beach services. All around the place you have many shops, beach bars and restaurants of all kind. Accommodation is available on every corner of the beach in all kind of forms, predominantly as hotels.', 3730, 'en', 1),
(347, 'If you would like to have the experience with the Albanian biggest seaside touristic City you have to visit Durr&euml;s. This place is famous for its very long sandy beaches but on some parts you also have a little bit more private small beaches. This one is called Plazhi ke Aragosta and its 300 metres long and up to 30 metres wide. It is very easy to reach with a vehicle of any kind and you can simply park beside the road. The main beach surface is sand, the water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately, but if you prefer to jump into the water you can also do it from a pier. Because this is a true city beach many beach infrastructure is available here and lots of beach services. All around the place you have many shops, beach bars and restaurants of all kind. Accommodation is available in all kind of forms, predominantly as hotels.', 3731, 'en', 1),
(348, 'One of the last beaches you can visit in the seaside touristic city Durr&euml;s before going to the north is the beach Plazhi Currila. It is located in the region Durr&euml;s and it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can either park by the road or on the private parking place from the hotel. The beach surface is sand, but you also have other types mixed within, like pebbles, and you even have some concrete parts. Altogether the beach is 500 metres long up to 25 metres wide. The water entry changes along the stretch of the beach and on some points you can start swimming after 5 metres or you can either jump from the pier. You have many beach infrastructure here and lots of beach services, the same goes also for the different types of restaurants and beach bars. There is also a partyplace located in the vicinity of the beach. If you are searching for accommodation you have a hotel directly on the beach and some apartments in the vicinity.', 3732, 'en', 1),
(349, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to the beach Hamallaj. The Albanian beach Plazhi Hamallaj is located in the region Durr&euml;s, known for its beautiful sandy coastline on the Adriatic Sea. It is a very long sandy beach mainly suitable for families. The road to the beach is in a good condition and you can park your vehicle directly in front of the beach just next to the beach bars and restaurants. The beach itself is several kilometres long and up to 75 meters wide, you really have lots of space here. The inclination of the beach is very moderate, quite normal, so is the water entry, and you can start swimming between 30 and 40 meters&rsquo; distance from the shoreline. You have some beach services available directly on the beach, where you can also rent some beach equipment, like parasols and sunbeds. Beach bars and restaurants are available as well on the beach. The same goes for accommodation, where you have a new apartment complex located directly on the beach and a campsite nearby. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</div>\n', 3733, 'en', 1),
(350, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to the Albanian beach Plazhi Gjiri i Lal&euml;zit 1. It is located in the region Durr&euml;s and is one of the last very long beaches in the north of this region. This sandy beach is very long, a few kilometres long and is more than 100 meters wide. Families will love this place, especially those one with children, because many children playgrounds are located here. You have a lot of parking options here, and you can park directly in front of the beach, next to the beach bars and restaurants. The inclination of the beach is normal, so is the water entry and you can start swimming between 30 and 40 meters&rsquo; distance from the shoreline. You have a lot of high quality beach services available directly on the beach, where you can also rent some beach equipment, paddle boats and so on. Beach bars and restaurants of all kind of cuisines are available as well on the beach. The same goes for accommodation, in the background of the beach there are located: a new apartment complex, resorts and hotels. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</div>\n', 3734, 'en', 1),
(351, 'Welcome to the very special Albanian beach, Plazhi Tal&euml;. One of the first very long sandy beaches when travelling up the Albanian coastline from south to the north, in the region Lezh&euml;, is the beach Plazhi Tal&euml;. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and is a must go if you are a fan of beaches where you can park and drive directly on the beach. Before you reach the sandy beach, you need to turn from the main road towards the sea, and drive a few hundred meters on a dirt road. Once on the beach, you can drive further and choose your parking place anywhere you want directly on the sand of the beach. The beach is completely made of sand, it is several kilometers long and up to 100 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. A lot of beach infrastructure is located here and many beach services are at your disposal. Restaurants and beach bars are also here, as well as many fast food restaurants. Some restaurants are located also on piers, to give you even a more special dining experience. Accommodation is available just next to the beach, mainly in the form of apartments, hotels and some apartment complexes. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3735, 'en', 1),
(352, 'Welcome to the Albanian beach Plazhi Kun&euml;. This Balkan country is known for its beauty, especially for its natural parks. Near the city Sh&euml;ngjin. located on the Adriatic coast, you can find the&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-family: arial, sans-serif-light, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Kun&euml;-Vain-Tale Nature Park, which offers the beach enthusiast a very long sandy beach. It is part of&nbsp;</span></span>region Lezh&euml;, near to the village Stomi i Madh. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and you can leave your car beside the road, directly at the beach. Altogether the beach is a few kilometres long and up to 40 metres wide. It is separated into many quarters, where you have a lot of beach bars located. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 40 m. Most of the beach infrastructure and services are available in the vicinity of the beach bars and restaurants, on other parts you have no service. Accommodation is also available, but not on the beach directly, the first hotel is only 300 meters away, more are available towards the city&nbsp;Sh&euml;ngjin. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3736, 'en', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(353, 'Welcome to the beach Sh&euml;ngjin. This city beach is a popular Albanian tourist destination. If you are a fan of a long sandy beach, with lots of hotels, shops and beach bars located directly in front of the beach, and you also like many tourist services at your disposal, this beach should be your next beach vacation. Region Lezh&euml; is where it is located in Albania, directly on the Adriatic coastline. No matter what kind of a vehicle you are driving, you will easy reach this location, and you can park either beside the road or on some public parking places. The beach itself is 3 kilometres long and up to 75 metres wide. The water entrance is very nice and swimming starts at around 30 metres. On one part of the beach you also have a pine tree forest to give you some natural shadow. On this beach you won&#39;t have any problems finding the right accommodation for you. Just a few meters from the beach plenty of all kind of hotels and apartments are available. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3737, 'en', 1),
(354, 'Welcome to the beach Rana e Medhun. This beautiful beach is the last beach in the north part of the Albanian region Lezh&euml;. Sh&euml;ngjin, a famous touristic town, is the closest to this location. You should visit this beach if you are on vacation with your family, and you also like a long sandy beach with luxurious hotels and pine trees located directly on the beach. Such beach characteristics are very unique for Albanian beaches, and you will be amazed by the view you will have every morning from a balcony of your room in the luxurious hotels. The location is easy to reach with a vehicle. Parking can be done directly in front of the beach, mostly on the private parking places from the restaurants or hotels. The beach is several kilometres long and on some parts even 100 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts already at 10 meters. You have plenty of beach infrastructure available here, and it is on the highest level. Restaurants and beach bars are also located here, as well as a few luxurious hotels and a beautiful resort. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3738, 'en', 1),
(355, 'Welcome to the beach Rrjollit. The very first region you enter, when arriving to Albania from Montenegro, by the coastline, is the region Shkod&euml;r. This region is famous for its beautiful sandy beaches, who stretch over several kilometres. The last beach before going to the next region down the coastline is located in the village Baks-Rrjoll&euml;. It is several kilometres long and up to 100 metres wide. You really have a lot of space here. It is especially beautiful at the sunset. On one side you have the Adriatic Sea and in your background some small mountains. The beach is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can simply park directly on the beach itself or at the resort, if you are a guest there. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 20 metres. You don&#39;t have much beach infrastructure here, only at the beach resort. A restaurant is also available here, as well as an accommodation in the form of a hotel. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3739, 'en', 1),
(356, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to the touristic beach&nbsp;Velipoj&euml;s.&nbsp;If you&#39;re a family, a one that loves very long, very wide and very touristic sandy beaches, with spending your holidays on the Albanian beach Plazhi Velipoj&euml;s you can&#39;t go wrong.&nbsp;It is less than 1 kilometre away from the bordering country Montenegro. The very famous Skadar lake is also in the vicinity.&nbsp;The beach is located in the region Shkod&euml;r and is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle. You can park on multiple parking spots almost directly in front of the beach. The beach is several kilometres long and more than 100 m wide, the water entrance is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. Because of this being a very popular tourist destination, you can expect to have many beach services and beach infrastructure available on the beach. Many restaurants, beach bars, fast food and other types of catering are available at the beach or in its vicinity. Accommodation is of course also present here, mainly in the form of hotels and apartments, and on one end of the beach you even have a luxurious resort. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3740, 'en', 1),
(357, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to the very special beach Plazhi Ada. The Albanian beaches are amazing, which is also true for the beach we are presenting in this video. The beach Ada has got an aqua park directly in front of the beach, but not only that, behind the aqua park, you have a luxury resort in an ancient Greek architecture style, where you can spend your holidays. The region this beach is located is called Shkod&euml;r, and the closest city is Velipoj&euml;. It is basically the first or the last beach in Albania. When you travel to the south, down the coastline from Montenegro, it is the first beach after crossing the border, and when you travel to the north, from Greece, it is the last beach. The location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. In the summertime the parking places for the beach and to the aqua park are open to the public. The beach itself is few kilometres long and up to 75 m wide. The inclination is normal, the water entry is nice and swimming starts almost immediately. You have some beach infrastructure available on the beach and even more in the aqua park. A few beach bars and restaurants are located directly on the beach. The closest accommodation, only 100 meters away, is the luxury resort just behind the aqua park. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3741, 'en', 1),
(358, 'Montenegro is famous for its beautiful beaches. In the south of the country in the region Ulcinj there is a very long sandy beach with the name Ada Bojana. The beach is special because it is specialized for the naturist/FKK/nudist type of tourist. The closest village is Doni &Scaron;toj. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, and you can park on multiple parking places. The walk from the parking place to the beach is only 100 meters long. The beach itself is several kilometers long and up to 50 meters wide. The inclination of the slope is normal, so is the water entry and swimming starts at around 10 meters. You have many beach infrastructure and services available here. Accommodation is also nearby and it comes in many shapes and forms, like bungalows, apartments, a hotel and even a campsite.', 3742, 'en', 1),
(359, 'Montenegro is famous for its beautiful beaches. In the south of the country in the region Ulcinj there are a few very long sandy beaches. The beach plaža Velika is several kilometers long and up to 100 meters wide. The closest village is Doni &Scaron;toj. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, and you can park on multiple parking places. The walk from the parking place to the beach is only 50 meters long. The inclination of the slope is normal, so is the water entry and swimming starts at around 10 meters. You have many beach infrastructure and services available here. Accommodation is also available on the beach directly, where you can rent some apartments or bungalows. A campsite is also present here.', 3743, 'en', 1),
(360, 'In Montenegro you also have a special beach near the town Ulcinj which is specialized for the kiteboarding sport. The closest village goes by the name Doni &Scaron;toj. This place is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. From the main road you take a dirt road which is in a quite good condition and after one kilometer you are on the beach. Parking can be done directly on the beach. The beach itself is several kilometers long and even more than 100 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters. You have some beach infrastructure here but it&#39;s mainly concentrated around the beach bar or the kiteboarding center. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach, but more in the background of the beach, some kilometers away.', 3744, 'en', 1),
(361, 'Near the town and the region Ulcinj there is a village Doni &Scaron;toj. It is a family beach which is known for its very long sandy beach with many many beach bars directly on the beach. This place is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. From the main road you take a paved road and after one kilometer you are on the beach. Parking can be done directly on the beach. The beach itself is several kilometers long and even more than 100 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters. You have many beach infrastructure and services here. The beach bars are sometimes also restaurants or fast food locations. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach, but more in the background or in the surrounding.', 3745, 'en', 1),
(362, 'If you&#39;re the one who likes long sandy beaches and you also would like to have pine trees on the beach to protect you from the sun the beach plaža Safari in Montenegro is the one for you. It is located in the region Ulcinj near the village Doni &Scaron;toj. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, because of the campsite, which is located directly at the beach, motorhomes and caravans are also welcomed. You also have parking place for normal cars directly at the beach. The access to the beach is very easy. The beach is more kilometers long and up to 100 meters wide. The inclination of the slope is small, it&#39;s almost flat, because of that you also have a very shallow water, which with the pine trees it makes it ideal for small children. The point of swim starts very late, at around 50 meters. You have a lot of beach infrastructure and services available on the beach. Many types of accommodation are available here. On the beach you have a campsite and in the background many apartments and hotels. If you are a family with small children and you travel with a motorhome this beach is perfect for your next vacation.', 3746, 'en', 1),
(363, 'This sandy Montenegro beach which stretches from the town Ulcinj all the way down to the Albanian border is very special and unique. The main surface, which is here sand, has a healing effect for some illnesses. Because here is no industry, the water is very clean and the sand has a special mineral mixture of 30 elements, some of them slightly radioactive, which makes them also bioactive. The beach is located in the region Ulcinj, near the village Gjerana, and it goes by the name beach Miami. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle, even under some trees. Because of so many camping grounds here around it is also very popular amongst motorhomes tourist types. The whole area around the beach is very organized and on the highest level. You have really a lot of beach infrastructure and services here. The beach is several kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide. The inclination of the beach is quite flat and because of that you also have a shallow water, which makes it ideal for small children. Because of the shallow water the point of swim starts at around 50 to 75 meters. Accommodation is on the beach directly available only in the form of a camping ground. Hotels and apartments are more in the background, but not far away.', 3747, 'en', 1),
(364, 'The south part of Montenegro in the turistic town Ulcinj you have very unique and special beaches which you won&#39;t find anywhere in the world. This whole area has a very rocky coastline and to enable the tourist to take a swim in the sea the locals have created a very special concrete beaches, with many terraces and wooden podiums. There are five of such beaches which are all a more adventurer type of user oriented, because of the high cliffs. And the first one is called plaža Albatros. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. Either you do it by the road or on some private large parking places which cost a few euros per day. The length of the path to the beach depends on where you have parked your vehicle and it can be up to 500 meters away or only 100 meters. From the road to the beach you have to descent about 15 meters in height. This beach is separated in three smaller parts, the main surface is concrete on rocks, what is also the material of the terraces. You also have some pine trees there. All together the beach is around 150 meters long and up to 30 meters wide. The inclination is on some parts normal on some parts steep and on some parts it falls abrupt into the sea. You can reach the water by a ladder, by concrete steps or by jumping into the water. A beach bar and a restaurant are directly on the beach. You also have the main beach infrastructure and services available on the beach. Accommodation is also available in the background of the beach, where you have a hotel. Apartments are available in the city itself.', 3748, 'en', 1),
(365, 'The south part of Montenegro in the turistic town Ulcinj you have very unique and special beaches which you won&#39;t find anywhere in the world. This whole area has a very rocky coastline and to enable the tourist to take a swim in the sea the locals have created very special concrete beaches, with many terraces and wooden podiums. There are five of such beaches which are all a more adventurer type of user oriented, because of the high cliffs. The second one is called plaža Ženska. This beach is even more special than the other ones, because it has a special smell. On the beach you have sulfur springs which are known in this location to have a healing effect. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. Either you do it by the road or on some private large parking places which cost a few euros per day. The length of the path to the beach depends on where you have parked your vehicle and it can be up to 500 meters away or only 100 meters. From the road to the beach you have to descent about 15 meters in height. This beach is separated into a few smaller parts, the main surface is concrete on rocks and some wooden terraces. The beach also has a small bay made of big white stones. All together the beach is around 75 meters long and up to 15 meters wide. The inclination is on some parts normal on some parts steep and on some parts it falls abrupt into the sea. You can reach the water by a ladder, by concrete steps, via the small beach, or by jumping into the water. A beach bar and a restaurant are directly on the beach. You also have the main beach infrastructure and services available on the beach. Accommodation is also available in the background of the beach, where you have a hotel. Apartments are available in the city itself.', 3749, 'en', 1),
(366, 'The South part of Montenegro, in the turistic town Ulcinj you have very unique and special beaches which you won&#39;t find anywhere in the world. This whole area has a very rocky coastline and to enable the tourist to take a swim in the sea the locals have created very special concrete beaches, with many terraces and wooden podiums. There are five of such beaches which are all a more adventurer type of user oriented, because of the high cliffs. The third one is called Plaža Sapore di Mare. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. Either you do it by the road or on some private large parking places which cost a few euros per day. The length of the path to the beach depends on where you have parked your vehicle and it can be up to 500 meters away or only 20 meters. From the road to the beach you have to descent about 15 meters in height. This beach is separated into a few smaller parts, the main surface is concrete on rocks and some wooden terraces on steel foundation. On some parts it is quite challenging to get around. Some pine trees are as well there. All together the beach is around 75 meters long and up to 25 meters wide. The inclination is on some parts normal on some parts steep and on some parts it falls abrupt into the sea. You can reach the water by a ladder, by concrete steps, or by jumping into the water. A beach bar and a restaurant are directly on the beach. You also have the main beach infrastructure and services available on the beach. Accommodation is also available in the background of the beach, where you have a hotel. Apartments are available in the city itself.', 3750, 'en', 1),
(367, 'The south part of Montenegro, in the turistic town Ulcinj you have very unique and special beaches which you won&#39;t find anywhere in the world. This whole area has a very rocky coastline and to enable the tourist to take a swim in the sea the locals have created very special concrete beaches, with many terraces and wooden podiums. There are five of such beaches which are all a more adventurer type of user oriented, because of the high cliffs. The fourth one is called Plaža Aquarius. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. Either you do it by the road or on some private large parking places which cost a few euros per day. The length of the path to the beach depends on where you have parked your vehicle and it can be up to 500 meters away or only a few meters if you find one free place near the entrance. From the road to the beach you have to descent about 15 meters in height till you reach the sea. This beach is separated into a few smaller parts, the main surface is concrete on rocks and some wooden terraces on steel foundation which are also installed on the rocks. On some parts it is quite challenging to get around. Some pine trees are as well there and also some grass. All together the beach is around 150 meters long and up to 40 meters wide. The inclination is on some parts normal on some parts steep and on some parts it falls abrupt into the sea. You can reach the water by a ladder, by concrete steps, or by jumping into the water. A beach bar and a restaurant are directly on the beach. You also have the main beach infrastructure and services available on the beach. Accommodation is also available in the background of the beach, where you have a hotel, apartments and rooms available for your vacation time in Montenegro.', 3751, 'en', 1),
(368, 'The south part of Montenegro, in the turistic town Ulcinj you have very unique and special beaches which you won&#39;t find anywhere in the world. This whole area has a very rocky coastline and to enable the tourist to take a swim in the sea the locals have created very special concrete beaches, with many terraces and wooden podiums. There are five of such beaches which are all a more adventurer type of user oriented, because of the high cliffs and sometimes dangerous spots. The fifth one is called Plaža Far. This location is really unique. The place is more like a party location, with many pools and beach bars and even a dancing floor on the top. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. Either you do it by the road or on some private large parking places which cost a few euros per day. The length of the path to the beach depends on where you have parked your vehicle and it can be up to 200 meters away or only a few meters if you find one free place near the entrance. From the road to the beach you have to descent about 20 meters in height till you reach the sea. This beach is separated into a few smaller parts, the main surface are concrete terraces. All together the beach is around 100 meters long and up to 50 meters wide. The inclination is on some parts normal on some parts steep and on some parts it falls abrupt into the sea. You can reach the water by a ladder, by concrete steps, or by jumping into the water. A beach bar and a restaurant as well as a dancing floor are directly on the beach. You have manny beach infrastructure and services available on the beach, even a few swimming pools. Accommodation is also available in the background of the beach, where you have a hotel, apartments and rooms available for your vacation time in Ulcinj in Montenegro.', 3752, 'en', 1),
(369, 'In the Montenegro town Ulcinj you have a sandy beach right in the center of the town. Ulcinj is located in the south part of Montenegro, not far away from the Albanian border. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, there is even some space for motorhomes. The name of the beach is Mala plaža and it is a family-type beach. You can park your vehicle on multiple park places, mostly beside the road, on designeted parking lots. The closest one is just beside the road directly on the beach or a little bit far away where you have larger private parking places available. The beach is 400 meters long and on some places up to 50 meters wide. The inclination of the beach is normal. The water here is quite shallow and swimming starts at around 50 meters. You have a lot of beach infrastructure and services available directly on the beach. Many restaurants, coffee bars and all kind of shops are available directly on the beach. Accommodation is also here, mainly in the form of hotels and apartments. If you are a fan of water sports equipment, like paddle boats or kayaks, you can rent them on the beach as well.', 3753, 'en', 1),
(370, 'When traveling in the country Montenegro from south to the north the very first pebbles beach in the region Ulcinj is the beach Valdanos. The closest village to the beach is Bratica. This place is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can park directly on the beach on a large parking place. The beach main surface are pebbles with big stones and you also have some concrete terraces. All together the beach is 500 meters long and up to 15 meters wide. The Inclination of the slope is on some places steep on some normal. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters. Beach infrastructure and some services are also available here, but they are very basic. A beach bar is directly on the beach as well. Accommodation in this location is not available, the closest one is in the town Ulcinj.', 3754, 'en', 1),
(371, 'In the Montenegro region Bar, in the small town Utjeha, there is a very special beach suitable for a more adventurer user type. This beach is really special. It is made of several concrete terraces and in the bottom near the sea there is a small white pebbles beach. On the terraces you even have some trees. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes can also park here. You can park directly at the beach on a large parking place, which is 10 meters above the beach. In the bottom the beach is 10 meters long and more up in the hill it is 20 meters. The widthness of the beach is around 30 meters, concrete terraces included, the pebble beach alone has only a width of 3 metres. You don&#39;t have much beach infrastructure on this beach, but there is a small beach bar here, and all around the beach there are apartments, where you can stay for your holiday in Montenegro.', 3755, 'en', 1),
(372, 'In the Montenegro region Bar, in the small town Utjeha, there is a very special concrete beach, called Rocky, suitable for families. This beach is really special. It is made of several concrete terraces on rocks and you even have some swimming pools there. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can park directly at the beach on a large private parking place. The beach is 100 meters long with cliffs all around it and it is 15 meters wide. To get into the crystal clear water you can either use some steps, or simply jump into the blue.water from the up to 2 meters high concrete terrace. This beach is very organized and the beach infrastructure is on the highest level with many services available on the beach directly. You have a beach bar and a restaurant directly on the beach as well. If you are thinking to spend your summer time at this destination, here are some accommodation options available. All around the beach there are some campsites, as well as apartments, which are available in the vicinity.', 3756, 'en', 1),
(373, 'The small town Utjeha, which is located in the Montenegro region Bar, you have a white big stone beach Utjeha, which is&nbsp;primarily suitable for families. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included, but you can only park in the camp. Parking is possible only on a private large parking place or in the camps. The beach is 150 meters long and up to 25 meters wide. On one side of the beach you also have some concrete terraces and a swimming pool. To get into the crystal clear water you can either go by the beach, use some steps or simply jump into the blue water from the concrete terraces. The point of swim starts very fast and you can swim away already after 5 meters, when going to the water by the beach, or immediately if you jump into the water, it is deep enough by the terraces. On the beach you have some beach infrastructure and some services available. You have a beach bar and a restaurant directly on the beach. All around the beach there are some campsites, as well as apartments, which are available in the vicinity.', 3757, 'en', 1),
(374, 'If you like small pebbles beaches with almost no beach infrastructure, but some accommodation in the vicinity, with the beach Uvala Maslina, near the small town Utjeha, you are on the right place. It is located in the Montenegro region Bar. It&#39;s very easy to reach with your vehicle. There are some parking places by the road, more are by private parking. To reach the beach from the parking you need to descent 25 meters in height and around 100 meters in length. The path is medium difficult and the beach is suitable for an adventurer user type. The main surface on the beach are white pebbles and you also have some concrete terraces. The beach is 20 meters long and around 10 meters wide. The water entry is nice and you can also jump from the concrete terrace. Swimming starts almost immediately. On the beach itself you don&#39;t have any beach infrastructure. Accommodation is available near the parking in the form of apartments.', 3758, 'en', 1),
(375, 'In the Montenegro town Dobra Voda, which means good water, you have a very large white pebble beach. Altough the main surface are pebbles, you also have some brown sand mixed within. The beach is located in the region Bar, and is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You have 2 large public parking places available almost directly at the beach. They are not for free and will cost you a few euros per day. The beach is 400 meters long and up to 50 meters wide. On one part of the beach you also have concrete terraces. The water gets deep here quite quickly which makes the point off swim almost immediately. The water entry is nice and you can also jump from the small pier, or use the water ladder to go into the water. Because this is the towns main beach, you have many beach services available here. If you get hungry or thirsty, you have many restaurants and similar catering available directly on the beach. Accommodation is also not a problem here, you have plenty of hotels and apartments all around the beach available for your vacation.', 3759, 'en', 1),
(376, 'In the Montenegro town Dobra Voda, which means good water you have two popular beaches. The one we are describing here is the smaller one, and since it has no official name, we gave it the name Dobra Voda. Altough the main surface are pebbles, you also have some brown sand mixed within. You also have some concrete terraces on each side of the main beach. The beach is located in the region Bar and is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You have 2 large public parking places available almost directly at the beach. They are not for free and will cost you a few euros per day. The first parking space is only 200 meters away, the second one around 500 meters. The beach is 200 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. On one part of the beach you also have some concrete terraces. The water falls here quite quickly, which makes the point off swim almost immediately. The water entry is nice and you can also jump from the small pier, or use the water ladder to go in it. This small beach is not as well equipped as the bigger one, but you have some basic services available as well here. If you get hungry or thirsty, you have many restaurants and beach bars, or similar catering, available on the bigger beach only a few meters away. Accommodation is also not a problem here, you have plenty of hotels and apartments, all around the beach, available for your vacation.', 3760, 'en', 1),
(377, 'If you would like to visit a Montenegro beach, which is located in a town with lots of beach services and many children playgrounds on the beach, you should visit the city Bar and the beach Topolica. It is located in the south part of the country Montenegro in the region Bar. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park on multiple parking places, some even only a few meters away from the beach. The beach is located near the marina and also near a park where you have lots of trees and grass. The main surface on the beach are pebbles, but there is even some sand and large stones mixed with in. The beach is 300 meters long and can be up to 100 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters. It is a true family beach where you have lots of services all around the place. The whole area is very organized and clean. You also have a beach bar, some restaurants and pizzerias near the beach. A luxury hotel is also available directly on the beach, and many apartments are nearby.', 3761, 'en', 1),
(378, 'The Montenegro town Bar is known for its commercial harbour, but beside that, it&#39;s also known to have a public beach with many sports fields nearby. Only 20 meters away from the beach you have an actual athletic stadium. The region this beach is located is called Bar, like the town itself. It is very easy to reach this location with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes are also welcomed. You have a very large parking place directly at the beach, which can hold more than one hundres vehicles. The beach main surface are large stones, but you also have some pebbles and some sand. This location is 400 meters long and up to 40 meters wide. The best way to get into the water comfortably, is on the little spots with the sand, otherwise you need to go over some large stones, which are not as comfortable. The point of swimming starts very fast, at around 5 meters. On the location you also have a beach bar and a restaurant, and this is also the point where you have the most beach infrastructure. Near the location you also have a hotel and some apartments, if you would like to spend your holidays here.', 3762, 'en', 1),
(379, 'In Montenegro you have many beaches you can select according to your wishes. This beach, which is located in the town Bar, and is also part of the region Bar, is very unique, because of the pine forest, which is aveilable for you directly on the beach. There are not many of such kind here around. The name of the beach is plaža &Scaron;u&scaron;anj and it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can park directly in front of the beach where you have a large parking place, motorhomes are also welcomed here. The main surface on the beach are small pebbles, but you also have some sand mixed with in. You also have a lot of pine trees directly on the beach to protect you from the sun. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming almost immediately. The total length of the beach is one kilometer and it can be up to 20 meters wide. You have a lot of beach infrastructure and services available directly on the beach. Accommodation is also nearby, mainly in the form of apartments and a few hotels.', 3763, 'en', 1),
(380, 'The beach with the name Plaža Mrčele belongs into the category of special beaches. It is very unique the way it presents itself and what surrounds her. It is located in the Montenegro region Bar, just a little bit outside the town Bar. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. Either you do it by the road or, on some private parking places near the beach. From the road you need to descend around 20 metres in height to reach the beach. The main surface of the beach are small pebbles. The total length is 200 meters and it is only 5 meter wide, really narrow. The inclination of the slope is between normal and steep, and swimming starts almost immediately. The beach is surrounded by 2 buildings, which are beach bars and there you also have the beach infrastructure and some services. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but in the background on the other side of the road, mainly in the form of apartments.', 3764, 'en', 1),
(381, 'The beaches in Montenegro are usually made of white pebbles, but this beach with the name Plaža Crvena is special, it is different, because the pebbles here are red colored. It is located in the region Bar and it&#39;s not far away from the town Bar. The beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, and you have a parking place just beside the road, directly at the beach. To get to the beach you need to take some steps downwards to teh beach, with a height difference of 15 meters. The main surface on the beach are red small pebbles. The location is 100 meters long and up to 10 meters wide. The water entry is nice and you can swim right away. You have a beach bar directly on the beach, where you also have some beach services. Directly on the beach you also have an option to rent some apartments.', 3765, 'en', 1),
(382, 'In this part of Montenegro you have a lot of beaches located just next to the main road. More or less they are pebbles beaches, they are small, but very romantic. The same goes for the beach Črvanj. It is located in the region Bar near the village Sutomore. It is very easy to reach it with a vehicle and you can park beside the road. The entrance to the beach is very organized and so is the whole place which manages this beach. The total length of the beach is 200 meters and it is 5 meters wide. The main surface are pebbles, but you also have some rocks and sand. The water entry is very nice and you can swim right away. You have many beach services available directly on the beach, as well as a restaurant, which is famous for good sea food. Apartments are not available directly on the beach, but in the surrounding area.', 3766, 'en', 1),
(383, 'The Montenegro town Sutomore is known for its touristic character. It has a very beautiful, one kilometer long sandy beach, which is very attractive to the human eye. The region where the beach is located is called Bar. It&#39;s very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park there, motorhomes will also find some place. Some do it on the large public parking place, some by the road and some on private places. Altough the main surface on the beach is sand, you also have some pebbles mixed with in. The maximum wide of the beach is 40 meters. The inclination of the slope is normal, so is the water entry and the point of swim is at around 5 meters. You have many beach infrastructure and beach services available along the whole stretch of the beach. Many different types of restaurants and beach bars are available here. Accommodation is also directly on the beach mainly as hotels or apartments.', 3767, 'en', 1),
(384, 'Not far away from the town Sutomore, you have a very special beach, called plaža &Scaron;trbina. It is located in the region Bar and is suitable for the adventure usertype. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you can leave your car on a dirt parking ground almost directly oin front of the beach. To access the beach you need to use some concrete steps which descend&nbsp;around 25 meters in height difference to the beach. The main surface are small pebbles, but you also have some rocks from which you can also jump into the crystal clear water. The total length of the beach is 100 meters and the widthness is 15 meters. You have multiple options to enter the water. You can either jump, or go by the beach and can start swimming almost immediately. Some beach services are available on the beach, but they are only basic. In the summertime you maybe have here a beach bar. Accommodation is also available here, but only in the form of apartments.', 3768, 'en', 1),
(385, 'Not far away from the town Sutomore you have a very special beach, called Plaža Maljevik. It is special also because of the fact, that the far end of the beach is reserved for nudists/ naturists. It is located in the region Bar and is suitable for the adventure usertype. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you can leave your car on a dirt parking ground only a few meters away from the beach. To access the beach you have to use some concrete steps, which descend around 25 meters in height difference to the beach, and about 100 meters in length. The main surface on the beach are small pebbles, but you also have some rocks there. On some parts of the beach you even have some trees. The total length of the beach is 300 meters and the maximum width is 10 meters. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts dependent on where you are on the beach, between 10 and 20 meters. Some beach services are available here, but only in basic mode. In the summertime you maybe also have here a beach bar. Accommodation is also available, but only in the form of apartments and hotels in the neighborhood of the beach.', 3769, 'en', 1),
(386, 'One of the last beaches in the north part of the Montenegro region Bar, is the beach Čanj. Here you have a 1 km long sandy beach, which can be on some places up to 75 meters wide. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, and you have multiple options to park here. Either you park directly on the beach or on some private parking places. The main surface on the beach is sand, but you have as well some pebbles and stones mixed with the sand. The slope on this beach has a normal inclination, the water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 5 meters. You have a lot of beach infrastructure directly on the beach, as well as many types of restaurants and beach bars. If you would like to stay here for longer you have many options, like a hotel directly on the beach, and some apartments in the vicinity.', 3770, 'en', 1),
(387, 'In the Montenegro region Budva, near the village Kaluderac, you have a very nice beach, called Plaža Buljarica. It is a little bit unique, because you can actually park directly on the beach, that&#39;s also the reason why it is very popular amongst the motorhome owners. This whole location is very easy to reach whit any kind of vehicle. Because this area is so huge, you don&#39;t have any problem to park your car directly on the beach. The main surface on the beach is brown sand, but you also have some pebbles mixed with in. The total length is a few kilometers and on some places it can be up up to 40 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming at around 10 meters. You also have some beach services available, but not on the whole stretch of the beach, only near the village. Restaurants and beach bars are available directly on the beach. You have many options to stay here for longer, where you can choose either to stay in apartments or on a campsite.', 3771, 'en', 1),
(388, 'The Montenegro beach Lučice has got to be one of the most beautiful beaches of this Mediterranean country. You have here a perfect harmony between crystal clear water, brown sand and pine trees, which are all around. It is located in the region Budva, near the town Petrovac na Moru. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park here. A large parking place is located directly at the beach with some pine trees to give you some shade, one is a little bit far away. Beside the brown sand, you will also find some small pebbles on the beach and rocks on the edges. This beauty is 200 meters long and can be up to 40 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming right away. You have lots of beach services here, a children playground is also available. Renting a sunbed and a umbrella is not the problem here. You also have a beach bar and a restaurant directly on the beach. Accommodation, mainly in the form of apartments and hotels, is on the beach not available but in the city itself, some 500 meters away.', 3772, 'en', 1),
(389, 'The Montenegro beach Petrovac na moru belongs to one of the most beautiful beaches of this Mediterranean country. It is a very famous and popular destination for the tourists, which visit this place from all around the world. The water here is crystal clear and the sand has a little bit of a red tone. It is located in the region Budva, directly in the town Petrovac na Moru. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large public parking place some 200 meters away from the beach. In the summertime account to pay parking fees. Beside the red sand, you will also find some small pebbles on the beach and rocks on the edges. This beauty is 500 meters long and can be up to 20 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming right away. You have lots of beach services here. Renting a sunbed and a umbrella is not a problem here. You also have a beach bar and many types of restaurants directly ot the beach. Accommodation is available here in many forms. You have lots of apartments and hotels to choose from, some only a few meters away from the beach and many of them with a balcon view of the beach.', 3773, 'en', 1),
(390, 'Some beaches in Montenegro really take your breath away, words are hard to find to describe these beauty. The beach plaža Drobni Pijesak is one of them, and it belongs to the top five beaches of Montenegro. It is located in the region Budva near the village Drobnići. It is very easy to reach it with your vehicle, but be advised that the road, which is paved, to the parking place is very steep. You have two parking places here. From the parking place to the beach it will take you a walk of 200 meters in length and 40 meters of height difference. The beach is 200 meters long and can be up to 30 meters wide. The main surface are small white pebbles mixed with some brown sand and some rocks on the edges. With the crystal clear water, the beach is really an attraction. The water entry is very nice and you can swim away almost immediately. You have some beach infrastructure available here, as well as a few restaurants and a beach bar. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but in the vicinity of the main road.', 3774, 'en', 1),
(391, 'The beaches in Montenegro, especially in the region Budva, are famous for its beauty and are very popular among the beach ehusiasts. Although the coastline here is very steep and rocky, there are some places where the nature has created some eye catching beauty. This is also true for the beach plaža Crvena Glavica, which is located near the famous village Sveti Stefan. The beach is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. In the summertime, when you drive down the road to the beach, you need to trespass a camp before you reach the final parking place. The road to the parking is made partly of concrete partly of dirt and is sometimes narrow and steep. To get to the beach from the parking you need to take a small path some 20 meters in height difference. On the beach itself you have as a surface small pebbles, some rocks and also a concrete terrace. All together the beach is 100 m long and some 15 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and you have multiple options to get into the water and start swimming almost immediately. The beach is very organized, and you have some beach infrastructure available, as well as a restaurant directly on the beach. The closest accommodation is in the form of a camp or some apartments, nearby the road to the beach.', 3775, 'en', 1),
(392, 'The most famous beach in Montenegro has got to be the beach Sveti Stefan. It is a real tourist magnet and a very special beach, but also a very expensive one. it&#39;s located in the region Budva. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park directly in front of the beach, but be advised that the parking fee is pretty high. For a normal car they charge 2 euros per hour, for a van or a motorhome you pay 10 euros per hour. For a bus you pay even more. The beach itself is a red pebble beach with some sand mix between, and also some rocks on the borders. Here you have actually two beaches, one is open for the public, the other one is only open for hotel guests. The total length is 750 meters and it can be up to 30 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming almost immediately. You can also rent some beach equipment here, but be advised that this is the most expensive beach and renting a first row sunbeds and umbrella will cost you 50 Euros. Beach services are also available here and are on the highest level. Restaurants and beach bars are as well located on the beach directly. You also have many options for accommodation, mainly in the form of hotels and apartments.', 3776, 'en', 1),
(393, 'Not far away from the most famous beach in Montenegro, you have the small town Pržno. The whole region Budva is full of one of the most beautiful beaches in Montenegro. The beach Pržno, although it is not as famous, is also an eye catcher. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, and you can leave your car on some public parking places some 200 meters away, around 20 meters in height difference from the beach. The main surface on the beach is sand but you also have other materials, like pebbles mixed with the sand. On one side of the beach you also have wooden terraces. The water entry on this beach is very nice and you can start swimming almost immediately. Many beach services are available directly on the beach. You even have a swimming pool close to the beach, which you can use if you are a hotel guest. The one thing what makes this beach special are the restaurants, which are placed very close to the beach, some above the water, and with their decoration, they create a very romantic atmosphere. Many types of accommodation is available all around the beach, mainly as hotels or apartments.', 3777, 'en', 2),
(394, 'The beach Kamenovo is located on the famous coastline of the region Budva. The nearest small town is Pržno, which is not far away from the most famous beach in Montenegro, the beach Sveti Stefan. It is located by the main road, from which you can also access the public parking place, which is payable in the summertime. To get to the beach, you need to descend a 200 meter long path, which has a height difference of 15 meters. Total length of the beach is 300 meters and it has a maximum width of 50 meters. The main surface on the beach is brown sand, but pebbles are also mixed withinn. You have a very nice water entry here and you can start swimming almost immediately. Beach services are available in many forms on the beach itself. You also have a beach bar and a restaurant on the beach, but no accommodation is available here directly, but in the small town Pržno, where you have many hotels and apartments at your disposal.', 3778, 'en', 1),
(395, 'In Montenegro you can have very different beaches, as in shape, tourist infrastructure and the main beach surface. This Montenegro beach is actually 2 kilometers long and up to 50 meters wide so you really have lots of space to find your spot for your towel. There are not many such beaches in this country, so if you prefer such a beach, you should visit the the small town Bečići, located in the Budva region. This beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can actually park directly in front of the beach, where you have lots of space, in the summer time it is payable. The main surface on the beach is sand, but you also have small pebbles of different sizes and colors mixed with the sand. The water entry is very nice here and you can start swimming already after only 10 meters. This is a very popular area, you have lots of beach services and beach infrastructure available on the whole stretch of the beach. Children will also love this place, just next to the beach there is a large children playground. Many types of restaurants and beach bars are present here. Accommodation is available in many different forms. You have lots of luxury apartments and hotels, as well as some resorts located directly in front of the beach.', 3779, 'en', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(396, 'The town Budva is famous for its very long white pebbles beach with a very clear and blue water. This Montenegro beach is located in the region of Budva and it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can actually park directly in front of the beach, where you have a very large parking place available. Access to the beach is easy. The main surface on the beach are white pebbles, but you also have some large stones, concrete plates and some small amount of sand. The water entry, no matter where you are is very easy and you can swim away after only 10 meters. The beach is more than one kilometer long and on some places up to 30 meters wide. All along the beach, you have many beach services and beach infrastructure available. You don&#39;t need to worry about beach bars and restaurants not being present here, here you have plenty of them and they come in all forms and shapes. The same is true if you intent to spent your vacation here, you have a lot of different accommodations available around the beach, where you can choose a variety of hotels and apartments, some very close to the beach.', 3780, 'en', 1),
(397, 'The Montenegro town Budva has got to be the most famous town in this beautiful Mediterranean country. Not only is the town very attractive, you also have a few beaches in the town directly, that will blow your mind. The beach we are describing here is called Plaža Ričardova glava and it is located in the center of the town Budva. It is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a few public payable parking places where you can leave your car. It takes you 200 meters of walking to reach the beach. The beach is 150 meters long and on some places 25 meters wide. The main surface are pebbles, but you also have some concrete and some sand, a pier is also located in the middle of the beach. The water entry is on some places not that comfortable, because you have a lot of stones and rocks on the bottom. You can either go into the water from the beach or you can jump from the pier. You have some beach infrastructure and beach services available here. Many restaurants and beach bars are on the beach or near the beach, as well as a hotel and some apartments, if you decide this beach to be your next summer vacation.', 3781, 'en', 1),
(398, 'The Montenegro town Budva is probarly the most famous town in this beautiful Mediterranean country. Not only is the town very attractive, with lots of historical buildings, you also have a few beaches that will make you wonder. The beach we are describing here is called Plaža Mogren and it is located near the center of the town Budva. It is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a few public payable parking places where you can leave your car. It takes you 500 meters to reach the beach, and the path to the beach is very attractive and stretches along the rocky coastline. The beach is 300 meters long and on some places 30 meters wide. It is divided Into two parts and you need to take a cave bridge to reach the second small beach. The main surface here is sand, but you also have some pebbles and some rocks on the beach as well. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 meters. You can also jump from some cliffs into the crystal blue water. You have some beach infrastructure and beach services available here. A beach bar is also located directly on the beach. Accommodation is on the beach not available but in the center of the town, not far away, mainly in the form of hotels and apartments.', 3782, 'en', 1),
(399, 'The Montenegro region Kotor, near the village Prijevor, has a very nice and attractive pebbles beach to offer. The beach is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road directly in front oft the beach. The beach is 1 kilometers long and up to 40 meters wide. Although the main surface on the beach are small pebbles, you also have some sand on the beach, and on some parts even rocks at the beach. The water entry here is very nice, and because the water gets here deep very fast, you can start swimming almost immediately. Because of so many beach bars and different types of restaurants, which are available on the beach, you also have here many beach infrastructure and different services available. Not only can you rent here a sunbed, you also have many water equipment to rent, like a sea scooter and similar. Beach accommodation is also availabe here. In the background of the beach there is a camping ground and very close you even have a hotel and some apartments.', 3783, 'en', 1),
(400, 'This Montenegro beach has got to be one of the most attractive beaches in this mediterranean country. Organization on this beach is on the highest level. It is suitable for many generations, from small children, to party enthusiast, families and even the ones who just love to have some peace on the beach, and enjoy the high-end beach services. It is located in the region Kotar, near the village Krimovica. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you have a few hundred parking places at your disposa in front of the beachl. The main surface on the beach is concrete, but you also have some parts with rocks and pebbles. The water entry is very nice and you either can jump into the crystal clear water or use the beach for water entry. Swimming starts almost immediately. You have lots of beach services and beach infrastructure available on this nice location. In the summertime, the ones who love to party, a part of the beach is reserved also for this activity. You also have many swimming pools here, some of them suitable for small children, some for adults. A restaurant and many beach bars of different types, are available on the beach directly. Accommodation is not available on the beach, but you can arrange with the owners of this beach to rent some apartments or other similar facilities.', 3784, 'en', 1),
(401, 'Welcome to the beach Pržno.The Montenegro region Tivat has a very short mediterranean coastline, and not many beaches. The one beach, we have visited, is called plaža Pržno and it is located near the Village Đura&scaron;evići. It is a sandy beach with one of the purest beach sands in Montenegro, which makes it really unique. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you have lots of parking spaces, almost directly in front of the beach. It is a 300 meters long and up to 30 meters wide beach with a very small incline. Some pine trees are also on the beach and are mostly located around the restaurant. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts pretty late, at around 50 meters, which makes this beach ideal for small children to play in the water safely. You have lots of beach infrastructure available here. A restaurant and a beach bar are as well located directly on the beach. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach, but in the village nearby, in the form of apartments.', 3785, 'en', 1),
(402, 'The beach Plaža Lu&scaron;tica, which is located in the region Herceg Novi, is located on a very special location. It is part of a new luxury village with a modern yachting marina and harbor. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you can park on multiple parking places near the marina itself. This is the only option where you can park, the village itself is private property. To get to the beach from the parking, you need to walk through the marina for around 400 meters. The main surface of the beach are small pebbles with some larger stones mixed with in, and you also have some rocks on the sides and in the background of the beach. The total length of the beach is 200 meters and it can be up to 30 meters wide. In some places the inclination of the slope is a little bit steep on some normal. The water entry is nice and you can start swimming immediately. You have many beach services available on the beach directly. A beach bar is also located here. Restaurants and other similar catering, as well as shops, are located in the marina itself. Accommodation is also possible in the village in the form of apartments, but you can also actually buy a new apartment yourself.', 3786, 'en', 1),
(403, 'The beach Velja &Scaron;pilja is for the ones recommended, who love to be in the nature, without any beach services available nearby. It is located in the region Herceg Novi, near the village Merdari. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. The final part of the road is a dirt one. You can park the vehicle directly at the beach and take a 100 meter walk some 15 meters in height difference to the beach. The path itself is on one part a little bit tricky and dangerous, but with enough caution it is possible to manage it. The main surface on the beach is brown sand, but you also have some small pebbles and some rocks on the sides of the beach. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts almost immediately. On the beach itself and in the surrounding, you don&#39;t have any beach infrastructure or any beach services available. The same is true for accommodation, which can be found in the neighboring villages, but not around the beach.', 3787, 'en', 1),
(404, 'Near the village Mardari, in the Montenegro region Herceg Novi, there is a 200 meters long pebbles beach with a luxury beach club, directly on the beach. If you&#39;re the one who likes a small pebble beach and you also like to have lots of high standard beach services available on the beach, this beach is the right one for you. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, and you have the parking avilable directly in front of the beach. This location is separated into three parts. In the middle you have the beach club and on the borders the two pebbles beaches, one longer and one smaller. On the beach you have 10 meters of widthness. The water entry here is very nice and swimming starts at around 30 to 40 meters. Once you are in the water you also have some sand on the bottom. Some infrastructure is on the beach, but more is in the beach club itself. You also have a very nice beach bar and a restaurant here. Accommodation is not available here, but in the beach Lu&scaron;tica village, around 1 km away.', 3788, 'en', 1),
(405, 'If you intend to visit Montenegro, the town Kotor, which is located in the famous Kotor bay, should be on your list. The whole bay is very unique and offers you spectacular views, especially the large cruise ships look spectacular in the the small bay, sorrounded by the high mountains, but you can also visit the famous Kotor old town and after that, of course enjoy also some time on the city beach. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place, which is payable, directly in front of the beach and near the attractions. The beach is made of several material, on some part you have pebbles, on some you have concrete. Alltogether it is 300 meters long and up to 15 meters wide. The water entry is very nice, no matter where you are and you can either go into the water by the beach or you can jump from a pier. A sea swimming pool is also available on the beach. The point of swim starts immediately. You have some beach infrastructure and services available directly on the beach. It&#39;s also possible to rent some water sport equipment. A restaurant and beach bars are also located here. For your accommodation you have here mainly hotels and apartments nearby.', 3789, 'en', 1),
(406, 'In the famous Montenegro Kotor bay, which should be on your list to visit, is a must visit if you like nice beaches. The whole bay is very unique and offers you spectacular views. The best to explore it is by a boat, which will take you to all sightseeing&#39;s here around. Around the bay you don&#39;t have much beaches but there are some you can visit if you are in this region. One of them is called plaža Morinj. The beach is very interesting, mainly because of the forms and shapes it offers you to enjoy. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place directly in front of the beach. The beach main surface are small pebbles, but you also have a lot of grass and some trees. It is 200 meters long and up to 25 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim starts at around 40 meters. You have some beach infrastructure and services available directly on the beach. A restaurant and a beach bar are also located here. For your accommodation you have here mainly hotels and apartments, which are nearby, available and if you would like to stay in a camp, you also have this option.', 3790, 'en', 1),
(407, 'If you would like to enjoy the best possible views on large ocean cruiseships passing by in the Kotor bay, and you would also like to be on a very special and attractive beach, then the beach Adriatica is the one for you. It is located in the Montenegro region Herceg Novi, near the village Jo&scaron;ice. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road directly in front of the beach. Here you have many different types of surface on the beach. The main surface are pebbles, but you also have some white sand and some concrete plates. The total length is 100 meters and it can be up to 50 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts between 0 and 15 meters. On the beach you have all the beach infrastructure needed to give you a comfortable stay. A restaurant and a beach bar are located directly on the beach. Accommodation is available in the vicinity of the beach in the form of apartments.', 3791, 'en', 1),
(408, 'The beach Bijela is located in the region Herceg Novi on the coastline of the Kotor bay. It is very easy to reach the beach with a vehicle, but more difficult to find a parking place. The most recommended way to park is on a private ground, the road is very narrow and you have very little options to park beside the road. The beach main surface are pebbles, but you also have some concrete plates. All together it is 200 meters long and up to 20 meters wide. The Inclination of the beach is very small. You have a very nice water entry and the point of swim is between 0 and 15 meters. You have some basic beach infrastructure available here. A restaurant is also located near the beach and for accommodation you have apartments and a few hotels at your disposal.', 3792, 'en', 1),
(409, 'Most of the beaches in the Montenegro Kotar bay are less or more artificial, but this beach, which is located near the village Sasovići in the region Herceg Novi, is very different and it&#39;s totally nature made. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road, just a few meters away from the beach. The path to the beach is 50 meters long and has a height difference of 15 meters. This beach is more suitable for the adventurer type of user. It is 75 meters long and only 5 meters wide. The main surface are small pebbles, but you also have some rocks and some concrete on the surface. Trees are also residing on the beach. The water entry is nice and swimming starts at 5 meters. You don&#39;t have any beach infrastructure here, also no restaurants or beach bars, but some accommodation is availabe in the form of apartments and hotels in the vicinity.', 3793, 'en', 1),
(410, 'In the small town Meljine, which is located in the Montenegro region Herceg Novi, there is a beach with the same name as the town, and the beach is suitable for families. No matter what kind of vehicle you are driving, you will find many options to park it close to the beach. On the beach, there are a few different surfaces, like the brown sand and some concrete plate. The total length of the beach is 200 meters and it can be 10 meters wide. The slope has a small inclination here and you can either jump from the pier into the water or use the beach and start swimming after around 10 meters. The water entry is very nice and you have small stones on the bottom. Some beach infrastructure is also available here and nearby is also a Marina/ harbor. If you get hungry or thirsty you have a beach bar and a restaurant directly on the beach itself. Accommodation is here available in the form of apartments and hotels and it is only a few meters away.', 3794, 'en', 1),
(411, 'The beach in the town igalo is a true city beach, with lots of beach infrastructure and services all around the beach. It is famous for being the former residence of the Yugoslavian leader Tito, where also a villa of the ex president is located. The beach belongs to the region Herceg Novi and it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can park on a large payable parking place almost directly in front of the beach. The beach is artificialy made and has lots of shapes and lines to show. The main surface here is concrete. The beach is totally flat, but at the water entry point there is a sudden drop. So you can either use the water ledder or simply jump into the water. The total length of the beach is 500 meters and it is up to 20 meters wide. The beach is separated into a few parts. You have lots of beach infrastructure and services available here. Many beach bars and restaurants, as well as shops are present on the beach or near the Beach. Accommodation is available here in the form of hotels and apartments and is nearby.', 3795, 'en', 1),
(412, 'Whenever you are in Maribor you should visit the Lent shore in the city itself. You will be amazed by the view', 3796, 'en', 2),
(413, 'Ddjslosodjd dkifslskdj dkdkofodlddnd djddodkdkdjdbfnsiieiowooj djjfidoosjdfifo skfiidiekkem jdkd dddddd', 3797, 'en', 2),
(414, 'One of the very first beaches you will encounter on the far north east site of Germany, just next to the border with Poland, is the beautiful white sand beach called Strand Ahlbeck. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You have lots of parking spaces here. Parking can not be done directly at the beach but some 100m away for the cars and around 400 m away for the motorhomes. The total length of the beach is a few kilometres and it is around 100 metres wide. The point of swim at around 30 m. It is best suitable for families. Dogs are not allowed during the summertime, but only in other seasons. You have lots of beach infrastructure here and many restaurants, beach bars and fast food points. Accommodation is available directly at the beach in the form of apartments and hotels.', 3798, 'en', 1),
(415, 'Welcome to the beach Strand Basin. In the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, which is it located near the Baltic sea, you have a very beautiful white sand beach just next to the town Heringsdorf. It is more kilometres long and up to 75 meters wide. The inclination is normal and the point of swim is at around 30 meters. You can reach the beach with all kind of vehicles and from the parking space it only takes you 200 meters of walking to access the beach. To enter on the beach, you need to pay 2.7 euros to a ticket machine which will print you daily ticket. The beach infrastructure is on a high level, you even have children playgrounds on the beach and you can rent some German type of beach chairs, called Strandkorb, and many more. Because this place is very touristic, you have plenty accommodation options to choose from, as well as many different restaurants, and they are all available near the beach.', 3799, 'en', 1),
(416, 'Welcome to the beautiful German beach of &Uuml;ckeritz. This sandy beach is a typical German beach and is intended for families, mostly with small children. You won&#39;t have any parking problems on this beautiful sandy beach. It is available for all types of vehicles including RVs. The name of the region to which this beach belongs is Mecklenburg-Western Pomerania. The next town near the beach is the town of &Uuml;ckeritz. The beach is only 200 meters from the parking lot. A lot of beach fun awaits you on this kilometer-long and 75 meter wide white sandy beach. Once you step into the water, you can start swimming after 20 meters. There is a lot of beach infrastructure on or next to the beach, some land sports and also a nice children&#39;s playground. Don&#39;t worry about the food here, you will find many restaurants, beach bars and also typical German fast food here. Since the entire area is surrounded by lush forest, accommodation directly on the beach is not possible, the only overnight accommodation is a camp on the beach. Let the weather serve you and enjoy your annual vacation with BeachRex.', 3800, 'en', 1),
(417, 'Welcome to the beautiful sandy beach Strand Loddin. Near the German city Loddin, which is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, you have a very beautiful sandy beach suitable for families. The families are very welcomed here, because of the two children playgrounds located directly at the beach. This German Baltic seaside location is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, and you only need to take a walk of 200 m to reach the beach. The beach is a few kilometres long and around 50 m wide. The point of swim is at around 30 m. To enter on to the beach, you need to pay a ticket of 2.5&euro;. You have plenty of beach infrastructure located here, even some sport fields and some water sport equipment can be rented here. Restaurants, beach bars and many different options of fast food are available here. Accommodation is also available in many forms, mostly as hotels, apartments and even some camping grounds.', 3801, 'en', 1),
(418, 'If you&#39;re the one who likes to be nude on the beach, this German sandy beach is the one for you. It is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, near the town Koserow. It&#39;s very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes are welcomed as well on the parking space. It takes you around 200 m of walking to reach the beach from the parking space. Once on the beach you have a few kilometres of sand and 50 m of wideness at your disposal. The point of swim is at around 30 m. Beach infrastructure here is only basic and you also don&#39;t have any restaurants or similar available. Some accommodation is available near the beach.', 3802, 'en', 1),
(419, 'To reach this beautiful sandy beach you need to drive with the vehicle to the city Zinnowitz, which is located on the German Ostsee or the Baltic Sea. It is a part of the region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. This beach is surrounded with pine trees which go all the way down to the beach. It&#39;s a really special place either to go to the beach or just to take a walk in the forest. It is very easy to access this area with your car, even motorhomes. Many parking options are available around the beach, some 300 m away from the beach. The total length of the beach is a few kilometres and it is up to 50 m wide. The water entry is very flat, the point of swim is at around 50 m and it is more suitable for small children. You have lots of beach infrastructure here, even a beach fitness, children playgrounds and a windsurfing rent point. Because the beach is so long you even have some parts for the nudist, as well as some parts for the dogs. Restaurants and similar are available as well on the location. Many hotels, apartments and camping grounds are also located in the surrounding.', 3803, 'en', 1),
(420, 'If you&#39;re a family who loves long sandy beaches with a large children playground close to the beach, you should visit the beach Strand Zinnowitz. It is located in the North German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, near the Baltic Sea and it will offer you some unforgettable holiday memories. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You have a large parking place some 400 meters away from the beach and it is also suitable for small motorhomes. The beach is several kilometers long and up to 75 meters wide. It is separated into many sectors, some of them are specialized to host dogs and some are for nudist. The inclination on the beach is normal and the swimming point starts at 20 meters. The whole area is very touristic, which means you have plenty of beach infrastructure, restaurants and different types of accommodation available.', 3804, 'en', 1),
(421, 'Welcome to the sandy beach&nbsp;Peenem&uuml;nde.&nbsp;This beach, which is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, belongs to the city Peenem&uuml;nde. It is one of those typical German sandy beaches, where you have many sectors, according to your lifestyle. You can choose a sector for dogs, a normal beachwear sector, or one for the nudists. The beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome, and it takes you around 400 meters of walking to reach the beach. The water is very flat, which makes the point of swim at around 50 meters. The total length of the beach is several kilometers and it is more than 50 meters wide. On some sectors you have many beach infrastructure, on some you have very little. The same goes for the catering and restaurants, on some parts you have lots to choose from, on some you have none. Accommodation is available along the whole stretch of the beach, mainly in the form of apartments, hotels, rooms and camping grounds. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3805, 'en', 1),
(422, 'If you are near the city Lubmin, which is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, and you have children who like to play on the children playground under some pine trees, and you also love to have a nice sandy beach next to it, you should visit the beach Strand Lubmin. Just next to the beach you have a large parking place, which can also host motorhomes and it takes you only 100m to reach the beach by walking. The beach is divided into many sectors, is several kilometres long and up to 30 m wide. The water entry is nice and comfortable, the whole seabed is very flat which makes the point of swim at more than 100 m away. Many beach infrastructure is available here, even a children playground. Restaurants and beach bars are located around the large pier. Accommodation is available here in many forms, mainly as apartments and hotels.', 3806, 'en', 1),
(423, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to the German sandy beach, called Loissin. The beach Strand Loissin is more suitable for an adventure type of beach enthusiast, than a regular family. It is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern and offers you a true sandy beach experience. To reach it with your vehicle is not a problem, motorhomes are also welcomed. The parking place is very large and you can stay on it for a maximum time of 3 hours, or you can choose to go to the neighbouring camp. The distance from the parking space to the beach is 200 m. From the path you need to take a narrow road down to the beach, with the descent being quite a tricky one. The total length of the beach is 750m and it is 10 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the whole water area is very flat, which makes the point of swim at several 100m. On the beach there is almost zero infrastructure, but more is located inside the camp. The camp and some apartments are the only accommodation you have available around the beach.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3807, 'en', 1),
(424, 'In the far north of Germany, near the Baltic Sea, you have a city called Greifswald. Not many beaches are here around, it&#39;s a quite swampy area, so the one beach, which is located just next to the city it&#39;s quite precious. It goes by the name Strand Eldena. You can reach it with any kind of vehicle, even a motorhome, and the parking lot is only 300 m away from the beach. It is more suitable for families especially with small children, since the water is very flat here. The beach is made of sand, it is 500 m long and more than 100 m wide. The water entry is very nice and comfortable and the swimming point is at around 75 m. On the beach there is some beach infrastructure but it is not on the highest level and not every thing you need is present there. A bistro and fast foods are available at the beach, and in the surrounding area you will find many different options for your accommodation.', 3808, 'en', 1),
(425, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Are you searching for a beach which is specialized for all kind of water sports, especially for kiteboarding and windsurfing? If so, we suggest you to visit the beach Strand Thiessow. It is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, on the beautiful island R&uuml;gen. The beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park directly in front of the beach only 50 meters away from it. The parking place is private, so take into account a parking fee. The main surface on the beach is sand, which stretches for over one kilometre and the width of the beach is only 5 meters. The water here is very shallow, which makes it ideal for water sports, like windsurfing and kiteboarding. The point of swim is at around 75 meters. Because this is a very popular place amongst windsurfers, you have lots of beach infrastructure here, and you can also sleep over on the parking place, which is organized like a small camp. Food is not available directly on the beach, but in the surrounding villages. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3809, 'en', 1),
(426, 'A very nice and long sandy beach awaits you near the village Gager. It is suitable for different types of users, because it is separated into many sectors. Either you are the one with a dog or you are a nudist swimmer, you will find your spot here. R&uuml;gen is the name of the island where this beach is waiting for you and it is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. If you&#39;re traveling with a car or a motorhome this location is very easy to reach. From the huge parking spot it takes only 100 meters of walking to reach the beach. The total length is several kilometers and it can be up to 40 meters wide. Swimming starts at around 15 meters. On some sectors you have some beach infrastructure, some restaurants and fast foods on some sectors you have none. Accommodation is available along the whole stretch of the beach, mainly as apartments or hotels and even a campsite is available.', 3810, 'en', 1),
(427, 'The island R&uuml;gen is famous for its sandy beaches. This one is no exception, it&#39;s a real beauty and additionally on some occasions you can even see some seals. To reach it you need to head towards the city G&ouml;hren which is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, and you can park only 100 meters away from the beach. The total length of the beach is more than 1 km and it can be up to 20 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and comfortable and swimming starts at around 30 meters. Beach infrastructure is only basic but on some spots you have a little bit more of it, so head there if you are not fine with little beach infrastructure. For accommodation you have several options like apartments and hotels. Food and drinks are not available on the beach, except on the more touristic spots.', 3811, 'en', 1),
(428, 'If you looking for a very touristic place with a beautiful sandy beach you should visit the beach Strand G&ouml;hren Ost, located in the city G&ouml;hren. It belongs to the beautiful island R&uuml;gen in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also motorhomes and it takes you only 100 m to reach the beach from the parking place. The main surface on the beach is sand and it is available on a beach which is several kilometres long. On some parts the beach can be up to 50 m wide. The water acess is very nice and comfortable and the swimming point starts at around 20 meters. On the beach itself there is also one large pier from which you can jump into the water or just enjoy the nice view when you walk up and down the pier. Beach infrastructure here is on the highest level and you have many services available to please your needs. Many restaurants, fast foods anf similar catering is available here, you even have some commercial shops here. Accommodation is available in many forms, mainly as apartments and hotels.', 3812, 'en', 1),
(429, 'If your plan to visit the German Baltic seaside, and you love beautiful sandy beaches with an astonishing view this beach has got to be on your list. It goes by the name Strand Sellin and it is famous for its legend and very beautifu pier. It is located in a city with the same name in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern on the famous German island R&uuml;gen. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can leave your car beside the road or on some public parking places. It takes you around 200 meters to reach the beach from the parking place if you are able to park the closest to the beach, some are more further away. You have several options to access the beach, either by stairs, with a lift or by a small road. The height difference is 25 meters. The beach main surface is sand, the beach is 500 meters long and has a widness of 75 meters. Access into the water is very nice and comfortable and because of the flat water the swimming point is at around 40 meters. A lot of beach infrastructure is located here, you also have many restaurants and similar catering in the whole surrounding. Accommodation is also not a problem here, here you have plenty of hotels and apartments to choose from.', 3813, 'en', 1),
(430, 'The city Binz, located on the German island R&uuml;gen, in the far north region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, has a very long sandy beach to offer. It is a typical German beach, because it is divided into many lifestyle sectors, like the ones for dogs, and for the nudist, and a regular one, where beachwear is obligatory. Because it is so long you have many options to access it. Parking places are available along the whole stretch of the beach, and there&#39;s even one big one which we used. It takes your 200 meters of walking to reach the beach. Once there, you have 50 meters of width available, which stretches over several kilometres. The water access is very nice and comfortable and swimming starts at around 30 meters. On some parts the beach infrastructure is only basic, on some you have more advanced services available. Beach bars and bistros, as well as fast foods kiosks, are available directly on the beach. If you would like to stay here for longer you have many options for accommodation to choose from, mainly as apartments, and most of them are only a few meters away from the beach. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3814, 'en', 1),
(431, 'The German beach Prora is famous for its German third reich heritage. It used to be a vacation spot for the German second world war soldiers and officers. Some buildings are still preserved in the original shape, some have been turned into modern apartments. The beach is located on the German island R&uuml;gen which is a part of the region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, a northern part on the Baltic Sea. If you would like to visit it it is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, even motorhomes. You have to take a path of 400 meters to reach the beach. Once there a beautiful sandy beach, several kilometers long and 30 meters wide awaits you. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 30 meters. You have some beach services available here, but they are only basic. Restaurants and bars are not available directly on the beach, but more in the background. You have several options for accommodation, mainly as apartments.', 3815, 'en', 1),
(432, 'If you&#39;re searching for a sandy beach on the German Island R&uuml;gen, which is very friendly towards motorhome owners, you need to visit the beach Strand Mukran. The nearest city goes by the name Binz and this beach is a part of the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. What is so special about the beach is the fact that you can park your motorhome, or vehicle, only 50 m away from the beach. In this part of Germany this is really rare. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and you can expect to have at least 10 m of widness on the beach. Main surface on the beach is sand and you also have some stones, which are located near the water what makes the entry not so comfortable. The point of swim is at around 30 m, you have very little beach infrastructure available, it is only basic. A fast food bar and a bistro are not far away from the beach, the same goes for accommodation, which is available in the background mainly in the form of apartments.', 3816, 'en', 1),
(433, 'The German village Glowe is located near a sandy beach with a total length of 10 kilometers. So if you&#39;re searching for that kind of a beach you should visit this place. It is located on the famous German island R&uuml;gen, a part of the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. It is very accessible for those one traveling with the motorhome or any other kind of vehicle. The parking place is next to the beach only 100 meters away. Once on the beach you have a 25 meters beach widness available. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 15 meters. You have many beach services available here, also a children playground. Restaurants and caffe bars, as well as fast food are all in the vicinity of the beach. For accommodation you have many options here mainly in the form of apartments.', 3817, 'en', 1),
(434, 'If you would like to be one with the nature, only the beach with pine trees in the background, no touristic infrastructure, very little visitors, we recommend you to visit the German beach Strand Breege Ost. This beauty is located on the German island R&uuml;gen in the region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. It is suitable for an adventure type of tourist. You don&#39;t have any beach infrastructure and services available here. All kind of vehicles are welcome on the parking space, also motorhomes and it takes 300 meters of walking to reach the beach. The beach is several kilometers long, 50 meters wide and the point of swim is at 30 meters.', 3818, 'en', 1),
(435, 'This beach, located on the beautiful German island R&uuml;gen, goes by the name Strand Juliusruh. Like most beaches on this island, this one is also made of sand and is several kilometres long. It is separated into many sectors, so the nudist and the one who have dogs can be on the same beach, just in their own sector, and all the others can be separated from them in their own sector.&nbsp; The parking place is some 300 meters away and it can hold more than 100 vehicles of any kind, motorhomes are also welcomed. Once you are on the beach you have a few kilometres of length and 40 meters of width at your service. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at around 50 meters. The beach services are available on some sectors; on some you have none. If you would like to stay here for longer, you have many options for accommodation, even a camp.', 3819, 'en', 1),
(436, 'Welcome to the northernmost beach on the Baltic Sea. The beach Strand Nordufer is very popular amongst the German tourists. It is the most north point on the Baltic Sea in Germany. It offers you a very long sandy beach with amazing views on the high cliffs surrounding it. To reach this point you need to visit the German island R&uuml;gen and head for the village Putgarten. From the main road, which is paved, you need to take a 1 km long concrete road, where you can park your vehicle directly in front of the beach on a large parking place. Be aware that the access to the beach is 100 m long and some 25m high. The stairs which go down to the beach are quite steep. The beach is best suitable for adventure type of tourists. You don&#39;t have any beach services, accommodation or food and drinks available on the beach or in the surrounding area. Once on the beach you have 30 metres of beach width available and a very comfortable water entry with a point of swim at around 20 meters. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3820, 'en', 1),
(437, 'Most of the beaches in Germany are a sandy type, but on this beach this is not the case. On the beach Strand Dranske, you have a mixture of sand and some large stones mixed with small stones. It is located on the German island R&uuml;gen, near the northernmost point of Germany. In front of the beach there is a large parking place which can hold many vehicles, also motorhomes. From the parking lot the beach is only 50 meters away. Beach services are here only basic, the accommodation and also the restaurants or a little bit more towards the village Dranske. On the beach the water entry is not as comfortable as somewhere else, because of the large stones directly at the sea. You have at least 15 meters of beach width available. The point of swim is at around 30 meters.', 3821, 'en', 1),
(438, 'A beautiful city with typical North German romantic houses and a beautiful sandy beach awaits you in the city Zingst. It is a typical Baltic Sea beach, with more kilometres of beach length available and divided into many lifestyle sectors, one for the nudist, one textil regular and for the dog owners. Along the whole stretch of the beach you have many parking options, motorhomes included. It takes you only 100 meters to reach the beach from the parkin space. The water entry is very nice and comfortable and the point of swim starts that around 20 meters. Beach services are available on many points and on some you also have restaurants and bars. Many accommodation options are as well available, from hotels to apartments and even camps.', 3822, 'en', 1),
(439, 'In the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern in the city Prerow a typical German sandy beach is at your service. It offers you lots of different lifestyle sectors, like the ones for the dogs, the one for the sport, a nudist part and of course a regular one. Not only that it is several kilometers long it is also very wide, on some places more than 100 meters. If you would like to visit it you have many options to park your vehicle, also a motorhome. Most of the parking places are some 300 meters away from the beach. On the beach the water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 20 meters. Some beach infrastructure is available, on some parts you have more on some parts you have less of it. Accommodation is available in many different forms. You can rent houses or apartments.', 3823, 'en', 1),
(440, 'In the German Nationalpark Vorpommersche Boddenlandschaft you have many beaches which you can visit. You can go to the village Ahrenshoop, where you will find a brown sand beach, a few kilometres long and up to 30 m wide. It is a typical German beach with lots of sectors for dog owners and the one who like to be nude on the beach, a regular textile part is of course also available.. You can leave your vehicle only 100m away from the beach on a large parking place. The water entry here is very nice and comfortable and the point of swim starts already after 10 m. Beach services are available along the whole stretch of the beach, as well as restaurants and coffee bars. If you would like to stay here for longer you can rent some apartments, a house or stay in a hotel.', 3824, 'en', 1),
(441, 'Welcome to the beautiful family beach Dierhagen. If you are a family type of beach user, who likes to have a children playground and a small outdoor fitness beneath the pine trees close to the beach, you have got to visit the German beach Strand Dierhagen. It is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern and is a part of the Baltic Sea region or as the German say the Ostsee. This place is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park some 300 meters away from the beach. Once on the beach you have many sectors to choose from, either the nudist, the one with the dogs or a regular one. The beach has a total length of many kilometres and can be up to 50 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and you can already start swimming after 15 meters. You have many beach services available here, and even more restaurants, coffee bars, fast food, ice cream shops. Accommodation is also available near the beach, mostly as hotels and apartments, and if you prefer to stay in a camp you also have this option. Enjoy your holiday with BeachRex.', 3825, 'en', 1),
(442, 'The German town Graal-M&uuml;ritz is a part of the region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. It is known for its beautiful sandy beach, which is several kilometers long and can be up to 30 meters wide. You can access this place very easy with any kind of vehicle, here you have several options to park your car, also motorhomes. It will take you between 100 and 500 meters to get from the parking place to the beach. Once on the beach you have a very nice water entry and the swimming point is at around 10 meters. Lots of beach services are available here and in some sectors you can even be nude or you can access the beach with your dog. On the main entrance to the beach you have lotss of restaurants, ice cream shops, traditional German food and coffee bars available. You won&#39;t have any problems to find accommodation here, you can rent either a house, an apartment or stay in a hotel.', 3826, 'en', 1),
(443, 'Near the German town Rostock you have a very large and long dune beach, of course with a brown sand as the surface, available to spend your vacation. The region the beach is located is Mecklenburg-Vorpommern and you need to go to the city of Rostock to have this great experience. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park only 50 m away from the beach, which is very convinient if you consider other beaches, where the parking place is much further away. The beach access is easy and you have many sectors to choose from, either the one for the nudist, a dog beach and of course the regular textile one. The water entry is very nice swimming starts already after 15 metres. Beach services here are only basic, maybe on some sectors you have more. Behind the dune you have some options to buy some food and drinks, the same goes for accommodation which is located more in the background and is available in many different forms.', 3827, 'en', 1),
(444, 'Near the German city Rostock, you have two options to go to the Baltic beach. The shoreline is divided by the river Unterwarnow. This beach, which is located in the northwest from the town, goes by the name Strand Warnem&uuml;nde. It is a part of the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern and is a must if you are near this location. The access to the beach with a vehicle is very easy and you can park only 100m away from the beach. The parking place is very large and can hold several hundred vehicles. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have several kilometres of sand and 40 m of beach width at your service. The beach inclination is normal, which makes the water entry very nice and the point of swim is at around 10 metres. The beach is divided into many lifestyle sectors, one is also reserved for nudist and one for the dog owners. According to the sectors you are enjoying your beach time, you have on some ones more beach services available on some you have less. Accommodation is available in many forms, predominantly as apartments and hotels and are not far away.&nbsp;', 3828, 'en', 1),
(445, 'The beach Strand Heiligendamm is famous for its very long sandy beach, which is, like most German beaches, divided into many lifestyle sectors, like a nudist beach, regular beach and a dog beach. You can reach this beach with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome, and simply park some 50 meters away from the beach. Along the whole stretch of the beach you have many options to park your vehicle. To access the beach from the parking lot you can choose one of many entry points, but be aware that on most of them you need to take some stairs to cross the dune. Before you enter the beach you need to pay a tax of 2 euros. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have 25 meters of&nbsp;wideness&nbsp;available. The inclination on the beach is normal and so is the water entry, which is nice and comfortable. The point of swim starts at 15 meters. Beach services are available along with the whole stretch of the beach. You also have many options to stay here for longer, mostly in some hotels or apartments, which are nearby. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3829, 'en', 1),
(446, 'The German Baltic Sea region, which starts with the border to Poland, offers you some astonishing sandy beaches. The beach in the city Zempin, which is located in the region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern is a typical German beach, where you have many beach sectors to choose from. On some parts you can access the beach with your dog, on some parts it is obligatory to wear textile and on some you can even be nude. For the ones who like a little bit of WWII history, here you can see, hidden in the woods, but very good accessible, the launching ramps for the V1 german rocket. This place is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, accept motorhomes. It will take you some 300m to reach the beach. The beach has a total length of several kilometres and is 50 m wide. To access the beach you need to pay 2.5 &euro; for the bathing tax. The water access is very easy and comfortable and the point of swim is at around 30 m. You have lots of beach services available here, a children playground is located directly on the beach. Many restaurants, fast food kiosks and ice cream shops are located as well here. Accommodation is available in many forms, predominantly as apartments, but you can also rent a house, stay in a hotel and even in a camp.', 3830, 'en', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(447, 'A beach with many lifestyles sectors, one for the dog owners, one for the nudist and one for regular beachwear awaits you on the beach Strand K&uuml;hlungsborn. It is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern in the village K&uuml;hlungsborn. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome and you can leave your vehicle only 300 meters away from the beach. Once on the beach a several kilometer long and up to 50 meters wide beach awaits you. Like in the most part of the Baltic Sea region this one is also made of sand. The inclination on the beach is normal and so is the access to the water, with a swimming starting point at 15 meters. On most part of the beach you have many beach services, also a sport ground and a children playground, and on some you have non. Beach bars, restaurants and similar is available either on the beach or near the beach. The same goes for accommodation where you have many options also a camping ground.', 3831, 'en', 1),
(448, 'How about a beach which acts like a bridge between two waters. On the one side you have the access to the sandy Baltic beach, on the other one to the more calm a lake like sea. If you like these kinds of a beach and you also like to leave your vehicle almost directly at the beach and enjoy the special views, you should visit the beach Strand Rerik. It is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern near the village Rerik. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes are also welcomed. It takes you only 30 meters from the parking to get to the beach. Total length of the beach is several kilometers and it is 50 meters wide. The beach is divided into many lifestyle sectors and the point of swim starts already at 5 meters. You need to pay a beach tax off 2 euros per person during the summer time. Many beach services are available here, a big children playground is also near the beach, as well as many restaurants and of course many great accommodations.', 3832, 'en', 1),
(449, 'If you are searching for a beach ideal for small children with lots of sand, where the water is very flat and the point of swim is hundrets of metres away, we suggest you to visit the beach Strand am Schwarzen Busch. To find this beach you need to drive to the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, to the island Poel and go into the direction of the village Poel. A very large parking place awaits you here, but it is some 500 m away from the beach, motorhomes are also welcomed. Once you are on the beach you have several kilometers of length and around 25 meters of beach widness available. The inclination on the beach is normal, the water access is very easy and comfortable and the point of swim is far away which makes this place ideal for small children to play in the water safely. A small children playground is also near the beach. Some beach services are also available on the beach and in some sectors you can even take your dog with you to the beach. Restaurants and coffee bars as well as fast food are also near the beach, the same goes for accommodation which is available in many forms.', 3833, 'en', 1),
(450, 'Germany has on the Baltic Sea many beautiful Islands. In the region of Mecklenburg-Vorpommern there is a small island with two beaches. The name of the island is Poel and you can access it via a bridge. The beach Strand Timmendorf is a sandy beach, 1 km long and up to 50 m wide. A large parking place awaits you some 400 m away from the beach where you have a few hundred parking places at your service. Motorhomes can also park on this spot on a separate parking place. On the beach the water entry is very nice and the starting point for swimming is at around 50 metres. On the beach and around the beach you have many beach services at your disposal. Just next to the beach you also have a small harbour. You won&#39;t get hungry or thirsty on this beach, many options zo get something to eat are available. A very large autocamp is just next to the beach as well as other accommodation options.', 3834, 'en', 1),
(451, 'A very special beach awaits you in the village Zierow. Although the beach is made of sand, here it has a special colour and shape, also the Seabed is very flat, which makes it ideal for small children. This location is very easy to reach and it\'s even more easy to access the beach if you are a guest in the camp. Otherwise there are little opportunities to leave your vehicle on a parking place. The beach is one kilometer long and 10 meters wide. Because the seabed is very flat the point of swim is at a few hundred meters. Most of the beach infrastructure is located inside the camp, where you will also find a restaurant and coffee bar. The  autocamp offers the most accommodation places but you can also find some apartments nearby.', 3835, 'en', 2),
(452, 'If you are searching for a beach with a very flat seabed, which is ideal for small children to play in the water safely, and you also would like to leave your car only 10 meters away from the beach, we recommend you to visit Strand Kl&uuml;tz. It is a part of the German Baltic Sea and is located in the German province Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. Next to the beach you have a very large parking place, only 10 meters away, which makes it very exceptional, according to German standards. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it is 10 meters wide. The very far away swimming point makes it ideal for small children, but not as much for those one who would like to swim immediately. Beach services are on some parts only basic, on some you have more at your disposal. You also need to pay a beach entry tax to access the beach. Some fast food restaurants are available directly on the beach. A camping place is also nearby, also very close to the beach, all other accommodation options are a little bit more in the background, a few 100 metres away in the village Wohlenberg. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach.&nbsp;', 3836, 'en', 1),
(453, 'Boltenhagen is the name of the village where this sandy beach is located. It belongs to the region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern and it is very easy to access with any kind of vehicle. You have many options to park your vehicle here, either by the road or on some large parking places. It takes you around 200 meters of walking to reach the beach. The beach is a few kilometres long and some 50 meters wide. The inclination on the beach is normal, water access is comfortable and because of the flat seabed the point of swim is at around 75 meters. Like many German beaches also this one is divided into many sectors, one regular, one for the dog owners, and one for the nudist. You have many options to get something to eat or to drink here. The infrastructure on the beach is on a high standard and like it is usual on German beaches you can also on this beach rent a typical German beach chair, who are available in many different types. Accommodation is also available in many forms, mostly as apartments, who are available for your stay only 50 metres away from the beach, but you can also stay in a camp, which is a little further away. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach.&nbsp;', 3837, 'en', 1),
(454, 'The beach Strand Kalkhorst is recommended for the ones who love to be more in the nature, without many neighbours and a quieter surrounding. It is located in the German region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern and is the last beach from this region before you enter Schleswig-Holstein. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. A very large parking place, which can hold more than 100 vehicles awaits you some 200 meters away from the beach. The path to the beach is very easy and well organized. Before you enter the beach you have a small fast food kiosk at your service, as well as a toilet. The main surface on the beach is sand, which stretches over a few kilometres and the beach itself is up to 25 meters wide. The point of swim on this beach is at around 40 meters. Beach services are only basic and accommodation in the form of apartments is more in the background, some 500 metres away. And remember, BeachRex is your best beach friend, which will always find your dream beach.', 3838, 'en', 1),
(455, 'The first beach when entering the German region Schleswig-Holstein from the direction of Mecklenburg-Vorpommern is the beach Strand Priwall. The world famous and historical town Lubeck, known for its marzipan sweets is only a few kilometres away. The city visit is a must go if you are in this region, you will not only be amazed by the culinary offer, but also with the historic buildings with its exciting architecture from the medieval times. The beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. The closest parking place is some 300m away from the beach. The beach itself is a few kilometres long, it is made of sand and is 100m wide. You have a lot of surface area to find your spot here. The water entry is very nice and because of the shallow water the point of swim is far out. The shallow water makes it also an ideal place for small children to play in the water safely. You have some beach services available here, also showers. Restaurants and coffee bars are also near the beach, the same goes for accommodation which is available here in the form of apartments, which are located mostly around the parking place. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex and always use BeachRex to find your dream beach.&nbsp;', 3839, 'en', 1),
(456, 'If you&#39;re searching for an idealistic family beach, with a very large children playground and a flat water for your children to play in the water safely you should visit the beach Strand Travem&uuml;nde. It is located near the famous and historical German town L&uuml;beck in the region Schleswig-Holstein. This place is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes can also park on the large parking place, which is some 300 meters away from the beach. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have 1 kilometer length and more than 100 meters of widness of brown sand at your service. The water entry is very nice and comfortable and because of the flat seabed the point of swim is at around 75 meters. This is a very touristic place, where you have many high standard beach services available, as well as many forms of restaurants. Accommodation is also available in many forms, and a tower hotel is directly on the beach.', 3840, 'en', 1),
(457, 'In the German region Schleswig-Holstein in the city Timmendorfer Strand u have a very beautiful sandy beach with numerous small bays stretching along the whole beach. The beach is recommended for family users. You can leave your vehicle on a large parking place, which is also friendly towards motorhomes. It is some 400 m away from the beach. The main surface on the beach is sand and the beach has a total length of more than 1 km and is up to 50 m wide. The water entery here is very nice and comfortable and the point of swim is at around 20 m. This place is very touristic and you have many beach services available here. Along the whole place you have lots of restaurants and coffee bars, accommodation is as well available, mainly as apartments and hotels.', 3841, 'en', 1),
(458, 'If you are searching for a to touristic place on the Baltic Sea, with a beautiful sandy beach, nice hotels, excellent beach services and all what your heart desires, you need to visit the beach Timmendorfer Strand. It is located in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein, just a few kilometres away from the historical town L&uuml;beck. It is very easy to get here with any kind of vehicle and you can leave your car on a large parking place, some 400 m away from the beach. When going down the path to the beach many beautiful houses and hotels are nearby. When getting to the beach you can choose between a few sectors, like the ones for the dog, or the one for the nudist and of course a regular one. You can have many kilometres of length and some 50 m of widness available. The water entry in every sector is very comfortable and the point of swim starts at 15 m. You also need to pay a beach tax of &euro;3 to enter the beach. Many beach services on the highest level are at your disposal. Restaurants and similar are located along the whole stretch of the beach, as well as many different accommodations types.', 3842, 'en', 1),
(459, 'Welcome to the beautiful sandy beach&nbsp;Scharbeutz.&nbsp;In the German region Schleswig-Holstein, you have many sandy beaches. In the small town of Scharbeutz, not only you can enjoy the beautiful sandy beach but also the excellent beach services and the beautiful promenade along the beach. This place is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and it takes you only 200 meters of walking from the big parking place to reach the beach, but you can also park right on the beach beside the road. A special parking place is also reserved for motorhomes owners, and it is a big one. The access to the beach is very easy and it is also suitable for disabled people. The total length of the beach is a few kilometres and the width is 40 meters. The water access is very fine and because of the flat seabed the point of swim is far out away which makes this place, along with the children playground, ideal for small children. Beach services are here on the highest level and everything is well organized. Of course you can also rent the famous German beach chairs. You have many options to get something to eat or to drink as well to choose your favourite accommodation, from which there are many in all different forms, and very close by. Enjoy your beach stay with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3843, 'en', 1),
(460, 'The beach Strand Haffkrug is a sandy beach and it is located near the small town Scharbeutz in the German region Schleswig-Holstein. It is recommended for a family type user, who loves to have lots of beach infrastructure. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and it takes you only 100m to get to the beach. The total length of the beach is several km and it can be up to 30 m wide. To get into the water on this beach it is very easy and you can already start swimming after 15 metres. If you are a tourists who needs lots of beach services here you will be served well. You won&#39;t need to worry about and eating and drinking on this beach, here you have many options. Many options are also available for different types of accommodation, a camping ground included.', 3844, 'en', 1),
(461, 'Have you ever been to a sandy beach with a Luna Park, the Hansa Park (enjoyment Park, roller coaster Park, family park) only a few metres away. Well, in the German region Schleswig-Holstein, near the city Sierksdorf even this option is available for you. The name of the beach is Strand Sierksdorf. You can get to this location with any kind of vehicle and from the parking place to the beach it only takes you 300 metres. Around the whole beach you have a very organized touristic location, with many apartments and a hotel complex. On the beach you have lots of beach services. The total length is several kilometers and the widness can be from 10 m up to 100 meters. The water entry on this beach is very nice and the point of swim is at around 15 meters. Because of this place being so well organized you also have many different options to get something to eat or to drink.', 3845, 'en', 1),
(462, 'Neustadt is the name of the city, near the Baltic Sea in the north German region Schleswig-Holstein, where an attractive sandy beach, just next to the harbour and the marina, is located. It offers you many beach services and a lot of fun for the youngsters, a children playground is located directly on the beach, the same goes for the ones who love sport, you can play beach volleyball on the sand. This location is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, you can simply park next to the road and it takes you only 50 metres of walking to access the beach. The total length of this beach is 750 m and it can be up to 50 m wide. Water entry is nice and the point of swim is between 5 in 25 m. Many types of restaurants, who offer different menus, are located directly on the beach. If you are searching for accommodation, you have many different options, some very close by, a camping ground included. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex. And remember, if you would like to find your dream beach very fast, always go to BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3846, 'en', 1),
(463, 'On the German Baltic seaside you can find many beautiful sandy beaches. They are very well organized and offer you lots of beach services. The same goes also for the beach Strand Pelzerhaken located in the German region Schleswig-Holstein. To get here with your vehicle is not a problem, you have many options to leave your car on some parking place around the beach. The closest one are only 100m away from the beach. Once on the beach you have lots of beach surface available, total length is approximately 1 km and the maximum wideness is 75 m. The water entry is very nice and you can also use the water stairs from the pier to get into the water. Here the water depth falls quickly which makes the point of swim at 10 m. Around the beach you have lots of touristic beach infrastructure, where they offer lots of shops, restaurants and many different forms of accommodation.', 3847, 'en', 1),
(464, 'If you are searching for a sandy beach in the German region Schleswig-Holstein with a parking place right next to the beach, you should visit the beach Strand Rettin. Drive with your vehicle towards the city Neustadt and a few kilometres to the north you will get to this place. The parking lot is very large here and it can hold more than 100 vehicles of any kind. It will take you only 100m of walking to reach the beach. Once on the beach you have many small bays, more than 1 km of length and up to 40 m of widness available. The water entry here is very nice, and you can also choose to use the ladder from the pier to enter the water. The seabed is very flat here, which moves the point of swim some 50 m into the sea. This fact makes this beach also suitable for small children to play in the water safely. When searching for beach services, here you will find many. Restaurants are also available directly on the beach, and for accommodation you have apartments available and many camping grounds of all different shapes and sizes.', 3848, 'en', 1),
(465, 'In the north German region Schleswig-Holstein, you have lots of camping grounds. Some are far away from the beach, but some are very close. If you are searching for the last one, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Schashagen. To get to this place is very easy and you have multiple options to park your vehicle, also a motorhome. To access the beach, you either go to the camp or you use a large parking place some 200 meters away from the beach. On the beach you have one kilometre of beach length and up to 40 meters of width. A boat ramp is also available here. The inclination on the beach is between normal and steep. On most part of the beach the water entry is nice on some places you have some stones in the water. The point of swim is at around 15 meters. Some beach services are available here, but they are more or less only basic. A restaurant and a coffee bar is also here and for accommodation you have many camping grounds all around the beach and some apartments more in the background.&nbsp;And remember, if you would like to find your dream beach very fast, always go to BeachRex.', 3849, 'en', 1),
(466, 'The German beach Strand Gr&ouml;mitz, which is located in the north German region Schleswig-Holstein is recommended for the ones who love to have a camping ground just next to the sandy beach. It is very easy to access this location with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes are also welcomed and it will take you only 100 metres of walking to reach the beach. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and on some places it can be up to 30 m wide. During the summertime you need to pay a beach tax of &euro;3. Along the whole stretch of the beach the water entry is very nice and the swimming point starts at around 20 m. You have some beach services available here. Just next to the beach you have a restaurant and a coffee bar. The most common accommodation around this beach are camping grounds and some apartments.', 3850, 'en', 1),
(467, 'If you are a fan off sandy beaches, which according to your needs, should also have a long pier, on which you can take a walk, catch some fish, or jump from it, we recommend you to visit the German beach Strand Kellenhusen. It is located in the North German region of Schleswig-Holstein, near the small city Kellenhusen. You can access this location very easy with any kind of vehicle and the parking place is only 50m away from the beach. The whole area around the beach is very well organized and you have lots of beach services available. This beach has a total length of several kilometres and it can be up to 50 meters wide. You have multiple options to go into the water, either you go by the beach, you take the water stairs or your simply jump from the pier. At the beginning the water here is very flat, which makes the point of swim at 40 meters. Because of this beach being very popular amongst the tourist, you have many beach services available, as well as many types of restaurants and a lot of different forms of accommodation, camping ground included, all very close to the beach. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3851, 'en', 1),
(468, 'The German beach Strand Dahme is the one we recommend you to visit, if you are in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein and you are a family with children, who would like to play on a big children playground, with lots of different stations. Besides having there a large children playground you also have a very long sandy beach with a flat seabed for children to play in the water safely. It&#39;s very easy to access this place with any kind of vehicle and it takes you only 100m from the parking place to access the beach. You have different sectors on the beach, the one for regular visitors with swimwear on them, a one for the one with dogs and one for the nudist. It is a several kilometres long beach which can be up to 50 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 75 meters. This place is very touristic and well organized, which means you have lots of beach services available. Many different options of restaurants and coffee bars are located on the beach. Behind the protection dune you&#39;ll have many different options of accommodation, also a camping ground.', 3852, 'en', 1),
(469, 'Are very well organised beach with lots of beach services is waiting for your visit on the beach Strand Gro&szlig;enbrode. It is a family type beach, with a sandy surface and a total length of 1 km. On some spots it can get up to 75 m wide. This beautiful beach is located in the German region Schleswig-Holstein. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have only 100m away from the beach a large parking ground which welcomes also motorhomes. The water entry on the beach is very nice and comfortable, the swimming point is between 0 and 25 m. You have many beach services available here on the highest level. Many different types of restaurants, coffee bars and fast food are available here. You have also plenty of different options to choose your accommodation if you would like to stay here for longer or maybe spend your summer holidays here.', 3853, 'en', 1),
(470, 'In the North German region Schleswig-Holstein there is a beautiful island Fehmarn. It has many beautiful and unique beaches and one of them is called Strand Wulfen. We recommend to visit this beach to an adventure type of user. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included. It takes you some 200m of walking to get to the beach. The main surface on the beach is brown sand. The total length of the beach is 500 m and it is up to 10 m wide. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is at 20 m. Beach services are here only basic, no restaurants or similar is available but you have some apartments in the surrounding area. If you are a fan of some prehistoric structures from cultures which lived here a few thousand years ago, you can also visit such a site not far away from the parking, beside the golf fields, it is called the Langbett.&nbsp;', 3854, 'en', 1),
(471, 'The north German island Fehmarn, located in the region Schleswig-Holstein is full of beautiful beaches. The name of this beauty, which is several kilometres long and more than 100 m wide is Strand Burgtiefe. To get to this island you can use a bridge, with no charges. Many parking places, also for motorhomes are located here and it takes you only 100m to go to the beach. The access to the beach is not free, you need to pay a beach tax of 2.5&euro;. The water entry is very nice here and you can start swimming already after 20 m. Many beach services are available along the whole stretch of the beach, you can also rent a german type of sunbed called the Strandkorb. You also have many options to get something to drink or to eat at the numerous restaurants and bars. Accommodation is not a problem here, you have many options, also a hotel and an apartment complex.', 3855, 'en', 1),
(472, 'On the German Island Fehmarn you have many type of beaches where the main surface is sand, with a large camping ground next to it. This is also true for the beach Strand Meeschendorf. It is located in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein. It&#39;s very easy to get here with any kind of vehicle, also motorhome, and you can leave your vehicle only 30 metres away from the beach. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have many small bays stretching over 1 km in length and up to 20m in width. You also have many piers on the beach, which you can use to jump into the water. The point of swim is between 0 and 15 meters. Some beach services are available here, also a children playground. You can also get here something to eat and to drink, but not on the beach directly. For accommodation you can choose between a large camping ground nearby and some apartments more in the background. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3856, 'en', 1),
(473, 'If you&#39;re searching for an adventure type of sandy beach on the German Island Fehmarn, we recommend you to go to the beach Strand Katharinenhof. It is located in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome, but the road to this beach, on the last kilometre, is a dirt one. You can simply park beside the road and after only 50 m of walking you are on the beach. It is 1 km long and can be up to 15 m wide. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at 30 metres. Beach services are here not available as well as there is no restaurant or similar. Accommodation is available in the form of camping grounds, which are nearby.', 3857, 'en', 1),
(474, 'The beach Strand Gr&uuml;ner Brink is located on the north German Island Fehmarn. Because of the very flat seabad and children playgrounds at the beach, it is recommended for a family user type. The region where this beach is located is called Schleswig-Holstein. You can reach this location with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome, and park on a large parking ground. From the parking place to the beach it is only 100 meters of comfortable walking. At the beach you have approximately 500 meters of length and 50 meters of width available. The beach is very flat and so is the water, which is ideal for small children, which can play in the water safely, and the parents having less stress. Some beach services are available here, but more or less they are only of basic nature. A small restaurant is also here, but no accommodation. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.&nbsp;', 3858, 'en', 1),
(475, 'On the German island Fehmarn there are many natural protection zones where you have a unique opportunity to watch some rare birds. But of course you also have the option to be on a beach just next to such a zone, like on the beach Strand Gammendorf. The region this zones are located in is the North German Schleswig-Holstein. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle; motorhomes are also welcomed. It will take you only 100 meters of walking to get to the beach. Before entering the beach, you need to pay 2.5&euro; of beach tax. The total length of the beach is several kilometers and it is up to 30 meters wide. The main surface on the beach are small pebbles, but you also have some sand and some grass on the beach. You can start swimming already after 15 m. Some beach services are available here, but they are mainly basic. A restaurant and a coffee bar is also nearby, as well as a large camping ground for your accommodation.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.&nbsp;​', 3859, 'en', 1),
(476, 'Welcome to a very special motorhome/ water sports beach. This beach, which goes by the name Strand Altenteil, is recommended for the ones who love to do some water sports, like windsurfing and kiteboarding. Because of this fact it is mostly recommended for a more adventurer user type.&nbsp; It is located on the German island Fehmarn in the north region Schleswig-Holstein. It is very easy to access it with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included and you can park only 10 meters away from the beach. The main surface on the beach are small pebbles, but you also have some brown sand included. The water entry is nice and swimming starts already at 10 meters. Most of the beach services are available only in the camp. If you are an owner of a dog, you are welcome here. The camp is also the only possible accommodation in this area as well as the only place where you have a bistro, which serves food around here.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.&nbsp;​', 3860, 'en', 1),
(477, 'Most of the German beaches have sand as their main surface. If you are searching for another type, like small pebbles, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Bojendorf. It is located in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein on the very famous island Fehmarn. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included, and you can leave your vehicle only 200m away from the beach. The beach has a total length of several kilometres and is 25m wide. The water entry is very nice and comfortable and you can already start swimming after 10 m after entering the water. It is obligatory to pay a beach tax of 2.5&euro; for an adult per day. Some beach services are available here, but more or less they are basic. Around the parking you also have a shop and a bistro, a children playground is also located there. Accommodation on this location is available in the camp.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.&nbsp;​</span>', 3861, 'en', 1),
(478, 'Welcome to a beach where kiters find their heaven. The German beach Strand Fl&uuml;gge is located on the famous island Fehmarn. Because of the flat seabed and strong winds, it is suitable for an adventure user type, especially for those one who like to do windsurfing and kiteboarding. The region this beach is located is called Schleswig-Holstein. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included. It takes you only 50 meters from the parking place to reach the beach. The beach is several kilometres long and up to 10 meters wide. The point of swim starts at 75 meters, very late, which is ideal for some serious&nbsp;wind water sports. Beach infrastructure is almost not present here, restaurants and similar are also not present here. You also won&#39;t find any accommodation nearby, a real paradise for nature lovers.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.&nbsp;​', 3862, 'en', 1),
(479, 'If you like to do some serious water sports on the beach, like windsurfing or kiteboarding, we recommend you to visit the German beach Strand Orthfeld. This place is ideal for those kind of sports mentioned before, because of the very flat seabed and strong winds, which in the most cases are present the whole year around. The region, this beach is located, belongs to Schleswig-Holstein. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome. The parking place is only 50 m away from the beach. The beach is 1 km long and 25 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is more than 100m out in the sea. You have very little beach service here, restaurants and bars are also not present. Accommodation is available in the form of apartments in a nearby village.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.&nbsp;</span>', 3863, 'en', 1),
(480, 'Welcome to the very special German Baltic beach. A very well organised and a beautiful sandy beach is waiting for your visit in the city Heiligenhafen. One of the reasons this is a special beach is because of the large boulders and rocks, which are located on some parts This location is part of the North German region Schleswig-Holstein. This beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also motorhomes. It takes only 50 m of easy walking to get to the beach. When entering the beach, you need to pay a beach tax. In totally you have 1 km of length and 50 m of width available. The water entry is very nice and quiet flat. The point of swim starts either from the pier or from the beach and it ranges between 0 to 25 m. You have lots of beach services available here. Near to the beach you also have the option to get something to eat or to drink. If you would like to stay here for longer and are searching for an accommodation you have multiple options to choose from. Many hotels, apartments and free rooms are available in the vicinity.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.&nbsp;', 3864, 'en', 1),
(481, 'The north German city Heiligenhafen offers you many beautiful sandy beaches of all kind of shapes and forms. The beach Strand Steinwarder is one of them and it is a family type beach. The region this beaches are located belongs to Schleswig-Holstein. The whole area is very well organised and it is a famous touristic location. You have many options to leave your vehicle here, also a motorhome. From the parking place to the beach it takes you only 200m of walking. The beach has a total length of 250 m and is on some places 50m wide. Outside the season, when the winds get stronger from the North west, this is a popular place for windsurfing. The point of swim starts already after 10 m. Some beach infrastructure with a few services is available here. You also have a beach bar directly on the beach. To find an accommodation here is not a problem, you have plenty of different options in the whole area.', 3865, 'en', 1),
(482, 'How about a beach on the German Binnensee. In a way it is a lake, but still connected via a small canal to the sea. One is for sure, this beach is new, it is artificial, but nonetheless very nice and beautiful constructed. it is located in the north German city Heiligenhafen, where most of the beaches are facing towards the Baltic Sea, but this one is facing towards the inland. The region this beach belongs to is called Schleswig-Holstein. You can reach this beach very easy with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome. It takes you only 30 m from the parking to reach the beach. The total length of the beach is 750m and it can be on some places up to 25 m wide. The lake is very flat what makes also the point of swim at around 50m. You have a lot of beach infrastructure here, also a sport ground and some children playgrounds. What I really like about this beach are the specially designed summer benches, which all face towards the sun, so you can maximize your sun tan. If you are an owner of a boat you also have a harbour here. Many options are also available for accommodation, if you would like to stay here for longer. Near the harbour I also have some restaurants and coffee bars.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.', 3866, 'en', 1),
(483, 'The North Germany region Schleswig-Holstein has many beautiful beaches on the Baltic Sea. Near the small town Wangels you have a sandy beach called Strand Wei&szlig;enhaus, which is located near a luxury resort. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, and you even have a parking place reserved for motorhomes. The owners of the motorhomes can park some 400 meters away from the beach, all other cars can go to only 100 meters away from the beach. Once on the beach your have several kilometers of length and up to 30 meters of widness available. The water entry here is very nice and swimming starts at around 30 meters. Some beach services are available here, a children playground is also nearby. Directly on the beach you also have a restaurant and for accommodation you have the resort at your disposal.', 3867, 'en', 1),
(484, 'If you like a long and wide sandy beach, with lots of surface, also a place where your dog can enjoy the sea, we recommend you to visit the German beach Strand Sehlendorf. It is located in the north German region Schleswig-Holstein near the village Blekendorf. It is very easy to reach this location with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included. The parking place is right next to the beach, only some 50 m away. Like many other German beaches this one is also several kilometres long and on the widest part it&#39;s more than 50 metres wide. The inclination on the beach is quite flat and so is the seabed, which causes the point of swim being at some 100m. This makes this beach ideal for small children to play in the water safely. You have many beach services available here, a children playground is included, as well as small sailing club. As it is in Germany usual you can of course rent a special German beach chair, called the Strandkorb, as well on this beach. You also have many options to get something to eat or to drink here. For your summer vacation the closest accommodation you can choose is a camping ground which is nearby.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.</span>', 3868, 'en', 1),
(485, 'If you like a sandy beach with many small bays, which give the beach a unique shape,&nbsp; we are recommening you to visit the German beach Strand Hohwacht. It is located in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein, near the village Hohwacht. This location is easy to reach with all kinds of vehicles and the parking place is only 50m away from the beach. On the beach you have lots of space, where the total length of the beach is several kilometres and the maximum width is 50m. The water entery here is nice and because of the flat seabed the point of swim is at 75 meters, somewhere even more out. This fact should be even more interesting for families with small children, because here the children can play in the water more safely than on other locations. Many beach services are available here, you also have children playground nearby. Once you are on the beach you shouldn&#39;t miss out the oppurtunity to rent a German beachchair, and have a very unique beach experience. Near the beach you also have many options to get something to eat and to drink and if you&#39;re searching for an accommodation, some hotels and apartments are nearby.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.</span>', 3869, 'en', 1),
(486, 'If you&#39;re searching for a German beach, which has on its surface a mixture of sand and pebbles and the parking space is only 10 m away, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Hohenfelde. It is located in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein, near the village Hohenfelde. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. Near the beach only cars can park, motorhomes can park a little bit in the background. The beach is several kilometres long and up to 15 m wide. The beach surface is a mixture of small and large pebbles as well as sand. The water entry is nice and the point of swimming is at around 20 m. You have some basic beach services available here. A restaurant and a coffee bar are located directly on the beach. Not far away is a camping ground and some apartments for your accommodation.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.</span>', 3870, 'en', 1),
(487, 'If you&#39;re the one who likes to be on a very well organised beach, with lots of beach services, with a free high-speed Wi-Fi included, where the main surface is sand, but you also would like to have some grass, we recommend you to visit the North German beach Strand Sch&ouml;nberg. It is located on the German Baltic Sea in the region Schleswig-Holstein. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your car. It takes you only 100m of walking to reach the beach. The beach is several kilometres long and on the widest part 30 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at around 50 m. You have lots of beach services here and some are on the highest level. To getting something to eat or to drink is here not a problem, you have multiple options. If you are searching for an accommodation and you would like to stay here for longer and spend your holidays here, you have several possibilities to choose the right one for you. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and remember to always use the BeachRex beach search engine to find your dream beach.&nbsp;', 3871, 'en', 1),
(488, 'The sand dunes in the North German Baltic Sea create sometimes astonishing sandy beaches. In the region Schleswig-Holstein, near the city Kiel there is a very beautiful beach called Strand Heidkate. The closest village to this beauty is Wisch. The location where the beach is located is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also motorhomes. It takes only 50 m of walking to access the beach. Although the main surface on the beach is white sand, you also have some grass on the artificially made protection dunes. If you also like cycling, this place is very popular for this kind of sport. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and you have around 25 m of widness available. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at around 40m. Some basic beach services are available here, a small bistro is also nearby. For accommodation you have multiple options to choose from, also a camp.', 3872, 'en', 1),
(489, 'Some German beaches are really special, literally. If you are a fan of second world war ships and submarines, on this beach in Laboe, you can actually take a look, outside and inside, on a German Second World War Submarine U-995. Next to the submarine you can also take a look at a German military maritime museum. The region, where this special beach is located belongs to the north German Schleswig-Holstein. You need to drive to the small city Laboe, where a large parking place, suitable also for motorhomes, only 200m from the beach, awaits you. The beach is suitable for a family type user. The total length of the beach is 1 km, on some places the width can reach even 100m, on some only 10m. The water entry here is very nice and also the seabed is very very flat. The point of swim is more than 100m away, which makes this place ideal for small children to play in the water safely. You have many beach services available here, also a water slide. Many different forms of restaurants and coffee bars offer their services here. You also have multiple options for accommodation, mainly as apartments and hotels. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 3873, 'en', 1),
(490, 'If you&#39;re searching for a German beach with brown sand near the city Kiel, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Heikendorf. It is located in the region Schleswig-Holstein. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You have multiple options to park your car. The closest one is only 50 m away from the beach. If you&#39;re travelling with a motorhome you need to park some 600m away, but some parking places are also available by the road. The whole area around the beach is very organised and offers you some beautiful architecture. The total length of the beach is 300m, and it can be up to 50 metres wide. The water entry here is very nice and the point of swim is at around 20 metres. To access the beach you need to pay a beach tax of 2&euro;. You have lots of beach services available here, and they are on the highest level. Many different restaurants and coffee bars are as well on the beach. Accommodation is available directly on the beach in the form of a hotel, apartments, and a camping ground is nearby.', 3874, 'en', 1),
(491, 'If you are searching for a large brown sandy beach near the German town Kiel, with lots of beach surface, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Falckenstein. It is located in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also with a large motorhome. It takes you some 400 meters of walking from the parking to the beach. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have a total length of several kilometres and up to 100 meters of beach width available. The whole beach area is very flat, which makes the water entry very comfortable. The seabed is also very flat here, because of that the point of swim is at around 75 meters. The beach services, which are available here, are only basic. Some beach bars and restaurants are available on the beach. Accommodation on this beach is not available directly, but more towards the direction of the town Kiel. Enjoy your beach, and remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 3875, 'en', 1),
(492, 'The North German beach, located on the Baltic Sea, Strand Schilksee is a family type beach with a sandy surface. It is located near the town Kiel. The region where the beach is located is called Schleswig-Holstein. If you&#39;re travelling with a car or a motorhome this location is easy to reach. A very large parking place awaits you nearby the beach. It takes you some 300 meters of walking to get from the parking to the beach. The beach has a total length of 1 kilometre and can be up to 40 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and you can start swimming already after 15 meters. Near the beach you have a harbour and some beach infrastructure with many beach services. A restaurant and a coffee bar are also nearby. For accommodation you can choose between apartments and free rooms. Enjoy you beach, and remember to always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach. We regularly add new beaches to our platform, from all over the world, there is always a new beach to admire and explore.&nbsp;', 3876, 'en', 1),
(493, 'The North German beach Strand Schwedeneck is suitable for those one who would like to have a sandy beach near a camping ground, with lots of beach services, also a sailing club, on the beach. To have such an experience you need to drive to the North German region Schleswig-Holstein. This location is accessible with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included and from the parking space it takes you only 100 meters of walking to reach the beach. The beach has a large area, it is several kilometres long and up to 75 meters wide. To access the beach, you need to pay a tax of 1.5&euro; per person. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at 50 meters. On the beach you have lots of beach infrastructure and services available. Some options to get something to eat and to drink are also available. For your accommodation you can choose a camping ground or some apartments in the village Schwedeneck. Enjoy your beach and remember to always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 3877, 'en', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(494, 'On the North German beach Strand Goosefeld you will find lots of beach area. On some places it is 100m wide and up to 1 km long. If you like this kind of beach, and you would like to visit it, it is located near the town Eckernf&ouml;rde in the region Schleswig-Holstein. Either if you&#39;re travelling with the car or a motorhome you can park almost directly at the beach, where are very large parking place, only 30 m away from the beach is waiting for you. The water entry on the beach is comfortable and the point of swim is at 20 m. You have also some beach infrastructure here, included is a&nbsp;children playground and a few beach volleyball fields. A beach bar and some restaurants are also directly on the beach, if you get hungry or you would like to taste some German beer or a beach coffee. Most of the accommodation is available in the form of apartments nearby. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3878, 'en', 1),
(495, 'If you are searching for a sandy beach in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein, where you can park your vehicle almost directly on the beach in a modern city, we suggest you, to visit the town Eckernförde. The parking place, which is only 30 meters away from the beach, can hold more than 100 vehicles, also motorhomes. The whole area around the beach is very organized with lots of beach infrastructure and beach services. The total length of the beach is several kilometers, and on the widest part it is 50 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is because of the flat seabed at 50 meters. On the beach you also have many volleyball fields, are children playground. Restaurants and coffee bars are directly on the beach. You have several options to choose your accommodation, mainly in the form of apartments.', 3879, 'en', 2),
(496, 'The beach Strand Eickholt is a true camp beach. It is located in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein near the village Waabs. This location is easy to reach with any kinds of vehicle. If you\'re traveling with the Motorhome you can also stay inside the camp and be only a few meters away from the beach. The total length of the beach is several kilometers and it can be up to 20 meters wide. The main surface on the beach are small pebbles, but you also have some sand mixed with in. The seabed is quite flat which makes the point of swim at 40 meters. Because of the camp many beach services are available here. A restaurant is also on the beach, and for your accommodation you have only the camp available. ', 3880, 'en', 2),
(497, 'Most German beaches on the Baltic sea are a sandy type, but there are also some who have mostly small pebbles on the beach or are a mixture of both. If you like beaches with small pebbles, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Schwastrum. It is located in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein. The parking place, which is only 50m away from the beach, is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome. When you get to the beach you have several kilometres of length available, as well as 25 meters of width. Most of the pebbles are on the beginning of the beach, the closer you get to the sea the more sand you have, which makes the water entering more comfortable. The point of swim is at around 30 m. Some beach services are available here, and if you want you can rent some equipment for extreme water sports. A restaurant and a bistro are located directly on the beach. On this beach the only possible accommodation is at the camping grounds. We hope you will have a nice beach day with BeachRex. Enjoy your beach.&nbsp;', 3881, 'en', 1),
(498, 'The German Baltic Sea coastline has many different beaches to offer. If you are searching for a real tourist destination, with lots of beach infrastructure, services, all what you can imagine, we suggested you to visit the beach Strand Damp. It is located in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein, between the city Kiel and Flensburg. It&#39;s very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included. Your have many different options to park there, the closest parking place is only 200 m away from the beach, the farest 500 m. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have lots of beach surface area at your disposal. The total length is several kilometers, and it is more than 100 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is already at 10 meters. Because of this place being a very touristic location, you have lots of beach infrastructure and all possible beach services available. Accommodation here is not the problem, you have lots of different options, but mostly in a hotel.', 3882, 'en', 1),
(499, 'The German beach Strand Brodersby is located in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein. It is a sandy type beach recommended for family. It&#39;s very easy to get there with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome, and it takes you only 50 meters to get to the beach. Before you access the beach you need to buy a beach ticket for 2&euro;. You have a total of several kilometers of beach length and up to 40 m of widness available. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at 10 meters. This place has some beach services to offer, a children playground and some sports field0 are as well included, also some restaurants and similar types of catering. For accommodation you can choose between apartments or rooms.', 3883, 'en', 1),
(500, 'The North German beach Strand Langballig , which is located on the coastline of the Baltic Sea, offers you lots of sand and a unique view to the other side of the canal, to the coastline of Denmark. This beach is located near the German town Flensburg in the region Schleswig-Holstein. This location is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, you even have a parking ground for motorhomes. Parking is done almost directly on the beach only 10 m away. The total length of the beach is 400 meters and it is 30 meters wide. Beside the sand as a main surface you also have some grass here. Because of the flat beach, the water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at 20 meters. You have lots of beach infrastructure located here, a large children playground is directly at the beach as well as some sports fields. You have many options to get something to eat or to drink here. You also have many options to find and accommodation, a camping ground is directly at the beach, nearby there are also apartments.', 3884, 'en', 1),
(501, 'On the North German Peninsula Holnis, which is located in the region Schleswig-Holstein, a very beautiful sandy beach Strand Drei, with views on Denmark, is waiting for your visit. The closest village is Gl&uuml;cksburg, not far away from the town Flensburg. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome. From the parking place to the beach it takes you only 200 meters of walking. The access to the beach is easy, but you need to pay a beach tax off 2.6&euro;. The beach is very long, 2 kilometers and 20 meters wide. Water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at 20 meters. Lots of beach services all available either directly on the beach or near the beach. You also have some options to get something to eat or drink directly on the beach. In the surrounding many different accommodation options are available.', 3885, 'en', 1),
(502, 'Far up in the North German region Schleswig-Holstein, near Denmark, you have a very beautiful city Gl&uuml;cksburg with an even more beautiful beach, called Strand Gl&uuml;cksburg. The beach is completely covered in sand, is very organized, with a beautiful architecture shape and it&#39;s recommended for family type users. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome. You have multiple options to park your car, and to the closest one is only 50 meters away from the beach. On this beach you have lots of beach infrastructure and services, which is also the reason why you need to pay a beach tax of 2,6&euro;. The beach has a total length of 300 meters and is 30 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 15 meters. You have lots of options to find something to eat or to drink here. And for your accommodation you can choose a hotel directly on the beach or some apartments in the neighbourhood. We wish you a nice beach day and remember to always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 3886, 'en', 1),
(503, 'If you&#39;re searching for a sandy beach near the North German city Flensburg, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Harrislee. It&#39;s not far away from the Danish border and also very near the city Flensburg. The region the beach is located is Schleswig-Holstein. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also large motorhomes and you can park almost directly at the beach, only 30 m away. When you get to the beach you have a lot of beach surface available. The length of the beach is 500 metres and it is 75 m wide. The inclination on the beach is quite flat, which makes a very pleasant water entry and the point of swim at around 20 m. Many beach services are available on the beach, you also have many different children&#39;s playground available and some sport fields. A lot of restaurants and coffee bars are available directly at the beach. If you would like to stay here for longer you have many different accommodation option available directly on the beach or in its vicinity. We wish you a pleasant beach day or a beach vacation with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3887, 'en', 1),
(504, 'One of the very first beaches in the Danish region Syddanmark on the Baltic Sea is the sandy beach Strand Kohage. It&#39;s not far away from the German border, only a few kilometres away from Flensburg. The beach is recommended for an adventurer user type. It is Easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, you simply leave your car beside the road. It takes only a few steps to enter the beach. The total length of the of the beach is 300m and it is up to 10 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at 30 metres. You have very little beach infrastructure here and almost no beach services. Bring your own food and drinks with you, here you can&#39;t get any. Some accommodation is available in the neighbouring village Kollund.', 3888, 'en', 1),
(505, 'Welcome to the very special beach S&oslash;nderhav. This Danish sandy beach is located in the region Syddanmark, near the village Krus&aring;. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome, and you can simply park on a parking place right in front of the beach. It is a family type beach with some beach infrastructure and some beach services. A small children playground and some picnic tables with benches are also on the sandy beach. You have a total length of 200 m and up to 40 m of width on the beach available. If you like specially shaped beaches, like a horn shaped beach, you are on the right spot. The water entry is because of the flat beach very comfortable. The point of swim is between 5 to 25 m. Right next to the beach you have a small bistro and if you are searching for accommodation there are some apartments in the surrounding area. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3889, 'en', 1),
(506, 'If you&#39;re searching for a peaceful and quiet sandy beach on the Danish coastline by the Baltic Sea, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Kragesand. It is located in the Danish region Syddanmark near the village Broager. This location is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome. The road to the beach is paved, but be aware that on the last kilometres it is very narrow, only one car can pass in both direction. The parking place is only 50 m away from the beach. The beach is easy to access. It is 500 metres long and 10 m wide. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is at around 30 m. You have some basic beach infrastructure here, but no restaurants or similar as well as no option for accommodation is available.', 3890, 'en', 1),
(507, 'Welcome to the&nbsp;Gammelmark Strand.&nbsp;If you are searching for a sandy Danish beach on the Baltic Sea coastline, with a camping ground next to it, we suggest you to visit the beach Strand Gammelmark. It is located in the Danish region Syddanmark, near the village Broager. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome. And either you stay in the camp or your park your vehicle on a small parking place some 30 m away from the beach. The beach has a total length of 1 km and it is 15 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 30 m. You have some basic beach infrastructure here; more services are available in the camp. The camp is also the only place to get something to eat and to stay here for a longer time. Explore the beach Gammelmark with BeachRex.', 3891, 'en', 1),
(508, 'The Danish Beach Strand Vemmingbund is recommended for those one who are a family user type and are searching for a very long sandy beach with lots of beach surface. It is located in the southern danish region Syddanmark. The closest village is Broager. This location is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, and the parking ground is large enough to hold also motorhomes. From the parking place to the beach it is only 10 metres. You have lots of beach surface here, the total length is around 1 km and it is 20 wide. The water entry is very nice and swimming starts at around 10 m. You have some beach infrastructure available here,children playground included. Some options for drinking and eating are available in the restaurants. And for your accommodation you can choose between rooms or apartments.', 3892, 'en', 1),
(509, 'Welcome to the beach&nbsp;S&oslash;nderborg Strand.&nbsp;The South Danish city S&oslash;nderborg, which is located on the island Als and has a coastline on the Baltic Sea, has a nice sandy beach, suitable for families, located not far away from the centre of the city. The whole area belongs to the region Syddanmark. It&#39;s easy to get to this location with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. A parking place is located directly in front of the beach; some are a little bit far away. The access to the beach is very easy and you have 200m of length and up to 50 m of width available. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim starts already at 10 metres. You also have an option to go to the water by water stairs from a pier. Some beach infrastructure is located directly on the beach, as well some fast food and ice cream kiosk. If you&#39;re searching for accommodation you have the option to go to a hotel or to some apartments nearby. Enjoy exploring the beach with BeachRex.', 3893, 'en', 1),
(510, 'If you&#39;re in the Danish City S&oslash;nderborg and you are looking for a sandy beach with a harbour next to it, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Den Sorte. It is located on the island Als in the south Danish region Syddanmark. Is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park on a large parking ground only some 100m away from the beach. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have 300 m of length and 20 m of widness available. The water fals here very quickly which makes the point of swim at 10 metres. This beach is awarded with the blue flag, which gives you a little bit more beach infrastructure and services then otherwise. Restaurants or similar are not available on the beach and for your accommodation you have a camping ground a few 100m away.', 3894, 'en', 1),
(511, 'On the Danish island Als you have many beautiful sandy beaches to explore. The island Als is a part of the southern Danish region Syddanmark. The beach we are presenting here is called Strand &Oslash;sterby and it is located near the village Sydals. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and a small parking place awaits you only 30 m away from the beach. Near the parking place you also have a camping ground where motorhomes can park. The access to the beach is easy. When you get to the beach you have 1 kilometre of length and 5 m of beach widthness available. Although the main surface on the beach is sand you also have a small stretch of grass. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at 15 m. Some basic beach infrastructure is available, you have more inside the camp, if you are a guest. Here you don&#39;t have any option to get something to eat, but you have many options to find an accommodation, a camping ground is nearby.', 3895, 'en', 1),
(512, 'If you&#39;re the one who likes long sandy beaches with a parking ground for your vehicle next to it, we recommend you to visit the Danish beach Strand Kegn&aelig;sh&oslash;j. It is located on the beautiful island Als, which is part of the Southern Danish region Syddanmark, near the village Sydals. The parking place is quite small, around 20 vehicles can stay here, also motorhomes, but it is only 10 metres away from the beach. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it is 10 metres wide. The point of swim starts already at 5 meters. All the beach infrastructure on this beach is located around the parking place. You need to bring your food and drinks with you, because here are no restaurants on similar catering. Accommodationsis available only in the form of a camping ground nearby.', 3896, 'en', 1),
(513, 'The Danish island Als in the south Danish region Syddanmark is the one you have to visit if you would like to explore some long sandy beaches on the Baltic coastline. The beach Strand Drejby, located near the village Sydals, falls into this category. It is a very beautiful beach, recommended for families and those one who would like to park their vehicle next to the beach. The parking place is very large and it is only 30 m away from the beach. Access to the beach is easy. All the beach infrastructure is located around the parking place, on a spot before you enter the beach, a small bistro included, as well as toilets. On the beach you have several kilometres of length and up to 25 m of widthness available. To enter the water here is very comfortable and the point of swim is at 15 m. If you would like to stay here for longer you have a camping ground nearby as well as some apartments.', 3897, 'en', 1),
(514, 'Welcome to the beach Mommark. The Danish beach Strand Mommark is a sandy beach, recommended for families and those one who would like to have a harbour next to the beach. If you are a fan of such beaches, the exact location of the beach is on the island Als, village Mommark, in the southern region Syddanmark. It&#39;s very easy to get to the beach with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome. Next to the beach you have a harbour and a camping ground. The beach itself is 250 m long and up to 30 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swimming is at 15 metres. It is a blue flag beach, which means you have some beach infrastructure at a certain standard at your disposal. Near the beach you also have a restaurant, and the only possible accommodation, in the form of a camp. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3898, 'en', 1),
(515, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hej on the beach Fynshav. On the Danish island Als, near the ferry port Fynshav, you have a nice sandy, beach suitable for families, with a small harbour nearby. The region where this beach is located is called Syddanmark. This beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also with motorhomes, and you have several options to park very close to the beach, the closest one is only 50 m away, some are a little bit further. The total length of the beach is 250 m and it is 20 m wide. On one part of the beach, more in the background, you also have a part with some grass. On this beach you have a quite flat seabed which makes the point of swim at around 40 m. This fact means that your small children can play more safely in the water. The beach is awarded with a blue flag sign. Because of the blue flag award and the harbour nearby you also have some beach infrastructure here. Restaurants are not nearby, so bring your food with you, and if you&#39;re searching for accommodation you have a camping ground nearby. Enjoy exploring the beach Fynshav with BeachRex.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3899, 'en', 1),
(516, 'Near the village Nordborg on the Danish island Als you can explore a beautiful long sandy beach Strand K&oslash;bingsmark. It is a part of the Danish region Syddanmark. This location is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, also motorhomes. Only 30 m away from the beach a large parking place awaits you. This beach is rewarded with a blue flag sign so many beach infrastructure is located here. Bring your food and drinks with you, because here is no option to buy anything. You have many options for accommodation here, a camping ground is nearby as well as some apartments. The beach itself has a total length of 1 km and is up to 20 m wide. You can enter the water here in two ways, either from the beach or from a water ledder on the pier. The point where you can start swimming is at around 15 m.', 3900, 'en', 1),
(517, 'If you are searching for a very long and wide danish beach in the region Syddanmark, we recommend you to visit the city Aabenraa and it&#39;s beach Strand &Aring;benr&aring;. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome, and you have plenty of parking places available directly on the beach. It takes only a few steps from the parking place to the beach. The beach has a total length of 500 m and is 100 m wide. The water entry is very nice and because of the very flat seabed the point of swim is at around 100 m. This fact this beach has a flat seabed and because of many children playgrounds on the beach, it makes this beach ideal for small children. You have a lot of beach infrastructure and many services available here. Many sports fields are also on the beach. A restaurant and a coffee bar is also on the beach and you have plenty accommodation options in the surrounding area.', 3901, 'en', 1),
(518, 'The Danish beach Strand Dyrhave is located in the south Denmark region Syddanmark, very close to the city Aabenraa. It is a sandy beach, which is 750 m long and only 3 meters wide. This location is very easy to reach, also with a motorhome, and a small parking place, just 30 metres away from the beach, is waiting for you. The beach surface is really small but you also have some grass surface in the background of the beach. You can either enter the water by the beach or via a pier. The point of swim is at around 10 meters. Restaurants and coffee bars are not available here but you have some options for accommodation, the closest one is a camp. Some beach services are also available here, a children playground and sport fields included.', 3902, 'en', 1),
(519, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Greetings from the beach Loddenh&oslash;j. If you are searching for a Danish beach where the beach surface is a mixture of sand and small pebbles, and you would also like to have a camp nearby, we suggest you to visit the family beach Strand Loddenh&oslash;j. It is located in the region Syddanmark in the vicinity of the city Aabenraa. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can simply park by the road just in front of the beach. On the beach you have 500 m of length and 15 m of width available, to find your spot for your parasol and towel. When going to the water you have some small stones on the bottom. The point of swim is at 20 m. Some beach infrastructure is available here, also a small bistro and for your accommodation you can either go to the camp or you can rent an apartment nearby. Enjoy exploring the beach Loddenh&oslash;j with BeachRex.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3903, 'en', 1),
(520, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to the beach Genner. Near the Danish village R&oslash;dekro in the region Syddanmark, you have a nice sandy beach, named Strand Genner, where you can to spend your well-deserved vacation. It is very easy to reach the beach with any kind of vehicle, and you can park only 30 m away from the beach on a small parking place. The beach has a total length of 750 m and is 20 m wide. The water entry is very nice here and the point of swim is at 10 m. You have some beach services available, but no restaurant or coffee bar is nearby. As for your accommodation, if you would like to stay here for longer, you can choose between a camp or some apartments, not far away from the beach. Enjoy exploring the beach Genner with BeachRex.&nbsp;</div>\n', 3904, 'en', 1),
(521, 'If you&#39;re looking in Denmark for a beach where you could immediately start swimming, after entering the water, we suggest you to visit the beach Strand Hejsager. It is located near the village Haderslev in the region Syddanmark. The beach is not only suitable for those one who like to swim, but also for those one who like long sandy beaches with the parking place next to the beach. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it can be up to 40 metres wide. The point of swim is already at 5 m. Near the parking place you also have some beach infrastructure. A restaurant is also available here and if you would like to stay here for longer you can rent a house or an apartment.', 3905, 'en', 1),
(522, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Welcome to the beach Flovt. Near the Danish town Haderslev, which is part of the region Syddanmark, you have a very long sandy beach called Strand Flovt. This beach is recommended for a family user type. If you have small children, who love to play in the water, be careful, because the point of swim on this beach is already at 5 m. You can come to this beach with any kind of vehicle, also with motorhomes. The parking is very large and you can leave your vehicle only 100m of walking from the beach. This beauty is several kilometres long and 20 m wide. The beach has a normal inclination and a quite steep drop in the depth of the seabed. Around the parking place you have some beach infrastructure. Restaurants or coffee bars are not available here, but you have some accommodation available in the form of apartments nearby. Enjoy exploring the beach Flovt with BeachRex.</div>\n', 3906, 'en', 1),
(523, 'If you like beaches with lots of beach surface, where the beach width is around 100 m and the sea bed is so flat that children can play safely inside it for many metres into the water, we suggest you to visit the beach Strand Hejlsminde. It is located in the Danish region Syddanmark. No matter if you&#39;re travelling with the car or with a motorhome this location is easy to reach and you can park directly at the beach on a large parking place. The inclination on the beach is very small, almost flat, which makes the water entry very easy. The point of swim is far away at around 75 m. This beach has a total length of 400 m and is 100 m wide. It is a very popular and touristic place with a harbour and many beach infrastructure. You also have many restaurants, fast food kiosks and coffee bars directly at the beach. Many options are also available closeby for different forms of accommodation.', 3907, 'en', 1),
(524, 'Every country on the Baltic Sea has some astonishing beautiful beaches. Denmark is here no exception, it really has so many awesome sandy beaches. And this time we would like to present you the beach Strand Trappendal. It is located in the region Syddanmark near the village Hejls. It is very easy to get there with any kind of vehicle. A large parking place only 200m away from the beach is waiting for your arrival. From the parking place you need to descent some 10 metres in height to the beach where a mixture of white and brown sand welcomes you. The total length of the beach is 200 m and it is 10 metres wide. The seabed on this beach is very flat and the point of swim is at 75 m. You can also walk down a pier and use the water ledder to get into the water. The beach infrastructure here is only basic, here are no restaurants or beach bars but you have some accommodation options in the form of apartments in the surrounding area.', 3908, 'en', 1),
(525, 'Welcome to the Danish city Assens. On the island Funen, you can visit a sandy beach called Strand Assens, which is located just next to the Harbour. This beach is located in the region Syddanmark and is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, and you also have plenty of options to park there. The closest parking is only 30 m away from the beach, others are a little bit further away. Although the main surface on the beach is sand, you also have some stones mixed within. The length of the beach is 500m and it&#39;s more than 100 m wide. The surface here is very flat. The water entry from the beach is not as comfortable, because of the large stones in the water, but you can use the ladder from the pier to get into the water. The point of swim is at 10m. Some beach infrastructure is available here, more is available in the marina. Restaurants are not available here and the closest accommodation for your stay is in a camp nearby. Enjoy exploring the beach Assens with BeachRex.<br />\n&nbsp;', 3909, 'en', 1),
(526, 'Welcome to the very peaceful and simple Danish beach&nbsp;Agern&aelig;s.&nbsp;It is located on the island Funen, near the village Ebberup. The region where this beach is located belongs to is the Danish region Syddanmark. It is a family type beach with the main surface being small stones. On the beach you have several kilometres of length and 10 m width available. The water entry is nice and you can start swimming at around 15 m. Some basic beach infrastructure is located here, and it is concentrated around the harbour, but don&#39;t expect too much. Restaurants or similar are not available here, but you have a hotel nearby, if you&#39;re searching for accommodation. Enjoy exploring the beach&nbsp;Agern&aelig;s with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3910, 'en', 1),
(527, 'The Danish beach Strand Damsbo is best recommended for the ones who have a more adventures souls. The main beach surface is sand, but only on a small portion, everything else is grass. It is located on the island Funen near the village Millinge in the region Syddanmark. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and the parking place is only 30 meters away from the beach. The beach has a width of 10 meters and is 500 m long. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is already at 5 m. The beach infrastructure on this location is only basic and around the beach there is also no possibility to get anything to eat or drink as well as no option for accommodation. If you prefer such beach characteristics than you should certainly give the beach a visit. Enjoy the beach Strand Damsboo with BeachRex.', 3911, 'en', 1),
(528, 'If you&#39;re searching for a Danish beach with white sand, with a beautiful park and a holiday apartments complex nearby, we suggest you to visit the beach Strand Faaborg. It is located in the region Syddanmark on the island Funen in the city Faaborg. It&#39;s very easy to get to the beach, but it&#39;s more a challenge to find a parking place. A small parking place is very close to the beach, but it can hold only 10 vehicles. The beach has a total length of 250 m and is 40 m wide. It consists of several small bays. The water entry and its depth is different and it depends on where you would like to enter the water. You can either use the water ladder, go slowly from the beach or jump from the pier. On some places the water drops immediately into the depth. Many beach infrastructure is available here, as well as restaurants and coffee bars. You will also find many options for accommodation here, an apartment complex is nearby. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3912, 'en', 1),
(529, 'Do you like beaches with lots of nature around you, with no tourist industry, only you, the sandy beach and the crystal clear Baltic Sea? If your answer is positive, we would like to present you the Danish beach Strand Bj&oslash;rneh&oslash;j. It is located on the island Langeland near the village Humble in the region Syddanmark. This place is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included. A large parking place is only 50 m away from the beach. The beach has a total length of several kilometres and is up to 15m wide. The water access is very nice and comfortable and the point of swim is at 10 m. Most of the beach infrastructure is located around the parking place. Here you have no option to buy food or drinks, but you have the option to find an accommodation right for you nearby, mainly as apartments or in a camping ground nearby.', 3913, 'en', 1),
(530, 'The Danish island Langeland, in the south region Syddanmark, is known for its long, sandy and wild beaches. Very little tourist&rsquo;s infrastructure is located here, and if you prefer that fact, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Hesselbjerg. The closest village to the beach is Humble. Right next to the beach you have a large parking place and it is very easy to get there with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome. Most of the beach infrastructure is located around the parking place, like toilets, sport fields and a small beach bistro. It takes only 50 m of walking from the parking place to reach the beach. The beach is very long and has a wideness of 10 metres. On the beach you also have a pier, which you can use as an alternative to get into the water via a ladder instead of going via the beach. The point of swim is between 0 and 15 m. If you would like to stay here for longer you can do so by renting some neighbouring apartments or houses. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3914, 'en', 1),
(531, 'On the faremost southpoint of the Danish island Langeland you have two attractions. The first one is the unique small pebbles beach Strand Gulstav with its small clay cliffs, the second one are unique wild horses. To reach those two attractions you need to drive in the direction of the village Bagenkop in the region Syddanmark. Not far away from the beach you have a large parking place and it&#39;s easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. Once on the beach you have a total length of several kilometres and up to 10 m off widthness available. The surface is a mixture of small and big pebbles. The point of swim is at around 5 m. Most of the beach infrastructure is located around the parking place and here you don&#39;t have any options to buy food or drinks or to stay over in an accommodation.', 3915, 'en', 1),
(532, 'The Danish beach Strand &Oslash;sterskov is quite something special, especially because of the surface on the beach. Here you don&#39;t have sand, but a mixture of different beach surfaces types with big pebbles being the dominant. The beach is located on the island Langeland, near the village Humble in the region Syddanmark. When getting here with your vehicle, you can park on a parking place only 10 m away from the beach. The beach has a total length of several kilometres and is 10 m wide. Because of the large stones in the water it&#39;s not that easy to enter it. Once you are in the water you can start swimming at around 10 m. You have a lot of beach infrastructure on this location, a children playground and sport fields included. No food or drink services are available here. If you would like to stay here for longer you can rent a house or an apartment nearby. Enjoy your beach day with BeachRex.', 3916, 'en', 1),
(533, 'On the Danish Island Langeland you have many different type of beaches. The one, near the village Rudk&oslash;bing is a sandy type of beach recommended for families with small children. The seabed here is very flat so small children can play in the water safely and you also have nearby some children&#39;s playgrounds and sports fields. This beach is located in the region Syddanmark. To get to the beach is very easy and you can also arrive with a motorhome. The parking place is very close to the beach and you have multiple options to park there. The total length of the beach is 500m and it is 30 m wide. The beach is very flat as well as the seabed which puts the point of swim far out away. A small bistro is also available on the beach and nearby you can rent an apartment or stay in a camp.', 3917, 'en', 1),
(534, 'Near the village Tranek&aelig;r, on the Danish island Langeland, there&#39;s a family beach called strand Lohals, which is waiting to be explored by you. If you like beaches where you can park directly in front of the beach, this one is the right for you. This beach location belongs to the region Syddanmark. Lohals, where the beaches is located, is very easy to reach, no matter the vehicle you are travelling with. Although the parking place is small, this beach is very popular. You have all the necessary beach infrastructure here. The main surface on the beach is sand, and the beach is 400 m long and up to 20 m wide. It is a very flat beach and the water entry is nice, with the point of swim being at 15 m. Some coffee bars and restaurants are available in the surrounding area, but not on the beach directly. Nearby you also have some apartments and some camping grounds for your summer holiday accommodation. Enjoy this one of a kind beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3918, 'en', 1),
(535, 'Welcome to the Danish beach Strand Stengade. It has a very flat seabed, which makes it very safe for small children to play in the water safely. If you&#39;re searching for those kind of a beach you can find this beach on the island Langeland, near the village Tranek&aelig;r in the region Syddanmark. This beach location is very easy to access with any kind of vehicle and you have a parking ground only a few metres away from the beach, motorhomes are also welcomed here. The beach is 750 m long and up to10 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is approximately at 75 m, maybe even further. A typical Danish beach infrastructure is as well located here, but you don&#39;t have any restaurants or coffee bars available on the beach. If you are searching for accommodation you have the option to rent some apartment or houses nearby. Let your children explore a flat beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3919, 'en', 1),
(536, 'Strand Dagel&oslash;kke is another island beach, located on the Danish island Langeland, near the village Tranek&aelig;r in the region Syddanmark. It is sandy type of beach recommended for families. This whole location is very touristic, with lots of apartments, a children playground, sport fields and even a harbour. You have lots of beach infrastructure and services available here. Close by are also restaurants and coffee bars as well as many options for accommodation. The beach itself is 200 m long and 20 m wide. The water entry here is very nice and you can start swimming at around 20 m. If all those facts are resonating with your beach preferences, don&#39;t hesitate and visit this beach, you won&#39;t regret it. And remember, when it comes to beaches, BeachRex will help you to find the one for you. Enjoy your beach stay with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3920, 'en', 1),
(537, 'Although The Danish village Tranek&aelig;r is a small place on the island Langeland, it has many beautiful beaches in it surrounding, like the beach Strand Emmerb&oslash;lle. It is a family type Beach, which is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle. You have a large parking place not far away from the beach. The main surface on the beach is brown sand and it stretches for one kilometer and is 20 m wide. The beach is quite flat and so so is the seabed, which s a consequence gives the beach the point of swim at around 40 meters. A Danish typical Beach infrastructure is located on this place. You also have a small Bistro nearby and an accommodation in the form of a camping ground.', 3921, 'en', 1),
(538, 'If you would like to visit one of the most beautiful beaches on the Danish island Funen, we recommend you to drive towards the city Nyborg and head for the beach Strand Fyns. The beach is located just next to the famous bridge Storeb&aelig;lt, which connects the island Funen with the island Zealand. This location is part of the south Danish region Syddanmark. The location where the beach is waiting for you is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You have a large parking ground only a few metres away from the beach. Lots of beach infrastructure and beach services are available here. It is recommended to visit the beach if you are with your family, because you have really lots of beach space here. The total length is several kilometres and it is 100m wide. It&#39;s a very flat beach with lots of sport fields on it. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 40 m. On the beach you also have some beach bars, bistros and similar catering. You also have several options for accommodation, like hotels, apartments and even a camp.', 3922, 'en', 1),
(539, 'Welcome to the Strand Kerteminde. Denmark has many beautiful islands, of course with many attractive beaches. On the Danish Island Funen in the town Kerteminde you have a sandy beach suitable for families with small children. The beach is very flat and so is the seabed, which is a ideal for small children to play in the water safely. The beach location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park directly at the beach only a few meters away. You really have a lot of beach surface here, because the length of the beach is one kilometre and it is 100 meters wide. The point of swim is far out away, at approximately 75 meters. Near the beach you also have a harbour and lots of beach infrastructure with many beach services. If you are a fan of beach sport and you would like to stay in shape also when being on the beach, here you can play beach volleyball, football and even Minigolf. Different options of restaurants are available here and for your accommodation you can choose between apartments, hotels or a camp. And remember, when you thing of beaches, think of BeachRex, and you will always find the right beach for you. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3923, 'en', 1),
(540, 'If you like beaches where the main surface are small pebbles, we recommend you to visit the Danish beach Strand B&oslash;gebjerg. It is located on the island Funen, one of many islands in this beautiful Scandinavian country, near the village Dalby in the region Syddanmark. To get here with your vehicle, also with a motorhome, is very easy. You have a large parking place only a few metres away from the beach. The parking place is owned by the camp so ask for permission to park there. The beach is here 2 km long and up to 10 metres wide. It has a small inclination, the water entry is nice and the point of swim is already at 10 m. Most of the beach infrastructure and services are available in the camp, otherwise there is little on the beach itself. Restaurants and coffee bars are not available here and the camp is here the only accommodation available. Like it is usual in Denmark, also this beach has a small pier and on the end of it, of course also a water ladder. Enjoy your beach vacation with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3924, 'en', 1),
(541, 'Welcome to the very special formed beach Strand Nordskov. On the north part of the Danish island Funen the beaches are not made of sand, but predominantly of small pebbles. This is also the case with the beach we are covering in this article. It is located near the village Martofte in the region Syddanmark. You can visit this beach and drive to it with any kind of vehicle. The parking place is located directly on the beach, and you can also park your motorhome here. On the beach you have different types of surfaces but the main type are small pebbles. The beach is a few kilometres long and 10 meters wide, with many different shapes, which change when you walk near the water. When going to the water you have some large stones on your way, so be careful where you step. After 30 m you can already start swimming. Here you don&#39;t have any options to buy something to eat or drink, but you have some options for accommodation like apartments and a camp nearby. Don&#39;t waste your time at home, use BeachRex to find the right beach for you and visit them as soon as possible. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3925, 'en', 1),
(542, 'The Danish beach Strand Hofmansgave is a sandy beach recommended for families. Its location is on the island Funen, near the village Otterup in the region Syddanmark. If you&#39;re travelling with a car or with a motorhome, this beach is very easy to reach and you can park directly in front of the beach. Some essential beach infrastructure is located&nbsp;around&nbsp;the parking; some is on the beach itself. The beach is several kilometres long and 30 m wide. On some places you even have grass as a surface. This beach consists of many small bays. The water entry is mostly comfortable, except from some places where you have stones in the water. The point of swim is at 15 metres. On this place you have no restaurants, some are available, but are a little bit further away. Accommodation is available mainly as apartments, and close by is also a camp. Enjoy your beach time with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3926, 'en', 1),
(543, 'Welcome to Danish beaches. Near the village Otterup, on the Danish Island Funen, you have a very nice sandy beach called Strand Fuglsang, located by the Baltic coastline. This area is part of the region Syddanmark. You can drive to this beach with any kind of vehicle and leave it beside the road only 100m away from the beach. The access to the beach is very easy. Although the main surface on the beach is sand, you also have some small stones, rocks and grass. It is a very long beach, several kilometres, it is mostly 20 m wide but it can be also on some places up to 50 m wide. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at 10 m. Most of the beach infrastructure is near the parking place and it is a typical Danish standard, toilets and a shower, with a bench and a table, just right for your beach picnic. Restaurants are not available here, but you have some apartments available in the vicinity, which you can rent for your summer accommodation. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and remember if you want to find the perfect beach for you in the fastest way, always use Beachrex.&nbsp;', 3927, 'en', 1),
(544, 'If you are searching for a sandy beach in Denmark, which should have a large children playground nearby, as well as a camp, we suggest you to visit the beach Strand Vejlby Fed. You will find this beach in the region Syddanmark on the island Funen, near the town Middelfart. No matter what the vehicle you are travelling with this location is easy accessible and you can park on a large parking space some 200m away from the beach. The access to the beach is very easy. On your way to the beach you have also the most beach infrastructure, as well as the children playground and the sport fields. This beach is recommended for families with small children. Not only you have here a large and modern playground, you also have a very flat beach and a flat seabed. The beach is several kilometres long and 30 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is because of the flat seabed at around 50 m. The only bistro here is near the camp. The Camp is also one of your options for accommodation, the other ones is renting either an apartment or a house. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex and always use our platform if you want to find your dream beach very fast.&nbsp;', 3928, 'en', 1),
(545, 'Welcome to a very special beach. Near the Danish city Middelfart there is a small town named Strib. A sandy beach is also located here and it is suitable for families who are or would like to visit the island Funen. This is also a famous Second World War spot, are torpedo bunker is here located. If you would like to take a photo of canons on the beach here, you can do that as well. The region this beach is located is called Syddanmark. It is very easy to get to this location with your vehicle and a small parking place awaits you directly at the beach. This beach is 1 km long and 15 m wide. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at around 10 m. A typical Danish beach infrastructure is located here. Restaurants are not available directly on the beach, but a few hundred meters away in the background. You also have some options for accommodation here, mainly as apartments. And remember, always enjoy your beach with BeachRex.', 3929, 'en', 1),
(546, 'Welcome to a very special beach. Why? Let me explain it to you. On the shoreline of the Danish city Fredericia you can explore a beautiful, modern and unique sandy beach called Strand &Oslash;sterstrand. It is recommended for a family user type who is searching for a city beach with lots of beach infrastructure, you even have a sauna on the beach. The city Fredericia is part of the region Syddanmark. If you like such beaches this location is easy to access with any kind of vehicle, and you can park only 10 m away from the beach on a payable parking spot. The beach has a total length of 750m and is 40 m wide. You have two options to enter the water, either you do it by the beach or you use a water ladder from the pier. The point of swim is between 0 and 10 m. On this beach you really have lots of beach infrastructure and services. If you are a fan of beach volleyball or beach football you can enjoy this sport here. They have installed even a small outdoor fitness here, awesome. A small bistro is also here and for your accommodation you can choose between apartments and hotels in the city centre. And remember, always use the BeachRex platform to find your dream beach.&nbsp;', 3930, 'en', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(547, 'Just a little bit outside the Danish city Fredericia, a town by the Baltic Sea,&nbsp;in the middle of small Peninsula,&nbsp;you have a family beach called Strand Trelde N&aelig;s. This part of Denmark belongs to the region Syddanmark. This beach is located next to a big forest, with lots of tall trees. If you like such beaches you can access this location with any kind of vehicle and leave it on a large parking place only 200m away from the beach. The path to the beach is easy, very comfortable. The main surface on the beach is sand, but you also have some grass and some small stones. All together this beach is 750 meters long and up to 30 meters wide. The water entry is nice and you can start swimming at around 10 meters, after entering the water. The beach infrastructure located here is a typical Danish standard. You don&#39;t have any options to get something to eat or drink here, except in the camp nearby, which is also the only possible accommodation nearby. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach.&nbsp;', 3931, 'en', 1),
(548, 'Denmark has many beautiful beaches. There is one fact witch is common for all of them, they don&#39;t have any natural shadow, but this is not the case for this beach. If you&#39;re the one who is looking for a sandy beach with trees on the beach, then the beach Strand Albuen is here the Danish exception and we would strongly recommend you to visit it. It is located in the region Syddanmark, near the city Vejle. It is very easy to reach it, no matter the vehicle you&#39;re travelling with and you can park almost directly in front of the beach only a few metres away. The surface on the beach a mixture of sand and grass and you also have many trees here to protect you from the sun. Altogether the beach is 200m long and 50 m wide. It is a flat beach with a nice water entry and the point of swim being at 5 m. You have lots of beach infrastructure and services here, included is an outdoor fitness, a volleyball field, a bistro and some fast food. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach, but in the surrounding area. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach.&nbsp;', 3932, 'en', 1),
(549, 'The Danish beach Strand Tirsb&aelig;k is another sandy family beach near the city Vejle with natural shadow. It is a very popular place for families and those ones who love to have a picnic on the beach. It is part of the region Syddanmark. If you would like to visit it, it is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place right in front of the beach. The beach has a total length of 250 m and is 20 m wide. It is a flat beach with a nice water entry and a point of swim at 10 m. The beach infrastructure here is a typical Danish standard, with many benches to have a picnic. You also have a small food kiosk here and accommodation is available in the form of apartments in the surrounding area. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach.&nbsp;', 3933, 'en', 1),
(550, 'Strand Daugaard is the name of the Danish sandy beach in the region Midtjylland. It is very close to the village Daug&aring;rd and it is easy accessible with any kind of vehicle. Only 100m away from the beach a large parking place is available. Down the path to the beach you also have some beach typical Danish infrastructure, like toilets, sport fields, benches and a lifeguard equipment. Altogether the beach has a total length of 250m and is 5 m wide. Close to the beach the main surface is sand but you also have a large grass field with some benches for your picnic. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is at 10 m. Restaurants or similar are not available here, but you have some options for accommodation, like a camping ground nearby. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3934, 'en', 1),
(551, 'Juelsminde is a town located in the south of the region Midtjylland. It has a long sandy beach Strand Sandbjerg Vig. It stretches for 2 kilometres in length and is 50 m wide. Beside the sand you also have here lots of grass. If you are searching for this kind of beach and you would like to visit it, you can drive here with any kind of vehicle and leave it next to the beach on a large parking place. On this location you have a Danish typical beach infrastructure. The water entry here is very nice and the point of swim starts already at 10 m. You also have a bistro and a fast food kiosk directly on the beach. Nearby you can also find a camping ground and some apartments for your accommodation.', 3935, 'en', 1),
(552, 'If the shape of a beach is important to you, and you&#39;re searching for Danish beaches with beautiful bays, then the beach Strand Husodde is the one for you. It is located in the region Midtjylland near the town Horsens. It is a family type beach, is easy to access with any kind of vehicle and you can park almost directly in front of the beach only a few metres away. The main surface here is sand, but you also have some grass where nice benches are placed for your picnic time. In total the beach has a length of 200m and is on some places even 50 m wide. You have two options to go into the water, either by the beach or by using a water ladder on the pier. The point of swim is between 0 and 30 m. You have a typical Danish beach infrastructure here, no restaurants or food kiosks, but different types of accommodation, like a camping ground nearby. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach.&nbsp;', 3936, 'en', 1),
(553, 'Once you visit the Danish beach Strand Saksild you will understand why it is so popular amongst the tourist. Obviously it is a sandy beach with a mixture of white and brown sand and it stretches for several kilometers and can be up to 30 meters wide. It is also popular amongst the families with small children. Not only do you have a children playground on the beach but the seabed is very flat which makes it safe for small children to play in the water safely. If you like all those facts, you will find this beach in the region Midtjylland near the city Odder. It&#39;s very easy to get here with any kind of vehicle and you can park on a very large parking place only a few meters away from the beach. Because of the flat seabed the point of swim on this beach is some 100 meters away. You have lots of beach infrastructure around this beach, also many types of restaurants, camping grounds and many apartments nearby.', 3937, 'en', 1),
(554, 'Strand Ajstrup is a Danish sandy beach near the city Beder-Malling in the region Midtjylland. It is best suitable for families who love to have the parking place on the beach and closeby a campground or an apartment. This beach is several km long and up to 15m wide. It stretches along the village Ajstrup. If you would like to visit it, it is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and you can park only a few metres away from the beach. Along the whole parking place you also have the most beach infrastructure, which is here present in a typical danish standard. The water entry is nice and you can also use a water ladder from the pier to get into the watter. The swimming point is at around 10 metres. Restaurants or similar are not available here so bring all your stuff with you.', 3938, 'en', 1),
(555, 'Near the Danish town Aarhus you have a very special beach called Strand Moesg&aring;rd. It is a sandy beach with a total length of 1 km and a maximum width of 50 m. The beach itself is very interesting, but also the road which leads to the beach will give you some excitement. It runs through a very old and beautiful Forest with specially formed trees. It is certainly worth to park your car beside the road and take a picture with the trees to post it on your social media account. The closest village to this beach is H&oslash;jbjerg and it is located in the region Midtjylland. It is very easy to reach this location with any kind of vehicle and you can park on very large parking place only 50 m away from the beach. Around the parking place you also have most of the beach infrastructure, as well as a bistro and a fast food kiosk. The acess to the beach is easy. On the beach you have obviously the sand, and in the background also some grass fields. The beach has a normal inclination, the water entry is nice and the point of swim is at 10 m. You can also use a water ladder from the pier to go into the water. Accommodation is not available around the beach but in the neighbouring villages.', 3939, 'en', 1),
(556, 'In the middle of a beautiful forest, near the city Aarhus, a beautiful sandy beach called Strand H&oslash;jbjerg is waiting for your visit. It is part of the Danish region Midtjylland and it is located near the village H&oslash;jbjerg. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle and you have parking places along the street and some smaller parking lots. From the parking spot to the beach it takes you some 100m in length and some 15 m in height difference to reach the beach. You can either use the steps or go by a longer path. The beach has a total length of 1 km and is on some spots 40 m wide. Along the whole stretch of the beach you have many small bays. The point of swim is at 10 m. A Danish typical beach infrastructure is available here, you also have a pier with a ladder here. Restaurants or similar are not available on the beach as well as there are no options for accommodation directly on the beach, but a little bit further away in the neighbouring villages. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 3940, 'en', 1),
(557, 'The Danish beach Strand Fortevej is a sandy beach located in the town Risskov. This location is part of the region Midtjylland. The whole surrounding around the beach is family oriented, with lots of surface for a picnic on the grass, sport fields, children playground and many beach infrastructure. It is very easy to get to this location also with a motorhome and you have a large parking place only 200m away from the beach. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it is up to 20 mm wide. You have a nice water entry here and the point of swim is at 20 m. You can also use the water ladder on the pier. If you get hungry here you also have the option to buy something to eat in a bistro. Accommodation is available in the surrounding area mainly as rooms or apartments.', 3941, 'en', 1),
(558, 'In windy conditions and with the seabed being here so flat this Danish beach Strand Sk&aelig;ring is just ideal for some serious water sports, like kiteboarding and windsurfing. This location is part of the region Midtjylland. If you are searching for this type of beaches you can arrive here with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome and simply park only 30 m away from the beach. Although the main surface here is sand you also have some grass fields. Very little beach infrastructure is located here. In the summertime maybe some fast food kiosks arrive and possibly you can rent an apartment in the neighbourhood. The beach has a total length of 1 km and is on some places 20m wide. The water entry is comfortable and because of the flat seabed the point of swim is more than 100m away. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3942, 'en', 1),
(559, 'Strand Sletterhage is a very special Danish beach. It is quite different from the other ones. Not only you have here different types of pebbles and stones on the beach, you also have a spectacular view with the lighthouse next to the beach. Another positive fact is the parking place which is directly at the beach. If this is the kind of beach you were looking for, you can find it in the region Midtjylland on the peninsula close to the village Knebel. It&#39;s very easy to get here with any kind of vehicle and motorhomes also have a place here. The beach has a total length of several km and can be up to 50 m wide. The water entry is not as comfortable because you need to walk over some large stones. The beach infrastructure is here a typically danish standard. A small bistro kiosk is available here to serve you some food or drinks. If you&#39;re looking for accommodations you can rent apartments or houses nearby.', 3943, 'en', 1),
(560, 'Near the Danish town Ebeltoft, in the region Midtjylland, you can explore the sandy beach Strand Bogens. It is a very simple beach and is mostly recommended for those one who like to have more nature than buildings around them. A parking place is just next to the beach and it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. Here you also have some basic beach infrastructure. No restaurants or accommodation are available on the beach or nearby. The beach has a total length of 1 km and is 10 m wide. The water entry is nice and you can also use the water ladder from the pier to get into the water. The swimming point is at around 10 m. If you have a boat you can also use a water ramp to get it into the water. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach. Enjoy your beach.&nbsp;', 3944, 'en', 1),
(561, 'In the Danish region Midtjylland, close to the city Ebeltoft, you have a very long sandy beach, called Strand Vib&aelig;k at your disposal. The parking place, which is very large and is just next to the beach, is very easy to reach, you can also park your motorhome here as long as it is not heavier than 2 tonnes. This beach has a total length of several kilometres and it is 10 m wide. The water entry is nice and the point of swimming is at around 15 m. You have here a typical Danish beach infrastructure. Restaurants are not available directly on the beach, but more in the background. Accommodation is available in many forms; a campsite is also nearby. If you are a fan of beach volleyball, you will admire this beach. The volleyball field is located between the parking place and the beach. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach.<br />\n&nbsp;', 3945, 'en', 1),
(562, 'If you are searching for a very natural danish sandy beach with lots of surface and almost no buildings around, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Ahl. You need to go to the region Midtjylland, close to the city Ebeltoft. This location is easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and a parking place is only 100 metres away from the beach. The beach infrastructure is located around the path to the beach and it is a typical danish standard. The beach itself is very flat and you have lots of surface available on a length of 750 m and 50 m widthness. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at around 50 m, maybe on some spots even further away. Here you have no restaurants or similar but you can rent an apartment or a house nearby.', 3946, 'en', 1),
(563, 'You won&#39;t get a better view of a beach from your car, you can&acute;t possibly park more closely to the beach and have a better unique beach experience then on this danish beach Strand Boeslum. It is located in the region Midtjylland near the city Ebeltoft. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have basically two options to park. Either you do it on a large parking place in a small forest, or you park by the road next to the beach. The beach is several kilometres long and up to 10m wide. Although the main surface is sand, you also have many small pebbles here so you can choose on which surface you wanna lay down your towel. The water entry is on some places tricky, because you have large stones in the water and the swimming point is at around 15 meters. A typical danish beach infrastructure is located here, with a small fast food kiosk nearby. For your accommodation you have the options to stay in a camp or rent a house or an apartment nearby.', 3947, 'en', 1),
(564, 'This Danish sandy beach Strand Polderrev is a true beauty. The green dunes, the white sand, the crystal clear Baltic Sea and the smiling sun, create a unique unforgettable experience. If you want it to be a part of your memory, you need to drive towards the city Gren&aring; in the region Midtjylland. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you have a parking place right next to the beach. The access to the beach is easy and it is also suitable for handicapped people, not only to access the beach but also to go into the water via a concrete ramp. The main surface is sand, which is a mixture of white sand and brown sand. The total length is several km and it is up to 25m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 30 metres. You have also some beach infrastructure here and it is a typical Danish standard. Restaurants are not available directly on the beach but more in the background. You have many options for accommodation, a camp ground is nearby as well as some apartments and houses, and even a hotel.<br />\n&nbsp;', 3948, 'en', 1),
(565, 'The danish beach Strand Sangstrup is a very special beach with a unique surface for danish standards. The slope here is very steep and it is totally made of large pebbles and cliffs surrounding it. The region, where this beach is located is called Midtjylland and it is near the city Gren&aring;. It is not a family, beach but more an adventure type beach. You have very little beach infrastructure here, not even a toilet. It is very easy to get here with any kind of vehicle and you have a parking place right next to the beach. The beach has a total length of 1 km and is up to 25m wide. Because of the very steep inclination of the beach and the large stones in the water, the water entry is not as comfortable and the point of swim is already at 3 m. Restaurants or similar are also not present here, but you have nearby a bed and breakfast accommodation.', 3949, 'en', 1),
(566, 'Strand Br&oslash;ndstrup is one of the many Danish beaches in the vicinity of the city Gren&aring; in the region Midtjylland. It is best known for its sandy surface and its immense length, several kilometres and width of some 40 m. If you like such beach characteristics you should pack your beach stuff, enter your vehicle, no matter what the type of vehicle, a motorhome is also an option, and visit it. When you arrive here you have a large parking place at your disposal only 200m away from the beach. Around the parking place is also the most beach infrastructure, a typical Danish standard. When on the beach, you have a nice water entry and the point of swim is at around 30 m. On the beach or nearby you don&#39;t have any type of restaurants, but you have some options for accommodation like a camping ground and some apartments and houses. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and remember to always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach.', 3950, 'en', 1),
(567, 'Strand B&oslash;sholmstein is a sandy beach recommended for families. It stretches over several kilometres and can be up to 25m wide. It is located close to the city Glesborg in the region Midtjylland. Families with small children will love this beach, especially because of the flat seabed, where the point of swim is far out away, at least 100 meters or even further. Most of the beach infrastructure is by the parking place. No matter what&#39;s the vehicle you&#39;re traveling with, this parking place is easy to reach and it is only 50 m away from the beach. Restaurants are not available directly on the beach, but there are some closer to the village centre. Accommodation is available near the beach in the form of apartments and houses, and near the village centre you also have a camp. Enjoy your beach time in Denmark. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next beach vacation.&nbsp;', 3951, 'en', 1),
(568, 'If you&#39;re searching for a Danish sandy beach close to a popular touristic destination, we would suggest you to visit the beach Strand &Oslash;ster Hurup. It is located near the city Hadsund in the north Danish region Nordjylland. To get here with your vehicle, also a motorhome, it&#39;s not a challenge. You have many options to park your car, most of them very close to the beach. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have several kilometres of length and around 10 m of width available. The water entry is very nice and because of the flat seabed the point of swim is very far out away, even more than 100m. This place has lots of beach infrastructure; you even have a small marina here. Restaurants and similar types are available in many different shapes and forms. Accommodation is available here also many different forms, a camping ground is included. Enjoy your beach vacation, and remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach.&nbsp;', 3952, 'en', 1),
(569, 'If you like beaches with a very flat seabed, where the point of swim is far out away, and you also would like to be surrounded with nature, we suggest you to go to the Danish beach Strand Toft &Oslash;st. The region where this beach is located is called Nordjylland and it is close to the city Hadsund. No matter what the vehicle you&#39;re travelling with, the parking place of the beach is easy to reach. You can park only 50 m away from the beach on a large parking place. Most of the beach infrastructure, which is a typical Danish standard, is located around the parking place. The beach has a total length of several kilometres and is up to 15 m wide. The water entry, because of the flat seabed, is very nice and the point of swim is more than 100m away. Restaurants or similar are not located here, also you don&#39;t have any accommodation on the beach directly, but in the neighbouring village in many different forms. Enjoy your beach vacations, and remember always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 3953, 'en', 1),
(570, 'Strand Asaa is another Danish Beach with very flat seabed. In the case of strong winds this beach could potentially be a hot spot for kiteboarding, otherwise it is certainly interesting for families with small children, who can play in the water safely. Many visitors, equipped with large cameras, come here also to watch birds. Nordjylland is the name of the region where this special beach is located and it is closely to the village Asaa. If you have decided to give it a visit, it is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, and you have a large parking place only 100m away from the beach. Motorhomes are also welcomed, like it is usual in Denmark. There is a wooden path which leads to the beach. Altogether the beach is 500 m long and up to 15 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is more than 100m away. You also have some beach infrastructure here; a small marina is also nearby. A coffee bar is also not far away, and in the village you have a camping ground and some apartments or houses to rent. Enjoy your beach time and remember to always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach.', 3954, 'en', 1),
(571, 'Near the Danish City S&aelig;by in the north region Nordjylland a sandy beach Strand Lyngs&aring; is close by. It is suitable for families and those one who would like to collect some shells on the beach, here you have plenty of them. You can access this location very easy with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome, and simply leave your vehicle on a large parking place only 30 m away from the beach. The beach is very long, altogether several kilometres, with a maximum width of 30 m. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at 50 m. Around the parking place you also have a Danish typical beach infrastructure. Bring your food and drinks with you, here you have no options to buy anything. If you would like to stay here for longer you can rent an apartment or a house nearby. Enjoy your beach vacation with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 3955, 'en', 1),
(572, 'Although the name for this Danish beach is Strand Munkevang, according to what the main surface on the beach is, it should be like The beach shell. Why? Shells everywhere, literally everywhere, tons and tons of all kind of shapes and forms. If this is what you are looking for to be on a beach, we recommend you to visit this beach, which is located in the city S&aelig;by in the north region Nordjylland. It is very easy to get to this beach, no matter what the vehicle, and you can park directly in front of the beach on a large parking place. You have very little beach infrastructure here, toilets are missing, so less than basic. The beach has a total length of 500 m and is 25 m wide. You really need to watch where you&#39;re stepping on this beach, because the shells, some of them sharp, are everywhere, especially in the water. The point of swim is here also far away, and is at around 100 m. Restaurants are not available here, close by you have a marina, some accommodation options, like apartments and houses. Enjoy your beach vacation, and remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 3956, 'en', 1),
(573, 'Nordstrand S&aelig;by is the Danish beach you have to visit if you like to be in a well-developed touristic place, with lots of beach infrastructure and services. Many sport fields are here, a children playground, a swimming pool, different types of restaurants and a hotel directly on the beach. Of course the parking place is also only a few metres away from the beach. You can find this beach in the region Nordjylland in the city S&aelig;by. It is very easy to access this beach with any kind of vehicle. Because of this being a very touristic location the access to the beach is also suitable for handicapped people. The beach has a total length of several km and is up to 30 m wide. You have many small bays here, which give the beach a special character. On the beach you also have a pier with a water ladder. Because of it, the point of swim is between 0 and 15 m. If you would like to spend your holidays here, you have many options to find the right type of accommodation, a camping ground is also nearby. Enjoy your beach vacation and remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 3957, 'en', 1),
(574, 'In Denmark most of the beaches are suited for a family type user. The perfect family beach is certainly the one which has a large and modern children playground as well as same sports fields for the more mature children, all the necessary beach infrastructure, as well as some bistro or similar. If this characteristics are important to you, we would like to point you into the direction of the beach Strand Bratten. The region where this beach is located belongs to Nordjylland, and the closest city is Jerup. Either if you&#39;re travelling with a normal car or a motorhome this beach is easy to reach, and you can park only 100m away from the beach. The access is also suitable for handicapped people. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it is up to 25m wide. The water entry here is very nice and you can enter the water also from the pier via a water ladder. The point of swim is between 0 and 30 m. If you like all those facts about the beach, you can also stay here in an accommodation, mainly in an apartment or a house.', 3958, 'en', 1),
(575, 'Some beaches in Denmark are because of their characteristics more suitable for an adventure type user. Such a beach, a sandy one, is located in the region Nordjylland, close to the city &Aring;lb&aelig;k and goes by the name Strand &Aring;lb&aelig;k. Here you really have almost no beach infrastructure, only a small parking place and the nature surrounding you. You can get to this place with any kind of vehicle, although the parking place is small, some motorhomes can also fit in. From the parking place to the beach you need to walk over dunes, a little bit up a little bit down. The beach is very long, several kilometers, and is up to 50 meters wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at 15 meters. Restaurants are really not available here, but you have some accommodation nearby in the form of apartments or houses.', 3959, 'en', 1),
(576, 'Strand Bunken is a very special Danish beach, with very large dunes, a very large parking place and is best suitable for an adventure user type. Located in the North Danish region Nordjylland, close to the town &Aring;lb&aelig;k, it is a beach which is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. Once you have parked your vehicle it will take you some 200m of walking to reach the beach. You need to walk over some small dunes, between 5 and 10 m height. It&#39;s not the easiest way but if you&#39;re fit enough you can make it. Most of the beach infrastructure is located by the parking place. The beach is very long, several kilometres and up to 15m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 40 m. Bring some food with you, because here you can&#39;t buy any. The only available accommodation nearby is a camp, other types are not available.', 3960, 'en', 1),
(577, 'Although Denmark is quite up in the north of Europe and normally some exotic trees or not present here, in the summertime you have here even a sandy beach with palm trees. So if you are in Denmark and you would like to have some exotic memories from the beach we recommend you to visit the beach Palmestranden in the city Frederikshavn. The Region this exotic beach is located is called Nordjylland. No matter what the vehicle you\'re travelling with, this location is easy to reach and a very large parking place, 200m from the beach, is at your disposal. Most of the beach infrastructure is located around the parking place, also the sport fields and a Fast Food kiosk, with additional ice cream services. The beach has a total length of 500 m and is 25 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 10 m. Accommodation is not available nearby but more in the city centre in the form of hotels and similar.', 3961, 'en', 2),
(578, 'Skagen is a danish city on the north most point in Denmark. It is a very interesting place because here two seas meet. On one side you have the Baltic Sea on the other you have the North Sea. Lots of sandy beaches are located around this point. Most of them are family oriented and are very easy to reach. The same is also true for the beach Strand Damstederne, which is located a little bit outside the city Skagen. This north point of Denmark is part of the region Nordjylland. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park almost directly at the beach on a small parking place. The beach is only 50 m away. On this point the beach is several km long and up to 20 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at 10 metres. The beach infrastructure is located around the parking place and it is a typical danish standard. Because this beach is located in a more remote area you don&#39;t have any restaurants or accommodation nearby, but some are a few kilometres away in the city Skagen.', 3962, 'en', 1),
(579, 'This beach in the far north Denmark is one of top 10 attractions in Denmark. It is located near the city Skagen in the region Nordjylland and goes by the name Strand Grenen. It is the place where two seas collide, one from the Baltic and one from the North. It is a very crowded place and people from all around the world come to visit it. This location is, because of its popularity, very organised, very easy to reach and you have multiple parking options for all kind of vehicles. It will take you some 200m to get to the beach. And to reach the point where the seas collide it is a 1,5 km long walk down the coastline. The beach is recommended for families. All together the total length of the beach is several km and has a maximum width of 75 m, on some occasions even more, because the beach is changing constantly. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is dependent on the location you enter the water, but it should be no more than 30 metres. Most of the beach infrastructure is located around the parking place. You also have there many types of restaurants. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach. A camping ground is nearby and all other options are available in the city Skagen.', 3963, 'en', 1),
(580, 'Around the Danish City Skagen there are many beautiful beaches, most of them are made of sand, but you also have some with small pebbles. If you are interested is such a beach we would like to point you towards the beach Strand Højen. This whole area is part of the region Nordjylland. To get to this location is very easy. Although the parking place is quite small, some smaller motorhomes can also park here. You have only a few steps from the parking place to the beach. In total the beach is several kilometres long and can be up to 30 metres wide. Because of the stones in the water the water entry is not as comfortable and the point of swim is at around 20 m. Around the parking place you also have some beach infrastructure and a small Bistro. Accommodation is also nearby in the form of apartments, houses or a hotel. ', 3964, 'en', 2),
(581, 'Strand Kandestederne is a very special beach near the city Skagen, up in the far north of Denmark. It is a very flat beach and you&#39;re even allowed to access the beach with your vehicle and actually drive on the beach itself. The region where this beach is located is called Nordjylland. No matter what the vehicle you are driving this beach is easy accessible. You have two options to park, either you do it by the road or on the beach itself. The total length you have at your disposal is several kilometres and around 50 m of width. The water entry is very nice and because of the flat seabed the point of swim is far out away and is at least at 100m maybe even further. The most beach infrastructure is by the parking place by the road before you enter the beach, in summertime a small bistro is here open. Nearby you also have a restaurant. Accommodation is also available nearby in the form of apartments or a hotel.', 3965, 'en', 1),
(582, 'Many Danish beaches are special and unique. The same is also true for the beach Strand Skiveren. This beach is very flat, it has a width of more than 50 meters and here you\'re allowed to park your vehicle on the beach. It is Located in the North Danish region Nordjylland, close to the city Ålbæk on the west coast facing towards the north Sea. The total length here is several kilometers. Because it\'s so flat you have a very nice water entry and the point of swim is at 75 meters or more. Some basic beach infrastructure is located close to the beach. Restaurants are not available here, but you have some accommodation nearby in the form of a camp and some houses.', 3966, 'en', 2),
(583, 'Strand Tversted is a danish beach located on the west coastline of the North Sea in the region Nordjylland. It is sandy beach recommended for families and those one who like flat beaches and would like to leave their vehicle parked on the beach. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and in the summertime, when the waves are smaller, you can park directly on the beach. The total length of the beach is several kilometers and when the wind is not blowing strong, the widness is 100 meters. Because of the flat beach and the flat seabed the water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at least 50 m. You also have some beach infrastructure here, but not on the beach directly, it is close to the road. This is also the point where you will find some fast food kiosk. Close to the beach you also have several accommodation options, like hotels, apartments and even a camping ground.', 3967, 'en', 1),
(584, 'The north danish city Hirtshals, when facing to the west the North Sea, has a very special and unique beach with 10 metres high cliffs. It is a sandy beach recommended for family users, although on some spots for more an adventure type user. It is located in the north region Nordjylland. It is very easy to reach this location with any kind of vehicle. You have multiple options to park your car, either you do it by the road or on a parking place with the height regulation, only a few metres away from the beach. Because here are high cliffs you can access the beach via steps. The main surface on the beach is sand. The total length is several km with a width of 50 m. On some spots you have rocks on the beach on some there is only sand. The water entry is nice and the point of swimming is at around 30 m. You have some basic beach infrastructure nearby. Some options to get something to eat or to drink are also available and you don&#39;t need to worry about accommodation, because here are plenty different types of it.', 3968, 'en', 1),
(585, 'If you&#39;re searching for an almost endless sandy beach in the danish North we would advise you to visit the beach Strand Tornby. It is a must go if you are near the town Hirtshals in the region Nordjylland. This beach is very popular in the summertime and it is accessible with any kind of vehicle. You have two options to park your vehicle, either you do it in front of a restaurant on a parking place or you simply drive to the beach and park on it. You really have lots of surface area here, with a total length of several kilometres and a width of more than 100 m. This beach is very flat and so is the seabed, which makes a pleasant water entry and a swimming point at around 50 m or more. A typical danish standard beach infrastructure is located here. Nearby you also have a restaurant and some accommodation in the form of apartments or houses.', 3969, 'en', 1),
(586, 'L&oslash;kken is the name of the danish city up in the far north region Nordjylland. It has a very beautiful sandy beach Strand L&oslash;kken right in the centre of the city. The beach has lots of surface, it is very long and very wide. No matter what the vehicle you are travelling with this location is very easy to reach. You can leave your car on a parking place close to beach. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and on some places it is more than 100 m wide. It is a very flat beach with a very easy entry and a point of swim at around 50 m. Because it is so close to them city centre you also have lots of beach infrastructure and services. Different types of restaurants are also nearby and you also have different types of accommodation to choose from, a camp and a hotel included.', 3970, 'en', 1),
(587, 'Not many beaches in the world have such unique characteristics like this danish beach Strand Gr&oslash;nh&oslash;j. Where in the world do you have a beach which is several km long, is more than 100 m wide and you can actually park on it. If you would like to have this experience you need to drive to the far north danish region Nordjylland and head towards the city L&oslash;kken. No matter what the vehicle you are travelling with it&#39;s very easy to find this location and even more easy to find the right parking place for you on the beach. Because this is a very flat beach the water entry is also very nice. The point of swim is at around 50 m. Most of the beach infrastructure is located around a fast food kiosk, which is also the only option to get something to eat. Maybe in the summer time some driving kiosk is also available on the beach. You also have some accommodation options available nearby, mainly as an apartment or a house and not far away is also camp.', 3971, 'en', 1),
(588, 'In the danish region Nordjylland you have a few places, on the west coast which is facing the North Sea, where you can park your vehicle directly on the beach. Not many such beaches are available in the world, but Denmark has plenty of them. If you&#39;re a fan of such beach characteristics, we recommend you to have your next beach experience on the beach Strand Blokhus. You can access this beach with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome and simple drive on the beach and park wherever you want. This place has lots of beach surface. You have several kilometres of length and more than 100m of widthness available. It&#39;s a very flat area, which makes the water entry very nice and the point of swim is at around 50 m. Most of the beach infrastructure is present around the beach vehicle entry point. There you also have lots of different types of restaurants, some close to the beach, some in the city centre. Because this is a very popular place you also have plenty of different accommodation options to choose from.', 3972, 'en', 1),
(589, 'The Danish beach Strand Slettestrand is because of its beach surface quite unique. Not only is it very long and very wide, it is also very flat and it has a special mixture of sand and small pebbles so that it is really hard to say if it is a sand or a pebbles beach. If you don\'t mind the confusion about the surface you can find this beach close to the city Fjerritslev up in the north region Nordjylland. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a parking place right at the beach. The access to the beach is also possible for handicapped people. It is several kilometres long and more than 100 m wide. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is at 30 m or further. Some beach infrastructure is at the beach some more close to the village center. Also more closely to the village centre are different types of restaurants, as well as different options for accommodation, a hotel included. ', 3973, 'en', 2),
(590, 'Have you ever been to a sandy beach where next to you you have a wind turbine. If not and you would like to have this experience we suggest you to visit danish beach Strand Hanstholm. It is part of the North Denmark region Nordjylland and is close to the city Hanstholm. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle especially it is popular amongst motorhomes users. You have Lots of space to park your vehicle here, which can be done only a few metres away from the beach. This beach is very long in total several kilometres and can be up to 75 m wide. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at approximately 50 m. You have Only basic beach infrastructure here, like toilets. Restaurants and accommodation are not available nearby, but in the city itself. ', 3974, 'en', 2),
(591, 'The Danish beach Strand Klitmøller is known for its mixed beach surface. If you\'re a fan of a sandy beach with small and big stones mixed within then this is the right place for you. It can be found in the region Nordjylland close to the city Thisted. It\'s very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a small parking place some 50 m away from the beach. The Access to the beach can be a little bit tricky, because the sand dunes constantly close up the entry point. Because of this fact it is also more recommended for an adventurer type user. All the beach infrastructure is located around the parking place. Once you get to the beach you have a very large area, because the which is several kilometres long and up to 75 metres wide on some point even more. Many stones of different sizes are in the water so choose your water entry Wisley. The point of swimming is at around 50 m. Bring also your food with you, because in the nearby area you have no option to buy anything. Many Different options of accommodation or available, close by is also a camp.', 3975, 'en', 2),
(592, 'Denmark is full of surprises, especially when it comes to beaches on the west coast or the North sea coast. This one is unique, because it&#39;s one of the few ones which beside the beach offers you also a swimming pool with fresh sea water directly on the beach. If you think this beach is the one you would like to visit, we recommend you to drive towards the region Nordjylland in the direction of the city Thisted, and head to the beach Strand Vorup&oslash;r. The whole area around the beach is very friendly towards parking your vehicle, no matter what the type. Motorhomes can also park here. From the parking place to the beach it is only 50 m of walking. Some beach infrastructure, like toilets and showers, is located around the parking place, some is directly on the beach. On the beach you have lots of surface, the total length is several km, and the widthness is more than 100 m. The water entry is nice, no mater if you go to swim by the beach or by the swimming pool, and according to that, the point of swim is between 0 (if you use the ladder) or more 10 metres. Many different types of restaurants are available near the beach, the same diversity is also true when it comes to accommodation, where you have multiple options to choose from.', 3976, 'en', 1),
(593, 'Strand Agger is very interesting Danish beach with lots of beach infrastructure and services all around the place. Here you can also admire a fishers memorial, facing the North Sea. It is also different from other beaches in Denmark because it consists of several smaller bays, with lots of waves blockers to protect the beach. If such beach sounds interesting to you it is located in the North Danish region Nordjylland, close to the city Vestervig. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park not far away from the beach on several parking grounds. A small path, which crosses the Dunes, it can be also used by handicapped people, leads you towards the beach entry. Parking place is also point where you have the most infrastructure, restaurants or similar included. The beach has a total length of several kilometres and a maximum width of 100 m. The surface is a mixture of sand and different size of pebbles. The water entry is nice and because of the slidly steep inclination the point of swim is already at 10 metres. If you like all those characteristics you also have many options for accommodation here, a camp and hotel included in the list. ', 3977, 'en', 2),
(594, 'The danish Beach Strand Thyboron in the region Midtjylland is a very interesting and unique beach, mainly because of its strategic position and the history surrounding it. A famous first world war ship battle whas faught not far away from the beach and you have an intresting sea war museum right next to the beach. If You like all those facts around the beach and you would like to visit it we can provide you with some more additional facts. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included. You can Park on several parking places only 100 m away from the beach. Around the parking place you also have all the necessary beach infrastructure. the beach has a total length of several kilometers and is 75 meters wide. The main surface on the beach is sand, but you also have some small pebbles. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is at 10 m. Because this place being so popular you have many different types of restaurants. And if you would like to stay here for longer you also have some options for accommodation.', 3978, 'en', 2),
(595, 'If you like high cliffs on a sandy beach with astonishing views, you really need to visit this danish beach Strand Bovbjerg. It is really a unique beach and a unique place, either for a visit of the beach or just for a day trip or to take a walk by the pictures coastline. This location, which is near the town Lemvig in the region Midtjylland, is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, and you can park on a large parking place beside the road. Very little beach infrastructure is located here and you need to take a walk of around 200 meters in length and 40 m in height difference down on some wooden steps. When taking into account all the facts about this beach it is more suitable for an adventure user type. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it is 75 metres wide. Although the main surface on the beach is sand, you also have some small pebbles. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is already at 5 m. Accommodation is not available here but you have by the parking place, near the Lighthouse, a coffee bar.', 3979, 'en', 1),
(596, 'Denmark has also some beaches which are suitable for surfing sport. In the region Midtjylland, close to the city Lemvig, you have a sandy beach Strand H&oslash;fde Q. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, motorhome owners especially will love this place. A large parking place is just next to the beach, here you also have the main beach infrastructure located. The beach has a total length of several kilometres and is up to 75 m wide. The main surface here is sand, but some small pebbles are as well present. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is already at 5 m. Close to the beach you don&#39;t have any accommodation available, neither any restaurants.', 3980, 'en', 1),
(597, 'On the danish west coast, in the region Midtjylland, you have a very nice sandy beach Strand Thorsminde, near to the city Ulfborg. It is best recommended for families. No matter what the vehicle you are travelling with, this location is easy to reach and you have multiple options to park your car only 100m away from the beach. Like it is in Denmark usual, most of the beach infrastructure is located around the parking place, a children playground included. Close to the parking place you also have some restaurants and an ice cream shop. The access to the beach is easy and handicapped people can also enter the beach. The beach is very long, several kilometres and on the widest part 100 m wide. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at 5 m. If you would like to stay here for longer you also have many different accommodation options to choose from.', 3981, 'en', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(598, 'If you&#39;re searching for a peaceful, not crowded, sandy danish beach in the region Midtjylland, we would like to point you towards the beach Strand Spidsbjerg. It is located on the danish west coast, close to the city Ulfborg. Very close to the beach, you have a parking place for around 30 vehicles, smaller motorhomes can also park here. From the main road it takes you 1 km on a dirt road to access the parking place of the beach. Because of being a very remote beach, it is more suitable for an adventure user type . Around the parking place you also have some beach infrastructure. It is a very long beach, several kilometres long and 100 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at 10 m. Restaurants or similar are not available on the beach or nearby. Accommodation is available close by in a village in the form of apartments or houses.', 3982, 'en', 1),
(599, 'A nice sandy beach Strand Vedersø  is waiting for your arrival on the Danish west coast in the region Midtjylland. If you are anywhere near the city Tim and you\'re travelling with your family we recommend you to visit it. The parking place, some 200m away from the beach is very large and welcomes also motorhomes. Around the parking place is also the spot where you have a danish typical beach infrastructure. The access to the beach is not the easiest one because you need to walk over a 15 m high Dune. If you like long sandy beaches you will admire this one because it is several kilometres long and up to 100 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at 10 metres. Bring your food and drinks with you because here you have no options to buy any. For accommodation you have several options, a typical rent of a Danish house and even a hotel and a camp.', 3983, 'en', 2),
(600, 'Some Danish beaches are popular because of the object on them which reminds us the Second World War, like bunkers. Strand Kryle, which is located in the region Midtjylland, close to the city Ringkobing is such one example. If you like such beaches, no matter what the vehicle you are travelling with this location is very easy to reach and you can park on a large parking place some 200m away from the beach. The access to the beach leads you over a dune, which is 10 m in height and not the easiest one to cross over. The main surface on the beach is sand, but you also have some small pebbles. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it is 100 m wide. It\'s a beach with different types of inclination. Mostly it is a flat beach, which is also true for the seabed. Because of this fact the water entry is nice and the point of swim is far out away at around 75 m. Most of the beach infrastructure is around the parking place. Here you have no restaurants, but you have some accommodation options, like renting a Danish beach house.', 3984, 'en', 2),
(601, 'The danish beach Strand S&oslash;ndervig is a very popular tourist destination on the west coast. It is also the place where you can for 3 months in a year admire the sand sculptures close to the beach. This place is full of various touristic services, especially when it comes to all kinds of restaurants and different accommodation options. If you like such characteristics, this location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple parking options around the place. It will take you some 300m of walking before you reach the beach. Most of the beach infrastructure is right at the entry point to the beach. It is a very long and wide beach. The total length is several km and it is more than 100m wide. Close to the water point, where you enter the sea, it gets very flat, which makes the entry very comfortable. The point of swim is at around 50 m, especially because of the flat seabed.', 3985, 'en', 1),
(602, 'The Danish Beach Strand Lyngvig  with the famous Lighthouse Lyngvig Fyr is a very popular tourist attraction. around the Lighthouse  you also have a small Museum and some children playgrounds. The beach is recommended for a family user type. If you like all those characteristics we can give you some tips how to find this beach. It is located on the west coast of Denmark in the region Midtjylland close to the city Hvide Sande. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place only 400 m away from the beach. The path to the beach goes over 15 m high dunes and it is not the easiest way, especially for the older ones. The beach has or total length of several kilometres and is 100 m wide. On some parts it is quite flat especially by the water entry which makes the going to water very comfortable. The point of swim is at 30 metres. Most of the beach infrastructure is located around the parking place, there you also have a museum and a coffee bar. And in the surrounding area you can rent a house for your accommodation.', 3986, 'en', 2),
(603, 'Have you ever been on a sandy beach with three 150m tall wind turbines next to you. If not and you would like to have this experience  we can present you the Danish  beach Strand Hvide Sande nord. It is Located on the west coast of the Danish  region Midtjylland, right next to the city Hvide Sande. No matter what the vehicle you\'re travelling with this location is easy to reach also with the Motorhome and you have a large parking place only 50 m away from the beach. On the parking place and around the beach  you have very little  beach infrastructure. The total length of the beach is several km  and it is more than 100 m wide. The inclination is normal, so is the water entry and the point of swim is at 15 m. Restaurants are not available on the beach or close by, but you have some accommodation the city itself available.', 3987, 'en', 2),
(604, 'In the Danish City Hvide Sande on the west coast Line you have a very interesting location for some water sports. The ones who like kitesurfing and windsurfing are located on the east side of the city, which is facing the Ringkøbing fjord, the Surfers are located on the west side on the North Sea. This area is part of the region Midtjylland. You can access this location where easy with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place close to the beach. It will take you some 200m of walking over a 10 m high dune to reach the beach. It is a very long Beach, several kilometres, which is also very wide, more than 100 metres. On most parts the beach is very flat, because of that the water entry is very comfortable and the point of swim is at 30 m. Most of the beach infrastructure is located around the parking place and here you also have a coffee bar and a Bistro. Accommodation is also available in the area, mainly as apartments or houses.', 3988, 'en', 2),
(605, 'The danish city Hvide Sande on the west coast in the region Midtjylland, with a perfect view on the North Sea, has many attractive beaches to offer. One of them is the beach Strand &Aring;rgab, only a few kilometres away from the city. It is several kilometres long and more than 100 m wide with a sandy surface and some small pebbles and rocks mixed within. If you like this characteristics it will welcome you, no matter what the vehicle you are travelling with on a large parking place, some 200 m away from the beach. The path to the beach is not the easiest one, because you need to walk over a 15 m high dune, which is quite steep. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have lots of surface. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is at 30m. Most of the beach infrastructure is by the parking place, restaurants are not available here and accommodation is available when renting a house.', 3989, 'en', 1),
(606, 'This Danish beach Strand Nymindegab is really unique especially because of the fact that it belongs basically to two regions. The North part of the beach belongs to Midtjylland, the southern to the region Syddanmark. Although here are no signs which indicate this fact it is still something special. This place is very easy to reach and you have a parking place, a very large one, 200 m away from the beach. Motorhomes can also park here. To access the beach you need to cross 10 m high dunes, which are not as steep as somewhere else. It is a sandy beach which has really lots of surface. The total length is several km and it is more than 100 m wide. The water entry on the beach is nice and the swimming point is at 15 meters. Most of the beach infrastructure is, like it is usual in Denmark, located around the parking place. By the parking place you also have a bistro. Accommodation is not available near the beach, but in the city itself where you have a camp and other types of accommodation.', 3990, 'en', 2),
(607, 'Strand Houstrup is recommended for those one who like to have a beach in the middle of pure nature and who like very wide and long sandy beaches. It is located in the region Syddanmark, close to the city Norre Nebel. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also a Motorhome. A very large parking place is waiting here for you, some 300 meters away from the beach. To access the beach you need to take a path over a dune, which has 10 meters in height. On the beach you have really lots of surface, because it\'s several kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide. Entering the water here is very comfortable and the point of swim is at 20 meters. All necessary beach infrastructure is by the parking place. Restaurants are not available here, accommodation is available in the neighboring village but not near the beach.', 3991, 'en', 2),
(608, 'The Danish sandy beach Strand Henne is the place you should go if you like a beach wich is 200 metres wide, several kilometres long and has a very touristic surrounding. It is very easy to get to this location. It is located in the region Syddanmark, close to the city Henne Kirkeby. The parking place which is just next to the beach is very large and welcomes also motorhomes. On the parking place you also have all the necessary beach infrastructure as well as some on the beach itself. Here you also have a restaurant and a beach bar right next to the beach. More shops and different types of restaurants are available in the villages itself. On the beach you also have some sport grounds. Because the beach surface is so large the inclination of the beach is very different. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at 20 m. You also have many options to find the right accommodation for you in the village, are camping ground is also included.', 3992, 'en', 2),
(609, 'If you are searching for a danish sandy beach in the southern region Syddanmark, where you can park directly on the beach itself, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand B&oslash;rsmose. It is very easy to reach it and the closest city is Oksb&oslash;l. All kind of vehicles can park on the beach, also motorhomes. It is a very large beach with a total length of several kilometres and a maximum width of more than 100m. It is also a very flat beach which makes the water entry very nice and comfortable. The point of swim is at around 50 m. On the beach itself you have almost no beach infrastructure, only trash cans, toilets are available near the camp. Restaurants or similar are not available on the beach or close by the beach, but you have one accommodation option in the form of a camp close to the beach.', 3993, 'en', 1),
(610, 'Driving on a beach in Denmark is possible in two regions, in the north it is in the region Nordjylland and in the south it is in the region Syddanmark. If you are in the south region and you would like to have this experience, we suggest you to visit the beach Strand Vejers. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes are also allowed to stay on the beach. There are some rules you need to respect, otherwise you&#39;re totally free to park wherever you want. It is a very long beach, several kilometres and also very wide, more than 100m. The beach has a small inclination, it is almost flat. This fact makes the water entry very nice, and the swimming point is at 75 m. On the beach itself you have very little beach infrastructure, but there is more in the village Vejers itself. Restaurants or similar are not available on the beach, maybe during the summer time you have some driving kiosks, but you have plenty more in the village itself. For accommodation you have plenty of different options to choose from in the village, wich is in the background of the beach.', 3994, 'en', 1),
(611, 'Very close to the danish city Bl&aring;vand in the region Syddanmark, you can visit a very nice sandy beach Strand Hvidbjerg. It is recommended for families and those one who like to have a touristic Village in the background of the beach. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes are also welcomed, and you can leave your car on a large parking place only 50 m away from the beach. To access the beach from the parking place you need to cross a small dune. The beach is very long, several kilometers, and around 75 meters wide. By the water the beach gets very flat, which makes the water entry very nice. The point of swim depends on you, either you go into the water by the beach or you take a water ladder from the pier. On most part of the beach the seabed is very flat, which makes it ideal for small children to play in the water safely. Some beach infrastructure is located on the beach directly, some around the parking place. Restaurants and similar are not available directly on the beach, but in the background, in the village. In the village you also have many different options for accommodation, a camping ground included.', 3995, 'en', 1),
(612, 'On The danish Island R&oslash;m&oslash; there has got to be one of the largest sandy beaches you will ever encounter in your life. It has one of the largest flat beach surface area, at least in Europe, if not in the whole world. Like it is usual with such beaches in Denmark, also this one is accessible with a vehicle, that means that you can park right on the beach itself, no matter what the size, or type of the vehicle you have. If you like all the characteristics we have described so far, then please read on. This beach goes by the name Strand Lakolk and it is located in the region Syddanmark. This island, where the beach is located, is easy to reach via a road, which connects the mainland with the island. When you get to the beach, you just need to respect some few rules, otherwise you are free to park wherever you want. This beach is obviously several kilometres long and the total width is close to 1 km. It is a very flat beach which makes the water entry very comfortable and also safe for children to play in it. The point of swim is far out away, more than 100m. Not many beach infrastructure is located on the beach directly, but more is before you enter the beach with your vehicle. This is also the location where you have the most restaurants and shops, but also some beach driving kiosks are available on the beach itself. Accommodation is also available in many forms in the background of the beach, a camping ground is also nearby.', 3996, 'en', 1),
(613, 'On the Danish Island Rømø you really have very unique beaches. If you like very flat beaches with lots of surface this Danish Island has got to be your next beach destination. This particular beach called Strand Sønderby is even more extreme than other beaches on this island. Of course you can park directly on the beach, but from the entry point on the beach, to where you can actually take a swim it will take you 2 kilometres of driving on the sand. If you like all those facts you are welcome to read further about other things on the beach. It is located in the south Danish region Syddanmark, only 5 km away from the famous German island Sylt. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, as long as you respect some basic rules you can park and go wherever you want on the beach. Some basic beach infrastructure is located at the entry point to the beach, on itself there is none. The beach is several km long, and more than 2 km wide. Because been it so flat the water entry is very nice and comfortable, but the point of swim is more than 100m away. In the summertime, because of the flat seabed the water can get very warm and it is more safe and pleasant for small children to play in the water. Lots of visitors come to the beach with their horses, some even drive with a wind surfbuggy or Kitebuggy. Restaurants are not available on the beach or close to it but you have nearby some accommodation options, like renting a house by the nearest Dancenter.', 3997, 'en', 2),
(614, 'One of the most popular German tourist destination, when it comes to beaches, is the Island Sylt. It is located in the German region Schleswig-Holstein on the west German coastline where you can experience the North sea, which is part of the Atlantic ocean. The island Sylt is accessible either by train from German mainland, by airplane or by a ferry from Denmark. The beach we are describing here, is located in a natural surrounding and is easy to reach with any kind of vehichle and you have a&nbsp;big parking place, also for motorhomes, only 200 m away from the beach. It is a family type beach, which is several kilometers long and has a maximum width of 100 m. On the beach you have a very different beach inclination, on some places quite steep. On the beach there is some beach infrastructure, there are also different options of restaurants. No accommodation is available here. Around the beach there is a water protected natural Park which offers you some wales watching.&nbsp;', 3998, 'en', 1),
(615, ' recommended for families, private parking, private University with some beach infrastructure, possible accommodation for guest, sand beach, 100mm wide, several kilometres long, sunbeds to rent, very natural surrounding, nice water entry, different options of swimming point', 3999, 'en', 2),
(616, '<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">One of the most popular German tourist destination, when it comes to beaches, is the Island Sylt. It is located in the German region Schleswig-Holstein on the west German coastline where you can experience the North sea, which is part of the Atlantic ocean. The island Sylt is accessible either by train from German mainland, by airplane or by a ferry from Denmark. The main city on the island Sylt is Westerland, which is not far away from the beach Kampen. You can arrive to the parking of the beach with any kind of vehicle, also a motorhome and park on a large parking place, it is a payable one. T</span>he path to the beach is quite long, around 600 m, but you will enjoy it, beacuse it runs trough the dunes, which are very interesting. It is a family beach whit lots of beach infrastructure, dogs are also allowed on the beach. If you like nudism you are welcomed here. On the beach you also have a restaurant, a fast food and coffee bar nearby. On the beach and in the surrounding there is no option for accommodation, the closest one is in Kampen. The beach itself is a sandy one, it is several kilometers long, 100 m wide, with very different beach inclination. The point of swim various between low and high tide, but should arround 25 m.', 4000, 'en', 1),
(617, '<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">One of the most pictures island Sylt beaches has got to be the beach Strand Rotes Kliff. It is fomous for 20 m high red cliffs and a sandy beach. The whole island is a popular German tourist destination, when it comes to beaches. It is located in the German region Schleswig-Holstein on the west German coastline where you can experience the North sea, which is part of the Atlantic ocean. The island Sylt is accessible either by train from German mainland, by airplane or by a ferry from Denmark. The main city on the island Sylt is Westerland, which is not far away from this beach. If you would like to spend a day on this beauty it is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, beacuse of the large parking place&nbsp;</span>also for motorhomes. From the parking the beach is only 100 m away. It is a family type beach which is several km long, 100 wide, has lots of beach infrastructure adn is quite crowded in the high sesaon. If you get hungry or thirsty you have some restaurants on the beach. In the surrounding are there are many different accommodation possibilities, even a camping ground is included. Close to the parking place you also have a children playground at your disposal.&nbsp;', 4001, 'en', 1),
(618, 'It is a very popular tourist place with lots of infrastructure, many children playgrounds, sports fields, even a water slide, lots options for restaurants, many accommodation possibilities, suitable also for handicapped people, family beach, 200m of walking to the beach, very large parking place, several kilometres long, more than 100 m wide', 4002, 'en', 2),
(619, 'Very large parking place, 100m of walking beach, popular tourist beach, many restaurants in similar, lots of different options of accommodation nearby, world Cup in windsurfing, several kilometres Long Beach, more than 100 m wide. Children playground close to the beach, a city beach', 4003, 'en', 2),
(620, '<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">The German island Sylt is the most famous and touristic island in this north European country. On the whole island you have many beautiful sandy beaches, facing towards the west, available. Towards the east there are no beaches, only towards the west. It is located in the German region Schleswig-Holstein on the west German coastline where you can experience the North sea, which is part of the Atlantic ocean. The island Sylt is accessible either by train from German mainland, by airplane or by a ferry from Denmark. The closest town to the beach is Westerland, which is also the biggest city on the island and the main logistic entry point. To get to this beach is very easy, no matter what the vehicle you are travelling with. A</span>&nbsp;very large parking place is available and it takes you some 200m to reach the beach via a nice path. It is a family type beach and the surrounding is very natural, with many bushes and dunes. On the beach you have some basic beach infrastructure, a restaurant is also nearby. The beach is several kilometres long, it is more than 100 m wide and has a normal and stady inclination. The point of swim is at arround 30m. To access the beach you need to pay a beach tax of 4&euro; a day, but this is the obligation for every beach on the island. Close to the beach you also have a camp available.&nbsp;', 4004, 'en', 1),
(621, 'This beach has a very large parking place, it takes you some 300m to reach the beach, you have some basic beach infrastructure, a restaurant is also nearby, it is a very natural environment, recommended for families, the beach is several kilometres long, it is more than 100 m wide, no accommodation nearby.', 4005, 'en', 2),
(622, 'In the north German region Schleswig-Holstein, close to the city Sankt Peter-Ording, there is a very unique sandy beach Strand Ording. It is really unique for Germany,  because it is one of the few  beaches on which you can actually drive on and park on. There are a few facts  which make this beach popular, like you have a very large children\'s playground here, many beach infrastructure is located on the beach and in strong wind conditions  this popular among windsurfers. If you like all those characteristics, and you are a family we recommend you to visit it. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, and you can park directly on the beach. The beach surface is really large,  total length is several kilometres and it is a few hundred metres wide. Because of the flat beach the water entry is very nice and the swimming point is more than 100m away. You have many types of restaurants available directly on the beach, many different accommodation options and lots of  beach infrastructure.', 4006, 'en', 2),
(623, 'The German city Büsum, which is located on the west coastline, facing towards the North Sea has created a very unique and interesting beach Lagoon, it goes by the name Familienlagune Perlebucht. It is part of the North German region Schleswig-Holstein. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have lots of parking options very close to the beach. Families will love this beach because of the numerous children playgrounds and the flat water. The main surface on the beach is sand, but you also have some concrete and many grass surface. To access the beach from the parking place you need to cross a 10 m high hill. Once on the beach U have lots of beach surface available with a total length of several km and more than 100m of widness. The  inclination on this beach is different from point to point and so is the water entry and the point of swim which is between 0 and a few 10 metres. You can also use some water ladders. Lots of beach infrastructure  is located here and many services are available to you. The small Lagoon is also a popular place for kiteboarding and windsurfing. You also have different options of restaurants and many different options of accommodation in the surrounding area. ', 4007, 'en', 2),
(624, 'If you are searching for a German beach with grass as the main surface, on the west coastline, which is part of the North Sea, we would like to point you towards the direction of the city Büsum. This part of Germany belongs to the north region Schleswig-Holstein. On the German Atlantic coastline you don\'t have many beaches to choose from, because it\'s a very swampy area, so each one there is is even more precious. The beach Hauptstrand Büsum is a family type Beach. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a parking place just next to the beach. To access the beach you need to cross a 10 meter high water protection Hill. Once you\'re on the beach you can choose either to lay down your towel on the green grass or on a concrete  plates, but you even have a small portion of sand. The Incalination on the beach is different from spot to spot, and when getting into the water you can use the water ladders. It is a very flat sandy seabed here with a nice water entry and the swimming point far out away, even more than 100 meters. It is a very popular place and because of that you have here many Beach services available. All around the place you have many different restaurants and also different accommodation options. ', 4008, 'en', 2),
(625, 'The German city Cuxhaven is located on the west coastline and shares the waters of the North Sea. This is also the location where the river Elba merges with the sea. For this part of Germany it has an astonishing number of beaches to offer its visitors. One of them is a very unique beach called Grünstrand Grimmershörn. The main surface here is grass, you really have a very large surface of it available. If you like this beach characteristics you can find this beach in the region  Niedersachsen. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple parking options around the whole beach. Some options are very close some a little bit further away. The total length of the beach is several kilometers and it is more than 100 meters wide. To get into the water you need to use water stairs. The point of swim and the water entry depends on the high or low tide. Beach infrastructure is also located directly the beach, the same goes also for different types of restaurants which are available either directly on the beach or around the beach. Because this is a City Beach you also have plenty of accommodation options and even a camping ground.', 4009, 'en', 2),
(626, 'If you\'re searching for a sandy beach on the German west coastline near the city Cuxhaven we have one very beautiful beach called Strand Kugelbake we would like to present you. It is located in the northwest region Niedersachsen. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also motorhomes and you can park only 50 m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to walk over a 5 m high water protection Hill. Before you access the main sand beach you also have a part with grass, if you prefer this service more. The beach here has a Total length of 1 km and is 50 m wide. The water entry here is very nice and because of the flat seabed the swimming point is at more than 100m away. It is a very popular tourist beach, which means you have lots of beach infrastructure and services here available. Many restaurants of all different types are as well on the beach. And if you are searching for accommodation you have plenty of different options, also camping ground, nearby. ', 4010, 'en', 2),
(627, 'The German beach Strand Duhnen is located on the west coastline in the north west region Niedersachsen, close to the city Cuxhaven. It is a sandy beach, recommended for families, especially those one who have small children, because of the very large children\'s playground near the beach and the flat seabed or the shallow water. If you like all those characteristics this beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. Parking places are located only 100m away and you have plenty of those. The access to the beach is easy. The main surface on the beach is sand and you also have some grass. The beach has a total length of several kilometers and is 50 meters wide. Because of the shallow water the water entry is nice and the swimming point is for out away. Because this is a very touristic and popular place your have many Beach services available. Different types of restaurants are also on the beach also as many different types of accommodation in the background and the surrounding area.', 4011, 'en', 2),
(628, 'The northwest German region Niedersachsen, which has a coastline with the North Sea, has because of the very flat land, only a few beaches to offer. A lot of them are located around the City Cuxhaven. This particular one, the beach Strand Sahlenburg is a sandy beach recommended for family users. It is very popular and has lots of different types of accommodation to offer in the surrounding area, also a large camping ground. No matter what the vehicle you are traveling with, this location is very easy to reach and you have lots of parking spots to choose from. Most of them are some 300 meters away from the beach. The access to the beach is easy. Altogether it is a 1 kilometer Long Beach, with a maximum width of 50 meters. Water here is very shallow, especially at low tide, which makes the water entry very nice but puts the swimming point for out away. You have many Beach infrastructure and services available here. Different types of restaurants are also nearby. If you like to stay in a hotel you can do so on this beach and if you prefer a camp there is even one here.', 4012, 'en', 2),
(629, 'Strand Hooksiel is a sandy beach you should visit if you are searching for a huge parking place next to the beach, and a one which should be located in the North West German region Niedersachsen, close to the city Wangerland. No matter what the vehicle you are travelling with this location is very easy to reach. It takes you only 100m of walking to access the beach. It is a very nice shaped beach with a total length of 1 km and a maximum width of 50 m. You have a very nice water entry because of the shallow water but the point of swim is far out away and it mostly depends on the low tide or high tide. Children and families will love this beach. You have plenty of children playground as well as sport Fields and many beach infrastructure with services available on the beach. Different types of restaurants, fast food kiosks are on the beach as well. Accommodation is not available nearby but a few kilometres away in the village Hooksiel.', 4013, 'en', 2),
(630, 'The German beach Strand Schillig, which is located close to the city Wangerland is a true family beach and children will simply love this location. You have really lots of children\'s playgrounds directly on the beach and the shallow water, which makes the play in the water more safely are two main characteristics to make your children happy on this sandy beach. If you like all those facts you can find this beach in the north west region Niedersachsen. It is a very popular place and lots of families come here, this is also the reason why you have here a very large parking place, also for motorhomes, and it is 200 m away from the beach. The access to the beach is very easy. A lot of beach surface is available here at your disposal, you have a total length of several kilometres and on some spots a width of 100m. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim depends on the low or high tide, but usually it\'s quite far away. You have a lot of beach infrastructure and beach services available all around the place, the same goes also for different types of restaurants. Accommodation is also not a problem here you have plenty of different options to choose from, like a camping ground just next to the beach. ', 4014, 'en', 2),
(631, 'In the North West german region Niedersachsen, close to the city Wittmund, there is nice small village Harlesiel with a sandy beach Strand Harlesiel. It is a family type beach which will make your children happy because of the very large children playground, from which there is one directly on the beach and one close to the beach. Children will also love to play in the shallow water, but be advised of the high difference between low and high tide. This location is very easy to reach and you have a parking place only 100m away from the beach. Next to the beach there is also a harbour. All around this location you have lots of beach infrastructure and all possible services. The beach itself is very flat and it has a length of 300 m and is more than 100m wide. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is dependent on low or high high tide. Different types of restaurants are available in the surrounding as well as many different options to find an accommodation.', 4015, 'en', 2),
(632, 'Strand Neuharlingersiel is a German beach located on the west coastline in the northwest region Niedersachsen. It is a sandy beach and best recommended for families. From the village Neuharlingersiel, where this beach is located you can access via a ferry the neighbouring Islands like Spiekeroog and Langeoog, which are also known to have some astonishing sandy beaches. Because this location is very popular you also have lots of parking options around the beach and it is easy accessible with any kind of vehicle. It takes you Only 50 m from the parking place to reach the beach. The Beach itself is very flat, it has lots of beach surface, it is 500 m long and more than 100 m wide. You can access the water via water stairs. The point of swim depends on low or high tide and can be from 0 to more than 100m. Many beach infrastructure is located on the beach and some in the neighbourhood. You also have plenty of different restaurants to choose from. Many different Types of accommodation are also in the neighbourhood or very close to the beach.', 4016, 'en', 2),
(633, 'If you\'re a family and you\'re searching for sandy beach with lots of beach infrastructure, many children playgrounds, lots of sports fields, a flat Beach and a shallow water for small children to play safely in the water you need to visit the German beach Strand Bensersiel. It is located in the North West region Niedersachsen not far away from the city Esens. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle and you have many parking places around the beach to choose from. It will take you some 200m of walking to access the beach. There is only one entrance to the beach and it will cost you 2.8 euros for an adult. This Sandy beach is very flat, it has lots of surface, the total length is 750 m and it is more than 100 m wide. Because of the flat and the shallow water the water entry is very nice and the swimming point is far out away, more than 100m. Beach services are here on the highest level you have so many. You can also choose from different types of restaurants and if you would like to spend your holidays here you have plenty of options in the surrounding area.', 4017, 'en', 2),
(634, 'In the North West German region Niedersachsen you don\'t have many beaches to choose from. There are a few on the mainland and for some you need to take a ferry to the islands. One beach, which is on the mainland, near the city Dornum, is the beach Strand Dornumersiel. The beach is artificial, the main surface is sand and it is a family type beach. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included and you have a parking place only 100m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to pay a beach tax. The beach is very flat and it has a very large beach area. Total length is 300m and it is more than 100 m wide. The water entry is very nice and you can use the water starts to get into it. The point of swim depends on low or high tide. You have lots of beach infrastructure  here. A Restaurant and a coffee bar is also directly at the beach. You also have some options for accommodation, a camping ground is nearby and some apartments are also not far away.', 4018, 'en', 2),
(635, 'Niedersachsen is a German region in the North West, with a coastline on the North Sea. You have some beaches here, although they are artificially made, like the one close to the city Dornum, which goes by the name Strand Nessmersiel. It is a family type Beach, it is easy to get here with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place only 50 m away from the beach. This location is also the entry point for the ferries, who connect the neighboring Islands.  The access to the beach is easy. You have lots of a sandy beach surface and a huge area available. In total the Beach is 250m long and it has a wide of more than 100m. The access to the water can be done via water stairs and the swimming point depends on the low or high tide. Many beach services are available here, a children playground and some sport Fields included. You also have a restaurant and coffee bar directly on the beach. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but in the neighbouring Village a few kilometres away.', 4019, 'en', 2),
(636, 'The Northwest German region Niedersachsen is on some beaches also a very popular location for water sports, like windsurfing and kiteboarding. A beach with such characteristics is Strand Norddeich which is located close to the city Norden. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your vehicle. The closest one is only 100m away from the beach, the furthest, this is also the largest parking place, is 400m away. To access the beach you need to cross a high water barrier of a little bit less than 10 m height. Once you\'re on the beach your have lots of beach area, with a total length of 400m and a wideness of more than 100 m. It is a very flat beach and to get into the water you need to use the water stairs. At low tide the point of swim is very far out away, at high tide it\'s a little bit less. Many beach services are available here, some directly on the beach, some behind the water barrier. Because of this being a very popular place you also have lots of different types of restaurants available. Accommodation is also nearby, mainly as Apartments and hotels.', 4020, 'en', 2),
(637, 'Because of its geography this Netherland region Groningen, has very little beaches on the coastline, but has more on the lakes, located all through the region. One such lake, with a beautiful beach ,is called Oldambtmeer. It is located near the city Winschoten, close to the village Blauwestad. The name of the beach is Strand Zuid. It is a family type beach, with sand as the main surface, but you also have some grass there. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also with motorhomes, and you can park only 30 m away from the beach. The beach is 100m long, 20 m wide and has a nice beach shape. The water entry is very nice and the swimming is allowed in a little area. Some basic beach infrastructure is located on the beach, also children playgrounds. Nearby you also have a bistro if you get hungry. For accommodation you have nearby the option to rent some apartments.', 4021, 'en', 1),
(638, 'Delfzijl is a Netherland city in the region Groningen, which can offer you a sandy beach, called Zeestrand Eemshotel and it is close to the city main harbour. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park your car, either you do it by the road or on some provisional parking places, close to the beach. It is a family type beach and it takes you only 30 m of walking to get to from the parking place. Altogether the beach is 200 m long and on the widest part 50 metres wide. The water entry is very nice, it is very flat, and the swimming point depends on the low or high tide. You have some basic beach infrastructure here. In the summertime, when this place gets more crowded, you also have some beach kiosks and fast food restaurants. Accommodation is also available nearby, you have a hotel in the vicinity and some apartments in the city itself. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 4022, 'en', 1),
(639, 'If you&#39;re searching for a sandy beach in the Netherland region Groningen and you don&#39;t mind that the beach is actually located on a lake, we suggest you, to visit the beach Strand Schildmeer. To get to it you need to drive towards the village Steendam. It is very easy to get to this location and you can park on a large parking place only 100m away from the beach. The path to the beach is easy and it is also accessible for handicapped people. The beach has a total length of 400 m and is up to 50 m wide. The water entry is very nice and at the beginning you have quite shallow water. On the beach there is also a pier, which you can also use to jump into the water, as long as it is deep enough. Some basic beach infrastructure and services are available on the beach. You also have a small restaurant. Accommodation is also available nearby, mainly as a camp or in the form of apartments.', 4023, 'en', 1),
(640, 'If you&#39;re a family with small children, who is searching for a sandy beach with shallow water, and a children playground in the Netherlands region Groningen, we suggest you to visit the beach Strand Meerwijck. This beach is actually not located on the coastline, but on the lake Zuidlaardermeer, close to the village Kropswolde. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome, and park on a very large parking place only 100m away from the beach. The path to the beach is easy and a very flat beach with lots of beach area awaits you. The total length of the beach is 500 m and it is more than 100 m wide. Because of the shallow water the water entry is very nice and the swimming point is far out away, more than 100m. The shallow water is also an additional characteristic for families with small children, which can play in the water more safely. Because of this place being very popular, you also have many beach infrastructure and services here. Close to the beach you also have a restaurant. Accommodation is also available nearby, mostly as a camp and in some apartments or houses. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.<br />\n&nbsp;', 4024, 'en', 1),
(641, 'The Netherlands city Groningen, which is located in the region with the same name, has a nice sandy beach to offer for your visit. This beach is not located on the coastline by the sea, but on the lake Hoornseplas and has also the same name Strand Hoornseplas. It is a family type beach, with lots of grass and natural shadow (trees), very shallow water and a big children playground. If you like all those characteristics and you would like to visit it, it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also with smaller motorhomes. You can park on a large parking place only 200m away from the beach. Although the parking place has a height barrier of 2.75 m and on one parking place of 3 m. The path to the beach is very nice and also handicapped people can reach the beach. The whole beach area has lots of surface, so you can choose either to stay on the sand or on the grass. All together the total length of the beach is 750 m and the part with the sand is 30 m wide. The green part of the beach is even more wider, some 100 m. The water entry is very nice and because of the shallow water the point of swim is at 75 m. Many beach services and infrastructure is available here. You also have plenty of options to get something to eat. Accommodation is also not a problem; you can stay either in a hotel or rent an apartment.', 4025, 'en', 1),
(642, 'Near the Netherlands city Leeuwarden, which is located in the middle of the region Friesland, far away from the coastline and the North Sea, you have a nice sandy beach on the lake Lytse Wielen. It has the same name as the lake and goes by the name Strand Lytse Wielen, it is a family type beach, which is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle. All around the area you have plenty of parking places available, motorhomes can also park here. It will take you some 200m of walking from the parking place to reach the beach. The path to the beach is very nice. Although the main surface on the beach is sand, you also have plenty of grass fields. The beach has a total length of 200 m and is 40 m wide. But you also have lots of grass area, which makes the beach even more wide. It is a very flat area, which makes the water entry very nice. Because the water is very shallow, the swimming point is at around 50 m. U have lots of beach infrastructure and services available here, children playground included. A small fast food kiosk is also nearby. If you would like to stay here for longer, you have a campsite nearby and some apartments. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 4026, 'en', 1),
(643, 'The Nederland&rsquo;s beach Strand Harlingen is located in the region Friesland. It is a sandy beach recommended for families and is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle. You can park on a very large parking place only 50 m away from the beach. To access the beach, you need to cross a 10 m high sea water barrier. The beach has a total length of 400 m and is 50 m wide. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is at 30 m. You have some basic beach infrastructure on the beach. On the beach is also a beach bar and a restaurant. You also have in the vicinity many summer accommodation options, like a camp and you can even rent some apartments.', 4027, 'en', 1),
(644, 'Near the small Netherlands village Kornwerderzand, which is located on a long artificial water barrier that divides the North Sea and the IJsselmeer, you have a small artificial sandy beach with the name Strand Kornwerderzan. The region where this beach is located is called Friesland. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. It is located close to a motorway and when you park on a large parking place it will take you only 100m to reach the beach. Close to the parking place is also the location where you have the most beach infrastructure. Here you can also visit a Waddenzee museum. When getting to the beach you have 100 m of length and 15 m of width available. This is also a famous kiteboarding location. The inclination on the beach is different from spot to spot. The water entry is nice and the swimming point depends on if you go into the water by the beach or use the water ladder by the pier. In the museum you also have a restaurant and in the surrounding area a campsite for your accommodation. Enjoy the beach Kornwerderzan with BeachRex.', 4028, 'en', 1),
(645, 'One of the biggest lakes in the Netherlands is IJsselmeer. Although it is made artificially, it is very interesting. because it offers you also some sandy beaches. One of them is located in the region Friesland, near the city Makkum and goes by the name Strand De Holle Poarte. It is a very popular location with lots of beach infrastructure, different shops, many accommodation options, as well as many restaurants. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and you have a parking place only 50 m away from the beach. The main surface on the beach is sand, the beach is 1 km long and 75 m wide. It is a very flat beach with a shallow water, and with the children playground on the beach it is ideal for small children. The shallow water makes the water entry very nice and because of it it is also very popular spot for windsurfing and kiteboarding. Enjoy the beach&nbsp;De Holle Poarte with BeachRex.', 4029, 'en', 1),
(646, 'If you are searching for a sandy beach which is also suitable for kiteboarding, is located in the Dutch region Friesland on the shores of the Lake IJsselmeer, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand It Soal. To get to this location you need to drive towards Workum. This location is very easy to reach no matter what the vehicle you are travelling with and you can leave your vehicle on a large parking place only 50 m away from the beach. The access to the beach is very easy and you have quite a big beach area with a total length of 750 metres and a widthness of 50 m. The water entry, because of the shallow water, is very nice and the swimming point is far out at around 100 m. Some basic beach infrastructure is located on the beach. You can also rent some kiteboarding equipment here. Bistro and fast food kiosks are also available nearby. If you are searching for accommodation here, you have the option to stay in a camp or rent an apartment or a house.', 4030, 'en', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(647, 'The Dutch beach Strand Stavoren is a sandy beach recommended for families. It is located in the region Friesland in the village Stavoren. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle and simply park by the road only 30 m away from the beach. To access the beach, you need to cross a small water barrier. This sandy beach has a total length of 200 m and is 20 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is between 0 and 25 m or even further away. Around the beach you have quite many services. Very close is a marina as well as many restaurants and coffee bars. Between the parking place and the beach you also have a children playground and a small sport field. The village offers you also some accommodation mainly in the form of apartments.', 4031, 'en', 1),
(648, 'Because of its shallow water, this Dutch beach Strand Mirnser Klif, is very popular amongst the kiteborders. Families with small children will also enjoy this place, not only is the water shallow and safe for play, you also have a children playground on the beach. This sandy beach is located close to the village Mirns in the region Friesland. If you would like to visit this location you can come here with any kind of vehicle and a large parking place, only 100m away from the beach, is waiting for you. The access to the beach is easy and when you get there at first you have a large grass field and then the sandy beach. Altogether the beach has a length of 200 m and is on the widest sandy spot 20 wide. With the grass field aded, the width gets even larger. Because of the shallow water the water entry is nice and the swimming point is at more than 100 m. This beach is out in the nature which means the beach infrastructure and services are only basic. But you have a restaurant and a coffee bar next to the beach as well as a campsite and some apartments for your accommodation nearby.', 4032, 'en', 1),
(649, 'One of the last beaches in the region Friesland, on the Lake IJsselmeer, before you enter the region Flevoland, is the Netherland beach Lemsterstrand. It is located in the city Lemmer and is a sandy beach suitable for families with small children. You have lots of children playground on the beach to make your little ones happy. This location has a very large parking ground only 100m away from the beach and you can access it with any kind of vehicle. The access to the beach is easy and you also have many beach infrastructure and services available here. The beach itself is very flat, with a total length of 750 m and is 100 m wide. Because of the shallow water the water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at 30 m. On the beach itself you also have a restaurant. Accommodation is also nearby, like a campsite as well as some apartments. Enjoy the beach Lemsterstrand with BeachRex.', 4033, 'en', 1),
(650, 'The Dutch harbour city Urk, located in the region Flevoland, has two beautiful sandy beaches to offer. The first one, which is a family beach is called Dijkstrand. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place only 100m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to walk over a small water barrier of 5 m height. The total length of the beach is 150m, it is 30 m wide and has a normal inclination. The water entry is very nice here and the swimming point is already at 5 m. A basic beach infrastructure is located here, but you also have a children playground and a small sports field. On the beach itself you don&#39;t have any restaurants, but they are located in the surrounding area, where you will also find lots of accommodation if you would like to stay here for longer.', 4034, 'en', 1),
(651, 'The Dutch harbour city Urk, located in the region Flevoland, has two beautiful sandy beaches to offer. The second one, which is a family beach is called Strand Staversekade. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place some 750m away from the beach. When walking down the path to the beach, you can admire the beautiful Dutch architecture. Before you arrive to the beach you can also take a look at the old harbour with many interesting ships. The total length of the beach, which has a quite large area, is 250 m with a 50 m width. This beach is very flat, which makes the water entry very nice and the swimming point is already at 5 m. Because this is actually a city harbour beach, you have lots of beach infrastructure located here with a children playground and a small sports field included. On the beach you also have a fast food kiosk and some restaurants in the neighbourhood. Accommodation is also available in the city in the form of apartments.', 4035, 'en', 1),
(652, 'If you are searching for a sandy family beach, with a big parking place, also for motorhomes, in the Netherland region Flevoland, close to the city Lelystad, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Houtribhoek. This location is very easy accessible and you have a large parking place only 50 m away from the beach. To access it you need to cross a water barrier of 10 metres in height via stairs. The beach is very flat, it has a length of 500 m and is 50 m wide. The water is quite shallow, which makes the water entry very nice, and the point of swim begins at 40 m. This beach has lots of beach infrastructure, a children playground included, a sport field and even a small outdoor fitness. A restaurant and a beach bar is also directly on the beach. If you would like to stay here for longer you can rent some apartments in the neighbourhood.', 4036, 'en', 1),
(653, 'In the Netherlands you not only have beautiful beaches on the Atlantic or the west coastline with the North Sea, you also have many ones on the numerous lakes located all over the land. One such beach, Harderstrand Noord, it is a sandy beach, is located on the shores of the lake Veluwemeer. If you would like to have such a lake beach experience, we recommend you to visit it. This location is easy to access with any kind of vehicle, and you have two options to park your car, either on a small parking place or by the road. It will take you a maximum of 50 m of walking to reach the beach. The beach area is very flat, it is 400 m long and 50m wide. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is at 20 m. The beach infrastructure here is only basic. No restaurants are available directly on the beach but in its vicinity. Close to the beach you also have a camping ground and the option to rent an apartment if you would like to stay here for longer. Enjoy the beach&nbsp;Harderstrand Noord with BeachRex.', 4037, 'en', 1),
(654, 'The Dutch City Zeewolde, although it&#39;s not located on the North Sea coastline, but has a coastline with the lake Wolderwijd, has a very nice sandy beach. It is recommended for families and those one who like to have a large parking place next to the beach. The region where this sandy beach, called Woldstrand, is located, is Flevoland. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included and you have a very large parking place only few metres away from the beach. The main surface on the beach is sand but you also have some grass Fields. On some spots you even have some trees to protect you from the sun. It is a flat beach with a total length of 750 m and a maximum width of 50 m. On most part of the beach the water is shallow but you also have a pier where the water gets deeper and you can either jump or use the water ladder. The point of swim is so between 0m and 25 m. On the whole stretch of the beach you have lots of beach infrastructure, children&#39;s playgrounds and sport fields included. You also have a restaurant and a beach bar directly on the beach and for your accommodation you can either rent a house or an apartment.', 4038, 'en', 1),
(655, 'The Dutch beach Strand RCN is located on the shores of the lake Wolderwijd. It is a sandy beach, recommended for families and those one who like to be in a camp. It is located in the region Flevoland, close to the city Zeewolde. This beach is very easy to reach, also with a motorhome and you can park on a large parking place, only 50 metres away from the beach, inside the camp. Although the main surface on the beach is sand you also have a lot of grass fields. The beach has a total length of 250 m and is 50 m wide. It is a flat beach with quite a shallow water. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at around 40 m. Because of this beach being inside a camp you have lots of beach infrastructure and services available here. Many different types of restaurants are as well here and for your accommodation you can stay in the camp or rent some apartments nearby. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach, the fastest beach browser on the planet.&nbsp;', 4039, 'en', 1),
(656, 'In the Dutch region Flevoland there is a city Almere, which is located next to the lake Weerwater. On the shores of the lake there is a new artificial sandy beach Fantasiestrand. What is really unique about this beach is the fact that you have next to it the option to try some water sport on the skilift waterboard. If you like this characteristics, you can get to the beach with any kind of vehicle and park on a very large parking place only 100m away from the beach. The access to the beach is very easy. Although the main surface is sand, you also have a large grass field. The total length of the beach is 200 m and it is 25 m wide on the sandy part, with the grass field included it gets even more wider. The water entry is nice and comfortable, the water is quite shallow and the point of swim is at 30 m. Some basic beach infrastructure is located here as well, nearby you also have a restaurant. Accommodation is also available mainly in the form of hotels and apartments in the city itself.', 4040, 'en', 1),
(657, 'The Dutch city Almere, which is located in the region Flevoland is surrounded by many lakes, which can also offer you some sandy beaches in the vicinity. One such sandy beach, called Strand Almere Haven is recommended for families and it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. A very large parking place is only a few metres away from the beach, and it welcome also motorhomes. The access to the beach is very easy. It is a flat beach with a total length of 400 m and a maximum width of 75 m. Because of the flat beach the water is also quite shallow, which means you have a nice water entry and the point of swim varies between 0 and 25 m. Some basic beach infrastructure is located here. On the beach you also have a beach bar and a restaurant. Accommodation is available in the vicinity in the form of a hotel or apartments.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach, the fastest beach browser on the planet.&nbsp;', 4041, 'en', 1),
(658, 'If you&#39;re the one who prefers a sandy beach on a Dutch lake with lots of beach area, you should visit the beach Almeerderstrand. It is located in the region Flevoland, close to the city Almere on the shorelines of the Lake IJmeer. No matter what the vehicle you are travelling with this location is easy to reach and you have a very large parking place only 30 m away from the beach. The access to beaches is easy and because of the very wide beach area, which is approximately 150 m wide, it will take you some time of walking on a sand to get to the water. You also have quite many trees here, to protect you from the sun. The whole beach area is really large. The beach has a total length of 1 km. The beach is very flat and has on the beginning a shallow water, which makes the water entry very nice. The point of swim is at 20 m. Some beach infrastructure is also present here and it is located mostly around the restaurants and beach bars, which are as well on the beach. Accommodation is available in the vicinity mostly in the form of a hotel or an apartment.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach, the fastest beach browser on the planet.&nbsp;', 4042, 'en', 1),
(659, 'The Moto of this Dutch beach, called Zilverstrand is: &quot;keep it simple&quot;. It is located in the region Flevoland near the city Almere on the shorelines of the Lake Gooimeer. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome and you can park on a very large parking place some 200 m away from the beach. The access to the beach is easy. On the beach the main surface is sand, but you also have some grass fields. The total length is 750 m and it is 50 m wide. It is a flat beach with a shallow water, which makes the water entry very nice and creates the point of swim at 40 m. On the beach you have only some basic beach infrastructure, like toilets and showers. No restaurants and accommodation is available on the beach or near the beach.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach, the fastest beach browser on the planet.&nbsp;', 4043, 'en', 1),
(660, 'On the Dutch lake IJmeer, near the city Muiderberg, which is a part of the region Noord-Holland, you have a nice sandy beach suitable for families and those one who like to do some water sport, like sailing. The location is very easy to reach and you can leave your vehicle by the road only a few metres away from the beach. To access the beach, you need to descend some 5 m in height down the stairs. The main surface on the beach is sand, but you also have some grass on the steep part of the beach. The total length is 300 m and it is 25m wide. It is quite a flat beach with a quite shallow water, which means that the point of swim is far out away. To get into the water you need to cross a concrete barrier, which can be sometimes tricky. A lot of beach infrastructure and services are available here, you also have a children&#39;s playground and a sports field. A sailing club is also on the beach, as well as a restaurant and a beach bar. If you prefer this kind of beaches accommodation is available in the vicinity in the form of apartments and a hotel.&nbsp;​And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach, the fastest beach browser on the planet.&nbsp;', 4044, 'en', 1),
(661, 'In the Dutch city Monnickendam, which is located by the lake Gouwzee, you have a very nice and unique sandy beach in the middle of a green park with lots of trees. The name of the beach is Mirrorstrand Hemmeland and it is located in the region Noord-Holland. If you would like to get here you can arrive with any kind of vehicle and leave your car on a large parking place only 100 metres away from the beach. The access to the beach is easy and handicapped people can also access it. Although the main surface is sand you also have many grass fields and some trees as well there. It is a 150 m long beach with a maximum width of 40 m. Because it is very flat and because it has a shallow water the water entry is nice and the swimming point is between 0 and 25+ m. Some basic beach infrastructure is located here, a children playground included. On the beach you also have a restaurant and in the vicinity you have the option to rent an apartment or stay in a hotel.', 4045, 'en', 1),
(662, 'The Dutch lake Gouwzee, in the region Noord-Holland, has a few sandy beaches to offer for your beach visit. The beach Strand Pieterma is located close to the city Volendam, it is a family beach which you should visit, if you like sand and grass on the beach. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place only a few metres away from the beach, motorhomes can also park here. The total length of the beach is 200 m and the sandy part is 20 m wide. With the grass field aded it gets even wider. It is a flat beach with a very shallow water,which makes the water entry very nice, but the swimming point is far out away, at more than 100 metres. On the beach you also have some basic beach infrastructure, a beach kiosk with fast food and in the vicinity you will even find a hotel and some apartments. Close to the beach you also have a motorhome rest area. Next to the beach there is a marina with lots of ships.', 4046, 'en', 1),
(663, 'This Dutch beach Strand Schellinkhout is mostly admired by kiters and windsurfers. The water here is very shallow, which makes it ideal to surf on the water fast with little waves, but on the other hand it makes it ideal for small children to play in the water safely. It is located in the region Noord-Holland in the city Schellinkhout by the lake Markermeer. If you like this characteristics, this location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park on a large parking place only a few metres away from the beach. The beach has a mixture of sand and grass, it is 100 m long and 30 m wide. It is a flat beach with a shallow water, nice water entry and the point of swim being at more than 100 m away. You have here almost no beach infrastructure, the nearest toilets are a few 100m away. In the vicinity U have some restaurants and the option to find an accommodation in an apartment.', 4047, 'en', 1),
(664, 'On the shores of the Dutch lake IJsselmeer in the region Noord-Holland, close to the city Enkhuizen, you have a sandy beach, which goes by the name Strand Enkhuizerzand. It is a family type beach with parking places only 50 m away. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also motorhomes have enough space here. The path to the beach is easy. The main surface is sand, but you also have some enormous grass fields. 200 Metres is the total length of the beach and it is 20 m wide. With the grass field added to the width it&#39;s even more wider. The water entry is nice and because of the shallow water the point of swim is far out away, at more than 100 m. Some basic beach infrastructure is located here, a small children playground included. Restaurants are not available on the beach but in the vicinity. Accommodation is not far away, the closest one is a camp, and in the city itself you have apartments and hotels available.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach, the fastest beach browser on the planet.&nbsp;', 4048, 'en', 1),
(665, 'If you&#39;re searching for a Dutch beach with a very special shape, three quarters of a circle, with a sandy surface and a large parking place next to the beach, we would recommend you to visit the beach Strand De Vooroever. It is located in the region Noord-Holland, close to the city Andijk on the Lake IJsselmeer. You can get here with any kind of vehicle and a large parking place only 200m away is located here. The access to the beaches is easy. Although the main surface on the beach is sand you also have many grass fields and even some trees to hide from the sun. It is a flat beach with a very shallow water, this fact makes it also more suitable for small children to play in the water safely. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is far out away. Beach infrastructure is only basic, children playgrounds included. Restaurants are not available on the beach. You have some options for accommodation in the vicinity, mainly apartments or bed and breakfast.&nbsp;​And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach, the fastest beach browser on the planet.&nbsp;', 4049, 'en', 1),
(666, 'In the Dutch city Wervershoof there is a sandy beach called Strand Het Nesbos, which is located on the shores of the Lake IJsselmeer. It is a family beach with children playgrounds, big and shady trees and with a shallow water. This location belongs to the region Noord-Holland. It is very easy to reach the beach with any kind of vehicle and you can park on a large parking place only 30 m away from the beach. The access to the beach is easy. The main surface is sand, but you also have some grass fields if you prefer the grass as your main beach surface. It is a flat beach with a total length of 200 m and 30 m width. The water entry is nice and because of the shallow water the point of swim is far out away. You don&#39;t have any option to buy a drink or food on the beach, but there are some accommodation options in the vicinity if you would like to stay here for longer.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach, the fastest beach browser on the planet.', 4050, 'en', 1),
(667, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">In the Dutch region Noord-Holland, by the lake IJsselmeer, there is a city Medemblik. Although it is not located by the coastline of the North Sea it has two beautiful sandy beaches to offer their beach visitors. You can get to this location with any kind of vehicle and you can leave your car on a large parking place only 100m away from the beach. The first one, the beach Strand Vlietsingel Poel, is a little bit smaller than the second one, but it&#39;s closer to the parking place. The access to the beach is easy. This sandy beauty is 75 m long and 20 m wide. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is because of the shallow water far out away. You also have a little bit of grass fields here, maybe you prefer them instead of the sand. Close to the beach there is some basic beach infrastructure. You also have a restaurant and the beach bar close to the beach. Accommodation is also available in the vicinity, mainly in the form of apartments and hotels.&nbsp;​And remember, always use BeachRex to find your dream beach, the fastest beach browser on the planet.</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 4051, 'en', 1),
(668, 'In the Dutch region Noord-Holland, by the lake IJsselmeer, there is a city Medemblik. Although it is not located by the coastline of the North Sea, it has two beautiful sandy beaches to offer their beach visitors. You can get to this location with any kind of vehicle and you can leave your car on a large parking place only 200m away from the beach. The second one, the beach Strand Vlietsingel, is a little further than the first one and it is also quite larger. The access to the beach is easy. It is 300 m long and 25 m wide. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is because of the shallow water far out away. You also have a little bit of grass fields here. Close to the beach there is some basic beach infrastructure. You also have a restaurant and a beach bar close to the beach. Accommodation is also available in the vicinity, mainly in the form of apartments and hotels.', 4052, 'en', 1),
(669, 'If you are searching for a Dutch beach with lots of sand, with high sand dunes in the region Noord-Holland, we suggest you to visit the beach Strandslag Duinoord, which is located close to the city Den Helder. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place some 500 m away from the beach. Although it&#39;s a quite long path to the beach, it is certainly worth it. You can also access the beach by bicycle, the paths are in a good condition. The beach is very long, several kilometres and the width depends on high or low tide,but it is a minimum of 50 m. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at 75 m. You have some basic beach infrastructure located here, a restaurant and a beach bar included. Accommodation is not available on the beach but in the vicinity in the form of a camp, which is the closest one, or as an apartment or a hotel.', 4053, 'en', 1),
(670, 'The Dutch beach Strand Falga is recommended for those ones who are searching for a very long sandy beach with almost zero beach infrastructure, hidden in the dunes, far away from any tourists. If you like such beach characteristics, this location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You have a very large parking place some 750 m away from the beach. The path to the beach is easy, but you need to cross the 15 m high dunes. Once you arrive to the beach, which has a very large area, it is several kilometres long and at least 75 m wide, a very fine sand is waiting for your beach day. The water entry is very nice and on the beginning the water is quite shallow, which makes the point of swim at around 75 m, but it can also vairy from low tide to high tide. Almost no beach infrastructure is located here, restaurants are also not available, accept the accommodation which is close to the parking place in the form of a camp or some apartments.', 4054, 'en', 1),
(671, 'Near the Dutch city Julianadorp you have a very nice sandy beach, called Strand Zandloper, which is recommended for families. It is located in the region Noord-Holland and faces the North Sea. If you would like to visit it, it is very easy to get here with any kind of vehicle, which you can leave on a very large parking place some 500m away from the beach. The path to the beach is easy, you just need to cross a 15 m high dune. The beach has a lot of area, it is several km long and a minimum of 50 m wide, and at low tide it gets even wider. The water entry is nice and the swimming point is far out away, because of the shallow water. You have some basic beach infrastructure here, a beach bar and a restaurant is also located here. No accommodation is available directly on the beach, but in the vicinity, mostly in the form of a camp, resorts, hotels and apartments.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.</span>', 4055, 'en', 1),
(672, 'The Dutch region Noord-Holland has a very beautiful coastline with the North Sea. The coastline is very long and is mainly protected by a sand dune and has many entry points to get to the beach. If you like sandy beaches, you need to visit the city Julianadorp and lay down your towel on the beach Strand Julianadorp. This place is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place some 400m away from the beach. To get to the beach U need to cross a 15 m high sand dune on a concrete path. The beach has a total length of several km, it has a minimum of 75 m in width. You can enter the water very comfortable and because of the shallow watter the swimming point is for out away. Beach infrastructure here is only basic, but you have a restaurant and a beach bar directly on the beach. You also have many options for accommodation in the vicinity of the beach, mostly in a camping ground, but options like apartments and hotels are also available.', 4056, 'en', 1),
(673, 'If you are searching for a Dutch sandy beach with very little beach infrastructure, a very large parking place and a unique natural environment, we would recommend you to visit the beach Strand Drooghe Weert. it is located In the region Noord-Holland, close to the city Julianadorp. This beach characteristics make it suitable to a more an adventurous type of beach user. This locationis is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place some 400m away from the beach. The path to the beach goes over a 10 metre high sand dune. On the beach you have a very large beach area which gets even wider in the case of low tide. The total length is several kilometres and it is 100m wide. On some part the beach is very flat and with the shallow water the beach entry is nice, but the swimming point is far out away. No basic services are available here, a restaurant also not. Accommodation is not available on the beach itself, also not in the vicinity, but it&#39;s further away.', 4057, 'en', 1),
(674, 'In the Netherlands you have all sort of beaches. You can choose to have a beach experience on a sandy beach by the lake or you can choose to try out a sandy beach by the North Sea. Fare most the longest and widest sandy beaches by the North Sea are in the Dutch region Noord-Holland. The one we are presenting here is called Strand Groote Keeten and it is located near the city Callantsoog. It is a family type beach, which is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. The parking place is very large and is some 400m away from the beach. Close to the parking place you also have a children&#39;s playground and a small sport field, on the beach itself there are none. When you go down the path to the beach you also have a restaurant, a beach bar is also available in the summertime on the beach itself. The access to the beach is easy. The beach is several km long and 75 m wide. Close to the water the beach is quite flat and so is the shallow water, which makes the water enter very nice but puts the point of swim far out away. On the beach you have many services, a lifeguard service included. Around the parking place you are also have the option for accommodation, in the form as apartments.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.', 4058, 'en', 1),
(675, 'Some beaches in Netherlands are for families who need quite a lot of beach services, and some are for the ones who are satisfied with the bare minimum. Such a beach is Strand Voordijk in the region Noord-Holland, close to the City Callantsoog. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you have a parking place some 300m away from the beach. To access the beach, you need to cross a 10 m high dune, but don&#39;t worry the path is concrete one and is in a good condition. The main surface on the beach is sand and you really have lots of it, because the total length of the beach is several km and it has a minimum width of 75 m, at low tide it can get to even more. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at 75 m. Like I said before no beach infrastructure is located here also not a restaurant. A small fast food kiosk is located by the parking place. Accommodation is also available in the surrounding area.&nbsp;And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach, like already millions of beach enthusiasts are doing for years.', 4059, 'en', 1),
(676, 'The Dutch city Callantsoog is a very popular tourist destination, not only for the Dutch people, but also for foreign tourists, mainly the Germans. The city itself has many different types of accommodation to offer and of course they also have a very beautiful sandy beach Strand Abbestee, with lots of beach infrastructure and services. If you&#39;re interested, you can find this location in the Dutch region Noord-Holland. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place 300m away from the beach. Like it is usual for this type of beaches you need to cross a 10 m high dune via a concrete path. This sandy beauty is several kilometres long and has a minimum of 100 m width, at low tide even more. The water entry is nice and because of the shallow water the point of swim is far out away. Not only you have here all the essential beach infrastructure, you also have different types of restaurants on the beach itself. Around the parking place many types of apartments and hotels are available, and in the vicinity there is also a camp.', 4060, 'en', 1),
(677, 'The Dutch city Callantsoog is one of the most popular tourist destination in the region Noord-Holland, not only for the Dutch people, but also for foreign tourists, mainly the Germans. The city itself has in its core many different types of all kind of shops, different restaurants and of course different types of accommodation to offer and of course they also have a very beautiful sandy beach, which goes by the name Strand Kiefteglop, with lots of beach infrastructure and services. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place some 500m away from the beach. Like it is usual for this type of beaches in this region, you need to cross a 10 m high dune via a concrete path. If you have a bike you don&#39;t need to walk to the beach, there is a parking place for bikes by the beach entry. This sandy beauty is several kilometres long and has a minimum of 100 m width, at low tide even more. The water entry is nice and because of the shallow water the point of swim is far out away. Not only you have here all the essential beach infrastructure, you also have different types of restaurants on the beach itself, some are located close to the beach entry, some a little bit further away. Around the parking place many types of apartments and hotels are available and in the vicinity there are also many camps. And remember, if you are searching for the perfect beach for you, always use BeachRex and use our powerful search engine, which will provide you with the optimal results in a matter of seconds. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 4061, 'en', 1),
(678, 'The Dutch sandy beach Strand Petten Centrum is a must go for all the ones who like a flat beach and would like to spend a day there. Not all the area is flat, but most of it sure is. If you would like to visit it, you can find this beach in the region Noord-Holland by the city Petten. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park on a very large parking place only 100m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to use stairs which go 10 m in height difference down to the beach. This sandy beauty is several kilometres long and more than 100m wide. Because of the flat beach and the shallow water the water entry is nice and the swimming point is at 75 m. All the necessary beach infrastructure is located here, a restaurant and beach bar included. You also have many options to find the right accommodation for you in the vicinity of the beach, like a hotel, an apartment and the closest one a camp.', 4062, 'en', 1),
(679, 'Because of the very flat beach surface and the shallow water, this sandy beach Strand Hargen aan Zee is very popular amongst the watersports enthusiast and the ones who need a flat surface for the sport activities on the beach, like horse riding or driving wind buggy. But be aware that all those activities are allowed outside the main beach season. It is located in the Dutch region Noord-Holland, close to the city Schoorl. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place only 200 meters away from the beach. The access to the beach is an easy one, a concrete path is laid there. It is a several kilometers long beach and more than 100 m wide. Because of the flat area the water entry is very nice but the swimming point is very far out away at more than 100 m. All the essential beach infrastructure is located here, you also have a restaurant on the beach. Accommodation is not available on the beach or in the surrounding area.', 4063, 'en', 1),
(680, 'The small village Bergen aan Zee on the Dutch west coastline, with the sandy beach, who has the same name as the village, is recommended for all those one, who like to have all the necessary tourist facilities close to the beach, lots of restaurants, shops and of course many types of accommodation included. It is located in the Dutch region Noord-Holland and is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle. Parking can be done either by the road or on a small central parking which is 200m away from the beach. The access to the beach is very easy. This beach is very flat and because of the shallow water and in the case of strong wings, it is loved by kiteborders. The total length is several km and it is 100 m wide. The water entry is because of the shallow water very nice but the swimming point is far out away, at more than 100m.', 4064, 'en', 1),
(681, 'In the Dutch region Noord-Holland, usually when you go to the beach you need to take into account that you would have to walk at least 300 m to 500m before you reach the beach from your parking place. But this is not the case on the beach Strand Egmond aan Zee, which is located in the city with the same name. Here it will take you only 50 m from your vehicle to get to the beach. The beach is made of sand, like this is the case on the whole west coastline. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road very close to the beach. The access is easy. This sandy beach has a total length of several kilometres and is 75 m wide. It has a normal inclination, but close to the water it gets quite flat. Together with the shallow water you have a nice water entry. The point of swim is far out away. Many beach infrastructure is located here, on the beach itself you also have different restaurants. Accommodation is also available in the vicinity and it comes in different forms and types.', 4065, 'en', 1),
(682, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Strand Wijk aan Zee is a Dutch beach located in the region Noord-Holland on the west coastline, facing the North Sea. It&#39;s a family beach with a sandy surface and a very large beach area. If you would like to visit it, it is very easy to get here with any kind of vehicle, you have a very large parking place only 100m away from the beach. The access to the beach goes via a concrete path, which is also suitable for handicapped people. It is a several km long beach with a width of at least 100m. The beach has on different spots different inclination and where the water starts it gets quite flat. Together with a quite shallow water, U have a nice water entry and the point of swim is at approximately 75 m. Many beach services are available here, as well as many types of restaurants, mostly of them directly located on the beach. Accommodation is also available in many types and forms in the vicinity of the beach, the closest one is a hotel but a camp is also nearby.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, if you are searching for the perfect beach for you, always use BeachRex and use our powerful search engine, which will provide you with the optimal results in a matter of seconds. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</span></div>\n', 4066, 'en', 1),
(683, 'What is the closest sandy beach on the Dutch west coastline in the region Noord-Holland to the famous city Amsterdam? We can give you the answer, it is the beach Kennemerstrand. The nearest city to this beach is Ijmuiden and it is located right on the point where the ship canal to Amsterdam touches the North Sea. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, also with a motorhome and you have a very large parking place only 100m away from the beach entry. According to the large parking place and the huge beach size, this beach looks like most of Amsterdam inhabitants go to. The beach is easy accessible by a concrete path. The beach itself has a very large area. It is several kilometres long and more than 100m wide. It is very flat with a shallow water which makes the water entry very nice but you need to walk for quite a time before you can actually start to swim. You have lots of beach infrastructure and services available on this location. Many different types of restaurants are as well directly on the beach. And if you&#39;re searching for accommodation you have a hotel nearby.', 4067, 'en', 1),
(684, 'If you&#39;re searching for one of the most beautiful Dutch sandy beaches you should take a closer look at the beach Strand Parnassia. It is located in the Dutch region Noord-Holland, close to the city Bloemendaal, not very far away from Amsterdam. The whole surrounding around the beach is full of nature and except a restaurant by the parking, you don&#39;t have any buildings around. Very high dunes are surrounding this area and giving the beach a special characteristics. It is very easy to get here with any kind of vehicle and you can park on a very large parking place 100m away from the beach. The path to the beach is not the easiest one, it is quite steep and you need to descent down a dune. This sandy beauty is several kilometres long and more than 100m wide. The inclination of the beach gets very flat the more close you are to the water. The flat beach at the water and the shallow water make the water entry very nice but the point of swim is because of that far away. Other essential beach infrastructure is located around the parking place, this is also the location where you have the restaurant and in summertime beach bars are on the beach. Accommodation is also available in the vicinity but only in the form of a camp or autocamp.', 4068, 'en', 1),
(685, 'This Dutch sandy beach Strand Bloemendaal aan Zee, which is not far away from the city Amsterdam, is recommended for all those ones who like to have a very touristic surrounding, with lots of different types of restaurants and many beach services. It is located in the Dutch region Noord-Holland, close to the city Overveen. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, except motorhomes, which are not allowed to park here. The parking place is very large and it takes you 100m of walking down a concrete path to reach the beach. The total length of the beach is several km and it is 100m wide. By the water it gets quite flat and together with the shallow water it creates a nice water entry. Swimming point is far out away. If you would like to stay here for longer or spend your holidays here you also have the option to stay in a neighbouring camp or to rent an apartment or a house nearby.', 4069, 'en', 1),
(686, 'Have you ever been to a sandy beach where you could actually have a race track just next to your beach, where racing cars of all kind, also the famous F1, and sport bikes are in the quest for the fastest time, or who crosses the finish line first? I guess probably not, but in the Netherlands, in the city Zandvoort you even can have this experience. The name of the beach is Strand Zandvoort aan Zee Noord. It is located in the Dutch region Noord-Holland. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place stretching along the whole stretch of the beach. Motorhomes can also park here on a special designated place. The path to the beach is quite easy, either you take the stairs or you go down a concrete road. At the beginning the beach is quite steep, but it flattens towards the water. It is several km long and more than 100m wide. Because of the shallow water the water entry is quite nice, but the swimming point is far out away. This place is very touristic, which means you have lots of beach services available on the beach and in the surrounding. Restaurants are as well available in many types and forms, which is also true for the accommodation, where you can choose according to your needs.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, if you are searching for the perfect beach for you, always use BeachRex and use our powerful search engine, which will provide you with the optimal results in a matter of seconds. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</span>', 4070, 'en', 1),
(687, 'The Dutch city Zandvoort is not only famous for its race track but also because of the several kilometres long sandy beach it has to offer its visitors. Along the whole stretch of the beach u have numerous entry points to access the beach. It is located in the region Noord-Holland. On this particular spot has the name Strand Zandvoort aan Zee Centrum. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle and many parking options are available, either by the street or on a large parking place a few hundred metres away. The access to the beach is very easy and you have a concrete path which leads to the beach. The beach is several km long and it is more than 100 m wide. When you access the beach u have a quite normal inclination which flattens towards the sea. This fact and the shallow water make the water entry very nice, but the point of swim is far out away. Many beach services are available here as well as many different options of restaurants, which is also true for all the different types of accommodation you have available in the vicinity.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, if you are searching for the perfect beach for you, always use BeachRex and use our powerful search engine, which will provide you with the optimal results in a matter of seconds. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</span>', 4071, 'en', 1),
(688, 'If you&#39;re searching for a sandy beach in the middle of the Zuid-Holland dunes, close to the city Noordwijk, we recommend you to visit the Dutch beach Strand Noordwijk 27. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place 200m away from the beach. The parking here is not for free, it will cost you &euro;3 per day. This location is recommended for families, and because of the shallow water and the children playgrounds, it is also recommended for small children. Close to the parking place you also have most of the beach infrastructure and all the different types of restaurants. On the beach or close to the beach, because of the dune nature, you don&#39;t have any option for accommodation. To access the beach is very easy and it is also suitable for handicapped people. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it is 100m wide. You really have lots of beach area here, close to the water the beach gets quite flat and together with the shallow water you have a very nice beach entry, but a quite far away point of swim.', 4072, 'en', 1),
(689, 'The Dutch city Noordwijk, located in the Dutch region Zuid-Holland, has a very touristic character and a very long sandy beach with lots of beach area, many different types of hotels as well as numerous restaurants and beach services all around the area. The name of this part of the beach is Strand Noordwijk 18. It is a family beach, not only because of the shallow water, but also because you have a children playground on the beach. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park it either close to the beach by the road or a little bit further away on a very large parking place. Minimum distance to get to the beach is 100 m and you need to descent down a concrete path to access the beach. It is several kilometres long and more than 100m wide. Because of the shallow water and beach getting flat towards the sea, you have a very nice water entry and a quite far away point of swim.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, if you are searching for the perfect beach for you, always use BeachRex and use our powerful search engine, which will provide you with the optimal results in a matter of seconds. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</span>', 4073, 'en', 1),
(690, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">On the Dutch west coastline, in the region Zuid-Holland, you can find many beautiful sandy beaches, which are facing on one side the North Sea and on the other side the high dunes. Strand Katwijk 6 &amp; 8 is such one beach and it is located in the city Katwijk aan Zee. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes included, and you can park on a very large parking place 200 m away from the beach. The access to the beach is also easy and it leads you on a concrete path. Once you are on the beach u have a very large beach area at your disposal. The total length is several kilometres and it is more than 100 m wide. The inclination is quite normal and it gets flatter towards the sea. The seabed is very shallow, which makes the water entry very nice, but because of it the point of swim is far out away. Beach infrastructure is here only basic, there are no public toilets, except in the restaurant on the beach, which on the other hand is probably open only in summer time. Accommodation is available in the vicinity in many forms, predominantly as a hotel, also a camp is available, but is a few kilometres away.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, if you are searching for the perfect beach for you, always use BeachRex and use our powerful search engine, which will provide you with the optimal results in a matter of seconds. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</span></div>\n', 4074, 'en', 1),
(691, 'Strand Katwijk Boulevard Zeezijde 51 is a Dutch sandy beach located on the west coastline in the region Zuid-Holland. The beach is very long, it stretches for several kilometres and offers you along the whole stretch many entry points. It is very easy and fast accessible from the parking place, which is only 50 m away. If you like all those characteristics, you can find this beach in the city Katwijk aan Zee. You will easy find this location, no matter what the vehicle you&#39;re travelling with. The beach area is very large and beside having several kilometres of beach length available, you also need to know that the beach is very wide, more than 100 m, at low tide even more. Closer to the sea the beach gets very flat and together with the shallow water you have a nice beach entry, but if you want to swim you need to take into account that the point of swim is very far out away. Many beach services are available here as well as many different types of beach bars and restaurants. Different options of accommodation are as well available close by.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, if you are searching for the perfect beach for you, always use BeachRex and use our powerful search engine, which will provide you with the optimal results in a matter of seconds. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</span>', 4075, 'en', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(692, 'On the west coastline, close to the city Wassenaar, you have a very beautiful sandy beach in the middle of sand dunes, called Strand 3 Wassenaarse. It is part of the region Zuid-Holland where also the famous cities Rotterdam and Den Haag are located. It is very easy to get to this location with any kind of vehicle and you can park on a very large parking place only 100m away from the beach. The access to the beach is very easy and handicapped people can also approach it. The total length of the beach is several km and it is 100 m wide with a quite steep inclination. The water entry is very nice and because of the shallow water the point of swim is far out away. You have many beach services and infrastructure located here, as well as many different types of restaurants and beach bars. Some children playgrounds are as well here. The only accommodation around here is a hotel which is around 1 km away, otherwise there are no other options.', 4076, 'en', 1),
(693, 'Close to the Dutch city Den Haag, there is probably one of the most famous sandy beaches in the Netherlands, the seaside resort Scheveningen. It is a very touristic place and will fulfill probably all your touristic needs, wishes and pleasures. The region where this beach, called Noorderstrand, is located is Zuid-Holland. If you&#39;re a fan of such touristic places and you would like to visit it, you can arrive with any kind of vehicle and there are numerous options to park. The closest one you can get with a vehicle is only 50 m away from the beach and some are a little bit more further away, but no matter where you park you have plenty of spaces. The access to the beach is very easy and you have many entry points along the whole stretch of the beach. It is a very flat beach with a very large beach area. The whole length is several kilometres and the maximum width is 200 m. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at around 30 m. This beach has also a special characteristic for creating waves, which is in favour for the surfers. A lot of surf schools, renting equipment shops and surf shops are located here. This beach and the surrounding area is also known for casinos and for a real party atmosphere. The beach infrastructure and the services are on the highest level and will please all your demands. Restaurants and beach bars are available in all possible forms, shapes and types you can imagine. Accommodation is also available near the beach, predominantly in hotels and apartments.', 4077, 'en', 1),
(694, 'The Dutch city Den Haag has a north beach and a south beach. If the north beach is the most famous Dutch touristic destination, the south beach is the complete opposite. So if you prefer a sandy beach with almost zero beach infrastructure, no restaurants, but a huge parking place, the beach Zuiderstrand is the one for you. Like the north beach also the south is located in the region Zuid-Holland. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, and you can park on a large parking place only 50 m away from the beach. The access to the beach is very easy and goes via a concrete path. The beach area is very large and you have several kilometres of length and more than 100m of width available. The inclination is normal and it gets more flat towards the sea, which makes the water entry very nice and the point of swim is also only 40 m away. This place is also a popular surfer location. Beach infrastructure is here only basic. In the summertime you possibly have a beach kiosk or some fast food available. Toilets are possibly available in the summertime only as a dixi style. Some accommodation is also in the vicinity in the form of apartments and some hotels are a little bit further away.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">And remember, if you are searching for the perfect beach for you, always use BeachRex and use our powerful search engine, which will provide you with the optimal results in a matter of seconds. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</span>', 4078, 'en', 1),
(695, 'Strand Zuiderstrand 3B is a very long sandy beach which belongs to the City Den Haag in the Dutch region Zuid-Holland. The Netherlands west coastline is famous for this type of beaches, which are typically very long, very wide an offer it&#39;s visitors a huge beach area where everyone will find its place. If you are searching for this kind of beach or you are nearby the city Den Haag, we recommend you to visit it. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle. You have lots of parking options around the beach and it typically takes you 200 m of walking to reach the beach. Because this place is also very touristic you can be sure to have lots of beach services available, as well as many different types of beach bars and restaurants, many children playgrounds are as well on the beach. Different types of apartments and hotels are located directly on the beach, and in the vicinity you even have a camp. The beach itself is several kilometres long and more than 100m wide. It has a normal inclination and a very shallow water which are a guarantee for a nice water entry but a very far away point of swim.', 4079, 'en', 1),
(696, 'If you like or you&#39;re searching for a beach with lots of beach surface, where the beach width is a few hundred metres and the length is several km, we recommend you to visit the Dutch beach Strand Monster Molenslag. It is located on the west coastline, facing the North Sea in the region Zuid-Holland. The closest city is Ter Heijde. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle and can simply park on a very large parking place 200m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to walk over a 10 metre high dunes barrier. The path is made of concrete. The inclination on the beach is different from spot to spot and it gets more flat towards the water. This fact, together with the shallow water, make the water entry very nice and the swimming point is at 50 m. All essential beach infrastructure is available to you directly on the beach. A few types of restaurants are as well here. If you would like to stay here for longer you have the option to stay in a hotel or in an apartment.', 4080, 'en', 1),
(697, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Dutch city Rotterdam, Europe&#39;s biggest logistics port, has in its vicinity some astonishing sandy beaches, which you can visit if you are nearby and you would like to spend your day on a sandy beach. This one, we are presenting here, is located close to the city s-Gravenzande in the region Zuid-Holland and goes by the name Strand Slag Beukel. It is a family beach, which is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle. You have some 200m from the beach a very large parking place, which welcomes also motorhomes, at your disposal. To access the beach, you need to walk over a 10 m high dune, but don&#39;t worry, the path is made of concrete, is very wide and is in a good condition. Once you&#39;re on the beach you will be amazed by the size of the beach area you have in front of you. In totally it is several kilometres long and more than 100m wide. The inclination is normal and it gets flat towards the sea. Here you also have a quite shallow water, which makes the water entry very nice and the swimming point is at 50 m. All essential beach infrastructure and services are available to you either directly on the beach or by the parking place. On the beach itself you also have a restaurant or a beach bar. Small children playgrounds and a sports field are as well available. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach, but in the form of apartments in the closest city not far away.&nbsp;And remember, if you are searching for the perfect beach for you, always use BeachRex and use our powerful search engine, which will provide you with the optimal results in a matter of seconds. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.</div>\n', 4081, 'en', 1),
(698, 'If you&#39;re in Rotterdam and you&#39;re searching for the closest sandy beach, we suggest you to visit the beach Strand Slag Zeekant, located in the city Hook of Holland. It is a beach with immense proportions, the beach area is really huge, total length is several kilometres and it is more than 100m wide. The whole surrounding around the beach is very touristic and you have lots of beach infrastructure and services available, also numerous restaurants of all types are here, and we also didn&#39;t forget the shops which are waiting for you here as well. You also have the option to rent and accommodation directly on the beach in the form of apartments in containers. The region where this beach is located is called Zuid-Holland. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and a very large parking place, 200m away from the beach, is located here. The access to the beach is easy. This beach has a normal inclination which falls steadily towards the sea. The water entry is very nice and because of the shallow water the point of swim is at around 50 m. Children of all ages will also love this place, not only is the water shallow but you also have numerous children playgrounds for them directly on the beach. Enjoy a wonderful beach day with BeachRex. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 4082, 'en', 1),
(699, 'Netherlands has really some unique beaches. There are not many places in the world where you could go on a sandy beach almost in the middle of the world&#39;s biggest harbour, in Rotterdam. On the one side you can enjoy the sandy beach and on the other side you can watch the loading and unloading of world&#39;s biggest ship containers. This beach is recommended for an adventurer beach user&nbsp;type, you have here almost no beach infrastructure, no restaurants and of course also no accommodation. If you still prefer this kind of beaches, by the way it is located in the region Zuid-Holland, this location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road only 30 m away from the beach. The beach is several kilometres long and more than 100 m wide. It has a nice water entry and the point of swim is at around 50 m. Close to the beach there is also a part of the beach which is reserved for nudist and a part for sport activities. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex. And remember, always use BeachRex to find your perfect beach.&nbsp;', 4083, 'en', 1),
(700, 'Rotterdam has really some special beaches. There are not many places in the world where you could go on a sandy beach almost in the middle of the world&#39;s most biggest harbours, at least in Europe it is the biggest one. On the one side you can enjoy the sandy beach an on the other side you can watch the loading and unloading of world&#39;s most biggest ship containers. This beach, called Strand Maasvlakte, is recommended for an adventurer type of beach user, you have here almost no beach infrastructure, no restaurants and of course also no accommodation. This beach is located in the Dutch region Zuid-Holland and is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You can park on a very large parking place only 50 m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to walk over a 5 m high dune, over some very steep stairs. The beach is several kilometres long and more than 100 m wide. It has a nice water entry and the point of swim is at around 50 m. Close to the beach there is also a part of the beach which is reserved for nudist and a part for sport activities, dogs are also allowed here.', 4084, 'en', 1),
(701, 'The Dutch sandy beach Strand Slufter is mostly recommended for the ones who don&#39;t need any beach infrastructure, except the parking place, and a very huge beach area, with many kilometres of length and a few hundred meters of widthness. It is located on the brinks of the Europe&#39;s biggest port in Rotterdam in the Dutch region Zuid-Holland. If you like all those characteristics, this beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road where a very large parking place is only 100 m away from the beach. The access to the beach is not the easiest one, you need to descent some 15 m in height over a dune. All over the place it is a very flat beach and towards the sea you have a very shallow water which makes the water entry very nice and the point of swim varies from spot to spot, especially because of the fact that in the middle of the beach you have a small but a deep little lake in which you can also take a swim, but it drops in depth immediately, otherwise the point of swim is far out away. Restaurants are also not available here as well as there is also no option for accommodation.', 4085, 'en', 1),
(702, 'According to the Dutch people the beach Strand Rockanje is one of the most beautiful beaches in whole Netherlands. It is a sandy beach with lots of purple shells, a very huge beach area and many restaurants and beach services available on it. The region where it is located is Zuid-Holland and it is a proud beach of the city Rockanje. No matter what the vehicle you are travelling with this location is very easy to reach and you have a very large parking place 200m away from the beach. The path to the beach is very easy and is made of concrete, also suitable for handicapped people. The inclination on the beach is normal and is more flat towards the sea. Altogether it is several kilometres long and 100m wide. You have a very nice beach entry, and because of the shallow water the point of swim is far out away. A certain part of the beach, a little bit further away from the entry point, is also reserved for nudist. Children will also love this place, you have a children playground on the beach and one beside the path to the beach. Accommodation is also available in the vicinity, mainly as hotels, apartments and even a camp.', 4086, 'en', 1),
(703, 'According to the Dutch people also this, beach Strand Rockanje 1e slag, like the neighbouring 2e slag, is one of the most beautiful beaches in whole Netherlands. It is a sandy beach with some small shells, a very huge beach area and many restaurants and beach services available on it. The region where it is located is Zuid-Holland and it is a proud beach of the city Rockanje. No matter what the vehicle you are travelling with this location is very easy to reach and you have a very large parking place 200m away from the beach. The path to the beach is very easy and is made of concrete, also suitable for handicapped people. The inclination on the beach is quite flat towards the sea. Altogether the beach is several kilometres long and more than 100m wide, with low tide even more. You have a very nice beach entry and because of the shallow water the point of swim is far out away. A certain part of the beach, a little bit further away from the entry point is also reserved for the dogs. Children will also love this place, you have a children playground on the beach as well as a sport playground. Accommodation is also available in the vicinity mainly as hotels, Apartments and even a camp. Enjoy your beach day with BeachRex, and remeber, if you would like to find your next dream beach, always use BeachRex.', 4087, 'en', 1),
(704, 'The Dutch region Zuid-Holland has many beautiful beaches, most of them on the west coastline by the North Sea, but you can also find some sandy beaches on lakes, like the beach Strand Hellecat. It is recommended for families and is located close to the city Hellevoetsluis. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle and a parking place is located very close to the beach, only a few metres away. The total length of the beach is 500 metres and it is 50 metres wide. The beach has a normal inclination and a very nice water entry. The point of swim is already at 5 m. On the beach you have all the essential beach infrastructure, a lifeguard included. A beach bar and a restaurant are as well on the beach. Accommodation is not available directly on the beach but in the surrounding area, mainly in the form of apartments. Enjoy your beach day with BeachRex.', 4088, 'en', 1),
(705, 'Strand Haringvlietsluizen is the name of the beach you should remember, if you&#39;re searching for a Dutch sandy beach for an adventurer user type, who except the beach, doesn&#39;t need anything more on the beach. That means that you have here almost no beach infrastructure, no restaurant, no accommodation and also very little people who will visit this beach. It is located in the Dutch region Zuid-Holland, close to the city Hellevoetsluis. It is very easy to reach this location with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place 500 m away from the beach. The path to the beach is very beautiful and leads through a small tunnel and some small forestation. All together the beach has a total length of several kilometres and is more than 100 m wide. It is a very large and quite flat beach area. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at 75 m, with high tide possibly less. Although no restaurant is available on the beach itself you have a restaurant available by the parking place and some accommodation in the surrounding area. Enjoy your beach adventure with BeachRex, and remember, always use BeachRex if you would like to find your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 4089, 'en', 1),
(706, 'On the Dutch Lake Haringvliet in the region Zuid-Holland you have are very beautiful small sandy beach, called Strand Vuurtoren. It is located in the City Hellevoetsluis, close to a harbour and the historic water fortifications, which are a must go if you are visiting the city or you want to enjoy some time on the beach. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road directly in front of the beach. The access to the beach is very easy and once you&#39;re on the beach you have altogether a 400m long beach which has a maximum width of 30 metres. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at 10 m. The beach is quite flat and children will love this beach, because you have a wooden ship children playground and some other children experimental installations located here. All the essential beach infrastructure is available here for you, a restaurant is very close by and you also have some options for accommodation, the closest one are a few hotels and one camp, approx. 1 km away. If you would like to find more beaches with the same characteristics use our advanced beach filter, and BeachRex will show the right beaches for you. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex.&nbsp;', 4090, 'en', 1),
(707, 'This sandy beach, located in the Dutch region Zuid-Holland, close to the city Ouddorp, is really a very special one. The fact which makes it so unique is its flatness, especially at low tide when the water moves far away, probably more than one kilometre. If you like such beach characteristics, then the beach Strand Oosterduinpad is the one for you. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place 500m away from the beach. The path which leads to the beach is paved and goes over a 5 m high dune. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have a very large beach area with several kilometres of length and more than 100 m of width available, at low tide more than 1 km. This makes the water entry of course very nice, but you would need to walk quite for a time to reach the point of swim. The shallow water together with a few children playgrounds makes this location a perfect spot for small children, either to play in the water safely or hang out on the playground. All the essential beach infrastructure is located here, you also have a restaurant on the beach, and if you are searching for accommodation around the parking place you have many different options to find one. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and remember, always use BeachRex advanced filter if you would like to find your next dream beach in only a few seconds.', 4091, 'en', 1),
(708, 'Around the Dutch city Ouddorp, which is located on the west coastline, facing the North Sea and belongs to the region Zuid-Holland, you have numerous beautiful sandy beaches. All of them are very easy accessible and it would be a shame not to visit them if you are nearby. This beach, which goes by the name Strand 3e Blok, is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes are also allowed to park here, and you have a very large parking place some 400m away from the beach. The path to the beach is very nice and paved, but it goes over 5 m high dunes. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it is at least 100m wide, at low tide even more. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at high tide at around 40 m, at low tide you need to walk some additional meters to be able to swim. The beach is quite flat and it offers you all the essential beach infrastructure, as well as a beach bar and a restaurant. You also have the option for accommodation nearby in the form of a camp, other types of accommodation are not available. Enjoy your beach day with BeachRex, and remember, always use BeachRex advanced filter to find your next dream beach in a matter of seconds.', 4092, 'en', 1),
(709, 'Around the Dutch city Ouddorp, which is located on the west coastline, facing the north sea, and it belongs to the region Zuid-Holland, you have numerous beautiful sandy beaches for all type of users. All of them are very easy accessible and it would be a shame not to visit them if you are nearby. This beach which goes by the name Strand 8 Noordweg, is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, motorhomes are also allowed to park here, and you have a parking place for some 50 vehicles some 200m away from the beach. The path to the beach is very nice and paved but it goes over 10 m high dune which is on some places quite steep. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it is at least 100m wide, at low tide even more. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at high tide at around 40 m, at low tide even more. The beach has a normal inclination and it offers you only essential beach infrastructure, restaurant is not available. You also have the option for accommodation nearby in the form of a camp, other types of accommodation are not available.', 4093, 'en', 1),
(710, 'On the Dutch west coastline, close to the city Ouddorp, located in the region Zuid-Holland, you have a very nice sandy family beach Strand 12&#39;t Gorsje. Nearby there is also the Brouwersdam, which separates the north sea and the lake Grevelingenmeer. If you are nearby or are searching for a beach in this location, you can arrive with any kind of vehicle and a very large parking place, 200m away from the beach, is waiting here for you. The path which leads to the beach is in a good condition and it is paved. Total length of the beach is several kilometres and it has a minimum width of 100m, with low tide even more. The water entry is very nice here and the point of swim starts already at 15 m. You have all the essential beach infrastructure located on the beach. A restaurant and a beach bar is as well available to you. Accommodation on the beach or near the beach is not available.', 4094, 'en', 1),
(711, 'Maldives never felt closer in the Netherlands then on this beach. Although the beach is completely artificial, the architects have done a great job and made one of the best looking beaches in Europe and certainly in Netherlands. Around the beach you also have very nice houses and apartments and some of them you can even rent. If you like such a beach, it goes by the name Strand De Punt Grevelingen, and it is located near the city Ouddorp and belongs to the region Zuid-Holland. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and a very large parking place, 100m away from the beach is here at your disposal. The main surface is obviously sand. It has many different shapes and forms and in total it has a length of 1 km and is 20 m wide. Water entry is very nice, additional you can also use the water ladder. The point of swim begins very quickly, in some spots you can even jump into the water. Many beach services are available here. A restaurant which is also a beach bar is also here. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and remember, if you would like to find more dream beaches for your next beach adventure, always use our BeachRex advanced filter.&nbsp;', 4095, 'en', 1),
(712, 'In Netherlands you won&#39;t find any sandy beach which can offer you more sport activities of all different types then on the beach Strand Brouwersdam De Kous. This beach is not only very flat, it is also very long, several kilometres and around 500 m wide, which makes it ideal for buggy surfing or buggy kiting. But it is not only reserved for sports, you also have a part reserved only for simple sunbathing and swimming. If you like all those beach characteristics, this location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have several kilometres parking options along the whole stretch of the beach. This beach is located in the region Zuid-Holland on the Brouwersdam, close to the city Ouddorp. You have all the essential beach infrastructure an additional beach services located directly on the beach. When going to the water the beach gets a little bit more steep before you enter the water, but it is always a very nice water entry and the point of swim is at around 30 m. A restaurant and a few beach bars, as well as beach equipment rental shops, are also located here. Accommodation is available close by on the other side of the dam in the form of apartments and hotels and even as a camp.', 4096, 'en', 1),
(713, 'Most of the beaches in the Dutch region Zuid-Holland are made of sand and have immense proportions in the sense of their sizes, but you also have one beach where the main surface is grass. One of the reasons is also the fact that it is not located on the west coastline, where you have the most sandy beache, but on the lake Grevelingenmeer, very close to the Brouwersdam, near the city Ouddorp, were not many sandy beaches are located. It is very easy to get here with any kind of vehicle and you can park almost directly at the beach on a very large parking place. This beach is also very popular amongst windsurfers and those one who need shallow waves and strong winds. You also have here a very unique installation, it is a waterslide with a jump into the lake. The beach has a total length of 300m, is 20 m wide, is very flat, has a nice water entry and the point of swim is at 15 m. All the necessary beach infrastructure and additional services are located directly on the beach. A beachbar and a restaurant are as well located here. In the surrounding area you also have different types of accommodation available, also a camp.', 4097, 'en', 1),
(714, 'On the Dutch lake Gravelingenmeer, which is located in the region Zuid-Holland, you have a nice sandy beach, called Strand Grevelingenstrand, on the small peninsula Port Z&eacute;lande. This peninsula is attached to the Brouwersdam. The closest city here around is Ouddorp. On the beach itself you also have a touristic village with nice small houses located directly on the beach. If you like this characteristic, it is very easy to arrive here with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road only 50 m away from the beach. This beach is artificial made and it comes in many different shapes and forms, which are dispersed around the whole beach. The water entry on most spots of the beach is quite steep and the point of swim is at around 10m. The total length of the beach is 300 m and it has a maximum width of 10m. All the essential beach infrastructure is located here, restaurants are not available and you have the accommodation available directly on the beach or you can choose some other one in the vicinity. Enjoy your beach with BeachRex, and remember, always use our advanced beach filter, if you would like to find in the fastest possible way your next dream beach.&nbsp;', 4098, 'en', 1),
(715, 'Located in the Dutch region Zeeland this sandy beach Strand Kijkduin is recommended for families and for those one who like to have a campsite nearby. If you like beaches with immense proportions, that means several kilometres of length end a few hundred meters of width, this beach is the one for you. The closest city is Renesse and this location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. A quite large parking place is 100 m away from the beach, which you can access via a paved road. All essential beach infrastructure is present here, as well as a restaurant and a beach bar. To go to swim you need to walk for quite a while before you actually reach the sea, but you have a nice water entry and the point of swim starts at 15 metres. If you like this beach characteristics and you would like to stay here for longer you have many different options for accommodation very close by.', 4099, 'en', 1),
(716, 'When crossing the Brouwersdam from north to the south or from the Dutch region Zuid-Holland to the Dutch region Zeeland one of the very first beaches you will encounter is the beach Strand Brouwersdam. It is a sandy beach with immense proportions and is recommended for a family user type. The closest city is Ellemeet and you can arrive here with any kind of vehicle and simply park by the road only a few metres away from the beach. The access to the beach is very easy and it is also suitable for handicapped people. On the beach you have a total length of several kilometres and a maximum width of more than 100m. This beach has a normal inclination you have a very nice water entry with the point of swim at around 15 metres. All essential beach infrastructure is available here. Different types of restaurants and beach bars ar as well located here. You also have many options for accommodation in the vicinity, from apartments to hotels and many camps.', 4100, 'en', 2),
(717, 'Close to the Dutch city Renesse in the region Zeeland, you have a very nice sandy beach Strand Jan van Renesseweg, which is mostly suitable for families, to spend a day or your summer holidays. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle very and you have a very large parking place 400m away from the beach. The access to the beach goes via a dune on a concrete pathway. Like it is usual four beaches in this region also this one has immense proportions, it is several kilometres long and around 100m wide, which can get even wider at low tide. Towards the sea the beach gets more flat and together with the shallow water u have a very nice beach entry, but the point of swim is quite far out away. All the essential beach infrastructure is located here. The same is also true for different types of restaurants and beach bars. If you would like to spend your holidays here you have many different types of accommodation in the surrounding area.', 4101, 'en', 1),
(718, 'If you&#39;re searching for a Dutch sandy beach with beautiful dunes in the middle of pure nature, more than 20 m in height, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Vuurtorenpad. It&#39;s located in the region Zeeland, close to the city Burgh-Haamstede. You can arrive here with any kind of vehicle and the parking places are available beside the road. To access the beach you need to take into account the 500 m walk on a concrete path with 20 m in height difference, first to the top of the dune and then down towards the beach. It is a nice walk and you will enjoy the view. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have a very large beach area with several kilometres of length and more than 100m of width. The beach has a normal inclination but it gets more flat towards the sea. The water entry is very nice and the point swim is at around 20 m. Beach infrastructure is only basic but you have a restaurant and a beach bar directly on the beach. Accommodation is available only in the surrounding area of the parking place mostly in the form of apartments.', 4102, 'en', 1),
(719, 'If you&#39;re travelling down the west coast line of Netherlands, from the north to the south, you have a very nice sandy beach, called Strand Rotonde, right before the Pijlerdam in the Dutch region Zeeland. The closest city is Burgh-Haamstede, but the beach is located closer to the village Westenschouwen. It is a family type beach, which is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. You have 100m away from the beach a very large parking place, motorhomes are also welcomed. To access the beach you need to cross a 10 metre high dune, which can be done by very steep stairs. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have a beach area with immense proportions available. The total length is several kilometres and it is more than 100 m wide. Towards the sea the beach gets more flat and together with the shallow water you have a very nice beach entry. The point of swim is located some 50 m away. All the essential beach infrastructure is located directly on the beach. You also have many different restaurants and beach bars either located on the beach or by the parking place. Accommodation is available in the vicinity in the form of apartments and as a camp.', 4103, 'en', 1),
(720, 'Have you ever been to a sandy beach on a Dutch North sea dam in the middle of the region Zeeland? If not, and if you\'re ok with the wind turbines looking over you, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Neeltje Jans. It is located on the Pijlerdam, close to the city Vrouwenpolder. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle and a large parking place is 200 m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to walk over a 5 m high water barrier fortification, but don\'t worry the path is in a good condition and you can use the stairs to cross over. The proportions of the beach are really impressive. It is a very large beach area with a total length of several kilometres and a width of more than 100 m. The beach area is very flat which makes the water enter very nice and the point of swim is at 75 m. All essential beach infrastructure is located here, you even have a restaurant and beach bar on the beach. On the dam you don\'t have any accommodation nearby only on the closest land.', 4104, 'en', 2),
(721, 'Strand De Banjaard is a sandy Dutch beach in the region Zeeland and it is the first beach on the west coastline when you travel from the north to the south over the Pijlerdam. It is a true family beach not only because of the children playgrounds but also because of the shallow water which makes the play in the water more safely for small children. You also have all the essential beach infrastructure here, as well as a restaurant and a beach bar and of course different types of accommodation in the vicinity. If you like this beach characteristics you can arrive with any kind of vehicle and simply park on a very large parking place 300 m away from the beach. The path to the beach is paved and also suitable for handicapped people. The beach area is very large and you have several kilometres of length and more than 100m of width at your disposal. On the beginning the beach is  very flat, then it drops a little bit and flattens again towards the sea. Because of that the water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 30 metres.', 4105, 'en', 2),
(722, 'Do you need a lot of beach area, for whatever the reason, a beach with really immense proportions, a beach where you are asking yourself if you are still on the beach or already in the desert? If your answer is yes and you\'re interested in such a beach we will try to present you the beach Strand Breezand in a quick overview. This sandy beauty is located in the Dutch region Zeeland, close to the city Vrouwenpolder. It\'s very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place only 100m away from the beach. To access it you need to cross a 10 m high dune via some steep stairs. Once you are on the beach you will be amazed by the size the beach offers you. It is very flat, several kilometres long and around 500 m wide. The water entry is very nice but of course at first you need to  get near the sea. The point of swim is it around 20 metres. You have all the essential beach infrastructure here as well as many different types of restaurants and beach bars. Children playground and sports fields are also located here. Accommodation is even available on the beach, where you can rent a beach bungalow or stay in an apartment or a camp in the vicinity.', 4106, 'en', 2),
(723, 'If you are searching for a true family beach in the Dutch region Zeeland, a one with children playgrounds and a very shallow water, so the children can play in it safely, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Duinweg. It is located near the city Oostkapelle and is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle. A very large parking place is 400m away from the beach. The path which leads to the beach is a paved one and is also suitable for handicapped people. The beach, especially at low tide, has immense proportions. It is several km long and more than 100 meters wide. The water entry is very nice, also because of the shallow water, but the point of swim is far out away. You have all the essential beach infrastructure, as well as children playgrounds located directly on the beach. A restaurant and a beach bar are as well here. If you like this place and you would like to spend your summer holidays here, you have many different options of accommodation nearby.', 4107, 'en', 1),
(724, 'Strand Duinstraat is a dutch beach in the region Zeeland, which is not only admired by the families, because of the children playground on the beach, but also among the surfers, who like the way the waves are transformed here when they touch the land. It is located in the city Domburg and this beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, and you can park on a large parking place 100m away from the beach. The access to the beach is easy and leads via a concrete path, which is also suitable for handicapped people to access the beach. This sandy beach is several km long and has at high tide a width of 75m, at low tide even more. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at 30 m. You have all the essential beach infrastructure here as well as a few types of restaurants and beach bars. Because this is a very interesting and touristic place, you have many different types of accommodation available in the vicinity.', 4108, 'en', 1),
(725, 'In the netherlands you have many beautiful beaches, of course most of them are a sandy type, but there are not many where you could almost park directly on the beach, at most of them you need to walk quiet for a while to reach them. Well, in the dutch region Zeeland, you actually have such a beach and it is called AutoStrand Westkapelle, not far away from the city Westkapelle. This beach is also popular amongst windsurfers and surfers. Obviously it is really easy to arrive here with any kind of vehicle, it is very popular amongst motorhomes, and simply park directly on the beach. This beach is several kilometres long and on some places even more than 100 metres wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 20 m. Beach infrastructure is here almost not present, it is only basic. Restaurants are as well not available directly on the beach. Accommodation is available in the vicinity in the form of camps.', 4109, 'en', 1),
(726, 'Strand Erica is a very beautiful, attractive and small, only 400 m in length ( that is very little if you compare it to other beaches who are several kilometres long) sandy Dutch beach in the city Westkapelle. The region where it is located is Zeeland. This beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a small parking place 100m away from the beach. To access it you have several options either you take the stairs or a paved road. The total length is 400 m and it is at least 75 m wide, at low tide even more. The water entry is very nice and because of the shallow water the point of swim is at 50 m. All the essential beach infrastructure, as well as a restaurant and a beach bar are located on the beach directly. Accommodation is also available in the vicinity in many different forms, a camp ground is also nearby.', 4110, 'en', 1),
(727, 'Zoutelande is the name of the city where the Dutch beach Strand De Hoge Hilt is located. It is a sandy beach recommended for families and those one who like to have a very large parking place close to the beach. From this beach you can also admire the view to the other side of the Scheldt canal. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place 200 m away from the beach. You need to cross the dune, which is 10 metres in height, over a nice paved road to access the beach. The beach is several kilometres long and has a minimum width of 75 m, at low tide even more. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 40 m. All the essential beach infrastructure is located  either by the parking place or on the beach itself. A restaurant and a beach bar are as well on the beach. Numerous different types of accommodation are located in the surrounding area some of them even very close to the beach.', 4111, 'en', 2),
(728, 'In the Dutch region Zeeland most of the sandy beaches have a sand dune behind their back, which protects the land the in the surrounding area from floods. This is also the case with the beach Strand Dishoek, a sandy beach located close to the city Koudekerke. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have two options to park your car, either you do it by the road or on a large parking place with a height barrier of 2,2 m. This beach is only accessible by stairs which go over the dune, some 15 m in height. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it has a minimum width of 75 m, whit low tide even more. The water entry here is very nice and the point of swim is at around 40 metres. Some basic basic infrastructure is available here, as well as a restaurant and a beachbar. Accommodation is available in the surrounding area, mainly in camps but you also have some hotels.', 4112, 'en', 2),
(729, 'Most of the beaches in the Dutch region Zeeland are recommended for families but there are also a few who are more suitable for an adventurer user type, meaning that you have almost no beach infrastructure, no restaurants but only a very large parking place. Such a beach is located close to the city Vlissingen and goes by the name Strand Burgemeester van Woelderenlaan. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place 200m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to cross a 10 m high dune on a paved path. This beach is several kilometres long and has a minimum width of 50m, at low tide even more. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at around 40 m. If you like such beaches and you would like to spend your holidays here you have many different options for accommodation in the vicinity of the beach.', 4113, 'en', 2),
(730, 'In Netherlands you won&#39;t find many beaches which are located directly in a city, especially not in the region Zeeland. Such a city, with a sandy beach, is Vlissingen, which is a very popular touristic destination. This beach is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and u have basically two major options to park your vehicle, either you do it by the road, or your park on a very large parking place a little bit further away. If you park by the road it only takes 30 metres to reach the beach. This beach is recommended for families, it has a normal inclination, is 750 metres long and more than 100 m wide. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is already after 20 m. Because this is a very touristic and popular dutch destination you have many beach services available on the beach. The same is also true for many different types of restaurants which are mostly located around the beach or in the vicinity. As it is usual for such a touristic destination you have plenty of different options to choose your favourite accommodation.', 4114, 'en', 1),
(731, 'On the brinks of the Dutch river Scheldt by the village Hoofdplaat you have a very nice little sandy beach with the same name as the village. This area is part of the region Zeeland and is located on the south side of the river not far away from the Belgium border. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking place only 100m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to cross a water barrier 10 metre high via stairs. On the beach you have 150m of length and 50 m of width available. The beach area has a normal inclination. The water entry is nice and the swimming point depends on low or high tide. At high tide you can start swimming after approximately 40 metres, at low tide you need to walk a little bit further till you reach the water but then can start swimming earlier. Very little beach infrastructure is present here. Buy the parking place you have a children playground. Restaurants or similar are not available on the beach or close by. Accommodation is available in the village in the form of apartments.', 4115, 'en', 2),
(732, 'The Dutch sandy beach Strand Breskens is located on a very special place. Here it is the point where the north sea and the river Scheldt meet. The influence of north sea and on the other side of the river have created a very nice and beautiful sandy beach which is admired by many tourists and beach visitors. This sandy beach is located in the city Breskens and belongs to the region Zeeland. It is very easy to get here with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road only 50 m away from the beach. You have two options to access the beach, either by the stairs or by a paved path. The total length of the beach is 1 km and it is more than 100m wide. Towards the sea it gets a little bit more steep. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is dependent upon low tide or high tide, but it should be around 40 m. All the essential beach infrastructure is located here, a children playground included and some sport fields. A restaurant and a beachbar are as well present here. Accommodation is also available in the city in many different forms.', 4116, 'en', 1),
(733, 'In the Dutch city Breskens, which is located in the region Zeeland, you have a very interesting beach Strand Zeekoet, because here the river Scheldt and the north sea crossover. It is a sandy beach recommended for families. The beach area is quite large, several km long and around 75 m wide, so you have enough space to play around and built sandcastles with your kids. You can arrive to this location with any kind of vehicle and simply park on a very large parking place 200 m away from the beach, or beside the road. This beach is accessible either by the stairs or by a small paved road, in both cases you need to cross a 10 metre high water protection barrier. This beach has a normal inclination and because of the quite shallow water you have a very nice watter entry and the point of swim is at around 50 m. Some beach infrastructure is available here, also a restaurant and even many different types of accommodation in the surrounding area.', 4117, 'en', 2),
(734, 'The Dutch city Breskens has got quite a few beautiful beaches which are stretching along the west coastline all the way up into the river Scheldt. The beach Strand Nieuwesluis we are describing here is already a little bit further away from the river Scheldt but it is still a very popular place for ship watching, were you can see some of the world\'s largest ships making the way to the port of Antwerpen. This location belongs to the region Zeeland. It\'s very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have a very large parking place 200m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to cross a 10 metre high water barrier via stairs. The main surface on the beach is sand and you have several kilometres of length a minimum of 75 m width, it low tide even more, available. The water entry is nice and the swimming point depends on the low or high tide, but it should be at around 20 m. All the essential beach infrastructure and services are available here, a restaurant and beach bar included. Accommodation is also available nearby but only in the form of a camp.', 4118, 'en', 2),
(735, 'If you&#39;re searching for a sandy beach in the dutch region Zeeland, close to the city Nieuwvliet, and with nice views of the west coast line and the large container ships passing by, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Kruishoofd. No matter what the vehicle you are travelling with this location is very easy to reach and you have a very large parking place 200 m away from the beach. Around the parking place and in the surrounding area you have many camps, apartments and even hotels. The access to the beach is very easy and you can either use the stairs or take a v paved path. If you&#39;re a fan of building sand castles or digging large sand holes with your children, you will have a very large beach area with many kilometres of length a minimum width of 100 m available for your activities. The water entry is nice and the point of swim mostly depends on low tide or high tide, but should be at around 30 m. Almost all necessary beach infrastructure is available here and additionally you also have a beach bar and a restaurant to fill your stomach and enjoy the dutch cuisine.', 4119, 'en', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(736, 'In Netherlands, very close to the Belgium border, you have many options to get to a sandy beach. If you like to watch large ships passing by, or simply just want to play with your children in the sand, the beach Strand Vlamingpolder is the right one for you. It is located near the city Retranchement in the Dutch region Zeeland. No matter what the vehicle you&#39;re travelling with this location is very easy to reach and you have multiple options to park your car. The closest parking place is 100m away, a bigger one a little bit more further. Because this is a very popular and touristic destination you have many different restaurants to choose from, also beach bars, which are located directly on the beach. The same is also true for your accommodation where you have the option to choose amongst different types. When you access the beach you have a nice paved path, which is also suitable for handicapped people. The total length of the beach several kilometres and it is more than 100 m wide. The water entry is very nice and you can already start swimming after 30 metres. All the essential beach infrastructure is here at your disposal.', 4120, 'en', 1),
(737, 'Have you ever been on a sandy beach which is located directly on a border between two countries? If not and you would like to have this experience, we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Duinlaan, a family beach on the border between Netherlands and Belgium. Cadzand is the name of the city which is the closest to the beach and Zeeland is the name of the region to look for to find this beach. No matter what the vehicle you&#39;re travelling with, this location is very easy to reach, also with a motorhome and a very large parking place is at your disposal some 400m away from the beach. The path to the beach is very nice and is paved. On the beach u have a very large area with several kilometres in length and more than 100 m in width. On the most part the inclination is normal and it flattens towards the sea. Like on most Dutch beaches you also have here a nice water entry and the point of swim is at around 75 m. All the essential beach infrastructure is either located on the beach directly or by the parking place. On the beach itself you also have a restaurant. Because this location is very popular, many different types of accommodations are available here, mostly in the form of campsites and hotels.', 4121, 'en', 1),
(738, 'The very first beach in north Belgium, not far away from the border with Netherlands, is the sandy beach Strand Het Zoute. It is located in the region West-Vlaanderen in the city Knokke-Heist. It is a very touristic place with lots of apartments and hotels directly on the beach. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road some 200 m away from the beach. The access to the beach is very easy. The total length is several kilometres and in the case of low tide this beach is a few 100m wide. You have a nice water entry and the point of swim is at around 40 metres. All the essential beach infrastructure is available here as well as a beach bar.', 4122, 'en', 1),
(739, 'In the Belgium city Knokke-Heist, which is a very popular and touristic destination, you have many beautiful beaches stretching for several kilometres. The beaches which are located here are a part of the region West-Vlaanderen. Strand Lekkerbekhelling is a sandy beach and recommended for families. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and like it as usual in Belgium you park beside the road and in 100m you are on the beach. The access to the beach is easy. On the beach you have very little beach infrastructure, also no restaurants, but you have all around many different types of apartments. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and it is more than 100 m wide. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at around 30 m.', 4123, 'en', 1),
(740, 'In the Belgium region West-Vlaanderen in the city Knokke-Heist, you have many beautiful beaches who are stretching for several kilometres. One of such city sandy beaches is the beach Strand Oosthinder, which is a family type beach and has in the summertime many beach services to offer. It is very easy to reach this location with any kind of vehicle and you can simply park beside the road only a few metres away from the beach, which is really convenient. What is good about this place is the accommodation, which is available directly on the beach, so you can see the beach directly from your balcony. On the beach you also have many beach bars and other installations which make your beach time easier. The total length of the beach is several kilometres and the minimum width is 100 m, at low tide even more. You have a very nice beach entry here and the point of swim is already after 15 m.', 4124, 'en', 1),
(741, 'The Belgium sandy beach Strand Knokke is located in the middle of the city Knokke-Heist. It is a family type beach and because it is very popular amongst the tourist you have many accommodations and different type of restaurants available directly on the beach. West-Vlaanderen is the name of the region this popular city is located. It is very easy to arrive here with any kind of vehicle and you can simply park beside the road only a few metres away from the beach. The beach area here is very large and you have several kilometres of length and more than 100m of width available. The water entery is very nice and the point of swim is dependent on on low or high tide but it should be at around 15 m. In the summertime many beach services are available here and will please all your needs.', 4125, 'en', 1),
(742, 'If you&#39;re searching for a sandy beach in Belgium with a very large beach area, where you have several kilometres of length and more than 100m of widthness available on the beach, we suggest you to visit the city Knokke-Heist and go to the beach Strand Meerlaan. It is located in the region West-Vlaanderen, is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can park beside the road only a few metres away from the beach. At the beginning the beach is very flat but then towards the water it gets a normal inclination. U have a very nice water entry and a point of swim at around 20 m, but it varies according to low or high tide. Many beach services are available here in the summertime as well as many beach bars and different types of restaurants. Accommodation is available directly at the beach in the form of apartments.', 4126, 'en', 1),
(743, 'Strand Zeegras is a sandy Belgium beach in the city Knokke-Heist. If you are a family this beach is recommended for you and you will love it especially if you are able to rent an accommodation in one of the numerous apartments located directly on the beach. The beach is very flat, but the inclination changes towards the sea where it gets more steep. The beach area here is very large and you have many kilometres of length and more than 100m of width available. If you like this characteristics, this beach is located in the region West-Vlaanderen and is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle. You have numerous parking options all around the place, some of them only a few metres away from the beach. In the summertime it gets very crowded, because this is a very popular touristic destination. Many beach services are available here and you can even rent some water equipment nearby. The water entry is very nice and the swimming point is at around 20 m, but it can vary according to low or high tide. Different types of beach bars and restaurants are available directly in the beach in the summertime.', 4127, 'en', 1),
(744, 'If you&#39;re searching for a true family beach in the Belgium region West-Vlaanderen in the city Knokke-Heist, we would recommend you to visit the sandy beach Strand Heldenplein. The reason to do so, is because of the fact that on this beach you have children playgrounds, you have sport fields, you have a very flat beach and if your children like to play in the water they can do it safely on this beach, because you have a shallow water. If you like all those characteristics, this beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, and you have multiple options in the surrounding area to park it. The closest parking places are only a few metres away from the beach. This place is also nice towards families because you can rent an apartment directly on the beach or in the surrounding area, even a campsite is close by. Many beach services are available here, as well as many different types of restaurants and beach bars. This sandy beach is several km long and more than 100 m wide. The water entry is very nice, but because of the shallow water the point of swim is far out away.', 4128, 'en', 1),
(745, 'Although Belgium has only got are short coastline with the north sea, it has quite a variety of beaches. The sandy beach Strand Zeebrugge is recommended for families and for all those ones who like very flat and very wide beaches. Families with small children will especially love this beach, because you have a children playground on it and this very shallow water is very safe for children to play in it safely. It is located in the region West-Vlaanderen and belongs to the city Brugge. This location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you simply park directly at the beach beside the road. It is a several kilometres long beach and at low tide it is around 500m wide. With such characteristics the water entry is very nice but the point of swim is far out away. You have all the essential beach infrastructure here, also restaurants and beach bars. And if you would like to stay here for longer, on the beach directly you can book a hotel or stay in an apartment.', 4129, 'en', 1),
(746, 'In the Belgium city Blankenberge you can visit a very nice natural sandy beach with amazing dunes in the background. This beach is located in the region West-Vlaanderen and goes by the name Strand Duinse Polders. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you can simply park beside the road 200 metres away from the beach. To access the beach you need to cross a 10 m high dune via the help of stairs and a dirt path. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have several kilometres of length and more than 100m of width available. The water entry is nice but the point of swim is far out away. Bring your food and drinks with you because here are no restaurants or beach bars present as well as no beach infrastructure. Accommodation is available in the vicinity in many different forms also some campsites.', 4130, 'en', 1),
(747, 'In the Belgium city Blankenberge you have a very special sandy beach located in the middle of the city itself. It is probably one of the most attractive buildings in the city and it is a very long pier from which you can admire all the beauty of the sandy beach. West-Vlaanderen is the name of the region where you will find this beach. If you would like to have a look at it, this location is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle, you have multiple options to park, the closest one is directly at the beach and some are a little bit more further away. Because this is a very popular tourist destination you have a lot of beach infrastructure and services available all around the place. The same is also true for all different types of restaurants, which are stretching along the whole beach. To find an accommodation is also not a problem, the closest one or directly on the beach in the form of hotels or apartments and some campsites are also nearby. On the beach you have several kilometres of length and more than 100m of width, at low tide even more, available. The water entry is very nice and the point of swim is at around 40 m. Another attraction on the beach is a small autodrom which runs around the pier. As you see you have multiple reasons this beach to be your next holiday location.', 4131, 'en', 1),
(748, 'The Belgium city Blankenberge is a very popular tourist destination, and it attracts it&#39;s visitors because of the very beautiful and long sandy beach. If you like beaches with immense proportions, like several kilometres of length and more than 100m of width, the beach Strand Blankenberge is the one you should visit. The region where it is located is called West-Vlaanderen. No matter what the vehicle you&#39;re travelling with, this location is very easy to reach, and you have multiple options to park close to the beach. The closest parking places are only 10 m away from the beach ,some are a little bit more further. You have a nice access to the beach and handicapped people can also access it. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at around 30 m at high tide and it can be further away at low tide. All the essential beach infrastructure is available here, children playgrounds and sport fields included. You also have many options to get something to eat here in one of the numerous restaurants and beach bars. Accommodation is already available at the beach in many different options and also in the surrounding area.', 4132, 'en', 1),
(749, 'If you are in Belgium and you&#39;re searching for a sandy beach for a more adventure user type, meaning you are surrounded by nature, in the case of this beach the dunes, no beach infrastructure, no restaurants and similar, then we recommend you to visit the beach Strand Harendijke. This beach is part of the region West-Vlaanderen and the closest city is De Haan. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you simply park beside the road some 200m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to cross the road by using the bridge and walk around 10 m in height. On the beach you have several km of length and a minimum of 75 m width available, in the case of low tide even more. The water entry is nice and the point of swim changes accordingly to the tide. Although U have no beach infrastructure, no restaurants available here, you do have many options of accommodation nearby, the closest one is a camp.', 4133, 'en', 1),
(750, 'De Haan is another touristic city in the Belgian region West-Vlaanderen on the west coastline, with astonishing views on the north sea. As it is usual for such a destination you also have here a very beautiful sandy beach Strand Wenduine, which is located in the neighbouring village Wenduine. Wenduine is also very popular and you can reach this location with any kind of vehicle and simply park beside the road some 50 m away from the beach. Because it is so touristic you can be sure to have lots of beach infrastructure here, as well as many different types of restaurants and beach bars, and of course many different types of accommodation, some located directly on the beach, even a campsite nearby. On the beach you have several km of length and a minimum of 100m width available at high tide, at low tide even more. The water entry is nice and the point of swim depends on the tide but it should be at around 30 m.', 4134, 'en', 1),
(751, 'Around the Belgium city De Haan U have numerous beautiful sandy beaches stretching for several kilometres down the Belgium west coastline. The region where this stretch of beaches is located is called West-Vlaanderen and the particular beach we are describing here is Strand Konijnenpad. You can get here with your vehicle, no matter what the type, also motorhome is ok, and simply park beside the road, in the best case only 50 m away. The access to the beach is very easy and also fine for handicapped people. On the beach you have several kilometres of length and a minimum of 50 m width available, at low tide even more. The water entry is very fine, although on some places it gets towards the water quite steep. The point of swim depends on the tide but it should be at around 30 metres. Beach infrastructure is almost not present here, except for one restaurant which is located directly on the beach. You have several options of accommodation in the surrounding area, mainly as camps.', 4135, 'en', 1),
(752, 'Strand Zwarte Kiezel is a sandy beach located on the Belgian west coastline near the city De Haan. Because you have here no beach infrastructure, no restaurants, this beach is more recommendet for an adventurer user type, who is satisfied with the bare minimum. If you like those beach characteristics this beach is located in the region West-Vlaanderen and is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle. Parking is done 100 meters away from the beach on a parking place. To access the beach you need to cross the dune via stairs. The stairs are quite steep but are only 10 meters in height. On the beach you have several kilometers of length and a minimum 50 m of width, at low tide even more. The water entry is nice end the point of swim is at 40m, in cases of low tide maybe even more. Accommodation is available in the surrounding area, mainly in campsites and also as family resorts.', 4136, 'en', 1),
(753, 'The Belgian destination De Haan is another popular touristic spot along the Belgian west coastline, which is suitable for a family user type and all those one who like to have the apartment directly at the beach. Located in the region West-Vlaanderen, it is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park, the closest one only 50 m away. On the beach you have several kilometres of length and a minimum of 100 m width available. In the beginning the beach is very flat and then it drops towards the sea. U have a nice water entry and the point of swim depends on the tide, but should be at around 40 m. A lot of beach infrastructure is available here for you, as well as many different types of restaurants. Around the whole area a lot of accommodations are available in many different forms, also as camps.', 4137, 'en', 1),
(754, 'Just a little bit outside the Belgian tourist destination De Haan, you have a more natural looking sandy beach Strand Zeepreventorium. If you prefer to have sand dunes in the back of the beach and in the same time enjoy the view of the north sea, this beach is the one for you. Because no beach infrastructure is available here and you also have no restaurants on the beach it is more recommended for an adventurer user type, than it is for a family, although it is quite close to the more crowded centre of the city De Haan. Getting here with your vehicle is very easy and the best way is to park beside the road some 200 m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to cross the 10 m high dunes. Half way the path is ok, half of it, there is only sand under your feet, and on some places a little bit steep. Total length of the beach is several kilometres and the minimum width is 50 m. The water entry is nice and the swimming point depends on the tide, but it should be at around 50 m. Because this is a very popular destination many different types of accommodation are available in the city and in the surrounding area.', 4138, 'en', 1),
(755, 'Strand Vosseslag is a true family beach. It is a sandy beach with lots of beach infrastructure, a children playground, hygenical facilities and even a beach bar. Although it is not located in a touristic place it still gets very crowded during the summertime. In the back of the beach U have sand dunes. The closest city is De Haan and it is located in the region West-Vlaanderen. It is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle and you can simply park by the road, 200m away from the beach. It is several km long and has a minimum width of 75 m, at low tide even more. The water entry is nice but the swimming point depends on the tide and it should be at around 75 metres. On the start of the beach you have a quite steep slope but then it gets more flat towards the water. Accommodation is available in the surrounding area in many different forms.', 4139, 'en', 1),
(756, 'On the west atlantic coast, Belgium has many beautiful sandy beaches on many different tourist destinations, like the city Bredene. The beach we are presenting here, is not recommended for families but more for the adventurer user type. You have no beach infrastructure and no restaurants on the beach, and the access to the beach is also not the easiest one. It is more recommended for those one who like nature in their surrounding. West-Vlaanderen is the name of the region this beach is located and you can arrive here with any kind of vehicle and simply park either by the road or on large parking places 400 m away from the beach. Once you&#39;re on the beach you have several kilometres of length and a minimum of 75 m width available. The water entry is nice and a swimming point depends on the tide, but it should be around 50 m. Because this is a very touristic place you have lots of different types of accommodation in the surrounding area.', 4140, 'en', 1),
(757, 'Belgium is known for having many sandy beaches from north to the south, most of them located on the west atlantic coastline. A lot of tourist destinations are located along the coastline. Most of them have a beach right in front of the city, but there are few who are protected from sand dunes, which means that between the beach and the city you have approximately 100 m of dunes to cross. One such city is Bredene which is located in the region West-Vlaanderen and can offer you a sandy beach Strand Bredene Aan Zee. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you have a large parking places 200m away from the beach. To access the beach you need to cross a railway and a street via a raillway underpass. On the beach you have all the essential beach infrastructure as well as a beach bar. Total length of the beach is several kilometres and the minimum width is 75 m, and with the low tide it gets even more. The inclination on the beach varies from spot to spot. At the beginning it is flat, then it has a sudden drop, then it&#39;s flat again. The water entry is nice and the point of swim depends on the tide and should be between 10 and 50 m. Because this is a very touristic destination many different types of accommodation are available in the city.', 4141, 'en', 1),
(758, 'Oostende is another popular tourist destination in Belgium on the west coastline. Many beautiful sandy beaches are available here and the first one, from north to the south, is the beach Strand Groenendijk. It is located on a very special location, by the Napoleon fort. The region where you can find these beach is West-Vlaanderen. Although not many beach infrastructure is located on the beach directly, you have lots of different facilities around the parking place, like huge sport fields and a very big children playground. In the Napoleon fort you also have a restaurant. If you like this facts, this beach is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle and you have quite a few parking options, the closest one 200 metres away from the beach. The access to the beach is not the easiest one but it is manageable. On the beach the total length is several kilometres and you have at least 75 m of width at high tide, and two to three times more at low tide. The water entry is nice and the point of swim various according to the tide but it should be between 10 and 50 m. You also have many options for accommodation in the city itself, mainly as apartments and hotels.', 4142, 'en', 1),
(759, 'The Belgium city Oostende is probably one of the most popular summer/ sun / beach tourist destination in this country. It is located in the region West-Vlaanderen and has many beautiful and attractive beaches to offer. Strand Westelijke Strekdam is one of them, and it is located directly in the city centre, close to the harbour. It is very easy to reach with any kind of vehicle amd parking can be done mostly by the road. It will take you some 50m of walking to access the beach. On the beach you have around 750m of beach length and a few 100m of beach width available. The water entry is nice and the point of swim depends on the tide and at which part of the beach you enter the water, but it should be between 5 and 40 m. All the essential beach infrastructure is available here as well as many different types of restaurants. You will also find many different forms of accommodation, some located directly at the beach.', 4143, 'en', 1),
(760, 'If you&#39;re searching for a Belgian sandy beach with immense proportions, like several kilometres of length, 200 m of width at high tide, and even more at low tide, then we are suggesting you to visit the beach Strand Oostende. It is located in the city Oostende, which is part of the region West-Vlaanderen, and has a coastline with the north sea. It is very easy to get here with any kind of vehicle and you can simply park by the road only 50 m away from the beach. The beach is very easy to access, also for handicapped people. All the essential beach infrastructure is available here, many different restaurants included. The beach is quite flat, which makes the water enter very nice and the point of swim is it around 40 m. Some sport fields are available here and a surf renting shop. Many apartments and hotels are available directly on the beach, much more or in the surrounding area.', 4144, 'en', 1),
(761, 'Are you a family with small children and you would like to have a large children&#39;s playground on a sandy beach? If so, then we are recommending you to visit the beach Strand Northlaan in the Belgium city Oostende. It is very easy to reach it with any kind of vehicle and you have multiple options to park here, the closest one directly at the beach. The region where this beach is located is West-Vlaanderen and it has a coastline with the north sea. The beach really has immense proportions. It is several km long and more than 100 m wide. It is a quite flat beach with a nice water entry and the swimming point at around 20 m, but this can change with the tide. You have all the essential beach infrastructure available on the beach or in the surrounding area. Many different restaurants are available to you. This beach is also very convenient because of the fact that you can rent an apartment or stay in a hotel directly on the beach.', 4145, 'en', 1),
(762, 'Strand Mariakerke Bad is a nother sandy beach in one of the most popular Belgian summer tourist destination, Oostende. If you like beaches where you can park very close to the beach, this beach is the right one for you. It is a family beach with all the essential beach infrastructure, of course many different types of restaurants are as well available here. West-Vlaanderen, which is the region where most of the beautiful sandy beaches are located, this one included, is located on the west coast line and enables U to experience some north sea summer feeling. No matter what the vehicle you are travelling with, this location is easy to reach and you have multiple options to park. To access to the beaches is easy. On the beach you have several kilometres of length and a minimum 75 m of width available, at low tide even more. Like it is usual in Belgium, also here you have a very nice water entry and the swimming point depends on the tide, but should be at around 20 metres. Oostende is famous for having accommodations directly on the beach, and in the case of this beach this is not exception.', 4146, 'en', 1),
(763, 'Located a little bit outside the famous Belgian tourist destination Oostende, the beach Strand Raversijde is not as crowded as other beaches here around, but it also can&#39;t provide you all the essential beach infstructure othere beaches can. Nonetheless it still has it&#39;s positive sites like for example the public tramway station which is located directly on the beach, or the numerous different accommodation options it can offer you when you cross the railway. You can access this location with any kind of vehicle and simply park beside the road. To get to the beach you need to cross the street and the railway. The access to the beach is easy and you have several kilometres of length and a minimum of 50 m widthness available, at low tide even more. The water entry is nice and the point of swim changes accordingly to the tide, but it should be around 20 m. Restaurants are also available here, but to get to them you need to cross the railway and the street.', 4147, 'en', 1),
(764, 'Middelkerke is another summer tourist destination in Belgium on the west coastline where you will find many sandy beaches like for example the beach Strand Raversijde Domein. If you are a fan of no beach infrastructure, no restaurants and no other facilities on the beach, this beach is the one for you. It is located in the region West-Vlaanderen and is very easy accessible with any kind of vehicle, which you can leave simply by the road. To access the beach you need to cross the road and the railways and use the very steep stairs to access the beach. It is several km long and has a minimum width of 15 metres, at low tide much much more. The water entry is nice and the point of swim is at around 40 m. In the vicinity you also have some family resorts and campsites for your accommodation.', 4148, 'en', 1),
(765, 'A nice family sandy beach, called Strand De Greefplein is located in one of the many Belgium summer seaside destinations in Middelkerke. Like it is usual for such a destination you have many touristic facilities available either on the beach or in the surrounding area, a children playground is available on the beach. Like the other seaside destinations also this one is located in the region West-Vlaanderen. If you like such beaches, this location is accessible with any kind of vehicle and you can simply park beside the road only a few meters away from the beach. To access the beach you need to cross the railways, so be careful for the tramway. This beach is several kilometres long and has a minimum width of 75 m. the water entry is very nice and the point of swim depends on the tide, but it should be around 40 m. Very close to the beach, by the railway, you have numerous of different restaurants available. For those who like to have an accommodation directly on the beach this is a perfect place where you can rent an apartment or stay in a hotel.', 4149, 'en', 1),
(766, 'The beach we are describing here, is located in another famous belgian tourist destination, the town Middelkerke. This beach is called Strand Casino. It is a&nbsp;typical family beach, when you consider all the tourist infrastructure sorrounding the beach. Like it is usual in Belgium and for such a tourist destination you also have here the option for a very close parking to the beach, at most 100 m away, some even closer, only a few meters away. Like all other beaches in Belgium also this one is made of sand. The lenght of the beach is several kilometers and is more than 100 meters wide, at low tide even more. Another unique feature of the beach is the quite unique formation of the beach, with steep parts, where you have a 2 meters drop to a more flat surface, somewhere in the middle of the beach. Because you have here also a strong difference in low and high tide, you also need to consider the point of swim changing accordingly, but is should be at around 30 meters. Dogs are allowed on this beach, but they need to be on the line. The beach infrastructure is present here on a basic level. You won&#39;t get hungry here, because many different restaurants, beach bars and fast food kiosks are available here. If you like this beach, and you would like to spend your holidays here, we can asure you to have many different accommodation options to choose from, even a camp is nearby.&nbsp;', 4150, 'en', 1),
(767, 'The beach Strand Krokodiel is located in the famous belgian tourist destination, in the town Middelkerke. It is a typical family beach, like most of the beaches here around, when you consider all the tourist infrastructure sorrounding the beach. On this particular beach you also have the option for a very close parking to the beach, the closest one only 10 m away, and some a little bit further away. It is a sandy beach with a lenght of several kilometers and a width of at least 100 meters, with low tide even more. The inclination on the beach varies from spot to spot, and is also influenced from the strength of the waves, but you can be sure to have a little drop somewhere in the middle of the width of the beach. Because you have here also a strong difference in low and high tide, you also need to consider the point of swim changing accordingly, but is should be at around 40 meters. Dogs are allowed on this beach, but they need to be on the line. The beach infrastructure is present here on a basic level , but you also have a small chidren playgournd present here. Many different restaurants, beach bars and fast food kiosks are available here. Because this location is very touristic, we can asure you to have many different accommodation options to choose from, even a camp is nearby.&nbsp;<br />\n&nbsp;', 4151, 'en', 1),
(768, 'The country of Belgium has about 60 km of coastline with the North Sea. All the beaches on the West Coast are sandy without exception, which is also true of the beach we present here. Situated in Middelkerke, Strand Westende Beach is family friendly, with close proximity to all the beach facilities, accommodation of various types and, of course, a car park just 30 meters away. Belgium is also known for their art that you can admire of course on their beaches. A large Navy rudder was installed on this beach, which looks halfway out of the sand. So if you need a picture of a sandy beach with this kind of artwork, maybe for your instagram profile, don&#39;t hesitate to visit this beach. A couple more beach details. Its length is, of course, several kilometers and its width is at least 100 meters, which, due to the tidal influence, also increases to more than 100 meters. The beach does not have a single slope, but it changes towards the water. The beach is very flat against the water, which means you have good access to the water, but the swim point is about 50 meters. There are various types of restaurants available at the beach. There is also a rental facility for various water sports equipment, the most typical water sport is surfing here. The smallest is also taken care of, as there is also a small children&#39;s playground. Accommodation is possible in different types and there is a campsite nearby.', 4152, 'en', 1),
(769, 'All beaches on the west coast of Belgium, which has a North Sea coast of 60 km in length, are sandy without exception, which is also the case with Strand Nieuwpoort Bad Beach. The beach is located in Nieuwpoort, which has a very tourist promenade. If you are going to the beach as a family you you will be happy here, since all the necessary beach infrastructure is nearby, accommodation of different types is located directly on the beach, which is also true of the parking lots, which are at best only 30 meters away and parking can be done by the road at designated parking spaces. A couple more beach details. Its length is, of course, several kilometers and its width is at least 100 meters, which, due to the tidal influence, also increases to more than 100 meters. The beach does not have a single slope, but it changes towards the water. Somewhere in the middle of the path there is a bigger drop where the beach is reduced by about 2 meters. Kids and the youth will surely love this spot and will do all kinds of stunts here. The beach is very flat against the water, which means that you have good access to the water, but the swimming point is&nbsp; at about 100 meters. This fact, next to the children&#39;s playground on the beach, makes this beach especially suitable for children, as only they, because of the low water, can safely snort in the water. Also, there are sports fields on the beach. There are different types of restaurants available on the beach that will satisfy just about every type of gourmet, and the same goes for different types of shops, especially the many that offer Belgian pralines. Accommodation is possible in the form of different types, but those who are looking for accommodation as a campsite are also located nearby.', 4153, 'en', 1),
(770, 'Strand Zonnebloem is a sandy beach, which is something special. There are very few beaches anywhere in the world that have small grassy dunes between their beach promenade and the beach. The beach is located in Nieuwpoort, which has a very tourist promenade. This beach is also suitable for the family as it is a typical family beach which offers you a very high standard of all possible services. Access to the beach by car is very easy. You can park your car along the road at designated parking lots, which are very busy but are only 100 meters away from the beach. This beach is also several kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide, which can be increased by more than 100 meters due to the influence of the tides. Just as in this place, it is a beach habit, so this beach does not have a uniform slope, but it changes towards the water. Somewhere in the middle of the path there is a bigger drop where the beach is reduced by about 2 meters. This small gorge will surely appeal to young people and children who will do all sorts of mischief on it. The beach is very flat against the water, which means that you have good access to the water, but the swimming point is about 100 meters. This fact, in addition to the children&#39;s playground on the beach and sports fields, makes this beach especially suitable for children, because of the low water they can safely mop in the water. There are various types of restaurants available on the beach that will satisfy just about any type of gourmet, you should also try the famous Belgian beers. The same goes for the different types of shops, especially the many that offer Belgian pralines, clothing and luxury goods. Accommodation is possible in the form of different types, but those who are looking for camping accommodation are also nearby.', 4154, 'en', 1),
(771, 'If you are looking for a sandy beach where you can park your car only a few meters away from the beach, which is very rare in Belgium, we suggest you visit the sandy beach of Strand Groenendijk Bad. This beach is also surrounded by dunes that protect the settlements from the sea. The beach is located in Koksijde. It is a typical family beach, although there is not as much tourism industry around it as elsewhere. Access to the beach by car is very easy. You can park your car by the roadside at designated parking spaces, or in the parking lot directly in front of the beach. This beach is also several kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide, which can be increased by more than 100 meters due to the influence of the tides. The slope on the beach changes on the way to the water. The beach is very flat against the water, which means that you have good access to the water, but the swimming point is about 100 meters. Because the water here is so shallowt, this beach is especially suitable for children, because only the low water makes it possible for them to safely snap in the water. There are various types of restaurants available at the beach. The beach infrastructure is also at a fairly high level, offering you various services. On the beach you also have the opportunity to rent various water sports equipment, especially surfboards. As is typical in Belgium and in this place, you also have plenty of different accommodation options here. There is also a motor camp nearby.', 4155, 'en', 1),
(772, 'If you are a lover of sandy beaches and have a heart for Belgium, you are advised to visit the beach Strand Oostduinkerke Duinpark. The beach is family friendly and is located in Koksijde. Unlike other beaches in Belgium, this beach is less touristy and surrounded by more nature. No matter what vehicle you are traveling with, this location is easily accessible. You can park your car by the roadside at designated parking spaces. The parking is only 50 meters away and you have to walk across the 5 meter high sand dunes to access the beach. Bye the parking lots there are apartments that you can rent for your vacation. The beach is also several kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide. The width of the beach, of course, also depends on the tide. The slope on the beach is not uniform but is falling towards the water. The closer you are to the water, the flatter the beach, which means you also have a very nice access to the water. Because of the flat beach, unfortunately, the swimming point is about 100 meters. Of course, shallow water is good for children to play safely in shallow water. The tourist infrastructure is more scarce here, so don&#39;t expect a lot of beach services. Also nearby is one beach restaurant and water equipment rental. In addition to the aforementioned apartments, accommodation is also possible in nearby hotels.', 4156, 'en', 1),
(773, 'On this Belgian beach, they really thought of everything. There are also such beach lovers who want to have a pool on the beach if the sand and everything else does not suit them. And that&#39;s exactly what they did at this place, they put a pool on the beach with all the necessary infrastructure. Where to find this beach? It is called Strand Oostduinkerke and is located in Koksijde. The beach is suitable for families and is a real tourist beach as it is surrounded by a real tourist bustle. In the vicinity of the beach, there are a large number of restaurants, as well as many shops offering traditional Belgian pralines, luxury products and everything you need for a tourist break. Those who admire art, statues, will be able to admire them on this beach, as is often the case in Belgium. There are two statues of horsemen here. Those of you who like dunes will be able to admire them here as well. Since this place is very touristy you have many accommodation options available, even a campsite is nearby. No matter what vehicle you are traveling with, this location is easily accessible. You can park your car by the roadside at designated parking spaces. Parking is 200 meters away from the beach. The beach is also several kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide. The width of the beach, of course, also depends on the tide. The slope of the beach is fairly uniform, but the closer you are to the water, the flatter the beach, which means that you also have a very nice entry into the water. Because of the flat beach, unfortunately, the swimming point is about 100 meters. Of course, shallow water is good for children to play safely in shallow water. Children will also admire children&#39;s plagrounds, which are not lacking here, and for those who love sports activities, something will be found as well. The tourist infrastructure is at a very high level here and offers you many beach services.', 4157, 'en', 1),
(774, 'In the vicinity of the Belgian city of Koksijde, which is known for being a true tourist destination, there is also a beach that does not have such a strong tourist hinterland and is not so crowded. The beach is surrounded by an abundance of sand dunes that give the beach a true natural character, of course this beach is also sandy. If you like this type of beach, this beach is very easily accessible with all types of vehicles. You can park your vehicle easily at designated parking areas along the road, which are only 50 meters away. Since the beach has basic beach infrastructure, this beach is also suitable for families. Along the road there are apartments that you can rent for your vacation. Otherwise it is allowed to bring dogs to the beach. Unfortunately there are no restaurants or anything like that on this beach, so bring your food with you. The beach is several kilometers long and has a minimum width of 40 meters, but of course this width increases to more than 100 meters in the case of low tide. The slope of the beach is fairly uniform, the entry into the water is very comfortable, and you can count on the swimming point at ca. 50 meters.', 4158, 'en', 1),
(775, 'Koksijde, a Belgian town known for being a true tourist destination, offers you a beach that is very unique in nature, mainly because it is more intended for people who prefer nature rather than a tourist destination and they are considered more of an adventurer than a family member. The beach is called Strand Lejeunelaan and is surrounded by an abundance of sand dunes that give the beach a true natural character, of course this beach is also sandy. If you like this type of beach, this beach is very easily accessible with all types of vehicles. You can park your vehicle easily at designated parking areas along the road, which are only 50 meters away. However, to reach the beach, it is necessary to beat a 10-meter-high sand dunes that are not very well-groomed. There is no beach infrastructure on the beach and there are no restaurants here, the closest one a few hundred meters away in the neighboring tourist center. While there is no accommodation in the immediate vicinity, these are already accessible a few hundred meters away in the form of apartments and hotels, and a little further away are campsites. The beach is several kilometers long and has a minimum width of 30 meters, but of course this width increases to more than 100 meters in the case of low tide. The slope of the beach is slightly elevated, the entry into the water is very comfortable, and you can count on the swimming point at ca. 50 meters.', 4159, 'en', 1),
(776, '<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">The Belgian beach Strand Koksijde Bad, located in the town Koksijde, is suitable for families and is a real tourist beach as it is surrounded by a real tourist bustle, like many other Belgian beaches. In the vicinity of this beach, like it is usual in Belgium, also here there are a large number of restaurants, as well as many shops offering traditional Belgian pralines, luxury products and everything you need for a tourist break. This place has lots of tourist infrastructure, which means that you have many accommodation options available, even a campsite is 1 km away. No matter what vehicle you are traveling with, this location is easily accessible. You can park your car by the roadside at designated parking spaces. Parking can be done already at only 30 meters away from the beach. The beach is also several kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide. You really have lots of beach space available here. The width of the beach, of course, also depends on the tide. The slope of the beach is on some places quit steep, but the closer you are to the water, the flatter the beach, which means that you also have a very nice entry into the water. The swimming point is at about 50 meters. The tourist infrastructure is at a very high level here and offers you many beach services, children playgrounds as well as many different sports fields included. You certainly won&#39;t get hungry here, since many beach bars and restaurants are available either on the beach itself or in the town itself.&nbsp;</span>', 4160, 'en', 1),
(777, 'The star of the sea, or in the original Ster Der Zee, is the name of the beach located in the famous Belgian tourist resort Koksijde. You may already know that Belgians love art, but if you don&#39;t, you will definitely find it when you visit one of their beaches. There is a monument on almost every beach, and on this one they thought of a star-shaped lookout tower that extends at least 10 meters high and which you can climb as well. The beach is family friendly and of course sandy, as are all the Belgian beaches along the North Sea. Access to the beach is possible with any vehicle that can be left at designated parking spots along the road, only 30 meters away from the beach. There is really a lot of parking here, which indicates that this is a very popular place. Here, too, the beach is several kilometers long and has a minimum width of 100 meters, which in the case of low tide increases to just over a few 100 meters wide. The beach has a fairly constant slope, which descends slightly. Access to the water is comfortable and the swimming point is at approx. 40 meters. The beach infrastructure here is enough to meet your basic needs. You also have different types of restaurants and beach bars nearby. Accommodation at this location is not a problem either, you have many different types of accommodation available. Within 1 kilometer of the beach, there are also some campsites, if you prefer this type of accommodation.', 4161, 'en', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(778, 'The country of Belgium is known for many things, Manneken Pis, beer, chocolate, atomium, waffles, diamonds, etc. It is also a paradise for those who like long sandy beaches, especially for families with many children. Very often there are many children playgrounds on the beach, including sports fields. If you are looking for a beach like this, you are advised to visit Strand De Panne beach, located in the town of De Panne, just a few kilometers away from the French border. This place is also the last tourist destination in Belgium before crossing the French border. Access to this beach is very easy, no matter what vehicle you travel with. You can park your vehicle at designated parking areas along the road, only 100 meters away from the beach. Because this place is a true tourist destination, you will of course also have here plenty of beach services and beach infrastructure. As is typical of beaches in Belgium, this beach is several kilometers long and has a width of more than 100 meters, but in the case of low tide, this width is, of course, increased by some 100 meters more. The slope of the beach, except for a few points, is quite constant. The access to the water is easy and convenient, as the depth increases very slowly, you can swim at ca. 50 meters. Finding accommodation in this place will not be a problem either, as there are numerous hotels and apartments near the beach, but if you are a fan of campsites, they are only a few kilometers away. If you happen to get bored on the beach, there is also a large amusement park called Plopsaland De Panne nearby.', 4162, 'en', 1),
(779, 'The Belgian town of Koksijde, due to its sandy beach, which is several kilometers long and more than 100 meters wide, is a very popular tourist destination, which mainly attracts families with small children. The beach we describe here is called Strand Sint-Idesbald. Access to this beach is very easy with every type of vehicle that can be parked at designated spots along the road, just 50 meters from the beach. The surface of the beach is really large, so there will never be too many people here as these will be distributed across the beach. The beach services here are enough to meet all your basic needs. Children are taken care of here, as there are children&#39;s playgrounds on the beach, as it is the case for sports lovers, who have some playgrounds here and can rent water sports equipment. No need to worry about food and drinks, restaurants of all types are located nearby. The same is true for accommodation. Hotels and apartments, as well as other types of accommodation, are located directly on the beach and extend some more than 100 meters inside the city. For those who prefer to spend their holidays at the campsite, these are also available and are available within a range of maximum 1 kilometer. The beach has a fairly uniform slope, except somewhere in the middle, where there is a smaller sandy slope. The beach is very flat against the water, giving you a very comfortable access to the water. It is possible to swim at this beach at ca. 50 meters of walking in the water, but this can also be shortened or extended by the tide.', 4163, 'en', 1),
(780, 'Strand De Westhoek is the last Belgian beach to visit before crossing the French border. It is only 1 kilometer from the French border. To visit this beach you have to drive to the nearest tourist center De Panne. If most Belgian beaches are family friendly, this one is certainly not, as it does not offer such a high standard of beach services like the others do. It is best suited for the explorer type of user, who is not too demanding and is satisfied with a mere beach. Sand is also present on the beach, but what gives the beach a unique character, is a concrete barrier that you can also walk on, which serves as a breakwater to protect the land from the sea. Access to the beach is easy, you can park by the road, just 50 meters from the beach. There are no restaurants or beach infrastructure on the beach, except for a couple of benches and trash cans. But the beach is open to dogs. A variety of accommodations are also available near the beach, but not directly on the beach. The length of the beach is several kilometers, and the width depends very much on the tide. In the event of high tide, the water can extend all the way to the breakwater barrier, and in the case of low tide it can be pulled far away. Entering the water can be possible immediately in the case of high tide, and in the case of low tide, when the water recedes and the beach is more flat, you will only be able to start swimming after about 75 m of walking in the water.', 4164, 'en', 1),
(781, 'A very little sandy beach on a lake,  family beach, sand and grass as surface,  large parking place,   steep water entry,  sports fields and children\'s playgrounds, a windsurfing spot,  nice place for fishing,  all esential beach infrastructure,  a bistro as well available,  agility place for training dogs', 4165, 'en', 2),
(782, 'Very nice and beautiful family sandy beach on a beautiful lake surrounded with nature and with trees,  very organised place with lots of beach infrastructure and a restaurant on the beach, a very large children\'s playground, small children and children of all ages will love this location, a lot of things to do,  easy to access with any kind of vehicle, very large parking place, accommodation in the surrounding area, mainly camps, also hotels', 4166, 'en', 2),
(783, 'Very nice and beautiful family sandy beach on a beautiful lake surrounded with nature and with trees on the brinks of a city,  very organised place with lots of beach infrastructure,  water slide, a  indoor swimming pool,  indoor children playground and a restaurant on the beach, a very large children\'s playground, small children and children of all ages will love this location, a lot of things to do,  many other sport activities available, tennis, football, skatepark,  easy to access with any kind of vehicle, very large parking place, accommodation in the surrounding area, mainly as apartments an also hotels', 4167, 'en', 2),
(784, 'Very nice and beautiful family sandy beach, also lots of grass, natural shadow. on a beautiful lake surrounded with nature and with trees,  very organised place with lots of beach infrastructure,  water slide, a  swimming pool, a jump tower, a restaurant on the beach, a very large children\'s playground, small children and children of all ages will love this location, a lot of things to do, easy to access with any kind of vehicle, very large parking place, accommodation in a camp. ', 4168, 'en', 2),
(785, 'Adventurer type beach, for water sport activities like kiteboarding and windsurfing, no beach infrastructure,  no restaurants, accommodation in the surrounding area but far away, parking place reserved for club members,  sandy beach,  500 m long, 15 metres wide.', 4169, 'en', 2),
(786, 'A family type sandy beach with lots of grass  on a lake, very large parking place directly on the beach, basic beach infrastructure, a beach bar and a restaurant on the beach,  close to a marina, nice water entry, very close to the netherlands border, accommodation available in the vicinity.', 4170, 'en', 2),
(787, 'A family type sandy beach with lots of grass  on a lake,  partially a private beach, very large parking place directly on the beach and by the road basic beach infrastructure,  partially mixed inclination, a beach bar and a restaurant on the beach,  close to a marina, nice water entry, very close to the netherlands border, accommodation, a huge camp available nearby,  a skilift wakeboard also available,  children playgrounds and sports fields,  basketball and volleyball.', 4171, 'en', 2),
(788, 'Eine wahre Sch&ouml;nheit ist sie, die Paralia Batis. Es ist ein Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien und diejenigen geeignet ist, die gerne in der n&auml;he eines Strandes campen. Der Strand ist 200 m lang und bis zu 25 m breit. Die Steigung des Abhangs ist an einigen Stellen etwas steil, aber meistens normal. Das Camp, mit allen m&ouml;glichen Strandinfrastrukturen befindet sich direkt neben dem Strand, sowie einigen Restaurants und Strandbars. Der Parkplatz ist etwas h&ouml;her und ca. 100 m entfernt. Er ist jedoch sehr gro&szlig; und Sie k&ouml;nnen den Strand vom Parkplatz &uuml;ber Treppen erreichen, ber&uuml;cksichtigen Sie jedoch den H&ouml;henunterschied von 15 m.', 3413, 'de', 1),
(789, 'Dieser Griechische Strand ist eine wahre Sch&ouml;nheit. Dieser Sandstrand, mit seinen sch&ouml;nen Kurven und dem kristallklaren Wasser wird Ihnen sehr lange in Erinnerung bleiben, auch zu Hause, wenn Sie weit davon entfernt sind, aber Sie werden wahrscheinlich ein anderes Mal dorthin zur&uuml;ckkehren wollen. Der Parkplatz ist gro&szlig; und aus Kies und Sie k&ouml;nnen fast direkt am Strand parken. Der Strand selbst ist mehr Kilometer lang und bis zu 25 m breit. Der Schwimmpunkt beginnt bereits bei 3 m, so dass Sie fast sofort nach dem Betreten des Wassers mit dem Schwimmen beginnen k&ouml;nnen. Hier gibt es auch Strandbars und einige Strandinfrastrukturen. Die Unterbringung erfolgt nicht direkt am Strand, sondern in den umliegenden D&ouml;rfern. Der gesamte Strandbereich ist mehr nat&uuml;rlicher als urban, sodass Sie dort mehr Ruhe erwarten k&ouml;nnen, wenn Sie ein Fan von dieser Art des Strandbesuchs sind. &nbsp;', 3417, 'de', 1),
(790, 'Wenn Sie lange Sandstr&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, dann ist der Paralia Iraklitsa der Richtige Strand f&uuml;r Sie. Er ist f&uuml;r Familien geeignet und Sie haben einen mehr als 1 km langen und bis zu 30 m breiten Strand fast direkt von Ihrem Auto aus zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Schwimmpunkt beginnt bereits bei 10 m. Das Parken ist kostenlos und es gibt sehr viel Platz, auch f&uuml;r Wohnmobile. Es gibt einige Sportpl&auml;tze und einen Kinderspielplatz direkt an dem Strand. Strandbars und andere Restaurants, sowie Apartments, befinden sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he oder direkt am Strand.', 3415, 'de', 1),
(791, 'Dieser Strand ist ein wahrer Abenteurerstrand. Er ist sehr lang, mehrere Kilometer lang und bis zu 25 m breit. Der Parkplatz selbst ist sehr gro&szlig; und Sie k&ouml;nnen sogar unter den B&auml;umen parken. Die Stra&szlig;e zum Strand ist am Ende der Stra&szlig;e aus Schotter und an einigen Stellen ist die Stra&szlig;e etwas steiler. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach, es muss keine Strandgeb&uuml;hr bezahlt werden, die Strandneigung ist normal und Sie k&ouml;nnen bereits nach 5 m, wenn Sie das Wasser betreten haben wegschwimmen. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist fast nicht vorhanden, aber der Strand selbst ist einen Besuch wert. Es gibt so viele B&auml;ume, die Ihnen Schutz bieten, falls die Sonne zu hei&szlig; wird. Beachten Sie jedoch, dass Sie dort nicht offiziell campen k&ouml;nnen.', 3426, 'de', 1),
(792, 'Sobald Sie diesen Strand besucht haben, wird er mit Sicherheit f&uuml;r viele, viele Male zu Ihrem Traumstrand werden. Es ist einer der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde, die Sie jemals in Ihrem Leben besuchen werden. Es hat alles was Sie suchen, zum Beispiel viel Sand, das Wasser ist kristallklar, es gibt sogar etwas nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten, B&auml;ume, und etwas Gras direkt am Strand. Der Einstieg ins Wasser ist sch&ouml;n und bequem. Er ist ein echter Diamant Strand in der Chalkidike-Region. Hier gibt es auch Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten, aber Sie m&uuml;ssen auf einer unbefestigten Stra&szlig;e fahren, und es kann manchmal schwierig sein den Parkplatz zu erreichen, manche Stellen sind eng. Wenn Sie in ein Strandresort gehen, der sich in der N&auml;he befindet, m&uuml;ssen Sie den Parkplatz bezahlen, ansonsten stehen Ihnen m&ouml;glicherweise 20 oder mehr kostenlose Parkpl&auml;tze zur Verf&uuml;gung. Ein Restaurant ist auch hier und es gibt einige Apartments in der N&auml;he des Strandes, wenn Sie f&uuml;r Ihren Sommerurlaub hierbleiben m&ouml;chten. Das ganze Gebiet mit dem Traum Strand, ist auch f&uuml;r einige nette Aufnahmen auf Ihrem Instagram-Konto sehr attraktiv, bringen Sie also Ihre beste Foto- oder Videoausr&uuml;stung mit.', 3433, 'de', 1),
(793, 'Dieser erstaunliche Sandstrand mit kristallklarem Wasser und einer leichten t&uuml;rkisfarbenen Farbe wird Sie &uuml;berraschen und Sie werden sich sicherlich verlieben. Der Strand geh&ouml;rt zur Region Kentriki Mazedonien und geh&ouml;rt zu Ormos Panagias. Es ist mehr als einen Kilometer lang und bis zu 40 Meter breit. Der Parkplatz befindet sich direkt neben dem Strand. Bei st&uuml;rmischem Wetter ist dies ein idealer Ort zum Windsurfen oder Kiten. Unterk&uuml;nfte wie Apartments und freie Zimmer befinden sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he. Einige Strandinfrastrukturen sind auch direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar, konzentrieren sich jedoch haupts&auml;chlich auf Strandbars oder &auml;hnliche Restaurants. Das Betreten des Wassers ist sehr angenehm und nach 10 Metern k&ouml;nnen Sie mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Der gesamte Bereich ist auch sehr attraktiv f&uuml;r einige sch&ouml;ne Aufnahmen f&uuml;r Ihr Instagram-Konto. Nehmen Sie also Ihre beste Foto- oder Videoausr&uuml;stung mit. Weitere sch&ouml;ne und attraktive Str&auml;nde finden Sie in unserer umfangreichen Basis europ&auml;ischer Str&auml;nde. Und denken Sie daran, der schnellste und einfachste Weg, Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, ist BeachRex.', 3432, 'de', 1),
(794, 'Der Karidi Strand ist ein wei&szlig;er Sandstrand. Und mit dem kristallklaren Wasser k&ouml;nnen Sie sich die Sch&ouml;nheit dieses Ortes vorstellen. Dieser Strand ist einer der sch&ouml;nsten in der Region Chalkidiki und ein Muss, wenn Sie in der N&auml;he dieser Region sind oder einfach nur atemberaubende Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen. Die Parkfl&auml;che besteht aus Kies und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto unter den B&auml;umen stehen lassen, wo es nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt in der K&auml;lte stehen bleiben kann. Am Strand selbst gibt es viele B&auml;ume, um Ihr Handtuch abzulegen und vor der hei&szlig;en Sonne sch&uuml;tzt zu suchen. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in der N&auml;he, meist in Form von Appartements und Hotels. Restaurants und andere Verpflegungsm&ouml;glichkeiten befinden sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he. Die gesamte Umgebung des Strandes ist sehr malerisch, so dass Sie viele Orte finden, an denen Sie wundersch&ouml;ne Bilder mit dem Strand im Hintergrund f&uuml;r Ihre Erinnerungen oder Ihren Instagram-Konto aufnehmen k&ouml;nnen. Weitere sch&ouml;ne und attraktive Str&auml;nde finden Sie in unserer umfangreichen Datenbank europ&auml;ischer Str&auml;nde. Und denken Sie daran, der schnellste und einfachste Weg, Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, ist BeachRex.', 3435, 'de', 1),
(795, 'Der Sarti Strand, der sich in der griechischen Region Chalkidiki befindet, ist ein sehr langer Sandstrand mit einem sehr spektakul&auml;ren Blick auf den Berg Athos. Es ist ein Teil der Region Kentriki Makedonija. Hier finden Sie viele Strandinfrastrukturen, einen Kinderspielplatz sowie einige Sportpl&auml;tze. Apartments, Zimmer und Hotels befinden sich direkt am Strand. Der Parkplatz befindet sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he und Sie m&uuml;ssen nur 100 Meter laufen, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Restaurants und andere Bars sind reichlich vorhanden und Sie haben hier eine gro&szlig;e Auswahl an verschiedenen Gerichten. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehr als 1 Kilometer, es ist auch sehr breit, 50 Meter, die Strandneigung ist normal, f&auml;llt aber scharf in Richtung Wasser ab, so dass Sie bereits 3 Meter nach dem Eintritt ins Wasser mit dem Schwimmen beginnen k&ouml;nnen. Aufgrund der Strandbildung und bei st&uuml;rmischem Wetter k&ouml;nnen sich hier gro&szlig;e Wellen bilden, die f&uuml;r manche Surfer sehr attraktiv sein k&ouml;nnen. Weitere sch&ouml;ne und attraktive Str&auml;nde finden Sie in unserer umfangreichen Datenbank europ&auml;ischer Str&auml;nde. Und denken Sie daran, der schnellste und einfachste Weg, Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, ist BeachRex.', 3436, 'de', 1),
(796, 'In der Region Kentriki Makedonija gibt es einen weiteren wundersch&ouml;nen Strand namens Paralia Akrathos. Es ist ein sehr sch&ouml;ner Sandstrand mit sehr interessanten Kurven. Es ist definitiv f&uuml;r Familien mit Kindern geeignet, da es auch etwas nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten gibt, der Parkplatz sehr gro&szlig; ist und hier viele Hotels sind, die direkt am Strand liegen. Am Strand selbst k&ouml;nnen Sie einige Boote oder andere Wasserger&auml;te mieten. Wenn Sie durstig oder hungrig sind, gibt es sogar eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant direkt am Strand.&nbsp;Weitere sch&ouml;ne und attraktive Str&auml;nde finden Sie in unserer umfangreichen Datenbank europ&auml;ischer Str&auml;nde. Und denken Sie daran, der schnellste und einfachste Weg, Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, ist BeachRex.', 3430, 'de', 1),
(797, 'Paralia Stiladari ist ein Sand- und Familienstrand auf der Westseite der zweiten Halbinsel, der Sithonia-Halbinsel, in der wundersch&ouml;nen und sehr interessanten griechischen Region Chalkidiki. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug direkt vor dem Strand parken und der Parkplatz ist gro&szlig; genug, um mehr Fahrzeuge aufzunehmen. Auch Wohnmobile sind hier willkommen. Es gibt einige B&auml;ume am Strand, die Ihnen Schutz vor der hei&szlig;en Sommersonne bieten, und Schatten ist besonders willkommen, wenn Sie mit kleinen Kindern an den Strand kommen, die die meiste Zeit vor der Sonne gesch&uuml;tzt werden m&uuml;ssen. Es gibt viel Strandinfrastruktur am oder in der N&auml;he des Strandes und es gibt auch eine Strandbar und ein Hotel an diesem sch&ouml;nen Strand. An den meisten Stellen entlang des Strandes ist der Eingang zum Wasser sehr sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen nach 3 m mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Seien Sie an einigen Stellen nur vorsichtig, wie Sie ins Wasser gelangen, da es auch einige unangenehme Felsen gibt. Aufgrund dieser Fakten &uuml;ber den Strand und die sehr malerische Umgebung ist dieser Ort bei Touristen sehr beliebt. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 500 Meter und seine Breite 25 Meter. In unserer umfangreichen Sammlung europ&auml;ischer Str&auml;nde finden Sie weitere sch&ouml;ne und attraktive Str&auml;nde. Und vergessen Sie nicht: Der schnellste und einfachste Weg, Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, ist mit BeachRex.', 3444, 'de', 1),
(798, 'Ein wahrer Abenteurer Sandstrand f&uuml;r diejenigen, die die wilde Natur m&ouml;gen. Das flache Gel&auml;nde scheint als ob dieser Strand f&uuml;r Wohnmobile gemacht wurde. Der Parkplatz ist sehr flach und riesig und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand parken. Die Stra&szlig;e zum Strand ist eine Mischung aus verschiedenen Oberfl&auml;chen. Die H&auml;lfte ist asphaltiert und die andere H&auml;lfte besteht aus Kies. Am Strand selbst gibt es fast keine Infrastruktur, sondern nur ein reines Freiheitsgef&uuml;hl. Einige Unterk&uuml;nfte in Form von Appartements sind in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar, jedoch nicht direkt am Strand. Die Oberfl&auml;che von Strand ist aus Sand und es gibt dort auch genug Gras, wenn Sie diese Oberfl&auml;che mehr m&ouml;gen als andere typische Str&auml;nde.', 3443, 'de', 1),
(799, 'Auf der S&uuml;dspitze der griechischen Halbinsel Sithonia befindet sich der Sandstrand Paralia Kalamitsi. Es geh&ouml;rt zur Region Kantriki Makedonia und ist ein Muss, wenn Sie in dieser Region sind. Es ist f&uuml;r Familien und f&uuml;r diejenigen geeignet, die Hunde dabei haben. Der Strand selbst ist rund 750 Meter lang und 30 Meter breit. Neben dem Strand gibt es einen Parkplatz und es gibt viele Strandbars, Apartments und einige Campingpl&auml;tze in der N&auml;he. Der Wassereintritt ist bequem, Sie k&ouml;nnen bereits nach 3 Metern Badetiefe schwimmen.', 3440, 'de', 1),
(800, 'Die griechische Region Chalkidiki ist ber&uuml;hmt f&uuml;r ihre sch&ouml;nen Sandstr&auml;nde. Die zweite oder mittlere Halbinsel in dieser Region hei&szlig;t Sithonia und ist ein Muss, wenn Sie einen der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde Griechenlands erleben m&ouml;chten. Dieser Ort, der in der N&auml;he der Stadt Nikiti liegt, ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, das Sie auf einem Parkplatz direkt neben der Stra&szlig;e und etwa 100 m vom Strand entfernt abstellen k&ouml;nnen, sehr leicht zu erreichen. Diese Sch&ouml;nheit ist rund 750 m lang und bis zu 40 m breit. Die Neigung des Abhangs ist normal und aufgrund der Schwimmpunks von ca. 30 m, auch f&uuml;r kleine Kinder geeignet. Hier finden Sie viele Strandinfrastrukturen, in K&uuml;rze sogar ein Hotel und Strandverpflegung.', 3447, 'de', 1),
(801, 'Das kristallklare Wasser an diesem Strand wird Sie sprachlos machen. Vorwiegend wegen des wei&szlig;en Sandes im Meer, der dem Strand einen besonderen t&uuml;rkisfarbenen Aquarellton verleiht. Der Strand selbst besteht aus kleinen Steinen und &uuml;berwiegend aus Sand. Schwimmen ist bereits nach f&uuml;nf Metern m&ouml;glich. In der N&auml;he des Strandes gibt es viele Strandbars und viele Apartments sowie einige Hotels. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist auf einem hohen Niveau und es gibt viele davon entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts. Das Parken erfolgt entweder auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz in 100 m Entfernung oder Sie parken in einem privaten Haus direkt am Strand. Auf dem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz k&ouml;nnen auch Wohnmobile abgestellt werden. Wenn Sie den Premium-Platz bekommen, haben Sie sogar Schatten.', 3460, 'de', 1),
(802, 'Auf der griechischen Halbinsel Kassandra in der wundersch&ouml;nen Region Chalkidiki gibt es einen besonderen, fast vollst&auml;ndig nat&uuml;rlichen Strand au&szlig;erhalb der Stadt Pefkochori. Es ist mehrere Kilometer lang, etwa 20 Meter breit und bietet viel nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten entlang der Stra&szlig;e am Strand. Sie k&ouml;nnen den Strand &uuml;ber eine unbefestigte Stra&szlig;e erreichen, die in der N&auml;he des Strandes verl&auml;uft. Auf einem Teil des Strandes gibt es auch einige Strandbars, die eine grundlegende Infrastruktur bieten, ansonsten gibt es keine. Wenn Sie im kristallklaren Wasser schwimmen m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie bereits nach 5 Metern wegschwimmen. Der Strand selbst besteht teilweise aus Sand, teilweise aus kleinen Kieselsteinen. Direkt neben dem Strand befindet sich eine wundersch&ouml;ne Lagune, die Sie entweder mit dem Boot oder beim Schnorcheln erkunden sollten.', 3462, 'de', 1),
(803, 'Sand, kristallklares Wasser und Restaurants direkt am Strand - das bekommen Sie, wenn Sie den Strand Siviris besuchen. Dieser griechische Strand auf der Halbinsel Kassandra in der Region Kentriki Makedonia bietet Ihnen einen Parkplatz, nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt. In der Stadt selbst gibt es viele Apartments, Zimmer und Hotels. Im Sommer kann der ganze Strand &uuml;berf&uuml;llt sein, seien Sie sich also dessen bewusst. Da dieser Ort bei Touristen so beliebt ist, gibt es hier auch gen&uuml;gend Strandinfrastruktur. Der Punkt des Schwimmens beginnt sehr fr&uuml;h, etwa nach 10 m, wenn Sie vom Strand ins Wasser gehen oder sofort, wenn Sie vom Pier springen.', 3470, 'de', 1),
(804, 'Sie werden keine Probleme mit dem Parken an diesem Strand haben. Reisemobile sind auf jeden Fall willkommen. Der Strand Skala Fourkas auf der Halbinsel Kassandra in Griechenland ist ein Sandstrand mit einigen grundlegenden Strandinfrastrukturen. Der Wassereintritt ist angenehm und das Wasser kristallklar. Am Strand selbst gibt es einige Strandbars und im Hintergrund viele Apartments und Zimmer.', 3469, 'de', 1),
(805, 'An diesem besonderen historischen griechischen Ort erwartet Sie ein wahrer Entdecker-Abenteurer-Strand. An diesem Strand k&ouml;nnen Sie nicht nur schwimmen und die Sonne genie&szlig;en, sondern auch eine antike r&ouml;mische Stadt direkt am Strand erkunden. Es ist wirklich erstaunlich das so eine wichtige historische Stadt an einem Strand erkunden kann, und das ohne eintritt oder jeder Art von Begrenzungen. Die ganze Halbinsel von Kassandra ist voll von solcher Art der Str&auml;nde. Die Stra&szlig;e zum Strand ist unbefestigt, und hier stehen Ihnen rund 40 Parkpl&auml;tze zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Strand ist ziemlich flach, ebenso wie der Wassereintritt, was bedeutet, dass kleine Kinder hier ziemlich sicher spielen k&ouml;nnen. An einem Teil des Strandes gibt es sogar Klippen.&nbsp;Am Strand gibt es auch ein Hotel mit viel Strandinfrastruktur.', 3471, 'de', 1),
(806, 'Einer der letzten Str&auml;nde auf der griechischen Halbinsel Kassandra, der gegen&uuml;ber der Stadt Marmaras auf der gegen&uuml;berliegenden Halbinsel Sithonia liegt, ist der Strand Paliouri. Es liegt in der N&auml;he der Stadt Chrousou. Es ist mehr als ein Kilometer langer Sandstrand mit etwas Strandinfrastruktur. Der Parkplatz ist sehr gro&szlig; und kann auch Wohnmobile beherbergen und das Fahrzeug kann man nur ein paar Meter von Strand entfernt parken. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihren Hund auch an den Strand bringen, solange Sie die Regeln einhalten. Wenn Sie schwimmen m&ouml;gen k&ouml;nnen Sid das bereits nach 5 Metern machen. Einige Strandbars, ein Campingplatz und einige Apartments befinden sich ebenfalls am Strand oder in Strandn&auml;he.', 3464, 'de', 1),
(807, 'Ein weiterer Strand auf der griechischen Halbinsel Kassandra, der Sie sprachlos machen wird, erwartet Sie in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Aploma. Es ist wilder und freier als andere, da es hier fast keine Strandinfrastruktur gibt. Es gibt einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, der aus Kies besteht und gro&szlig; genug ist, um auch Wohnmobile aufzunehmen. Der Strand besteht zum Teil aus Sand und zum Teil aus kleinen Kieselsteinen, der Wassereintritt ist an manchen Stellen bequem, an manchen muss man &uuml;ber die Felsen gehen bevor man schwimmen kann. Der schwimmpunkt beginnt bei ca. 15 Meter. Etwas weiter vom Strand entfernt findet man auch etwas nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten.', 3468, 'de', 1),
(808, 'Ich k&ouml;nnte fast sagen, ein weiterer sch&ouml;ner Strand in Griechenland. Dieser Sandstrand besteht aus wei&szlig;em Sand und hat etwas seichtes Wasser, das kristallklar ist und Familien willkommen hei&szlig;t. In der Umgebung gibt es zahlreiche Restaurants sowie einige Apartments, Zimmer und Hotels. Der Parkplatz ist nur 30 Meter entfernt, ist ziemlich gro&szlig; und ist auch f&uuml;r Wohnwagen geignet. Der Strand liegt auf der Halbinsel Kassandra, die Teil der Chalkidiki-Region ist, oder einer weiteren Region, der Kantriki Makedonia. Die L&auml;nge des Strandes ist 500 Meter und die Breite betr&auml;gt 15 Meter. Schwimmen kann man hier schon ab 20 Meter.', 3467, 'de', 1),
(809, 'Einer der ersten Str&auml;nde im &auml;u&szlig;ersten Nordosten Deutschlands, gleich neben der Grenze zu Polen, ist der wundersch&ouml;ne wei&szlig;e Sandstrand Strand Ahlbeck. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil. Sie haben hier viele Parkpl&auml;tze. Das Parken ist nicht direkt am Strand m&ouml;glich, aber f&uuml;r die Autos sind es ungef&auml;hr 100 m und f&uuml;r die Wohnmobile ungef&auml;hr 400 m. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt einige Kilometer und er ist rund 100 Meter breit. Der Schwimmpunk liegt bei ca. 30 m. Es ist am besten f&uuml;r Familien geeignet. Hunde sind im Sommer nicht gestattet, jedoch nur zu anderen Jahreszeiten. Sie haben hier viel Strandinfrastruktur und viele Restaurants, Strandbars und Fastfood-Punkte zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Unterbringung erfolgt direkt am Strand in Form von Appartements und Hotels.', 3798, 'de', 1),
(810, '<span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); font-family: Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Willkommen am sch&ouml;nen deutschen Strand von &Uuml;ckeritz. Dieser Sandstrand ist ein typisch deutscher Strand und ist f&uuml;r Familien, meist mit kleinen Kindern, gedacht. An diesem sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand werden Sie keine Parkprobleme haben. Es ist f&uuml;r alle Arten von Fahrzeugen, einschlie&szlig;lich Wohnmobilen, erh&auml;ltlich. Der Name der Region, zu der dieser Strand geh&ouml;rt, ist Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. Die n&auml;chste Stadt in Strandn&auml;he ist die Stadt &Uuml;ckeritz. Der Strand ist nur 200 Meter vom Parkplatz entfernt. An diesem kilometerlangen und 75 Meter breiten wei&szlig;en Sandstrand erwartet dich jede Menge Strandspa&szlig;. Sobald Sie das Wasser betreten, k&ouml;nnen Sie nach 20 Metern mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Es gibt viel Strandinfrastruktur am oder neben dem Strand, einige Landsportarten und auch einen sch&ouml;nen Kinderspielplatz. Machen Sie sich hier keine Sorgen um das Essen, Sie finden hier viele Restaurants, Strandbars und auch typisch deutsches Fast Food. Da das gesamte Gebiet von &uuml;ppigem Wald umgeben ist, ist eine Unterkunft direkt am Strand nicht m&ouml;glich, die einzige &Uuml;bernachtungsm&ouml;glichkeit ist ein Camp am Strand. Lassen Sie sich vom Wetter bedienen und genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Jahresurlaub mit BeachRex.</span>', 3800, 'de', 1),
(811, 'Wenn Sie am Strand gerne nackt sind, ist dieser deutsche Sandstrand genau das Richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Es liegt in der deutschen Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Koserow. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen, auch Wohnmobile sind auf dem Parkplatz willkommen. Zum Strand sind es zu Fu&szlig; ca. 200 m vom Parkplatz aus. Am Strand stehen Ihnen einige Kilometer Sand und 50 Meter Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Badepunkt liegt bei ca. 30 m. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist hier nur basis und es gibt auch keine Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches. Einige Unterk&uuml;nfte sind in Strandn&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar.', 3802, 'de', 1),
(812, 'Um diesen sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand zu erreichen, m&uuml;ssen Sie mit dem Fahrzeug in die Stadt Zinnowitz fahren, die an der deutschen Ostsee oder dem Baltischem Meer. Es ist ein Teil der Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. Dieser Strand ist von Pinien umgeben, die bis zum Strand reichen. Es ist ein ganz besonderer Ort um entweder an den Strand zu gehen oder einfach nur im Wald spazieren zu gehen. Es ist sehr einfach diesen Bereich mit Ihrem Auto zu erreichen, auch mit Wohnmobilen. Rund um den Strand, etwa 300 m vom Strand entfernt, stehen zahlreiche Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt einige Kilometer und hat eine Breite von 50 Meter. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr flach, der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 50 m und ist eher f&uuml;r kleine Kinder geeignet. Sie haben hier viel Strandinfrastruktur, sogar ein Strandfitnesscenter, Kinderspielpl&auml;tze und eine Windsurf-Mietstation. Weil der Strand so lang ist, haben Sie sogar einige Teile f&uuml;r die Nudisten, sowie einige Teile f&uuml;r die Hunde. Restaurants und &auml;hnliches sind ebenfalls vor Ort vorhanden. Viele Hotels, Apartments und Campingpl&auml;tze befinden sich ebenfalls in der Umgebung.', 3803, 'de', 1),
(813, 'Wenn Sie eine Familie sind, die lange Sandstr&auml;nde mit einem gro&szlig;en Kinderspielplatz in Strandn&auml;he liebt, sollten Sie den Strand Zinnowitz besuchen. Es liegt in der norddeutschen Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern in der N&auml;he der Ostsee und bietet Ihnen unvergessliche Urlaubserinnerungen. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz ca. 400 m vom Strand entfernt und er ist auch f&uuml;r kleine Wohnmobile geeignet. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und bis zu 75 Meter breit. Es ist in viele Sektoren unterteilt, von denen einige auf die Aufnahme von Hunden spezialisiert sind und andere f&uuml;r Nudisten. Die Neigung am Strand ist normal und der Schwimmpunkt beginnt bei 20 Metern. Die gesamte Gegend ist sehr touristisch gepr&auml;gt, was bedeutet, dass Sie &uuml;ber zahlreiche Strandinfrastrukturen, Restaurants und verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften verf&uuml;gen.', 3804, 'de', 1),
(814, 'Einer der allerersten Str&auml;nde in der d&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark an der Ostsee ist der Sandstrand Kohage. Es ist nicht weit von der deutschen Grenze und nur wenige Kilometer von Flensburg entfernt. Der Strand wird f&uuml;r Abenteurer empfohlen. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen, Sie lassen Ihr Auto einfach am Stra&szlig;enrand stehen. Zum Strand sind es nur wenige Schritte. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 300 m und es ist bis zu 10 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 30 Metern. Sie haben hier sehr wenig Strandinfrastruktur und fast keine Strandservices. Bringen Sie Ihre eigenen Speisen und Getr&auml;nke mit, hier bekommen Sie keine. Einige Unterk&uuml;nfte stehen im Nachbardorf Kollund zur Verf&uuml;gung.', 3888, 'de', 1),
(815, 'Wenn Sie einen ruhigen Sandstrand an der d&auml;nischen K&uuml;ste an der Ostsee suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Kragesand zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der d&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Broager. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohmobil, leicht zu erreichen. Die Stra&szlig;e zum Strand ist asphaltiert, aber beachten Sie, dass auf den letzten Kilometern nur ein Auto in beide Richtungen fahren kann. Der Parkplatz ist nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Strand ist leicht zu erreichen. Es ist 500 Meter lang und 10 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei ca. 30 m. Sie haben hier eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur, aber es gibt keine Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches sowie keine Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten.', 3890, 'de', 1),
(816, 'Der d&auml;nische Strand Vemmingbund empfiehlt sich f&uuml;r Familien, die einen sehr langen Sandstrand mit viel Strandoberfl&auml;che suchen. Es befindet sich in der s&uuml;dd&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark. Das n&auml;herstehe Dorf ist Broager. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und der Parkplatz ist gro&szlig; genug um auch Wohnmobile aufzunehmen. Vom Parkplatz bis zum Strand sind es nur 10 Meter. Sie haben hier viel Strandoberfl&auml;che, die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt ca. 1 km und es ist 20 breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt in ca. 10 m. Hier steht Ihnen einige Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung, ein Kinderspielplatz ist inbegriffen. In den n&auml;heren Restaurants gibt es einige M&ouml;glichkeiten zum Trinken und Essen. Und f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft auf den sch&ouml;nen Strand k&ouml;nnen Sie zwischen Zimmern oder Appartements w&auml;hlen.', 3892, 'de', 1),
(817, 'Wenn Sie in der d&auml;nischen Stadt S&oslash;nderborg sind und einen Sandstrand mit einem Hafen suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Den Sorte zu besuchen. Es befindet sich auf der Insel Als in der s&uuml;dd&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark. Ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und man kann auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur ca. 100m vom Strand entfernt parken. Am Strand stehen Ihnen 300 m L&auml;nge und 20 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Das Wasser f&auml;llt hier sehr schnell, so dass man nach 10 Metern bereits schwimmen kann. Dieser Strand ist mit der blauen Flagge ausgezeichnet, die Ihnen ein bisschen mehr Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen als sonst bietet. Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches gibt es am Strand nicht und f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft steht Ihnen ein Campingplatz in weniger 100m Entfernung zur Verf&uuml;gung.', 3894, 'de', 1),
(818, 'Auf der d&auml;nischen Insel Als gibt es viele sch&ouml;ne Sandstr&auml;nde zu erkunden. Die Insel Als geh&ouml;rt zur s&uuml;dd&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark. Der Strand, den wir hier pr&auml;sentieren, hei&szlig;t Strand &Oslash;sterby und befindet sich in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Sydals. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und ein kleiner Parkplatz erwartet Sie nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt. In der N&auml;he des Parkplatzes befindet sich auch ein Campingplatz, auf dem Wohnmobile parken k&ouml;nnen. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach. Wenn Sie am Strand ankommen, stehen Ihnen 1 Kilometer L&auml;nge und 5 Meter Strandbreite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand Sand ist, haben Sie auch ein kleines St&uuml;ck Gras. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 15 m. Grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur ist vorhanden. Wenn Sie ein Gast sind, haben Sie mehr Infrastruktur im Camp. Hier haben Sie keine M&ouml;glichkeit, etwas zu essen, aber Sie haben viele M&ouml;glichkeiten eine Unterkunft zu finden, ein Campingplatz ist in der N&auml;he.', 3895, 'de', 1),
(819, 'Wenn Sie lange Sandstr&auml;nde mit einem Parkplatz f&uuml;r Ihr Fahrzeug m&ouml;gen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den d&auml;nischen Strand Kegn&aelig;sh&oslash;j zu besuchen. Es liegt auf der sch&ouml;nen Insel Als, die Teil der s&uuml;dd&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark ist, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Sydals. Der Parkplatz ist recht klein, hier k&ouml;nnen ca. 20 Fahrzeuge stehen, auch Wohnmobile, aber es ist nur 10 Meter vom Strand entfernt. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und die Breite 10 Meter. Der Schwimmpunkt beginnt bereits bei 5 Metern. Die gesamte Strandinfrastruktur an diesem Strand befindet sich rund um den Parkplatz. Sie m&uuml;ssen Ihr Essen und Ihre Getr&auml;nke mitbringen, da es hier keine Restaurants mit &auml;hnlicher Verpflegung gibt. Die Unterk&uuml;nfte sind nur in Form eines Campingplatzes in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar.', 3896, 'de', 1),
(820, 'Die d&auml;nische Insel Als in der s&uuml;dd&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark ist diejenige, die Sie besuchen m&uuml;ssen, wenn Sie einige lange Sandstr&auml;nde an der Ostseek&uuml;ste erkunden m&ouml;chten. Der Strand Drejby in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Sydals f&auml;llt in diese Kategorie. Es ist ein sehr sch&ouml;ner Strand, empfohlen f&uuml;r Familien und diejenigen, die ihr Fahrzeug neben dem Strand parken m&ouml;chten. Der Parkplatz ist sehr gro&szlig; und nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach. Die gesamte Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich rund um den Parkplatz an einer Stelle, bevor Sie den Strand betreten. Ein kleines Bistro sowie Toiletten sind ebenfalls vorhanden. Am Strand stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und bis zu 25 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Einstieg ins Wasser ist hier sehr bequem und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 15 m. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, haben Sie einen Campingplatz in der N&auml;he sowie einige Apartments.', 3897, 'de', 1),
(821, 'In der N&auml;he des Dorfes Nordborg auf der d&auml;nischen Insel Als k&ouml;nnen Sie einen sch&ouml;nen langen Sandstrand Strand K&oslash;bingsmark erkunden. Es ist ein Teil der d&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark. Dieser Standort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit Reisemobilen, sehr gut zu erreichen. Nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt erwartet Sie ein gro&szlig;er Parkplatz. Dieser Strand wird mit einer blauen Flagge belohnt, so dass sich hier viele Strandinfrastrukturen befinden. Bringen Sie Ihr Essen und Ihre Getr&auml;nke mit, denn hier gibt es keine M&ouml;glichkeit etwas zu kaufen. Sie haben hier viele Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, ein Campingplatz befindet sich in der N&auml;he sowie einige Apartments. Der Strand selbst hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 1 km und ist bis zu 20 m breit. Sie k&ouml;nnen das Wasser hier auf zwei Arten betreten, entweder vom Strand oder von einer Wassertreppe auf dem Pier. Der Punkt, an dem Sie mit dem Schwimmen beginnen k&ouml;nnen, ist ca. 15 m entfernt.', 3900, 'de', 1),
(822, 'Wenn Sie nach einem sehr langen und breiten d&auml;nischen Strand in der Region Syddanmark suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, die Stadt Aabenraa und ihren Strand &Aring;benr&aring; zu besuchen. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit dem Wohnmobil, sehr gut zu erreichen und es stehen ausreichend Parkpl&auml;tze direkt am Strand zur Verf&uuml;gung. Vom Parkplatz bis zum Strand sind es nur wenige Schritte. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 500 m und ist 100 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und aufgrund des sehr flachen Meeresbodens liegt der Schwimmpunkt bei ca. 100 m. Diese Tatsache, dass dieser Strand einen flachen Meeresboden hat und wegen der vielen Kinderspielpl&auml;tze am Strand, ist dieser Strand ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder. Sie haben eine Menge Strandinfrastruktur und viele Dienstleistungen die hier direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar sind. Viele Sportpl&auml;tze befinden sich auch am Strand. Ein Restaurant und eine Caf&eacute;-Bar befinden sich ebenfalls am Strand. In der Umgebung finden Sie zahlreiche Unterbringungsm&ouml;glichkeiten.', 3901, 'de', 1),
(823, 'Der d&auml;nische Strand Dyrhave liegt in der s&uuml;dd&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark, ganz in der N&auml;he der Stadt Aabenraa. Es ist ein Sandstrand, der 750 m lang und nur 3 m breit ist. Dieser Ort ist sehr leicht zu erreichen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, und ein kleiner Parkplatz, nur 30 Meter vom Strand entfernt, wartet hier auf Sie. Die Strandoberfl&auml;che ist sehr klein, aber Sie haben auch Gras im Hintergrund des Strandes. Sie k&ouml;nnen das Wasser entweder am Strand oder &uuml;ber einen Pier betreten. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 10 Metern. Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s gibt es hier nicht, aber Sie haben einige Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, das n&auml;chste ist ein Camp. Einige Strandservices sind ebenfalls verf&uuml;gbar, darunter ein Kinderspielplatz und Sportpl&auml;tze.', 3902, 'de', 1),
(824, 'Wenn Sie in D&auml;nemark nach einem Strand suchen, an dem Sie sofort nach dem Betreten des Wassers mit dem Schwimmen beginnen k&ouml;nnen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Hejsager zu besuchen. Es liegt in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Haderslev in der Region Syddanmark. Der Strand ist nicht nur f&uuml;r diejenigen geeignet, die gerne schwimmen, sondern auch f&uuml;r diejenigen, die lange Sandstr&auml;nde mit dem Parkplatz neben dem Strand m&ouml;gen. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr gut zu erreichen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und kann bis zu 40 Meter breit sein. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bereits bei 5 m. In der N&auml;he des Parkplatzes haben Sie auch einige Strandinfrastruktur. Hier gibt es auch ein Restaurant. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie ein Haus oder eine Wohnung in der N&auml;he mieten.', 3905, 'de', 1),
(825, 'Wenn Sie Str&auml;nde mit viel Strandoberfl&auml;che m&ouml;gen, deren Strandbreite etwa 100 m betr&auml;gt und deren Meeresboden so flach ist, dass Kinder sicher viele Meter im Wasser spielen k&ouml;nnen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Hejlsminde zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der d&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark. Egal, ob Sie mit dem Auto oder mit dem Wohnmobil anreisen, dieser Standort ist leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken. Die Neigung am Strand ist sehr gering, fast flach, was den Wassereintritt sehr einfach macht. Die Badestelle liegt in ca. 75 m Entfernung. Dieser Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 400 m und ist 100 m breit. Es ist ein sehr beliebter und touristischer Ort mit einem Hafen und viel Strandinfrastruktur. Sie haben auch viele Restaurants, Fast-Food-Kioske und Caf&eacute;s direkt am Strand. Viele Optionen sind auch in der N&auml;he f&uuml;r verschiedene Formen der Unterbringung verf&uuml;gbar.', 3907, 'de', 1),
(826, 'Jedes Land an der Ostsee hat einige erstaunlich sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde. D&auml;nemark ist hier keine Ausnahme, es hat wirklich so viele tolle Sandstr&auml;nde. Und dieses Mal m&ouml;chten wir Ihnen den Strand Trappendal vorstellen. Es befindet sich in der Region Syddanmark in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Hejls. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug dorthin zu gelangen. Ein gro&szlig;er Parkplatz nur 200m vom Strand entfernt wartet auf Ihre Ankunft. Vom Parkplatz aus m&uuml;ssen Sie etwa 10 m zum Strand hinabsteigen, wo Sie eine Mischung aus wei&szlig;em und braunem Sand erwartet. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 200 m und die Breite 10 m. Der Meeresboden an diesem Strand ist sehr flach und die Badestelle ist 75 m entfernt. Sie k&ouml;nnen auch einen Pier hinuntergehen und das Wasserleiter verwenden, um ins Wasser zu gelangen. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist hier nur basisch, hier gibt es keine Restaurants oder Strandbars, aber Sie haben einige Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten in Form von Apartments in der Umgebung.', 3908, 'de', 1),
(827, 'M&ouml;gen Sie Str&auml;nde mit viel Natur, ohne Tourismus, nur Sie selbst, den Sandstrand und die kristallklare Ostsee? Wenn Ihre Antwort positiv ist, m&ouml;chten wir Ihnen den d&auml;nischen Strand Bj&oslash;rneh&oslash;j vorstellen. Es befindet sich auf der Insel Langeland in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Humble in der Region Syddanmark. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, einschlie&szlig;lich Wohnmobilen, sehr leicht zu erreichen. Ein gro&szlig;er Parkplatz ist nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und ist bis zu 15m breit. Der Zugang zum Wasser ist sehr sch&ouml;n und komfortabel und der Punkt zum Schwimmen liegt bei 10 m. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich rund um den Parkplatz. Hier haben Sie keine M&ouml;glichkeit Essen oder Getr&auml;nke zu kaufen, aber Sie haben die M&ouml;glichkeit eine Unterkunft in der N&auml;he zu finden, haupts&auml;chlich als Ferienwohnung oder auf einem Campingplatz.', 3913, 'de', 1),
(828, 'Auf dem &auml;u&szlig;ersten S&uuml;dpunkt der d&auml;nischen Insel Langeland gibt es zwei Attraktionen. Die erste ist der einzigartige kleine Kiesstrand Strand Gulstav mit seinen kleinen Lehmfelsen, die zweite sind einzigartige Wildpferde. Um diese beiden Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten zu erreichen, m&uuml;ssen Sie in Richtung des Dorfes Bagenkop in der Region Syddanmark fahren. Nicht weit vom Strand entfernt befindet sich ein gro&szlig;er Parkplatz, den Sie mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht erreichen k&ouml;nnen. Am Strand stehen Ihnen eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und eine Breite von bis zu 10 m zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Oberfl&auml;che ist eine Mischung aus kleinen und gro&szlig;en Steinen. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 5 m. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich rund um den Parkplatz. Hier haben Sie keine M&ouml;glichkeit, Essen oder Getr&auml;nke zu kaufen oder in einer Unterkunft zu &uuml;bernachten.', 3915, 'de', 1),
(829, 'Auf der d&auml;nischen Insel Langeland gibt es viele verschiedene Arten von Str&auml;nden. Der Strand in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Rudk&oslash;bing ist ein Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien mit kleinen Kindern empfohlen wird. Der Meeresboden ist sehr flach, so dass kleine Kinder sicher im Wasser spielen k&ouml;nnen. In der N&auml;he befinden sich auch einige Kinderspielpl&auml;tze und Sportpl&auml;tze. Dieser Strand befindet sich in der Region Syddanmark. Der Weg zum Strand ist sehr einfach und Sie k&ouml;nnen auch mit einem Wohnmobil anreisen. Der Parkplatz ist sehr nah am Strand und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten dort zu parken. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 500 m und die Breite 30 m. Der Strand ist sehr flach, ebenso wie der Meeresboden, der den schwimmpunkt in die Ferne treibt. Am Strand gibt es auch ein kleines Bistro. In der N&auml;he k&ouml;nnen Sie ein Apartment mieten oder in einem Camp &uuml;bernachten.', 3917, 'de', 1),
(830, 'Obwohl das d&auml;nische Dorf Tranek&aelig;r ein kleiner Ort auf der Insel Langeland ist, hat es viele sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde in seiner Umgebung, wie den Strand Emmerb&oslash;lle. Es ist ein Strand f&uuml;r einen Familientyp, der mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr einfach zu erreichen ist. Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nicht weit vom Strand entfernt. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist brauner Sand und erstreckt sich &uuml;ber einen Kilometer und ist 20 m breit. Der Strand ist ziemlich flach, ebenso wie der Meeresboden, was dazu f&uuml;hrt, dass der Strand nach etwa 40 Metern L&auml;nge zum Schwimmen einl&auml;dt. An diesem Ort befindet sich eine typisch d&auml;nische Strandinfrastruktur. Sie haben auch ein kleines Bistro in der N&auml;he und eine Unterkunft in Form eines Campingplatzes.', 3921, 'de', 1),
(831, 'Wenn Sie einen der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde der d&auml;nischen Insel F&uuml;nen besuchen m&ouml;chten, empfehlen wir Ihnen in Richtung der Stadt Nyborg zu fahren und zum Strand Fyns zu fahren. Der Strand liegt direkt neben der ber&uuml;hmten Br&uuml;cke Storeb&aelig;lt, die die Insel F&uuml;nen mit der Insel Seeland verbindet. Dieser Standort ist Teil der s&uuml;dd&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark. Der Ort, an dem der Strand auf Sie wartet, ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen. Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt. Viele Strandinfrastrukturen und Stranddienstleistungen sind hier verf&uuml;gbar. Es wird empfohlen den Strand zu besuchen, wenn Sie mit Ihrer Familie anreisen, da Sie hier wirklich viel Platz am Strand haben. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und es ist 100m breit. Es ist ein sehr flacher Strand mit vielen Sportfeldern. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und die Badestelle liegt bei ca. 40 m. Am Strand gibt es auch einige Strandbars, Bistros und &auml;hnliches. Sie haben auch mehrere Optionen f&uuml;r die Unterkunft, wie Hotels, Apartments und sogar ein Camp.', 3922, 'de', 1),
(832, 'Juelsminde ist eine Stadt im S&uuml;den der Region Midtjylland. Es hat einen langen Sandstrand Strand Sandbjerg Vig. Es erstreckt sich &uuml;ber eine L&auml;nge von 2 Kilometern und ist 50 m breit. Neben dem Sand gibt es hier auch viel Gras. Wenn Sie nach diesem Strand suchen und ihn besuchen m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie hier mit jedem Fahrzeug fahren und ihn neben dem Strand auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz stehen lassen. An diesem Ort haben Sie eine typisch d&auml;nische Strandinfrastruktur. Der Wassereintritt hier ist sehr sch&ouml;n und die Schwimmstelle beginnt bereits bei 10 m. Sie haben auch ein Bistro und einen Fast-Food-Kiosk direkt am Strand. In der N&auml;he finden Sie auch einen Campingplatz und einige Apartments f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft.', 3935, 'de', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(833, 'Wenn Sie den d&auml;nischen Strand Saksild besuchen, werden Sie verstehen, warum er bei Touristen so beliebt ist. Offensichtlich handelt es sich um einen Sandstrand mit einer Mischung aus wei&szlig;em und braunem Sand, der sich &uuml;ber mehrere Kilometer erstreckt und bis zu 30 Meter breit sein kann. Es ist auch beliebt bei Familien mit kleinen Kindern. Sie haben nicht nur einen Kinderspielplatz am Strand, sondern der Meeresboden ist sehr flach, sodass kleine Kinder sicher im Wasser spielen k&ouml;nnen. Wenn Sie all diese Fakten m&ouml;gen, finden Sie diesen Strand in der Region Midtjylland in der N&auml;he der Stadt Odder. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug hierher zu kommen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken, der nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt ist. Aufgrund des flachen Meeresbodens ist die Badestelle an diesem Strand etwa 100 Meter entfernt. Sie haben viele Strandinfrastruktur rund um diesen Strand, auch viele Arten von Restaurants, Campingpl&auml;tze und viele Apartments in der N&auml;he.', 3937, 'de', 1),
(834, 'Das Strand Ajstrup ist ein Sand Strand in der Region Midtjylland. Es ist am besten f&uuml;r Familien geeignet, die einen Parkplatz am Strand und in der N&auml;he eines Campingplatzes oder einer Wohnung bevorzugen. Dieser Strand ist einige Kilometer lang und bis zu 15 Meter breit. Es erstreckt sich entlang des Dorfes Ajstrup. Wenn Sie es besuchen m&ouml;chten, ist es mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr einfach zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt parken. Entlang des gesamten Parkplatzes haben Sie auch die meiste Strandinfrastruktur, die hier in einem typischen d&auml;nischen Standard pr&auml;sentiert wird. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und man kann auch eine Wasserleiter vom Pier benutzen, um ins Wasser zu gelangen. Die Badestelle ist ca. 10 m entfernt. Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches gibt es hier nicht, bitte bringen Sie das Essen und die Getr&auml;nke mit.', 3938, 'de', 1),
(835, 'In der N&auml;he der d&auml;nischen Stadt Aarhus gibt es einen ganz besonderen Strand namens Strand Moesg&aring;rd. Es ist ein Sandstrand mit einer Gesamtl&auml;nge von 1 km und einer maximalen Breite von 50 m. Der Strand selbst ist sehr interessant, aber auch die Stra&szlig;e, die zum Strand f&uuml;hrt, wird f&uuml;r Aufregung sorgen. Es verl&auml;uft durch einen sehr alten und sch&ouml;nen Wald mit speziell geformten B&auml;umen. Es lohnt sich auf jeden Fall, Ihr Auto neben der Stra&szlig;e zu parken und ein Foto mit den B&auml;umen zu machen, um es auf Ihrem Social Media-Konto zu ver&ouml;ffentlichen. Das n&auml;chstgelegene Dorf zu diesem Strand ist H&oslash;jbjerg und befindet sich in der Region Midtjylland. Es ist sehr einfach, diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken, der nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt ist. Rund um den Parkplatz gibt es auch die meiste Strandinfrastruktur sowie ein Bistro und einen Fast-Food-Kiosk. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach. Am Strand hat man offensichtlich den Sand und im Hintergrund auch einige Rasenfl&auml;chen. Der Strand hat eine normale Neigung, der Wasserzulauf ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 10 m. Sie k&ouml;nnen auch eine Wasserleiter vom Pier benutzen, um ins Wasser zu gehen. Die Unterbringung erfolgt nicht am Strand, sondern in der Nachbarschaft.', 3939, 'de', 1),
(836, 'Der Danishe Strand Fortevej &nbsp;ist ein Sandstrand in Risskov. Dieser Ort ist Teil der Region Midtjylland. Die gesamte Umgebung rund um den Strand ist familienorientiert, mit viel Platz f&uuml;r ein Picknick auf der Wiese, Sportpl&auml;tzen, Kinderspielplatz und vielen Strandinfrastrukturen. Es ist sehr einfach, diesen Ort auch mit einem Wohnmobil zu erreichen, und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, nur 200 m vom Strand entfernt. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist bis zu 20 mm breit. Sie haben hier einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und der Badepunkt liegt bei 20 m. Sie k&ouml;nnen auch die Wasserleiter am Pier benutzen. Wenn Sie hier hungrig werden, haben Sie auch die M&ouml;glichkeit, in einem Bistro etwas zu essen zu kaufen. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in der n&auml;heren Umgebung.', 3941, 'de', 1),
(837, 'Strand Sletterhage ist ein ganz besonderer Strand in D&auml;nemark. Es ist ganz anders als die anderen. Sie haben nicht nur verschiedene Arten von Kieselsteinen und Steinen am Strand, sondern auch eine spektakul&auml;re Aussicht mit dem Leuchtturm neben dem Strand. Eine weitere positive Tatsache ist der Parkplatz direkt am Strand. Wenn Sie nach diesem Strand suchen, finden Sie ihn in der Region Midtjylland auf der Halbinsel in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Knebel. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug hierher zu kommen und auch Wohnmobile haben hier einen Platz. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und kann bis zu 50 m breit sein. Der Wassereintritt ist nicht so angenehm, man muss &uuml;ber einige gro&szlig;e Steine gehen. Die Strandinfrastruktur entspricht hier einem typischen d&auml;nischen Standard. Ein kleiner Bistrokiosk steht Ihnen hier zum Servieren von Speisen oder Getr&auml;nken zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wenn Sie eine Unterkunft suchen, k&ouml;nnen Sie Wohnungen oder H&auml;user in der N&auml;he mieten.', 3943, 'de', 1),
(838, 'Wenn Sie auf der Suche nach einem nat&uuml;rlichen Sandstrand mit viel Oberfl&auml;che und fast keinen Geb&auml;uden sind, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Ahl zu besuchen. Sie m&uuml;ssen in die Region Midtjylland in der N&auml;he der Stadt Ebeltoft fahren. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und ein Parkplatz ist nur 100 Meter vom Strand entfernt. Die Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich rund um den Weg zum Strand und entspricht einem typischen d&auml;nischen Standard. Der Strand selbst ist sehr flach und Sie haben viel Fl&auml;che mit einer L&auml;nge von 750 m und einer Breite von 50 m zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Wassereingang ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt ist ca. 50 m entfernt, an ein paar Stellen noch weiter. Hier gibt es keine Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen eine Wohnung oder ein Haus in der N&auml;he mieten.', 3946, 'de', 1),
(839, 'Sie werden von Ihrem Auto aus nirgends wo auf der Welt einen besseren Blick auf den Strand haben, und ein einzigartiges Stranderlebnis haben, als an diesem d&auml;nischen Strand in Boeslum. Es befindet sich in der Region Midtjylland in der N&auml;he der Stadt Ebeltoft. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr einfach zu erreichen und Sie haben grunds&auml;tzlich zwei Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten. Entweder parken Sie auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz in einem kleinen Wald, oder Sie parken an der Stra&szlig;e neben dem Strand. Der Strand ist einige Kilometer lang und bis zu 10 Meter breit. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che Sand ist, haben Sie hier auch viele kleine Kieselsteine. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier sogar w&auml;hlen auf welcher Oberfl&auml;che Sie Ihr Handtuch ablegen m&ouml;chten. Der Wassereintritt ist an einigen Stellen schwierig, da Sie gro&szlig;e Steine im Wasser haben und der Schwimmpunkt bei etwa 15 Meter liegt. Vor Ort befindet sich eine typische d&auml;nische Strandinfrastruktur mit einem kleinen Fastfood-Kiosk in der N&auml;he. F&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft haben Sie die M&ouml;glichkeit, auf einem Campingplatz zu &uuml;bernachten oder ein Haus oder eine Wohnung in der N&auml;he zu mieten.', 3947, 'de', 1),
(840, 'Der Strand Sangstrup ist ein ganz besonderer Strand mit einer f&uuml;r d&auml;nische Verh&auml;ltnisse einzigartigen Oberfl&auml;che. Der Hang ist hier sehr steil und besteht vollst&auml;ndig aus gro&szlig;en Kieselsteinen und Klippen, die ihn umgeben. Dieser Strand befindet sich in Midtjylland, in der N&auml;he von Gren&aring;. Es ist kein Familienstrand, aber der Strand ist ein Abenteuertyp Strand. Sie haben hier sehr wenig Strandinfrastruktur, nicht einmal eine Toilette. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug hierher zu kommen und Sie haben einen Parkplatz direkt am Strand. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 1 km und ist bis zu 25 m breit. Aufgrund der sehr steilen Neigung des Strandes und der gro&szlig;en Steine im Wasser ist der Wassereintritt nicht so angenehm und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bereits bei 3 m. Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches gibt es hier ebenfalls nicht, aber in der N&auml;he k&ouml;nnen Sie ein Bed &amp; Breakfast-Unterkunft mieten.', 3949, 'de', 1),
(841, 'In D&auml;nemark sind die meisten Str&auml;nde f&uuml;r Familien geeignet. Der perfekte Familienstrand ist sicherlich einer, der gro&szlig;e und moderne Kinderspielpl&auml;tze sowie nebenan Sportpl&auml;tze f&uuml;r &auml;ltere Kinder hat, die gesamte erforderliche Strandinfrastruktur ist ebenfalls am Ort, sowie ein Restaurant oder &auml;hnliches. Wenn Ihnen diese Eigenschaften wichtig sind, weisen wir Sie gerne in Richtung Strand Bratten. Die Region wo sich dieser Strand befindet ist Nordjylland in der N&auml;he des Ortes und der Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeit Jerup. &nbsp;Egal ob Sie mit einem normalen Auto oder Wohnmobil anreisen, ist dieser Strand leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Zugang ist auch f&uuml;r Behinderte geeignet. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und bis zu 25 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt hier ist sehr sch&ouml;n und man kann das Wasser auch vom Pier &uuml;ber eine Wasserleiter betreten. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt zwischen 0 und 30 m. Wenn Ihnen all diese Fakten &uuml;ber den Strand gefallen, k&ouml;nnen Sie hier auch in Unterk&uuml;nften &uuml;bernachten, haupts&auml;chlich in einer Wohnung oder einem Haus.', 3958, 'de', 1),
(842, 'Einige Str&auml;nde in D&auml;nemark sind aufgrund ihrer Eigenschaften eher f&uuml;r Abenteuerlustige geeignet. Dieser Sandstrand befindet sich in der Region Nordjylland in der N&auml;he des Ortes &Aring;lb&aelig;k und ist bekannt unter den Namen Strand &Aring;lb&aelig;k. Hier haben Sie wirklich fast keine Strandinfrastruktur, nur einen kleinen Parkplatz und die Natur, die Sie umgibt. Sie k&ouml;nnen mit jedem Fahrzeug an diesen Ort fahren, obwohl der Parkplatz klein ist, k&ouml;nnen einige Wohnmobile auch hineinpassen. Vom Parkplatz bis zum Strand muss man &uuml;ber D&uuml;nen laufen, ein bisschen rauf und ein bisschen runter. Der Strand ist einige Kilometer lang und bis zu 50 Meter breit. Der Wassereingang ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 15 Metern. Restaurants gibt es hier wirklich nicht, aber Sie haben einige Unterk&uuml;nfte in Form von Wohnungen oder H&auml;usern in der N&auml;he.', 3959, 'de', 1),
(843, 'Strand Bunken ist ein ganz besonderer d&auml;nischer Strand mit sehr gro&szlig;en D&uuml;nen, einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz und eignet sich am besten f&uuml;r Abenteurer. Es liegt in der nordd&auml;nischen Region Nordjylland in der N&auml;he der Stadt &Aring;lb&aelig;k und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen. Sobald Sie Ihr Fahrzeug geparkt haben, ben&ouml;tigen Sie etwa 200 m Fu&szlig;weg, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Sie m&uuml;ssen &uuml;ber einige kleine D&uuml;nen laufen, die zwischen 5 und 10 m hoch sind. Es ist nicht der einfachste Weg, aber wenn Sie fit genug sind, k&ouml;nnen Sie es schaffen. Die Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich am Parkplatz. Der Strand ist sehr lang, mehrere Kilometer und bis zu 15 Meter breit. Der Wassereingang ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei ca. 40 m. Bringen Sie etwas zu essen mit, denn hier k&ouml;nnen Sie nichts kaufen. In der Umgebung befinden sich au&szlig;erdem ein Campingpl&auml;tz f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft, andere Arten der Unterkunft ist nicht verf&uuml;gbar.', 3960, 'de', 1),
(844, 'Skagen ist eine d&auml;nische Stadt am n&ouml;rdlichsten Punkt D&auml;nemarks. Es ist ein sehr interessanter Ort, weil sich hier zwei Meere treffen. Auf der einen Seite liegt die Ostsee, auf der anderen die Nordsee. Rund um diesen Punkt befinden sich viele Sandstr&auml;nde. Die meisten von ihnen sind familienorientiert und sehr leicht zu erreichen. Gleiches gilt auch f&uuml;r den Strand Damstederne, der etwas au&szlig;erhalb der Stadt Skagen liegt. Dieser Nordpunkt D&auml;nemarks geh&ouml;rt zur Region Nordjylland. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr gut zu erreichen und man kann fast direkt am Strand auf einem kleinen Parkplatz parken. Der Strand ist nur 50 m entfernt. An dieser Stelle ist der Strand mehrere Kilometer lang und bis zu 20 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 10 Metern. Die Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich rund um den Parkplatz und entspricht einem typischen d&auml;nischen Standard. Da sich dieser Strand in einer abgelegenen Gegend befindet, gibt es in der N&auml;he keine Restaurants oder Unterk&uuml;nfte. Einige befinden sich jedoch einige Kilometer entfernt in der Stadt Skagen.', 3962, 'de', 1),
(845, 'Dieser Strand im hohen Norden D&auml;nemarks ist eine der Top 10 Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten in D&auml;nemark. Es liegt in der N&auml;he der Stadt Skagen in der Region Nordjylland und tr&auml;gt den Namen Strand Grenen. Hier treffen zwei Meere aufeinander, eines aus der Ostsee und eines aus dem Norden. Es ist ein sehr &uuml;berf&uuml;llter Ort und Menschen aus der ganzen Welt kommen, um ihn zu besuchen. Dieser Ort ist aufgrund seiner Beliebtheit sehr gut organisiert, sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten f&uuml;r alle Arten von Fahrzeugen. Bis zum Strand sind es ungef&auml;hr 200 m. Und um den Punkt zu erreichen, an dem die Meere kollidieren, ist es ein 1,5 km langer Spaziergang entlang der K&uuml;ste. Der Strand ist f&uuml;r Familien zu empfehlen. Insgesamt betr&auml;gt die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes mehrere Kilometer und hat eine maximale Breite von 75 Metern, manchmal sogar mehr, da sich der Strand st&auml;ndig &auml;ndert. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Stelle ab, an der Sie ins Wasser eintauchen. Er sollte jedoch nicht l&auml;nger als 30 Meter sein. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich rund um den Parkplatz. Sie haben dort auch viele Arten von Restaurants. Die Unterkunft ist nicht direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar. Ein Campingplatz ist in der N&auml;he und alle anderen M&ouml;glichkeiten sind in der Stadt Skagen vorhanden.', 3963, 'de', 1),
(846, 'Strand Kandestederne ist ein ganz besonderer Strand in der N&auml;he der Stadt Skagen im hohen Norden D&auml;nemarks. Es ist ein sehr flacher Strand, und Sie d&uuml;rfen sogar mit Ihrem Fahrzeug auf den Strand stehen und tats&auml;chlich auf dem Strand selbst fahren. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Nordjylland. Egal mit welchem Fahrzeug Sie anreisen, dieser Strand ist leicht zug&auml;nglich. Sie haben zwei M&ouml;glichkeiten zu parken, entweder neben der Stra&szlig;e oder am Strand selber. Die Ihnen zur Verf&uuml;gung stehende Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ca. 50 m Breite. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und wegen des flachen Meeresbodens ist der Schwimmpunkt weit weg und liegt mindestens 100 m entfernt, vielleicht sogar noch weiter. Die meiste Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich am Parkplatz an der Stra&szlig;e, bevor Sie den Strand betreten. Im Sommer ist hier ein kleines Bistro ge&ouml;ffnet. In der N&auml;he haben Sie auch ein Restaurant. Die Unterbringung erfolgt auch in Form von Apartments oder einem Hotel in der N&auml;he.', 3965, 'de', 1),
(847, 'Strand Tversted ist ein d&auml;nischer Strand an der Westk&uuml;ste der Nordsee in der Region Nordjylland. Es ist ein Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien und diejenigen empfohlen wird, die flache Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen und ihr Fahrzeug am Strand parken m&ouml;chten. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und im Sommer, wenn die Wellen kleiner sind, k&ouml;nnen Sie direkt am Strand parken. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer, und wenn der Wind nicht stark weht, betr&auml;gt die Breite 100 Meter. Aufgrund des flachen Strandes und des flachen Meeresbodens ist der Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n und die Badestelle ist mindestens 50 m entfernt. Sie haben hier auch einige Strandinfrastruktur, aber nicht direkt am Strand, es liegt in der N&auml;he der Stra&szlig;e. Hier finden Sie auch einen Fast-Food-Kiosk. In der N&auml;he des Strandes haben Sie auch verschiedene Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, wie Hotels, Apartments und sogar einen Campingplatz.', 3967, 'de', 1),
(848, 'Die nordd&auml;nische Stadt Hirtshals hat im Westen der Nordsee einen ganz besonderen und einzigartigen Strand mit 10 Meter hohen Klippen. Es ist ein Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familienbenutzer empfohlen wird, an einigen Stellen jedoch eher f&uuml;r Abenteuerlustige. Es liegt in der n&ouml;rdlichen Region Nordjylland. Es ist sehr einfach diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen. Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten Ihr Auto zu parken, entweder auf der Stra&szlig;e oder auf einem Parkplatz mit H&ouml;henregulierung, nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt. Da es hier hohe Klippen gibt, k&ouml;nnen Sie &uuml;ber Stufen zum Strand gelangen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist Sand. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere km bei einer Breite von 50 m. An manchen Stellen hat man Felsen am Strand, an manchen gibt es nur Sand. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und die Badestelle liegt bei ca. 30 m. Sie haben einige grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur in der N&auml;he. Es gibt auch einige M&ouml;glichkeiten etwas zu essen oder zu trinken zubekommen, und Sie m&uuml;ssen sich keine Sorgen um die Unterkunft machen, da es hier viele verschiedene Arten gibt.', 3968, 'de', 1),
(849, 'Wenn Sie nach einem fast endlosen Sandstrand im d&auml;nischen Norden suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Tornby zu besuchen. Es ist ein Muss, wenn Sie in der N&auml;he der Stadt Hirtshals in der Region Nordjylland sind. Dieser Strand ist im Sommer sehr beliebt und mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichbar. Sie haben zwei M&ouml;glichkeiten Ihr Fahrzeug zu parken, entweder vor einem Restaurant auf einem Parkplatz oder Sie fahren einfach zum Strand und parken dort. Mit einer Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und einer Breite von mehr als 100 m haben Sie hier wirklich viel Fl&auml;che. Dieser Strand ist sehr flach, ebenso wie der Meeresboden, der einen angenehmen Wassereintritt und einen Badepunkt auf etwa 50 m oder mehr bietet. Hier befindet sich eine typische d&auml;nische Standard-Strandinfrastruktur. In der N&auml;he gibt es auch ein Restaurant und einige Unterk&uuml;nfte in Form von Wohnungen oder H&auml;usern.', 3969, 'de', 1),
(850, 'L&oslash;kken ist der Name der d&auml;nischen Stadt im hohen Norden der Region Nordjylland. Es hat einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand Strand L&oslash;kken mitten im Zentrum der Stadt. Der Strand hat viel Oberfl&auml;che, ist sehr lang und sehr breit. Egal mit welchem Fahrzeug Sie an diesem Ort unterwegs sind, es ist sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto auf einem Parkplatz in der N&auml;he des Strandes abstellen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und an einigen Stellen ist er mehr als 100 m breit. Es ist ein sehr flacher Strand mit einem sehr einfachen Einstieg und einer Badestelle in ca. 50 m. Weil es so nahe am Stadtzentrum liegt, gibt es auch viele Strandinfrastrukturen und -dienstleistungen. Verschiedene Arten von Restaurants sind ebenfalls in der N&auml;he und Sie haben auch verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften zur Auswahl, ein Camp und ein Hotel inklusive.', 3970, 'de', 1),
(851, 'Nicht viele Str&auml;nde der Welt haben so einzigartige Eigenschaften wie dieser d&auml;nische Strand Gr&oslash;nh&oslash;j. Wo auf der Welt haben Sie einen Strand, der mehrere Kilometer lang, mehr als 100 Meter breit ist und auf dem Sie tats&auml;chlich parken k&ouml;nnen. Wenn Sie diese Erfahrung machen m&ouml;chten, m&uuml;ssen Sie in die nordd&auml;nische Region Nordjylland fahren und in Richtung der Stadt L&oslash;kken fahren. Egal mit welchem Fahrzeug Sie unterwegs sind, es ist sehr einfach diesen Ort zu finden und noch einfacher den richtigen Parkplatz f&uuml;r Sie am Strand zu finden. Da dies ein sehr flacher Strand ist, ist der Wassereintritt auch sehr sch&ouml;n. Die Badestelle liegt bei ca. 50 m. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich um einen Fast-Food-Kiosk, der auch die einzige M&ouml;glichkeit ist etwas zu essen zu bekommen. Vielleicht ist im Sommer ein Fahrkiosk auch am Strand. Sie haben auch einige Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten in der N&auml;he zur Verf&uuml;gung, vor allem als Wohnung oder ein Haus und nicht weit entfernt ist auch ein Camp.', 3971, 'de', 1),
(852, 'In der d&auml;nischen Region Nordjylland gibt es an der Nordsee zugewandten Westk&uuml;ste einige Stellen, an denen Sie Ihr Fahrzeug direkt am Strand parken k&ouml;nnen. Es gibt nicht viele solcher Str&auml;nde auf der Welt, aber D&auml;nemark hat viele davon. Wenn Sie solche Strandmerkmale m&ouml;gen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, am Strand Blokhus das n&auml;chste Stranderlebnis zu machen. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Strand mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, und einfachen auf den Strand fahren und parken wo immer Sie wollen. Dieser Ort hat viel Strandoberfl&auml;che. Sie haben mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mehr als 100 Meter Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Es ist ein sehr flaches Gebiet, wodurch der Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n ist und der Badepunkt bei ca. 50 m liegt. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich rund um den Einstiegspunkt f&uuml;r fahrzeuge. Dort gibt es auch viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants, einige in der N&auml;he des Strandes, einige in der Innenstadt. Da dies ein sehr beliebter Ort ist, haben Sie auch die Wahl zwischen zahlreichen verschiedenen Unterk&uuml;nften.', 3972, 'de', 1),
(853, 'D&auml;nemark steckt voller &Uuml;berraschungen, besonders wenn es um Str&auml;nde an der Westk&uuml;ste oder der Nordseek&uuml;ste geht. Dieser Strand ist einzigartig, weil es eines der wenigen ist, das neben dem Strand auch einen Schwimmbecken mit frischem Meerwasser direkt am Strand bietet. Wenn Sie glauben dass dieser Strand derjenige ist, den Sie gerne besuchen w&uuml;rden, empfehlen wir Ihnen, nach Nordjylland in Richtung der Stadt Thisted zu fahren und zum Strand Vorup&oslash;r sich zu orientieren. Die gesamte Umgebung des Strandes ist sehr freundlich zum Parken Ihres Fahrzeugs, egal welcher Typ. Wohnmobile k&ouml;nnen hier auch parken. Vom Parkplatz bis zum Strand sind es nur 50 m zu Fu&szlig;. Einige Strandinfrastrukturen wie Toiletten und Duschen befinden sich rund um den Parkplatz, andere direkt am Strand. Am Strand gibt es viel Oberfl&auml;che, die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und die Breite mehr als 100 Meter. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n, egal ob Sie am Strand oder am Pool schwimmen gehen, und dementsprechend liegt der Schwimmpunkt zwischen 0 (wenn Sie die Leiter benutzen) und mehr als 10 Metern. In der N&auml;he des Strandes gibt es viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants. Die gleiche Vielfalt gilt auch f&uuml;r Unterk&uuml;nfte, bei denen Sie aus mehreren Optionen w&auml;hlen k&ouml;nnen.', 3976, 'de', 1),
(854, 'Wenn Sie hohe Klippen an einem Sandstrand mit atemberaubender Aussicht m&ouml;gen, sollten Sie unbedingt diesen d&auml;nischen Strand Bovbjerg besuchen. Es ist wirklich ein einzigartiger Strand und ein einzigartiger Ort, entweder f&uuml;r einen Besuch am Strand oder nur f&uuml;r einen Tagesausflug oder einen Spaziergang an der Bilderhaften K&uuml;ste. Dieser Ort in der N&auml;he der Stadt Lemvig in der Region Midtjylland, und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen, wo Sie auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz neben der Stra&szlig;e parken k&ouml;nnen. Hier befindet sich nur eine sehr geringe Strandinfrastruktur, und Sie m&uuml;ssen auf einigen Holzstufen einen Spaziergang von etwa 200 Metern L&auml;nge und 40 Metern H&ouml;henunterschied unternehmen um den Strand zu erreichen. Wenn man alle Fakten &uuml;ber diesen Strand ber&uuml;cksichtigt, ist er eher f&uuml;r Abenteurer geeignet. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und 75 Meter breit. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand Sand ist, gibt es auch einige kleine Kieselsteine. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bereits bei 5 m. Die Unterkunft ist hier nicht verf&uuml;gbar, aber Sie haben am Parkplatz in der N&auml;he des Leuchtturms eine Kaffee-Bar.', 3979, 'de', 1),
(855, 'D&auml;nemark hat auch einige Str&auml;nde, die zum Surfen geeignet sind. In der Region Midtjylland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Lemvig, gibt es einen Sandstrand Strand H&oslash;fde Q. Er ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen, besonders die Besitzer eines Wohnmobils werden diesen Ort lieben. Ein gro&szlig;er Parkplatz befindet sich direkt neben dem Strand, hier befindet sich auch die Hauptstrandinfrastruktur. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und ist bis zu 75 m breit. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che ist hier Sand, aber es sind auch einige kleine Kieselsteine vorhanden. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt schon bei 5 m. In Strandn&auml;he gibt es weder Unterk&uuml;nfte noch Restaurants.', 3980, 'de', 1),
(856, 'An der d&auml;nischen Westk&uuml;ste, in der Region Midtjylland, haben Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand Strand Thorsminde in der N&auml;he der Stadt Ulfborg. Es ist am ideal f&uuml;r Familien. Egal mit welchem Fahrzeug Sie unterwegs sind, dieser Standort ist leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten Ihr Auto nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt zu parken. Wie es in D&auml;nemark &uuml;blich ist, befindet sich der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur rund um den Parkplatz, ein Kinderspielplatz ist inbegriffen. In der N&auml;he des Parkplatzes gibt es auch einige Restaurants und eine Eisdiele. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach und auch Behinderte k&ouml;nnen den Strand betreten. Der Strand ist sehr lang, mehrere Kilometer lang und an der breitesten Stelle 100 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 5 m. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, haben Sie auch verschiedene Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten zur Auswahl.', 3981, 'de', 1),
(857, 'Wenn Sie nach einem ruhigen, nicht &uuml;berf&uuml;llten, d&auml;nischen Sandstrand in der Region Midtjylland suchen, m&ouml;chten wir Sie auf den Strand Spidsbjerg hinweisen. Es liegt an der d&auml;nischen Westk&uuml;ste in der N&auml;he der Stadt Ulfborg. Ganz in der N&auml;he des Strandes gibt es einen Parkplatz f&uuml;r ca. 30 Fahrzeuge, auch kleinere Reisemobile k&ouml;nnen hier parken. Von der Hauptstra&szlig;e gelangen Sie nach 1 km auf einer unbefestigten Stra&szlig;e zum Parkplatz des Strandes. Da es sich um einen sehr abgelegenen Strand handelt, ist er eher f&uuml;r Abenteurer geeignet. Rund um den Parkplatz haben Sie auch einige Strandinfrastruktur. Es ist ein sehr langer Strand, mehrere Kilometer lang und 100 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 10 m. Am Strand oder in der N&auml;he gibt es keine Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in einem nahen gelegenen Dorf in Form von Wohnungen oder H&auml;usern.', 3982, 'de', 1),
(858, 'Der d&auml;nische Strand S&oslash;ndervig ist ein sehr beliebtes Touristenziel an der Westk&uuml;ste. Es ist auch der Ort, an dem Sie 3 Monate im Jahr die Sandskulpturen in der N&auml;he des Strandes bewundern k&ouml;nnen. Dieser Ort ist voll von verschiedenen touristischen Dienstleistungen, insbesondere wenn es um alle Arten von Restaurants und verschiedenen Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten geht. Wenn Sie solche Eigenschaften m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Ort mit jeder Art von Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten rund um den Ort. Bis zum Strand sind es ungef&auml;hr 300 m zu Fu&szlig;. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich direkt am Eingang zum Strand. Es ist ein sehr langer und breiter Strand. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist mehr als 100 Meter breit. In der N&auml;he des Wasserpunktes, wo Sie ins Meer eintauchen, wird es sehr flach, was den Einstieg sehr komfortabel macht. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 50 m, vor allem wegen des flachen Meeresbodens.', 3985, 'de', 1),
(859, 'Die d&auml;nische Stadt Hvide Sande, an der Westk&uuml;ste in der Region Midtjylland mit einem perfekten Blick auf die Nordsee, hat viele attraktive Str&auml;nde zu bieten. Einer von ihnen ist der Strand &Aring;rgab, nur wenige Kilometer von der Stadt entfernt. Es ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 m breit, mit einer sandigen Oberfl&auml;che und einigen kleinen Kieselsteinen und Felsen, die sich darin vermischen. Wenn Ihnen diese Eigenschaften gefallen, werden Sie auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, etwa 200 m vom Strand entfernt, willkommen gehei&szlig;en, egal mit welchem Fahrzeug Sie unterwegs sind. Der Weg zum Strand ist nicht der einfachste, da man &uuml;ber eine 15 m hohe D&uuml;ne gehen muss, die ziemlich steil ist. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, haben Sie viel Oberfl&auml;che zu Verf&uuml;gung. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 30m. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich am Parkplatz, Restaurants sind hier nicht verf&uuml;gbar und Unterk&uuml;nfte sind verf&uuml;gbar, wenn Sie ein Haus mieten.', 3989, 'de', 1),
(860, 'Wenn Sie nach einem d&auml;nischen Sandstrand in der s&uuml;dlichen Region Syddanmark suchen, an dem Sie direkt am Strand parken k&ouml;nnen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand B&oslash;rsmose zu besuchen. Es ist sehr leicht zu erreichen und die n&auml;chste Stadt ist Oksb&oslash;l. Alle Arten von Fahrzeugen k&ouml;nnen am Strand parken, auch Wohnmobile. Es ist ein sehr gro&szlig;er Strand mit einer Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und einer maximalen Breite von mehr als 100 Metern. Es ist auch ein sehr flacher Strand, der den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n und komfortabel macht. Die Badestelle liegt bei ca. 50 m. Am Strand selbst gibt es fast keine Strandinfrastruktur, nur M&uuml;lleimer, Toiletten sind in der N&auml;he des Camps vorhanden. Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches gibt es nicht am Strand oder in der N&auml;he des Strandes, aber Sie haben eine Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeit in Form eines Camps in der N&auml;he des Strandes.', 3993, 'de', 1),
(861, 'Das Befahren eines Strandes in D&auml;nemark ist in zwei Regionen m&ouml;glich, im Norden in der Region Nordjylland und im S&uuml;den in der Region Syddanmark. Wenn Sie in der Region S&uuml;d sind und diese Erfahrung machen m&ouml;chten, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Vejers zu besuchen. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen, auch Wohnmobile d&uuml;rfen am Strand bleiben. Es gibt einige Regeln, die Sie beachten m&uuml;ssen, ansonsten k&ouml;nnen Sie v&ouml;llig frei parken, wo immer Sie m&ouml;chten. Es ist ein sehr langer Strand, mehrere Kilometer und auch sehr breit, mehr als 100m. Der Strand hat eine kleine Neigung, er ist fast flach. Diese Tatsache macht den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 75 m. Am Strand selbst gibt es nur eine sehr geringe Strandinfrastruktur, aber im Dorf Vejers selbst gibt es noch mehr. Am Strand gibt es auch keine Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches. Vielleicht sind im Sommer ein paar Fastfood Fahrkioske vorhanden, aber im Dorf selbst gibt es noch viel mehr. F&uuml;r die Unterbringung stehen Ihnen im Ort, der sich im Hintergrund des Strandes befindet, viele verschiedene M&ouml;glichkeiten zur Auswahl.', 3994, 'de', 1),
(862, 'Ganz in der N&auml;he der d&auml;nischen Stadt Bl&aring;vand in der Region Syddanmark k&ouml;nnen Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand Strand Hvidbjerg besuchen. Es ist f&uuml;r Familien und diejenigen, die ein touristisches Dorf im Hintergrund des Strandes haben m&ouml;chten, zu empfehlen. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen, auch Wohnmobile sind willkommen und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt abstellen. Um vom Parkplatz zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine kleine D&uuml;ne &uuml;berqueren. Der Strand ist sehr lang, mehrere Kilometer lang und ungef&auml;hr 75 Meter breit. Nah zum Wasser wird der Strand sehr flach, was den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n macht. Der Punkt zum Schwimmen h&auml;ngt von Ihnen ab. Entweder gehen Sie am Strand ins Wasser oder Sie nehmen eine Wasserleiter vom Pier. Auf dem gr&ouml;&szlig;ten Teil des Strandes ist der Meeresboden sehr flach, was es f&uuml;r kleine Kinder ideal macht, sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Einige Strandinfrastrukturen befinden sich direkt am Strand, andere rund um den Parkplatz. Restaurants und &auml;hnliches gibt es nicht direkt am Strand, sondern im Hintergrund im Ort. Im Dorf gibt es auch viele verschiedene Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, einschlie&szlig;lich eines Campingplatzes.', 3995, 'de', 1),
(863, 'Auf der d&auml;nischen Insel R&oslash;m&oslash; muss es einen der gr&ouml;&szlig;ten Sandstr&auml;nde geben, denen Sie jemals in Ihrem Leben begegnen werden. Es hat eine der gr&ouml;&szlig;ten flachen Strandfl&auml;chen, zumindest in Europa, wenn nicht in der ganzen Welt. Wie bei solchen Str&auml;nden in D&auml;nemark &uuml;blich, ist auch dieser Strand mit einem Fahrzeug zug&auml;nglich, Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand parken, unabh&auml;ngig von der Gr&ouml;&szlig;e oder Art des Fahrzeugs. Wenn Ihnen alle bisher beschriebenen Eigenschaften gefallen, lesen Sie bitte weiter. Dieser Strand tr&auml;gt den Namen Strand Lakolk und befindet sich in der Region Syddanmark. Diese Insel, auf der sich der Strand befindet, ist leicht &uuml;ber eine Stra&szlig;e zu erreichen, die das Festland mit der Insel verbindet. Wenn Sie an den Strand kommen, m&uuml;ssen Sie nur einige Regeln beachten, ansonsten k&ouml;nnen Sie frei parken, wo immer Sie m&ouml;chten. Dieser Strand ist offensichtlich mehrere Kilometer lang und die Gesamtbreite betr&auml;gt knapp 1 km. Es ist ein sehr flacher Strand, der den Wassereintritt sehr angenehm und auch f&uuml;r Kinder sicher macht. Die Badestelle ist weit weg, mehr als 100 m. Nicht viele Strandinfrastrukturen befinden sich direkt am Strand, mehr jedoch, bevor Sie mit Ihrem Fahrzeug an den Strand fahren. Dies ist auch der Ort, an dem Sie die meisten Restaurants und Gesch&auml;fte haben, aber auch einige Lebensmittel beweglicher Kiosk stehen am Strand selbst zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Unterbringung ist auch in verschiedenen Formen im Hintergrund des Strandes m&ouml;glich, ein Campingplatz befindet sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he.', 3996, 'de', 1),
(864, 'Diese niederl&auml;ndische Region mit den Namen Groningen, hat aufgrund ihrer Geografie nur sehr wenige Str&auml;nde an der K&uuml;ste, aber mehr an den Seen, die sich in der gesamten Region befinden. Ein solcher See mit einem wundersch&ouml;nen Strand hei&szlig;t Oldambtmeer. Es liegt in der N&auml;he der Stadt Winschoten, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Blauwestad. Der Name des Strandes ist Strand Zuid. Es ist ein famili&auml;rer Strand mit Sand als Hauptoberfl&auml;che, aber Sie haben auch etwas Gras dort. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeugtyp, einschlie&szlig;lich Wohnmobilen, sehr leicht zu erreichen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Strand ist 100 m lang, 20 m breit und hat eine sch&ouml;ne Strandform. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und auf engstem Raum darf gebadet werden. Einige grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich am Strand, sowie auch Kinderspielpl&auml;tze. In der N&auml;he haben Sie auch ein Bistro, wenn Sie hungrig werden. F&uuml;r die Unterbringung haben Sie die M&ouml;glichkeit einige Wohnungen in der N&auml;he zu mieten.', 4021, 'de', 1),
(865, 'Wenn Sie nach einem Sandstrand in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Groningen suchen und es kein Problem ist, dass sich der Strand tats&auml;chlich an einem See befindet, empfehlen wir Ihnen den Strand Schildmeer zu besuchen. Um dorthin zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie in Richtung des Dorfes Steendam fahren. Es ist sehr einfach an diesen Ort zu gelangen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Weg zum Strand ist einfach und auch f&uuml;r Behinderte zug&auml;nglich. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 400 m und ist bis zu 50 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und am Anfang hat man recht seichtes Wasser. Am Strand gibt es auch einen Pier, von dem Sie auch ins Wasser springen k&ouml;nnen, solange er tief genug ist. Einige grundlegende Strandinfrastrukturen und Dienstleistungen sind am Strand verf&uuml;gbar. Sie haben auch ein kleines Restaurant. Die Unterbringung erfolgt auch in der N&auml;he, haupts&auml;chlich im Camp oder in Form von Apartments.', 4023, 'de', 1),
(866, 'Wenn Sie einen Sandstrand suchen, der sich auch zum Kitesurfen eignet und in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Friesland am Ufer des IJsselmeers liegt, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand It Soal zu besuchen. Um an diesen Ort zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie nach Workum fahren. Dieser Ort ist sehr einfach zu erreichen, egal mit welchem Fahrzeug Sie unterwegs sind, und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt abstellen. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und Sie haben einen ziemlich gro&szlig;en Strandbereich mit einer Gesamtl&auml;nge von 750 Metern und einer Breite von 50 Metern. Der Wassereingang ist aufgrund des seichten Wassers sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt ist ca. 100 m entfernt. Einige grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich am Strand. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier auch Kiteboarding-Ausr&uuml;stung ausleihen. Bistro und Fast-Food-Kioske finden Sie ebenfalls in der N&auml;he. Wenn Sie hier eine Unterkunft suchen, haben Sie die M&ouml;glichkeit in einem Camp zu &uuml;bernachten oder eine Wohnung oder ein Haus zu mieten.', 4030, 'de', 1),
(867, 'Der niederl&auml;ndische Strand Stavoren ist ein f&uuml;r Familien empfohlener Sandstrand. Es befindet sich in der Region Friesland im Dorf Stavoren. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen und nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt, auf der Stra&szlig;e parken. Um bis zu dem Strand zu gelangen m&uuml;ssen Sie eine Wassersperre &uuml;berkreuzen. Dieser Sandstrand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 200 m und ist 20 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt zwischen 0 und 25 m oder noch weiter entfernt. Rund um den Strand haben Sie eine ganze Reihe von Dienstleistungen. Ganz in der N&auml;he befindet sich ein Yachthafen sowie viele Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s. Zwischen dem Parkplatz und dem Strand gibt es auch einen Kinderspielplatz und einen kleinen Sportplatz. Das Dorf bietet Ihnen auch einige Unterk&uuml;nfte, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Appartements.', 4031, 'de', 1),
(868, 'Dieser niederl&auml;ndische Strand Mirnser Clif ist wegen seines seichten Wassers bei Kitebordern sehr beliebt. Familien mit kleinen Kindern werden diesen Ort ebenfalls genie&szlig;en, nicht nur das Wasser ist flach und sicher zum Spielen, Sie haben auch einen Kinderspielplatz am Strand. Dieser Sandstrand liegt in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Mirns in der Region Friesland. Wenn Sie diesen Ort besuchen m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie mit jedem Fahrzeug hierherkommen, und ein gro&szlig;er Parkplatz, nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt, wartet auf Sie. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach und wenn Sie dort ankommen, haben Sie zuerst eine gro&szlig;e Wiese und dann den Sandstrand. Insgesamt ist der Strand 200 m lang und an der breitesten Stelle 20 m breit. Mit der Rasenfl&auml;che wird die Breite noch gr&ouml;&szlig;er. Aufgrund des seichten Wassers ist der Wassereingang sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei mehr als 100 m. Dieser Strand liegt in der Natur, was bedeutet, dass die Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen nur einfach sind. Aber Sie haben ein Restaurant und eine Caf&eacute;-Bar neben dem Strand sowie einen Campingplatz und einige Apartments f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft in der N&auml;he.', 4032, 'de', 1),
(869, 'Die niederl&auml;ndische Hafenstadt Urk in der Region Flevoland bietet zwei wundersch&ouml;ne Sandstr&auml;nde. Der erste, ein Familienstrand, hei&szlig;t Dijkstrand. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie &uuml;ber eine kleine Wasserbarriere von 5 m H&ouml;he gehen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 150 m, 30 m breite und hat eine normale Neigung. Der Wassereinstieg ist hier sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt schon bei 5 m. Hier befindet sich eine Basis Strandinfrastruktur, aber Sie haben auch einen Kinderspielplatz und einen kleinen Sportplatz zu Verf&uuml;gung. Am Strand selbst gibt es keine Restaurants, die befinden sich in der n&auml;heren Umgebung, wo Sie auch gen&uuml;gend Unterk&uuml;nfte finden, wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten.', 4034, 'de', 1),
(870, 'Die niederl&auml;ndische Hafenstadt Urk in der Region Flevoland bietet Ihnen zwei wundersch&ouml;ne Sandstr&auml;nde an. Der zweite, ein Familienstrand, hei&szlig;t Strand Staversekade. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, der etwa 750 m vom Strand entfernt ist. Wenn Sie den Weg zum Strand hinuntergehen, k&ouml;nnen Sie die sch&ouml;ne niederl&auml;ndische Architektur bewundern. Bevor Sie den Strand erreichen, k&ouml;nnen Sie auch einen Blick auf den alten Hafen mit vielen interessanten Schiffen werfen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des ziemlich gro&szlig;en Strandes betr&auml;gt 250 m bei einer Breite von 50 m. Dieser Strand ist sehr flach, was den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n macht und der Badepunkt liegt bereits bei 5 m. Da es sich hier eigentlich um einen Stadthafenstrand handelt, befindet sich hier eine gro&szlig;e Strandinfrastruktur mit einem Kinderspielplatz und einem kleinen Sportplatz. Am Strand gibt es auch einen Fastfood-Kiosk und einige Restaurants in der Nachbarschaft. Die Unterkunft ist auch in Form von Appartements in der Stadt m&ouml;glich.', 4035, 'de', 1),
(871, 'Die niederl&auml;ndische Stadt Zeewolde liegt zwar nicht an der Nordseek&uuml;ste, hat aber eine K&uuml;ste entlang des Wolderwijd-Sees und hat einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand. Es ist f&uuml;r Familien und diejenigen, die einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz neben dem Strand haben m&ouml;chten, zu empfehlen. Die Region, in der sich dieser Sandstrand namens Woldstrand befindet, ist Flevoland. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeugtyp, einschlie&szlig;lich Wohnmobilen, sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch einige Rasenfl&auml;chen. An einigen Stellen k&ouml;nnen Sie sogar B&auml;ume haben, die Sie vor der Sonne sch&uuml;tzen. Es ist ein flacher Strand mit einer Gesamtl&auml;nge von 750 m und einer maximalen breite von 50 m. An den meisten Stellen des Strandes ist das Wasser flach, aber Sie haben auch einen Pier, an dem das Wasser tiefer wird und Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder springen oder die Wasserleiter benutzen. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt zwischen 0m und 25m. Auf dem gesamten Strandabschnitt gibt es viele Strandinfrastrukturen, Kinderspielpl&auml;tze und Sportpl&auml;tze. Sie haben auch ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar direkt am Strand und f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft k&ouml;nnen Sie entweder ein Haus oder eine Wohnung mieten.', 4038, 'de', 1),
(872, 'In der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Flevoland gibt es eine Stadt Almere, die sich neben dem Weerwatersee befindet. Am Ufer des Sees gibt es einen neuen k&uuml;nstlichen Sandstrand mit dem Namen Fantasiestrand. Das Einzigartige an diesem Strand ist, dass Sie die M&ouml;glichkeit haben, Wassersport auf dem Skilift-Waterboard zu betreiben. Wenn Ihnen diese Funktionen gefallen, k&ouml;nnen Sie mit jedem Fahrzeug zum Strand fahren und auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che Sand ist, haben Sie auch eine gro&szlig;e Rasenfl&auml;che. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 200 m und die Breite des Sandabschnitts betr&auml;gt 25 m. Durch die Rasenfl&auml;che wird der Strand noch breiter. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und bequem, das Wasser ist ziemlich flach und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 30 m. Einige grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich ebenfalls hier und Sie haben auch ein Restaurant in der N&auml;he. Die Unterbringung erfolgt haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Hotels und Apartments in der Stadt.', 4040, 'de', 1),
(873, 'In der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Flevoland gibt es eine Stadt Almere, die sich neben dem Weerwatersee befindet. Am Ufer des Sees gibt es einen neuen k&uuml;nstlichen Sandstrand mit dem Namen Fantasiestrand. Das Einzigartige an diesem Strand ist, dass Sie die M&ouml;glichkeit haben, Wassersport auf dem Skilift-Waterboard zu betreiben. Wenn Ihnen diese Funktionen gefallen, k&ouml;nnen Sie mit jedem Fahrzeug zum Strand fahren und auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che Sand ist, haben Sie auch eine gro&szlig;e Rasenfl&auml;che. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 200 m und die Breite des Sandabschnitts betr&auml;gt 25 m. Durch die Rasenfl&auml;che wird der Strand noch breiter. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und bequem, das Wasser ist ziemlich flach und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 30 m. Einige grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich ebenfalls hier und Sie haben auch ein Restaurant in der N&auml;he. Die Unterbringung erfolgt haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Hotels und Apartments in der Stadt.', 4045, 'de', 1),
(874, 'Der niederl&auml;ndische See Gouwzee in der Region Nordholland bietet einige Sandstr&auml;nde f&uuml;r Ihren Strandbesuch. Der Strand Pieterma liegt in der N&auml;he der Stadt Volendam, es ist ein Familienstrand, den Sie besuchen sollten, wenn Sie Sand und Gras am Strand m&ouml;gen. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt, hier k&ouml;nnen auch Wohnmobile parken. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 200 m und der sandige Teil ist 20 m breit. Mit der Rasenfl&auml;che wird es noch breiter. Es ist ein flacher Strand mit sehr flachem Wasser, wodurch der Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n ist, aber der Badepunkt ist mit mehr als 100 Metern weit weg. Am Strand gibt es auch eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur, einen Strandkiosk mit Fastfood und in der N&auml;he finden Sie sogar ein Hotel und einige Apartments. In Strandn&auml;he befindet sich auch eine Wohnmobil-Rastst&auml;tte. Neben dem Strand gibt es einen Yachthafen mit vielen Schiffen.', 4046, 'de', 1),
(875, 'Dieser niederl&auml;ndische Strand Schellinkhout wird vor allem von Kittern und Windsurfern bewundert. Das Wasser ist hier sehr flach, was es ideal macht, schnell mit kleinen Wellen auf dem Wasser zu surfen, aber andererseits ist es ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder, um sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Es liegt in der Region Noord-Holland in der Stadt Schellinkhout am Markermeer. Wenn Sie diese Eigenschaften m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Strand hat eine Mischung aus Sand und Gras, ist 100 m lang und 30 m breit. Es ist ein flacher Strand mit flachem Wasser, sch&ouml;nem Wassereintritt und einer Badestelle in mehr als 100 m Entfernung. Sie haben hier fast keine Strandinfrastruktur, die Toiletten sind nur wenige 100m entfernt. In der N&auml;he haben Sie einige Restaurants und die M&ouml;glichkeit eine Unterkunft in einer Wohnung zu finden.', 4047, 'de', 1),
(876, 'In der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Noord-Holland, am IJsselmeer, liegt die Stadt Medemblik. Obwohl es nicht an der Nordseek&uuml;ste liegt, bietet es seinen Strandbesuchern zwei wundersch&ouml;ne Sandstr&auml;nde. Sie k&ouml;nnen mit jedem Fahrzeug an diesen Ort fahren und Ihr Auto auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 200 m vom Strand entfernt abstellen. Der zweite Strand, der Strand Vlietsingel, ist etwas weiter als der erste und auch etwas gr&ouml;&szlig;er. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach. Es ist 300 m lang und 25 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt am seichten Wasser weit drau&szlig;en. Hier gibt es auch ein bisschen Gras. In Strandn&auml;he gibt es einige grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur. Sie haben auch ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar in der N&auml;he des Strandes. Unterkunft ist auch in der N&auml;he m&ouml;glich, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Appartements und Hotels.', 4052, 'de', 1),
(877, 'Wenn Sie nach einem niederl&auml;ndischen Strand mit viel Sand und hohen Sandd&uuml;nen in der Region Nordholland suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Strandslag Duinoord zu besuchen, der sich in der N&auml;he der Stadt Den Helder befindet. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, der etwa 500 m vom Strand entfernt ist. Obwohl es ein ziemlich langer Weg zum Strand ist, lohnt es sich auf jeden Fall. Sie k&ouml;nnen den Strand auch mit dem Fahrrad erreichen, die Wege sind in gutem Zustand. Der Strand ist mit mehreren Kilometern sehr lang und die Breite h&auml;ngt von der Flut oder Ebbe ab, betr&auml;gt jedoch mindestens 50 m. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 75 m. Sie haben einige grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur hier, ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar enthalten. Die Unterbringung erfolgt nicht am Strand, sondern in der N&auml;he in Form eines n&auml;chstgelegenen Camps oder als Apartment oder Hotel.', 4053, 'de', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(878, 'Der niederl&auml;ndische Strand Falga ist f&uuml;r diejenigen zu empfehlen, die einen sehr langen Sandstrand mit fast null Strandinfrastruktur suchen, der in den D&uuml;nen versteckt und weit weg von Touristen liegt. Wenn Sie solche Strandmerkmale m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz ca. 750 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Weg zum Strand ist einfach, aber Sie m&uuml;ssen die 15 m hohen D&uuml;nen &uuml;berqueren. Wenn Sie am Strand ankommen, der eine sehr gro&szlig;e Fl&auml;che hat, mehrere Kilometer lang und mindestens 75 m breit ist, wartet ein sehr feiner Sand auf Ihren Strandtag. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Wasser ist anfangs recht flach, so dass der Schwimmpunkt bei ca. 75 m liegt, es kann aber auch zwischen Ebbe und Flut variieren. Hier befindet sich fast keine Strandinfrastruktur, Restaurants sind auch nicht vorhanden, die Unterkunft ist in der N&auml;he des Parkplatzes in Form eines Camps oder einiger Appartements verf&uuml;gbar.', 4054, 'de', 1),
(879, 'Die niederl&auml;ndische Region Noord-Holland hat eine sehr sch&ouml;ne K&uuml;ste mit der Nordsee. Die K&uuml;ste ist sehr lang und wird haupts&auml;chlich von einer Sandd&uuml;ne gesch&uuml;tzt. Sie hat viele Einstiegspunkte um zum Strand zu gelangen. Wenn Sie Sandstr&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, m&uuml;ssen Sie die Stadt Julianadorp besuchen und Ihr Handtuch auf den Strand Julianadorp legen. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz ca. 400 m vom Strand entfernt. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine 15 m hohe Sandd&uuml;ne auf einem Beton weg &uuml;berqueren. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und eine Breite von mindestens 75 Metern. Man kann sehr bequem ins Wasser gehen und wegen des seichten Wassers ist der Badepunkt weit weg. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist hier nur einfach, aber Sie haben ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar direkt am Strand. Sie haben auch viele Optionen f&uuml;r die Unterbringung in der N&auml;he des Strandes, meist auf einem Campingplatz, aber auch Optionen wie Appartements und Hotels sind verf&uuml;gbar.', 4056, 'de', 1),
(880, 'Wenn Sie einen niederl&auml;ndischen Sandstrand mit sehr wenig Strandinfrastruktur, einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz und einer einzigartigen nat&uuml;rlichen Umgebung suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Drooghe Weert zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der Region Noord-Holland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Julianadorp. Diese Strandcharakteristik macht es f&uuml;r einen eher abenteuerlustigen Strandnutzertyp geeignet. Diese Lage ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz ca. 400 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Weg zum Strand f&uuml;hrt &uuml;ber eine 10 Meter hohe Sandd&uuml;ne. Am Strand gibt es einen sehr gro&szlig;en Strandbereich, der bei Ebbe noch breiter wird. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und es ist 100m breit. An einigen Stellen ist der Strand sehr flach und mit dem flachen Wasser ist der Strandeingang sch&ouml;n, aber der Badepunkt ist weit weg. Grundversorgung gibt es hier nicht, ein Restaurant auch nicht. Die Unterkunft ist nicht am Strand selbst verf&uuml;gbar, auch nicht in der N&auml;he, aber weiter weg.', 4057, 'de', 1),
(881, 'Die niederl&auml;ndische Stadt Callantsoog ist ein sehr beliebtes Touristenziel, nicht nur f&uuml;r die Niederl&auml;nder, sondern auch f&uuml;r ausl&auml;ndische Touristen, vor allem f&uuml;r die Deutschen. Die Stadt selbst hat viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften zu bieten und nat&uuml;rlich auch einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand Strand Abbestee, nat&uuml;rlich mit vielen Strandinfrastrukturen und Dienstleistungen. Wenn Sie interessiert sind, k&ouml;nnen Sie diesen Ort in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Noord-Holland finden. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 300 m vom Strand entfernt. Wie es f&uuml;r diese Art von Str&auml;nden &uuml;blich ist, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine 10 m hohe D&uuml;ne &uuml;ber einen Betonweg &uuml;berqueren. Diese sandige Sch&ouml;nheit ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mindestens 100 m breit, bei Ebbe sogar noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und wegen des seichten Wassers ist die Badestelle weit weg. Hier haben Sie nicht nur die notwendige Strandinfrastruktur, sondern auch verschiedene Arten von Restaurants am Strand. Rund um den Parkplatz stehen viele Arten von Apartments und Hotels zur Verf&uuml;gung, und in der N&auml;he gibt es auch ein Camp.', 4060, 'de', 1),
(882, 'Der niederl&auml;ndische Sandstrand Strand Petten Centrum ist ein Muss f&uuml;r alle, die einen flachen Strand m&ouml;gen und einen Tag dort verbringen m&ouml;chten. Nicht die gesamte Fl&auml;che ist flach, aber das meiste davon ist sicher. Wenn Sie es besuchen m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie diesen Strand in der Region Noord-Holland bei der Stadt Petten finden. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine Treppe benutzen, die einen H&ouml;henunterschied von 10 m zum Strand hinunterf&uuml;hrt. Diese sandige Sch&ouml;nheit ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit. Aufgrund des flachen Strandes und des flachen Wassers ist der Wassereintritt sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 75 m. Hier befindet sich die gesamte Strandinfrastruktur, ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar inklusive. Sie haben auch viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, die richtige Unterkunft in der N&auml;he des Strandes zu finden, wie ein Hotel, eine Wohnung und die n&auml;chstgelegene ein Camp.', 4062, 'de', 1),
(883, 'Aufgrund der sehr flachen Strandoberfl&auml;che und des seichten Wassers ist dieser Sandstrand Strand Hargen aan Zee bei Wassersportlern und Sportlern, die eine flache Oberfl&auml;che f&uuml;r die sportlichen Aktivit&auml;ten am Strand, wie Reiten oder Windbuggy fahren, ben&ouml;tigen, sehr beliebt. Beachten Sie jedoch, dass all diese Aktivit&auml;ten au&szlig;erhalb der Hauptstrandsaison gestattet sind. Es befindet sich in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Noord-Holland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Schoorl. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, nur 200 Meter vom Strand entfernt. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach, dort ist ein betonierter Weg verlegt. Es ist ein mehrere Kilometer langer Strand und mehr als 100 m breit. Aufgrund der ebenen Fl&auml;che ist der Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n, aber der Badepunkt ist mit mehr als 100 m sehr weit weg. Die gesamte wesentliche Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich hier, Sie haben auch ein Restaurant am Strand. Die Unterbringung am Strand oder in der Umgebung ist nicht m&ouml;glich.', 4063, 'de', 1),
(884, 'Das kleine Dorf Bergen aan Zee an der niederl&auml;ndischen Westk&uuml;ste mit dem Sandstrand, der den gleichen Namen wie das Dorf hat, ist f&uuml;r alle zu empfehlen, die alle notwendigen touristischen Einrichtungen in Strandn&auml;he haben m&ouml;chten. Viele Restaurants, Gesch&auml;fte und nat&uuml;rlich viele Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften inklusive. Es befindet sich in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Noord-Holland und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Das Parken kann entweder an der Stra&szlig;e oder auf einem kleinen zentralen Parkplatz erfolgen, der 200 m vom Strand entfernt ist. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach. Dieser Strand ist sehr flach und wegen des flachen Wassers und bei starken Wind wird er von Kitebordern geliebt. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere km und ist 100 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist wegen des flachen Wassers sehr sch&ouml;n, aber der Schwimmpunkt ist weit weg, auf mehr als 100m.', 4064, 'de', 1),
(885, 'In der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Noord-Holland m&uuml;ssen Sie normalerweise beim Strandbesuch ber&uuml;cksichtigen, dass Sie mindestens 300 bis 500 m gehen m&uuml;ssen, bevor Sie den Strand von Ihrem Parkplatz aus erreichen. Dies ist jedoch am Strand Strand Egmond aan Zee nicht der Fall, der sich in der gleichnamigen Stadt befindet. Hier sind Sie nur 50 m von Ihrem Fahrzeug entfernt, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Der Strand besteht aus Sand, wie dies an der gesamten Westk&uuml;ste der Fall ist. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen neben der Stra&szlig;e ganz in der N&auml;he des Strandes parken. Der Zugang ist einfach. Dieser Sandstrand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und ist 75 m breit. Es hat eine normale Neigung, aber in der N&auml;he des Wassers wird es ziemlich flach. Zusammen mit dem flachen Wasser haben Sie einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt. Der Schwimmpunkt ist weit weg. Viele Strandinfrastrukturen befinden sich hier, am Strand selbst gibt es auch verschiedene Restaurants. Die Unterkunft ist auch in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar und in verschiedenen Formen und Typen erh&auml;ltlich.', 4065, 'de', 1),
(886, 'Was ist der n&auml;chstgelegene Sandstrand an der niederl&auml;ndischen Westk&uuml;ste in der Region Nordholland zur ber&uuml;hmten Stadt Amsterdam? Wir k&ouml;nnen Ihnen die Antwort geben, es ist der Strand Kennemerstrand. Die diesem Strand am n&auml;chsten gelegene Stadt ist Ijmuiden und befindet sich direkt an der Stelle, an der der Schiffskanal nach Amsterdam die Nordsee ber&uuml;hrt. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 100 m vom Strandeingang entfernt. Aufgrund des gro&szlig;en Parkplatzes und der riesigen Strandgr&ouml;&szlig;e sieht dieser Strand so aus, als w&uuml;rden die meisten Einwohner Amsterdams dorthin gehen. Der Strand ist &uuml;ber einen Betonweg leicht zu erreichen. Der Strand selbst hat eine sehr gro&szlig;e Fl&auml;che. Es ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 m breit. Es ist sehr flach mit flachem Wasser, was den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n macht, aber Sie m&uuml;ssen eine ganze Weile gehen, bevor Sie tats&auml;chlich schwimmen k&ouml;nnen. An diesem Standort stehen Ihnen zahlreiche Strandinfrastrukturen und -dienste zur Verf&uuml;gung. Viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants befinden sich ebenfalls direkt am Strand. Und wenn Sie nach einer Unterkunft suchen, haben Sie ein Hotel in der N&auml;he.', 4067, 'de', 1),
(887, 'Wenn Sie nach einem der sch&ouml;nsten holl&auml;ndischen Sandstr&auml;nde suchen, sollten Sie sich den Strand Parnassia genauer ansehen. Es befindet sich in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Noord-Holland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Bloemendaal, nicht weit von Amsterdam entfernt. Die gesamte Umgebung rund um den Strand ist voller Natur und au&szlig;er einem Restaurant am Parkplatz gibt es keine Geb&auml;ude. Sehr hohe D&uuml;nen umgeben dieses Gebiet und verleihen dem Strand besondere Eigenschaften. Es ist sehr einfach, mit jedem Fahrzeug hierher zu gelangen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 100 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Weg zum Strand ist nicht der einfachste, er ist ziemlich steil und man muss eine D&uuml;ne hinuntersteigen. Diese sandige Sch&ouml;nheit ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 m breit. Die Neigung des Strandes wird sehr flach, je n&auml;her Sie dem Wasser sind. Der flache Strand am Wasser und das flache Wasser machen den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n, aber der Punkt zum Schwimmen ist deshalb so weit weg. Weitere wichtige Strandinfrastrukturen befinden sich rund um den Parkplatz. Hier befindet sich auch das Restaurant und im Sommer befinden sich Strandbars am Strand. Die Unterbringung erfolgt ebenfalls in der N&auml;he, jedoch nur in Form eines Camps oder Autocamps.', 4068, 'de', 1),
(888, 'Dieser niederl&auml;ndische Sandstrand Strand Bloemendaal aan Zee, nicht weit von der Stadt Amsterdam entfernt, ist f&uuml;r alle empfehlenswert, die eine sehr touristische Umgebung mit vielen verschiedenen Arten von Restaurants und vielen Strandservices bevorzugen. Es befindet sich in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Noord-Holland in der N&auml;he der Stadt Overveen. Es ist sehr leicht mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, au&szlig;er mit Wohnmobilen, die hier nicht parken d&uuml;rfen. Der Parkplatz ist sehr gro&szlig; und Sie m&uuml;ssen 100 m auf einem Betonweg zum Strand laufen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist 100 m breit. Durch das Wasser wird es ziemlich flach und zusammen mit dem flachen Wasser haben Sie einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt. Der Schwimmpunkt ist weit weg. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten oder Ihren Urlaub hier verbringen m&ouml;chten, haben Sie auch die M&ouml;glichkeit, in einem benachbarten Camp zu &uuml;bernachten oder eine Wohnung oder ein Haus in der N&auml;he zu mieten.', 4069, 'de', 1),
(889, 'Wenn Sie nach einem Sandstrand mitten in den Zuid-Holland-D&uuml;nen in der N&auml;he der Stadt Noordwijk suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den niederl&auml;ndischen Strand Noordwijk 27 zu besuchen. Er ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 200m vom Strand entfernt. Das Parken hier ist nicht kostenlos, es kostet Sie 3 &euro; pro Tag. Dieser Ort wird f&uuml;r Familien empfohlen und wegen des flachen Wassers und der Kinderspielpl&auml;tze auch f&uuml;r kleine Kinder empfohlen. In der N&auml;he des Parkplatzes haben Sie auch den gr&ouml;&szlig;ten Teil der Strandinfrastruktur und all die verschiedenen Arten von Restaurants. Am Strand oder in Strandn&auml;he haben Sie aufgrund der D&uuml;nennatur keine Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeit. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und auch f&uuml;r Behinderte geeignet. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist 100 m breit. Sie haben wirklich viel Strand hier, in der N&auml;he des Wassers wird der Strand ziemlich flach und zusammen mit dem flachen Wasser haben Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Strandeingang, aber einen ziemlich weit entfernten Punkt zum Schwimmen.', 4072, 'de', 1),
(890, 'An der Westk&uuml;ste, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Wassenaar, befindet sich ein sehr sch&ouml;ner Sandstrand inmitten von Sandd&uuml;nen, Strand 3 Wassenaarse. Es ist Teil der Region Zuid-Holland, in der sich auch die ber&uuml;hmten St&auml;dte Rotterdam und Den Haag befinden. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug an diesen Ort zu gelangen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und auch behinderte Menschen k&ouml;nnen ihm besuchen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist 100 m breit mit einer ziemlich steilen Neigung. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und wegen des flachen Wassers ist der Schwimmpunkt weit weg. Sie haben viele Strandservices und Infrastruktur hier, sowie viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants und Strandbars. Einige Kinderspielpl&auml;tze sind auch hier. Die einzige Unterkunft hier ist ein Hotel, das etwa 1 km entfernt ist, ansonsten gibt es keine anderen M&ouml;glichkeiten.', 4076, 'de', 1),
(891, 'In der N&auml;he der niederl&auml;ndischen Stadt Den Haag befindet sich wahrscheinlich einer der ber&uuml;hmtesten Sandstr&auml;nde der Niederlande, der Badeort Scheveningen. Es ist ein sehr touristischer Ort und wird wahrscheinlich alle Ihre touristischen Bed&uuml;rfnisse, W&uuml;nsche und Freuden erf&uuml;llen. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand namens Noorderstrand befindet, ist Zuid-Holland. Wenn Sie ein Fan solcher touristischen Orte sind und diese besuchen m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie mit jedem Fahrzeug anreisen und es gibt zahlreiche Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten. Der n&auml;chste, den Sie mit einem Fahrzeug erreichen k&ouml;nnen, ist nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt und einige sind etwas weiter entfernt, aber egal wo Sie parken, Sie haben gen&uuml;gend Pl&auml;tze. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und Sie haben viele Einstiegspunkte entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts. Es ist ein sehr flacher Strand mit einem sehr gro&szlig;en Strandbereich. Die gesamte L&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und die maximale Breite betr&auml;gt 200 m. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei ca. 30 m. Dieser Strand hat auch ein besonderes Merkmal f&uuml;r die Erzeugung von Wellen, was f&uuml;r die Surfer g&uuml;nstig ist. Hier befinden sich viele Surfschulen, Leihausr&uuml;stungsgesch&auml;fte und Surfshops. Dieser Strand und die Umgebung sind auch bekannt f&uuml;r Casinos und eine echte Partyatmosph&auml;re. Die Strandinfrastruktur und die Dienstleistungen sind auf h&ouml;chstem Niveau und werden alle Ihre Anforderungen erf&uuml;llen. Restaurants und Strandbars gibt es in allen erdenklichen Formen und Typen. Unterk&uuml;nfte sind auch in Strandn&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich in Hotels und Apartments.', 4077, 'de', 1),
(892, 'Strand Zuiderstrand 3B ist ein sehr langer Sandstrand, der zur Stadt Den Haag in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zuid-Holland geh&ouml;rt. Die niederl&auml;ndische Westk&uuml;ste ist ber&uuml;hmt f&uuml;r diese Art von Str&auml;nden, die normalerweise sehr lang und sehr breit sind und ihren Besuchern einen riesigen Strandbereich bieten, an dem jeder seinen Platz finden wird. Wenn Sie nach dieser Art von Strand suchen oder sich in der N&auml;he der Stadt Den Haag befinden, empfehlen wir Ihnen, ihn zu besuchen. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zug&auml;nglich. Sie haben viele Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten rund um den Strand und ben&ouml;tigen in der Regel 200 m zu Fu&szlig;, um den Strand zu erreichen. Da dieser Ort auch sehr touristisch ist, k&ouml;nnen Sie sicher sein, dass viele Stranddienstleistungen sowie viele verschiedene Arten von Strandbars und Restaurants zur Verf&uuml;gung stehen. Viele Kinderspielpl&auml;tze befinden sich ebenfalls am Strand. Verschiedene Arten von Apartments und Hotels befinden sich direkt am Strand und in der N&auml;he gibt es sogar ein Camp. Der Strand selbst ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 m breit. Es hat eine normale Neigung und ein sehr flaches Wasser, was eine Garantie f&uuml;r einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt, aber einen sehr weit entfernten Schwimmpunkt ist.', 4079, 'de', 1),
(893, 'Wenn Sie einen Strand mit viel Strandoberfl&auml;che suchen, dessen Strandbreite einige hundert Meter betr&auml;gt und dessen L&auml;nge mehrere Kilometer betr&auml;gt, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den niederl&auml;ndischen Strand Monster Molenslag zu besuchen. Es liegt an der Westk&uuml;ste mit Blick auf die Nordsee in der Region Zuid-Holland. Die n&auml;chstgelegene Stadt ist Ter Heijde. Sie k&ouml;nnen mit jedem Fahrzeug auf diesen Ort zufahren und einfach auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 200 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie &uuml;ber eine 10 Meter hohe D&uuml;nenbarriere gehen. Der Weg besteht aus Beton. Die Neigung am Strand ist von Punkt zu Punkt unterschiedlich und wird zum Wasser hin flacher. Diese Tatsache, zusammen mit dem flachen Wasser, macht den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 50 m. Alle wichtigen Strandinfrastrukturen stehen Ihnen direkt am Strand zur Verf&uuml;gung. Hier gibt es auch einige Arten von Restaurants. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, haben Sie die M&ouml;glichkeit, in einem Hotel oder einer Wohnung zu &uuml;bernachten.', 4080, 'de', 1),
(894, 'Dnxnx d d d d d cc d s g d d fdf df f d dd. G g d s sf. F d d ss. F f s s d f d s d g f d s sssddff fd ', 4172, 'en', 2),
(895, 'Rotterdam hat wirklich einige besondere Str&auml;nde. Es gibt nicht viele Orte auf der Welt, an denen man fast mitten in den gr&ouml;&szlig;ten H&auml;fen der Welt an einen Sandstrand gehen k&ouml;nnte, zumindest in Europa ist es der gr&ouml;&szlig;te. Auf der einen Seite k&ouml;nnen Sie den Sandstrand genie&szlig;en und auf der anderen Seite k&ouml;nnen Sie das Be- und Entladen der gr&ouml;&szlig;ten Schiffscontainer der Welt beobachten. Dieser Strand, Strand Maasvlakte genannt, wird f&uuml;r Abenteurer empfohlen. Sie haben hier fast keine Strandinfrastruktur, keine Restaurants und nat&uuml;rlich auch keine Unterkunft. Dieser Strand befindet sich in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zuid-Holland und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie &uuml;ber eine 5 m hohe D&uuml;ne &uuml;ber einige sehr steile Treppen gehen. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 m breit. Es hat einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 50 m. In Strandn&auml;he gibt es auch einen Teil des Strandes, der f&uuml;r Nudisten reserviert ist, und einen Teil f&uuml;r sportliche Aktivit&auml;ten. Hunde sind hier ebenfalls erlaubt.', 4084, 'de', 1),
(896, 'Der niederl&auml;ndische Sandstrand Strand Slufter wird vor allem f&uuml;r diejenigen empfohlen, die keine Strandinfrastruktur ben&ouml;tigen, au&szlig;er dem Parkplatz und einem sehr gro&szlig;en Strandbereich mit vielen Kilometern L&auml;nge und einigen hundert Metern Breite. Es liegt am Rande des gr&ouml;&szlig;ten europ&auml;ischen Hafens in Rotterdam in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zuid-Holland. Wenn Sie all diese Eigenschaften m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Strand mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen neben der Stra&szlig;e parken, wo ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt ist. Der Zugang zum Strand ist nicht der einfachste. Sie m&uuml;ssen etwa 15 m H&ouml;he &uuml;ber eine D&uuml;ne hinabsteigen. &Uuml;berall ist es ein sehr flacher Strand und in Richtung Meer gibt es ein sehr flaches Wasser, was den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n macht und der Schwimmpunkt von Ort zu Ort variiert, insbesondere aufgrund der Tatsache, dass sich mitten am Strand einer kleiner, aber tiefen See befindet, in dem Sie auch schwimmen k&ouml;nnen, der jedoch sofort in die Tiefe abf&auml;llt, da sonst der Schwimmpunkt an anderen Stellen weit entfernt ist. Restaurants sind hier ebenfalls nicht verf&uuml;gbar und es gibt auch keine Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeit.', 4085, 'de', 1),
(897, 'Nach Angaben der Niederl&auml;nder ist der Strand Rockanje einer der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde in den ganzen Niederlanden. Es ist ein Sandstrand mit vielen lila Muscheln, einem sehr gro&szlig;en Strandbereich und vielen Restaurants und Strandienstleistungen. Die Region, in der es sich befindet, ist Zuid-Holland und es ist ein stolzer Strand der Stadt Rockanje. Egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie zum diesem Ort unterwegs sind, es ist sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 200 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Weg zum Strand ist sehr einfach und besteht aus Beton, auch f&uuml;r Behinderte geeignet. Die Neigung am Strand ist normal und zum Meer hin flacher. Insgesamt ist es mehrere Kilometer lang und 100 m breit. Sie haben einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Strandeingang und wegen des flachen Wassers ist der Schwimmpunkt weit weg. Ein bestimmter Teil des Strandes, etwas weiter vom Eingang entfernt, ist ebenfalls Nudisten vorbehalten. Kinder werden diesen Ort auch lieben, Sie haben einen Kinderspielplatz am Strand und einen neben dem Weg zum Strand. Unterk&uuml;nfte sind auch in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich als Hotels, Apartments und sogar als Camp.', 4086, 'de', 1),
(898, 'Rund um die niederl&auml;ndische Stadt Ouddorp, die an der Westk&uuml;ste mit Blick auf die Nordsee liegt und zur Region Zuid-Holland geh&ouml;rt, gibt es zahlreiche sch&ouml;ne Sandstr&auml;nde f&uuml;r alle Arten von Nutzern. Alle von ihnen sind sehr leicht zug&auml;nglich und es w&auml;re eine Schande, sie nicht zu besuchen, wenn Sie in der N&auml;he sind. Dieser Strand, der unter dem Namen Strand 8 Noordweg bekannt ist, ist mit jeder Art von Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Hier d&uuml;rfen auch Wohnmobile parken, und Sie haben einen Parkplatz f&uuml;r etwa 50 Fahrzeuge, etwa 200 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Weg zum Strand ist sehr sch&ouml;n und asphaltiert, f&uuml;hrt aber &uuml;ber eine 10 m hohe D&uuml;ne, die an einigen Stellen ziemlich steil ist. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist mindestens 100 m breit, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei Flut auf ca. 40 m, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Strand hat eine normale Neigung und bietet Ihnen nur wesentliche Strandinfrastruktur, Restaurant ist nicht verf&uuml;gbar. Sie haben auch die M&ouml;glichkeit in der N&auml;he in Form eines Camps zu &uuml;bernachten, andere Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften sind nicht verf&uuml;gbar.', 4093, 'de', 1),
(899, 'An der niederl&auml;ndischen Westk&uuml;ste, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Ouddorp, in der Region Zuid-Holland, haben Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand den Familien Strand 12&#39;t Gorsje. In der N&auml;he befindet sich auch der Brouwersdam, der die Nordsee vom Grevelingenmeer trennt. Wenn Sie in der N&auml;he sind oder an dieser Stelle nach einem Strand suchen, k&ouml;nnen Sie mit jedem Fahrzeug anreisen und ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz, 200 m vom Strand entfernt, wartet hier auf Sie. Der Weg zum Strand ist in gutem Zustand und asphaltiert. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und er hat eine Mindestbreite von 100 m, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist hier sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt beginnt bereits bei 15 m. Sie haben alle wichtigen Strandinfrastruktur am Strand. Ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar stehen Ihnen ebenfalls zur Verf&uuml;gung. Unterk&uuml;nfte am Strand oder in Strandn&auml;he sind nicht verf&uuml;gbar.', 4094, 'de', 1),
(900, 'In den Niederlanden gibt es keinen Sandstrand, der Ihnen mehr sportliche Aktivit&auml;ten aller Art bietet als am Strand Brouwersdam De Kous. Dieser Strand ist nicht nur sehr flach, sondern auch sehr lang, mehrere Kilometer lang und rund 500 m breit, was ihn ideal zum Surfen mit dem Buggy oder zum Kiten mit dem Buggy macht. Aber es ist nicht nur f&uuml;r Sport reserviert, Sie haben auch einen Teil, der nur f&uuml;r einfaches Sonnenbaden und Schwimmen reserviert ist. Wenn Sie all diese Strandeigenschaften m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere Kilometer Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts. Dieser Strand befindet sich in der Region Zuid-Holland am Brouwersdam, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Ouddorp. Sie haben alle notwendigen Strandinfrastrukturen und zus&auml;tzliche Strandservices direkt am Strand. Wenn Sie zum Wasser gehen, wird der Strand etwas steiler, bevor Sie ins Wasser gehen, aber es ist immer ein sehr sch&ouml;ner Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 30 m. Hier befinden sich auch ein Restaurant und einige Strandbars sowie ein Verleih von Strandausr&uuml;stung. Die Unterkunft ist in der N&auml;he auf der anderen Seite des Damms in Form von Apartments und Hotels und sogar als Camp verf&uuml;gbar.', 4096, 'de', 1),
(901, 'Die meisten Str&auml;nde in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zuid-Holland bestehen aus Sand und haben im Sinne ihrer Gr&ouml;&szlig;e immense Proportionen, aber Sie haben auch einen Strand, an dem die Hauptoberfl&auml;che Gras ist. Einer der Gr&uuml;nde ist auch die Tatsache, dass es nicht an der Westk&uuml;ste liegt, wo Sie den sandigsten Strand haben, sondern am Grevelingenmeer See, ganz in der N&auml;he des Brouwersdam, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Ouddorp, wo sich nicht viele Sandstr&auml;nde befinden. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug hierher zu gelangen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen fast direkt am Strand auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken. Dieser Strand ist auch sehr beliebt bei Windsurfern und solchen, die flache Wellen und starken Wind brauchen. Sie haben hier auch eine sehr einzigartige Installation, es ist eine Wasserrutsche mit einem Sprung in den See. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 300 m, ist 20 m breit, ist sehr flach, hat einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 15 m. Alle notwendigen Strandinfrastrukturen und Dienstleistungen befinden sich direkt am Strand. Eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant befinden sich ebenfalls hier. In der Umgebung stehen Ihnen auch verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften zur Verf&uuml;gung, auch ein Camp.', 4097, 'de', 1),
(902, 'Dieser Sandstrand Strand Kijkduin in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zeeland ist f&uuml;r Familien und diejenigen geeignet, die einen Campingplatz in der N&auml;he haben m&ouml;chten. Wenn Sie Str&auml;nde mit immensen Proportionen m&ouml;gen, mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und einige hundert Meter Breite, dann ist dieser Strand genau das Richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Die n&auml;chstgelegene Stadt ist Renesse und dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Ein ziemlich gro&szlig;er Parkplatz ist 100 m vom Strand entfernt, den Sie &uuml;ber eine asphaltierte Stra&szlig;e erreichen k&ouml;nnen. Hier sind alle wichtigen Strandinfrastrukturen sowie ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar vorhanden. Um schwimmen zu gehen, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine Weile gehen, bevor Sie tats&auml;chlich das Meer erreichen, aber Sie haben einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt beginnt bei 15 Metern. Wenn Sie diese Strandeigenschaften m&ouml;gen und l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, haben Sie viele verschiedene Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten in unmittelbarer N&auml;he.', 4099, 'de', 1),
(903, 'In der N&auml;he der niederl&auml;ndischen Stadt Renesse in der Region Zeeland haben Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand, Strand Jan van Renesseweg, der vor allem f&uuml;r Familien geeignet ist, um einen Tag oder Ihre Sommerferien hier zu verbringen. Es ist sehr leicht mit jeder Art von Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 400 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Zugang zum Strand erfolgt &uuml;ber eine D&uuml;ne auf einem Beton Weg. Wie es in dieser Region &uuml;blich ist, hat auch dieser Str&auml;nd immense Ausma&szlig;e, ist mehrere Kilometer lang und etwa 100 m breit, was bei Ebbe noch breiter werden kann. In Richtung Meer wird der Strand flacher und zusammen mit dem flachen Wasser haben Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Strandeingang, aber der Punkt zum Schwimmen ist ziemlich weit weg. Hier befindet sich die gesamte wesentliche Strandinfrastruktur. Gleiches gilt auch f&uuml;r verschiedene Arten von Restaurants und Strandbars. Wenn Sie Ihren Urlaub hier verbringen m&ouml;chten, haben Sie viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften in der Umgebung.', 4101, 'de', 1),
(904, 'Wenn Sie nach einem holl&auml;ndischen Sandstrand mit wundersch&ouml;nen D&uuml;nen, die mehr als 20 m hoch sind, inmitten reiner Natur suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Vuurtorenpad zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der Region Zeeland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Burgh-Haamstede. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier mit jedem Fahrzeug anreisen und die Parkpl&auml;tze stehen neben der Stra&szlig;e zur Verf&uuml;gung. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie den 500 m langen Fu&szlig;weg auf einem Beton Weg mit 20 m H&ouml;henunterschied ber&uuml;cksichtigen, zuerst bis zur Spitze der D&uuml;ne und dann hinunter zum Strand. Es ist ein sch&ouml;ner Spaziergang und Sie werden die Aussicht genie&szlig;en. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, haben Sie einen sehr gro&szlig;en Strandbereich mit mehreren Kilometern L&auml;nge und mehr als 100 Metern Breite. Der Strand hat eine normale Neigung, wird aber zum Meer hin flacher. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 20 m. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist nur einfach, aber Sie haben ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar direkt am Strand. Die Unterbringung erfolgt nur in der Umgebung des Parkplatzes, meist in Form von Apartments.', 4102, 'de', 1),
(905, 'Wenn Sie die Westk&uuml;ste der Niederlande von Norden nach S&uuml;den entlangfahren, haben Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand namens Strand Rotonde zu Verf&uuml;gung, direkt vor dem Pijlerdam in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zeeland. Die n&auml;chstgelegene Stadt ist Burgh-Haamstede, aber der Strand liegt n&auml;her am Dorf Westenschouwen. Es ist ein Strand vom Typ Familie, der mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen ist. Sie haben 100 m vom Strand entfernt einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, Wohnmobile sind ebenfalls willkommen. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine 10 Meter hohe D&uuml;ne &uuml;berqueren, was &uuml;ber sehr steile Treppen m&ouml;glich ist. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, haben Sie einen Strandbereich mit immensen Proportionen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist mehr als 100 m breit. In Richtung Meer wird der Strand flacher und zusammen mit dem flachen Wasser haben Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Strandeingang. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt ca. 50 m entfernt. Die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich direkt am Strand. Sie haben auch viele verschiedene Restaurants und Strandbars, entweder am Strand oder am Parkplatz zu Verf&uuml;gung. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in der N&auml;he in Form von Apartments und als Camp.', 4103, 'de', 1),
(906, 'Wenn Sie nach einem echten Familienstrand in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zeeland suchen, einem mit Kinderspielpl&auml;tzen und einem sehr flachen Wasser, damit die Kinder sicher darin spielen k&ouml;nnen, empfehlen wir Ihnen den Strand Duinweg zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der N&auml;he der Stadt Oostkapelle und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz ist 400 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Weg zum Strand ist asphaltiert und auch f&uuml;r Behinderte geeignet. Der Strand hat vor allem bei Ebbe immense Ausma&szlig;e. Es ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n, auch wegen des flachen Wassers, aber der Schwimmpunkt ist weit weg. Sie verf&uuml;gen &uuml;ber alle wichtigen Strandinfrastrukturen sowie Kinderspielpl&auml;tze direkt am Strand. Ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar sind ebenfalls hier. Wenn Sie diesen Ort m&ouml;gen und Ihre Sommerferien hier verbringen m&ouml;chten, haben Sie viele verschiedene Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten in der N&auml;he.', 4107, 'de', 1),
(907, 'Strand Duinstraat ist ein niederl&auml;ndischer Strand in der Region Zeeland, der nicht nur von den Familien wegen des Kinderspielplatzes am Strand bewundert wird, sondern auch unter den Surfern, die die Art und Weise m&ouml;gen, wie sich die Wellen hier verwandeln, wenn sie das Land ber&uuml;hren. Es befindet sich in der Stadt Domburg und dieser Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 100 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach und f&uuml;hrt &uuml;ber einen Betonweg, der auch f&uuml;r Behinderte geeignet ist, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Dieser Sandstrand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und hat bei Flut eine Breite von 75 m, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 30 m. Sie haben hier alle wichtigen Strandinfrastrukturen sowie einige Arten von Restaurants und Strandbars. Da dies ein sehr interessanter und touristischer Ort ist, stehen Ihnen in der N&auml;he viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften zur Verf&uuml;gung.', 4108, 'de', 1),
(908, 'In den Niederlanden gibt es viele sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde, nat&uuml;rlich sind die meisten sandig, aber es gibt nicht viele, an denen man fast direkt am Strand parken k&ouml;nnte. Bei den meisten muss man eine Weile ruhig spazieren, um sie zu erreichen. Nun, in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zeeland gibt es tats&auml;chlich einen solchen Strand, der AutoStrand Westkapelle hei&szlig;t und nicht weit von der Stadt Westkapelle entfernt ist. Dieser Strand ist auch bei Windsurfern und Surfern beliebt. Offensichtlich ist es wirklich einfach, mit jedem Fahrzeug hierher zu kommen, es ist sehr beliebt bei Wohnmobilen und man kann einfach direkt am Strand parken. Dieser Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und an einigen Stellen sogar mehr als 100 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 20 m. Strandinfrastruktur ist hier fast nicht vorhanden, nur ein paar Dienstleistungen sind verf&uuml;gbar. Restaurants gibt es auch nicht direkt am Strand. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in der N&auml;he in Form von Camps.', 4109, 'de', 1),
(909, 'Strand Erica ist ein sehr sch&ouml;ner, attraktiver und kleiner Sandstrand in der Stadt Westkapelle, der nur 400 m lang ist (das ist sehr wenig, wenn man ihn mit anderen Str&auml;nden vergleicht, die mehrere Kilometer lang sind). Die Region, in der es sich befindet, ist Zeeland. Dieser Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen kleinen Parkplatz 100 m vom Strand entfernt. Um darauf zuzugreifen, haben Sie mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, entweder die Treppe oder eine asphaltierte Stra&szlig;e zu nehmen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt 400 m und ist mindestens 75 m breit, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und wegen des flachen Wassers liegt der Schwimmpunkt bei 50 m. Die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur sowie ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar befinden sich direkt am Strand. Unterk&uuml;nfte gibt es auch in der N&auml;he in vielen verschiedenen Formen, ein Campingplatz ist ebenfalls in der N&auml;he.', 4110, 'de', 1),
(910, 'In den Niederlanden gibt es nicht viele Str&auml;nde, die direkt in einer Stadt liegen, insbesondere nicht in der Region Zeeland. Eine solche Stadt mit Sandstrand ist Vlissingen, ein sehr beliebtes Touristenziel. Dieser Strand ist mit jeder Art von Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben grunds&auml;tzlich zwei Hauptoptionen, um Ihr Fahrzeug zu parken, entweder Sie tun es neben der Stra&szlig;e oder Sie parken auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz etwas weiter entfernt. Wenn Sie an der Stra&szlig;e parken, sind es nur 30 Meter bis zum Strand. Dieser Strand ist f&uuml;r Familien zu empfehlen, hat eine normale Neigung, ist 750 Meter lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bereits nach 20 m. Da dies ein sehr touristisches und beliebtes niederl&auml;ndisches Reiseziel ist, stehen Ihnen am Strand viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Gleiches gilt auch f&uuml;r viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants, die sich meist am Strand oder in der N&auml;he befinden. Wie es f&uuml;r ein solches Touristenziel &uuml;blich ist, haben Sie viele verschiedene M&ouml;glichkeiten Ihre Lieblingsunterkunft zu w&auml;hlen.', 4114, 'de', 1),
(911, 'Der niederl&auml;ndische Sandstrand Strand Breskens liegt an einem ganz besonderen Ort. Hier treffen sich Nordsee und Schelde. Der Einfluss der Nordsee und auf der anderen Seite des Flusses hat einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand geschaffen, der von vielen Touristen und Strandbesuchern bewundert wird. Dieser Sandstrand befindet sich in der Stadt Breskens und geh&ouml;rt zur Region Zeeland. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug hierher zu gelangen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen neben der Stra&szlig;e parken, die nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt ist. Sie haben zwei M&ouml;glichkeiten, um zum Strand zu gelangen, entweder &uuml;ber die Treppe oder &uuml;ber einen asphaltierten Weg. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 1 km und ist mehr als 100 m breit. In Richtung Meer wird es etwas steiler. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von Ebbe oder Flut ab, sollte aber ungef&auml;hr 40 m betragen. Hier befindet sich die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur, ein Kinderspielplatz und einige Sportpl&auml;tze. Ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar sind ebenfalls vorhanden. Unterkunft ist auch in der Stadt in vielen verschiedenen Formen verf&uuml;gbar.', 4116, 'de', 1),
(912, 'Wenn Sie nach einem Sandstrand in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zeeland in der N&auml;he der Stadt Nieuwvliet suchen und einen sch&ouml;nen Blick auf die Westk&uuml;ste und die vorbeifahrenden gro&szlig;en Containerschiffe haben mochten, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Kruishoofd zu besuchen. Egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie an diesem Ort unterwegs sind, es ist sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 200 m vom Strand entfernt. Rund um den Parkplatz und in der Umgebung gibt es viele Camps, Apartments und sogar Hotels. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder die Treppe benutzen oder einen asphaltierten Weg nehmen. Wenn Sie gerne Sandburgen bauen oder mit Ihren Kindern gro&szlig;e Sandl&ouml;cher graben, steht Ihnen f&uuml;r Ihre Aktivit&auml;ten ein sehr gro&szlig;er Strandbereich mit vielen Kilometern L&auml;nge und einer Mindestbreite von 100 m zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt haupts&auml;chlich von Ebbe oder Flut ab, sollte aber bei etwa 30 m liegen. Fast die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur steht hier zur Verf&uuml;gung und zus&auml;tzlich haben Sie eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant, um Ihren Magen zu f&uuml;llen und die niederl&auml;ndische K&uuml;che zu genie&szlig;en.', 4119, 'de', 1),
(913, 'In den Niederlanden, ganz in der N&auml;he der belgischen Grenze, haben Sie viele M&ouml;glichkeiten an einen Sandstrand zu gelangen. Wenn Sie gro&szlig;e vorbeifahrende Schiffe beobachten oder einfach nur mit Ihren Kindern im Sand spielen m&ouml;chten, ist der Strand Vlamingpolder genau das Richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Es befindet sich in der N&auml;he der Stadt Retranchement in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zeeland. Unabh&auml;ngig davon, mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie an diesem Ort unterwegs sind, ist es sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten Ihr Auto zu parken. Der n&auml;chste Parkplatz ist 100 m entfernt, ein gr&ouml;&szlig;erer etwas weiter. Da dies ein sehr beliebtes und touristisches Ziel ist, haben Sie viele verschiedene Restaurants zur Auswahl, auch Strandbars, die direkt am Strand liegen. Gleiches gilt auch f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft, bei der Sie zwischen verschiedenen Typen w&auml;hlen k&ouml;nnen. Wenn Sie den Strand betreten haben Sie einen sch&ouml;nen asphaltierten Weg, der auch f&uuml;r Behinderte geeignet ist. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und er ist mehr als 100 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und man kann schon nach 30 Metern mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Hier steht Ihnen die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung.', 4120, 'de', 1),
(914, 'Waren Sie schon einmal an einem Sandstrand, der direkt an einer Grenze zwischen zwei L&auml;ndern liegt? Wenn nicht und Sie diese Erfahrung machen m&ouml;chten, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Duinlaan zu besuchen, einen Familienstrand an der Grenze zwischen den Niederlanden und Belgien. Cadzand ist der Name der Stadt, die dem Strand am n&auml;chsten liegt, und Zeeland ist der Name der Region, nach der gesucht werden muss, um diesen Strand zu finden. Egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie reisen, dieser Ort ist sehr leicht zu erreichen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil. Der Parkplatz ist sehr gro&szlig; und steht Ihnen etwa 400 m vom Strand entfernt zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Weg zum Strand ist sehr sch&ouml;n und asphaltiert. Am Strand hast du ein sehr gro&szlig;es Gebiet mit mehreren Kilometern L&auml;nge und mehr als 100 Metern Breite. Die Neigung ist gr&ouml;&szlig;tenteils normal und flacht zum Meer hin ab. Wie an den meisten niederl&auml;ndischen Str&auml;nden haben Sie auch hier einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 75 m. Die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich entweder direkt am Strand oder am Parkplatz. Am Strand selbst gibt es auch ein Restaurant. Da dieser Ort sehr beliebt ist, stehen hier viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften zur Verf&uuml;gung, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Campingpl&auml;tzen und Hotels.', 4121, 'de', 1),
(915, 'Der allererste Strand in Nordbelgien, nicht weit von der Grenze zu den Niederlanden entfernt, ist der Sandstrand Strand Het Zoute. Es befindet sich in der Region West-Vlaanderen in der Stadt Knokke-Heist. Es ist ein sehr touristischer Ort mit vielen Apartments und Hotels direkt am Strand. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen etwa 200 m vom Strand entfernt neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und bei Ebbe ist dieser Strand einige 100 m breit. Sie haben einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 40 Metern. Hier finden Sie die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur sowie eine Strandbar.', 4122, 'de', 1),
(916, 'In der belgischen Stadt Knokke-Heist, die ein sehr beliebtes und touristisches Ziel ist, gibt es viele sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde, die sich &uuml;ber mehrere Kilometer erstrecken. Die Str&auml;nde, die sich hier befinden, sind Teil der Region West-Vlaanderen. Strand Lekkerbekhelling ist ein Sandstrand und f&uuml;r Familien zu empfehlen. Es ist sehr leicht mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und wie in Belgien &uuml;blich parken Sie neben der Stra&szlig;e und in 100 m Entfernung sind Sie am Strand. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach. Am Strand haben Sie sehr wenig Strandinfrastruktur, auch keine Restaurants, aber Sie haben rundum viele verschiedene Arten von Wohnungen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist mehr als 100 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 30 m.', 4123, 'de', 1),
(917, 'In der belgischen Region West-Vlaanderen in der Stadt Knokke-Heist gibt es viele sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde, die sich &uuml;ber mehrere Kilometer erstrecken. Einer dieser Sandstr&auml;nde in der Stadt ist der Strand Oosthinder, ein Familienstrand, der im Sommer viele Stranddienstleistungen bietet. Es ist sehr einfach diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach neben der Stra&szlig;e parken, nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt, was sehr praktisch ist. Was an diesem Ort gut ist, ist die Unterkunft, die direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar ist, so dass Sie den Strand direkt von Ihrem Balkon aus bewundern k&ouml;nnen. Am Strand gibt es auch viele Strandbars und andere Installationen, die Ihnen die Strandzeit erleichtern. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und die Mindestbreite 100 m, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Sie haben hier einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Strandeingang und der Schwimmpunkt ist bereits nach 15 m.', 4124, 'de', 1),
(918, 'Der belgische Sandstrand Strand Knokke liegt mitten in der Stadt Knokke-Heist. Es ist ein Familienstrand und da er bei Touristen sehr beliebt ist, gibt es viele Unterk&uuml;nfte und verschiedene Arten von Restaurants direkt am Strand. West-Vlaanderen ist der Name der Region, in der sich diese beliebte Stadt befindet. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug hierher zu kommen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Der Strandbereich hier ist sehr gro&szlig; und Sie haben mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mehr als 100 Meter Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Das Wasser ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von Ebbe oder Flut ab, sollte aber bei etwa 15 m liegen. Im Sommer stehen hier viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, die alle Ihre Bed&uuml;rfnisse befriedigen.', 4125, 'de', 1),
(919, 'Wenn Sie nach einem Sandstrand in Belgien mit einem sehr gro&szlig;en Strandbereich suchen, an dem Sie mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mehr als 100 Meter Breite am Strand haben, empfehlen wir Ihnen, die Stadt Knokke-Heist zu besuchen und zum Strand Meerlaan. Es befindet sich in der Region West-Vlaanderen, ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Am Anfang ist der Strand sehr flach, aber in Richtung Wasser bekommt er eine normale Neigung. Sie haben einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und einen Schwimmpunkt bei ca. 20 m, der jedoch je nach Ebbe oder Flut variiert. Im Sommer gibt es hier viele Stranddienstleistungen sowie viele Strandbars und verschiedene Arten von Restaurants. Die Unterbringung erfolgt direkt am Strand in Form von Apartments.', 4126, 'de', 1),
(920, 'Strand Zeegras ist ein belgischer Sandstrand in der Stadt Knokke-Heist. Wenn Sie eine Familie sind, ist dieser Strand f&uuml;r Sie zu empfehlen und Sie werden es lieben, besonders, wenn Sie eine Unterkunft in einem der zahlreichen Apartments direkt am Strand mieten k&ouml;nnen. Der Strand ist sehr flach, aber die Neigung &auml;ndert sich zum Meer, wo es steiler wird. Der Strandbereich hier ist sehr gro&szlig; und Sie haben viele Kilometer L&auml;nge und mehr als 100 Meter Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wenn Sie diese Eigenschaften m&ouml;gen, befindet sich dieser Strand in der Region West-Vlaanderen und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Rund um den Ort gibt es zahlreiche Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten, von denen einige nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt sind. Im Sommer ist es sehr voll, da dies ein sehr beliebtes Touristenziel ist. Viele Stranddienstleistungen sind hier verf&uuml;gbar und Sie k&ouml;nnen sogar einige Wasserger&auml;te in der N&auml;he mieten. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 20 m, kann aber je nach Ebbe oder Flut variieren. Im Sommer stehen verschiedene Arten von Strandbars und Restaurants direkt am Strand zur Verf&uuml;gung.', 4127, 'de', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(921, 'Wenn Sie nach einem echten Familienstrand in der belgischen Region West-Vlaanderen in der Stadt Knokke-Heist suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Sandstrand Strand Heldenplein zu besuchen. Der Grund daf&uuml;r ist die Tatsache, dass Sie an diesem Strand Kinderspielpl&auml;tze haben, Sportpl&auml;tze haben, einen sehr flachen Strand haben und wenn Ihre Kinder gerne im Wasser spielen, k&ouml;nnen sie dies sicher an diesem Strand tun, weil es ein seichtes Wasser hier gibt. Wenn Sie all diese Eigenschaften m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Strand mit jeder Art von Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen, und Sie haben in der Umgebung mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten ihr Auto zu parken. Die n&auml;chsten Parkpl&auml;tze sind nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt. Dieser Ort ist auch sch&ouml;n f&uuml;r Familien, da Sie eine Wohnung direkt am Strand oder in der Umgebung mieten k&ouml;nnen, sogar ein Campingplatz in der N&auml;he. Hier gibt es viele Stranddienstleistungen, sowie viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants und Strandbars. Dieser Sandstrand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n, aber wegen des flachen Wassers ist der Schwimmpunkt weit weg.', 4128, 'de', 1),
(922, 'Obwohl Belgien nur eine kurze K&uuml;ste mit der Nordsee hat, hat es eine ganze Reihe von Str&auml;nden. Der Sandstrand Strand Zeebrugge ist f&uuml;r Familien und f&uuml;r alle denen empfehlenswert, die sehr flache und sehr breite Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen. Familien mit kleinen Kindern werden diesen Strand besonders lieben, da Sie einen Kinderspielplatz darauf haben und dieses sehr flache Wasser f&uuml;r Kinder sehr sicher ist, um sicher darin zu spielen. Es befindet sich in der Region West-Vlaanderen und geh&ouml;rt zur Stadt Br&uuml;gge. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie parken einfach direkt am Strand neben der Stra&szlig;e. Es ist ein mehrere Kilometer langer Strand, der bei Ebbe etwa 500 m breit ist. Mit solchen Eigenschaften ist der Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n, aber der Schwimmpunkt ist weit weg. Sie haben hier alle wichtigen Strandinfrastrukturen, auch Restaurants und Strandbars. Und wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie direkt am Strand ein Hotel buchen oder in einem Apartment &uuml;bernachten.', 4129, 'de', 1),
(923, 'In der belgischen Stadt Blankenberge k&ouml;nnen Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen nat&uuml;rlichen Sandstrand mit atemberaubenden D&uuml;nen im Hintergrund besuchen. Dieser Strand befindet sich in der Region West-Vlaanderen und tr&auml;gt den Namen Strand Duinse Polders. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach 200 Meter vom Strand entfernt neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie &uuml;ber Treppen und einen Feldweg eine 10 m hohe D&uuml;ne &uuml;berqueren. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mehr als 100 Meter Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n, aber der Punkt zum Schwimmen ist weit weg. Bringen Sie Ihre Speisen und Getr&auml;nke mit, denn hier gibt es keine Restaurants oder Strandbars sowie keine Strandinfrastruktur. Unterkunft gibt es in der N&auml;he in vielen verschiedenen Formen auch auf einigen Campingpl&auml;tzen.', 4130, 'de', 1),
(924, 'In der belgischen Stadt Blankenberge gibt es einen ganz besonderen Sandstrand mitten in der Stadt. Es ist wahrscheinlich eines der attraktivsten Geb&auml;ude der Stadt und es ist ein sehr langer Pier, von dem aus Sie die ganze Sch&ouml;nheit des Sandstrandes bewundern k&ouml;nnen. West-Vlaanderen ist der Name der Region, in der Sie diesen Strand finden. Wenn Sie es sich ansehen m&ouml;chten, ist dieser Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen, Sie haben mehrere Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten, der n&auml;chstgelegene befindet sich direkt am Strand und einige sind etwas weiter entfernt. Da dies ein sehr beliebtes Touristenziel ist, stehen Ihnen &uuml;berall zahlreiche Strandinfrastrukturen und -dienste zur Verf&uuml;gung. Gleiches gilt auch f&uuml;r alle Arten von Restaurants, die sich &uuml;ber den gesamten Strand erstrecken. Eine Unterkunft zu finden ist auch kein Problem, die n&auml;chstgelegene ist direkt am Strand in Form von Hotels oder Apartments und einige Campingpl&auml;tze sind ebenfalls in der N&auml;he. Am Strand stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mehr als 100 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 40 m. Eine weitere Attraktion am Strand ist ein kleines Autodrom, das rund um den Pier verl&auml;uft. Wie Sie sehen, haben Sie mehrere Gr&uuml;nde, warum dieser Strand Ihr n&auml;chster Urlaubsort sein sollte.', 4131, 'de', 1),
(925, 'Die belgische Stadt Blankenberge ist ein sehr beliebtes Touristenziel und zieht ihre Besucher wegen des sehr sch&ouml;nen und langen Sandstrandes an. Wenn Sie Str&auml;nde mit immensen Proportionen m&ouml;gen, wie mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mehr als 100 m Breite, ist der Strand Blankenberge derjenige, den Sie besuchen sollten. Die Region in der es sich befindet, hei&szlig;t West-Vlaanderen. Unabh&auml;ngig davon, mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie reisen, ist dieser Ort sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten in Strandn&auml;he zu parken. Die n&auml;chsten Parkpl&auml;tze sind nur 10 m vom Strand entfernt, einige sind etwas weiter entfernt. Sie haben einen sch&ouml;nen Zugang zum Strand und behinderte Menschen k&ouml;nnen auch den Strand benutzen. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei Flut bei etwa 30 m und kann bei Ebbe weiter entfernt sein. Hier steht die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung, einschlie&szlig;lich Kinderspielpl&auml;tze und Sportpl&auml;tze. Sie haben auch viele M&ouml;glichkeiten hier in einem der zahlreichen Restaurants und Strandbars etwas zu essen zu bekommen. Unterkunft ist bereits am Strand in vielen verschiedenen Optionen und auch in der Umgebung verf&uuml;gbar.', 4132, 'de', 1),
(926, 'Wenn Sie in Belgien sind und nach einem Sandstrand f&uuml;r einen abenteuerlustigeren Benutzertyp suchen, was bedeutet, dass Sie von Natur umgeben sind, im Falle dieses Strandes die D&uuml;nen, keine Strandinfrastruktur, keine Restaurants und &auml;hnliches, dann empfehlen wir Ihnen den Strand Harendijke zu besuchen. Dieser Strand ist Teil der Region West-Vlaanderen und die n&auml;chstgelegene Stadt ist De Haan. Der Strand ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie parken einfach neben der Stra&szlig;e, etwa 200 m vom Strand entfernt. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie die Stra&szlig;e &uuml;ber die Br&uuml;cke &uuml;berqueren und etwa 10 m hochsteigen. Am Strand stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mindestens 75 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt &auml;ndert sich entsprechend der Flut. Obwohl Sie keine Strandinfrastruktur haben und hier keine Restaurants zur Verf&uuml;gung stehen, haben Sie viele Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten in der N&auml;he. Die n&auml;chste ist ein Camp.', 4133, 'de', 1),
(927, 'De Haan ist eine weitere touristische Stadt in der belgischen Region West-Vlaanderen an der Westk&uuml;ste, mit erstaunlichem Blick auf die Nordsee. Wie es f&uuml;r ein solches Reiseziel &uuml;blich ist, haben Sie hier auch einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand Strand Wenduine, der sich im Nachbardorf Wenduine befindet. Wenduine ist auch sehr beliebt und Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen und einfach etwa 50 m vom Strand entfernt neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Weil es so touristisch ist, k&ouml;nnen Sie sicher sein, dass Sie hier eine gro&szlig;e Vielzahl an Strandinfrastruktur finden, sowie viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants und Strandbars und nat&uuml;rlich viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften, von denen einige direkt am Strand liegen, sogar einen Campingplatz in der N&auml;he. Am Strand stehen Ihnen bei Flut mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mindestens 100 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Flut ab, sollte aber bei etwa 30 m liegen.', 4134, 'de', 1),
(928, 'Rund um die belgische Stadt De Haan gibt es zahlreiche sch&ouml;ne Sandstr&auml;nde, die sich &uuml;ber mehrere Kilometer entlang der belgischen Westk&uuml;ste erstrecken. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strandabschnitt befindet, hei&szlig;t West-Vlaanderen, und der besondere Strand, den wir hier beschreiben, ist Strand Konijnenpad. Sie k&ouml;nnen mit Ihrem Fahrzeug hierherkommen, egal welcher Art, auch das Wohnmobil ist in Ordnung, und einfach neben der Stra&szlig;e parken, im besten Fall nur 50 m entfernt. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und auch f&uuml;r Behinderte in Ordnung. Am Strand stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mindestens 50 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr gut, obwohl er an einigen Stellen ziemlich steil zum Wasser f&uuml;hrt. Der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Flut ab, sollte aber bei etwa 30 Metern liegen. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist hier fast nicht vorhanden, mit Ausnahme eines Restaurants, das direkt am Strand liegt. Sie haben verschiedene Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten in der Umgebung, haupts&auml;chlich als Camps.', 4135, 'de', 1),
(929, 'Strand Zwarte Kiezel ist ein Sandstrand an der belgischen Westk&uuml;ste in der N&auml;he der Stadt De Haan. Da Sie hier keine Strandinfrastruktur, keine Restaurants haben, ist dieser Strand eher f&uuml;r Abenteurer geeignet, die mit dem N&ouml;tigsten zufrieden sind. Wenn Sie diese Strandeigenschaften m&ouml;gen, befindet sich dieser Strand in der Region West-Vlaanderen und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Das Parken erfolgt 100 Meter vom Strand entfernt auf einem Parkplatz. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie die D&uuml;ne &uuml;ber Treppen &uuml;berqueren. Die Treppen sind ziemlich steil, aber nur 10 Meter hoch. Am Strand haben Sie mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mindestens 50 m Breite, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 40 m, bei Ebbe vielleicht sogar mehr. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in der Umgebung, haupts&auml;chlich auf Campingpl&auml;tzen und auch als Familienresort.', 4136, 'de', 1),
(930, 'Das belgische Reiseziel De Haan ist ein weiterer beliebter Touristenort an der belgischen Westk&uuml;ste, der sich f&uuml;r einen Familienbenutzer und alle diejenigen eignet, die die Wohnung direkt am Strand haben m&ouml;chten. Der Strand liegt in der Region West-Vlaanderen und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen. Sie haben mehrere Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten, die n&auml;chste ist nur 50 m entfernt. Am Strand stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mindestens 100 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Am Anfang ist der Strand sehr flach und f&auml;llt dann in Richtung Meer ab. Du hast einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Flut ab, sollte aber bei ca. 40 m liegen. Hier steht Ihnen eine Vielzahl von Strandinfrastrukturen sowie viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants zur Verf&uuml;gung. In der gesamten Region gibt es viele Unterk&uuml;nfte in vielen verschiedenen Formen, auch als Camps.', 4137, 'de', 1),
(931, 'Nur ein wenig au&szlig;erhalb des belgischen Touristenziels De Haan befindet sich ein nat&uuml;rlicher aussehender Sandstrand Strand Zeepreventorium. Wenn Sie lieber Sandd&uuml;nen im hinteren Teil des Strandes haben und gleichzeitig den Blick auf die Nordsee genie&szlig;en m&ouml;chten, ist dieser Strand genau das Richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Da hier keine Strandinfrastruktur verf&uuml;gbar ist und Sie auch keine Restaurants am Strand haben, wird dies eher f&uuml;r Abenteurer als f&uuml;r Familien empfohlen, obwohl es ziemlich nahe am &uuml;berf&uuml;llten Zentrum der Stadt De Haan liegt. Die Anreise mit Ihrem Fahrzeug ist sehr einfach und Sie k&ouml;nnen 200 m vom Strand entfernt neben der Stra&szlig;e zu parken. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie die 10 m hohen D&uuml;nen &uuml;berqueren. Auf halber Strecke ist der Weg in Ordnung, auf der letzten halber Strecke gibt es nur Sand unter Ihren F&uuml;&szlig;en und an einigen Stellen ist der Weg etwas steil. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und die Mindestbreite betr&auml;gt 50 m. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Flut ab, sollte aber bei ca. 50 m liegen. Da dies ein sehr beliebtes Reiseziel ist, gibt es in der Stadt und in der Umgebung viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften.', 4138, 'de', 1),
(932, 'Strand Vosseslag ist ein wahrer Familienstrand. Es ist ein Sandstrand mit viel Strandinfrastruktur, einem Kinderspielplatz, hygienischen Einrichtungen und sogar einer Strandbar. Obwohl es nicht an einem touristischen Ort liegt, ist es im Sommer immer noch sehr voll. Im hinteren Teil des Strandes haben Sie Sandd&uuml;nen. Die n&auml;chstgelegene Stadt ist De Haan und befindet sich in der Region West-Vlaanderen. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach an der Stra&szlig;e parken, 200 m vom Strand entfernt. Es ist mehrere Kilometer lang und hat eine Mindestbreite von 75 m, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n, aber der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Flut ab und sollte bei etwa 75 Metern liegen. Am Anfang des Strandes haben Sie einen ziemlich steilen Hang, der dann in Richtung Wasser flacher wird. Die Unterkunft in der Umgebung ist in vielen verschiedenen Formen verf&uuml;gbar.', 4139, 'de', 1),
(933, 'An der Westatlantikk&uuml;ste hat Belgien viele sch&ouml;ne Sandstr&auml;nde an vielen verschiedenen Touristenzielen wie in der Stadt Bredene. Der Strand, den wir hier pr&auml;sentieren, wird nicht f&uuml;r Familien empfohlen, sondern eher f&uuml;r Abenteurer. Sie haben keine Strandinfrastruktur und keine Restaurants am Strand, und der Zugang zum Strand ist auch nicht der einfachste. Es ist eher f&uuml;r diejenigen zu empfehlen, die die Natur in ihrer Umgebung m&ouml;gen. West-Vlaanderen ist der Name der Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier mit jedem Fahrzeug anreisen und einfach entweder an der Stra&szlig;e oder auf gro&szlig;en Parkpl&auml;tzen 400 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mindestens 75 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und ein Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Flut ab, sollte aber ca. 50 m betragen. Da dies ein sehr touristischer Ort ist, gibt es in der Umgebung viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften.', 4140, 'de', 1),
(934, 'Belgien ist bekannt f&uuml;r seine vielen Sandstr&auml;nde von Norden nach S&uuml;den, die meisten davon an der Westatlantikk&uuml;ste. Viele touristische Ziele befinden sich entlang der K&uuml;ste. Die meisten von ihnen haben einen Strand direkt vor der Stadt, aber es gibt nur wenige, die vor Sandd&uuml;nen gesch&uuml;tzt sind, was bedeutet, dass Sie zwischen dem Strand und der Stadt ungef&auml;hr 100 m D&uuml;nen &uuml;berqueren m&uuml;ssen. Eine solche Stadt ist Bredene, die in der Region West-Vlaanderen liegt und Ihnen einen Sandstrand Strand Bredene Aan Zee anbieten kann. Der Strand ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 200 m vom Strand entfernt. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine Eisenbahn und eine Stra&szlig;e &uuml;ber eine Unterf&uuml;hrung der Eisenbahn &uuml;berqueren. Am Strand haben Sie alle wichtigen Strandinfrastruktur sowie eine Strandbar. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und die Mindestbreite betr&auml;gt 75 m, und bei Ebbe wird es noch gr&ouml;&szlig;er. Die Neigung am Strand variiert von Ort zu Ort. Am Anfang ist es flach, dann f&auml;llt es pl&ouml;tzlich ab, dann ist es wieder flach. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Flut ab und sollte zwischen 10 und 50 m liegen. Da dies ein sehr touristisches Ziel ist, gibt es in der Stadt viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften.', 4141, 'de', 1),
(935, 'Oostende ist ein weiteres beliebtes Touristenziel in Belgien an der Atlantischen Westk&uuml;ste. Hier gibt es viele sch&ouml;ne Sandstr&auml;nde und der erste, von Norden nach S&uuml;den, ist der Strand Groenendijk. Es befindet sich an einem ganz besonderen Ort, neben der Festung Napoleon. Die Region, in der Sie diesen Strand finden, ist West-Vlaanderen. Obwohl sich nicht viele Strandinfrastrukturen direkt am Strand befinden, gibt es rund um den Parkplatz viele verschiedene Einrichtungen, wie riesige Sportfelder und einen sehr gro&szlig;en Kinderspielplatz. In der Festung Napoleon gibt es auch ein Restaurant. Wenn Sie diese Fakten m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Strand mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einige Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten, die n&auml;chstgelegene 200 Meter vom Strand entfernt. Der Zugang zum Strand ist nicht der einfachste, aber zu bew&auml;ltigen. Am Strand betr&auml;gt die Gesamtl&auml;nge mehrere Kilometer und Sie haben bei Flut mindestens 75 m Breite und bei Ebbe zwei- bis dreimal mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt ist je nach Flut unterschiedlich, sollte aber zwischen 10 und 50 m liegen. Sie haben auch viele M&ouml;glichkeiten f&uuml;r eine Unterkunft in der Stadt selbst, haupts&auml;chlich als Apartments und Hotels.', 4142, 'de', 1),
(936, 'Die belgische Stadt Oostende ist wahrscheinlich eines der beliebtesten Sommer-, Sonnen- und Strandreiseziele in diesem Land. Es befindet sich in der Region West-Vlaanderen und hat viele sch&ouml;ne und attraktive Str&auml;nde zu bieten. Strand Westelijke Strekdam ist einer von ihnen und liegt direkt im Stadtzentrum, in der N&auml;he des Hafens. Es ist sehr leicht mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und das Parken kann meistens am Parkpl&auml;tzen neben der Stra&szlig;e erfolgen. Zum Strand gelangen Sie etwa nach 50 m zu Fu&szlig;. Am Strand stehen Ihnen ca. 750 m Strandl&auml;nge und einige 100 m Strandbreite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Flut und dem Teil des Strandes ab, an dem Sie ins Wasser gehen. Er sollte jedoch zwischen 5 und 40 m liegen. Hier finden Sie die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur sowie viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants. Sie finden auch viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften, einige direkt am Strand.', 4143, 'de', 1),
(937, 'Wenn Sie nach einem belgischen Sandstrand mit immensen Proportionen suchen, wie z. B. mehreren Kilometern L&auml;nge, 200 m Breite bei Flut und noch mehr bei Ebbe, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Strand Oostende zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der Stadt Oostende, die Teil der Region West-Vlaanderen ist und eine K&uuml;ste mit der Nordsee hat. Es ist sehr einfach, mit jedem Fahrzeug hierher zu gelangen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach an der Stra&szlig;e parken, die nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt ist. Der Strand ist sehr leicht zu erreichen, auch f&uuml;r Behinderte. Hier finden Sie die gesamte grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur, einschlie&szlig;lich vieler verschiedener Restaurants. Der Strand ist ziemlich flach, wodurch das Wasser sehr sch&ouml;n eindringt und der Schwimmpunkt etwa 40 m betr&auml;gt. Einige Sportpl&auml;tze stehen hier zur Verf&uuml;gung und ein Surfverleih. Viele Apartments und Hotels sind direkt am Strand, vielmehr in der Umgebung verf&uuml;gbar.', 4144, 'de', 1),
(938, 'Sind Sie eine Familie mit kleinen Kindern und m&ouml;chten einen gro&szlig;en Kinderspielplatz an einem Sandstrand haben? Dann empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Northlaan in der belgischen Stadt Oostende zu besuchen. Es ist ihn sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, hier zu parken, die n&auml;chstgelegene direkt am Strand. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, ist West-Vlaanderen und hat eine K&uuml;ste mit der Nordsee. Der Strand hat wirklich enorme Proportionen. Es ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 m breit. Es ist ein ziemlich flacher Strand mit einem sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und einem Badepunkt auf ca. 20 m, aber das kann sich mit der Flut &auml;ndern. Sie verf&uuml;gen &uuml;ber alle wichtigen Strandinfrastruktur am Strand oder in der Umgebung. Viele verschiedene Restaurants stehen Ihnen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Dieser Strand ist auch sehr praktisch, da Sie eine Wohnung mieten k&ouml;nnen oder in einem Hotel direkt am Strand &uuml;bernachten k&ouml;nnen.', 4145, 'de', 1),
(939, 'Strand Mariakerke Bad ist ein weiterer Sandstrand in einem der beliebtesten belgischen Sommertouristenziele, Oostende. Wenn Sie Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, an denen Sie ganz in der N&auml;he des Strandes parken k&ouml;nnen, ist dieser Strand der richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Es ist ein Familienstrand mit der notwendigen Strandinfrastruktur, nat&uuml;rlich gibt es hier auch viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants. West-Vlaanderen, die Region, in der sich die meisten sch&ouml;nen Sandstr&auml;nde befinden, einschlie&szlig;lich dieser, befindet sich an der Westk&uuml;ste und erm&ouml;glicht es Ihnen ein Sommergef&uuml;hl in der Nordsee zu erleben. Unabh&auml;ngig davon, mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie reisen, ist dieser Ort leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten. Der Zugang zu den Str&auml;nden ist einfach. Am Strand stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und mindestens 75 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Wie es in Belgien &uuml;blich ist, haben Sie auch hier einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Flut ab, sollte aber bei etwa 20 Metern liegen. Oostende ist ber&uuml;hmt f&uuml;r seine Unterkunft direkt am Strand, und bei diesem Strand ist dies keine Ausnahme.', 4146, 'de', 1),
(940, 'Der Strand Raversijde liegt etwas au&szlig;erhalb des ber&uuml;hmten belgischen Touristenziels Oostende und ist nicht so &uuml;berf&uuml;llt wie andere Str&auml;nde in der Umgebung. Er bietet Ihnen jedoch nicht alle wichtige Strandinfrastruktur, die andere Str&auml;nde bieten k&ouml;nnen. Trotzdem hat es immer noch positive Seiten, wie zum Beispiel die &ouml;ffentliche Stra&szlig;enbahnhaltestelle, die direkt am Strand liegt, oder die zahlreichen verschiedenen Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, die es Ihnen beim &Uuml;berqueren der Eisenbahn bieten kann. Sie k&ouml;nnen mit jedem Fahrzeug auf diesen Ort zugreifen und einfach neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie die Stra&szlig;e und die Eisenbahn &uuml;berqueren. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach und Sie haben mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und eine Mindestbreite von 50 m zur Verf&uuml;gung, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt &auml;ndert sich entsprechend der Flut, sollte aber ungef&auml;hr 20 m betragen. Hier gibt es auch Restaurants, aber um dorthin zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie die Eisenbahn und die Stra&szlig;e &uuml;berqueren.', 4147, 'de', 1),
(941, 'Middelkerke ist ein weiteres Sommerreiseziel in Belgien an der Westk&uuml;ste, wo Sie viele Sandstr&auml;nde finden, wie zum Beispiel den Strand Raversijde Domein. Wenn Sie keine Strandinfrastruktur, keine Restaurants und keine anderen Einrichtungen am Strand m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Strand genau das Richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Es befindet sich in der Region West-Vlaanderen und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, das Sie einfach auf der Stra&szlig;e verlassen k&ouml;nnen, sehr leicht zu erreichen. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie die Stra&szlig;e und die Eisenbahnen &uuml;berqueren und &uuml;ber die sehr steilen Treppen zum Strand gelangen. Es ist mehrere Kilometer lang ist und hat eine Mindestbreite von 15 Metern, bei Ebbe viel viel mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 40 m. In der N&auml;he haben Sie auch einige Familienresorts und Campingpl&auml;tze f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft.', 4148, 'de', 1),
(942, 'Ein sch&ouml;ner Familiensandstrand namens Strand De Greefplein befindet sich in einem der vielen belgischen Sommerziele am Meer in Middelkerke. Wie es f&uuml;r ein solches Reiseziel &uuml;blich ist, stehen Ihnen entweder am Strand oder in der Umgebung viele touristische Einrichtungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Am Strand steht ein Kinderspielplatz zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wie die anderen Reiseziele am Meer befindet sich auch dieses in der Region West-Vlaanderen. Wenn Sie solche Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichbar und Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie die Eisenbahnen &uuml;berqueren. Achten Sie daher auf die Stra&szlig;enbahn. Dieser Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und hat eine Mindestbreite von 75 m. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Flut ab, sollte aber ungef&auml;hr 40 m betragen. Ganz in der N&auml;he des Strandes, bei der Bahn, stehen Ihnen zahlreiche verschiedene Restaurants zur Verf&uuml;gung. F&uuml;r diejenigen, die eine Unterkunft direkt am Strand haben m&ouml;chten, ist dies ein perfekter Ort, an dem Sie eine Wohnung mieten oder in einem Hotel &uuml;bernachten k&ouml;nnen.', 4149, 'de', 1),
(943, 'Der Strand, den wir hier beschreiben, befindet sich in einem anderen ber&uuml;hmten belgischen Touristenziel, der Stadt Middelkerke. Dieser Strand hei&szlig;t Strand Casino. Es ist ein typischer Familienstrand, wenn man die gesamte touristische Infrastruktur rund um den Strand ber&uuml;cksichtigt. Wie es in Belgien &uuml;blich ist f&uuml;r ein solches Touristenziel, haben Sie hier auch die M&ouml;glichkeit, ganz in der N&auml;he des Strandes zu parken, h&ouml;chstens 100 m entfernt, einige sogar noch n&auml;her, nur wenige Meter entfernt. Wie alle anderen Str&auml;nde in Belgien besteht auch dieser aus Sand. Die L&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist mehr als 100 Meter breit, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Ein weiteres einzigartiges Merkmal des Strandes ist die einzigartige Formation des Strandes mit steilen Stellen, an denen Sie irgendwo in der Mitte des Strandes 2 Meter auf eine flachere Oberfl&auml;che abfallen. Da Sie hier auch einen starken Unterschied bei Ebbe und Flut haben, m&uuml;ssen Sie auch dass ber&uuml;cksichtigen, dass sich der Schwimmpunkt entsprechend &auml;ndert, sollte aber bei etwa 30 Metern liegen. Hunde sind an diesem Strand erlaubt, m&uuml;ssen aber an der Leine sein. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist hier grunds&auml;tzlich vorhanden. Sie werden hier nicht hungrig, denn hier gibt es viele verschiedene Restaurants, Strandbars und Fast-Food-Kioske. Wenn Sie diesen Strand m&ouml;gen und Ihren Urlaub hier verbringen m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen wir Ihnen versichern, dass Sie viele verschiedene Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten zur Auswahl haben, sogar ein Camp ist in der N&auml;he.', 4150, 'de', 1),
(944, 'Der Strand Krokodiel befindet sich im ber&uuml;hmten belgischen Touristenziel in der Stadt Middelkerke. Es ist ein typischer Familienstrand, wie die meisten Str&auml;nde hier, wenn man die gesamte touristische Infrastruktur rund um den Strand ber&uuml;cksichtigt. An diesem speziellen Strand haben Sie auch die M&ouml;glichkeit, ganz in der N&auml;he des Strandes zu parken, der n&auml;chste ist nur 10 m entfernt und einige etwas weiter entfernt. Es ist ein Sandstrand mit einer L&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und einer Breite von mindestens 100 Metern, bei Ebbe noch mehr. Die Neigung am Strand variiert von Punkt zu Punkt und wird auch von der St&auml;rke der Wellen beeinflusst, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen sicher sein, dass Sie irgendwo in der Mitte der Strandbreite einen kleinen abstieg haben. Da Sie hier auch einen starken Unterschied bei Ebbe und Flut haben, m&uuml;ssen Sie auch ber&uuml;cksichtigen, dass sich der Schwimmpunkt entsprechend &auml;ndert, sollte aber bei etwa 40 Metern liegen. Hunde sind an diesem Strand erlaubt, m&uuml;ssen aber an der Leine sein. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist hier auf einer grundlegenden Ebene vorhanden, aber Sie haben auch einen kleinen Kinderspielplatz hier vorhanden. Hier finden Sie viele verschiedene Restaurants, Strandbars und Fast-Food-Kioske. Da dieser Ort sehr touristisch ist, k&ouml;nnen wir Ihnen versichern, dass Sie viele verschiedene Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten zur Auswahl haben, sogar ein Camp ist in der N&auml;he.', 4151, 'de', 1),
(945, 'Država Belgija ima z severnim morjem okrog 60 km obale. Vse plaže na zahodni obali so brez izjeme pe&scaron;čene, kar tudi velja za plažo, ki vam jo predstavljamo tu. Plaža Strand Westende, ki se nahaja v kraju Middelkerke je tako kot večina, primerna za družino, saj je v bližini vsa potrebna plažna infrastruktura, nastanitev različnih tipov in seveda parkiri&scaron;če, ki je oddaljeno zgolj 30 metrov. Belgija je tudi znana po svoji umetnosti, ki je lahko občudujete seveda tudi na njihovih plažah. Na tej plaži so namestili veliko mornarsko krmilo, ki na pol gleda iz peska. Če torej potrebujete sliko iz pe&scaron;čene plaže z tak&scaron;no umetnino, mogoče za va&scaron; instagram profil, kr ne oklevajte in obi&scaron;čite to plažo. &Scaron;e par podatkov o plaži. Njena dolžina je seveda več kilometrov, &scaron;irina pa je minimalno 100 metrov, kar se pa zaradi vpliva plimovanja, tudi poveča na več 100 metrov. Plaža nima enotnega naklona, temveč se ta spreminja proti vodi. Proti vodi je plaža zelo ravna, kar pomeni, da imate lep dostop v vodo, vendar je točka plavanja pri okrog 50 metrih. Na plaži so vam na razpolago različni tipi restavracij. Tukaj se prav tako nahaja izposojevalnica različnih vodnih &scaron;portnih rekvizitov, najbolj tipičen vodni &scaron;port je tukaj surfanje. Za najmanj&scaron;e je tudi poskrbljeno, saj se tukaj nahaja tudi manj&scaron;e otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če. Nastanitev je možna v različnih tipih, v bližini je tudi kamp.', 4152, 'sl', 1),
(946, 'Das Land Belgien hat etwa 60 km K&uuml;ste mit der Nordsee. Alle Str&auml;nde an der Westk&uuml;ste sind ausnahmslos sandig, was auch f&uuml;r den Strand gilt, den wir hier pr&auml;sentieren. Der Strand Westende in Middelkerke ist familienfreundlich und befindet sich in unmittelbarer N&auml;he aller Strandeinrichtungen, Unterk&uuml;nfte verschiedener Art und nat&uuml;rlich eines nur 30 m entfernten Parkplatzes. Belgien ist auch bekannt f&uuml;r seine Kunst, die man nat&uuml;rlich an den Str&auml;nden bewundern kann. An diesem Strand, der halb aus dem Sand ragt, wurde ein gro&szlig;es Ruder der Marine installiert. Wenn Sie also ein Bild von einem Sandstrand mit dieser Art von Kunstwerken ben&ouml;tigen, vielleicht f&uuml;r Ihr Instagram-Profil, z&ouml;gern Sie nicht, diesen Strand zu besuchen. Noch ein paar Stranddetails. Seine L&auml;nge betr&auml;gt nat&uuml;rlich mehrere Kilometer und seine Breite mindestens 100 Meter, was sich aufgrund des Einflusses der Gezeiten ebenfalls auf &uuml;ber 100 Meter erh&ouml;ht. Der Strand hat keinen einzigen Hang, sondern &auml;ndert sich in Richtung Wasser. Der Strand ist sehr flach zum Wasser hin, was bedeutet, dass Sie einen guten Zugang zum Wasser haben, aber der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ungef&auml;hr 50 Meter. Es gibt verschiedene Arten von Restaurants am Strand. Es gibt auch einen Verleih f&uuml;r verschiedene Wassersportger&auml;te, der typischste Wassersport ist das Surfen hier. F&uuml;r das Kleinste wird ebenfalls gesorgt, da es auch einen kleinen Kinderspielplatz gibt. Die Unterbringung ist in verschiedenen Ausf&uuml;hrungen m&ouml;glich und es gibt einen Campingplatz in der N&auml;he.', 4152, 'de', 1),
(947, 'Vse plaže na zahodni obali Belgije, ki ima obalo z severnim morjem, katera je dolga 60 km,&nbsp; so brez izjeme pe&scaron;čene, kar tudi velja za plažo Strand Nieuwpoort Bad. Plaža se nahaja v kraju Nieuwpoort, ki ima zelo turistično obalno promenado. Če se na plažo odpravljate kot družina boste tukaj pri&scaron;li na svoj račun, saj je v bližini vsa potrebna plažna infrastruktura, nastanitev, ki je različnih tipov, se nahaja direktno na plaži, kar velja tudi seveda za parkiri&scaron;ča, ki so v najbolj&scaron;em primeru oddaljena zgolj 30 metrov, parkira pa se ob cesti na označenih parkirnih mestih. &Scaron;e par podatkov o plaži. Njena dolžina je seveda več kilometrov, &scaron;irina pa je minimalno 100 metrov, kar se pa zaradi vpliva plimovanja, tudi poveča na več 100 metrov. Plaža nima enotnega naklona, temveč se ta spreminja proti vodi. Nekje na polovici poti pa je večji padec, kjer se zniža plaža za kak&scaron;na 2 metra. Ta majhen klance bo sigurno v&scaron;eč mladini in otrokom, ki bodo na njem počeli vse mogoče vragolije. Proti vodi je plaža zelo ravna, kar pomeni, da imate lep dostop v vodo, vendar je točka plavanja pri okrog 100 metrih. To dejstvo, zraven otro&scaron;kega igri&scaron;ča na plaži, dela to plažo &scaron;e posebej primerno za otroke, saj lahko le ti, zaradi nizke vode varno čofotajo v vodi. Prav tako, pa se na plaži tudi nahajajo &scaron;portna igri&scaron;ča. Na plaži so vam na razpolago različni tipi restavracij, ki bodo zadovoljili prav vse tipe gurmanov, enako velja tudi za različne tipe trgovin, &scaron;e posebej je veliko tak&scaron;nih ki ponujajo belgijske praline. Nastanitev je možna v obliki različnih tipov, tisti, ki pa i&scaron;čejo kot nastanitev kamp, se tudi ta&nbsp; nahaja v bližini.', 4153, 'sl', 1),
(948, 'Alle Str&auml;nde an der Westk&uuml;ste Belgiens mit einer 60 km langen Nordseek&uuml;ste sind ausnahmslos sandig, was auch beim Strand Nieuwpoort Bad der Fall ist. Der Strand befindet sich in Nieuwpoort, dass eine sehr touristische Promenade hat. Wenn Sie als Familie an den Strand gehen, werden Sie sich hier freuen, da die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur in der N&auml;he ist. Unterk&uuml;nfte verschiedener Art befinden sich direkt am Strand, was auch f&uuml;r die Parkpl&auml;tze gilt, die bestenfalls nur 30 m entfernt und das Parken kann neben der Stra&szlig;e auf ausgewiesenen Parkpl&auml;tzen erfolgen. Noch ein paar Stranddetails. Seine L&auml;nge betr&auml;gt nat&uuml;rlich mehrere Kilometer und seine Breite mindestens 100 Meter, was sich aufgrund des Einflusses der Gezeiten ebenfalls auf &uuml;ber 100 Meter erh&ouml;ht. Der Strand hat keinen einzigen Hang, sondern &auml;ndert sich in Richtung Wasser. Irgendwo in der Mitte des Weges gibt es einen gr&ouml;&szlig;eren Abhang, wo der Strand um etwa 2 Meter reduziert ist. Kinder und Jugendliche werden diesen Ort sicherlich lieben und hier alle Arten von Stunts machen. Der Strand ist sehr flach zum Wasser hin, was bedeutet, dass Sie einen guten Zugang zum Wasser haben, aber der Badepunkt ist ungef&auml;hr 100 Meter. Diese Tatsache neben dem Kinderspielplatz am Strand macht diesen Strand besonders f&uuml;r Kinder geeignet, da nur sie aufgrund des niedrigen Wassers sicher im Wasser schnauben k&ouml;nnen. Es gibt auch Sportpl&auml;tze am Strand. Am Strand gibt es verschiedene Arten von Restaurants, die nahezu jede Art von Gourmet zufrieden stellen. Gleiches gilt f&uuml;r verschiedene Arten von Gesch&auml;ften, insbesondere f&uuml;r die vielen, die belgische Pralinen anbieten. Die Unterbringung ist in Form verschiedener Arten m&ouml;glich, aber auch diejenigen, die eine Unterkunft als Campingplatz suchen, befinden sich in der N&auml;he.', 4153, 'de', 1),
(949, 'Strand Zonnebloem je pe&scaron;čena plaža, ki je prav nekaj posebnega. Zelo redke so plaže, kjerkoli na svetu, ki imajo med svojo plažno promenado in plažo, vmes &scaron;e majhne sipine, pora&scaron;čene z travo.Plaža se nahaja v kraju Nieuwpoort, ki ima zelo turistično obalno promenado. Tudi ta plaža je primerna za družino, saj je tipična družinska plaža, ki vam nudi zelo velik standard vseh možnih uslug. Dostop do plaže z avtom je zelo enostaven. Avto lahko parkirate ob cesti na označenih parkirnih mestih, ki so sicer zelo zasedena, vendar so od plaže oddaljena zgolj 100 metrov.&nbsp; Tudi ta plaža je dolga več kilometrov, &scaron;irina je več kot 100, kar se pa zaradi vpliva plimovanja lahko poveča tudi na več 100 metrov. Tako kot je v tem kraju plažna navada, tudi ta plaža nima enotnega naklona, temveč se ta spreminja proti vodi. Nekje na polovici poti pa je večji padec, kjer se zniža plaža za kak&scaron;na 2 metra. Ta majhen klanec bo sigurno v&scaron;eč mladini in otrokom, ki bodo na njem počeli vse mogoče vragolije. Proti vodi je plaža zelo ravna, kar pomeni, da imate lep dostop v vodo, vendar je točka plavanja pri okrog 100 metrih. To dejstvo, zraven otro&scaron;kega igri&scaron;ča na plaži ter &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č dela to plažo &scaron;e posebej primerno za otroke, saj lahko le ti, zaradi nizke vode varno čofotajo v vodi. Na plaži so vam na razpolago različni tipi restavracij, ki bodo zadovoljili prav vse tipe gurmanov, velja tudi poizkusiti znana belgijska piva. Enako velja tudi za različne tipe trgovin, &scaron;e posebej je veliko tak&scaron;nih ki ponujajo belgijske praline, oblačila in luksuzne izdelke. Nastanitev je možna v obliki različnih tipov, tisti, ki pa i&scaron;čejo kot nastanitev kamp, se tudi ta&nbsp; nahaja v bližini.', 4154, 'sl', 1),
(950, 'Strand Zonnebloem ist ein Sandstrand, der etwas Besonderes ist. Es gibt weltweit nur sehr wenige Str&auml;nde mit kleinen grasbewachsenen D&uuml;nen zwischen Strandpromenade und Strand. Der Strand befindet sich in Nieuwpoort, dass eine sehr touristische Promenade hat. Dieser Strand ist auch f&uuml;r die Familie geeignet, da es sich um einen typischen Familienstrand handelt, der Ihnen einen sehr hohen Standard aller m&ouml;glichen Dienstleistungen bietet. Der Zugang zum Strand mit dem Auto ist sehr einfach. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto entlang der Stra&szlig;e auf ausgewiesenen Parkpl&auml;tzen parken, die sehr belebt sind, aber nur 100 Meter vom Strand entfernt. Dieser Strand ist auch mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit, was aufgrund des Einflusses der Gezeiten um mehr als 100 Meter erh&ouml;ht werden kann. Wie es an diesem schon eine Strandgewohnheit ist, daher hat dieser Strand keine einheitliche Neigung, sondern &auml;ndert sich in Richtung Wasser. Irgendwo in der Mitte des Weges gibt es einen gr&ouml;&szlig;eren Abhang, wo der Strand um etwa 2 Meter reduziert ist. Diese kleine Schlucht wird sicherlich junge Leute und Kinder ansprechen, die allerlei Unheil anrichten werden. Der Strand ist sehr flach zum Wasser, was bedeutet, dass Sie einen guten Zugang zum Wasser haben, aber der Badepunkt ist ungef&auml;hr bei 100 Meter. Diese Tatsache, neben dem Kinderspielplatz am Strand und den Sportpl&auml;tzen, macht diesen Strand besonders f&uuml;r Kinder geeignet, da sie nur wegen des niedrigen Wassers sicher im Wasser spielen k&ouml;nnen. Es gibt verschiedene Arten von Restaurants am Strand, die fast jede Art von Gourmet befriedigen. Sie sollten auch die ber&uuml;hmten belgischen Biere probieren. Gleiches gilt f&uuml;r die verschiedenen Arten von Gesch&auml;ften, insbesondere f&uuml;r die vielen, die belgischen Pralinen, Kleidung und Luxusg&uuml;ter anbieten. Die Unterbringung ist in Form verschiedener Arten m&ouml;glich, aber auch diejenigen, die eine Campingunterkunft suchen, sind in der N&auml;he.', 4154, 'de', 1),
(951, 'Če i&scaron;čete pe&scaron;čeno plažo, kjer lahko svoje vozilo pustite parkirano zgolj par metrov stran od plaže, kar je v Belgiji zelo redko, vam predlagamo da obi&scaron;čete pe&scaron;čeno plažo Strand Groenendijk Bad. Tudi ta plaža je obdana z sipinami, ki &scaron;čitijo naselja pred morjem. Plaža se nahaja v kraju Koksijde. Je tipična družinska plaža, čeprav okrog nje ni toliko turistične industrije kot drugje. Dostop do plaže z avtom je zelo enostaven. Avto lahko parkirate ob cesti na označenih parkirnih mestih, ali pa na parkiri&scaron;ču neposredno pred plažo. Tudi ta plaža je dolga več kilometrov, &scaron;irina je več kot 100, kar se pa zaradi vpliva plimovanja lahko poveča tudi na več 100 metrov. Naklon na plaži se spreminja na poti proti vodi. Proti vodi je plaža zelo ravna, kar pomeni, da imate lep dostop v vodo, vendar je točka plavanja pri okrog 100 metrih. Ker je voda tukaj tako plitka dela to plažo &scaron;e posebej primerno za otroke, saj lahko le ti, zaradi nizke vode varno čofotajo v vodi. Na plaži so vam na razpolago različni tipi restavracij. Plažna infrastruktura je tudi na dokaj visokem nivoju in vam tako nudi različne storitve. Na plaži sami imaste tudi možnost izposoje različnih vodnih &scaron;portnih rekvizitov, &scaron;e posebej desk za surfanje. Kot je značilno za Belgijo in ta kraj, imaste tudi tukaj obilo različnih možnosti nastanitev. V bližini se nahaja tudi avtokamp.', 4155, 'sl', 1),
(952, 'Wenn Sie nach einem Sandstrand suchen, an dem Sie Ihr Auto nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt parken k&ouml;nnen, was in Belgien sehr selten ist, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Sandstrand von Strand Groenendijk Bad zu besuchen. Dieser Strand ist auch von D&uuml;nen umgeben, die die Siedlungen vor dem Meer sch&uuml;tzen. Der Strand befindet sich in Koksijde. Es ist ein typischer Familienstrand, obwohl es nicht so viel Tourismus gibt wie anderswo. Der Zugang zum Strand mit dem Auto ist sehr einfach. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto am Stra&szlig;enrand auf ausgewiesenen Parkpl&auml;tzen oder auf dem Parkplatz direkt vor dem Strand parken. Dieser Strand ist auch mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit, was aufgrund des Einflusses der Gezeiten um mehr als 100 Meter erh&ouml;ht werden kann. Der Hang am Strand &auml;ndert sich auf dem Weg zum Wasser. Der Strand ist sehr flach ins Richtung Wasser, was bedeutet, dass Sie einen guten Zugang zum Wasser haben, aber der Badepunkt ist bei ungef&auml;hr 100 Meter . Da das Wasser hier so flach ist, ist dieser Strand besonders f&uuml;r Kinder geeignet, da nur das niedrige Wasser es ihnen erm&ouml;glicht, sicher ins Wasser zu schnappen. Es gibt verschiedene Arten von Restaurants am Strand. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist ebenfalls auf einem ziemlich hohen Niveau und bietet Ihnen verschiedene Dienstleistungen. Am Strand haben Sie auch die M&ouml;glichkeit, verschiedene Wassersportger&auml;te, insbesondere Surfbretter, zu mieten. Wie es in Belgien und an diesem Ort typisch ist, haben Sie hier auch viele verschiedene Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten. Es gibt auch ein Motorcamp in der N&auml;he.', 4155, 'de', 1),
(953, 'Če ste ljubitelj pe&scaron;čenih plaž in vam je Belgija pri srcu, vam svetujemo da obi&scaron;čete plažo Strand Oostduinkerke Duinpark. Plaža je primerna za družine in se nahaja v kraju Koksijde. Za razliko od drugih plaž v Belgiji je ta manj turistična in je obdana z več narave. Ne glede nato s katerim vozilom potujete, je ta lokacija zelo lahko dostopna. Avto lahko parkirate ob cesti na označenih parkirnih mestih. Parkiri&scaron;če je oddaljeno zgolj 50 metrov, za dostop do plaže pa se morate sprehoditi čez 5 metrov visoko pe&scaron;čeno sipino. Zraven parkiri&scaron;č se nahajajo tudi apartmaji, ki jih lahko najamete za va&scaron; dopust. Plaža je tudi tukaj dolga več kilometrov in &scaron;iroka več kot 100 metrov. Sama &scaron;irina plaže je seveda tudi odvisna od plimovanja. Naklon na plaži ni enoten ampak se spreminja oz. pada proti vodi. Bližje kot ste vodi bolj ravna je plaža, kar pomeni da imate tudi zelo lep vstop v vodo. Zaradi ravne plaže, pa je žal točka plavanja pri kak&scaron;nih 100 metrih. Je pa seveda plitka voda ugodna za otroke, da se varno igrajo v plitki vodi. Turistična infrastruktura je tukaj bolj skopa, tako da ne pričakujte veliko plažnih uslug. V bližini je tudi ena plažna restavracija in izposoja vodne opreme. Nastanitev je poleg že omenjenih apartmajev, možna tudi v bližnjih hotelih.&nbsp;', 4156, 'sl', 1),
(954, 'Wenn Sie Sandstr&auml;nde lieben und ein Herz in Belgien haben, sollten Sie den Strand Oostduinkerke Duinpark besuchen. Der Strand ist familienfreundlich und befindet sich in Koksijde. Im Gegensatz zu anderen Str&auml;nden in Belgien ist dieser Strand weniger touristisch und von mehr Natur umgeben. Egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie reisen, dieser Ort ist leicht zug&auml;nglich. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto am Stra&szlig;enrand auf ausgewiesenen Parkpl&auml;tzen parken. Der Parkplatz ist nur 50 Meter entfernt und Sie m&uuml;ssen &uuml;ber die 5 Meter hohen Sandd&uuml;nen gehen, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Neben den Parkpl&auml;tzen gibt es Apartments, die Sie f&uuml;r Ihren Urlaub mieten k&ouml;nnen. Der Strand ist auch mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit. Die Breite des Strandes h&auml;ngt nat&uuml;rlich auch von der Flut ab. Der Hang am Strand ist nicht gleichm&auml;&szlig;ig, sondern f&auml;llt in Richtung Wasser. Je n&auml;her Sie dem Wasser sind, desto flacher ist der Strand, was bedeutet, dass Sie auch einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Zugang zum Wasser haben. Wegen des flachen Strandes liegt der Badepunkt leider bei ca. 100 Metern. Nat&uuml;rlich ist seichtes Wasser gut f&uuml;r Kinder, um sicher im seichten Wasser zu spielen. Die touristische Infrastruktur ist hier knapper, erwarten Sie also nicht viele Stranddienste. Ebenfalls in der N&auml;he befindet sich ein Strandrestaurant und ein Verleih von Wasserger&auml;ten. Neben den oben genannten Apartments ist auch eine Unterkunft in nahe gelegenen Hotels m&ouml;glich.', 4156, 'de', 1),
(955, 'Na tej belgijski plaži pa so resnično mislili na vse. Obstajajo tudi tak&scaron;ni ljubitelji plaž, ki želijo imeti na plaži bazen, če jim že pesek in vse ostalo ne ustreza. In točno to so naredili na tem kraju, postavili so bazen na plažo z vso potrebno infrastrukturo. Kje se pa najde to plažo? Imenuje se Strand Oostduinkerke in se nahaja v kraju Koksijde. Plaža je primerna za družine in je prava turistična plaža, saj jo obdaja pravi turistični vrvež. V okolici plaže se poleg &scaron;tevilnih restavracij nahaja tudi veliko &scaron;tevilo trgovin, ki ponujajo tradicionalne belgijske praline, luksuzne izdelke in nasploh vse kar potrebujete za turistični oddih. Tisti ki občudujete umetnost, kipe, boste le te, kot je to pogosto v Belgiji, lahko občudovali tudi na tej plaži. Tukaj se nahajata dva kipa konjenikov. Tisti ki imaste radi sipine, boste le te lahko tudi tukaj občudovali. Ker je ta kraj zelo turističen imaste na razpolago &scaron;tevilne možnosti za namestitev, celo kamp in avtokamp sta v bližini. Ne glede nato s katerim vozilom potujete, je ta lokacija zelo lahko dostopna. Avto lahko parkirate ob cesti na označenih parkirnih mestih. Parkiri&scaron;če je oddaljeno od plaže 200 metrov. Plaža je tudi tukaj dolga več kilometrov in &scaron;iroka več kot 100 metrov. Sama &scaron;irina plaže je seveda tudi odvisna od plimovanja. Naklon na plaži je dokaj enoten, vendar bližje kot ste vodi bolj ravna je plaža, kar pomeni da imate tudi zelo lep vstop v vodo. Zaradi ravne plaže, pa je žal točka plavanja pri kak&scaron;nih 100 metrih. Je pa seveda plitka voda ugodna za otroke, da se varno igrajo v plitki vodi. Otroci bodo tudi občudovali otro&scaron;ka igrala, ki jih tukaj tudi ne manjka, za tiste ki pa imajo radi &scaron;portne aktivnosti, pa se bo tudi nekaj na&scaron;lo. Turistična infrastruktura je tukaj na zelo visokem nivoju in vam nudi veliko plažnih uslug.', 4157, 'sl', 1),
(956, 'Aber an diesem belgischen Strand haben sie wirklich an alles gedacht. Es gibt auch solche Strandliebhaber, die einen Pool am Strand haben wollen, wenn der Sand und alles andere nicht zu ihnen passt. Und genau das haben sie an diesem Ort getan, sie haben einen Pool am Strand mit der n&ouml;tigen Infrastruktur aufgestellt. Wo finde ich diesen Strand? Es hei&szlig;t Strand Oostduinkerke und befindet sich in Koksijde. Der Strand ist f&uuml;r Familien geeignet und ein echter Touristenstrand, da er von einem echten Touristenrummel umgeben ist. In der N&auml;he des Strandes gibt es auch eine gro&szlig;e Anzahl von Restaurants und Shops, die traditionellen belgischen Pralinen, Luxusprodukte und alles bieten, was Sie f&uuml;r einen Touristenurlaub ben&ouml;tigen. Wer Kunst und Statuen bewundert, kann Sie an diesem Strand bewundern, wie es in Belgien h&auml;ufig der Fall ist. Hier gibt es zwei Reiterstatuen. Diejenigen unter Ihnen, die D&uuml;nen m&ouml;gen, werden sie auch hier bewundern k&ouml;nnen. Da dieser Ort sehr touristisch ist, stehen Ihnen viele Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten zur Verf&uuml;gung, sogar ein Campingplatz befindet sich in der N&auml;he. Egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie reisen, dieser Ort ist leicht zug&auml;nglich. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto am Stra&szlig;enrand auf ausgewiesenen Parkpl&auml;tzen parken. Das Parken ist 200 Meter vom Strand entfernt. Der Strand ist auch mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit. Die Breite des Strandes h&auml;ngt nat&uuml;rlich auch von der Flut ab. Die Neigung des Strandes ist ziemlich gleichm&auml;&szlig;ig, aber je n&auml;her Sie dem Wasser sind, desto flacher ist der Strand, was bedeutet, dass Sie auch einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Zugang zum Wasser haben. Wegen des flachen Strandes liegt der Badepunkt leider bei ca. 100 Metern. Nat&uuml;rlich ist seichtes Wasser gut f&uuml;r Kinder, um sicher im seichten Wasser zu spielen. Kinder werden auch Kinderspielplatze bewundern, die hier nicht fehlen, aber f&uuml;r diejenigen, die sportliche Aktivit&auml;ten lieben, werde auch hier auf Ihre Rechnung kommen. Die touristische Infrastruktur ist hier auf einem sehr hohen Niveau und bietet Ihnen viele Strand Dienstleistungen.', 4157, 'de', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(957, 'V bližine belgijskega mesta Koksijde, ki je sicer znan po tem da je prava turistična destinacija, se prav tako nahaja plaža, ki nima tako močnega turističnega zaledja, ter tudi ni tako obljudena. Plaža je obdana z obilo pe&scaron;čenih sipin, ki dajejo plaži pravi naravni karakter, seveda je tudi ta plaža pe&scaron;čena. Če vam je tak&scaron;en tip plaže v&scaron;eč, je ta plaža zelo lahko dostopna z vsemi tipi vozil. Vozilo lahko parkirate enostavno ob označenih parkiri&scaron;čih ob cesti, ki so oddaljena zgolj 50 metrov. Ker se na plaži nahaja osnovna plažna infrastruktura, je ta plaža primerna tudi za družine. Ob cesti se nahajajo tudi apartmaji, ki jih lahko najamete za va&scaron; dopust. Drugače pa je dovoljeno na plažo pripeljati tudi pse. Restavracij ali česa podobnega na tej plaži žal ni, zato si vzamite hrano s seboj. Plaža je dolga več kilometrov in ima minimalno &scaron;irino 40 metrov, seveda se pa ta &scaron;irina poveča na več 100 metrov, v primeru oseke. Naklon plaže je dokaj enoten, vstop v vodo je zelo udoben, računate pa lahko, da je točka plavanja pri ca. 50 metrih.&nbsp;', 4158, 'sl', 1),
(958, 'In der N&auml;he der belgischen Stadt Koksijde, die als wahres Touristenziel bekannt ist, gibt es auch einen Strand, der kein so starkes touristisches Hinterland hat und nicht so beliebt ist. Der Strand ist von einer F&uuml;lle von Sandd&uuml;nen umgeben, die dem Strand einen echten nat&uuml;rlichen Charakter verleihen. Nat&uuml;rlich ist dieser Strand auch sandig. Wenn Sie diese Art von Strand m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Strand mit allen Arten von Fahrzeugen sehr leicht zug&auml;nglich. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug problemlos auf ausgewiesenen Parkpl&auml;tzen entlang der Stra&szlig;e parken, die nur 50 Meter entfernt sind. Da der Strand &uuml;ber eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur verf&uuml;gt, ist dieser Strand auch f&uuml;r Familien geeignet. Entlang der Stra&szlig;e gibt es Wohnungen, die Sie f&uuml;r Ihren Urlaub mieten k&ouml;nnen. Ansonsten ist es erlaubt Hunde an den Strand zu bringen. Leider gibt es an diesem Strand keine Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches. Bringen Sie also Ihr Essen mit. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und hat eine Mindestbreite von 40 Metern, aber bei Ebbe erh&ouml;ht sich diese Breite nat&uuml;rlich auf &uuml;ber 100 Meter. Die Neigung des Strandes ist ziemlich gleichm&auml;&szlig;ig, der Eintritt ins Wasser ist sehr bequem, und Sie k&ouml;nnen sich auf den Schwimmpunkt bei ca. z&auml;hlen. 50 Meter.', 4158, 'de', 1),
(959, 'Belgijsko mesto Koksijde, ki je sicer znan po tem da je prava turistična destinacija, vam ponuja plažo, ki je po svoji naravi zelo unikatna, predvsem zato, ker je bolj namenjena za ljudi, ki imajo raje naravo, ne pa turistični direndaj in se po svoji naravi pri&scaron;tevajo bolj med avanturiste kot pa med družinske uporabnike. Plaža se imenuje Strand Lejeunelaan in je obdana z obilo pe&scaron;čenih sipin, ki dajejo plaži pravi naravni karakter, seveda je tudi ta plaža pe&scaron;čena. Če vam je tak&scaron;en tip plaže v&scaron;eč, je ta plaža zelo lahko dostopna z vsemi tipi vozil. Vozilo lahko parkirate enostavno ob označenih parkiri&scaron;čih ob cesti, ki so oddaljena zgolj 50 metrov. Je pa potrebno za dostop do plaže premagati 10 metrov visoko pe&scaron;čeno sipino, ki ni zelo dobro utrjena. Na plaži ni nobene plažne infrastrukture, prav tako ni tukaj nobene restavracije, te so oddaljene par sto metrov proti sosednjemu turističnemu sredi&scaron;ču. V neposredni bližini sicer ni nastanitev, so pa te že dostopne par 100 metrov oddaljene v obliki apartmajev in hotelov, malo dlje oddaljeni pa se nahajajo tudi avtokampi. Plaža je dolga več kilometrov in ima minimalno &scaron;irino 30 metrov, seveda se pa ta &scaron;irina poveča na več 100 metrov, v primeru oseke. Naklon plaže je rahlo povi&scaron;an, vstop v vodo je zelo udoben, računate pa lahko, da je točka plavanja pri ca. 50 metrih.&nbsp;', 4159, 'sl', 1),
(960, 'Koksijde, eine belgische Stadt, die als wahres Touristenziel bekannt ist, bietet Ihnen einen Strand, der in der Natur sehr einzigartig ist, vor allem, weil er eher f&uuml;r Menschen gedacht ist, die eher die Natur als ein Touristenziel bevorzugen, Sie gelten eher als Abenteurer als Familienmitglieder. Der Strand hei&szlig;t Strand Lejeunelaan und ist von einer F&uuml;lle von Sandd&uuml;nen umgeben, die dem Strand einen echten nat&uuml;rlichen Charakter verleihen. Nat&uuml;rlich ist dieser Strand auch sandig. Wenn Sie diese Art von Strand m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Strand mit allen Arten von Fahrzeugen sehr leicht zug&auml;nglich. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug problemlos auf ausgewiesenen Parkpl&auml;tzen entlang der Stra&szlig;e parken, die nur 50 Meter entfernt sind. Um den Strand zu erreichen, m&uuml;ssen jedoch 10 Meter hohe Sandd&uuml;nen geschlagen werden, die nicht sehr gepflegt sind. Es gibt keine Strandinfrastruktur am Strand, es gibt auch keine Restaurants hier und sie sind einige hundert Meter vom benachbarten Touristenzentrum entfernt. W&auml;hrend es in unmittelbarer N&auml;he keine Unterk&uuml;nfte gibt, sind diese bereits in Form von Apartments und Hotels in einigen hundert Metern Entfernung erreichbar, und etwas weiter entfernt befinden sich Campingpl&auml;tze. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und hat eine Mindestbreite von 30 Metern, aber bei Ebbe erh&ouml;ht sich diese Breite nat&uuml;rlich auf &uuml;ber 100 Meter. Der Hang des Strandes ist leicht erh&ouml;ht, der Eintritt ins Wasser ist sehr bequem, und Sie k&ouml;nnen sich auf den Badepunkt bei ca. 50 Meter z&auml;hlen.', 4159, 'de', 1),
(961, 'Belgijska plaža Strand Koksijde Bad, ki se nahaja v mestecu Koksijde, je primerna za družine in je prava turistična plaža, saj je obdana s pravim turističnim vrvežem, kot &scaron;tevilne druge belgijske plaže. V bližini te plaže, kot je običajno v Belgiji, je tudi tukaj veliko restavracij, pa tudi veliko trgovin, ki ponujajo tradicionalne belgijske praline, luksuzne izdelke in vse, kar potrebujete za turistični oddih. Ta kraj ima veliko turistične infrastrukture, kar pomeni, da imate na voljo veliko možnosti nastanitve, celo kamp je oddaljen 1 km. Ne glede na to, s katerim vozilom potujete, je ta lokacija enostavno dostopna. Avto lahko parkirate ob cesti na določenih parkirnih mestih. Parkiranje je možno že na samo 30 metrov od plaže. Plaža je tudi nekaj kilometrov dolga in več kot 100 metrov &scaron;iroka. Tu imate res na voljo veliko prostora na plaži. &Scaron;irina plaže je seveda odvisna tudi od plime, in se lahko temu primerno poveča ali zmanj&scaron;a. Pobočje plaže je ponekod zelo strmo, a bolj ko ste bliže vodi, je plaža vse bolj položna, kar pomeni, da imate tudi zelo lep vstop v vodo. Plavalna točka je na približno 50 metrih. Turistična infrastruktura je tukaj na zelo visoki ravni in vam ponuja &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži, otro&scaron;ka igri&scaron;ča in tudi veliko različnih &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č. Tu zagotovo ne boste lačni, saj je veliko barov na plaži in restavracij na voljo na sami plaži in tudi v mestu.', 4160, 'sl', 1),
(962, 'Der belgische Strand Koksijde Bad in der Stadt Koksijde ist f&uuml;r Familien geeignet und ein echter Touristenstrand, da er wie viele andere belgische Str&auml;nde von einem echten Touristenrummel umgeben ist. In der N&auml;he dieses Strandes, wie es in Belgien &uuml;blich ist, gibt es auch hier eine gro&szlig;e Anzahl von Restaurants sowie viele Gesch&auml;fte, die traditionelle belgische Pralinen, Luxusprodukte und alles anbieten, was Sie f&uuml;r einen Touristenurlaub ben&ouml;tigen. Dieser Ort hat viele touristische Infrastrukturen, was bedeutet, dass Sie viele Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten zur Verf&uuml;gung haben, sogar ein Campingplatz ist 1 km entfernt. Egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie reisen, dieser Ort ist leicht zug&auml;nglich. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto am Stra&szlig;enrand auf ausgewiesenen Parkpl&auml;tzen parken. Das Parken kann bereits in nur 30 Metern Entfernung vom Strand erfolgen. Der Strand ist auch mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit. Sie haben hier wirklich viel Platz am Strand. Die Breite des Strandes h&auml;ngt nat&uuml;rlich auch von der Flut ab. Der Hang des Strandes ist an einigen Stellen ziemlich steil, aber je n&auml;her Sie dem Wasser sind, desto flacher ist der Strand, was bedeutet, dass Sie auch einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Zugang zum Wasser haben. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 50 Metern. Die touristische Infrastruktur ist hier auf einem sehr hohen Niveau und bietet Ihnen viele Strandservices, Kinderspielpl&auml;tze sowie viele verschiedene Sportpl&auml;tze inklusive. Sie werden hier sicherlich nicht hungern, da viele Strandbars und Restaurants entweder am Strand selbst oder in der Stadt selbst verf&uuml;gbar sind.', 4160, 'de', 1),
(963, 'Zvezda morja, ali v originalu Ster Der Zee, je ime plaže, ki se nahaja v znamenitem Belgijskem turističnem kraju Koksijde. Da imajo belgijci radi umetnost, mogoče že veste, če pa &scaron;e ne, pa boste to prav gotovo ugotovili, ko obi&scaron;čete eno izmed njihovih plaž. Skoraj na vsaki plaži je kak spomenik, na tej pa so si omislili razgledni stolp v obliki zvezde morja, ki sega vsaj 10 metrov visoko, in na katerega se lahko tudi povzpete. Plaža je primerna za družine in je seveda pe&scaron;čena, kot so vse belgijske plaže ob Severnem morju. Dostop do plaže je možen z vsakim vozilom, ki ga lahko pustite na označenih parkirnih mestih ob cesti, zgolj 30 metrov stran od plaže. Parkiri&scaron;č je tukaj res veliko, kar kaže na to, da je to zelo obljuden kraj. Tudi tukaj je plaža dolga več kilometrov in ima minimalno &scaron;irino 100 metrov, ki pa se v primeru oseke poveča na nekaj več 100 metrov &scaron;irine. Plaža ima dokaj konstanten naklon, ki se rahlo spu&scaron;ča. Dostop v vodo je udoben in točka plavanja je pri ca. 40 metrih. Plažne infrastrukture je tukaj dovolj, da bo zadovoljila va&scaron;e osnovne potrebe. Prav tako imaste v bližini različne tipe restavracij in plažnih barov. Nastanitev na tej lokaciji tudi ni problem, na razpolago imate veliko različnih nastanitev vseh možnih tipov. Znotraj 1 kilometra od plaže, pa se nahaja tudi nekaj avtokampov, če vam je ta oblika nastanitve bolj po godu.&nbsp;', 4161, 'sl', 1),
(964, 'Der Stern des Meeres oder im urspr&uuml;nglichen Ster Der Zee ist der Name des Strandes im ber&uuml;hmten belgischen Ferienort Koksijde. Sie wissen vielleicht schon, dass Belgier Kunst lieben, aber wenn Sie dies nicht tun, werden Sie es auf jeden Fall finden, wenn Sie einen ihrer Str&auml;nde besuchen. An fast jedem Strand gibt es ein Denkmal, und an diesem haben sie an einen sternf&ouml;rmigen Aussichtsturm gedacht, der mindestens 10 Meter hoch ist und den man auch besteigen kann. Der Strand ist familienfreundlich und nat&uuml;rlich sandig, ebenso wie alle belgischen Str&auml;nde entlang der Nordsee. Der Zugang zum Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug m&ouml;glich, das an ausgewiesenen Parkpl&auml;tzen entlang der Stra&szlig;e, nur 30 Meter vom Strand entfernt, abgestellt werden kann. Es gibt hier wirklich viele Parkpl&auml;tze, was darauf hinweist, dass dies ein sehr beliebter Ort ist. Auch hier ist der Strand mehrere Kilometer lang und hat eine Mindestbreite von 100 Metern, die sich bei Ebbe auf etwas mehr als 100 Meter Breite erh&ouml;ht. Der Strand hat einen ziemlich konstanten Hang, der leicht abf&auml;llt. Der Zugang zum Wasser ist bequem und der Badepunkt ist bei ca. 40 Meter. Die Strandinfrastruktur hier reicht aus, um Ihre Grundbed&uuml;rfnisse zu erf&uuml;llen. Sie haben auch verschiedene Arten von Restaurants und Strandbars in der N&auml;he. Die Unterkunft an diesem Ort ist ebenfalls kein Problem. Sie haben viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften zur Verf&uuml;gung. Innerhalb von 1 km vom Strand gibt es auch einige Campingpl&auml;tze, wenn Sie diese Art der Unterkunft bevorzugen.', 4161, 'de', 1),
(965, 'Država Belgija je znana po marsičemu, Manneken Pis, pivo, čokolada, atomium, vaflji, diamanti, in &scaron;e bi lahko na&scaron;teval. Prav tako pa je pravi raj za tiste, ki imajo radi dolge pe&scaron;čene plaže, &scaron;e posebej za tiste družine, ki imajo veliko otrok. Zelo pogosto je na plaži veliko otro&scaron;kih igri&scaron;č, tudi &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č. Če i&scaron;čete prav tak&scaron;no plažo, vam svetujemo da obi&scaron;čete plažo Strand De Panne, ki se nahaja v istoimenskem kraju De Panne, samo par kilometrov oddaljeno od francoske meje. Ta kraj je tudi zadnja turistična destinacija v Belgiji preden prečkate francosko mejo. Dostop do te plaže je zelo enostaven, ne glede na to s katerim vozilom potujete. Vozilo lahko parkirate na označenih parkirnih mestih, ki se nahajajo vzdolž ceste in so od plaže oddaljena zgolj 100 metrov. Ker je ta kraj pravo turistično sredi&scaron;če imate na razpolago seveda tudi veliko plažnih storitev in plažne infrastrukture. Kot je značilno za plaže v Belgiji, je tudi ta plaža dolga več kilometrov in ima &scaron;irino večjo od 100 metrov, v primeru oseke, pa se seveda ta &scaron;irina &scaron;e poveča za nekaj 100 metrov. Naklon plaže je, razen par točk, dokaj konstantno padajoč. Dostop do vode je enostaven in udoben, saj se globina zelo počasi veča, zaplavate lahko pri ca. 50 metrih. Najti nastanitev v tem kraju tudi ne bo težava, saj se zraven plaže nahajajo &scaron;tevilni hoteli in apartmaji, če pa ste ljubitelj avtokampov, se ti nahajajo zgolj par kilometrov oddaljeni. Če vam slučajno postane dolgčas na plaži, se v bližini nahaja tudi velik zabavi&scaron;čni park imenovan Plopsaland De Panne.&nbsp;', 4162, 'sl', 1),
(966, 'Das Land Belgien ist bekannt f&uuml;r viele Dinge, Manneken Pis, Bier, Schokolade, Atomium, Waffeln, Diamanten usw. Es ist auch ein Paradies f&uuml;r diejenigen, die lange Sandstr&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, besonders f&uuml;r Familien mit vielen Kindern. Sehr oft gibt es am Strand viele Kinderspielpl&auml;tze, darunter Sportpl&auml;tze. Wenn Sie nach einem solchen Strand suchen, sollten Sie den Strand De Panne besuchen, der sich in der Stadt De Panne befindet, nur wenige Kilometer von der franz&ouml;sischen Grenze entfernt. Dieser Ort ist auch das letzte Touristenziel in Belgien vor dem &Uuml;berqueren der franz&ouml;sischen Grenze. Der Zugang zu diesem Strand ist sehr einfach, egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie reisen. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug auf ausgewiesenen Parkpl&auml;tzen entlang der Stra&szlig;e parken, nur 100 Meter vom Strand entfernt. Da dieser Ort ein echtes Touristenziel ist, haben Sie hier nat&uuml;rlich auch viele Stranddienstleistungen und Strandinfrastruktur zu Verf&uuml;gung. Wie es f&uuml;r belgische Str&auml;nde typisch ist, ist dieser Strand mehrere Kilometer lang und hat eine Breite von mehr als 100 Metern. Bei Ebbe wird diese Breite nat&uuml;rlich um etwa 100 Meter erh&ouml;ht. Die Neigung des Strandes ist bis auf wenige Punkte recht konstant. Der Zugang zum Wasser ist einfach und bequem, da die Tiefe sehr langsam zunimmt, der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 50 Meter. Die Suche nach einer Unterkunft an diesem Ort ist ebenfalls kein Problem, da es in der N&auml;he des Strandes zahlreiche Hotels und Apartments gibt. Wenn Sie jedoch ein Fan von Campingpl&auml;tzen sind, sind diese nur wenige Kilometer entfernt. Wenn Sie sich am Strand langweilen, gibt es auch einen gro&szlig;en Vergn&uuml;gungspark namens Plopsaland De Panne in der N&auml;he.', 4162, 'de', 1),
(967, 'Beljgijsko mesto Koksijde je zaradi svoje pe&scaron;čene plaže, ki je dolga več kilometrov in &scaron;iroka več 100 metrov, zelo popularno turistično sredi&scaron;če, ki privablja predvsem družine z majhnimi otroki. Plaža, ki jo opisujemo tukaj, se imenuje Strand Sint-Idesbald. Dostop do te plaže je zelo enostaven z vsakim tipom vozila, katerega lahko parkirate na označenih mestih ob cesti, zgolj 50 metrov od plaže. Povr&scaron;ina plaže je res velika, zato tukaj nikoli ne bo preveč ljudi, saj se bodo ti porazdelili po plaži. Plažnih storitev je tukaj dovolj, da zadovoljijo vse va&scaron;e osnovne potrebe. Za otroke je tukaj poskrbljeno, saj se na plaži nahajajo otro&scaron;ka igrala, enako velja za &scaron;portne ljubitelje, katerim je na razpolago nekaj igri&scaron;č in izposojevalnica opreme za vodni &scaron;port. Ni vam potrebno skrbeti za hrano in pijačo, restavracije vseh tipov se nahajajo v bližini. Enako velja tudi za nastanitev. Hoteli in apartmaji, kot tudi drugi tipi nastanitev, se nahajajo direktno na plaži in segajo v notranjost mesta več 100 metrov. Za tiste, ki raje preživljajo svoje počitnice v kampu, so tudi ti na razpolago in so oddaljeni največ 1 kilometer. Plaža ima dokaj enoten naklon, razen nekje na polovici, kjer je manj&scaron;a pe&scaron;čena klančina. Proti vodi je plaža zelo ravna in vam tako omogoča zelo udoben pristop v vodo. Na tej plaži je možno zaplavati pri ca. 50 metrih sprehajanja po vodi, vendar se to z plimovanjem lahko tudi skraj&scaron;a ali podalj&scaron;a.&nbsp;', 4163, 'sl', 1),
(968, 'Die belgische Stadt Koksijde ist aufgrund ihres mehrere Kilometer langen und mehr als 100 Meter breiten Sandstrandes ein sehr beliebtes Touristenziel, das haupts&auml;chlich Familien mit kleinen Kindern anzieht. Der Strand, den wir hier beschreiben, hei&szlig;t Strand Sint-Idesbald. Der Zugang zu diesem Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeugtyp sehr leicht erreichbar, an bestimmten Stellen entlang der Stra&szlig;e, nur 50 Meter vom Strand entfernt, kann geparkt werden. Die Oberfl&auml;che des Strandes ist sehr gro&szlig;, daher wird es hier nie zu viele Menschen kommen, da diese &uuml;ber den Strand verteilt sind. Die Stranddienstleistungen hier reichen aus, um alle Ihre Grundbed&uuml;rfnisse zu erf&uuml;llen. Kinder sind hier sehr gut betreut, da es am Strand Kinderspielpl&auml;tze gibt, wie es auch bei Sportliebhabern der Fall ist, die sie hier einige Spielpl&auml;tze haben und auch Wassersportger&auml;te mieten k&ouml;nnen. Sie m&uuml;ssen sich keine Sorgen um Speisen und Getr&auml;nke machen. Restaurants aller Art befinden sich in der N&auml;he. Gleiches gilt f&uuml;r die Unterbringung. Hotels und Apartments sowie andere Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften befinden sich direkt am Strand und erstrecken sich &uuml;ber mehr als 100 Meter innerhalb der Stadt. F&uuml;r diejenigen, die ihren Urlaub lieber auf dem Campingplatz verbringen m&ouml;chten, sind diese ebenfalls verf&uuml;gbar und innerhalb einer Reichweite von maximal 1 km verf&uuml;gbar. Der Strand hat einen ziemlich gleichm&auml;&szlig;igen Hang, au&szlig;er irgendwo in der Mitte, wo es einen kleineren Sand hang gibt. Der Strand ist sehr flach zum Wasser und bietet Ihnen einen sehr bequemen Zugang zum Wasser. Es ist m&ouml;glich an diesem Strand bei ca. 50 Meter bereits zu schwimmen, aber dieser Punkt kann auch durch die Flut verk&uuml;rzt oder verl&auml;ngert werden.', 4163, 'de', 1),
(969, 'Plaža Strand De Westhoek je zadnja Belgijska plaža, ki jo lahko obi&scaron;čete preden prečkate francosko mejo. Od francoske meje je oddaljena zgolj 1 kilometer. Če želite obiskati to plažo se morate zapeljati do najbližjega turističnega sredi&scaron;ča De Panne. Če je večina beljgiskih plaž namenjena družina, ta sigurno ni, saj ne nudi tako visokega standarda plažnih uslug, ko to omogočajo ostale. Najbolj primerna je za raziskovalni tip uporabnika, ki ni preveč zahteven in se zadovolji zgolj z golo plažo. Pesek je na plaži prisoten tudi tukaj, kar pa daje plaži edinstven značaj, je betonska za&scaron;čitna pregrada, po kateri se lahko tudi sprehajate, ki služi kot valobran pred morjem. Dostop do plaže je enostaven, parkirate lahko ob cesti, zgolj 50 metrov od plaže. Na plaži ni ne restavracij, ne plažne infrastrukture, razen par klopi in ko&scaron;ev za smeti. Je pa plaža odprta za pse. V okolici plaže, vendar ne direktno na plaži, so dostopne tudi razne nastanitve. Dolžina plaže je več kilometrov, &scaron;irina pa je zelo močno odvisna od plimovanja. V primeru plime lahko voda sega vse do betonske za&scaron;čite, pri oseki pa se umakne daleč proč. Vstop v vodo je tako lahko v primeru plime možen takoj, v primeru oseke, ko se voda umakne in je plaža bolj položna, pa boste lahko začeli plavati &scaron;ele po kak&scaron;nih 75 m hoje po vodi.&nbsp;', 4164, 'sl', 1),
(970, 'Strand De Westhoek ist der letzte belgische Strand, der vor dem &Uuml;berqueren der franz&ouml;sischen Grenze besucht werden kann. Es ist nur 1 km von der franz&ouml;sischen Grenze entfernt. Um diesen Strand zu besuchen, m&uuml;ssen Sie zum n&auml;chsten Touristenzentrum De Panne fahren. Wenn die meisten belgischen Str&auml;nde familienfreundlich sind, ist dies sicherlich nicht der Fall, da er keinen so hohen Standard an Stranddienstleistungen bietet wie die anderen. Es ist am besten f&uuml;r den Abenteurer Typ geeignet, der nicht zu anspruchsvoll ist und mit einem blo&szlig;en Strand zufrieden ist. Sand ist auch am Strand vorhanden, aber was dem Strand einen einzigartigen Charakter verleiht, ist eine Betonbarriere, auf der Sie auch spazieren k&ouml;nnen, die als Wellenbrecher dient, um das Land vor dem Meer zu sch&uuml;tzen. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach, Sie k&ouml;nnen an der Stra&szlig;e parken, nur 50 Meter vom Strand entfernt. Es gibt keine Restaurants oder Strandinfrastruktur am Strand, au&szlig;er ein paar B&auml;nken und M&uuml;lleimern. Aber der Strand ist offen f&uuml;r Hunde. Eine Vielzahl von Unterk&uuml;nften ist auch in Strandn&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar, jedoch nicht direkt am Strand. Die L&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und die Breite h&auml;ngt stark von der Flut ab. Bei Flut kann sich das Wasser bis zur Wellenbrecher sperre erstrecken und bei Ebbe weit weggezogen werden. Bei Flut kann das Wasser sofort betreten werden, und bei Ebbe, wenn das Wasser zur&uuml;ckgeht und der Strand flacher ist, k&ouml;nnen Sie erst nach etwa 75 m im Wasser schwimmen.', 4164, 'de', 1),
(971, 'V črnogorskem mestu Ulcinj imate pe&scaron;čeno plažo prav v sredi&scaron;ču mesta. Ulcinj se nahaja v južnem delu Črne gore, nedaleč od albanske meje. Do te lokacije je zelo enostavno priti s katerim koli vozilom, za avtodome je tudi nekaj prostora. Ime plaže je Mala plaža in je plaža družinskega tipa. Vozilo lahko parkirate na več parkirnih mestih, večinoma ob cesti, na označenih parkiri&scaron;čih. Najbližja so tik ob cesti neposredno na plaži ali malenkost dlje oddaljena, kjer imate na voljo večja zasebna parkiri&scaron;ča. Plaža je dolga 400 metrov, ponekod pa je &scaron;iroka tudi do 50 metrov. Naklon plaže je normalen. Voda je tu precej plitva in plavanje se začne pri približno 50 metrih. Na plaži imate na voljo veliko plažne infrastrukture in storitev. &Scaron;tevilne restavracije, kavarne in vse vrste trgovin so na voljo neposredno na plaži. Direktno ob plaži sami vam je na volju tudi nastanitev, predvsem v obliki hotelov in apartmajev. Če ste ljubitelj opreme za vodne &scaron;porte, kot so pendolino ali kajak, si jih lahko izposodite tudi na plaži.', 3753, 'sl', 1),
(972, 'U crnogorskom gradu Ulcinju imate pje&scaron;čanu plažu upravo u centru grada. Ulcinj je smje&scaron;ten u južnom dijelu Crne Gore, nedaleko od albanske granice. Do ovog se mjesta vrlo lako doći bilo kojim vozilom, a ima i prostora za autodoma. Naziv plaže je Little Beach i to je plaža obiteljskog tipa. Vozilo možete parkirati na nekoliko parkirali&scaron;ta, uglavnom na cesti, na označenim parkirali&scaron;tima. Najbliži su tik uz cestu direktno na plaži ili malo dalje gdje imate veća privatna parkirna mjesta. Plaža je dugačka 400 metara, a ponekad i do 50 metara. Nagib plaže je normalan. Voda je ovdje prilično plitka, a kupanje započinje s oko 50 metara. Na plaži je na raspolaganju mno&scaron;tvo plažne infrastrukture i usluga. Na plaži su dostupni brojni restorani, kafići i sve vrste trgovina. Neposredno do plaže naći ćete i smje&scaron;taj, posebno u obliku hotela i apartmana. Ako ste ljubitelj opreme za vodene sportove, poput pendolina ili kajaka, možete ih unajmiti i na plaži.', 3753, 'hr', 1),
(973, 'In der montenegrinischen Stadt Ulcinj haben Sie einen Sandstrand mitten im Zentrum der Stadt. Ulcinj liegt im s&uuml;dlichen Teil Montenegros, nicht weit von der albanischen Grenze entfernt. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen, es gibt sogar ein Platz f&uuml;r Wohnmobile. Der Name des Strandes ist Mala plaža und es ist ein Familienstrand. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug auf mehreren Parkpl&auml;tzen, meist neben der Stra&szlig;e, auf ausgewiesenen Parkpl&auml;tzen parken. Der n&auml;chste befindet sich direkt neben der Stra&szlig;e direkt am Strand oder etwas weit entfernt, wo Sie gr&ouml;&szlig;ere private Parkpl&auml;tze zur Verf&uuml;gung haben. Der Strand ist 400 Meter lang und an einigen Stellen bis zu 50 Meter breit. Die Neigung des Strandes ist normal. Das Wasser hier ist ziemlich flach und das Schwimmen beginnt bei etwa 50 Metern. Sie haben eine Menge Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar. Viele Restaurants, Caf&eacute;s und Gesch&auml;fte aller Art befinden sich direkt am Strand. Die Unterbringung kann ebenfalls direkt am Strand erfolgen, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Hotels und Apartments. Wenn Sie ein Fan von Wassersportger&auml;ten wie Paddelbooten oder Kajaks sind, k&ouml;nnen Sie diese auch am Strand mieten.', 3753, 'de', 1),
(974, 'Nella citt&agrave; montenegrina di Ulcinj hai una spiaggia sabbiosa proprio nel centro della citt&agrave;. Ulcinj si trova nella parte meridionale del Montenegro, non lontano dal confine con l&#39;Albania. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungere questa posizione con qualsiasi veicolo e c&#39;&egrave; anche spazio per i camper. Il nome della spiaggia &egrave; Little Beach ed &egrave; una spiaggia di tipo familiare. &Egrave; possibile parcheggiare il veicolo in diversi parcheggi, principalmente a bordo strada, in parcheggi designati. I pi&ugrave; vicini si trovano proprio accanto alla strada direttamente sulla spiaggia o un po &#39;pi&ugrave; lontano, dove si dispone di ampi parcheggi privati. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 400 metri e talvolta larga fino a 50 metri. La pendenza della spiaggia &egrave; normale. L&#39;acqua qui &egrave; piuttosto bassa e il nuoto inizia a circa 50 metri. Ci sono molte infrastrutture e servizi sulla spiaggia disponibili sulla spiaggia. Numerosi ristoranti, caff&egrave; e negozi di ogni genere sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. Direttamente sulla spiaggia troverete anche alloggi, soprattutto sotto forma di hotel e appartamenti. Se sei un fan delle attrezzature per sport acquatici, come il pendolino o il kayak, puoi noleggiarle sulla spiaggia.', 3753, 'it', 1),
(975, 'Wenn Sie in dem Land Montenegro von S&uuml;den nach Norden reisen, ist der Strand Valdanos der allererste Kieselstrand in der Region Ulcinj. Das dem Strand am n&auml;chsten gelegene Dorf ist Bratica. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes besteht aus Kieselsteinen mit gro&szlig;en Steinen und Sie haben auch einige Betonterrassen. Insgesamt ist der Strand 500 Meter lang und bis zu 15 Meter breit. Die Neigung des Abhangs ist an einigen Stellen steil, an einigen normal. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 10 Metern. Strandinfrastruktur und einige Dienstleistungen sind auch hier verf&uuml;gbar, aber sie sind sehr einfach. Eine Strandbar befindet sich ebenfalls direkt am Strand. Eine Unterkunft an diesem Ort ist nicht verf&uuml;gbar, die n&auml;chstgelegene befindet sich in der Stadt Ulcinj.', 3754, 'de', 1),
(976, 'Med potovanjem po Črni gori od juga do severa je prva prodnata plaža v regiji Ulcinj plaža Valdanos. Najbližja vasica ob plaži je Bratica. Do tega kraja je zelo enostavno priti s katero koli vrsto vozila. Na velikem parkiri&scaron;ču lahko parkirate neposredno na plaži. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je prod, so pa tukaj tudi veliki kamni ter nekaj betonskih teras. Dolžina plaže je 500 metrov, njena &scaron;irina pa do 15 metrov. Naklon pobočja je ponekod strm, na nekaterih točkah običajnih. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne pri približno 10 metrih. Infrastruktura na plaži in nekatere storitve so na voljo tudi tukaj, vendar so zelo osnovne. Plažni bar je prav tako dostopen neposredno na plaži. Nastanitev na tej lokaciji ni na voljo, najbližja je v mestu Ulcinj.', 3754, 'sl', 1),
(977, 'Putujući Crnom Gorom od juga do sjevera, prva &scaron;ljunčana plaža u ulcinjskom kraju je plaža Valdanos. Najbliže selo uz plažu je Bratica. Do ovog mjesta je vrlo lako doći bilo kojom vrstom vozila. Na velikom parkirali&scaron;tu možete parkirati direktno na plaži. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je &scaron;ljunak, ali postoje i veliko kamenje i neke betonske terase. Plaža je dugačka 500 metara i &scaron;iroka do 15 metara. Nagib padine na nekim je mjestima strm, na pojedinim mjestima uobičajen. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje na oko 10 metara. Infrastruktura za plažu i neke usluge također su dostupne ovdje, ali su vrlo osnovne. Bar na plaži dostupan je i direktno na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj nije dostupan na ovoj lokaciji, koja je najbliža Ulcinju.', 3754, 'hr', 1),
(978, 'Quando si viaggia nel paese Montenegro da sud a nord, la prima spiaggia di ciottoli nella regione di Ulcinj &egrave; la spiaggia Valdanos. Il villaggio pi&ugrave; vicino alla spiaggia &egrave; Bratica. Questo posto &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. &Egrave; possibile parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia in un ampio parcheggio. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di ciottoli con grandi pietre e hai anche delle terrazze di cemento. Tutti insieme la spiaggia &egrave; lunga 500 metri e larga fino a 15 metri. L&#39;inclinazione della pendenza &egrave; in alcuni punti ripida in alcuni normali. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 10 metri. Anche le infrastrutture della spiaggia e alcuni servizi sono disponibili qui, ma sono molto semplici. Un bar sulla spiaggia &egrave; direttamente sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione in questa localit&agrave; non &egrave; disponibile, la pi&ugrave; vicina &egrave; nella citt&agrave; di Dulcigno.', 3754, 'it', 1),
(979, 'Nella regione del Montenegro Bar, nella piccola citt&agrave; di Utjeha, c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia molto speciale adatta a un tipo di utente pi&ugrave; avventuriero. Questa spiaggia &egrave; davvero speciale. &Egrave; composto da diverse terrazze in cemento e sul fondo vicino al mare c&#39;&egrave; una piccola spiaggia di ciottoli bianchi. Sulle terrazze hai persino degli alberi. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche i camper possono parcheggiare qui. &Egrave; possibile parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia in un ampio parcheggio, che si trova a 10 metri sopra la spiaggia. In fondo la spiaggia &egrave; lunga 10 metri e pi&ugrave; in cima alla collina &egrave; di 20 metri. La larghezza della spiaggia &egrave; di circa 30 metri, terrazze in cemento incluse, la sola spiaggia di ciottoli ha solo una larghezza di 3 metri. Non disponi di molte infrastrutture da spiaggia su questa spiaggia, ma qui c&#39;&egrave; un piccolo bar sulla spiaggia, e intorno alla spiaggia ci sono appartamenti, dove puoi soggiornare per le tue vacanze in Montenegro.', 3755, 'it', 1),
(980, 'In der Bar, der Region Montenegro, in der kleinen Stadt Utjeha, gibt es einen ganz besonderen Strand, der f&uuml;r Abenteurer geeignet ist. Dieser Strand ist wirklich etwas Besonderes. Es besteht aus mehreren Betonterrassen und am Boden in der N&auml;he des Meeres befindet sich ein kleiner wei&szlig;er Kieselstrand. Auf den Terrassen gibt es sogar einige B&auml;ume. Den Strand ist sehr leicht mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, Wohnmobile k&ouml;nnen auch hier parken. Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken, der 10 Meter &uuml;ber dem Strand liegt. Im unteren Bereich ist der Strand 10 Meter lang und im H&uuml;gel 20 Meter. Die Breite des Strandes betr&auml;gt rund 30 Meter, inklusive Betonterrassen, allein der Kieselstrand hat nur eine Breite von 3 Metern. Sie haben nicht viel Strandinfrastruktur an diesem Strand, aber es gibt hier eine kleine Strandbar und rund um den Strand gibt es Apartments, in denen Sie Ihren Urlaub in Montenegro verbringen k&ouml;nnen.', 3755, 'de', 1),
(981, 'V črnogorski regiji Bar, v majhnem mestu Utjeha, je zelo posebna plaža, primerna za bolj avanturističnega uporabnika. Ta plaža je res nekaj posebnega. Sestavljena je iz več betonskih teras, na dnu, blizu morja, pa je majhna bela prodnata plaža. Na terasah imate celo nekaj dreves. Plažo je možno doseči s katerim koli vozilom, tu lahko parkirajo tudi avtodomi. Na plaži lahko parkirate neposredno na velikem parkiri&scaron;ču, ki je 10 metrov nad plažo. Na dnu je plaža dolga 10 metrov, v hribu pa več, 20 metrov. &Scaron;irina plaže je približno 30 metrov, vključene so betonske terase, sama prodnata plaža pa ima &scaron;irino le 3 metre. Na tej plaži nimate veliko plažne infrastrukture, vendar je tu majhen bar na plaži, vse okoli plaže pa so apartmaji, kjer lahko preživite počitnice v Črni gori.', 3755, 'sl', 1),
(982, 'U crnogorskom dijelu Bara, u malom gradu Utjeha, nalazi se vrlo posebna plaža, pogodna za vi&scaron;e avanturističkog korisnika. Ova plaža je zaista ne&scaron;to posebno. Sastoji se od nekoliko betonskih terasa, a na dnu, u blizini mora, nalazi se mala bijela &scaron;ljunčana plaža. Čak imate i neko drveće na terasama. Do plaže se može doći bilo kojim vozilom, a ovdje se mogu parkirati i kamp kućice. Možete parkirati izravno na plaži na velikom parkirali&scaron;tu 10 metara iznad plaže. Na dnu je plaža dugačka 10 metara, a u brdu vi&scaron;e od 20 metara. Plaža je &scaron;iroka oko 30 metara, uključene su betonske terase, a sama &scaron;ljunčana plaža &scaron;iroka je samo 3 metra. Na ovoj plaži nemate veliku infrastrukturu na plaži, ali ovdje je mali bar na plaži, a svuda oko plaže su apartmani u kojima možete provesti svoj odmor u Crnoj Gori.', 3755, 'hr', 1),
(983, 'In der Montenegro Region Bar, in der kleinen Stadt Utjeha, gibt es einen ganz besonderen Betonstrand namens Rocky, der f&uuml;r Familien geeignet ist. Dieser Strand ist wirklich etwas Besonderes. Es besteht aus mehreren Betonterrassen auf Felsen und Sie haben dort sogar einige Schwimmb&auml;der. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand auf einem gro&szlig;en privaten Parkplatz parken. Der Strand ist 100 Meter lang und ringsum von Klippen umgeben. Er ist 15 Meter breit. Um ins kristallklare Wasser zu gelangen, k&ouml;nnen Sie entweder einige Stufen benutzen oder einfach von der bis zu 2 Meter hohen Betonterrasse ins blaue Wasser springen. Dieser Strand ist sehr gut organisiert und die Strandinfrastruktur ist auf h&ouml;chstem Niveau mit vielen Dienstleistungen direkt am Strand. Sie haben eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant direkt am Strand. Wenn Sie Ihre Sommerzeit an diesem Urlausziel verbringen m&ouml;chten, finden Sie hier einige Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten. Rund um den Strand gibt es einige Campingpl&auml;tze sowie Apartments, die in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar sind.', 3756, 'de', 1),
(984, 'Nella regione del Montenegro Bar, nella piccola citt&agrave; di Utjeha, c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia di cemento molto speciale, chiamata Rocky, adatta alle famiglie. Questa spiaggia &egrave; davvero speciale. &Egrave; composto da diverse terrazze di cemento sulle rocce e ci sono anche alcune piscine l&igrave;. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. &Egrave; possibile parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia in un ampio parcheggio privato. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 100 metri con scogliere tutt&#39;intorno ed &egrave; larga 15 metri. Per entrare nell&#39;acqua cristallina &egrave; possibile utilizzare alcuni passaggi o semplicemente saltare nell&#39;acqua blu dalla terrazza in cemento alta fino a 2 metri. Questa spiaggia &egrave; molto organizzata e l&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; di altissimo livello con molti servizi disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. Hai un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante direttamente sulla spiaggia. Se stai pensando di trascorrere l&#39;estate in questa destinazione, ecco alcune opzioni di alloggio disponibili. Tutto intorno alla spiaggia ci sono alcuni campeggi, cos&igrave; come appartamenti, che sono disponibili nelle vicinanze.', 3756, 'it', 1),
(985, 'V črnogorski regiji Bar, v mestecu Utjeha, je zelo posebna betonska plaža, imenovana Rocky, primerna za družine. Ta plaža je res nekaj posebnega. Narejena je iz več betonskih teras na skalah in tam imate celo nekaj bazenov. Pot do te lokacije je zelo enostavna. Na velikem zasebnem parkiri&scaron;ču lahko parkirate neposredno ob plaži. Plaža je dolga 100 metrov, obdana je s klifi, do 2 metra vi&scaron;ine, &scaron;iroka pa je do 15 metrov. Za vstop v kristalno čisto vodo lahko uporabite ali stopnice ali preprosto skočite v modro vodo z do 2 metra visoke betonske terase. Ta plaža je zelo organizirana in infrastruktura na plaži je na najvi&scaron;ji ravni s &scaron;tevilnimi storitvami, ki so na voljo neposredno na plaži. Na plaži imate tudi bar na plaži in restavracijo. Če nameravate poletni čas preživeti na tej destinaciji, je na voljo nekaj možnosti nastanitve. V okolici plaže je nekaj kampov, pa tudi apartmajev, ki so na voljo v bližini.', 3756, 'sl', 1),
(986, 'U crnogorskom dijelu Bara, u gradu Utjeha, nalazi se posebna betonska plaža nazvana Rocky, pogodna za obitelji. Ova plaža je zaista ne&scaron;to posebno. Sačinjena je od nekoliko betonskih terasa na stijenama i čak imate neke bazene tamo. Dolazak je vrlo jednostavan. Parkirati možete direktno uz plažu na velikom privatnom parkirali&scaron;tu. Plaža je dugačka 100 metara, okružena je liticama, visine do 2 metra, a &scaron;irine do 15 metara. Možete se stepenicama koristiti za ulazak u kristalno čistu vodu ili jednostavno skočiti u plavu vodu s betonske terase visoke do 2 metra. Ova je plaža vrlo organizirana, a infrastruktura na plaži vrhunska je s mnogim uslugama dostupnim direktno na plaži. Na plaži je i bar na plaži i restoran. Ako planirate provesti ljeto na ovoj destinaciji, postoje neke mogućnosti smje&scaron;taja. Postoji nekoliko kampova u blizini plaže, kao i apartmani u blizini.', 3756, 'hr', 1),
(987, 'In der kleinen Stadt Utjeha, die sich in der Montenegrinischen Region Bar befindet, hat einen Steinstrand Utjeha mit wei&szlig;en gro&szlig;en Steinen anzubieten, der vor allem f&uuml;r Familien geeignet ist. Diesen Ort ist es sehr leicht mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, einschlie&szlig;lich Wohnmobilen, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen nur im Camp parken. Das Parken ist nur auf einem privaten gro&szlig;en Parkplatz oder in dem Camp m&ouml;glich. Der Strand ist 150 Meter lang und bis zu 25 Meter breit. Auf einer Seite des Strandes haben Sie auch einige Betonterrassen und einen Swimmingpool. Um ins kristallklare Wasser zu gelangen, k&ouml;nnen Sie entweder am Strand entlanggehen, einige Stufen benutzen oder einfach von den Betonterrassen ins blaue Wasser springen. Der Schwimmpunkt beginnt sehr schnell und Sie k&ouml;nnen bereits nach 5 Metern wegschwimmen, wenn Sie am Strand ins Wasser gehen oder sofort, wenn Sie ins Wasser springen, bei den Terrassen ist es Tief genug. Am Strand haben Sie einige Strandinfrastruktur und einige Dienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Sie haben eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant direkt am Strand. Rund um den Strand gibt es einige Campingpl&auml;tze sowie Apartments, die in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar sind.', 3757, 'de', 1),
(988, 'Nel cuore della citt&agrave; di Utjeha, muori nella regione di Montenegrinischen Bar Befindet, Hat Steintrand Utjeha mit wei&szlig;en gro&szlig;en Steinen anzubieten, der vor allem f&uuml;r Familien geeignet ist. Diesen Ort &egrave; la prima volta con Jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, einschlie&szlig;lich Wohnmobilen, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen nur im Camp parken. Das Parken &egrave; un vero e proprio parco privato di Parkplatz o nel Camp M&ouml;glich. Der Strand is 150 Meter lang und bis zu 25 Meter breit. Auf einer Seite des Strandes haben Sie ain einige Betonterrassen und einen Swimmingpool. Um in kristallklare Wasser zu gelangen, K&ouml;nnen Sie intrecciata con Strand entlanggehen, einige Stufen benutzen oder einfach von den Betonterrassen in blaue Wasser springen. Der Schwimmpunkt ha iniziato a vivere insieme a Sie k&ouml;nnen con 5 bambini moderni, quando Sie am Strand a Wasser gehen oder sofort, quando Sie a Wasser springen, bei den Terrassen ist es Tief genug. Am Strand haben Sie einige Strandinfrastruktur und einige Dienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Sie haben eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant direkt am Strand. Rund um den Strand gibt es einige Campingpl&auml;tze sowie Apartments, die in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar sind.', 3757, 'it', 1),
(989, 'V mestecu Utjeha, ki se nahaja v črnogorski regiji Bar, imate tukaj veliko belo kamnito plažo Utjeha, ki je primerna predvsem za družine. Sem se lahko pripeljete s katerim koli tipom vozilam, tudi z avtodomi, vendar lahko le te parkirate zgolj v kampu. Parkiranje je možno le na zasebnem velikem parkiri&scaron;ču ali v kampih. Plaža je dolga 150 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 25 metrov. Na eni strani plaže imate tudi nekaj betonskih teras in na njih en bazen. Ko boste želeli zaplavati v kristalno čisti vodi, se lahko do te odpravite iz plaže, uporabite lahko stopnice ali vodno lestev ali preprosto skočite v modro vodo s betonskih teras. Točka plavanja se začne zelo hitro, po 5 metrih, ko grete v vodo ob plaži ali takoj, če skočite v vodo,&nbsp; ta je dovolj globoko ob terasah za tak&scaron;en podvig. Na plaži imate na voljo nekaj plažne infrastrukture in nekaj storitev. Restavracija in bar se prav tako nahajata na ali ob plaži. Ob celotni plaži je nekaj kampov, pa tudi apartmajev, ki so na voljo v bližini.', 3757, 'sl', 1),
(990, 'U malom gradu Utjeha koji se nalazi u crnogorskom dijelu Bara, ovdje imate veliku bijelu kamenu plažu Utjeha, koja je posebno pogodna za obitelji. Možete se voziti s bilo kojom vrstom vozila, uključujući i kućice, ali možete ih parkirati samo u kampu. Parkiranje je moguće samo na privatnim velikim parkirali&scaron;tima ili u kampovima. Plaža je dugačka 150 metara i &scaron;iroka do 25 metara. S jedne strane plaže također imate betonske terase i jedan bazen na njima. Kad želite plivati ​​u kristalno čistoj vodi, možete izaći s plaže, koristiti stepenice ili vodene ljestve ili jednostavno skočiti u plavu vodu s betonskih terasa. Točka kupanja započinje vrlo brzo, nakon 5 metara kada uđete u vodu na plaži ili čim skočite u vodu, dovoljno je duboko uz terase za takav podvig. Na plaži postoji neka infrastruktura na plaži i neke usluge. Restoran i bar također su smje&scaron;teni na ili uz plažu. Uz cijelu plažu postoji nekoliko kampova, kao i apartmani u blizini.', 3757, 'hr', 1),
(991, 'Wenn Sie kleine Kiesstr&auml;nde mit fast keiner Strandinfrastruktur m&ouml;gen, aber einige Unterk&uuml;nfte in der N&auml;he, mit dem Strand Uvala Maslina in der N&auml;he der kleinen Stadt Utjeha, sind Sie hier richtig. Es befindet sich in der Montenegro Region Bar. Es ist sehr leicht mit Ihrem Fahrzeug zu erreichen. Es gibt einige Parkpl&auml;tze neben der Stra&szlig;e, und einige private Parkpl&auml;tze. Um vom Parkplatz zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie 25 Meter H&ouml;he und etwa 100 Meter lang absteigen. Der Weg ist mittelschwer und der Strand ist f&uuml;r Abenteurer geeignet. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand sind wei&szlig;e Kieselsteine und Sie haben auch einige Betonterrassen. Der Strand ist 20 Meter lang und rund 10 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und man kann auch von der Betonterrasse springen. Das Schwimmen beginnt fast sofort. Am Strand selbst gibt es keine Strandinfrastruktur. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in der N&auml;he des Parkplatzes in Form von Apartments.', 3758, 'de', 1),
(992, 'Se ti piacciono le piccole spiagge di ciottoli con quasi nessuna infrastruttura balneare, ma alcuni alloggi nelle vicinanze, con la spiaggia di Uvala Maslina vicino alla piccola citt&agrave; di Utjeha, sei nel posto giusto. Si trova nella regione montenegrina di Bar. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con il tuo veicolo. Ci sono alcuni parcheggi vicino alla strada e alcuni parcheggi privati. Per arrivare dal parcheggio alla spiaggia devi scendere 25 metri e circa 100 metri di lunghezza. Il sentiero &egrave; medio e la spiaggia &egrave; adatta agli avventurieri. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di ciottoli bianchi e hai anche dei cortili di cemento. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 20 metri e larga circa 10 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; bello e puoi anche saltare dalla terrazza di cemento. Il nuoto inizia quasi immediatamente. Non ci sono infrastrutture sulla spiaggia stessa. La sistemazione &egrave; vicino al parcheggio sotto forma di appartamenti.', 3758, 'it', 1),
(993, 'Če so vam v&scaron;eč majhne prodnate plaže s skoraj nobeno plažno infrastrukturo na plaži, vendar z nekaj nastanitvami v bližini, ste s plažo Uvala Maslina, ki se nahaja v bližini majhnega mesteca Utjeha, pri&scaron;li na pravo mesto. Nahaja se v črnogorski regiji Bar in je s svojim vozilom zelo lahko dostopna. Ob cesti se nahaja nekaj parkiri&scaron;č in nekaj parkirnih mest je dostopnih na zasebnih parkiri&scaron;čih. Če želite priti s parkiri&scaron;ča do plaže, se morate spustiti 25 metrov v globino in podati na približno 100 metrov dolgo pot. Pot je srednja težka in plaža je po svojih karakteristikah primerna za avanturiste. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži so beli kamenčki, poleg tega pa imate v bližini tudi nekaj betonskih teras. Plaža je dolga 20 metrov in &scaron;iroka približno 10 metrov. Dostop v vodo je udoben, lahko pa tudi skočite z betonske terase. Plavati lahko začnete začne skoraj. Na sami plaži ni plažne infrastrukture. Nastanitev je v bližini parkiri&scaron;ča v obliki apartmajev.', 3758, 'sl', 1),
(994, 'Ako volite male &scaron;ljunčane plaže s gotovo nikakvom plažnom infrastrukturom, ali s nekim smje&scaron;tajem u blizini, do&scaron;li ste na pravo mjesto s zaljevom Maslina, koji se nalazi u blizini malog grada Utjeha. Nalazi se u crnogorskom predjelu Bara i vrlo je lako dostupan automobilom. Uz parkirali&scaron;te postoje parkirali&scaron;ta, a na pojedinim su parkirali&scaron;tima dostupna i parkirali&scaron;ta. Da biste do&scaron;li do parkirali&scaron;ta na plaži, morate se spustiti duboko 25 metara i krenuti stazom dugom 100 metara. Staza je srednje te&scaron;ka, a plaža je pogodna za avanturiste. Glavni dio plaže je bijeli &scaron;ljunak, a u blizini imate i nekoliko betonskih terasa. Plaža je duga 20 metara i &scaron;iroka oko 10 metara. Pristup vodi je udoban, a možete i skočiti s betonskog popločanog dijela. Gotovo možete početi plivati. Na samoj plaži nema infrastrukturu plaže. Smje&scaron;taj se nalazi u neposrednoj blizini parkirali&scaron;ta u obliku apartmana.', 3758, 'hr', 1),
(995, 'In der montenegrinischen Stadt Dobra Voda, was gutes Wasser bedeutet, gibt es einen sehr gro&szlig;en wei&szlig;en Kieselstrand. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che aus Kieselsteinen besteht, ist auch etwas brauner Sand darin gemischt. Der Strand befindet sich in der Region Bar und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie haben 2 gro&szlig;e &ouml;ffentliche Parkpl&auml;tze fast direkt am Strand. Sie sind nicht kostenlos und kosten ein paar Euro pro Tag. Der Strand ist 400 Meter lang und bis zu 50 Meter breit. An einem Teil des Strandes gibt es auch Betonterrassen. Das Wasser wird hier ziemlich schnell tief, was hei&szlig;t, dass sie sehr schnell wegschwimmen k&ouml;nnen. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen auch vom kleinen Pier springen oder die Wasserleiter benutzen, um ins Wasser zu gehen. Da dies der Hauptstrand der Stadt ist, stehen Ihnen hier viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wenn Sie hungrig oder durstig werden, stehen Ihnen direkt am Strand viele Restaurants und &auml;hnliche Restaurants zur Verf&uuml;gung. Unterkunft ist auch hier kein Problem, Sie haben viele Hotels und Apartments rund um den Strand f&uuml;r Ihren Urlaub zur Verf&uuml;gung.', 3759, 'de', 1),
(996, 'Nella citt&agrave; montenegrina Dobra Voda, che significa buona acqua, hai una spiaggia di ciottoli bianca molto grande. Anche se la superficie principale &egrave; di ciottoli, hai anche un po &#39;di sabbia marrone mescolata all&#39;interno. La spiaggia si trova nella regione Bar, ed &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Hai 2 ampi parcheggi pubblici disponibili quasi direttamente in spiaggia. Non sono gratuiti e ti costeranno pochi euro al giorno. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 400 metri e larga fino a 50 metri. Su una parte della spiaggia ci sono anche terrazze in cemento. L&#39;acqua si fa profonda qui abbastanza rapidamente, il che rende il punto di nuoto quasi immediato. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; piacevole e puoi anche saltare dal piccolo molo o utilizzare la scala per entrare nell&#39;acqua. Poich&eacute; questa &egrave; la spiaggia principale della citt&agrave;, qui sono disponibili molti servizi di spiaggia. Se hai fame o sete, hai molti ristoranti e catering simili direttamente sulla spiaggia. Anche l&#39;alloggio non &egrave; un problema qui, hai molti hotel e appartamenti in tutta la spiaggia disponibili per le tue vacanze.', 3759, 'it', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(997, 'V črnogorskem mestu Dobra Voda lahko obi&scaron;čete zelo veliko belo prodnato plažo, ki sli&scaron;i na enako ime. Čeprav so glavna povr&scaron;ina kamenčki, je prime&scaron;anega tudi nekaj rjavega peska. Plaža se nahaja v regiji Bar in je zelo enostavno dosegljiva s kakr&scaron;nimi koli vozili. Na voljo imate 2 velika javna parkiri&scaron;ča skoraj neposredno ob plaži. Niso brezplačna in vas bodo stala nekaj evrov na dan. Plaža je dolga 400 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 50 metrov. Na enem delu plaže imate tudi betonske terase. Voda se tukaj zelo hitro spu&scaron;ča v globino, zaradi česar lahko začnete plavati skoraj takoj. Vstop v vodo iz plaže je lep, lahko pa tudi skočite z majhnega pomola ali pa uporabite vodno lestev, da greste v vodo. Ker je to glavna plaža v mestu, imate tukaj na voljo &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži in ob njej. Če ste lačni ali žejni, imate na voljo &scaron;tevilne restavracije in podobno gostinsko ponudbo neposredno na plaži. Tudi nastanitev tukaj ni težava, za počitnice imate na voljo veliko hotelov in apartmajev ob celotni plaži.', 3759, 'sl', 1),
(998, 'U crnogorskom gradu Dobra Voda možete posjetiti vrlo veliku bijelu &scaron;ljunkovitu plažu koja zvuči istoimeno. Iako je glavna povr&scaron;ina &scaron;ljunak, pomije&scaron;an je i neki smeđi pijesak. Plaža se nalazi u regiji Bar i lako je dostupna bilo kojim vozilom. Imate 2 velika javna parkirali&scaron;ta gotovo direktno uz plažu. Nisu besplatni i ko&scaron;tat će vas nekoliko eura dnevno. Plaža je dugačka 400 metara i &scaron;iroka do 50 metara. Na jednom dijelu plaže imate i betonske terase. Voda ovdje tone duboko u vodu, &scaron;to olak&scaron;ava plivanje gotovo odmah. Ulaz u vodu s plaže je lijepo, ali možete i skočiti s malog mola ili pomoću ljestvi za vodu ući u vodu. Budući da je ovo glavna plaža u gradu, ovdje imate na raspolaganju razne usluge na plaži. Ako ste gladni ili žedni, na plaži je na raspolaganju puno restorana i sličnih ugostiteljskih objekata. Također, smje&scaron;taj ovdje nije problem, za odmor imate puno hotela i apartmana duž cijele plaže.', 3759, 'hr', 1),
(999, 'In der montenegrinischen Stadt Dobra Voda, was gutes Wasser bedeutet, gibt es zwei beliebte Str&auml;nde. Das hier beschriebene ist das kleinere, und da es keinen offiziellen Namen hat, haben wir ihm den Namen Dobra Voda gegeben. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che aus Kieselsteinen besteht, ist auch etwas brauner Sand darin gemischt. Sie haben auch einige Betonterrassen auf jeder Seite des Hauptstrandes. Der Strand befindet sich in der Region Bar und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie haben 2 gro&szlig;e &ouml;ffentliche Parkpl&auml;tze fast direkt am Strand. Sie sind nicht kostenlos und kosten ein paar Euro pro Tag. Der erste Parkplatz ist nur 200 Meter entfernt, der zweite rund 500 Meter. Der Strand ist 200 Meter lang und bis zu 20 Meter breit. An einem Teil des Strandes gibt es auch einige Betonterrassen. Das Wasser f&auml;llt hier ziemlich schnell, Sie k&ouml;nnen fast sofort mit Schwimmen beginnen. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen auch vom einem kleinen Pier springen oder die Wasserleiter benutzen, um hineinzugehen. Dieser kleine Strand ist nicht so gut ausgestattet wie der gr&ouml;&szlig;ere, aber hier stehen Ihnen auch einige grundlegende Dienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wenn Sie hungrig oder durstig werden, haben Sie viele Restaurants und Strandbars oder &auml;hnliches Catering am gr&ouml;&szlig;eren Strand, nur wenige Meter entfernt. Unterkunft ist auch hier kein Problem, Sie haben viele Hotels und Apartments rund um den Strand, die f&uuml;r Ihren Urlaub zur Verf&uuml;gung stehen.', 3760, 'de', 1),
(1000, 'Nella citt&agrave; montenegrina Dobra Voda, che significa buona acqua, hai due spiagge famose. Quello che stiamo descrivendo qui &egrave; il pi&ugrave; piccolo, e poich&eacute; non ha un nome ufficiale, gli abbiamo dato il nome Dobra Voda. Anche se la superficie principale &egrave; di ciottoli, hai anche un po &#39;di sabbia marrone mescolata all&#39;interno. Hai anche alcune terrazze di cemento su ciascun lato della spiaggia principale. La spiaggia si trova nella regione Bar ed &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Hai 2 ampi parcheggi pubblici disponibili quasi direttamente in spiaggia. Non sono gratuiti e ti costeranno pochi euro al giorno. Il primo parcheggio &egrave; a soli 200 metri di distanza, il secondo a circa 500 metri. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 200 metri e larga fino a 20 metri. Su una parte della spiaggia ci sono anche delle terrazze di cemento. L&#39;acqua cade qui abbastanza rapidamente, il che rende il punto di nuoto quasi immediato. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; piacevole e puoi anche saltare dal piccolo molo o usare la scala per entrarci. Questa piccola spiaggia non &egrave; ben attrezzata come quella pi&ugrave; grande, ma qui sono disponibili anche alcuni servizi di base. Se hai fame o sete, hai molti ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia, o catering simile, disponibili sulla spiaggia pi&ugrave; grande a pochi metri di distanza. Anche l&#39;alloggio non &egrave; un problema qui, hai molti hotel e appartamenti, tutti intorno alla spiaggia, disponibili per le tue vacanze.', 3760, 'it', 1),
(1001, 'V črnogorskem mestu Dobra Voda imate dve priljubljeni plaži. Ta, ki jo tukaj opisujemo, je manj&scaron;a, in ker nima uradnega imena, smo ji dali ime Dobra Voda. Čeprav so glavna povr&scaron;ina kamenčki, imate znotraj tudi prime&scaron;an nekaj rjavega peska. Na vsaki strani glavne plaže imate tudi nekaj betonskih teras. Plaža se nahaja v regiji Bar in je zelo enostavno dosegljiva s kakr&scaron;nimi koli vozili. Na voljo imate 2 velika javna parkiri&scaron;ča skoraj neposredno ob plaži. Niso brezplačna in vas bodo stala nekaj evrov na dan. Prvo parkirno mesto je oddaljeno le 200 metrov, drugo približno 500 metrov. Plaža je dolga 200 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 20 metrov. Na enem delu plaže imate tudi nekaj betonskih teras. Voda pade tu dokaj hitro, zaradi česar lahko začete plavati skoraj takoj. Vstop v vodo je udoben, prav tako lahko v vodo skočite z majhnega pomola ali pa uporabite vodno lestev. Ta majhna plaža ni tako dobro opremljena kot večja, vendar imate tudi tukaj na voljo nekaj osnovnih storitev. Če ste lačni ali žejni, imate na večji plaži, le nekaj metrov stran, veliko restavracij in plažnih barov ali podobno gostinsko ponudbo. Tudi nastanitev tukaj ni težava, za počitnice imate na voljo veliko hotelov in apartmajev, vse okoli plaže.', 3760, 'sl', 1),
(1002, 'U crnogorskom gradu Dobra Voda nalaze se dvije popularne plaže. Ova koju opisujemo ovdje je manja, a budući da nema službeno ime, nazvali smo je Dobra voda. Iako je glavna povr&scaron;ina &scaron;ljunak, unutra se također mije&scaron;a neki smeđi pijesak. Na svakoj od glavne plaže nalaze se i betonske terase. Plaža se nalazi u regiji Bar i lako je dostupna bilo kojim vozilom. Imate 2 velika javna parkirali&scaron;ta gotovo direktno uz plažu. Nisu besplatni i ko&scaron;tat će vas nekoliko eura dnevno. Prvo parkirno mjesto udaljeno je samo 200 metara, drugo udaljeno oko 500 metara. Plaža je dugačka 200 metara i &scaron;iroka do 20 metara. Na jednom dijelu plaže imate i betonske terase. Voda ovdje prilično brzo pada, &scaron;to omogućava da se odmah počne plivati. Ulazak u vodu je ugodan, možete skočiti i s malog pristana ili koristiti vodene ljestve. Ova mala plaža nije tako dobro opremljena kao veća, ali ovdje imate i neke osnovne usluge. Ako ste gladni ili žedni, imate veliku plažu na samo nekoliko metara, mnogo restorana i barova na plaži ili sličan catering. Ni smje&scaron;taj ovdje nije problem, a na plaži je puno hotela i apartmana.', 3760, 'hr', 1),
(1003, 'Wenn Sie einen Strand in Montenegro besuchen m&ouml;chten, der sich in einer Stadt mit vielen Stranddienstleistungen und vielen Kinderspielpl&auml;tzen am Strand befindet, sollten Sie die Stadt Bar und den Strand Topolica besuchen. Es befindet sich im s&uuml;dlichen Teil des Landes Montenegro in der Region Bar. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf mehreren Parkpl&auml;tzen parken, von denen einige sogar nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt sind. Der Strand befindet sich in der N&auml;he des Yachthafens und auch in der N&auml;he eines Parks, in dem Sie viele B&auml;ume und Gras haben. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes sind Kieselsteine, aber es gibt sogar etwas Sand und gro&szlig;e Steine, die eingemischt sind. Der Strand ist 300 Meter lang und kann bis zu 100 Meter breit sein. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 10 Metern. Es ist ein wahrer Familienstrand, an dem Sie &uuml;berall viele Dienstleistungen haben. Die ganze Gegend ist sehr gut organisiert und sauber. Sie haben auch eine Strandbar, einige Restaurants und Pizzerien in Strandn&auml;he. Ein Luxushotel ist auch direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar und viele Apartments befinden sich in der N&auml;he.', 3761, 'de', 1),
(1004, 'Se desideri visitare una spiaggia del Montenegro, che si trova in una citt&agrave; con molti servizi di spiaggia e molti parchi giochi per bambini sulla spiaggia, dovresti visitare il bar della citt&agrave; e la spiaggia di Topolica. Si trova nella parte meridionale del paese Montenegro nella regione Bar. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi parcheggiare in pi&ugrave; parcheggi, alcuni anche a pochi metri dalla spiaggia. La spiaggia si trova vicino al porto turistico e anche vicino a un parco dove ci sono molti alberi ed erba. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di ciottoli, ma c&#39;&egrave; anche un po &#39;di sabbia e grandi pietre mescolate con dentro. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 300 metri e pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 100 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 10 metri. &Egrave; una vera spiaggia per famiglie dove hai molti servizi in tutto il luogo. L&#39;intera area &egrave; molto organizzata e pulita. Hai anche un bar sulla spiaggia, alcuni ristoranti e pizzerie vicino alla spiaggia. Un hotel di lusso &egrave; disponibile anche direttamente sulla spiaggia e molti appartamenti si trovano nelle vicinanze.', 3761, 'it', 1),
(1005, 'Če bi radi obiskali črnogorsko plažo, ki se nahaja v mestu, kjer imaste na plaži sami na razpolago veliko plažnih storitev na ter hkrati veliko otro&scaron;kih igri&scaron;č, obi&scaron;čite mesto Bar in plažo Topolica. Nahaja se v južnem delu države Črna gora v regiji Bar. Zelo enostavno jo je doseči s katerim koli vozilom in parkirate lahko na več parkirnih mestih,&nbsp; nekatera so oddaljena le nekaj metrov. Plaža se nahaja v bližini marine in tudi v bližini parka, kjer imate veliko dreves in travnatih povr&scaron;in. Glavna podlaga na plaži je prod, prav tako pa je nekaj peska in velikih kamnov pome&scaron;anih k produ. Plaža je dolga 300 metrov in je lahko &scaron;iroka tudi do 100 metrov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne pri približno 10 metrih. To je prava družinska plaža, kjer imate povsod na voljo veliko storitev. Celotno območje je zelo urejeno in čisto. V bližini plaže imate tudi bar na plaži, nekaj restavracij in picerij. Luksuzni hotel je na voljo tudi neposredno na plaži, v bližini pa je veliko apartmajev.', 3761, 'sl', 1),
(1006, 'Ako želite posjetiti Crnogorsku plažu koja se nalazi u gradu u kojem imate puno usluga na plaži na vlastitom i mnogim dječjim igrali&scaron;tima istovremeno, posjetite Bar i plažu Topolica. Smje&scaron;ten u južnom dijelu Crne Gore u regiji Bar. Do njega se lako dolazi bilo kojim vozilom, a može se parkirati na nekoliko parkirnih mjesta, nekih samo nekoliko metara. Plaža se nalazi u blizini marine, a također u blizini parka u kojem imate puno drveća i trave. Glavna baza na plaži je &scaron;ljunak, kao i ne&scaron;to pijeska i velikog kamenja pomije&scaron;anog u &scaron;ljunak. Plaža je dugačka 300 metara, a može biti &scaron;iroka i do 100 metara. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje na oko 10 metara. Ovo je prava obiteljska plaža na kojoj imate svugdje usluge. Cijelo je područje vrlo uredno i čisto. U blizini plaže imate i bar na plaži, neke restorane i picerije. Luksuzni hotel dostupan je i na samoj plaži, a mnogi apartmani su u blizini.', 3761, 'hr', 1),
(1007, 'Die Stadt Bar in Montenegro ist bekannt f&uuml;r ihren Handelshafen, aber daneben gibt es auch einen &ouml;ffentlichen Strand mit vielen Sportpl&auml;tzen in der N&auml;he. Nur 20 Meter vom Strand entfernt befindet sich ein echtes Sportstadion. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Bar, genau wie die Stadt selbst. Es ist sehr einfach diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, auch Wohnmobile sind willkommen. Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz direkt am Strand, auf dem mehr als einhundert Fahrzeuge Platz finden. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes besteht aus gro&szlig;en Steinen, aber Sie haben auch einige Kieselsteine ​​und etwas Sand. Dieser Strand ist 400 Meter lang und bis zu 40 Meter breit. Der beste Weg, um bequem ins Wasser zu gelangen, sind die kleinen Stellen mit dem Sand. Andernfalls m&uuml;ssen Sie &uuml;ber einige gro&szlig;e Steine ​​gehen, die nicht so bequem sind. Der Schwimmpunkt beginnt mit ca. 5 Metern sehr schnell. Auf dem Gel&auml;nde haben Sie auch eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant, und dies ist auch der Punkt, an dem Sie die meiste Strandinfrastruktur haben. In der N&auml;he des Strandes haben Sie auch ein Hotel und einige Apartments, wenn Sie Ihren Urlaub hier verbringen m&ouml;chten.', 3762, 'de', 1),
(1008, 'La citt&agrave; di Bar in Montenegro &egrave; nota per il suo porto commerciale, ma c&#39;&egrave; anche una spiaggia pubblica con molti campi sportivi nelle vicinanze. C&#39;&egrave; un vero stadio sportivo a soli 20 metri dalla spiaggia. La regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia &egrave; chiamata il bar, proprio come la citt&agrave; stessa.&Egrave; molto facile raggiungere questo posto con qualsiasi veicolo, anche i camper sono i benvenuti. Hanno un ampio parcheggio proprio sulla spiaggia che pu&ograve; ospitare pi&ugrave; di un centinaio di veicoli. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; fatta di grandi pietre, ma hai anche dei ciottoli e della sabbia. Questa spiaggia &egrave; lunga 400 metri e larga fino a 40 metri. Il modo migliore per entrare comodamente in acqua &egrave; con le piccole macchie di sabbia. Altrimenti, dovrai camminare su alcune pietre di grandi dimensioni che non sono cos&igrave; comode. La virgola mobile inizia molto rapidamente a circa 5 metri. Hai anche un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante in loco, ed &egrave; qui che hai la maggior parte delle infrastrutture sulla spiaggia. Vicino alla spiaggia hai anche un hotel e alcuni appartamenti se vuoi trascorrere le tue vacanze qui.', 3762, 'it', 1),
(1009, 'Mesto Bar v Črni gori je znano po svojem trgovskem pristani&scaron;ču, v bližini pa je tudi javna plaža s &scaron;tevilnimi &scaron;portnimi igri&scaron;či. Pravi &scaron;portni stadion je le 20 metrov od plaže. Regija, v kateri se nahaja ta plaža, se imenuje Bar, tako kot samo mesto. Do tega mesta je zelo enostavno priti s katerim koli vozilom, tudi avtodomi so dobrodo&scaron;li. Ob plaži je zelo veliko parkiri&scaron;če, ki lahko sprejme več kot sto vozil. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je zgrajena iz velikega kamenja, imate pa tudi nekaj kamenčkov in nekaj peska. Ta plaža je dolga 400 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 40 metrov. Najbolj&scaron;i način za udobno vstopanje v vodo je tam, kjer so majhne zaplate peska. V nasprotnem primeru boste morali hoditi čez nekaj velikih kamnov, ki niso tako udobni. Plavat lahko začnete zelo hitro, pri približno 5 metrih. V bližini plaže imate tudi bar na plaži in restavracijo, in to je tudi točka, kjer se nahaja največ plažne infrastrukture. V bližini plaže imate tudi hotel in nekaj apartmajev, če bi želeli preživeti svoje poletne počitnice tukaj.', 3762, 'sl', 1),
(1010, 'Grad Bar u Crnoj Gori poznat je po svojoj komercijalnoj luci, a u blizini se nalazi i javna plaža s brojnim sportskim terenima. Pravi sportski stadion udaljen je samo 20 metara od plaže. Regija u kojoj se nalazi ova plaža zove se Bar, ba&scaron; kao i sam grad. Do ovog se mjesta vrlo lako doći bilo kojim vozilom, dobrodo&scaron;li su i kućni ljubimci. Uz plažu postoji vrlo veliko parkirali&scaron;te koje može primiti vi&scaron;e od stotinu vozila. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže izgrađena je od velikih stijena, a imate i ne&scaron;to &scaron;ljunka i pijeska. Ova je plaža dugačka 400 metara i &scaron;iroka do 40 metara. Najbolji način za ugodan ulazak u vodu je tamo gdje postoje male mrlje pijeska. Inače ćete morati hodati preko nekih velikih stijena koje nisu toliko ugodne. Možete početi plivati ​​vrlo brzo, na oko 5 metara. Tu je i bar na plaži i restoran u blizini plaže, a to je ujedno i mjesto na kojem se nalazi najvi&scaron;e plaže. Imate i hotel i nekoliko apartmana u blizini plaže ako ovdje želite provesti svoj ljetni odmor.', 3762, 'hr', 1),
(1011, 'Una delle primissime spiagge vicino alla citt&agrave; di Ksamil quando si viaggia verso il sud dell&#39;Albania &egrave; la spiaggia Plazhi i Pasqyrave situata nella regione di Valona. La spiaggia non &egrave; cos&igrave; facile da raggiungere perch&eacute; &egrave; necessario prendere una strada stretta e abbastanza ripida che &egrave; nell&#39;ultima parte fatta di terra e rocce. I camper possono anche andare l&igrave;, ma dovrebbe essere piccolo e, se possibile, a quattro o quattro ruote motrici, perch&eacute; alcune parti sono piuttosto difficili. Hai un ampio parcheggio direttamente sulla spiaggia. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia sono piccoli ciottoli mescolati con un po &#39;di sabbia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 150 metri e larga fino a 25 metri. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia quasi immediatamente. Hai delle infrastrutture balneari qui, ma &egrave; pi&ugrave; semplice. Qui sono presenti anche un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante. La sistemazione non &egrave; disponibile direttamente sulla spiaggia ma nel villaggio soprastante sotto forma di appartamenti e camere.', 3698, 'it', 1),
(1012, 'Una delle prime spiagge quando si viaggia dal sud dell&#39;Albania verso la citt&agrave; di Saranda &egrave; la spiaggia Plazhi Manastirit situata nella regione di Valona. La spiaggia non &egrave; cos&igrave; facile da raggiungere perch&eacute; devi prendere una strada stretta e abbastanza ripida ma &egrave; fatta di cemento, quindi hai una trazione migliore. I camper possono anche andare l&igrave;, ma dovrebbe essere piccolo e, se possibile, a quattro o quattro ruote motrici, perch&eacute; alcune parti sono piuttosto difficili. Hai un ampio parcheggio direttamente sulla spiaggia. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia sono piccoli ciottoli mescolati con un po &#39;di sabbia. Il faro &egrave; lungo 75 metri e largo fino a 15 metri. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia quasi immediatamente. Hai delle infrastrutture sulla spiaggia qui, anche un piccolo parco giochi per bambini. Qui sono presenti anche un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile anche direttamente sulla spiaggia sotto forma di un hotel e hai anche un piccolo campeggio.', 3699, 'it', 1),
(1013, 'La citt&agrave; albanese Saranda si trova nella regione di Valona. Le spiagge di questa citt&agrave; sono famose per molti servizi che offrono ai turisti. Se sei tu a cui piace trascorrere le vacanze in un hotel direttamente sulla spiaggia, questa citt&agrave; &egrave; quella giusta per te. Anche la spiaggia Plazhi Mango appartiene a questa categoria. &Egrave; molto facilmente accessibile con un veicolo e il parcheggio pu&ograve; essere fatto direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma nella maggior parte dei casi solo parcheggio privato in un grande parcheggio privato dell&#39;hotel. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga circa 300 m e larga fino a 50 metri. &Egrave; separato da molti moli. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di ciottoli e hai anche del cemento. La pendenza della spiaggia si trova sul punto di ingresso dell&#39;acqua molto ripida, ma &egrave; possibile nuotare immediatamente. Hai molti servizi di spiaggia qui disponibili. Ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia sono disponibili anche qui. Per l&#39;alloggio hai molti hotel e appartamenti di ogni tipo disponibili in tutto l&#39;ambiente circostante.', 3700, 'it', 1),
(1014, 'La citt&agrave; albanese Saranda &egrave; famosa per il suo impulso turistico. La concentrazione dell&#39;hotel qui &egrave; molto alta, cos&igrave; come il numero di spiagge e altre strutture turistiche, per rendere il vostro soggiorno il pi&ugrave; piacevole possibile. Abbiamo visitato la spiaggia Saranda n. 7 che si trova proprio nel centro della citt&agrave; ed &egrave; classificato come una spiaggia per famiglie. &Egrave; possibile parcheggiare l&#39;auto lungo la strada o in alcuni posti auto privati. Sul lungomare, che divide la spiaggia dalla strada, troverete molti negozi, ristoranti, bar e i famosi bistrot di fast food albanesi. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di ghiaia e hai a disposizione 200 m di lunghezza e fino a 30 m di larghezza. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e confortevole e il nuoto inizia gi&agrave; dopo 5 m dall&#39;ingresso nell&#39;acqua. Tutti i tipi di infrastrutture balneari sono qui a tua disposizione. Non avrai problemi a trovare un alloggio qui, ce ne sono cos&igrave; tanti e hai molti tipi diversi tra cui scegliere, e il fatto migliore &egrave; che sono tutti a pochi metri dalla tua spiaggia.', 3701, 'it', 1),
(1015, 'La citt&agrave; albanese Saranda si trova nella regione di Valona. Le spiagge di questa citt&agrave; sono famose per molti servizi di spiaggia che offrono ai turisti. Se sei tu a cui piace trascorrere le vacanze in un hotel direttamente sulla spiaggia, questa citt&agrave; &egrave; quella giusta per te. Anche la spiaggia Plazhi Sarand&euml; 4 appartiene a questa categoria. &Egrave; facilmente accessibile con un veicolo e il parcheggio pu&ograve; essere effettuato direttamente sulla spiaggia in un parcheggio privato o un po &#39;su per la strada. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga circa 400 me larga fino a 20 metri ed &egrave; divisa in pi&ugrave; parti. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di ghiaia e in alcuni punti hai anche del cemento. L&#39;inclinazione della pendenza &egrave; normale e puoi nuotare immediatamente. Qui hai molti servizi di spiaggia disponibili. Ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia sono disponibili anche qui. Per l&#39;alloggio hai molti hotel e appartamenti disponibili. Un disco bar con una pista da ballo si trova nelle vicinanze, quindi se ti piace fare festa, sei il benvenuto.', 3702, 'it', 1),
(1016, 'La citt&agrave; albanese Saranda si trova nella regione di Valona. Le spiagge di questa citt&agrave; sono famose per molti servizi che offrono ai turisti. Se sei tu a cui piace trascorrere le vacanze in un hotel direttamente sulla spiaggia, questa citt&agrave; &egrave; quella giusta per te. Anche la spiaggia Plazhi Sarand&euml; 2 appartiene a questa categoria. &Egrave; facilmente accessibile con un veicolo e il parcheggio pu&ograve; essere effettuato direttamente sulla spiaggia in un parcheggio privato o un po &#39;su per la strada. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga circa 300 me larga fino a 30 metri ed &egrave; divisa in pi&ugrave; parti. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di ghiaia fine e ci sono anche alcuni punti concreti, molto comuni per le spiagge di questa citt&agrave;. L&#39;inclinazione della pendenza &egrave; normale e puoi nuotare immediatamente. Hai anche un molo qui che &egrave; in estate utilizzato per saltare in acqua. L&#39;acqua qui &egrave; molto profonda, quindi &egrave; sicuro saltare. Hai molti servizi di spiaggia disponibili qui, puoi anche noleggiare un lettino e un ombrellone. Ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia sono disponibili anche qui. Per l&#39;alloggio hai molti hotel e appartamenti disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia.', 3703, 'it', 1),
(1017, 'Appena fuori dalla citt&agrave; albanese di Saranda, hai una bellissima spiaggia con il nome Plazhi Gjiri Sarand&euml; per trascorrere le tue vacanze estive in Albania. A causa del modo in cui &egrave; realizzato, le diverse forme che lo definiscono, la sabbia bianca, lo rende molto speciale e molto attraente. Scattare una foto speciale con te sulla spiaggia &egrave; la spiaggia perfetta. Si trova nella regione di Valona. Se sei tu a cui piace trascorrere le tue vacanze in un hotel direttamente sulla spiaggia, questa spiaggia &egrave; quella giusta per te. L&#39;accessibilit&agrave; con un veicolo &egrave; facile e il parcheggio pu&ograve; essere effettuato direttamente in spiaggia su un parcheggio privato. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga circa 100 metri e larga fino a 50 metri. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia bianca e cemento. L&#39;inclinazione della pendenza &egrave; normale e puoi nuotare immediatamente. Hai anche un molo qui che &egrave; in estate utilizzato per saltare in acqua. L&#39;acqua qui &egrave; molto profonda, quindi &egrave; sicuro saltare. Hai molti servizi di spiaggia qui disponibili, puoi anche noleggiare un lettino e un ombrellone. Qui sono disponibili anche un ristorante dell&#39;hotel e un bar sulla spiaggia. Per l&#39;alloggio hai un hotel direttamente sulla spiaggia e alcuni appartamenti disponibili nelle vicinanze.', 3704, 'it', 1),
(1018, 'Vicino al villaggio albanese Borsh hai una spiaggia di ghiaia bianca lunga pochi chilometri per goderti le tue meritate vacanze. La posizione della spiaggia &egrave; nella regione di Valona. La spiaggia &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con un veicolo, anche i camper sono i benvenuti qui, e puoi parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia dalla strada. La spiaggia &egrave; larga circa 30 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di nuoto inizia quasi immediatamente. Hai molti servizi in spiaggia disponibili, soprattutto nei bar e ristoranti sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile anche direttamente sulla spiaggia, sotto forma di appartamenti, un hotel &egrave; anche qui e hai anche un campeggio.', 3705, 'it', 1),
(1019, 'In der N&auml;he des albanischen Dorfes Borsh haben Sie ein paar Kilometer langen wei&szlig;en feinen Kiesstrand, um Ihren wohlverdienten Urlaub zu genie&szlig;en. Die Lage des Strandes ist in der Region Vlor&euml;. Der Strand ist mit dem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen, auch Wohnmobile sind hier willkommen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand bei der Stra&szlig;e parken. Der Strand ist rund 30 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt beginnt fast sofort. Sie haben auf dem Strand viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, insbesondere rund um die Strandbars und Restaurants. Die Unterkunft ist auch direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar, in Form von Apartments, ein Hotel ist auch hier und Sie haben sogar einen Campingplatz.', 3705, 'de', 1),
(1020, 'V bližini albanske vasi Borsh imate nekaj kilometrov dolgo belo gramozno plažo, na kateri lahko uživate v svojih zasluženih počitnicah. Lokacija plaže je v regiji Vlor&euml;. Dostop do plaže je enostaven in sem se lahko pripeljete za katerikolim vozilom, tu so dobrodo&scaron;li tudi avtodomi, parkirate pa lahko neposredno pri plaži ob cesti. Plaža je &scaron;iroka približno 30 metrov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in točka plavanja se začne skoraj takoj. Na plaži&nbsp; imate na voljo &scaron;tevilne storitve , &scaron;e posebej v bližini plažnih barov in restavracij. Nastanitev je na voljo tudi neposredno na plaži, v obliki apartmajev, tukaj je tudi hotel in prav tako en kamp.', 3705, 'sl', 1),
(1021, 'U blizini albanskog sela Borsh imate nekoliko kilometara dugu bijelu &scaron;ljunkovitu plažu na kojoj možete uživati u svom zasluženom odmoru. Plaža se nalazi u regiji Vlor&euml;. Pristup plaži je jednostavan i možete se voziti iza bilo kojeg vozila, ovdje su također dobrodo&scaron;li avtodomi, a na plaži možete parkirati direktno uz cestu. Plaža je &scaron;iroka oko 30 metara. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i točka plivanja počinje gotovo odmah. Na plaži je dostupno mno&scaron;tvo usluga, osobito u blizini barova na plaži i restorana. Smje&scaron;taj je također dostupan direktno na plaži, u obliku apartmana, tu je i hotel te također jedan kamp.', 3705, 'hr', 1),
(1022, 'Nur ein wenig au&szlig;erhalb der albanischen Stadt Sarand&euml; haben Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Strand mit dem Namen Plazhi Gjiri Sarand&euml;, wo Sie Ihre Sommerferien in Albanien verbringen k&ouml;nnen. Aufgrund der Art und Weise, wie der Strand gebaut ist, die verschiedenen Formen, der wei&szlig;e Sand, macht es diesen Strand sehr speziell und sehr attraktiv. Wenn Sie ein besonderes Foto am Strand machen m&ouml;chten, ist dieser Strand einfach perfekt. Es befindet sich in der Region Vlor&euml;. Wenn Sie Ihren Urlaub in einem Hotel direkt am Strand verbringen m&ouml;chten, ist dieser Strand der richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Die Erreichbarkeit mit einem Fahrzeug ist einfach und das Parken kann direkt am Strand auf einem privaten Parkplatz erfolgen. Der Strand ist rund 100 m lang und bis zu 50 m breit. Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist wei&szlig;er Sand sowie Beton. Die Neigung des Abhangs ist normal und Sie k&ouml;nnen sofort wegschwimmen. Hier gibt es auch einen Pier, an dem im Sommer ins Wasser gesprungen wird. Das Wasser hier ist sehr tief, so dass man sicher springen kann. Sie haben hier viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, Sie k&ouml;nnen auch eine Sonnenliege und einen Sonnenschirm mieten. Ein Hotelrestaurant und eine Strandbar sind ebenfalls vorhanden. F&uuml;r die Unterkunft haben Sie ein Hotel direkt am Strand und einige Apartments in der N&auml;he.', 3704, 'de', 1),
(1023, 'Le malo izven albanskega mesta Sarand&euml; imate čudovito plažo z imenom Plazhi Gjiri Sarand&euml;, kjer lahko preživite svoje poletne počitnice v Albaniji. Zaradi načina izdelave plaže, različnih&nbsp; in atraktivnih oblik, belega peska, naredi to plažo zelo posebno in zelo privlačno. Če želite imeti za svoj instagram profil lepo fotografijo na plaži je to plaža naravnost popolna. Nahaja se v regiji Vlor&euml;. Če ste tisti, ki radi preživite počitnice v hotelu neposredno na plaži, je ta plaža prav tako idealna za vas. Dostopnost z vozilom je enostavna, parkiranje pa je mogoče neposredno na plaži na zasebnem parkiri&scaron;ču. Plaža je dolga približno 100 m in &scaron;iroka do 50 metrov. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je bel pesek in beton. Nagib pobočja je običajen in tukaj lahko takoj zaplavate. Tu imate tudi pomol, ki se poleti uporablja za skok v vodo. Voda je tu zelo globoka, tako da je varno skakati. Tu imate na voljo &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži, najamete si lahko tudi ležalnik in senčnik. Tu sta na voljo tudi hotelska restavracija in bar na plaži. Za namestitev imate hotel neposredno na plaži, v bližini pa so na voljo tudi apartmaji.', 3704, 'sl', 1),
(1024, 'Neposredno izvan albanskog grada Sarande, imate prekrasnu plažu nazvanu Plazhi Gjiri Sarand&euml;, gdje možete provesti svoj ljetni odmor u Albaniji. Zbog načina na koji je plaža napravljena, zbog različitih i atraktivnih oblika, bijelog pijeska, ova plaža čini je posebnom i vrlo atraktivnom. Ako želite imati lijepu fotografiju na plaži za svoj instagram profil, ova plaža je savr&scaron;ena. Smje&scaron;ten u regiji Vlor&euml;. Ako ste vi koji volite provesti svoj odmor u hotelu direktno na plaži, ova je plaža idealna i za vas. Pristup automobilom je jednostavan, a parkiranje je moguće direktno na plaži na privatnom parkingu. Plaža je dugačka oko 100 metara i &scaron;iroka do 50 metara. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je bijeli pijesak i beton. Nagib padine je normalan i ovdje možete plivati. Imate i pristani&scaron;te koje se ljeti koristi za skok u vodu. Voda je ovdje vrlo duboka, pa je sigurno skočiti. Mnogobrojne usluge na plaži dostupne su ovdje, možete unajmiti ležaljku i suncobran. Tu je i hotelski restoran i bar na plaži. Imate hotel odmah na plaži za svoj smje&scaron;taj, a u blizini su apartmani.', 3704, 'hr', 1),
(1025, 'In Montenegro haben Sie viele Str&auml;nde, die Sie nach Ihren W&uuml;nschen ausw&auml;hlen k&ouml;nnen. Dieser Strand, der sich in der Stadt Bar befindet und auch Teil der Region Bar ist, ist aufgrund des Kiefernwaldes, der f&uuml;r Sie direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar ist, sehr einzigartig. Es gibt hier nicht viele solcher Arten. Der Name des Strandes ist plaža &Scaron;u&scaron;anj und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand parken, wo Sie einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz haben. Auch Wohnmobile sind hier willkommen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand sind kleine Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben auch etwas Sand eingemischt. Sie haben auch viele Kiefern direkt am Strand, um Sie vor der Sonne zu sch&uuml;tzen. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und man kann fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt einen Kilometer und kann bis zu 20 Meter breit sein. Sie haben eine Menge Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen direkt am Strand. Die Unterkunft befindet sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Apartments und einigen Hotels.', 3763, 'de', 1),
(1026, 'In Montenegro hai molte spiagge che puoi selezionare in base ai tuoi desideri. Questa spiaggia, che si trova nel Bar della citt&agrave;, e fa anche parte del Bar della regione, &egrave; davvero unica, a causa della pineta, che &egrave; disponibile per te direttamente sulla spiaggia. Non ce ne sono molti di questo tipo qui intorno. Il nome della spiaggia &egrave; plaža &Scaron;u&scaron;anj ed &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. &Egrave; possibile parcheggiare direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia dove si trova un ampio parcheggio, anche i camper sono i benvenuti qui. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di piccoli ciottoli, ma hai anche un po &#39;di sabbia mescolata con dentro. Hai anche molti pini direttamente sulla spiaggia per proteggerti dal sole. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi iniziare a nuotare quasi immediatamente. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di un chilometro e pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 20 metri. Hai molte infrastrutture e servizi sulla spiaggia disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. Gli alloggi sono anche nelle vicinanze, principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti e alcuni hotel.', 3763, 'it', 1),
(1027, 'V Črni gori imate veliko plaž, ki jih lahko izberete glede na va&scaron;e želje. Ta plaža, ki se nahaja v mestecu Bar in je tudi del regije Bar, je zaradi borovega gozda, ta je na voljo neposredno na plaži, zelo edinstvena. Tu naokoli ni veliko tak&scaron;nih. Ime plaže je plaža &Scaron;u&scaron;anj, do katere se da&nbsp; enostavno priti s katerim koli vozilom. Parkirate lahko neposredno pred plažo, kjer imate veliko parkirno mesto, tu so dobrodo&scaron;li tudi avtodomi. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži so majhni prodniki, vmes pa je tudi nekaj peska, ki je pome&scaron;an med kamenčke. Na plaži imate tudi veliko borovcev, ki vas &scaron;čitijo pred soncem. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in z plavanjem lahko začnete skoraj takoj. Skupna dolžina plaže je en kilometer, &scaron;iroka je lahko tudi do 20 metrov. Na plaži imate na voljo veliko plažne infrastrukture in nekaj storitev. V bližini imate tudi možnost nastanitve, predvsem v obliki apartmajev in nekaj hotelov.', 3763, 'sl', 1),
(1028, 'U Crnoj Gori ima mnogo plaža koje možete birati prema va&scaron;im željama. Ova plaža koja se nalazi u gradu Baru i također je dio bara, vrlo je jedinstvena zbog borove &scaron;ume koja je dostupna direktno na plaži. Nema nas mnogo ovdje. Naziv plaže je plaža Susanj koja je lako dostupna bilo kojim vozilom. Parkirati možete direktno ispred plaže, gdje imate veliko parkirno mjesto, a dobrodo&scaron;li su i kamp kućice. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže su mali &scaron;ljunci, a između njih se nalazi pijesak pomije&scaron;an sa &scaron;ljunkom. Na plaži se nalazi i mnogo borovih stabala koje vas &scaron;tite od sunca. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i možete početi plivati gotovo odmah. Ukupna dužina plaže je jedan kilometar, a može biti &scaron;iroka i do 20 metara. Na plaži ima dosta infrastrukture na plaži i neke usluge. Imate i smje&scaron;taj u blizini, posebno u obliku apartmana i nekoliko hotela.', 3763, 'hr', 1),
(1029, 'Der Strand mit dem Namen Plaža Mrčele geh&ouml;rt zur Kategorie der Sonderstr&auml;nde. Es ist sehr einzigartig, wie es sich pr&auml;sentiert und was sie umgibt. Es befindet sich in der montenegrinischen Region Bar, etwas au&szlig;erhalb der Stadt Bar. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten Ihr Fahrzeug zu parken. Entweder Sie machen es an der Stra&szlig;e oder auf einigen privaten Parkpl&auml;tzen in Strandn&auml;he. Von der Stra&szlig;e m&uuml;ssen Sie etwa 20 Meter hoch absteigen, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes sind kleine Kieselsteine. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt 200 Meter und es ist nur 5 Meter breit, sehr schmal. Die Neigung des Abhangs liegt zwischen normal und steil, und das Schwimmen beginnt fast sofort. Der Strand ist von 2 Geb&auml;uden umgeben, die Strandbars sind, und dort haben Sie auch die Strandinfrastruktur und einige Dienstleistungen. Die Unterbringung erfolgt nicht direkt am Strand, sondern im Hintergrund auf der anderen Stra&szlig;enseite, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Apartments.', 3764, 'de', 1),
(1030, 'La spiaggia con il nome Plaža Mrčele appartiene alla categoria delle spiagge speciali. &Egrave; davvero unico il modo in cui si presenta e ci&ograve; che la circonda. Si trova nella regione del Montenegro Bar, appena fuori dal bar della citt&agrave;. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e hai diverse opzioni per parcheggiare il tuo veicolo. O lo fai sulla strada o, in alcuni parcheggi privati vicino alla spiaggia. Dalla strada &egrave; necessario scendere per circa 20 metri in altezza per raggiungere la spiaggia. La superficie principale della spiaggia sono piccoli ciottoli. La lunghezza totale &egrave; di 200 metri ed &egrave; larga solo 5 metri, molto stretta. L&#39;inclinazione della pendenza &egrave; tra normale e ripida e il nuoto inizia quasi immediatamente. La spiaggia &egrave; circondata da 2 edifici, che sono bar sulla spiaggia e l&igrave; hai anche l&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia e alcuni servizi. La sistemazione non &egrave; disponibile direttamente sulla spiaggia ma sullo sfondo dall&#39;altra parte della strada, principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti.', 3764, 'it', 1),
(1031, 'Plaža z imenom Mrčele spada v kategorijo posebnih plaž. Zelo edinstven je način, kako se predstavlja in kaj jo obdaja. Nahaja se v črnogorski regiji Bar, le malo zunaj mesta Bar. Prihod do plaže je možen z katerimkoli vozilom in pred plažo imate več možnosti za parkiranje vozila. Ali to storite ob cesti ali na nekaterih zasebnih parkirnih mestih v bližini plaže. S ceste se morate spustiti približno 20 metrov v vi&scaron;ino, da pridete do plaže. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže so majhni prodniki. Skupna dolžina je 200 metrov, &scaron;iroka je le 5 metrov, res ozka. Naklon strmine je med običajnim in strmim, plavanje pa se začne skoraj takoj. Plažo obdajata dve zgradbi, ki sta bara na plaži in tam imate tudi plažno infrastrukturo in nekaj storitev. Nastanitev ni na voljo neposredno na plaži, ampak v ozadju na drugi strani ceste, predvsem v obliki apartmajev.', 3764, 'sl', 1),
(1032, 'Plaža po imenu Mrcele spada u kategoriju posebnih plaža. Način na koji se predstavlja i &scaron;to je okružuje vrlo je jedinstven. Smje&scaron;ten u crnogorskom predjelu Bara, odmah izvan grada Bar. Dolazak na plažu moguć je bilo kojim vozilom, a postoji nekoliko mogućnosti za parkiranje automobila ispred plaže. Učinite to pored puta ili na nekim privatnim parkirali&scaron;tima u blizini plaže. S ceste se morate spustiti oko 20 metara visine da biste do&scaron;li do plaže. Glavno područje plaže su mali &scaron;ljunak. Ukupna duljina je 200 metara, &scaron;iroka je samo 5 metara, stvarno uska. Nagib padine je između normalnog i strmog, a plivanje počinje gotovo odmah. Plažu okružuju dvije zgrade, to su beach barovi, a postoji i infrastruktura za plažu i neke usluge. Smje&scaron;taj nije dostupan direktno na plaži, već u pozadini s druge strane ceste, posebno u obliku apartmana.', 3764, 'hr', 1),
(1033, 'Le spiagge del Montenegro sono generalmente fatte di ciottoli bianchi, ma questa spiaggia con il nome Plaža Crvena &egrave; speciale, &egrave; diversa, perch&eacute; i ciottoli qui sono di colore rosso. Si trova nella regione Bar e non &egrave; lontano dal bar della citt&agrave;. La spiaggia &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si dispone di un parcheggio proprio accanto alla strada, direttamente sulla spiaggia. Per raggiungere la spiaggia &egrave; necessario scendere alcuni gradini verso la spiaggia, con un dislivello di 15 metri. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia sono piccoli ciottoli rossi. La posizione &egrave; lunga 100 metri e larga fino a 10 metri. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; piacevole e si pu&ograve; nuotare subito. Hai un bar sulla spiaggia direttamente sulla spiaggia, dove hai anche alcuni servizi in spiaggia. Direttamente sulla spiaggia hai anche la possibilit&agrave; di affittare alcuni appartamenti.', 3765, 'it', 1),
(1034, 'Die Str&auml;nde in Montenegro bestehen normalerweise aus wei&szlig;en Kieselsteinen, aber dieser Strand mit dem Namen Plaža Crvena ist etwas Besonderes, er ist anders, weil die Kieselsteine hier rot gef&auml;rbt sind. Es befindet sich in der Region Bar und ist nicht weit von der Stadt Bar entfernt. Der Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen Parkplatz direkt neben der Stra&szlig;e, direkt am Strand. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie einige Schritte nach unten zum Strand mit einem H&ouml;henunterschied von 15 Metern gehen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand sind rote kleine Kieselsteine. Der Standort ist 100 Meter lang und bis zu 10 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und man kann sofort wegschwimmen. Sie haben eine Strandbar direkt am Strand, wo Sie auch einige Stranddienstleistungen haben. Direkt am Strand haben Sie auch die M&ouml;glichkeit, einige Apartments zu mieten.', 3765, 'de', 1),
(1035, 'Plaže v Črni gori so običajno narejene iz belih kamenčkov, vendar je ta plaža, z imenom Plaža Crvena posebna, drugačna je, saj so kamenčki tukaj rdeče obarvani. Nahaja se v regiji Bar in je nedaleč stran od mesta Bar. Do plaže se lahko pripeljete s kakr&scaron;nim koli vozilom, parkirno mesto pa imate tik ob cesti, neposredno ob plaži. Če želite priti do plaže, morate narediti nekaj korakov navzdol do plaže, z vi&scaron;insko razliko 15 metrov. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži so rdeči majhni kamenčki, pa tudi nekaj skal se bo na&scaron;lo. Lokacija je dolga 100 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 10 metrov. Vstop v vodo je lep in plavati lahko začnete takoj. Na plaži sami se nahaja tudi plažni bar, kjer vam je na voljo tudi nekaj dodatnih storitev. Neposredno na plaži imate tudi možnost najema apartmajev.', 3765, 'sl', 1),
(1036, 'Plaže u Crnoj Gori obično su napravljene od bijelog &scaron;ljunka, ali ova se plaža, koja se zove Crvena plaža, razlikuje po tome &scaron;to su &scaron;ljunci ovdje crvene boje. Smje&scaron;ten u regiji Bar, a nedaleko od grada Bar. Do plaže se možete voziti bilo kojim vozilom, a parkirno mjesto imate odmah pored ceste, odmah do plaže. Da biste do&scaron;li do plaže, morate napraviti nekoliko stepenica do plaže, s visinskom razlikom od 15 metara. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže crveni su mali &scaron;ljunak, a naći će se i neke stijene. Lokacija je dugačka 100 metara i &scaron;iroka do 10 metara. Ulazak u vodu je lijep i odmah možete početi plivati. Na plaži se nalazi i bar na plaži, gdje možete uživati i u nekim dodatnim uslugama. Izravno na plaži također imate mogućnost iznajmljivanja apartmana.', 3765, 'hr', 1),
(1037, 'In diesem Teil Montenegros befinden sich viele Str&auml;nde direkt neben der Hauptstra&szlig;e. Mehr oder weniger sind sie Kiesstr&auml;nde, sie sind klein, aber sehr romantisch. Gleiches gilt f&uuml;r den Strand Črvanj. Es befindet sich in der Region Bar in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Sutomore. Es ist sehr leicht mit einem Fahrzeug es zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Der Eingang zum Strand ist sehr gut organisiert, ebenso wie der gesamte Ort, der diesen Strand verwaltet. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 200 Meter und ist 5 Meter breit. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che sind Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben auch einige Steine und Sand. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und man kann sofort wegschwimmen. Sie haben viele Stranddienstleistungen direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar, sowie ein Restaurant, das f&uuml;r gute Meeresfr&uuml;chte bekannt ist. Die Apartments stehen nicht direkt am Strand, sondern in der Umgebung zur Verf&uuml;gung.', 3766, 'de', 1),
(1038, 'In questa parte del Montenegro ci sono molte spiagge situate proprio accanto alla strada principale. Pi&ugrave; o meno sono spiagge di ciottoli, sono piccole, ma molto romantiche. Lo stesso vale per la spiaggia di Črvanj. Si trova nella regione Bar vicino al villaggio di Sutomore. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con un veicolo e puoi parcheggiare accanto alla strada. L&#39;ingresso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto organizzato, cos&igrave; come l&#39;intero posto che gestisce questa spiaggia. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 200 metri ed &egrave; larga 5 metri. La superficie principale &egrave; di ciottoli, ma hai anche alcune rocce e sabbia. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi nuotare subito. Hai molti servizi sulla spiaggia disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia, cos&igrave; come un ristorante, che &egrave; famoso per i buoni frutti di mare. Gli appartamenti non sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma nell&#39;area circostante.', 3766, 'it', 1),
(1039, 'V tem delu Črne gore imate veliko plaž, ki se nahajajo tik ob glavni cesti. Bolj ali manj so prodnate plaže, majhne so, a zelo romantične. Enako velja za plažo Črvanj. Nahaja se v regiji Bar v bližini vasi Sutomore. Do njega je zelo enostavno priti z vsakim vozilom, ki ga lahko parkirate ob cesti. Vhod na plažo je zelo urejen in tako tudi celoten kraj in osebje, ki upravlja s to plažo. Skupna dolžina plaže je 200 metrov, &scaron;iroka pa je 5 metrov. Glavna povr&scaron;ina so prodniki, imate pa tudi nekaj skal in peska. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavati lahko začnete takoj. Na voljo imate &scaron;tevilne plažne storitve neposredno na plaži, pa tudi restavracijo, ki slovi po dobri morski hrani. Apartmaji niso na voljo neposredno na plaži, ampak v okolici.', 3766, 'sl', 1),
(1040, 'U ovom dijelu Crne Gore imate brojne plaže koje se nalaze tik uz glavnu cestu. Vi&scaron;e-manje &scaron;ljunčane plaže su male, ali vrlo romantične. Isto vrijedi i za plažu Crvanj. Nalazi se u regiji Bar, u blizini sela Sutomore. Vrlo je lako doći do svakog vozila koje možete parkirati sa strane ceste. Ulaz na plažu je vrlo uredan, pa tako i cijelo mjesto i osoblje koje upravlja plažom. Ukupna dužina plaže je 200 metara, a &scaron;iroka je 5 metara. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je &scaron;ljunak, ali imate i nekoliko stijena i pijeska. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i odmah možete početi plivati. Možete uživati u mnogim uslugama na plaži odmah na plaži, kao i u restoranu koji je poznat po dobroj morskoj hrani. Apartmani nisu dostupni direktno na plaži već u okolini.', 3766, 'hr', 1),
(1041, 'Die montenegrinische Stadt Sutomore ist bekannt f&uuml;r ihren touristischen Charakter. Es hat einen sehr sch&ouml;nen, einen Kilometer langen Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r das menschliche Auge sehr attraktiv ist. Die Region, in der sich der Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Bar. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, dort zu parken. Wohnmobile finden auch einen Platz. Einige tun es auf dem gro&szlig;en &ouml;ffentlichen Parkplatz, einige an der Stra&szlig;e und einige auf privaten Pl&auml;tzen. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes Sand ist, sind auch einige Kieselsteine eingemischt. Die maximale Breite des Strandes betr&auml;gt 40 Meter. Die Neigung des Abhangs ist normal, ebenso wie der Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 5 Metern. Sie haben viele Strandinfrastrukturen und Stranddienstleistungen entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts. Hier gibt es viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants und Strandbars. Die Unterkunft befindet sich auch direkt am Strand, haupts&auml;chlich als Hotels oder Apartments.', 3767, 'de', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1042, 'La citt&agrave; del Montenegro Sutomore &egrave; nota per il suo carattere turistico. Ha una bellissima spiaggia di sabbia lunga un chilometro, che &egrave; molto attraente per l&#39;occhio umano. La regione in cui si trova la spiaggia si chiama Bar. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e hai pi&ugrave; opzioni per parcheggiare l&igrave;, anche i camper troveranno posto. Alcuni lo fanno nell&#39;ampio parcheggio pubblico, altri lungo la strada e altri in luoghi privati. Anche se la superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia, ci sono anche alcuni ciottoli mescolati con dentro. La massima larghezza della spiaggia &egrave; di 40 metri. L&#39;inclinazione della pendenza &egrave; normale, cos&igrave; come l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua e il punto di nuoto &egrave; di circa 5 metri. Hai molte infrastrutture e servizi di spiaggia disponibili lungo tutto il tratto di spiaggia. Qui sono disponibili molti diversi tipi di ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; anche direttamente sulla spiaggia principalmente come hotel o appartamenti.', 3767, 'it', 1),
(1043, 'Črnogorsko mesto Sutomore je znano po svojem turističnem značaju. Ima zelo lepo, kilometer dolgo pe&scaron;čeno plažo, ki je zelo privlačna za člove&scaron;ko oko. Regija, v kateri se nahaja plaža, se imenuje Bar. Do te lokacije se lahko pripeljete z vsemi tipi vozil, kjer imate na voljo več možnosti za parkiranje, avtodomi bodo na&scaron;li tudi nekaj prostora. Nekateri parkirajo na velikem javnem parkiri&scaron;ču, nekateri ob cesti in nekateri na zasebnih mestih. Čeprav je glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži pesek, imate tudi nekaj kamenčkov pome&scaron;anih v pesek. Največja &scaron;irina plaže je 40 metrov. Naklon plaže je normalen, tak&scaron;en je tudi vstop v vodo in točka plavanja je pri približno 5 metrih. Na celotnem delu plaže imate na voljo veliko plažne infrastrukture in storitve na plaži. Tukaj je na voljo veliko različnih vrst restavracij in barov na plaži. Nastanitev je na voljo tudi neposredno na plaži, predvsem v obliki hotelov ali apartmajev.', 3767, 'sl', 1),
(1044, 'Crnogorski grad Sutomore poznat je po svom turističkom značaju. Ima vrlo lijepu, kilometražu pje&scaron;čanu plažu koja je vrlo privlačna ljudskom oku. Regija u kojoj se nalazi plaža zove se Bar. Na ovu lokaciju možete doći sa svim vrstama vozila, gdje imate vi&scaron;e mogućnosti za parkiranje, kućice za kućice također će pronaći malo prostora. Neki parkiraju na velikom javnom parkirali&scaron;tu, neki uz cestu, a neki na privatnim mjestima. Iako je glavni dio plaže pijesak, imate i ne&scaron;to &scaron;ljunka pomije&scaron;anih u pijesku. Maksimalna &scaron;irina plaže je 40 metara. Nagib plaže je normalan, pa je i ulaz u vodu, a točka plivanja je na oko 5 metara. Na plaži je na raspolaganju mno&scaron;tvo plažne infrastrukture i usluga na plaži. Mnogo je različitih vrsta restorana i barova na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj je također dostupan direktno na plaži, uglavnom u obliku hotela ili apartmana.', 3767, 'hr', 1),
(1045, 'Nicht weit von der Stadt Sutomore entfernt befindet sich ein ganz besonderer Strand namens plaža &Scaron;trbina. Es befindet sich in der Region Bar und ist f&uuml;r den Abenteuertyp geeignet. Es ist sehr einfach den Strand mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto auf einem unbefestigten Parkplatz fast direkt vor dem Strand stehen lassen. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie einige Betonstufen verwenden, die einen H&ouml;henunterschied von etwa 25 Metern zum Strand aufweisen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che sind kleine Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben auch einige Felsen, von denen Sie auch ins kristallklare Wasser springen k&ouml;nnen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 100 Meter und die Breite 15 Meter. Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten um ins Wasser zu gelangen. Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder springen oder am Strand entlanggehen und fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Einige Stranddienstleistungen sind am Strand verf&uuml;gbar, aber sie sind nur einfach. Im Sommer haben Sie hier vielleicht eine Strandbar. Unterkunft ist auch hier verf&uuml;gbar, jedoch nur in Form von Apartments.', 3768, 'de', 1),
(1046, 'Non lontano dalla citt&agrave; di Sutomore, hai una spiaggia molto speciale, chiamata plaža &Scaron;trbina. Si trova nella regione Bar ed &egrave; adatto per il tipo di utente avventura. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi lasciare l&#39;auto in un parcheggio sterrato quasi direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. Per accedere alla spiaggia &egrave; necessario utilizzare alcuni gradini in cemento che scendono di circa 25 metri di dislivello rispetto alla spiaggia. La superficie principale &egrave; di piccoli ciottoli, ma hai anche delle rocce da cui puoi anche saltare nell&#39;acqua cristallina. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 100 metri e la larghezza &egrave; di 15 metri. Hai pi&ugrave; opzioni per entrare in acqua. Puoi saltare o andare in spiaggia e puoi iniziare a nuotare quasi immediatamente. Alcuni servizi in spiaggia sono disponibili sulla spiaggia, ma sono solo di base. In estate potresti avere qui un bar sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile anche qui, ma solo sotto forma di appartamenti.', 3768, 'it', 1),
(1047, 'Nedaleč stran od mesta Sutomore imate čisto posebno plažo, imenovano plaža &Scaron;trbina. Nahaja se v regiji Bar in je primerna za uporabnika, ki je bolj pustolovske vrste. Do plaže se da zelo enostavno priti s katerim koli vozilom in avtomobil lahko pustite na neutrjenem parkiri&scaron;ču skoraj neposredno pred plažo. Za dostop do plaže morate uporabiti nekaj betonskih stopnic, ki se spu&scaron;čajo okoli 25 metrov vi&scaron;inske razlike do plaže. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži so majhni prodniki, vendar imate tudi nekaj skal, iz katerih lahko skočite v kristalno čisto vodo. Skupna dolžina plaže je 100 metrov, &scaron;irina pa 15 metrov. Na voljo imate več možnosti za vstop v vodo. Lahko skočite ali greste v vodo iz plaže, v vsakem primeru, pa lahko začnete plavati skoraj takoj. Nekatere plažne storitve so na voljo na plaži, vendar so le osnovne. V poletnem času se morda tukaj nahaja tudi bar na plaži. Tukaj je na voljo tudi nastanitev, vendar le v obliki apartmajev.', 3768, 'sl', 1),
(1048, 'Nedaleko od grada Sutomore imate vrlo posebnu plažu koja se zove plaža Strbina. Nalazi se u regiji Bar i pogodan je za avanturističnijeg korisnika. Do plaže je vrlo lako doći bilo kojim vozilom, a automobil možete ostaviti na neodređenom parkirali&scaron;tu gotovo direktno ispred plaže. Za pristup plaži morate koristiti betonske stepenice koje se spu&scaron;taju oko 25 metara visine do plaže. Glavno područje plaže su mali &scaron;ljunak, ali imate i nekoliko stijena iz kojih možete skočiti u kristalno čistu vodu. Ukupna dužina plaže je 100 metara, a &scaron;irina 15 metara. Imate vi&scaron;e mogućnosti za ulazak u vodu. Možete skočiti ili otići do vode s plaže, u svakom slučaju, možete početi plivati gotovo odmah. Neke usluge na plaži dostupne su na plaži, ali su osnovne. Ljeti ovdje može biti i beach bar. Ovdje je dostupan i smje&scaron;taj, ali samo u obliku apartmana.', 3768, 'hr', 1),
(1049, 'Nicht weit von der Stadt Sutomore entfernt befindet sich ein ganz besonderer Strand namens Plaža Maljevik. Es ist auch etwas Besonderes, dass das andere Ende des Strandes Nudisten / Naturisten vorbehalten ist. Es befindet sich in der Region Bar und ist f&uuml;r den Abenteuertyp geeignet. Es ist sehr einfach ihn mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto auf einem unbefestigten Parkplatz nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt abstellen. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie einige Betonstufen verwenden, die einen H&ouml;henunterschied von etwa 25 Metern zum Strand und eine L&auml;nge von etwa 100 Metern aufweisen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand sind kleine Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben dort auch einige Felsen. An einigen Stellen des Strandes gibt es sogar B&auml;ume. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 300 Meter und die maximale Breite 10 Meter. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt je nachdem, wo Sie sich am Strand befinden, zwischen 10 und 20 Metern. Einige Stranddienstleistungen sind hier verf&uuml;gbar, jedoch nur im Basismodus. Im Sommer haben Sie hier vielleicht auch eine Strandbar. Unterk&uuml;nfte sind ebenfalls verf&uuml;gbar, jedoch nur in Form von Apartments und Hotels in der N&auml;he des Strandes.', 3769, 'de', 1),
(1050, 'Non lontano dalla citt&agrave; di Sutomore c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia molto speciale, chiamata Plaža Maljevik. &Egrave; speciale anche per il fatto che l&#39;estremit&agrave; della spiaggia &egrave; riservata ai nudisti / naturisti. Si trova nella regione Bar ed &egrave; adatto per il tipo di utente avventura. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi lasciare la tua auto in un parcheggio sterrato a pochi metri dalla spiaggia. Per accedere alla spiaggia &egrave; necessario utilizzare alcuni gradini in cemento, che scendono di circa 25 metri di dislivello rispetto alla spiaggia e di circa 100 metri di lunghezza. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; composta da piccoli ciottoli, ma ci sono anche delle rocce. In alcune parti della spiaggia hai persino degli alberi. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 300 metri e la larghezza massima &egrave; di 10 metri. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a seconda di dove ti trovi sulla spiaggia, tra 10 e 20 metri. Alcuni servizi di spiaggia sono disponibili qui, ma solo in modalit&agrave; base. In estate potresti anche avere qui un bar sulla spiaggia. &Egrave; disponibile anche l&#39;alloggio, ma solo sotto forma di appartamenti e hotel nelle vicinanze della spiaggia.', 3769, 'it', 1),
(1051, 'Nedaleč stran od mesta Sutomore imate prav posebno plažo, imenovano Plaža Maljevik. Posebna je tudi zato, ker je skrajni del plaže rezerviran za nudiste / naturiste. Nahaja se v regiji Bar in je primerna za pustolovskega tipa uporabnika. Do te lokacije se da zelo enostavno priti s katerim koli vozilom, svoj avto pa lahko pustite na neutrjenem parkiri&scaron;ču le nekaj metrov stran od plaže. Za dostop do plaže morate uporabiti nekaj betonskih stopnic, ki se spu&scaron;čajo približno 25 metrov v globino in so dolge približno 100 metrov. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži so majhni prodniki, vendar imate tam tudi nekaj skal. Na nekaterih delih plaže imate celo nekaj dreves. Skupna dolžina plaže je 300 metrov, največja &scaron;irina pa 10 metrov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in kopanje se začne odvisno od mesta na plaži, pri 10 do 20 metrih. Nekatere plažne storitve so na voljo tudi tukaj, vendar le v osnovnem načinu. Poleti imate morda tukaj tudi bar na plaži. Na voljo je tudi nastanitev, vendar le v obliki apartmajev in hotelov v sose&scaron;čini plaže.', 3769, 'sl', 1),
(1052, 'Nedaleko od Sutomora imate posebnu plažu koja se zove Maljevik Beach. Poseban je i po tome &scaron;to je ekstremni dio plaže rezerviran za nudiste / naturiste. Nalazi se u regiji Bar i pogodan je za avanturističkog tipa korisnika. Do ove lokacije se može lako doći bilo kojim vozilom, a svoj automobil možete ostaviti na neasfaltiranom parkirali&scaron;tu samo nekoliko metara od plaže. Za pristup plaži trebate koristiti neke konkretne stepenice koje se spu&scaron;taju oko 25 metara dubine i dugačke su oko 100 metara. Glavno područje plaže su mali &scaron;ljunak, ali ondje imate i nekoliko stijena. Čak imate i drveće u nekim dijelovima plaže. Ukupna dužina plaže je 300 metara, a maksimalna &scaron;irina 10 metara. Pristup vodi je vrlo lijep i kupanje započinje ovisno o mjestu na plaži, na 10 do 20 metara. Ovdje su dostupne i neke usluge na plaži, ali samo u osnovnom načinu. Ljeti ovdje također možete imati beach bar. Također je dostupan i smje&scaron;taj, ali samo u obliku apartmana i hotela u blizini plaže.', 3769, 'hr', 1),
(1053, 'Einer der letzten Str&auml;nde im n&ouml;rdlichen Teil der Region Bar in Montenegro ist der Strand Čanj. Hier haben Sie einen 1 km langen Sandstrand, der an einigen Stellen bis zu 75 Meter breit sein kann. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten hier zu parken. Entweder Sie parken direkt am Strand oder auf einigen privaten Parkpl&auml;tzen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch einige Kieselsteine und Steine mit dem Sand gemischt. Der Hang an diesem Strand hat eine normale Neigung, der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 5 Metern. Sie haben viel Strandinfrastruktur direkt am Strand sowie viele Arten von Restaurants und Strandbars. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, haben Sie viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, wie ein Hotel direkt am Strand und einige Apartments in der N&auml;he.', 3770, 'de', 1),
(1054, 'Una delle ultime spiagge nella parte nord della regione del Montenegro Bar, &egrave; la spiaggia di Čanj. Qui hai una spiaggia sabbiosa lunga 1 km, che pu&ograve; essere in alcuni punti fino a 75 metri di larghezza. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e qui puoi parcheggiare pi&ugrave; opzioni. O parcheggi direttamente sulla spiaggia o in alcuni posti auto privati. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia, ma ci sono anche alcuni ciottoli e pietre mescolati con la sabbia. La pendenza su questa spiaggia ha un&#39;inclinazione normale, l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 5 metri. Hai molte infrastrutture sulla spiaggia direttamente sulla spiaggia, cos&igrave; come molti tipi di ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia. Se desideri rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo, hai molte opzioni, come un hotel direttamente sulla spiaggia e alcuni appartamenti nelle vicinanze.', 3770, 'it', 1),
(1055, 'Ena zadnjih plaž na severnem delu črnogorske regije Bar je plaža Čanj. Tu imate 1 km dolgo pe&scaron;čeno plažo, ki je na nekaterih mestih do 75 metrov &scaron;iroka. Dostop do te lokacije je zelo enostaven in sem se lahko pripeljete s kakr&scaron;nimi koli vozili in tukaj imate več možnosti za parkiranje. Ali parkirate neposredno na plaži ali na nekaterih zasebnih parkirnih mestih. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je pesek, vendar imate tudi nekaj kamenčkov in kamnov pome&scaron;anih s peskom. Pobočje na tej plaži ima običajen naklon, vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne pri približno 5 metrih. Na plaži imate veliko plažne infrastrukture, pa tudi veliko vrst restavracij in barov na plaži. Če bi radi tu ostali dlje, imate na voljo veliko možnosti, kot je hotel neposredno na plaži in nekateri apartmaji v bližini.', 3770, 'sl', 1),
(1056, 'Jedna od posljednjih plaža u sjevernom dijelu crnogorske barske regije je plaža Čanj. Ovdje se nalazi pje&scaron;čana plaža dužine 1 km koja je na nekim mjestima &scaron;iroka i do 75 metara. Pristup ovom mjestu je vrlo jednostavan i ovdje se možete voziti bilo kojim vozilom i imate vi&scaron;e mogućnosti parkiranja. Bilo da parkirate izravno na plaži ili na nekim privatnim parkirnim mjestima. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je pijesak, ali imate i ne&scaron;to &scaron;ljunka i kamenja pomije&scaron;anog s pijeskom. Nagib na ovoj plaži ima normalnu padinu, ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje na oko 5 metara. Na plaži postoji mno&scaron;tvo infrastrukture na plaži kao i mnogo vrsta restorana i barova na plaži. Ako želite ostati dulje, na raspolaganju su vam mnoge mogućnosti, poput hotela izravno na plaži i nekih apartmana u blizini.', 3770, 'hr', 1),
(1057, 'In der montenegrinischen Region Budva, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Kaluderac, befindet sich ein sehr sch&ouml;ner Strand namens Plaža Buljarica. Es ist ein bisschen einzigartig, weil man tats&auml;chlich direkt am Strand parken kann, das ist auch der Grund, warum es bei den Reisemobilbesitzern sehr beliebt ist. Dieser ganze Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Da diese Gegend so gro&szlig; ist, haben Sie kein Problem damit, Ihr Auto direkt am Strand zu parken. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist brauner Sand, aber es sind auch einige Kieselsteine eingemischt. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt einige Kilometer und kann an einigen Stellen bis zu 40 Meter breit sein. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und man kann nach ca. 10 Metern mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Sie haben auch einige Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, aber nicht auf dem gesamten Strandabschnitt, nur in der N&auml;he des Dorfes. Restaurants und Strandbars befinden sich direkt am Strand. Sie haben viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, l&auml;nger hier zu bleiben, wo Sie entweder in Apartments oder auf einem Campingplatz &uuml;bernachten k&ouml;nnen.', 3771, 'de', 1),
(1058, 'Nella regione del Montenegro Budva, vicino al villaggio di Kaluderac, hai una spiaggia molto bella, chiamata Plaža Buljarica. &Egrave; un po &#39;unico, perch&eacute; puoi effettivamente parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia, questo &egrave; anche il motivo per cui &egrave; molto popolare tra i proprietari di camper. L&#39;intera posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Perch&eacute; questa zona &egrave; cos&igrave; grande, non hai alcun problema a parcheggiare l&#39;auto direttamente sulla spiaggia. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia marrone, ma ci sono anche alcuni ciottoli mescolati con dentro. La lunghezza totale &egrave; di alcuni chilometri e in alcuni punti pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 40 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare a circa 10 metri. Hai anche alcuni servizi di spiaggia disponibili, ma non su tutto il tratto di spiaggia, solo vicino al villaggio. Ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. Hai molte opzioni per rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo, dove puoi scegliere di soggiornare in appartamenti o in un campeggio.', 3771, 'it', 1),
(1059, 'V črnogorski regiji Budva, v bližini vasi Kaluderac, je zelo lepa plaža imenovana Plaža Buljarica. Je nekoliko edinstvena, saj lahko dejansko parkirate neposredno na plaži, zato je pri lastnikih avtodomov zelo priljubljena. Celoten kraj je zelo enostavno doseči s katerim koli vozilom. Ker je to območje tako veliko, nimate težav s parkiranjem avtomobila na plaži. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži je rjav pesek, vendar je v njem zme&scaron;anih tudi nekaj kamenčkov. Skupna dolžina plaže je nekaj kilometrov, ponekod je lahko &scaron;iroka tudi do 40 metrov. Dostop v vodo je zelo prijeten in plavati lahko začnete že po približno 10 metrih. Na voljo imate tudi nekaj storitev na plaži, vendar ne na celotnem delu plaže, le tik ob vasi. Restavracije in bari na plaži so dostopni tudi tukaj. Imate veliko možnosti, da se tukaj zadržite dlje časa, saj lahko ostanete v apartmajih ali v kampu.', 3771, 'sl', 1),
(1060, 'U crnogorskom dijelu Budve, u blizini sela Kaluderac, nalazi se vrlo lijepa plaža koja se zove plaža Buljarica. Pomalo je jedinstven jer zapravo možete parkirati direktno na plaži, pa je vrlo popularan kod vlasnika autodoma. Cijelo mjesto je vrlo lako doći bilo kojim vozilom. Budući da je ovo područje toliko veliko, nemate problema parkirati automobil na plaži. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je smeđi pijesak, ali se u njemu također mije&scaron;aju neki &scaron;ljunak. Ukupna dužina plaže je nekoliko kilometara, na nekim mjestima može biti &scaron;iroka i do 40 metara. Pristup vodi je vrlo udoban, a plivanje možete početi nakon otprilike 10 metara. Na raspolaganju su vam i neke usluge na plaži, ali ne na cijeloj plaži, tik uz selo. Tu su dostupni i restorani na plaži i barovi. Imate obilje mogućnosti da ovdje dugo ostanete, jer možete boraviti u apartmanima ili u kampu.', 3771, 'hr', 1),
(1061, 'Der montenegrinische Strand Lučice muss einer der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde dieses Mittelmeerlandes sein. Sie haben hier eine perfekte Harmonie zwischen kristallklarem Wasser, braunem Sand und Kiefern, die &uuml;berall sind. Es befindet sich in der Region Budva, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Petrovac na Moru. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, hier zu parken. Ein gro&szlig;er Parkplatz befindet sich direkt am Strand mit einigen Kiefern, die Ihnen Schatten spenden. Einer ist etwas weit entfernt. Neben dem braunen Sand finden Sie auch einige kleine Kieselsteine ​​am Strand und Felsen an den R&auml;ndern. Diese Sch&ouml;nheit ist 200 Meter lang und kann bis zu 40 Meter breit sein. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Sie haben hier viele Stranddienstleistungen, ein Kinderspielplatz ist ebenfalls vorhanden. Eine Sonnenliege und einen Regenschirm zu mieten ist hier nicht das Problem. Sie haben auch eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant direkt am Strand. Unterk&uuml;nfte, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Apartments und Hotels, sind am Strand nicht verf&uuml;gbar, aber in der Stadt selbst, etwa 500 Meter entfernt.', 3772, 'de', 1),
(1062, 'La spiaggia del Montenegro Lučice deve essere una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; belle di questo paese mediterraneo. Qui hai una perfetta armonia tra acqua cristallina, sabbia marrone e pini, che sono tutt&#39;intorno. Si trova nella regione di Budva, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Petrovac na Moru. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e qui puoi parcheggiare pi&ugrave; opzioni. Un ampio parcheggio si trova direttamente sulla spiaggia con alcuni alberi di pino per darti un po &#39;d&#39;ombra, uno &egrave; un po&#39; lontano. Oltre alla sabbia marrone, troverai anche dei piccoli ciottoli sulla spiaggia e degli scogli ai bordi. Questa bellezza &egrave; lunga 200 metri e pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 40 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi iniziare subito a nuotare. Hai un sacco di servizi in spiaggia qui, &egrave; disponibile anche un parco giochi per bambini. Noleggiare un lettino e un ombrellone non &egrave; il problema qui. Hai anche un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante direttamente sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione, principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti e hotel, non &egrave; disponibile sulla spiaggia ma nella citt&agrave; stessa, a circa 500 metri di distanza.', 3772, 'it', 1),
(1063, 'Črnogorska plaža Lučice mora biti ena najlep&scaron;ih plaž v tej sredozemski državi. Tu imate popolno harmonijo med kristalno čisto vodo, rjavim peskom in borovci, ki so povsod okoli plaže. Nahaja se na območju regije Budve, v bližini mesta Petrovac na Moru. Do te plaže se je možno pripeljati z katerikoli vozilom in tukaj imate več možnosti parkiranja. Ob plaži je veliko parkiri&scaron;če z nekaj borovci, ki nudijo senco. Eden je malo dlje in je večji od prvega. Poleg rjavega peska boste na plaži na&scaron;li tudi nekaj majhnih kamenčkov in skale na robovih plaže. Ta lepotica je dolga 200 metrov in je lahko &scaron;iroka do 40 metrov. Dostop v vodo je zelo lep in takoj lahko začnete plavati. Tu imate &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži, na voljo pa je tudi otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če. Najem ležalnika in senčnika tu ni problem. Na plaži imajo tudi bar na plaži in restavracijo. Nastanitev, večinoma v obliki apartmajev in hotelov, ni na voljo na plaži, ampak v samem mestu, oddaljenem približno 500 metrov.', 3772, 'sl', 1),
(1064, 'Crnogorska plaža Lučice trebala bi biti jedna od najljep&scaron;ih plaža ove mediteranske države. Ovdje imate savr&scaron;en sklad između kristalno čiste vode, smeđeg pijeska i borova koji su posvuda na plaži. Smje&scaron;ten na području budvanske regije, u blizini grada Petrovca ​​na Moru. Do ove plaže moguće je voziti bilo kojim vozilom, a ovdje je na raspolaganju nekoliko opcija za parkiranje. Uz plažu postoji veliko parkirali&scaron;te s borovima koje pružaju hladovinu. Jedan je malo duži i veći od prvog. Osim smeđeg pijeska, na rubovima plaže naći ćete i sitne &scaron;ljunke i stijene. Ova je ljepotica duga 200 metara, a može biti &scaron;iroka i do 40 metara. Pristup vodi je vrlo lijep i odmah možete početi plivati. Na raspolaganju su brojne usluge na plaži i dječje igrali&scaron;te. Unajmljivanje ležaljki i suncobrana ovdje nije problem. Na plaži se nalazi bar na plaži i restoran. Smje&scaron;taj, uglavnom u obliku apartmana i hotela, nije dostupan na plaži, već u samom gradu, udaljenom oko 500 metara.', 3772, 'hr', 1),
(1065, 'In Albania, in alcune parti, il paese ha molte montagne fino alla costa. Qua e l&agrave; le montagne hanno una pausa e una bellissima spiaggia aperta sul mare. In questa parte dell&#39;Albania hai la regione di Valona e il villaggio di Qeparo. La spiaggia qui si chiama plazhi Qeparo. La spiaggia &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con un veicolo e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare direttamente accanto alla spiaggia in un ampio parcheggio. In alcuni luoghi ti addebiteranno il parcheggio. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga circa 2 chilometri e larga fino a 25 metri. Qual &egrave; la superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; abbastanza difficile da determinare, perch&eacute; &egrave; una miscela di sabbia marrone, ciottoli e grandi pietre. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello, il nuoto inizia a circa 15 metri. Lungo tutto il tratto della spiaggia ci sono molti ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia e questo &egrave; anche il luogo in cui si hanno pi&ugrave; infrastrutture e servizi sulla spiaggia. Hai molte opzioni per rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile in varie tipologie, principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti, camere, hotel e persino campeggi.', 3706, 'it', 1),
(1066, 'In Albanien hat das Land teilweise viele Berge bis zur K&uuml;ste. Hier und da machen die Berge eine Pause und sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde offen sich zum Meer hin. In diesem Teil Albaniens gibt es die Region Vlora und das Dorf Qeparo. Der Strand hier hei&szlig;t plazhi Qeparo. Der Strand ist mit dem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt neben dem Strand auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken. An einigen Stellen wird Ihnen f&uuml;r das Parken eine Rechnung gestellt. Der Strand ist rund 2 Kilometer lang und bis zu 25 Meter breit. Was die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes ist, ist ziemlich schwer zu bestimmen, da es sich um eine Mischung aus braunem Sand, Kieselsteinen und gro&szlig;en Steinen handelt. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n, das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 15 Metern. Entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts gibt es viele Restaurants und Strandbars. Dies ist auch der Ort, an dem Sie &uuml;ber die meisten Strandinfrastrukturen und -dienstleistungen verf&uuml;gen. Sie haben viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, l&auml;nger hier zu bleiben. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in verschiedenen Arten, meist in Form von Apartments, Zimmern, Hotels und sogar Campingpl&auml;tzen.', 3706, 'de', 1),
(1067, 'V Albaniji je na nekaterih delih države veliko gora, ki segajo vse do obale. Tu in tam se planine odpočijejo in čudovite plaže so odprejo pri morju. V tem delu Albanije imate regijo Vlor&euml; in vas Qeparo. Plaža tukaj se imenuje plazhi Qeparo. Do plaže se lahko enostavno pripeljete z vozilom, parkirate lahko neposredno ob plaži na velikem parkiri&scaron;ču. Na nekaterih mestih vam bodo zaračunali parkirnino. Plaža je dolga približno 2 kilometra in &scaron;iroka do 25 metrov. Kak&scaron;na je glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže, je precej težko določiti, saj gre za me&scaron;anico rjavega peska, kamenčkov in velikih kamnov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep, plavanje se začne pri približno 15 metrih. Na celotnem delu plaže imate veliko restavracij in barov na plaži in to je tudi kraj, kjer imate največ infrastrukture in storitev na plaži. Če želite tukaj preživeti počitnice, imate na voljo veliko možnosti, da ostanete tukaj dlje. Nastanitev je na voljo v različnih oblikah, večinoma v obliki apartmajev, sob, hotelov in celo kampov.', 3706, 'sl', 1),
(1068, 'U Albaniji postoje brojne planine u nekim dijelovima zemlje koje se protežu sve do obale. Tu i tamo se planine odmaraju, a prekrasne plaže otvara more. U ovom dijelu Albanije imate regiju Vlor&euml; i selo Qeparo. Plaža se ovdje zove Qeparo plazhi. Do plaže možete lako doći automobilom, direktno na plaži možete parkirati na velikom parkirali&scaron;tu. Neka mjesta naplaćuju vam parking. Plaža je duga oko 2 kilometra i &scaron;iroka do 25 metara. Koja je glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže prilično je te&scaron;ko odrediti jer se radi o mje&scaron;avini smeđeg pijeska, &scaron;ljunka i velikih stijena. Pristup vodi je vrlo lijep, plivanje započinje s oko 15 metara. Na cijeloj plaži postoji mnogo restorana i barova na plaži i to je mjesto na kojem imate najvi&scaron;e sadržaja i usluga na plaži. Ako ovdje želite provesti svoj odmor, imate mnogo mogućnosti da ostanete duže. Smje&scaron;taj je dostupan u različitim oblicima, većinom u obliku apartmana, soba, hotela, pa čak i kampova.', 3706, 'hr', 1),
(1069, 'Quando viaggi lungo la costa albanese nella regione di Valona dalla citt&agrave; di Qeparo alla parte nord dell&#39;Albania, proprio accanto alla costa c&#39;&egrave; una bellissima spiaggia con il nome Plazhi Porto Palermos 3. &Egrave; facile da raggiungere con il veicolo e puoi lasciare il tuo auto in un parcheggio accanto alla strada. Dopo aver camminato per circa 30 metri gi&ugrave; per le scale, passando un ristorante vedrai questa spiaggia di ghiaia fine lunga 50 me larga 10 metri. Come superficie hai anche del cemento. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; dalla spiaggia o si salta da una piattaforma che fa il punto di nuotare immediatamente o a circa 5 metri. Questo posto &egrave; molto organizzato e hai un ristorante e alcuni alloggi direttamente sulla spiaggia e per questo motivo hai molti servizi in spiaggia.', 3707, 'it', 1),
(1070, 'Wenn Sie entlang der albanischen K&uuml;ste, in der Region Vlor&euml;, von der Stadt Qeparo in den Norden Albaniens fahren, befindet sich direkt neben der K&uuml;ste ein sehr sch&ouml;ner Strand mit dem Namen Plazhi Porto Palermos 3. Mit dem Fahrzeug ist er leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen das Auto auf einem Parkplatz neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Nachdem Sie etwa 30 Meter die Treppe hinuntergehen und an ein sch&ouml;nes Restaurant passieren, sehen Sie diesen 50 m langen und 10 m breiten feinen Traumhaften Kiesstrand. Neben dem Kies, haben Sie als Oberfl&auml;che auch etwas Beton. Der Wassereintritt erfolgt entweder vom Strand aus oder Sie springen von einer Plattform, auf der Sie sofort oder in einer Entfernung von etwa 5 Metern schwimmen k&ouml;nnen. Dieser Ort ist sehr gut organisiert und Sie haben ein Restaurant und einige Unterk&uuml;nfte direkt am Strand und aus diesem Grund haben Sie hier viele Stranddienstleistungen. Badeliegen und Sonnenschirme k&ouml;nnen Sie hier auch mieten.', 3707, 'de', 1),
(1071, 'Če se vozite ob albanski obali, v regiji Vlor&euml;, od mesta Qeparo proti severu Albanije, je tik ob obali prelepa plaža z imenom Plazhi Porto Palermos 3. Do te simpatične plaže se da enostavno priti z različnimi tipi avtomobilov in va&scaron;e vozilo lahko parkirate na parkiri&scaron;ču ob cesti. Ko se približno 30 metrov spustite po stopnicah in se prehodite mimo lepe restavracije, boste videli to 50 m dolgo in 10 m &scaron;iroko sanjsko prodnato plažo. Poleg gramoza ima povr&scaron;ina tudi nekaj betona oz. betonskih teras. V vodo se lahko vstopi bodisi s plaže ali pa skočite s plo&scaron;čadi, točka plavanja se pri vstopu iz plo&scaron;čadi začne takoj iz plaže pa na razdalji približno 5 metrov. Ta kraj je zelo dobro organiziran, ne samo da imate tukaj restavracijo, tudi nastanitev v obliki apartmajev je na voljo. Vsa lokacija vam zaradi dobre organiziranosti nudi veliko storitev na plaži. Tukaj lahko najamete tudi ležalnike in senčnike.', 3707, 'sl', 1),
(1072, 'Ako se vozite duž albanske obale, u regiji Vlor&euml;, od grada Qeparo do sjeverne Albanije, tik uz obalu nalazi se prekrasna plaža koja se zove Plazhi Porto Palermos 3. pored puta. Kad se popnete stubama oko 30 metara i prođete pored ljupkog restorana, vidjet ćete ovu &scaron;ljunčanu plažu iz snova dugu 50 m i 10 m &scaron;iroku. Osim &scaron;ljunka na povr&scaron;ini se nalazi i ne&scaron;to betona ili betona. betonske terase. U vodu možete ući bilo s plaže ili skočiti s perona, a točka plivanja počinje na udaljenosti od oko 5 metara kada uđete na platformu s plaže. Ovo je mjesto vrlo dobro organizirano, ne samo da ovdje imate restoran, već je i apartmanski smje&scaron;taj dostupan. Zbog dobre organizacije, cijela lokacija nudi vam brojne usluge na plaži. Ovdje možete unajmiti ležaljke i suncobrane.', 3707, 'hr', 1),
(1073, 'Quando si viaggia lungo la costa albanese nella regione di Valona dalla citt&agrave; di Qeparo a nord, proprio accanto alla costa c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia molto particolare con il castello Ali Pasha nelle vicinanze. Il nome della spiaggia &egrave; Plazhi Porto Palermos 2. &Egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con un veicolo e puoi lasciare la tua auto in un parcheggio direttamente sulla spiaggia o al ristorante accanto alla strada. La strada per la spiaggia &egrave; fatta di terra battuta e rocce ma &egrave; molto corta e la pendenza &egrave; abbastanza normale. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 100 me larga 10 metri e la superficie principale &egrave; di ghiaia fine. Come superficie hai anche del cemento e delle rocce ai bordi. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; dalla spiaggia o si salta da un molo vicino, il che rende il punto di nuotata immediatamente o a circa 5 metri. Sulla stessa spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; poca infrastruttura di spiaggia. Hai un ristorante e alcuni alloggi sotto forma di bungalow lungo la strada a circa 50 m dalla spiaggia.', 3708, 'it', 1),
(1074, 'Wenn Sie die albanische K&uuml;ste in der Region Vlor&euml; von der Stadt Qeparo im Norden entlangfahren, befindet sich direkt neben der K&uuml;ste ein ganz besonders geformter Strand mit dem Schloss Ali Pascha in der N&auml;he. Der Name des Strandes ist Plazhi Porto Palermos 2. Es ist ihm leicht mit dem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto auf einem Parkplatz direkt am Strand oder beim Restaurant neben der Stra&szlig;e abstellen. Die Stra&szlig;e zum Strand besteht aus Schotter und Felsen, ist aber sehr kurz und die Steigung ist ganz normal. Der Strand ist 100 m lang und 10 m breit und die Hauptoberfl&auml;che ist feiner Kies. Als Oberfl&auml;che haben Sie auch etwas Beton und einige Steine an den R&auml;ndern. Der Wassereintritt erfolgt entweder vom Strand aus oder Sie springen von einem nahen gelegenen Pier, wodurch Sie sofort oder in einer Entfernung von etwa 5 Metern wegschwimmen k&ouml;nnen. Am Strand selbst gibt es wenig Strandinfrastruktur. Sie haben ein Restaurant und einige Unterk&uuml;nfte in Form von Bungalows ganz nah zu der Stra&szlig;e, etwa 50 m vom Strand entfernt.', 3708, 'de', 1),
(1075, 'Če vozite ob albanski obali v regiji Vlor&euml; iz mesta Qeparo na severu, se nahaja tik ob obali zelo posebno oblikovana plaža, v bližini katere se tudi nahaja grad Ali Pascha. Ime plaže je Plazhi Porto Palermos 2. Do plaže se da enostavno priti z kateremkoli tipom avtomoba, svoj avto pa lahko ali parkirate na parkiri&scaron;ču neposredno ob plaži ali v restavraciji ob glavni cesti. Pot do plaže je sestavljena iz gramoza in kamnin, vendar je zelo kratka in klančina ni preveč strma. Plaža je dolga 100 m in &scaron;iroka 10 m, glavna povr&scaron;ina pa je droben prod. Na robovih je tudi nekaj betona in nekaj skal. V vodo se lahko vstopi bodisi s plaže ali pa lahko skočite z bližnjega pomola, kar vam omogoča, da takoj zaplavate ali po približno 5 metrih. Na sami plaži je malo infrastrukture. V bližini imate na voljo restavracijo in nekaj bungalovskih namestitev, ki so blizu glavne ceste, zgolj 50 m od plaže.', 3708, 'sl', 1),
(1076, 'Ako se vozite duž albanske obale u regiji Vlore u gradu Qeparo na sjeveru, blizu obale nalazi se vrlo posebno oblikovana plaža, blizu koje se nalazi dvorac Ali Pascha. Naziv plaže je Plazhi Porto Palermos 2. Do plaže je lako doći bilo kojim automobilom, a svoj automobil možete parkirati na parkirali&scaron;tu odmah pored plaže ili u restoranu uz glavnu cestu. Put do plaže sastoji se od &scaron;ljunka i stijena, ali vrlo je kratak i rampa nije previ&scaron;e strma. Plaža je dugačka 100 m i &scaron;iroka 10 m, a glavna povr&scaron;ina je mala &scaron;ljunčana. Rubovi također imaju ne&scaron;to betona i ne&scaron;to stijena. U vodu možete ući bilo s plaže ili možete skočiti s obližnjeg pristani&scaron;ta &scaron;to vam omogućuje da odmah plivate ili nakon otprilike 5 metara. Na samoj plaži malo je infrastrukture. U blizini glavne prometnice, samo 50 metara od plaže, nalazi se restoran i nekoliko bungalova.', 3708, 'hr', 1),
(1077, 'Wenn Sie derjenige sind, der einen sehr sch&ouml;nen albanischen Strand mit vielen Stranddienstleistungen und sogar einen Party Ort m&ouml;gen, m&uuml;ssen Sie den Strand Plazhi i Llamanit besuchen. Es befindet sich in der Region Vlor&euml; in der N&auml;he der Stadt Himar&euml;. Es ist ein sehr gut zug&auml;nglicher Strand mit jeder Art von Fahrzeug. Die Stra&szlig;en zu diesem Ort sind von h&ouml;chster Qualit&auml;t und Sie haben eine sehr sch&ouml;ne Landschaft, wenn Sie die K&uuml;ste entlangfahren. Die letzten hundert Meter bestehen aus Schotter und wenn Sie den Punkt erreichen, k&ouml;nnen Sie direkt vor dem Strand parken. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes besteht aus feinem Kies und etwas Sand. Es ist ein 200 Meter langer und bis zu 40 Meter breiter Strand. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und man kann fast sofort wegschwimmen. Sie haben viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, Sie k&ouml;nnen auch ein Tretboot mieten, und vieles andere. Hier befinden sich eine Strand-Bar, ein Restaurant und sogar ein Club. Die Unterkunft ist nicht direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar, aber es gibt ein Hotel in der N&auml;he der Hauptstra&szlig;e.', 3709, 'de', 1),
(1078, 'Se sei quello a cui piace una bellissima spiaggia albanese con molti servizi di spiaggia e persino un luogo di festa, devi visitare la spiaggia di Plazhi i Llamanit. Si trova nella regione di Valona, ​​vicino alla citt&agrave; di Himar&euml;. &Egrave; una spiaggia molto accessibile con ogni tipo di veicolo. Le strade per questo luogo sono di altissima qualit&agrave; e hai un paesaggio molto bello quando guidi lungo la costa. Gli ultimi cento metri sono di ghiaia e quando si raggiunge il punto &egrave; possibile parcheggiare proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; fatta di ghiaia fine e sabbia. &Egrave; una spiaggia lunga 200 metri e larga fino a 40 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi nuotare via quasi immediatamente. Hai molti servizi in spiaggia disponibili, puoi anche noleggiare una pedal&ograve; e molto altro. Qui c&#39;&egrave; un bar sulla spiaggia, un ristorante e persino un club. La propriet&agrave; non &egrave; disponibile proprio sulla spiaggia, ma c&#39;&egrave; un hotel vicino alla strada principale.', 3709, 'it', 1),
(1079, 'Če ste tisti, ki imate radi zelo lepe in romantične albanske plaže, kjer imate na razpolago veliko plažnih storitev, vključujoč zabavo in glasno glasbo, morate obiskati plažo Plazhi i Llamanit. Nahaja se v regiji Vlor&euml; v bližini mesta Himar&euml;. Je zelo dostopna plaža z vsemi vrstami vozil. Ceste do tega lokacije so najvi&scaron;je kakovosti in ko se vozite ob obali imate ves čas ob sebi zelo lepo pokrajino, ki jo boste z veseljem občudovali. Zadnjih sto metrov do plaže je na cesti gramoz in na koncu ceste lahko parkirate tik pred plažo. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je narejena iz drobnega gramoza in nekaj peska. Gre za 200 metrov dolgo in do 40 metrov &scaron;iroko plažo. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavati lahko začnete skoraj takoj. Na voljo imate &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži, najamete lahko tudi čoln s pedali in &scaron;e veliko več. Tu je tudi bar na plaži, restavracija in celo klub. Nastanitev ni na voljo na plaži, se pa nahaja hotel v bližini glavne ceste.', 3709, 'sl', 1),
(1080, 'Ako ste ljubitelj prekrasnih i romantičnih albanskih plaža na kojima imate brojne usluge na plaži, uključujući zabavu i glasnu glazbu, posjetite plažu Plazhi i Llamanit. Smje&scaron;ten u regiji Vlor&euml; u blizini Himar&euml;. To je vrlo pristupačna plaža sa svim vrstama vozila. Ceste do ove lokacije su najvi&scaron;e kvalitete i kad se vozite duž obale cijelo vrijeme imate vrlo lijep krajolik u kojem možete uživati. Zadnjih stotinjak metara do plaže je makadam, a na kraju ceste možete parkirati točno ispred plaže. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže izgrađena je od sitnog &scaron;ljunka i ne&scaron;to pijeska. Duga je 200 metara i &scaron;iroka do 40 metara. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i možete početi plivati gotovo odmah. Na raspolaganju su vam mnoge usluge na plaži, možete unajmiti i čamac s pedalama i jo&scaron; mnogo toga. Tu je i bar na plaži, restoran, pa čak i klub. Smje&scaron;taj nije dostupan na plaži, ali postoji hotel u blizini glavne ceste.', 3709, 'hr', 1),
(1081, 'La citt&agrave; albanese di Himar&euml;, che si trova nella regione di Valona, &egrave; molto popolare tra i turisti. Non c&#39;&egrave; da stupirsi, perch&eacute; ha molte belle spiagge e una di queste &egrave; la spiaggia di Plazhi Guma. La strada che porta lungo la costa &egrave; in ottime condizioni e ti porta anche in questo punto dove puoi parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia lungo la strada. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 400 me larga fino a 50 m. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi iniziare a nuotare immediatamente. Qui sono disponibili alcuni servizi in spiaggia, cos&igrave; come molti ristoranti, pizzerie e catering simili. Anche l&#39;alloggio non &egrave; un problema, qui hai molti appartamenti e hotel.', 3710, 'it', 1),
(1082, 'Die albanische Stadt Himar&euml; in der Region Vlor&euml; ist bei Touristen sehr beliebt. Kein Wunder, denn es gibt viele sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde hier, und einer davon ist der Strand Plazhi Guma. Die Stra&szlig;e, die die K&uuml;ste entlangf&uuml;hrt, ist in einem sehr guten Zustand und f&uuml;hrt Sie auch zu diesem Punkt, an dem Sie direkt vor dem Strand an der Stra&szlig;e parken k&ouml;nnen. Der Strand ist 400 m lang und bis zu 50 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Hier gibt es einige Stranddienstleistungen sowie viele Restaurants, Pizzerien und &auml;hnliches Catering. Unterkunft ist auch kein Problem, hier haben Sie viele Apartments und Hotels zu Verf&uuml;gung.', 3710, 'de', 1),
(1083, 'La ville albanaise Himar&euml;, situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion de Vlor&euml;, est tr&egrave;s appr&eacute;ci&eacute;e des touristes. Pas &eacute;tonnant, car il y a beaucoup de belles plages, et l&#39;une d&#39;entre elles est la plage Plazhi Guma. La route qui descend le long du littoral est en tr&egrave;s bon &eacute;tat et elle vous m&egrave;ne &eacute;galement &agrave; cet endroit o&ugrave; vous pourrez vous garer directement &agrave; la plage par la route. La plage mesure 400 m de long et 50 m de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager imm&eacute;diatement. Vous avez quelques services de plage disponibles ici, ainsi que de nombreux restaurants, pizzerias et traiteurs similaires. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas non plus un probl&egrave;me, ici vous avez de nombreux appartements et h&ocirc;tels.', 3710, 'fr', 1),
(1084, 'Albansko mesto Himar&euml;, ki se nahaja v regiji Vlor&euml;, je zelo priljubljeno med turisti. Nič čudnega, saj ima veliko lepih plaž, ena od njih pa je plaža Plazhi Guma. Cesta, ki vodi navzdol do obale, je v zelo dobrem stanju in vas pripelje tudi do tega mesta, kjer lahko parkirate neposredno pred plažo ob cesti. Plaža je dolga 400 m in &scaron;iroka do 50 m. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavati lahko začnete takoj. Tu imate na voljo nekaj storitev na plaži, pa tudi &scaron;tevilne restavracije, picerije in podobne gostinske storitve. Tudi nastanitev ni problem, tukaj imate veliko apartmajev in hotelov.', 3710, 'sl', 1),
(1085, 'Albanski grad Himar&euml;, smje&scaron;ten u regiji Vlor&euml;, vrlo je popularan među turistima. Nije ni čudo da ima mnogo lijepih plaža i jedna od njih je Plazhi Guma plaža. Cesta koja vodi do obale u vrlo je dobrom stanju i dovodi vas do ovog mjesta gdje možete parkirati direktno ispred plaže uz cestu. Plaža je dugačka 400 m i &scaron;iroka do 50 m. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i odmah možete početi plivati. Ovdje su na raspolaganju neke usluge na plaži, kao i mnogi restorani, picerije i slične ugostiteljske usluge. Također, smje&scaron;taj nije problem, ovdje imate puno apartmana i hotela.', 3710, 'hr', 1),
(1086, 'La citt&agrave; albanese di Himar&euml;, che si trova nella regione di Valona, &egrave; molto popolare tra i turisti. Non c&#39;&egrave; da stupirsi perch&eacute; ha molte belle spiagge, e una di queste &egrave; la spiaggia Plazhi Potam. La strada che porta lungo la costa &egrave; in ottime condizioni e ti porta anche in questo punto dove puoi parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia lungo la strada. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 750 me larga fino a 40 m. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi iniziare a nuotare immediatamente. Qui sono disponibili alcuni servizi in spiaggia, nonch&eacute; numerosi ristoranti, pizzerie e catering simili. Anche l&#39;alloggio non &egrave; un problema, qui hai molti appartamenti e hotel, persino un campeggio.', 3711, 'it', 1),
(1087, 'Die albanische Stadt Himar&euml; in der Region Vlor&euml; ist bei Touristen sehr beliebt. Kein Wunder, denn es gibt viele sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde, und einer davon ist der Strand Plazhi Potam. Die Stra&szlig;e, die die K&uuml;ste entlangf&uuml;hrt, ist in einem sehr guten Zustand und f&uuml;hrt Sie auch zu diesem Punkt, an dem Sie direkt am Strand an der Stra&szlig;e parken k&ouml;nnen. Der Strand ist 750 m lang und bis zu 40 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Hier gibt es einige Stranddienstleistunge sowie viele Restaurants, Pizzerien und &auml;hnliches Catering. Unterkunft ist auch kein Problem, hier gibt es viele Apartments und Hotels, sogar einen Campingplatz.', 3711, 'de', 1),
(1088, 'Albansko mesto Himar&euml;, ki se nahaja v regiji Vlor&euml;, je zelo priljubljeno med turisti. Nič čudnega, saj imate tukaj veliko lepih plaž, ena od njih pa je plaža Plazhi Potam. Cesta, ki vodi navzdol do obale, je v zelo dobrem stanju in vas pripelje tudi do tega mesta, kjer lahko parkirate va&scaron;e vozilo neposredno ob plaži in sicer ob cesti. Plaža je dolga 750 m in &scaron;iroka do 40 m. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in takoj lahko začnete plavati. Tu imate na voljo tudi nekaj plažnih storitev, pa tudi &scaron;tevilne restavracije, picerije in podobne gostinske storitve. Tudi nastanitev ni težava, tukaj imate veliko apartmajev in hotelov, celo kamp.', 3711, 'sl', 1),
(1089, 'Albanski grad Himar&euml;, smje&scaron;ten u regiji Vlor&euml;, vrlo je popularan među turistima. Nije ni čudo &scaron;to ovdje imate mnogo lijepih plaža, a jedna od njih je Plazhi Potam plaža. Cesta koja vodi do obale u vrlo je dobrom stanju i dovodi vas do ovog mjesta gdje možete parkirati svoje vozilo odmah do plaže, tik uz cestu. Plaža je dugačka 750 m i &scaron;iroka 40 m. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i odmah možete početi plivati. Tu su i neke usluge na plaži, kao i mnogi restorani, picerije i slične ugostiteljske usluge. Također, smje&scaron;taj nije problem, ovdje imate puno apartmana i hotela, čak i kamp.', 3711, 'hr', 1),
(1090, 'La ville albanaise Himar&euml;, situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion de Vlor&euml;, est tr&egrave;s appr&eacute;ci&eacute;e des touristes. Pas &eacute;tonnant car il y a beaucoup de belles plages, et l&#39;une d&#39;elles est la plage Plazhi Potam. La route qui descend le long du littoral est en tr&egrave;s bon &eacute;tat et elle vous m&egrave;ne &eacute;galement &agrave; cet endroit o&ugrave; vous pourrez vous garer directement &agrave; la plage par la route. La plage mesure 750 m de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 40 m de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager imm&eacute;diatement. Vous avez quelques services de plage disponibles ici ainsi que de nombreux restaurants, pizzerias et traiteurs similaires. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas non plus un probl&egrave;me, ici vous avez de nombreux appartements et h&ocirc;tels, m&ecirc;me un camping.', 3711, 'fr', 1),
(1091, 'La citt&agrave; albanese di Himar&euml;, che si trova nella regione di Valona, &egrave; molto popolare tra i turisti. Non c&#39;&egrave; da stupirsi perch&eacute; ha molte belle spiagge, e una di queste, che &egrave; anche la spiaggia del centro della citt&agrave; &egrave; la spiaggia Plazhi i Spiles&euml;. La strada che porta lungo la costa &egrave; in ottime condizioni e conduce direttamente al centro della citt&agrave;, &egrave; possibile parcheggiare lungo la strada o in alcuni posti del parco pubblico. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 500 me larga fino a 20 m. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia con alcuni terassi di cemento. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi iniziare a nuotare immediatamente o puoi saltare dal molo. Qui sono disponibili alcuni servizi in spiaggia, nonch&eacute; numerosi ristoranti, pizzerie e catering simili. Anche l&#39;alloggio non &egrave; un problema, qui hai molti appartamenti e hotel.', 3712, 'it', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1092, 'La ville albanaise Himar&euml;, situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion de Vlor&euml;, est tr&egrave;s appr&eacute;ci&eacute;e des touristes. Pas &eacute;tonnant car il y a beaucoup de belles plages, et l&#39;une d&#39;entre elles, qui est aussi la plage du centre de la ville est la plage Plazhi i Spiles&euml;. La route qui descend le long du littoral est en tr&egrave;s bon &eacute;tat et m&egrave;ne directement au centre de la ville, vous pouvez vous garer soit par la route, soit par quelques places publiques. La plage mesure 500 m de long et 20 m de large. La surface principale de la plage est du sable avec quelques terrasses en b&eacute;ton. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager imm&eacute;diatement ou vous pouvez sauter de la jet&eacute;e. Vous avez quelques services de plage disponibles ici ainsi que de nombreux restaurants, pizzerias et traiteurs similaires. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas non plus un probl&egrave;me, ici vous avez de nombreux appartements et h&ocirc;tels.', 3712, 'fr', 1),
(1093, 'Die albanische Stadt Himar&euml; in der Region Vlor&euml; ist bei Touristen sehr beliebt. Kein Wunder, denn es gibt viele sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde, und einer von ihnen, der auch der Strand des Stadtzentrums ist, ist der Strand Plazhi i Spiles&euml;. Die Stra&szlig;e, die die K&uuml;ste entlangf&uuml;hrt, ist in einem sehr guten Zustand und f&uuml;hrt direkt ins Stadtzentrum, wo Sie entweder neben der Stra&szlig;e oder an einigen &ouml;ffentlichen Parkpl&auml;tzen parken k&ouml;nnen. Der Strand ist 500 m lang und bis zu 20 m breit. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes ist Sand mit einigen Betonterrassen. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen oder vom Pier springen. Hier gibt es einige Stranddienstleistungen sowie viele Restaurants, Pizzerien und &auml;hnliches Catering. Unterkunft ist auch kein Problem, hier haben Sie viele Apartments und Hotels.', 3712, 'de', 1),
(1094, 'Albansko mesto Himar&euml;, ki se nahaja v regiji Vlor&euml;, je zelo priljubljeno med turisti. Nič čudnega, ker ima veliko čudovitih plaž, ena od njih, ki je tudi plaža sredi&scaron;ča mesta, pa je plaža Plazhi i Spiles&euml;. Cesta, ki vodi navzdol do obale, je v zelo dobrem stanju vas vodi direktno v sredi&scaron;če mesta, kjer lahko parkirate bodisi ob cesti bodisi na nekaterih javnih mestih. Plaža je dolga 500 m in &scaron;iroka do 20 m. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je pesek z nekaj betonskimi terasami. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in takoj lahko začnete plavati ali pa lahko skočite s pomola. Tu imate na voljo nekaj storitev na plaži, pa tudi &scaron;tevilne restavracije, picerije in podobne gostinske storitve. Tudi nastanitev ni problem, tukaj imate veliko apartmajev in hotelov.', 3712, 'sl', 1),
(1095, 'Albanski grad Himar&euml;, smje&scaron;ten u regiji Vlor&euml;, vrlo je popularan među turistima. Nije ni čudo &scaron;to ima mnogo lijepih plaža, a jedna od njih, koja je ujedno i plaža sredi&scaron;ta grada, je plaža Plazhi i Spiles&euml;. Cesta koja vodi do obale u vrlo je dobrom stanju, vodi vas izravno u sredi&scaron;te grada, gdje možete parkirati bilo uz cestu ili na nekim javnim mjestima. Plaža je dugačka 500 m, a &scaron;iroka do 20 m. Glavno područje plaže je pijesak s nekim betonskim terasama. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i možete početi plivati odmah ili možete skočiti s pristani&scaron;ta. Ovdje su na raspolaganju neke usluge na plaži, kao i mnogi restorani, picerije i slične ugostiteljske usluge. Također, smje&scaron;taj nije problem, ovdje imate puno apartmana i hotela.', 3712, 'hr', 1),
(1096, 'La ciudad albanesa Himar&euml;, ubicada en la regi&oacute;n de Vlor&euml;, es muy popular entre los turistas. No es de extra&ntilde;ar porque tiene muchas playas hermosas, y una de ellas, que tambi&eacute;n es la playa del centro de la ciudad, es la playa Plazhi i Spiles&euml;. La carretera que conduce a la costa est&aacute; en muy buenas condiciones y conduce directamente al centro de la ciudad, donde puede estacionarse por la carretera o por algunos lugares p&uacute;blicos. La playa tiene 500 m de largo y hasta 20 m de ancho. La superficie principal de la playa es arena con algunas terasses de hormig&oacute;n. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y puedes comenzar a nadar de inmediato o puedes saltar desde el muelle. Tienes algunos servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;, as&iacute; como muchos restaurantes, pizzer&iacute;as y catering similar. El alojamiento tampoco es un problema, aqu&iacute; tienes muchos apartamentos y hoteles.', 3712, 'es', 1),
(1097, 'In der N&auml;he der albanischen Stadt Himar&euml; befindet sich das Dorf Jala, das f&uuml;r seinen 1 km langen, feinen Kiesstrand Plazhi Jal&euml; 2 bekannt ist. Es befindet sich in der Region Vlor&euml; und ist bei Reisemobil-Enthusiasten und Campern sehr beliebt. Die Stra&szlig;e, die die K&uuml;ste entlangf&uuml;hrt, ist in einem sehr guten Zustand und Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder an Rand der Stra&szlig;e oder auf einigen privaten Parkpl&auml;tzen parken. Der Strand ist 1000 m lang und bis zu 50 m breit. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes ist feiner Kies mit etwas gemischtem Sand. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Hier stehen Ihnen einige Stranddienstleistungen sowie viele Restaurants, Strandbars, Pizzerien und &auml;hnliches Catering zur Verf&uuml;gung. Unterkunft ist auch kein Problem, hier gibt es viele Apartments und Hotels sowie viele Campingpl&auml;tze. Viele kleine Superm&auml;rkte sind ebenfalls vorhanden.', 3713, 'de', 1),
(1098, 'Vicino alla citt&agrave; albanese di Himar&euml; c&#39;&egrave; un villaggio Jala che &egrave; noto per la sua spiaggia di ghiaia fine lunga 1 km chiamata Plazhi Jal&euml; 2. Si trova nella regione di Valona ed &egrave; molto popolare tra gli appassionati di camper e quelli a cui piace campeggiare. La strada che porta lungo la costa &egrave; in ottime condizioni e puoi parcheggiare lungo la strada o in alcuni parcheggi privati.La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 1000 me larga fino a 50 m. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di ghiaia fine con un po &#39;di sabbia mescolata all&#39;interno. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi iniziare a nuotare immediatamente. Qui sono disponibili alcuni servizi in spiaggia, nonch&eacute; numerosi ristoranti, bar sulla spiaggia, pizzerie e catering simili. Anche l&#39;alloggio non &egrave; un problema, qui ci sono molti appartamenti e hotel e anche molti campeggi. Sono disponibili anche molti piccoli supermercati.', 3713, 'it', 1),
(1099, 'V bližini albanskega mesta Himar&euml; stoji vasica Jala, ki je znana po 1 km dolgi gramozni plaži, imenovani Plazhi Jal&euml; 2. Nahaja se v regiji Vlor&euml; in je zelo priljubljena med ljubitelji avtodomov in med tistimi, ki radi kampirajo. Cesta, ki vodi navzdol do obale, je v zelo dobrem stanju in parkirate lahko ob cesti ali na nekaterih zasebnih parkiri&scaron;čih. Plaža je dolga 1000 m in &scaron;iroka do 50 m. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je droben gramoz, vmes pa je pome&scaron;an pesek. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in takoj lahko začnete plavati. Tu imate na voljo nekaj storitev na plaži, pa tudi &scaron;tevilne restavracije, bare na plaži, picerije in podobno gostinsko ponudbo. Tudi nastanitev ni problem, tukaj imate veliko apartmajev in hotelov in tudi veliko kampov. Veliko majhnih supermarketov je prav tako na voljo.', 3713, 'sl', 1),
(1100, 'U blizini albanskog grada Himar&euml; nalazi se selo Jala, poznato po &scaron;ljunčanoj plaži dugoj 1 km nazvanoj Plazhi Jal&euml; 2. Nalazi se u regiji Vlor&euml; i vrlo je popularna među kamperima i onima koji vole kampovati. Cesta koja vodi do obale u vrlo je dobrom stanju, a možete parkirati uz cestu ili na nekim privatnim parkirali&scaron;tima. Plaža je duga 1000 m i &scaron;iroka do 50 m. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je sitan &scaron;ljunak, s pijeskom pomije&scaron;anim između. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i odmah možete početi plivati. Ovdje su na raspolaganju neke usluge na plaži, kao i mnogi restorani, barovi na plaži, picerije i slični catering. Također, smje&scaron;taj nije problem, imate mnogo apartmana i hotela i mnogo kampova. Na raspolaganju su i mnogi mali supermarketi.', 3713, 'hr', 1),
(1101, 'Pr&egrave;s de la ville albanaise Himar&euml;, il y a un village Jala qui est connu pour sa plage de gravier fin de 1 km de long appel&eacute;e Plazhi Jal&euml; 2. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion de Vlor&euml; et est tr&egrave;s populaire parmi les amateurs de camping-car et ceux qui aiment camper. La route qui descend le long du littoral est en tr&egrave;s bon &eacute;tat et vous pouvez vous garer soit par la route, soit sur certains parkings priv&eacute;s.La plage mesure 1000 m de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 50 m de large. La surface principale de la plage est en gravier fin avec un peu de sable m&eacute;lang&eacute; &agrave; l&#39;int&eacute;rieur. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager imm&eacute;diatement. Vous avez quelques services de plage disponibles ici ainsi que de nombreux restaurants, bars de plage, pizzerias et restauration similaire. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas non plus un probl&egrave;me, ici vous avez de nombreux appartements et h&ocirc;tels et aussi de nombreux campings. De nombreux petits supermarch&eacute;s sont &eacute;galement disponibles.', 3713, 'fr', 1),
(1102, 'Cerca de la ciudad albanesa Himar&euml; hay un pueblo Jala que es conocido por su playa de grava fina de 1 km de largo llamada Plazhi Jal&euml; 2. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Vlor&euml; y es muy popular entre los entusiastas de las autocaravanas y aquellos a quienes les gusta acampar. La carretera que baja por la costa est&aacute; en muy buenas condiciones y puede estacionarse junto a la carretera o en algunos estacionamientos privados. La playa tiene 1000 m de largo y hasta 50 m de ancho. La superficie principal de la playa es de grava fina con un poco de arena mezclada. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y puedes comenzar a nadar de inmediato. Tiene algunos servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;, as&iacute; como muchos restaurantes, chiringuitos, pizzer&iacute;as y catering similar. El alojamiento tampoco es un problema, aqu&iacute; tienes muchos apartamentos y hoteles y tambi&eacute;n muchos campings. Muchos supermercados peque&ntilde;os tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles.', 3713, 'es', 1),
(1103, 'Der montenegrinische Strand Petrovac na moru geh&ouml;rt zu einem der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde dieses Mittelmeerlandes. Es ist ein sehr ber&uuml;hmtes und beliebtes Ziel f&uuml;r die Touristen, die diesen Ort aus der ganzen Welt besuchen. Das Wasser hier ist kristallklar und der Sand hat einen etwas roten Farbton. Es befindet sich in der Region Budva, direkt in der Stadt Petrovac na Moru. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en &ouml;ffentlichen Parkplatz etwa 200 Meter vom Strand entfernt. Im Sommer m&uuml;ssen Sie hier Parkgeb&uuml;hren zahlen. Neben dem roten Sand finden Sie auch einige kleine Kieselsteine ​​am Strand und Felsen an den R&auml;ndern. Diese Sch&ouml;nheit ist 500 Meter lang und kann bis zu 20 Meter breit sein. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Sie haben hier viele Stranddienstleistungen. Eine Sonnenliege und einen Regenschirm zu mieten ist hier kein Problem. Sie haben auch eine Strandbar und viele Arten von Restaurants direkt am Strand. Die Unterkunft ist hier in vielen Formen verf&uuml;gbar. Sie haben viele Apartments und Hotels zur Auswahl, einige nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt und viele mit Balkonblick auf den Strand.', 3773, 'de', 1),
(1104, 'La spiaggia montenegrina Petrovac na moru &egrave; una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; belle di questo paese mediterraneo. &Egrave; una destinazione molto famosa e popolare per i turisti che visitano questo luogo da tutto il mondo. L&#39;acqua qui &egrave; cristallina e la sabbia &egrave; un po &#39;rossa. Si trova nella regione di Budva, proprio nella citt&agrave; di Petrovac na Moru. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi veicolo e si dispone di un ampio parcheggio pubblico a circa 200 metri dalla spiaggia. In estate devi pagare le tasse di parcheggio qui. Oltre alla sabbia rossa, troverai anche alcuni piccoli ciottoli sulla spiaggia e rocce sui bordi. Questa bellezza &egrave; lunga 500 metri e pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 20 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi iniziare a nuotare immediatamente. Hai molti servizi di spiaggia qui. Noleggiare un lettino e un ombrellone non &egrave; un problema qui. Hanno anche un bar sulla spiaggia e molti tipi di ristoranti sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile in molte forme qui. Hai molti appartamenti e hotel tra cui scegliere, alcuni a pochi metri dalla spiaggia e molti con balcone vista sulla spiaggia.', 3773, 'it', 1),
(1105, 'Črnogorska plaža Petrovac na moru je ena najlep&scaron;ih plaž v tej sredozemski državi. Je zelo znana in priljubljena destinacija za turiste, ki ta kraj obiskujejo z vsega sveta. Voda je kristalno čista, pesek pa je rahlo rdečkaste barve. Nahaja se na območju Budve, prav v mestu Petrovac na Moru. Do te lokacije se lahko pripeljete z različnimi tipi vozila, veliko javno parkiri&scaron;če pa imate približno 200 metrov od plaže. Poleti morate tukaj plačevati parkirnino. Poleg rdečega peska boste na plaži na&scaron;li tudi nekaj majhnih kamenčkov in skal na robovih plaže. Ta lepotica je dolga 500 metrov in je lahko &scaron;iroka do 20 metrov. Dostop v vodo je zelo lep in takoj lahko začnete plavati. Tu imate veliko storitev na plaži. Najem ležalnika in senčnika tukaj ni problem. Imajo tudi bar na plaži in &scaron;tevilne vrste restavracij neposredno ob morju. Tukaj je nastanitev možna v različnih oblikah. Na izbiro imate veliko apartmajev in hotelov, nekateri so oddaljeni le nekaj metrov od plaže in &scaron;tevilni so na voljo z balkonskim pogledom na plažo.', 3773, 'sl', 1),
(1106, 'Crnogorska plaža Petrovac jedna je od najljep&scaron;ih plaža ove mediteranske države. Vrlo je poznato i popularno odredi&scaron;te za turiste koji posjećuju iz cijelog svijeta. Voda je kristalno bistra, a pijesak je blago crvenkaste boje. Nalazi se na području Budve, točno u gradu Petrovcu na Moru. Do ove lokacije možete se voziti različitim vrstama vozila, a veliko javno parkirali&scaron;te udaljeno je oko 200 metara od plaže. Ovdje ljeti morate plaćati parking. Osim crvenog pijeska, na rubovima plaže naći ćete i sitne &scaron;ljunke i stijene. Ova je ljepotica duga 500 metara, a može biti &scaron;iroka i do 20 metara. Pristup vodi je vrlo lijep i odmah možete početi plivati. Ovdje imate puno usluga na plaži. Unajmljivanje ležaljki i suncobrana ovdje nije problem. Također imaju bar na plaži i brojne vrste restorana tik uz more. Ovdje je moguć smje&scaron;taj u različitim oblicima. Postoji mnogo apartmana i hotela za biranje, neki na samo nekoliko metara od plaže, a mnogi s balkonom s pogledom na plažu.', 3773, 'hr', 1),
(1107, 'Einige Str&auml;nde in Montenegro sind wirklich atemberaubend, Worte sind schwer zu finden, um diese Sch&ouml;nheit zu beschreiben. Der Strand Plaža Drobni Pijesak ist einer von ihnen und geh&ouml;rt zu den f&uuml;nf sch&ouml;nsten und besten Str&auml;nden Montenegros. Es befindet sich in der Region Budva in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Drobnići. Es ist sehr einfach es mit Ihrem Fahrzeug zu erreichen. Beachten Sie jedoch, dass die asphaltierte Stra&szlig;e zum Parkplatz sehr steil ist. Sie haben hier zwei Parkpl&auml;tze. Vom Parkplatz zum Strand gelangen Sie zu Fu&szlig; in 200 Metern L&auml;nge und 40 Metern H&ouml;henunterschied. Der Strand ist 200 Meter lang und kann bis zu 30 Meter breit sein. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che sind kleine wei&szlig;e Kieselsteine, die mit etwas braunem Sand und einigen Felsen an den R&auml;ndern gemischt sind. Mit dem kristallklaren Wasser ist der Strand wirklich eine Attraktion. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und man kann fast sofort wegschwimmen. Hier gibt es eine Strandinfrastruktur sowie einige Restaurants und eine Strandbar. Die Unterbringung erfolgt nicht direkt am Strand, sondern in der N&auml;he der Hauptstra&szlig;e.', 3774, 'de', 1),
(1108, 'Alcune spiagge del Montenegro sono davvero mozzafiato, le parole sono difficili da trovare per descrivere questa bellezza. La spiaggia di Plaža Drobni Pijesak &egrave; una di queste ed &egrave; una delle cinque spiagge pi&ugrave; belle e pi&ugrave; belle del Montenegro. Si trova nella regione di Budva vicino al villaggio di Drobnići. &Egrave; molto facile arrivarci con il tuo veicolo. Tuttavia, si noti che la strada asfaltata per il parcheggio &egrave; molto ripida. Hai due posti auto qui. Dal parcheggio alla spiaggia &egrave; possibile percorrere 200 metri di lunghezza e 40 metri di altezza. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 200 metri e pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 30 metri. La superficie principale &egrave; di piccoli ciottoli bianchi mescolati con un po &#39;di sabbia marrone e alcune rocce ai bordi. Con l&#39;acqua cristallina, la spiaggia &egrave; davvero un&#39;attrazione. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi nuotare via quasi immediatamente. C&#39;&egrave; un&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia cos&igrave; come alcuni ristoranti e un bar sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione non &egrave; sulla spiaggia, ma vicino alla strada principale.', 3774, 'it', 1),
(1109, 'Nekatere črnogorske plaže so resnično dih jemajoče, težko je najti besede za opisovanje te lepote. Plaža Drobni Pijesak je ena izmed njih in spada med pet najlep&scaron;ih in najbolj&scaron;ih plaž v Črni gori. Nahaja se na območju Budve v bližini vasi Drobnići. Dostop do parkiri&scaron;ča plaže je dokaj enostaven, vendar ne brez nevarnosti. Upo&scaron;tevajte da je asfaltirana cesta do parkiri&scaron;ča zelo strma. Tu imate dve parkirni mesti. Od parkiri&scaron;ča do plaže se lahko sprehodite v dolžini 200 metrov in vi&scaron;ini 40 metrov. Plaža je dolga 200 metrov in je lahko &scaron;iroka do 30 metrov. Glavna povr&scaron;ina so majhni beli kamenčki, pome&scaron;ani z nekaj rjavega peska in nekaj skalami na robovih. S kristalno čisto vodo je plaža res prava privlačnost. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in z plavanjem lahko začnete skoraj takoj. Tukaj se nahaja tudi nekaj plažne infrastruktura, pa tudi nekatere restavracije in bar na plaži. Namestitev ni možna na plaži, ampak v bližini glavne ulice, ki je vi&scaron;je zgoraj.', 3774, 'sl', 1),
(1110, 'Neke su crnogorske plaže uistinu zadivljujuće, te&scaron;ko je naći riječi za opisivanje ove ljepote. Plaža Drobni Pijesak jedna je od njih i jedna je od pet najljep&scaron;ih i najboljih plaža u Crnoj Gori. Nalazi se na predjelu Budve u blizini sela Drobnići. Pristup parkingu na plaži prilično je jednostavan, ali ne bez opasnosti. Imajte na umu da je asfaltirana cesta do parkirali&scaron;ta vrlo strma. Ovdje imate dva parkirna mjesta. Od parkirali&scaron;ta do plaže možete hodati 200 metara duljine i 40 metara visine. Plaža je dugačka 200 metara, a može biti &scaron;iroka i do 30 metara. Glavna povr&scaron;ina su mali bijeli &scaron;ljunci pomije&scaron;ani s nekim smeđim pijeskom i nekim stijenama na rubovima. Uz kristalno čistu vodu, plaža je prava atrakcija. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i možete početi plivati gotovo odmah. Tu je i neka plaža na plaži, kao i neki restorani i bar na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj nije moguć na plaži, ali u blizini glavne ulice iznad.', 3774, 'hr', 1),
(1111, 'Die Str&auml;nde in Montenegro, insbesondere in der Region Budva, sind ber&uuml;hmt f&uuml;r ihre Sch&ouml;nheit und sind bei den Strandliebhabern sehr beliebt. Obwohl die K&uuml;ste hier sehr steil und felsig ist, gibt es einige Orte, an denen die Natur eine auff&auml;llige Sch&ouml;nheit geschaffen hat. Dies gilt auch f&uuml;r den Strand plaža Crvena Glavica, der sich in der N&auml;he des ber&uuml;hmten Dorfes Sveti Stefan befindet. Der Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen. Im Sommer, wenn Sie die Stra&szlig;e zum Strand hinunterfahren, m&uuml;ssen Sie durch ein Camp fahren, bevor Sie den endg&uuml;ltigen Parkplatz erreichen. Die Stra&szlig;e zum Parkplatz besteht teilweise aus Beton, teilweise aus Schotter und ist manchmal schmal und steil. Um vom Parkplatz zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie einen kleinen Pfad mit einem H&ouml;henunterschied von etwa 20 Metern nehmen. Am Strand selbst gibt es als Oberfl&auml;che kleine Kieselsteine, einige Felsen und auch eine Betonterrasse. Insgesamt ist der Strand 100 m lang und etwa 15 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten ins Wasser zu gehen und fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen zu beginnen. Der Strand ist sehr gut organisiert und Sie verf&uuml;gen &uuml;ber eine Strandinfrastruktur, sowie ein Restaurant direkt am Strand. Die n&auml;chstgelegene Unterkunft befindet sich in Form eines Camps oder einiger Apartments in der N&auml;he der Stra&szlig;e zum Strand.', 3775, 'de', 1),
(1112, 'Le spiagge del Montenegro, in particolare nella regione di Budva, sono famose per la loro bellezza e sono molto apprezzate dagli amanti della spiaggia. Sebbene la costa qui sia molto ripida e rocciosa, ci sono alcuni luoghi in cui la natura ha creato una bellezza sorprendente. Questo vale anche per la spiaggia di Plaža Crvena Glavica, che si trova vicino al famoso villaggio di Sveti Stefan. La spiaggia &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con qualsiasi veicolo. In estate, quando guidi lungo la strada per la spiaggia, devi guidare attraverso un campo prima di raggiungere il parcheggio finale. La strada per il parcheggio &egrave; in parte in cemento, in parte in ghiaia ed &egrave; talvolta stretta e ripida. Per arrivare dal parcheggio alla spiaggia, devi prendere un piccolo sentiero con un dislivello di circa 20 metri. Sulla stessa spiaggia ci sono piccoli ciottoli, alcuni scogli e una terrazza di cemento. Nel complesso, la spiaggia &egrave; lunga 100 me larga circa 15 m. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e hai diverse opzioni per andare in acqua e iniziare a nuotare quasi immediatamente. La spiaggia &egrave; molto ben organizzata e si dispone di un&#39;infrastruttura di spiaggia e un ristorante proprio sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione pi&ugrave; vicina &egrave; sotto forma di un campo o di alcuni appartamenti vicino alla strada per la spiaggia.', 3775, 'it', 1),
(1113, 'Plaže v Črni gori, zlasti na območju Budve, slovijo po svoji lepoti in so zelo priljubljene pri ljubiteljih plaž. Čeprav je obala tukaj zelo strma in skalnata, je nekaj krajev, kjer je narava ustvarila presenetljivo lepoto. To velja tudi za plažo Crvena Glavica, ki se nahaja v bližini znane vasice Sveti Stefan. Do plaže je enostavno priti s katerim koli vozilom. Poleti, ko se peljete po cesti do plaže, se morate peljati skozi kamp, preden pridete do končnega parkiri&scaron;ča. Pot do parkiri&scaron;ča je deloma betonska, deloma gramozna, včasih pa ozka in strma. Če želite priti s parkiri&scaron;ča do plaže, morate prehoditi kraj&scaron;o pot z vi&scaron;insko razliko približno 20 metrov. Na sami plaži so majhni prodniki, nekaj kamnin in betonska terasa. Na splo&scaron;no je plaža dolga 100 m in &scaron;iroka približno 15 m. Dostop v vodo je zelo prijeten in na voljo imate več možnosti, da greste v vodo in začnete plavati skoraj takoj, tudi skočite lahko v vodo iz pomola. Plaža je zelo dobro organizirana in na plaži imate storitev in restavracijo. Najbližja nastanitev je v obliki kampa ali nekaterih apartmajev ob cesti do plaže.', 3775, 'sl', 1),
(1114, 'Plaže u Crnoj Gori, posebno na području Budve, poznate su po svojoj ljepoti i vrlo su popularne među ljubiteljima plaže. Iako je obala ovdje vrlo strma i stjenovita, postoje mjesta na kojima je priroda stvorila upečatljive ljepote. To se odnosi i na plažu Crvena glavica koja se nalazi u blizini poznatog sela Sveti Stefan. Do plaže je lako doći bilo kojim vozilom. Ljeti, kad vozite cestom prema plaži, morate proći kroz kamp, ​​prije nego &scaron;to stignete do konačnog parkirali&scaron;ta. Put do parkirali&scaron;ta dijelom je betoniran, dijelom &scaron;ljunak, a ponekad uzak i strm. Da biste do&scaron;li s parkirali&scaron;ta do plaže, morate pro&scaron;etati kraćom stazom s visinskom razlikom od oko 20 metara. Na samoj plaži nalaze se mali &scaron;ljunak, neke stijene i betonska terasa. Općenito, plaža je dugačka 100 m i &scaron;iroka oko 15 m. Pristup vodi je vrlo udoban i imate vi&scaron;e &scaron;anse da uđete u vodu i počnete plivati ​​gotovo odmah, čak i skočite u vodu s pristani&scaron;ta. Plaža je vrlo dobro organizirana i na plaži imate uslugu i restoran. Najbliži smje&scaron;taj nalazi se u obliku kampa ili nekih apartmana uz cestu do plaže.', 3775, 'hr', 1),
(1115, 'Der ber&uuml;hmteste Strand Montenegros muss der Strand Sveti Stefan sein. Es ist ein echter Touristenmagnet und ein ganz besonderer Strand, aber auch ein sehr teurer. Es befindet sich in der Region Budva. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug diesen Strand zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand parken. Beachten Sie jedoch, dass die Parkgeb&uuml;hr ziemlich hoch ist. F&uuml;r ein normales Auto berechnen sie 2 Euro pro Stunde, f&uuml;r einen Van oder ein Wohnmobil zahlen Sie 10 Euro pro Stunde. F&uuml;r einen Bus zahlen Sie noch mehr. Der Strand selbst ist ein roter Kieselstrand mit etwas Sandmischung und einigen Felsen an den Grenzen. Hier haben Sie tats&auml;chlich zwei Str&auml;nde, einer ist f&uuml;r die &Ouml;ffentlichkeit zug&auml;nglich, der andere ist nur f&uuml;r Hotelg&auml;ste ge&ouml;ffnet. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt 750 Meter und kann bis zu 30 Meter breit sein. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und man kann fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier auch einige Strandausr&uuml;stung mieten. Beachten Sie jedoch, dass dies der teuerste Strand Montenegros ist. Das Mieten einer Sonnenliege und eines Sonnenschirms in der ersten Reihe kostet 50 Euro. Hier gibt es auch Stranddienstleistungen auf h&ouml;chstem Niveau. Restaurants und Strandbars befinden sich ebenfalls direkt am Strand. Sie haben auch viele Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Hotels und Apartments.', 3776, 'de', 1),
(1116, 'La spiaggia pi&ugrave; famosa del Montenegro deve essere la spiaggia di Sveti Stefan. &Egrave; una vera calamita turistica e una spiaggia molto speciale, ma anche molto costosa. Si trova nella regione di Budva. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungere questa spiaggia con qualsiasi veicolo e puoi parcheggiare proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. Tuttavia, tieni presente che il costo del parcheggio &egrave; piuttosto elevato. Per un&#39;auto normale fanno pagare 2 euro l&#39;ora, per un furgone o un camper si pagano 10 euro l&#39;ora. Paghi ancora di pi&ugrave; per un autobus. La stessa spiaggia &egrave; una spiaggia di ciottoli rossi con un po &#39;di sabbia mista e alcuni scogli ai bordi. In realt&agrave; hai due spiagge qui, una &egrave; aperta al pubblico, l&#39;altra &egrave; aperta solo agli ospiti dell&#39;hotel. La lunghezza totale &egrave; di 750 metri e pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 30 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi iniziare a nuotare quasi immediatamente. Puoi anche noleggiare l&#39;attrezzatura da spiaggia qui. Tuttavia, tieni presente che questa &egrave; la spiaggia pi&ugrave; costosa del Montenegro. Noleggiare un lettino e un ombrellone in prima fila costa 50 euro. Ci sono anche servizi di spiaggia al pi&ugrave; alto livello. Ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia si trovano direttamente sulla spiaggia. Hanno anche molte opzioni di alloggio, principalmente sotto forma di hotel e appartamenti.', 3776, 'it', 1),
(1117, 'Najbolj znana plaža v Črni gori mora biti plaža Sveti Stefan. Je pravi turistični magnet in prav posebna plaža, a tudi zelo draga. Nahaja se na območju Budve. Do te plaže se da zelo enostavno priti s katerim koli vozilom in parkirate lahko tik pred plažo. Upo&scaron;tevajte pa, da je parkirnina precej visoka. Za navaden avto zaračunajo 2 evra na uro, za kombi ali avtodom pa plačate 10 evrov na uro. &Scaron;e več plačate za avtobus. Sama plaža je rdeče prodnata plaža z nekaj me&scaron;anice peska in nekaj skal na obrobju. Tu imate dejansko dve plaži, ena je odprta za javnost, druga pa je odprta samo za goste hotela. Skupna dolžina je 750 metrov, &scaron;iroka je lahko do 30 metrov. Dostop v vodo je zelo lep in plavati lahko začnete skoraj takoj. Tukaj lahko najamete tudi nekaj opreme za plažo. Vendar ne pozabite, da je to najdražja plaža v Črni gori. Najem ležalnika in sončnika v prvi vrsti stane 50 evrov. Na najvi&scaron;ji ravni so tudi storitve na plaži. Restavracije in bari na plaži se nahajajo tudi neposredno na plaži. Neposredno na plaži in v okolici imate&nbsp; tudi veliko možnosti za nastanitev, predvsem v obliki hotelov in apartmajev.', 3776, 'sl', 1),
(1118, 'Najpoznatija plaža u Crnoj Gori mora biti plaža Sveti Stefan. Pravi je turistički magnet i vrlo posebna plaža, ali i vrlo skupa. Smje&scaron;ten na području Budve. Do ove plaže se može lako doći bilo kojim vozilom, a možete se parkirati točno ispred plaže. Međutim, imajte na umu da je parkiranje prilično visoko. Za običan automobil naplaćuju 2 dolara na sat, a za kombi ili kamper plaćate 10 dolara na sat. Za autobus plaćate vi&scaron;e. Sama plaža je crvena &scaron;ljunčana plaža s ponekim pijeskom i ponekim stijenama na periferiji. Ovdje su zapravo dvije plaže, jedna otvorena za javnost, a druga otvorena samo za goste hotela. Ukupna duljina je 750 metara, a može biti &scaron;iroka i do 30 metara. Pristup vodi je vrlo lijep i možete početi plivati ​​gotovo odmah. Ovdje možete unajmiti i ne&scaron;to opreme za plažu. Međutim, ne zaboravite da je ovo najskuplja plaža u Crnoj Gori. Iznajmljivanje ležaljke i suncobrana u prvom redu ko&scaron;ta 50 eura. Usluge na plaži također su na najvi&scaron;em nivou. Restorani i barovi na plaži također se nalaze direktno na plaži. Izravno na plaži i u okolici također imate dosta smje&scaron;taja, posebno u obliku hotela i apartmana.', 3776, 'hr', 1),
(1119, 'Nicht weit vom ber&uuml;hmtesten Strand Montenegros entfernt liegt die kleine Stadt Pržno. Die ganze Region Budva ist voll von einem der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde Montenegros. Der Strand Pržno ist zwar nicht so ber&uuml;hmt, aber auch ein Blickfang. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichbar, und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto auf einigen &ouml;ffentlichen Parkpl&auml;tzen in etwa 200 Metern Entfernung abstellen, die etwa 20 Meter vom Strand entfernt sind. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch andere Materialien, wie Kieselsteine, die mit dem Sand gemischt sind. Auf einer Seite des Strandes haben Sie auch Holzterrassen. Der Wassereintritt an diesem Strand ist sehr sch&ouml;n und man kann fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Viele Stranddientsleistungen sind direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar. Sie haben sogar einen Pool in Strandn&auml;he, den Sie als Hotelgast nutzen k&ouml;nnen. Das einzige, was diesen Strand so besonders macht, sind die Restaurants, die sich sehr nahe am Strand befinden, einige &uuml;ber dem Wasser, und mit ihrer Dekoration schaffen sie eine sehr romantische Atmosph&auml;re. Rund um den Strand gibt es viele Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften, haupts&auml;chlich als Hotels oder Apartments.', 3777, 'de', 1),
(1120, 'Non lontano dalla spiaggia pi&ugrave; famosa del Montenegro, si trova la piccola citt&agrave; di Pržno. Tutta la regione di Budva &egrave; piena di una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; belle del Montenegro. La spiaggia di Pržno, anche se non &egrave; cos&igrave; famosa, attira anche gli occhi. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi lasciare l&#39;auto in alcuni parcheggi pubblici a circa 200 metri di distanza, a circa 20 metri di dislivello dalla spiaggia. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; sabbia ma hai anche altri materiali, come i ciottoli mescolati con la sabbia. Su un lato della spiaggia ci sono anche terrazze in legno. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua su questa spiaggia &egrave; molto bello e puoi iniziare a nuotare quasi immediatamente. Molti servizi di spiaggia sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. Hai anche una piscina vicino alla spiaggia, che puoi usare se sei un ospite dell&#39;hotel. L&#39;unica cosa che rende speciale questa spiaggia sono i ristoranti, che sono situati molto vicino alla spiaggia, alcuni sopra l&#39;acqua, e con la loro decorazione, creano un&#39;atmosfera molto romantica. Molti tipi di alloggi sono disponibili in tutta la spiaggia, principalmente come hotel o appartamenti.', 3777, 'it', 1),
(1121, 'Mestece Pržno je nedaleč od najbolj znane črnogorske plaže. Celotna regija Budva je polna ene najlep&scaron;ih plaž v Črni gori. Plaža Pržno sicer ni tako znana, je pa tudi privlačna za oči. Dostop z vozilom je enostaven, avtomobil pa lahko parkirate na nekaterih javnih parkiri&scaron;čih, oddaljenih približno 200 metrov dolžine in približno 20 metrov vi&scaron;ine od plaže. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži je pesek, imate pa tudi druge materiale, na primer kamenčke, pome&scaron;ane s peskom. Na eni strani plaže imate tudi lesene terase. Vstop v vodo na tej plaži je zelo lep in plavati lahko začnete skoraj takoj. Na plaži so na voljo &scaron;tevilne storitve. V bližini plaže imate celo bazen, ki ga lahko uporabite kot hotelski gost. Poleg ostalih dejstev, je tudi ena dejstvo, zaradi katerega je ta plaža tako posebna, to so restavracije, ki so zelo blizu plaže, nekatere nad vodo in s svojo dekoracijo ustvarijo zelo romantično vzdu&scaron;je. Obstaja veliko vrst nastanitve v okolici plaže, predvsem kot hoteli ali apartmaji.', 3777, 'sl', 1),
(1122, 'Grad Pržno je nedaleko od najpoznatije crnogorske plaže. Cijeli region Budve prepun je jedne od najljep&scaron;ih plaža u Crnoj Gori. Plaža Pržno nije toliko poznata, ali je atraktivna i za oko. Pristup vozilu je jednostavan, a automobil se može parkirati na nekim javnim parkirali&scaron;tima, duljine oko 200 metara i visine oko 20 metara. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je pijesak, ali imate i druge materijale poput &scaron;ljunka pomije&scaron;anog s pijeskom. S jedne strane plaže imate i drvene terase. Pristup vodi ovoj plaži je vrlo lijep i možete početi plivati ​​gotovo odmah. Na plaži su dostupne brojne usluge. Čak imate i bazen u blizini plaže koji možete koristiti kao hotelski gost. Pored ostalih činjenica, jedna od stvari koja ovu plažu čini tako posebnom jesu restorani, koji se nalaze u neposrednoj blizini plaže, neki iznad vode i svojim ukrasom stvaraju vrlo romantičnu atmosferu. Mnogo je vrsta smje&scaron;taja oko plaže, uglavnom kao hoteli ili apartmani.', 3777, 'hr', 1),
(1123, 'Der Strand Kamenovo liegt an der ber&uuml;hmten K&uuml;ste der Region Budva. Die n&auml;chste kleine Stadt ist Pržno, nicht weit vom ber&uuml;hmtesten Strand Montenegros, dem Strand Sveti Stefan, entfernt. Es liegt an der Hauptstra&szlig;e, von der aus Sie auch auf den &ouml;ffentlichen Parkplatz zugreifen k&ouml;nnen, der im Sommer zu zahlen ist. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie einen 200 Meter langen Pfad mit einem H&ouml;henunterschied von 15 Metern hinuntersteigen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 300 Meter und die maximale Breite betr&auml;gt 50 Meter. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist brauner Sand, aber auch Kieselsteine sind eingemischt. Sie haben hier einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und k&ouml;nnen fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Stranddienstleistungen sind in vielen Formen am Strand selbst verf&uuml;gbar. Sie haben auch eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant am Strand, aber hier ist keine Unterkunft direkt verf&uuml;gbar, sondern in der kleinen Stadt Pržno, wo Ihnen viele Hotels und Apartments zur Verf&uuml;gung stehen.', 3778, 'de', 1),
(1124, 'La spiaggia di Kamenovo si trova sulla famosa costa della regione di Budva. La cittadina pi&ugrave; vicina &egrave; Pržno, che non &egrave; lontana dalla spiaggia pi&ugrave; famosa del Montenegro, la spiaggia di Sveti Stefan. Si trova sulla strada principale, da cui &egrave; possibile accedere anche al parcheggio pubblico, che &egrave; pagabile in estate. Per raggiungere la spiaggia, &egrave; necessario scendere un sentiero lungo 200 metri, che ha un dislivello di 15 metri. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 300 metri e ha una larghezza massima di 50 metri. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia marrone, ma all&#39;interno si mescolano anche i ciottoli. Hai una bella entrata d&#39;acqua qui e puoi iniziare a nuotare quasi immediatamente. I servizi di spiaggia sono disponibili in molte forme sulla spiaggia stessa. Hai anche un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante sulla spiaggia, ma qui non sono disponibili alloggi direttamente, ma nella piccola citt&agrave; di Pržno, dove hai molti hotel e appartamenti a tua disposizione.', 3778, 'it', 1),
(1125, 'Plaža Kamenovo se nahaja na znani obali budvanske regije. Najbližje mestece je Pržno, nedaleč od najbolj znane črnogorske plaže, plaže Sveti Stefan. Je na glavni ulici, od koder lahko dostopate tudi do javnega parkiri&scaron;ča, ki je plačljivo poleti. Če želite priti do plaže, se morate spustiti po 200 metrski poti z vi&scaron;insko razliko 15 metrov. Skupna dolžina plaže je 300 metrov, največja &scaron;irina pa je 50 metrov. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži je rjavi pesek, vendar so vme&scaron;ani tudi kamenčki. Tu imate zelo lep dostop do vode in lahko začnete plavati skoraj takoj. Usluge na plaži so na voljo v različnih oblikah. Na plaži imajo tudi bar na plaži in restavracijo, vendar tukaj ni na voljo neposredna namestitev, temveč je ta v majhnem mestu Pržno, kjer je veliko hotelov in apartmajev.', 3778, 'sl', 1),
(1126, 'Plaža Kamenovo nalazi se na poznatoj obali budvanskog kraja. Najbliži grad je Pržno, nedaleko od najpoznatije crnogorske plaže, plaže Sveti Stefan. Nalazi se u glavnoj ulici, odakle se također može pristupiti javnom parkirali&scaron;tu, koje se plaća ljeti. Da biste do&scaron;li do plaže, morate se spustiti stazom od 200 metara s razlikom visine od 15 metara. Ukupna duljina plaže je 300 metara, a maksimalna &scaron;irina 50 metara. Glavno područje plaže je smeđi pijesak, ali su također uključeni &scaron;ljunak. Ovdje imate vrlo dobar pristup vodi i možete početi plivati gotovo odmah. Usluge na plaži dostupne su u različitim oblicima. Na plaži je i bar na plaži i restoran, ali nema direktnog smje&scaron;taja već je ovaj u malom gradu Pržno, gdje ima puno hotela i apartmana.', 3778, 'hr', 1),
(1127, 'In Montenegro k&ouml;nnen Sie sehr unterschiedliche Str&auml;nde haben, wie in Form, touristischer Infrastruktur und der Strandoberfl&auml;che. Dieser Strand in Montenegro ist 2 Kilometer lang und bis zu 50 Meter breit, sodass Sie wirklich viel Platz haben, um Ihren Platz f&uuml;r Ihr Handtuch zu finden. Es gibt nicht viele solcher Str&auml;nde in diesem Land. Wenn Sie einen solchen Strand bevorzugen, sollten Sie die kleine Stadt Bečići in der Region Budva besuchen. Dieser Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand parken, wo Sie viel Platz haben. Im Sommer ist er zahlbar. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch kleine Kieselsteine ​​in verschiedenen Gr&ouml;&szlig;en und Farben, die mit dem Sand gemischt sind. Der Wassereintritt ist hier sehr sch&ouml;n und schon nach 10 Metern kann man schwimmen gehen. Dies ist eine sehr beliebte Gegend, Sie haben viele Stranddienstleistungen und Strandinfrastruktur auf dem gesamten Strandabschnitt verf&uuml;gbar. Kinder werden diesen Ort auch lieben, direkt neben dem Strand gibt es einen gro&szlig;en Kinderspielplatz. Hier gibt es viele Arten von Restaurants und Strandbars. Die Unterkunft ist in vielen verschiedenen Formen verf&uuml;gbar. Sie haben viele Luxusapartments und Hotels sowie einige Resorts direkt am Strand.', 3779, 'de', 1),
(1128, 'In Montenegro puoi avere spiagge molto diverse, per forma, infrastruttura turistica e superficie principale della spiaggia. Questa spiaggia del Montenegro &egrave; in realt&agrave; lunga 2 chilometri e larga fino a 50 metri, quindi hai davvero molto spazio per trovare il posto per il tuo asciugamano. Non ci sono molte spiagge simili in questo paese, quindi se preferite una spiaggia del genere, dovreste visitare la piccola citt&agrave; di Bečići, situata nella regione di Budva. Questa spiaggia &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi effettivamente parcheggiare direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, dove hai molto spazio, in estate &egrave; pagabile. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia, ma hai anche piccoli ciottoli di diverse dimensioni e colori mescolati con la sabbia. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello qui e puoi iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; dopo soli 10 metri. Questa &egrave; una zona molto popolare, hai un sacco di servizi e infrastrutture sulla spiaggia disponibili su tutto il tratto di spiaggia. Anche i bambini adoreranno questo posto, proprio accanto alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un grande parco giochi per bambini. Molti tipi di ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia sono presenti qui. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile in molte forme diverse. Hai molti appartamenti e hotel di lusso, cos&igrave; come alcuni resort situati direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia.', 3779, 'it', 1),
(1129, 'V Črni gori imate lahko zelo različne plaže, po oblika, turistična infrastruktura, strukturi povr&scaron;ine plaže, dolžini in &scaron;irini,... Ta plaža v Črni gori je dolga 2 kilometra in &scaron;iroka do 50 metrov, tako da imate res veliko prostora, da najdete svoje mesto za brisačo. V tej državi ni veliko tak&scaron;nih plaž. Če imate raje tak&scaron;no plažo, obi&scaron;čite mestece Bečići na območju Budve. Do te plaže je zelo enostavno priti s katerim koli vozilom in parkirate lahko tik pred plažo, kjer imate veliko prostora. Plača se poleti, izven sezone pa ne. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži je pesek, imate pa tudi majhne kamenčke različnih velikosti in barv, pome&scaron;ane s peskom. Dostop v vodo je tu zelo lep in po 10 metrih že lahko zaplavate. To je zelo priljubljeno območje, na razpolago imate veliko storitev na plaži in plažne infrastrukture. Otroci bodo občudovali to plažo, saj je tik ob plaži veliko otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če. Tukaj je veliko vrst restavracij in barov na plaži. Nastanitev je na voljo v različnih oblikah. Na voljo imate veliko luksuznih apartmajev in hotelov, ki se nahajajo tik ob plaži.', 3779, 'sl', 1),
(1130, 'Možete imati vrlo različite plaže u Crnoj Gori, po obliku, turističkoj infrastrukturi, strukturi povr&scaron;ine plaže, dužini i &scaron;irini, ... Ova plaža u Crnoj Gori duga je 2 kilometra i &scaron;irina do 50 metara, tako da zaista imate puno prostora za pronalazak va&scaron; ručnik. U ovoj zemlji nema mnogo ovakvih plaža. Ako preferirate ovakvu plažu, posjetite malene gradove Bečići na području Budve. Do ove plaže je vrlo lako doći bilo kojim vozilom, a možete parkirati točno ispred plaže na kojoj imate puno prostora. Plaća se ljeti, ali van sezone. Glavno područje plaže je pijesak, a imate i sitne &scaron;ljunak različitih veličina i boja pomije&scaron;anih s pijeskom. Pristup vodi je vrlo lijep ovdje i nakon 10 metara već možete plivati. Ovo je vrlo popularno područje, na raspolaganju vam je puno usluga na plaži i plaže. Djeca će se diviti ovoj plaži jer se uz plažu nalazi veliko igrali&scaron;te. Ovdje se nalaze mnoge vrste restorana i barova na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj je dostupan u raznim oblicima. Postoji mnogo luksuznih apartmana i hotela koji se nalaze tik uz plažu.', 3779, 'hr', 1),
(1131, 'Die Stadt Budva ist ber&uuml;hmt f&uuml;r ihren sehr langen wei&szlig;en Kieselstrand mit einem sehr klaren und blauen Wasser. Dieser Strand von Montenegro befindet sich in der Region Budva und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen tats&auml;chlich direkt vor dem Strand parken, wo Ihnen ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz zur Verf&uuml;gung steht. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand sind wei&szlig;e Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben auch einige gro&szlig;e Steine, Betonplatten und eine kleine Menge Sand. Der Wassereintritt, egal wo Sie sind, ist sehr einfach und Sie k&ouml;nnen nach nur 10 Metern wegschwimmen. Der Strand ist mehr als einen Kilometer lang und an einigen Stellen bis zu 30 Meter breit. Entlang des Strandes stehen Ihnen zahlreiche Stranddienstleistungen und Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung. Sie m&uuml;ssen sich keine Sorgen machen, dass Strandbars und Restaurants hier nicht vorhanden sind. Hier gibt es viele davon und sie sind in allen Formen und Formen erh&auml;ltlich. Das Gleiche gilt, wenn Sie Ihren Urlaub hier verbringen m&ouml;chten. Sie haben viele verschiedene Unterk&uuml;nfte rund um den Strand, in denen Sie eine Vielzahl von Hotels und Apartments ausw&auml;hlen k&ouml;nnen, von denen einige sehr nahe am Strand liegen.', 3780, 'de', 1),
(1132, 'La citt&agrave; di Budva &egrave; famosa per la sua lunghissima spiaggia di ciottoli bianchi con un&#39;acqua molto chiara e blu. Questa spiaggia del Montenegro si trova nella regione di Budva ed &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Puoi effettivamente parcheggiare direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, dove hai a disposizione un ampio parcheggio. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; facile. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di ciottoli bianchi, ma hai anche delle grandi pietre, lastre di cemento e una piccola quantit&agrave; di sabbia. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua, indipendentemente da dove ti trovi, &egrave; molto semplice e puoi nuotare via dopo soli 10 metri. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga pi&ugrave; di un chilometro e in alcuni punti larga fino a 30 metri. Lungo tutta la spiaggia, hai molti servizi e infrastrutture sulla spiaggia disponibili. Non devi preoccuparti che i bar sulla spiaggia e i ristoranti non siano presenti qui, qui ce ne sono molti e sono disponibili in tutte le forme e forme. Lo stesso vale se hai intenzione di trascorrere le tue vacanze qui, hai un sacco di alloggi diversi disponibili intorno alla spiaggia, dove puoi scegliere una variet&agrave; di hotel e appartamenti, alcuni molto vicini alla spiaggia.', 3780, 'it', 1),
(1133, 'Mesto Budva slovi po zelo dolgi beli prodnati plaži z zelo bistro in modro vodo. Ta črnogorska plaža se nahaja na območju Budve in je zelo enostavno dosegljiva s katerim koli vozilom. Pravzaprav lahko parkirate tik pred plažo, kjer je zelo veliko parkiri&scaron;če. Dostop do plaže je enostaven. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži so beli kamenčki, imate pa tudi nekaj velikih kamnov, betonskih plo&scaron;č in majhne količine peska. Vstop v vodo, ne glede na to, kje si, je zelo enostaven in lahko začne plavati že po 10 metrih. Plaža je dolga več kot kilometer, ponekod pa je tudi do 30 metrov &scaron;iroka. Ob plaži so na voljo &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži in plažna infrastruktura. Ni vam treba skrbeti, da ne bi bilo na plaži dostopnih barov in restavracij. Tu jih je veliko in so vam na voljo v vseh oblikah in oblikah. Enako velja, če želite svoje počitnice preživeti v Črni Gori. Blizu plaže so vam na voljo &scaron;tevilne različne namestitve, kjer lahko izbirate med &scaron;tevilnimi hoteli in apartmaji, med katerimi so nekateri zelo blizu plaže.', 3780, 'sl', 1),
(1134, 'Budva je poznata po vrlo dugoj bijeloj &scaron;ljunčanoj plaži s vrlo bistrom i plavom vodom. Ova crnogorska plaža nalazi se na području Budve i lako je dostupna bilo kojim vozilom. Možete se parkirati točno ispred plaže, gdje postoji vrlo veliko parkirali&scaron;te. Pristup plaži je jednostavan. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže su bijeli &scaron;ljunak, ali imate i nekoliko velikih kamenja, betonskih ploča i male količine pijeska. Ući u vodu, bez obzira gdje se nalazite, vrlo je jednostavno i možete početi plivati ​​u krugu od 10 metara. Plaža je duga vi&scaron;e od kilometra, a na nekim mjestima i do 30 metara. Uz plažu su dostupne brojne usluge na plaži. Ne morate brinuti o nedostatku beach barova i restorana. Ima ih mnogo i dostupni su u svim oblicima i oblicima. Isto je i ako želite odmor provesti u Crnoj Gori. Postoji mnogo različitih smje&scaron;taja u blizini plaže koje možete izabrati, a mnogi hoteli i apartmani, od kojih su neki vrlo blizu plaže.', 3780, 'hr', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1135, 'Budva, la citt&agrave; del Montenegro, deve essere la citt&agrave; pi&ugrave; famosa di questo splendido paese mediterraneo. Non solo la citt&agrave; &egrave; molto attraente, ma hai anche alcune spiagge direttamente in citt&agrave;, che ti lasceranno a bocca aperta. La spiaggia che stiamo descrivendo qui si chiama Plaža Ričardova glava ed &egrave; situata nel centro della citt&agrave; di Budva. &Egrave; facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e hai alcuni parcheggi pubblici a pagamento dove puoi lasciare la tua auto. Ci vogliono 200 metri di cammino per raggiungere la spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 150 metri e in alcuni punti larga 25 metri. La superficie principale &egrave; di ciottoli, ma hai anche del cemento e della sabbia, un molo si trova anche nel mezzo della spiaggia. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; in alcuni punti non cos&igrave; comodo, perch&eacute; sul fondo ci sono molte pietre e rocce. Puoi andare in acqua dalla spiaggia o saltare dal molo. Hai alcune infrastrutture e servizi di spiaggia disponibili qui. Molti ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia si trovano sulla spiaggia o vicino alla spiaggia, cos&igrave; come un hotel e alcuni appartamenti, se decidi che questa spiaggia sar&agrave; la tua prossima vacanza estiva.', 3781, 'it', 1),
(1136, 'Die montenegrinische Stadt Budva muss die ber&uuml;hmteste Stadt in diesem wundersch&ouml;nen Mittelmeerland sein. Die Stadt ist nicht nur sehr attraktiv, Sie haben auch ein paar Str&auml;nde direkt in der Stadt, die Sie verzaubern werden. Der Strand, den wir hier beschreiben, hei&szlig;t Plaža Ričardova glava und befindet sich im Zentrum der Stadt Budva. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben ein paar &ouml;ffentliche kostenpflichtige Parkpl&auml;tze, auf denen Sie Ihr Auto abstellen k&ouml;nnen. Zum Strand gelangen Sie nach 200 Metern. Der Strand ist 150 Meter lang und an einigen Stellen 25 Meter breit. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che sind Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben auch etwas Beton und etwas Sand, ein Pier befindet sich auch in der Mitte des Strandes. Der Wassereintritt ist an einigen Stellen nicht so bequem, weil Sie viele Steine ​​und Felsen am Boden haben. Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder vom Strand ins Wasser gehen oder vom Pier springen. Hier stehen Ihnen einige Strandinfrastrukturen und Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Viele Restaurants und Strandbars befinden sich am Strand oder in Strandn&auml;he sowie ein Hotel und einige Apartments, wenn Sie sich f&uuml;r diesen Strand als n&auml;chsten Sommerurlaub entscheiden.', 3781, 'de', 1),
(1137, 'Črnogorsko mesto Budva mora biti najbolj znano mesto v tej čudoviti sredozemski državi. Mesto je ne samo zelo privlačno, v mestu imate tudi nekaj plaž, ki vas bodo očarale. Plaža, ki jo opisujemo, se imenuje Plaža Ričardova glava in se nahaja v sredi&scaron;ču mesta Budva. Do bližine plaže se lahko pripeljete z različnimi tipi vozil, edino večji avtodomi niso priporočljivi, kjer imate na voljo par javnih plačljivih parkiri&scaron;č za parkiranje va&scaron;ega avtomobila. Plaža je oddaljena 200 metrov od najbližjega parkiri&scaron;ča. Plaža je dolga 150 metrov in na nekaterih mestih &scaron;iroka 25 metrov. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je prod, vendar imate tudi nekaj betona in nekaj peska, na sredini plaže pa je tudi pomol. Vstopanje v vodo ponekod ni tako enostavno, saj imate na tleh veliko kamenja in kamnin. Lahko greste v vodo s plaže ali skočite s pomola. Tu je na voljo nekaj infrastrukture in nekaj storitve na plaži. &Scaron;tevilne restavracije in bari na plaži se nahajajo na plaži ali blizu nje, pa tudi hotel in nekateri apartmaji, če vas plaža očara in izberete to plažo za svoj naslednji poletni dopust.', 3781, 'sl', 1),
(1138, 'Crnogorski grad Budva mora biti najpoznatiji grad u ovoj prekrasnoj mediteranskoj zemlji. Ne samo da je grad vrlo atraktivan, u gradu postoje neke plaže koje će vas očarati. Plaža koju opisujemo zove se Richard&#39;s Head Beach i nalazi se u srcu Budve. Do plaže se možete voziti s različitim vrstama vozila, ne preporučuju se samo veći kućici gdje imate par javnih parking mjesta za parkiranje automobila. Plaža je udaljena 200 metara od najbližeg parkirali&scaron;ta. Plaža je dugačka 150 metara, a na nekim mjestima i 25 metara. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je &scaron;ljunak, ali imate i betona i ne&scaron;to pijeska, a na sredini plaže nalazi se pristani&scaron;te. Ući u vodu na nekim mjestima nije tako lako jer je na podu puno kamenja i stijena. Možete otići do vode s plaže ili skočiti s pristani&scaron;ta. Ovdje je dostupna neka infrastruktura i usluga na plaži. Mnogi restorani i barovi na plaži nalaze se na ili u blizini plaže, kao i hotel i neki apartmani ako vas plaža fascinira i odaberete ovu plažu za svoj sljedeći ljetni odmor.', 3781, 'hr', 1),
(1139, 'Die montenegrinische Stadt Budva ist wahrscheinlich die ber&uuml;hmteste Stadt in diesem wundersch&ouml;nen Mittelmeerland. Die Stadt ist nicht nur sehr attraktiv, mit vielen historischen Geb&auml;uden, sondern auch mit einigen Str&auml;nden, die Sie zum Staunen bringen werden. Der Strand, den wir hier beschreiben, hei&szlig;t Plaža Mogren und befindet sich in der N&auml;he des Stadtzentrums Budva. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben ein paar &ouml;ffentliche kostenpflichtige Parkpl&auml;tze, auf denen Sie Ihr Auto abstellen k&ouml;nnen. Sie ben&ouml;tigen 500 Meter, um den Strand zu erreichen, und der Weg zum Strand ist sehr attraktiv und erstreckt sich entlang der felsigen K&uuml;ste. Der Strand ist 300 Meter lang und an einigen Stellen 30 Meter breit. Es ist in zwei Teile geteilt und Sie m&uuml;ssen eine H&ouml;hlenbr&uuml;cke &uuml;berqueren, um zum zweiten kleinen Strand zu gelangen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che hier ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch einige Kieselsteine ​​und einige Felsen am Strand. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 10 Metern. Sie k&ouml;nnen auch von einigen Klippen ins kristallblaue Wasser springen. Hier stehen Ihnen einige Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Eine Strandbar befindet sich ebenfalls direkt am Strand. Unterkunft ist am Strand nicht verf&uuml;gbar, aber im Zentrum der Stadt, nicht weit entfernt, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Hotels und Apartments.', 3782, 'de', 1),
(1140, 'La citt&agrave; del Montenegro Budva &egrave; probabilmente la citt&agrave; pi&ugrave; famosa in questo splendido paese mediterraneo. Non solo la citt&agrave; &egrave; molto attraente, con molti edifici storici, ma hai anche alcune spiagge che ti faranno meravigliare. La spiaggia che stiamo descrivendo qui si chiama Plaža Mogren e si trova vicino al centro della citt&agrave; di Budva. &Egrave; facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e hai alcuni parcheggi pubblici a pagamento dove puoi lasciare la tua auto. Ci vogliono 500 metri per raggiungere la spiaggia, e il percorso per la spiaggia &egrave; molto attraente e si estende lungo la costa rocciosa. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 300 metri e in alcuni punti larga 30 metri. &Egrave; diviso in due parti e devi prendere un ponte della grotta per raggiungere la seconda piccola spiaggia. La superficie principale qui &egrave; di sabbia, ma hai anche alcuni ciottoli e alcune rocce sulla spiaggia. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 10 metri. Puoi anche saltare da alcune scogliere nell&#39;acqua blu cristallina. Hai alcune infrastrutture e servizi di spiaggia disponibili qui. Un bar sulla spiaggia si trova anche direttamente sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; sulla spiaggia non disponibile ma nel centro della citt&agrave;, non lontano, principalmente sotto forma di hotel e appartamenti.', 3782, 'it', 1),
(1141, 'Črnogorsko mesto Budva je verjetno najbolj znano mesto v tej čudoviti sredozemski državi. Mesto ni samo zelo privlačno, s &scaron;tevilnimi zgodovinskimi stavbami, ampak tudi z nekaj plažami, ki vas bodo navdu&scaron;ile. Plaža, ki jo opisujemo, se imenuje Plaža Mogren in se nahaja v bližini sredi&scaron;ča Budve. Do katerega koli vozila je enostavno priti in imate na voljo par javnih plačljivih parkiri&scaron;č za parkiranje va&scaron;ega avtomobila. Do plaže je potrebno prehoditi pot dolgo 500 metrov, pot do plaže pa je tudi zelo privlačna in se razprostira ob skalnati obali. Plaža je dolga 300 metrov in ponekod &scaron;iroka 30 metrov. Razdeljena je na dva dela, da bi pri&scaron;li do drugega dela plaže, pa boste morali prečkati zelo ozek jamski most. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži je pesek, na plaži pa imate tudi nekaj kamenčkov in nekaj skal ob robih plaže. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne pri približno 10 metrih. V kristalno modro vodo lahko skočite tudi iz klifov . Na plaži je na voljo tudi nekaj plažnih storitev. Na plaži se nahaja tudi bar na plaži. Nastanitev ni na voljo na plaži, ampak v sredi&scaron;ču mesta, nedaleč stran, predvsem v obliki hotelov in apartmajev.', 3782, 'sl', 1),
(1142, 'Crnogorski grad Budva je vjerovatno najpoznatiji grad u ovoj prekrasnoj mediteranskoj zemlji. Grad nije samo vrlo atraktivan, s mnogo povijesnih građevina, već i s nekim plažama koje će vas odu&scaron;eviti. Plaža koju opisujemo zove se Mogren plaža i nalazi se u blizini centra Budve. Lako je doći do bilo kojeg vozila i na raspolaganju imate par javnih parking mjesta za parkiranje. Plaža je dugačka 500 metara, a plaža je vrlo atraktivna i prostire se duž stjenovite obale. Plaža je dugačka 300 metara, a na nekim mjestima i 30 metara. Podijeljen je u dva dijela da biste do&scaron;li do drugog dijela plaže, ali morat ćete prijeći vrlo uski &scaron;piljski most. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je pijesak, a plaža ima i ne&scaron;to &scaron;ljunka i ne&scaron;to stijena uz rubove plaže. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje na oko 10 metara. Također možete iskočiti sa litica u kristalno plavu vodu. Na plaži postoje i neke usluge na plaži. Na plaži se nalazi i bar na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj nije dostupan na plaži, već u centru grada, nedaleko, uglavnom u obliku hotela i apartmana.', 3782, 'hr', 1),
(1143, 'Nella regione albanese Valona, nel mezzo della costa montana, c&#39;&egrave; un villaggio molto speciale Dh&euml;rmi. Di fronte al villaggio c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia di ghiaia fine lunga 1 chilometro e larga fino a 50 metri. Tutta la spiaggia &egrave; molto organizzata, con molti bar sulla spiaggia al vostro servizio, con molte panchine e una lunga passeggiata. Questo posto &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con il tuo veicolo e puoi parcheggiare accanto alla strada direttamente sulla spiaggia o in alcuni parcheggi privati. Quando vai a nuotare hai un ingresso d&#39;acqua molto bello e puoi iniziare a nuotare quasi immediatamente. Molta infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; qui con molti servizi. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile anche direttamente sulla spiaggia principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti, camere e hotel.', 3714, 'it', 1),
(1144, 'Dans la r&eacute;gion albanaise de Vlor&euml;, au milieu de la c&ocirc;te montagnarde, il y a un village tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;cial Dh&euml;rmi. En face du village, vous avez une plage de gravier fin de 1 km de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 50 m&egrave;tres de large. Toute la plage est tr&egrave;s organis&eacute;e, avec de nombreux bars de plage &agrave; votre service, avec de nombreux bancs et une longue promenade. Cet endroit est facilement accessible avec votre v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer au bord de la route directement sur la plage ou sur certains parkings priv&eacute;s. Lorsque vous allez nager, vous avez une tr&egrave;s belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager presque imm&eacute;diatement. Beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage sont ici avec de nombreux services. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement disponible directement sur la plage, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements, de chambres et d&#39;h&ocirc;tels.', 3714, 'fr', 1),
(1145, 'En la regi&oacute;n albanesa de Vlor&euml;, en medio de la costa monta&ntilde;osa, hay un pueblo muy especial, Dh&euml;rmi. Frente al pueblo tiene una playa de grava fina de 1 kil&oacute;metro de largo y hasta 50 metros de ancho. Toda la playa est&aacute; muy organizada, con muchos chiringuitos a su servicio, con muchos bancos y un largo paseo mar&iacute;timo. Es f&aacute;cil llegar a este lugar con su veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar al lado de la carretera directamente en la playa o en algunos terrenos de estacionamiento privados. Cuando va a nadar tiene una entrada de agua muy agradable y puede comenzar a nadar casi de inmediato. Mucha infraestructura de playa est&aacute; aqu&iacute; con muchos servicios. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible directamente en la playa, principalmente en forma de apartamentos, habitaciones y hoteles.', 3714, 'es', 1),
(1146, 'In der albanischen Region Vlor&euml; liegt mitten in der bergigen K&uuml;ste ein ganz besonderes Dorf Dh&euml;rmi. Vor dem Dorf befindet sich ein 1 km langer und bis zu 50 m breiter feiner Kiesstrand. Der ganze Strand ist sehr gut organisiert, mit vielen Strandbars, vielen B&auml;nken und einer langen Promenade. Dieser Ort ist mit Ihrem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand oder auf einem privaten Parkplatz neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Wenn Sie schwimmen gehen, haben Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und k&ouml;nnen fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Hier gibt es viel Strandinfrastruktur mit vielen Dienstleistungen. Die Unterbringung erfolgt auch direkt am Strand, meist in Form von Apartments, Zimmern und Hotels.', 3714, 'de', 1),
(1147, 'V albanski regiji Vlor&euml;, sredi planinske obale stoji prav posebna vas Dh&euml;rmi. Pred vasjo imate 1 kilometer dolgo in do 50 metrov &scaron;iroko plažo z drobnim gramozom. Celotna plaža je zelo urejena, na voljo so vam &scaron;tevilni bari na plaži, z veliko klopi in dolgo promenado. Ta kraj je enostavno dosegljiv s va&scaron;im vozilom in parkirate lahko ob cesti neposredno na plaži ali na nekaterih zasebnih parkiri&scaron;čih. Ko se boste kopali, imate zelo lep vhod v vodo in lahko začnete plavati skoraj takoj. Na plaži imate veliko plažne infrastrukture in veliko storitev. Nastanitev je na voljo tudi neposredno na plaži, večinoma v obliki apartmajev, sob in hotelov.', 3714, 'sl', 1),
(1148, 'U albanskom predjelu Vlor&euml;, usred planinske obale, stoji vrlo posebno selo Dh&euml;rmi. Ispred sela imate plažu dugu 1 kilometar i do 50 metara sa sitnim &scaron;ljunkom. Cijela je plaža vrlo uredna, na plaži ima mnogo barova, s puno klupa i duge &scaron;etnice. Ovo je mjesto lako dostupno va&scaron;im vozilom, a parkirate se uz cestu izravno na plaži ili na nekim privatnim parkirali&scaron;tima. Nakon &scaron;to plivate, imate vrlo lijep ulaz u vodu i možete početi plivati gotovo odmah. Na plaži imate puno infrastrukture na plaži i puno usluga. Smje&scaron;taj je također dostupan direktno na plaži, uglavnom u obliku apartmana, soba i hotela.', 3714, 'hr', 1),
(1149, 'Nella regione albanese Valona, nel mezzo della costa montana, prima che le strade vi portino in montagna c&#39;&egrave; un villaggio Gjilek&euml;. Nel mese di maggio 2019 questa spiaggia era speciale perch&eacute; c&#39;era un jet da combattimento direttamente sulla spiaggia. Come il villaggio vicino ha anche una spiaggia molto lunga che si chiama Plazhi Drymades. &Egrave; fatto di ghiaia fine ed &egrave; lungo 2 chilometri e largo fino a 50 metri. Questo posto &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con il tuo veicolo e puoi parcheggiare accanto alla strada direttamente sulla spiaggia. Quando vai a nuotare hai un ingresso d&#39;acqua molto bello e puoi iniziare a nuotare quasi immediatamente. Molte infrastrutture per la spiaggia sono qui con molti servizi. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile anche direttamente sulla spiaggia principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti, camere e hotel, alcuni resort sono anche presenti qui. E se ti piace accamparti, hai anche questa opzione disponibile qui.', 3715, 'it', 1),
(1150, 'Dans la r&eacute;gion albanaise de Vlor&euml;, au milieu de la c&ocirc;te montagnarde, avant que les routes ne vous m&egrave;nent dans les montagnes, il y a un village Gjilek&euml;. Au mois de mai 2019, cette plage &eacute;tait sp&eacute;ciale car il y avait un avion de chasse directement sur la plage. Comme le village voisin, il a &eacute;galement une tr&egrave;s longue plage qui s&#39;appelle Plazhi Drymades. Il est fait de gravier fin et mesure 2 kilom&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 50 m&egrave;tres de large. Cet endroit est facilement accessible avec votre v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer au bord de la route directement sur la plage. Lorsque vous allez nager, vous avez une tr&egrave;s belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager presque imm&eacute;diatement. Beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage sont ici avec de nombreux services. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement disponible directement &agrave; la plage principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements, de chambres et d&#39;h&ocirc;tels, certaines stations sont &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sentes ici. Et si vous aimez camper, vous avez m&ecirc;me cette option disponible ici.', 3715, 'fr', 1),
(1151, 'En la regi&oacute;n albanesa de Vlor&euml;, en medio de la costa monta&ntilde;osa, antes de que los caminos conduzcan a las monta&ntilde;as, hay un pueblo de Gjilek&euml;. En el mes de mayo de 2019, esta playa era especial porque hab&iacute;a un avi&oacute;n de combate directamente en la playa. Al igual que el pueblo vecino, tambi&eacute;n tiene una playa muy larga que se llama Plazhi Drymades. Est&aacute; hecho de grava fina y tiene 2 kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 50 metros de ancho. Es f&aacute;cil llegar a este lugar con su veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar al lado de la carretera directamente en la playa. Cuando va a nadar tiene una entrada de agua muy agradable y puede comenzar a nadar casi de inmediato. Aqu&iacute; hay mucha infraestructura de playa con muchos servicios. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible directamente en la playa, principalmente en forma de apartamentos, habitaciones y hoteles, algunos resorts tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n aqu&iacute; presentes. Y si te gusta acampar, incluso tienes esta opci&oacute;n disponible aqu&iacute;.', 3715, 'es', 1),
(1152, 'In der albanischen Region Vlor&euml;, mitten an der K&uuml;ste des Berges, bevor die Stra&szlig;en Sie in die Berge f&uuml;hren, befindet sich ein Dorf Gjilek&euml;. Im Mai 2019 war dieser Strand etwas Besonderes, da sich direkt am Strand ein Kampfjet befand. Wie das Nachbardorf, hat es auch einen sehr langen Strand, der Plazhi Drymades hei&szlig;t. Es besteht aus feinem Kies und ist 2 Kilometer lang und bis zu 50 Meter breit. Dieser Ort ist mit Ihrem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Wenn Sie schwimmen gehen, haben Sie einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und k&ouml;nnen fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Hier gibt es viel Strandinfrastruktur mit vielen Dienstleistungen. Die Unterbringung erfolgt auch direkt am Strand, meist in Form von Apartments, Zimmern und Hotels. Einige Resorts sind auch hier vorhanden. Und wenn Sie gerne campen, steht Ihnen diese Option sogar hier zur Verf&uuml;gung.', 3715, 'de', 1),
(1153, 'V albanski regiji Vlor&euml;, kjer je v sredini planin obala in preden vas cesta zapelje v obmorske gore, je vas Gjilek&euml;. V mesecu maju 2019 je bila ta plaža zelo posebna, saj je bil neposredno na plaži voja&scaron;ko letalo mig-21, razstavljen kot atrakcija. Tako kot sosednja vas ima tudi ta plaža zelo dolgo plažo, ki se imenuje Plazhi Drymades. Narejena je iz finega gramoza in je dolga 2 kilometra in &scaron;iroka do 50 metrov. Ta kraj je enostavno dosegljiv s va&scaron;im vozilom, tudi z avtodomom, in parkirate lahko ob cesti neposredno pred plažo. Ko se boste odpravili kopat, imate iz plaže zelo lep vhod v vodo in lahko začnete plavati skoraj takoj. Veliko plažne infrastrukture se nahaja na plaži, kjer vam nudijo veliko različnih storitev. Nastanitev je na voljo tudi neposredno ob plaži, večinoma v obliki apartmajev, sob in hotelov, resorji so tudi tukaj na razpolago. In če želite kampirati, imate tudi to opcijo na razpolago.', 3715, 'sl', 1),
(1154, 'U albanskom dijelu Vlore, gdje se obala nalazi usred planina i prije nego &scaron;to vas put odvede u obalne planine, nalazi se selo Gjilek&euml;. U svibnju 2019. godine ova je plaža bila vrlo posebna jer se na plaži nalazio vojni avion mig-21, izložen kao atrakcija. Kao i susjedno selo, i ova plaža ima vrlo dugu plažu koja se zove Plazhi Drymades. Napravljen je od sitnog &scaron;ljunka, a dugačak je 2 kilometra i &scaron;irok do 50 metara. Ovo je vozilo lako dostupno va&scaron;im vozilom, uključujući i kućicu za kućice, a parkirate se uz cestu direktno ispred plaže. Kada idete na kupanje, s plaže se pruža vrlo lijep ulaz u vodu i možete odmah početi plivati. Na plaži se nalazi mno&scaron;tvo infrastrukture na plaži gdje vam nude mnogo različitih usluga. Smje&scaron;taj je također dostupan direktno na plaži, uglavnom u obliku apartmana, soba i hotela, ovdje su dostupni i odjeli. A ako želite kampirati, na raspolaganju vam je i ova opcija.', 3715, 'hr', 1),
(1155, 'Quando percorri la costa albanese da sud a nord verso la citt&agrave; di Valona, ​​prima che la strada si trasformi in montagna, l&#39;ultima spiaggia che incontrerai &egrave; Plazhi Palas&euml;s nel villaggio di Palasa. Si trova nella regione di Valona. La spiaggia &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con il tuo veicolo e la strada &egrave; completamente nuova. Puoi parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia in un parcheggio, ma non &egrave; gratuito, ti faranno pagare circa &euro; 2 al giorno. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di ghiaia fine mista a sabbia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga circa 2 chilometri e larga fino a 100 metri. Hai davvero molto spazio per trovare il tuo posto. L&#39;intera area &egrave; completamente nuova ed &egrave; ancora in fase di realizzazione entro l&#39;anno 2019, quando l&#39;abbiamo visitata. Tutto &egrave; molto organizzato e ai massimi livelli, cos&igrave; come i servizi di spiaggia e l&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia. Un parco giochi per bambini &egrave; disponibile anche direttamente sulla spiaggia. Molti bar sulla spiaggia e ristoranti sono disponibili qui, e puoi anche noleggiare alcune attrezzature da spiaggia l&igrave;. Alcuni alloggi sono gi&agrave; disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia, altri sono ancora in fase di realizzazione. Molti appartamenti e case di lusso sono costruiti qui. Una spiaggia molto lussuosa e di alta qualit&agrave;, raccomandata dal nostro team.', 3716, 'it', 1),
(1156, 'Lorsque vous remontez la c&ocirc;te albanaise du sud au nord en direction de la ville de Vlor&euml;, avant que la route ne monte dans les montagnes, la toute derni&egrave;re plage que vous rencontrerez est Plazhi Palas&euml;s dans le village de Palasa. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Vlor&euml;. La plage est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec votre v&eacute;hicule et la route est compl&egrave;tement nouvelle. Vous pouvez vous garer directement sur la plage sur une place de parking, mais ce n&#39;est pas gratuit, ils vous factureront environ 2 &euro; par jour. La surface principale de la plage est constitu&eacute;e de gravier fin m&eacute;lang&eacute; &agrave; du sable. La plage mesure environ 2 kilom&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 100 m&egrave;tres de large. Vous avez vraiment beaucoup d&#39;espace pour trouver votre place. Toute la zone est enti&egrave;rement r&eacute;nov&eacute;e et est encore en cours de construction en 2019, lorsque nous l&#39;avons visit&eacute;e. Tout est tr&egrave;s organis&eacute; et au plus haut niveau, tout comme les services de plage et l&#39;infrastructure de la plage. Une aire de jeux pour enfants est &eacute;galement disponible directement sur la plage. De nombreux bars et restaurants de plage sont disponibles ici, et vous pouvez &eacute;galement y louer du mat&eacute;riel de plage. Certains h&eacute;bergements sont d&eacute;j&agrave; disponibles directement sur la plage, certains sont encore en cours de r&eacute;alisation. De nombreux appartements et maisons de luxe y sont construits. Une plage tr&egrave;s luxueuse et de haute qualit&eacute; en effet, higlhy recommand&eacute;e par notre &eacute;quipe.', 3716, 'fr', 1),
(1157, 'Cuando viajas por la costa albanesa desde el sur hacia el norte hacia la ciudad de Vlor&euml;, antes de que el camino se convierta en las monta&ntilde;as, la &uacute;ltima playa que encontrar&aacute;s es Plazhi Palas&euml;s en el pueblo de Palasa. Se encuentra ubicado en la regi&oacute;n de Vlor&euml;. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a la playa con su veh&iacute;culo y el camino es completamente nuevo. Puede estacionar directamente en la playa en un lugar de estacionamiento, pero no es gratis, le cobrar&aacute;n alrededor de &euro; 2 por d&iacute;a. La superficie principal de la playa es de grava fina mezclada con algo de arena. La playa tiene alrededor de 2 kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 100 metros de ancho. Realmente tienes mucho espacio para encontrar tu lugar. Toda el &aacute;rea se hizo completamente nueva y todav&iacute;a est&aacute; en proceso para el a&ntilde;o 2019, cuando la visitamos. Todo est&aacute; muy organizado y al m&aacute;s alto nivel, al igual que los servicios de playa y la infraestructura de la playa. Un parque infantil tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible directamente en la playa. Muchos bares y restaurantes de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, y tambi&eacute;n puedes alquilar algunos equipos de playa all&iacute;. Algunos alojamientos ya est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa, algunos todav&iacute;a est&aacute;n en proceso. Aqu&iacute; se construyen muchos apartamentos y casas de lujo. Una playa muy lujosa y de alta calidad, muy recomendada por nuestro equipo.', 3716, 'es', 1),
(1158, 'Wenn Sie die albanische K&uuml;ste von S&uuml;den nach Norden in Richtung der Stadt Vlor&euml; hinauffahren, bevor die Stra&szlig;e in die Berge &uuml;bergeht, ist Plazhi Palas&euml;s im Dorf Palasa der letzte Strand, dem Sie begegnen. Es befindet sich in der Region Vlor&euml;. Der Strand ist mit Ihrem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und die Stra&szlig;e ist v&ouml;llig neu. Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand auf einem Parkplatz parken, dies ist jedoch nicht kostenlos. Die Geb&uuml;hr betr&auml;gt ca. 2 &euro; pro Tag. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes ist feiner Kies, gemischt mit etwas Sand. Der Strand ist rund 2 Kilometer lang und bis zu 100 Meter breit. Sie haben wirklich viel Platz, um Ihren Platz zu finden. Das gesamte Gebiet ist komplett neu und befindet sich noch in der Bauphase im Jahr 2019, als wir es besuchten. Alles ist sehr gut organisiert und auf h&ouml;chstem Niveau, ebenso die Stranddienstleistungen und die Strandinfrastruktur. Ein Kinderspielplatz steht ebenfalls direkt am Strand zur Verf&uuml;gung. Hier gibt es viele Strandbars und Restaurants, und Sie k&ouml;nnen dort auch Strandausr&uuml;stung mieten. Einige Unterk&uuml;nfte sind bereits direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar, andere sind noch in Vorbereitung. Hier werden viele Luxusapartments und -h&auml;user gebaut. Ein sehr luxuri&ouml;ser und qualitativ hochwertiger Strand, der von unserem Team sehr empfohlen wird.', 3716, 'de', 1),
(1159, 'Ko potujete navzgor ob albanski obali od juga proti severu proti mestecu Vlor&euml;, preden cesta zavije v gore, je zadnja plaža, ki jo boste srečali, Plazhi Palas&euml;s v vasi Palasa. Nahaja se v regiji Vlor&euml;. Do plaže je zelo enostavno priti z osebnim vozilom, cesta pa je povsem nova. Na plaži lahko parkirate neposredno na plaži, vendar ni brezplačno, zaračunali vam bodo približno 2 &euro; na dan. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je droben gramoz, pome&scaron;an z nekaj peska. Plaža je dolga približno 2 kilometra in &scaron;iroka do 100 metrov. Resnično imate dovolj prostora, da najdete svoje mesto. Celotno območje je narejeno povsem na novo v letu 2019, ko smo ga obiskali. Vse je zelo organizirano in na najvi&scaron;ji ravni, tako tudi storitve na plaži in infrastruktura na plaži. Otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če je na voljo tudi neposredno na plaži. Tukaj so na voljo &scaron;tevilni bari in restavracije na plaži, tam pa lahko najamete tudi nekaj opreme za plažo. Nekatere nastanitve so vam na voljo neposredno na plaži, nekatere so &scaron;e v nastajanju. Tu je zgrajenih veliko luksuznih stanovanj in hi&scaron;. Je zelo razko&scaron;na in kakovostna plaža, zelo priporočljiva s strani na&scaron;e ekipe.', 3716, 'sl', 1),
(1160, 'Dok putujete albanskom obalom od juga do sjevera prema gradu Vlor&euml; prije nego &scaron;to se cesta pretvori u planine, posljednja plaža koju ćete naići je Plazhi Palas&euml;s u selu Palasa. Smje&scaron;ten u regiji Vlor&euml;. Do plaže je vrlo lako doći automobilom, a cesta je potpuno nova. Na plaži možete parkirati direktno na plaži, ali to nije besplatno, naplatit će vam se oko 2 &euro; dnevno. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je sitni &scaron;ljunak pomije&scaron;an s malo pijeska. Plaža je duga oko 2 kilometra i &scaron;iroka do 100 metara. Doista imate dovoljno prostora da pronađete svoje mjesto. Čitav prostor je napravljen potpuno nov 2019. godine kada smo ga posjetili. Sve je vrlo organizirano i na najvi&scaron;em nivou, kao i usluge na plaži i infrastruktura na plaži. Igrali&scaron;te za djecu dostupno je i direktno na plaži. Ovdje su brojni kafići i restorani na plaži, a tamo možete i unajmiti ne&scaron;to opreme za plažu. Neki su smje&scaron;taj dostupni direktno na plaži, a neki su jo&scaron; u izgradnji. Ovdje su sagrađeni mnogi luksuzni apartmani i kuće. To je vrlo luksuzna i kvalitetna plaža koju toplo preporučuje na&scaron; tim.', 3716, 'hr', 1),
(1161, 'La prima spiaggia che incontrerai percorrendo la costa da sud a nord dell&#39;Albania nella regione di Valona, dopo aver attraversato le montagne sul mare e aver guidato lungo il passo di montagna alto 1000 metri, &egrave; la spiaggia nella piccola citt&agrave; Orikum. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga pochi chilometri e larga fino a 40 metri. Per parcheggiare il tuo veicolo, anche i camper, qui non &egrave; un problema, devi semplicemente lasciare l&#39;auto accanto alla strada. La superficie principale &egrave; di ghiaia fine mista a sabbia. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua qui &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 10 metri. Lungo tutto il tratto di spiaggia ci sono molti ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia e cos&igrave; sono anche i servizi di spiaggia disponibili intorno a quei luoghi. A causa di alcuni hotel direttamente sulla spiaggia, puoi anche pianificare di soggiornare qui per le tue vacanze.', 3717, 'it', 1),
(1162, 'La premi&egrave;re plage que vous rencontrerez en remontant le littoral du sud au nord de l&#39;Albanie dans la r&eacute;gion de Vlor&euml;, apr&egrave;s avoir travers&eacute; les montagnes du bord de mer et descendre le col de 1000 m&egrave;tres de haut, est la plage de la petite ville d&#39;Orikum. La plage fait quelques kilom&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 40 m&egrave;tres de large. Pour garer votre v&eacute;hicule, y compris les camping-cars, ce n&#39;est pas un probl&egrave;me, il vous suffit de laisser votre voiture au bord de la route. La surface principale est en gravier fin m&eacute;lang&eacute; &agrave; du sable. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau ici est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence &agrave; environ 10 m&egrave;tres. Tout au long de la plage, vous avez de nombreux restaurants et bars de plage, tout comme les services de plage disponibles autour de ces endroits. En raison de quelques h&ocirc;tels directement sur la plage, vous pouvez &eacute;galement pr&eacute;voir de rester ici pour vos vacances.', 3717, 'fr', 1),
(1163, 'La primera playa que encontrar&aacute; al conducir por la costa desde el sur hasta la parte norte de Albania en la regi&oacute;n de Vlor&euml;, despu&eacute;s de cruzar las monta&ntilde;as junto al mar y conducir por el puerto de monta&ntilde;a de 1000 metros de altura, es la playa en el peque&ntilde;o pueblo de Orikum. La playa tiene unos pocos kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 40 metros de ancho. Para estacionar su veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n las autocaravanas, aqu&iacute; no hay problema, simplemente deje su autom&oacute;vil al lado de la carretera. La superficie principal es grava fina mezclada con arena. La entrada de agua aqu&iacute; es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza a unos 10 metros. A lo largo de todo el tramo de la playa hay muchos restaurantes y chiringuitos y tambi&eacute;n los servicios de playa disponibles en esos lugares. Debido a algunos hoteles directamente en la playa, tambi&eacute;n puede planear quedarse aqu&iacute; para sus vacaciones.', 3717, 'es', 1),
(1164, 'Der erste Strand, dem Sie begegnen, wenn Sie die K&uuml;ste von S&uuml;den nach Norden Albaniens in der Region Vlor&euml; hinauffahren, nachdem Sie die Berge am Meer &uuml;berquert und den 1000 Meter hohen Gebirgspass hinuntergefahren haben, ist der Strand in der kleinen Stadt Orikum. Der Strand ist wenige Kilometer lang und bis zu 40 Meter breit. Um Ihr Fahrzeug, auch Wohnmobile, zu parken, ist dies kein Problem, Sie lassen Ihr Auto einfach neben der Stra&szlig;e stehen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che ist feiner Kies, gemischt mit Sand. Der Wassereintritt hier ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 10 Metern. Entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts gibt es viele Restaurants und Strandbars, ebenso wie die Stranddienstleistungen rund um diese Ort. Aufgrund einiger Hotels direkt am Strand k&ouml;nnen Sie auch planen, hier Ihren Urlaub zu verbringen.', 3717, 'de', 1),
(1165, 'Prva plaža, na katero boste naleteli ob vožnji navzgor ob obali od juga proti severnemu dela Albanije, v regiji Vlor&euml;, potem ko prečkate goro ob morju in se spustite po 1000 metrov visokem gorskem prelazu, je plaža v mestecu Orikum. Plaža je dolga nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka do 40 metrov. Parkirati svoje vozilo, tudi avtodome, tukaj ni problem, avto preprosto pustite ob cesti. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je droben prod, pome&scaron;an s peskom. Vstop v vodo je tukaj zelo lep in plavanje se začne pri približno 10 metrih. Na celotnem delu plaže imate veliko restavracij in barov na plaži, prav tako pa so na voljo tudi storitve na plaži okrog lokacij z postrežbo. Zaradi &scaron;tevilnih hotelov, ki so nahajajo neposredno na plaži, bi lahko bile va&scaron;e naslednje počitnice morda prav tukaj.', 3717, 'sl', 1),
(1166, 'Prva plaža na koju ćete naići dok se vozite uz obalu od juga do sjevernog dijela Albanije, u regiji Vlor&euml;, nakon prelaska planine uz more i spu&scaron;tanja preko 1000 metara visokog planinskog prijevoja, je plaža u gradu Orikum. Plaža je duga nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka do 40 metara. Parkiranje va&scaron;eg vozila, pa čak i kućica za kućne ljubimce, ovdje nije problem, jednostavno ostavite automobil pored ceste. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je sitni &scaron;ljunak pomije&scaron;an s pijeskom. Ulaz u vodu ovdje je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje na oko 10 metara. Ima mnogo restorana i barova na cijeloj plaži, kao i usluga na plaži oko usluga. Zahvaljujući brojnim hotelima koji se nalaze direktno na plaži, va&scaron; sljedeći odmor možda će biti ba&scaron; ovdje.', 3717, 'hr', 1),
(1167, 'Questa spiaggia deve essere una delle spiagge meglio organizzate, belle, adatte alle famiglie, verdi, con servizi di spiaggia di alta qualit&agrave; in Albania. Quando visiti questa spiaggia puoi essere sicuro che rimarr&agrave; per sempre nella tua memoria. Lo troverai nella piccola citt&agrave; di Orikum quando percorri la costa da sud a nord dell&#39;Albania nella regione di Valona, ​​dopo aver attraversato le montagne sul mare e guidare lungo il passo di montagna alto 1000 metri. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 500 metri e larga fino a 30 metri. Per parcheggiare il tuo veicolo anche i camper qui non sono un problema, devi semplicemente lasciare l&#39;auto accanto alla strada. La superficie principale &egrave; di ghiaia fine mista a sabbia, e qui c&#39;&egrave; anche molta erba, persino alcuni alberi. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua qui &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 10 metri. Questo &egrave; in realt&agrave; un resort sulla spiaggia con molti servizi sulla spiaggia e molti bar e ristoranti sulla spiaggia. &Egrave; una spiaggia di tipo veramente familiare, hai cos&igrave; tanti spazi per far giocare i tuoi bambini in sicurezza nei campi da gioco per bambini di alta qualit&agrave; o semplicemente godersi i campi di erba verde. A causa di alcuni hotel, appartamenti e resort direttamente sulla spiaggia, puoi anche pianificare di soggiornare qui per le tue vacanze, sicuramente non te ne pentirai.', 3718, 'it', 1),
(1168, 'Cette plage doit &ecirc;tre l&#39;une des mieux organis&eacute;es, belles, familiales, vertes, avec des plages de services de plage de haute qualit&eacute; en Albanie. Lorsque vous visitez cette plage, vous pouvez &ecirc;tre s&ucirc;r qu&#39;elle restera dans votre m&eacute;moire pour toujours. Vous le trouverez dans la petite ville d&#39;Orikum en remontant le littoral du sud au nord de l&#39;Albanie dans la r&eacute;gion de Vlor&euml;, apr&egrave;s avoir travers&eacute; les montagnes du bord de mer et descendre le col de 1000 m&egrave;tres de haut. La plage mesure 500 m&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 30 m&egrave;tres de large. Pour garer votre v&eacute;hicule aussi les camping-cars ici n&#39;est pas un probl&egrave;me, il vous suffit de laisser votre voiture au bord de la route. La surface principale est constitu&eacute;e de gravier fin m&eacute;lang&eacute; &agrave; du sable, et vous avez &eacute;galement beaucoup d&#39;herbe ici, m&ecirc;me quelques arbres. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau ici est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence &agrave; environ 10 m&egrave;tres. Il s&#39;agit en fait d&#39;une station baln&eacute;aire avec de nombreux services de plage ainsi que de nombreux bars et restaurants de plage. C&#39;est une plage vraiment familiale, vous avez tellement d&#39;espace pour que vos enfants puissent jouer en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute; sur les aires de jeux pour enfants de haute qualit&eacute; ou tout simplement profiter des champs d&#39;herbe verte. En raison de quelques h&ocirc;tels, appartements et complexes directement sur la plage, vous pouvez &eacute;galement pr&eacute;voir de s&eacute;journer ici pour vos vacances, vous ne le regretterez certainement pas.', 3718, 'fr', 1),
(1169, 'Esta playa tiene que ser una de las playas mejor organizadas, hermosas, familiares, verdes y con servicios de playa de alta calidad en Albania. Al visitar esta playa, puede estar seguro de que permanecer&aacute; en su memoria para siempre. Lo encontrar&aacute;s en el peque&ntilde;o pueblo de Orikum cuando conduzcas por la costa del sur al norte de Albania en la regi&oacute;n de Vlor&euml;, despu&eacute;s de cruzar las monta&ntilde;as costeras y conducir por el puerto de monta&ntilde;a de 1000 metros de altura. La playa tiene 500 metros de largo y hasta 30 metros de ancho. Para estacionar su veh&iacute;culo tambi&eacute;n las autocaravanas aqu&iacute; no es un problema, simplemente deje su autom&oacute;vil al lado de la carretera. La superficie principal es grava fina mezclada con arena, y aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n hay mucha hierba, incluso algunos &aacute;rboles. La entrada de agua aqu&iacute; es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza a unos 10 metros. Este es en realidad un resort de playa con muchos servicios de playa, as&iacute; como muchos bares y restaurantes de playa. Es una playa verdaderamente familiar, tiene mucho espacio para que sus hijos jueguen con seguridad en los parques infantiles de alta calidad o simplemente disfruten de los campos de hierba verde. Debido a algunos hoteles, apartamentos y complejos tur&iacute;sticos directamente en la playa, tambi&eacute;n puede planear quedarse aqu&iacute; para sus vacaciones, ciertamente no se arrepentir&aacute;.', 3718, 'es', 1),
(1170, 'Dieser Strand muss einer der am besten organisierten, sch&ouml;nen, familienfreundlichen, gr&uuml;nen Str&auml;nde, mit hochwertigen Dienstleistungen in Albanien sein. Wenn Sie diesen Strand besuchen, k&ouml;nnen Sie sicher sein, dass er f&uuml;r immer in Erinnerung bleibt. Sie finden es in der kleinen Stadt Orikum, wenn Sie die K&uuml;ste von S&uuml;d- nach Nordalbanien in der Region Vlor&euml; hinauffahren, nachdem Sie die Berge am Meer &uuml;berquert und den 1000 Meter hohen Gebirgspass hinuntergefahren haben. Der Strand ist 500 Meter lang und bis zu 30 Meter breit. Um Ihr Fahrzeug, auch Wohnmobil, hier zu parken, ist es kein Problem, Sie stellen es einfach neben der Stra&szlig;e. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist feiner Kies, gemischt mit Sand, und Sie haben hier auch viel Gras, sogar einige B&auml;ume. Der Wassereintritt hier ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt nach ca. 10 Metern. Dies ist eigentlich ein Strandresort mit vielen Stranddienstleistungen, sowie vielen Strandbars und Restaurants. Es ist ein wahrhaft famili&auml;rer Strand, Sie haben so viel Platz f&uuml;r Ihre Kinder, um sicher auf den hochwertigen Kinderspielpl&auml;tzen zu spielen oder einfach nur die gr&uuml;nen Rasenfl&auml;chen zu genie&szlig;en. Aufgrund einiger Hotels, Apartments und Resorts direkt am Strand, k&ouml;nnen Sie vielleicht Ihren Urlaub hier verbringen. Sie werden es sicherlich nicht bereuen.', 3718, 'de', 1),
(1171, 'Ta plaža mora biti ena najbolje urejenih, lepih, družinam prijaznih, zelenih plaž, s kakovostnimi storitvami, v Albaniji. Ko obi&scaron;čete to plažo, ste lahko prepričani, da si jo boste zapomnili za vedno. Najdete jo v majhnem mestu Orikum, ko se zapeljete ob obali od juga proti severu Albanije v regiji Vlor&euml;, potem ko prečkate gore ob morju in se spustite po 1000 metrov visokem gorskem prelazu. Plaža je dolga 500 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 30 metrov. Parkiranje va&scaron;ega vozila, vključno z avtodomom, ni problem, preprosto ga postavite ob cesto. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži je droben prod, pome&scaron;an s peskom, in tukaj imate prav tako veliko trave, celo nekaj dreves. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in kopanje se začne po približno 10 metrih. To je pravzaprav obalno letovi&scaron;če s &scaron;tevilnimi storitvami na plaži, kjer se pa nahaja tudi veliko barov na plaži in restavracij. To je resnično družinska plaža, na razpolago imate resnično veliko prostora, da se lahko va&scaron;i otroci varno igrajo na kakovostnih igralih in igri&scaron;čih ali samo uživajo na lepo urejeni zelenici. Zaradi nekaterih hotelov, apartmajev in letovi&scaron;č, ki so locirani v bližini plaže, bi lahko mogoče tukaj preživeli svoj naslednji dopust. Zagotovo vam ne bo žal.', 3718, 'sl', 1),
(1172, 'Ova bi plaža trebala biti jedna od najbolje održavanih, lijepih, obiteljskih, zelenih plaža, s kvalitetnim uslugama, u Albaniji. Kada posjetite ovu plažu, možete biti sigurni da ćete je zauvijek pamtiti. Naći ćete ga u malom gradu Orikum dok se vozite duž obale od juga do sjevera Albanije u regiji Vlor&euml;, nakon &scaron;to pređete planine uz more i spustite se preko 1000 metara visokog planinskog prijevoja. Plaža je dugačka 500 metara i &scaron;iroka do 30 metara. Parkiranje va&scaron;eg vozila, uključujući i kućicu za kamp, ​​nije problem, jednostavno ga postavite uz cestu. Glavni prostor na plaži je sitni &scaron;ljunak pomije&scaron;an s pijeskom, a ovdje također imate puno trave, čak i nekoliko stabala. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i kupanje započinje nakon otprilike 10 metara. Zapravo je obalno odmarali&scaron;te s mnogim uslugama na plaži, ali postoje i mnogi beach barovi i restorani. Ovo je prava obiteljska plaža, na raspolaganju imate puno prostora kako bi se va&scaron;a djeca mogla sigurno igrati na kvalitetnim igrali&scaron;tima i igrali&scaron;tima ili samo uživati ​​u lijepo uređenom travnjaku. Zahvaljujući nekim hotelima, apartmanima i odmarali&scaron;tima koji se nalaze u blizini plaže, možda biste mogli provesti svoj sljedeći odmor ovdje. Sigurno nećete požaliti.', 3718, 'hr', 1),
(1173, 'Guidando lungo la costa da Orikum verso la citt&agrave; di Valona, ci sono molte spiagge artificiali proprio accanto alla strada. Lo stesso vale per la spiaggia Vega che &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con il tuo veicolo. Puoi semplicemente parcheggiare accanto alla strada o parcheggiare nei posti di parcheggio forniti dalla spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 150 metri e larga fino a 15 metri. La superficie principale &egrave; di ghiaia fine, cemento e ci sono anche delle rocce. L&#39;accesso all&#39;acqua qui avviene tramite i gradini dell&#39;acqua o sulla spiaggia. Il nuoto inizia a circa 10 metri. La spiaggia &egrave; molto organizzata e qui sono disponibili molti servizi. Un ristorante e un bar sulla spiaggia si trovano direttamente sulla spiaggia. Nelle vicinanze si trovano anche un hotel e alcuni appartamenti.', 3719, 'it', 1),
(1174, 'En remontant la c&ocirc;te d&#39;Orikum vers la ville de Vlor&euml;, vous avez de nombreuses plages artificielles juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route. Il en va de m&ecirc;me pour la plage Vega qui est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec votre v&eacute;hicule. Vous pouvez simplement vous garer &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route ou vous garer sur les places de stationnement fournies par la plage. Le plage mesure 150 m&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 15 m&egrave;tres de large. La surface principale est en gravier fin, en b&eacute;ton et vous avez &eacute;galement des roches. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau ici se fait soit en utilisant les marches d&#39;eau soit par la plage. La natation commence &agrave; environ 10 m&egrave;tres. La plage est tr&egrave;s organis&eacute;e et vous disposez de nombreux services de plage. Un restaurant et un bar de plage se trouvent &eacute;galement directement sur la plage. A proximit&eacute;, vous avez &eacute;galement un h&ocirc;tel et quelques appartements.', 3719, 'fr', 1),
(1175, 'Al conducir por la costa desde Orikum hacia la ciudad de Vlor&euml;, tienes muchas playas artificiales justo al lado de la carretera. Lo mismo ocurre con la playa Vega, que es muy f&aacute;cil de alcanzar con su veh&iacute;culo. Simplemente puede estacionar al lado de la carretera o estacionar en los lugares de estacionamiento que ofrece la playa. La playa tiene 150 metros de largo y hasta 15 metros de ancho. La superficie principal es grava fina, hormig&oacute;n y tambi&eacute;n tiene algunas rocas. La entrada de agua aqu&iacute; se realiza utilizando los escalones de agua o en la playa. La nataci&oacute;n comienza a unos 10 metros. La playa est&aacute; muy organizada y tiene muchos servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;. Un restaurante y un bar en la playa tambi&eacute;n se encuentran directamente en la playa. Cerca tambi&eacute;n tienes un hotel y algunos apartamentos.', 3719, 'es', 1),
(1176, 'Wenn Sie die K&uuml;ste von Orikum in Richtung Stadt Vlora hinauffahren, haben Sie viele k&uuml;nstliche Str&auml;nde direkt neben der Stra&szlig;e. Gleiches gilt f&uuml;r den Strand Vega, der mit Ihrem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen ist. Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach neben der Stra&szlig;e parken oder auf den Parkpl&auml;tzen parken, die der Strand bietet. Der Strand ist 150 Meter lang und bis zu 15 Meter breit. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che ist feiner Kies, Beton und Sie haben auch einige Felsen. Der Wassereintritt erfolgt hier entweder &uuml;ber die Wasserstufen oder am Strand. Das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 10 Metern. Der Strand ist sehr gut organisiert und Sie haben hier viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar befinden sich ebenfalls direkt am Strand. In der N&auml;he haben Sie auch ein Hotel und einige Apartments.', 3719, 'de', 1),
(1177, 'Če se od Orikuma zapeljete proti mestu Vlor&euml;, boste imeli tik ob cesti &scaron;tevilne umetne plaže. Enako velja za plažo Vega, do katere se lahko pripeljete z va&scaron;im vozilom. Vozilo lahko parkirate ali poleg ulice ali pa parkirate na parkiri&scaron;čih, ki jih ponuja organizator plaže. Plaža je dolga 150 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 15 metrov. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je droben prod, beton, imate pa tudi nekaj kamnin. V vodo se vstopa bodisi preko vodnih stopnic, bodisi iz smeri plaže. Plavanje se začne pri približno 10 metrih. Plaža je zelo dobro organizirana in na voljo imate veliko storitev na plaži. Na plaži se nahajata tudi restavracija in bar na plaži. V bližini je tudi hotel in nekaj apartmajev.', 3719, 'sl', 1),
(1178, 'Ako se od Orikuma zapeljete protiv grada Vlor&euml;, vi ćete biti tik do cisti umjetničke plaže. Enako vrijedi za plažu Vega, može&scaron; li se pripeljeti sa svojim vozilom. Vozilo može parkirati ili gledati ulice ili parkirati na parkiranim parkirali&scaron;tima, a na raspolaganju su vam organizatorske plaže. Plaža je dolga 150 metara u &scaron;irokoj do 15 metara. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je tamo gore, beton, imate i ne&scaron;to kamnina. V vodo se vstopa bodisi preko vodnih stopnic, bodisi iz smeri plaže. Plaćanje se nalazi na približno 10 metara. Plaža je vrlo dobro organizirana i na raspolaganju vam je velika usluga na plaži. Na plaži se nalazi i rezervacija u gotovini na plaži. Hotel je također u nekom apartmajevu.', 3719, 'hr', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1179, 'Se ti trovi nelle vicinanze della citt&agrave; albanese Valona o hai intenzione di trascorrere le tue vacanze in Albania e ti piacciono anche le belle spiagge sabbiose che devi visitare questa spiaggia cittadina. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con il tuo veicolo e puoi parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia, dove devi essere cliente del bar della spiaggia o nelle vicinanze. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga circa 2 chilometri e larga fino a 75 m. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; molto bassa, &egrave; quasi piatta. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 50 m, il che lo rende una spiaggia perfetta per i bambini piccoli che giocano in sicurezza sul litorale. Tutta questa zona &egrave; molto organizzata e ci sono molte panchine e percorsi per passeggiare. Molti servizi di spiaggia sono disponibili qui, anche campi sportivi e campi da gioco per bambini. Intorno alla zona ci sono molti ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia, anche altri tipi di catering per soddisfare le tue esigenze. Qui troverai molti tipi di alloggi, i pi&ugrave; presenti sono sicuramente gli hotel che sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia.', 3720, 'it', 1),
(1180, 'Si vous &ecirc;tes &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville albanaise de Vlor&euml; ou si vous pr&eacute;voyez de passer vos vacances en Albanie et que vous aimez &eacute;galement les belles longues plages de sable fin, vous devez visiter cette plage de la ville. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec votre v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer directement sur la plage, o&ugrave; vous devez &ecirc;tre le client du bar de la plage, ou &agrave; proximit&eacute;. La plage mesure environ 2 kilom&egrave;tres de long et 75 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est tr&egrave;s faible, c&#39;est presque plat. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence &agrave; environ 50 m, ce qui en fait une plage id&eacute;ale pour les petits enfants pour jouer en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute; sur le rivage. Toute cette zone est tr&egrave;s organis&eacute;e et vous avez de nombreux bancs et sentiers pour vous promener. De nombreux services de plage sont disponibles ici, m&ecirc;me des terrains de sport et des aires de jeux pour enfants. Dans toute la r&eacute;gion, vous trouverez de nombreux restaurants et bars de plage, ainsi que d&#39;autres types de restauration pour satisfaire vos besoins.Vous trouverez ici de nombreux types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, les plus pr&eacute;sents sont certainement des h&ocirc;tels disponibles directement sur la plage.', 3720, 'fr', 1),
(1181, 'Si est&aacute; cerca de la ciudad albanesa de Vlor&euml; o planea pasar sus vacaciones en Albania y tambi&eacute;n le gustan las hermosas playas de arena larga, debe visitar esta playa de la ciudad. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con su veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar directamente en la playa, donde necesita ser el cliente del bar de la playa, o en las cercan&iacute;as. La playa tiene alrededor de 2 kil&oacute;metros de largo hasta 75 m de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es muy baja, es casi plana. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza a unos 50 m, lo que la convierte en una playa perfecta para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen con seguridad en la costa. Toda esta &aacute;rea est&aacute; muy organizada y tiene muchos bancos y senderos para caminar. Muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, incluso campos deportivos y parques infantiles. En toda la zona hay muchos restaurantes y bares de playa, tambi&eacute;n otro tipo de catering para satisfacer sus necesidades. Aqu&iacute; encontrar&aacute; muchos tipos de alojamiento, los m&aacute;s presentes son sin duda los hoteles que est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa.', 3720, 'es', 1),
(1182, 'Wenn Sie in der N&auml;he der albanischen Stadt Vlor&euml; sind, oder Ihren Urlaub in Albanien verbringen m&ouml;chten, und auch sch&ouml;ne lange Sandstr&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, m&uuml;ssen Sie diesen Stadtstrand besuchen. Es ist sehr einfach mit Ihrem Fahrzeug den Strand zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand parken, wo Sie der Kunde der Strandbar sein m&uuml;ssen, oder in der N&auml;he. Der Strand ist rund 2 Kilometer lang und bis zu 75 m breit. Die Neigung des Strandes ist sehr gering, es ist fast flach. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 50 m, was es zu einem perfekten Strand f&uuml;r kleine Kinder macht, um sicher an der K&uuml;ste zu spielen. Diese ganze Gegend ist sehr gut organisiert und Sie haben viele B&auml;nke und Wege, um herumzulaufen. Hier gibt es viele Stranddienstleistungen, sogar Sportpl&auml;tze und Kinderspielpl&auml;tze. In der gesamten Gegend gibt es viele Restaurants und Strandbars sowie andere Arten von Catering, um Ihren Bed&uuml;rfnissen gerecht zu werden. Hier finden Sie viele Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften. Am pr&auml;sentesten sind sicherlich Hotels, die direkt vor Strand verf&uuml;gbar sind.', 3720, 'de', 1),
(1183, 'Če ste v bližini albanskega mesta Vlor&euml; ali če nameravate preživeti počitnice v Albaniji in imate radi tudi čudovite dolge pe&scaron;čene plaže, morate obiskati to mestno plažo, ki se imenuje Plazhi Vlor&euml;s 1. Plaža je zelo enostavno dostopna z vsakim tipom vozila, kjer lahko parkirate neposredno pred plažo, sicer pa morate biti gost bara na plaži, da lahko parkirate pred plažo, ali pa enostavno parkirate v bližini. Plaža je dolga približno 2 kilometra in dosega &scaron;irino 75 m. Naklon plaže je zelo nizek, skoraj raven. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep, kopanje pa se začne pri približno 50 m, zaradi česar je to popolna plaža za majhne otroke, ki se lahko varno igrajo v vodi. Celotno območje je zelo urejeno in na voljo imate veliko klopi in poti. Tu so na voljo tudi &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži, celo &scaron;portna igri&scaron;ča in otro&scaron;ka igrala. Na celotnem območju imate veliko restavracij in barov na plaži, ter tudi druge vrste postrežbe, tako, da se bo sigurno kaj na&scaron;lo, kar ustreza va&scaron;im zahtevam. Tu boste na&scaron;li &scaron;tevilne vrste nastanitve, najbolj prisotni so gotovo hoteli, ki so na voljo neposredno ob plaži.', 3720, 'sl', 1),
(1184, 'Ako se nalazite u blizini albanskog grada Vlor&euml; ili planirate provesti odmor u Albaniji, a volite i lijepe duge pje&scaron;čane plaže, posjetite ovu gradsku plažu nazvanu Plazhi Vlor&euml;s 1. Plaža je vrlo lako dostupna bilo kojoj vrsti vozila na kojoj možete izravno parkirati ispred plaže, inače morate biti gost beach bara kako biste mogli parkirati ispred plaže ili jednostavno parkirati u blizini. Plaža je duga oko 2 kilometra i doseže &scaron;irinu od 75 m. Nagib plaže je vrlo nizak, gotovo u ravni. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje na oko 50 m, &scaron;to ga čini savr&scaron;enom plažom za malu djecu koja se mogu sigurno igrati u vodi. Cijelo je područje vrlo uredno i na raspolaganju imate puno klupa i staza. Tu su i brojne usluge na plaži, čak i sportski tereni i dječje igrali&scaron;te. Na cijelom području imate brojne restorane i barove na plaži, kao i druge vrste usluga, pa ćete sigurno pronaći ne&scaron;to &scaron;to odgovara va&scaron;im potrebama. Ovdje ćete pronaći mnoge vrste smje&scaron;taja, a najvi&scaron;e su prisutni hoteli dostupni direktno na plaži.', 3720, 'hr', 1),
(1185, 'Se ti trovi nelle vicinanze della citt&agrave; albanese Valona o hai intenzione di trascorrere le tue vacanze in Albania e ti piacciono anche le belle spiagge sabbiose, devi visitare questa spiaggia cittadina. Raggiungerlo &egrave; molto semplice con il tuo veicolo e puoi parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia, letteralmente sulla spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e in alcuni punti anche pi&ugrave; larga di 100 m. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; molto bassa, &egrave; quasi piatta. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 75 m, il che rende questa spiaggia ideale per i tuoi giovani a giocare in sicurezza sul litorale. Molti servizi di spiaggia sono disponibili qui. Intorno alla zona ci sono molti ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia, anche altri tipi di catering per soddisfare le tue esigenze. Qui troverai molti tipi di alloggi, i pi&ugrave; presenti sono sicuramente gli hotel disponibili direttamente in spiaggia.', 3721, 'it', 1),
(1186, 'Si vous &ecirc;tes &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville albanaise de Vlor&euml; ou si vous pr&eacute;voyez de passer vos vacances en Albanie et que vous aimez &eacute;galement les belles longues plages de sable fin, vous devez visiter cette plage de la ville. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de l&#39;atteindre avec votre v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer directement sur la plage, litt&eacute;ralement sur la plage. La plage fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et sur certains endroits m&ecirc;me plus de 100 m de large. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est tr&egrave;s faible, c&#39;est presque plat. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence &agrave; environ 75 m, ce qui rend cette plage id&eacute;ale pour que vos jeunes puissent jouer en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute; sur le rivage. De nombreux services de plage sont disponibles ici. Dans toute la r&eacute;gion, vous trouverez de nombreux restaurants et bars de plage, ainsi que d&#39;autres types de restauration pour satisfaire vos besoins. Vous trouverez ici de nombreux types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, les plus pr&eacute;sents &eacute;tant certainement des h&ocirc;tels disponibles directement sur la plage.', 3721, 'fr', 1),
(1187, 'Si est&aacute; cerca de la ciudad albanesa de Vlor&euml; o planea pasar sus vacaciones en Albania y tambi&eacute;n le gustan las hermosas playas de arena larga, debe visitar esta playa de la ciudad. Es muy f&aacute;cil alcanzarlo con su veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar directamente en la playa, literalmente en la playa. La playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y en algunos lugares incluso m&aacute;s de 100 m de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es muy baja, es casi plana. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza a unos 75 m, lo que hace que esta playa sea ideal para que sus hijos jueguen con seguridad en la costa. Muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;. En toda la zona hay muchos restaurantes y bares de playa, tambi&eacute;n otro tipo de catering para satisfacer sus necesidades. Aqu&iacute; encontrar&aacute; muchos tipos de alojamiento, los m&aacute;s presentes son sin duda los hoteles que est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa.', 3721, 'es', 1),
(1188, 'Wenn Sie in der N&auml;he der albanischen Stadt Vlor&euml; sind oder Ihren Urlaub in Albanien verbringen m&ouml;chten und auch sch&ouml;ne lange Sandstr&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, m&uuml;ssen Sie diesen Stadtstrand besuchen. Es ist sehr einfach mit Ihrem Fahrzeug den Strand zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand parken, buchst&auml;blich am Strand. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und stellenweise sogar mehr als 100 m breit. Die Neigung des Strandes ist sehr gering, es ist fast flach. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 75 m, was diesen Strand ideal f&uuml;r Ihre Kinder macht, um sicher an der K&uuml;ste zu spielen. Viele Stranddienstleistungen sind hier verf&uuml;gbar. In der gesamten Gegend gibt es viele Restaurants und Strandbars sowie andere Arten von Catering, um Ihren Bed&uuml;rfnissen gerecht zu werden. Hier finden Sie viele Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften. Am pr&auml;sentesten sind sicherlich Hotels, die direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar sind.', 3721, 'de', 1),
(1189, 'Če ste v bližini albanskega mesta Vlor&euml; ali nameravate preživeti počitnice v Albaniji in imate radi tudi čudovite dolge pe&scaron;čene plaže, morate obiskati to mestno plažo. Dostop do plaže z vozilom je zelo enostaven, kjer lahko parkirate neposredno na plaži, dobesedno na plaži. Plaža je dolga nekaj kilometrov, ponekod celo več kot 100 m. Naklon plaže je zelo nizek, skoraj raven. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne pri približno 75 m, zaradi česar je ta plaža idealna za va&scaron;e najmlaj&scaron;e, da se varno igrajo ob obali. &Scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži so na voljo tukaj. Na celotnem območju imate veliko restavracij in barov na plaži, ter tudi druge vrste postrežbe, da zadovoljijo prav vse va&scaron;e potrebe. Tu boste na&scaron;li &scaron;tevilne vrste nastanitev, najbolj prisotni so gotovo hoteli, ki so na voljo neposredno na plaži.', 3721, 'sl', 1),
(1190, 'Ako ste u blizini albanskog grada Vlor&euml; ili planirate provesti svoj odmor u Albaniji, a volite i prelijepe duge pje&scaron;čane plaže, posjetite ovu gradsku plažu. Pristup automobilom na plažu vrlo je jednostavan gdje možete parkirati izravno na plaži, doslovno na plaži. Plaža je duga nekoliko kilometara, na nekim mjestima čak i vi&scaron;e od 100 m. Nagib plaže je vrlo nizak, gotovo u ravni. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i kupanje započinje na oko 75 m, &scaron;to ovu plažu čini idealnom za va&scaron;e mali&scaron;ane kako bi se sigurno igrali uz obalu. Ovdje su dostupne mnoge usluge na plaži. Na cijelom području imate brojne restorane i barove na plaži, kao i druge vrste usluga koje zadovoljavaju sve va&scaron;e potrebe. Ovdje ćete pronaći mnoge vrste smje&scaron;taja, najzastupljeniji su svakako hoteli koji su dostupni direktno na plaži.', 3721, 'hr', 1),
(1191, 'Se ti trovi nelle vicinanze della citt&agrave; albanese Valona o hai intenzione di trascorrere le tue vacanze in Albania e ti piacciono anche le belle spiagge sabbiose, devi visitare la vicina cittadina di Narta e la sua lunga spiaggia sabbiosa. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con il tuo veicolo e puoi parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia, accanto alla strada. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e in alcuni punti anche pi&ugrave; larga di 100 metri. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; molto bassa, &egrave; quasi piatta. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 75 m. Perch&eacute; l&#39;acqua &egrave; cos&igrave; poco profonda qui &egrave; anche adatto per i bambini piccoli a giocare nell&#39;acqua. Molti servizi di spiaggia sono disponibili qui. Intorno alla zona ci sono molti ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia, anche altri tipi di catering per soddisfare le tue esigenze. Direttamente sulla spiaggia non si dispone di alcun alloggio, ma di pi&ugrave; &egrave; disponibile nella citt&agrave; di Narta o nella citt&agrave; di Valona.', 3722, 'it', 1),
(1192, 'Si vous &ecirc;tes &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville albanaise de Vlor&euml; ou si vous pr&eacute;voyez de passer vos vacances en Albanie et que vous aimez &eacute;galement les belles longues plages de sable, vous devez visiter la petite ville voisine Narta et sa longue plage de sable. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec votre v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer directement sur la plage, &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route. La plage fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et sur certains endroits m&ecirc;me plus de 100 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est tr&egrave;s faible, c&#39;est presque plat. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence &agrave; environ 75 m. Parce que l&#39;eau est si peu profonde ici, elle convient &eacute;galement aux petits enfants pour jouer dans l&#39;eau. De nombreux services de plage sont disponibles ici. Dans toute la r&eacute;gion, vous trouverez de nombreux restaurants et bars de plage, ainsi que d&#39;autres types de restauration pour satisfaire vos besoins. Directement sur la plage, vous n&#39;avez pas d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, mais d&#39;autres sont disponibles dans la ville de Narta ou la ville de Vlor&euml;.', 3722, 'fr', 1),
(1193, 'Si est&aacute; cerca de la ciudad albanesa de Vlor&euml; o planea pasar sus vacaciones en Albania y tambi&eacute;n le gustan las hermosas playas de arena larga, debe visitar el peque&ntilde;o pueblo vecino de Narta y su larga playa de arena. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con su veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar directamente en la playa, al lado de la carretera. La playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y en algunos lugares incluso m&aacute;s de 100 metros de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es muy baja, es casi plana. La entrada de agua es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza a unos 75 m. Debido a que el agua es tan poco profunda aqu&iacute;, tambi&eacute;n es adecuada para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen en el agua. Muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;. En toda la zona hay muchos restaurantes y bares de playa, tambi&eacute;n otro tipo de catering para satisfacer sus necesidades. Directamente en la playa no tienes alojamiento, pero hay m&aacute;s disponible en la ciudad de Narta o en la ciudad de Vlor&euml;.', 3722, 'es', 1),
(1194, 'Wenn Sie in der N&auml;he der albanischen Stadt Vlor&euml; sind oder Ihren Urlaub in Albanien verbringen m&ouml;chten und auch sch&ouml;ne lange Sandstr&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, m&uuml;ssen Sie die benachbarte Kleinstadt Narta und ihren langen Sandstrand besuchen. Es ist sehr leicht mit Ihrem Fahrzeug ihn zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und stellenweise sogar mehr als 100 Meter breit. Die Neigung des Strandes ist sehr gering, es ist fast flach. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 75 m. Da das Wasser hier so flach ist, eignet es sich auch f&uuml;r kleine Kinder, um im Wasser zu spielen. Kinderspielpl&auml;tze sind auch auf dem Strand verf&uuml;gbar. Viele Stranddienstleistungen sind hier verf&uuml;gbar. In der gesamten Gegend gibt es viele Restaurants und Strandbars sowie andere Arten von Catering, um Ihren Bed&uuml;rfnissen gerecht zu werden. Direkt am Strand haben Sie keine Unterkunft, aber mehr gibt es in der Stadt Narta oder der Stadt Vlor&euml;.', 3722, 'de', 1),
(1195, 'Če se nahajate blizu albanskega mesta Vlor&euml; ali bi radi preživeli dopust v Albaniji in imate radi tudi lepe dolge pe&scaron;čene plaže, morate obiskati sosednje majhno mesto Narta in njegovo dolgo pe&scaron;čeno plažo. Do plaže se zelo enostavno pripeljete z vsakim vozilom, tudi avtodomom, kjer lahko parkirate neposredno pred plažo ob cesti. Plaža je dolga nekaj kilometrov, ponekod celo več kot 100 metrov. Naklon plaže je zelo majhen, skoraj raven. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne pri približno 75 metrih. Ker je voda tukaj tako plitva, je primerna tudi za igranje majhnih otrok v vodi. Na plaži so na voljo tudi otro&scaron;ka igrala in &scaron;portna igri&scaron;ča. &Scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži so na voljo tukaj. Na celotnem območju je veliko restavracij in barov na plaži, pa tudi druge vrste postrežbe, ki bodo zadovoljile va&scaron;e potrebe. Namestitve neposredno na plaži ni, je pa več opcij v mestu Narta ali v mestu Vlor&euml;, predvsem kot apartmaji.', 3722, 'sl', 1),
(1196, 'Ako se nalazite u blizini albanskog grada Vlor&euml; ili želite provesti odmor u Albaniji, a volite i lijepe duge pje&scaron;čane plaže, posjetite susjedni mali grad Narta i njegovu dugu pje&scaron;čanu plažu. Do plaže se može lako doći bilo kojim vozilom, uključujući i kamp kućicu, gdje možete parkirati direktno ispred plaže pored ceste. Plaža je duga nekoliko kilometara, na nekim mjestima čak i vi&scaron;e od 100 metara. Nagib plaže je vrlo mali, gotovo u ravni. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep, a plivanje počinje na oko 75 metara. Kako je voda ovdje plitka, pogodna je i za malu djecu koja se mogu igrati u vodi. Na plaži su i dječja igrali&scaron;ta i sportski tereni. Ovdje su dostupne mnoge usluge na plaži. U cijelom tom području postoje brojni restorani i barovi na plaži kao i ostale vrste usluga prema va&scaron;im potrebama. Na plaži nema smje&scaron;taja, ali postoji vi&scaron;e opcija u Narta ili Vlor&euml;, uglavnom kao apartmani.', 3722, 'hr', 1),
(1197, 'Die montenegrinische Region Kotor, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Prijevor, hat einen sehr sch&ouml;nen und attraktiven Kieselstrand zu bieten. Der Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Der Strand ist 1 Kilometer lang und bis zu 40 Meter breit. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand kleine Kieselsteine ​​sind, haben Sie auch etwas Sand am Strand und an einigen Stellen sogar Felsen am Strand. Der Wassereintritt hier ist sehr sch&ouml;n, und weil das Wasser hier sehr schnell tief wird, k&ouml;nnen Sie fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Aufgrund der vielen Strandbars und verschiedenen Arten von Restaurants, die am Strand verf&uuml;gbar sind, stehen Ihnen hier auch viele Strandinfrastrukturen und verschiedene Dienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier nicht nur eine Sonnenliege mieten, sondern auch viele Wasserger&auml;te mieten, wie einen Seescooter und &auml;hnliches. Hier gibt es auch Strandunterk&uuml;nfte. Im Hintergrund des Strandes gibt es einen Campingplatz und ganz in der N&auml;he gibt es sogar ein Hotel und einige Apartments.', 3783, 'de', 1),
(1198, 'La regione del Montenegro Kotor, vicino al villaggio di Prijevor, ha una spiaggia di ciottoli molto bella e attraente da offrire. La spiaggia &egrave; facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare accanto alla strada direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 1 km e larga fino a 40 metri. Sebbene la superficie principale sulla spiaggia sia di piccoli ciottoli, hai anche un po &#39;di sabbia sulla spiaggia e in alcune parti persino rocce sulla spiaggia. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua qui &egrave; molto bello e poich&eacute; l&#39;acqua arriva molto in profondit&agrave; molto velocemente, puoi iniziare a nuotare quasi immediatamente. A causa di cos&igrave; tanti bar sulla spiaggia e diversi tipi di ristoranti, che sono disponibili sulla spiaggia, qui hai anche molte infrastrutture sulla spiaggia e diversi servizi disponibili. Non solo puoi noleggiare qui un lettino, ma hai anche molte attrezzature acquatiche da noleggiare, come uno scooter marino e simili. Qui &egrave; disponibile anche l&#39;alloggio in spiaggia. Sullo sfondo della spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un campeggio e molto vicino si ha anche un hotel e alcuni appartamenti.', 3783, 'it', 1),
(1199, 'La r&eacute;gion du Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro Kotor, pr&egrave;s du village Prijevor, a une tr&egrave;s belle et jolie plage de galets &agrave; offrir. La plage est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route juste en face de la plage. La plage mesure 1 km de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 40 m&egrave;tres de large. Bien que la surface principale de la plage soit de petits cailloux, vous avez &eacute;galement du sable sur la plage et, sur certaines parties, m&ecirc;me des rochers sur la plage. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau ici est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able, et parce que l&#39;eau y p&eacute;n&egrave;tre tr&egrave;s rapidement, vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager presque imm&eacute;diatement. En raison de tant de bars de plage et de diff&eacute;rents types de restaurants, qui sont disponibles sur la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement ici de nombreuses infrastructures de plage et diff&eacute;rents services disponibles. Non seulement vous pouvez louer ici un transat, mais vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreux &eacute;quipements aquatiques &agrave; louer, comme un scooter de mer et similaire. Un h&eacute;bergement &agrave; la plage est &eacute;galement disponible ici. Au fond de la plage il y a un terrain de camping et tout pr&egrave;s vous avez m&ecirc;me un h&ocirc;tel et quelques appartements.', 3783, 'fr', 1),
(1200, 'La regi&oacute;n de Montenegro Kotor, cerca del pueblo de Prijevor, tiene una playa de guijarros muy bonita y atractiva para ofrecer. La playa es de f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar al lado de la carretera directamente en frente de la playa. La playa tiene 1 kil&oacute;metro de largo y hasta 40 metros de ancho. Aunque la superficie principal de la playa son peque&ntilde;as piedras, tambi&eacute;n tiene algo de arena en la playa y, en algunas partes, incluso rocas en la playa. La entrada de agua aqu&iacute; es muy agradable, y debido a que el agua llega muy profundo, puede comenzar a nadar casi de inmediato. Debido a tantos bares de playa y diferentes tipos de restaurantes, que est&aacute;n disponibles en la playa, tambi&eacute;n tiene aqu&iacute; muchas infraestructuras de playa y diferentes servicios disponibles. No solo puede alquilar aqu&iacute; una tumbona, sino que tambi&eacute;n tiene muchos equipos de agua para alquilar, como un scooter de mar y similares. El alojamiento en la playa tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;. Al fondo de la playa hay un camping y muy cerca incluso tienes un hotel y algunos apartamentos.', 3783, 'es', 1),
(1201, 'Črnogorska regija Kotor, v bližini vasi Prijevor, ponuja zelo lepo in privlačno prodnato plažo. Plaža je zelo enostavno dostopna s kakr&scaron;nimi koli vozili in parkirate lahko ob cesti neposredno pred plažo. Plaža je dolga 1 kilometer in &scaron;iroka do 40 metrov. Čeprav so glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži majhni prodniki, imate na plaži tudi nekaj peska, na nekaterih delih celo skale ob plaži. Vstop v vodo je tukaj zelo lep, in ker globina vode tu zelo hitro nara&scaron;ča, lahko začnete plavati skoraj takoj. Zaradi toliko barov na plaži in različnih vrst restavracij, ki so na voljo na plaži, imate tukaj tudi veliko plažne infrastrukture in različnih storitev. Tu ne le, da lahko najamete ležalnik, izposodite si lahko tudi veliko vodne opreme, kot je morski skuter in podobno. Na tej plaži imate na voljo tudi namestitev ob plaži. V ozadju plaže se nahaja kamp, prav tako pa sta zelo blizu tudi hotel in nekaj apartmajev.', 3783, 'sl', 1),
(1202, 'Crnogorsko područje Kotor, u blizini sela Prijevor, nudi vrlo lijepu i atraktivnu &scaron;ljunčanu plažu. Plaža je vrlo lako dostupna bilo kojim vozilima i možete parkirati uz cestu direktno ispred plaže. Plaža je duga 1 kilometar i &scaron;iroka do 40 metara. Iako je glavni dio plaže mali &scaron;ljunak, na plaži imate i ne&scaron;to pijeska, u nekim dijelovima čak i stijene uz plažu. Ulazak ovdje u vodu je vrlo lijep, a budući da se dubina vode ovdje vrlo brzo povećava, možete početi plivati ​​gotovo odmah. Zbog toliko mnogo barova na plaži i različitih vrsta restorana dostupnih na plaži, ovdje također imate puno plaže i razne usluge. Ovdje ne samo da možete unajmiti ležaljku, već možete i najamiti puno vodene opreme poput morskog skutera i slično. Na ovoj je plaži također dostupan smje&scaron;taj uz obalu. U pozadini plaže nalazi se kamp, ​​a također vrlo blizu hotela i nekih apartmana.', 3783, 'hr', 1),
(1203, 'Esta playa de Montenegro tiene que ser una de las playas m&aacute;s atractivas de este pa&iacute;s mediterr&aacute;neo. La organizaci&oacute;n en esta playa est&aacute; al m&aacute;s alto nivel. Es adecuado para muchas generaciones, desde ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os hasta entusiastas de las fiestas, familias e incluso aquellos que aman tener un poco de paz en la playa y disfrutar de los servicios de playa de alta gama. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Kotar, cerca del pueblo Krimovica. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a &eacute;l con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tiene unos cientos de lugares de estacionamiento a su disposici&oacute;n frente a la playa. La superficie principal de la playa es de hormig&oacute;n, pero tambi&eacute;n tiene algunas partes con rocas y guijarros. La entrada de agua es muy agradable y puedes saltar al agua cristalina o usar la playa para entrar al agua. La nataci&oacute;n comienza casi de inmediato. Usted tiene muchos servicios de playa e infraestructura de playa disponibles en esta buena ubicaci&oacute;n. En verano, los amantes de la fiesta, una parte de la playa est&aacute; reservada tambi&eacute;n para esta actividad. Tambi&eacute;n tiene muchas piscinas aqu&iacute;, algunas adecuadas para ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os y otras para adultos. Un restaurante y muchos bares de playa de diferentes tipos, est&aacute;n disponibles en la playa directamente. El alojamiento no est&aacute; disponible en la playa, pero puede concertar con los propietarios de esta playa para alquilar algunos apartamentos u otras instalaciones similares.', 3784, 'es', 1),
(1204, 'Cette plage du Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro doit &ecirc;tre l&#39;une des plus belles plages de ce pays m&eacute;diterran&eacute;en. L&#39;organisation sur cette plage est au plus haut niveau. Il convient &agrave; de nombreuses g&eacute;n&eacute;rations, des petits enfants aux f&ecirc;tards, aux familles et m&ecirc;me &agrave; ceux qui aiment simplement avoir un peu de paix sur la plage et profiter des services de plage haut de gamme. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion de Kotar, pr&egrave;s du village de Krimovica. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de l&#39;atteindre avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous avez quelques centaines de places de parking &agrave; votre disposition en face de la plage. La surface principale de la plage est en b&eacute;ton, mais vous avez &eacute;galement des parties avec des rochers et des cailloux. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez soit sauter dans l&#39;eau cristalline ou utiliser la plage pour entrer dans l&#39;eau. La natation commence presque imm&eacute;diatement. Vous avez beaucoup de services de plage et d&#39;infrastructures de plage disponibles sur ce bel emplacement. En &eacute;t&eacute;, ceux qui aiment faire la f&ecirc;te, une partie de la plage est &eacute;galement r&eacute;serv&eacute;e &agrave; cette activit&eacute;. Vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreuses piscines ici, certaines adapt&eacute;es aux petits enfants, d&#39;autres aux adultes. Un restaurant et de nombreux bars de plage de diff&eacute;rents types sont disponibles directement sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas disponible sur la plage, mais vous pouvez vous arranger avec les propri&eacute;taires de cette plage pour louer des appartements ou d&#39;autres installations similaires.', 3784, 'fr', 1),
(1205, 'Questa spiaggia del Montenegro deve essere una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; belle di questo paese mediterraneo. L&#39;organizzazione su questa spiaggia &egrave; di altissimo livello. &Egrave; adatto a molte generazioni, dai bambini piccoli, agli appassionati di feste, alle famiglie e anche a coloro che adorano semplicemente avere un po &#39;di pace sulla spiaggia e godersi i servizi di fascia alta della spiaggia. Si trova nella regione di Kotar, vicino al villaggio di Krimovica. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e ci sono alcune centinaia di parcheggi nella tua disposa di fronte al lido. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; in cemento, ma hai anche alcune parti con rocce e ciottoli. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e puoi anche saltare nell&#39;acqua cristallina o utilizzare la spiaggia per l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua. Il nuoto inizia quasi immediatamente. Hai un sacco di servizi e infrastrutture sulla spiaggia disponibili in questa bella posizione. In estate, chi ama fare festa, una parte della spiaggia &egrave; riservata anche a questa attivit&agrave;. Hai anche molte piscine qui, alcune adatte a bambini piccoli, altre per adulti. Un ristorante e molti bar sulla spiaggia di diversi tipi, sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione non &egrave; disponibile sulla spiaggia, ma &egrave; possibile concordare con i proprietari di questa spiaggia di affittare alcuni appartamenti o altre strutture simili.', 3784, 'it', 1),
(1206, 'Dieser montenegrinische Strand muss einer der attraktivsten Str&auml;nde in diesem mediterranen Land sein. Die Organisation an diesem Strand ist auf h&ouml;chstem Niveau. Es ist f&uuml;r viele Generationen geeignet, von kleinen Kindern &uuml;ber Partybegeisterte bis hin zu Familien und sogar f&uuml;r diejenigen, die es einfach lieben, etwas Ruhe am Strand zu haben und die High-End-Stranddienstleistungen zu genie&szlig;en. Es befindet sich in der Region Kotar, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Krimovica. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug es zu erreichen und Sie haben ein paar hundert Parkpl&auml;tze vor dem Strand zu Verf&uuml;gung. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist aus Beton, aber Sie haben auch einige Teile mit Steinen und Kieselsteinen. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder ins kristallklare Wasser springen oder den Strand f&uuml;r den Wassereintritt nutzen. Das Schwimmen beginnt fast sofort. An diesem sch&ouml;nen Ort stehen Ihnen viele Stranddienstleistungen und Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung. Im Sommer ist f&uuml;r diejenigen, die gerne feiern, ein Teil des Strandes auch f&uuml;r diese Aktivit&auml;t reserviert. Sie haben hier auch viele Schwimmb&auml;der, von denen einige f&uuml;r kleine Kinder geeignet sind, andere f&uuml;r Erwachsene. Ein Restaurant und viele Strandbars verschiedener Art befinden sich direkt am Strand. Am Strand ist keine Unterkunft verf&uuml;gbar, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen mit den Eigent&uuml;mern dieses Strandes vereinbaren, einige Apartments oder &auml;hnliche Einrichtungen zu mieten.', 3784, 'de', 1),
(1207, 'Ta črnogorska plaža mora biti ena najprivlačnej&scaron;ih plaž v tej mediteranski državi. Organizacija na tej plaži je na najvi&scaron;ji ravni. Plaža&nbsp; je primerna za &scaron;tevilne generacije, od majhnih otrok, do tistih željnih zabave, družin in celo tistih, ki imajo radi nekaj miru na plaži in uživajo v vrhunskih plažnih storitvah. Nahaja se v regiji Kotar, v bližini vasi Krimovica. Do te lokacije se lahko pripeljete s kakr&scaron;nim koli vozilom in pred plažo imate na razpolago nekaj sto parkirnih mest. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži je beton, nekaj delov na plaži pa ima tudi skale in prod. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in v kristalno čisto vodo lahko ali skočite ali pa greste v vodo iz prodnate plaže. Plavanje se začne skoraj takoj. Na tej lepi lokaciji imate na voljo &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži in infrastrukturo na plaži. Poleti, za tiste, ki se radi zabavajo, ple&scaron;ejo, je del plaže rezerviran tudi za to dejavnost. Tu imate tudi veliko bazenov, nekateri so primerni za majhne otroke, nekateri za odrasle. Restavracija in veliko barov na plaži različnih vrst so na voljo neposredno na plaži. Namestitev na plaži ni na voljo, lahko pa se z lastniki te plaže dogovorite za najem nekaterih apartmajev ali drugih podobnih objektov.', 3784, 'sl', 1),
(1208, 'Ova crnogorska plaža mora biti jedna od najatraktivnijih plaža u ovoj mediteranskoj zemlji. Organizacija na ovoj plaži na najvi&scaron;em je nivou. Plaža je pogodna za mnoge generacije, od male djece, do onih koji žele zabavu, obitelji, pa čak i onih koji vole malo mira na plaži i uživaju u vrhunskim plažnim uslugama. Nalazi se u kotarskom kraju, u blizini sela Krimovica. Do ove lokacije se može doći bilo kojim vozilom, a ispred plaže je na raspolaganju nekoliko stotina parkirnih mjesta. Glavni dio plaže je betonski, a neki dijelovi plaže također imaju stijene i &scaron;ljunak. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i možete skočiti u kristalno čistu vodu ili ući u vodu sa &scaron;ljunčane plaže. Plivanje započinje gotovo odmah. Na ovom prekrasnom mjestu na raspolaganju su vam mnoge usluge na plaži i plaža. Ljeti, za one koji se vole zabavljati, plesati, dio plaže također je rezerviran za ovu aktivnost. Ovdje također imate puno bazena, neki prikladni za malu djecu, neki za odrasle. Restoran i mno&scaron;tvo raznih barova na plaži dostupni su izravno na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj na plaži nije dostupan, ali možete se dogovoriti s vlasnicima ove plaže za najam nekih apartmana ili drugih sličnih sadržaja.', 3784, 'hr', 1),
(1209, 'La spiaggia Plaža Lu&scaron;tica, che si trova nella regione di Herceg Novi, si trova in una posizione molto speciale. Fa parte di un nuovo villaggio di lusso con un moderno porto turistico e un porto turistico. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi parcheggiare in pi&ugrave; parcheggi vicino al porticciolo stesso. Questa &egrave; l&#39;unica opzione dove &egrave; possibile parcheggiare, il villaggio stesso &egrave; di propriet&agrave; privata. Per raggiungere la spiaggia dal parcheggio, &egrave; necessario attraversare il porto turistico per circa 400 metri. La superficie principale della spiaggia sono piccoli ciottoli con alcune pietre pi&ugrave; grandi mescolate con dentro, e hai anche delle rocce sui lati e sullo sfondo della spiaggia. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 200 metri e pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 30 metri. In alcuni punti l&#39;inclinazione della pendenza &egrave; un po &#39;ripida in alcuni normali. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; piacevole e puoi iniziare a nuotare immediatamente. Hai molti servizi di spiaggia disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. Un bar sulla spiaggia si trova anche qui. Ristoranti e altri catering simili, oltre a negozi, si trovano nel porticciolo stesso. &Egrave; anche possibile alloggiare nel villaggio sotto forma di appartamenti, ma &egrave; anche possibile acquistare un nuovo appartamento da soli.', 3786, 'it', 1),
(1210, 'La plage Plaža Lu&scaron;tica, qui est situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion Herceg Novi, est situ&eacute;e dans un endroit tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;cial. Il fait partie d&#39;un nouveau village de luxe avec une marina et un port de plaisance modernes. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de l&#39;atteindre avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer sur plusieurs places de parking pr&egrave;s de la marina elle-m&ecirc;me. C&#39;est la seule option o&ugrave; vous pouvez vous garer, le village lui-m&ecirc;me est une propri&eacute;t&eacute; priv&eacute;e. Pour vous rendre &agrave; la plage depuis le parking, vous devez traverser la marina sur environ 400 m&egrave;tres. La surface principale de la plage est constitu&eacute;e de petits cailloux avec de plus grosses pierres m&eacute;lang&eacute;es &agrave; l&#39;int&eacute;rieur, et vous avez &eacute;galement des rochers sur les c&ocirc;t&eacute;s et &agrave; l&#39;arri&egrave;re-plan de la plage. La longueur totale de la plage est de 200 m&egrave;tres et elle peut atteindre 30 m&egrave;tres de large. Dans certains endroits, l&#39;inclinaison de la pente est un peu raide sur une normale. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager imm&eacute;diatement. De nombreux services de plage sont disponibles directement sur la plage. Un bar de plage se trouve &eacute;galement ici. Les restaurants et autres traiteurs similaires, ainsi que les magasins, sont situ&eacute;s dans la marina elle-m&ecirc;me. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement possible dans le village sous forme d&#39;appartements, mais vous pouvez &eacute;galement acheter un nouvel appartement vous-m&ecirc;me.', 3786, 'fr', 1),
(1211, 'La playa Plaža Lu&scaron;tica, que se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Herceg Novi, se encuentra en un lugar muy especial. Es parte de un nuevo pueblo de lujo con un moderno puerto deportivo y puerto deportivo. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a &eacute;l con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar en m&uacute;ltiples lugares de estacionamiento cerca del puerto deportivo. Esta es la &uacute;nica opci&oacute;n donde puedes estacionar, el pueblo en s&iacute; es propiedad privada. Para llegar a la playa desde el estacionamiento, debe caminar por el puerto deportivo durante unos 400 metros. La superficie principal de la playa son peque&ntilde;os guijarros con algunas piedras m&aacute;s grandes mezcladas, y tambi&eacute;n tiene algunas rocas en los lados y en el fondo de la playa. La longitud total de la playa es de 200 metros y puede tener hasta 30 metros de ancho. En algunos lugares, la inclinaci&oacute;n de la pendiente es un poco pronunciada en algunos niveles normales. La entrada al agua es agradable y puedes comenzar a nadar de inmediato. Tienes muchos servicios de playa disponibles en la playa directamente. Un bar de playa tambi&eacute;n se encuentra aqu&iacute;. Restaurantes y otros servicios de catering similares, as&iacute; como tiendas, se encuentran en el puerto deportivo. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n es posible en el pueblo en forma de apartamentos, pero tambi&eacute;n puede comprar un apartamento nuevo usted mismo.', 3786, 'es', 1),
(1212, 'Der Strand Plaža Lu&scaron;tica in der Region Herceg Novi befindet sich an einem ganz besonderen Ort. Es ist Teil eines neuen Luxusdorfes mit einem modernen Yachthafen und Hafen. Dieser Strand ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf mehreren Parkpl&auml;tzen in der N&auml;he des Yachthafens selbst parken. Dies ist die einzige M&ouml;glichkeit, wo Sie parken k&ouml;nnen. Das Dorf selbst ist in Privatbesitz. Um vom Parkplatz zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie etwa 400 Meter durch den Yachthafen laufen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes sind kleine Kieselsteine ​​mit einigen gr&ouml;&szlig;eren Steinen, und Sie haben auch einige Felsen an den Seiten und im Hintergrund des Strandes. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 200 Meter und kann bis zu 30 Meter breit sein. An einigen Stellen ist die Neigung des Abhangs etwas steil, an einigen Stellen ganz Normal. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Sie haben viele Stranddienstleistungen direkt am Strand. Hier befindet sich auch eine Strandbar. Restaurants und &auml;hnliches Catering sowie Gesch&auml;fte befinden sich im Yachthafen. Eine Unterkunft im Dorf ist auch in Form von Wohnungen m&ouml;glich, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen auch selbst eine neue Wohnung kaufen.', 3786, 'de', 1),
(1213, 'Plaža Lu&scaron;tica, v regiji Herceg Novi, se nahaja na prav posebnem mestu. Je del nove luksuzne vasice s sodobno marino in pristani&scaron;čem. Do te plaže se lahko pripeljete s katerim koli vozilom, kjer lahko parkirate na več parkirnih mestih v bližini marine. To je tudi edini mesto, kjer lahko parkirate. Vas je v zasebni lasti. Če želite priti s parkiri&scaron;ča do plaže, morate pe&scaron; prehoditi približno 400 metrov skozi marino. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže so majhni prodniki z nekaj večjimi kamni, na straneh in v ozadju plaže pa imate tudi nekaj skal. Skupna dolžina plaže je 200 metrov in je lahko &scaron;iroka do 30 metrov. Ponekod je pobočje nekoliko strmo, ponekod povsem normalno. Dostop v vodo je lep in skoraj takoj lahko pričnete s plavanjem. Na plaži se za vas nahajajo &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži. Tu je tudi bar na plaži. Restavracije in podobne gostinske storitve, ter trgovine, se nahajajo v marini. V okolici plaže, kjer se&nbsp; nahaja naselje, lahko tudi prespite oz. preživite va&scaron; dopust, najamete lahko apartmajev. Če pa vam je vsa okolica zelo v&scaron;eč, pa lahko katerega izmed stanovanj tudi kupite.', 3786, 'sl', 1),
(1214, 'Plaža Lu&scaron;tica, u regiji Herceg Novog, nalazi se na vrlo posebnom mjestu. Dio je novog luksuznog sela s modernom marinom i lukom. Do ove plaže se može doći bilo kojim vozilom, gdje se možete parkirati na nekoliko parkirnih mjesta u blizini marine. To je ujedno i jedino mjesto na kojem možete parkirati. Selo je u privatnom vlasni&scaron;tvu. Da biste do&scaron;li s parkirali&scaron;ta do plaže, morate pro&scaron;etati oko 400 metara kroz marinu. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže su mali &scaron;ljunci s ne&scaron;to većim kamenjem, a sa strana i u pozadini plaže imate i nekoliko stijena. Ukupna duljina plaže je 200 metara, a može biti &scaron;iroka i do 30 metara. Na nekim mjestima padina je malo strma, na nekim mjestima potpuno normalna. Pristup vodi je lijep i možete početi plivati ​​gotovo odmah. Na plaži postoje brojne usluge na plaži. Tu je i bar na plaži. Restorani i slične ugostiteljske usluge, kao i trgovine, nalaze se u marini. U blizini plaže, na kojoj se nalazi selo, možete i prespavati ili. provedite odmor, možete unajmiti apartmane. No ako vam se cijelo područje doista sviđa, možete kupiti i jedan od apartmana.', 3786, 'hr', 1),
(1215, 'La spiaggia Velja &Scaron;pilja &egrave; per quelli consigliati, che amano stare nella natura, senza servizi di spiaggia disponibili nelle vicinanze. Si trova nella regione di Herceg Novi, vicino al villaggio di Merdari. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. La parte finale della strada &egrave; sterrata. &Egrave; possibile parcheggiare il veicolo direttamente in spiaggia e fare una passeggiata di 100 metri a circa 15 metri di dislivello dalla spiaggia. Il percorso in s&eacute; &egrave; un po &#39;complicato e pericoloso, ma con sufficiente cautela &egrave; possibile gestirlo. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia marrone, ma ci sono anche dei piccoli ciottoli e delle rocce ai lati della spiaggia. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia quasi immediatamente. Sulla spiaggia stessa e nei dintorni non &egrave; disponibile alcuna infrastruttura o servizio spiaggia. Lo stesso vale per l&#39;alloggio, che pu&ograve; essere trovato nei villaggi vicini, ma non intorno alla spiaggia.', 3787, 'it', 1),
(1216, 'La plage Velja &Scaron;pilja est pour ceux recommand&eacute;s, qui aiment &ecirc;tre dans la nature, sans aucun service de plage disponible &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Herceg Novi, pr&egrave;s du village Merdari. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. La derni&egrave;re partie de la route est en terre. Vous pouvez garer le v&eacute;hicule directement sur la plage et faire une promenade de 100 m&egrave;tres sur 15 m&egrave;tres de d&eacute;nivel&eacute; jusqu&#39;&agrave; la plage. Le chemin lui-m&ecirc;me est en partie un peu d&eacute;licat et dangereux, mais avec suffisamment de prudence, il est possible de le g&eacute;rer. La surface principale de la plage est du sable brun, mais vous avez &eacute;galement de petits cailloux et des rochers sur les c&ocirc;t&eacute;s de la plage. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence presque imm&eacute;diatement. Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me et dans les environs, vous ne disposez d&#39;aucune infrastructure de plage ou de services de plage disponibles. Il en va de m&ecirc;me pour l&#39;h&eacute;bergement, que l&#39;on trouve dans les villages voisins, mais pas autour de la plage.', 3787, 'fr', 1),
(1217, 'La playa Velja &Scaron;pilja es para los recomendados, que aman estar en la naturaleza, sin ning&uacute;n servicio de playa disponible cerca. Se encuentra ubicado en la regi&oacute;n Herceg Novi, cerca del pueblo de Merdari. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. La parte final del camino es de tierra. Puede estacionar el veh&iacute;culo directamente en la playa y dar un paseo de 100 metros con una diferencia de altura de 15 metros hasta la playa. El camino en s&iacute; es, por una parte, un poco complicado y peligroso, pero con suficiente precauci&oacute;n es posible gestionarlo. La superficie principal de la playa es arena marr&oacute;n, pero tambi&eacute;n tiene algunas piedras peque&ntilde;as y algunas rocas a los lados de la playa. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza casi de inmediato. En la playa misma y en los alrededores, no tiene infraestructura de playa ni servicios de playa disponibles. Lo mismo es cierto para el alojamiento, que se puede encontrar en los pueblos vecinos, pero no alrededor de la playa.', 3787, 'es', 1),
(1218, 'Der Strand Velja &Scaron;pilja ist f&uuml;r diejenigen empfehlenswert, die es lieben, in der Natur zu sein, ohne dass in der N&auml;he Stranddienste angeboten werden. Es befindet sich in der Region Herceg Novi, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Merdari. Es ist sehr leicht mit jedem Fahrzeug es zu erreichen. Der letzte Teil der Stra&szlig;e ist unbefestigt. Sie k&ouml;nnen das Fahrzeug direkt am Strand parken und einen 100-Meter-Spaziergang mit einem H&ouml;henunterschied von 15 Metern zum Strand unternehmen. Der Weg selbst ist einerseits etwas knifflig und gef&auml;hrlich, aber mit gen&uuml;gend Vorsicht ist es m&ouml;glich, ihn zu maistern. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist brauner Sand, aber Sie haben auch einige kleine Kieselsteine und einige Felsen an den Seiten des Strandes. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt fast sofort. Am Strand selbst und in der Umgebung stehen Ihnen keine Strandinfrastruktur oder Stranddienste zur Verf&uuml;gung. Gleiches gilt f&uuml;r Unterk&uuml;nfte, die in den Nachbard&ouml;rfern, aber nicht rund um den Strand zu finden sind.', 3787, 'de', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1219, 'Plaža Velja &Scaron;pilja je priporočljiva za tiste, ki radi uživate v naravi, brez možnosti kori&scaron;čenja storitev na plaži, ki so običajne za tipične turistične kraje. Nahaja se v regiji Herceg Novi, v bližini vasi Merdari. Do te plaže se lahko pripeljete s katerim koli vozilom. Zadnji del ceste je neasfaltiran. Vozilo lahko parkirate neposredno pred plažo in se odpravite na 100-metrski sprehod z vi&scaron;insko razliko 15 metrov do plaže. Sama pot je nekoliko zapletena in nevarna, vendar jo je z dovolj previdnosti mogoče obvladati. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži je rjav pesek, vendar je vmes pome&scaron;anih tudi nekaj majhnih kamenčkov in v ozadju in ob straneh plaže je nekaj skal. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavati lahko začnete skoraj takoj. Na sami plaži in v okolici ni na voljo nobene infrastrukture za plažo ali storitve na plaži. Enako velja za nastanitev, ki jo najdemo v sosednjih vaseh, ne pa tudi okoli plaže.', 3787, 'sl', 1),
(1220, 'Plaža Velja &Scaron;pilja preporučuje se onima koji vole uživati ​​u prirodi, bez mogućnosti kori&scaron;tenja usluga na plaži, koje su uobičajene za tipična turistička odredi&scaron;ta. Nalazi se u regiji Herceg Novog, u blizini sela Merdari. Do ove plaže se može doći bilo kojim vozilom. Stražnji dio ceste je neasfaltiran. Automobil možete parkirati izravno ispred plaže i ići na 100-metarsku &scaron;etnju s visinskom razlikom od 15 metara do plaže. Put je sam po sebi malo kompliciran i opasan, ali njime se može upravljati s dovoljno opreza. Glavni dio plaže je smeđi pijesak, ali također je nekoliko sitnih &scaron;ljunka pomije&scaron;anih između njih, a u pozadini i na bočnoj strani plaže postoje neke stijene. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i možete početi plivati ​​gotovo odmah. Na plaži i oko nje nema plažne infrastrukture ili usluga na plaži. Isto vrijedi i za smje&scaron;taj u susjednim selima, ali ne oko plaže.', 3787, 'hr', 1),
(1221, 'Vicino al villaggio Mardari, nella regione del Montenegro Herceg Novi, c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia di ciottoli lunga 200 metri con un lussuoso beach club, direttamente sulla spiaggia. Se sei quello a cui piace una piccola spiaggia di ciottoli e ti piace anche avere molti servizi di spiaggia di alto livello disponibili sulla spiaggia, questa spiaggia &egrave; quella giusta per te. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e il parcheggio &egrave; disponibile direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. Questa posizione &egrave; divisa in tre parti. Nel mezzo si trova il beach club e ai bordi le due spiagge di ciottoli, una pi&ugrave; lunga e una pi&ugrave; piccola. Sulla spiaggia hai 10 metri di larghezza. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua qui &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia da circa 30 a 40 metri. Una volta che sei in acqua, hai anche un po &#39;di sabbia sul fondo. Alcune infrastrutture sono sulla spiaggia, ma altre sono nel beach club stesso. Hai anche un bellissimo bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante qui. La sistemazione non &egrave; disponibile qui, ma nel villaggio sulla spiaggia di Lu&scaron;tica, a circa 1 km di distanza.', 3788, 'it', 1),
(1222, 'Pr&egrave;s du village de Mardari, dans la r&eacute;gion du Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro Herceg Novi, il y a une plage de galets de 200 m&egrave;tres de long avec un club de plage de luxe, directement sur la plage. Si vous &ecirc;tes celui qui aime une petite plage de galets et que vous aimez aussi avoir beaucoup de services de plage de haut niveau disponibles sur la plage, cette plage est la bonne pour vous. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de l&#39;atteindre avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule, et vous disposez du parking directement en face de la plage. Cet emplacement est s&eacute;par&eacute; en trois parties. Au milieu, vous avez le club de plage et aux fronti&egrave;res les deux plages de galets, une plus longue et une plus petite. Sur la plage, vous avez 10 m&egrave;tres de largeur. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau ici est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence &agrave; environ 30 &agrave; 40 m&egrave;tres. Une fois que vous &ecirc;tes dans l&#39;eau, vous avez &eacute;galement du sable au fond. Certaines infrastructures se trouvent sur la plage, mais davantage dans le club de plage lui-m&ecirc;me. Vous avez &eacute;galement un tr&egrave;s beau bar de plage et un restaurant ici. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas disponible ici, mais dans le village de la plage de Lu&scaron;tica, &agrave; environ 1 km.', 3788, 'fr', 1),
(1223, 'Cerca del pueblo de Mardari, en la regi&oacute;n de Montenegro Herceg Novi, hay una playa de guijarros de 200 metros de largo con un club de playa de lujo, directamente en la playa. Si le gusta una peque&ntilde;a playa de guijarros y tambi&eacute;n le gusta tener muchos servicios de playa de alto est&aacute;ndar disponibles en la playa, esta playa es la adecuada para usted. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, y tiene el estacionamiento disponible directamente en frente de la playa. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n est&aacute; separada en tres partes. En el medio tiene el club de playa y en las fronteras las dos playas de guijarros, una m&aacute;s larga y otra m&aacute;s peque&ntilde;a. En la playa tienes 10 metros de ancho. La entrada de agua aqu&iacute; es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza alrededor de los 30 a 40 metros. Una vez que est&aacute;s en el agua, tambi&eacute;n tienes algo de arena en el fondo. Parte de la infraestructura est&aacute; en la playa, pero hay m&aacute;s en el club de playa. Tambi&eacute;n tienes un bar de playa muy agradable y un restaurante aqu&iacute;. El alojamiento no est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;, pero en la playa del pueblo de Lu&scaron;tica, a aproximadamente 1 km de distancia.', 3788, 'es', 1),
(1224, 'In der N&auml;he des Dorfes Mardari, in der montenegrinischen Region Herceg Novi, befindet sich ein 200 Meter langer Kieselstrand mit einem Luxus-Strandclub direkt am Strand. Wenn Sie einen kleinen Kieselstrand m&ouml;gen und auch viele Stranddienste mit hohem Standard am Strand haben m&ouml;chten, ist dieser Strand der richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug ihn zu erreichen und Sie haben den Parkplatz direkt vor dem Strand zur Verf&uuml;gung. Dieser Ort ist in drei Teile unterteilt. In der Mitte befindet sich der Beach Club und an den Grenzen die beiden Kieselstr&auml;nde, einer l&auml;nger und einer kleiner. Am Strand haben Sie 10 Meter Breite. Der Wassereintritt hier ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei etwa 30 bis 40 Metern. Sobald Sie im Wasser sind, haben Sie auch etwas Sand auf dem Boden. Einige Infrastrukturen befinden sich am Strand, aber mehr befindet sich im Beach Club selbst. Sie haben auch eine sehr sch&ouml;ne Strandbar und ein Restaurant hier. Eine Unterkunft ist hier nicht verf&uuml;gbar, aber im etwa 1 km entfernten Stranddorf Lu&scaron;tica.', 3788, 'de', 1),
(1225, 'V bližini vasi Mardari, v črnogorski regiji Herceg Novi, se nahaja 200 metrov dolga prodnata plaža z luksuznim beach klubom, neposredno na plaži. Če ste tisti, ki imate rad majhno prodnato plažo in imate radi na voljo tudi veliko visokokakovostnih storitev na plaži, je ta plaža prava za vas. Do nje se zelo enostavno pripeljete s katerim koli vozilom, parkiranje pa imate na voljo neposredno pred plažo. Ta lokacija je ločena na tri dele. Na sredini imate klub na plaži, na obeh straneh pa dve prodnati plaži, eno dalj&scaron;o in eno manj&scaron;o. Na plaži je &scaron;irina 10 metrov. Vstop v vodo je tukaj zelo lep in plavanje se začne pri približno 30 do 40 metrih. Ko ste v vodi, imate na dnu tudi nekaj peska. Nekaj infrastrukture je na plaži sami, več pa je v samem beach klubu. Bar na plaži in restavracijo se nahaja v samem klubu. Nastanitev tu ni na voljo, najbližja je v vasi Lu&scaron;tica, ki je oddaljena približno 1 km.', 3788, 'sl', 1),
(1226, 'U blizini sela Mardari, u crnogorskom regionu Herceg Novog, nalazi se 200 metara duga &scaron;ljunčana plaža s luksuznim plažnim klubom, direktno na samoj plaži. Ako ste vi koji volite malu &scaron;ljunčanu plažu, a također volite imati na raspolaganju puno kvalitetnih usluga na plaži, ova plaža je prava za vas. Do njega se lako može doći bilo kojim vozilom, a parking je dostupan direktno ispred plaže. Ova je lokacija podijeljena na tri dijela. U sredini imate klub na plaži, a s obje strane dvije &scaron;ljunčane plaže, jedna duža i jedna manja. Plaža je &scaron;iroka 10 metara. Ulaz u vodu ovdje je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje na otprilike 30 do 40 metara. Kad ste u vodi, na dnu imate i malo pijeska. Neka infrastruktura je na samoj plaži, ali vi&scaron;e u samom beach klubu. Bar na plaži i restoran nalaze se u klubu. Smje&scaron;taj nije dostupan ovdje, najbliže je u selu Lu&scaron;tica koje je udaljeno oko 1 km.', 3788, 'hr', 1),
(1227, 'Se hai intenzione di visitare il Montenegro, la citt&agrave; di Kotor, che si trova nella famosa baia di Kotor, dovrebbe essere nella tua lista. L&#39;intera baia &egrave; davvero unica e offre viste spettacolari, in particolare le grandi navi da crociera sembrano spettacolari nella piccola baia, circondata dalle alte montagne, ma puoi anche visitare il famoso centro storico di Kotor e dopo, ovviamente, goditi anche un po &#39;di tempo sulla spiaggia della citt&agrave;. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si dispone di un ampio parcheggio a pagamento, direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia e vicino alle attrazioni. La spiaggia &egrave; fatta di diversi materiali, in parte hai ciottoli, in alcuni hai cemento. Complessivamente &egrave; lungo 300 metri e largo fino a 15 metri. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello, non importa dove ti trovi e puoi andare in acqua sulla spiaggia o puoi saltare da un molo. Una piscina sul mare &egrave; disponibile anche sulla spiaggia. Il punto di nuoto inizia immediatamente. Hai alcune infrastrutture e servizi sulla spiaggia disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. &Egrave; anche possibile noleggiare alcune attrezzature per sport acquatici. Un ristorante e bar sulla spiaggia si trovano anche qui. Per il tuo alloggio hai qui principalmente hotel e appartamenti nelle vicinanze.', 3789, 'it', 1),
(1228, 'Si vous avez l&#39;intention de visiter le Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro, la ville de Kotor, situ&eacute;e dans la c&eacute;l&egrave;bre baie de Kotor, devrait &ecirc;tre sur votre liste. Toute la baie est tr&egrave;s unique et vous offre des vues spectaculaires, en particulier les grands navires de croisi&egrave;re ont un aspect spectaculaire dans la petite baie, entour&eacute;e par les hautes montagnes, mais vous pouvez &eacute;galement visiter la c&eacute;l&egrave;bre vieille ville de Kotor et apr&egrave;s cela, bien s&ucirc;r, profitez &eacute;galement de certains temps sur la plage de la ville. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez d&#39;un grand parking payant, juste en face de la plage et &agrave; proximit&eacute; des attractions. La plage est constitu&eacute;e de plusieurs mat&eacute;riaux, sur une partie vous avez des cailloux, sur certains vous avez du b&eacute;ton. Au total, il mesure 300 m&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 15 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able, peu importe o&ugrave; vous &ecirc;tes et vous pouvez soit aller dans l&#39;eau pr&egrave;s de la plage, soit sauter d&#39;une jet&eacute;e. Une piscine de mer est &eacute;galement disponible sur la plage. Le point de nage commence imm&eacute;diatement. Vous avez des infrastructures et des services de plage disponibles directement sur la plage. Il est &eacute;galement possible de louer du mat&eacute;riel de sports nautiques. Un restaurant et des bars de plage se trouvent &eacute;galement ici. Pour votre h&eacute;bergement, vous avez ici principalement des h&ocirc;tels et des appartements &agrave; proximit&eacute;.', 3789, 'fr', 1),
(1229, 'Si tiene la intenci&oacute;n de visitar Montenegro, la ciudad de Kotor, que se encuentra en la famosa bah&iacute;a de Kotor, deber&iacute;a estar en su lista. Toda la bah&iacute;a es muy &uacute;nica y le ofrece vistas espectaculares, especialmente los grandes cruceros se ven espectaculares en la peque&ntilde;a bah&iacute;a, rodeada de altas monta&ntilde;as, pero tambi&eacute;n puede visitar el famoso casco antiguo de Kotor y, despu&eacute;s, disfrutar de algunos tiempo en la playa de la ciudad. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es muy f&aacute;cil de alcanzar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tiene un amplio estacionamiento, que se paga, directamente en frente de la playa y cerca de las atracciones. La playa est&aacute; hecha de varios materiales, en alguna parte tienes guijarros, en algunos tienes concreto. En total, tiene 300 metros de largo y hasta 15 metros de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable, no importa d&oacute;nde se encuentre y puede ir al agua por la playa o puede saltar desde un muelle. Una piscina de mar tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible en la playa. El punto de nataci&oacute;n comienza de inmediato. Tiene infraestructura y servicios de playa disponibles directamente en la playa. Tambi&eacute;n es posible alquilar algunos equipos para deportes acu&aacute;ticos. Un restaurante y bares de playa tambi&eacute;n se encuentran aqu&iacute;. Para su alojamiento tiene aqu&iacute; principalmente hoteles y apartamentos cercanos.', 3789, 'es', 1),
(1230, 'Wenn Sie Montenegro besuchen m&ouml;chten, sollte die Stadt Kotor, die sich in der ber&uuml;hmten Bucht von Kotor befindet, auf Ihrer Liste stehen. Die ganze Bucht ist sehr einzigartig und bietet Ihnen spektakul&auml;re Ausblicke, besonders die gro&szlig;en Kreuzfahrtschiffe sehen in der kleinen Bucht, umgeben von hohen Bergen, spektakul&auml;r aus, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen auch die ber&uuml;hmte Altstadt von Kotor besuchen und danach nat&uuml;rlich auch einige Zeit am Stadtstrand genie&szlig;en. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, der kostenpflichtig ist, direkt vor dem Strand und in der N&auml;he der Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten. Der Strand besteht aus mehreren Materialien, zum Teil haben Sie Kieselsteine, zum Teil Beton. Insgesamt ist es 300 Meter lang und bis zu 15 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n, egal wo Sie sind und Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder am Strand ins Wasser gehen oder von einem Pier springen. Ein Strandpool ist auch am Strand vorhanden. Der Schwimmpunkt beginnt sofort. Sie haben einige Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen direkt am Strand. Es ist auch m&ouml;glich, Wassersportausr&uuml;stung zu mieten. Ein Restaurant und Strandbars befinden sich ebenfalls hier. F&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft haben Sie hier haupts&auml;chlich Hotels und Apartments in der N&auml;he.', 3789, 'de', 1),
(1231, 'Če nameravate obiskati Črno goro, bi moralo biti na va&scaron;em seznamu mesto Kotor, ki leži v znamenitem kotorskem zalivu. Celoten zaliv je zelo edinstven in vam ponuja&nbsp; spektakularen razgled, &scaron;e posebej velike križarke izgledajo spektakularno v majhnem zalivu, obkroženem z visokimi gorami, lahko pa obi&scaron;čete tudi znamenito starodavno mesto Kotor in po tem seveda uživate tudi nekaj čas na mestni plaži. Do te lokacije je zelo enostavno priti s kakr&scaron;nim koli vozilom in na voljo imate veliko parkiri&scaron;če, to je plačljivo, neposredno pred plažo in v bližini zanimivosti. Plaža je zgrajena iz več materiala, na nekem delu imate kamenčke, na nekaterih je beton. Skupaj je dolga 300 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 15 metrov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep, ne glede na to kje si. V vodo se lahko ali iz plaže ali pa se skoči s pomola. Na plaži je na voljo tudi morski bazen. Točka plavanja se začne takoj. Na voljo imate nekaj plažne infrastrukture in storitev, ki so na voljo neposredno na plaži. Možno je najeti tudi nekaj opreme za vodne &scaron;porte. Tu se nahajajo tudi restavracija in bari na plaži. Za svojo nastanitev imate v bližini na razpolago predvsem hotele in apartmaje.', 3789, 'sl', 1),
(1232, 'Ako planirate posjetiti Crnu Goru, grad Kotor koji se nalazi u poznatoj kotorskoj uvali trebao bi se naći na va&scaron;oj listi. Čitava uvala je vrlo jedinstvena i pruža vam spektakularan pogled, posebno veliki brodovi za krstarenje izgledaju spektakularno u maloj uvali okruženoj visokim planinama, ali možete posjetiti i poznati drevni grad Kotor i nakon toga, naravno, uživati ​​neko vrijeme na gradskoj plaži. Do ove je lokacije vrlo lako doći bilo kojim vozilom, a na raspolaganju vam je veliko parkirali&scaron;te, naplaćuje se direktno, ispred plaže i u blizini atrakcija. Plaža je izgrađena od nekoliko materijala, u nekim dijelovima imate &scaron;ljunak, u nekima je beton. Ukupno je dugačak 300 metara i &scaron;irok do 15 metara. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep bez obzira gdje se nalazite. Možete skočiti u vodu s plaže ili skočiti s pristani&scaron;ta. Na plaži se nalazi i morski bazen. Točka plivanja počinje odmah. Na plaži imate dostupnu infrastrukturu i usluge na plaži. Moguće je unajmiti i neku opremu za sportove na vodi. Tu su i restoran i barovi na plaži. Za svoj smje&scaron;taj stojite na raspolaganju uglavnom hoteli i apartmani.', 3789, 'hr', 1),
(1233, 'En la famosa bah&iacute;a de Montenegro Kotor, que debe estar en su lista para visitar, es una visita obligada si le gustan las playas bonitas. Toda la bah&iacute;a es &uacute;nica y te ofrece vistas espectaculares. Lo mejor para explorarlo es en un bote, que lo llevar&aacute; a todos los lugares de inter&eacute;s tur&iacute;stico. Alrededor de la bah&iacute;a no tienes muchas playas, pero hay algunas que puedes visitar si est&aacute;s en esta regi&oacute;n. Uno de ellos se llama plaža Morinj. La playa es muy interesante, principalmente por las formas y formas que le ofrece para disfrutar. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es muy f&aacute;cil de alcanzar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tiene un amplio estacionamiento directamente en frente de la playa. La superficie principal de la playa son peque&ntilde;os guijarros, pero tambi&eacute;n hay mucha hierba y algunos &aacute;rboles. Tiene 200 metros de largo y hasta 25 metros de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de nataci&oacute;n comienza a unos 40 metros. Tiene infraestructura y servicios de playa disponibles directamente en la playa. Un restaurante y un bar en la playa tambi&eacute;n se encuentran aqu&iacute;. Para su alojamiento, aqu&iacute; tiene principalmente hoteles y apartamentos, que est&aacute;n cerca, disponibles y si desea quedarse en un campamento, tambi&eacute;n tiene esta opci&oacute;n.', 3790, 'es', 1),
(1234, 'Nella famosa baia di Kotor in Montenegro, che dovrebbe essere nella tua lista da visitare, &egrave; assolutamente da visitare se ti piacciono le belle spiagge. L&#39;intera baia &egrave; davvero unica e offre viste spettacolari. Il meglio per esplorarlo &egrave; in barca, che ti porter&agrave; a tutte le attrazioni turistiche qui intorno. Intorno alla baia non hai molte spiagge ma ce ne sono alcune che puoi visitare se ti trovi in ​​questa regione. Uno di questi si chiama plaža Morinj. La spiaggia &egrave; molto interessante, principalmente per le forme e le forme che ti offre di divertirti. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si dispone di un ampio parcheggio direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di piccoli ciottoli, ma hai anche molta erba e alcuni alberi. &Egrave; lungo 200 metri e largo fino a 25 metri. L&#39;ingresso &egrave; molto bello e il punto di nuoto inizia a circa 40 metri. Hai alcune infrastrutture e servizi sulla spiaggia disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. Qui si trovano anche un ristorante e un bar sulla spiaggia. Per il tuo alloggio hai qui principalmente hotel e appartamenti, che sono nelle vicinanze, disponibili e se desideri soggiornare in un campo, hai anche questa opzione.', 3790, 'it', 1),
(1235, 'Dans la c&eacute;l&egrave;bre baie du Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro Kotor, qui devrait &ecirc;tre sur votre liste &agrave; visiter, est une visite incontournable si vous aimez les belles plages. Toute la baie est unique et vous offre des vues spectaculaires. Le mieux pour l&#39;explorer est en bateau, qui vous am&egrave;nera &agrave; tous les sites touristiques ici autour. Autour de la baie, vous n&#39;avez pas beaucoup de plages mais il y en a que vous pouvez visiter si vous &ecirc;tes dans cette r&eacute;gion. L&#39;un d&#39;eux s&#39;appelle plaža Morinj. La plage est tr&egrave;s int&eacute;ressante, principalement en raison des formes et des formes qu&#39;elle vous offre. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez d&#39;une grande place de parking juste en face de la plage. La surface principale de la plage est constitu&eacute;e de petits cailloux, mais vous avez &eacute;galement beaucoup d&#39;herbe et quelques arbres. Il mesure 200 m&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 25 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de nage commence &agrave; environ 40 m&egrave;tres. Vous avez des infrastructures et des services de plage disponibles directement sur la plage. Un restaurant et un bar de plage se trouvent &eacute;galement ici. Pour votre h&eacute;bergement, vous avez ici principalement des h&ocirc;tels et des appartements, qui sont &agrave; proximit&eacute;, disponibles et si vous souhaitez rester dans un camp, vous avez &eacute;galement cette option.', 3790, 'fr', 1),
(1236, 'Die ber&uuml;hmten montenegrinischen Kotor Bucht sollte auf Ihrer Liste der Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten stehen, wenn Sie sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen. Die ganze Bucht ist sehr einzigartig und bietet Ihnen spektakul&auml;re Ausblicke. Am besten erkunden Sie es mit einem Boot, das Sie zu allen Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten hier in der Umgebung bringt. Rund um die Bucht gibt es nicht viele Str&auml;nde, aber es gibt einige, die Sie besuchen k&ouml;nnen, wenn Sie in dieser Region sind. Einer von ihnen hei&szlig;t Plaža Morinj. Der Strand ist sehr interessant, vor allem wegen der Formen und Gestalten, die er Ihnen bietet. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz direkt vor dem Strand. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes sind kleine Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben auch viel Gras und einige B&auml;ume. Es ist 200 Meter lang und bis zu 25 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt beginnt bei ca. 40 Metern. Sie haben einige Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen direkt am Strand verf&uuml;gbar. Ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar befinden sich ebenfalls hier. F&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft stehen hier haupts&auml;chlich Hotels und Apartments in der N&auml;he zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wenn Sie in einem Camp &uuml;bernachten m&ouml;chten, haben Sie auch diese Option.', 3790, 'de', 1),
(1237, 'Znani črnogorski kotorski zaliv bi moral biti na va&scaron;em seznamu znamenitosti, če imate radi čudovite plaže. Celoten zaliv je zelo edinstven in vam ponuja&nbsp; spektakularen razgled. Najbolj&scaron;i način raziskovanja tega prelepega zaliva je s čolnom, ki vas lahko popelje do prav vseh znamenitosti. Plaž okoli tega zaliva ni veliko, vendar jih je pa nekaj, ki jih lahko vseeno obi&scaron;čete, če ste na potepu v bližini in bi se želeli namočiti v morju. Ena od njih se imenuje Plaža Morinj. Plaža je zelo zanimiva, predvsem zaradi zavitih linij, ki se vijejo ob vodi. Ta kraj je zelo enostavno doseči s katerim koli vozilom. Pred plažo imate na voljo veliko parkiri&scaron;če. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže so majhni prodniki, imate pa tudi veliko trave in nekaj dreves, ki vam nudijo senco. Dolga je 200 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 25 metrov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep, točka plavanje pa se začne pri približno 40 metrih. Na voljo imate tudi nekaj plažne infrastrukture in različne tipe storitev. Tu sta tudi restavracija in bar na plaži. V bližini so vam na voljo predvsem hoteli in apartmaji. Če želite ostati v kampu, imate tudi to možnost.', 3790, 'sl', 1),
(1238, 'Čuveni crnogorski kotorski zaliv trebao bi se naći na va&scaron;oj listi atrakcija ako volite prekrasne plaže. Čitava uvala je vrlo jedinstvena i pruža vam spektakularan pogled. Najbolji način za istraživanje ove prekrasne uvale je brodom, koji vas može odvesti do svih znamenitosti. Oko ove uvale nema mnogo plaža, ali ima ih nekoliko koje ipak možete posjetiti ako &scaron;etate u blizini i želite se natopiti u moru. Jedna od njih zove se Morinj plaža. Plaža je vrlo zanimljiva, uglavnom zbog vijugavih linija koje vijugaju duž vode. Do ovog se mjesta vrlo lako doći bilo kojim vozilom. Ispred plaže se nalazi veliko parkirali&scaron;te. Glavni dio plaže su mali &scaron;ljunak, ali također imate puno trave i nekoliko stabala koja vam pružaju hladovinu. Dugačka je 200 metara i &scaron;iroka do 25 metara. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep, a točka plivanja počinje na oko 40 metara. Na raspolaganju vam je i neka infrastruktura na plaži i različite vrste usluga. Tu su i restoran i bar na plaži. Hoteli i apartmani dostupni su u blizini. Ako želite ostati u kampu, imate i ovu mogućnost.', 3790, 'hr', 1),
(1239, 'Se desideri godere delle migliori viste possibili sulle grandi navi da crociera oceaniche che passano nella baia di Kotor e desideri anche essere su una spiaggia molto speciale e attraente, allora la spiaggia Adriatica &egrave; quella che fa per te. Si trova nella regione del Montenegro Herceg Novi, vicino al villaggio di Jo&scaron;ice. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi parcheggiare accanto alla strada direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. Qui hai molti diversi tipi di superficie sulla spiaggia. La superficie principale &egrave; di ciottoli, ma hai anche della sabbia bianca e delle lastre di cemento. La lunghezza totale &egrave; di 100 metri e pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 50 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia tra 0 e 15 metri. Sulla spiaggia hai tutte le infrastrutture necessarie per darti un soggiorno confortevole. Un ristorante e un bar sulla spiaggia si trovano direttamente sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile nelle vicinanze della spiaggia sotto forma di appartamenti.', 3791, 'it', 1),
(1240, 'Si desea disfrutar de las mejores vistas posibles en grandes cruceros oce&aacute;nicos que pasan por la bah&iacute;a de Kotor, y tambi&eacute;n le gustar&iacute;a estar en una playa muy especial y atractiva, entonces la playa Adriatica es la adecuada para usted. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Montenegro Herceg Novi, cerca del pueblo Jo&scaron;ice. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a &eacute;l con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar junto a la carretera directamente en frente de la playa. Aqu&iacute; tienes muchos tipos diferentes de superficie en la playa. La superficie principal son guijarros, pero tambi&eacute;n tiene arena blanca y algunas placas de concreto. La longitud total es de 100 metros y puede tener hasta 50 metros de ancho. La entrada de agua es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza entre 0 y 15 metros. En la playa tiene toda la infraestructura de playa necesaria para brindarle una estad&iacute;a confortable. Un restaurante y un bar en la playa se encuentran directamente en la playa. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en las proximidades de la playa en forma de apartamentos.', 3791, 'es', 1),
(1241, 'Si vous souhaitez profiter des meilleures vues possibles sur les grands bateaux de croisi&egrave;re oc&eacute;aniques qui passent dans la baie de Kotor, et que vous souhaitez &eacute;galement &ecirc;tre sur une plage tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale et attrayante, la plage Adriatica est faite pour vous. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion du Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro Herceg Novi, pr&egrave;s du village Jo&scaron;ice. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de l&#39;atteindre avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route directement en face de la plage. Ici, vous avez de nombreux types de surfaces sur la plage. La surface principale est constitu&eacute;e de galets, mais vous avez &eacute;galement du sable blanc et des plaques de b&eacute;ton. La longueur totale est de 100 m&egrave;tres et sa largeur peut atteindre 50 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence entre 0 et 15 m&egrave;tres. Sur la plage, vous disposez de toutes les infrastructures de plage n&eacute;cessaires pour vous offrir un s&eacute;jour confortable. Un restaurant et un bar de plage sont situ&eacute;s directement sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la plage sous forme d&#39;appartements.', 3791, 'fr', 1),
(1242, 'Wenn Sie die bestm&ouml;gliche Aussicht auf gro&szlig;e Kreuzfahrtschiffe in der Bucht von Kotor genie&szlig;en m&ouml;chten und auch an einem ganz besonderen und attraktiven Strand sein m&ouml;chten, dann ist der Strand Adriatica genau das Richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Es befindet sich in der montenegrinischen Region Herceg Novi in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Jo&scaron;ice. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Hier haben Sie viele verschiedene Arten von Strandoberfl&auml;chen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che sind Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben auch etwas wei&szlig;en Sand und einige Betonplatten. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt 100 Meter und kann bis zu 50 Meter breit sein. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt zwischen 0 und 15 Metern. Am Strand verf&uuml;gen Sie &uuml;ber die gesamte Strandinfrastruktur, die Sie f&uuml;r einen komfortablen Aufenthalt ben&ouml;tigen. Ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar befinden sich direkt am Strand. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in der N&auml;he des Strandes in Form von Apartments.', 3791, 'de', 1),
(1243, 'Če želite uživati v najbolj&scaron;em možnem pogledu na velike križarke v Kotorskem zalivu, le nekaj metrov stran od plaže, in želite biti tudi na zelo posebni in privlačni plaži, potem je plaža Adriatica&nbsp; pravi kraj za vas. Nahaja se v črnogorski regiji Herceg Novi v bližini vasi Jo&scaron;ice. Do plaže se lahko pripeljete z različnimi tipi vozil, tudi avtodomi in parkirate tik pred plažo ob cesti. Na plaži imate veliko različnih vrst povr&scaron;in. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je prod, imate pa tudi nekaj belega peska in nekaj betonskih plo&scaron;č. Skupna dolžina je 100 metrov, &scaron;iroka je lahko do 50 metrov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne med 0 in 15 metrov. Na plaži imate vso potrebno infrastrukturo, ki jo potrebujete za udobno bivanje. Restavracija in bar na plaži se nahajata neposredno na plaži sami. Nastanitev je v bližini plaže v obliki apartmajev.', 3791, 'sl', 1),
(1244, 'Ako želite uživati ​​u najboljem mogućem pogledu na velike brodove za krstarenje u Kotorskom zaljevu, samo nekoliko metara od plaže, a želite biti i na vrlo posebnoj i atraktivnoj plaži, onda je plaža Adriatica pravo mjesto za vas. Nalazi se u crnogorskom području Herceg Novog, u blizini sela Jo&scaron;ice. Do plaže se mogu doći raznim vrstama vozila, uključujući i kućice za parkiranje, i parkirati se ispred plaže pored ceste. Na plaži imate mnogo različitih vrsta povr&scaron;ina. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je &scaron;ljunak, ali imate i bijeli pijesak i neke betonske ploče. Ukupna duljina je 100 metara, može biti &scaron;iroka i do 50 metara. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje između 0 i 15 metara. Na plaži imate svu potrebnu infrastrukturu koja vam je potrebna za ugodan boravak. Restoran i bar na plaži nalaze se direktno na samoj plaži. Smje&scaron;taj je u blizini plaže u obliku apartmana.', 3791, 'hr', 1),
(1245, 'La spiaggia Bijela si trova nella regione Herceg Novi sulla costa della baia di Kotor. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungere la spiaggia con un veicolo, ma &egrave; pi&ugrave; difficile trovare un parcheggio. Il modo pi&ugrave; consigliato per parcheggiare &egrave; su un terreno privato, la strada &egrave; molto stretta e hai poche opzioni per parcheggiare accanto alla strada. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di ciottoli, ma hai anche delle lastre di cemento. Complessivamente &egrave; lungo 200 metri e largo fino a 20 metri. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; molto piccola. Hai un ingresso d&#39;acqua molto bello e il punto di nuoto &egrave; tra 0 e 15 metri. Hai alcune infrastrutture di base per la spiaggia disponibili qui. Un ristorante si trova anche vicino alla spiaggia e per l&#39;alloggio hai appartamenti e alcuni hotel a tua disposizione.', 3792, 'it', 1),
(1246, 'La playa Bijela se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Herceg Novi en la costa de la bah&iacute;a de Kotor. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a la playa con un veh&iacute;culo, pero es m&aacute;s dif&iacute;cil encontrar un lugar para estacionar. La forma m&aacute;s recomendada para estacionar es en un terreno privado, el camino es muy estrecho y tiene muy pocas opciones para estacionar al lado del camino. La superficie principal de la playa es de guijarros, pero tambi&eacute;n tiene algunas placas de hormig&oacute;n. En total, tiene 200 metros de largo y hasta 20 metros de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es muy peque&ntilde;a. Tiene una entrada de agua muy agradable y el punto de nado est&aacute; entre 0 y 15 metros. Tienes alguna infraestructura b&aacute;sica de playa disponible aqu&iacute;. Tambi&eacute;n hay un restaurante cerca de la playa y para el alojamiento tiene apartamentos y algunos hoteles a su disposici&oacute;n.', 3792, 'es', 1),
(1247, 'La plage de Bijela est situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion de Herceg Novi sur le littoral de la baie de Kotor. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage avec un v&eacute;hicule, mais plus difficile de trouver une place de parking. Le moyen le plus recommand&eacute; de se garer est sur un terrain priv&eacute;, la route est tr&egrave;s &eacute;troite et vous avez tr&egrave;s peu d&#39;options pour vous garer &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route. La surface principale de la plage est constitu&eacute;e de galets, mais vous avez &eacute;galement des plaques de b&eacute;ton. Dans l&#39;ensemble, elle mesure 200 m&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 20 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est tr&egrave;s petite. Vous avez une tr&egrave;s belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et le point de nage se situe entre 0 et 15 m&egrave;tres. Vous disposez ici d&#39;une infrastructure basique de plage. Un restaurant est &eacute;galement situ&eacute; pr&egrave;s de la plage et pour l&#39;h&eacute;bergement, vous avez des appartements et quelques h&ocirc;tels &agrave; votre disposition.', 3792, 'fr', 1),
(1248, 'Der Strand Bijela befindet sich in der Region Herceg Novi an der K&uuml;ste der Bucht von Kotor. Es ist sehr einfach, mit einem Fahrzeug zum Strand zu gelangen, aber es ist schwieriger, einen Parkplatz zu finden. Die am meiste empfohlene Art zu parken ist auf einem privaten Grundst&uuml;ck, die Stra&szlig;e ist sehr eng und Sie haben nur sehr wenige M&ouml;glichkeiten, neben der Stra&szlig;e zu parken. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes besteht aus Kieselsteinen, aber Sie haben auch einige Betonplatten. Insgesamt ist der Strand 200 Meter lang und bis zu 20 Meter breit. Die Neigung des Strandes ist sehr gering. Sie haben einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt liegt zwischen 0 und 15 Metern. Hier steht Ihnen eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung. Ein Restaurant befindet sich ebenfalls in Strandn&auml;he. F&uuml;r die Unterbringung stehen Ihnen Apartments und einige Hotels zur Verf&uuml;gung.', 3792, 'de', 1),
(1249, 'Plaža Bijela se nahaja v regiji Herceg Novi na obali Kotorskega zaliva. Z vozilom se lahko pripeljete do plaže, težje pa je najti parkirno mesto. Najbolj priporočljiv način parkiranja je v zasebni lasti, ulica je zelo ozka, kar pomeni da imate zelo malo možnosti parkirati va&scaron;e vozilo ob ulici. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je sestavljena iz kamenčkov, imate pa tudi nekaj betonskih plo&scaron;č. Na splo&scaron;no je plaža dolga 200 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 20 metrov. Naklon plaže je zelo majhen. Dostop v vodo je zelo lep in plavati lahko začnete med 0 in 15 metri. Nekaj plažne infrastrukture se nahaja na plaži, ampak je zgolj osnovna. V bližini plaže je tudi restavracija. Za namestitev so vam v bližini na voljo apartmaji in nekateri hoteli.', 3792, 'sl', 1),
(1250, 'Plaža Bijela nalazi se u regiji Herceg Novi na obali Kotorskog zaljeva. Možete se voziti do plaže, ali teže je naći parkirno mjesto. Najvi&scaron;e se preporučuje način parkiranja u privatnom vlasni&scaron;tvu, ulica je vrlo uska, &scaron;to znači da imate vrlo malo mogućnosti parkiranja vozila uz ulicu. Glavnu povr&scaron;inu plaže čine &scaron;ljunak, ali imate i nekoliko betonskih ploča. Općenito, plaža je dugačka 200 metara i &scaron;iroka do 20 metara. Nagib plaže je vrlo mali. Pristup vodi je vrlo lijep i možete početi plivati ​​između 0 i 15 metara. Na plaži se nalazi neka infrastruktura na plaži, ali ona je samo osnovna. Tu je i restoran u blizini plaže. Apartmani i neki hoteli dostupni su za smje&scaron;taj u blizini.', 3792, 'hr', 1),
(1251, 'La maggior parte delle spiagge della baia di Kotar in Montenegro sono meno o pi&ugrave; artificiali, ma questa spiaggia, che si trova vicino al villaggio di Sasovići nella regione di Herceg Novi, &egrave; molto diversa ed &egrave; totalmente naturale. Raggiungerlo &egrave; molto semplice con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi parcheggiare a lato della strada, a pochi metri dalla spiaggia. Il percorso per la spiaggia &egrave; lungo 50 metri e ha un dislivello di 15 metri. Questa spiaggia &egrave; pi&ugrave; adatta al tipo di utente avventuriero. &Egrave; lungo 75 metri e largo solo 5 metri. La superficie principale &egrave; di piccoli ciottoli, ma hai anche alcune rocce e del cemento sulla superficie. Gli alberi risiedono anche sulla spiaggia. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; piacevole e il nuoto inizia a 5 metri. Non hai infrastrutture sulla spiaggia qui, anche senza ristoranti o bar sulla spiaggia, ma alcuni alloggi sono disponibili sotto forma di appartamenti e hotel nelle vicinanze.', 3793, 'it', 1),
(1252, 'La mayor&iacute;a de las playas de la bah&iacute;a de Montenegro Kotar son menos o m&aacute;s artificiales, pero esta playa, que se encuentra cerca del pueblo Sasovići en la regi&oacute;n Herceg Novi, es muy diferente y est&aacute; totalmente hecha por la naturaleza. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a &eacute;l con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar al lado de la carretera, a pocos metros de la playa. El camino a la playa tiene 50 metros de largo y tiene una diferencia de altura de 15 metros. Esta playa es m&aacute;s adecuada para el tipo de usuario aventurero. Tiene 75 metros de largo y solo 5 metros de ancho. La superficie principal son peque&ntilde;os guijarros, pero tambi&eacute;n tiene algunas rocas y algo de concreto en la superficie. Los &aacute;rboles tambi&eacute;n residen en la playa. La entrada de agua es agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza a 5 metros. Aqu&iacute; no tiene ninguna infraestructura de playa, tampoco hay restaurantes o bares de playa, pero algunos alojamientos est&aacute;n disponibles en forma de apartamentos y hoteles en los alrededores.', 3793, 'es', 1),
(1253, 'La plupart des plages de la baie de Kotar au Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro sont plus ou moins artificielles, mais cette plage, situ&eacute;e pr&egrave;s du village de Sasovići dans la r&eacute;gion de Herceg Novi, est tr&egrave;s diff&eacute;rente et enti&egrave;rement r&eacute;alis&eacute;e par la nature. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de s&#39;y rendre avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route, &agrave; quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage. Le chemin menant &agrave; la plage mesure 50 m&egrave;tres de long et a une diff&eacute;rence de hauteur de 15 m&egrave;tres. Cette plage est plus adapt&eacute;e au type d&#39;aventurier de l&#39;utilisateur. Il mesure 75 m&egrave;tres de long et seulement 5 m&egrave;tres de large. La surface principale est constitu&eacute;e de petits cailloux, mais vous avez &eacute;galement des roches et du b&eacute;ton &agrave; la surface. Les arbres r&eacute;sident &eacute;galement sur la plage. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence &agrave; 5 m&egrave;tres. Vous n&#39;avez pas d&#39;infrastructure de plage ici, pas de restaurants ni de bars de plage, mais certains h&eacute;bergements sont disponibles sous forme d&#39;appartements et d&#39;h&ocirc;tels &agrave; proximit&eacute;.', 3793, 'fr', 1),
(1254, 'Die meisten Str&auml;nde in der Bucht von Montenegro Kotar sind weniger oder mehr k&uuml;nstlich erschaffen, aber dieser Strand, der sich in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Sasovići in der Region Herceg Novi befindet, ist ganz anders und ganz von Natur selbst erschaffen. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug ihm zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen neben der Stra&szlig;e parken, nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt. Der Weg zum Strand ist 50 Meter lang und hat einen H&ouml;henunterschied von 15 Metern. Dieser Strand ist eher f&uuml;r Abenteurer geeignet. Es ist 75 Meter lang und nur 5 Meter breit. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che sind kleine Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben auch einige Steine und etwas Beton auf der Oberfl&auml;che. Am Strand leben auch B&auml;ume. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei 5 Metern. Sie haben hier keine Strandinfrastruktur, auch keine Restaurants oder Strandbars, aber einige Unterk&uuml;nfte sind in Form von Apartments und Hotels in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar.', 3793, 'de', 1),
(1255, 'Večina plaž v črnogorskem zalivu Kotar je manj ali bolj umetnih, vendar je ta plaža, ki se nahaja v bližini vasi Sasovići v regiji Herceg Novi, zelo različna in je povsem naravno narejena. Do plaže se da zelo enostavno priti s katerim koli vozilom in parkirate lahko ob cesti, le nekaj metrov stran od plaže. Pot do plaže je dolga 50 metrov in ima vi&scaron;insko razliko 15 metrov. Ta plaža je bolj primerna za avanturističnega tipa uporabnika. Dolga je 75 metrov in &scaron;iroka le 5 metrov. Glavna povr&scaron;ina so majhni prodniki, na povr&scaron;ini pa imate tudi nekaj skal in nekaj betona. Na plaži prebivajo tudi drevesa. Vstop v vodo je lep, kopanje pa se začne pri 5 metrih. Tu nimate nobene plažne infrastrukture, prav tako ni restavracij ali barov na plaži, vendar pa imate v bližini na voljo nekaj nastanitev v obliki apartmajev in hotelov.', 3793, 'sl', 1),
(1256, 'Većina plaža u crnogorskom Kotarskom zaljevu je manje ili vi&scaron;e umjetna, ali ova plaža koja se nalazi u blizini sela Sasovići u regiji Herceg Novog, vrlo je različita i napravljena je potpuno prirodno. Do plaže se može lako doći bilo kojim vozilom, a možete se parkirati uz cestu, samo nekoliko metara od plaže. Put do plaže dugačak je 50 metara i ima visinsku razliku od 15 metara. Ova je plaža pogodnija za avanturističkog tipa korisnika. Duga je 75 metara i &scaron;iroka je samo 5 metara. Glavna povr&scaron;ina su mali &scaron;ljunak, a na povr&scaron;ini imate i ne&scaron;to stijena i ne&scaron;to betona. Na plaži ima i drveća. Ulaz u vodu je lijep i kupanje počinje na 5 metara. Ovdje nemate plažnu infrastrukturu, niti postoje restorani ili barovi na plaži, ali imate smje&scaron;taj u obliku apartmana i hotela u blizini.', 3793, 'hr', 1),
(1257, 'Nella piccola citt&agrave; di Meljine, che si trova nella regione del Montenegro Herceg Novi, c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia con lo stesso nome della citt&agrave; e la spiaggia &egrave; adatta alle famiglie. Indipendentemente dal tipo di veicolo che stai guidando, troverai molte opzioni per parcheggiarlo vicino alla spiaggia. Sulla spiaggia, ci sono alcune superfici diverse, come la sabbia marrone e qualche lastra di cemento. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 200 metri e pu&ograve; essere larga 10 metri. La pendenza ha una piccola inclinazione qui e puoi saltare dal molo in acqua o usare la spiaggia e iniziare a nuotare dopo circa 10 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e hai delle piccole pietre sul fondo. Alcune infrastrutture della spiaggia sono disponibili anche qui e nelle vicinanze si trova anche un porto turistico. Se hai fame o sete hai un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante direttamente sulla spiaggia stessa. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile qui sotto forma di appartamenti e hotel ed &egrave; a pochi metri di distanza.', 3794, 'it', 1),
(1258, 'En la peque&ntilde;a ciudad de Meljine, que se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Montenegro Herceg Novi, hay una playa con el mismo nombre que la ciudad, y la playa es adecuada para familias. No importa qu&eacute; tipo de veh&iacute;culo conduzca, encontrar&aacute; muchas opciones para estacionarlo cerca de la playa. En la playa, hay algunas superficies diferentes, como la arena marr&oacute;n y algunas placas de hormig&oacute;n. La longitud total de la playa es de 200 metros y puede tener 10 metros de ancho. La pendiente tiene una peque&ntilde;a inclinaci&oacute;n aqu&iacute; y puedes saltar desde el muelle al agua o usar la playa y comenzar a nadar despu&eacute;s de unos 10 metros. La entrada de agua es muy agradable y tienes peque&ntilde;as piedras en el fondo. Parte de la infraestructura de la playa tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute; y cerca tambi&eacute;n hay un puerto deportivo. Si tiene hambre o sed, tiene un bar en la playa y un restaurante directamente en la playa. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en forma de apartamentos y hoteles y est&aacute; a solo unos metros de distancia.', 3794, 'es', 1),
(1259, 'Dans la petite ville de Meljine, situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion du Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro Herceg Novi, il y a une plage du m&ecirc;me nom que la ville, et la plage est adapt&eacute;e aux familles. Peu importe le type de v&eacute;hicule que vous conduisez, vous trouverez de nombreuses options pour le garer pr&egrave;s de la plage. Sur la plage, il y a quelques surfaces diff&eacute;rentes, comme le sable brun et une plaque de b&eacute;ton. La longueur totale de la plage est de 200 m&egrave;tres et elle peut &ecirc;tre large de 10 m&egrave;tres. La pente a une petite inclinaison ici et vous pouvez soit sauter de la jet&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau, soit utiliser la plage et commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s environ 10 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et vous avez de petites pierres sur le fond. Certaines infrastructures de plage sont &eacute;galement disponibles ici et &agrave; proximit&eacute; se trouve &eacute;galement une marina / port. Si vous avez faim ou soif, vous avez un bar de plage et un restaurant directement sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est ici disponible sous forme d&#39;appartements et d&#39;h&ocirc;tels et il est &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres.', 3794, 'fr', 1),
(1260, 'In der kleinen Stadt Meljine in der montenegrinischen Region Herceg Novi gibt es einen Strand mit dem gleichen Namen wie die Stadt, und der Strand ist f&uuml;r Familien geeignet. Egal welche Art von Fahrzeug Sie fahren, Sie finden viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, es in Strandn&auml;he zu parken. Am Strand gibt es einige verschiedene Oberfl&auml;chen, wie den braunen Sand und eine Betonplatte. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 200 Meter und es kann 10 Meter breit sein. Der Hang hat hier eine geringe Neigung und Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder vom Pier ins Wasser springen oder den Strand benutzen und nach etwa 10 Metern mit dem Schwimmen zu beginnen. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und Sie haben kleine Steine am Boden. Hier gibt es auch einige Strandinfrastrukturen und in der N&auml;he befindet sich auch ein Yachthafen / Hafen. Wenn Sie hungrig oder durstig werden, haben Sie eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant direkt am Strand. Die Unterbringung erfolgt hier in Form von Apartments und Hotels und ist nur wenige Meter entfernt.', 3794, 'de', 1),
(1261, 'V majhnem mestecu Meljine, ki leži v črnogorski regiji Herceg Novi, se nahaja plaža z istim imenom kot mesto, plaža pa je primerna za družine. Ne glede na to, s kak&scaron;nim vozilom se boste pripeljali sem, boste na&scaron;li veliko možnosti, da ga parkirate v bližini plaže. Na plaži je nekaj različnih povr&scaron;in, na primer rjav pesek in nekaj betonskih plo&scaron;č. Skupna dolžina plaže je 200 metrov, &scaron;iroka pa je lahko 10 metrov. Pobočje ima tukaj majhen naklon in v vodo lahko skočite s pomola ali uporabite plažo in začnete plavati po približno 10 metrih. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in na dnu imate majhne kamne. Tu je na voljo tudi nekaj plažne infrastrukture, v bližini pa je tudi marina / pristani&scaron;če. Če ste lačni ali žejni, imate bar na plaži in restavracijo neposredno na sami plaži. Nastanitev je tukaj na voljo v obliki apartmajev in hotelov in je le nekaj metrov stran.', 3794, 'sl', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1262, 'U malom gradu Meljine, smje&scaron;tenom u crnogorskom regionu Herceg Novog, nalazi se plaža s istim imenom kao i grad, a plaža je pogodna za obitelji. Bez obzira kakvim se vozilom ovdje vozite, pronaći ćete mnogo opcija za parkiranje u blizini plaže. Na plaži postoje neke različite povr&scaron;ine, poput smeđeg pijeska i nekih betonskih ploča. Ukupna duljina plaže je 200 metara, a može biti &scaron;iroka 10 metara. Nagib ovdje ima malu padinu i možete skočiti u vodu s pristani&scaron;ta ili koristiti plažu i početi plivati ​​nakon otprilike 10 metara. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i na dnu imate sitno kamenje. Ovdje se nalazi i neka infrastruktura za plažu, a u blizini je i marina / luka. Ako ste gladni ili žedni, na plaži imate bar na plaži i restoran. Ovdje je smje&scaron;taj dostupan u obliku apartmana i hotela, a udaljen je samo nekoliko metara.', 3794, 'hr', 1),
(1263, 'La spiaggia dell&#39;igalo &egrave; una vera e propria spiaggia cittadina, con molte infrastrutture e servizi in tutta la spiaggia. &Egrave; famoso per essere l&#39;ex residenza del leader jugoslavo Tito, dove si trova anche una villa dell&#39;ex presidente. La spiaggia appartiene alla regione di Herceg Novi ed &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. &Egrave; possibile parcheggiare in un ampio parcheggio a pagamento quasi direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; fatta artificialmente e ha molte forme e linee da mostrare. La superficie principale qui &egrave; di cemento. La spiaggia &egrave; completamente pianeggiante, ma al punto di entrata dell&#39;acqua c&#39;&egrave; un improvviso calo. Quindi puoi usare il ledder dell&#39;acqua o semplicemente saltare in acqua. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 500 metri ed &egrave; larga fino a 20 metri. La spiaggia &egrave; divisa in alcune parti. Hai un sacco di infrastrutture e servizi per la spiaggia disponibili qui. Molti bar sulla spiaggia e ristoranti, nonch&eacute; negozi sono presenti sulla spiaggia o vicino alla spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile qui sotto forma di hotel e appartamenti e si trova nelle vicinanze.', 3795, 'it', 1),
(1264, 'La playa en la ciudad igalo es una verdadera playa de la ciudad, con mucha infraestructura de playa y servicios alrededor de la playa. Es famoso por ser la antigua residencia del l&iacute;der yugoslavo Tito, donde tambi&eacute;n se encuentra una villa del ex presidente. La playa pertenece a la regi&oacute;n Herceg Novi y es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. Puede estacionar en un amplio estacionamiento de pago casi directamente frente a la playa. La playa est&aacute; hecha artificialmente y tiene muchas formas y l&iacute;neas para mostrar. La superficie principal aqu&iacute; es de hormig&oacute;n. La playa es totalmente plana, pero en el punto de entrada del agua hay una ca&iacute;da repentina. Entonces puede usar el ledder de agua o simplemente saltar al agua. La longitud total de la playa es de 500 metros y tiene hasta 20 metros de ancho. La playa est&aacute; separada en unas pocas partes. Tienes mucha infraestructura de playa y servicios disponibles aqu&iacute;. Muchos bares y restaurantes de playa, as&iacute; como tiendas est&aacute;n presentes en la playa o cerca de la playa. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute; en forma de hoteles y apartamentos y est&aacute; cerca.', 3795, 'es', 1),
(1265, 'La plage de la ville d&#39;igalo est une v&eacute;ritable plage de la ville, avec beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures et de services de plage tout autour de la plage. Il est c&eacute;l&egrave;bre pour &ecirc;tre l&#39;ancienne r&eacute;sidence du dirigeant yougoslave Tito, o&ugrave; se trouve &eacute;galement une villa de l&#39;ancien pr&eacute;sident. La plage appartient &agrave; la r&eacute;gion de Herceg Novi et elle est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. Vous pouvez vous garer sur un grand parking payant presque directement en face de la plage. La plage est artificielle et a beaucoup de formes et de lignes &agrave; montrer. La surface principale ici est en b&eacute;ton. La plage est totalement plate, mais au point d&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau, il y a une chute soudaine. Vous pouvez donc soit utiliser la conduite d&#39;eau ou simplement sauter dans l&#39;eau. La longueur totale de la plage est de 500 m&egrave;tres et elle peut atteindre 20 m&egrave;tres de large. La plage est s&eacute;par&eacute;e en quelques parties. Vous avez beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures et de services de plage disponibles ici. De nombreux bars et restaurants de plage, ainsi que des magasins sont pr&eacute;sents sur la plage ou pr&egrave;s de la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible ici sous forme d&#39;h&ocirc;tels et d&#39;appartements et se trouve &agrave; proximit&eacute;.', 3795, 'fr', 1),
(1266, 'Der Strand in der Stadt Igalo ist ein wahrer Stadtstrand mit vielen Strandinfrastrukturen und Dienstleistungen rund um den Strand. Die Stadt ist ber&uuml;hmt als ehemalige Residenz des jugoslawischen F&uuml;hrers Tito, in der sich auch eine Villa des Ex-Pr&auml;sidenten befindet. Der Strand geh&ouml;rt zur Region Herceg Novi und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem gro&szlig;en kostenpflichtigen Parkplatz fast direkt vor dem Strand parken. Der Strand ist k&uuml;nstlich angelegt und hat viele Formen und Linien zu zeigen. Die Hauptfl&auml;che hier ist Beton. Der Strand ist total flach, aber am Wassereintrittspunkt gibt es einen pl&ouml;tzlichen Abfall. Sie k&ouml;nnen also entweder die Wasserleiste verwenden oder einfach ins Wasser springen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 500 Meter und ist bis zu 20 Meter breit. Der Strand ist in einige Teile unterteilt. Sie haben viele Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen hier zur Verf&uuml;gung. Viele Strandbars und Restaurants sowie Gesch&auml;fte befinden sich am Strand oder in Strandn&auml;he. Die Unterkunft ist hier in Form von Hotels und Apartments verf&uuml;gbar und befindet sich in der N&auml;he.', 3795, 'de', 1),
(1267, 'Plaža v mestu igalo je prava mestna plaža, z veliko plažne infrastrukture in različnih storitev po vsej plaži. Znana je po tem, da je bila nekdanja rezidenca jugoslovanskega voditelja Tita, kjer se nahaja tudi vila biv&scaron;ega predsednika. Plaža spada v regijo Herceg Novi in do nje se lahko pripeljete s kakr&scaron;nim koli vozilom. Parkirate lahko na velikem plačljivem parkiri&scaron;ču skoraj neposredno pred plažo. Plaža je umetno narejena in ima veliko zanimivih oblik in linij. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je beton. Plaža je popolnoma ravna, a na mestu vstopa v vodo vas pričakuje nenaden padec. Za vstop v vodo lahko uporabite vodne stopnice ali preprosto skočite v vodo. Skupna dolžina plaže je 500 metrov, &scaron;iroka pa je do 20 metrov. Plaža je ločena na nekaj delov. Tu imate na voljo veliko plažne infrastrukture in storitev na plaži. Na plaži ali v bližini plaže je veliko barov in restavracij. Nastanitev se prav tako nahaja v bližini in vam je na voljo v obliki hotelov in apartmajev.', 3795, 'sl', 1),
(1268, 'Plaža u gradu Igalo prava je gradska plaža, s puno plaže i razne usluge na cijeloj plaži. Poznato je po biv&scaron;oj rezidenciji jugoslavenskog lidera Tita, u kojoj je također smje&scaron;tena vila biv&scaron;eg predsjednika. Plaža pripada regiji Herceg Novog i do nje se može doći bilo kojim vozilom. Na velikom plaćenom parkirali&scaron;tu možete parkirati gotovo direktno ispred plaže. Plaža je umjetno napravljena i ima mnogo zanimljivih oblika i linija. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je beton. Plaža je savr&scaron;eno ravna, ali iznenadni pad očekuje vas na ulazu u vodu. Možete koristiti vodene stepenice ili jednostavno skočiti u vodu da uđete u vodu. Ukupna dužina plaže je 500 metara, a &scaron;iroka je do 20 metara. Plaža je podijeljena na nekoliko dijelova. Tu je na raspolaganju mno&scaron;tvo plaže i usluga na plaži. Na plaži ili u blizini plaže ima mnogo barova i restorana. Smje&scaron;taj se također nalazi u blizini i dostupan vam je u obliku hotela i apartmana.', 3795, 'hr', 1),
(1269, 'Nella regione albanese Fier non ci sono molte spiagge, ma quelle che esistono ti toglieranno il respiro. Questo si trova vicino al villaggio Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re e si chiama Plazhi Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re. &Egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa molto lunga che &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga pi&ugrave; di 100 metri. Hai davvero molto spazio qui. Tutta la spiaggia &egrave; quasi pianeggiante, cos&igrave; come le acque poco profonde. Ci vuole davvero molto tempo prima di raggiungere il punto di nuoto, probabilmente pi&ugrave; di 100 metri. Ma l&#39;acqua poco profonda &egrave; eccellente per far giocare i bambini piccoli in sicurezza. Questo posto &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con il tuo veicolo e puoi parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia stessa. Se hai fame o sete hai molti ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia direttamente disponibili. La sistemazione non &egrave; disponibile sulla spiaggia ed &egrave; probabilmente a pi&ugrave; chilometri nell&#39;entroterra. Questo posto a causa dell&#39;acqua piatta e dei forti venti &egrave; anche molto popolare tra i kiteboarder.', 3723, 'it', 1),
(1270, 'Dans la r&eacute;gion albanaise de Fier, il n&#39;y a pas beaucoup de plages, mais celles qui existent vous couperont le souffle. Celui-ci est situ&eacute; pr&egrave;s du village Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re et s&#39;appelle Plazhi Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re. C&#39;est une tr&egrave;s longue plage de sable qui fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et plus de 100 m&egrave;tres de large. Vous avez vraiment beaucoup d&#39;espace ici. Toute la plage est presque plate, tout comme les eaux peu profondes. Il faut vraiment beaucoup de temps avant d&#39;atteindre le point de nage, probablement plus de 100 m&egrave;tres. Mais l&#39;eau peu profonde est excellente pour que les petits enfants y jouent en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;. Cet endroit est facilement accessible avec votre v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer directement sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me. Si vous avez faim ou soif, vous disposez de nombreux restaurants et bars de plage directement sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas disponible sur la plage et se trouve probablement &agrave; plus de kilom&egrave;tres &agrave; l&#39;int&eacute;rieur des terres. Cet endroit &agrave; cause de l&#39;eau plate et des vents forts est &eacute;galement tr&egrave;s populaire parmi les kitesurfeurs.', 3723, 'fr', 1),
(1271, 'En la regi&oacute;n albanesa de Fier no hay muchas playas, pero las que existen te dejar&aacute;n sin aliento. Este se encuentra cerca del pueblo Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re y se llama Plazhi Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re. Es una playa de arena muy larga que tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y m&aacute;s de 100 metros de ancho. Realmente tienes mucho espacio aqu&iacute;. Toda la playa es casi plana y tambi&eacute;n las aguas poco profundas. Realmente lleva mucho tiempo antes de llegar al punto de nataci&oacute;n, probablemente m&aacute;s de 100 metros. Pero el agua poco profunda es excelente para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen con seguridad en ella. Es f&aacute;cil llegar a este lugar con su veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar directamente en la playa. Si tiene hambre o sed, tiene muchos restaurantes y bares de playa disponibles directamente en la playa. El alojamiento no est&aacute; disponible en la playa y probablemente est&eacute; a m&aacute;s kil&oacute;metros de distancia hacia el interior. Este lugar debido al agua plana y los fuertes vientos tambi&eacute;n es muy popular entre los kiteboarders.', 3723, 'es', 1),
(1272, 'In der albanischen Region Fier gibt es nicht viele Str&auml;nde, aber diejenigen, die existieren, werden Ihnen den Atem rauben. Dieser befindet sich in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re und hei&szlig;t Plazhi Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re. Es ist ein sehr langer Sandstrand, der mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit ist. Sie haben hier wirklich viel Platz. Der ganze Strand ist fast flach, ebenso das flache Wasser. Es dauert sehr lange, bis Sie den Schwimmpunkt erreichen, wahrscheinlich mehr als 100 Meter. Aber das flache Wasser eignet sich hervorragend f&uuml;r kleine Kinder, um sicher darin zu spielen. Dieser Ort ist mit Ihrem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand selbst parken. Wenn Sie hungrig oder durstig werden, stehen Ihnen viele Restaurants und Strandbars direkt am Strand zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Unterkunft ist am Strand nicht verf&uuml;gbar und liegt wahrscheinlich mehr Kilometer im Landesinneren. Dieser Ort ist wegen des flachen Wassers und der starken Winde auch bei Kiteboardern sehr beliebt.', 3723, 'de', 1),
(1273, 'V albanski regiji Fier ni veliko plaž, toda tiste, ki obstajajo, vam bodo vzele sapo. Ta se nahaja v bližini vasi Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re in se imenuje Plazhi Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re. Gre za zelo dolgo pe&scaron;čeno plažo, ki je dolga nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka več kot 100 metrov. Tu imate res veliko prostora. Celotna plaža je skoraj ravna in tako je tudi z morjem, ki je zelo plitvo. Resnično traja veliko časa, preden pridete do točke plavanja, verjetno več kot 100 metrov. Plitva voda je tudi odlična za majhne otroke, da se v njej varno igrajo. Ta kraj je enostavno dosegljiv z vozilom in parkirate lahko neposredno na sami plaži, dobesedno. Če ste lačni ali žejni, imate na plaži sami voljo veliko restavracij in barov na plaži. Namestitev na plaži ni na voljo in je verjetno oddaljena več kilometrov v notranjost. Ta kraj je zaradi ravne vode in močnega vetra zelo priljubljen tudi med kiteboarderji.', 3723, 'sl', 1),
(1274, 'U albanskoj regiji Fier nema mnogo plaža, ali one koje postoje postoje oduzet će vam dah. To se nalazi u blizini sela Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re i naziva se Plazhi Dar&euml;zez&euml; e Re. To je vrlo duga pje&scaron;čana plaža, duga nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka vi&scaron;e od 100 metara. Ovdje stvarno imate puno prostora. Cijela je plaža gotovo ravna i isto toliko i more koje je vrlo plitko. Zaista treba puno vremena prije nego &scaron;to dođete do mjesta plivanja, vjerojatno preko 100 metara. Plitka voda je izvrsna i za malu djecu koja se mogu sigurno igrati. Ovo je mjesto lako dostupno automobilom, a možete parkirati izravno na samoj plaži, doslovno. Ako ste gladni ili žedni, na plaži imate dosta restorana i barova. Smje&scaron;taj na plaži nije dostupan i vjerojatno je nekoliko kilometara u unutra&scaron;njosti. Zbog ravne vode i jakog vjetra, ovo je mjesto također vrlo popularno među kiteboarderima.', 3723, 'hr', 1),
(1275, 'Benvenuti in spiaggia Divjak&euml;s. La regione albanese Fier ha una costa molto speciale che consiste principalmente di spiagge sabbiose molto lunghe. Vicino alla cittadina Divjak&euml; hai una spiaggia del genere, chiamata Plazhi Divjak&euml;s. Non &egrave; famoso solo per la spiaggia, ma anche per la bellissima area naturale protetta, con molti uccelli, in particolare pellicani e fenicotteri. &Egrave; facile raggiungerlo con tutti i tipi di veicoli, anche i camper e puoi parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia stessa. Dal punto in cui hai la maggiore concentrazione di alloggi al punto in cui effettivamente vieni in spiaggia, devi guidare su strade sabbiose, &egrave; sicuro, perch&eacute; sono molto stabili, soprattutto quando sono asciutte, non tanto dopo pioggia. La stessa spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga pi&ugrave; di 100 metri. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; molto bassa, &egrave; quasi piatta e cos&igrave; &egrave; l&#39;acqua dove &egrave; necessario camminare per 100 metri per raggiungere il punto di nuotata. Questo rende questa spiaggia, tranne per il fatto che sulla spiaggia stessa c&#39;&egrave; una piccola infrastruttura da spiaggia, perfetta per far giocare i bambini in sicurezza in acqua. Sulla stessa spiaggia non c&#39;&egrave; quasi nessuna infrastruttura, ma di pi&ugrave; &egrave; intorno ai ristoranti e agli alloggi, che si trovano anche sulla spiaggia. Hai molti tipi di alloggi tra cui scegliere. Ecco un hotel, un resort e alcuni appartamenti.', 3724, 'it', 1),
(1276, 'Bienvenue sur la plage de Divjak&euml;s. La r&eacute;gion albanaise de Fier poss&egrave;de un littoral tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;cial compos&eacute; principalement de tr&egrave;s longues plages de sable. Pr&egrave;s de la petite ville de Divjak&euml;, vous avez une telle plage, appel&eacute;e Plazhi Divjak&euml;s. Il n&#39;est pas seulement c&eacute;l&egrave;bre &agrave; cause de la plage, mais aussi &agrave; cause de la magnifique zone naturelle prot&eacute;g&eacute;e, avec beaucoup d&#39;oiseaux, en particulier les p&eacute;licans et les flamants roses. Il est facile de l&#39;atteindre avec toutes sortes de v&eacute;hicules, m&ecirc;me des camping-cars et vous pouvez vous garer directement sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me. Du point o&ugrave; vous avez la plus grande concentration d&#39;h&eacute;bergement au point o&ugrave; vous venez r&eacute;ellement &agrave; la plage, vous devez conduire sur des routes sablonneuses, c&#39;est s&ucirc;r, car elles sont tr&egrave;s stables, surtout quand elles sont s&egrave;ches, pas tellement apr&egrave;s la pluie. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et plus de 100 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est tr&egrave;s faible, elle est presque plate, tout comme l&#39;eau o&ugrave; vous devez marcher 100 m&egrave;tres pour atteindre le point de baignade. Cela fait de cette plage, sauf du fait que sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, il y a peu d&#39;infrastructures de plage, parfaites pour que les petits enfants puissent jouer en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, il n&#39;y a presque pas d&#39;infrastructure, mais plus autour des restaurants et des h&eacute;bergements, qui sont &eacute;galement situ&eacute;s sur la plage. Vous avez le choix entre plusieurs types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement. Voici un h&ocirc;tel, un complexe et quelques appartements.', 3724, 'fr', 1),
(1277, 'Bienvenido a la playa Divjak&euml;s. La regi&oacute;n albanesa Fier tiene una costa muy especial que consiste principalmente en playas de arena muy largas. Cerca del peque&ntilde;o pueblo Divjak&euml; tienes una playa llamada Plazhi Divjak&euml;s. No solo es famoso por la playa, sino tambi&eacute;n por la hermosa &aacute;rea protegida de la naturaleza, con muchas aves, especialmente pel&iacute;canos y flamencos. Es f&aacute;cil llegar a &eacute;l con todo tipo de veh&iacute;culos, incluso autocaravanas, y puedes estacionar directamente en la playa. Desde el punto donde tiene la mayor concentraci&oacute;n de alojamiento hasta el punto en el que realmente llega a la playa, debe conducir por caminos arenosos, es seguro, porque son muy estables, especialmente cuando est&aacute;n secos, no tanto despu&eacute;s del lluvia. La playa en s&iacute; tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y m&aacute;s de 100 metros de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es muy baja, es casi plana y tambi&eacute;n lo es el agua por donde debes caminar durante 100 metros para llegar al punto de nataci&oacute;n. Esto hace que esta playa, excepto por el hecho de que en la playa en s&iacute; hay poca infraestructura de playa, perfecta para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen con seguridad en el agua. En la playa en s&iacute; casi no hay infraestructura, pero hay m&aacute;s alrededor de los restaurantes y alojamientos, que tambi&eacute;n se encuentran en la playa. Tienes muchos tipos de alojamiento para elegir. Aqu&iacute; hay un hotel, un resort y algunos apartamentos.', 3724, 'es', 1),
(1278, 'Willkommen am Strand Divjak&euml;s. Die albanische Region Fier hat eine ganz besondere K&uuml;ste, die haupts&auml;chlich aus sehr langen Sandstr&auml;nden besteht. In der N&auml;he der kleinen Stadt Divjak&euml; gibt es einen solchen Strand namens Plazhi Divjak&euml;s. Es ist nicht nur wegen des Strandes ber&uuml;hmt, sondern auch wegen des wundersch&ouml;nen Naturschutzgebiets mit vielen V&ouml;geln, insbesondere Pelikanen und Flamingos. Es ist leicht mit allen Arten von Fahrzeugen ihn zu erreichen, sogar mit Wohnmobilen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand selbst parken. Von dem Punkt, an dem Sie die gr&ouml;&szlig;te Unterkunftskonzentration haben, bis zu dem Punkt, an dem Sie tats&auml;chlich zum Strand kommen, m&uuml;ssen Sie auf sandigen Stra&szlig;en fahren, es ist sicher, weil sie sehr stabil sind, besonders, wenn sie trocken sind, nicht so sehr nach dem Regen. Der Strand selbst ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit. Die Neigung des Strandes ist sehr gering, er ist fast flach, ebenso wie das Wasser, in dem Sie 100 Meter gehen m&uuml;ssen, um den Schwimmpunkt zu erreichen. Dies macht diesen Strand, abgesehen von der Tatsache, dass es am Strand selbst wenig Strandinfrastruktur gibt, ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder, um sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Am Strand selbst gibt es fast keine Infrastruktur, aber mehr gibt es rund um die Restaurants und Unterk&uuml;nfte, die sich ebenfalls am Strand befinden. Sie haben viele Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften zur Auswahl. Hier ist ein Hotel, ein Resort und einige Apartments.', 3724, 'de', 1),
(1279, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Divjak&euml;s. Albanska regija Fier ima zelo posebno obalo, ki je sestavljena večinoma iz zelo dolgih pe&scaron;čenih plaž. V bližini majhnega mesta Divjak&euml; imate točno tak&scaron;no plažo, imenovano Plazhi Divjak&euml;s. Ne slovi samo po plaži, ampak tudi zaradi čudovitega naravnega rezervati, z veliko pticami, predvsem pelikani in flamingi. Do plaže se lahko enostavno pripeljete z vsemi vrstami vozil, celo z avtodomi in parkirate lahko neposredno na sami plaži. Od točke, kjer imate največjo nastanitveno koncentracijo, do točke, ko pravzaprav pridete na plažo, se morate voziti po pe&scaron;čenih cestah Te so varne, saj so zelo stabilne, zlasti ko so suhe, ne toliko po dežu. Sama plaža je dolga nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka več kot 100 metrov. Naklon plaže je zelo nizek, skoraj ravno je tukaj. Enako je z vodo, kjer morate prehoditi več 100 metrov, da dosežete točko plavanja. To dejstvo naredi to plažo, razen dejstva, da je na sami plaži malo infrastrukture za plažo, kot nala&scaron;č za majhne otroke, ki se lahko tako varno igrajo v vodi. Na sami plaži skorajda ni infrastrukture, več pa je okrog restavracij in prenoči&scaron;č, ki se nahajajo tudi blizu plaže. Na izbiro imate več vrst prenoči&scaron;č. Tukaj je hotel, letovi&scaron;če in nekaj apartmajev.', 3724, 'sl', 1),
(1280, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Divjak&euml;. Albanska regija Fier ima vrlo posebnu obalu, koja se sastoji uglavnom od vrlo dugih pje&scaron;čanih plaža. U blizini malog grada Divjak&euml; imate upravo takvu plažu koja se zove Plazhi Divjak&euml;s. Poznat je ne samo po plaži, već i po prekrasnom rezervatu prirode, s mnogim pticama, posebno pelikanima i flamingosima. Do plaže se mogu lako doći svim vrstama vozila, čak i kućicama, a možete parkirati izravno na plaži. Od mjesta na kojem imate najveću koncentraciju smje&scaron;taja, do mjesta gdje zapravo stižete na plažu, morate se voziti pje&scaron;čanim cestama. Sigurne su jer su vrlo stabilne, pogotovo kada su suhe, a ne toliko nakon ki&scaron;e. Sama plaža dugačka je nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka vi&scaron;e od 100 metara. Nagib plaže je vrlo nizak, ovdje je gotovo ravna. Isto je i s vodom gdje morate pje&scaron;ačiti vi&scaron;e od 100 metara da biste do&scaron;li do mjesta plivanja. Ova činjenica čini ovu plažu osim činjenicom da na samoj plaži postoji mala infrastruktura, pogodna za malu djecu koja se mogu tako sigurno igrati u vodi. Na samoj plaži gotovo da nema infrastrukture, ali ima vi&scaron;e oko restorana i smje&scaron;taja, koji se također nalaze u neposrednoj blizini plaže. Možete odabrati nekoliko vrsta smje&scaron;taja. Ovdje su hotel, odmarali&scaron;te i nekoliko apartmana.', 3724, 'hr', 1),
(1281, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia di Spille. Una delle primissime spiagge della regione di Tiran&euml;, quando si viaggia dalla parte meridionale del paese verso il nord, c&#39;&egrave; una lunghissima spiaggia sabbiosa, chiamata Plazhi Spille. La spiaggia &egrave; molto organizzata ed &egrave; un luogo turistico popolare adatto alle famiglie. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con il tuo veicolo e puoi parcheggiare direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, vicino ai bar della spiaggia. L&#39;intera area di parcheggio &egrave; molto grande e pu&ograve; contenere centinaia di macchine. Hai un sacco di infrastrutture e servizi spiaggia disponibili qui. L&#39;intera spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e pu&ograve; essere in alcuni punti larghi fino a 75 m. Hai davvero molto spazio qui per trovare il tuo posto. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 50 metri, il che rende questo posto ideale per i bambini piccoli che giocano in acqua in sicurezza. &Egrave; possibile noleggiare qui un lettino e un ombrellone, che pu&ograve; essere fatto dai ristoranti o dai bar sulla spiaggia che si trovano lungo tutto il tratto di spiaggia. Gli alloggi sono anche nelle vicinanze, principalmente sotto forma di hotel, sono disponibili anche alcuni appartamenti.', 3725, 'it', 1),
(1282, 'Bienvenido a la playa Spille. Una de las primeras playas de la regi&oacute;n de Tiran&euml;, cuando se viaja desde el sur del pa&iacute;s hacia el norte, hay una playa de arena muy larga, llamada Plazhi Spille. La playa est&aacute; muy organizada y es un lugar tur&iacute;stico popular ideal para familias. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con su veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar directamente frente a la playa, al lado de los bares de la playa. Toda el &aacute;rea de estacionamiento es muy grande y puede albergar cientos de autos. Usted tiene mucha infraestructura de playa y servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;. Toda la playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y puede estar en algunos lugares de hasta 75 m de ancho. Realmente tienes mucho espacio aqu&iacute; para encontrar tu lugar. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza a unos 50 metros, lo que hace que este lugar sea ideal para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen en el agua de manera segura. Puede alquilar aqu&iacute; una hamaca y una sombrilla, que pueden hacer los restaurantes o chiringuitos ubicados en todo el tramo de la playa. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n se encuentra en las proximidades, principalmente en forma de hoteles, algunos apartamentos tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles.', 3725, 'es', 1),
(1283, 'Bienvenue sur la plage de Spille. L&#39;une des toutes premi&egrave;res plages de la r&eacute;gion Tiran&euml;, lorsque vous voyagez du sud du pays vers le nord, il y a une tr&egrave;s longue plage de sable, appel&eacute;e Plazhi Spille. La plage est tr&egrave;s organis&eacute;e et est un lieu touristique populaire adapt&eacute; aux familles. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de l&#39;atteindre avec votre v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer directement en face de la plage, &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; des bars de plage. L&#39;ensemble du parking est tr&egrave;s grand et peut contenir plusieurs centaines de voitures. Vous avez beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage et de services de plage disponibles ici. Toute la plage est longue de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et peut atteindre en certains endroits jusqu&#39;&agrave; 75 m de large. Vous avez vraiment beaucoup d&#39;espace ici pour trouver votre place. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence &agrave; environ 50 m&egrave;tres, ce qui rend cet endroit id&eacute;al pour que les petits enfants puissent jouer dans l&#39;eau en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;. Vous pouvez louer ici un transat et un parasol, ce qui peut &ecirc;tre fait par les restaurants ou les bars de plage qui sont situ&eacute;s le long de toute la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;, principalement sous forme d&#39;h&ocirc;tels, certains appartements sont &eacute;galement disponibles.', 3725, 'fr', 1),
(1284, 'Willkommen am Strand Spille. Als einer der ersten Str&auml;nde in der Region Tiran&euml; gibt es einen sehr langen Sandstrand namens Plazhi Spille, wenn Sie vom s&uuml;dlichen Teil des Landes nach Norden reisen. Der Strand ist sehr gut organisiert und ein beliebter Touristenort f&uuml;r Familien. Es ist sehr einfach mit Ihrem Fahrzeug ihn zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand neben den Strandbars parken. Der gesamte Parkplatz ist sehr gro&szlig; und bietet Platz f&uuml;r viele hundert Autos. Sie haben hier eine Menge Strandinfrastruktur und Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der gesamte Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und kann an einigen Stellen bis zu 75 m breit sein. Sie haben hier wirklich viel Raum, um Ihren Platz zu finden. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei etwa 50 Metern, was diesen Ort ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder macht, um sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier eine Sonnenliege und einen Sonnenschirm mieten, was von den Restaurants oder Strandbars getan werden kann, die sich entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts befinden. Die Unterbringung erfolgt ebenfalls in der N&auml;he, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Hotels, einige Apartments sind ebenfalls verf&uuml;gbar.', 3725, 'de', 1),
(1285, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Spille. Ena prvih plaž v regiji Tiran&euml;, ko potujete iz južnega dela države proti severu, je zelo dolga pe&scaron;čena plaža, imenovana Plazhi Spille. Plaža je zelo urejena in je priljubljeno turistično mesto, primerno za družine. Do plaže se lahko pripeljete z vozilom, kjer lahko parkirate neposredno pred plažo, poleg barov na plaži. Celotno parkiri&scaron;če je zelo veliko in lahko sprejme več sto avtomobilov. Tu imate na voljo veliko plažne infrastrukture in storitve na plaži. Celotna plaža je dolga nekaj kilometrov in je na nekaterih mestih &scaron;iroka tudi do 75 m . Tu imate res veliko prostora, da najdete svoj kotiček. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne pri približno 50 metrih, zaradi česar je ta kraj idealen za majhne otroke, ki se lahko varno igrajo v vodi. Tu si lahko najamete tudi ležalnik in senčnik, kar se lahko stori pri restavracijah ali barih na plaži, ki se nahajajo vzdolž celotnega dela plaže. Nastanitev je razpoložljiva v bližini plaže, predvsem v obliki hotelov, na voljo pa je tudi nekaj apartmajev.', 3725, 'sl', 1),
(1286, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Spille. Jedna od prvih plaža u regiji Tiran&euml; kad se putuje iz južnog dijela zemlje na sjever je vrlo dugačka pje&scaron;čana plaža koja se zove Plazhi Spille. Plaža je vrlo dobro održavana i popularno je turističko odredi&scaron;te pogodno za obitelji. Do plaže se može doći automobilom, gdje možete parkirati direktno ispred plaže, pored barova na plaži. Čitavo parkirali&scaron;te je vrlo veliko i može primiti stotine automobila. Ovdje je na raspolaganju mnoga infrastruktura na plaži i usluge na plaži. Cijela plaža dugačka je nekoliko kilometara, a na nekim mjestima i do 75 m. Ovdje stvarno imate puno prostora da pronađete svoj kutak. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje na oko 50 metara, &scaron;to ovo mjesto čini idealnim za malu djecu koja se mogu sigurno igrati u vodi. Ovdje možete unajmiti ležaljku i suncobran, &scaron;to se može učiniti u restoranima ili barovima na plaži koji se nalaze duž cijelog područja plaže. Smje&scaron;taj je dostupan u blizini plaže, uglavnom u obliku hotela, ali tu je i nekoliko apartmana.', 3725, 'hr', 1),
(1287, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia di Karpen. In Albania ci sono molti posti meravigliosi da togliere il fiato, e lo stesso vale per la spiaggia Plazhi Karpen, che si trova nella regione di Tiran&euml; vicino alla citt&agrave; di Golem. Ci&ograve; che lo rende cos&igrave; speciale &egrave; la vista che avrai camminando su un molo di legno su una piccola isola, non lontano dal litorale. A causa delle acque poco profonde, degli alberi sulla spiaggia e della sabbia tutt&#39;intorno, &egrave; uno dei luoghi pi&ugrave; pittoreschi che abbia mai visto. Il posto &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con un veicolo, anche un camper, soprattutto a causa del campo che si trova direttamente sulla spiaggia. Puoi parcheggiare accanto alla strada o nel campo. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia. Molti alberi sono qui disponibili per proteggerti dal sole. La spiaggia, come l&#39;acqua, &egrave; molto piatta, il che la rende ideale per i bambini piccoli. Complessivamente la spiaggia &egrave; lunga circa 750 metri e larga fino a 40 m ed &egrave; separata in molti settori. Il punto di nuoto &egrave; molto lontano, probabilmente pi&ugrave; di 100 metri. Hai molti servizi di spiaggia disponibili qui, lo stesso vale per bar e ristoranti sulla spiaggia. Se ti piacciono queste caratteristiche della spiaggia e desideri trascorrere le tue vacanze qui, un campeggio, appartamenti e un hotel sono a tua disposizione proprio accanto alla spiaggia. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3726, 'it', 1),
(1288, 'Bienvenue sur la plage de Karpen. En Albanie, il y a beaucoup de beaux endroits &agrave; couper le souffle, et il en va de m&ecirc;me pour la plage Plazhi Karpen, qui est situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion de Tiran&euml; pr&egrave;s de la ville de Golem. Ce qui le rend si sp&eacute;cial, c&#39;est la vue que vous aurez lorsque vous marcherez sur une jet&eacute;e en bois vers une petite &icirc;le, non loin du rivage. En raison de l&#39;eau peu profonde, des arbres sur la plage et du sable tout autour, c&#39;est l&#39;un des sites les plus photographiques que j&#39;aie jamais vus. L&#39;endroit est facilement accessible avec un v&eacute;hicule, &eacute;galement un camping-car, en particulier &agrave; cause du camp qui est situ&eacute; directement sur la plage. Vous pouvez vous garer &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route ou dans le camp. La surface principale de la plage est du sable. De nombreux arbres sont disponibles pour vous prot&eacute;ger du soleil. La plage, comme l&#39;eau, est tr&egrave;s plate, ce qui la rend id&eacute;ale pour les petits enfants. Ensemble, la plage mesure environ 750 m&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 40 m de large, et est s&eacute;par&eacute;e dans de nombreux secteurs de plage. Le point de nage est tr&egrave;s loin, probablement &agrave; plus de 100 m&egrave;tres. Vous avez de nombreux services de plage disponibles ici, il en va de m&ecirc;me pour les bars et restaurants de plage. Si vous aimez les caract&eacute;ristiques de cette plage et que vous souhaitez passer vos vacances ici, un camping, des appartements et un h&ocirc;tel sont &agrave; votre disposition juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3726, 'fr', 1),
(1289, 'Bienvenido a la playa Karpen. En Albania hay muchos lugares hermosos para dejar sin aliento, y lo mismo ocurre con la playa Plazhi Karpen, que se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Tiran&euml;, cerca de la ciudad de Golem. Lo que lo hace tan especial es la vista que tendr&aacute; al caminar sobre un muelle de madera a una peque&ntilde;a isla, no muy lejos de la costa. Debido a las aguas poco profundas, los &aacute;rboles en la playa y la arena a su alrededor, es una de las vistas m&aacute;s pintorescas que he visto. Es f&aacute;cil llegar al lugar con un veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n una autocaravana, especialmente debido al campamento que se encuentra directamente en la playa. Puedes aparcar al lado de la carretera o en el campamento. La superficie principal de la playa es arena. Muchos &aacute;rboles est&aacute;n disponibles para protegerlo del sol. La playa, como el agua, es muy plana, lo que la hace ideal para ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os. En total, la playa tiene alrededor de 750 metros de largo y hasta 40 m de ancho, y est&aacute; separada en muchos sectores de playa. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; muy lejos, probablemente m&aacute;s de 100 metros. Tiene muchos servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;, lo mismo ocurre con los bares y restaurantes de playa. Si le gustan las caracter&iacute;sticas de esta playa y le gustar&iacute;a pasar sus vacaciones aqu&iacute;, un camping, apartamentos y un hotel est&aacute;n a su disposici&oacute;n justo al lado de la playa. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3726, 'es', 1),
(1290, 'Willkommen am Strand Karpen. In Albanien gibt es viele sch&ouml;ne Orte, die Ihnen den Atem rauben werden. Gleiches gilt f&uuml;r den Strand Plazhi Karpen, der sich in der Region Tiran&euml; in der N&auml;he der Stadt Golem befindet. Was es ihn so besonders macht, ist die Aussicht, die Sie haben, wenn Sie auf einem h&ouml;lzernen Pier zu einer kleinen Insel gehen, die nicht weit von der K&uuml;ste entfernt ist. Aufgrund des flachen Wassers, der B&auml;ume am Strand und des Sandes ringsum ist es eine der sch&ouml;nsten Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten, die ich je gesehen habe. Der Ort ist leicht mit einem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, insbesondere wegen des Camps, das direkt am Strand liegt. Sie k&ouml;nnen neben der Stra&szlig;e oder im Camp parken. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes ist Sand. Hier stehen viele B&auml;ume zur Verf&uuml;gung, um Sie vor der Sonne zu sch&uuml;tzen. Der Strand ist wie das Wasser sehr flach, was ihn ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder macht. Insgesamt ist der Strand rund 750 Meter lang und bis zu 40 Meter breit und in viele Strandsektoren getrennt. Der Schwimmpunkt ist sehr weit entfernt, wahrscheinlich mehr als 100 Meter. Sie haben hier viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, das gleiche gilt f&uuml;r Strandbars und Restaurants. Wenn Ihnen diese Strandeigenschaften gefallen und Sie Ihren Urlaub hier verbringen m&ouml;chten, stehen Ihnen direkt am Strand ein Campingplatz, Apartments und ein Hotel zur Verf&uuml;gung. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3726, 'de', 1),
(1291, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Karpen. V Albaniji je veliko lepih krajev, ki vam bodo vzeli sapo, enako velja za plažo Plazhi Karpen, ki se nahaja v regiji Tiran&euml; v bližini mesta Golem. Tisto kar jo dela posebno, je pogled, ki ga boste imeli, ko se boste sprehodili po lesenem pomolu do majhnega otoka, nedaleč stran od obale. Zaradi plitvine, dreves na plaži in peska naokoli je ena najbolj slikovitih znamenitosti, kar sem jih kdajkoli videl. Do plaže se lahko pripeljete z vozilom, tudi avtodomom, &scaron;e posebej zaradi kampa, ki se nahaja neposredno na plaži. Parkirate lahko ob cesti ali v kampu. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži je pesek. Tu je na voljo veliko dreves, ki vas bodo &scaron;čitila pred soncem. Plaže je, podobno kot voda, zelo ravna, zaradi česar je idealna za majhne otroke. Plaža je skupaj dolga približno 750 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 40 m, ločena pa je v &scaron;tevilne plažne sektorje. Točka plavanja je zelo daleč, verjetno več kot 100 metrov. Tu imate na voljo &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži, enako velja za bare na plaži in restavracije. Če so vam v&scaron;eč te plažne značilnosti in bi radi preživeli počitnice tukaj, so vam na voljo kamp, apartmaji in hotel, ti so tik ob plaži. Uživajte na plaži z BeachRexom.', 3726, 'sl', 1),
(1292, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Karpen. U Albaniji postoji mnogo lijepih mjesta koja će vam oduzeti dah, a isto vrijedi i za plažu Plazhi Karpen koja se nalazi u regiji Tiran&euml; u blizini grada Golem. Ono &scaron;to ga čini tako posebnim jest pogled na koji ćete se htjeti &scaron;etati drvenim pristani&scaron;tem do malog otoka, nedaleko od obale. Zbog plitke vode, drveća na plaži i pijeska svuda oko nje, jedna je od slika s najvi&scaron;e slika koje sam ikada vidio. Mjesto je lako doći vozilom, ali i kućicom za kamp, ​​posebno zbog kampa koji se nalazi direktno na plaži. Možete parkirati pored ceste ili u kampu. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je pijesak. Mnogo je stabala dostupno za za&scaron;titu od sunca. Plaže su, poput vode, vrlo ravne, &scaron;to je čini idealnom za malu djecu. Sve skupa plaža je dugačka oko 750 metara i &scaron;iroka do 40 m, a razdvojena je u mnogim sektorima plaže. Točka plivanja je vrlo daleko, vjerojatno vi&scaron;e od 100 metara. Ovdje su vam na raspolaganju brojne usluge na plaži, isto vrijedi i za beach barove i restorane. Ako vam se sviđaju ove karakteristike plaže i želite provesti ovdje svoj odmor, na raspolaganju su vam kamp, ​​apartmani i hotel tik uz plažu. Uživajte na svojoj plaži uz BeachRex.', 3726, 'hr', 1),
(1293, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia albanese Qerret. Se ti piace avere una spiaggia sabbiosa in vacanza e allo stesso tempo ti piacerebbe stare all&#39;ombra dei pini, con la spiaggia albanese Plazhi Qerret sei nel posto giusto. Si trova nella regione di Tiran&euml; vicino alla citt&agrave; di Golem. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con un veicolo. Puoi parcheggiare direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia in una pineta, in questo modo la tua auto sar&agrave; fresca tutto il giorno. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga circa 1000 me in alcuni punti larga fino a 100 m. &Egrave; separato in molti settori, dipende da quale localit&agrave; di soggiorno. L&#39;inclinazione &egrave; abbastanza normale, l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia abbastanza tardi, a circa 50 m. Hai molte infrastrutture per la spiaggia disponibili in tutto il tratto di spiaggia e in alcune parti ci sono servizi davvero premium. Non avrai fame su questa spiaggia, ci sono molti bar sulla spiaggia e ristoranti disponibili, lo stesso vale per tutti i tipi di alloggio, dalle semplici camere, ai campeggi fino ai resort e agli hotel premium. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3727, 'it', 1),
(1294, 'Bienvenue sur la plage albanaise de Qerret. Si vous aimez avoir une plage de sable pendant vos vacances et en m&ecirc;me temps vous souhaitez rester &agrave; l&#39;ombre des pins, avec la plage albanaise Plazhi Qerret vous &ecirc;tes au bon endroit. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion de Tiran&euml; pr&egrave;s de la ville de Golem. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec un v&eacute;hicule. Vous pouvez vous garer directement en face de la plage dans une for&ecirc;t de pins, de cette fa&ccedil;on votre voiture sera fra&icirc;che toute la journ&eacute;e. La plage mesure environ 1000 m de long et sur certains endroits jusqu&#39;&agrave; 100 m de large. Il est s&eacute;par&eacute; dans de nombreux secteurs, cela d&eacute;pend du lieu de vill&eacute;giature de votre s&eacute;jour. La pente est assez normale, l&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence assez tard, &agrave; environ 50 m. Vous avez beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage disponibles sur toute l&#39;&eacute;tendue de la plage, et sur certaines parties, il y a des services vraiment premium. Vous n&#39;aurez pas faim sur cette plage, il y a de nombreux bars et restaurants de plage disponibles, il en va de m&ecirc;me pour tous les types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, des chambres simples au camping jusqu&#39;aux stations baln&eacute;aires et h&ocirc;tels haut de gamme. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3727, 'fr', 1),
(1295, 'Bienvenido a la playa albanesa de Qerret. Si te gusta tener una playa de arena en tus vacaciones y al mismo tiempo te gustar&iacute;a quedarte a la sombra de los pinos, con la playa albanesa Plazhi Qerret est&aacute;s en el lugar correcto. Se encuentra ubicado en la regi&oacute;n de Tiran&euml; cerca de la ciudad de Golem. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es muy f&aacute;cil de alcanzar con un veh&iacute;culo. Puede estacionar directamente frente a la playa en un bosque de pinos, de esta manera su autom&oacute;vil estar&aacute; fresco todo el d&iacute;a. La playa tiene alrededor de 1000 m de largo y en algunos lugares hasta 100 m de ancho. Est&aacute; separado en muchos sectores, depende de en qu&eacute; resort se hospede. La inclinaci&oacute;n es bastante normal, la entrada al agua es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza bastante tarde, a unos 50 m. Tiene mucha infraestructura de playa disponible en todo el tramo de la playa, y en algunas partes hay servicios realmente premium. No tendr&aacute; hambre en esta playa, hay muchos bares de playa y restaurantes disponibles, lo mismo ocurre con todo tipo de alojamiento, desde habitaciones sencillas, acampadas hasta los mejores resorts y hoteles. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3727, 'es', 1),
(1296, 'Willkommen am albanischen Strand Qerret. Wenn Sie in Ihrem Urlaub einen Sandstrand haben m&ouml;chten und gleichzeitig im Schatten der Kiefern bleiben m&ouml;chten, sind Sie mit dem albanischen Strand Plazhi Qerret genau richtig. Es befindet sich in der Region Tiran&euml; in der N&auml;he der Stadt Golem. Dieser Ort ist mit einem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand in einem Kiefernwald parken, so dass Ihr Auto den ganzen Tag k&uuml;hl ist. Der Strand ist ca. 1000 m lang und an einigen Stellen bis zu 100 m breit. Es ist in vielen Bereichen getrennt, es h&auml;ngt davon ab, in welchem ​​Resort Sie &uuml;bernachten. Die Steigung ist ganz normal, der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt ziemlich sp&auml;t mit ca. 50 m. Sie haben eine Menge Strandinfrastruktur &uuml;ber den gesamten Strandabschnitt zur Verf&uuml;gung, und an einigen Stellen gibt es wirklich Premium-Dienstleistungen. Sie werden an diesem Strand nicht hungrig sein, es gibt viele Strandbars und Restaurants, das gleiche gilt f&uuml;r alle Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften, von einfachen Zimmern &uuml;ber Camping bis hin zu Premium-Resorts und Hotels. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3727, 'de', 1),
(1297, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na albanski plaži Qerret. Če želite imeti na počitnicah pe&scaron;čeno plažo in hkrati želite ostati v senci borovcev, je albanska plaža Plazhi Qerret točno prava za vas. Nahaja se v regiji Tiran&euml; v bližini mesta Golem. Do te lokacije se lahko pripeljete z va&scaron;im vozilom. Parkirate lahko neposredno pred plažo v borovem gozdu, tako bo va&scaron; avto ostal hladen cel dan. Plaža je dolga približno 1000 m, ponekod pa je &scaron;iroka do 100 m. Razdeljena je na več sektorjev, odvisno je, v katerem resorju ste nastanjeni Nagib je povsem običajen, vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne precej pozno, pri približno 50 m. Na celotnem delu plaže imate na voljo veliko infrastrukturo za plažo, na nekaterih delih pa so vam na razpolago resnično vrhunske storitve. Na tej plaži ne boste lačni, na voljo je veliko barov na plaži in restavracij, enako velja za vse vrste nastanitev, od preprostih sob, kampiranja vse do vrhunskih letovi&scaron;č in hotelov. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3727, 'sl', 1),
(1298, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na albansku plažu Qerret. Ako na odmoru želite imati pje&scaron;čanu plažu, a istovremeno želite ostati u hladu borova, albanska plaža Plazhi Qerret ba&scaron; je prava za vas. Smje&scaron;teno je u regiji Tiran&euml; u blizini grada Golem. Možete se voziti do ove lokacije svojim vozilom. Parkirati možete direktno ispred plaže u borovoj &scaron;umi, tako da će va&scaron; automobil ostati svjež cijeli dan. Plaža je duga oko 1000 m, a na nekim mjestima i do 100 m. Podijeljen je u nekoliko sektora, ovisno o kojem odjelu se nalazite. Nagib je sasvim normalan, ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje prilično kasno, na oko 50 m. Imate odličnu infrastrukturu za plažu na cijelom dijelu plaže, a u nekim dijelovima imate na raspolaganju zaista vrhunske usluge. Nećete ostati gladni na ovoj plaži, postoje mnogi beach barovi i restorani, isto vrijedi za sve vrste smje&scaron;taja, od jednostavnih soba, kampiranja pa sve do vrhunskih mjesta i hotela. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3727, 'hr', 1),
(1299, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia del Golem. Nella regione di Tiran&euml;, vicino alla famosa citt&agrave; di Durazzo, hai un&#39;altra spiaggia tipica per questa regione. Le spiagge, che si trovano in questa regione, sono tutte di tipo sabbioso, con i pini sullo sfondo. Questa spiaggia appartiene alla citt&agrave; Golem. &Egrave; facile raggiungerlo con il tuo veicolo e puoi parcheggiare direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, accanto alla strada, per lo pi&ugrave; sotto alcuni alberi di pino. &Egrave; lungo diversi chilometri e nella parte pi&ugrave; larga circa 100 metri di larghezza. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di nuoto &egrave; a circa 30 metri. Perch&eacute; questo posto &egrave; molto popolare tra i turisti, hai molti servizi di spiaggia disponibili sulla spiaggia. Qui ci sono anche molti bar sulla spiaggia, ristoranti e simili. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile in tutti i tipi di forme, principalmente come hotel e persino come resort. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3728, 'it', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1300, 'Bienvenido a la playa Golem. En la regi&oacute;n de Tiran&euml;, cerca de la famosa ciudad de Durr&euml;s, tiene otra playa t&iacute;pica para esta regi&oacute;n. Las playas, que se encuentran en esta regi&oacute;n, son todas de tipo arenoso, con los pinos al fondo. Esta playa pertenece a la ciudad de Golem. Es f&aacute;cil llegar con su veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionar directamente frente a la playa, al lado de la carretera, principalmente debajo de algunos pinos. Tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y en su parte m&aacute;s ancha, alrededor de 100 metros de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de nataci&oacute;n es de unos 30 metros. Debido a que este lugar es muy popular entre los turistas, tienes muchos servicios de playa disponibles en la playa. Aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n tiene muchos bares de playa, restaurantes y similares. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en todo tipo de formas, principalmente como hoteles e incluso como centros tur&iacute;sticos. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3728, 'es', 1),
(1301, 'Bienvenue sur la plage du Golem. Dans la r&eacute;gion de Tiran&euml;, pr&egrave;s de la c&eacute;l&egrave;bre ville de Durr&euml;s, vous avez une autre plage typique de cette r&eacute;gion. Les plages, situ&eacute;es dans cette r&eacute;gion, sont toutes de type sablonneux, avec les pins en arri&egrave;re-plan. Cette plage appartient &agrave; la ville de Golem. Il est facile de l&#39;atteindre avec votre v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer directement en face de la plage, &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route, principalement sous des pins. Elle est longue de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et sur la partie la plus large d&#39;environ 100 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 30 m&egrave;tres. Parce que cet endroit est tr&egrave;s populaire parmi les touristes, vous avez beaucoup de services de plage disponibles sur la plage. Ici, vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreux bars de plage, restaurants et similaires. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible sous toutes sortes de formes, principalement sous forme d&#39;h&ocirc;tels et m&ecirc;me de complexes h&ocirc;teliers. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3728, 'fr', 1),
(1302, 'Willkommen am Strand Golem. In der Region Tiran&euml;, in der N&auml;he der ber&uuml;hmten Stadt Durr&euml;s, gibt es einen weiteren typischen Strand f&uuml;r diese Region. Die Str&auml;nde, die sich in dieser Region befinden, sind alle sandig, mit den Kiefern im Hintergrund. Dieser Strand geh&ouml;rt zur Stadt Golem. Es ist leicht ihn mit Ihrem Fahrzeug zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand neben der Stra&szlig;e parken, meistens unter einigen Kiefern. Es ist mehrere Kilometer lang und an der breitesten Stelle rund 100 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 30 Metern. Da dieser Ort bei Touristen sehr beliebt ist, stehen Ihnen am Strand viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Hier gibt es auch viele Strandbars, Restaurants und &auml;hnliches. Unterkunft ist in allen Arten von Formen verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich als Hotels und sogar als Resorts. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3728, 'de', 1),
(1303, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Golem. V regiji Tiran&euml;, blizu znamenitega mesta Durr&euml;s, imate &scaron;e eno značilno plažo za to regijo. Plaže, ki se nahajajo v tej regiji, so vse pe&scaron;čene vrste, v ozadju pa se nahajajo borova drevesa. Ta plaža pripada mestu Golem. Do te lokacije se lahko pripeljete z vozilom, kjer lahko parkirate neposredno pred plažo, ob cesti, večinoma celo v senci borovih dreves. Dolga je nekaj kilometrov, na naj&scaron;ir&scaron;em delu pa okoli 100 metrov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep, točka plavanja pa je pri približno 30 metrih. Ker je ta kraj zelo priljubljen med turisti, imate na plaži na voljo veliko storitev na plaži. Tu imate tudi obilo barov na plaži, restavracij in podobnega. Nastanitev je na voljo v vseh oblikah, predvsem kot hoteli in celo kot letovi&scaron;ča. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3728, 'sl', 1),
(1304, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na Golem plažu. U regiji Tiran&euml;, u blizini poznatog grada Drača, imate jo&scaron; jednu tipičnu plažu za ovu regiju. Plaže koje se nalaze u ovoj regiji sve su pje&scaron;čane vrste, s borovom &scaron;umom u pozadini. Ova plaža pripada gradu Golem. Do ove se lokacije može doći automobilom, gdje možete parkirati direktno ispred plaže, uz cestu, uglavnom čak u sjeni borova. Duga je nekoliko kilometara i naj&scaron;ire je oko 100 metara. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep, a točka plivanja je na oko 30 metara. Kako je ovo mjesto vrlo popularno kod turista, na plaži vam je na raspolaganju puno usluga na plaži. Ovdje također imate obilje beach barova, restorana i slično. Smje&scaron;taj je dostupan u svim oblicima, uglavnom kao hoteli, pa čak i kao odmarali&scaron;ta. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3728, 'hr', 1),
(1305, 'Benvenuti in spiaggia Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Se ti piacciono le lunghe spiagge sabbiose con molto spazio, con molte infrastrutture e servizi di spiaggia al massimo livello, e vorresti avere il tuo appartamento in un hotel premium proprio di fronte alla spiaggia, con la spiaggia Plazhi Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s sei nel posto giusto. La spiaggia si trova al confine tra due regioni, quelle sono la regione di Tiran&euml; e la regione di Durazzo. La citt&agrave; pi&ugrave; vicina si chiama Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Questo posto &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con il tuo veicolo e puoi parcheggiare direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia in un parco pubblico, oppure puoi parcheggiare in un luogo privato appartenente a un hotel. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga pochi chilometri e larga 100 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di nuoto &egrave; a circa 50 metri. Hai un sacco di servizi da spiaggia disponibili, inclusi campi da gioco per bambini e campi sportivi. Bar sulla spiaggia e diversi tipi di ristoranti sono disponibili lungo tutta la spiaggia. Lo stesso vale per gli alloggi che sono presenti qui principalmente sotto forma di hotel premium, ma sono disponibili anche alcuni appartamenti e altri tipi di alloggio. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3729, 'it', 1),
(1306, 'Bienvenue &agrave; la plage Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Si vous aimez les longues plages de sable fin avec beaucoup d&#39;espace, avec de nombreuses infrastructures de plage et des services de plage au plus haut niveau, et que vous souhaitez &eacute;galement avoir votre appartement dans un h&ocirc;tel premium juste en face de la plage, avec la plage Plazhi Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s vous &ecirc;tes au bon endroit. La plage est situ&eacute;e &agrave; la fronti&egrave;re entre deux r&eacute;gions, ce sont la r&eacute;gion de Tiran&euml; et la r&eacute;gion de Durr&euml;s. La ville la plus proche s&#39;appelle Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Cet endroit est facilement accessible avec votre v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez soit vous garer directement en face de la plage sur une place de parc public, soit vous garer sur une place priv&eacute;e appartenant &agrave; un h&ocirc;tel. La plage est longue de quelques kilom&egrave;tres et large de 100 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 50 m&egrave;tres. Vous avez beaucoup de services de plage disponibles, y compris des aires de jeux pour enfants et des terrains de sport. Des bars de plage et diff&eacute;rents types de restaurants sont disponibles sur toute la plage. Il en va de m&ecirc;me pour les h&eacute;bergements qui sont pr&eacute;sents ici principalement sous forme d&#39;h&ocirc;tels haut de gamme, mais certains appartements et autres types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement sont &eacute;galement disponibles. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3729, 'fr', 1),
(1307, 'Bienvenido a la playa Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Si le gustan las largas playas de arena con mucho espacio, con muchas infraestructuras de playa y servicios de playa al m&aacute;s alto nivel, y tambi&eacute;n le gustar&iacute;a tener su apartamento en un hotel premium justo en frente de la playa, con la playa Plazhi Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s Est&aacute;s en el lugar correcto. La playa se encuentra en el l&iacute;mite entre dos regiones, esas son la regi&oacute;n Tiran&euml; y la regi&oacute;n Durr&euml;s. La ciudad m&aacute;s cercana se llama Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Es f&aacute;cil llegar a este lugar con su veh&iacute;culo y puede estacionarse directamente frente a la playa en un lugar de parque p&uacute;blico, o puede estacionar en un lugar privado que pertenece a un hotel. La playa tiene unos pocos kil&oacute;metros de largo y 100 metros de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de nataci&oacute;n es de unos 50 metros. Tiene muchos servicios de playa disponibles, incluidos parques infantiles y campos deportivos. Hay bares de playa y diferentes tipos de restaurantes disponibles a lo largo de toda la playa. Lo mismo ocurre con el alojamiento que est&aacute; presente aqu&iacute; principalmente en forma de hoteles premium, pero algunos apartamentos y otros tipos de alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3729, 'es', 1),
(1308, 'Willkommen am Strand Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Wenn Sie lange Sandstr&auml;nde mit viel Platz, vielen Strandinfrastrukturen und Stranddienstleistungen auf h&ouml;chstem Niveau m&ouml;gen, und Ihre Wohnung auch in einem Premium-Hotel direkt vor dem Strand liegen sollte, dann sind Sie mit dem Strand Plazhi Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s an der richtigen Stelle. Der Strand liegt an der Grenze zwischen zwei Regionen, n&auml;mlich der Region Tiran&euml; und der Region Durr&euml;s. Die n&auml;chstgelegene Stadt hei&szlig;t Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Dieser Ort ist mit Ihrem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder direkt vor dem Strand auf einem &ouml;ffentlichen Parkplatz oder auf einem privaten Platz eines Hotels parken. Der Strand ist einige Kilometer lang und 100 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 50 Metern. Sie haben viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, darunter Kinderspielpl&auml;tze und Sportpl&auml;tze. Strandbars und verschiedene Arten von Restaurants sind entlang des gesamten Strandes verf&uuml;gbar. Gleiches gilt f&uuml;r Unterk&uuml;nfte, die hier haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Premium-Hotels angeboten werden. Einige Apartments und andere Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften sind jedoch ebenfalls verf&uuml;gbar. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3729, 'de', 1),
(1309, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Če imate radi dolge pe&scaron;čene plaže z veliko prostora, z veliko infrastrukture na plaži in različnimi plažnimi storitvami na najvi&scaron;ji ravni, poleg tega pa bi radi imeli svoje stanovanje v vrhunskem hotelu tik pred plažo, je plaža Plazhi Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s točno za vas. Plaža se nahaja na meji med dvema regijama, to sta regija Tiran&euml; in regija Drač. Najbližje mesto se imenuje Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Ta kraj je enostavno dosegljiv z vozilom in parkirate lahko neposredno pred plažo na javnem parkiri&scaron;ču ali pa parkirate na zasebnem mestu hotela. Plaža je dolga nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka 100 metrov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep, točka plavanja pa je na približno 50 metrih. Na voljo imate veliko storitev na plaži, vključena so otro&scaron;ka igri&scaron;ča in &scaron;portna igri&scaron;ča. Ob celotni plaži so na voljo &scaron;tevilni plažni bari in različne vrste restavracij. Enako velja za nastanitev, ki so tukaj prisotne predvsem v obliki vrhunskih hotelov, prav tako so na voljo apartmaji in druge vrste nastanitve. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3729, 'sl', 1),
(1310, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaže Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Ako volite duge pje&scaron;čane plaže s puno prostora, s puno plaže i razne usluge na plaži na najvi&scaron;oj razini, a željeli biste imati svoj stan u vrhunskom hotelu točno ispred plaže, Plazhi Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s je pravi za vas. Plaža se nalazi na granici između dviju regija, naime regije Tiran&euml; i regije Drač. Najbliže mjesto naziva se Shk&euml;mbi i Kavaj&euml;s. Ovo je mjesto lako dostupno automobilom, a možete parkirati direktno ispred plaže na javnom parkirali&scaron;tu ili u parkiranju na privatnom mjestu hotela. Plaža je dugačka nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka 100 metara. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep, a točka plivanja je na oko 50 metara. Postoji mnogo usluga na plaži, uključujući dječja igrali&scaron;ta i sportska igrali&scaron;ta. Uz cijelu plažu postoje brojni barovi na plaži i razne vrste restorana. Isto vrijedi i za smje&scaron;taj koji je ovdje uglavnom u obliku vrhunskih hotela, kao i apartmane i druge vrste smje&scaron;taja. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3729, 'hr', 1),
(1311, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia di Paralia Astir. Si trova nella citt&agrave; di Alexandroupoli della regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. &Egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa, ma ci sono anche alcuni ciottoli mescolati con dentro. Il parcheggio &egrave; a soli 50 m dalla spiaggia, ha una capacit&agrave; di 70 veicoli e si trova vicino alla strada. L&#39;accesso al parcheggio &egrave; molto semplice, indipendentemente dal veicolo. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 300 metri, la larghezza massima &egrave; di 15 metri. L&#39;inclinazione sulla spiaggia &egrave; normale, l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; comodo e il punto di nuoto &egrave; gi&agrave; a 3 metri. Accanto alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un complesso alberghiero con piscina, parco giochi per bambini e molti altri servizi. &Egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie e adatta ai bambini pi&ugrave; grandi, non tanto per i pi&ugrave; piccoli, a causa delle acque profonde. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile anche in appartamenti, camere o in un campo nelle vicinanze. Alcune infrastrutture della spiaggia sono disponibili anche sulla spiaggia, ma altre sono a vostra disposizione nel complesso alberghiero. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3388, 'it', 1),
(1312, 'Bienvenue &agrave; la plage Paralia Astir. Il est situ&eacute; dans la ville d&#39;Alexandroupoli de la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. C&#39;est une plage de sable, mais vous avez aussi des cailloux m&eacute;lang&eacute;s. Le parking est &agrave; seulement 50 m de la plage, a une capacit&eacute; de 70 v&eacute;hicules et il est situ&eacute; &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route. L&#39;acc&egrave;s au parking est tr&egrave;s facile, quel que soit le v&eacute;hicule. La longueur totale de la plage est de 300 m&egrave;tres, la largeur maximale est de 15 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;inclinaison sur la plage est normale, l&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est confortable et le point de nage est d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 3 m&egrave;tres. &Agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, il y a un complexe h&ocirc;telier avec une piscine, une aire de jeux pour enfants et de nombreux autres &eacute;quipements. C&#39;est une plage familiale et adapt&eacute;e aux enfants plus &acirc;g&eacute;s, pas tellement aux petits, &agrave; cause de l&#39;eau profonde. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement disponible dans des appartements, des chambres ou dans un camp, qui est &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Certaines infrastructures de plage sont &eacute;galement disponibles sur la plage, mais d&#39;autres sont &agrave; votre disposition dans le complexe h&ocirc;telier. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3388, 'fr', 1),
(1313, 'Bienvenido a la playa Paralia Astir. Se encuentra ubicado en la ciudad de Alexandroupoli de la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Es una playa de arena, pero tambi&eacute;n tiene algunos guijarros mezclados. El estacionamiento est&aacute; a solo 50 m de la playa, tiene capacidad para 70 veh&iacute;culos y est&aacute; ubicado al lado de la carretera. El acceso al estacionamiento es muy f&aacute;cil, sin importar el veh&iacute;culo. La longitud total de la playa es de 300 metros, el ancho m&aacute;ximo es de 15 metros. La inclinaci&oacute;n en la playa es normal, la entrada al agua es c&oacute;moda y el punto de nataci&oacute;n ya est&aacute; a 3 metros. Junto a la playa hay un complejo hotelero con piscina, parque infantil y muchas otras comodidades. Es una playa familiar y adecuada para ni&ntilde;os mayores, no tanto para los peque&ntilde;os, debido a las aguas profundas. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible en apartamentos, habitaciones o en un campamento cercano. Parte de la infraestructura de la playa tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible en la playa, pero hay m&aacute;s a su disposici&oacute;n en el complejo hotelero. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3388, 'es', 1),
(1314, 'Willkommen am Strand Paralia Astir. Es befindet sich in der Stadt Alexandroupoli in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Es ist ein Sandstrand, aber Sie haben auch einige Kieselsteine ​​eingemischt. Der Parkplatz ist nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt, hat eine Kapazit&auml;t von 70 Fahrzeugen und befindet sich neben der Stra&szlig;e. Der Zugang zum Parkplatz ist sehr einfach, egal welches Fahrzeug sie fahren. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 300 Meter, die maximale Breite betr&auml;gt 15 Meter. Die Neigung am Strand ist normal, der Wassereintritt ist angenehm und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bereits bei 3 Metern. Neben dem Strand befindet sich ein Hotelkomplex mit einem Schwimmbecken, einem Kinderspielplatz und vielen anderen Annehmlichkeiten. Es ist ein Familienstrand und f&uuml;r &auml;ltere Kinder geeignet, wegen des tiefen Wassers nicht so sehr f&uuml;r die Kleinen. Die Unterbringung erfolgt auch in Apartments, Zimmern oder in einem nahen gelegenen Camp. Einige Strandinfrastrukturen sind auch am Strand verf&uuml;gbar, aber im Hotelkomplex steht Ihnen mehr zur Verf&uuml;gung. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3388, 'de', 1),
(1315, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Paralia Astir. Nahaja se v mestu Alexandroupoli v regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. To je pe&scaron;čena plaža, ki pa ima na določenih delih v pesek pome&scaron;ane tudi kamenčke. Parkiri&scaron;če je od plaže oddaljeno le 50 m, prostora je za 70 vozil, nahaja pa se ob cesti. Dostop do parkiri&scaron;ča je zelo enostaven, ne glede na vozilo. Skupna dolžina plaže je 300 metrov, največja &scaron;irina je 15 metrov. Naklon na plaži je normalen, vstop v vodo je udoben, točka plavanja pa je že pri 3 metrih. Ob plaži je hotelski kompleks z bazenom, otro&scaron;kim igri&scaron;čem in &scaron;tevilnimi drugimi udobji. To je družinska plaža in primerna za starej&scaron;e otroke, ne toliko za majhne, ​​zaradi globoke vode. Nastanitev vam je na voljo tudi v apartmajih, sobah ali kampu, ki je v bližini. Na plaži je na voljo tudi nekatera infrastruktura za plažo, več pa je je na razpolago v hotelskem kompleksu. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3388, 'sl', 1),
(1316, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Paralia Astir. Smje&scaron;ten u gradu Alexandroupoli u regiji Anatoliki Makedonija kai Thraki. Ovo je pje&scaron;čana plaža koja na nekim dijelovima ima i &scaron;ljunak pomije&scaron;an u pijesku. Parkirali&scaron;te je udaljeno samo 50 m od plaže, ima mjesta za 70 vozila i nalazi se uz cestu. Pristup parkirali&scaron;tu je vrlo jednostavno, bez obzira na vozilu. Ukupna dužina plaže je 300 metara, maksimalna &scaron;irina 15 metara. Nagib na plaži je normalan, ulaz u vodu je udoban, a točka plivanja već je na 3 metra. Uz plažu je hotelski kompleks s bazenom, dječjim igrali&scaron;tem i mnogim drugim sadržajima. Obiteljska je plaža i pogodna za stariju djecu, ne toliko za malu, zbog duboke vode. Smje&scaron;taj je također dostupan u apartmanima, sobama ili kampu u blizini. Na plaži je dostupan i u nekoj infrastrukturi za plažu, ali vi&scaron;e je dostupno u hotelskom kompleksu. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3388, 'hr', 1),
(1317, 'Benvenuti in spiaggia Paralia Reina. Nella regione di Anatoliki Makedonia Kai Thraki, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Alexandroupoli, puoi visitare con la tua famiglia la spiaggia sabbiosa di Reina. &Egrave; una spiaggia molto lunga, lunga pi&ugrave; di 1 km, con una larghezza di 20 m, ed &egrave; semplicemente perfetta che corre lungo la spiaggia sabbiosa. Non c&#39;&egrave; ombra naturale, quindi porta con te il tuo parasole. La sistemazione e i ristoranti sono proprio accanto alla spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile in molte forme, principalmente come hotel e appartamenti, alcune camere e persino un campo sono pure disponibili. Anche il parcheggio &egrave; enorme, il che lo rende ideale per i camper e puoi parcheggiare proprio di fronte alla spiaggia, a pochi metri di distanza. L&#39;inclinazione sulla spiaggia &egrave; normale e hai una bella entrata d&#39;acqua. L&#39;acqua diventa profonda molto rapidamente e puoi iniziare a nuotare quasi subito. Tutta l&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia necessaria &egrave; disponibile qui, ma non aspettarti troppo, &egrave; solo di base. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3389, 'it', 1),
(1318, 'Bienvenue &agrave; la plage Paralia Reina. Dans la r&eacute;gion d&#39;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, pr&egrave;s de la ville d&#39;Alexandroupoli, vous pourrez visiter en famille la plage de sable de Reina. C&#39;est une tr&egrave;s longue plage, plus de 1 km de long, avec une largeur de 20 m, et c&#39;est tout simplement parfait en descendant la plage de sable. Il n&#39;y a pas d&#39;ombre naturelle, alors apportez votre parasol avec vous. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement et les restaurants sont juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible sous de nombreuses formes, principalement sous forme d&#39;h&ocirc;tels et d&#39;appartements, certaines chambres et m&ecirc;me un camp sont &eacute;galement disponibles. Le parking est &eacute;galement immense, ce qui le rend id&eacute;al pour les camping-cars, et vous pouvez vous garer juste en face de la plage, &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres. L&#39;inclinaison sur la plage est normale et vous avez une tr&egrave;s belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau. L&#39;eau devient profonde tr&egrave;s rapidement et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager presque imm&eacute;diatement. Toutes les infrastructures de plage n&eacute;cessaires sont disponibles ici, mais n&#39;en attendez pas trop, ce n&#39;est que basique. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3389, 'fr', 1),
(1319, 'Bienvenido a la playa Paralia Reina. En la regi&oacute;n de Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, cerca de la ciudad de Alexandroupoli, puede visitar con su familia la playa de arena Reina. Es una playa muy larga, de m&aacute;s de 1 km de largo, con un ancho de 20 m, y es perfecta para correr por la playa de arena. No hay sombra natural, as&iacute; que traiga su sombrilla con usted. El alojamiento y los restaurantes est&aacute;n justo al lado de la playa. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en muchas formas, principalmente como hoteles y apartamentos, algunas habitaciones e incluso un campamento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles. El estacionamiento tambi&eacute;n es enorme, lo que lo hace ideal para autocaravanas, y puede estacionarse justo en frente de la playa, a solo unos metros de distancia. La inclinaci&oacute;n en la playa es normal, y tienes una muy buena entrada de agua. El agua se profundiza muy r&aacute;pidamente y puedes comenzar a nadar casi de inmediato. Toda la infraestructura de playa necesaria est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;, pero no esperes demasiado, solo es b&aacute;sica. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3389, 'es', 1),
(1320, 'Willkommen am Strand Paralia Reina. In der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Alexandroupoli, k&ouml;nnen Sie mit Ihrer Familie den Sandstrand Reina besuchen. Es ist ein sehr langer Strand, mehr als 1 km lang, mit einer Breite von 20 m, und es ist einfach perfekt, den Sandstrand hinunterzulaufen. Es gibt keinen nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten, bringen Sie also Ihren Sonnenschirm mit. Die Unterkunft und die Restaurants befinden sich direkt am Strand. Unterk&uuml;nfte gibt es in vielen Formen, haupts&auml;chlich als Hotels und Apartments, einige Zimmer und sogar ein Camp sind auch verf&uuml;gbar. Der Parkplatz ist ebenfalls riesig, was ihn ideal f&uuml;r Wohnmobile macht. Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand parken, der nur wenige Meter entfernt ist. Die Neigung am Strand ist normal und Sie haben einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt. Das Wasser wird sehr schnell tief und Sie k&ouml;nnen fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur ist hier verf&uuml;gbar, aber erwarten Sie nicht zu viel, es ist nur einfach. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3389, 'de', 1),
(1321, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Paralia Reina. V regiji Anatoliki Makedonija kai Thraki, v bližini mesta Alexandroupoli, lahko z družino obi&scaron;čete pe&scaron;čeno plažo Reina. To je zelo dolga plaža, dolga je več kot 1 km, s &scaron;irino 20 m, in je naravnost popolna za tek po pe&scaron;čeni plaži. Naravne sence ni, zato prinesite s seboj senčnik. Namestitev in restavracije so tik ob plaži. Nastanitev je na voljo v različnih oblikah, predvsem kot hotel in apartmaji, nekatere sobe in celo kamp so tudi na voljo. Tudi parkiri&scaron;če je ogromno, zaradi česar je idealno za avtodome, parkirate pa lahko neposredno pred plažo, le nekaj metrov stran. Naklon na plaži je običajen in vstop v vodo je zelo lep. Globina vode zelo hitro pada in z plavanjem lahko začnete skoraj takoj. Tu je na voljo vsa potrebna infrastruktura za plažo, vendar ne pričakujte preveč, saj je le osnovna. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3389, 'sl', 1),
(1322, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Paralia Reina. U regiji Anatoliki Makedonija kai Thraki, u blizini grada Alexandroupoli, s obitelji možete posjetiti pje&scaron;čanu plažu Reina. To je vrlo dugačka plaža, duga vi&scaron;e od 1 km, &scaron;irine 20 m, a upravo je savr&scaron;ena za trčanje uz pje&scaron;čanu plažu. Nema prirodne sjene, zato ponesite ki&scaron;obran. Smje&scaron;taj i restorani nalaze se odmah do plaže. Smje&scaron;taj je dostupan u različitim oblicima, uglavnom kao hotel i apartmani, neke sobe, pa čak i kamp su također dostupni. Parkirali&scaron;te je također ogromno, &scaron;to ga čini idealnim za kamp kućice, a možete parkirati točno ispred plaže, samo nekoliko metara. Nagib na plaži je normalan, a ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep. Dubina vode vrlo brzo opada i možete početi plivati ​​gotovo odmah. Sva potrebna infrastruktura za plažu dostupna je ovdje, ali nemojte očekivati ​​previ&scaron;e jer je samo osnovna. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3389, 'hr', 1),
(1323, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia Alexander. Questa spiaggia &egrave; una vera spiaggia per esploratori. Perch&eacute;, perch&eacute; il percorso per la spiaggia &egrave; difficile. Parti delle scale sono rotte, quindi fai attenzione. Si consiglia di fare attenzione quando si scende lungo il percorso. La spiaggia si trova nella citt&agrave; di Alessandropoli, che fa parte della regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Proprio di fronte alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un ampio parcheggio, che &egrave; anche molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche un camper. &Egrave; una spiaggia di ciottoli con belle rocce rossastre alte 10 metri sullo sfondo. &Egrave; una spiaggia davvero unica. 100 metri &egrave; la lunghezza e 10 metri la larghezza della spiaggia. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; piacevole e puoi nuotare subito. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia non &egrave; presente sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile a pochi metri di distanza sotto forma di un hotel, che &egrave; anche un casin&ograve;. Se preferite gli appartamenti, sono disponibili anche nelle vicinanze. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3390, 'it', 1),
(1324, 'Bienvenue sur la plage Alexander. Cette plage est une v&eacute;ritable plage d&#39;exploration. Pourquoi, car le chemin vers la plage est difficile. Certaines parties de l&#39;escalier sont cass&eacute;es, alors faites attention. Soyez prudent lorsque vous descendez le chemin. La plage est situ&eacute;e dans la ville d&#39;Alexandroupoli, qui fait partie de la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Juste en face de la plage, vous avez une tr&egrave;s grande place de parking, qui est &eacute;galement tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, m&ecirc;me un camping-car. C&#39;est une plage de galets avec de belles roches rouge&acirc;tres de 10m de haut en arri&egrave;re-plan. C&#39;est une plage vraiment unique. 100 m&egrave;tres est la longueur et 10 m&egrave;tres la largeur de la plage. L&#39;entr&eacute;e &agrave; l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez nager tout de suite. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage n&#39;est pas pr&eacute;sente sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est disponible qu&#39;&agrave; quelques m&egrave;tres sous forme d&#39;h&ocirc;tel, qui est aussi un casino. Si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez des appartements, ils sont &eacute;galement disponibles &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3390, 'fr', 1),
(1325, 'Bienvenido a la playa Alexander. Esta playa es una verdadera playa exploradora. Por qu&eacute;, porque el camino a la playa es dif&iacute;cil. Algunas partes de las escaleras est&aacute;n rotas, as&iacute; que tenga cuidado. Se aconseja tener cuidado al descender por el camino. La playa est&aacute; ubicada en la ciudad de Alexandroupoli, que forma parte de la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Justo en frente de la playa tiene un lugar de estacionamiento muy grande, al que tambi&eacute;n se puede acceder f&aacute;cilmente con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, incluso una autocaravana. Es una playa de guijarros con bonitas rocas rojizas de 10 m de altura en el fondo. Es una playa realmente &uacute;nica. 100 metros es la longitud y 10 metros el ancho de la playa. La entrada al agua es agradable y puedes nadar de inmediato. La infraestructura de la playa no est&aacute; presente en la playa. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible a pocos metros en forma de hotel, que tambi&eacute;n es un casino. Si prefiere apartamentos, tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles cerca. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3390, 'es', 1),
(1326, 'Willkommen am Strand Alexander. Dieser Strand ist ein wahrer Entdeckerstrand. Warum, weil der Weg zum Strand schwierig ist. Teile der Treppe sind kaputt, seien Sie also vorsichtig. Seien Sie vorsichtig, wenn Sie den Weg entlanggehen. Der Strand befindet sich in der Stadt Alexandroupoli, die Teil der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki ist. Direkt vor dem Strand haben Sie einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, der auch mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, sehr leicht zu erreichen ist. Es ist ein Kieselstrand mit sch&ouml;nen r&ouml;tlichen 10 m hohen Felsen im Hintergrund. Es ist ein wirklich einzigartiger Strand. 100 Meter ist die L&auml;nge und 10 Meter die Breite des Strandes. Der Zugang zum Wasser ist sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen sofort wegschwimmen. Strandinfrastruktur ist am Strand nicht vorhanden. Die Unterkunft ist nur wenige Meter entfernt in Form eines Hotels verf&uuml;gbar, das auch ein Casino ist. Wenn Sie Apartments bevorzugen, sind diese auch in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3390, 'de', 1),
(1327, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Alexander. Ta plaža je prava raziskovalna plaža. Zakaj, ker je pot do plaže težka. Deli stopnic so pokvarjeni, zato bodite previdni. Ko se spustite po poti, bodite previdni. Plaža se nahaja v mestu Alexandroupoli, ki je del regije Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Tik pred plažo imate zelo veliko parkirno mesto, ki je prav tako zelo enostavno dostopno s kakr&scaron;nimi koli vozili, celo avtodomom. To je prodnata plaža z lepo rdečimi 10 m visokimi skalami v ozadju. To je res edinstvena plaža. 100 metrov je dolžina, 10 metrov pa &scaron;irina plaže. Vstop v vodo je lep in z plavanjem lahko začnete takoj. Infrastruktura na plaži ni prisotna. Nastanitev je na voljo le nekaj metrov stran v obliki hotela, ki je tudi casino. Če imate raje apartmaje, so vam ti tudi na voljo v bližini. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3390, 'sl', 1),
(1328, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na Alexander Beach. Ova plaža je prava istraživačka plaža. Za&scaron;to, jer je put do plaže težak. Dijelovi stepenica su slomljeni, zato budite oprezni. Spu&scaron;tajući se stazom, budite oprezni. Plaža se nalazi u gradu Alexandroupoli koji je dio regije Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Ispred plaže imate vrlo veliko parkirno mjesto koje je također vrlo lako dostupno svim vozilima, pa čak i kućicama. &Scaron;ljunčana je plaža s prekrasnim crvenim stijenama visokim 10 m u pozadini. Ovo je zaista jedinstvena plaža. 100 metara je duljina, a 10 metara &scaron;irina plaže. Ulazak u vodu je lijep i možete početi plivati ​​odmah. Infrastruktura na plaži nema. Smje&scaron;taj je dostupan na samo nekoliko metara u obliku hotela, koji je ujedno i kockarnica. Ako vi&scaron;e volite apartmane, dostupni su i u blizini. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3390, 'hr', 1),
(1329, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia di Anapafseos. Puoi trovare questa spiaggia di 2 km di lunghezza e 20 di larghezza appena fuori dalla citt&agrave; di Alessandropoli nella regione di Anatoliki Makedonia Kai Thraki, che si trova nell&#39;estremo oriente della Grecia. Il parcheggio &egrave; disponibile lungo tutto il tratto della spiaggia, i camper troveranno anche un posto per parcheggiare. Alcuni parcheggi sono organizzati; alcuni sono pi&ugrave; gratuiti. &Egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa con alcuni ciottoli e una formazione rocciosa rossa, di circa 5-10 metri di altezza sullo sfondo. Ristoranti e alloggi, anche un hotel sono proprio sulla spiaggia. Alcune infrastrutture balneari sono disponibili qui, ma sono principalmente concentrate nei ristoranti. L&#39;inclinazione del pendio &egrave; normale, hai un buon ingresso in acqua e il nuoto inizia gi&agrave; a 3 metri. Se preferisci appartamenti per il tuo alloggio, quelli pi&ugrave; vicini sono a soli 100 metri di distanza. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3391, 'it', 1),
(1330, 'Bienvenue sur la plage d&#39;Anapafseos. Vous pouvez trouver cette plage de 2 km de long et 20 de large juste &agrave; l&#39;ext&eacute;rieur de la ville d&#39;Alexandroupoli dans la r&eacute;gion d&#39;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, qui se trouve dans l&#39;extr&ecirc;me est de la Gr&egrave;ce. Un parking est disponible sur toute la plage, les camping-cars trouveront &eacute;galement une place de parking. Des places de parking sont organis&eacute;es; certains sont plus gratuits. C&rsquo;est une plage de sable avec quelques cailloux et une formation de roches rouges, d&rsquo;environ 5 &agrave; 10 m&egrave;tres de hauteur en arri&egrave;re-plan. Restaurants et h&eacute;bergement, aussi un h&ocirc;tel sont juste sur la plage. Certaines infrastructures de plage sont disponibles ici, mais elles sont principalement concentr&eacute;es autour des restaurants. L&#39;inclinaison de la pente est normale, vous avez une belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et la natation commence d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 3 m&egrave;tres. Si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez des appartements pour votre h&eacute;bergement, les plus proches sont &agrave; seulement 100 m&egrave;tres. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3391, 'fr', 1),
(1331, 'Bienvenido a la playa de Anapafseos. Puede encontrar esta playa de 2 km de largo y 20 de ancho a las afueras de la ciudad de Alexandroupoli, en la regi&oacute;n de Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, que se encuentra en el extremo este de Grecia. Hay estacionamiento disponible en todo el tramo de la playa, las autocaravanas tambi&eacute;n encontrar&aacute;n un lugar para estacionar. Algunos lugares de estacionamiento est&aacute;n organizados; Algunos son m&aacute;s gratuitos. Es una playa de arena con algunos guijarros y una formaci&oacute;n de roca roja, de alrededor de 5 a 10 metros de altura en el fondo. Restaurantes y alojamiento, tambi&eacute;n un hotel est&aacute;n justo en la playa. Aqu&iacute; hay algo de infraestructura de playa, pero se concentra principalmente en los restaurantes. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la pendiente es normal, tiene una buena entrada de agua y la nataci&oacute;n ya comienza a los 3 metros. Si prefiere apartamentos para su alojamiento, los m&aacute;s cercanos est&aacute;n a solo 100 metros. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3391, 'es', 1),
(1332, 'Willkommen am Strand von Anapafseos. Sie finden diesen 2 km langen und 20 km breiten Strand etwas au&szlig;erhalb der Stadt Alexandroupoli in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, die sich im &auml;u&szlig;ersten Osten Griechenlands befindet. Das Parken ist entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts m&ouml;glich. Wohnmobile finden auch einen Parkplatz. Einige Parkpl&auml;tze sind organisiert; Einige sind freier. Es ist ein Sandstrand mit einigen Kieselsteinen und einer roten Felsformation von etwa 5 bis 10 Metern H&ouml;he im Hintergrund. Restaurants und Unterk&uuml;nfte sowie ein Hotel liegen direkt am Strand. Hier gibt es einige Strandinfrastrukturen, die sich jedoch haupts&auml;chlich herum die Restaurants konzentrieren. Die Hangneigung ist normal, Sie haben einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und das Schwimmen beginnt bereits bei 3 Metern. Wenn Sie Apartments f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft bevorzugen, sind die n&auml;chsten nur 100 Meter entfernt. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3391, 'de', 1),
(1333, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Anapafseos. To 2 km dolgo in 20 &scaron;iroko plažo najdete tik pred mestecem Alexandroupoli v regiji Anatoliki Makedonija kai Thraki, ki leži na skrajnem vzhodnem delu Grčije. Parkiranje je na voljo na celotnem delu plaže, avtodomi bodo na&scaron;li tudi prostor za parkiranje. Nekatera parkiri&scaron;ča so organizirana; nekatera so bolj divja. To je pe&scaron;čena plaža z nekaj kamenčki in rdečo skalo v ozadju z vi&scaron;ino približno 5 do 10 metrov. Restavracije in nastanitve, prav tako hotel so dostopni tik pred plažo ali na njej. Tu je na voljo nekaj infrastruktur za plažo, ki pa je večinoma koncentrirana okoli restavracij. Naklon plaže je običajen, vhod v vodo je udoben, plavanje pa se začne že pri 3 metrih. Če imate raje apartmaje za svojo nastanitev, so najbližji oddaljeni le 100 metrov. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3391, 'sl', 1),
(1334, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Anapafseos. Ova 2 km dugačka i 20 &scaron;iroka plaža smje&scaron;tena je neposredno izvan grada Alexandroupoli u regiji Anatoliki Makedonija kai Thraki, koji leži na krajnjem istočnom dijelu Grčke. Parkiranje je dostupno na cijeloj plaži, a kućice će pronaći parkirali&scaron;te. Neka su parkirali&scaron;ta organizirana; neki su divlji. To je pje&scaron;čana plaža s nekoliko &scaron;ljunka i crvene stijene u pozadini s visinom od oko 5 do 10 metara. Restorani i smje&scaron;taj, kao i hotel dostupni su neposredno ispred plaže ili na njoj. Za plažu je na raspolaganju neka infrastruktura, ali uglavnom je koncentrirana oko restorana. Nagib plaže je normalan, ulaz u vodu je udoban, a kupanje počinje na 3 metra. Ako vi&scaron;e želite apartmane za svoj smje&scaron;taj, najbliži su udaljeni samo 100 metara. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3391, 'hr', 1),
(1335, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia greca di Makri. Paralia Makri &egrave; ancora sotto l&#39;autorit&agrave; della citt&agrave; di Alexandroupoli e appartiene alla regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. &Egrave; una spiaggia con un porto, ristoranti e un ambiente molto bello nel cuore di molti ulivi. &Egrave; adatto a famiglie che amano la sabbia, i ciottoli e le piccole conchiglie sulla spiaggia. Il parcheggio &egrave; pavimentato e adatto anche a camper. &Egrave; a soli 50 di distanza dalla spiaggia. Se ti piacciono le lunghe spiagge, questa sar&agrave; quella giusta per te, poich&eacute; &egrave; lunga 500 metri e ha una larghezza massima di 25 metri. La pendenza sulla spiaggia &egrave; normale e il punto di nuoto &egrave; gi&agrave; a 3 metri. Hai anche alcune infrastrutture da spiaggia qui, pi&ugrave; &egrave; disponibile vicino ai ristoranti e ai bar sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile solo sotto forma di appartamenti e camere ed &egrave; a poche centinaia di metri nel villaggio di Makri. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3392, 'it', 1),
(1336, 'Bienvenue sur la plage grecque de Makri. Paralia Makri est toujours sous l&#39;autorit&eacute; de la ville d&#39;Alexandroupoli et appartient &agrave; la r&eacute;gion d&#39;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. C&#39;est une plage avec un port, des restaurants et un tr&egrave;s bel environnement au coeur de nombreux oliviers. Il convient aux familles qui aiment le sable, les cailloux et les petits coquillages sur la plage. Le parking est pav&eacute; et convient &eacute;galement aux camping-cars. Il n&#39;est qu&#39;&agrave; 50 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Si vous aimez les longues plages, celle-ci sera parfaite pour vous, car elle mesure 500 m&egrave;tres de long et a une largeur maximale de 25 m&egrave;tres. La pente sur la plage est normale, et le point de nage est d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 3 m&egrave;tres. Vous avez &eacute;galement une infrastructure de plage ici, plus est disponible pr&egrave;s des restaurants et des bars de plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est disponible que sous forme d&#39;appartements et de chambres, et se trouve &agrave; quelques centaines de m&egrave;tres dans le village de Makri. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3392, 'fr', 1),
(1337, 'Bienvenido a la playa griega Makri. Paralia Makri todav&iacute;a est&aacute; dentro de la autoridad de la ciudad de Alexandroupoli y pertenece a la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Es una playa con puerto, restaurantes y un entorno muy agradable en el coraz&oacute;n de muchos olivos. Es adecuado para familias que aman la arena, los guijarros y las peque&ntilde;as conchas en la playa. El estacionamiento est&aacute; pavimentado y es adecuado tambi&eacute;n para autocaravanas. Est&aacute; a solo 50 de la playa. Si le gustan las playas largas, esta ser&aacute; la adecuada para usted, ya que tiene 500 metros de largo y tiene un ancho m&aacute;ximo de 25 metros. La pendiente en la playa es normal, y el punto de nataci&oacute;n ya est&aacute; a 3 metros. Tambi&eacute;n tiene una infraestructura de playa aqu&iacute;, hay m&aacute;s disponible cerca de los restaurantes y bares de playa. El alojamiento solo est&aacute; disponible en forma de apartamentos y habitaciones, y est&aacute; a unos cientos de metros en el pueblo de Makri. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3392, 'es', 1),
(1338, 'Willkommen am griechischen Strand Makri. Paralia Makri befindet sich immer noch in der Autorit&auml;t der Stadt Alexandroupoli und geh&ouml;rt zur Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Es ist ein Strand mit einem Hafen, Restaurants und einer sehr sch&ouml;nen Umgebung im Herzen vieler Olivenb&auml;ume. Es ist f&uuml;r Familien geeignet, die Sand, Kieselsteine und kleine Muscheln am Strand lieben. Der Parkplatz ist asphaltiert und auch f&uuml;r Wohnmobile geeignet. Es ist nur 50 Meter&nbsp;vom Strand entfernt. Wenn Sie lange Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, ist dieser genau das Richtige f&uuml;r Sie, da er 500 Meter lang und maximal 25 Meter breit ist. Der Hang am Strand ist normal und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bereits bei 3 Metern. Sie haben auch einige Strandinfrastruktur hier, mehr ist in der N&auml;he der Restaurants und Strandbars verf&uuml;gbar. Die Unterkunft ist nur in Form von Apartments und Zimmern verf&uuml;gbar und liegt einige hundert Meter entfernt im Dorf Makri. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3392, 'de', 1),
(1339, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na gr&scaron;ki plaži Makri. Paralia Makri je &scaron;e vedno v pristojnosti mesta Alexandroupoli in spada v regijo Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. To je plaža s pristani&scaron;čem, restavracijami in zelo lepo okolico v osrčju &scaron;tevilnih oljk. Primerna je za družine, ki imajo na plaži radi pesek, kamenčke in majhne &scaron;koljke. Parkiri&scaron;če je tlakovano in primerno tudi za avtodome. Od plaže je oddaljena le 50 metrov. Če imate radi dolge plaže, bo ta prava za vas, saj je dolga 500 metrov in ima največjo &scaron;irino 25 metrov. Naklon na plaži je normalen, točka plavanja pa je že pri 3 metrih. Tu imate tudi nekaj plažne infrastrukture, več je na voljo v bližini restavracij in barov na plaži. Nastanitev je na voljo le v obliki apartmajev in sob in sicer v vasi Makri, ki pa je nekaj sto metrov oddaljena. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3392, 'sl', 1),
(1340, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na grčku plažu Makri. Paralia Makri jo&scaron; je pod nadležno&scaron;ću grada Alexandroupoli i pripada regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. To je plaža s lukom, restoranima i vrlo lijepim okruženjem u srcu mnogih maslinika. Pogodan je za obitelji koje na plaži vole pijesak, &scaron;ljunak i male &scaron;koljke. Parkirali&scaron;te je asfaltirano i prikladno za kamp kućice. Od plaže je udaljen samo 50 metara. Ako volite duge plaže, ova će vam biti prava jer je dugačka 500 metara i ima maksimalnu &scaron;irinu od 25 metara. Nagib na plaži je normalan, a točka plivanja već je na 3 metra. Ovdje također imate neku plažnu infrastrukturu, vi&scaron;e je na raspolaganju u blizini restorana i barova na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj je dostupan samo u obliku apartmana i soba u selu Makri koje je udaljeno nekoliko stotina metara. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3392, 'hr', 1),
(1341, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia greca di Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s. La citt&agrave; di Alexandroupoli e la regione di Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki &egrave; nota per molte spiagge sabbiose, e Paralia Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s &egrave; una di queste. Questa spiaggia per famiglie ha molte infrastrutture da offrire, il che render&agrave; il vostro soggiorno il pi&ugrave; piacevole possibile. Poich&eacute; non c&#39;&egrave; ombra naturale disponibile sulla spiaggia, &egrave; possibile noleggiare sedie a sdraio e ombrelloni presso i bar sulla spiaggia. &Egrave; una spiaggia molto lunga, circa 2 chilometri, con una larghezza massima di 40 metri. I ristoranti e i bar sulla spiaggia si trovano direttamente sulla spiaggia. La strada per la spiaggia &egrave; in buone condizioni e puoi parcheggiare proprio di fronte alla spiaggia, a pochi metri di distanza. Questa spiaggia ha una pendenza normale, un ingresso d&#39;acqua molto bello e ci si pu&ograve; aspettare di iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; a soli 5 metri. Gli alloggi sono disponibili anche nelle vicinanze, principalmente come appartamenti e camere. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3393, 'it', 1),
(1342, 'Bienvenue sur la plage grecque Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s. La ville d&#39;Alexandroupoli et la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki sont connues pour de nombreuses plages de sable, et Paralia Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s en fait partie. Cette plage familiale a beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage &agrave; offrir, ce qui rendra votre s&eacute;jour le plus agr&eacute;able possible. Parce qu&#39;il n&#39;y a pas d&#39;ombre naturelle disponible sur la plage, vous pouvez louer des transats et des parasols dans les bars de plage. C&#39;est une tr&egrave;s longue plage, d&#39;environ 2 kilom&egrave;tres, avec une largeur maximale de 40 m&egrave;tres. Les restaurants et les bars de plage sont situ&eacute;s directement sur la plage. La route de la plage est en bon &eacute;tat et vous pouvez vous garer juste en face de la plage, &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres. Cette plage a une pente normale, une tr&egrave;s belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et vous pouvez vous attendre &agrave; commencer &agrave; nager &agrave; seulement 5 m&egrave;tres. Des logements sont &eacute;galement disponibles &agrave; proximit&eacute;, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements et de chambres. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3393, 'fr', 1),
(1343, 'Bienvenido a la playa griega Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s. La ciudad Alexandroupoli y la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki es conocida por sus numerosas playas de arena, y la paralia Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s es una de ellas. Esta playa familiar tiene mucha infraestructura de playa para ofrecer, lo que har&aacute; que su estad&iacute;a sea lo m&aacute;s placentera posible. Debido a que no hay sombra natural disponible en la playa, puede alquilar algunas tumbonas y sombrillas en los bares de la playa. Es una playa muy larga, de unos 2 kil&oacute;metros, con un ancho m&aacute;ximo de 40 metros. Los restaurantes y los chiringuitos se encuentran directamente en la playa. El camino a la playa est&aacute; en buen estado y puede aparcar justo en frente de la playa, a solo unos metros de distancia. Esta playa tiene una pendiente normal, una entrada de agua muy agradable y puede comenzar a nadar a solo 5 metros. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible cerca, principalmente como apartamentos y habitaciones. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3393, 'es', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1344, 'Willkommen am griechischen Strand Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s. Die Stadt Alexandroupoli und die Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki ist bekannt f&uuml;r viele Sandstr&auml;nde, und Paralia Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s ist einer von ihnen. Dieser Familienstrand hat viel Strandinfrastruktur zu bieten, die Ihren Aufenthalt so angenehm wie m&ouml;glich macht. Da am Strand kein nat&uuml;rlicher Schatten vorhanden ist, k&ouml;nnen Sie einige Liegest&uuml;hle und Sonnenschirme an den Strandbars mieten. Es ist ein sehr langer Strand, ungef&auml;hr 2 Kilometer lang, mit einer maximalen Breite von 40 Metern. Die Restaurants und Strandbars befinden sich direkt am Strand. Die Stra&szlig;e zum Strand ist in einem guten Zustand und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand parken, nur wenigen Meter entfernten. Dieser Strand hat einen normalen Hang, einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und Sie k&ouml;nnen erwarten, bereits nach 5 Metern mit dem Schwimmen zu beginnen. Unterk&uuml;nfte sind auch in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich als Apartments und Zimmer. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3393, 'de', 1),
(1345, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na gr&scaron;ki plaži Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s. Mesto Alexandroupoli in regija Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki je znano po &scaron;tevilnih pe&scaron;čenih plažah, paralia Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s pa je ena izmed njih. Na tej družinski plaži je na voljo veliko infrastruktur za plažo, da bi bilo va&scaron;e bivanje čim bolj prijetno. Ker na plaži ni na voljo naravne sence, si lahko barih na plaži najamete nekaj ležalnikov in senčnikov. To je zelo dolga plaža, približno 2 kilometra, največja &scaron;irina pa je 40 metrov. Restavracije in bari na plaži se nahajajo neposredno na plaži. Pot do plaže je v dobrem stanju in parkirate lahko neposredno pred plažo, ki je le nekaj metrov stran. Ta plaža ima normalen naklon, vstop v vodo je zelo lep in pričakujete lahko, da boste začeli plavati že pri samo 5 metrih. V bližini je na voljo tudi nastanitev, predvsem kot apartmaji in sobe. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3393, 'sl', 1),
(1346, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na grčku plažu Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s. Grad Alexandroupoli i Anatoliki regija Makedonija kai Thraki poznat je po brojnim pje&scaron;čanim plažama, a paralia Ag&iacute;as Paraskev&iacute;s jedna je od njih. Na ovoj je obiteljskoj plaži na raspolaganju mnogo infrastruktura za plažu kako bi va&scaron; boravak bio &scaron;to ugodniji. Kako na plaži nema prirodne hladovine, u barovima na plaži možete unajmiti ležaljke i suncobrane. To je vrlo dugačka plaža, duga oko 2 kilometra, maksimalne &scaron;irine 40 metara. Restorani i barovi na plaži nalaze se direktno na plaži. Put do plaže je u dobrom stanju i možete se parkirati direktno ispred plaže koja je udaljena samo nekoliko metara. Ova plaža ima normalnu padinu, ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i možete očekivati ​​da ćete početi plivati ​​na samo 5 metara. Smje&scaron;taj je također dostupan u blizini, uglavnom kao apartmani i sobe. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3393, 'hr', 1),
(1347, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia greca Dikellon. L&#39;ultima spiaggia molto lunga, lunga molti chilometri con una larghezza di 25 metri, ad Alexandroupoli, e la regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki &egrave; la spiaggia Dikellon. Questa spiaggia &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere e puoi parcheggiare lungo la strada, proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. Questa spiaggia per famiglie ha pochissime infrastrutture, la maggior parte &egrave; concentrata intorno ai bar sulla spiaggia. I ristoranti e i bar sulla spiaggia si trovano sulla spiaggia o nelle vicinanze e sono disponibili lungo tutto il tratto di spiaggia. La superficie principale sulla spiaggia sono piccoli ciottoli, l&#39;ombra naturale, come gli alberi, non &egrave; presente qui. La pendenza della spiaggia &egrave; normale, l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; comodo e il punto di nuotata &egrave; di circa 5 metri. Alcuni alloggi sono disponibili anche qui, ma solo come appartamenti o camere. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3394, 'it', 1),
(1348, 'Bienvenue sur la plage grecque de Dikellon. La derni&egrave;re tr&egrave;s longue plage, longue de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres avec une largeur de 25 m&egrave;tres, &agrave; Alexandroupoli, et la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki est la plage Dikellon. Cette plage est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s et vous pouvez vous garer par la route, juste en face de la plage. Cette plage familiale a tr&egrave;s peu d&#39;infrastructures, la plupart se concentrent autour des bars de plage. Les restaurants et bars de plage sont situ&eacute;s sur la plage ou &agrave; proximit&eacute; et sont disponibles le long de toute la plage. La surface principale de la plage est constitu&eacute;e de petits cailloux, l&#39;ombre naturelle, comme les arbres, n&#39;est pas pr&eacute;sente ici. La pente de la plage est normale, l&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est confortable et le point de nage est &agrave; environ 5 m&egrave;tres. Certains logements sont &eacute;galement disponibles ici, mais uniquement sous forme d&#39;appartements ou de chambres. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3394, 'fr', 1),
(1349, 'Bienvenido a la playa griega Dikellon. La &uacute;ltima playa muy larga, de muchos kil&oacute;metros de largo con un ancho de 25 metros, en Alexandroupoli, y la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki es la playa Dikellon. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a esta playa y se puede estacionar junto a la carretera, justo en frente de la playa. Esta playa familiar tiene muy poca infraestructura, la mayor parte se concentra alrededor de los chiringuitos. Los restaurantes y chiringuitos se encuentran en la playa o cerca, y est&aacute;n disponibles a lo largo de todo el tramo de la playa. La superficie principal en la playa son peque&ntilde;os guijarros, la sombra natural, como los &aacute;rboles, no est&aacute;n presentes aqu&iacute;. La pendiente de la playa es normal, la entrada al agua es c&oacute;moda y el punto de nataci&oacute;n es de unos 5 metros. Algunos alojamientos tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, pero solo como apartamentos o habitaciones. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3394, 'es', 1),
(1350, 'Willkommen am griechischen Strand Dikellon. Der letzte sehr lange Strand, viele Kilometer lang und 25 Meter breit, in Alexandroupoli und der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki ist der Strand Dikellon. Dieser Strand ist sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen an der Stra&szlig;e direkt vor dem Strand parken. Dieser Familienstrand hat sehr wenig Infrastruktur, der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil konzentriert sich auf die Strandbars. Die Restaurants und Strandbars befinden sich entweder am Strand oder in der N&auml;he und sind entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts verf&uuml;gbar. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand sind kleine Kieselsteine, nat&uuml;rliche Schatten, wie B&auml;ume, sind hier nicht vorhanden. Die Strandneigung ist normal, der Wassereintritt ist bequem und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 5 Metern. Einige Unterk&uuml;nfte sind auch hier verf&uuml;gbar, jedoch nur als Apartments oder Zimmer. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3394, 'de', 1),
(1351, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na gr&scaron;ki plaži Dikellon. Zadnja zelo dolga plaža, dolga več kilometrov z &scaron;irino 25 metrov, v Aleksandroupoliju in regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki je plaža Dikellon. Do te plaže se lahko zelo enostavno pripeljete z vozilom, kjer lahko parkirate ob cesti, tik pred plažo. Ta družinska plaža ima zelo malo infrastrukture, večina je koncentrirana okoli barov na plaži. Restavracije in bari na plaži se nahajajo na plaži ali v bližini le te, na voljo pa so na celotnem delu plaže. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži so majhni prodniki, naravna senca, kot drevesa, tukaj ni prisotna. Pobočje na plaži je normalno, vstop v vodo je udoben, točka kopanja pa je pri približno 5 metrih. Nekaj nastanitev je na voljo tudi tukaj, vendar le kot apartmaji ali sobe. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3394, 'sl', 1),
(1352, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na grčku plažu Dikellon. Posljednja vrlo dugačka plaža, dugačka nekoliko kilometara, &scaron;irine 25 metara, u Aleksandroupoliju i Anatolijskoj regiji Makedonije kai Thraki je plaža Dikellon. Do ove plaže se može lako doći automobilom, gdje se možete parkirati uz cestu, točno ispred plaže. Ova obiteljska plaža ima vrlo malo infrastrukture, većina je koncentrirana oko barova na plaži. Restorani i barovi na plaži nalaze se na ili u blizini plaže i dostupni su na cijeloj plaži. Glavni dio plaže su mali &scaron;ljunak, prirodna hladovina, poput drveća, ovdje nije prisutna. Nagib na plaži je normalan, ulaz u vodu udoban, a mjesto za kupanje na oko 5 metara. Ovdje je dostupan i dio smje&scaron;taja, ali samo kao apartmani ili sobe. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3394, 'hr', 1),
(1353, 'Benvenuti nella spiaggia di ghiaia greca di Sapes. L&#39;unica spiaggia che la citt&agrave; di Sapes chiama la sua &egrave; la Paralia Sapes. Sempre nella regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki questa spiaggia &egrave; pi&ugrave; adatta a coloro che cercano l&#39;avventura, prima del comfort. Qui praticamente non ci sono infrastrutture, ma nelle vicinanze c&#39;&egrave; un sito archeologico chiamato Choros Archea. La spiaggia stessa &egrave; composta principalmente da ciottoli. Il parcheggio &egrave; solo sul ciglio della strada, nessun parcheggio ufficiale. Ha una lunghezza di 1 chilometro e la larghezza massima &egrave; di 20 metri. L&#39;inclinazione sulla spiaggia &egrave; normale, l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; confortevole e il punto di nuotata &egrave; a 20 metri. Non &egrave; disponibile alcuna sistemazione per questa spiaggia, non nelle vicinanze, ma a pochi chilometri di distanza. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3395, 'it', 1),
(1354, 'Bienvenue &agrave; Sapes de plage de gravier grec. La seule plage que la ville appelle Sapes est la paralia Sapes. Toujours dans la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki cette plage est plus adapt&eacute;e &agrave; ceux qui recherchent l&#39;aventure, avant le confort. Ici, il n&#39;y a pratiquement pas d&#39;infrastructure, mais il y a un site arch&eacute;ologique &agrave; proximit&eacute;, appel&eacute; Choros Archea. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me est compos&eacute;e principalement de galets. Le stationnement est uniquement en bordure de route, pas de parking officiel. Il a une longueur de 1 kilom&egrave;tre et une largeur maximale de 20 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;inclinaison sur la plage est normale, l&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est confortable et le point de nage est &agrave; 20 m&egrave;tres. Aucun logement n&#39;est disponible pour cette plage, pas &agrave; proximit&eacute;, mais &agrave; quelques kilom&egrave;tres. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3395, 'fr', 1),
(1355, 'Bienvenido a ser griego playa de grava Sapes. La &uacute;nica playa que la ciudad de Sapes llama propia es la paralia Sapes. Todav&iacute;a en la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, esta playa es m&aacute;s adecuada para aquellos que buscan aventura, antes que la comodidad. Aqu&iacute; b&aacute;sicamente no hay infraestructura, pero hay un sitio arqueol&oacute;gico cerca, llamado Choros Archea. La playa en s&iacute; est&aacute; hecha principalmente de guijarros. El estacionamiento es solo en la carretera, no hay estacionamiento oficial. Tiene una longitud de 1 kil&oacute;metro y el ancho m&aacute;ximo es de 20 metros. La inclinaci&oacute;n en la playa es normal, la entrada al agua es c&oacute;moda y el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a 20 metros. No hay alojamiento disponible para esta playa, no cerca, pero a pocos kil&oacute;metros de distancia. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3395, 'es', 1),
(1356, 'Willkommen im griechischen Kiesstrand Sapes. Der einzige Strand, den die Stadt Sapes nennt, ist der Paralia Sapes. Noch in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki ist dieser Strand eher f&uuml;r diejenigen geeignet, die Abenteuer vor Komfort suchen. Hier gibt es im Grunde keine Infrastruktur, aber in der N&auml;he befindet sich eine arch&auml;ologische St&auml;tte namens Choros Archea. Der Strand selbst besteht haupts&auml;chlich aus Kieselsteinen. Das Parken ist nur am Stra&szlig;enrand, kein offizielles Parken. Es hat eine L&auml;nge von 1 Kilometer und die maximale Breite betr&auml;gt 20 Meter. Die Neigung am Strand ist normal, der Wassereintritt ist angenehm und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 20 Metern. F&uuml;r diesen Strand ist keine Unterkunft verf&uuml;gbar, nicht in der N&auml;he, aber nur wenige Kilometer entfernt. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3395, 'de', 1),
(1357, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na gr&scaron;ki gramozni plaži Sapes. Edina plaža, ki jo kraj Sapes imenuje svojo, je paralia Sapes. &Scaron;e vedno v regiji Anatoliki Makedonija kai Thraki je ta plaža bolj primerna za tiste, ki i&scaron;čejo pustolov&scaron;čino, pred udobjem. Tu v bistvu ni infrastrukture, obstaja pa arheolo&scaron;ko najdi&scaron;če tik v bližini, imenovano Choros Archea. Sama plaža je sestavljena večinoma iz kamenčkov. Parkiranje je možno le ob cesti, uradnega parkiri&scaron;ča ni. Dolga je 1 kilometer, največja &scaron;irina pa je 20 metrov. Naklon na plaži je normalen, vstop v vodo je udoben, točka plavanja pa je pri 20 metrih. Za to plažo ni na voljo namestitve, ne v bližini, ampak nekaj kilometrov stran. Uživajte na plaži z BeachRexom.', 3395, 'sl', 1),
(1358, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na grčku &scaron;ljunčanu plažu Sapes. Jedina plaža koju Sapes naziva svojom je Paralia Sapes. Jo&scaron; uvijek u kai Thrakiju, regiji Anatoliki Makedonija, ova je plaža pogodnija za one koji traže avanturu prije udobnosti. Ovdje u osnovi nema infrastrukture, ali u blizini se nalazi arheolo&scaron;ko nalazi&scaron;te zvano Choros Archea. Sama plaža sastoji se od &scaron;ljunka. Parkiranje je moguće samo uz cestu, službeno parkirali&scaron;te nema. Duga je 1 kilometar i ima maksimalnu &scaron;irinu od 20 metara. Nagib na plaži je normalan, ulaz u vodu je udoban, a točka plivanja je na 20 metara. Za ovu plažu nema smje&scaron;taja, ne u blizini, nego na nekoliko kilometara. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3395, 'hr', 1),
(1359, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia greca di Profitis Ilias. Le ombre naturali non sono molto frequenti da trovare sulle spiagge intorno alla citt&agrave; di Maronia. Ma questo paralia, o spiaggia in inglese, &egrave; diverso. Appartiene ancora alla regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, &egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie con un misto di sabbia, ciottoli e grandi pietre. Il parcheggio &egrave; possibile di fronte alla spiaggia e anche i camper sono i benvenuti. Alcune infrastrutture di spiaggia di base sono disponibili qui, ma non aspettatevi troppo. Qui &egrave; disponibile un bar sulla spiaggia, non &egrave; disponibile un ristorante. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza di 750 metri, una larghezza di 30 metri, l&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; normale. Quando vai in acqua hai un ingresso d&#39;acqua confortevole, puoi aspettarti di iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; a 5 metri. Nelle vicinanze sono disponibili sistemazioni, in particolare appartamenti. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3397, 'it', 1),
(1360, 'Bienvenue sur la plage grecque Profitis Ilias. Les teintes naturelles ne sont pas tr&egrave;s fr&eacute;quentes sur les plages autour de la ville de Maronia. Mais cette paralia, ou plage en anglais, est diff&eacute;rente. Elle appartient toujours &agrave; la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, c&#39;est une plage familiale avec un m&eacute;lange de sable, de galets et de grosses pierres. Le stationnement est possible en face de la plage et les camping-cars sont &eacute;galement les bienvenus. Certaines infrastructures de plage de base sont disponibles ici, mais n&#39;en attendez pas trop. Un bar de plage est disponible ici, un restaurant n&#39;est pas disponible. La plage a une longueur de 750 m&egrave;tres, une largeur de 30 m&egrave;tres, l&#39;inclinaison de la plage est normale. Lorsque vous allez &agrave; l&#39;eau, vous avez une entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau confortable, vous pouvez vous attendre &agrave; commencer &agrave; nager d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 5 m&egrave;tres. Des logements, notamment des appartements sont disponibles &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3397, 'fr', 1),
(1361, 'Bienvenido a la playa griega Profitis Ilias. Los tonos naturales no se encuentran muy a menudo en las playas alrededor de la ciudad de Maronia. Pero esta paralia, o playa en ingl&eacute;s, es diferente. Todav&iacute;a pertenece a la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, es una playa familiar con una mezcla de arena, guijarros y grandes piedras. El estacionamiento es posible frente a la playa, y las autocaravanas tambi&eacute;n son bienvenidas. Aqu&iacute; hay disponible una infraestructura b&aacute;sica de playa, pero no esperes demasiado. Un bar de playa est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;, un restaurante no est&aacute; disponible. La playa tiene una longitud de 750 metros, un ancho de 30 metros, la inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es normal. Cuando va al agua tiene una entrada de agua c&oacute;moda, puede esperar comenzar a nadar ya a 5 metros. Alojamiento, especialmente apartamentos est&aacute;n disponibles en los alrededores. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3397, 'es', 1),
(1362, 'Willkommen am griechischen Strand Profitis Ilias. Nat&uuml;rliche Schatten sind an den Str&auml;nden rund um die Stadt Maronia nicht sehr h&auml;ufig zu finden. Aber diese Paralia oder der Strand auf Englisch ist anders. Es geh&ouml;rt immer noch zur Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, es ist ein Familienstrand mit einer Mischung aus Sand, Kieselsteinen und gro&szlig;en Steinen. Das Parken ist vor dem Strand m&ouml;glich und Wohnmobile sind ebenfalls willkommen. Einige grundlegende Strandinfrastrukturen sind hier verf&uuml;gbar, aber erwarten Sie nicht zu viel. Eine Strandbar ist hier vorhanden, ein Restaurant ist nicht verf&uuml;gbar. Der Strand hat eine L&auml;nge von 750 Metern, eine Breite von 30 Metern, die Strandneigung ist normal. Wenn Sie zum Wasser gehen und einen bequemen Wassereintritt haben, k&ouml;nnen Sie davon ausgehen, dass Sie bereits nach 5 Metern mit dem Schwimmen beginnen k&ouml;nnen. Unterk&uuml;nfte, insbesondere Apartments, sind in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3397, 'de', 1),
(1363, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na gr&scaron;ki plaži Profitis Ilias. Naravnih senc se ne najde zelo pogosto na plažah okoli mesta Maronia. Toda ta paralia, ali plaža, je drugačna, tu je nekaj sence. &Scaron;e vedno spada v regijo Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, je družinska plaža z me&scaron;anico peska, kamenčkov in velikih kamnov. Parkiranje je možno pred plažo, dobrodo&scaron;li so tudi avtodomi. Tu je na voljo nekaj osnovnih plažnih infrastruktur, vendar ne pričakujte preveč. Tu je na voljo tudi bar na plaži, restavracija ni na voljo. Plaža je dolga 750 metrov, &scaron;irina je 30 metrov, naklon plaže pa je normalen. Ko greste v vodo vas čaka udoben vstop v vodo, lahko tudi pričakujete, da boste začeli z plavanjem že pri 5 metrih. Nastanitev, zlasti apartmaji so na voljo v bližini. Uživajte na plaži z BeachRexom.', 3397, 'sl', 1),
(1364, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na grčku plažu Profitis Ilias. Prirodnu hladovinu ne nalazimo vrlo često na plažama oko grada Maronije. Ali ova paralija, ili plaža, je drugačija, ovdje ima neke hladovine. Jo&scaron; uvijek pripada Anatolijskoj regiji Makedonija kai Thraki, obiteljska je plaža s mje&scaron;avinom pijeska, &scaron;ljunka i velikog kamenja. Parkiranje je moguće ispred plaže, auto-kućice su također dobrodo&scaron;le. Ovdje je na raspolaganju neka osnovna infrastruktura za plažu, ali ne očekujte previ&scaron;e. Tu je i bar na plaži, restoran nije dostupan. Plaža je dugačka 750 metara, &scaron;iroka 30 metara, a nagib plaže je normalan. Kad uđete u vodu, čeka vas ugodan ulazak u vodu, također možete očekivati ​​da ćete početi plivati ​​već s 5 metara. Smje&scaron;taj, posebno apartmani dostupni su u blizini. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3397, 'hr', 1),
(1365, 'Beautifull beach with coastguard area ans one restaurant. Acces very easy near the road and parking.', 4173, 'en', 2),
(1366, 'Benvenuti in una bella spiaggia sabbiosa per famiglie, chiamata Paralia Kryoneri .. Situato nella regione Anatoliki Makedonia Kai Thraki, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Maronia, offre un enorme parcheggio proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. I bambini adoreranno questa bellezza, ma attenzione alle scogliere, in alcune parti si alzano davvero. L&#39;acqua &egrave; poco profonda e quindi perfetta per i bambini piccoli di giocare in sicurezza nell&#39;acqua. La spiaggia &egrave; molto lunga, pi&ugrave; di 1 chilometro e ha una larghezza massima di 40 metri. Quando si tratta di infrastrutture per la spiaggia, si pu&ograve; essere sicuri di avere molti elementi nell&#39;elenco. Alcuni campi sportivi sono disponibili qui e in estate un bagnino sta attento alla tua sicurezza. Non ci sono alberi sulla spiaggia, ma non preoccuparti, qui puoi noleggiare un ombrellone e una sedia a sdraio. Una volta che hai fame hai alcune opzioni da servire, un ristorante, un bar sulla spiaggia e un chiosco fast food sono disponibili qui. Se ti piace questa spiaggia e ti piacerebbe soggiornare qui per le tue vacanze estive, hai alcune opzioni di alloggio, principalmente in appartamenti e camere, e nelle vicinanze c&#39;&egrave; anche un campo. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3396, 'it', 1),
(1367, 'Bienvenue &agrave; une tr&egrave;s belle plage de sable familiale, appel&eacute;e Paralia Kryoneri .. Situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion d&#39;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, pr&egrave;s de la ville de Maronia, il offre une immense place de parking juste en face de la plage. Les enfants adoreront cette beaut&eacute;, mais attention aux falaises, sur certaines parties elles deviennent vraiment hautes. L&#39;eau est peu profonde, et donc parfaite pour les petits enfants &agrave; jouer en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. La plage est tr&egrave;s longue, plus d&#39;un kilom&egrave;tre et a une largeur maximale de 40 m&egrave;tres. En ce qui concerne les infrastructures de plage, vous pouvez &ecirc;tre s&ucirc;r d&#39;avoir de nombreux &eacute;l&eacute;ments sur la liste. Certains terrains de sport sont disponibles ici et en &eacute;t&eacute;, un ma&icirc;tre nageur veille &agrave; votre s&eacute;curit&eacute;. Aucun arbre n&#39;est situ&eacute; sur la plage, mais ne vous inqui&eacute;tez pas, vous pouvez &eacute;galement louer un parasol et un transat ici. Une fois que vous avez faim, vous avez quelques options &agrave; servir, un restaurant, un bar de plage et un kiosque de restauration rapide sont disponibles ici. Si vous aimez cette plage et que vous souhaitez y s&eacute;journer pour vos vacances d&#39;&eacute;t&eacute;, vous avez quelques options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, principalement dans des appartements et des chambres, et &agrave; proximit&eacute; il y a m&ecirc;me un camp. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3396, 'fr', 1),
(1368, 'Bienvenido a una playa familiar de arena muy bonita, llamada Paralia Kryoneri. Ubicada en la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, cerca de la ciudad de Maronia, ofrece un enorme estacionamiento justo enfrente de la playa. A los ni&ntilde;os les encantar&aacute; esta belleza, pero ten cuidado con los acantilados, en algunas partes se ponen muy altos. El agua es poco profunda y perfecta para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen con seguridad en el agua. La playa es muy larga, m&aacute;s de 1 kil&oacute;metro y tiene un ancho m&aacute;ximo de 40 metros. Cuando se trata de infraestructura de playa, puede estar seguro de tener muchos elementos en la lista. Algunos campos deportivos est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute; y en el verano un socorrista vigila su seguridad. No hay &aacute;rboles en la playa, pero no se preocupe, aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n puede alquilar una sombrilla y una tumbona. Una vez que tenga hambre, tiene algunas opciones para servir, un restaurante, un bar en la playa y un quiosco de comida r&aacute;pida est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;. Si te gusta esta playa y te gustar&iacute;a quedarte aqu&iacute; para tus vacaciones de verano, tienes algunas opciones de alojamiento, principalmente en apartamentos y habitaciones, y cerca hay incluso un campamento. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3396, 'es', 1),
(1369, 'Willkommen an einem wirklich sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand der Familie, Paralia Kryoneri. Es liegt in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki in der N&auml;he der Stadt Maronia und bietet einen riesigen Parkplatz direkt vor dem Strand. Kinder werden diese Sch&ouml;nheit lieben, aber achten Sie auf die Klippen, an einigen Stellen werden sie sehr hoch. Das Wasser ist flach und daher perfekt f&uuml;r kleine Kinder, um sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Der Strand ist sehr lang, mehr als 1 Kilometer und hat eine maximale Breite von 40 Metern. Wenn es um die Strandinfrastruktur geht, k&ouml;nnen Sie sicher sein, dass viele Elemente auf der Liste stehen. Einige Sportpl&auml;tze stehen hier zur Verf&uuml;gung und im Sommer achtet ein Rettungsschwimmer auf Ihre Sicherheit. Am Strand stehen keine B&auml;ume, aber keine Sorge, hier k&ouml;nnen Sie auch einen Sonnenschirm und einen Liegestuhl mieten. Wenn Sie hungrig werden, haben Sie einige M&ouml;glichkeiten, ein Restaurant, eine Strandbar und einen Fast-Food-Kiosk. Wenn Sie diesen Strand m&ouml;gen und f&uuml;r Ihre Sommerferien hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, haben Sie einige Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, haupts&auml;chlich in Apartments und Zimmern, und in der N&auml;he gibt es sogar ein Camp. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3396, 'de', 1),
(1370, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na res lepo pe&scaron;čeno družinsko plažo, imenovano Paralia Kryoneri. Nahaja se v regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, v bližini mesta Maronia, in vam ponuja ogromno parkiri&scaron;če tik pred plažo. Otroci bodo imeli radi to lepotico, vendar pazite na pečine, na nekaterih delih so resnično visoke. Voda je plitva in tako popolna za majhne otroke, da se lahko varno igrajo v vodi. Plaža je zelo dolga, več kot 1 kilometer in ima največjo &scaron;irino 40 metrov. Ko gre za infrastrukturo na plaži, ste lahko prepričani, da je na seznamu veliko elementov. Tu so na voljo nekateri &scaron;portni tereni, poleti pa re&scaron;evalec skrbi za svojo varnost. Na plaži ni nobenega drevja, vendar ne skrbite, tukaj lahko najamete senčnik in tudi ležalnik. Ko ste lačni, imate na voljo nekaj možnosti za postrežbo, tukaj so na voljo restavracija, bar na plaži in kiosk s hitro hrano. Če vam je ta plaža v&scaron;eč in bi se radi tu preživeli svoje poletne počitnice, imate nekaj možnosti za nastanitev, predvsem v apartmajih in sobah, v bližini pa je celo kamp. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3396, 'sl', 1),
(1371, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na zaista lijepu pje&scaron;čanu obiteljsku plažu koja se zove Paralia Kryoneri. Smje&scaron;ten je u regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, u blizini grada Maronia, i nudi vam ogromno parkirali&scaron;te točno ispred plaže. Djeca će voljeti ovu ljepotu, ali pazite na litice, u nekim su dijelovima one zaista visoke. Voda je plitka i toliko savr&scaron;ena za malu djecu da se mogu sigurno igrati u vodi. Plaža je vrlo dugačka, dugačka je vi&scaron;e od jednog kilometra i ima maksimalnu &scaron;irinu od 40 metara. Kada je u pitanju infrastruktura na plaži, možete biti sigurni da je na popisu mnogo stavki. Ovdje su na raspolaganju neki sportski tereni, a ljeti se spasilac brine za svoju sigurnost. Na plaži nema drveća, ali ne brinite, ovdje možete unajmiti suncobran i ležaljku. Kad ste gladni, na raspolaganju vam je nekoliko opcija, tu su restoran, bar na plaži i kiosk brze hrane. Ako vam se sviđa ova plaža i želite ovdje provesti svoj ljetni odmor, imate neke mogućnosti smje&scaron;taja, posebno u apartmanima i sobama, a u blizini je čak i kamp. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3396, 'hr', 1),
(1372, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia di Pržno. La regione montana di Tivat ha una costa mediterranea molto breve e non molte spiagge. L&#39;unica spiaggia che abbiamo visitato si chiama plaža Pržno e si trova vicino al villaggio Đura&scaron;evići. &Egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa con una delle sabbie pi&ugrave; pure del Montenegro, che la rende davvero unica. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e hai un sacco di posti auto, quasi direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. &Egrave; una spiaggia lunga 300 metri e larga fino a 30 metri con una pendenza molto piccola. Alcuni alberi di pino sono anche sulla spiaggia e si trovano principalmente intorno al ristorante. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia abbastanza tardi, a circa 50 metri, il che rende questa spiaggia ideale per i bambini piccoli che giocano in acqua in sicurezza. Hai un sacco di infrastrutture balneari disponibili qui. Un ristorante e un bar sulla spiaggia si trovano direttamente sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione non &egrave; disponibile direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma nel vicino villaggio, sotto forma di appartamenti.', 3785, 'it', 1),
(1373, 'Bienvenue &agrave; la plage de Pržno.La r&eacute;gion du Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro Tivat a une c&ocirc;te m&eacute;diterran&eacute;enne tr&egrave;s courte et peu de plages. La seule plage que nous avons visit&eacute;e s&#39;appelle plaža Pržno et se situe pr&egrave;s du village Villageura&scaron;evići. C&#39;est une plage de sable avec l&#39;un des sables de plage les plus purs du Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro, ce qui la rend vraiment unique. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de l&#39;atteindre avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez de nombreuses places de parking, presque directement en face de la plage. C&#39;est une plage de 300 m&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 30 m&egrave;tres de large avec une tr&egrave;s petite pente. Certains pins sont &eacute;galement sur la plage et sont principalement situ&eacute;s autour du restaurant. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence assez tard, &agrave; environ 50 m&egrave;tres, ce qui rend cette plage id&eacute;ale pour les petits enfants pour jouer dans l&#39;eau en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;. Vous avez beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage disponibles ici. Un restaurant et un bar de plage sont &eacute;galement situ&eacute;s directement sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas disponible directement sur la plage, mais dans le village voisin, sous forme d&#39;appartements.', 3785, 'fr', 1),
(1374, 'Bienvenido a la playa Pržno. La regi&oacute;n de Montenegro Tivat tiene una costa mediterr&aacute;nea muy corta y no muchas playas. La &uacute;nica playa que hemos visitado se llama plaža Pržno y se encuentra cerca del pueblo Đura&scaron;evići. Es una playa de arena con una de las arenas de playa m&aacute;s puras de Montenegro, lo que la hace realmente &uacute;nica. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a &eacute;l con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tiene muchos espacios de estacionamiento, casi directamente frente a la playa. Es una playa de 300 metros de largo y hasta 30 metros de ancho con una pendiente muy peque&ntilde;a. Algunos pinos tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n en la playa y se encuentran principalmente alrededor del restaurante. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza bastante tarde, a unos 50 metros, lo que hace que esta playa sea ideal para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen en el agua de manera segura. Tienes mucha infraestructura de playa disponible aqu&iacute;. Un restaurante y un bar en la playa tambi&eacute;n se encuentran directamente en la playa. El alojamiento no est&aacute; disponible directamente en la playa, sino en el pueblo cercano, en forma de apartamentos.', 3785, 'es', 1),
(1375, 'Willkommen am Strand Pržno. Die montenegrinische Region Tivat hat eine sehr kurze Mittelmeerk&uuml;ste und nicht viele Str&auml;nde. Der einzige Strand, den wir besucht haben, hei&szlig;t plaža Pržno und befindet sich in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Đura&scaron;evići. Es ist ein Sandstrand mit einem der reinsten Strandsande in Montenegro, was ihn wirklich einzigartig macht. Es ist sehr einfach ihn zu erreichen und Sie haben viele Parkpl&auml;tze, fast direkt vor dem Strand. Es ist ein 300 Meter langer und bis zu 30 Meter breiter Strand mit einer sehr kleinen Steigung. Einige Kiefern stehen auch am Strand und befinden sich meist rund um das Restaurant. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt ziemlich sp&auml;t mit etwa 50 Metern, was diesen Strand ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder macht, um sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Hier steht Ihnen eine gro&szlig;e Auswahl von der Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung. Ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar befinden sich ebenfalls direkt am Strand. Die Unterbringung erfolgt nicht direkt am Strand, sondern im nahe gelegenen Dorf in Form von Apartments.', 3785, 'de', 1),
(1376, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Pržno. Črnogorska regija Tivat ima zelo kratko mediteransko obalo in ne veliko plaž. Plaža, ki smo jo obiskali, se imenuje plaža Pržno in se nahaja v bližini vasi Đura&scaron;evići. To je pe&scaron;čena plaža z enim najčistej&scaron;ih peskov v Črni gori, zaradi česar je res edinstvena. Dostop do plaže je z vozilom zelo enostaven, in skoraj pred plažo samo imate na voljo veliko parkirnih mest. Gre za 300 metrov dolgo in do 30 metrov &scaron;iroko plažo z zelo majhnim naklonom. Nekaj borovih dreves je tudi na plaži in se večinoma nahajajo okoli restavracije. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne precej pozno, pri približno 50 metrih, zaradi česar je ta plaža idealna za majhne otroke, da se lahko varno igrajo v vodi. Tu imate na voljo veliko infrastrukture za plažo. Restavracija in bar na plaži sta prav tako name&scaron;čena neposredno na plaži. Namestitev ni na voljo neposredno na plaži, ampak v vasi v bližini, v obliki apartmajev.', 3785, 'sl', 1),
(1377, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Pržno. Crnogorska regija Tivat ima vrlo kratku mediteransku obalu i nema mnogo plaža. Plaža koju smo posjetili zove se plaža Pržno i nalazi se u blizini sela Đura&scaron;evići. To je pje&scaron;čana plaža s jednim od najči&scaron;ćih pijeska u Crnoj Gori, &scaron;to je čini jedinstvenom. Pristup plaži vrlo je jednostavan automobilom, a gotovo ispred plaže imate samo puno parkirnih mjesta. Plaža je dugačka 300 metara i do 30 metara, s vrlo malim nagibom. Na plaži ima i nekoliko borova, a uglavnom su smje&scaron;tene oko restorana. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje prilično kasno, na oko 50 metara, &scaron;to ovu plažu čini idealnom za malu djecu da se mogu sigurno igrati u vodi. Ovdje je na raspolaganju mnogo infrastruktura za plažu. Restoran i bar na plaži također su smje&scaron;teni direktno na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj nije dostupan direktno na plaži, već u obližnjem selu, u obliku apartmana.', 3785, 'hr', 1),
(1378, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenue &agrave; la plage Hamallaj. La plage albanaise Plazhi Hamallaj est situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion de Durr&euml;s, connue pour sa magnifique c&ocirc;te de sable sur la mer Adriatique. C&#39;est une tr&egrave;s longue plage de sable principalement adapt&eacute;e aux familles. La route de la plage est en bon &eacute;tat et vous pouvez garer votre v&eacute;hicule directement en face de la plage juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; des bars et restaurants de la plage. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 75 m&egrave;tres de large, vous avez vraiment beaucoup d&#39;espace ici. L&rsquo;inclinaison de la plage est tr&egrave;s mod&eacute;r&eacute;e, tout &agrave; fait normale, tout comme l&rsquo;entr&eacute;e d&rsquo;eau, et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager entre 30 et 40 m&egrave;tres de distance du rivage. Vous avez des services de plage disponibles directement sur la plage, o&ugrave; vous pouvez &eacute;galement louer du mat&eacute;riel de plage, comme des parasols et des chaises longues. Des bars de plage et des restaurants sont &eacute;galement disponibles sur la plage. Il en va de m&ecirc;me pour l&#39;h&eacute;bergement, o&ugrave; vous avez un nouveau complexe d&#39;appartements situ&eacute; directement sur la plage et un camping &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.</div>\n', 3733, 'fr', 1),
(1379, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Benvenuti sulla spiaggia di Hamallaj. La spiaggia albanese Plazhi Hamallaj si trova nella regione di Durazzo, nota per la sua bellissima costa sabbiosa sul mare Adriatico. &Egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa molto lunga adatta principalmente alle famiglie. La strada per la spiaggia &egrave; in buone condizioni e puoi parcheggiare il tuo veicolo direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, proprio accanto ai bar e ai ristoranti della spiaggia. La stessa spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga fino a 75 metri, qui c&#39;&egrave; davvero molto spazio. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; molto moderata, abbastanza normale, cos&igrave; come l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua, e puoi iniziare a nuotare tra 30 e 40 metri di distanza dal litorale. Hai alcuni servizi in spiaggia disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia, dove puoi anche noleggiare alcune attrezzature da spiaggia, come ombrelloni e lettini. Bar sulla spiaggia e ristoranti sono disponibili anche sulla spiaggia. Lo stesso vale per l&#39;alloggio, dove hai un nuovo complesso di appartamenti situato direttamente sulla spiaggia e un campeggio nelle vicinanze. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3733, 'it', 1),
(1380, 'Bienvenido a la playa Hamallaj. La playa albanesa Plazhi Hamallaj se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Durr&euml;s, conocida por su hermosa costa arenosa en el mar Adri&aacute;tico. Es una playa de arena muy larga principalmente apta para familias. El camino a la playa est&aacute; en buenas condiciones y puede estacionar su veh&iacute;culo directamente frente a la playa, justo al lado de los bares y restaurantes de la playa. La playa en s&iacute; es de varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 75 metros de ancho, realmente tienes mucho espacio aqu&iacute;. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es muy moderada, bastante normal, al igual que la entrada del agua, y puede comenzar a nadar entre 30 y 40 metros de distancia de la costa. Tiene algunos servicios de playa disponibles directamente en la playa, donde tambi&eacute;n puede alquilar algunos equipos de playa, como sombrillas y tumbonas. Los bares y restaurantes de la playa est&aacute;n disponibles tambi&eacute;n en la playa. Lo mismo ocurre con el alojamiento, donde tiene un nuevo complejo de apartamentos ubicado directamente en la playa y un camping cercano. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3733, 'es', 1),
(1381, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Willkommen am Strand von Hamallaj. Der albanische Strand Plazhi Hamallaj befindet sich in der Region Durr&euml;s, die f&uuml;r ihre wundersch&ouml;ne Sandk&uuml;ste an der Adria bekannt ist. Es ist ein sehr langer Sandstrand, der haupts&auml;chlich f&uuml;r Familien geeignet ist. Die Stra&szlig;e zum Strand ist in gutem Zustand und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug direkt vor dem Strand direkt neben den Strandbars und Restaurants parken. Der Strand selbst ist mehrere Kilometer lang und bis zu 75 Meter breit, hier haben Sie wirklich viel Platz. Die Neigung des Strandes ist sehr moderat, ganz normal, ebenso wie der Wassereintritt, und Sie k&ouml;nnen zwischen 30 und 40 Metern Entfernung von der K&uuml;ste mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Sie haben einige Stranddienstleistungen direkt am Strand, wo Sie auch Strandausr&uuml;stung, wie Sonnenschirme und Sonnenliegen, mieten k&ouml;nnen. Am Strand gibt es auch Strandbars und Restaurants. Gleiches gilt f&uuml;r Unterk&uuml;nfte, bei denen Sie einen neuen Apartmentkomplex direkt am Strand und einen Campingplatz in der N&auml;he haben. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3733, 'de', 1),
(1382, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Hamallaj. Albanska plaža Plazhi Hamallaj se nahaja v regiji Drač, znani po čudoviti pe&scaron;čeni obali na Jadranskem morju. Gre za zelo dolgo pe&scaron;čeno plažo, ki je primerna predvsem za družine. Cesta do plaže je v dobrem stanju, vozilo pa lahko parkirate neposredno pred plažo tik ob plažnih barih in restavracijah. Sama plaža je dolga nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka do 75 metrov, tukaj imate res veliko prostora. Naklon plaže je zelo zmeren, povsem običajen, tako je tudi vstop v vodo, plavati pa lahko začnete med 30 in 40 metri razdalje od obale. Na voljo imate nekaj storitev na plaži neposredno na plaži sami, kjer lahko najamete tudi nekaj opreme za plažo, kot so marele in ležalniki. Na plaži so na voljo tudi bari na plaži in restavracije. Enako velja za nastanitev, kjer imate na voljo nov apartmajski kompleks, ki se nahaja neposredno na plaži, v bližini pa je tudi kamp. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3733, 'sl', 1),
(1383, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Hamallaj. Albanska plaža Plazhi Hamallaj nalazi se u regiji Drač, poznatoj po lijepoj pje&scaron;čanoj obali u Jadranskom moru. To je vrlo duga pje&scaron;čana plaža, pogodna posebno za obitelji. Put do plaže je u dobrom stanju, a svoj automobil možete parkirati neposredno ispred plaže odmah pored beach barova i restorana. Sama plaža duga je nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka je do 75 metara, ovdje imate puno prostora. Nagib plaže je vrlo umjeren, sasvim normalan, pa je i ulaz u vodu, a možete početi plivati ​​između 30 i 40 metara od obale. Na plaži su dostupne neke usluge na plaži, gdje možete unajmiti i neku opremu za plažu, poput pregača i ležaljki. Na plaži su također dostupni barovi i restorani na plaži. Isto se odnosi i na smje&scaron;taj u kojem imate na raspolaganju novi apartmanski kompleks, smje&scaron;ten direktno na plaži, a u blizini je i kamp. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.</div>\n', 3733, 'hr', 1),
(1384, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Benvenuti sulla spiaggia albanese Plazhi Gjiri i Lal&euml;zit 1. Si trova nella regione di Durazzo ed &egrave; una delle ultime spiagge molto lunghe nel nord di questa regione. Questa spiaggia sabbiosa &egrave; molto lunga, lunga pochi chilometri ed &egrave; larga pi&ugrave; di 100 metri. Le famiglie adoreranno questo posto, specialmente quelli con bambini, perch&eacute; qui si trovano molti parchi giochi per bambini. Hai un sacco di opzioni di parcheggio qui e puoi parcheggiare direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, vicino a bar e ristoranti sulla spiaggia. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; normale, cos&igrave; come l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua e puoi iniziare a nuotare tra 30 e 40 metri di distanza dal litorale. Hai molti servizi di spiaggia di alta qualit&agrave; disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia, dove puoi anche noleggiare alcune attrezzature da spiaggia, pedal&ograve; e cos&igrave; via. Sulla spiaggia sono disponibili bar sulla spiaggia e ristoranti di ogni tipo di cucina. Lo stesso vale per l&#39;alloggio, sullo sfondo della spiaggia si trovano: un nuovo complesso di appartamenti, resort e hotel. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3734, 'it', 1),
(1385, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenue sur la plage albanaise Plazhi Gjiri i Lal&euml;zit 1. Elle est situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion de Durr&euml;s et est l&#39;une des derni&egrave;res tr&egrave;s longues plages du nord de cette r&eacute;gion. Cette plage de sable est tr&egrave;s longue, longue de quelques kilom&egrave;tres et large de plus de 100 m&egrave;tres. Les familles adoreront cet endroit, en particulier celles avec des enfants, car de nombreuses aires de jeux pour enfants se trouvent ici. Vous avez beaucoup d&#39;options de stationnement ici, et vous pouvez vous garer directement en face de la plage, &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; des bars et des restaurants de la plage. L&rsquo;inclinaison de la plage est normale, tout comme l&rsquo;entr&eacute;e de l&rsquo;eau et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager entre 30 et 40 m&egrave;tres du rivage. Vous avez beaucoup de services de plage de haute qualit&eacute; disponibles directement sur la plage, o&ugrave; vous pouvez &eacute;galement louer du mat&eacute;riel de plage, des p&eacute;dalos, etc. Des bars de plage et des restaurants de toutes sortes de cuisines sont &eacute;galement disponibles sur la plage. Il en va de m&ecirc;me pour l&#39;h&eacute;bergement, au fond de la plage se trouvent: un nouveau complexe d&#39;appartements, des stations baln&eacute;aires et des h&ocirc;tels. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.</div>\n', 3734, 'fr', 1),
(1386, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenido a la playa albanesa Plazhi Gjiri i Lal&euml;zit 1. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Durr&euml;s y es una de las &uacute;ltimas playas muy largas en el norte de esta regi&oacute;n. Esta playa de arena es muy larga, de unos pocos kil&oacute;metros de largo y tiene m&aacute;s de 100 metros de ancho. Las familias adorar&aacute;n este lugar, especialmente aquellas con ni&ntilde;os, porque aqu&iacute; hay muchos parques infantiles. Aqu&iacute; tiene muchas opciones de estacionamiento, y puede estacionar directamente frente a la playa, al lado de los bares y restaurantes de la playa. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es normal, tambi&eacute;n lo es la entrada de agua y puede comenzar a nadar entre 30 y 40 metros de distancia de la costa. Usted tiene muchos servicios de playa de alta calidad disponibles directamente en la playa, donde tambi&eacute;n puede alquilar algunos equipos de playa, botes de remo, etc. Los bares de playa y restaurantes de todo tipo de cocina tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles en la playa. Lo mismo ocurre con el alojamiento, en el fondo de la playa se encuentran: un nuevo complejo de apartamentos, resorts y hoteles. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3734, 'es', 1),
(1387, 'Willkommen am albanischen Strand Plazhi Gjiri i Lal&euml;zit 1. Er befindet sich in der Region Durr&euml;s und ist einer der letzten sehr langen Str&auml;nde im Norden dieser Region. Dieser Sandstrand ist sehr lang, einige Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit. Familien werden diesen Ort lieben, besonders diejenigen mit Kindern, da sich hier viele Kinderspielpl&auml;tze befinden. Sie haben hier viele Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten und k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand neben den Strandbars und Restaurants parken. Die Neigung des Strandes ist normal, ebenso wie der Wassereintritt. Sie k&ouml;nnen zwischen 30 und 40 Meter von der K&uuml;ste entfernt wegschwimmen. Sie haben viele hochwertige Stranddienstleistungen direkt am Strand, wo Sie auch Strandausr&uuml;stung, Paddelboote usw. mieten k&ouml;nnen. Am Strand gibt es auch Strandbars und Restaurants aller Art. Gleiches gilt f&uuml;r die Unterbringung, im Hintergrund des Strandes befinden sich: ein neuer Apartmentkomplex, Resorts und Hotels. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3734, 'de', 1),
(1388, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na albanski plaži Plazhi Gjiri i Lal&euml;zit 1. Nahaja se v regiji Drač in je ena zadnjih zelo dolgih plaž na severu te regije. Ta pe&scaron;čena plaža je zelo dolga, nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka več kot 100 metrov. Družine bodo vzljubile ta kraj, &scaron;e posebej tiste z otroki, saj se tu nahaja veliko otro&scaron;kih igri&scaron;č in igral. Tu imate veliko možnosti parkiranja in lahko parkirate neposredno pred plažo, poleg barov na plaži in restavracij. Naklon plaže je običajen, tako je tudi vstop v vodo in plavati lahko začnete med 30 in 40 metri oddaljenosti od obale. Na plaži imate na voljo veliko kakovostnih storitev na plaži, kjer lahko najamete tudi nekaj opreme za plažo, čolne, pendolino, ležalnike,.... Na plaži so na voljo tudi bari na plaži in restavracije vseh vrst kuhinj. Enako velja za nastanitev, v ozadju plaže se nahajajo: nov apartmajski kompleks, letovi&scaron;ča in hoteli. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3734, 'sl', 1),
(1389, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na albansku plažu Plazhi Gjiri i Lal&euml;zit 1. Nalazi se u regiji Drač i jedna je od posljednjih vrlo dugih plaža na sjeveru ove regije. Ova pje&scaron;čana plaža vrlo je dugačka, nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka vi&scaron;e od 100 metara. Obitelji će voljeti ovo mjesto, posebno one s djecom, jer ovdje ima mnogo igrali&scaron;ta i igrali&scaron;ta. Ovdje ima puno mogućnosti parkiranja, a možete parkirati ispred plaže, pored beach barova i restorana. Nagib plaže je normalan, pa je i ulaz u vodu i možete početi plivati ​​između 30 i 40 metara od obale. Na plaži imate puno kvalitetnih usluga na plaži, gdje možete unajmiti ne&scaron;to opreme za plažu, čamce, pendolino, ležaljke, .... Na plaži se nalaze i beach barovi i restorani svih vrsta. Isto se odnosi i na smje&scaron;taj, u pozadini plaže nalaze se: novi apartmanski kompleks, odmarali&scaron;ta i hoteli. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.</div>\n', 3734, 'hr', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1390, 'Benvenuti nella speciale spiaggia albanese, Plazhi Tal&euml;. Una delle prime spiagge sabbiose molto lunghe quando si viaggia lungo la costa albanese da sud a nord, nella regione di Lezh&euml;, &egrave; la spiaggia Plazhi Tal&euml;. &Egrave; facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo ed &egrave; un must se sei un fan delle spiagge dove &egrave; possibile parcheggiare e guidare direttamente sulla spiaggia. Prima di raggiungere la spiaggia sabbiosa, &egrave; necessario svoltare dalla strada principale verso il mare e percorrere alcune centinaia di metri su una strada sterrata. Una volta sulla spiaggia, puoi guidare oltre e scegliere il tuo parcheggio ovunque tu voglia direttamente sulla sabbia della spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; completamente di sabbia, &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga fino a 100 metri. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia quasi immediatamente. Molte infrastrutture balneari si trovano qui e molti servizi di spiaggia sono a vostra disposizione. Ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia sono anche qui, cos&igrave; come molti ristoranti fast food. Alcuni ristoranti si trovano anche sui moli, per darti un&#39;esperienza culinaria ancora pi&ugrave; speciale. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile proprio accanto alla spiaggia, principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti, hotel e alcuni complessi di appartamenti. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3735, 'it', 1),
(1391, 'Bienvenue sur la plage albanaise tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale, Plazhi Tal&euml;. La plage Plazhi Tal&euml; est l&#39;une des premi&egrave;res tr&egrave;s longues plages de sable en remontant le littoral albanais du sud au nord, dans la r&eacute;gion de Lezh&euml;. Il est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et est un incontournable si vous &ecirc;tes un fan des plages o&ugrave; vous pouvez vous garer et conduire directement sur la plage. Avant d&#39;atteindre la plage de sable, vous devez tourner de la route principale vers la mer et parcourir quelques centaines de m&egrave;tres sur un chemin de terre. Une fois sur la plage, vous pouvez conduire plus loin et choisir votre place de parking o&ugrave; vous le souhaitez directement sur le sable de la plage. La plage est enti&egrave;rement faite de sable, elle fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 100 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence presque imm&eacute;diatement. De nombreuses infrastructures de plage se trouvent ici et de nombreux services de plage sont &agrave; votre disposition. Restaurants et bars de plage sont &eacute;galement l&agrave;, ainsi que de nombreux restaurants de restauration rapide. Certains restaurants sont &eacute;galement situ&eacute;s sur des piliers, pour vous offrir une exp&eacute;rience culinaire encore plus sp&eacute;ciale. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, principalement sous la forme d&#39;appartements, d&#39;h&ocirc;tels et de certains complexes d&#39;appartements. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3735, 'fr', 1),
(1392, 'Bienvenido a la playa albanesa muy especial, Plazhi Tal&euml;. Una de las primeras playas de arena muy largas cuando se viaja por la costa albanesa de sur a norte, en la regi&oacute;n de Lezh&euml;, es la playa Plazhi Tal&euml;. Es de f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y es imprescindible si eres fan&aacute;tico de las playas donde puedes estacionar y conducir directamente en la playa. Antes de llegar a la playa de arena, debe girar desde la carretera principal hacia el mar y conducir unos cientos de metros por un camino de tierra. Una vez en la playa, puede conducir m&aacute;s lejos y elegir su lugar de estacionamiento en cualquier lugar que desee directamente en la arena de la playa. La playa est&aacute; completamente hecha de arena, tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 100 metros de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza casi de inmediato. Aqu&iacute; se encuentra mucha infraestructura de playa y muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n a su disposici&oacute;n. Tambi&eacute;n hay restaurantes y bares de playa, as&iacute; como muchos restaurantes de comida r&aacute;pida. Algunos restaurantes tambi&eacute;n se encuentran en muelles, para brindarle una experiencia gastron&oacute;mica a&uacute;n m&aacute;s especial. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible justo al lado de la playa, principalmente en forma de apartamentos, hoteles y algunos complejos de apartamentos. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3735, 'es', 1),
(1393, 'Willkommen am einen ganz besonderen albanischen Strand, Plazhi Tal&euml;. Einer der ersten sehr langen Sandstr&auml;nde in der Region Lezh&euml; entlang der albanischen K&uuml;ste, von S&uuml;den nach Norden, ist der Strand Plazhi Tal&euml;. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und ein Muss, wenn Sie ein Fan von Str&auml;nden sind, an denen Sie parken und direkt am Strand fahren k&ouml;nnen. Bevor Sie den Sandstrand erreichen, m&uuml;ssen Sie von der Hauptstra&szlig;e in Richtung Meer abbiegen und einige hundert Meter auf einer unbefestigten Stra&szlig;e fahren. Sobald Sie am Strand angekommen sind, k&ouml;nnen Sie weiterfahren und Ihren Parkplatz &uuml;berall im Sand des Strandes ausw&auml;hlen. Der Strand besteht komplett aus Sand, ist mehrere Kilometer lang und bis zu 100 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt fast sofort. Hier befindet sich viel Strandinfrastruktur und viele Stranddienstleistungen stehen zu Ihrer Verf&uuml;gung. Hier finden Sie auch Restaurants und Strandbars, sowie viele Fast-Food-Restaurants. Einige Restaurants befinden sich auch auf Piers, um Ihnen ein noch spezielleres Speiseerlebnis zu bieten. Die Unterbringung erfolgt direkt am Strand, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Apartments, Hotels und einigen Apartmentkomplexen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3735, 'de', 1),
(1394, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na zelo posebni albanski plaži, Plazhi Tal&euml;. Med prvimi zelo dolgimi pe&scaron;čenimi plažami, ko potujete po albanski obali od juga proti severu, v regiji Lež&euml;, je plaža Plazhi Tal&euml;. Je zelo lahko dostopna s kakr&scaron;nimi koli vozili in jo morate obiskati, če ste ljubitelj tak&scaron;nih plaž, na katerih lahko parkirate in vozite neposredno na plaži sami. Preden pridete do pe&scaron;čene plaže, morate zaviti z glavne ceste proti morju in nekaj sto metrov zapeljati po makadamski cesti. Ko ste v va&scaron;im vozilom, tudi avtodomom na na plaži, se lahko zapeljete naprej in izberete svoje parkiri&scaron;če kjer koli želite neposredno na pesku plaže. Plaža je v celoti narejena iz peska, dolga je nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka do 100 metrov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne skoraj takoj. Tu se nahaja veliko plažne infrastrukture in na voljo so vam &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži. Tu so tudi restavracije in bari na plaži, pa tudi &scaron;tevilne restavracije s hitro hrano. Nekatere restavracije se nahajajo tudi na pomolih, kjer boste &scaron;e bližje morju in bo okusna albanska kuhinja &scaron;e bolj aromatična. Nastanitev je na voljo tik ob plaži, predvsem v obliki apartmajev, hotelov in nekaterih apartmajskih kompleksov. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3735, 'sl', 1),
(1395, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na vrlo posebnu albansku plažu, Plazhi Tal&euml;. Među prvim vrlo dugim pje&scaron;čanim plažama na putovanju duž albanske obale od juga do sjevera, u regiji Leže, je plaža Plazhi Tal&euml;. Vrlo je lako dostupan bilo kojim vozilima i trebali biste ga posjetiti ako ste ljubitelj takvih plaža na kojima možete sami parkirati i voziti se direktno plažom. Prije nego &scaron;to dođete do pje&scaron;čane plaže, morate skrenuti s glavne ceste prema moru i voziti nekoliko stotina metara makadamskom cestom. Jednom kada ste u svom vozilu, čak i kućici za odmor na plaži, možete voziti unaprijed i odabrati svoje parkirali&scaron;te gdje god želite izravno na pijesku na plaži. Plaža je napravljena u cijelosti od pijeska, duga je nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka je do 100 metara. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i plivanje započinje gotovo odmah. Ovdje je puno plaže plaže i mnoge usluge na plaži su vam na raspolaganju. Tu su i restorani i barovi na plaži, kao i mnogi restorani brze hrane. Neki su restorani također smje&scaron;teni na pristani&scaron;tima, gdje ćete biti jo&scaron; bliže moru i ukusna albanska kuhinja bit će jo&scaron; aromatičnija. Smje&scaron;taj je moguć odmah do plaže, uglavnom u obliku apartmana, hotela i nekih apartmanskih kompleksa. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3735, 'hr', 1),
(1396, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia albanese Plazhi Kun&euml;. Questo paese dei Balcani &egrave; noto per la sua bellezza, in particolare per i suoi parchi naturali. Vicino alla citt&agrave; di Sh&euml;ngjin. situato sulla costa adriatica, &egrave; possibile trovare il Parco Naturale Kun&euml;-Vain-Tale, che offre agli appassionati di spiaggia una lunghissima spiaggia sabbiosa. Fa parte della regione di Lezh&euml;, vicino al villaggio di Stomi i Madh. &Egrave; facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi lasciare la tua auto accanto alla strada, direttamente sulla spiaggia. Complessivamente la spiaggia &egrave; lunga pochi chilometri e larga fino a 40 metri. &Egrave; separato in molti quartieri, dove si trovano molti bar sulla spiaggia. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 40 m. La maggior parte delle infrastrutture e dei servizi sulla spiaggia sono disponibili nelle vicinanze dei bar e dei ristoranti sulla spiaggia, in altre parti non &egrave; disponibile alcun servizio. &Egrave; disponibile anche l&#39;alloggio, ma non direttamente sulla spiaggia, il primo hotel &egrave; a soli 300 metri di distanza, altri sono disponibili verso la citt&agrave; di Sh&euml;ngjin. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3736, 'it', 1),
(1397, 'Bienvenue sur la plage albanaise Plazhi Kun&euml;. Ce pays des Balkans est connu pour sa beaut&eacute;, notamment pour ses parcs naturels. Pr&egrave;s de la ville Sh&euml;ngjin. situ&eacute; sur la c&ocirc;te Adriatique, se trouve le parc naturel Kun&euml;-Vain-Tale, qui offre aux amateurs de plage une tr&egrave;s longue plage de sable. Il fait partie de la r&eacute;gion Lezh&euml;, pr&egrave;s du village Stomi i Madh. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez laisser votre voiture au bord de la route, directement &agrave; la plage. Au total, la plage mesure quelques kilom&egrave;tres de long et 40 m&egrave;tres de large. Il est s&eacute;par&eacute; en plusieurs quartiers, o&ugrave; vous trouverez de nombreux bars de plage. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence &agrave; environ 40 m. La plupart des infrastructures et services de plage sont disponibles &agrave; proximit&eacute; des bars et des restaurants de plage, sur d&#39;autres parties, vous n&#39;avez aucun service. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement disponible, mais pas directement sur la plage, le premier h&ocirc;tel est &agrave; seulement 300 m&egrave;tres, d&#39;autres sont disponibles en direction de la ville de Sh&euml;ngjin. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3736, 'fr', 1),
(1398, 'Bienvenido a la playa albanesa Plazhi Kun&euml;. Este pa&iacute;s balc&aacute;nico es conocido por su belleza, especialmente por sus parques naturales. Cerca de la ciudad Sh&euml;ngjin. ubicado en la costa del Adri&aacute;tico, se encuentra el Parque Natural Kun&euml;-Vain-Tale, que ofrece a los entusiastas de la playa una playa de arena muy larga. Es parte de la regi&oacute;n de Lezh&euml;, cerca del pueblo Stomi i Madh. Es de f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y puede dejar su autom&oacute;vil al lado de la carretera, directamente en la playa. En total, la playa tiene unos pocos kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 40 metros de ancho. Est&aacute; separado en muchos barrios, donde tienes muchos chiringuitos ubicados. La entrada de agua es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza a unos 40 m. La mayor&iacute;a de la infraestructura y los servicios de la playa est&aacute;n disponibles en las cercan&iacute;as de los bares y restaurantes de la playa, en otras partes no tiene servicio. Tambi&eacute;n hay alojamiento disponible, pero no directamente en la playa, el primer hotel est&aacute; a solo 300 metros de distancia, hay m&aacute;s disponibles hacia la ciudad de Sh&euml;ngjin. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3736, 'es', 1),
(1399, 'Willkommen am albanischen Strand Plazhi Kun&euml;. Dieses Balkanland ist bekannt f&uuml;r seine Sch&ouml;nheit, insbesondere f&uuml;r seine Naturparks. In der N&auml;he der Stadt Sh&euml;ngjin. An der Adriak&uuml;ste befindet sich der Naturpark Kun&euml;-Vain-Tale, der dem Strandliebhaber einen sehr langen Sandstrand bietet. Es ist Teil der Region Lezh&euml;, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Stomi i Madh. Der Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht erreichbar und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Auto direkt am Strand neben der Stra&szlig;e stehen lassen. Insgesamt ist der Strand einige Kilometer lang und bis zu 40 Meter breit. Es ist in viele Viertel unterteilt, in denen sich viele Strandbars befinden. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 40 m. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen ist in der N&auml;he der Strandbars und Restaurants verf&uuml;gbar, an anderen Stellen haben Sie keinen Dienstleistungen. Unterkunft ist auch verf&uuml;gbar, aber nicht direkt am Strand, das erste Hotel ist nur 300 Meter entfernt, weitere sind in Richtung der Stadt Sh&euml;ngjin verf&uuml;gbar. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3736, 'de', 1),
(1400, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na albanski plaži Plazhi Kun&euml;. Ta balkanska država je znana po svojih lepotah, predvsem po naravnih parkih. V bližini mesta Sh&euml;ngjin, na jadranski obali, najdete naravni park Kun&euml;-Vain-Tale, ki ljubiteljem plaže ponuja zelo dolgo pe&scaron;čeno plažo. Je del regije Lezh&euml;, v bližini vasi Stomi i Madh. Je zelo lahko dostopna s katero koli vrsto vozila, avtomobil pa lahko pustite ob cesti, neposredno ob plaži. Skupno je plaža dolga nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka do 40 metrov. Razdeljena je na &scaron;tevilne dele, kjer se nahaja veliko barov na plaži. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne na približno 40 m. Večina infrastrukture in storitev na plaži je na voljo v bližini barov na plaži in restavracij, na drugih delih nimate storitev. Nastanitev je tudi na voljo, vendar ne na plaži neposredno, prvi hotel je oddaljen le 300 metrov, več je na voljo proti mestu Sh&euml;ngjin. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3736, 'sl', 1),
(1401, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na albansku plažu Plazhi Kun&euml;. Ova balkanska država poznata je po svojoj ljepoti, posebno u parkovima prirode. U blizini Sh&euml;ngjina, na jadranskoj obali, naći ćete park prirode Kun&euml;-Vain-Tale, koji ljubiteljima plaže nudi vrlo dugu pje&scaron;čanu plažu. Dio je regije Lezh&euml;, u blizini sela Stomi i Madh. Vrlo je lako dostupan bilo kojoj vrsti vozila, a automobil se može ostaviti uz cestu, direktno na plaži. Ukupno, plaža je duga nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka do 40 metara. Podijeljen je na mnogo dijelova gdje se na plaži nalazi mnogo barova. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep, a kupanje započinje na oko 40 m. Većina infrastrukture i usluga na plaži dostupna je u blizini beach barova i restorana, u ostalim dijelovima nemate usluge. Smje&scaron;taj je također dostupan, ali ne na samoj plaži, prvi hotel je udaljen samo 300 metara, vi&scaron;e je na raspolaganju prema gradu Sh&euml;ngjin. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3736, 'hr', 1),
(1402, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia di Sh&euml;ngjin. Questa spiaggia cittadina &egrave; una popolare destinazione turistica albanese. Se sei un fan di una lunga spiaggia sabbiosa, con molti hotel, negozi e bar sulla spiaggia situati direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, e ti piacciono anche molti servizi turistici a tua disposizione, questa spiaggia dovrebbe essere la tua prossima vacanza al mare. La regione di Lezh&euml; si trova in Albania, direttamente sulla costa adriatica. Indipendentemente dal tipo di veicolo che stai guidando, raggiungerai facilmente questa posizione e potrai parcheggiare vicino alla strada o in alcuni parcheggi pubblici. La stessa spiaggia &egrave; lunga 3 chilometri e larga fino a 75 metri. L&#39;ingresso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 30 metri. Su una parte della spiaggia hai anche una foresta di pini per darti un po &#39;d&#39;ombra naturale. Su questa spiaggia non avrai problemi a trovare la sistemazione giusta per te. A pochi metri dalla spiaggia sono disponibili numerosi hotel e appartamenti di ogni genere. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3737, 'it', 1),
(1403, 'Bienvenue &agrave; la plage Sh&euml;ngjin. Cette plage de la ville est une destination touristique populaire albanaise. Si vous &ecirc;tes fan d&#39;une longue plage de sable, avec de nombreux h&ocirc;tels, boutiques et bars de plage situ&eacute;s juste en face de la plage, et que vous aimez &eacute;galement les nombreux services touristiques &agrave; votre disposition, cette plage devrait &ecirc;tre vos prochaines vacances &agrave; la plage. La r&eacute;gion Lezh&euml; est l&#39;endroit o&ugrave; elle est situ&eacute;e en Albanie, directement sur la c&ocirc;te adriatique. Quel que soit le type de v&eacute;hicule que vous conduisez, vous atteindrez facilement cet endroit et vous pourrez vous garer soit &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route, soit sur certains parkings publics. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me mesure 3 kilom&egrave;tres de long et 75 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence &agrave; environ 30 m&egrave;tres. Sur une partie de la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement une for&ecirc;t de pins pour vous donner une ombre naturelle. Sur cette plage, vous n&#39;aurez aucun probl&egrave;me &agrave; trouver le logement qui vous convient. &Agrave; quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage, de nombreux h&ocirc;tels et appartements sont disponibles. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex', 3737, 'fr', 1),
(1404, 'Bienvenido a la playa Sh&euml;ngjin. Esta playa de la ciudad es un popular destino tur&iacute;stico alban&eacute;s. Si eres fan&aacute;tico de una larga playa de arena, con muchos hoteles, tiendas y chiringuitos ubicados directamente en frente de la playa, y tambi&eacute;n te gustan muchos servicios tur&iacute;sticos a tu disposici&oacute;n, esta playa deber&iacute;a ser tus pr&oacute;ximas vacaciones en la playa. La regi&oacute;n de Lezh&euml; es donde se encuentra en Albania, directamente en la costa del Adri&aacute;tico. No importa qu&eacute; tipo de veh&iacute;culo est&eacute; conduciendo, podr&aacute; llegar f&aacute;cilmente a esta ubicaci&oacute;n, y puede estacionarse al lado de la carretera o en algunos lugares de estacionamiento p&uacute;blicos. La playa en s&iacute; tiene 3 kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 75 metros de ancho. La entrada del agua es muy agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza a unos 30 metros. En una parte de la playa tambi&eacute;n tienes un bosque de pinos para darte un poco de sombra natural. En esta playa no tendr&aacute; problemas para encontrar el alojamiento adecuado para usted. A pocos metros de la playa hay muchos hoteles y apartamentos de todo tipo disponibles. Disfruta tu playa con BeachRex.', 3737, 'es', 1),
(1405, 'Willkommen am Strand Sh&euml;ngjin. Dieser Stadtstrand ist ein beliebtes albanisches Touristenziel. Wenn Sie ein Fan eines langen Sandstrandes mit vielen Hotels, Gesch&auml;ften und Strandbars direkt vor dem Strand sind und auch viele touristische Dienstleistungen zu Ihrer Verf&uuml;gung haben m&ouml;chten, sollte dieser Strand Ihr n&auml;chster Strandurlaub sein. In der Region Lezh&euml; befindet es sich in Albanien direkt an der Adriak&uuml;ste. Egal welche Art von Fahrzeug Sie fahren, Sie erreichen diesen Ort leicht und k&ouml;nnen entweder neben der Stra&szlig;e oder auf einigen &ouml;ffentlichen Parkpl&auml;tzen parken. Der Strand selbst ist 3 Kilometer lang und bis zu 75 Meter breit. Der Wassereingang ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 30 Metern. An einem Teil des Strandes gibt es auch einen Kiefernwald, der Ihnen nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten spendet. An diesem Strand haben Sie keine Probleme, die richtige Unterkunft f&uuml;r Sie zu finden. Nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt stehen zahlreiche Hotels und Apartments aller Art zur Verf&uuml;gung. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3737, 'de', 1),
(1406, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Sh&euml;ngjin. Ta mestna plaža je priljubljena albanska turistična destinacija. Če ste ljubitelj dolge pe&scaron;čene plaže, z veliko hoteli, trgovinami in plažnimi bari, ki se nahajajo neposredno pred plažo, in imate radi tudi &scaron;tevilne turistične storitve, bi morala biti ta plaža va&scaron; naslednji dopust. V Regiji Lezh&euml; v Albaniji se nahaja ta plaža, neposredno na jadranski obali. Ne glede na to, s kak&scaron;nim vozilom se boste pripeljali, boste zlahka dosegli to lokacijo in parkirate lahko bodisi ob cesti, bodisi na nekaterih javnih parkirnih mestih. Sama plaža je dolga 3 kilometre in &scaron;iroka do 75 metrov. Vhod za vodo je zelo lep, kopanje pa se začne na približno 30 metrih. Na enem delu plaže imate tudi borov gozd, ki vam daje nekaj naravne sence. Na tej plaži ne boste imeli težav z iskanjem prave namestitve za vas. Le nekaj metrov od plaže je na voljo veliko različnih hotelov in apartmajev. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3737, 'sl', 1),
(1407, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Sh&euml;ngjin. Ova gradska plaža popularno je albansko turističko odredi&scaron;te. Ako ste ljubitelj dugih pje&scaron;čanih plaža, s mnogim hotelima, trgovinama i barovima na plaži koji se nalaze neposredno ispred plaže, a volite i brojne turističke usluge, ova bi vam plaža trebala biti sljedeći odmor. Ova plaža nalazi se u regiji Lež&euml; u Albaniji, neposredno na obali Jadrana. Bez obzira kojim vozilom vozite, lako ćete stići do ove lokacije i moći ćete parkirati bilo uz cestu ili na nekim javnim parkirali&scaron;nim mjestima. Sama plaža dugačka je 3 kilometra i &scaron;iroka do 75 metara. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i plivanje počinje na oko 30 metara. Na jednom dijelu plaže imate i borovu &scaron;umu koja vam daje prirodnu hladovinu. Na ovoj plaži nećete imati problema naći pravi smje&scaron;taj za vas. Samo nekoliko metara od plaže nalazi se mno&scaron;tvo različitih hotela i apartmana. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3737, 'hr', 1),
(1408, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia Rana e Medhun. Questa bellissima spiaggia &egrave; l&#39;ultima spiaggia nella parte nord della regione albanese di Lezh&euml;. Sh&euml;ngjin, una famosa citt&agrave; turistica, &egrave; la pi&ugrave; vicina a questa localit&agrave;. Dovresti visitare questa spiaggia se sei in vacanza con la tua famiglia e ti piace anche una lunga spiaggia sabbiosa con hotel di lusso e alberi di pino situati direttamente sulla spiaggia. Queste caratteristiche della spiaggia sono davvero uniche per le spiagge albanesi e rimarrai stupito dalla vista che avrai ogni mattina dal balcone della tua camera negli hotel di lusso. La posizione &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con un veicolo. Il parcheggio pu&ograve; essere effettuato direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, principalmente nei parcheggi privati ​​dei ristoranti o degli hotel. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e in alcuni tratti larga anche 100 metri. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il bagno inizia gi&agrave; a 10 metri. Hai molte infrastrutture per la spiaggia disponibili qui, ed &egrave; al livello pi&ugrave; alto. Qui si trovano anche ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia, alcuni hotel di lusso e un bellissimo resort. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3738, 'it', 1),
(1409, 'Bienvenido a la playa Rana e Medhun. Esta hermosa playa es la &uacute;ltima playa en la parte norte de la regi&oacute;n albanesa de Lezh&euml;. Sh&euml;ngjin, una famosa ciudad tur&iacute;stica, es la m&aacute;s cercana a este lugar. Debe visitar esta playa si est&aacute; de vacaciones con su familia, y tambi&eacute;n le gusta una larga playa de arena con lujosos hoteles y pinos ubicados directamente en la playa. Estas caracter&iacute;sticas de la playa son &uacute;nicas para las playas de Albania, y se sorprender&aacute; con la vista que tendr&aacute; cada ma&ntilde;ana desde el balc&oacute;n de su habitaci&oacute;n en los hoteles de lujo. La ubicaci&oacute;n es de f&aacute;cil acceso con un veh&iacute;culo. El estacionamiento se puede hacer directamente en frente de la playa, principalmente en los lugares de estacionamiento privados de los restaurantes u hoteles. La playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y en algunas partes incluso 100 metros de ancho. La entrada de agua es muy bonita y la nataci&oacute;n comienza ya a los 10 metros. Tiene mucha infraestructura de playa disponible aqu&iacute;, y est&aacute; en el nivel m&aacute;s alto. Aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n se encuentran restaurantes y bares en la playa, as&iacute; como algunos hoteles de lujo y un hermoso resort. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3738, 'es', 1),
(1410, 'Bienvenue &agrave; la plage Rana e Medhun. Cette belle plage est la derni&egrave;re plage de la partie nord de la r&eacute;gion albanaise de Lezh&euml;. Sh&euml;ngjin, une ville touristique c&eacute;l&egrave;bre, est la plus proche de cet endroit. Vous devriez visiter cette plage si vous &ecirc;tes en vacances avec votre famille, et vous aimez aussi une longue plage de sable avec des h&ocirc;tels luxueux et des pins situ&eacute;s directement sur la plage. De telles caract&eacute;ristiques de plage sont tout &agrave; fait uniques pour les plages albanaises, et vous serez surpris par la vue que vous aurez chaque matin depuis le balcon de votre chambre dans les h&ocirc;tels de luxe. L&#39;emplacement est facilement accessible avec un v&eacute;hicule. Le stationnement peut se faire directement en face de la plage, principalement sur les places de parking priv&eacute;es des restaurants ou des h&ocirc;tels. La plage fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et sur certaines parties m&ecirc;me 100 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 10 m&egrave;tres. Vous avez beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage disponibles ici, et c&#39;est au plus haut niveau. Des restaurants et des bars de plage sont &eacute;galement situ&eacute;s ici, ainsi que quelques h&ocirc;tels de luxe et une belle station baln&eacute;aire. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3738, 'fr', 1),
(1411, 'Willkommen am Strand Rana e Medhun. Dieser sch&ouml;ne Strand ist der letzte Strand im n&ouml;rdlichen Teil der albanischen Region Lezh&euml;. Sh&euml;ngjin, eine ber&uuml;hmte touristische Stadt, ist diesem Ort am n&auml;chsten. Sie sollten diesen Strand besuchen, wenn Sie mit Ihrer Familie im Urlaub sind, und Sie m&ouml;gen auch einen langen Sandstrand mit luxuri&ouml;sen Hotels und Kiefern direkt am Strand. Solche Strandeigenschaften sind f&uuml;r albanische Str&auml;nde sehr einzigartig und Sie werden von der Aussicht, die Sie jeden Morgen von einem Balkon Ihres Zimmers in den Luxushotels aushaben, begeistert sein. Der Standort ist mit einem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen. Das Parken kann direkt vor dem Strand erfolgen, meist auf den privaten Parkpl&auml;tzen der Restaurants oder Hotels. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und teilweise sogar 100 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bereits bei 10 Metern. Hier steht Ihnen eine ausreichende Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung, die sich auf h&ouml;chstem Niveau befindet. Hier befinden sich auch Restaurants und Strandbars sowie einige luxuri&ouml;se Hotels und ein wundersch&ouml;nes Resort. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3738, 'de', 1),
(1412, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Rana e Medhun. Ta čudovita plaža je zadnja plaža v severnem delu albanske regije Lež&euml;. Sh&euml;ngjin, znano turistično mesto, je najbližje tej lokaciji. To plažo bi morali obiskati, če ste na počitnicah z družino, v&scaron;eč pa vam je tudi dolga pe&scaron;čena plaža z luksuznimi hoteli in borovci, ki se nahajajo neposredno na plaži. Tak&scaron;ne značilnosti plaže so za albanske plaže zelo edinstvene in presenetil vas bo pogled, ki ga boste imeli vsako jutro z balkona svoje sobe v va&scaron;em luksuznem hotelu. Dostop do plaže z vozilom je urejen. Parkiranje lahko opravite neposredno pred plažo, večinoma na zasebnih parkirnih mestih od tamkaj&scaron;njih restavracij ali hotelov. Plaža je dolga nekaj kilometrov, na nekaterih delih pa je &scaron;iroka tudi do 100 metrov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in z plavanjem lahko pričnete že pri 10 metrih. Tu imate na voljo veliko plažne infrastrukture, in to na najvi&scaron;ji ravni. Restavracije in bari se tudi nahajajo na plaži, pa tudi nekaj luksuznih hotelov in čudovito letovi&scaron;če. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3738, 'sl', 1),
(1413, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Rana e Medhun. Ova lijepa plaža posljednja je plaža u sjevernom dijelu albanske regije Leže. Sh&euml;ngjin, poznati turistički grad, najbliži je ovoj lokaciji. Ovu biste plažu trebali posjetiti ako ste na odmoru s obitelji, a volite i dugu pje&scaron;čanu plažu s luksuznim hotelima i borovima koja se nalaze neposredno na samoj plaži. Ovakve značajke plaže vrlo su jedinstvene za albanske plaže i iznenadit će vas pogled koji ćete imati svako jutro s balkona svoje sobe u va&scaron;em luksuznom hotelu. Organiziran je pristup automobilom do plaže. Parkiranje se može obaviti izravno ispred plaže, uglavnom na privatnim parkirali&scaron;nim mjestima iz tamo&scaron;njih restorana ili hotela. Plaža je duga nekoliko kilometara, a na nekim dijelovima je &scaron;iroka i do 100 metara. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo lijep i možete početi plivati ​​s 10 metara. Ovdje vam je na raspolaganju mno&scaron;tvo plaže na najvi&scaron;oj razini. Restorani i barovi također se nalaze na plaži, kao i neki luksuzni hoteli i prekrasno odmarali&scaron;te. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3738, 'hr', 1),
(1414, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia Rrjollit. La primissima regione in cui entri, arrivando in Albania dal Montenegro, lungo la costa, &egrave; la regione di Scutari. Questa regione &egrave; famosa per le sue bellissime spiagge sabbiose, che si estendono per diversi chilometri. L&#39;ultima spiaggia prima di passare alla prossima regione lungo la costa si trova nel villaggio di Baks-Rrjoll&euml;. &Egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga fino a 100 metri. Hai davvero molto spazio qui. &Egrave; particolarmente bello al tramonto. Da un lato hai il mare Adriatico e sullo sfondo alcune piccole montagne. La spiaggia &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con qualsiasi mezzo. Puoi semplicemente parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia stessa o presso il resort, se sei un ospite l&igrave;. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il nuoto inizia a circa 20 metri. Non hai molte infrastrutture da spiaggia qui, solo presso il resort sulla spiaggia. Un ristorante &egrave; disponibile anche qui, cos&igrave; come un alloggio sotto forma di un hotel. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3739, 'it', 1),
(1415, 'Bienvenue &agrave; la plage Rrjollit. La toute premi&egrave;re r&eacute;gion que vous entrez, en arrivant en Albanie depuis le Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro, par le littoral, est la r&eacute;gion de Shkod&euml;r. Cette r&eacute;gion est r&eacute;put&eacute;e pour ses belles plages de sable, qui s&#39;&eacute;tendent sur plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres. La derni&egrave;re plage avant de passer &agrave; la r&eacute;gion suivante sur le littoral est situ&eacute;e dans le village de Baks-Rrjoll&euml;. Il mesure plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 100 m&egrave;tres de large. Vous avez vraiment beaucoup d&#39;espace ici. C&#39;est particuli&egrave;rement beau au coucher du soleil. D&#39;un c&ocirc;t&eacute;, vous avez la mer Adriatique et dans votre arri&egrave;re-plan quelques petites montagnes. La plage est facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. Vous pouvez simplement vous garer directement sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me ou au complexe, si vous y &ecirc;tes invit&eacute;. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence &agrave; environ 20 m&egrave;tres. Vous n&#39;avez pas beaucoup d&#39;infrastructure de plage ici, seulement dans la station baln&eacute;aire. Un restaurant est &eacute;galement disponible ici, ainsi qu&#39;un h&eacute;bergement sous la forme d&#39;un h&ocirc;tel. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3739, 'fr', 1),
(1416, 'Bienvenido a la playa Rrjollit. La primera regi&oacute;n a la que ingresa, al llegar a Albania desde Montenegro, por la costa, es la regi&oacute;n de Shkod&euml;r. Esta regi&oacute;n es famosa por sus hermosas playas de arena, que se extienden a lo largo de varios kil&oacute;metros. La &uacute;ltima playa antes de ir a la siguiente regi&oacute;n de la costa se encuentra en el pueblo Baks-Rrjoll&euml;. Tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 100 metros de ancho. Realmente tienes mucho espacio aqu&iacute;. Es especialmente hermoso al atardecer. A un lado tienes el mar Adri&aacute;tico y al fondo unas peque&ntilde;as monta&ntilde;as. La playa es de f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. Simplemente puede estacionar directamente en la playa o en el complejo, si es un hu&eacute;sped all&iacute;. La entrada al agua es muy bonita y la nataci&oacute;n comienza a unos 20 metros. Aqu&iacute; no tiene mucha infraestructura de playa, solo en el resort de playa. Un restaurante tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;, as&iacute; como un alojamiento en forma de hotel. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3739, 'es', 1),
(1417, 'Willkommen am Strand Rrjollit. Die allererste Region, die Sie betreten, wenn Sie von Montenegro an der K&uuml;ste nach Albanien kommen, ist die Region Shkod&euml;r. Diese Region ist ber&uuml;hmt f&uuml;r ihre wundersch&ouml;nen Sandstr&auml;nde, die sich &uuml;ber mehrere Kilometer erstrecken. Der letzte Strand vor der n&auml;chsten Region entlang der K&uuml;ste befindet sich im Dorf Baks-Rrjoll&euml;. Es ist mehrere Kilometer lang und bis zu 100 Meter breit. Sie haben hier wirklich viel Platz. Es ist besonders sch&ouml;n bei Sonnenuntergang. Auf der einen Seite haben Sie die Adria und im Hintergrund einige kleine Berge. Der Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach direkt am Strand selbst oder im Resort parken, wenn Sie dort zu Gast sind. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bei ca. 20 Metern. Sie haben hier nicht viel Strandinfrastruktur, nur im Strandresort. Hier gibt es auch ein Restaurant sowie eine Unterkunft in Form eines Hotels. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3739, 'de', 1),
(1418, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Rrjollit. Prva regija, ki jo boste obiskali, če pridete z avtomobilom iz Črne gore v Albanijo, je regija Shkod&euml;r. Ta regija slovi po čudovitih pe&scaron;čenih plažah, ki se raztezajo na več kilometrov. Zadnja plaža, pred odhodom na naslednjo regijo ob obali, se nahaja v vasi Baks-Rrjoll&euml;. Dolga je nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka do 100 metrov. Tu imate res veliko prostora. Posebej lepo je ob sončnem zahodu. Na eni strani imate Jadransko morje, v ozadju pa nekaj majhnih gora. Do plaže se da enostavno priti s katerim koli vozilom. Lahko preprosto parkirate neposredno na sami plaži ali na parkiri&scaron;ču letovi&scaron;ča, če ste tam gost. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep in plavanje se začne na približno 20 metrih. Tu nimate veliko plažne infrastrukture, največ se je nahaja okrog letovi&scaron;ča. Tu je na voljo tudi restavracija, pa tudi nastanitev v obliki hotela. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3739, 'sl', 1),
(1419, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Rrjollit Prva regija koju ćete posjetiti ako dođete automobilom iz Crne Gore u Albaniju je regija Skadar. Ova regija poznata je po prelijepim pje&scaron;čanim plažama koje se protežu kilometrima. Posljednja plaža prije odlaska u sljedeću regiju uz obalu nalazi se u selu Baks-Rrjoll&euml;. Duga je nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka je do 100 metara. Ovdje stvarno imate puno prostora. Posebno je lijepa pri zalasku sunca. S jedne strane imate Jadransko more, a u pozadini neke male planine. Do plaže se može lako doći bilo kojim vozilom. Jednostavno možete parkirati izravno na samoj plaži ili na parkirali&scaron;tu za odmarali&scaron;ta ako ste gost. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep, a plivanje počinje na oko 20 metara. Ovdje nemate mnogo plažne infrastrukture, većina se nalazi oko odmarali&scaron;ta. Ovdje se nalazi i restoran, kao i smje&scaron;taj u hotelskom stilu. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3739, 'hr', 1),
(1420, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia turistica di Velipoj&euml;s. Se sei una famiglia, una che ama le spiagge sabbiose molto lunghe, molto ampie e molto turistiche, trascorrendo le tue vacanze sulla spiaggia albanese Plazhi Velipoj&euml;s non puoi sbagliare. Si trova a meno di 1 chilometro dal paese confinante, il Montenegro. Anche il famoso lago di Scutari si trova nelle vicinanze. La spiaggia si trova nella regione di Shkod&euml;r ed &egrave; molto facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. &Egrave; possibile parcheggiare in pi&ugrave; parcheggi quasi direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga pi&ugrave; di 100 m, l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello e il bagno inizia quasi subito. Poich&eacute; questa &egrave; una destinazione turistica molto popolare, puoi aspettarti di avere molti servizi e infrastrutture balneari disponibili sulla spiaggia. Molti ristoranti, bar sulla spiaggia, fast food e altri tipi di ristorazione sono disponibili in spiaggia o nelle sue vicinanze. Ovviamente qui sono presenti anche alloggi, principalmente sotto forma di hotel e appartamenti, e su un&#39;estremit&agrave; della spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; persino un resort di lusso. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3740, 'it', 1),
(1421, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenue sur la plage touristique Velipoj&euml;s. Si vous &ecirc;tes une famille, qui aime les plages de sable tr&egrave;s longues, tr&egrave;s larges et tr&egrave;s touristiques, passer vos vacances sur la plage albanaise Plazhi Velipoj&euml;s vous ne pouvez pas vous tromper. Il se trouve &agrave; moins d&#39;un kilom&egrave;tre du pays limitrophe du Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro. Le tr&egrave;s c&eacute;l&egrave;bre lac de Skadar se trouve &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. La plage est situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion Shkod&euml;r et est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. Vous pouvez vous garer sur plusieurs places de parking presque directement en face de la plage. La plage fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et plus de 100 m de large, l&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence presque imm&eacute;diatement. En raison de cette destination touristique tr&egrave;s populaire, vous pouvez vous attendre &agrave; avoir de nombreux services de plage et des infrastructures de plage disponibles sur la plage. De nombreux restaurants, bars de plage, restauration rapide et autres types de restauration sont disponibles sur la plage ou &agrave; proximit&eacute;. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est bien s&ucirc;r &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sent ici, principalement sous forme d&#39;h&ocirc;tels et d&#39;appartements, et &agrave; une extr&eacute;mit&eacute; de la plage, vous avez m&ecirc;me un complexe de luxe. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.</div>\n', 3740, 'fr', 1),
(1422, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenido a la playa tur&iacute;stica Velipoj&euml;s. Si sois una familia a la que le encantan las playas de arena muy largas, muy amplias y muy tur&iacute;sticas, con pasar sus vacaciones en la playa albanesa Plazhi Velipoj&euml;s no puede equivocarse. Est&aacute; a menos de 1 kil&oacute;metro del pa&iacute;s fronterizo de Montenegro. El famoso lago Skadar tambi&eacute;n se encuentra en las inmediaciones. La playa se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Shkod&euml;r y es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. Puede estacionar en varios lugares de estacionamiento casi directamente en frente de la playa. La playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y m&aacute;s de 100 m de ancho, la entrada de agua es muy agradable y el ba&ntilde;o comienza casi de inmediato. Debido a que este es un destino tur&iacute;stico muy popular, puede esperar tener muchos servicios e infraestructura de playa disponibles en la playa. Muchos restaurantes, chiringuitos, comida r&aacute;pida y otros tipos de catering est&aacute;n disponibles en la playa o en sus alrededores. El alojamiento, por supuesto, tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; presente aqu&iacute;, principalmente en forma de hoteles y apartamentos, y en un extremo de la playa incluso tiene un resort de lujo. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3740, 'es', 1),
(1423, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Willkommen am touristischen Strand Velipoj&euml;s. Wenn Sie eine Familie sind, die sehr lange, sehr breite und sehr touristische Sandstr&auml;nde liebt und Sie Ihre Ferien am albanischen Strand Plazhi Velipoj&euml;s verbringen mochten, k&ouml;nnen Sie nichts falsch machen. Es ist weniger als 1 km vom Grenzland Montenegro entfernt. Der sehr ber&uuml;hmte Skadar See befindet sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he. Der Strand befindet sich in der Region Shkod&euml;r und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen auf mehreren Parkpl&auml;tzen fast direkt vor dem Strand parken. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 m breit, der Wassereingang ist sehr sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt fast sofort. Da dies ein sehr beliebtes Touristenziel ist, k&ouml;nnen Sie erwarten, dass am Strand viele Stranddienstleistungen und Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung stehen. Viele Restaurants, Strandbars, Fast Food und andere Arten von Catering sind am Strand oder in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar. Nat&uuml;rlich gibt es hier auch Unterk&uuml;nfte, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Hotels und Apartments, und an einem Ende des Strandes befindet sich sogar ein luxuri&ouml;ses Resort. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n', 3740, 'de', 1),
(1424, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na turistični plaži Velipoj&euml;s. Če ste družina, ki ljubi zelo dolge, zelo &scaron;iroke in zelo turistične pe&scaron;čene plaže, pomet z preživitjem počitnic na albanski plaži Plazhi Velipoj&euml;s, ne morete zgre&scaron;iti. Od meje Črne gore je oddaljena manj kot 1 kilometer. V bližini je tudi zelo znano Skadarsko jezero. Plaža se nahaja v regiji Shkod&euml;r in je zelo enostavno dostopna z vsemi vrstami vozil. Parkirate lahko na več parkirnih mestih skoraj neposredno pred plažo. Plaža je dolga nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka več kot 100 m, vhod v vodo je zelo lep in kopanje se začne skoraj takoj. Ker je to zelo priljubljena turistična destinacija, lahko pričakujete, da bodo na plaži na voljo &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži in infrastruktura za plažo. Na plaži ali v njeni bližini so na voljo tudi &scaron;tevilne restavracije, bari na plaži, hitra hrana in druge vrste prehrane. Tukaj je seveda prisotna tudi nastanitev, predvsem v obliki hotelov in apartmajev, na enem koncu plaže pa imate celo razko&scaron;no letovi&scaron;če. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3740, 'sl', 1),
(1425, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na turističku plažu Velipoj&euml;s. Ako ste obitelj koja voli vrlo duge, vrlo &scaron;iroke i vrlo turističke pje&scaron;čane plaže, ne možete propustiti provesti odmor na albanskoj plaži Plazhi Velipoj&euml;s. Nalazi se na manje od jednog kilometra od crnogorske granice. U blizini je i vrlo poznato Skadarsko jezero. Plaža se nalazi u regiji Skadar i vrlo je lako dostupna svim vrstama vozila. Parkirati možete na nekoliko parkirnih mjesta gotovo direktno ispred plaže. Plaža je duga nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka vi&scaron;e od 100 m, ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i kupanje započinje gotovo odmah. Budući da je ovo vrlo popularno turističko odredi&scaron;te, na plaži možete očekivati ​​da će na raspolaganju biti brojne usluge na plaži i infrastruktura za plažu. Na plaži ili u blizini plaže postoje i mnogi restorani, barovi na plaži, brza hrana i druge vrste hrane. Naravno, ovdje se nalazi i smje&scaron;taj, posebno u obliku hotela i apartmana, a na jednom kraju plaže imate čak i luksuzno odmarali&scaron;te. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3740, 'hr', 1),
(1426, 'Benvenuti nella spiaggia molto speciale Plazhi Ada. Le spiagge albanesi sono fantastiche, il che vale anche per la spiaggia che presentiamo in questo video. La spiaggia Ada ha un parco acquatico direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, ma non solo, dietro il parco acquatico, hai un resort di lusso in stile architettura greca antica, dove puoi trascorrere le tue vacanze. La regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia si chiama Shkod&euml;r, e la citt&agrave; pi&ugrave; vicina &egrave; Velipoj&euml;. &Egrave; fondamentalmente la prima o l&#39;ultima spiaggia in Albania. Quando viaggi a sud, lungo la costa dal Montenegro, &egrave; la prima spiaggia dopo aver attraversato il confine, e quando viaggi a nord, dalla Grecia, &egrave; l&#39;ultima spiaggia. La posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Nel periodo estivo sono aperti al pubblico i parcheggi per la spiaggia e per il parco acquatico. La spiaggia stessa &egrave; lunga pochi chilometri e larga fino a 75 m. L&#39;inclinazione &egrave; normale, l&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il nuoto inizia quasi subito. Hai qualche infrastruttura spiaggia disponibile sulla spiaggia e ancora di pi&ugrave; nel parco acquatico. Alcuni bar e ristoranti sulla spiaggia si trovano direttamente sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione pi&ugrave; vicina, a soli 100 metri di distanza, &egrave; il resort di lusso appena dietro il parco acquatico. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3741, 'it', 1),
(1427, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenue sur la plage tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale de Plazhi Ada. Les plages albanaises sont incroyables, ce qui est &eacute;galement vrai pour la plage que nous pr&eacute;sentons dans cette vid&eacute;o. La plage Ada a un parc aquatique directement en face de la plage, mais pas seulement, derri&egrave;re le parc aquatique, vous avez un complexe de luxe dans un style d&#39;architecture grecque antique, o&ugrave; vous pouvez passer vos vacances. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve cette plage s&#39;appelle Shkod&euml;r et la ville la plus proche est Velipoj&euml;. C&#39;est essentiellement la premi&egrave;re ou la derni&egrave;re plage d&#39;Albanie. Lorsque vous voyagez vers le sud, le long de la c&ocirc;te depuis le Mont&eacute;n&eacute;gro, c&#39;est la premi&egrave;re plage apr&egrave;s avoir travers&eacute; la fronti&egrave;re, et lorsque vous voyagez vers le nord, depuis la Gr&egrave;ce, c&#39;est la derni&egrave;re plage. L&#39;emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. En &eacute;t&eacute;, les parkings de la plage et du parc aquatique sont ouverts au public. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me mesure quelques kilom&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 75 m de large. L&#39;inclinaison est normale, l&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence presque imm&eacute;diatement. Vous avez des infrastructures de plage disponibles sur la plage et encore plus dans le parc aquatique. Quelques bars et restaurants de plage sont situ&eacute;s directement sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement le plus proche, &agrave; seulement 100 m&egrave;tres, est le complexe de luxe juste derri&egrave;re le parc aquatique. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.</div>\n', 3741, 'fr', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1428, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenido a la playa muy especial Plazhi Ada. Las playas de Albania son incre&iacute;bles, lo que tambi&eacute;n es cierto para la playa que presentamos en este video. La playa Ada tiene un parque acu&aacute;tico directamente en frente de la playa, pero no solo eso, detr&aacute;s del parque acu&aacute;tico, tienes un resort de lujo en un estilo de arquitectura griega antigua, donde puedes pasar tus vacaciones. La regi&oacute;n en la que se encuentra esta playa se llama Shkod&euml;r, y la ciudad m&aacute;s cercana es Velipoj&euml;. B&aacute;sicamente es la primera o la &uacute;ltima playa de Albania. Cuando viajas hacia el sur, por la costa de Montenegro, es la primera playa despu&eacute;s de cruzar la frontera, y cuando viajas hacia el norte, desde Grecia, es la &uacute;ltima playa. La ubicaci&oacute;n es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. En verano, las plazas de aparcamiento de la playa y del parque acu&aacute;tico est&aacute;n abiertas al p&uacute;blico. La playa en s&iacute; tiene unos pocos kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 75 m de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n es normal, la entrada de agua es agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza casi de inmediato. Tienes algo de infraestructura de playa disponible en la playa y a&uacute;n m&aacute;s en el parque acu&aacute;tico. Algunos bares de playa y restaurantes se encuentran directamente en la playa. El alojamiento m&aacute;s cercano, a solo 100 metros de distancia, es el complejo de lujo justo detr&aacute;s del parque acu&aacute;tico. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3741, 'es', 1),
(1429, 'Willkommen am ganz besonderen Strand Plazhi Ada. Die albanischen Str&auml;nde sind unglaublich, was auch f&uuml;r den Strand gilt, den wir in diesem Video pr&auml;sentieren. Der Strand Ada hat ein Aquapark direkt vor dem Strand, und hinter dem Aquapark haben Sie ein Luxusresort im antiken griechischen Architekturstil, in dem Sie Ihren Urlaub verbringen k&ouml;nnen. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Shkod&euml;r und die n&auml;chstgelegene Stadt ist Velipoj&euml;. Es ist im Grunde der erste oder letzte Strand in Albanien. Wenn Sie nach S&uuml;den reisen, entlang der K&uuml;ste von Montenegro, ist es der erste Strand nach dem &Uuml;berqueren der Grenze, und wenn Sie von Griechenland nach Norden reisen, ist es der letzte Strand. Der Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Im Sommer sind die Parkpl&auml;tze f&uuml;r den Strand und das Aqua park f&uuml;r die &Ouml;ffentlichkeit zug&auml;nglich. Der Strand selbst ist wenige Kilometer lang und bis zu 75 m breit. Die Neigung ist normal, der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt fast sofort. Sie haben einige Strandinfrastruktur am Strand und noch mehr im Aquapark. Einige Strandbars und Restaurants befinden sich direkt am Strand. Die n&auml;chste Unterkunft, nur 100 Meter entfernt, ist das Luxusresort direkt hinter dem Aquapark. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3741, 'de', 1),
(1430, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na prav posebni plaži Plazhi Ada. Albanske plaže so neverjetne, kar velja tudi za plažo, ki jo predstavljamo v tem videoposnetku. Plaža Ada ima vodni park neposredno pred plažo, a ne le to, za vodnim parkom imate tudi luksuzno letovi&scaron;če v slogu starogr&scaron;ke arhitekture, kjer lahko preživite svoje naslednje počitnice. Regija, na kateri se nahaja ta plaža, se imenuje Shkod&euml;r, najbližje mesto pa je Velipoj&euml;. V bistvu je prva ali zadnja plaža v Albaniji. Ko potujete na jug, navzdol ob obali Črne gore, je to plaža prva albanska plaža po prečkanju meje, in ko potujete na sever, iz Grčije, je ta plaža zadnja albanska plaža. Do plaže se lahko pripeljete s kakr&scaron;nimi koli vozili. V poletnem času so parkirna mesta za plažo in za vodni park odprta za javnost. Sama plaža je dolga nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka do 75 m. Naklon je normalen, vstop v vodo je lep in plavanje se začne skoraj takoj. Na voljo imate nekaj plažne infrastrukture na plaži in &scaron;e več se je nahaja v akva parku. Nekaj barov na plaži in restavracij se nahaja neposredno na plaži. Luksuzno letovi&scaron;če tik za akva parkom je najbližje bivali&scaron;če, oddaljeno le 100 metrov. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3741, 'sl', 1),
(1431, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na vrlo posebnu plažu Plazhi Ade. Albanske plaže su zadivljujuće, &scaron;to se također odnosi i na plažu koju predstavljamo u ovom videu. Ada Beach ima vodeni park neposredno ispred plaže, ali ne samo to, iza vodenog parka imate i luksuzno odmarali&scaron;te u stilu starogrčke arhitekture, u kojem možete provesti svoj sljedeći odmor. Područje u kojem se nalazi ova plaža naziva se Shkod&euml;r, a najbliži grad je Velipoj&euml;. To je u osnovi prva ili posljednja plaža u Albaniji. Kada putujete prema jugu, uz obalu Crne Gore, ova je plaža prva albanska plaža nakon prelaska granice, a kada putujete prema sjeveru, iz Grčke, ova je plaža posljednja albanska plaža. Do plaže možete doći bilo kojim vozilom. Ljeti su parkirna mjesta za plažu i vodeni park otvorena za javnost. Sama plaža dugačka je nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka do 75 m. Nagib je normalan, ulazak u vodu je lijep i plivanje počinje gotovo odmah. Imate neku plažnu infrastrukturu na plaži, a jo&scaron; vi&scaron;e se nalazi u aqua parku. Nekoliko barova i restorana smje&scaron;tenih je na samoj plaži. Luksuzno odmarali&scaron;te odmah iza akva parka najbliža je rezidencija, udaljena samo 100 metara. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.</div>\n', 3741, 'hr', 1),
(1432, 'Benvenuti nella spiaggia molto speciale di S&oslash;nderhav. Questa spiaggia sabbiosa danese si trova nella regione di Syddanmark, vicino al villaggio di Krus&aring;. E &#39;molto facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche camper, e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare semplicemente in un parcheggio proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. &Egrave; una spiaggia di tipo familiare con alcune infrastrutture e alcuni servizi di spiaggia. Sulla spiaggia di sabbia si trovano anche un piccolo parco giochi per bambini e alcuni tavoli da picnic con panchine. Hai a disposizione una lunghezza totale di 200 me fino a 40 m di larghezza sulla spiaggia. Se ti piacciono le spiagge dalla forma speciale, come una spiaggia a forma di corno, sei nel posto giusto. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto comodo grazie alla spiaggia piatta. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; compreso tra 5 e 25 m. Proprio accanto alla spiaggia hai un piccolo bistrot e se cerchi un alloggio ci sono alcuni appartamenti nei dintorni. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3889, 'it', 1),
(1433, 'Bienvenido a la playa muy especial de S&oslash;nderhav. Esta playa de arena danesa se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark, cerca del pueblo Krus&aring;. Es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n una autocaravana, y simplemente se puede estacionar en un lugar de estacionamiento justo en frente de la playa. Es una playa de tipo familiar con cierta infraestructura de playa y algunos servicios de playa. Un peque&ntilde;o parque infantil y algunas mesas de picnic con bancos tambi&eacute;n se encuentran en la playa de arena. Tienes una longitud total de 200 my hasta 40 m de ancho en la playa disponible. Si te gustan las playas con formas especiales, como una playa con forma de cuerno, est&aacute;s en el lugar correcto. La entrada de agua es debido a la playa plana muy c&oacute;moda. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; entre 5 y 25 m. Justo al lado de la playa tienes un peque&ntilde;o bistr&oacute; y si est&aacute;s buscando alojamiento hay algunos apartamentos en los alrededores. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3889, 'es', 1),
(1434, 'Bienvenue sur la plage tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale de S&oslash;nderhav. Cette plage de sable danoise est situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark, pr&egrave;s du village de Krus&aring;. Il est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, y compris un camping-car, et vous pouvez simplement vous garer sur une place de parking juste en face de la plage. C&#39;est une plage de type familial avec des infrastructures de plage et des services de plage. Une petite aire de jeux pour enfants et des tables de pique-nique avec bancs se trouvent &eacute;galement sur la plage de sable. Vous avez une longueur totale de 200 m et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 40 m de largeur sur la plage disponible. Si vous aimez les plages de forme sp&eacute;ciale, comme une plage en forme de corne, vous &ecirc;tes au bon endroit. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est en raison de la plage plate tr&egrave;s confortable. Le point de nage est compris entre 5 et 25 m. Juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, vous avez un petit bistrot et si vous cherchez un logement, il y a des appartements dans les environs. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3889, 'fr', 1),
(1435, 'Willkommen am einen ganz besonderen Strand S&oslash;nderhav. Dieser d&auml;nische Sandstrand befindet sich in der Region Syddanmark in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Krus&aring;. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach auf einem Parkplatz direkt vor dem Strand parken. Es ist ein Familienstrand mit einer Strandinfrastruktur und einigen Stranddienstleistungen. Ein kleiner Kinderspielplatz und einige Picknicktische mit B&auml;nken befinden sich ebenfalls am Sandstrand. Sie haben eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 200 m und bis zu 40 m Breite am Strand zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wenn Sie speziell geformte Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, wie einen hornf&ouml;rmigen Strand, sind Sie hier richtig. Der Wassereintritt ist wegen des flachen Strandes sehr angenehm. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt zwischen 5 und 25 m. Direkt neben dem Strand befindet sich ein kleines Bistro. Wenn Sie nach einer Unterkunft suchen, finden Sie in der Umgebung einige Apartments. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3889, 'de', 1),
(1436, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na zelo posebni plaži S&oslash;nderhav. Ta danska pe&scaron;čena plaža se nahaja v regiji Syddanmark, v bližini vasi Krus&aring;. Je zelo lahko dostopna s katerim koli vozilom, tudi avtodomom, in preprosto parkirate na parkirnem mestu tik pred plažo. To je plaža družinskega tipa z nekaj plažne infrastrukture in nekaj storitev na plaži. Na pe&scaron;čeni plaži je tudi majhno otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če in nekaj piknik miz s klopmi. Na plaži imate skupno dolžino 200 m in do 40 m &scaron;irine. Če imate radi posebej oblikovane plaže, na primer plažo v obliki roga, ste na pravem mestu. Vstop v vodo je zaradi ravne plaže zelo udoben. Točka plavanja je med 5 in 25 m. Tik ob plaži imate majhen bistro in če i&scaron;čete namestitev, je v bližini nekaj apartmajev. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3889, 'sl', 1),
(1437, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na vrlo posebnu plažu S&oslash;nderhav. Ova danska pje&scaron;čana plaža nalazi se u regiji Syddanmark, u blizini sela Krus&aring;. Do njega je vrlo lako pristupiti bilo koje vozilo, uključujući i kamperom, a na parkirali&scaron;tu jednostavno parkirate točno ispred plaže. Ovo je plaža obiteljskog tipa s nekom plažnom infrastrukturom i nekim uslugama na plaži. Na pje&scaron;čanoj plaži se nalazi i dječje igrali&scaron;te te nekoliko stolova za piknik sa klupama. Na plaži imate ukupnu duljinu od 200 m i &scaron;irinu do 40 m. Ako volite posebno dizajnirane plaže, poput plaže u obliku roga, na pravom ste mjestu. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo udoban zbog ravne plaže. Točka kupanja je između 5 i 25 m. Odmah do plaže imate mali bistro i ako tražite smje&scaron;taj, u blizini se nalazi nekoliko apartmana. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3889, 'hr', 1),
(1438, 'Benvenuto a Gammelmark Strand. Se stai cercando una spiaggia sabbiosa danese sulla costa del Mar Baltico, con un campeggio accanto, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand Gammelmark. Si trova nella regione danese del Syddanmark, vicino al villaggio di Broager. &Egrave; possibile accedere a questa posizione con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche un camper. E tu resti nel campeggio o parcheggi il tuo veicolo in un piccolo parcheggio a circa 30 m dalla spiaggia. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 1 km ed &egrave; larga 15 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 30 m. Hai alcune infrastrutture di base sulla spiaggia qui; pi&ugrave; servizi sono disponibili nel campo. Il campo &egrave; anche l&#39;unico posto dove mangiare e dove stare pi&ugrave; a lungo. Esplora la spiaggia Gammelmark con BeachRex.', 3891, 'it', 1),
(1439, 'Bienvenue sur le Gammelmark Strand. Si vous recherchez une plage de sable danoise sur la c&ocirc;te de la mer Baltique, avec un terrain de camping &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute;, nous vous sugg&eacute;rons de visiter la plage Strand Gammelmark. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion danoise de Syddanmark, pr&egrave;s du village Broager. Vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cet emplacement avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, y compris un camping-car. Et soit vous restez au camp, soit votre v&eacute;hicule garez votre v&eacute;hicule sur un petit parking &agrave; environ 30 m de la plage. La plage a une longueur totale de 1 km et une largeur de 15 m. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 30 m. Vous avez une infrastructure de plage de base ici; plus de services sont disponibles dans le camp. Le camp est &eacute;galement le seul endroit o&ugrave; manger et y rester plus longtemps. Explorez la plage de Gammelmark avec BeachRex.', 3891, 'fr', 1),
(1440, 'Bienvenido a Gammelmark Strand. Si est&aacute; buscando una playa danesa de arena en la costa del Mar B&aacute;ltico, con un camping al lado, le sugerimos que visite la playa Strand Gammelmark. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n danesa de Syddanmark, cerca del pueblo Broager. Puede acceder a esta ubicaci&oacute;n con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n una autocaravana. Y o te quedas en el campamento o aparcas tu veh&iacute;culo en un peque&ntilde;o aparcamiento a unos 30 m de la playa. La playa tiene una longitud total de 1 km y 15 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy bonita y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a unos 30 m. Aqu&iacute; tienes alguna infraestructura de playa b&aacute;sica; m&aacute;s servicios est&aacute;n disponibles en el campamento. El campamento tambi&eacute;n es el &uacute;nico lugar para comer algo y quedarse aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo. Explore la playa Gammelmark con BeachRex.', 3891, 'es', 1),
(1441, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Willkommen am Gammelmark Strand. Wenn Sie nach einem d&auml;nischen Sandstrand an der Ostseek&uuml;ste mit einem Campingplatz daneben suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Gammelmark zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der d&auml;nischen Region Syddanmark in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Broager. Sie k&ouml;nnen mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, diesen Ort erreichen. Und entweder bleiben Sie im Camp oder parken Ihr Fahrzeug auf einem kleinen Parkplatz etwa 30 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 1 km und ist maximal 15 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 30 m. Sie haben hier eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur; Weitere Dienstleistungen sind im Camp verf&uuml;gbar. Das Camp ist auch der einzige Ort, an dem man etwas zu essen bekommt und l&auml;nger hierbleiben kann. Entdecken Sie den Strand Gammelmark mit BeachRex.</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3891, 'de', 1),
(1442, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Gammelmark. Če i&scaron;čete pe&scaron;čeno dansko plažo na obali Baltskega morja, ki ima zraven možnost kampiranja, vam predlagamo, da obi&scaron;čete plažo Strand Gammelmark. Nahaja se na danskem območju Syddanmark, v bližini vasi Broager. Do te lokacije lahko dostopate s katerim koli vozilom, tudi avtodomom. In bodisi ostanete v kampu ali parkirate svoje vozilo na majhnem parkiri&scaron;ču, ki je oddaljeno 30 m od plaže. Plaža ima skupno dolžino 1 km in je &scaron;iroka maksimalno 15 m. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep, točka plavanja pa je pri približno 30 m. Tu imate nekaj osnovne plažne infrastrukture; več storitev je na voljo v kampu. Kamp je tudi edino mesto, da si privo&scaron;čimo kaj za pojesti in da se tu zadržimo dlje časa. Razi&scaron;čite plažo Gammelmark s BeachRexom.', 3891, 'sl', 1),
(1443, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na Gammelmark plaži. Ako tražite pje&scaron;čanu dansku plažu na obali Baltičkog mora, koja također ima mogućnost kampiranja, predlažemo vam da posjetite plažu Strand Gammelmark. Nalazi se u predjelu Syddanmark u Danskoj, u blizini sela Broager. Ovoj lokaciji može se pristupiti bilo koje vozilom, uključujući i kamperom. Ili ostajete u kampu ili parkirate svoje vozilo na malom parkirali&scaron;tu koje je udaljeno 30 m od plaže. Plaža je ukupne dužine 1 km i &scaron;iroka je maksimalno 15 m. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep, a točka kupanja je na oko 30 m. Ovdje imate osnovnu plažnu infrastrukturu; vi&scaron;e vam je dostupno je u kampu. Kamp je također jedino mjesto gdje se možete prepustiti nečemu za jelo i dulje ostati ovdje. Istražite Gammelmark plažu s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3891, 'hr', 1),
(1444, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia S&oslash;nderborg Strand. La citt&agrave; del sud della Danimarca S&oslash;nderborg, che si trova sull&#39;isola di Als e ha una costa sul Mar Baltico, ha una bella spiaggia sabbiosa, adatta alle famiglie, situata non lontano dal centro della citt&agrave;. L&#39;intera area appartiene alla regione Syddanmark. &Egrave; facile raggiungere questa posizione con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e hai pi&ugrave; opzioni per parcheggiare il tuo veicolo. Un parcheggio si trova direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia; alcuni sono un po &#39;lontani. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto facile e hai a disposizione 200 m di lunghezza e fino a 50 m di larghezza. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione inizia gi&agrave; a 10 metri. Hai anche la possibilit&agrave; di andare in acqua da scale d&#39;acqua da un molo. Alcune infrastrutture balneari si trovano direttamente sulla spiaggia, cos&igrave; come alcuni fast food e chioschi di gelati. Se stai cercando un alloggio hai la possibilit&agrave; di andare in un hotel o in alcuni appartamenti nelle vicinanze. Divertiti ad esplorare la spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3893, 'it', 1),
(1445, 'Bienvenue &agrave; la plage S&oslash;nderborg Strand. La ville du sud du Danemark, S&oslash;nderborg, qui est situ&eacute;e sur l&#39;&icirc;le Als et poss&egrave;de un littoral sur la mer Baltique, poss&egrave;de une belle plage de sable, adapt&eacute;e aux familles, situ&eacute;e non loin du centre de la ville. L&#39;ensemble de la zone appartient &agrave; la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. Il est facile de se rendre &agrave; cet endroit avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et vous avez plusieurs options pour garer votre v&eacute;hicule. Une place de parking est situ&eacute;e directement en face de la plage; certains sont un peu loin. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s facile et vous disposez de 200 m de longueur et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 50 m de largeur. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade commence d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 10 m&egrave;tres. Vous avez &eacute;galement la possibilit&eacute; d&#39;aller &agrave; l&#39;eau par des escaliers d&#39;eau depuis une jet&eacute;e. Certaines infrastructures de plage sont situ&eacute;es directement sur la plage, ainsi que des kiosques de restauration rapide et de cr&egrave;me glac&eacute;e. Si vous recherchez un logement, vous avez la possibilit&eacute; de vous rendre dans un h&ocirc;tel ou dans certains appartements &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de l&#39;exploration de la plage avec BeachRex.', 3893, 'fr', 1),
(1446, 'Bienvenido a la playa S&oslash;nderborg Strand. La ciudad de S&oslash;nderborg, en el sur de Dinamarca, que se encuentra en la isla Als y tiene una costa en el Mar B&aacute;ltico, tiene una bonita playa de arena, adecuada para familias, ubicada no muy lejos del centro de la ciudad. Toda la zona pertenece a la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark. Es f&aacute;cil llegar a esta ubicaci&oacute;n con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tiene m&uacute;ltiples opciones para estacionar su veh&iacute;culo. Un lugar de estacionamiento se encuentra directamente en frente de la playa; algunos est&aacute;n un poco lejos. El acceso a la playa es muy f&aacute;cil y tienes 200 m de largo y hasta 50 m de ancho disponibles. La entrada al agua es muy bonita y el punto de nataci&oacute;n comienza ya a los 10 metros. Tambi&eacute;n tiene la opci&oacute;n de ir al agua por escaleras de agua desde un muelle. Parte de la infraestructura de la playa se encuentra directamente en la playa, as&iacute; como algunos quioscos de comida r&aacute;pida y helados. Si est&aacute;s buscando alojamiento tienes la opci&oacute;n de ir a un hotel o a algunos apartamentos cercanos. Disfrute explorando la playa con BeachRex.', 3893, 'es', 1),
(1447, 'Willkommen am Strand S&oslash;nderborg Strand. Die s&uuml;dd&auml;nische Stadt S&oslash;nderborg, die auf der Insel Als liegt und eine Ostseek&uuml;ste hat, hat einen sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien geeignet ist und nicht weit vom Stadtzentrum entfernt liegt. Das gesamte Gebiet geh&ouml;rt zur Region Syddanmark. Es ist einfach, mit jedem Fahrzeug an diesen Ort zu gelangen, und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, Ihr Fahrzeug zu parken. Ein Parkplatz befindet sich direkt vor dem Strand. einige sind etwas weit weg. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und Sie haben 200 m L&auml;nge und bis zu 50 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt beginnt bereits bei 10 Metern. Sie haben auch die M&ouml;glichkeit, &uuml;ber eine Wassertreppe von einem Pier zum Wasser zu gehen. Einige Strandinfrastrukturen befinden sich direkt am Strand, ebenso einige Fast-Food- und Eisdielen. Wenn Sie nach einer Unterkunft suchen, haben Sie die M&ouml;glichkeit, zu einem Hotel oder zu einigen Apartments in der N&auml;he zu gehen. Genie&szlig;en Sie es, den Strand mit BeachRex zu erkunden.', 3893, 'de', 1),
(1448, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži S&oslash;nderborg Strand. Južno dansko mesto S&oslash;nderborg, ki leži na otoku Als in ima obalo na Baltskem morju, ima lepo pe&scaron;čeno plažo, primerno za družine, ki se nahaja nedaleč stran od sredi&scaron;ča mesta. Celotno območje spada v regijo Syddanmark. Do te lokacije se lahko enostavno pripeljete s katerim koli vozilom, kjer imate več možnosti za parkiranje svojega vozila. Parkirno mesto se nahaja neposredno pred plažo; nekatera so malo bolj oddaljena. Dostop do plaže je zelo enostaven in na voljo imate 200 m dolžine in do 50 m &scaron;irine. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep, točka plavanja pa se začne že pri 10 metrih. Prav tako imate možnost, da se s pomola odpravite v vodo po vodnih stopnicah. Nekaj infrastrukture za plažo se nahaja neposredno na plaži, v bližini pa je tudi kiosk s hitro hrano in sladoledom. Če i&scaron;čete nastanitev, imate možnost najeti sobo v bližnjem hotelu ali v apartmaju. Uživajte v raziskovanju plaže s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3893, 'sl', 1),
(1449, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu S&oslash;nderborg Strand. Južni danski grad S&oslash;nderborg, koji leži na otoku Als i ima obalu na Baltičkom moru, ima prekrasnu pje&scaron;čanu plažu pogodnu za obitelji, koja se nalazi nedaleko od centra grada. Cijelo područje pripada regiji Syddanmark. Na ovu lokaciju lako možete doći bilo kojim vozilom na kojem imate vi&scaron;e mogućnosti parkiranja svog vozila. Parkirno mjesto nalazi se neposredno ispred plaže; neki su malo dalje. Pristup plaži je vrlo jednostavan, a na raspolaganju imate 200 m &scaron;irine i do 50 m. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep, a točka plivanja počinje na 10 metara. Također imate mogućnost krenuti niz vode s stepenica. Na plaži se nalazi neka infrastruktura za plažu, a u blizini je i kiosk za brzu hranu i sladoled. Ako tražite smje&scaron;taj, možete unajmiti sobu u obližnjem hotelu ili apartmanu. Uživajte u istraživanju plaže uz BeachRex.', 3893, 'hr', 1),
(1450, 'Benvenuti in spiaggia Mommark. La spiaggia danese Strand Mommark &egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa, consigliata alle famiglie ea coloro che desiderano avere un porto vicino alla spiaggia. Se sei un fan di queste spiagge, la posizione esatta della spiaggia &egrave; sull&#39;isola di Als, villaggio di Mommark, nella regione meridionale del Syddanmark. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungere la spiaggia con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con camper. Vicino alla spiaggia ci sono un porto e un campeggio. La spiaggia stessa &egrave; lunga 250 me larga fino a 30 metri. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 15 metri. &Egrave; una spiaggia con bandiera blu, il che significa che hai a disposizione alcune infrastrutture balneari di un certo standard. Vicino alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; anche un ristorante, e l&#39;unica sistemazione possibile, sotto forma di campeggio. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3898, 'it', 1),
(1451, 'Bienvenue &agrave; la plage Mommark. La plage danoise Strand Mommark est une plage de sable, recommand&eacute;e pour les familles et ceux qui souhaitent avoir un port &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage. Si vous &ecirc;tes fan de ces plages, l&#39;emplacement exact de la plage est sur l&#39;&icirc;le Als, village Mommark, dans la r&eacute;gion sud de Syddanmark. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de se rendre &agrave; la plage avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, y compris avec un camping-car. &Agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, vous avez un port et un terrain de camping. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me mesure 250 m de long et 30 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; 15 m&egrave;tres. C&#39;est une plage drapeau bleu, ce qui signifie que vous avez &agrave; votre disposition une infrastructure de plage d&#39;un certain niveau. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement un restaurant, et le seul h&eacute;bergement possible, sous la forme d&#39;un camp. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3898, 'fr', 1),
(1452, 'Bienvenidos a la playa Mommark. La playa danesa Strand Mommark es una playa de arena, recomendada para familias y para aquellos que quieran tener un puerto junto a la playa. Si eres fan&aacute;tico de estas playas, la ubicaci&oacute;n exacta de la playa es en la isla Als, pueblo Mommark, en la regi&oacute;n sur de Syddanmark. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a la playa con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana. Junto a la playa tiene un puerto y un camping. La playa en s&iacute; tiene 250 m de largo y hasta 30 metros de ancho. La entrada de agua es muy bonita y el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a 15 metros. Es una playa con bandera azul, lo que significa que tiene una infraestructura de playa con un cierto nivel a su disposici&oacute;n. Cerca de la playa tambi&eacute;n tienes un restaurante, y el &uacute;nico alojamiento posible, en forma de campamento. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3898, 'es', 1),
(1453, 'Willkommen am Strand Mommark. Der d&auml;nische Strand Mommark ist ein Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien und diejenigen empfohlen wird, die einen Hafen neben dem Strand haben m&ouml;chten. Wenn Sie ein Fan solcher Str&auml;nde sind, ist die genaue Lage des Strandes auf der Insel Als, Dorf Mommark, in der s&uuml;dlichen Region Syddanmark. Es ist sehr einfach, mit jedem Fahrzeug zum Strand zu gelangen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil. Neben dem Strand gibt es einen Hafen und einen Campingplatz. Der Strand selbst ist 250 m lang und bis zu 30 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 15 Metern. Es ist ein Strand mit blauer Flagge, was bedeutet, dass Ihnen eine Strandinfrastruktur mit einem bestimmten Standard zur Verf&uuml;gung steht. In Strandn&auml;he gibt es auch ein Restaurant und die einzig m&ouml;gliche Unterkunft in Form eines Camps. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3898, 'de', 1),
(1454, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Mommark. Danska plaža Strand Mommark je pe&scaron;čena plaža, priporočljiva za družine in tiste, ki bi radi imeli pristani&scaron;če ob plaži. Če ste ljubitelj tak&scaron;nih plaž, je natančna lokacija plaže na otoku Als, vasica Mommark, v južni regiji Syddanmark. Do plaže se lahko zelo enostavno pripeljete z va&scaron;im vozilom, tudi z avtodomom. Poleg plaže se nahaja pristani&scaron;če in možnost kampiranja v avtokampu. Sama plaža je dolga 250 m in &scaron;iroka do 30 metrov. Vstop v vodo je zelo lep, točka plavanja pa je pri 15 metrih. To je plaža z modro zastavo, kar pomeni, da imate na razpolago nekaj infrastrukture za plažo v okviru določenega standarda. V bližini plaže imate tudi restavracijo in edino možno nastanitev, v obliki kampa. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom.', 3898, 'sl', 1),
(1455, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Mommark. Danska plaža Strand Mommark je pje&scaron;čana plaža, preporučuje se obiteljima i onima koji bi željeli imati luku uz plažu. Ako ste ljubitelj takvih plaža, točan položaj plaže je na otoku Als, selu Mommark, u južnoj regiji Syddanmark. Do plaže se lako dolazi va&scaron;im vozilom, uključujući i kamperom. Pored plaže nalazi se luka i mogućnost kampiranja u kamping parku. Sama plaža dugačka je 250 m i &scaron;iroka do 30 metara. Ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep, a točka plivanja je na 15 metara. Ovo je plaža sa plavom zastavom, &scaron;to znači da vam je na raspolaganju neka infrastruktura na plaži unutar određenog standarda. U blizini plaže također imate restoran i jedini mogući smje&scaron;taj, u obliku kampa. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex.', 3898, 'hr', 1),
(1456, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hej sulla spiaggia Fynshav. Sull&#39;isola danese di Als, vicino al porto dei traghetti Fynshav, c&#39;&egrave; una bella spiaggia sabbiosa adatta alle famiglie, con un piccolo porto nelle vicinanze. La regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia si chiama Syddanmark. Questa spiaggia &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con camper, e hai diverse possibilit&agrave; per parcheggiare molto vicino alla spiaggia, la pi&ugrave; vicina &egrave; a soli 50 m, alcune sono un po &#39;pi&ugrave; lontane. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 250 m ed &egrave; larga 20 m. In una parte della spiaggia, pi&ugrave; sullo sfondo, c&#39;&egrave; anche una parte con dell&#39;erba. Su questa spiaggia si ha un fondale abbastanza piatto che rende il punto di balneazione a circa 40 m. Questo fatto significa che i tuoi bambini piccoli possono giocare in acqua in modo pi&ugrave; sicuro. La spiaggia &egrave; premiata con un segno di bandiera blu. A causa del premio Bandiera Blu e del porto vicino, qui hai anche delle infrastrutture sulla spiaggia. I ristoranti non sono nelle vicinanze, quindi porta con te il cibo e se stai cercando un alloggio hai un campeggio nelle vicinanze. Divertiti ad esplorare la spiaggia di Fynshav con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3899, 'it', 1),
(1457, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hej sur la plage Fynshav. Sur l&#39;&icirc;le danoise d&#39;Als, pr&egrave;s du port de ferry de Fynshav, vous avez une belle plage de sable fin adapt&eacute;e aux familles, avec un petit port &agrave; proximit&eacute;. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve cette plage s&#39;appelle Syddanmark. Cette plage est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, y compris avec les camping-cars, et vous avez plusieurs options pour vous garer tr&egrave;s pr&egrave;s de la plage, la plus proche est &agrave; seulement 50 m, certaines un peu plus loin. La longueur totale de la plage est de 250 m et sa largeur est de 20 m. Sur une partie de la plage, plus en arri&egrave;re-plan, vous avez &eacute;galement une partie avec de l&#39;herbe. Sur cette plage vous avez un fond marin assez plat qui fait le point de nager &agrave; environ 40 m. Ce fait signifie que vos petits enfants peuvent jouer plus en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. La plage est r&eacute;compens&eacute;e par un drapeau bleu. En raison du prix du drapeau bleu et du port &agrave; proximit&eacute;, vous avez &eacute;galement une infrastructure de plage ici. Les restaurants ne sont pas &agrave; proximit&eacute;, alors apportez votre nourriture avec vous, et si vous cherchez un h&eacute;bergement, vous avez un terrain de camping &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de l&#39;exploration de la plage Fynshav avec BeachRex.</div>\n', 3899, 'fr', 1),
(1458, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hej en la playa Fynshav. En la isla danesa de Als, cerca del puerto de ferries Fynshav, tiene una bonita playa de arena adecuada para familias, con un peque&ntilde;o puerto cerca. La regi&oacute;n donde se encuentra esta playa se llama Syddanmark. Esta playa es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravanas, y tienes varias opciones para aparcar muy cerca de la playa, la m&aacute;s cercana est&aacute; a 50 m, algunas un poco m&aacute;s lejos. La longitud total de la playa es de 250 my 20 m de ancho. En una parte de la playa, m&aacute;s al fondo, tambi&eacute;n tienes una parte con algo de c&eacute;sped. En esta playa tienes un fondo marino bastante plano que hace que el punto de nadar sea de unos 40 m. Este hecho significa que sus ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os pueden jugar con mayor seguridad en el agua. La playa est&aacute; premiada con un cartel de bandera azul. Debido a la concesi&oacute;n de la bandera azul y al puerto cercano, tambi&eacute;n tiene alguna infraestructura de playa aqu&iacute;. Los restaurantes no est&aacute;n cerca, as&iacute; que traiga su comida, y si est&aacute; buscando alojamiento, tiene un camping cerca. Disfrute explorando la playa Fynshav con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3899, 'es', 1),
(1459, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hej am Strand Fynshav. Auf der d&auml;nischen Insel Als, in der N&auml;he des F&auml;hrhafens Fynshav, befindet sich ein sch&ouml;ner Sandstrand f&uuml;r Familien mit einem kleinen Hafen in der N&auml;he. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Syddanmark. Dieser Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen, auch mit Wohnmobilen, und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, ganz in der N&auml;he des Strandes zu parken. Der n&auml;chste ist nur 50 m entfernt, einige sind etwas weiter entfernt. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 250 m und er ist 20 m breit. An einem Teil des Strandes, mehr im Hintergrund, haben Sie auch einen Teil mit etwas Gras. An diesem Strand haben Sie einen ziemlich flachen Meeresboden, auf dem Sie etwa 40 m schwimmen k&ouml;nnen. Diese Tatsache bedeutet, dass Ihre kleinen Kinder sicherer im Wasser spielen k&ouml;nnen. Der Strand ist mit einem Schild mit blauer Flagge ausgezeichnet. Aufgrund der Auszeichnung mit der blauen Flagge und des nahen gelegenen Hafens haben Sie hier auch eine Strandinfrastruktur. Restaurants sind nicht in der N&auml;he, bringen Sie also Ihr Essen mit und wenn Sie nach einer Unterkunft suchen, haben Sie einen Campingplatz in der N&auml;he. Genie&szlig;en Sie mit BeachRex die Erkundung des Strandes Fynshav.</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3899, 'de', 1),
(1460, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hej na plaži Fynshav. Na danskem otoku Als, v bližini trajektnega pristani&scaron;ča Fynshav, imate lepo pe&scaron;čeno plažo, primerno za družine, z majhnim pristani&scaron;čem v bližini. Regija, v kateri se nahaja ta plaža, se imenuje Syddanmark. Do te plaže se da zelo enostavno priti s kakr&scaron;nim koli vozilom, tudi z avtodomom, in imate na voljo več možnosti za parkiranje zelo blizu plaže, najbližje parkiri&scaron;če je le 50 m oddaljeno, nekaj pa jih malo dlje. Skupna dolžina plaže je 250 m, &scaron;iroka pa je 20 m. Na enem delu plaže, bolj v ozadju, imate tudi del z nekaj trave. Na tej plaži imate precej ravno morsko dno, kar omogoča pričetek plavanja pri približno 40 m. To dejstvo pomeni, da se lahko va&scaron;i majhni otroci bolj varno igrajo v vodi. Plaža je nagrajena z znakom modre zastave. Zaradi nagrade modre zastave in pristani&scaron;ča v bližini imate tukaj tudi nekaj plažne infrastrukture. Restavracije niso v bližini, zato hrano prinesite s seboj, in če i&scaron;čete nastanitev, imate v bližini možnost kampiranja. Uživajte v raziskovanju plaže Fynshav s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3899, 'sl', 1),
(1461, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hej, na plaži Fynshav. Na danskom otoku Als, u blizini trajektne luke Fynshav, imate prekrasnu pje&scaron;čanu plažu, pogodnu za obitelji, s malom lukom u blizini. Regija u kojoj se nalazi ova plaža naziva se Syddanmark. Do ove plaže se može doći vrlo lako bilo kojim vozilom, uključujući i kamperom, a imate nekoliko mogućnosti parkiranja u neposrednoj blizini plaže, najbliže parkirali&scaron;te udaljeno je samo 50 m, a nekoliko malo duže. Ukupna dužina plaže je 250 m, a &scaron;irina 20 m. Na jednom dijelu plaže, vi&scaron;e u pozadini, imate i dio s nekom travom. Na ovoj plaži imate prilično ravno morsko dno, &scaron;to vam omogućuje da počnete plivati na oko 40 m. Ta činjenica znači da će se va&scaron;a mala djeca sigurnije igrati u vodi. Plaža je nagrađena znakom plave zastave. Zbog nagrade &bdquo;Plava zastava&ldquo; i luke u blizini, ovdje imate i neku plažnu infrastrukturu. Restorani nisu u blizini, pa ponesite hranu sa sobom, a ako tražite smje&scaron;taj, imate mogućnost kampiranja u blizini. Uživajte u istraživanju plaže Fynshav s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3899, 'hr', 1),
(1462, 'Saluti dalla spiaggia Loddenh&oslash;j. Se stai cercando una spiaggia danese la cui superficie sia un misto di sabbia e piccoli ciottoli, e ti piacerebbe anche avere un campo nelle vicinanze, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia per famiglie Strand Loddenh&oslash;j. Si trova nella regione Syddanmark nelle vicinanze della citt&agrave; di Aabenraa. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi semplicemente parcheggiare sulla strada proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. In spiaggia hai a disposizione 500 m di lunghezza e 15 m di larghezza, per trovare il tuo posto per ombrellone e telo. Quando vai in acqua hai delle piccole pietre sul fondo. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 20 m. Alcune infrastrutture balneari sono disponibili qui, anche un piccolo bistrot e per il tuo alloggio puoi andare al campo o affittare un appartamento nelle vicinanze. Divertiti ad esplorare la spiaggia di Loddenh&oslash;j con BeachRex.', 3903, 'it', 1),
(1463, 'Saludos desde la playa Loddenh&oslash;j. Si est&aacute; buscando una playa danesa donde la superficie de la playa sea una mezcla de arena y peque&ntilde;os guijarros, y tambi&eacute;n le gustar&iacute;a tener un campamento cerca, le sugerimos que visite la playa familiar Strand Loddenh&oslash;j. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Syddanmark en las cercan&iacute;as de la ciudad Aabenraa. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y simplemente puede estacionarse en la carretera justo en frente de la playa. En la playa tienes 500 m de largo y 15 m de ancho disponibles, para encontrar tu lugar para tu sombrilla y toalla. Al ir al agua tienes unas peque&ntilde;as piedras en el fondo. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a 20 m. Algunas infraestructuras de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, tambi&eacute;n un peque&ntilde;o bistr&oacute; y para su alojamiento puede ir al campamento o alquilar un apartamento cercano. Disfrute explorando la playa Loddenh&oslash;j con BeachRex.', 3903, 'es', 1),
(1464, 'Salutations de la plage de Loddenh&oslash;j. Si vous recherchez une plage danoise o&ugrave; la surface de la plage est un m&eacute;lange de sable et de petits galets, et que vous souhaitez &eacute;galement avoir un campement &agrave; proximit&eacute;, nous vous sugg&eacute;rons de visiter la plage familiale Strand Loddenh&oslash;j. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville Aabenraa. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez simplement vous garer sur la route juste en face de la plage. Sur la plage, vous disposez de 500 m de longueur et 15 m de largeur, pour trouver votre place pour votre parasol et votre serviette. En allant &agrave; l&#39;eau, vous avez quelques petites pierres sur le fond. Le point de nage est &agrave; 20 m. Certaines infrastructures de plage sont disponibles ici, &eacute;galement un petit bistrot et pour votre h&eacute;bergement, vous pouvez soit aller au camp, soit louer un appartement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de l&#39;exploration de la plage de Loddenh&oslash;j avec BeachRex.', 3903, 'fr', 1),
(1465, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Gr&uuml;&szlig;e vom Strand Loddenh&oslash;j. Wenn Sie nach einem d&auml;nischen Strand suchen, dessen Strandoberfl&auml;che eine Mischung aus Sand und kleinen Kieselsteinen ist, und Sie auch ein Camp in der N&auml;he haben m&ouml;chten, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Familienstrand Strand Loddenh&oslash;j zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der Region Syddanmark in der N&auml;he der Stadt Aabenraa. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach an der Stra&szlig;e direkt vor dem Strand parken. Am Strand stehen Ihnen 500 m L&auml;nge und 15 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung, um Ihren Platz f&uuml;r Sonnenschirm und Handtuch zu finden. Wenn Sie zum Wasser gehen, haben Sie einige kleine Steine auf dem Boden. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 20 m. Hier gibt es eine Strandinfrastruktur, auch ein kleines Bistro. F&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft k&ouml;nnen Sie entweder ins Camp gehen oder eine Wohnung in der N&auml;he mieten. Genie&szlig;en Sie mit BeachRex die Erkundung des Strandes Loddenh&oslash;j.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n', 3903, 'de', 1),
(1466, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Lep pozdrav s plaže Loddenh&oslash;j. Če i&scaron;čete dansko plažo, na kateri je povr&scaron;ina plaže me&scaron;anica peska in drobnih kamenčkov, poleg tega pa bi radi imeli kamp v bližini, predlagamo, da obi&scaron;čete družinsko plažo Strand Loddenh&oslash;j. Nahaja se v regiji Syddanmark v bližini mesta Aabenraa. Do te lokacije se lahko pripeljete s katero koli vrsto vozila in preprosto parkirate ob cesti tik pred plažo. Na plaži imate na voljo 500 m dolžine in 15 m &scaron;irine, da najdete svoje mesto za sončnik in brisačo. Ko greste v vodo, imate na dnu nekaj majhnih kamnov. Točka plavanja je pri 20 m. Tu je na voljo nekaj infrastruktur za plažo, tudi majhen bistro, za namestitev pa se lahko odpravite v kamp ali pa si najamete apartma v bližini. Uživajte v raziskovanju plaže Loddenh&oslash;j s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3903, 'sl', 1),
(1467, 'Pozdrav s plaže Loddenh&oslash;j. Ako tražite dansku plažu na kojoj je područje plaže mje&scaron;avina pijeska i &scaron;ljunka, a uz to biste željeli imati i kamp u blizini, predlažemo vam da posjetite obiteljsku plažu Strand Loddenh&oslash;j. Nalazi se u regiji Syddanmark u blizini grada Aabenraa. Do ove lokacije se može doći bilo kojom vrstom vozila, a jednostavno možete parkirati pored ceste ispred plaže. Na plaži vam je na raspolaganju dug 500 m i &scaron;irok 15 m da biste prona&scaron;li svoje mjesto za suncobran i ručnik. Kad uđete u vodu, na dnu imate sitno kamenje. Točka kupanja je na 20 m. Postoji neka infrastruktura na plaži, uključujući mali bistro, a možete ići u kampiranje ili unajmiti stan u blizini. Uživajte u istraživanju plaže Loddenh&oslash;j s uslugom BeachRex.', 3903, 'hr', 1),
(1468, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia Genner. Vicino al villaggio danese di R&oslash;dekro nella regione di Syddanmark, c&#39;&egrave; una bella spiaggia di sabbia, chiamata Strand Genner, dove puoi trascorrere le tue meritate vacanze. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungere la spiaggia con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare a soli 30 m dalla spiaggia in un piccolo parcheggio. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 750 m ed &egrave; larga 20 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello qui e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 10 m. Sono disponibili alcuni servizi in spiaggia, ma nelle vicinanze non vi sono ristoranti o bar. Per quanto riguarda il tuo alloggio, se desideri rimanere pi&ugrave; a lungo qui, puoi scegliere tra un campeggio o alcuni appartamenti, non lontano dalla spiaggia. Divertiti ad esplorare la spiaggia Genner con BeachRex.', 3904, 'it', 1),
(1469, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenue &agrave; la plage Genner. Pr&egrave;s du village danois de R&oslash;dekro dans la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark, vous avez une belle plage de sable, nomm&eacute;e Strand Genner, o&ugrave; vous pourrez passer vos vacances bien m&eacute;rit&eacute;es. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, et vous pouvez vous garer &agrave; seulement 30 m de la plage sur une petite place de parking. La plage a une longueur totale de 750 m et une largeur de 20 m. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able ici et le point de baignade est &agrave; 10 m. Vous avez des services de plage disponibles, mais aucun restaurant ou caf&eacute; ne se trouve &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Quant &agrave; votre h&eacute;bergement, si vous souhaitez y rester plus longtemps, vous avez le choix entre un camp ou des appartements, non loin de la plage. Profitez de l&#39;exploration de la plage Genner avec BeachRex.</div>\n', 3904, 'fr', 1),
(1470, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenido a la playa Genner. Cerca del pueblo dan&eacute;s R&oslash;dekro en la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark, tiene una bonita playa de arena, llamada Strand Genner, donde puede pasar sus merecidas vacaciones. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a la playa con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, y se puede aparcar a solo 30 m de la playa en una peque&ntilde;a plaza de aparcamiento. La playa tiene una longitud total de 750 my 20 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy bonita aqu&iacute; y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a 10 m. Tiene algunos servicios de playa disponibles, pero no hay restaurante ni cafeter&iacute;a cerca. En cuanto a tu alojamiento, si quieres quedarte m&aacute;s tiempo aqu&iacute;, puedes elegir entre un campamento o algunos apartamentos, no muy lejos de la playa. Disfrute explorando la playa Genner con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3904, 'es', 1),
(1471, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Willkommen am Strand Genner. In der N&auml;he des d&auml;nischen Dorfes R&oslash;dekro in der Region Syddanmark befindet sich ein sch&ouml;ner Sandstrand namens Strand Genner, an dem Sie Ihren wohlverdienten Urlaub verbringen k&ouml;nnen. Es ist sehr einfach, den Strand mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt auf einem kleinen Parkplatz parken. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 750 m und ist 20 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist hier sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 10 m. Sie haben einige Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, aber kein Restaurant oder eine Kaffeebar ist in der N&auml;he. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie zwischen einem Camp oder einigen Apartments in der N&auml;he des Strandes w&auml;hlen. Genie&szlig;en Sie es, den Strand Genner mit BeachRex zu erkunden.</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3904, 'de', 1),
(1472, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Genner. V bližini danske vasi R&oslash;dekro v regiji Syddanmark imate lepo pe&scaron;čeno plažo z imenom Strand Genner, kjer lahko preživite zaslužene počitnice. Dostop do plaže je možen z vsemi oblikami transporta, tudi z avtodomom, na majhnem parkiri&scaron;ču pa lahko parkirate le 30 m stran od plaže. Plaža ima skupno dolžino 750 m in je &scaron;iroka 20 m. Vstop v vodo je tu zelo lep, točka plavanja pa je na 10 m. Na voljo imate nekaj storitev na plaži, v bližini pa ni nobene restavracije ali kavarne. Kar se tiče va&scaron;e namestitve, če želite ostati tukaj dlje, lahko izbirate med kampom ali nekaj apartmaji, nedaleč stran od plaže. Uživajte v raziskovanju plaže Genner s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3904, 'sl', 1),
(1473, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na plažu Genner. U blizini danskog sela R&oslash;dekro u regiji Syddanmark imate prekrasnu pje&scaron;čanu plažu koja se zove Strand Genner, gdje možete provesti zasluženi odmor. Pristup plaži moguć je svim oblicima prijevoza, uključujući i kamperom, a na malom parkirali&scaron;tu možete parkirati samo 30 m od plaže. Plaža je ukupne dužine 750 m i &scaron;iroka je 20 m. Ulaz u vodu je ovdje vrlo lijep, a mjesto za kupanje je na 10 m. Na raspolaganju su neke usluge na plaži, a u blizini nema restorana ili kafića. &Scaron;to se tiče va&scaron;eg smje&scaron;taja, ako želite ovdje ostati duže, možete birati između kampa ili nekoliko apartmana, nedaleko od plaže. Uživajte u istraživanju plaže Genner s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3904, 'hr', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1474, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Benvenuti sulla spiaggia Flovt. Vicino alla citt&agrave; danese di Haderslev, che fa parte della regione Syddanmark, c&#39;&egrave; una lunghissima spiaggia sabbiosa chiamata Strand Flovt. Questa spiaggia &egrave; consigliata per un tipo di utente familiare. Se avete bambini piccoli, che amano giocare in acqua, fate attenzione, perch&eacute; il punto di balneazione su questa spiaggia &egrave; gi&agrave; a 5 m. Puoi venire in questa spiaggia con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con camper. Il parcheggio &egrave; molto ampio e si pu&ograve; lasciare il proprio veicolo a soli 100mt a piedi dalla spiaggia. Questa bellezza &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga 20 m. La spiaggia ha un&#39;inclinazione normale e un dislivello abbastanza ripido nella profondit&agrave; del fondale. Attorno al parcheggio ci sono delle infrastrutture per la spiaggia. Ristoranti o bar non sono disponibili qui, ma hai alcuni alloggi disponibili sotto forma di appartamenti nelle vicinanze. Divertiti ad esplorare la spiaggia Flovt con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3906, 'it', 1),
(1475, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenue &agrave; la plage Flovt. Pr&egrave;s de la ville danoise de Haderslev, qui fait partie de la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark, vous avez une tr&egrave;s longue plage de sable appel&eacute;e Strand Flovt. Cette plage est recommand&eacute;e pour un type d&#39;utilisateur familial. Si vous avez de jeunes enfants, qui aiment jouer dans l&#39;eau, soyez prudent, car le point de baignade sur cette plage est d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 5 m. Vous pouvez venir sur cette plage avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, y compris avec des camping-cars. Le parking est tr&egrave;s grand et vous pouvez laisser votre v&eacute;hicule &agrave; seulement 100m &agrave; pied de la plage. Cette beaut&eacute; mesure plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et 20 m de large. La plage a une inclinaison normale et une pente assez raide dans la profondeur du fond marin. Autour du parking, vous avez une infrastructure de plage. Les restaurants ou les caf&eacute;s ne sont pas disponibles ici, mais vous avez des h&eacute;bergements disponibles sous forme d&#39;appartements &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de l&#39;exploration de la plage Flovt avec BeachRex.</div>\n', 3906, 'fr', 1),
(1476, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenido a la playa Flovt. Cerca de la ciudad danesa de Haderslev, que forma parte de la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark, tiene una playa de arena muy larga llamada Strand Flovt. Esta playa est&aacute; recomendada para un tipo de usuario familiar. Si tienes ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os, a los que les encanta jugar en el agua, ten cuidado, porque el punto de ba&ntilde;o en esta playa ya est&aacute; a 5 m. Puedes venir a esta playa con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravanas. El parking es muy amplio y puedes dejar tu veh&iacute;culo a solo 100m andando de la playa. Esta belleza tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y 20 m de ancho. La playa tiene una inclinaci&oacute;n normal y un desnivel bastante pronunciado en la profundidad del fondo marino. Alrededor del lugar de estacionamiento tiene infraestructura de playa. Aqu&iacute; no hay restaurantes ni cafeter&iacute;as, pero hay algunos alojamientos disponibles en forma de apartamentos cercanos. Disfrute explorando la playa Flovt con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3906, 'es', 1),
(1477, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Willkommen am Strand Flovt. In der N&auml;he der d&auml;nischen Stadt Haderslev, die Teil der Region Syddanmark ist, befindet sich ein sehr langer Sandstrand namens Strand Flovt. Dieser Strand wird f&uuml;r einen Familienbenutzertyp empfohlen. Wenn Sie kleine Kinder haben, die gerne im Wasser spielen, seien Sie vorsichtig, denn der Schwimmpunkt an diesem Strand liegt bereits bei 5 m. Sie k&ouml;nnen mit jedem Fahrzeug an diesen Strand kommen, auch mit Wohnmobilen. Der Parkplatz ist sehr gro&szlig; und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt lassen. Diese Sch&ouml;nheit ist mehrere Kilometer lang und 20 Meter breit. Der Strand hat eine normale Neigung und einen ziemlich steilen Abfall in der Tiefe des Meeresbodens. Rund um den Parkplatz gibt es eine Strandinfrastruktur. Restaurants oder Caf&eacute;s sind hier nicht verf&uuml;gbar, aber Sie haben einige Unterk&uuml;nfte in Form von Apartments in der N&auml;he. Genie&szlig;en Sie es, den Strand Flovt mit BeachRex zu erkunden.</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3906, 'de', 1),
(1478, 'Benvenuti nella citt&agrave; danese di Assens. Sull&#39;isola di Funen, puoi visitare una spiaggia sabbiosa chiamata Strand Assens, che si trova proprio accanto al porto. Questa spiaggia si trova nella regione di Syddanmark ed &egrave; molto facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, e hai anche molte opzioni per parcheggiare l&igrave;. Il parcheggio pi&ugrave; vicino si trova a soli 30 m dalla spiaggia, altri sono un po &#39;pi&ugrave; lontani. Sebbene la superficie principale della spiaggia sia sabbia, ci sono anche alcune pietre mescolate all&#39;interno. La lunghezza della spiaggia &egrave; di 500 m ed &egrave; larga pi&ugrave; di 100 m. La superficie qui &egrave; molto piatta. L&#39;ingresso in acqua dalla spiaggia non &egrave; altrettanto comodo, a causa dei grossi sassi nell&#39;acqua, ma &egrave; possibile utilizzare la scaletta del molo per entrare in acqua. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 10m. Alcune infrastrutture sulla spiaggia sono disponibili qui, altre sono disponibili nel porto turistico. I ristoranti non sono disponibili qui e la sistemazione pi&ugrave; vicina per il tuo soggiorno &egrave; in un campo vicino. Divertiti ad esplorare la spiaggia di Assens con BeachRex.', 3909, 'it', 1),
(1479, 'Bienvenue dans la ville danoise d&#39;Assens. Sur l&#39;&icirc;le de Fionie, vous pouvez visiter une plage de sable appel&eacute;e Strand Assens, qui est situ&eacute;e juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; du port. Cette plage est situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion de Syddanmark et est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, et vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreuses options pour vous y garer. Le parking le plus proche est &agrave; seulement 30 m de la plage, les autres sont un peu plus &eacute;loign&eacute;s. Bien que la surface principale de la plage soit du sable, vous avez &eacute;galement des pierres m&eacute;lang&eacute;es &agrave; l&#39;int&eacute;rieur. La longueur de la plage est de 500 m et sa largeur de plus de 100 m. La surface ici est tr&egrave;s plate. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau depuis la plage n&#39;est pas aussi confortable, &agrave; cause des grosses pierres dans l&#39;eau, mais vous pouvez utiliser l&#39;&eacute;chelle de la jet&eacute;e pour vous mettre &agrave; l&#39;eau. Le point de nage est &agrave; 10m. Certaines infrastructures de plage sont disponibles ici, d&#39;autres sont disponibles dans la marina. Les restaurants ne sont pas disponibles ici et l&#39;h&eacute;bergement le plus proche pour votre s&eacute;jour est dans un camp &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de l&#39;exploration de la plage d&#39;Assens avec BeachRex.', 3909, 'fr', 1),
(1480, 'Bienvenido a la ciudad danesa de Assens. En la isla de Funen, puede visitar una playa de arena llamada Strand Assens, que se encuentra justo al lado del puerto. Esta playa se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark y es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, y tambi&eacute;n tienes muchas opciones para estacionar all&iacute;. El parking m&aacute;s cercano est&aacute; a solo 30 m de la playa, otros est&aacute;n un poco m&aacute;s lejos. Aunque la superficie principal de la playa es arena, tambi&eacute;n tiene algunas piedras mezcladas en su interior. La playa tiene una longitud de 500 my m&aacute;s de 100 m de ancho. La superficie aqu&iacute; es muy plana. La entrada de agua desde la playa no es tan c&oacute;moda, por las grandes piedras que hay en el agua, pero puedes usar la escalera del muelle para entrar al agua. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a 10m. Algunas infraestructuras de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, m&aacute;s en el puerto deportivo. Los restaurantes no est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute; y el alojamiento m&aacute;s cercano para su estad&iacute;a es en un campamento cercano. Disfrute explorando la playa de Assens con BeachRex.', 3909, 'es', 1),
(1481, 'Willkommen in der d&auml;nischen Stadt Assens. Auf der Insel F&uuml;nen k&ouml;nnen Sie einen Sandstrand namens Strand Assens besuchen, der sich direkt neben dem Hafen befindet. Dieser Strand befindet sich in der Region Syddanmark und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Dort haben Sie auch viele Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten. Der n&auml;chste Parkplatz ist nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt, andere sind etwas weiter entfernt. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand Sand ist, haben Sie auch einige Steine darin gemischt. Der Strand ist 500 m lang und mehr als 100 m breit. Die Oberfl&auml;che hier ist sehr flach. Der Wassereintritt vom Strand ist wegen der gro&szlig;en Steine im Wasser nicht so bequem, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen die Leiter vom Pier aus benutzen, um ins Wasser zu gelangen. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 10m. Einige Strandinfrastrukturen sind hier verf&uuml;gbar, weitere sind in der Marina verf&uuml;gbar. Restaurants sind hier nicht verf&uuml;gbar und die n&auml;chstgelegene Unterkunft f&uuml;r Ihren Aufenthalt befindet sich in einem Camp in der N&auml;he. Genie&szlig;en Sie es, den Strand Assens mit BeachRex zu erkunden.', 3909, 'de', 1),
(1482, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li v danskem mestu Assens. Na otoku Funen lahko obi&scaron;čete pe&scaron;čeno plažo, imenovano Strand Assens, ki se nahaja tik ob pristani&scaron;ču. Ta plaža se nahaja v regiji Syddanmark in je zelo enostavno dostopna z vsemi vrstami vozil, poleg tega pa imate na voljo veliko možnosti za parkiranje va&scaron;ega vozila. Najbližje parkiri&scaron;če je od plaže oddaljeno le 30 m, druga pa so malo bolj oddaljena. Čeprav je glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži pesek, je med pesek pome&scaron;anih tudi nekaj kamnov. Dolžina plaže je 500 m in &scaron;iroka je več kot 100 m. Povr&scaron;ina plaže je zelo ravna. Vstop v vodo zaradi tako velikih kamnov ni tako udoben, vendar ni problem saj lahko uporabite lestev s pomola za vstop v vodo. Točka plavanja je pri 10 m. Nekaj infrastrukture za plažo je na voljo tukaj, več je na voljo v marini. Restavracije tukaj niso na voljo in najbližja nastanitev za va&scaron;e bivanje je v kampu v bližini. Uživajte v raziskovanju plaže Assens s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3909, 'sl', 1),
(1483, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li u danski grad Assens. Na otoku Funen možete posjetiti pje&scaron;čanu plažu koja se zove Strand Assens, a nalazi se tik uz luku. Ova se plaža nalazi u regiji Syddanmark i vrlo je lako dostupna svim vrstama vozila, a osim toga, imate brojne mogućnosti parkiranja va&scaron;eg vozila. Najbliže parkirali&scaron;te udaljeno je samo 30 m od plaže, a drugi su malo dalje. Iako je glavni dio plaže na pijesku, neki kamenčići također su pomije&scaron;ani između pijeska. Plaža je dugačka 500 m i &scaron;iroka vi&scaron;e od 100 m. Povr&scaron;ina plaže vrlo je ravna. Ulazak u vodu nije toliko zgodan zbog tako velikog kamenja, ali nije problem jer za ulazak u vodu možete koristiti ljestve s pristani&scaron;ta. Točka kupanja je na 10 m. Ovdje je dostupna neka infrastruktura na plaži, a vi&scaron;e u marini. Restorani ovdje nisu dostupni, a najbliži smje&scaron;taj za va&scaron; boravak je u obližnjem kampu. Uživajte u istraživanju plaže Beach Assens s BeachRexom.', 3909, 'hr', 1),
(1484, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na plaži Flovt. V bližini danskega mesta Haderslev, ki je del regije Syddanmark, imate zelo dolgo pe&scaron;čeno plažo, imenovano Strand Flovt. Ta plaža je priporočljiva za družinske uporabnike. Če imate majhne otroke, ki se radi igrajo v vodi, bodite previdni, saj je točka plavanja na tej plaži že na 5 m. Na to plažo lahko pridete s katerim koli vozilom, tudi z avtodomom. Parkiri&scaron;če je zelo veliko, vozilo pa lahko pustite le 100 m hoje od plaže. Ta lepotica je dolga nekaj kilometrov in &scaron;iroka 20 m. Plaža ima normalen naklon in precej strm padec v globino morskega dna. Okoli parkirnega mesta imate nekaj infrastrukture za plažo. Restavracije ali kavarne tukaj niso na voljo, vendar imate na voljo nekaj prenoči&scaron;č v obliki apartmajev v bližini. Uživajte v raziskovanju plaže Flovt s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3906, 'sl', 1),
(1485, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na Flovt plaži. U blizini danskog grada Haderslev, koji je dio regije Syddanmark, imate vrlo dugu pje&scaron;čanu plažu koja se zove Strand Flovt. Ova se plaža preporučuje obiteljskim korisnicima. Ako imate malu djecu koja se vole igrati u vodi, budite oprezni jer je točka kupanja na ovoj plaži već na 5 m. Do ove plaže možete doći bilo kojim vozilom, uključujući i kamp kućicu. Parkirali&scaron;te je vrlo veliko, a vozilo se može ostaviti samo 100 m hoda od plaže. Ova je ljepotica duga nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka 20 metara. Plaža ima normalnu padinu i prilično strm pad u dubine morskog dna. Imate neku plažnu infrastrukturu oko parkirali&scaron;ta. Restorani ili kafići ovdje nisu dostupni, ali imate smje&scaron;taj u obliku apartmana u blizini. Uživajte u istraživanju plaže Flovt s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3906, 'hr', 1),
(1486, 'Benvenuti nella tranquilla e semplice spiaggia danese di Agern&aelig;s. Si trova sull&#39;isola di Funen, vicino al villaggio di Ebberup. La regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia appartiene alla regione danese Syddanmark. &Egrave; una spiaggia di tipo familiare con la superficie principale di piccole pietre. Sulla spiaggia sono disponibili diversi chilometri di lunghezza e 10 m di larghezza. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare a circa 15 m. Alcune infrastrutture di base sulla spiaggia si trovano qui e sono concentrate intorno al porto, ma non aspettarti troppo. Ristoranti o simili non sono disponibili qui, ma hai un hotel nelle vicinanze, se stai cercando un alloggio. Divertiti ad esplorare la spiaggia di Agern&aelig;s con BeachRex.', 3910, 'it', 1),
(1487, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenue sur la plage danoise tr&egrave;s paisible et simple Agern&aelig;s. Il est situ&eacute; sur l&#39;&icirc;le de Fionie, pr&egrave;s du village Ebberup. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve cette plage est la r&eacute;gion danoise Syddanmark. C&#39;est une plage de type familial dont la surface principale est de petites pierres. Sur la plage, vous disposez de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de longueur et 10 m de largeur. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager &agrave; environ 15 m. Certaines infrastructures de plage de base se trouvent ici, et elles sont concentr&eacute;es autour du port, mais ne vous attendez pas &agrave; trop. Les restaurants ou similaires ne sont pas disponibles ici, mais vous avez un h&ocirc;tel &agrave; proximit&eacute;, si vous recherchez un h&eacute;bergement. Profitez de l&#39;exploration de la plage Agern&aelig;s avec BeachRex.</div>\n', 3910, 'fr', 1),
(1488, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenido a la tranquila y sencilla playa danesa Agern&aelig;s. Se encuentra en la isla Funen, cerca del pueblo Ebberup. La regi&oacute;n a la que pertenece esta playa es la regi&oacute;n danesa de Syddanmark. Es una playa de tipo familiar con la superficie principal de piedras peque&ntilde;as. En la playa tienes varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y 10 m de ancho disponibles. La entrada de agua es agradable y se puede empezar a nadar a unos 15 m. Aqu&iacute; se encuentra algo de infraestructura de playa b&aacute;sica y se concentra alrededor del puerto, pero no espere demasiado. Los restaurantes o similares no est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, pero tienes un hotel cerca, si est&aacute;s buscando alojamiento. Disfrute explorando la playa Agern&aelig;s con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3910, 'es', 1),
(1489, 'Willkommen am sehr ruhigen und einfachen d&auml;nischen Strand Agern&aelig;s. Es befindet sich auf der Insel F&uuml;nen in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Ebberup. Die Region, zu der dieser Strand geh&ouml;rt, ist die d&auml;nische Region Syddanmark. Es ist ein Strand vom Typ Familie, dessen Hauptoberfl&auml;che kleine Steine sind. Am Strand stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und 10 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen bei 15 m mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Hier befindet sich eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur, die sich um den Hafen konzentriert, aber Sie sollten nicht zu viel erwarten. Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches gibt es hier nicht, aber Sie haben ein Hotel in der N&auml;he, wenn Sie nach einer Unterkunft suchen. Genie&szlig;en Sie mit BeachRex die Erkundung des Strandes Agern&aelig;s.', 3910, 'de', 1),
(1490, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na zelo mirni in preprosti danski plaži Agern&aelig;s. Nahaja se na otoku Funen, v bližini vasi Ebberup. Območje, kjer se nahaja ta plaža, je danska regija Syddanmark. To je plaža družinskega tipa, katere glavna povr&scaron;ina je majhno kamenje. Na plaži imate na voljo več kilometrov dolžine in 10 m &scaron;irine. Vstop v vodo je lep in lahko začnete plavati pri približno 15 m. Tu je nekaj osnovne plaže infrastrukture in je večinoma skoncentrirana okoli pristani&scaron;ča, vendar ne pričakujte preveč. Restavracije ali podobno tukaj niso na voljo, imate pa hotel v bližini, če i&scaron;čete nastanitev. Uživajte v raziskovanju plaže Agern&aelig;s s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3910, 'sl', 1),
(1491, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na vrlo mirnu i jednostavnu dansku plažu Agern&aelig;s. Nalazi se na otoku Funen, u blizini sela Ebberup. Područje gdje se nalazi ova plaža je danska regija Syddanmark. Ovo je plaža obiteljskog tipa čija je glavna povr&scaron;ina mali &scaron;ljunak. Na plaži imate nekoliko kilometara dužine i 10 m &scaron;irine. Ulaz u vodu je lijep i plivanje možete započeti na oko 15 m. Postoji osnovna infrastruktura za plažu i uglavnom je koncentrirana oko luke, ali nemojte očekivati previ&scaron;e. Restorani ili slični ovdje nisu dostupni, ali u blizini imate hotel ako tražite smje&scaron;taj. Uživajte u istraživanju plaže Agern&aelig;s s BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3910, 'hr', 1),
(1492, 'Willkommen am Strand Basin. In der deutschen Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, die sich in der N&auml;he der Ostsee befindet, befindet sich direkt neben der Stadt Heringsdorf ein sehr sch&ouml;ner wei&szlig;er Sandstrand. Es ist mehr Kilometer lang und bis zu 75 Meter breit. Die Neigung ist normal und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 30 Metern. Sie k&ouml;nnen den Strand mit allen Arten von Fahrzeugen erreichen und vom Parkplatz aus sind es nur 200 Meter zu Fu&szlig;, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Um an den Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie 2,7 Euro Strandgeb&uuml;hr an einem Belegautomaten zahlen, an dem Sie Ihre Tageskarte ausdrucken k&ouml;nnen. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist auf einem hohen Niveau, Sie haben sogar Kinderspielpl&auml;tze am Strand und Sie k&ouml;nnen einige deutsche Liegest&uuml;hle, Strandkorb genannt, und vieles mehr mieten. Da dieser Ort sehr touristisch ist, haben Sie eine gro&szlig;e Auswahl an Unterk&uuml;nften sowie viele verschiedene Restaurants, die alle in Strandn&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar sind.', 3799, 'de', 1),
(1493, 'Willkommen am sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand Strand Loddin. In der N&auml;he der deutschen Stadt Loddin in der deutschen Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern befindet sich ein sehr sch&ouml;ner Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien geeignet ist. Die Familien sind hier sehr willkommen, da sich zwei Kinderspielpl&auml;tze direkt am Strand befinden. Diese deutsche Ostseelage ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und Sie m&uuml;ssen nur 200 m zu Fu&szlig; gehen, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Der Strand ist einige Kilometer lang und rund 50 m breit. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 30 m. Um an den Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie ein Ticket von 2,5 &euro; bezahlen. Sie haben hier reichlich Strandinfrastruktur, sogar einige Sportpl&auml;tze und einige Wassersportger&auml;te k&ouml;nnen hier gemietet werden. Hier finden Sie Restaurants, Strandbars und viele verschiedene Fastfood-Optionen. Die Unterkunft ist auch in vielen Formen verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich als Hotels, Apartments und sogar in einigen Campingpl&auml;tzen.', 3801, 'de', 1),
(1494, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Willkommen am Sandstrand Peenem&uuml;nde. Dieser Strand in der deutschen Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern geh&ouml;rt zur Stadt Peenem&uuml;nde. Es ist einer dieser typisch deutschen Sandstr&auml;nde, an denen Sie je nach Lebensstil viele verschiedene Sektoren haben. Sie k&ouml;nnen einen Sektor f&uuml;r Hunde, einen normalen Strandbekleidungssektor oder einen f&uuml;r Nudisten ausw&auml;hlen. Der Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, sehr leicht zu erreichen. Zum Strand gelangen Sie zu Fu&szlig; nach rund 400 Meter. Das Wasser ist sehr flach, so dass der Schwimmpunkt bei etwa 50 Metern liegt. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist mehr als 50 Meter breit. In einigen Sektoren haben Sie viel Strandinfrastruktur, in einigen haben Sie sehr wenig. Das gleiche gilt f&uuml;r das Catering und die Restaurants. An einigen Stellen haben Sie eine gro&szlig;e Auswahl, an anderen haben Sie keine. Die Unterbringung erfolgt entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Apartments, Hotels, Zimmern und Campingpl&auml;tzen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3805, 'de', 1),
(1495, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Willkommen am deutschen Sandstrand Loissin. Der Strand Loissin eignet sich eher f&uuml;r Abenteuerlustige als f&uuml;r eine normale Familie. Es befindet sich in der deutschen Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern und bietet Ihnen ein echtes Sandstranderlebnis. Es ist kein Problem, es mit Ihrem Fahrzeug zu erreichen. Auch Wohnmobile sind willkommen. Der Parkplatz ist sehr gro&szlig; und Sie k&ouml;nnen maximal 3 Stunden auf dem Parkplatz bleiben oder sich f&uuml;r das benachbarte Camp entscheiden. Die Entfernung vom Parkplatz zum Strand betr&auml;gt 200 m. Vom Weg aus m&uuml;ssen Sie eine schmale Stra&szlig;e hinunter zum Strand nehmen, wobei der Abstieg ziemlich schwierig ist. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 750 m und ist 10 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und die gesamte Wasserfl&auml;che ist sehr flach, so dass der Punkt zum Schwimmen bei mehreren 100 m liegt. Am Strand gibt es fast keine Infrastruktur, aber mehr befindet sich im benachbarten Camp. Das Camp und einige Apartments sind die einzigen verf&uuml;gbaren Unterk&uuml;nfte rund um den Strand.</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n', 3807, 'de', 1),
(1496, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Suchen Sie einen Strand, der auf alle Arten von Wassersportarten spezialisiert ist, insbesondere auf Kitesurfen und Windsurfen? Dann empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Thiessow zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der deutschen Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern auf der sch&ouml;nen Insel R&uuml;gen. Der Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand parken, nur 50 Meter entfernt. Der Parkplatz ist privat, ber&uuml;cksichtigen Sie also eine Parkgeb&uuml;hr. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes ist Sand, der sich &uuml;ber einen Kilometer erstreckt und die Breite des Strandes betr&auml;gt nur 5 Meter. Das Wasser hier ist sehr flach, was es ideal f&uuml;r Wassersportarten wie Windsurfen und Kitesurfen macht. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei rund 75 Metern. Da dies ein sehr beliebter Ort f&uuml;r Windsurfer ist, haben Sie hier eine gro&szlig;e Strandinfrastruktur und k&ouml;nnen auch auf dem Parkplatz &uuml;bernachten, der wie ein kleines Camp organisiert ist. Essen gibt es nicht direkt am Strand, sondern in den umliegenden D&ouml;rfern. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.</div>\n', 3809, 'de', 1),
(1497, 'Die Stadt Binz, auf der deutschen Insel R&uuml;gen, im &auml;u&szlig;ersten Norden Mecklenburg-Vorpommerns, hat einen sehr langen Sandstrand zu bieten. Es ist ein typisch deutscher Strand, weil er in viele Lifestyle-Bereiche unterteilt ist, wie den f&uuml;r Hunde und den f&uuml;r Nudisten, und einen regul&auml;ren, in dem Strandkleidung obligatorisch ist. Weil der Strand so lang ist, haben Sie viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, darauf zuzugreifen. Parkpl&auml;tze stehen entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts zur Verf&uuml;gung, und es gibt sogar einen gro&szlig;en, den wir benutzt haben um zu dem Strand zu gelangen. Zum Strand gelangen Sie nach 200 Metern. Dort stehen Ihnen 50 Meter Strand Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung, die sich &uuml;ber mehrere Kilometer erstreckt. Der Zugang zum Wasser ist sehr sch&ouml;n und komfortabel und das Schwimmen beginnt bei etwa 30 Metern. An einigen Stellen ist die Strandinfrastruktur nur grundlegend, an einigen Stellen stehen erweiterte Dienste zur Verf&uuml;gung. Strandbars und Bistros sowie Fast-Food-Kioske stehen direkt am Strand zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, haben Sie viele M&ouml;glichkeiten zur Auswahl, haupts&auml;chlich als Apartments, und die meisten sind nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3814, 'de', 1),
(1498, 'Dieser Strand auf der sch&ouml;nen deutschen Insel R&uuml;gen tr&auml;gt den Namen Strand Juliusruh. Wie die meisten Str&auml;nde dieser Insel besteht auch dieser aus Sand und ist mehrere Kilometer lang. Es ist in viele Sektoren unterteilt, so dass der Nudist und derjenige, der Hunde hat, am selben Strand sein k&ouml;nnen, nur in ihrem eigenen Sektor, und alle anderen k&ouml;nnen in ihrem eigenen Sektor von ihnen getrennt werden. Der Parkplatz ist rund 300 Meter entfernt und bietet Platz f&uuml;r mehr als 100 Fahrzeuge aller Art. Wohnmobile sind ebenfalls willkommen. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, stehen Ihnen einige Kilometer L&auml;nge und 40 Meter Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei ca. 50 Metern. Die Stranddienstleistungen sind in einigen Sektoren verf&uuml;gbar. auf einigen hast du keinen Dienst. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, haben Sie viele Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, sogar ein Camp.', 3819, 'de', 1),
(1499, 'Willkommen am n&ouml;rdlichsten Strand der Ostsee. Der Strand Nordufer ist bei deutschen Touristen sehr beliebt. Es ist der n&ouml;rdlichste Punkt an der Ostsee in Deutschland. Es bietet Ihnen einen sehr langen Sandstrand mit herrlichem Blick auf die hohen Klippen, die ihn umgeben. Um diesen Punkt zu erreichen, m&uuml;ssen Sie die deutsche Insel R&uuml;gen besuchen und in das Dorf Putgarten fahren. Von der asphaltierten Hauptstra&szlig;e m&uuml;ssen Sie eine 1 km lange Betonstra&szlig;e nehmen, auf der Sie Ihr Fahrzeug direkt vor dem Strand auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken k&ouml;nnen. Beachten Sie, dass der Zugang zum Strand 100 m lang und etwa 25 m hoch ist. Die Treppen zum Strand sind ziemlich steil. Der Strand ist am besten f&uuml;r Abenteuertouristen geeignet. Am Strand oder in der Umgebung stehen Ihnen keine Stranddienstleistungen, Unterk&uuml;nfte oder Speisen und Getr&auml;nke zur Verf&uuml;gung. Sobald Sie am Strand angekommen sind, stehen Ihnen 30 Meter Strandbreite und ein sehr komfortabler Wassereintritt mit einem Schwimmpunkt von etwa 20 Metern zur Verf&uuml;gung. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3820, 'de', 1),
(1500, 'Die meisten Str&auml;nde in Deutschland sind sandig, aber an diesem Strand ist dies nicht der Fall. Am Strand Dranske gibt es eine Mischung aus Sand und einigen gro&szlig;en Steinen gemischt mit kleinen Steinen. Der Strand befindet sich auf der deutschen Insel R&uuml;gen, nahe dem n&ouml;rdlichsten Punkt Deutschlands. Vor dem Strand gibt es einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, auf dem viele Fahrzeuge, auch Wohnmobile, Platz finden. Vom Parkplatz ist der Strand nur 50 Meter entfernt. Stranddienstleistungen sind hier sehr wenige , die Unterkunft und auch die Restaurants sind etwas mehr in Richtung Dorf Dranske verf&uuml;gbar. Am Strand ist der Wassereintritt wegen der gro&szlig;en Steine direkt am Meer nicht so bequem wie anderswo. Sie haben mindestens 15 Meter Strandbreite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei rund 30 Metern.', 3821, 'de', 1),
(1501, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Willkommen am sch&ouml;nen Familienstrand Dierhagen. Wenn Sie ein famili&auml;rer Strandnutzer sind, der gerne einen Kinderspielplatz und eine kleine Fitness im Freien unter den Pinien in Strandn&auml;he hat, m&uuml;ssen Sie den deutschen Strand Dierhagen besuchen. Es liegt im deutschen Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern und ist Teil des Ostseeraums oder wie der Deutsche sagt der Ostsee. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen etwa 300 Meter vom Strand entfernt parken. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, haben Sie viele Sektoren zur Auswahl, entweder den f&uuml;r Nudisten, den mit den Hunden oder einen normalen. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von vielen Kilometern und kann bis zu 50 Meter breit sein. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und schon nach 15 Metern kann man mit dem schwimmen beginnen. Hier gibt es viele Stranddienstleistungen und noch mehr Restaurants, Caf&eacute;s, Fast Food und Eisdielen. Unterk&uuml;nfte sind auch in Strandn&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich als Hotels und Apartments. Wenn Sie lieber in einem Camp &uuml;bernachten m&ouml;chten, haben Sie auch diese Option. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Urlaub mit BeachRex.</div>\n', 3825, 'de', 1),
(1502, 'Delfzijl ist eine niederl&auml;ndische Stadt in der Region Groningen, die Ihnen einen Sandstrand namens Zeestrand Eemshotel bieten kann und in der N&auml;he des Haupthafens der Stadt liegt. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, Ihr Auto zu parken, entweder auf der Stra&szlig;e oder auf einigen provisorischen Parkpl&auml;tzen in Strandn&auml;he. Es ist ein familien&auml;hnlicher Strand und Sie sind nur 30 m zu Fu&szlig; vom Parkplatz entfernt. Insgesamt ist der Strand 200 m lang und an der breitesten Stelle 50 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n, es ist sehr flach und der Schwimmpunkt h&auml;ngt von der Ebbe oder Flut ab. Sie haben hier eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur. Im Sommer, wenn dieser Ort &uuml;berf&uuml;llt ist, gibt es auch einige Strandkiosks und Fast-Food-Restaurants. Unterk&uuml;nfte sind ebenfalls in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar. Sie haben ein Hotel in der N&auml;he und einige Apartments in der Stadt. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4022, 'de', 1),
(1503, 'Wenn Sie eine Familie mit kleinen Kindern sind, die einen Sandstrand mit seichtem Wasser und einen Kinderspielplatz in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Groningen sucht, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Meerwijck zu besuchen. Dieser Strand liegt eigentlich nicht an der K&uuml;ste, sondern am See Zuidlaardermeer, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Kropswolde. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, und auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken, der nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt ist. Der Weg zum Strand ist einfach und ein sehr flacher Strand mit viel Strand erwartet Sie. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 500 m und ist mehr als 100 m breit. Aufgrund des flachen Wassers ist der Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt ist weit weg, mehr als 100 m. Das flache Wasser ist auch ein zus&auml;tzliches Merkmal f&uuml;r Familien mit kleinen Kindern, die sicherer im Wasser spielen k&ouml;nnen. Da dieser Ort sehr beliebt ist, gibt es hier auch viele Strandinfrastrukturen und -dienste. In Strandn&auml;he gibt es auch ein Restaurant. Unterk&uuml;nfte sind auch in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich als Camp und in einigen Apartments oder H&auml;usern. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4024, 'de', 1),
(1504, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Die niederl&auml;ndische Stadt Groningen, die in der gleichnamigen Region liegt, hat einen sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand f&uuml;r Ihren Besuch zu bieten. Dieser Strand liegt nicht an der K&uuml;ste am Meer, sondern am See Hoornseplas und hat auch den gleichen Namen Strand Hoornseplas. Es ist ein famili&auml;rer Strand mit viel Gras und nat&uuml;rlichem Schatten (B&auml;ume), sehr flachem Wasser und einem gro&szlig;en Kinderspielplatz. Wenn Sie all diese Eigenschaften m&ouml;gen und es besuchen m&ouml;chten, ist es mit jeder Art von Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen, auch mit kleineren Wohnmobilen. Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 200 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Obwohl der Parkplatz eine H&ouml;henbarriere von 2,75 m und auf einem Parkplatz von 3 m hat. Der Weg zum Strand ist sehr sch&ouml;n und auch behinderte Menschen k&ouml;nnen den Strand erreichen. Der gesamte Strandbereich hat viel Fl&auml;che, so dass Sie w&auml;hlen k&ouml;nnen, ob Sie im Sand oder im Gras bleiben m&ouml;chten. Insgesamt betr&auml;gt die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes 750 m und der Teil mit dem Sand ist 30 m breit. Der gr&uuml;ne Teil des Strandes ist mit rund 100 m noch breiter. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und wegen des flachen Wassers liegt der Schwimmpunkt bei 75 m. Viele Stranddienstleistungen und Infrastrukturen sind hier verf&uuml;gbar. Sie haben auch viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, etwas zu essen zu bekommen. Unterkunft ist auch kein Problem; Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder in einem Hotel &uuml;bernachten oder eine Wohnung mieten.</div>\n', 4025, 'de', 1),
(1505, 'In der N&auml;he der niederl&auml;ndischen Stadt Leeuwarden, die sich in der Mitte der Region Friesland befindet, weit weg von der K&uuml;ste und der Nordsee, befindet sich ein sch&ouml;ner Sandstrand am Lytse Wielen-See. Es hat den gleichen Namen wie der See und tr&auml;gt den Namen Strand Lytse Wielen. Es handelt sich um einen Familienstrand, der mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen ist. Rund um die Gegend stehen Ihnen zahlreiche Parkpl&auml;tze zur Verf&uuml;gung. Hier k&ouml;nnen auch Wohnmobile parken. Vom Parkplatz aus sind es etwa 200 m zu Fu&szlig; zum Strand. Der Weg zum Strand ist sehr sch&ouml;n. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand Sand ist, haben Sie auch viele Rasenfl&auml;chen. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 200 m und ist 40 m breit. Sie haben aber auch viel Rasenfl&auml;che, wodurch der Strand noch breiter wird. Es ist ein sehr flacher Bereich, der den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n macht. Da das Wasser sehr flach ist, liegt der Schwimmpunkt bei ca. 50 m. Sie haben viele Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, Kinderspielplatz inklusive. Ein kleiner Fast-Food-Kiosk befindet sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, haben Sie einen Campingplatz in der N&auml;he und einige Apartments. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4026, 'de', 1),
(1506, 'Der niederl&auml;ndische Strand Harlingen liegt in der Region Friesland. Es ist ein Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien empfohlen wird und mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen ist. Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine 10 m hohe Meerwassersperre &uuml;berqueren. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 400 m und ist 50 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 30 m. Sie haben einige grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur am Strand. Am Strand befindet sich auch eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant. Sie haben auch in der N&auml;he viele Sommerunterk&uuml;nfte, wie ein Camp, und Sie k&ouml;nnen sogar einige Wohnungen mieten.', 4027, 'de', 1),
(1507, 'In der N&auml;he des kleinen niederl&auml;ndischen Dorfes Kornwerderzand, das an einer langen k&uuml;nstlichen Wassersperre liegt, die die Nordsee und das IJsselmeer trennt, befindet sich ein kleiner k&uuml;nstlicher Sandstrand mit dem Namen Strand Kornwerderzan. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Friesland. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Es liegt in der N&auml;he einer Autobahn und wenn Sie auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken, ben&ouml;tigen Sie nur 100 m, um den Strand zu erreichen. In der N&auml;he des Parkplatzes befindet sich auch der Ort, an dem Sie die meiste Strandinfrastruktur haben. Hier k&ouml;nnen Sie auch ein Wattenmeer-Museum besuchen. Wenn Sie zum Strand kommen, stehen Ihnen 100 m L&auml;nge und 15 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Dies ist auch ein ber&uuml;hmter Kiteboarding-Ort. Die Neigung am Strand ist von Punkt zu Punkt unterschiedlich. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt h&auml;ngt davon ab, ob Sie am Strand ins Wasser gehen oder die Wasserleiter am Pier benutzen. Im Museum haben Sie auch ein Restaurant und in der Umgebung einen Campingplatz f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft. Genie&szlig;en Sie den Strand Kornwerderzan mit BeachRex.', 4028, 'de', 1),
(1508, 'Einer der gr&ouml;&szlig;ten Seen in den Niederlanden ist IJsselmeer. Obwohl es k&uuml;nstlich hergestellt wird, ist es sehr interessant. weil es Ihnen auch einige Sandstr&auml;nde bietet. Eine davon befindet sich in der Region Friesland in der N&auml;he der Stadt Makkum und tr&auml;gt den Namen Strand De Holle Poarte. Es ist ein sehr beliebter Ort mit viel Strandinfrastruktur, verschiedenen Gesch&auml;ften, vielen Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten sowie vielen Restaurants. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen Parkplatz nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist Sand, der Strand ist 1 km lang und 75 m breit. Es ist ein sehr flacher Strand mit flachem Wasser und mit dem Kinderspielplatz am Strand ist er ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder. Das flache Wasser macht den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n und ist deshalb auch ein sehr beliebter Ort zum Windsurfen und Kitesurfen. Genie&szlig;en Sie den Strand De Holle Poarte mit BeachRex.', 4029, 'de', 1),
(1509, 'Einer der letzten Str&auml;nde in der Region Friesland am IJsselmeer See, bevor Sie in die Region Flevoland einreisen, ist der niederl&auml;ndische Strand Lemsterstrand. Es befindet sich in der Stadt Lemmer und ist ein Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien mit kleinen Kindern geeignet ist. Sie haben viele Kinderspielpl&auml;tze am Strand, um Ihre Kleinen gl&uuml;cklich zu machen. Dieser Ort verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, der nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt ist und mit jedem Fahrzeug erreicht werden kann. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach und Sie haben auch viele Strandinfrastrukturen und Dienstleistungen hier zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Strand selbst ist sehr flach, hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 750 m und ist 100 m breit. Aufgrund des flachen Wassers ist der Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 30 m. Am Strand selbst gibt es auch ein Restaurant. Die Unterkunft befindet sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he, wie ein Campingplatz sowie einige Apartments. Genie&szlig;en Sie den Strand Lemsterstrand mit BeachRex.', 4033, 'de', 1),
(1510, 'Wenn Sie nach einem Sandstrand f&uuml;r Familien mit einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, auch f&uuml;r Wohnmobile, in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Flevoland in der N&auml;he der Stadt Lelystad suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Houtribhoek zu besuchen. Dieser Ort ist sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt. Um darauf zuzugreifen, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine 10 Meter hohe Wassersperre &uuml;ber Treppen &uuml;berqueren. Der Strand ist sehr flach, hat eine L&auml;nge von 500 m und ist 50 m breit. Das Wasser ist ziemlich flach, was den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n macht, und der Schwimmpunkt beginnt bei 40 m. Dieser Strand verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber eine gro&szlig;e Strandinfrastruktur, einen Kinderspielplatz, einen Sportplatz und sogar eine kleine Fitness im Freien. Ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar befinden sich ebenfalls direkt am Strand. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie einige Apartments in der Nachbarschaft mieten.', 4036, 'de', 1),
(1511, 'In den Niederlanden gibt es nicht nur sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde am Atlantik oder an der Westk&uuml;ste mit der Nordsee, sondern auch viele an den zahlreichen Seen im ganzen Land. Ein solcher Strand, Harderstrand Noord, ist ein Sandstrand, der sich am Ufer des Sees Veluwemeer befindet. Wenn Sie ein solches Seestranderlebnis haben m&ouml;chten, empfehlen wir Ihnen, es zu besuchen. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen, und Sie haben zwei M&ouml;glichkeiten, Ihr Auto zu parken, entweder auf einem kleinen Parkplatz oder neben der Stra&szlig;e. Zum Strand gelangen Sie nach maximal 50 m zu Fu&szlig;. Der Strandbereich ist sehr flach, 400 m lang und 50 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 20 m. Die Strandinfrastruktur hier ist nur einfach. Es gibt keine Restaurants direkt am Strand, aber in der N&auml;he. In Strandn&auml;he haben Sie auch einen Campingplatz und die M&ouml;glichkeit, eine Wohnung zu mieten, wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten. Genie&szlig;en Sie den Strand Harderstrand Noord mit BeachRex.', 4037, 'de', 1),
(1512, 'Benvenuti nella bellissima spiaggia di sabbia Mesis. Si trova nella regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, tra le citt&agrave; Aleksandroupoli e la citt&agrave; Kavala. L&#39;accesso a questa spiaggia con un veicolo &egrave; molto facile, anche con un camper. Un parcheggio molto grande &egrave; disponibile direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, a soli 30 metri di distanza. La superficie della spiaggia principale &egrave; di sabbia, ma c&#39;&egrave; anche dell&#39;erba sulla spiaggia e degli alberi dietro il parcheggio. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di pochi chilometri e nella parte pi&ugrave; ampia &egrave; larga 40 metri. Se sei una famiglia, con bambini piccoli, che hanno bisogno di un po &#39;pi&ugrave; di protezione dal sole, adorerai questa spiaggia, perch&eacute; puoi stare tranquillamente sotto l&#39;ombra naturale degli alberi. Sulla spiaggia hai tutte le infrastrutture essenziali della spiaggia, un ristorante e un bar-caffetteria sono disponibili anche direttamente sulla spiaggia. Se ti innamori della spiaggia Mesis, e vuoi trascorrere qui le tue vacanze estive, hai a disposizione alcune sistemazioni, sotto forma di appartamenti e camere, a poche centinaia di metri di distanza. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3400, 'it', 1),
(1513, 'Bienvenue sur la magnifique plage de sable Mesis. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, entre les villes Aleksandroupoli et la ville Kavala. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; cette plage avec un v&eacute;hicule est tr&egrave;s facile, &eacute;galement avec un camping-car. Un tr&egrave;s grand parking est disponible juste en face de la plage, &agrave; seulement 30 m&egrave;tres. La surface principale de la plage est du sable, mais il y a aussi de l&#39;herbe sur la plage et des arbres derri&egrave;re le parking. La longueur totale de la plage est de quelques kilom&egrave;tres et sur la partie la plus large, elle mesure 40 m&egrave;tres de large. Si vous &ecirc;tes une famille, avec de jeunes enfants, qui ont besoin d&#39;un peu plus de protection contre le soleil, vous allez adorer cette plage, car vous pouvez rester en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute; &agrave; l&#39;ombre naturelle des arbres. Sur la plage, vous avez toutes les infrastructures essentielles de la plage, un restaurant et un caf&eacute;-bar sont &eacute;galement disponibles directement sur la plage. Si vous tombez amoureux de la plage de Mesis et que vous souhaitez passer vos vacances d&#39;&eacute;t&eacute; ici, vous disposez d&#39;un logement, sous forme d&#39;appartements et de chambres, &agrave; seulement quelques centaines de m&egrave;tres. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3400, 'fr', 1),
(1514, 'Bienvenido a la hermosa playa de arena Mesis. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, entre las ciudades Aleksandroupoli y la ciudad Kavala. El acceso a esta playa con veh&iacute;culo es muy f&aacute;cil, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana. Hay una plaza de aparcamiento muy grande disponible directamente en frente de la playa, a s&oacute;lo unos 30 metros de distancia. La superficie principal de la playa es de arena, pero tambi&eacute;n hay algo de c&eacute;sped en la playa y algunos &aacute;rboles detr&aacute;s del estacionamiento. La longitud total de la playa es de unos pocos kil&oacute;metros y en la parte m&aacute;s ancha tiene 40 metros de ancho. Si sois una familia, con ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os, que necesit&aacute;is un poco m&aacute;s de protecci&oacute;n del sol, esta playa os encantar&aacute;, porque podr&eacute;is estar seguros bajo la sombra natural de los &aacute;rboles. En la playa tiene toda la infraestructura de playa esencial, un restaurante y un bar cafeter&iacute;a tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa. Si te enamora de la playa Mesis y te gustar&iacute;a pasar tus vacaciones de verano aqu&iacute;, tienes algunos alojamientos, en forma de apartamentos y habitaciones, a solo unos cientos de metros de distancia. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3400, 'es', 1),
(1515, 'Willkommen am sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand Mesis. Es befindet sich in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, zwischen den St&auml;dten Aleksandroupoli und der Stadt Kavala. Der Zugang zu diesem Strand mit einem Fahrzeug ist sehr einfach, auch mit einem Wohnmobil. Ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz befindet sich direkt vor dem Strand, nur etwa 30 Meter entfernt. Die Hauptstrandoberfl&auml;che ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch etwas Gras am Strand und einige B&auml;ume hinter dem Parkplatz. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt einige Kilometer und ist an der breitesten Stelle 40 Meter breit. Wenn Sie eine Familie mit kleinen Kindern sind, die etwas mehr Schutz vor der Sonne ben&ouml;tigen, werden Sie diesen Strand lieben, da Sie sicher im nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten der B&auml;ume bleiben k&ouml;nnen. Am Strand stehen Ihnen alle wichtigen Strandinfrastrukturen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Ein Restaurant und eine Caf&eacute;-Bar befinden sich ebenfalls direkt am Strand. Wenn Sie sich in den Strand Mesis verlieben und Ihre Sommerferien hier verbringen m&ouml;chten, haben Sie eine Unterkunft in Form von Apartments und Zimmern, die nur wenige hundert Meter entfernt sind, zu Verf&uuml;gung. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3400, 'de', 1),
(1516, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na čudoviti pe&scaron;čeni plaži Mesis. Nahaja se v regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, med mesti Aleksandroupoli in Kavala. Dostop do te plaže z vozilom je zelo enostaven, tudi z avtodomom. Zelo veliko parkiri&scaron;če je na voljo tik pred plažo, oddaljeno le 30 metrov. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je pesek, vendar imate na plaži tudi nekaj trave in nekaj dreves za parkiri&scaron;čem. Skupna dolžina plaže je nekaj kilometrov, na naj&scaron;ir&scaron;em delu pa je &scaron;iroka 40 metrov. Če ste družina z majhnimi otroki, ki potrebujejo malo več za&scaron;čite pred soncem, vam bo ta plaža v&scaron;eč, saj lahko varno ostanete pod naravno senco dreves. Na plaži imate vso potrebno infrastrukturo, restavracija in kavarna sta na voljo tudi neposredno na plaži. Če se zaljubite v plažo Mesis in bi radi tu preživeli poletne počitnice, imate nekaj apartmajev in sob le nekaj sto metrov stran. Uživajte na svoji plaži z BeachRex.', 3400, 'sl', 1),
(1517, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na prekrasnu pje&scaron;čanu plažu Mesis. Smje&scaron;teno je u regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, između gradova Aleksandroupoli i Kavala. Pristup ovoj plaži automobilom vrlo je jednostavan, čak i automobilom. Ispred plaže, udaljene samo 30 metara, nalazi se vrlo veliko parkirali&scaron;te. Glavno područje plaže je pijesak, ali imate i nekoliko trave i drveća iza parkirali&scaron;ta na plaži. Ukupna dužina plaže je nekoliko kilometara, a na svom naj&scaron;irem dijelu &scaron;iroka je 40 metara. Ako ste obitelj s malom djecom kojoj treba malo vi&scaron;e za&scaron;tite od sunca, svidjet će vam se ova plaža jer možete sigurno boraviti pod prirodnom sjenom drveća. Na plaži imate svu potrebnu infrastrukturu, restoran i kafić su također dostupni direktno na plaži. Ako se zaljubite u plažu Mesis i želite ovdje provesti ljetni odmor, na raspolaganju vam je nekoliko apartmana i soba udaljenih samo nekoliko stotina metara. Uživajte na svojoj plaži uz BeachRex.', 3400, 'hr', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1518, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia sabbiosa di Arogi Fanari. La citt&agrave; greca di Fanari &egrave; famosa per le sue bellissime spiagge sabbiose. Molte spiagge speciali sono disponibili qui. Uno di loro, l&#39;Arogi Fanari &egrave; una vera bellezza. La strada che porta alla spiaggia &egrave; asfaltata. Puoi arrivare qui con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con camper. Il parcheggio si trova direttamente davanti alla spiaggia, &egrave; molto ampio ed &egrave; asfaltato. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga pochi chilometri, larga 50 metri e ha un bel ingresso d&#39;acqua, dopo soli 3 metri si pu&ograve; gi&agrave; iniziare a fare il bagno. La superficie principale &egrave; sabbia, ma hai anche dell&#39;ombra naturale da alcuni piccoli alberi presenti qui. Tutte le infrastrutture essenziali della spiaggia sono disponibili qui, un campo sportivo da spiaggia incluso. Sicuramente non avrete fame o sete su questa spiaggia, molti ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia sono presenti qui. Sono disponibili anche alloggi, principalmente come appartamenti, e hai persino un hotel nelle vicinanze. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3401, 'it', 1),
(1519, 'Bienvenue sur la plage de sable Arogi Fanari. La ville grecque de Fanari est bien connue pour ses belles plages de sable. De nombreuses plages sp&eacute;ciales sont disponibles ici. L&#39;un d&#39;eux, l&#39;Arogi Fanari est une vraie beaut&eacute;. La route qui m&egrave;ne &agrave; la plage est goudronn&eacute;e. Vous pouvez arriver ici avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, y compris avec un camping-car. La place de parking est juste en face de la plage, est tr&egrave;s grande et pav&eacute;e. La plage fait quelques kilom&egrave;tres de long, 50 m&egrave;tres de large et a une belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau, apr&egrave;s seulement 3 m&egrave;tres, vous pouvez d&eacute;j&agrave; commencer &agrave; nager. La surface principale est du sable, mais vous avez &eacute;galement de l&#39;ombre naturelle de certains petits arbres pr&eacute;sents ici. Toutes les infrastructures de plage essentielles sont disponibles ici, un terrain de sport de plage inclus. Vous n&#39;aurez certainement ni faim ni soif sur cette plage, de nombreux restaurants et bars de plage sont pr&eacute;sents ici. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement disponible, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements, et vous avez m&ecirc;me un h&ocirc;tel &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3401, 'fr', 1),
(1520, 'Bienvenido a la playa de arena Arogi Fanari. La ciudad griega de Fanari es conocida por sus hermosas playas de arena. Muchas playas especiales est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;. Uno de ellos, el Arogi Fanari es una verdadera belleza. El camino que conduce a la playa est&aacute; asfaltado. Puedes llegar aqu&iacute; con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana. El lugar de estacionamiento est&aacute; directamente en frente de la playa, es muy grande y est&aacute; pavimentado. La playa tiene unos kil&oacute;metros de largo, 50 metros de ancho y tiene una bonita entrada de agua, despu&eacute;s de solo 3 metros ya puedes empezar a nadar. La superficie principal es arena, pero tambi&eacute;n tiene algo de sombra natural de algunos &aacute;rboles peque&ntilde;os presentes aqu&iacute;. Toda la infraestructura de playa esencial est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;, incluido un campo de deportes de playa. Ciertamente no tendr&aacute; hambre ni sed en esta playa, muchos restaurantes y chiringuitos est&aacute;n presentes aqu&iacute;. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible, principalmente como apartamentos, e incluso tiene un hotel en las inmediaciones. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3401, 'es', 1),
(1521, 'Willkommen am Sandstrand Arogi Fanari. Die griechische Stadt Fanari ist bekannt f&uuml;r ihre sch&ouml;nen Sandstr&auml;nde. Hier gibt es viele besondere Str&auml;nde. Einer von ihnen, der Arogi Fanari, ist eine wahre Sch&ouml;nheit. Die Stra&szlig;e, die zum Strand f&uuml;hrt, ist asphaltiert. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier mit jedem Fahrzeug ankommen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil. Der Parkplatz liegt direkt am Strand, ist sehr gro&szlig; und asphaltiert. Der Strand ist einige Kilometer lang, 50 Meter breit und hat einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt, nach nur 3 Metern k&ouml;nnen Sie bereits mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten von einigen kleinen B&auml;umen, die hier vorhanden sind. Hier steht die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung, einschlie&szlig;lich eines Strandsportplatzes. Sie werden an diesem Strand sicherlich nicht hungrig oder durstig sein, viele Restaurants und Strandbars sind hier vorhanden. Unterkunft ist auch verf&uuml;gbar, meistens als Apartments, und Sie haben sogar ein Hotel in der N&auml;he. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3401, 'de', 1),
(1522, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na pe&scaron;čeni plaži Arogi Fanari. Gr&scaron;ko mesto Fanari je znano po čudovitih pe&scaron;čenih plažah. Tu so na voljo &scaron;tevilne posebne plaže. Ena od njih, Arogi Fanari, je prava lepotica. Cesta, ki vodi do plaže, je asfaltirana. Sem lahko pridete s kakr&scaron;nim koli vozilom, tudi z avtodomom. Parkiri&scaron;če je tik pred plažo, je zelo veliko in je asfaltirano. Plaža je dolga nekaj kilometrov, &scaron;iroka 50 metrov in ima lep vstop v vodo, že po 3 metrih lahko začnete plavati. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je pesek, imate pa tudi nekaj naravne sence od majhnih dreves, ki so tukaj prisotna. Tu je na voljo vsa bistvena infrastruktura na plaži, vključno s &scaron;portnim igri&scaron;čem na plaži. Na tej plaži zagotovo ne boste lačni ali žejni, tu je veliko restavracij in barov na plaži. Na voljo je tudi nastanitev, večinoma kot apartmaji, v bližini pa imate celo hotel. Uživajte na svoji plaži z BeachRex.', 3401, 'sl', 1),
(1523, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na pje&scaron;čanu plažu Arogi Fanari. Grčki grad Fanari poznat je po prekrasnim pje&scaron;čanim plažama. Ovdje postoje mnoge posebne plaže. Jedan od njih, Arogi Fanari, prava je ljepotica. Put koji vodi do plaže je asfaltiran. Ovdje možete doći bilo kojim vozilom, uključujući i kamp kućicu. Parkirali&scaron;te je ispred plaže, vrlo je veliko i popločano je. Plaža je dugačka nekoliko kilometara, &scaron;iroka 50 metara i ima lijep ulaz u vodu, nakon 3 metra možete početi plivati. Glavna povr&scaron;ina je pijesak, ali imate i prirodnu hladovinu od ovdje prisutnih malih stabala. Ovdje je sva bitna infrastruktura na plaži, uključujući sportski teren na plaži. Na ovoj plaži definitivno nećete biti gladni ili žedni, na plaži ima mnogo restorana i barova. Također je dostupan smje&scaron;taj, uglavnom kao apartmani, a čak imate i hotel u blizini. Uživajte na svojoj plaži uz BeachRex.', 3401, 'hr', 1),
(1524, 'Benvenuti al kentro della spiaggia greca Paralia Fanari. La cittadina di Fanari ha molte belle spiagge da offrire. Quella che presentiamo qui &egrave; una spiaggia la cui superficie principale &egrave; un misto di sabbia e ciottoli. Puoi raggiungere questa spiaggia con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con un camper. Il parcheggio &egrave; molto ampio e nelle vicinanze si trova anche un campo per auto. Le caratteristiche della spiaggia sono le seguenti: la lunghezza totale &egrave; di 500 metri, la larghezza massima &egrave; di 30 metri e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 20 metri. Non &egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie, ma &egrave; pi&ugrave; adatta per un tipo di avventuriero utente della spiaggia. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; molto scarsa, quindi non aspettarti un comfort elevato, non sono disponibili servizi igienici o docce. Sulla spiaggia non ci sono ristoranti o bar disponibili, tranne un ristorante che si trova vicino alla spiaggia, a circa 200 metri di distanza, pi&ugrave; bar e simili sono disponibili verso la citt&agrave;. Hai sicuramente pi&ugrave; servizi quando si tratta di alloggio. &Egrave; disponibile un&#39;intera variet&agrave;, da appartamenti, camere, un hotel e persino un campeggio. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3402, 'it', 1),
(1525, 'Bienvenue &agrave; la plage grecque Paralia Fanari kentro. La petite ville de Fanari a de nombreuses belles plages &agrave; offrir. Celle que nous pr&eacute;sentons ici est une plage dont la surface principale est un m&eacute;lange de sable et de galets. Vous pouvez vous rendre sur cette plage avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, y compris avec un camping-car. La place de parking est tr&egrave;s grande et il y a aussi un camp d&#39;automobiles &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Les caract&eacute;ristiques de la plage sont les suivantes: la longueur totale est de 500 m&egrave;tres, la largeur maximale est de 30 m&egrave;tres et le point de baignade est &agrave; 20 m&egrave;tres. Ce n&#39;est pas une plage familiale, mais elle convient mieux &agrave; un utilisateur de plage de type aventurier. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage est tr&egrave;s m&eacute;diocre, alors ne vous attendez pas &agrave; un confort &eacute;lev&eacute;, pas de toilettes ni de douches disponibles. Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, il n&#39;y a pas de restaurants ou de bars disponibles, &agrave; l&#39;exception d&#39;un restaurant qui est proche de la plage, &agrave; environ 200 m&egrave;tres, d&#39;autres bars et similaires sont disponibles vers la ville. Vous avez certainement plus de services en mati&egrave;re d&#39;h&eacute;bergement. Toute une vari&eacute;t&eacute; est disponible, des appartements, des chambres, un h&ocirc;tel et m&ecirc;me un camping. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3402, 'fr', 1),
(1526, 'Bienvenidos a la playa griega Paralia Fanari kentro. La peque&ntilde;a ciudad de Fanari tiene muchas playas bonitas que ofrecer. La que presentamos aqu&iacute; es una playa cuya superficie principal es una mezcla de arena y guijarros. Se puede llegar a esta playa con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana. El lugar de estacionamiento es muy grande y tambi&eacute;n hay un campamento de autos en las cercan&iacute;as. Las caracter&iacute;sticas de la playa son las siguientes: la longitud total es de 500 metros, la anchura m&aacute;xima es de 30 metros y el punto de ba&ntilde;o es de 20 metros. No es una playa familiar, pero es m&aacute;s adecuada para un tipo de usuario de playa aventurero. La infraestructura de la playa es muy pobre, as&iacute; que no espere un gran confort, no hay ba&ntilde;os ni duchas disponibles. En la propia playa no hay restaurantes o bares disponibles, excepto un restaurante que est&aacute; cerca de la playa, a unos 200 metros de distancia, m&aacute;s bares y similares disponibles hacia el pueblo. Seguro que tienes m&aacute;s servicios en lo que a alojamiento se refiere. Una gran variedad est&aacute; disponible, desde apartamentos, habitaciones, un hotel e incluso un camping. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3402, 'es', 1),
(1527, 'Willkommen am griechischen Strand Paralia Fanari kentro. Die kleine Stadt Fanari hat viele sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde zu bieten. Der hier vorgestellte ist ein Strand, dessen Hauptoberfl&auml;che eine Mischung aus Sand und Kieselsteinen ist. Sie k&ouml;nnen mit jedem Fahrzeug zu diesem Strand fahren, auch mit einem Wohnmobil. Der Parkplatz ist sehr gro&szlig; und es gibt auch ein Auto camp in der N&auml;he. Die Strandeigenschaften sind wie folgt: Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt 500 Meter, die maximale Breite 30 Meter und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 20 Metern. Es ist kein Familienstrand, aber eher f&uuml;r Abenteurer geeignet. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist sehr schlecht, erwarten Sie also keinen hohen Komfort, es stehen keine Toiletten oder Duschen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Am Strand selbst gibt es keine Restaurants oder Bars, au&szlig;er einem Restaurant in Strandn&auml;he, etwa 200 Meter entfernt. Weitere Bars und &auml;hnliches gibt es in Richtung Stadt. Sie haben sicherlich mehr Dienstleistungen, wenn es um Unterkunft geht. Es gibt eine ganze Reihe von Apartments, Zimmern, einem Hotel und sogar einem Campingplatz. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3402, 'de', 1),
(1528, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na gr&scaron;ki plaži Paralia Fanari kentro. Mestece Fanari ponuja veliko lepih plaž. Tukaj predstavljamo plažo, katere glavna povr&scaron;ina je me&scaron;anica peska in kamenčkov. Na to plažo se lahko pripeljete s kakr&scaron;nim koli vozilom, tudi z avtodomom. Parkiri&scaron;če je zelo veliko, v bližini pa je tudi avtokamp. Značilnosti plaže so naslednje: skupna dolžina je 500 metrov, največja &scaron;irina je 30 metrov, točka kopanja pa 20 metrov. Ni družinska plaža, je pa bolj primerna za pustolovske uporabnike plaž. Infrastruktura na plaži je zelo slaba, zato ne pričakujte visokega udobja, strani&scaron;č ali tu&scaron;ev ni na voljo. Na sami plaži ni na voljo nobene restavracije ali bara, razen ene restavracije, ki je blizu plaže, približno 200 metrov stran, proti mestu je na voljo več barov in podobno. Zagotovo imate več storitev, ko gre za nastanitev. Na voljo je cela vrsta, od apartmajev, sob, hotela in celo kampa. Uživajte na svoji plaži z BeachRex.', 3402, 'sl', 1),
(1529, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na grčku plažu Paralia Fanari kentro. Grad Fanari nudi brojne prekrasne plaže. Ovdje predstavljamo plažu čija je glavna povr&scaron;ina mje&scaron;avina pijeska i &scaron;ljunka. Do ove plaže možete doći bilo kojim vozilom, uključujući i kamp kućicu. Parkirali&scaron;te je vrlo veliko, a u blizini se nalazi i kamp-park. Karakteristike plaže su sljedeće: ukupna dužina je 500 metara, maksimalna &scaron;irina je 30 metara, a kupali&scaron;te je 20 metara. Nije obiteljska plaža, ali je prikladnija za avanturističke korisnike plaža. Infrastruktura na plaži je vrlo lo&scaron;a, stoga nemojte očekivati ​​visoku udobnost, toaleti ili tu&scaron;evi nisu dostupni. Na samoj plaži nema restorana ni bara, osim jednog restorana, koji je blizu plaže, udaljene oko 200 metara, prema gradu ima nekoliko barova i slično. Definitivno imate vi&scaron;e usluga &scaron;to se tiče smje&scaron;taja. Na raspolaganju je čitav niz, od apartmana, soba, hotela, pa čak i kampova. Uživajte na svojoj plaži uz BeachRex.', 3402, 'hr', 1),
(1530, 'Benvenuti nella spiaggia della citt&agrave; greca Fanari. Situata nella regione greca di Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, questa spiaggia &egrave; un must se ti piace la diversit&agrave; della spiaggia sulla spiaggia. Sebbene la superficie principale sia sabbia, qui ci sono anche dei ciottoli e persino delle rocce. E &#39;molto facilmente raggiungibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con camper, e disponi di un parcheggio direttamente davanti alla spiaggia. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 500 metri, con una larghezza di 25 metri. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 10 metri e si ha un&#39;inclinazione molto varia. Questa spiaggia non &egrave; dritta, ma vi si presenta in tante forme diverse, alcune molto romantiche. Poich&eacute; si trova direttamente nel paese, qui hai a disposizione molti servizi di spiaggia, per soddisfare tutte le tue esigenze. Nelle vicinanze si trova anche il porto turistico della citt&agrave; e il porto. Se ti piace avere un po &#39;di ombra naturale sulla spiaggia, puoi anche andare in un piccolo parco per proteggerti dal sole estivo. Il catering &egrave; disponibile in molte forme diverse. Anche gli alloggi sono vicini, principalmente come appartamenti o camere, anche un campeggio non &egrave; lontano. Vi auguriamo una buona vacanza sulla Paralia Fanari con BeachRex.', 3403, 'it', 1),
(1531, 'Bienvenue &agrave; la plage de la ville grecque Fanari. Situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion grecque d&#39;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, cette plage est un incontournable si vous aimez la diversit&eacute; des plages sur la plage. Bien que la surface principale soit du sable, vous avez &eacute;galement des cailloux et m&ecirc;me des rochers ici. Il est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, m&ecirc;me avec un camping-car, et vous disposez d&#39;une place de parking juste en face de la plage. La longueur totale de la plage est de 500 m&egrave;tres, avec une largeur de 25 m&egrave;tres. Le point de nage est &agrave; 10 m&egrave;tres et vous avez une inclinaison de pente tr&egrave;s diverse. Cette plage n&#39;est pas droite, mais se pr&eacute;sente &agrave; vous sous de nombreuses formes diff&eacute;rentes, certaines tr&egrave;s romantiques. Parce qu&#39;il est situ&eacute; directement dans la ville, vous avez ici de nombreux services de plage disponibles, pour satisfaire tous vos besoins. A proximit&eacute; se trouvent &eacute;galement la marina de la ville et le port. Si vous aimez avoir de l&#39;ombre naturelle sur la plage, vous pouvez m&ecirc;me vous rendre dans un petit parc pour vous prot&eacute;ger du soleil d&#39;&eacute;t&eacute;. La restauration est disponible sous de nombreuses formes diff&eacute;rentes. Les h&eacute;bergements sont &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;, principalement en appartements ou en chambres, un terrain de camping n&#39;est pas loin non plus. Nous vous souhaitons de bonnes vacances sur le Paralia Fanari avec BeachRex.', 3403, 'fr', 1),
(1532, 'Bienvenido a la playa de la ciudad griega Fanari. Situada en la regi&oacute;n griega de Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, esta playa es una visita obligada si te gusta la diversidad de playas en la playa. Aunque la superficie principal es arena, tambi&eacute;n tienes algunos guijarros e incluso rocas aqu&iacute;. Es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, incluso con autocaravana, y tienes una plaza de aparcamiento directamente en frente de la playa. La longitud total de la playa es de 500 metros, con un ancho de 25 metros. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a 10 metros y tienes una inclinaci&oacute;n de pendiente muy diversa. Esta playa no es recta, pero se presenta de muchas formas diferentes, algunas muy rom&aacute;nticas. Debido a que est&aacute; ubicado directamente en la ciudad, tiene muchos servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;, para satisfacer todas sus necesidades. Muy cerca tambi&eacute;n se encuentra el puerto deportivo de la ciudad y el puerto. Si te gusta tener algo de sombra natural en la playa, incluso puedes ir a un peque&ntilde;o parque para protegerte del sol de verano. El catering est&aacute; disponible en muchas formas diferentes. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; cerca, principalmente como apartamentos o habitaciones, un camping tampoco est&aacute; lejos. Le deseamos unas buenas vacaciones en Paralia Fanari con BeachRex.', 3403, 'es', 1),
(1533, 'Willkommen am griechischen Stadtstrand Fanari. Dieser Strand befindet sich in der griechischen Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki und ist ein Muss, wenn Sie Strandvielfalt am Strand m&ouml;gen. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che Sand ist, gibt es hier auch einige Kieselsteine ​​und sogar Felsen. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, und Sie haben einen Parkplatz direkt vor dem Strand. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 500 Meter bei einer Breite von 25 Metern. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 10 Metern und Sie haben eine sehr unterschiedliche Hangneigung. Dieser Strand ist nicht gerade, sondern pr&auml;sentiert sich Ihnen in vielen verschiedenen Formen, einige sehr romantisch. Da es direkt in der Stadt liegt, stehen Ihnen hier viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, um alle Ihre Bed&uuml;rfnisse zu befriedigen. In der N&auml;he befinden sich auch der Yachthafen und der Hafen. Wenn Sie einen nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten am Strand haben m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie sogar in einen kleinen Park gehen, um sich vor der Sommersonne zu sch&uuml;tzen. Catering gibt es in vielen verschiedenen Formen. Die Unterkunft befindet sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he, haupts&auml;chlich als Apartments oder Zimmer. Ein Campingplatz ist ebenfalls nicht weit entfernt. Wir w&uuml;nschen Ihnen einen sch&ouml;nen Urlaub auf der Paralia Fanari mit BeachRex.', 3403, 'de', 1),
(1534, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na gr&scaron;ki mestni plaži Fanari. Ta plaža, ki se nahaja v gr&scaron;ki regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, mora biti na va&scaron;em seznamu, če imate radi raznolikost na plaži. Čeprav je glavna povr&scaron;ina pesek, imate tukaj tudi nekaj kamenčkov in celo skale. Zelo lahko je dostopna s kakr&scaron;nimi koli vozilom, tudi z avtodomom, parkiri&scaron;če pa imate tik pred plažo. Skupna dolžina plaže je 500 metrov, &scaron;irina pa 25 metrov. Točka plavanja je pri 10 metrih, na razpolago pa imate zelo raznolik naklon plaže. Ta plaža ni ravna, ampak se vam predstavlja v različnih oblikah, nekatere zelo romantične. Ker se nahaja neposredno v mestu, imate tukaj na voljo veliko storitev na plaži, ki bodo zadovoljile vse va&scaron;e potrebe. V bližini je tudi mestna marina in pristani&scaron;če. Če imate radi nekaj naravne sence na plaži, se lahko odpravite v majhen park, ki vas za&scaron;čiti pred poletnim soncem. Gostinska ponudba je na voljo v različnih oblikah. V bližini so tudi namestitve, predvsem kot apartmaji ali sobe, tudi kamp ni nedaleč stran. Želimo vam prijetne počitnice na Paralia Fanari z BeachRexom.', 3403, 'sl', 1),
(1535, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na grčku gradsku plažu Fanari. Ova plaža smje&scaron;tena u grčkoj regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki trebala bi biti na va&scaron;em popisu ako volite raznolikost na plaži. Iako je glavna povr&scaron;ina pijesak, ovdje također imate nekoliko kamenčića, pa čak i kamenja. Do njega je vrlo lako doći bilo kojim vozilom, uključujući i kućicu na točkovima, a parkirali&scaron;te imate ispred plaže. Ukupna dužina plaže je 500 metara, a &scaron;irina 25 metara. Točka kupanja nalazi se na 10 metara, a na raspolaganju vam je vrlo raznolik nagib plaže. Ova plaža nije ravna, ali predstavlja vam se u raznim oblicima, neke vrlo romantične. Budući da se nalazi izravno u gradu, ovdje su vam na raspolaganju mnoge usluge na plaži koje će zadovoljiti sve va&scaron;e potrebe. U blizini su i gradska marina i luka. Ako volite neku prirodnu hladovinu na plaži, možete se uputiti u mali park koji će vas za&scaron;tititi od ljetnog sunca. Ugostiteljska ponuda dostupna je u raznim oblicima. U blizini se nalaze i smje&scaron;taji, posebno apartmani ili sobe, a kamp nije daleko. Želimo vam ugodan odmor u Paraliji Fanari uz BeachRex.', 3403, 'hr', 1),
(1536, 'Benvenuti nella spiaggia di sabbia greca per bambini, paralia Mandra. Questa spiaggia &egrave; una delle poche spiagge della regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, particolarmente adatta ai bambini piccoli. L&#39;acqua bassa &egrave; presente ovunque lungo la costa della spiaggia. &Egrave; particolarmente adatto per i bambini piccoli perch&eacute; il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 100 metri di pi&ugrave;, l&#39;acqua &egrave; davvero bassa qui. La strada che porta alla spiaggia &egrave; asfaltata ed &egrave; in buone condizioni. Il parcheggio si trova proprio di fronte alla spiaggia e pu&ograve; contenere diversi veicoli, anche camper. &Egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa, con un po &#39;d&#39;ombra naturale e molte infrastrutture balneari. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di diversi chilometri e ha una larghezza di 30 metri. L&#39;inclinazione sulla spiaggia &egrave; molto piccola, &egrave; quasi piatta, cos&igrave; come il fondale, il che rende questa spiaggia una spiaggia molto sicura per i bambini piccoli. Tutte le infrastrutture essenziali della spiaggia sono disponibili qui, un parco giochi per bambini incluso e alcuni campi sportivi. Un campo per auto &egrave; proprio nelle vicinanze, quindi non &egrave; necessario cercare un alloggio nei dintorni. Sulla spiaggia hai anche un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante. Quindi, se sei una famiglia con bambini piccoli dovresti visitare la spiaggia Mandra, non te ne pentirai. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3404, 'it', 1),
(1537, 'Bienvenue sur la plage de sable grecque pour enfants, Paralia Mandra. Cette plage est l&#39;une des rares plages de la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, qui convient vraiment aux petits enfants. L&#39;eau peu profonde est pr&eacute;sente partout le long du littoral de la plage. Il est particuli&egrave;rement adapt&eacute; aux petits enfants du fait que le point de baignade est &agrave; 100 m&egrave;tres de plus, l&#39;eau y est vraiment peu profonde. La route qui m&egrave;ne &agrave; la plage est goudronn&eacute;e et en bon &eacute;tat. Le parking est juste en face de la plage et peut accueillir plusieurs v&eacute;hicules, &eacute;galement des camping-cars. C&#39;est une plage de sable, avec de l&#39;ombre naturelle et de nombreuses infrastructures de plage. La longueur totale de la plage est de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et elle a une largeur de 30 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est tr&egrave;s petite, elle est presque plate, tout comme le fond marin, ce qui fait de cette plage une plage tr&egrave;s s&ucirc;re pour les petits enfants. Toutes les infrastructures essentielles de la plage sont disponibles ici, une aire de jeux pour enfants incluse ainsi que des terrains de sport. Un camp de voitures est juste &agrave; proximit&eacute;, donc pas besoin de chercher un logement dans les environs. Sur la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement un bar de plage et un restaurant. Donc, si vous &ecirc;tes une famille avec de jeunes enfants, vous devriez visiter la plage de Mandra, vous ne le regretterez pas. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3404, 'fr', 1),
(1538, 'Bienvenido a la playa de arena griega para ni&ntilde;os, paralia Mandra. Esta playa es una de las pocas playas de la regi&oacute;n de Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, que es realmente adecuada para ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os. El agua poco profunda est&aacute; presente en todas partes a lo largo de la costa de la playa. Es especialmente adecuado para ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os por el hecho de que el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a 100 metros o m&aacute;s, el agua es muy poco profunda aqu&iacute;. El camino que conduce a la playa est&aacute; asfaltado y en buen estado. La plaza de aparcamiento est&aacute; justo enfrente de la playa y tiene capacidad para varios veh&iacute;culos, tambi&eacute;n autocaravanas. Es una playa de arena, con algo de sombra natural y muchas infraestructuras de playa. La longitud total de la playa es de varios kil&oacute;metros y tiene una anchura de 30 metros. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es muy peque&ntilde;a, es casi plana, al igual que el fondo marino, lo que hace de esta playa una playa muy segura para los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os. Toda la infraestructura de playa esencial est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;, un parque infantil incluido, as&iacute; como algunos campos deportivos. Un campamento de autom&oacute;viles est&aacute; cerca, por lo que no es necesario buscar alojamiento en los alrededores. En la playa tambi&eacute;n tienes un chiringuito y un restaurante. As&iacute; que, si sois una familia con ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os deber&eacute;is visitar la playa Mandra, no te arrepentir&aacute;s. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3404, 'es', 1),
(1539, 'Willkommen am griechischen Sandstrand f&uuml;r Kinder, Paralia Mandra. Dieser Strand ist einer der wenigen Str&auml;nde in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, der wirklich f&uuml;r kleine Kinder geeignet ist. Das flache Wasser ist &uuml;berall entlang der Strandk&uuml;ste vorhanden. Es ist besonders f&uuml;r kleine Kinder geeignet, da der Schwimmpunkt bei 100 Metern mehr liegt und das Wasser hier wirklich flach ist. Die Stra&szlig;e, die zum Strand f&uuml;hrt, ist asphaltiert und in gutem Zustand. Der Parkplatz befindet sich direkt vor dem Strand und bietet Platz f&uuml;r mehrere Fahrzeuge, auch Wohnmobile. Es ist ein Sandstrand mit etwas nat&uuml;rlichem Schatten und vielen Strandinfrastrukturen. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und eine Breite von 30 Metern. Die Neigung am Strand ist sehr gering, fast flach, ebenso wie der Meeresboden, was diesen Strand zu einem sehr sicheren Strand f&uuml;r kleine Kinder macht. Hier finden Sie die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur, einen Kinderspielplatz sowie einige Sportpl&auml;tze. Ein Auto Camp befindet sich in unmittelbarer N&auml;he, sodass Sie nicht nach Unterk&uuml;nften in der Umgebung suchen m&uuml;ssen. Am Strand gibt es auch eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant. Wenn Sie eine Familie mit kleinen Kindern sind, sollten Sie den Strand Mandra besuchen, Sie werden es nicht bereuen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3404, 'de', 1),
(1540, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na gr&scaron;ki pe&scaron;čeni otro&scaron;ki plaži, paralia Mandra. Ta plaža je ena redkih plaž v regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, ki je res primerna za majhne otroke. Plitva voda je prisotna povsod vzdolž obale plaže. Posebej primeren je za majhne otroke, ker je točka plavanja pri 100 metrih, voda je tu res plitva. Cesta, ki vodi do plaže, je asfaltirana in je v dobrem stanju. Parkiri&scaron;če je tik pred plažo in lahko sprejme več vozil, tudi avtodome. Je pe&scaron;čena plaža z nekaj naravne sence in veliko plažne infrastrukture. Skupna dolžina plaže je nekaj kilometrov, &scaron;iroka pa je 30 metrov. Nagib na plaži je zelo majhen, skorajda ga ni, prav tako je tudi morsko dno zelo ravno in plitvo, zaradi česar je ta plaža zelo varna za majhne otroke. Tu je na voljo vsa bistvena infrastruktura na plaži, prav tako imate tukaj otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če in nekaj &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č. Avto kamp je v bližini, zato vam ni treba iskati nastanitve v okolici. Na plaži imate tudi bar na plaži in restavracijo. Torej, če ste družina z majhnimi otroki, obi&scaron;čite plažo Mandra, ne bo vam žal. Uživajte na svoji plaži z BeachRex.', 3404, 'sl', 1),
(1541, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na grčku pje&scaron;čanu dječju plažu, paralia Mandra. Ova je plaža jedna od rijetkih plaža u regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki koja je zaista pogodna za malu djecu. Plitka voda prisutna je svugdje uz obalu. Posebno je pogodno za malu djecu, jer je kupali&scaron;te na 100 metara, voda je ovdje doista plitka. Put koji vodi do plaže je asfaltiran i u dobrom je stanju. Parkirali&scaron;te je tik ispred plaže i može primiti nekoliko vozila, uključujući i kamp kućice. To je pje&scaron;čana plaža s prirodnom hladovinom i puno infrastrukture na plaži. Ukupna dužina plaže je nekoliko kilometara, a &scaron;iroka je 30 metara. Nagib na plaži je vrlo mali, gotovo da ga i nema, a morsko dno je također vrlo ravno i plitko, &scaron;to ovu plažu čini vrlo sigurnom za malu djecu. Ovdje je dostupna sva bitna infrastruktura na plaži, ovdje imate i dječje igrali&scaron;te i neke sportske terene. U blizini je autokamp, ​​tako da ne morate tražiti smje&scaron;taj na tom području. Na plaži se nalazi i beach bar i restoran. Dakle, ako ste obitelj s malom djecom, posjetite plažu Mandra, nećete požaliti. Uživajte na svojoj plaži uz BeachRex.', 3404, 'hr', 1),
(1542, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia greca Ai Giannis. La Grecia ha tutti i tipi di spiagge da offrire. Sono disponibili in diverse forme e dimensioni. Un tipo speciale di spiaggia &egrave; quella in cui si guida su una strada per chilometri, con la spiaggia adiacente alla strada, a pochi metri di distanza. Ebbene, se ti piacciono questo tipo di spiagge, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Paralia Ai Giannis. La piccola citt&agrave; pi&ugrave; vicina si chiama Avdira ed &egrave; famosa per avere molte spiagge sabbiose nella zona circostante. La maggior parte sono lunghe, ma paralia Ai Giannis &egrave; lunga solo 200 m, ha una larghezza massima di 15 metri e ha una bella e attraente curva della spiaggia. Qui non hai molte possibilit&agrave; di parcheggio, alcune sono disponibili proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. Ci sono alcuni scogli ai bordi della spiaggia e il punto di balneazione &egrave; gi&agrave; a 3 metri. Tutta l&#39;infrastruttura balneare essenziale &egrave; presente qui, hai anche un bar sulla spiaggia direttamente sulla spiaggia. Sono disponibili anche alloggi molto vicini alla spiaggia, principalmente come appartamenti e camere, ma non hai hotel. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3405, 'it', 1),
(1543, 'Bienvenue sur la plage grecque Ai Giannis. La Gr&egrave;ce a toutes sortes de plages &agrave; offrir. Ils viennent dans diff&eacute;rentes formes et tailles. Un type sp&eacute;cial de plage est celui o&ugrave; vous conduisez sur une route pendant des kilom&egrave;tres, la plage &eacute;tant &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route, &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres. Eh bien, si vous aimez ce genre de plages, nous vous sugg&eacute;rons de visiter la plage Paralia Ai Giannis. La petite ville la plus proche s&#39;appelle Avdira, et elle est c&eacute;l&egrave;bre pour ses nombreuses plages de sable dans les environs. La plupart d&#39;entre eux sont longs, mais la paralia Ai Giannis ne mesure que 200 m de long, a une largeur maximale de 15 m&egrave;tres et a une belle et jolie courbe de plage. Ici, vous n&#39;avez pas beaucoup d&#39;options de stationnement, certaines sont disponibles juste en face de la plage. Il y a quelques rochers sur les bords de la plage et le point de baignade est d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 3 m&egrave;tres. Toutes les infrastructures essentielles de la plage sont pr&eacute;sentes ici, vous avez &eacute;galement un bar de plage directement sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement disponible tr&egrave;s pr&egrave;s de la plage, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements et de chambres, mais vous n&#39;avez pas d&#39;h&ocirc;tels. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3405, 'fr', 1),
(1544, 'Bienvenido a la playa griega Ai Giannis. Grecia tiene todo tipo de playas que ofrecer. Vienen en diferentes formas y tama&ntilde;os. Un tipo especial de playa es aquella, en la que se conduce por una carretera durante kil&oacute;metros, con la playa junto a la carretera, a solo unos metros de distancia. Pues si te gustan ese tipo de playas, te sugerimos que visites la playa Paralia Ai Giannis. La peque&ntilde;a ciudad m&aacute;s cercana se llama Avdira, y es famosa por tener muchas playas de arena en los alrededores. La mayor&iacute;a de ellas son largas, pero la paralia Ai Giannis mide solo 200 m de largo, tiene un ancho m&aacute;ximo de 15 metros y tiene una bonita y atractiva curva de playa. Aqu&iacute; no tiene muchas opciones de estacionamiento, algunas est&aacute;n disponibles justo en frente de la playa. Hay algunas rocas en los bordes de la playa y el punto de ba&ntilde;o ya est&aacute; a 3 metros. Toda la infraestructura de playa esencial est&aacute; presente aqu&iacute;, tambi&eacute;n tiene un chiringuito directamente en la playa. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible muy cerca de la playa, principalmente como apartamentos y habitaciones, pero no tienes hoteles. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3405, 'es', 1),
(1545, 'Willkommen am griechischen Strand Ai Giannis. Griechenland hat alle Arten von Str&auml;nden zu bieten. Sie kommen in verschiedenen Formen und Gr&ouml;&szlig;en. Eine besondere Art von Strand ist der, an dem Sie kilometerweit auf einer Stra&szlig;e fahren, und der Strand befindet sich neben der Stra&szlig;e, nur wenige Meter entfernt. Wenn Sie diese Art von Str&auml;nden m&ouml;gen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Paralia Ai Giannis zu besuchen. Die n&auml;chstgelegene kleine Stadt hei&szlig;t Avdira und ist ber&uuml;hmt f&uuml;r ihre vielen Sandstr&auml;nde in der Umgebung. Die meisten von ihnen sind lang, aber Paralia Ai Giannis ist nur 200 m lang, hat eine maximale Breite von 15 m und eine sch&ouml;ne und attraktive Strandkurve. Hier gibt es nicht viele Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten, einige stehen direkt vor dem Strand zur Verf&uuml;gung. Es gibt einige Felsen an den R&auml;ndern des Strandes und der Badepunkt liegt bereits bei 3 Metern. Hier ist die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur vorhanden, Sie haben auch eine Strandbar direkt am Strand. Die Unterkunft ist auch sehr nahe am Strand verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich als Apartments und Zimmer, aber Sie haben keine Hotels. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3405, 'de', 1),
(1546, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na gr&scaron;ki plaži Ai Giannis. Grčija ponuja vse vrste plaž. Na voljo so v različnih oblikah in velikostih. Posebna vrsta plaže je tista, na kateri se vozite po cesti več kilometrov, plaža pa je le nekaj metrov stran od ceste. No, če so vam tak&scaron;ne plaže v&scaron;eč, vam predlagamo, da obi&scaron;čete plažo Paralia Ai Giannis. Najbližje mestece se imenuje Avdira in je znano po tem, da ima &scaron;tevilnih pe&scaron;čene plaže v svoji okolici. Večina jih je dolgih, a paralia Ai Giannis je dolga le 200 m, ima največ 15 metrov &scaron;irine in ima lepo in privlačno krivuljo na plaži. Tu nimate veliko možnosti za parkiranje, nekatera so na voljo tik pred plažo. Na robovih plaže je nekaj skal, možnost zaplavati pa imate že po 3 metrih. Tu je prisotna vsa bistvena infrastruktura na plaži, na plaži imate tudi bar na plaži. Nastanitev je na voljo tudi zelo blizu plaže, predvsem kot apartmaji in sobe, žal &scaron;a se tu ne nahaja noben hotel. Uživajte na svoji plaži z BeachRexom.', 3405, 'sl', 1),
(1547, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na grčku plažu Ai Giannis. Grčka nudi sve vrste plaža. Dostupni su u različitim oblicima i veličinama. Posebna je vrsta plaže na kojoj se vozite cestom nekoliko kilometara, a plaža je udaljena samo nekoliko metara od ceste. Pa, ako volite takve plaže, predlažemo da posjetite plažu Paralia Ai Giannis. Najbliži grad zove se Avdira i poznat je po tome &scaron;to u okolici ima mnogo pje&scaron;čanih plaža. Većina ih je duga, ali paralija Ai Giannis duga je samo 200 metara, ima maksimalnu &scaron;irinu od 15 metara i ima lijepu i atraktivnu krivulju na plaži. Ovdje nemate puno mogućnosti parkiranja, neke su dostupne tik ispred plaže. Na rubovima plaže ima nekoliko stijena, a vi imate priliku kupati se nakon 3 metra. Ovdje je sva bitna infrastruktura na plaži, na plaži imate i beach bar. Smje&scaron;taj je također dostupan vrlo blizu plaže, posebno kao apartmani i sobe, iako ovdje nema hotela. Uživajte na svojoj plaži uz BeachRex.', 3405, 'hr', 1),
(1548, 'Una vera spiaggia avventurosa &egrave; ci&ograve; che puoi aspettarti quando visiti la spiaggia greca Paralia Glyfada. Si trova nella regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, che &egrave; la parte nord-est di questo famoso paese, e fa parte del comune della citt&agrave; Komotini. La strada che porta alla spiaggia &egrave; asfaltata e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare direttamente davanti alla spiaggia. Se sei un fan di una spiaggia con quasi nessuna infrastruttura, solo un parcheggio, anche per camper, allora questa spiaggia &egrave; quella che fa per te. Se non lo sei, dovresti evitarlo e visitare qualche spiaggia pi&ugrave; vicina al piccolo paese di Fanari. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; prevalentemente di sabbia, ma ci sono anche alcuni ciottoli misti. Questa spiaggia &egrave; molto lunga, pi&ugrave; di 1 chilometro e la larghezza massima &egrave; di soli 10 metri. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; gi&agrave; a 10 metri. Una delle caratteristiche che rende questa spiaggia un po &#39;speciale sono le piccole scogliere, di colore rosso, sullo sfondo della spiaggia. Gli alloggi sono lontani, cos&igrave; come i ristoranti. Goditi questa spiaggia speciale con BeachRex.', 3399, 'it', 1),
(1549, 'Une v&eacute;ritable plage d&#39;aventure est ce &agrave; quoi vous pouvez vous attendre lorsque vous visitez la plage grecque Paralia Glyfada. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, qui est la partie nord-est de ce c&eacute;l&egrave;bre pays, et fait partie de la municipalit&eacute; de la ville de Komotini. La route qui m&egrave;ne &agrave; la plage est goudronn&eacute;e et vous pouvez vous garer directement en face de la plage. Si vous &ecirc;tes fan d&#39;une plage avec presque aucune infrastructure, seulement un parking, &eacute;galement pour les camping-cars, cette plage est faite pour vous. Si ce n&#39;est pas le cas, vous devriez l&#39;&eacute;viter et visiter une plage plus proche de la petite ville de Fanari. La surface principale de la plage est principalement constitu&eacute;e de sable, mais il y a aussi des galets m&eacute;lang&eacute;s avec dedans. Cette plage est tr&egrave;s longue, plus d&#39;un kilom&egrave;tre, et la largeur maximale n&#39;est que de 10 m&egrave;tres. Le point de nage est d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 10 m&egrave;tres. Une des caract&eacute;ristiques qui rend cette plage un peu sp&eacute;ciale sont les petites falaises, de couleur rouge, en arri&egrave;re-plan de la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est loin, ainsi que les restaurants. Profitez de cette plage sp&eacute;ciale avec BeachRex.', 3399, 'fr', 1),
(1550, 'Una verdadera playa de aventuras es lo que puede esperar cuando visite la playa griega Paralia Glyfada. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, que es la parte noreste de este famoso pa&iacute;s, y es parte del municipio de la ciudad Komotini. La carretera que conduce a la playa est&aacute; asfaltada y se puede aparcar directamente frente a la playa. Si eres un fan&aacute;tico de una playa sin apenas infraestructura, solo estacionamiento, tambi&eacute;n para autocaravanas, entonces esta playa es para ti. Si no es as&iacute;, debe evitarlo y visitar alguna playa m&aacute;s cercana al peque&ntilde;o pueblo de Fanari. La superficie principal de la playa es predominantemente de arena, pero tambi&eacute;n hay algunos guijarros mezclados. Esta playa es muy larga, m&aacute;s de 1 kil&oacute;metro y el ancho m&aacute;ximo es de solo 10 metros. El punto de nadar ya est&aacute; a los 10 metros. Una caracter&iacute;stica que hace que esta playa sea un poco especial son los peque&ntilde;os acantilados, en color rojo, en el fondo de la playa. El alojamiento est&aacute; lejos, al igual que los restaurantes. Disfruta de esta playa especial con BeachRex.', 3399, 'es', 1),
(1551, 'Ein wahrer Abenteuerstrand ist das, was Sie erwarten k&ouml;nnen, wenn Sie den griechischen Strand Paralia Glyfada besuchen. Es befindet sich in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, dem nord&ouml;stlichen Teil dieses ber&uuml;hmten Landes, und ist Teil der Gemeinde der Stadt Komotini. Die Stra&szlig;e, die zum Strand f&uuml;hrt, ist asphaltiert und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand parken. Wenn Sie ein Fan eines Strandes mit fast keiner Infrastruktur sind, nur einem Parkplatz, auch f&uuml;r Wohnmobile, dann ist dieser Strand der richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Wenn Sie nicht sind, sollten Sie es vermeiden und einen Strand besuchen, der n&auml;her an der kleinen Stadt Fanari liegt. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes besteht &uuml;berwiegend aus Sand, aber es sind auch einige Kieselsteine ​​eingemischt. Dieser Strand ist sehr lang, mehr als 1 Kilometer lang und die maximale Breite betr&auml;gt nur 10 Meter. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bereits bei 10 Metern. Eine Besonderheit, die diesen Strand zu etwas Besonderem macht, sind die kleinen Klippen in roter Farbe im Hintergrund des Strandes. Die Unterkunft ist weit weg, ebenso die Restaurants. Genie&szlig;en Sie diesen besonderen Strand mit BeachRex.', 3399, 'de', 1),
(1552, 'Prava pustolovska plaža je tisto, kar lahko pričakujete ob obisku gr&scaron;ke plaže Paralia Glyfada. Nahaja se v regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, ki je severovzhodni del te slavne države in je del občine mesta Komotini. Cesta, ki vodi do plaže, je asfaltirana in parkirate lahko neposredno pred plažo. Če ste ljubitelj plaže s skoraj nobeno infrastrukturo, le parkiri&scaron;čem, tudi za avtodome, potem je ta plaža prava za vas. Če niste, se tej plaži raji izognite in obi&scaron;čite kak&scaron;no plažo bližje mestecu Fanari. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je pretežno iz peska, vendar je v njej tudi nekaj prodnatih kamnov. Ta plaža je zelo dolga, več kot 1 kilometer in največja &scaron;irina je le 10 metrov. Točka plavanja je že na 10 metrih. Značilnosti, zaradi katerih je ta plaža nekoliko posebna, so majhne pečine v rdeči barvi v ozadju plaže. Namestitev je daleč stran, prav tako restavracije. Uživajte na tej posebni plaži z BeachRexom.', 3399, 'sl', 1),
(1553, 'Prava avanturistička plaža ono je &scaron;to možete očekivati ​​prilikom posjeta grčkoj plaži Paralia Glyfada. Smje&scaron;teno je u regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, koja je sjeveroistočni dio ove poznate zemlje i dio je općine Komotini. Cesta koja vodi do plaže je asfaltirana i možete parkirati neposredno ispred plaže. Ako ste ljubitelj plaže s gotovo nikakvom infrastrukturom, već samo parkirali&scaron;tem, čak i za kamp kućice, onda je ova plaža prava za vas. Ako niste, radije izbjegavajte ovu plažu i posjetite neku plažu bliže gradu Fanari. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže uglavnom je izrađena od pijeska, ali u njoj ima i &scaron;ljunka. Ova je plaža vrlo dugačka, vi&scaron;e od 1 kilometra, a maksimalna &scaron;irina je samo 10 metara. Točka plivanja već je na 10 metara. Značajke koje ovu plažu čine malo posebnom su male crvene litice u pozadini plaže. Smje&scaron;taj je daleko, kao i restorani. Uživajte na ovoj posebnoj plaži uz BeachRex.', 3399, 'hr', 1),
(1554, 'Vicino all&#39;aeroporto di Kavala, ai margini dei campi agricoli, c&#39;&egrave; una bella spiaggia sabbiosa chiamata Tirala. &Egrave; molto facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con camper, e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare quasi direttamente davanti alla spiaggia. Questa spiaggia &egrave; molto lunga, pochi chilometri, e ha una larghezza massima di 15 metri. Il punto di balneazione inizia molto velocemente, gi&agrave; dopo soli 5 metri. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; ripido, non proprio per i bambini piccoli. Un&#39;altra buona caratteristica della spiaggia &egrave; il fatto che offre molta ombra naturale, quindi sei protetto dal caldo sole del Mediterraneo meridionale. Tutte le infrastrutture essenziali della spiaggia si trovano qui e hai anche un bel bar sulla spiaggia per goderti una bella vista sul Mar Egeo. Non sono disponibili alloggi nelle vicinanze, ma sono pi&ugrave; lontani, a pochi chilometri. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3409, 'it', 1),
(1555, 'Pr&egrave;s de l&#39;a&eacute;roport de Kavala, au bord des champs agricoles, il y a une belle plage de sable appel&eacute;e Tirala. Il est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, y compris avec un camping-car, et vous pouvez vous garer presque directement devant la plage. Cette plage est tr&egrave;s longue, quelques kilom&egrave;tres, et sa largeur maximale est de 15 m&egrave;tres. Le point de baignade commence tr&egrave;s rapidement, d&eacute;j&agrave; apr&egrave;s seulement 5 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est raide, pas vraiment pour les petits enfants. Une autre bonne caract&eacute;ristique de la plage est le fait qu&#39;elle offre beaucoup d&#39;ombre naturelle, vous &ecirc;tes donc prot&eacute;g&eacute; du soleil chaud du sud de la M&eacute;diterran&eacute;e. Toutes les infrastructures essentielles de la plage se trouvent ici et vous avez &eacute;galement un joli bar de plage pour profiter d&#39;une belle vue sur la mer &Eacute;g&eacute;e. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas disponible dans les environs, mais est plus loin, &agrave; quelques kilom&egrave;tres. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3409, 'fr', 1),
(1556, 'Cerca del aeropuerto de Kavala, al borde de los campos agr&iacute;colas, hay una bonita playa de arena llamada Tirala. Es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana, y se puede aparcar casi directamente frente a la playa. Esta playa es muy larga, de pocos kil&oacute;metros, y tiene una anchura m&aacute;xima de 15 metros. El punto de nataci&oacute;n comienza muy r&aacute;pido, ya despu&eacute;s de solo 5 metros. La entrada al agua es empinada, no es realmente para que jueguen los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os. Otra buena caracter&iacute;stica de la playa es el hecho de que ofrece mucha sombra natural, por lo que est&aacute; protegido del c&aacute;lido sol del sur del Mediterr&aacute;neo. Toda la infraestructura de playa esencial se encuentra aqu&iacute; y tambi&eacute;n tiene un agradable bar en la playa para disfrutar de una hermosa vista del mar Egeo. No hay alojamiento disponible en las cercan&iacute;as, pero est&aacute; m&aacute;s lejos, a pocos kil&oacute;metros. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3409, 'es', 1),
(1557, 'In der N&auml;he des Flughafens Kavala, am Rande der landwirtschaftlichen Felder, befindet sich ein sch&ouml;ner Sandstrand namens Tirala. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen fast direkt vor dem Strand parken. Dieser Strand ist sehr lang, einige Kilometer lang und hat eine maximale Breite von 15 Metern. Der Schwimmpunkt beginnt sehr schnell, bereits nach nur 5 Metern. Der Wassereintritt ist steil, nicht wirklich f&uuml;r kleine Kinder zum Spielen. Ein weiteres gutes Strandmerkmal ist die Tatsache, dass es viele nat&uuml;rliche Schatten bietet, sodass Sie vor der hei&szlig;en Sonne des s&uuml;dlichen Mittelmeers gesch&uuml;tzt sind. Hier befindet sich die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur und Sie haben auch eine sch&ouml;ne Strandbar, um einen sch&ouml;nen Blick auf die &Auml;g&auml;is zu genie&szlig;en. Die Unterkunft ist in der N&auml;he nicht verf&uuml;gbar, liegt jedoch einige Kilometer entfernt. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3409, 'de', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1558, 'V bližini letali&scaron;ča Kavala se na robu kmetijskih polj nahaja lepa pe&scaron;čena plaža z imenom Tirala. Dostop do te plaže je omogočen s kakr&scaron;nimi koli vozili, tudi z avtodomom, parkirate pa lahko skoraj neposredno pred plažo. Ta plaža je zelo dolga, nekaj kilometrov, in ima največ 15 metrov &scaron;irine. Plavati lahko začnete zelo hitro, že po samo 5 metrih. Vhod v vodo je strm, v resnici ni za igranje majhnih otrok. &Scaron;e ena dobra značilnost plaže je dejstvo, da ponuja veliko naravne sence, zato ste za&scaron;čiteni pred vročim južnim sredozemskim soncem. Tu se nahaja vsa bistvena infrastruktura na plaži, imate pa tudi prijeten bar na plaži, kjer lahko uživate v čudovitem razgledu na Egejsko morje. Nastanitev v bližini ni na voljo, je pa oddaljena nekaj kilometrov stran. Uživajte na svoji plaži z BeachRexom.', 3409, 'sl', 1),
(1559, 'U blizini zračne luke Kavala, na rubu poljoprivrednih polja, nalazi se prekrasna pje&scaron;čana plaža Tirala. Pristup ovoj plaži moguć je bilo kojim vozilom, uključujući i kamp kućicu, a možete parkirati gotovo izravno ispred plaže. Ova je plaža vrlo duga, nekoliko kilometara, a maksimalna &scaron;irina je 15 metara. Već nakon 5 metara možete početi plivati ​​vrlo brzo. Ulaz u vodu je strm, nije ba&scaron; za igranje male djece. Jo&scaron; jedna dobra karakteristika plaže je činjenica da nudi puno prirodnog hlada, tako da ste za&scaron;tićeni od vrućeg južnog mediteranskog sunca. Ovdje je sva bitna infrastruktura na plaži, a imate i ugodan bar na plaži u kojem možete uživati ​​u prekrasnom pogledu na Egejsko more. Smje&scaron;taj u blizini nije dostupan, ali je udaljen nekoliko kilometara. Uživajte na svojoj plaži uz BeachRex.', 3409, 'hr', 1),
(1560, 'Benvenuti nella bellissima spiaggia sabbiosa paralia Aspri Ammos. Se ti trovi vicino alla cittadina greca di Kavala, che con i suoi 70.000 abitanti &egrave; un luogo molto affollato, e ti piacerebbe trascorrere una giornata su una spiaggia tranquilla, con pochissimi turisti, ti consigliamo di visitare questa spiaggia, a pochi chilometri lontano dal centro di Kavala. La citt&agrave; di Kavala ha molte spiagge da offrire. Il primo dal lato est della citt&agrave; &egrave; il paralia Aspri Ammos. Si trova tra due piccole colline e la superficie principale &egrave; di sabbia. Per le sue caratteristiche di spiaggia &egrave; consigliato soprattutto alle famiglie. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia con un veicolo &egrave; molto agevole, si arriva anche con un camper e si dispone di un ampio parcheggio proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 300 metri, ha una larghezza massima di 25 metri, ha una pendenza normale e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 15 metri. Tutte le infrastrutture essenziali della spiaggia sono presenti qui e, se sei un proprietario di cani, puoi portare anche il tuo cane in spiaggia. Nelle vicinanze c&#39;&egrave; un ristorante e alcuni appartamenti. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3410, 'it', 1),
(1561, 'Bienvenue sur la magnifique plage de sable paralia Aspri Ammos. Si vous &ecirc;tes pr&egrave;s de la ville grecque de Kavala, qui est avec ses 70.000 habitants un endroit tr&egrave;s fr&eacute;quent&eacute;, et que vous souhaitez passer une journ&eacute;e sur une plage paisible, avec tr&egrave;s peu de touristes, nous vous sugg&eacute;rons de visiter cette plage, &agrave; seulement quelques kilom&egrave;tres loin du centre de Kavala. La ville de Kavala a de nombreuses plages &agrave; offrir. Le premier du c&ocirc;t&eacute; est de la ville est la paralia Aspri Ammos. Il est situ&eacute; entre deux petites collines et la surface principale est en sable. En raison de ses caract&eacute;ristiques de plage, il est principalement recommand&eacute; aux familles. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage avec un v&eacute;hicule est tr&egrave;s facile, vous pouvez &eacute;galement arriver en camping-car, et vous disposez d&#39;une grande place de parking juste en face de la plage. La longueur totale de la plage est de 300 m&egrave;tres, elle a une largeur maximale de 25 m&egrave;tres, a une pente normale et les &eacute;toiles de point de baignade &agrave; 15 m&egrave;tres. Toutes les infrastructures essentielles de la plage sont pr&eacute;sentes ici, et si vous &ecirc;tes propri&eacute;taire d&#39;un chien, vous pouvez &eacute;galement amener votre chien sur la plage. Dans les environs il y a un restaurant et quelques appartements. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3410, 'fr', 1),
(1562, 'Bienvenido a la hermosa playa de arena paralia Aspri Ammos. Si est&aacute;s cerca de la localidad griega de Kavala, que con sus 70.000 habitantes es un lugar muy concurrido, y te gustar&iacute;a pasar un d&iacute;a en una playa tranquila, con muy pocos turistas, te sugerimos que visites esta playa, a solo unos kil&oacute;metros. lejos del centro de Kavala. La ciudad de Kavala tiene muchas playas que ofrecer. El primero del lado este de la ciudad es el paralia Aspri Ammos. Est&aacute; ubicado entre dos peque&ntilde;os cerros y la superficie principal es arena. Por sus caracter&iacute;sticas de playa es sobre todo recomendable para familias. El acceso a la playa con veh&iacute;culo es muy f&aacute;cil, tambi&eacute;n puedes llegar con autocaravana, y tienes una amplia plaza de aparcamiento justo enfrente de la playa. La longitud total de la playa es de 300 metros, tiene un ancho m&aacute;ximo de 25 metros, tiene un desnivel normal y el punto de nataci&oacute;n comienza a los 15 metros. Toda la infraestructura esencial de la playa est&aacute; presente aqu&iacute;, y si usted es due&ntilde;o de un perro, tambi&eacute;n puede traerlo a la playa. En los alrededores hay un restaurante y algunos apartamentos. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3410, 'es', 1),
(1563, 'Willkommen am wundersch&ouml;nen Sandstrand Paralia Aspri Ammos. Wenn Sie sich in der N&auml;he der griechischen Stadt Kavala befinden, die mit ihren 70.000 Einwohnern ein sehr &uuml;berf&uuml;llter Ort ist, und einen Tag an einem ruhigen Strand mit sehr wenig Touristen verbringen m&ouml;chten, empfehlen wir Ihnen, diesen Strand nur wenige Kilometer entfernt vom Kavala-Zentrum, zu besuchen. Die Stadt Kavala hat viele Str&auml;nde zu bieten. Der erste von der Ostseite der Stadt, ist die Paralia Aspri Ammos. Es liegt zwischen zwei kleinen H&uuml;geln und die Hauptoberfl&auml;che ist Sand. Aufgrund seiner Strandeigenschaften wird es haupts&auml;chlich f&uuml;r Familien empfohlen. Der Zugang zum Strand mit einem Fahrzeug ist sehr einfach, Sie k&ouml;nnen auch mit einem Wohnmobil anreisen und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz direkt vor dem Strand. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 300 Meter, er hat eine maximale Breite von 25 Metern, eine normale Neigung und der Schwimmpunkt ist bei15 Meter. Hier ist die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur vorhanden. Wenn Sie ein Hundebesitzer sind, k&ouml;nnen Sie Ihren Hund auch an den Strand bringen. In der N&auml;he gibt es ein Restaurant und einige Apartments. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3410, 'de', 1),
(1564, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na čudoviti pe&scaron;čeni plaži paralia Aspri Ammos. Če ste v bližini gr&scaron;kega mesta Kavala, ki je s 70.000 prebivalci zelo natrpan kraj in bi radi preživeli dan na mirni plaži z zelo malo turistov, vam predlagamo, da obi&scaron;čete to plažo, oddaljeno le nekaj kilometrov stran od centra Kavale. Mesto Kavala ponuja &scaron;tevilne plaže. Prva z vzhodne strani mesta je paralia Aspri Ammos. Nahaja se med dvema majhnima gričema, glavna povr&scaron;ina pa je pesek. Zaradi značilnosti plaže je večinoma priporočljiva za družine. Dostop do plaže z vozilom je zelo enostaven, pridete lahko tudi z avtodomom in na razpolago imate veliko parkiri&scaron;če tik pred plažo. Skupna dolžina plaže je 300 metrov, največja &scaron;irina je 25 metrov, ima normalen naklon in mesto plavanja se začne pri 15 metrih. Tu je prisotna vsa bistvena infrastruktura na plaži in če ste lastnik psa, lahko psa pripeljete tudi na plažo. V bližini je restavracija in nekaj apartmajev. Uživajte na svoji plaži z BeachRexom.', 3410, 'sl', 1),
(1565, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na prekrasnu pje&scaron;čanu plažu paralia Aspri Ammos. Ako ste u blizini grčkog grada Kavale, koji je vrlo gužva sa 70 000 stanovnika i željeli biste provesti dan na mirnoj plaži s vrlo malo turista, predlažemo da posjetite ovu plažu, udaljenu samo nekoliko kilometara od sredi&scaron;ta Kavale. Grad Kavala nudi brojne plaže. Prva s istočne strane grada je paralija Asrali Ammos. Smje&scaron;teno je između dva mala brda, a glavna povr&scaron;ina je pijesak. Zbog karakteristika plaže, uglavnom se preporučuje obiteljima. Pristup automobilom do plaže je vrlo jednostavan, možete i automobilom, a ispred plaže je veliko parkirali&scaron;te. Ukupna dužina plaže je 300 metara, maksimalna &scaron;irina je 25 metara, ima normalan nagib, a mjesto kupanja počinje na 15 metara. Ovdje je prisutna sva bitna infrastruktura na plaži, a ako ste vlasnik psa, možete ga dovesti i na plažu. U blizini se nalazi restoran i neki apartmani. Uživajte na svojoj plaži uz BeachRex.', 3410, 'hr', 1),
(1566, 'Benvenuti nella pi&ugrave; lunga spiaggia sabbiosa della citt&agrave; greca di Kavala. Questa spiaggia di sabbia si trova appena fuori dal centro di Kavala, vicino a un centro sportivo e uno stadio di atletica / calcio. La spiaggia &egrave; molto facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, e hai il parcheggio direttamente davanti alla spiaggia. &Egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie, adatta anche a chi ha cani. Tutta l&#39;infrastruttura essenziale della spiaggia &egrave; disponibile qui e hai anche alcuni campi sportivi nelle vicinanze. 1 km &egrave; la lunghezza totale della spiaggia, con una larghezza massima di 25 metri. L&#39;acqua arriva qui molto velocemente in profondit&agrave;, quindi puoi iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; dopo 5 metri. Alcuni bar sulla spiaggia sono anche sulla spiaggia, anche i ristoranti non sono lontani, quindi non c&#39;&egrave; bisogno di portare tutto il cibo con te. Nelle vicinanze sono disponibili anche alloggi, principalmente come appartamenti o camere. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3411, 'it', 1),
(1567, 'Bienvenido a la playa de arena m&aacute;s larga de la ciudad griega de Kavala. Esta playa de arena se encuentra a las afueras del centro de Kavala, junto a un centro deportivo y un estadio de atletismo / f&uacute;tbol. La playa es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, y tienes el estacionamiento directamente en frente de la playa. Es una playa familiar, apta tambi&eacute;n para los que tienen perros. Toda la infraestructura de playa esencial est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute; e incluso tiene algunos campos deportivos cerca. 1 km es la longitud total de la playa, con un ancho m&aacute;ximo de 25 metros. El agua llega aqu&iacute; muy r&aacute;pido y profundo, por lo que puede comenzar a nadar ya despu&eacute;s de 5 metros. Algunos chiringuitos tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n en la playa, los restaurantes tampoco est&aacute;n muy lejos, por lo que no es necesario llevar toda la comida. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible en las cercan&iacute;as, principalmente como apartamentos o habitaciones. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3411, 'es', 1),
(1568, 'Bienvenue sur la plus longue plage de sable de la ville grecque de Kavala. Cette plage de sable est situ&eacute;e juste &agrave; l&#39;ext&eacute;rieur du centre de Kavala, &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; d&#39;un centre sportif et d&#39;un stade d&#39;athl&eacute;tisme / football. La plage est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, et vous avez le parking juste en face de la plage. C&#39;est une plage familiale, id&eacute;ale aussi pour ceux qui ont des chiens. Toutes les infrastructures de plage essentielles sont disponibles ici et vous avez m&ecirc;me des terrains de sport &agrave; proximit&eacute;. 1 km est la longueur totale de la plage, avec une largeur maximale de 25 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;eau arrive ici tr&egrave;s vite en profondeur, vous pouvez donc commencer &agrave; nager d&eacute;j&agrave; apr&egrave;s 5 m&egrave;tres. Certains bars de plage sont &eacute;galement sur la plage, les restaurants ne sont pas loin non plus, donc pas besoin d&#39;emporter toute la nourriture avec vous. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement disponible &agrave; proximit&eacute;, principalement en appartements ou en chambres. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3411, 'fr', 1),
(1569, 'Willkommen am l&auml;ngsten Sandstrand der griechischen Stadt Kavala. Dieser Sandstrand befindet sich etwas au&szlig;erhalb des Kavala-Zentrums, neben einem Sportzentrum und einem Sport- / Fu&szlig;ballstadion. Der Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben den Parkplatz direkt vor dem Strand. Es ist ein Familienstrand, der auch f&uuml;r Hunde geeignet ist. Hier finden Sie alle wichtigen Strandinfrastrukturen und sogar einige Sportpl&auml;tze in der N&auml;he. 1 km ist die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes mit einer maximalen Breite von 25 Metern. Das Wasser kommt hier sehr schnell tief, so dass Sie bereits nach 5 Metern mit dem Schwimmen beginnen k&ouml;nnen. Einige Strandbars befinden sich ebenfalls am Strand, Restaurants sind auch nicht weit entfernt, sodass Sie nicht das gesamte Essen mitnehmen m&uuml;ssen. Unterk&uuml;nfte sind auch in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich als Apartments oder Zimmer. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3411, 'de', 1),
(1570, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na najdalj&scaron;i pe&scaron;čeni plaži gr&scaron;kega mesta Kavala. Ta pe&scaron;čena plaža se nahaja tik pred sredi&scaron;čem Kavale, poleg &scaron;portnega centra in atletskega / nogometnega stadiona. Plaža je zelo lahko dostopna s kakr&scaron;nimi koli vozili, parkiri&scaron;če pa imate neposredno pred plažo. Je družinska plaža, primerna tudi za tiste s psi. Tu je na voljo vsa bistvena infrastruktura za plažo, v bližini pa imate celo nekaj &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č. 1 km je skupna dolžina plaže z največjo &scaron;irino 25 metrov. Voda je zelo hitro globoka, tako da lahko začnete plavati že po 5 metrih. Nekateri bari na plaži so prisotni neposredno na plaži, restavracije tudi niso daleč, zato vam ni treba vso hrano jematii s seboj. Namestitev je na voljo tudi v bližini, večinoma kot apartmaji ali sobe. Uživajte na svoji plaži z BeachRexom.', 3411, 'sl', 1),
(1571, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na najdužu pje&scaron;čanu plažu u grčkom gradu Kavali. Ova pje&scaron;čana plaža nalazi se neposredno ispred sredi&scaron;ta Kavale, pored sportskog centra i atletskog / nogometnog stadiona. Plaža je vrlo lako dostupna bilo kojim vozilom, a imate parkirali&scaron;te neposredno ispred plaže. Obiteljska je plaža, pogodna i za one sa psima. Sva bitna infrastruktura za plažu dostupna je ovdje, a čak imate i nekoliko sportskih terena u blizini. 1 km je ukupna dužina plaže s maksimalnom &scaron;irinom od 25 metara. Voda je vrlo brza duboko, tako da možete početi plivati ​​već nakon 5 metara. Neki su barovi na plaži prisutni izravno na plaži, a ni restorani nisu daleko, tako da ne morate svu hranu ponijeti sa sobom. Smje&scaron;taj je također dostupan u blizini, uglavnom kao apartmani ili sobe. Uživajte na svojoj plaži uz BeachRex.', 3411, 'hr', 1),
(1572, 'Der d&auml;nische Strand Damsbo ist am besten f&uuml;r diejenigen zu empfehlen, die mehr Abenteuer Seelen haben. Die Hauptstrandoberfl&auml;che ist Sand, aber nur auf einem kleinen Teil, alles andere ist Gras. Es befindet sich auf der Insel F&uuml;nen in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Millinge in der Region Syddanmark. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und der Parkplatz ist nur 30 Meter vom Strand entfernt. Der Strand hat eine Breite von 10 Metern und ist 500 Meter lang. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bereits bei 5 m. Die Strandinfrastruktur an diesem Ort ist nur einfach und rund um den Strand gibt es auch keine M&ouml;glichkeit, etwas zu essen oder zu trinken zubekommen sowie keine Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeit. Wenn Sie solche Strandeigenschaften bevorzugen, sollten Sie dem Strand auf jeden Fall einen Besuch abstatten. Genie&szlig;en Sie den Strand Damsboo mit BeachRex.', 3911, 'de', 1),
(1573, 'La playa danesa Strand Damsbo es la m&aacute;s recomendada para aquellos que tienen un alma m&aacute;s aventurera. La superficie principal de la playa es arena, pero solo en una peque&ntilde;a porci&oacute;n, todo lo dem&aacute;s es pasto. Se encuentra en la isla Funen cerca del pueblo Millinge en la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y el lugar de estacionamiento est&aacute; a solo 30 metros de la playa. La playa tiene un ancho de 10 metros y 500 m de largo. La entrada al agua es agradable y el punto de nadar ya est&aacute; a 5 m. La infraestructura de la playa en esta ubicaci&oacute;n es solo b&aacute;sica y alrededor de la playa tampoco hay posibilidad de conseguir nada para comer o beber, as&iacute; como tampoco opci&oacute;n de alojamiento. Si prefiere estas caracter&iacute;sticas de playa, entonces deber&iacute;a visitar la playa. Disfruta de la playa Strand Damsboo con BeachRex.', 3911, 'es', 1),
(1574, 'La plage danoise Strand Damsbo est la mieux recommand&eacute;e pour ceux qui ont une &acirc;me plus aventureuse. La surface principale de la plage est du sable, mais seulement sur une petite partie, tout le reste est de l&#39;herbe. Il est situ&eacute; sur l&#39;&icirc;le de Fionie pr&egrave;s du village Millinge dans la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et le parking est &agrave; seulement 30 m&egrave;tres de la plage. La plage a une largeur de 10 m&egrave;tres et une longueur de 500 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 5 m. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage &agrave; cet endroit n&#39;est que basique et autour de la plage, il n&#39;y a pas non plus de possibilit&eacute; d&#39;obtenir quoi que ce soit &agrave; manger ou &agrave; boire ni aucune option d&#39;h&eacute;bergement. Si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez de telles caract&eacute;ristiques de plage, vous devriez certainement visiter la plage. Profitez de la plage Strand Damsboo avec BeachRex.', 3911, 'fr', 1),
(1575, 'La spiaggia danese Strand Damsbo &egrave; consigliata per coloro che hanno un&#39;anima pi&ugrave; avventurosa. La superficie della spiaggia principale &egrave; di sabbia, ma solo in una piccola porzione, tutto il resto &egrave; erba. Si trova sull&#39;isola di Funen vicino al villaggio di Millinge nella regione Syddanmark. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e il parcheggio &egrave; a soli 30 metri dalla spiaggia. La spiaggia ha una larghezza di 10 metri ed &egrave; lunga 500 metri. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; gi&agrave; a 5 m. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia in questa localit&agrave; &egrave; solo di base e intorno alla spiaggia non c&#39;&egrave; nemmeno la possibilit&agrave; di avere qualcosa da mangiare o da bere e nessuna possibilit&agrave; di alloggio. Se preferisci queste caratteristiche di spiaggia, dovresti sicuramente fare una visita alla spiaggia. Goditi la spiaggia Strand Damsboo con BeachRex.', 3911, 'it', 1),
(1576, 'Wenn Sie nach einem d&auml;nischen Strand mit wei&szlig;em Sand, einem wundersch&ouml;nen Park und einem Ferienwohnungskomplex in der N&auml;he des Strandes suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Faaborg zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der Region Syddanmark auf der Insel F&uuml;nen in der Stadt Faaborg. Es ist sehr einfach, zum Strand zu gelangen, aber es ist eher eine Herausforderung, einen Parkplatz zu finden. Ein kleiner Parkplatz befindet sich ganz in der N&auml;he des Strandes, bietet jedoch Platz f&uuml;r nur 10 Fahrzeuge. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 250 m und ist 40 m breit. Es besteht aus mehreren kleinen Buchten. Der Wassereintritt und seine Tiefe sind unterschiedlich und h&auml;ngen davon ab, wo Sie ins Wasser m&ouml;chten. Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder die Wasserleiter benutzen, langsam vom Strand gehen oder vom Pier springen. An einigen Stellen f&auml;llt das Wasser sofort in die Tiefe. Hier gibt es viele Strandinfrastrukturen sowie Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s. Hier finden Sie auch viele Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, ein Apartmentkomplex befindet sich in der N&auml;he. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3912, 'de', 1),
(1577, 'Se stai cercando una spiaggia danese di sabbia bianca, con un bellissimo parco e un complesso di appartamenti per vacanze nelle vicinanze, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand Faaborg. Si trova nella regione Syddanmark sull&#39;isola di Fionia nella citt&agrave; di Faaborg. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungere la spiaggia, ma trovare un parcheggio &egrave; pi&ugrave; una sfida. Un piccolo parcheggio &egrave; molto vicino alla spiaggia, ma pu&ograve; contenere solo 10 veicoli. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 250 m ed &egrave; larga 40 m. Si compone di diverse piccole baie. L&#39;ingresso in acqua e la sua profondit&agrave; sono diversi e dipende da dove vorresti entrare in acqua. Puoi usare la scala d&#39;acqua, andare lentamente dalla spiaggia o saltare dal molo. In alcuni punti l&#39;acqua scende immediatamente in profondit&agrave;. Molte infrastrutture sulla spiaggia sono disponibili qui, cos&igrave; come ristoranti e bar. Troverete anche molte opzioni di alloggio qui, un complesso di appartamenti si trova nelle vicinanze. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3912, 'it', 1),
(1578, 'Si vous recherchez une plage danoise de sable blanc, avec un magnifique parc et un complexe d&#39;appartements de vacances &agrave; proximit&eacute;, nous vous sugg&eacute;rons de visiter la plage Strand Faaborg. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark sur l&#39;&icirc;le Fionie dans la ville Faaborg. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de se rendre &agrave; la plage, mais c&#39;est plus un d&eacute;fi de trouver une place de parking. Un petit parking est tr&egrave;s proche de la plage, mais il ne peut contenir que 10 v&eacute;hicules. La plage a une longueur totale de 250 m et une largeur de 40 m. Il se compose de plusieurs petites baies. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et sa profondeur sont diff&eacute;rentes et cela d&eacute;pend de l&#39;endroit o&ugrave; vous souhaitez entrer dans l&#39;eau. Vous pouvez utiliser l&#39;&eacute;chelle &agrave; eau, sortir lentement de la plage ou sauter de la jet&eacute;e. &Agrave; certains endroits, l&#39;eau tombe imm&eacute;diatement dans la profondeur. De nombreuses infrastructures de plage sont disponibles ici, ainsi que des restaurants et des caf&eacute;s. Vous trouverez &eacute;galement de nombreuses options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement ici, un complexe d&#39;appartements est &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3912, 'fr', 1),
(1579, 'Si est&aacute; buscando una playa danesa de arena blanca, con un hermoso parque y un complejo de apartamentos de vacaciones cerca, le sugerimos que visite la playa Strand Faaborg. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Syddanmark en la isla Funen en la ciudad Faaborg. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a la playa, pero es m&aacute;s dif&iacute;cil encontrar un lugar para estacionar. Un peque&ntilde;o lugar de estacionamiento est&aacute; muy cerca de la playa, pero solo tiene capacidad para 10 veh&iacute;culos. La playa tiene una longitud total de 250 my 40 m de ancho. Consta de varias bah&iacute;as peque&ntilde;as. La entrada de agua y su profundidad es diferente y depende de d&oacute;nde le gustar&iacute;a entrar al agua. Puedes usar la escalera de agua, ir despacio desde la playa o saltar desde el muelle. En algunos lugares, el agua cae inmediatamente a la profundidad. Hay mucha infraestructura de playa disponible aqu&iacute;, as&iacute; como restaurantes y cafeter&iacute;as. Tambi&eacute;n encontrar&aacute; muchas opciones de alojamiento aqu&iacute;, un complejo de apartamentos est&aacute; cerca. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3912, 'es', 1),
(1580, 'Die d&auml;nische Insel Langeland in der s&uuml;dlichen Region Syddanmark ist bekannt f&uuml;r ihre langen, sandigen und wilden Str&auml;nde. Hier befindet sich nur eine sehr geringe touristische Infrastruktur. Wenn Sie dies bevorzugen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Hesselbjerg zu besuchen. Das dem Strand am n&auml;chsten gelegene Dorf ist Humble. Direkt neben dem Strand haben Sie einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz und es ist sehr einfach, mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, dorthin zu gelangen. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich rund um den Parkplatz, z. B. Toiletten, Sportpl&auml;tze und ein kleines Strandbistro. Vom Parkplatz sind es nur 50 m zu Fu&szlig; zum Strand. Der Strand ist sehr lang und hat eine Breite von 10 Metern. Am Strand gibt es auch einen Pier, den Sie alternativ nutzen k&ouml;nnen, um &uuml;ber eine Leiter ins Wasser zu gelangen, anstatt &uuml;ber den Strand zu gehen. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt zwischen 0 und 15 m. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie dies tun, indem Sie einige benachbarte Wohnungen oder H&auml;user mieten. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3914, 'de', 1),
(1581, 'L&#39;isola danese Langeland, nella regione meridionale del Syddanmark, &egrave; nota per le sue lunghe spiagge sabbiose e selvagge. L&#39;infrastruttura turistica molto piccola si trova qui, e se preferisci questo fatto, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand Hesselbjerg. Il villaggio pi&ugrave; vicino alla spiaggia &egrave; Humble. Proprio accanto alla spiaggia si dispone di un ampio parcheggio ed &egrave; molto facile arrivarci con qualsiasi tipo di mezzo, anche camper. La maggior parte delle infrastrutture della spiaggia si trova intorno al parcheggio, come servizi igienici, campi sportivi e un piccolo bistrot sulla spiaggia. Ci vogliono solo 50 m di cammino dal parcheggio per raggiungere la spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; molto lunga e ha una larghezza di 10 metri. Sulla spiaggia hai anche un molo, che puoi utilizzare in alternativa per entrare in acqua tramite una scala invece di passare dalla spiaggia. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; compreso tra 0 e 15 m. Se desideri rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo puoi farlo affittando alcuni appartamenti o case vicini. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3914, 'it', 1),
(1582, 'La isla danesa de Langeland, en la regi&oacute;n sur de Syddanmark, es conocida por sus extensas playas arenosas y salvajes. Aqu&iacute; hay muy poca infraestructura tur&iacute;stica, y si lo prefiere, le recomendamos que visite la playa Strand Hesselbjerg. El pueblo m&aacute;s cercano a la playa es Humble. Justo al lado de la playa tienes una amplia plaza de aparcamiento y es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n autocaravana. La mayor parte de la infraestructura de la playa se encuentra alrededor del lugar de estacionamiento, como ba&ntilde;os, canchas deportivas y un peque&ntilde;o bistr&oacute; en la playa. Solo se necesitan 50 m de caminata desde el lugar de estacionamiento para llegar a la playa. La playa es muy larga y tiene una anchura de 10 metros. En la playa tambi&eacute;n tienes un muelle, que puedes utilizar como alternativa para meterte al agua por una escalera en lugar de ir por la playa. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; entre 0 y 15 m. Si desea permanecer aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo, puede hacerlo alquilando algunos apartamentos o casas vecinas. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3914, 'es', 1),
(1583, 'L&#39;&icirc;le danoise Langeland, dans la r&eacute;gion sud de Syddanmark, est connue pour ses longues plages de sable et sauvages. Tr&egrave;s peu d&rsquo;infrastructures touristiques se trouvent ici, et si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez cela, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage Strand Hesselbjerg. Le village le plus proche de la plage est Humble. Juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, vous avez un grand parking et il est tr&egrave;s facile de s&#39;y rendre avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, y compris un camping-car. La plupart des infrastructures de la plage sont situ&eacute;es autour du parking, comme les toilettes, les terrains de sport et un petit bistrot de plage. Il ne faut que 50 m de marche depuis le parking pour rejoindre la plage. La plage est tr&egrave;s longue et a une largeur de 10 m&egrave;tres. Sur la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement une jet&eacute;e, que vous pouvez utiliser comme alternative pour vous mettre &agrave; l&#39;eau via une &eacute;chelle au lieu de passer par la plage. Le point de nage est compris entre 0 et 15 m. Si vous souhaitez rester ici plus longtemps, vous pouvez le faire en louant des appartements ou des maisons voisins. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3914, 'fr', 1),
(1584, 'Der d&auml;nische Strand &Oslash;sterskov ist etwas ganz Besonderes, vor allem wegen der Oberfl&auml;che am Strand. Hier gibt es keinen Sand, sondern eine Mischung verschiedener Strandoberfl&auml;chentypen, wobei gro&szlig;e Kieselsteine dominieren. Der Strand befindet sich auf der Insel Langeland in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Humble in der Region Syddanmark. Wenn Sie mit Ihrem Fahrzeug hierherkommen, k&ouml;nnen Sie auf einem Parkplatz parken, der nur 10 m vom Strand entfernt ist. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und ist 10 m breit. Wegen der gro&szlig;en Steine im Wasser ist es nicht so einfach, es zu betreten. Sobald Sie im Wasser sind, k&ouml;nnen Sie nach 10 m bereits mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Sie haben viel Strandinfrastruktur an diesem Ort, einen Kinderspielplatz und Sportpl&auml;tze inklusive. Hier sind keine Speisen oder Getr&auml;nke verf&uuml;gbar. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie ein Haus oder eine Wohnung in der N&auml;he mieten. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandtag mit BeachRex.', 3916, 'de', 1),
(1585, 'La plage danoise Strand &Oslash;sterskov est quelque chose de sp&eacute;cial, surtout en raison de la surface sur la plage. Ici, vous n&#39;avez pas de sable, mais un m&eacute;lange de diff&eacute;rents types de surfaces de plage avec de gros galets dominant. La plage est situ&eacute;e sur l&#39;&icirc;le Langeland, pr&egrave;s du village Humble dans la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. En arrivant ici avec votre v&eacute;hicule, vous pouvez vous garer sur une place de parking &agrave; seulement 10 m de la plage. La plage a une longueur totale de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et une largeur de 10 m. En raison des grosses pierres dans l&#39;eau, il n&#39;est pas si facile d&#39;y p&eacute;n&eacute;trer. Une fois dans l&#39;eau, vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager &agrave; environ 10 m. Vous avez beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage &agrave; cet endroit, une aire de jeux pour enfants et des terrains de sport inclus. Aucun service de restauration ou de boisson n&#39;est disponible ici. Si vous souhaitez rester ici plus longtemps, vous pouvez louer une maison ou un appartement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de votre journ&eacute;e &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex.', 3916, 'fr', 1),
(1586, 'La playa danesa Strand &Oslash;sterskov es algo muy especial, especialmente por la superficie de la playa. Aqu&iacute; no hay arena, sino una mezcla de diferentes tipos de superficies de playa con grandes guijarros como dominantes. La playa se encuentra en la isla Langeland, cerca del pueblo Humble en la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark. Al llegar aqu&iacute; con su veh&iacute;culo, puede estacionar en un lugar de estacionamiento a solo 10 m de la playa. La playa tiene una longitud total de varios kil&oacute;metros y 10 m de ancho. Debido a las piedras grandes en el agua, no es tan f&aacute;cil entrar. Una vez en el agua puedes empezar a nadar a unos 10 m. Tiene mucha infraestructura de playa en este lugar, un parque infantil y campos deportivos incluidos. No hay servicios de comida o bebida disponibles aqu&iacute;. Si desea quedarse aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo, puede alquilar una casa o un apartamento cercano. Disfrute de su d&iacute;a de playa con BeachRex.', 3916, 'es', 1),
(1587, 'La spiaggia danese Strand &Oslash;sterskov &egrave; davvero qualcosa di speciale, soprattutto per la superficie sulla spiaggia. Qui non c&#39;&egrave; sabbia, ma una miscela di diversi tipi di spiaggia con grandi ciottoli dominanti. La spiaggia si trova sull&#39;isola Langeland, vicino al villaggio di Humble nella regione Syddanmark. Quando si arriva con il proprio veicolo, &egrave; possibile parcheggiare in un parcheggio a soli 10 m dalla spiaggia. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di diversi chilometri ed &egrave; larga 10 m. A causa delle grandi pietre nell&#39;acqua non &egrave; cos&igrave; facile entrarvi. Una volta in acqua puoi iniziare a nuotare a circa 10 m. Hai molte infrastrutture da spiaggia in questa localit&agrave;, un parco giochi per bambini e campi sportivi inclusi. Nessun servizio di cibo o bevande &egrave; disponibile qui. Se desideri rimanere pi&ugrave; a lungo qui puoi affittare una casa o un appartamento nelle vicinanze. Goditi la tua giornata in spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3916, 'it', 1),
(1588, 'In der N&auml;he des Dorfes Tranek&aelig;r auf der d&auml;nischen Insel Langeland befindet sich ein Familienstrand namens Strand Lohals, der darauf wartet, von Ihnen erkundet zu werden. Wenn Sie Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, an denen Sie direkt vor dem Strand parken k&ouml;nnen, ist dieser genau das Richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Diese Strandlage geh&ouml;rt zur Region Syddanmark. Lohals, wo sich der Str&auml;nde befinden, ist sehr leicht zu erreichen, egal mit welchem Fahrzeug Sie reisen. Obwohl der Parkplatz klein ist, ist dieser Strand sehr beliebt. Sie haben hier die n&ouml;tige Strandinfrastruktur. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes ist Sand, und der Strand ist 400 m lang und bis zu 20 m breit. Es ist ein sehr flacher Strand und der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n, der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 15 m. Einige Caf&eacute;s und Restaurants befinden sich in der Umgebung, jedoch nicht direkt am Strand. In der N&auml;he haben Sie auch einige Apartments und einige Campingpl&auml;tze f&uuml;r Ihre Sommerferienunterk&uuml;nfte. Genie&szlig;en Sie diesen einzigartigen Strand mit BeachRex.', 3918, 'de', 1),
(1589, 'Pr&egrave;s du village de Tranek&aelig;r, sur l&#39;&icirc;le danoise de Langeland, il y a une plage familiale appel&eacute;e strand Lohals, qui n&#39;attend que d&#39;&ecirc;tre explor&eacute;e par vous. Si vous aimez les plages o&ugrave; vous pouvez vous garer directement en face de la plage, celle-ci est faite pour vous. Cet emplacement de plage appartient &agrave; la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. Lohals, o&ugrave; se trouvent les plages, est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s, quel que soit le v&eacute;hicule avec lequel vous voyagez. Bien que la place de parking soit petite, cette plage est tr&egrave;s populaire. Vous avez ici toutes les infrastructures de plage n&eacute;cessaires. La surface principale de la plage est du sable, et la plage mesure 400 m de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 20 m de large. C&#39;est une plage tr&egrave;s plate et l&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able, le point de baignade &eacute;tant &agrave; 15 m. Certains caf&eacute;s et restaurants sont disponibles dans les environs, mais pas directement sur la plage. &Agrave; proximit&eacute;, vous trouverez &eacute;galement des appartements et des terrains de camping pour vos vacances d&#39;&eacute;t&eacute;. Profitez de cette plage unique avec BeachRex.', 3918, 'fr', 1),
(1590, 'Vicino al villaggio di Tranek&aelig;r, sull&#39;isola danese di Langeland, c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie chiamata Strand Lohals, che aspetta solo di essere esplorata da te. Se ti piacciono le spiagge dove parcheggiare direttamente davanti alla spiaggia, questa &egrave; quella giusta per te. Questa localit&agrave; balneare appartiene alla regione Syddanmark. Lohals, dove si trovano le spiagge, &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere, indipendentemente dal veicolo con cui viaggi. Sebbene il parcheggio sia piccolo, questa spiaggia &egrave; molto frequentata. Hai tutte le infrastrutture necessarie per la spiaggia qui. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia e la spiaggia &egrave; lunga 400 me larga fino a 20 m. &Egrave; una spiaggia molto piatta e l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; piacevole, con la balneazione a 15 m. Alcuni bar e ristoranti sono disponibili nella zona circostante, ma non direttamente sulla spiaggia. Nelle vicinanze ci sono anche alcuni appartamenti e alcuni campeggi per le vostre vacanze estive. Goditi questa spiaggia unica nel suo genere con BeachRex.', 3918, 'it', 1),
(1591, 'Cerca del pueblo de Tranek&aelig;r, en la isla danesa de Langeland, hay una playa familiar llamada Strand Lohals, que espera ser explorada por usted. Si te gustan las playas donde aparcar directamente frente a la playa, esta es la indicada para ti. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n de playa pertenece a la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark. Lohals, donde se encuentran las playas, es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso, sin importar el veh&iacute;culo con el que viaje. Aunque el lugar de estacionamiento es peque&ntilde;o, esta playa es muy popular. Tienes toda la infraestructura de playa necesaria aqu&iacute;. La superficie principal de la playa es de arena, y la playa tiene 400 m de largo y hasta 20 m de ancho. Es una playa muy plana y la entrada de agua es agradable, con el punto de ba&ntilde;o a 15 m. Algunas cafeter&iacute;as y restaurantes est&aacute;n disponibles en los alrededores, pero no directamente en la playa. Cerca tambi&eacute;n tiene algunos apartamentos y algunos terrenos de camping para su alojamiento de vacaciones de verano. Disfruta de esta playa &uacute;nica con BeachRex.', 3918, 'es', 1),
(1592, 'Willkommen am d&auml;nischen Strand Stengade. Es hat einen sehr flachen Meeresboden, was es f&uuml;r kleine Kinder sehr sicher macht, sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Wenn Sie nach einem solchen Strand suchen, finden Sie diesen Strand auf der Insel Langeland in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Tranek&aelig;r in der Region Syddanmark. Diese Strandlage ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen Parkplatz nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt. Auch Wohnmobile sind hier willkommen. Der Strand ist 750 m lang und bis zu 10 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt ungef&auml;hr bei 75 m, vielleicht sogar noch weiter. Hier befindet sich auch eine typisch d&auml;nische Strandinfrastruktur, aber am Strand stehen keine Restaurants oder Caf&eacute;s zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wenn Sie nach einer Unterkunft suchen, haben Sie die M&ouml;glichkeit, eine Wohnung oder ein Haus in der N&auml;he zu mieten. Lassen Sie Ihre Kinder mit BeachRex einen flachen Strand erkunden.', 3919, 'de', 1),
(1593, 'Bienvenue sur la plage danoise Strand Stengade. Son fond marin est tr&egrave;s plat, ce qui permet aux petits enfants de jouer en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. Si vous recherchez ce genre de plage, vous pouvez trouver cette plage sur l&#39;&icirc;le Langeland, pr&egrave;s du village Tranek&aelig;r dans la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. Cet emplacement sur la plage est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez d&#39;un parking &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage, les camping-cars sont &eacute;galement les bienvenus ici. La plage mesure 750 m de long et 10 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 75 m, peut-&ecirc;tre m&ecirc;me plus loin. Une infrastructure de plage typiquement danoise est &eacute;galement situ&eacute;e ici, mais vous n&#39;avez pas de restaurants ou de caf&eacute;s disponibles sur la plage. Si vous recherchez un logement, vous avez la possibilit&eacute; de louer un appartement ou une maison &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Laissez vos enfants explorer une plage plate avec BeachRex.', 3919, 'fr', 1),
(1594, 'Bienvenido a la playa danesa Strand Stengade. Tiene un fondo marino muy plano, lo que lo hace muy seguro para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen en el agua de forma segura. Si est&aacute; buscando ese tipo de playa, puede encontrar esta playa en la isla Langeland, cerca del pueblo Tranek&aelig;r en la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n en la playa es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tiene un estacionamiento a solo unos metros de la playa, las autocaravanas tambi&eacute;n son bienvenidas aqu&iacute;. La playa tiene 750 m de largo y hasta 10 metros de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy bonita y el punto de nado est&aacute; aproximadamente a 75 m, quiz&aacute;s incluso m&aacute;s lejos. Aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n se encuentra una infraestructura de playa t&iacute;pica danesa, pero no hay restaurantes o cafeter&iacute;as disponibles en la playa. Si est&aacute;s buscando alojamiento tienes la opci&oacute;n de alquilar alg&uacute;n apartamento o casas cercanas. Deje que sus hijos exploren una playa plana con BeachRex.', 3919, 'es', 1),
(1595, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia danese Strand Stengade. Ha un fondale molto piatto, che rende molto sicuro per i bambini piccoli giocare in acqua in sicurezza. Se stai cercando questo tipo di spiaggia, puoi trovare questa spiaggia sull&#39;isola di Langeland, vicino al villaggio di Tranek&aelig;r nella regione di Syddanmark. Questa posizione sulla spiaggia &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si dispone di un parcheggio a pochi metri dalla spiaggia, anche i camper sono i benvenuti. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 750 me larga fino a 10 metri. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 75 m, forse anche oltre. Anche una tipica infrastruttura balneare danese si trova qui, ma non ci sono ristoranti o bar disponibili sulla spiaggia. Se stai cercando un alloggio hai la possibilit&agrave; di affittare alcuni appartamenti o case nelle vicinanze. Lascia che i tuoi bambini esplorino una spiaggia piatta con BeachRex.', 3919, 'it', 1),
(1596, 'Strand Dagel&oslash;kke ist ein weiterer Inselstrand auf der d&auml;nischen Insel Langeland in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Tranek&aelig;r in der Region Syddanmark. Es ist ein Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien empfohlen wird. Diese ganze Umgebung ist sehr touristisch, mit vielen Apartments, einem Kinderspielplatz, Sportfeldern und sogar einem Hafen. Sie haben viele Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen hier zur Verf&uuml;gung. In der N&auml;he befinden sich auch Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s sowie viele Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten. Der Strand selbst ist 200 m lang und 20 m breit. Der Wassereintritt hier ist sehr sch&ouml;n und man kann in ca. 20 m H&ouml;he mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Wenn all diese Fakten mit Ihren Strandpr&auml;ferenzen &uuml;bereinstimmen, z&ouml;gern Sie nicht und besuchen Sie diesen Strand, Sie werden es nicht bereuen. Und denken Sie daran, wenn es um Str&auml;nde geht, hilft Ihnen BeachRex den richtigen f&uuml;r Sie zu finden. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandaufenthalt mit BeachRex.', 3920, 'de', 1),
(1597, 'Strand Dagel&oslash;kke est une autre plage insulaire, situ&eacute;e sur l&#39;&icirc;le danoise de Langeland, pr&egrave;s du village de Tranek&aelig;r dans la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. C&#39;est un type de plage de sable recommand&eacute; pour les familles. Cet endroit est tr&egrave;s touristique, avec de nombreux appartements, une aire de jeux pour enfants, des terrains de sport et m&ecirc;me un port. Vous avez beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures et de services de plage disponibles ici. A proximit&eacute; se trouvent &eacute;galement des restaurants et des caf&eacute;s ainsi que de nombreuses options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me mesure 200 m de long et 20 m de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau ici est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager &agrave; environ 20 m. Si tous ces faits sont en r&eacute;sonance avec vos pr&eacute;f&eacute;rences de plage, n&#39;h&eacute;sitez pas et visitez cette plage, vous ne le regretterez pas. Et n&#39;oubliez pas qu&#39;en ce qui concerne les plages, BeachRex vous aidera &agrave; trouver celle qui vous convient. Profitez de votre s&eacute;jour &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex.', 3920, 'fr', 1),
(1598, 'Strand Dagel&oslash;kke es una playa de otra isla, ubicada en la isla danesa de Langeland, cerca del pueblo Tranek&aelig;r en la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark. Es un tipo de playa de arena recomendada para familias. Toda esta ubicaci&oacute;n es muy tur&iacute;stica, con muchos apartamentos, un parque infantil, campos deportivos e incluso un puerto. Tiene mucha infraestructura y servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;. Muy cerca tambi&eacute;n hay restaurantes y cafeter&iacute;as, as&iacute; como muchas opciones de alojamiento. La playa en s&iacute; tiene 200 m de largo y 20 m de ancho. La entrada de agua aqu&iacute; es muy bonita y se puede empezar a nadar a unos 20 m. Si todos esos hechos resuenan con tus preferencias de playa, no lo dudes y visita esta playa, no te arrepentir&aacute;s. Y recuerde, cuando se trata de playas, BeachRex le ayudar&aacute; a encontrar la que m&aacute;s le convenga. Disfrute de su estancia en la playa con BeachRex.', 3920, 'es', 1),
(1599, 'Strand Dagel&oslash;kke &egrave; un&#39;altra spiaggia dell&#39;isola, situata sull&#39;isola danese di Langeland, vicino al villaggio di Tranek&aelig;r nella regione di Syddanmark. &Egrave; un tipo di spiaggia sabbiosa consigliata alle famiglie. Tutta questa localit&agrave; &egrave; molto turistica, con molti appartamenti, un parco giochi per bambini, campi sportivi e persino un porto. Hai molte infrastrutture e servizi sulla spiaggia disponibili qui. Nelle vicinanze si trovano anche ristoranti e bar, nonch&eacute; molte opzioni di alloggio. La spiaggia stessa &egrave; lunga 200 me larga 20 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua qui &egrave; molto bello e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare a circa 20 m. Se tutti questi fatti sono in sintonia con le tue preferenze sulla spiaggia, non esitare e visita questa spiaggia, non te ne pentirai. E ricorda, quando si tratta di spiagge, BeachRex ti aiuter&agrave; a trovare quella che fa per te. Goditi il tuo soggiorno al mare con BeachRex.', 3920, 'it', 1),
(1600, 'Willkommen im Strand Kerteminde. D&auml;nemark hat viele sch&ouml;ne Inseln, nat&uuml;rlich mit vielen attraktiven Str&auml;nden. Auf der d&auml;nischen Insel F&uuml;nen in der Stadt Kerteminde haben Sie einen Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien mit kleinen Kindern geeignet ist. Der Strand ist sehr flach, ebenso wie der Meeresboden, der ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder ist, um sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Die Strandlage ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen nur wenige Meter entfernt direkt am Strand parken. Sie haben hier wirklich viel Strandoberfl&auml;che, weil der Strand einen Kilometer lang und 100 Meter breit ist. Der Schwimmpunkt ist mit ungef&auml;hr 75 Metern weit entfernt. In Strandn&auml;he gibt es auch einen Hafen und viel Strandinfrastruktur mit vielen Stranddienstleistungen. Wenn Sie ein Fan des Strandsports sind und auch am Strand in Form bleiben m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie hier Beachvolleyball, Fu&szlig;ball und sogar Minigolf spielen. Hier stehen verschiedene Restaurants zur Verf&uuml;gung und f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft k&ouml;nnen Sie zwischen Apartments, Hotels oder einem Camp w&auml;hlen. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie an Str&auml;nde denken, denken Sie an BeachRex, und Sie werden immer den richtigen Strand f&uuml;r Sie finden. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3923, 'de', 1),
(1601, 'Benvenuti allo Strand Kerteminde. La Danimarca ha molte bellissime isole, ovviamente con molte spiagge attraenti. Sull&#39;isola danese di Funen, nella citt&agrave; di Kerteminde, c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa adatta a famiglie con bambini piccoli. La spiaggia &egrave; molto piatta e cos&igrave; anche il fondale, ideale per far giocare i bambini piccoli in acqua in sicurezza. La posizione della spiaggia &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con ogni tipo di mezzo e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare direttamente in spiaggia a pochi metri di distanza. Hai davvero molta superficie di spiaggia qui, perch&eacute; la lunghezza della spiaggia &egrave; di un chilometro ed &egrave; larga 100 metri. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; lontano, a circa 75 metri. Vicino alla spiaggia hai anche un porto e molte infrastrutture balneari con molti servizi di spiaggia. Se sei un appassionato di sport da spiaggia e vuoi mantenerti in forma anche quando sei in spiaggia, qui puoi giocare a beach volley, calcio e anche a minigolf. Qui sono disponibili diverse opzioni di ristoranti e per il tuo alloggio puoi scegliere tra appartamenti, hotel o un campeggio. E ricorda, quando pensi alle spiagge, pensa a BeachRex e troverai sempre la spiaggia giusta per te. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3923, 'it', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1602, 'Bienvenido a Strand Kerteminde. Dinamarca tiene muchas islas hermosas, por supuesto, con muchas playas atractivas. En la isla danesa de Fionia, en la ciudad de Kerteminde, tiene una playa de arena adecuada para familias con ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os. La playa es muy plana y tambi&eacute;n lo es el fondo marino, que es ideal para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen en el agua de forma segura. La ubicaci&oacute;n de la playa es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y se puede aparcar directamente en la playa a solo unos metros de distancia. Realmente hay mucha superficie de playa aqu&iacute;, porque la longitud de la playa es de un kil&oacute;metro y tiene 100 metros de ancho. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; lejos, a unos 75 metros. Cerca de la playa tambi&eacute;n tiene un puerto y mucha infraestructura de playa con muchos servicios de playa. Si eres un aficionado al deporte de playa y te gustar&iacute;a mantenerte en forma tambi&eacute;n estando en la playa, aqu&iacute; puedes jugar al v&oacute;ley playa, al f&uacute;tbol e incluso al minigolf. Aqu&iacute; hay diferentes opciones de restaurantes y para tu alojamiento puedes elegir entre apartamentos, hoteles o un campamento. Y recuerde, cuando piense en playas, piense en BeachRex, y siempre encontrar&aacute; la playa adecuada para usted. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3923, 'es', 1),
(1603, 'Bienvenue au Strand Kerteminde. Le Danemark a de nombreuses &icirc;les magnifiques, bien s&ucirc;r avec de nombreuses plages attrayantes. Sur l&#39;&icirc;le danoise de Fionie, dans la ville de Kerteminde, vous avez une plage de sable adapt&eacute;e aux familles avec de jeunes enfants. La plage est tr&egrave;s plate, tout comme le fond marin, id&eacute;al pour que les petits enfants puissent jouer dans l&#39;eau en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;. L&#39;emplacement de la plage est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer directement sur la plage &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres. Vous avez vraiment beaucoup de surface de plage ici, car la longueur de la plage est d&#39;un kilom&egrave;tre et elle fait 100 m&egrave;tres de large. Le point de baignade est &eacute;loign&eacute;, &agrave; environ 75 m&egrave;tres. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement un port et de nombreuses infrastructures de plage avec de nombreux services de plage. Si vous &ecirc;tes amateur de sports de plage et que vous souhaitez &eacute;galement rester en forme lorsque vous &ecirc;tes &agrave; la plage, vous pouvez jouer au beach-volley, au football et m&ecirc;me au minigolf. Diff&eacute;rentes options de restaurants sont disponibles ici et pour votre h&eacute;bergement, vous pouvez choisir entre des appartements, des h&ocirc;tels ou un camp. Et rappelez-vous, lorsque vous aimez les plages, pensez &agrave; BeachRex, et vous trouverez toujours la plage qui vous convient. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3923, 'fr', 1),
(1604, 'Wenn Sie Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, an denen die Hauptoberfl&auml;che aus kleinen Kieselsteinen besteht, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den d&auml;nischen Strand B&oslash;gebjerg zu besuchen. Es befindet sich auf der Insel F&uuml;nen, einer der vielen Inseln in diesem wundersch&ouml;nen skandinavischen Land, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Dalby in der Region Syddanmark. Mit Ihrem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, hierher zu kommen, ist sehr einfach. Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt. Der Parkplatz geh&ouml;rt dem Camp. Bitten Sie um Erlaubnis, dort parken zu d&uuml;rfen. Der Strand ist hier 2 km lang und bis zu 10 m breit. Es hat eine kleine Neigung, der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bereits bei 10 m. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur und -dienste ist im Camp verf&uuml;gbar, ansonsten gibt es am Strand selbst wenig. Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s sind hier nicht verf&uuml;gbar und das Camp ist hier die einzige verf&uuml;gbare Unterkunft. Wie es in D&auml;nemark &uuml;blich ist, hat auch dieser Strand einen kleinen Pier und am Ende nat&uuml;rlich auch eine Wasserleiter. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandurlaub mit BeachRex.', 3924, 'de', 1),
(1605, 'Si vous aimez les plages dont la surface principale est constitu&eacute;e de petits galets, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage danoise Strand B&oslash;gebjerg. Il est situ&eacute; sur l&#39;&icirc;le de Fionie, l&#39;une des nombreuses &icirc;les de ce magnifique pays scandinave, pr&egrave;s du village Dalby dans la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. Arriver ici avec votre v&eacute;hicule, &eacute;galement avec un camping-car, est tr&egrave;s simple. Vous disposez d&#39;un grand parking &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage. Le parking appartient au camp, alors demandez la permission de vous y garer. La plage fait ici 2 km de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 10 m&egrave;tres de large. Il a une petite inclinaison, l&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 10 m. La plupart des infrastructures et services de plage sont disponibles dans le camp, sinon il y en a peu sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me. Les restaurants et les caf&eacute;s ne sont pas disponibles ici et le camp est ici le seul h&eacute;bergement disponible. Comme d&#39;habitude au Danemark, cette plage a &eacute;galement une petite jet&eacute;e et au bout de celle-ci, bien s&ucirc;r aussi une &eacute;chelle d&#39;eau. Profitez de vos vacances &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex.', 3924, 'fr', 1),
(1606, 'Se ti piacciono le spiagge la cui superficie principale &egrave; costituita da piccoli ciottoli, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia danese Strand B&oslash;gebjerg. Si trova sull&#39;isola di Fionia, una delle tante isole di questo bellissimo paese scandinavo, vicino al villaggio di Dalby nella regione di Syddanmark. Arrivare qui con il tuo mezzo, anche con camper, &egrave; semplicissimo. Hai un ampio parcheggio a pochi metri dalla spiaggia. Il parcheggio &egrave; di propriet&agrave; del campeggio quindi chiedi il permesso di parcheggiare l&igrave;. La spiaggia &egrave; qui lunga 2 km e larga fino a 10 metri. Ha una piccola pendenza, l&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; gi&agrave; a 10 m. La maggior parte delle infrastrutture e dei servizi della spiaggia sono disponibili nel campeggio, altrimenti c&#39;&egrave; poco sulla spiaggia stessa. Ristoranti e bar non sono disponibili qui e il campo &egrave; qui l&#39;unico alloggio disponibile. Come &egrave; consuetudine in Danimarca, anche questa spiaggia ha un piccolo molo e in fondo ovviamente anche una scaletta d&#39;acqua. Goditi la tua vacanza al mare con BeachRex.', 3924, 'it', 1),
(1607, 'Si te gustan las playas donde la superficie principal son peque&ntilde;os guijarros, te recomendamos que visites la playa danesa Strand B&oslash;gebjerg. Se encuentra en la isla Funen, una de las muchas islas de este hermoso pa&iacute;s escandinavo, cerca del pueblo de Dalby en la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark. Llegar hasta aqu&iacute; con tu veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana, es muy f&aacute;cil. Dispones de una amplia plaza de aparcamiento a escasos metros de la playa. El lugar de estacionamiento es propiedad del campamento, as&iacute; que solicite permiso para estacionar all&iacute;. La playa tiene aqu&iacute; 2 km de largo y hasta 10 metros de ancho. Tiene una peque&ntilde;a inclinaci&oacute;n, la entrada de agua es agradable y el punto de nado ya est&aacute; a 10 m. La mayor parte de la infraestructura y los servicios de la playa est&aacute;n disponibles en el campamento; de lo contrario, hay poca en la playa. Los restaurantes y cafeter&iacute;as no est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute; y el campamento es aqu&iacute; el &uacute;nico alojamiento disponible. Como es habitual en Dinamarca, tambi&eacute;n esta playa tiene un peque&ntilde;o muelle y al final del mismo, por supuesto tambi&eacute;n una escalera de agua. Disfrute de sus vacaciones en la playa con BeachRex.', 3924, 'es', 1),
(1608, 'Willkommen am ganz besonderen Strand Nordskov. Im n&ouml;rdlichen Teil der d&auml;nischen Insel F&uuml;nen bestehen die Str&auml;nde nicht aus Sand, sondern &uuml;berwiegend aus kleinen Kieselsteinen. Dies gilt auch f&uuml;r den Strand, den wir in diesem Artikel behandeln. Es liegt in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Martofte in der Region Syddanmark. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Strand mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen. Der Parkplatz befindet sich direkt am Strand und Sie k&ouml;nnen hier auch Ihr Wohnmobil parken. Am Strand gibt es verschiedene Arten von Oberfl&auml;chen, aber die Haupttypen sind kleine Kieselsteine. Der Strand ist einige Kilometer lang und 10 Meter breit und hat viele verschiedene Formen, die sich &auml;ndern, wenn Sie in der N&auml;he des Wassers gehen. Wenn Sie zum Wasser gehen, haben Sie einige gro&szlig;e Steine ​​auf dem Weg, seien Sie also vorsichtig, wohin Sie treten. Nach 30 m k&ouml;nnen Sie bereits mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Hier haben Sie keine M&ouml;glichkeit, etwas zu essen oder zu trinken zu kaufen, aber Sie haben einige M&ouml;glichkeiten f&uuml;r Unterk&uuml;nfte wie Apartments und ein Camp in der N&auml;he. Verschwenden Sie nicht Ihre Zeit zu Hause, verwenden Sie BeachRex, um den richtigen Strand f&uuml;r Sie zu finden und besuchen Sie ihn so schnell wie m&ouml;glich. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3925, 'de', 1),
(1609, 'Bienvenido a la playa muy especial de Nordskov. En la parte norte de la isla danesa de Funen, las playas no son de arena, sino principalmente de peque&ntilde;os guijarros. Esto tambi&eacute;n se aplica a la playa, que cubrimos en este art&iacute;culo. Est&aacute; cerca del pueblo de Martofte en la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark. Puede llegar a esta playa con cualquier veh&iacute;culo. El estacionamiento est&aacute; justo en la playa y tambi&eacute;n puedes estacionar tu autocaravana aqu&iacute;. Existen diferentes tipos de superficies en la playa, pero los tipos principales son peque&ntilde;os guijarros. La playa tiene unos pocos kil&oacute;metros de largo y 10 metros de ancho y tiene muchas formas diferentes que cambian cuando caminas cerca del agua. Ir al agua tiene algunas rocas grandes en el camino, as&iacute; que tenga cuidado por donde pisa. Despu&eacute;s de 30 m puedes empezar a nadar. No hay lugar para comprar nada para comer o beber aqu&iacute;, pero tienes algunas opciones de alojamiento como apartamentos y campamentos cercanos. No pierda su tiempo en casa, use BeachRex para encontrar la playa adecuada para usted y vis&iacute;tela lo antes posible. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3925, 'es', 1),
(1610, 'Bienvenue sur la plage tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale de Nordskov. Dans la partie nord de l&#39;&icirc;le danoise de Fionie, les plages ne sont pas constitu&eacute;es de sable, mais principalement de petits galets. Cela s&#39;applique &eacute;galement &agrave; la plage, que nous couvrons dans cet article. Il est pr&egrave;s du village de Martofte dans la r&eacute;gion de Syddanmark. Vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cette plage avec n&#39;importe quel v&eacute;hicule. Le parking est juste sur la plage et vous pouvez &eacute;galement garer votre camping-car ici. Il existe diff&eacute;rents types de surfaces sur la plage, mais les principaux types sont de petits cailloux. La plage fait quelques kilom&egrave;tres de long et 10 m&egrave;tres de large et a de nombreuses formes diff&eacute;rentes qui changent lorsque vous marchez pr&egrave;s de l&#39;eau. Aller &agrave; l&#39;eau a de gros rochers le long du chemin, alors faites attention &agrave; l&#39;endroit o&ugrave; vous marchez. Apr&egrave;s 30 m, vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager. Il n&#39;y a pas d&#39;endroit pour acheter quelque chose &agrave; manger ou &agrave; boire ici, mais vous avez quelques options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement telles que des appartements et un camp &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Ne perdez pas votre temps &agrave; la maison, utilisez BeachRex pour trouver la plage qui vous convient et visitez-la d&egrave;s que possible. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3925, 'fr', 1),
(1611, 'Benvenuti nella spiaggia molto speciale di Nordskov. Nella parte settentrionale dell&#39;isola danese di Funen, le spiagge non sono costituite da sabbia, ma principalmente da piccoli ciottoli. Questo vale anche per la spiaggia, che trattiamo in questo articolo. Si trova vicino al villaggio di Martofte nella regione del Syddanmark. Puoi raggiungere questa spiaggia con qualsiasi veicolo. Il parcheggio &egrave; proprio sulla spiaggia e qui puoi parcheggiare anche il tuo camper. Ci sono diversi tipi di superfici sulla spiaggia, ma i tipi principali sono piccoli ciottoli. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga pochi chilometri e larga 10 metri e ha molte forme diverse che cambiano quando si cammina vicino all&#39;acqua. Andando in acqua ci sono alcune grandi rocce lungo la strada, quindi fai attenzione a dove metti. Dopo 30 m puoi iniziare a nuotare. Non c&#39;&egrave; posto dove comprare qualcosa da mangiare o da bere qui, ma hai alcune opzioni per l&#39;alloggio come appartamenti e campo nelle vicinanze. Non perdere tempo a casa, usa BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia giusta per te e visitala al pi&ugrave; presto. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3925, 'it', 1),
(1612, 'Der d&auml;nische Strand Hofmansgave ist ein Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien empfohlen wird. Seine Lage ist auf der Insel F&uuml;nen, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Otterup in der Region Syddanmark. Wenn Sie mit dem Auto oder mit dem Wohnmobil anreisen, ist dieser Strand sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand parken. Einige wichtige Strandinfrastrukturen befinden sich rund um den Parkplatz. Einige sind am Strand selbst. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und 30 m breit. An einigen Stellen haben Sie sogar Gras als Oberfl&auml;che. Dieser Strand besteht aus vielen kleinen Buchten. Der Wassereintritt ist gr&ouml;&szlig;tenteils bequem, au&szlig;er an einigen Stellen, an denen Sie Steine im Wasser haben. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 15 Metern. An diesem Ort gibt es keine Restaurants, einige sind vorhanden, aber etwas weiter entfernt. Die Unterkunft ist haupts&auml;chlich als Apartment verf&uuml;gbar und in der N&auml;he befindet sich auch ein Camp. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihre Strandzeit mit BeachRex.', 3926, 'de', 1),
(1613, 'La spiaggia danese Strand Hofmansgave &egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa consigliata alle famiglie. La sua posizione &egrave; sull&#39;isola di Fionia, vicino al villaggio di Otterup nella regione di Syddanmark. Se viaggi con un&#39;auto o con un camper, questa spiaggia &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere e puoi parcheggiare direttamente davanti alla spiaggia. Alcune infrastrutture essenziali della spiaggia si trovano intorno al parcheggio; alcuni sono sulla spiaggia stessa. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga 30 m. In alcuni punti hai persino l&#39;erba come superficie. Questa spiaggia &egrave; composta da tante piccole baie. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; per lo pi&ugrave; comodo, tranne che da alcuni punti in cui ci sono pietre nell&#39;acqua. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 15 metri. In questo posto non ci sono ristoranti, alcuni sono disponibili, ma sono un po &#39;pi&ugrave; lontani. Gli alloggi sono disponibili principalmente come appartamenti e nelle vicinanze c&#39;&egrave; anche un campo. Goditi il tuo tempo in spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3926, 'it', 1),
(1614, 'La plage danoise Strand Hofmansgave est une plage de sable fin recommand&eacute;e pour les familles. Son emplacement est sur l&#39;&icirc;le de Fionie, pr&egrave;s du village Otterup dans la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. Si vous voyagez en voiture ou en camping-car, cette plage est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s et vous pouvez vous garer directement en face de la plage. Certaines infrastructures de plage essentielles sont situ&eacute;es autour du parking; certains sont sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me. La plage fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et 30 m de large. &Agrave; certains endroits, vous avez m&ecirc;me de l&#39;herbe comme surface. Cette plage se compose de nombreuses petites baies. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est g&eacute;n&eacute;ralement confortable, sauf &agrave; partir de certains endroits o&ugrave; vous avez des pierres dans l&#39;eau. Le point de baignade est &agrave; 15 m&egrave;tres. Sur cet endroit, vous n&#39;avez pas de restaurants, certains sont disponibles, mais sont un peu plus loin. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements, et &agrave; proximit&eacute; se trouve &eacute;galement un camp. Profitez de votre temps &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex.', 3926, 'fr', 1),
(1615, 'La playa danesa Strand Hofmansgave es una playa de arena recomendada para familias. Su ubicaci&oacute;n es en la isla Funen, cerca del pueblo Otterup en la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark. Si viajas con coche o autocaravana, esta playa es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso y puedes aparcar directamente en frente de la playa. Alguna infraestructura de playa esencial se encuentra alrededor del estacionamiento; algunos est&aacute;n en la misma playa. La playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y 30 m de ancho. En algunos lugares incluso tienes c&eacute;sped como superficie. Esta playa consta de muchas bah&iacute;as peque&ntilde;as. La entrada de agua es en su mayor&iacute;a c&oacute;moda, excepto en algunos lugares donde hay piedras en el agua. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a 15 metros. En este lugar no tienes restaurantes, algunos est&aacute;n disponibles, pero est&aacute;n un poco m&aacute;s lejos. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible principalmente como apartamentos, y cerca tambi&eacute;n hay un campamento. Disfrute de su tiempo en la playa con BeachRex.', 3926, 'es', 1),
(1616, 'In der N&auml;he der deutschen Stadt Rostock haben Sie zwei M&ouml;glichkeiten, um zum Ostseestrand zu gelangen. Die K&uuml;ste wird durch den Fluss Unterwarnow geteilt. Dieser Strand, der sich im Nordwesten der Stadt befindet, tr&auml;gt den Namen Strand Warnem&uuml;nde. Es ist ein Teil der deutschen Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern und ein Muss, wenn Sie in der N&auml;he dieses Ortes sind. Der Zugang zum Strand mit einem Fahrzeug ist sehr einfach und Sie k&ouml;nnen nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Parkplatz ist sehr gro&szlig; und bietet Platz f&uuml;r mehrere hundert Fahrzeuge. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer Sand und 40 m Strandbreite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Neigung zum Strand ist normal, was den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n macht und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 10 Metern. Der Strand ist in viele Lifestyle-Bereiche unterteilt, einer ist auch f&uuml;r Nudisten und einer f&uuml;r Hundebesitzer reserviert. Je nachdem, in welchen Sektoren Sie Ihre Strandzeit genie&szlig;en, stehen ihnen in einigen mehr Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, in den anderen weniger. Die Unterkunft ist in vielen Formen verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich als Apartments und Hotels, und ist nicht weit entfernt.', 3828, 'de', 1),
(1617, 'Pr&egrave;s de la ville allemande de Rostock, vous avez deux options pour vous rendre &agrave; la plage de la Baltique. Le rivage est divis&eacute; par la rivi&egrave;re Unterwarnow. Cette plage, situ&eacute;e au nord-ouest de la ville, porte le nom de Strand Warnem&uuml;nde. Il fait partie de la r&eacute;gion allemande de Mecklenburg-Vorpommern et est un must si vous &ecirc;tes &agrave; proximit&eacute; de cet endroit. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage avec un v&eacute;hicule est tr&egrave;s facile et vous pouvez vous garer &agrave; seulement 100m de la plage. La place de parking est tr&egrave;s grande et peut contenir plusieurs centaines de v&eacute;hicules. Une fois sur la plage, plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de sable et 40 m de largeur de plage sont &agrave; votre disposition. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est normale, ce qui rend l&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 10 m&egrave;tres. La plage est divis&eacute;e en plusieurs secteurs de style de vie, l&#39;un est &eacute;galement r&eacute;serv&eacute; aux nudistes et l&#39;autre aux propri&eacute;taires de chiens. Selon les secteurs dans lesquels vous appr&eacute;ciez votre temps &agrave; la plage, vous avez sur certains plus de services de plage disponibles sur certains que vous en avez moins. Les h&eacute;bergements sont disponibles sous de nombreuses formes, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements et d&#39;h&ocirc;tels et ne sont pas loin.', 3828, 'fr', 1),
(1618, 'Cerca de la ciudad alemana de Rostock, tienes dos opciones para ir a la playa del B&aacute;ltico. La costa est&aacute; dividida por el r&iacute;o Unterwarnow. Esta playa, que se encuentra al noroeste de la ciudad, recibe el nombre de Strand Warnem&uuml;nde. Es parte de la regi&oacute;n alemana de Mecklenburg-Vorpommern y es imprescindible si se encuentra cerca de esta ubicaci&oacute;n. El acceso a la playa con veh&iacute;culo es muy f&aacute;cil y se puede aparcar a tan solo 100 metros de la playa. El lugar de estacionamiento es muy grande y tiene capacidad para varios cientos de veh&iacute;culos. Una vez en la playa tienes varios kil&oacute;metros de arena y 40 m de ancho de playa a tu servicio. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es normal, lo que hace que la entrada al agua sea muy agradable y el punto de nado sea a unos 10 metros. La playa est&aacute; dividida en muchos sectores de estilo de vida, uno tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; reservado para nudistas y otro para los due&ntilde;os de perros. Seg&uacute;n los sectores en los que est&eacute;s disfrutando tu tiempo en la playa, en algunos tienes m&aacute;s servicios de playa disponibles en algunos tienes menos. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en muchas formas, principalmente como apartamentos y hoteles y no est&aacute;n lejos.', 3828, 'es', 1),
(1619, 'Vicino alla citt&agrave; tedesca di Rostock, hai due opzioni per andare alla spiaggia del Baltico. Il litorale &egrave; diviso dal fiume Unterwarnow. Questa spiaggia, che si trova a nord-ovest della citt&agrave;, si chiama Strand Warnem&uuml;nde. Fa parte della regione tedesca del Meclemburgo-Pomerania Anteriore ed &egrave; un must se ti trovi vicino a questa localit&agrave;. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia con un veicolo &egrave; molto agevole e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare a soli 100 mt dalla spiaggia. Il parcheggio &egrave; molto ampio e pu&ograve; contenere diverse centinaia di veicoli. Una volta in spiaggia, hai a disposizione diversi chilometri di sabbia e 40 m di larghezza. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; normale, il che rende l&#39;ingresso in acqua molto piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 10 metri. La spiaggia &egrave; suddivisa in tanti settori lifestyle, uno riservato anche ai nudisti e uno ai proprietari di cani. A seconda dei settori in cui ti stai godendo il tempo in spiaggia, su alcuni hai pi&ugrave; servizi spiaggia disponibili su alcuni ne hai meno. Gli alloggi sono disponibili in molte forme, prevalentemente come appartamenti e hotel e non sono lontani.', 3828, 'it', 1),
(1620, 'Der Strand Heiligendamm ist ber&uuml;hmt f&uuml;r seinen sehr langen Sandstrand, der wie die meisten deutschen Str&auml;nde in viele Lifestyle-Bereiche unterteilt ist, wie einen FKK-Strand, einen regul&auml;ren Strand und einen Hundestrand. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Strand mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, und einfach etwa 50 Meter vom Strand entfernt parken. Entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts haben Sie viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, Ihr Fahrzeug zu parken. Um vom Parkplatz zum Strand zu gelangen, k&ouml;nnen Sie einen von vielen Einstiegspunkten ausw&auml;hlen. Beachten Sie jedoch, dass Sie bei den meisten von ihnen einige Treppen nehmen m&uuml;ssen, um die D&uuml;ne zu &uuml;berqueren. Bevor Sie den Strand betreten, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine Steuer von 2 Euro bezahlen. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, stehen Ihnen 25 Meter weite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Neigung am Strand ist normal, ebenso wie der Wassereintritt, der sch&ouml;n und komfortabel ist. Der Schwimmpunkt beginnt bei 15 Metern. Stranddienstleistungen sind entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitt verf&uuml;gbar. Sie haben auch viele M&ouml;glichkeiten l&auml;nger hier zu bleiben, haupts&auml;chlich in einigen Hotels oder Apartments in der N&auml;he. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3829, 'de', 1),
(1621, 'La spiaggia Strand Heiligendamm &egrave; famosa per la sua lunghissima spiaggia sabbiosa, che &egrave;, come la maggior parte delle spiagge tedesche, divisa in molti settori di stile di vita, come una spiaggia per nudisti, una spiaggia normale e una spiaggia per cani. &Egrave; possibile raggiungere questa spiaggia con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con camper, e parcheggiare a circa 50 metri dalla spiaggia. Lungo tutto il tratto di spiaggia ci sono molte possibilit&agrave; per parcheggiare il proprio veicolo. Per accedere alla spiaggia dal parcheggio puoi scegliere uno dei tanti punti di ingresso, ma tieni presente che sulla maggior parte di essi &egrave; necessario prendere delle scale per attraversare la duna. Prima di entrare in spiaggia &egrave; necessario pagare una tassa di 2 euro. Una volta in spiaggia hai a disposizione 25 metri di ampiezza. L&#39;inclinazione sulla spiaggia &egrave; normale, cos&igrave; come l&#39;ingresso in acqua, piacevole e confortevole. Il punto di nuotata inizia a 15 metri. Sono disponibili servizi spiaggia lungo tutto il tratto di spiaggia. Hai anche molte opzioni per rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo, principalmente in alcuni hotel o appartamenti, che si trovano nelle vicinanze. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3829, 'it', 1),
(1622, 'La playa Strand Heiligendamm es famosa por su playa de arena muy larga, que, como la mayor&iacute;a de las playas alemanas, est&aacute; dividida en muchos sectores de estilo de vida, como una playa nudista, una playa normal y una playa para perros. Se puede llegar a esta playa con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana, y simplemente aparcar a unos 50 metros de la playa. A lo largo de todo el tramo de la playa tienes muchas opciones para aparcar tu veh&iacute;culo. Para acceder a la playa desde el estacionamiento, puede elegir uno de los muchos puntos de entrada, pero tenga en cuenta que en la mayor&iacute;a de ellos debe subir unas escaleras para cruzar la duna. Antes de entrar en la playa hay que pagar una tasa de 2 euros. Una vez en la playa tienes 25 metros de ancho disponibles. La inclinaci&oacute;n en la playa es normal y tambi&eacute;n lo es la entrada de agua, que es agradable y c&oacute;moda. El punto de nataci&oacute;n comienza a los 15 metros. Los servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles junto con todo el tramo de la playa. Tambi&eacute;n tienes muchas opciones para quedarte aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo, principalmente en algunos hoteles o apartamentos, que est&aacute;n cerca. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3829, 'es', 1),
(1623, 'La plage Strand Heiligendamm est c&eacute;l&egrave;bre pour sa tr&egrave;s longue plage de sable qui, comme la plupart des plages allemandes, est divis&eacute;e en de nombreux secteurs de style de vie, comme une plage nudiste, une plage r&eacute;guli&egrave;re et une plage pour chiens. Vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cette plage avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, &eacute;galement avec un camping-car, et simplement vous garer &agrave; 50 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Tout au long de la plage, vous avez de nombreuses options pour garer votre v&eacute;hicule. Pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage depuis le parking, vous pouvez choisir l&#39;un des nombreux points d&#39;entr&eacute;e, mais sachez que sur la plupart d&#39;entre eux, vous devez emprunter des escaliers pour traverser la dune. Avant d&#39;entrer sur la plage, vous devez payer une taxe de 2 euros. Une fois sur la plage, vous disposez de 25 m&egrave;tres de largeur. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est normale, tout comme l&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau, qui est agr&eacute;able et confortable. Le point de nage commence &agrave; 15 m&egrave;tres. Les services de plage sont disponibles avec tout le tron&ccedil;on de plage. Vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreuses options pour rester ici plus longtemps, principalement dans certains h&ocirc;tels ou appartements situ&eacute;s &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3829, 'fr', 1),
(1624, 'Nicht weit von der Stadt Wismar entfernt haben Sie die M&ouml;glichkeit, einen sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Zierow. Obwohl der Strand aus Sand besteht, hat er hier eine besondere braune Farbe und Form und einen sehr flachen Meeresboden, was ihn ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder macht. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und der Zugang zum Strand ist noch einfacher, wenn Sie ein Gast im Camp sind. In der N&auml;he des Strandes haben Sie auch einen &ouml;ffentlichen kostenpflichtigen Parkplatz. Der Strand ist einen Kilometer lang und 10 Meter breit. Da der Meeresboden sehr flach ist, liegt der Schwimmpunkt bei einigen hundert Metern. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich im Camp, wo sich auch ein Restaurant und eine Kaffeebar befinden. In Strandn&auml;he gibt es sogar einen Minigolfplatz und am Strand selbst haben Kinder die M&ouml;glichkeit, auf einem Strandspielplatz zu spielen. F&uuml;r diejenigen, die gerne Sport am Strand treiben, gibt es die M&ouml;glichkeit, Beachvolleyball zu spielen. Das Auto camp bietet die meisten Unterk&uuml;nfte, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen auch einige Apartments, H&auml;user und Zimmer in der N&auml;he finden. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie an einen Strand denken, denken Sie an BeachRex und Sie werden immer den richtigen Strand f&uuml;r Sie finden.', 3835, 'de', 1),
(1625, 'Non loin de la ville de Wismar, vous avez la possibilit&eacute; de visiter une belle plage de sable. Il est situ&eacute; &agrave; proximit&eacute; du village Zierow. Bien que la plage soit faite de sable, elle a ici une couleur et une forme marron sp&eacute;ciales, et elle a &eacute;galement un fond marin tr&egrave;s plat, ce qui la rend id&eacute;ale pour les petits enfants. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et il est encore plus facile d&#39;acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage si vous &ecirc;tes un invit&eacute; dans le camp. A proximit&eacute; de la plage, vous disposez &eacute;galement d&#39;un parking public payant. La plage mesure un kilom&egrave;tre de long et 10 m&egrave;tres de large. Le fond marin &eacute;tant tr&egrave;s plat, le point de nage est &agrave; quelques centaines de m&egrave;tres. La plupart des infrastructures de la plage sont situ&eacute;es &agrave; l&#39;int&eacute;rieur du camp, o&ugrave; vous trouverez &eacute;galement un restaurant et un caf&eacute;. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, il y a m&ecirc;me un mini-golf et sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, les enfants auront la possibilit&eacute; de jouer sur une aire de jeux sur la plage. Pour ceux qui aiment faire du sport sur la plage, il y a une option pour jouer au beach-volley. L&#39;autocamp offre le plus de lieux d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, mais vous pouvez &eacute;galement trouver des appartements, des maisons et des chambres &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, lorsque vous pensez &agrave; une plage, pensez &agrave; BeachRex et vous trouverez toujours la plage qui vous convient.', 3835, 'fr', 1),
(1626, 'No muy lejos de la ciudad de Wismar, tiene la opci&oacute;n de visitar una bonita playa de arena. Se encuentra en las cercan&iacute;as del pueblo Zierow. Aunque la playa est&aacute; hecha de arena, aqu&iacute; tiene un color y una forma especial de color marr&oacute;n, y tambi&eacute;n tiene un fondo marino muy plano, lo que la hace ideal para los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y es a&uacute;n m&aacute;s f&aacute;cil acceder a la playa si eres un invitado en el campamento. En las inmediaciones de la playa tambi&eacute;n dispone de una plaza de aparcamiento p&uacute;blico de pago. La playa tiene un kil&oacute;metro de largo y 10 metros de ancho. Debido a que el fondo del mar es muy plano, el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a unos cientos de metros. La mayor parte de la infraestructura de la playa se encuentra dentro del campamento, donde tambi&eacute;n encontrar&aacute; un restaurante y una cafeter&iacute;a. Cerca de la playa hay incluso un campo de minigolf y en la misma playa los ni&ntilde;os tendr&aacute;n la opci&oacute;n de jugar en un parque infantil. Para los que les gusta disfrutar de un rato de deporte en la playa, existe la opci&oacute;n de jugar al voleibol de playa. El autocamp ofrece la mayor&iacute;a de los lugares de alojamiento, pero tambi&eacute;n puedes encontrar algunos apartamentos, casas y habitaciones cerca. Y recuerda, cuando pienses en una playa, piensa en BeachRex y siempre encontrar&aacute;s la playa adecuada para ti.', 3835, 'es', 1),
(1627, 'Non lontano dalla citt&agrave; di Wismar hai la possibilit&agrave; di visitare una bella spiaggia sabbiosa. Si trova nelle vicinanze del villaggio Zierow. Anche se la spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia, qui ha un colore e una forma marroni particolari, e ha anche un fondale molto piatto, che la rende ideale per i bambini piccoli. Questa localit&agrave; &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo ed &egrave; ancora pi&ugrave; facile accedere alla spiaggia se sei ospite del campeggio. Nelle vicinanze della spiaggia si dispone anche di un parcheggio pubblico a pagamento. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga un chilometro e larga 10 metri. Poich&eacute; il fondale &egrave; molto piatto, il punto di balneazione &egrave; a poche centinaia di metri. La maggior parte dell&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia si trova all&#39;interno del campeggio, dove troverai anche un ristorante e un bar. Vicino alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; anche un campo da minigolf e sulla spiaggia stessa i bambini avranno la possibilit&agrave; di giocare in un parco giochi sulla spiaggia. Per coloro che amano godersi un po &#39;di sport in spiaggia, c&#39;&egrave; un&#39;opzione per giocare a beach volley. L&#39;autocamp offre la maggior parte delle strutture ricettive, ma nelle vicinanze si possono trovare anche appartamenti, case e camere. E ricorda, quando pensi ad una spiaggia pensa a BeachRex e troverai sempre la spiaggia giusta per te.', 3835, 'it', 1),
(1628, 'Wenn Sie nach einem Strand mit einem sehr flachen Meeresboden suchen, der ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder ist, um sicher im Wasser zu spielen, und Ihr Auto nur 10 Meter vom Strand entfernt stehen lassen m&ouml;chten, empfehlen wir Ihnen, Strand Kl&uuml;tz zu besuchen. Es ist Teil der deutschen Ostsee und liegt in der deutschen Provinz Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. Neben dem Strand befindet sich ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz, nur 10 Meter entfernt, was ihn nach deutschen Ma&szlig;st&auml;ben sehr au&szlig;ergew&ouml;hnlich macht. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist 10 Meter breit. Der sehr weit entfernte Schwimmpunkt macht es ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder, aber nicht so sehr f&uuml;r diejenigen, die sofort schwimmen m&ouml;chten. Stranddienste sind an einigen Stellen nur grundlegend, an einigen steht Ihnen mehr zur Verf&uuml;gung. Sie m&uuml;ssen auch eine Strandeintrittssteuer zahlen, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Einige Fast-Food-Restaurants befinden sich direkt am Strand. Ein Campingplatz befindet sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he, ebenfalls ganz in der N&auml;he des Strandes. Alle anderen Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten befinden sich etwas weiter im Hintergrund, einige 100 Meter entfernt im Dorf Wohlenberg. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3836, 'de', 1),
(1629, 'Si vous recherchez une plage avec un fond marin tr&egrave;s plat, id&eacute;ale pour que les petits enfants jouent dans l&#39;eau en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;, et que vous souhaitez &eacute;galement laisser votre voiture &agrave; seulement 10 m&egrave;tres de la plage, nous vous recommandons de visiter Strand Kl&uuml;tz . Il fait partie de la mer Baltique allemande et est situ&eacute; dans la province allemande de Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. A c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, vous avez un tr&egrave;s grand parking, &agrave; seulement 10 m&egrave;tres, ce qui le rend tr&egrave;s exceptionnel, selon les normes allemandes. La longueur totale de la plage est de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et sa largeur est de 10 m&egrave;tres. Le point de baignade tr&egrave;s &eacute;loign&eacute; le rend id&eacute;al pour les petits enfants, mais pas autant pour ceux qui aimeraient nager imm&eacute;diatement. Les services de plage sont sur certaines parties uniquement basiques, sur certains, vous en avez plus &agrave; votre disposition. Vous devez &eacute;galement payer une taxe d&#39;entr&eacute;e &agrave; la plage pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage. Certains restaurants de restauration rapide sont disponibles directement sur la plage. Un emplacement de camping est &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;, &eacute;galement tr&egrave;s proche de la plage, toutes les autres options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement sont un peu plus en arri&egrave;re-plan, &agrave; quelques 100 m&egrave;tres dans le village de Wohlenberg. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3836, 'fr', 1),
(1630, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Si est&aacute;s buscando una playa con un fondo marino muy plano, ideal para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen en el agua de forma segura, y adem&aacute;s te gustar&iacute;a dejar tu coche a tan solo 10 metros de la playa, te recomendamos que visites Strand Kl&uuml;tz. . Es parte del Mar B&aacute;ltico alem&aacute;n y se encuentra en la provincia alemana de Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. Junto a la playa tienes una plaza de aparcamiento muy amplia, a tan solo 10 metros, lo que la hace muy excepcional, seg&uacute;n los est&aacute;ndares alemanes. La longitud total de la playa es de varios kil&oacute;metros y tiene 10 metros de ancho. El punto de nataci&oacute;n muy lejano lo hace ideal para ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os, pero no tanto para aquellos a los que les gustar&iacute;a nadar de inmediato. Los servicios de playa son en algunas partes solo b&aacute;sicos, en otras tienes m&aacute;s a tu disposici&oacute;n. Tambi&eacute;n debe pagar una tasa de entrada a la playa para acceder a la playa. Algunos restaurantes de comida r&aacute;pida est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa. Un lugar para acampar tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; cerca, tambi&eacute;n muy cerca de la playa, todas las dem&aacute;s opciones de alojamiento est&aacute;n un poco m&aacute;s al fondo, a unos 100 metros en el pueblo de Wohlenberg. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.</div>\n', 3836, 'es', 1),
(1631, 'Se stai cercando una spiaggia con un fondale molto piatto, ideale per far giocare i bambini piccoli in acqua in sicurezza, e desideri anche lasciare la tua auto a soli 10 metri dalla spiaggia, ti consigliamo di visitare Strand Kl&uuml;tz . Fa parte del Mar Baltico tedesco e si trova nella provincia tedesca del Meclemburgo-Pomerania Anteriore. Accanto alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un parcheggio molto ampio, a soli 10 metri di distanza, il che lo rende davvero eccezionale, secondo gli standard tedeschi. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di diversi chilometri ed &egrave; larga 10 metri. Il punto di balneazione molto lontano lo rende ideale per i bambini piccoli, ma non tanto per chi vorrebbe nuotare subito. I servizi in spiaggia sono in alcune parti solo di base, in alcuni ne hai di pi&ugrave; a tua disposizione. &Egrave; inoltre necessario pagare una tassa di ingresso alla spiaggia per accedere alla spiaggia. Alcuni fast food sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. Nelle vicinanze c&#39;&egrave; anche un campeggio, anche molto vicino alla spiaggia, tutte le altre possibilit&agrave; di alloggio sono un po &#39;pi&ugrave; in secondo piano, a poche centinaia di metri nel villaggio di Wohlenberg. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3836, 'it', 1),
(1632, 'Boltenhagen ist der Name des Dorfes, in dem sich dieser Sandstrand befindet. Es geh&ouml;rt zur Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Sie haben viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, Ihr Fahrzeug hier zu parken, entweder auf der Stra&szlig;e oder auf einigen gro&szlig;en Parkpl&auml;tzen. Zum Strand gelangen Sie zu Fu&szlig; nach rund 200 Meter. Der Strand ist einige Kilometer lang und rund 50 Meter breit. Die Neigung am Strand ist normal, der Zugang zum Wasser ist bequem und aufgrund des flachen Meeresbodens liegt der Schwimmpunkt bei etwa 75 Metern. Wie viele deutsche Str&auml;nde ist auch dieser in viele Sektoren unterteilt, einen regul&auml;ren, einen f&uuml;r die Hundebesitzer und einen f&uuml;r den Nudisten. Sie haben viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, hier etwas zu essen oder zu trinken zu bekommen. Die Infrastruktur am Strand ist auf einem hohen Standard und wie es an deutschen Str&auml;nden &uuml;blich ist, k&ouml;nnen Sie an diesem Strand auch einen typisch deutschen Strandkorb mieten, der in vielen verschiedenen Ausf&uuml;hrungen erh&auml;ltlich ist. Die Unterbringung ist auch in vielen Formen m&ouml;glich, haupts&auml;chlich als Apartments, die f&uuml;r Ihren Aufenthalt nur 50 Meter vom Strand entfernt zur Verf&uuml;gung stehen. Sie k&ouml;nnen aber auch in einem etwas weiter entfernten Camp &uuml;bernachten. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3837, 'de', 1),
(1633, 'Boltenhagen &egrave; il nome del villaggio dove si trova questa spiaggia di sabbia. Appartiene alla regione Meclemburgo-Pomerania Anteriore ed &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Hai molte opzioni per parcheggiare il tuo veicolo qui, sulla strada o in alcuni grandi parcheggi. Ci vogliono circa 200 metri di cammino per raggiungere la spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga pochi chilometri e larga circa 50 metri. L&#39;inclinazione in spiaggia &egrave; normale, l&#39;accesso in acqua &egrave; comodo e per via del fondale piatto il punto di balneazione &egrave; intorno ai 75 metri. Come molte spiagge tedesche anche questa &egrave; divisa in tanti settori, uno regolare, uno per i proprietari di cani e uno per i nudisti. Hai molte opzioni per ottenere qualcosa da mangiare o da bere qui. L&#39;infrastruttura sulla spiaggia &egrave; di alto livello e, come &egrave; normale sulle spiagge tedesche, anche su questa spiaggia &egrave; possibile noleggiare una tipica sedia a sdraio tedesca, disponibile in molti tipi diversi. Anche l&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile in molte forme, principalmente come appartamenti, che sono disponibili per il tuo soggiorno a soli 50 metri dalla spiaggia, ma puoi anche stare in un campeggio, che &egrave; un po &#39;pi&ugrave; lontano. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3837, 'it', 1),
(1634, 'Boltenhagen est le nom du village o&ugrave; se trouve cette plage de sable. Il appartient &agrave; la r&eacute;gion Mecklenburg-Vorpommern et il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. Vous avez de nombreuses options pour garer votre v&eacute;hicule ici, que ce soit sur la route ou sur certaines grandes places de parking. Il vous faut environ 200 m&egrave;tres de marche pour atteindre la plage. La plage fait quelques kilom&egrave;tres de long et environ 50 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est normale, l&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; l&#39;eau est confortable et en raison du fond plat, le point de baignade se situe &agrave; environ 75 m&egrave;tres. Comme beaucoup de plages allemandes, celle-ci est divis&eacute;e en plusieurs secteurs, un r&eacute;gulier, un pour les propri&eacute;taires de chiens et un pour les nudistes. Vous avez de nombreuses options pour trouver quelque chose &agrave; manger ou &agrave; boire ici. L&#39;infrastructure sur la plage est de haut niveau et, comme d&#39;habitude sur les plages allemandes, vous pouvez &eacute;galement louer sur cette plage une chaise de plage allemande typique, disponible dans de nombreux types diff&eacute;rents. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement disponible sous de nombreuses formes, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements, qui sont disponibles pour votre s&eacute;jour &agrave; seulement 50 m&egrave;tres de la plage, mais vous pouvez &eacute;galement rester dans un camp, qui est un peu plus loin. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3837, 'fr', 1),
(1635, 'Boltenhagen es el nombre del pueblo donde se encuentra esta playa de arena. Pertenece a la regi&oacute;n Mecklenburg-Vorpommern y es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. Tiene muchas opciones para estacionar su veh&iacute;culo aqu&iacute;, ya sea en la carretera o en algunos lugares de estacionamiento grandes. Se tarda unos 200 metros de caminata para llegar a la playa. La playa tiene unos pocos kil&oacute;metros de largo y unos 50 metros de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n en la playa es normal, el acceso al agua es c&oacute;modo y debido al fondo plano del mar el punto de ba&ntilde;o es de unos 75 metros. Como muchas playas alemanas, tambi&eacute;n esta se divide en muchos sectores, uno regular, otro para los due&ntilde;os de perros y otro para los nudistas. Tienes muchas opciones para comer o beber aqu&iacute;. La infraestructura en la playa es de alto nivel y, como es habitual en las playas alemanas, tambi&eacute;n puede alquilar en esta playa una silla de playa t&iacute;pica alemana, que est&aacute;n disponibles en muchos tipos diferentes. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible en muchas formas, principalmente como apartamentos, que est&aacute;n disponibles para su estad&iacute;a a solo 50 metros de la playa, pero tambi&eacute;n puede quedarse en un campamento, que est&aacute; un poco m&aacute;s lejos. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3837, 'es', 1),
(1636, 'Der Strand Kalkhorst ist f&uuml;r diejenigen zu empfehlen, die es lieben, mehr in der Natur zu sein, ohne viele Nachbarn und eine ruhigere Umgebung. Es befindet sich in der deutschen Region Mecklenburg-Vorpommern und ist der letzte Strand aus dieser Region, bevor Sie nach Schleswig-Holstein kommen. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Etwa 200 Meter vom Strand entfernt erwartet Sie ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz mit mehr als 100 Fahrzeugen. Der Weg zum Strand ist sehr einfach und gut organisiert. Bevor Sie den Strand betreten, stehen Ihnen ein kleiner Fast-Food-Kiosk sowie eine Toilette zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes ist Sand, der sich &uuml;ber einige Kilometer erstreckt und der Strand selbst ist bis zu 25 Meter breit. Der Schwimmpunkt an diesem Strand liegt bei rund 40 Metern. Stranddienstleistungen sind nur einfach und Unterk&uuml;nfte in Form von Apartments befinden sich eher im Hintergrund, etwa 500 Meter entfernt. Und denken Sie daran, BeachRex ist Ihr bester Strandfreund, der immer Ihren Traumstrand findet.', 3838, 'de', 1),
(1637, 'La playa Strand Kalkhorst se recomienda para los que aman estar m&aacute;s en la naturaleza, sin muchos vecinos y un entorno m&aacute;s tranquilo. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n alemana de Mecklenburg-Vorpommern y es la &uacute;ltima playa de esta regi&oacute;n antes de entrar en Schleswig-Holstein. Es muy f&aacute;cil de alcanzar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. Un aparcamiento muy amplio, con capacidad para m&aacute;s de 100 veh&iacute;culos, le espera a unos 200 metros de la playa. El camino a la playa es muy f&aacute;cil y est&aacute; bien organizado. Antes de entrar a la playa tienes a tu servicio un peque&ntilde;o quiosco de comida r&aacute;pida, as&iacute; como un aseo. La superficie principal de la playa es de arena, que se extiende a lo largo de unos pocos kil&oacute;metros y la playa en s&iacute; tiene hasta 25 metros de ancho. El punto de ba&ntilde;o en esta playa est&aacute; a unos 40 metros. Los servicios de playa son b&aacute;sicos y el alojamiento en forma de apartamentos est&aacute; m&aacute;s al fondo, a unos 500 metros de distancia. Y recuerda, BeachRex es tu mejor amigo de la playa, que siempre encontrar&aacute; la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3838, 'es', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1638, 'La plage Strand Kalkhorst est recommand&eacute;e pour ceux qui aiment &ecirc;tre plus dans la nature, sans beaucoup de voisins et un environnement plus calme. Elle est situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion allemande de Mecklenburg-Vorpommern et est la derni&egrave;re plage de cette r&eacute;gion avant d&#39;entrer dans le Schleswig-Holstein. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. Un tr&egrave;s grand parking, pouvant accueillir plus de 100 v&eacute;hicules, vous attend &agrave; environ 200 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Le chemin vers la plage est tr&egrave;s facile et bien organis&eacute;. Avant d&#39;entrer sur la plage, vous avez un petit kiosque de restauration rapide &agrave; votre service, ainsi que des toilettes. La surface principale de la plage est du sable, qui s&#39;&eacute;tend sur quelques kilom&egrave;tres et la plage elle-m&ecirc;me mesure jusqu&#39;&agrave; 25 m&egrave;tres de large. Le point de baignade sur cette plage est &agrave; environ 40 m&egrave;tres. Les services de plage ne sont que basiques et l&#39;h&eacute;bergement sous forme d&#39;appartements est plus &agrave; l&#39;arri&egrave;re-plan, &agrave; environ 500 m&egrave;tres. Et rappelez-vous, BeachRex est votre meilleur ami de plage, qui trouvera toujours la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3838, 'fr', 1),
(1639, 'La spiaggia Strand Kalkhorst &egrave; consigliata a chi ama stare pi&ugrave; a contatto con la natura, senza molti vicini e un ambiente pi&ugrave; tranquillo. Si trova nella regione tedesca del Meclemburgo-Pomerania Anteriore ed &egrave; l&#39;ultima spiaggia di questa regione prima di entrare nello Schleswig-Holstein. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Un parcheggio molto ampio, che pu&ograve; contenere pi&ugrave; di 100 veicoli, vi aspetta a circa 200 metri dalla spiaggia. Il percorso per la spiaggia &egrave; molto facile e ben organizzato. Prima di entrare in spiaggia hai a disposizione un piccolo chiosco fast food e una toilette. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia, che si estende per pochi chilometri e la spiaggia stessa &egrave; larga fino a 25 metri. Il punto di balneazione su questa spiaggia &egrave; a circa 40 metri. I servizi in spiaggia sono solo di base e gli alloggi sotto forma di appartamenti sono pi&ugrave; in secondo piano, a circa 500 metri di distanza. E ricorda, BeachRex &egrave; il tuo migliore amico di spiaggia, che trover&agrave; sempre la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3838, 'it', 1),
(1640, 'Der erste Strand beim Betreten der deutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein aus Richtung Mecklenburg-Vorpommern ist der Strand Priwall. Die weltber&uuml;hmte und historische Stadt L&uuml;beck, bekannt f&uuml;r ihre Marzipan-S&uuml;&szlig;igkeiten, liegt nur wenige Kilometer entfernt. Der Stadtbesuch ist ein Muss, wenn Sie in dieser Region sind. Sie werden nicht nur vom kulinarischen Angebot begeistert sein, sondern auch von den historischen Geb&auml;uden mit ihrer aufregenden Architektur aus dem Mittelalter. Der Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Der n&auml;chste Parkplatz ist ca. 300 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Strand selbst ist einige Kilometer lang, besteht aus Sand und ist 100 m breit. Sie haben viel Fl&auml;che, um hier Ihren Platz zu finden. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und wegen des flachen Wassers ist der Schwimmpunkt weit drau&szlig;en. Das flache Wasser macht es auch zu einem idealen Ort f&uuml;r kleine Kinder, um sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Hier stehen Ihnen einige Stranddienste zur Verf&uuml;gung, auch Duschen. Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s befinden sich ebenfalls in Strandn&auml;he. Gleiches gilt f&uuml;r Unterk&uuml;nfte, die hier in Form von Apartments angeboten werden, die sich gr&ouml;&szlig;tenteils rund um den Parkplatz befinden. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3839, 'de', 1),
(1641, 'La prima spiaggia quando si entra nella regione tedesca dello Schleswig-Holstein dalla direzione del Meclemburgo-Pomerania Anteriore &egrave; la spiaggia Strand Priwall. La famosa e storica citt&agrave; di Lubecca, nota per i suoi dolci di marzapane, &egrave; a pochi chilometri di distanza. La visita della citt&agrave; &egrave; d&#39;obbligo se ti trovi in ​​questa regione, non solo rimarrai stupito dall&#39;offerta culinaria, ma anche dagli edifici storici con la sua emozionante architettura di epoca medievale. La spiaggia &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Il parcheggio pi&ugrave; vicino si trova a circa 300 metri dalla spiaggia. La spiaggia stessa &egrave; lunga pochi chilometri, &egrave; di sabbia ed &egrave; larga 100 m. Hai molta superficie per trovare il tuo posto qui. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e per via del basso fondale il punto di balneazione &egrave; molto lontano. Il fondale basso lo rende anche un luogo ideale per far giocare i bambini piccoli in acqua in sicurezza. Hai alcuni servizi in spiaggia disponibili qui, anche docce. Vicino alla spiaggia si trovano anche ristoranti e bar, lo stesso vale per gli alloggi che qui sono disponibili sotto forma di appartamenti, che si trovano per lo pi&ugrave; intorno al parcheggio. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3839, 'it', 1),
(1642, 'La premi&egrave;re plage en entrant dans la r&eacute;gion allemande du Schleswig-Holstein en direction de Mecklenburg-Vorpommern est la plage Strand Priwall. La ville historique et mondialement connue de L&uuml;beck, connue pour ses bonbons au massepain, n&#39;est qu&#39;&agrave; quelques kilom&egrave;tres. La visite de la ville est un must si vous &ecirc;tes dans cette r&eacute;gion, vous serez non seulement surpris par l&#39;offre culinaire, mais aussi par les b&acirc;timents historiques avec son architecture passionnante de l&#39;&eacute;poque m&eacute;di&eacute;vale. La plage est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. Le parking le plus proche est &agrave; environ 300 m&egrave;tres de la plage. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me mesure quelques kilom&egrave;tres de long, elle est faite de sable et mesure 100 m de large. Vous avez beaucoup de surface pour trouver votre place ici. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et &agrave; cause de l&#39;eau peu profonde, le point de baignade est loin. L&#39;eau peu profonde en fait &eacute;galement un endroit id&eacute;al pour les petits enfants pour jouer dans l&#39;eau en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;. Vous avez quelques services de plage disponibles ici, &eacute;galement des douches. Des restaurants et des caf&eacute;s sont &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la plage, il en va de m&ecirc;me pour les h&eacute;bergements qui sont disponibles ici sous forme d&#39;appartements, situ&eacute;s principalement autour du parking. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex et utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3839, 'fr', 1),
(1643, 'La primera playa al entrar en la regi&oacute;n alemana de Schleswig-Holstein desde Mecklenburg-Vorpommern es la playa Strand Priwall. La mundialmente famosa e hist&oacute;rica ciudad de L&uuml;beck, conocida por sus dulces de mazap&aacute;n, est&aacute; a solo unos kil&oacute;metros de distancia. La visita a la ciudad es imprescindible si se encuentra en esta regi&oacute;n, no solo se sorprender&aacute; con la oferta culinaria, sino tambi&eacute;n con los edificios hist&oacute;ricos con su emocionante arquitectura de la &eacute;poca medieval. La playa es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. El aparcamiento m&aacute;s cercano est&aacute; a unos 300 m de la playa. La playa en s&iacute; tiene unos pocos kil&oacute;metros de largo, est&aacute; hecha de arena y tiene 100 m de ancho. Tienes mucha superficie para encontrar tu lugar aqu&iacute;. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y debido a la poca profundidad el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; muy lejos. El agua poco profunda lo convierte tambi&eacute;n en un lugar ideal para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen en el agua de manera segura. Tienes algunos servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;, tambi&eacute;n duchas. Los restaurantes y cafeter&iacute;as tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n cerca de la playa, lo mismo ocurre con el alojamiento que est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute; en forma de apartamentos, que se encuentran principalmente alrededor del lugar de estacionamiento. Disfrute de su playa con BeachRex y utilice siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de sus sue&ntilde;os.', 3839, 'es', 1),
(1644, 'Willkommen am sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand Scharbeutz. In der deutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein gibt es viele Sandstr&auml;nde. In der kleinen Stadt Scharbeutz k&ouml;nnen Sie nicht nur den sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand genie&szlig;en, sondern auch die exzellenten Stranddienste und die sch&ouml;ne Strandpromenade. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie ben&ouml;tigen nur 200 Meter zu Fu&szlig; vom gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Sie k&ouml;nnen aber auch direkt am Strand neben der Stra&szlig;e parken. Ein spezieller Parkplatz ist auch f&uuml;r Wohnmobilbesitzer reserviert und es ist ziemlich gro&szlig;. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und auch f&uuml;r behinderte Menschen geeignet. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt einige Kilometer und die Breite 40 Meter. Der Zugang zum Wasser ist sehr gut und aufgrund des flachen Meeresbodens ist der Schwimmpunkt weit entfernt, was diesen Ort zusammen mit dem Kinderspielplatz ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder macht. Stranddienste sind hier auf h&ouml;chstem Niveau und alles ist gut organisiert. Nat&uuml;rlich k&ouml;nnen Sie auch die ber&uuml;hmten deutschen Liegest&uuml;hle mieten. Sie haben viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, etwas zu essen oder zu trinken zu bekommen. Unterk&uuml;nfte gibt es hier auch ganz nah am Strand und zwar ziemlich viele in allen verschiedenen Formen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandaufenthalt mit BeachRex.', 3843, 'de', 1),
(1645, 'Bienvenue sur la magnifique plage de sable de Scharbeutz. Dans la r&eacute;gion allemande du Schleswig-Holstein, vous avez de nombreuses plages de sable. Dans la petite ville de Scharbeutz, vous pouvez non seulement profiter de la belle plage de sable mais aussi des excellents services de plage et de la belle promenade le long de la plage. Cet endroit est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et il ne vous faudra que 200 m&egrave;tres de marche depuis le grand parking pour rejoindre la plage, mais vous pouvez &eacute;galement vous garer directement sur la plage &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route. Une place de parking sp&eacute;ciale est &eacute;galement r&eacute;serv&eacute;e aux propri&eacute;taires de camping-cars, et c&#39;est une grande. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s facile et convient &eacute;galement aux personnes handicap&eacute;es. La longueur totale de la plage est de quelques kilom&egrave;tres et la largeur est de 40 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s fin et en raison du fond plat, le point de baignade est &eacute;loign&eacute;, ce qui rend cet endroit, avec l&#39;aire de jeux pour enfants, id&eacute;al pour les petits enfants. Les services de plage sont ici au plus haut niveau et tout est bien organis&eacute;. Bien s&ucirc;r, vous pouvez &eacute;galement louer les c&eacute;l&egrave;bres chaises de plage allemandes. Vous avez de nombreuses options pour vous restaurer ou boire ainsi que pour choisir votre h&eacute;bergement pr&eacute;f&eacute;r&eacute;, parmi lesquels il y en a beaucoup sous toutes les formes, et tout pr&egrave;s. Profitez de votre s&eacute;jour &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex.', 3843, 'fr', 1),
(1646, 'Bienvenido a la hermosa playa de arena Scharbeutz. En la regi&oacute;n alemana de Schleswig-Holstein, tiene muchas playas de arena. En el peque&ntilde;o pueblo de Scharbeutz, no solo podr&aacute; disfrutar de la hermosa playa de arena, sino tambi&eacute;n de los excelentes servicios de playa y del hermoso paseo mar&iacute;timo a lo largo de la playa. Este lugar es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y solo toma 200 metros de caminata desde el gran estacionamiento para llegar a la playa, pero tambi&eacute;n puedes estacionar justo en la playa al lado de la carretera. Tambi&eacute;n se reserva una plaza de aparcamiento especial para los propietarios de autocaravanas, y es grande. El acceso a la playa es muy f&aacute;cil y tambi&eacute;n es apto para minusv&aacute;lidos. La longitud total de la playa es de unos pocos kil&oacute;metros y el ancho es de 40 metros. El acceso al agua es muy fino y debido al fondo plano del mar, el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; muy alejado, lo que hace que este lugar, junto con el parque infantil, sea ideal para los m&aacute;s peque&ntilde;os. Los servicios de playa est&aacute;n aqu&iacute; al m&aacute;s alto nivel y todo est&aacute; bien organizado. Por supuesto, tambi&eacute;n puede alquilar las famosas sillas de playa alemanas. Tienes muchas opciones para conseguir algo de comer o de beber para elegir tu alojamiento favorito, de los cuales hay muchos en todas las formas, y muy cerca. Disfrute de su estancia en la playa con BeachRex.', 3843, 'es', 1),
(1647, 'Benvenuti nella bellissima spiaggia sabbiosa di Scharbeutz. Nella regione tedesca dello Schleswig-Holstein ci sono molte spiagge sabbiose. Nella piccola citt&agrave; di Scharbeutz, non solo puoi goderti la bellissima spiaggia sabbiosa, ma anche gli eccellenti servizi in spiaggia e il bellissimo lungomare lungo la spiaggia. Questo posto &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e dal grande parcheggio bastano solo 200 metri a piedi per raggiungere la spiaggia, ma si pu&ograve; parcheggiare anche direttamente sulla spiaggia a lato della strada. Un parcheggio speciale &egrave; riservato anche ai proprietari di camper, ed &egrave; di grandi dimensioni. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto agevole ed &egrave; adatto anche a persone diversamente abili. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di pochi chilometri e la larghezza &egrave; di 40 metri. L&#39;accesso all&#39;acqua &egrave; molto fine e per via del fondale piatto il punto di balneazione &egrave; molto distante, il che rende questo luogo, insieme al parco giochi per bambini, ideale per i pi&ugrave; piccoli. I servizi in spiaggia qui sono di altissimo livello e tutto &egrave; ben organizzato. Ovviamente puoi anche noleggiare le famose sdraio tedesche. Hai molte opzioni per prendere qualcosa da mangiare o da bere per scegliere la tua sistemazione preferita, da cui ce ne sono molte in tutte le forme diverse e molto vicine. Goditi il ​​tuo soggiorno al mare con BeachRex.', 3843, 'it', 1),
(1648, 'Neustadt ist der Name der Stadt in der N&auml;he der Ostsee im norddeutschen Raum Schleswig-Holstein, wo sich ein attraktiver Sandstrand direkt neben dem Hafen und dem Yachthafen befindet. Es bietet Ihnen viele Stranddienste und viel Spa&szlig; f&uuml;r die Jugendlichen, ein Kinderspielplatz befindet sich direkt am Strand, das gleiche gilt f&uuml;r diejenigen, die Sport lieben, Sie k&ouml;nnen Beachvolleyball auf dem Sand spielen. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach neben der Stra&szlig;e parken und ben&ouml;tigen nur 50 Meter zu Fu&szlig;, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge dieses Strandes betr&auml;gt 750 m und kann bis zu 50 m breit sein. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt zwischen 5 in 25 m. Viele Arten von Restaurants, die verschiedene Men&uuml;s anbieten, befinden sich direkt am Strand. Wenn Sie nach einer Unterkunft suchen, haben Sie viele verschiedene M&ouml;glichkeiten, einige ganz in der N&auml;he, einschlie&szlig;lich eines Campingplatzes. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie Ihren Traumstrand sehr schnell finden m&ouml;chten, gehen Sie immer zu BeachRex.', 3846, 'de', 1),
(1649, 'Neustadt &egrave; il nome della citt&agrave;, vicino al Mar Baltico nella regione della Germania settentrionale dello Schleswig-Holstein, dove si trova un&#39;attraente spiaggia sabbiosa, proprio accanto al porto e al porto turistico. Ti offre tanti servizi spiaggia e tanto divertimento per i pi&ugrave; piccoli, un parco giochi per bambini si trova direttamente sulla spiaggia, lo stesso vale per chi ama lo sport, puoi giocare a beach volley sulla sabbia. Questa localit&agrave; &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, &egrave; sufficiente parcheggiare vicino alla strada e bastano 50 metri di cammino per accedere alla spiaggia. La lunghezza totale di questa spiaggia &egrave; di 750 me pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 50 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; compreso tra 5 e 25 m. Molte tipologie di ristoranti, che propongono men&ugrave; differenti, si trovano direttamente sulla spiaggia. Se stai cercando un alloggio, hai molte opzioni diverse, alcune molto vicine, incluso un campeggio. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex. E ricorda, se vuoi trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni molto velocemente, vai sempre a BeachRex.', 3846, 'it', 1),
(1650, 'Neustadt es el nombre de la ciudad, cerca del Mar B&aacute;ltico en la regi&oacute;n del norte de Alemania Schleswig-Holstein, donde se encuentra una atractiva playa de arena, justo al lado del puerto y el puerto deportivo. Te ofrece muchos servicios de playa y mucha diversi&oacute;n para los m&aacute;s peque&ntilde;os, un parque infantil est&aacute; ubicado directamente en la playa, lo mismo ocurre con los amantes del deporte, puedes jugar al voleibol de playa en la arena. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, simplemente puede estacionarse al lado de la carretera y solo toma 50 metros de caminata para acceder a la playa. La longitud total de esta playa es de 750 my puede llegar a tener 50 m de ancho. La entrada de agua es agradable y el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; entre 5 en 25 m. Muchos tipos de restaurantes, que ofrecen diferentes men&uacute;s, se encuentran directamente en la playa. Si est&aacute;s buscando alojamiento, tienes muchas opciones diferentes, algunas muy cerca, con zona de acampada incluida. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex. Y recuerde, si desea encontrar la playa de sus sue&ntilde;os muy r&aacute;pido, vaya siempre a BeachRex.', 3846, 'es', 1),
(1651, 'Neustadt est le nom de la ville, pr&egrave;s de la mer Baltique dans la r&eacute;gion du nord de l&#39;Allemagne Schleswig-Holstein, o&ugrave; se trouve une jolie plage de sable, juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; du port et de la marina. Il vous offre de nombreux services de plage et beaucoup de plaisir pour les plus jeunes, une aire de jeux pour enfants est situ&eacute;e directement sur la plage, il en va de m&ecirc;me pour les amateurs de sport, vous pouvez jouer au beach-volley sur le sable. Cet emplacement est facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, vous pouvez simplement vous garer &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la route et il ne vous faudra que 50 m&egrave;tres de marche pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage. La longueur totale de cette plage est de 750 m et elle peut atteindre 50 m de largeur. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade se situe entre 5 &agrave; 25 m. De nombreux types de restaurants, qui proposent des menus diff&eacute;rents, sont situ&eacute;s directement sur la plage. Si vous cherchez un logement, vous avez de nombreuses options diff&eacute;rentes, certaines tr&egrave;s proches, un terrain de camping inclus. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex. Et n&#39;oubliez pas que si vous souhaitez trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves tr&egrave;s rapidement, rendez-vous toujours &agrave; BeachRex.', 3846, 'fr', 1),
(1652, 'In der norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein gibt es viele Campingpl&auml;tze. Einige sind weit vom Strand entfernt, andere sind sehr nah. Wenn Sie nach dem letzten suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Schashagen zu besuchen. Der Weg zu diesem Ort ist sehr einfach und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, Ihr Fahrzeug zu parken, auch ein Wohnmobil. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, gehen Sie entweder zum Camp oder nutzen einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, der etwa 200 Meter vom Strand entfernt ist. Am Strand haben Sie einen Kilometer Strandl&auml;nge und bis zu 40 Meter Breite. Hier gibt es auch eine Bootsrampe. Die Neigung am Strand liegt zwischen normal und steil. An den meisten Stellen des Strandes ist der Wassereintritt an einigen Stellen sch&ouml;n, an den anderen befinden sich Steine ​​im Wasser. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 15 Metern. Einige Stranddienste sind hier verf&uuml;gbar, aber sie sind mehr oder weniger Basic. Ein Restaurant und eine Kaffeebar sind ebenfalls hier und f&uuml;r die Unterbringung gibt es viele Campingpl&auml;tze rund um den Strand und einige Apartments mehr im Hintergrund. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie Ihren Traumstrand sehr schnell finden m&ouml;chten, gehen Sie immer zu BeachRex.', 3849, 'de', 1),
(1653, 'Dans la r&eacute;gion du nord de l&#39;Allemagne, Schleswig-Holstein, vous avez de nombreux terrains de camping. Certains sont loin de la plage, mais certains sont tr&egrave;s proches. Si vous cherchez le dernier, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage Strand Schashagen. Se rendre &agrave; cet endroit est tr&egrave;s facile et vous avez plusieurs options pour garer votre v&eacute;hicule, &eacute;galement un camping-car. Pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage, soit vous vous rendez au camp, soit vous utilisez un grand parking &agrave; environ 200 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Sur la plage, vous avez un kilom&egrave;tre de longueur de plage et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 40 m&egrave;tres de largeur. Une rampe de mise &agrave; l&#39;eau est &eacute;galement disponible ici. L&#39;inclinaison sur la plage est entre normale et raide. Sur la majeure partie de la plage, l&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able &agrave; certains endroits o&ugrave; vous avez des pierres dans l&#39;eau. Le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 15 m&egrave;tres. Certains services de plage sont disponibles ici, mais ils sont plus ou moins simples. Un restaurant et un caf&eacute;-bar sont &eacute;galement ici et pour l&#39;h&eacute;bergement, vous avez de nombreux terrains de camping tout autour de la plage et quelques appartements plus en arri&egrave;re-plan. Et n&#39;oubliez pas que si vous souhaitez trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves tr&egrave;s rapidement, rendez-vous toujours &agrave; BeachRex.', 3849, 'fr', 1),
(1654, 'En la regi&oacute;n de Schleswig-Holstein, en el norte de Alemania, hay muchos terrenos para acampar. Algunos est&aacute;n lejos de la playa, pero otros est&aacute;n muy cerca. Si est&aacute; buscando el &uacute;ltimo, le recomendamos que visite la playa Strand Schashagen. Llegar a este lugar es muy f&aacute;cil y tienes m&uacute;ltiples opciones para estacionar tu veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n una autocaravana. Para acceder a la playa, puedes ir al campamento o utilizar un gran aparcamiento a unos 200 metros de la playa. En la playa tienes un kil&oacute;metro de longitud de playa y hasta 40 metros de ancho. Una rampa para botes tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;. La inclinaci&oacute;n en la playa es entre normal y empinada. En la mayor parte de la playa, la entrada de agua es agradable, en algunos lugares hay piedras en el agua. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a unos 15 metros. Algunos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, pero son m&aacute;s o menos b&aacute;sicos. Un restaurante y una cafeter&iacute;a tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n aqu&iacute; y para el alojamiento tiene muchos terrenos para acampar alrededor de la playa y algunos apartamentos m&aacute;s en el fondo. Y recuerde, si desea encontrar la playa de sus sue&ntilde;os muy r&aacute;pido, vaya siempre a BeachRex.', 3849, 'es', 1),
(1655, 'Nella regione della Germania settentrionale, Schleswig-Holstein, ci sono molti campeggi. Alcuni sono lontani dalla spiaggia, ma altri sono molto vicini. Se stai cercando l&#39;ultima, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand Schashagen. Raggiungere questo posto &egrave; molto semplice e hai pi&ugrave; opzioni per parcheggiare il tuo veicolo, anche un camper. Per accedere alla spiaggia si va al campeggio oppure si utilizza un ampio parcheggio a circa 200 metri dalla spiaggia. Sulla spiaggia hai un chilometro di lunghezza della spiaggia e fino a 40 metri di larghezza. Una rampa per barche &egrave; disponibile anche qui. L&#39;inclinazione sulla spiaggia &egrave; tra normale e ripida. Sulla maggior parte della spiaggia l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; piacevole in alcuni punti ci sono dei sassi nell&#39;acqua. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 15 metri. Alcuni servizi di spiaggia sono disponibili qui, ma sono pi&ugrave; o meno solo di base. C&#39;&egrave; anche un ristorante e un bar e per l&#39;alloggio ci sono molti campeggi intorno alla spiaggia e alcuni appartamenti pi&ugrave; sullo sfondo. E ricorda, se vuoi trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni molto velocemente, vai sempre a BeachRex.', 3849, 'it', 1),
(1656, 'Wenn Sie ein Fan von Sandstr&auml;nden sind, die nach Ihren W&uuml;nschen auch einen langen Pier haben sollten, an dem Sie spazieren gehen, Fische fangen oder von dort springen k&ouml;nnen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den deutschen Strand Kellenhusen zu besuchen. Es liegt im norddeutschen Schleswig-Holstein in der N&auml;he der Kleinstadt Kellenhusen. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr einfach erreichen und der Parkplatz ist nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt. Der gesamte Bereich rund um den Strand ist sehr gut organisiert und Sie haben viele Stranddienste zur Verf&uuml;gung. Dieser Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und kann bis zu 50 Meter breit sein. Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, ins Wasser zu gehen, entweder Sie gehen am Strand entlang, Sie nehmen die Wassertreppe oder Sie springen einfach vom Pier. Zu Beginn ist das Wasser hier sehr flach, was den Punkt des Schwimmens auf 40 Meter macht. Da dieser Strand bei Touristen sehr beliebt ist, stehen Ihnen viele Stranddienste sowie viele Arten von Restaurants und viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften zur Verf&uuml;gung, einschlie&szlig;lich Campingpl&auml;tze, alle sehr nahe am Strand. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3851, 'de', 1),
(1657, 'Se sei un fan delle spiagge sabbiose, che in base alle tue esigenze, dovrebbero avere anche un lungo molo, sul quale puoi fare una passeggiata, pescare un po &#39;di pesce o saltare da esso, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia tedesca Strand Kellenhusen. Si trova nella regione della Germania settentrionale dello Schleswig-Holstein, vicino alla piccola citt&agrave; di Kellenhusen. &Egrave; possibile accedere a questa localit&agrave; molto facilmente con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e il parcheggio &egrave; a soli 50 metri dalla spiaggia. L&#39;intera area intorno alla spiaggia &egrave; molto ben organizzata e sono disponibili numerosi servizi di spiaggia. Questa spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di diversi chilometri e pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 50 metri. Hai pi&ugrave; opzioni per entrare in acqua, o vai in spiaggia, prendi le scale d&#39;acqua o semplicemente salti dal molo. All&#39;inizio l&#39;acqua qui &egrave; molto piatta, il che rende il punto di nuotare a 40 metri. Poich&eacute; questa spiaggia &egrave; molto popolare tra i turisti, sono disponibili molti servizi di spiaggia, nonch&eacute; molti tipi di ristoranti e molte diverse forme di alloggio, campeggio incluso, tutti molto vicini alla spiaggia. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3851, 'it', 1),
(1658, 'Se sei un fan delle spiagge sabbiose, che in base alle tue esigenze, dovrebbero avere anche un lungo molo, sul quale puoi fare una passeggiata, pescare un po &#39;di pesce o saltare da esso, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia tedesca Strand Kellenhusen. Si trova nella regione della Germania settentrionale dello Schleswig-Holstein, vicino alla piccola citt&agrave; di Kellenhusen. &Egrave; possibile accedere a questa localit&agrave; molto facilmente con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e il parcheggio &egrave; a soli 50 metri dalla spiaggia. L&#39;intera area intorno alla spiaggia &egrave; molto ben organizzata e sono disponibili numerosi servizi di spiaggia. Questa spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di diversi chilometri e pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 50 metri. Hai pi&ugrave; opzioni per entrare in acqua, o vai in spiaggia, prendi le scale d&#39;acqua o semplicemente salti dal molo. All&#39;inizio l&#39;acqua qui &egrave; molto piatta, il che rende il punto di nuotare a 40 metri. Poich&eacute; questa spiaggia &egrave; molto popolare tra i turisti, sono disponibili molti servizi di spiaggia, nonch&eacute; molti tipi di ristoranti e molte diverse forme di alloggio, campeggio incluso, tutti molto vicini alla spiaggia. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3851, 'es', 1),
(1659, 'Si vous &ecirc;tes fan des plages de sable fin, qui, selon vos besoins, devraient &eacute;galement avoir une longue jet&eacute;e, sur laquelle vous pouvez vous promener, attraper du poisson ou y sauter, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage allemande Strand Kellenhusen. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion nord-allemande du Schleswig-Holstein, pr&egrave;s de la petite ville de Kellenhusen. Vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cet endroit tr&egrave;s facilement avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et le parking est &agrave; seulement 50 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Toute la zone autour de la plage est tr&egrave;s bien organis&eacute;e et vous disposez de nombreux services de plage. Cette plage a une longueur totale de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et peut atteindre 50 m&egrave;tres de large. Vous avez plusieurs options pour aller dans l&#39;eau, soit vous passez par la plage, vous prenez les escaliers d&#39;eau ou vous sautez simplement de la jet&eacute;e. Au d&eacute;but l&#39;eau ici est tr&egrave;s plate, ce qui fait le point de nager &agrave; 40 m&egrave;tres. Cette plage &eacute;tant tr&egrave;s populaire aupr&egrave;s des touristes, vous disposez de nombreux services de plage, ainsi que de nombreux types de restaurants et de nombreuses formes d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, terrain de camping inclus, tous tr&egrave;s proches de la plage. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3851, 'fr', 1),
(1660, 'Auf der deutschen Insel Fehmarn gibt es viele Arten von Str&auml;nden, an denen die Hauptoberfl&auml;che aus Sand besteht und daneben befindet sich ein gro&szlig;er Campingplatz. Dies gilt auch f&uuml;r den Strand Meeschendorf. Es befindet sich in der norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein. Es ist sehr einfach, mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit dem Wohnmobil, hierher zu gelangen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug nur 30 Meter vom Strand entfernt abstellen. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, haben Sie viele kleine Buchten, die sich &uuml;ber 1 km L&auml;nge und bis zu 20 m Breite erstrecken. Sie haben auch viele Pfeiler am Strand, mit denen Sie ins Wasser springen k&ouml;nnen. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt zwischen 0 und 15 Metern. Einige Stranddienste stehen hier zur Verf&uuml;gung, auch ein Kinderspielplatz. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier auch etwas zu essen und zu trinken bekommen, aber nicht direkt am Strand. F&uuml;r die Unterkunft k&ouml;nnen Sie zwischen einem gro&szlig;en Campingplatz in der N&auml;he und einigen Apartments im Hintergrund w&auml;hlen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3856, 'de', 1),
(1661, 'Sur l&#39;&icirc;le allemande de Fehmarn, vous avez de nombreux types de plages dont la surface principale est du sable, avec un grand terrain de camping &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute;. Ceci est &eacute;galement vrai pour la plage Strand Meeschendorf. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion nord-allemande du Schleswig-Holstein. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de s&#39;y rendre avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, camping-car &eacute;galement, et vous pouvez laisser votre v&eacute;hicule &agrave; seulement 30 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Une fois sur la plage, vous avez de nombreuses petites baies s&#39;&eacute;tendant sur 1 km de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 20 m de large. Vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreuses jet&eacute;es sur la plage, que vous pouvez utiliser pour sauter dans l&#39;eau. Le point de nage est compris entre 0 et 15 m&egrave;tres. Certains services de plage sont disponibles ici, ainsi qu&#39;une aire de jeux pour enfants. Vous pouvez &eacute;galement trouver ici quelque chose &agrave; manger et &agrave; boire, mais pas directement sur la plage. Pour l&#39;h&eacute;bergement, vous pouvez choisir entre un grand terrain de camping &agrave; proximit&eacute; et quelques appartements plus en arri&egrave;re-plan. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3856, 'fr', 1),
(1662, 'En la isla alemana de Fehmarn tienes muchos tipos de playas donde la superficie principal es arena, con un gran terreno para acampar al lado. Esto tambi&eacute;n es v&aacute;lido para la playa Strand Meeschendorf. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n del norte de Alemania Schleswig-Holstein. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n autocaravana, y puedes dejar tu veh&iacute;culo a tan solo 30 metros de la playa. Una vez que est&aacute;s en la playa tienes muchas bah&iacute;as peque&ntilde;as que se extienden por m&aacute;s de 1 km de largo y hasta 20 m de ancho. Tambi&eacute;n tienes muchos muelles en la playa, que puedes usar para saltar al agua. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; entre 0 y 15 metros. Algunos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, tambi&eacute;n un parque infantil. Tambi&eacute;n se puede conseguir aqu&iacute; algo para comer y beber, pero no directamente en la playa. Para el alojamiento se puede elegir entre una gran zona de acampada cercana y algunos apartamentos m&aacute;s al fondo. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3856, 'es', 1),
(1663, 'Sull&#39;isola tedesca di Fehmarn ci sono molti tipi di spiagge la cui superficie principale &egrave; di sabbia, con un grande campeggio accanto ad essa. Questo vale anche per la spiaggia Strand Meeschendorf. Si trova nella regione della Germania settentrionale dello Schleswig-Holstein. &Egrave; molto facile arrivare qui con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche camper, e puoi lasciare il tuo veicolo a soli 30 metri dalla spiaggia. Una volta che sei sulla spiaggia, hai molte piccole baie che si estendono per oltre 1 km di lunghezza e fino a 20 m di larghezza. Ci sono anche molti moli sulla spiaggia, che puoi usare per tuffarti in acqua. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; compreso tra 0 e 15 metri. Alcuni servizi spiaggia sono disponibili qui, anche un parco giochi per bambini. Puoi anche trovare qui qualcosa da mangiare e da bere, ma non direttamente sulla spiaggia. Per l&#39;alloggio si pu&ograve; scegliere tra un grande campeggio nelle vicinanze e alcuni appartamenti pi&ugrave; in secondo piano. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3856, 'it', 1),
(1664, 'Der niederl&auml;ndische Strand RCN liegt am Ufer des Wolderwijd-Sees. Es ist ein Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien und diejenigen empfohlen wird, die gerne in einem Camp sind. Es befindet sich in der Region Flevoland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Zeewolde. Dieser Strand ist sehr leicht zu erreichen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil. Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, nur 50 Meter vom Strand entfernt, im Camp parken. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand Sand ist, haben Sie auch viele Rasenfl&auml;chen. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 250 m und ist 50 m breit. Es ist ein flacher Strand mit ziemlich flachem Wasser. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 40 m. Da sich dieser Strand in einem Camp befindet, stehen Ihnen hier viele Strandinfrastrukturen und -dienste zur Verf&uuml;gung. Hier gibt es auch viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants. F&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft k&ouml;nnen Sie im Camp &uuml;bernachten oder einige Apartments in der N&auml;he mieten. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, den schnellsten Strandbrowser der Welt.', 4039, 'de', 1),
(1665, 'La plage n&eacute;erlandaise Strand RCN est situ&eacute;e sur les rives du lac Wolderwijd. C&#39;est une plage de sable, recommand&eacute;e pour les familles et ceux qui aiment &ecirc;tre dans un camp. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Flevoland, &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville Zeewolde. Cette plage est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s, &eacute;galement avec un camping-car et vous pouvez vous garer sur un grand parking, &agrave; seulement 50 m&egrave;tres de la plage, &agrave; l&#39;int&eacute;rieur du camp. Bien que la surface principale de la plage soit du sable, vous avez &eacute;galement beaucoup de champs d&#39;herbe. La plage a une longueur totale de 250 m et une largeur de 50 m. C&#39;est une plage plate avec une eau assez peu profonde. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 40 m. En raison de cette plage &agrave; l&#39;int&eacute;rieur d&#39;un camp, vous disposez de nombreuses infrastructures et services de plage disponibles ici. De nombreux types de restaurants sont &eacute;galement disponibles ici et pour votre h&eacute;bergement, vous pouvez rester dans le camp ou louer des appartements &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, le navigateur de plage le plus rapide de la plan&egrave;te.', 4039, 'fr', 1),
(1666, 'La playa holandesa Strand RCN se encuentra a orillas del lago Wolderwijd. Es una playa de arena, recomendada para familias y aquellos a los que les gusta estar en un campamento. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Flevoland, cerca de la ciudad Zeewolde. Esta playa es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana y se puede aparcar en una gran plaza de aparcamiento, a solo 50 metros de la playa, dentro del campamento. Aunque la superficie principal de la playa es de arena, tambi&eacute;n hay muchos campos de hierba. La playa tiene una longitud total de 250 my 50 m de ancho. Es una playa plana con aguas bastante poco profundas. La entrada al agua es agradable y el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a unos 40 m. Debido a que esta playa est&aacute; dentro de un campamento, tiene mucha infraestructura y servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;. Tambi&eacute;n hay muchos tipos diferentes de restaurantes aqu&iacute; y para su alojamiento puede quedarse en el campamento o alquilar algunos apartamentos cercanos. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os, el navegador de playas m&aacute;s r&aacute;pido del planeta.', 4039, 'es', 1),
(1667, 'La spiaggia olandese Strand RCN si trova sulle rive del lago Wolderwijd. &Egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa, consigliata alle famiglie ea chi ama stare in campeggio. Si trova nella regione Flevoland, vicino alla citt&agrave; Zeewolde. Questa spiaggia &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere, anche con camper e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare in un ampio parcheggio, a soli 50 metri dalla spiaggia, all&#39;interno del campeggio. Sebbene la superficie principale della spiaggia sia sabbia, ci sono anche molti campi in erba. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 250 m ed &egrave; larga 50 m. &Egrave; una spiaggia pianeggiante con un fondale abbastanza basso. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 40 m. Poich&eacute; questa spiaggia si trova all&#39;interno di un campo, hai molte infrastrutture e servizi disponibili qui. Ci sono anche molti diversi tipi di ristoranti e per il tuo alloggio puoi soggiornare nel campo o affittare alcuni appartamenti nelle vicinanze. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni, il browser spiaggia pi&ugrave; veloce del pianeta.', 4039, 'it', 1),
(1668, 'Die niederl&auml;ndische Stadt Almere in der Region Flevoland ist von vielen Seen umgeben, die Ihnen auch einige Sandstr&auml;nde in der N&auml;he bieten k&ouml;nnen. Ein solcher Sandstrand namens Strand Almere Haven wird f&uuml;r Familien empfohlen und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz ist nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt und beherbergt auch Wohnmobile. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach. Es ist ein flacher Strand mit einer Gesamtl&auml;nge von 400 m und einer maximalen Breite von 75 m. Aufgrund des flachen Strandes ist das Wasser auch ziemlich flach, was bedeutet, dass Sie einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt haben und der Schwimmpunkt zwischen 0 und 25 m variiert. Hier befindet sich eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur. Am Strand gibt es auch eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in der N&auml;he in Form eines Hotels oder eines Apartments. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, den schnellsten Strandbrowser der Welt.', 4041, 'de', 1),
(1669, 'La citt&agrave; olandese di Almere, che si trova nella regione del Flevoland, &egrave; circondata da molti laghi, che possono anche offrirti alcune spiagge sabbiose nelle vicinanze. Una di queste spiagge sabbiose, chiamata Strand Almere Haven, &egrave; consigliata alle famiglie ed &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. A pochi metri dalla spiaggia si trova un parcheggio molto ampio, che accoglie anche camper. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto semplice. &Egrave; una spiaggia pianeggiante con una lunghezza totale di 400 me una larghezza massima di 75 m. A causa della spiaggia piatta l&#39;acqua &egrave; anche abbastanza bassa, il che significa che hai una bella entrata in acqua e il punto di nuotata varia tra 0 e 25 m. Alcune infrastrutture di base sulla spiaggia si trovano qui. Sulla spiaggia hai anche un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile nelle vicinanze sotto forma di hotel o appartamenti. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni, il browser spiaggia pi&ugrave; veloce del pianeta.', 4041, 'it', 1),
(1670, 'La citt&agrave; olandese di Almere, che si trova nella regione del Flevoland, &egrave; circondata da molti laghi, che possono anche offrirti alcune spiagge sabbiose nelle vicinanze. Una di queste spiagge sabbiose, chiamata Strand Almere Haven, &egrave; consigliata alle famiglie ed &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. A pochi metri dalla spiaggia si trova un parcheggio molto ampio, che accoglie anche camper. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto semplice. &Egrave; una spiaggia pianeggiante con una lunghezza totale di 400 me una larghezza massima di 75 m. A causa della spiaggia piatta l&#39;acqua &egrave; anche abbastanza bassa, il che significa che hai una bella entrata in acqua e il punto di nuotata varia tra 0 e 25 m. Alcune infrastrutture di base sulla spiaggia si trovano qui. Sulla spiaggia hai anche un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile nelle vicinanze sotto forma di hotel o appartamenti. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni, il browser spiaggia pi&ugrave; veloce del pianeta.', 4041, 'es', 1),
(1671, 'La ville n&eacute;erlandaise d&#39;Almere, situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion du Flevoland, est entour&eacute;e de nombreux lacs, qui peuvent &eacute;galement vous offrir quelques plages de sable &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Une de ces plages de sable, appel&eacute;e Strand Almere Haven, est recommand&eacute;e pour les familles et est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. Un tr&egrave;s grand parking se trouve &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage, et il accueille &eacute;galement les camping-cars. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s facile. C&#39;est une plage plate d&#39;une longueur totale de 400 m et d&#39;une largeur maximale de 75 m. En raison de la plage plate, l&#39;eau est &eacute;galement assez peu profonde, ce qui signifie que vous avez une belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et que le point de baignade varie entre 0 et 25 m. Certaines infrastructures de plage de base se trouvent ici. Sur la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement un bar de plage et un restaurant. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible &agrave; proximit&eacute; sous forme d&#39;h&ocirc;tel ou d&#39;appartements. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, le navigateur de plage le plus rapide de la plan&egrave;te.', 4041, 'fr', 1),
(1672, 'Wenn Sie einen Sandstrand an einem holl&auml;ndischen See mit viel Strand bevorzugen, sollten Sie den Strand Almeerderstrand besuchen. Es befindet sich in der Region Flevoland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Almere am Ufer des IJmeer-Sees. Egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie an diesem Ort unterwegs sind, es ist leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Zugang zu den Str&auml;nden ist einfach und aufgrund des sehr breiten Strandbereichs, der ungef&auml;hr 150 m breit ist, ben&ouml;tigen Sie einige Zeit, um auf einem Sand zu Fu&szlig; zum Wasser zu gelangen. Sie haben hier auch ziemlich viele B&auml;ume, um Sie vor der Sonne zu sch&uuml;tzen. Der gesamte Strandbereich ist sehr gro&szlig;. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 1 km. Der Strand ist sehr flach und hat am Anfang ein flaches Wasser, was den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n macht. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 20 m. Hier ist auch eine gewisse Strandinfrastruktur vorhanden, die sich haupts&auml;chlich in der N&auml;he der Restaurants und Strandbars befindet, die sich ebenfalls am Strand befinden. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in der N&auml;he meist in Form eines Hotels oder einer Wohnung. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, den schnellsten Strandbrowser der Welt.', 4042, 'de', 1),
(1673, 'Si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez une plage de sable sur un lac n&eacute;erlandais avec beaucoup de plages, vous devriez visiter la plage Almeerderstrand. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion du Flevoland, &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville d&#39;Almere sur les rives du lac IJmeer. Quel que soit le v&eacute;hicule dans lequel vous voyagez, cet emplacement est facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s et vous disposez d&#39;un tr&egrave;s grand parking &agrave; seulement 30 m de la plage. L&#39;acc&egrave;s aux plages est facile et en raison de la tr&egrave;s grande plage, qui mesure environ 150 m de large, il vous faudra un certain temps de marche sur le sable pour vous rendre &agrave; l&#39;eau. Vous avez &eacute;galement pas mal d&#39;arbres ici, pour vous prot&eacute;ger du soleil. Toute la plage est vraiment grande. La plage a une longueur totale de 1 km. La plage est tr&egrave;s plate et a au d&eacute;but une eau peu profonde, ce qui rend l&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able. Le point de nage est &agrave; 20 m. Certaines infrastructures de plage sont &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sentes ici et elles sont situ&eacute;es principalement autour des restaurants et des bars de plage, qui sont &eacute;galement sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible &agrave; proximit&eacute; principalement sous la forme d&#39;un h&ocirc;tel ou d&#39;un appartement. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, le navigateur de plage le plus rapide de la plan&egrave;te.', 4042, 'fr', 1),
(1674, 'Si eres de los que prefiere una playa de arena en un lago holand&eacute;s con mucha zona de playa, debes visitar la playa de Almeerderstrand. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Flevoland, cerca de la ciudad de Almere, a orillas del lago IJmeer. Independientemente del veh&iacute;culo al que viaje, esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de f&aacute;cil acceso y tiene un lugar de estacionamiento muy grande a solo 30 m de la playa. El acceso a las playas es f&aacute;cil y debido a la gran extensi&oacute;n de la playa, que tiene aproximadamente 150 m de ancho, te llevar&aacute; un tiempo caminar sobre la arena para llegar al agua. Aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n tienes bastantes &aacute;rboles para protegerte del sol. Toda la zona de la playa es realmente grande. La playa tiene una longitud total de 1 km. La playa es muy plana y tiene al principio un agua poco profunda, lo que hace que la entrada al agua sea muy agradable. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a 20 m. Tambi&eacute;n hay algo de infraestructura de playa aqu&iacute; y se encuentra principalmente alrededor de los restaurantes y chiringuitos, que tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n en la playa. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en los alrededores principalmente en forma de hotel o apartamento. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os, el navegador de playas m&aacute;s r&aacute;pido del planeta.', 4042, 'es', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1675, 'Se sei quello che preferisce una spiaggia sabbiosa su un lago olandese con molta spiaggia, dovresti visitare la spiaggia Almeerderstrand. Si trova nella regione del Flevoland, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Almere, sulle sponde del lago IJmeer. Non importa quale sia il veicolo che stai viaggiando, questa posizione &egrave; facile da raggiungere e hai un parcheggio molto ampio a soli 30 metri dalla spiaggia. L&#39;accesso alle spiagge &egrave; facile e, data la spiaggia molto ampia, che &egrave; larga circa 150 m, ci vorr&agrave; un po &#39;di tempo a camminare sulla sabbia per arrivare all&#39;acqua. Hai anche molti alberi qui, per proteggerti dal sole. L&#39;intera area della spiaggia &egrave; davvero grande. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 1 km. La spiaggia &egrave; molto pianeggiante e presenta inizialmente un fondale basso, che rende l&#39;ingresso in acqua molto piacevole. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 20 m. Alcune infrastrutture balneari sono presenti anche qui e si trovano principalmente intorno ai ristoranti e ai bar sulla spiaggia, che si trovano anche sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile nelle vicinanze per lo pi&ugrave; sotto forma di un hotel o un appartamento. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni, il browser spiaggia pi&ugrave; veloce del pianeta.', 4042, 'it', 1),
(1676, 'Das Moto dieses holl&auml;ndischen Strandes namens Zilverstrand lautet: &quot;Halte es einfach&quot;. Es befindet sich in der Region Flevoland in der N&auml;he der Stadt Almere am Ufer des Gooimeer-Sees. Es ist sehr leicht mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz etwa 200 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach. Am Strand ist die Hauptoberfl&auml;che Sand, aber Sie haben auch einige Rasenfl&auml;chen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt 750 m und sie ist 50 m breit. Es ist ein flacher Strand mit flachem Wasser, was den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n macht und den Schwimmpunkt auf 40 m schafft. Am Strand gibt es nur einige grundlegende Strandinfrastrukturen wie Toiletten und Duschen. Am Strand oder in Strandn&auml;he sind keine Restaurants und Unterk&uuml;nfte verf&uuml;gbar. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, den schnellsten Strandbrowser der Welt.', 4043, 'de', 1),
(1677, 'La Moto di questa spiaggia olandese, chiamata Zilverstrand &egrave;: &quot;Keep it simple&quot;. Si trova nella regione del Flevoland, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Almere, sulle sponde del lago Gooimeer. E &#39;molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con camper e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare in un parcheggio molto ampio a circa 200 m dalla spiaggia. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; facile. Sulla spiaggia la superficie principale &egrave; di sabbia, ma ci sono anche alcuni campi in erba. La lunghezza totale &egrave; di 750 m ed &egrave; larga 50 m. &Egrave; una spiaggia pianeggiante con un fondale basso, che rende l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua molto piacevole e crea il punto di balneazione a 40 m. Sulla spiaggia hai solo alcune infrastrutture di base della spiaggia, come bagni e docce. Non sono disponibili ristoranti e alloggi sulla spiaggia o vicino alla spiaggia. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni, il browser spiaggia pi&ugrave; veloce del pianeta.', 4043, 'it', 1),
(1678, 'El Moto de esta playa holandesa, llamada Zilverstrand es: &quot;hazlo simple&quot;. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Flevoland, cerca de la ciudad de Almere, a orillas del lago Gooimeer. Es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana y se puede aparcar en una plaza de aparcamiento muy amplia a unos 200 m de la playa. El acceso a la playa es sencillo. En la playa la superficie principal es arena, pero tambi&eacute;n hay algunos campos de hierba. La longitud total es de 750 my 50 m de ancho. Es una playa plana y de aguas poco profundas, lo que hace muy agradable la entrada al agua y crea el punto de nado a 40 m. En la playa solo tiene una infraestructura b&aacute;sica de playa, como ba&ntilde;os y duchas. No hay restaurantes y alojamiento disponible en la playa o cerca de la playa. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os, el navegador de playas m&aacute;s r&aacute;pido del planeta.', 4043, 'es', 1),
(1679, 'La moto de cette plage hollandaise, appel&eacute;e Zilverstrand est: &quot;Keep it simple&quot;. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Flevoland pr&egrave;s de la ville d&#39;Almere sur les rives du lac Gooimeer. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, y compris avec un camping-car et vous pouvez vous garer sur un tr&egrave;s grand parking &agrave; environ 200 m de la plage. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est facile. Sur la plage, la surface principale est du sable, mais vous avez &eacute;galement des champs d&#39;herbe. La longueur totale est de 750 m et la largeur de 50 m. C&#39;est une plage plate avec une eau peu profonde, ce qui rend l&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et cr&eacute;e le point de baignade &agrave; 40 m. Sur la plage, vous n&#39;avez que quelques infrastructures de plage de base, comme des toilettes et des douches. Aucun restaurant ni h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est disponible sur la plage ou &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la plage. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, le navigateur de plage le plus rapide de la plan&egrave;te.', 4043, 'fr', 1),
(1680, 'Sur le lac n&eacute;erlandais IJmeer, pr&egrave;s de la ville de Muiderberg, qui fait partie de la r&eacute;gion Noord-Holland, vous avez une belle plage de sable adapt&eacute;e aux familles et &agrave; ceux qui aiment pratiquer des sports nautiques, comme la voile. L&#39;emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s et vous pouvez laisser votre v&eacute;hicule par la route &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage. Pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage, il faut descendre les escaliers d&#39;environ 5 m de hauteur. La surface principale de la plage est du sable, mais il y a aussi de l&#39;herbe sur la partie escarp&eacute;e de la plage. La longueur totale est de 300 m et sa largeur est de 25 m. C&#39;est une plage assez plate avec une eau assez peu profonde, ce qui signifie que le point de baignade est &eacute;loign&eacute;. Pour entrer dans l&#39;eau, vous devez traverser une barri&egrave;re en b&eacute;ton, ce qui peut &ecirc;tre parfois d&eacute;licat. De nombreuses infrastructures et services de plage sont disponibles ici, vous avez &eacute;galement une aire de jeux pour enfants et un terrain de sport. Un club de voile se trouve &eacute;galement sur la plage, ainsi qu&#39;un restaurant et un bar de plage. Si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez ce type de plage, des h&eacute;bergements sont disponibles &agrave; proximit&eacute; sous forme d&#39;appartements et d&#39;un h&ocirc;tel. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, le navigateur de plage le plus rapide de la plan&egrave;te.', 4044, 'fr', 1),
(1681, 'En el lago holand&eacute;s IJmeer, cerca de la ciudad de Muiderberg, que forma parte de la regi&oacute;n de Noord-Holland, tiene una bonita playa de arena adecuada para familias y para aquellos a los que les gusta practicar deportes acu&aacute;ticos, como navegar. La ubicaci&oacute;n es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso y puede dejar su veh&iacute;culo en la carretera a solo unos metros de la playa. Para acceder a la playa es necesario descender unos 5 m de altura por las escaleras. La superficie principal de la playa es arena, pero tambi&eacute;n hay algo de c&eacute;sped en la parte empinada de la playa. La longitud total es de 300 my tiene 25 m de ancho. Es una playa bastante plana con aguas bastante poco profundas, lo que significa que el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; muy lejos. Para meterse en el agua es necesario cruzar una barrera de hormig&oacute;n, lo que a veces puede resultar complicado. Una gran cantidad de infraestructura y servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, tambi&eacute;n tiene un parque infantil y un campo de deportes. Tambi&eacute;n hay un club n&aacute;utico en la playa, as&iacute; como un restaurante y un bar en la playa. Si prefiere este tipo de playas, hay alojamiento disponible en las inmediaciones en forma de apartamentos y un hotel. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os, el navegador de playas m&aacute;s r&aacute;pido del planeta.', 4044, 'es', 1),
(1682, 'Sul lago olandese IJmeer, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Muiderberg, che fa parte della regione Noord-Holland, c&#39;&egrave; una bella spiaggia sabbiosa adatta alle famiglie ea chi ama praticare sport acquatici, come la vela. La posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere e si pu&ograve; lasciare il proprio veicolo lungo la strada a pochi metri dalla spiaggia. Per accedere alla spiaggia &egrave; necessario scendere le scale per circa 5 m di altezza. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia, ma c&#39;&egrave; anche dell&#39;erba nella parte ripida della spiaggia. La lunghezza totale &egrave; di 300 m ed &egrave; larga 25 m. &Egrave; una spiaggia abbastanza piatta con un fondale abbastanza basso, il che significa che il punto di balneazione &egrave; molto lontano. Per entrare in acqua &egrave; necessario attraversare una barriera di cemento, che a volte pu&ograve; essere complicata. Qui sono disponibili molte infrastrutture e servizi sulla spiaggia, anche un parco giochi per bambini e un campo sportivo. Sulla spiaggia &egrave; presente anche un circolo velico, un ristorante e un bar sulla spiaggia. Se si preferisce questo tipo di spiagge, l&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile nelle vicinanze sotto forma di appartamenti e un hotel. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni, il browser spiaggia pi&ugrave; veloce del pianeta.', 4044, 'it', 1),
(1683, 'Auf dem niederl&auml;ndischen See IJmeer, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Muiderberg, das Teil der Region Nordholland ist, gibt es einen sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien und diejenigen geeignet ist, die gerne Wassersport betreiben, wie zum Beispiel Segeln. Die Lage ist sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug an der Stra&szlig;e nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt abstellen. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie etwa 5 m die Treppe hinuntersteigen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch etwas Gras am steilen Teil des Strandes. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt 300 m und sie ist 25 m breit. Es ist ein ziemlich flacher Strand mit einem ziemlich flachen Wasser, was bedeutet, dass der Schwimmpunkt weit weg ist. Um ins Wasser zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine Betonbarriere &uuml;berqueren, was manchmal schwierig sein kann. Viele Strandinfrastrukturen und Dienstleistungen stehen hier zur Verf&uuml;gung, Sie haben auch einen Kinderspielplatz und einen Sportplatz. Ein Strandclub sowie ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar befinden sich ebenfalls am Strand. Wenn Sie diese Art von Str&auml;nden bevorzugen, stehen Ihnen in der N&auml;he Unterk&uuml;nfte in Form von Apartments und einem Hotel zur Verf&uuml;gung. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, den schnellsten Strandbrowser der Welt.', 4044, 'de', 1),
(1684, 'Sulle rive del lago olandese IJsselmeer nella regione Noord-Holland, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Enkhuizen, c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa, che prende il nome di Strand Enkhuizerzand. &Egrave; una spiaggia di tipo familiare con posti auto a soli 50 m di distanza. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche i camper hanno abbastanza spazio qui. Il percorso per la spiaggia &egrave; facile. La superficie principale &egrave; sabbia, ma ci sono anche degli enormi campi in erba. 200 metri &egrave; la lunghezza totale della spiaggia ed &egrave; larga 20 m. Con il campo in erba aggiunto alla larghezza &egrave; ancora pi&ugrave; ampio. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e per via del basso fondale il punto di balneazione &egrave; lontano, a pi&ugrave; di 100 m. Alcune infrastrutture di base sulla spiaggia si trovano qui, un piccolo parco giochi per bambini incluso. I ristoranti non sono disponibili sulla spiaggia ma nelle vicinanze. L&#39;alloggio non &egrave; lontano, il pi&ugrave; vicino &egrave; un campo, e nella citt&agrave; stessa hai a disposizione appartamenti e hotel. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni, il browser spiaggia pi&ugrave; veloce del pianeta.', 4048, 'it', 1),
(1685, 'A orillas del lago holand&eacute;s IJsselmeer en la regi&oacute;n de Noord-Holland, cerca de la ciudad de Enkhuizen, tiene una playa de arena, que se conoce con el nombre de Strand Enkhuizerzand. Es una playa de tipo familiar con plazas de aparcamiento a tan solo 50 m. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, adem&aacute;s las autocaravanas tienen suficiente espacio aqu&iacute;. El camino a la playa es f&aacute;cil. La superficie principal es de arena, pero tambi&eacute;n hay unos enormes campos de hierba. 200 metros es la longitud total de la playa y 20 m de ancho. Con el campo de c&eacute;sped agregado al ancho, es a&uacute;n m&aacute;s ancho. La entrada al agua es agradable y debido a la poca profundidad el punto de nado est&aacute; lejos, a m&aacute;s de 100 m. Aqu&iacute; se encuentra algo de infraestructura de playa b&aacute;sica, incluido un peque&ntilde;o parque infantil. Los restaurantes no est&aacute;n disponibles en la playa pero s&iacute; en los alrededores. El alojamiento no est&aacute; lejos, el m&aacute;s cercano es un campamento, y en la propia ciudad tienes apartamentos y hoteles disponibles. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os, el navegador de playas m&aacute;s r&aacute;pido del planeta.', 4048, 'es', 1),
(1686, 'Sur les rives du lac n&eacute;erlandais IJsselmeer dans la r&eacute;gion Noord-Holland, &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville d&#39;Enkhuizen, vous avez une plage de sable, qui porte le nom de Strand Enkhuizerzand. C&#39;est une plage de type familial avec des places de parking &agrave; seulement 50 m. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule, les camping-cars ont &eacute;galement suffisamment d&#39;espace ici. Le chemin vers la plage est facile. La surface principale est du sable, mais vous avez &eacute;galement d&#39;&eacute;normes champs d&#39;herbe. 200 m&egrave;tres est la longueur totale de la plage et elle mesure 20 m de large. Avec le champ d&#39;herbe ajout&eacute; &agrave; la largeur, il est encore plus large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et &agrave; cause de l&#39;eau peu profonde, le point de baignade est &eacute;loign&eacute;, &agrave; plus de 100 m. Certaines infrastructures de plage de base se trouvent ici, une petite aire de jeux pour enfants incluse. Les restaurants ne sont pas disponibles sur la plage mais &agrave; proximit&eacute;. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas loin, le plus proche est un camp, et dans la ville elle-m&ecirc;me, vous avez des appartements et des h&ocirc;tels disponibles. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, le navigateur de plage le plus rapide de la plan&egrave;te.', 4048, 'fr', 1),
(1687, 'Am Ufer des niederl&auml;ndischen Sees IJsselmeer in der Region Nordholland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Enkhuizen, befindet sich ein Sandstrand, der unter dem Namen Strand Enkhuizerzand bekannt ist. Es ist ein Familienstrand mit Parkpl&auml;tzen nur 50 m entfernt. Es ist sehr leicht mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, auch Wohnmobile haben hier gen&uuml;gend Platz. Der Weg zum Strand ist einfach. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch einige riesige Rasenfl&auml;chen. 200 Meter ist die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes und er ist 20 m breit. Wenn die Rasenfl&auml;che zur Breite hinzugef&uuml;gt wird, ist sie noch breiter. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und wegen des flachen Wassers ist der Schwimmpunkt mit mehr als 100 m weit entfernt. Hier befindet sich eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur, einschlie&szlig;lich eines kleinen Kinderspielplatzes. Restaurants gibt es nicht am Strand, sondern in der N&auml;he. Die Unterkunft ist nicht weit entfernt, die n&auml;chste ist ein Camp, und in der Stadt selbst stehen Ihnen Apartments und Hotels zur Verf&uuml;gung. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, den schnellsten Strandbrowser der Welt.', 4048, 'de', 1),
(1688, 'Si vous recherchez une plage hollandaise avec une forme tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale, trois quarts de cercle, avec une surface sablonneuse et un grand parking &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage Strand De Vooroever. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Noord-Holland, &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville Andijk sur le lac IJsselmeer. Vous pouvez vous y rendre avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et un grand parking &agrave; seulement 200 m&egrave;tres se trouve ici. L&#39;acc&egrave;s aux plages est facile. Bien que la surface principale de la plage soit du sable, vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreux champs d&#39;herbe et m&ecirc;me des arbres pour se cacher du soleil. C&#39;est une plage plate avec une eau tr&egrave;s peu profonde, ce fait la rend &eacute;galement plus adapt&eacute;e aux petits enfants pour jouer dans l&#39;eau en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est loin. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage n&#39;est que basique, les aires de jeux pour enfants sont incluses. Les restaurants ne sont pas disponibles sur la plage. Vous avez quelques possibilit&eacute;s d&#39;h&eacute;bergement &agrave; proximit&eacute;, principalement des appartements ou des chambres d&#39;h&ocirc;tes. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, le navigateur de plage le plus rapide de la plan&egrave;te.', 4049, 'fr', 1),
(1689, 'Si est&aacute;s buscando una playa holandesa con una forma muy especial, tres cuartos de c&iacute;rculo, con una superficie arenosa y un gran aparcamiento junto a la playa, te recomendamos que visites la playa Strand De Vooroever. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Noord-Holland, cerca de la ciudad Andijk en el lago IJsselmeer. Se puede llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y aqu&iacute; se encuentra una gran plaza de aparcamiento a solo 200 m. El acceso a las playas es sencillo. Aunque la superficie principal de la playa es de arena, tambi&eacute;n tienes muchos campos de c&eacute;sped e incluso algunos &aacute;rboles para esconderte del sol. Es una playa plana con un agua muy poco profunda, este hecho tambi&eacute;n la hace m&aacute;s adecuada para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen en el agua de forma segura. La entrada de agua es muy bonita y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; muy lejos. La infraestructura de la playa es solo b&aacute;sica, se incluyen &aacute;reas de juegos para ni&ntilde;os. Los restaurantes no est&aacute;n disponibles en la playa. Tiene algunas opciones de alojamiento en los alrededores, principalmente apartamentos o bed and breakfast. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os, el navegador de playas m&aacute;s r&aacute;pido del planeta.', 4049, 'es', 1),
(1690, 'Se stai cercando una spiaggia olandese con una forma molto particolare, tre quarti di cerchio, con una superficie sabbiosa e un ampio parcheggio vicino alla spiaggia, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand De Vooroever. Si trova nella regione Noord-Holland, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Andijk sul lago IJsselmeer. Ci si arriva con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e qui si trova un ampio parcheggio a soli 200 mt. L&#39;accesso alle spiagge &egrave; facile. Sebbene la superficie principale della spiaggia sia sabbia, ci sono anche molti campi in erba e persino alcuni alberi per ripararsi dal sole. E &#39;una spiaggia pianeggiante con un fondale molto basso, questo infatti la rende pi&ugrave; adatta anche ai bambini piccoli per giocare in acqua in sicurezza. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; lontano. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; solo di base, parchi giochi per bambini inclusi. I ristoranti non sono disponibili sulla spiaggia. Hai alcune opzioni di alloggio nelle vicinanze, principalmente appartamenti o bed and breakfast. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni, il browser spiaggia pi&ugrave; veloce del pianeta.', 4049, 'it', 1),
(1691, 'Wenn Sie nach einem niederl&auml;ndischen Strand mit einer ganz besonderen Form, einem Dreiviertelkreis, einer sandigen Oberfl&auml;che und einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz neben dem Strand suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand De Vooroever zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der Region Noord-Holland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Andijk am IJsselmeer See. Sie k&ouml;nnen mit jedem Fahrzeug hierherkommen und ein gro&szlig;er Parkplatz, nur 200 m entfernt, befindet sich hier. Der Zugang zu den Str&auml;nden ist einfach. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand Sand ist, gibt es auch viele Rasenfl&auml;chen und sogar einige B&auml;ume, die Sie vor der Sonne verstecken k&ouml;nnen. Es ist ein flacher Strand mit einem sehr flachen Wasser. Aufgrund dieser Tatsache eignet es sich auch besser f&uuml;r kleine Kinder, um sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt ist weit weg. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist nur einfach, Kinderspielpl&auml;tze inklusive. Am Strand gibt es keine Restaurants. Sie haben einige Optionen f&uuml;r die Unterkunft in der N&auml;he, haupts&auml;chlich Apartments oder Bed &amp; Breakfast. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, den schnellsten Strandbrowser der Welt.', 4049, 'de', 1),
(1692, 'Nella citt&agrave; olandese di Wervershoof c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa chiamata Strand Het Nesbos, che si trova sulle rive del lago IJsselmeer. &Egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie con parchi giochi per bambini, alberi grandi e ombrosi e con un fondale basso. Questa localit&agrave; appartiene alla regione Noord-Holland. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungere la spiaggia con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare in un ampio parcheggio a soli 30 m dalla spiaggia. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; facile. La superficie principale &egrave; sabbia, ma hai anche dei campi in erba se preferisci l&#39;erba come superficie principale della spiaggia. &Egrave; una spiaggia pianeggiante con una lunghezza totale di 200 me una larghezza di 30 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e per via dell&#39;acqua poco profonda il punto di balneazione &egrave; molto lontano. Non hai alcuna possibilit&agrave; di acquistare qualcosa da bere o da mangiare sulla spiaggia, ma ci sono alcune opzioni di alloggio nelle vicinanze se desideri rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni, il browser spiaggia pi&ugrave; veloce del pianeta.', 4050, 'it', 1),
(1693, 'En la ciudad holandesa Wervershoof hay una playa de arena llamada Strand Het Nesbos, que se encuentra a orillas del lago IJsselmeer. Es una playa familiar con parques infantiles, &aacute;rboles grandes y sombreados y con un agua poco profunda. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n pertenece a la regi&oacute;n de Holanda Septentrional. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a la playa con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y se puede aparcar en una gran plaza de aparcamiento a solo 30 m de la playa. El acceso a la playa es sencillo. La superficie principal es arena, pero tambi&eacute;n tienes algunos campos de c&eacute;sped si prefieres el c&eacute;sped como superficie principal de la playa. Es una playa plana con una longitud total de 200 my 30 m de ancho. La entrada de agua es agradable y debido a la poca profundidad del agua, el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; muy lejos. No tienes ninguna opci&oacute;n para comprar una bebida o comida en la playa, pero hay algunas opciones de alojamiento en los alrededores si quieres quedarte aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os, el navegador de playas m&aacute;s r&aacute;pido del planeta.', 4050, 'es', 1),
(1694, 'Dans la ville n&eacute;erlandaise de Wervershoof, il y a une plage de sable appel&eacute;e Strand Het Nesbos, qui est situ&eacute;e sur les rives du lac IJsselmeer. C&#39;est une plage familiale avec des aires de jeux pour enfants, de grands arbres ombrag&eacute;s et avec une eau peu profonde. Cet emplacement appartient &agrave; la r&eacute;gion Noord-Holland. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer sur un grand parking &agrave; seulement 30 m de la plage. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est facile. La surface principale est du sable, mais vous avez &eacute;galement des champs d&#39;herbe si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez l&#39;herbe comme surface principale de votre plage. C&#39;est une plage plate d&#39;une longueur totale de 200 m et d&#39;une largeur de 30 m. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et &agrave; cause de l&#39;eau peu profonde, le point de baignade est &eacute;loign&eacute;. Vous n&#39;avez pas la possibilit&eacute; d&#39;acheter un verre ou de la nourriture sur la plage, mais il existe des options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement dans les environs si vous souhaitez rester ici plus longtemps. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, le navigateur de plage le plus rapide de la plan&egrave;te.', 4050, 'fr', 1),
(1695, 'In der niederl&auml;ndischen Stadt Wervershoof gibt es einen Sandstrand namens Strand Het Nesbos, der sich am Ufer des IJsselmeer-Sees befindet. Es ist ein Familienstrand mit Kinderspielpl&auml;tzen, gro&szlig;en und schattigen B&auml;umen und flachem Wasser. Dieser Standort geh&ouml;rt zur Region Nord-Holland. Es ist sehr einfach, den Strand mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken, der nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt ist. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch einige Rasenfl&auml;chen, wenn Sie das Gras als Hauptstrandoberfl&auml;che bevorzugen. Es ist ein flacher Strand mit einer Gesamtl&auml;nge von 200 m und einer Breite von 30 m. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und wegen des flachen Wassers ist der Schwimmpunkt weit weg. Sie haben keine M&ouml;glichkeit, am Strand ein Getr&auml;nk oder Speise zu kaufen, aber es gibt einige Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten in der N&auml;he, wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, den schnellsten Strandbrowser der Welt.', 4050, 'de', 1),
(1696, 'Dans la r&eacute;gion n&eacute;erlandaise Noord-Holland, au bord du lac IJsselmeer, il y a une ville Medemblik. Bien qu&#39;il ne soit pas situ&eacute; sur le littoral de la mer du Nord, il a deux belles plages de sable &agrave; offrir &agrave; ses visiteurs. Vous pouvez vous rendre &agrave; cet endroit avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez laisser votre voiture sur un grand parking &agrave; seulement 100 m&egrave;tres de la plage. La premi&egrave;re, la plage Strand Vlietsingel Poel, est un peu plus petite que la seconde, mais elle est plus proche du parking. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est facile. Cette beaut&eacute; sablonneuse mesure 75 m de long et 20 m de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; cause de l&#39;eau peu profonde loin. Vous avez aussi un peu de champs d&#39;herbe ici, peut-&ecirc;tre que vous les pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez &agrave; la place du sable. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, il y a des infrastructures de plage de base. Vous avez &eacute;galement un restaurant et le bar de la plage &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la plage. Des h&eacute;bergements sont &eacute;galement disponibles &agrave; proximit&eacute;, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements et d&#39;h&ocirc;tels. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, le navigateur de plage le plus rapide de la plan&egrave;te.', 4051, 'fr', 1),
(1697, 'En la regi&oacute;n holandesa de Noord-Holland, junto al lago IJsselmeer, hay una ciudad Medemblik. Aunque no se encuentra en la costa del Mar del Norte, tiene dos hermosas playas de arena para ofrecer a sus visitantes. Puede llegar a este lugar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y puede dejar su coche en un amplio aparcamiento a solo 100 metros de la playa. La primera, la playa Strand Vlietsingel Poel, es un poco m&aacute;s peque&ntilde;a que la segunda, pero est&aacute; m&aacute;s cerca del aparcamiento. El acceso a la playa es sencillo. Esta belleza arenosa tiene 75 m de largo y 20 m de ancho. La entrada de agua es agradable y el punto de nataci&oacute;n se debe al agua poco profunda que est&aacute; lejos. Tambi&eacute;n tienes un poco de campos de hierba aqu&iacute;, tal vez los prefieras en lugar de la arena. Cerca de la playa hay una infraestructura playera b&aacute;sica. Tambi&eacute;n tienes un restaurante y el chiringuito cerca de la playa. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible en los alrededores, principalmente en forma de apartamentos y hoteles. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os, el buscador de playas m&aacute;s r&aacute;pido del planeta.', 4051, 'es', 1),
(1698, 'Nella regione olandese Noord-Holland, sul lago IJsselmeer, c&#39;&egrave; una citt&agrave; Medemblik. Sebbene non si trovi sulla costa del Mare del Nord, ha due bellissime spiagge sabbiose da offrire ai suoi visitatori. &Egrave; possibile raggiungere questa localit&agrave; con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e lasciare l&#39;auto in un ampio parcheggio a soli 100 mt dalla spiaggia. La prima, la spiaggia Strand Vlietsingel Poel, &egrave; un po &#39;pi&ugrave; piccola della seconda, ma &egrave; pi&ugrave; vicina al parcheggio. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; facile. Questa bellezza sabbiosa &egrave; lunga 75 me larga 20 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; dovuto all&#39;acqua poco profonda in lontananza. Hai anche un po &#39;di campi in erba qui, forse li preferisci al posto della sabbia. Vicino alla spiaggia ci sono alcune infrastrutture di base della spiaggia. Hai anche un ristorante e il bar sulla spiaggia vicino alla spiaggia. Sono disponibili anche alloggi nelle vicinanze, principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti e hotel. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni, il browser spiaggia pi&ugrave; veloce del pianeta.', 4051, 'it', 1),
(1699, 'In der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Nordholland am IJsselmeer gibt es eine Stadt Medemblik. Obwohl es nicht an der K&uuml;ste der Nordsee liegt, bietet es seinen Strandbesuchern zwei wundersch&ouml;ne Sandstr&auml;nde. Sie k&ouml;nnen mit jedem Fahrzeug an diesen Ort gelangen und Ihr Auto auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz abstellen, der nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt ist. Der erste, der Strand Vlietsingel Poel, ist etwas kleiner als der zweite, liegt aber n&auml;her am Parkplatz. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach. Diese sandige Sch&ouml;nheit ist 75 m lang und 20 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt ist wegen des seichten Wassers weit weg. Sie haben hier auch ein bisschen Grasfelder, vielleicht bevorzugen Sie sie anstelle des Sandes. In der N&auml;he des Strandes gibt es einige grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur. Sie haben auch ein Restaurant und die Strandbar in Strandn&auml;he. Unterk&uuml;nfte sind auch in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Apartments und Hotels. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden, den schnellsten Strandbrowser der Welt.', 4051, 'de', 1),
(1700, 'Willkommen am Sandstrand Paralia Mirodato. Es liegt in der N&auml;he der kleinen Stadt Avdira in der griechischen Ostregion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier mit allen Arten von Fahrzeugen fahren und ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz erwartet Sie direkt vor dem Strand. Der Parkplatz ist asphaltiert und sehr gro&szlig;. Dieser Strand ist nicht sehr touristisch, es ist ruhiger und in der Umgebung des Strandes ist fast keine touristische Infrastruktur vorhanden. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehr als 1 Kilometer; es ist 100 Meter breit. Sie haben hier noch viel Strandinfrastruktur. Kinder, besonders kleine Kinder, werden diesen Strand lieben. Der Eintritt ins Wasser ist sehr flach, der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 75 Metern und es gibt viele Kinderspielpl&auml;tze und Sportpl&auml;tze. Wenn Sie ein Fan von Beachvolleyball sind, werden Sie diesen Sandstrand lieben. Restaurants und Strandbars sind ebenfalls hier und servieren Ihnen einige der besten griechischen Gerichte. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie in einem Hotel oder einer Wohnung &uuml;bernachten, die alle sehr nahe am Strand liegen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren griechischen Urlaub mit BeachRex.', 3406, 'de', 1),
(1701, 'Bienvenue sur la plage de sable Paralia Mirodato. Il est situ&eacute; &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la petite ville Avdira dans la r&eacute;gion orientale de la Gr&egrave;ce Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Vous pouvez conduire ici avec toutes sortes de v&eacute;hicules et une tr&egrave;s grande place de parking vous attend juste en face de la plage. Le parking est pav&eacute; et tr&egrave;s grand. Cette plage n&#39;est pas tr&egrave;s touristique, elle est plus calme et quasiment aucune infrastructure touristique n&#39;est pr&eacute;sente aux abords de la plage. La longueur totale de la plage est sup&eacute;rieure &agrave; 1 kilom&egrave;tre; c&#39;est une largeur de 100 m&egrave;tres. Vous avez encore beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage pr&eacute;sentes ici. Les enfants, en particulier les petits enfants adoreront cette plage. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s peu profonde, le point de baignade est &agrave; 75 m&egrave;tres, et il y a beaucoup d&#39;aires de jeux pour enfants et de terrains de sport autour. Si vous &ecirc;tes fan de beach-volley, vous allez adorer cette plage de sable. Des restaurants et des bars de plage se trouvent &eacute;galement ici et vous serviront de la meilleure cuisine grecque. Si vous souhaitez rester ici plus longtemps, vous pouvez s&eacute;journer dans un h&ocirc;tel ou dans un appartement, qui sont tous tr&egrave;s proches de la plage. Profitez de vos vacances grecques avec BeachRex.', 3406, 'fr', 1),
(1702, 'Bienvenido a la playa de arena Paralia Mirodato. Se encuentra cerca de la peque&ntilde;a ciudad de Avdira en la regi&oacute;n oriental griega Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Puede conducir aqu&iacute; con todo tipo de veh&iacute;culos y un lugar de estacionamiento muy grande lo espera justo en frente de la playa. El estacionamiento est&aacute; pavimentado y es muy amplio. Esta playa no es muy tur&iacute;stica, es m&aacute;s tranquila y casi no hay infraestructura tur&iacute;stica presente en los alrededores de la playa. La longitud total de la playa es de m&aacute;s de 1 kil&oacute;metro; tiene 100 metros de ancho. Todav&iacute;a tienes mucha infraestructura de playa presente aqu&iacute;. A los ni&ntilde;os, especialmente a los peque&ntilde;os, les encantar&aacute; esta playa. La entrada al agua es muy poco profunda, el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a 75 metros, y hay muchos parques infantiles y campos deportivos alrededor. Si eres fan&aacute;tico del voleibol de playa te encantar&aacute; esta playa de arena. Tambi&eacute;n hay restaurantes y chiringuitos que le servir&aacute;n de la mejor cocina griega. Si quieres quedarte m&aacute;s tiempo aqu&iacute; puedes alojarte en un hotel o en un apartamento, todos muy cerca de la playa. Disfrute de sus vacaciones en Grecia con BeachRex.', 3406, 'es', 1),
(1703, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia di sabbia Paralia Mirodato. Si trova vicino alla piccola citt&agrave; di Avdira nella regione greca orientale Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Puoi guidare qui con tutti i tipi di veicoli e un parcheggio molto ampio ti aspetta proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. Il parcheggio &egrave; asfaltato e molto ampio. Questa spiaggia non &egrave; molto turistica, &egrave; pi&ugrave; tranquilla e quasi nessuna infrastruttura turistica &egrave; presente nei dintorni della spiaggia. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; superiore a 1 chilometro; &egrave; largo 100 metri. Hai ancora molte infrastrutture da spiaggia presenti qui. I bambini, soprattutto i bambini piccoli, adoreranno questa spiaggia. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto basso, il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 75 metri e ci sono molti parchi giochi per bambini e campi sportivi intorno. Se sei un fan del beach volley adorerai questa spiaggia sabbiosa. Ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia sono anche qui e vi serviranno alcuni dei migliori piatti della cucina greca. Se desideri rimanere pi&ugrave; a lungo qui puoi soggiornare in un hotel o in un appartamento, tutti molto vicini alla spiaggia. Goditi la tua vacanza in Grecia con BeachRex.', 3406, 'it', 1),
(1705, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na pe&scaron;čeni plaži Paralia Mirodato. Nahaja se v bližini mesteca Avdira v gr&scaron;ki vzhodni regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Do plaže se lahko peljete z vsemi vrstami vozil, tik pred plažo pa vas čaka zelo veliko parkiri&scaron;če. Parkiri&scaron;če je tlakovano in zelo veliko. Ta plaža ni preveč turistična, je bolj mirna in v okolici plaže skorajda ni nobene turistične infrastrukture. Skupna dolžina plaže je več kot 1 kilometer; &scaron;iroka je 100 metrov. Na plaži imate na razpolago veliko plažne infrastrukture. Otroci, &scaron;e posebej majhni otroci bodo imeli radi to plažo. Vstop v vodo je zelo plitek, točka začetka plavanja je 75 metrov, na plaži pa se nahaja veliko otro&scaron;kih igri&scaron;č in &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č. Če ste ljubitelj odbojke na mivki, vam bo ta pe&scaron;čena plaža &scaron;e posebej v&scaron;eč. Tukaj so tudi restavracije in bari na plaži, ki vam bodo postregli z nekaterimi najbolj&scaron;imi gr&scaron;kimi jedmi. Če bi radi tu ostali dlje, lahko bivate v hotelu ali apartmaju, ki je zelo blizu plaže. Uživajte v svojih gr&scaron;kih počitnicah s BeachRex.', 3406, 'sl', 1),
(1706, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na pe&scaron;čeni plazi Paralia Mirodato. Nahaja se u blizini mesteca Avdira u grčkoj vzhodnoj regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Do plaže možete peljete sa svim vrstama vozil, tik pred plažo pa vas čaka vrlo veliko parkiri&scaron;te. Parkiri&scaron;če je tlakovano i vrlo veliko. Ta plaža nije previ&scaron;e turistička, vi&scaron;e je mirna i blizu plaže su blizu ni turističke infrastrukture. Skupna dolinska plaža udaljena je vi&scaron;e od 1 kilometra; &scaron;iroka je 100 metrova. Na plaži imate na raspolaganju veliko planske infrastrukture. Otroci, jo&scaron; posebni mali&scaron;ani mogli bi imati radi to plažo. Vstop v vodo je vrlo plitek, točka početnog planiranja je 75 metara, na plažama se nalazi veliko dječje igrali&scaron;te u sportskim igrama. Če ste ljubitelj odbojke na mivki, vam bo ta pe&scaron;čana plaža jo&scaron; posebno v&scaron;eč. Tukaj tako i restauracije i bari na plažama, koji će vam postregli s nekakvim najboljim gr&scaron;kim jedima. Ako biste radili na ostalim dijelovima, možete bivati ​​u hotelima ili apartmanima, koji su vrlo blizu plaže. Uživajte u svojih grčkih počitnicah s BeachRex.', 3406, 'hr', 1),
(1708, 'Willkommen am wundersch&ouml;nen Sandstrand Paralia Mangana. Wenn Sie Sand am Strand lieben, werden Sie sich hier wie zu Hause f&uuml;hlen. Dieser Strand befindet sich in der griechischen Grafschaft Topeiros, die sich im &ouml;stlichen Teil Griechenlands in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki befindet. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehr als 1 Kilometer und ist sehr breit, mehr als 100 m, so dass Sie wirklich viel Platz haben, um einen Platz f&uuml;r Sie zu finden. Der Parkplatz befindet sich direkt vor dem Strand, ist sehr gro&szlig; und auch f&uuml;r Wohnmobile sehr gut geeignet. Der Strand ist von einem Sumpf umgeben, erwarten Sie also keine Unterkunft in der N&auml;he. Obwohl es so weit von jeder Tourismusbranche entfernt ist, gibt es hier wirklich viel Strandinfrastruktur, einschlie&szlig;lich Beachvolleyballfeldern. Wenn Sie hungrig oder durstig werden, k&ouml;nnen Sie direkt am Strand in einer Strandbar griechische K&uuml;che genie&szlig;en. Das Schwimmen kann nach 30 m Eintritt ins Wasser erfolgen. Und denken Sie daran, genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandurlaub immer mit BeachRex.', 3407, 'de', 1),
(1709, 'Bienvenue sur la magnifique plage de sable Paralia Mangana. Si vous aimez le sable sur la plage, vous vous sentirez ici, comme &agrave; la maison. Cette plage est situ&eacute;e dans le comt&eacute; grec de Topeiros, qui est situ&eacute; dans la partie orientale de la Gr&egrave;ce dans la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. La longueur totale de la plage est de plus d&#39;un kilom&egrave;tre et elle est tr&egrave;s large, plus de 100 m, vous avez donc vraiment beaucoup d&#39;espace pour trouver une place pour vous. L&#39;espace de stationnement est situ&eacute; directement en face de la plage, il est tr&egrave;s grand et convient parfaitement aux camping-cars. La plage est entour&eacute;e d &#39;un marais, alors ne vous attendez pas &agrave; un h&eacute;bergement dans les environs. Bien qu&#39;il soit si &eacute;loign&eacute; de toute industrie touristique, vous avez vraiment beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage ici, terrains de beach-volley inclus. Si vous avez faim ou soif, vous pourrez d&eacute;guster une cuisine grecque directement sur la plage dans un bar de plage. La baignade peut se faire apr&egrave;s 30m d&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, profitez toujours de vos vacances &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex.', 3407, 'fr', 1),
(1710, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenido a la hermosa playa de arena Paralia Mangana. Si te encanta la arena de la playa, aqu&iacute; te sentir&aacute;s como en casa. Esta playa se encuentra en el condado griego de Topeiros, que se encuentra en la parte oriental de Grecia en la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. La longitud total de la playa es de m&aacute;s de 1 kil&oacute;metro y es muy ancha, m&aacute;s de 100 m, por lo que realmente tienes mucho espacio para encontrar un lugar para ti. La plaza de aparcamiento est&aacute; situada directamente en frente de la playa, es muy amplia y muy apta tambi&eacute;n para autocaravanas. La playa est&aacute; rodeada de un pantano, por lo que no espere alojamiento en los alrededores. Aunque est&aacute; tan alejado de cualquier industria tur&iacute;stica, realmente tiene mucha infraestructura de playa aqu&iacute;, incluidos los campos de voleibol de playa. Si tiene hambre o sed, puede disfrutar de la cocina griega en la playa en un chiringuito. Se puede nadar despu&eacute;s de 30 m de la entrada al agua. Y recuerda, disfruta siempre de tus vacaciones en la playa con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3407, 'es', 1),
(1711, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Benvenuti nella bellissima spiaggia di sabbia Paralia Mangana. Se ami la sabbia in spiaggia ti sentirai qui, come a casa. Questa spiaggia si trova nella contea greca di Topeiros, che si trova nella parte orientale della Grecia nella regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; pi&ugrave; di 1 chilometro ed &egrave; molto ampia, pi&ugrave; di 100 m, quindi hai davvero molto spazio per trovare un posto per te. Il parcheggio si trova direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, &egrave; molto ampio, ed &egrave; molto adatto anche per i camper. La spiaggia &egrave; circondata da una palude, quindi non aspettatevi alloggi nelle vicinanze. Sebbene sia cos&igrave; lontano da qualsiasi industria turistica, qui hai davvero molte infrastrutture da spiaggia, compresi i campi da beach volley. Se hai fame o sete, puoi gustare della cucina greca direttamente sulla spiaggia in un bar sulla spiaggia. Si pu&ograve; nuotare dopo 30 m dall&#39;entrata in acqua. E ricorda, goditi sempre la tua vacanza al mare con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3407, 'it', 1),
(1712, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na prekrasnu pje&scaron;čanu plažu Paralia Mangana. Ako volite pijesak na plaži, ovdje ćete se osjećati kao kod kuće. Ova se plaža nalazi u grčkoj općini Topeiros, smje&scaron;tenoj u istočnom dijelu Grčke u regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Ukupna dužina plaže je vi&scaron;e od 1 kilometra, vrlo je &scaron;iroka, vi&scaron;e od 100 metara, tako da zaista imate dovoljno mjesta da pronađete mjesto za vas. Parkirali&scaron;te se nalazi neposredno ispred plaže, vrlo je veliko i pogodno je i za kamp kućice. Plaža je okružena močvarama, pa ne očekujte smje&scaron;taj u blizini. Iako je toliko udaljen od bilo koje turističke industrije, ovdje zaista imate puno infrastrukture za plažu, uključujući terene za odbojku na pijesku. Ako ogladnite ili ožednite, možete uživati ​​u grčkoj kuhinji u baru na plaži. Plivanje je moguće nakon 30 m ulaska u vodu. I ne zaboravite, uvijek uživajte u odmoru na plaži uz BeachRex.</div>\n', 3407, 'hr', 1),
(1713, 'Willkommen am sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand der Stadt Keramoti. Es befindet sich im &ouml;stlichen Teil Griechenlands in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Wenn Sie die Nachbarinsel Thassos besuchen m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie vom Hafen aus, der sehr nahe am Strand liegt, eine F&auml;hre nehmen. Um mit einem Fahrzeug zum Strand zu gelangen, ist auch ein Wohnmobil sehr einfach und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz direkt vor dem Strand. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, stehen Ihnen insgesamt mehr als 1000 Meter Strandl&auml;nge und mehr als 100 Meter Strandbreite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wenn Sie einen nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten am Strand bevorzugen, haben Sie hier viel davon zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist hier nicht nur einfach, sondern auch fortgeschrittener. Sie haben sogar einige Sportpl&auml;tze. Einige Strandbars und Restaurants befinden sich ebenfalls direkt am Strand. Sobald Sie Ihre Strandzeit beendet haben, k&ouml;nnen Sie die Stadt besuchen, in der Sie noch mehr Gesch&auml;fte, Bars und M&auml;rkte finden. Die Unterk&uuml;nfte befinden sich in unmittelbarer N&auml;he des Strandes, einige weniger als 100 Meter entfernt, &uuml;berwiegend Apartments und einige Hotels. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden.', 3408, 'de', 1),
(1714, 'Bienvenue sur la magnifique plage de sable de la ville de Keramoti. Il est situ&eacute; dans la partie orientale de la Gr&egrave;ce dans la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Si vous souhaitez visiter l&#39;&icirc;le voisine de Thassos, vous pouvez embarquer sur un ferry depuis le port qui est tr&egrave;s proche de la plage. Pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage avec un v&eacute;hicule, un camping-car est &eacute;galement tr&egrave;s facile et vous avez une tr&egrave;s grande place de parking juste en face de la plage. Une fois que vous &ecirc;tes sur la plage, vous avez un total de plus de 1000 m&egrave;tres de longueur de plage et plus de 100 m&egrave;tres de largeur de plage disponibles. Si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez une ombre naturelle sur la plage, vous en avez beaucoup ici. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage est ici non seulement basique, mais plus avanc&eacute;e, vous avez m&ecirc;me des terrains de sport. Quelques bars et restaurants de plage sont &eacute;galement disponibles directement sur la plage. Une fois que vous avez termin&eacute; votre temps de plage, vous pouvez visiter la ville o&ugrave; vous trouverez encore plus de boutiques, de bars et de march&eacute;s. Les h&eacute;bergements sont disponibles tr&egrave;s pr&egrave;s de la plage, certains &agrave; moins de 100 m&egrave;tres, principalement des appartements et quelques h&ocirc;tels. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre plage parfaite.', 3408, 'fr', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1715, 'Bienvenido a la hermosa playa de arena de la ciudad de Keramoti. Se encuentra en la parte oriental de Grecia en la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Si desea visitar la isla vecina de Tasos, puede embarcarse en un ferry desde el puerto, que est&aacute; muy cerca de la playa. Para acceder a la playa con un veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n una autocaravana es muy f&aacute;cil y tienes una plaza de aparcamiento muy grande justo en frente de la playa. Una vez que est&eacute; en la playa, tiene un total de m&aacute;s de 1000 metros de longitud de playa y m&aacute;s de 100 metros de ancho de playa disponible. Si prefiere un poco de sombra natural en la playa, aqu&iacute; tiene un mont&oacute;n de ese tipo. La infraestructura de la playa aqu&iacute; no solo es b&aacute;sica, sino m&aacute;s avanzada, incluso tienes algunos campos deportivos. Algunos bares de playa y restaurantes tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa. Una vez que termine su tiempo de playa, puede visitar la ciudad donde encontrar&aacute; a&uacute;n m&aacute;s tiendas, bares y mercados. Los alojamientos est&aacute;n disponibles muy cerca de la playa, algunos a menos de 100 metros de distancia, predominantemente apartamentos y algunos hoteles. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta.', 3408, 'es', 1),
(1716, 'Benvenuti nella bellissima spiaggia sabbiosa della citt&agrave; di Keramoti. Si trova nella parte orientale della Grecia nella regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Se desideri visitare la vicina isola di Taso, puoi imbarcarti su un traghetto dal porto che &egrave; molto vicino alla spiaggia. Per accedere alla spiaggia con un veicolo, anche un camper &egrave; molto semplice e hai un parcheggio molto ampio proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. Una volta che sei in spiaggia, hai a disposizione un totale di pi&ugrave; di 1000 metri di lunghezza della spiaggia e 100 metri pi&ugrave; di larghezza della spiaggia. Se preferisci un po &#39;di ombra naturale sulla spiaggia, qui ne hai in abbondanza. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia qui non &egrave; solo di base, ma pi&ugrave; avanzata, hai anche alcuni campi sportivi. Alcuni bar e ristoranti sulla spiaggia sono anche disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. Una volta terminato il tempo in spiaggia, puoi visitare la citt&agrave; dove troverai ancora pi&ugrave; negozi, bar e mercati. Gli alloggi sono disponibili molto vicino alla spiaggia, alcuni a meno di 100 metri, prevalentemente appartamenti e alcuni hotel. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta.', 3408, 'it', 1),
(1718, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na čudoviti pe&scaron;čeni plaži mesta Keramoti. Nahaja se v vzhodnem delu Grčije v regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Če bi radi obiskali sosednji otok Thassos, se lahko iz pristani&scaron;ča, ki je zelo blizu plaže, vkrcate na trajekt. Do plaže lahko pridete enostavno z vozilom, tudi avtodomom, kjer imate zelo veliko parkiri&scaron;če tik pred plažo. Ko ste na plaži, imate na voljo več kot 1000 metrov dolžine plaže in 100 metrov plus &scaron;irine plaže. Če imate radi naravno senco na plaži, je imate tukaj resnično veliko na voljo. Infrastruktura na plaži tukaj ni samo osnovna, ampak tudi naprednej&scaron;a, imate celo nekaj &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č. Nekaj ​​barov in restavracij na plaži je na voljo tudi neposredno na plaži. Ko končate s plažo, lahko obi&scaron;čete mesto, kjer boste na&scaron;li &scaron;e več trgovin, barov in tržnic. Nastanitve so na voljo zelo blizu plaže, nekatere so oddaljene manj kot 100 metrov, pretežno apartmaji in nekaj hotelov. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, da najdete svojo popolno plažo.', 3408, 'sl', 1),
(1719, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na prekrasnu pje&scaron;čanu plažu Keramoti. Smje&scaron;teno je u istočnom dijelu Grčke u regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Ako želite posjetiti susjedni otok Tasos, možete se ukrcati na trajekt iz luke koja je vrlo blizu plaže. Do plaže možete lako doći automobilom, uključujući i kućicu na točkovima, gdje imate vrlo veliko parkirali&scaron;te ispred plaže. Kada ste na plaži, na raspolaganju vam je vi&scaron;e od 1000 metara dužine plaže i 100 metara plus &scaron;irina plaže. Ako volite prirodnu hladovinu na plaži, ovdje vam je zaista mnogo dostupno. Infrastruktura na plaži ovdje nije samo osnovna već i naprednija, čak imate nekoliko sportskih terena. Neki plažni barovi i restorani također su dostupni izravno na plaži. Kad zavr&scaron;ite s plažom, možete posjetiti mjesto gdje ćete pronaći jo&scaron; vi&scaron;e trgovina, barova i tržnica. Smje&scaron;taj je dostupan vrlo blizu plaže, neki su udaljeni manje od 100 metara, uglavnom apartmani i nekoliko hotela. I ne zaboravite, uvijek upotrijebite BeachRex kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju savr&scaron;enu plažu.', 3408, 'hr', 1),
(1720, 'Wenn Sie nach einem sch&ouml;nen kleinen Sandstrand in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki suchen, sollten Sie den griechischen Strand Paralia Nea Peramos Kavalas besuchen. Es ist ein wahrer Stadtstrand mit viel Strandinfrastruktur, Strandbars und nat&uuml;rlich vielen sehr nahe gelegenen Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften. Dieser Strand ist der Hauptstrand im Dorf Nea Peramos. Sie haben hier viel braunen Sand, eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehr als 1 km, aber nur 10 Meter Breite. Viele Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten stehen zur Verf&uuml;gung, einige direkt vor dem Strand. Die Umgebung ist sehr touristisch, so dass Sie viele verschiedene Restaurants und Strandbars besuchen k&ouml;nnen. Unterkunft, meist als Apartments und Hotels ist in der N&auml;he. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist ebenfalls auf einem hohen Niveau und Sie haben viele Strandservices zur Verf&uuml;gung. F&uuml;r Kinder gibt es auch einen Spielplatz sowie einige Sportpl&auml;tze f&uuml;r diejenigen, die gerne Beachvolleyball spielen. Die Strandneigung ist normal, aber der Schwimmpunkt beginnt sehr schnell. Sie k&ouml;nnen bereits nach 5 Metern nach dem Eintritt ins Wasser wegschwimmen. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden.', 3416, 'de', 1),
(1721, 'Si est&aacute; buscando una bonita playa de arena de un peque&ntilde;o pueblo, ubicada en la regi&oacute;n de Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, debe visitar la playa griega Paralia Nea Peramos Kavalas. Es una verdadera playa urbana con mucha infraestructura de playa, chiringuitos y, por supuesto, muchos tipos de alojamiento muy cercanos. Esta playa es la playa principal del pueblo Nea Peramos. Aqu&iacute; tienes mucha arena marr&oacute;n, una longitud total de m&aacute;s de 1 km, pero solo 10 metros de ancho. Hay muchas opciones de parques disponibles, algunas directamente frente a la playa. Los alrededores son muy tur&iacute;sticos, por lo que puede visitar diferentes restaurantes y chiringuitos. En las inmediaciones se dispone de alojamiento, principalmente en forma de apartamentos y hoteles. La infraestructura de la playa tambi&eacute;n es de alto nivel y tiene muchos servicios de playa disponibles. Para los ni&ntilde;os tambi&eacute;n hay un parque infantil, as&iacute; como algunas canchas deportivas para los que les guste disfrutar del voleibol de playa. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es normal, pero el punto de nataci&oacute;n comienza muy r&aacute;pido, ya se puede nadar despu&eacute;s de solo 5 metros despu&eacute;s de ingresar al agua. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta.', 3416, 'es', 1),
(1722, 'Si vous cherchez une jolie petite plage de sable de village, situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion d&#39;Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, vous devriez visiter la plage grecque Paralia Nea Peramos Kavalas. C&#39;est une vraie plage de la ville avec de nombreuses infrastructures de plage, des bars de plage et bien s&ucirc;r de nombreux types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement tr&egrave;s proches. Cette plage est la plage principale du village de Nea Peramos. Vous avez beaucoup de sable brun ici, une longueur totale de plus de 1 km, mais seulement 10 m&egrave;tres de largeur. De nombreux parcs sont disponibles, certains directement en face de la plage. Les environs sont tr&egrave;s touristiques, vous pouvez donc visiter de nombreux restaurants et bars de plage. Des h&eacute;bergements, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements et d&#39;h&ocirc;tels, sont disponibles &agrave; proximit&eacute;. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage est &eacute;galement &agrave; un niveau &eacute;lev&eacute; et vous avez de nombreux services de plage disponibles. Pour les enfants, il y a aussi une aire de jeux, ainsi que des terrains de sport pour ceux qui aiment jouer au beach-volley. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est normale, mais le point de nage commence tr&egrave;s vite, vous pouvez d&eacute;j&agrave; nager apr&egrave;s seulement 5 m&egrave;tres apr&egrave;s &ecirc;tre entr&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre plage parfaite.', 3416, 'fr', 1),
(1723, 'Se stai cercando una bella spiaggia sabbiosa di un piccolo villaggio, situata nella regione di Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, dovresti visitare la spiaggia greca Paralia Nea Peramos Kavalas. &Egrave; una vera spiaggia cittadina con molte infrastrutture balneari, bar sulla spiaggia e, ovviamente, molti molto vicini per tipo di alloggio. Questa &egrave; la spiaggia principale del villaggio di Nea Peramos. Hai molta sabbia marrone qui, una lunghezza totale di oltre 1 km, ma solo 10 metri di larghezza. Sono disponibili molte opzioni di parco, alcune direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. I dintorni sono molto turistici, quindi puoi visitare molti diversi ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia. Alloggi, principalmente come appartamenti e hotel sono disponibili nelle vicinanze. Anche l&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; di alto livello e sono disponibili molti servizi di spiaggia. Per i bambini c&#39;&egrave; anche un parco giochi, oltre ad alcuni campi sportivi per chi ama il beach volley. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; normale, ma il punto di nuotata inizia molto velocemente, puoi nuotare via gi&agrave; dopo soli 5 metri dopo essere entrato in acqua. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta.', 3416, 'it', 1),
(1725, 'Če i&scaron;čete lepo majhno va&scaron;ko pe&scaron;čeno plažo, ki se nahaja v regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, obi&scaron;čite gr&scaron;ko plažo Paralia Nea Peramos Kavalas. To je prava mestna plaža z veliko infrastrukture na plaži, bari na plaži in seveda veliko različnih nastanitev v okolici. Ta plaža je glavna plaža v vasi Nea Peramos. Tu imate veliko rjavega peska, katerega skupna dolžina je več kot 1 km, a &scaron;irina le 10 metrov. Na voljo je veliko možnosti za parkiranje, nekatere neposredno pred plažo. Okolica je zelo turistična, zato lahko obi&scaron;čete &scaron;tevilne različne restavracije in bare na plaži. Namestitev, večinoma kot apartmaji in hoteli, so na voljo v bližini. Infrastruktura na plaži je prav tako na visoki ravni in na voljo imate &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži. Za otroke je na voljo tudi igri&scaron;če, pa tudi nekaj &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č za tiste, ki radi uživajo v odbojki na mivki. Nagib plaže je normalen, vendar se točka kopanja začne zelo hitro, odplavate lahko že po 5 metrih po vstopu v vodo. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, da najdete svojo popolno plažo.', 3416, 'sl', 1),
(1726, 'Ako tražite lijepu malu seosku pje&scaron;čanu plažu smje&scaron;tenu u regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, posjetite grčku plažu Paralia Nea Peramos Kavalas. Ovo je prava gradska plaža s puno infrastrukture na plaži, barovima na plaži i naravno puno različitih smje&scaron;taja na tom području. Ova je plaža glavna plaža u selu Nea Peramos. Ovdje imate puno smeđeg pijeska, čija je ukupna duljina veća od 1 km, ali &scaron;irina je samo 10 metara. Postoji mnogo mogućnosti parkiranja, neke direktno ispred plaže. Okolica je vrlo turistička, pa možete posjetiti mnogo različitih restorana i barova na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj, uglavnom kao apartmani i hoteli, dostupan je u blizini. Infrastruktura na plaži je također na visokoj razini, a na plaži su vam na raspolaganju brojne usluge. Tu je i igrali&scaron;te za djecu, kao i neki sportski tereni za one koji vole uživati ​​u odbojci na pijesku. Nagib plaže je normalan, ali kupali&scaron;te započinje vrlo brzo, možete plivati ​​već 5 metara nakon ulaska u vodu. I ne zaboravite, uvijek upotrijebite BeachRex kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju savr&scaron;enu plažu.', 3416, 'hr', 1),
(1727, 'Wie w&auml;re es mit einem griechischen Sandstrand, an dem Sie Ihr Wohnmobil oder ein anderes Fahrzeug direkt vor dem Strand parken k&ouml;nnen. Wenn Sie nach einem solchen Strand in der griechischen Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand paralia Vrisi zu besuchen. Der Parkplatz hier ist sehr flach und sehr breit, man hat wirklich viel Platz zum Parken. Hier gibt es eine Strandinfrastruktur, einen Kinderspielplatz und einen Sportplatz. Eine Strandbar ist auch hier. Und wie es in Griechenland &uuml;blich ist, k&ouml;nnen Sie auch Ihren Hund mit an den Strand nehmen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehr als 1 km, es ist auch ziemlich breit, 30 Meter. Es hat eine normale Neigung und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bereits 5 Meter nach dem Eintritt ins Wasser. Hier gibt es keinen nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten, bringen Sie also Ihre Sonnenschirme mit oder mieten Sie sie am Strand. Unterkunft ist hier verf&uuml;gbar, aber nicht in der N&auml;he des Strandes. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3419, 'de', 1),
(1728, '&iquest;Qu&eacute; tal una playa de arena griega donde puedes aparcar tu autocaravana, o cualquier otro veh&iacute;culo justo en frente de la playa? Si est&aacute; buscando una playa de este tipo en la regi&oacute;n griega Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, le recomendamos que visite la playa paralia Vrisi. El estacionamiento aqu&iacute; es muy plano y muy amplio, realmente tienes mucho espacio para estacionar. Aqu&iacute; hay algo de infraestructura de playa, un parque infantil y un campo de deportes incluidos. Tambi&eacute;n hay un bar en la playa. Y como es habitual en Grecia, tambi&eacute;n puedes llevar a tu perro a la playa. La longitud total de la playa es de m&aacute;s de 1 km, tambi&eacute;n es bastante ancha, 30 metros. Tiene una inclinaci&oacute;n normal y el punto de nado ya est&aacute; a 5 metros despu&eacute;s de entrar al agua. Aqu&iacute; no hay sombra natural, as&iacute; que traiga sus sombrillas o alquilelas en la playa. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;, pero no cerca de la playa. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3419, 'es', 1),
(1729, 'Que diriez-vous d&#39;une plage de sable grecque o&ugrave; vous pouvez garer votre camping-car ou tout autre v&eacute;hicule juste en face de la plage. Si vous recherchez une telle plage dans la r&eacute;gion grecque Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage paralia Vrisi. Le parking ici est tr&egrave;s plat et tr&egrave;s large, vous avez vraiment beaucoup d&#39;espace pour vous garer. Certaines infrastructures de plage sont pr&eacute;sentes ici, une aire de jeux pour enfants et un terrain de sport inclus. Un bar de plage est &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sent. Et comme d&#39;habitude en Gr&egrave;ce, vous pouvez &eacute;galement emmener votre chien avec vous &agrave; la plage. La longueur totale de la plage est de plus de 1 km, elle est &eacute;galement assez large, 30 m&egrave;tres. Il a une inclinaison normale et le point de nage est d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 5 m&egrave;tres apr&egrave;s &ecirc;tre entr&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. Il n&#39;y a pas d&#39;ombre naturelle, alors apportez vos parasols avec vous ou louez-les &agrave; la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible ici, mais pas &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la plage. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3419, 'fr', 1),
(1730, 'Che ne dici di una spiaggia di sabbia greca dove puoi parcheggiare il tuo camper o qualsiasi altro veicolo proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. Se stai cercando una spiaggia del genere nella regione greca Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia paralia Vrisi. Il parcheggio qui &egrave; molto piatto e molto ampio, hai davvero molto spazio per parcheggiare. Alcune infrastrutture balneari sono presenti qui, un parco giochi per bambini e un campo sportivo inclusi. C&#39;&egrave; anche un bar sulla spiaggia. E come di consueto in Grecia puoi portare con te anche il tuo cane in spiaggia. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di oltre 1 km, &egrave; anche abbastanza ampia, 30 metri. Ha un&#39;inclinazione normale e il punto di balneazione &egrave; gi&agrave; a 5 metri dopo essere entrati in acqua. Non c&#39;&egrave; ombra naturale, quindi porta con te gli ombrelloni o noleggiali in spiaggia. La sistemazione &egrave; disponibile qui, ma non vicino alla spiaggia. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3419, 'it', 1),
(1732, 'Kaj pa gr&scaron;ka pe&scaron;čena plaža, kjer lahko parkirate svoj avtodom ali katero koli drugo vozilo tik pred plažo. Če i&scaron;čete tak&scaron;no plažo v gr&scaron;ki regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, vam priporočamo, da obi&scaron;čete plažo paralia Vrisi. Tu je parkiri&scaron;če zelo ravno in zelo &scaron;iroko, prostora za parkiranje imate res veliko. Tu je prisotne nekaj plažne infrastrukture, otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če in &scaron;portno igri&scaron;če. Tu je tudi bar na plaži. In kot je običajno v Grčiji, lahko tudi svojega psa pripeljete s seboj na plažo. Skupna dolžina plaže je več kot 1 km, prav tako je precej &scaron;iroka, 30 metrov. Ima normalen naklon in točka kopanja je že 5 metrov po vstopu v vodo. Tu ni naravne sence, zato senčnike imejte s seboj ali si jih izposodite na plaži. Nastanitev je tudi na voljo, vendar ne blizu plaže. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, da najdete svojo sanjsko plažo.', 3419, 'sl', 1),
(1733, '&Scaron;to je s grčkom pje&scaron;čanom plažom na kojoj možete parkirati svoj kamper ili bilo koje drugo vozilo ispred plaže. Ako takvu plažu tražite u grčkoj regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, preporučujemo vam da posjetite plažu paralia Vrisi. Ovdje je parkirali&scaron;te vrlo ravno i vrlo &scaron;iroko, imate puno parking mjesta. Postoji ne&scaron;to infrastrukture za plažu, dječje igrali&scaron;te i sportsko igrali&scaron;te. Tu je i bar na plaži. Kao i obično u Grčkoj, na plažu možete povesti i svog psa. Ukupna dužina plaže je vi&scaron;e od 1 km, također je prilično &scaron;iroka, 30 metara. Ima normalan nagib, a točka kopanja je već 5 metara nakon ulaska u vodu. Ovdje nema prirodne hladovine, pa ponesite sa sobom ki&scaron;obrane ili ih unajmite na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj je također dostupan, ali ne u blizini plaže. I ne zaboravite, uvijek koristite BeachRex da biste prona&scaron;li plažu iz snova.', 3419, 'hr', 1),
(1734, 'Wenn Sie nach einem mediterranen Land mit vielen sch&ouml;nen Str&auml;nden suchen, k&ouml;nnen Sie mit Griechenland nichts falsch machen. Es ist bekannt, dass die Str&auml;nde Griechenlands zumindest eine geringe Tourismusbranche rund um den Strand haben. Wenn Sie das Gegenteil m&ouml;gen, einen Strand ohne Tourismusbranche, einen echten Abenteurerstrand, empfehlen wir Ihnen, die Paralia Akrotirir Apollonias zu besuchen. Es befindet sich im &ouml;stlichen Teil Griechenlands in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Am Strand gibt es praktisch keine Strandinfrastruktur, au&szlig;er dem Parkplatz, der aus Schmutz besteht. Sie k&ouml;nnen fast direkt vor dem Strand parken. Am Strand selbst gibt es eine Mischung aus Sand und Felsen, und einige Teile am Strand k&ouml;nnen aufgrund der nassen Felsen rutschig sein. Der Wassereintritt ist einfach, au&szlig;er wo es Felsen gibt. Hunde werden diesen Ort lieben. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 500 Meter, er ist 25 Meter breit, hat eine normale Neigung und Sie k&ouml;nnen bereits nach nur 3 Metern Wassereintritt mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Einige Teile des Strandes sind auch den Nudisten vorbehalten. Bringen Sie all Ihre Speisen und Getr&auml;nke mit, denn hier gibt es keine Strandbars oder Restaurants. Das gleiche gilt auch f&uuml;r die Unterkunft, keine ist in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3418, 'de', 1),
(1735, 'Si est&aacute; buscando un pa&iacute;s mediterr&aacute;neo con muchas playas hermosas, no puede equivocarse con Grecia. Se sabe que las playas de Grecia tienen al menos un peque&ntilde;o nivel de industria tur&iacute;stica alrededor de la playa. Pues si te gusta lo contrario, una playa sin industria tur&iacute;stica, una verdadera playa aventurera, te recomendamos que visites la paralia Akrotirir Apollonias. Se encuentra en la parte oriental de Grecia en la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. En la playa no tienes pr&aacute;cticamente ninguna infraestructura de playa, excepto el estacionamiento, que consiste en tierra. Se puede estacionar casi directamente en frente de la playa. En la playa misma hay una mezcla de arena y rocas, y algunas partes de la playa pueden estar resbaladizas debido a las rocas mojadas. La entrada de agua es f&aacute;cil, excepto donde hay rocas. A los perros les encantar&aacute; este lugar. La longitud total de la playa es de 500 metros, tiene 25 metros de ancho, tiene una inclinaci&oacute;n normal y ya puedes empezar a nadar despu&eacute;s de solo 3 metros de entrar al agua. Algunas partes de la playa tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n reservadas para los nudistas. Traiga toda su comida y bebida, porque aqu&iacute; no hay chiringuitos ni restaurantes. Lo mismo ocurre con el alojamiento, no hay ninguno disponible en las inmediaciones. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3418, 'es', 1),
(1736, 'Se stai cercando un paese mediterraneo con tante belle spiagge, non puoi sbagliare con la Grecia. Le spiagge della Grecia sono note per avere almeno un piccolo livello di industria del turismo intorno alla spiaggia. Bene, se ti piace il contrario, una spiaggia senza industria turistica, una vera spiaggia avventuriera, ti consigliamo di visitare la paralia Akrotirir Apollonias. Si trova nella parte orientale della Grecia nella regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Sulla spiaggia non hai praticamente nessuna infrastruttura balneare, tranne il parcheggio, che &egrave; costituito da terra battuta. &Egrave; possibile parcheggiare quasi direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia Sulla spiaggia stessa c&#39;&egrave; un misto di sabbia e rocce, e alcune parti della spiaggia potrebbero essere scivolose a causa delle rocce bagnate. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; facile, tranne dove ci sono rocce. I cani adoreranno questo posto. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 500 metri, &egrave; larga 25 metri, ha un&#39;inclinazione normale e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; dopo soli 3 metri dall&#39;ingresso in acqua. Alcune parti della spiaggia sono riservate anche ai nudisti. Porta con te tutto il cibo e le bevande, perch&eacute; qui non ci sono bar o ristoranti sulla spiaggia. Lo stesso vale anche per gli alloggi, nessuno &egrave; disponibile nelle vicinanze. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3418, 'it', 1),
(1737, 'Si vous recherchez un pays m&eacute;diterran&eacute;en avec beaucoup de belles plages, vous ne pouvez pas vous tromper avec la Gr&egrave;ce. Les plages de la Gr&egrave;ce sont connues pour avoir au moins un petit niveau d&#39;industrie touristique autour de la plage. Eh bien, si vous aimez le contraire, une plage sans industrie touristique, une vraie plage aventuri&egrave;re, nous vous recommandons de visiter le paralia Akrotirir Apollonias. Il est situ&eacute; dans la partie orientale de la Gr&egrave;ce dans la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Sur la plage, vous n&#39;avez pratiquement aucune infrastructure de plage, &agrave; l&#39;exception du parking, qui est en terre battue. Vous pouvez vous garer presque directement en face de la plage Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, il y a un m&eacute;lange de sable et de roches, et certaines parties de la plage pourraient &ecirc;tre glissantes &agrave; cause des roches humides. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est facile, sauf l&agrave; o&ugrave; il y a des rochers. Les chiens vont adorer cet endroit. La longueur totale de la plage est de 500 m&egrave;tres, elle mesure 25 m&egrave;tres de large, elle a une inclinaison normale et vous pouvez d&eacute;j&agrave; commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s seulement 3 m&egrave;tres d&#39;entrer dans l&#39;eau. Certaines parties de la plage sont &eacute;galement r&eacute;serv&eacute;es aux nudistes. Apportez toute votre nourriture et vos boissons avec vous, car il n&#39;y a ni bars de plage ni restaurants. Il en va de m&ecirc;me pour les h&eacute;bergements, aucun n&#39;est disponible &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3418, 'fr', 1),
(1750, 'Če i&scaron;čete sredozemsko državo z veliko čudovitimi plažami, z Grčijo ne morete zgre&scaron;iti. Znano je, da imajo gr&scaron;ke plaže okoli plaže vsaj nekaj turistične industrije. No, če vam je v&scaron;eč nasprotno, plaža brez turistične industrije, prava avanturistična plaža, vam priporočamo, da obi&scaron;čete plažo paralijo Akrotirir Apollonias. Nahaja se v vzhodnem delu Grčije v regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Na plaži nimate praktično nobene plažne infrastrukture, razen parkiri&scaron;ča, ki je sestavljeno iz trdega blata. Parkirate lahko skoraj neposredno pred plažo Na sami plaži je me&scaron;anica peska in kamenja, nekateri deli na plaži pa bi lahko bili mokri zaradi mokrih skal. Vstop v vodo je enostaven, razen tam, kjer so skale. Psom bo ta plaža zelo v&scaron;eč. Skupna dolžina plaže je 500 metrov, &scaron;iroka je 25 metrov, ima normalen naklon in plavati lahko začnete že po 3 metrih vstopa v vodo. Nekateri deli plaže so rezervirani tudi za nudiste. S seboj imejte vso hrano in pijačo, saj tukaj ni barov ali restavracij na plaži. Enako velja tudi za nastanitve, v bližini jih ni. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, da najdete svojo sanjsko plažo.', 3418, 'sl', 1),
(1751, 'Ako tražite mediteransku zemlju s puno prekrasnih plaža, s Grčkom ne možete pogrije&scaron;iti. Poznato je da grčke plaže imaju barem neku turističku industriju oko plaže. Pa, ako volite suprotno, plažu bez turističke industrije, pravu avanturističku plažu, preporučujemo vam da posjetite plažu Akrotirir Apollonias. Smje&scaron;teno je u istočnom dijelu Grčke u regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Na plaži praktički nemate infrastrukture za plažu, osim parkirali&scaron;ta koje se sastoji od tvrdog blata. Možete parkirati gotovo izravno ispred plaže Na samoj plaži mje&scaron;avina je pijeska i kamenja, a neki dijelovi plaže mogu biti mokri zbog vlažnih stijena. Ulazak u vodu je jednostavan, osim tamo gdje ima stijena. Psi će se svidjeti ovoj plaži. Ukupna dužina plaže je 500 metara, &scaron;iroka je 25 metara, ima normalan nagib i možete početi plivati ​​nakon 3 metra ulaska u vodu. Neki dijelovi plaže također su rezervirani za nudiste. Sa sobom ponesite svu hranu i piće, jer ovdje na plaži nema barova ili restorana. Isto vrijedi i za smje&scaron;taj, nema ih u blizini. I ne zaboravite, uvijek koristite BeachRex da biste prona&scaron;li plažu iz snova.', 3418, 'hr', 1),
(1752, 'Willkommen im Paralia Ofryniu, einem ganz besonderen Sandstrand. Wenn Sie nach Sandstr&auml;nden in Griechenland suchen, werden Sie bald feststellen, dass es viele gibt. In der Tat sind die meisten von ihnen ein Sandtyp. Die hier beschriebene befindet sich im &ouml;stlichen Teil Griechenlands in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Es ist der Hauptstrand im Dorf Paralia Ofryniou. Wie es in Griechenland &uuml;blich ist, ist auch dieser Strand mit einem Fahrzeug und einem Wohnmobil sehr leicht zu erreichen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand parken. Die Eigenschaften des Strandes sind fantastisch, es ist ein sehr langer Strand, mehr als 1 km, und es ist auch sehr breit, 75 Meter. Die Neigung am Strand ist normal, fast flach und der Badepunkt liegt bereits bei 3 Metern. Hier finden Sie viele Strandinfrastrukturen, hier stehen viele verschiedene Sportpl&auml;tze zur Verf&uuml;gung, nat&uuml;rlich der &uuml;bliche Beachvolleyball und nat&uuml;rlich ein Basketballfeld. An einigen Stellen gibt es sogar Gras und Sie haben einige B&auml;ume, die Sie vor der Sonne sch&uuml;tzen. Die Anzahl der Gesch&auml;fte und Bars ist unglaublich, es gibt so viele, Sie haben wirklich so viele K&uuml;chenoptionen, ein wahrer touristischer Ort. Sie werden diesen Ort einfach lieben. Und wenn Sie einen Hund besitzen, k&ouml;nnen Sie ihn auch an den Strand bringen. Hier m&uuml;ssen Sie sich keine Sorgen um eine Unterkunft machen, es stehen viele verschiedene Optionen zur Verf&uuml;gung, haupts&auml;chlich Apartments und einige Hotels. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3420, 'de', 1),
(1753, 'Bienvenido a Paralia Ofryniu, una playa de arena muy especial. Si est&aacute; buscando playas de arena en Grecia, pronto descubrir&aacute; que hay muchas. De hecho, la mayor&iacute;a de ellos son del tipo arena. El que estamos describiendo aqu&iacute; se encuentra en la parte oriental de Grecia, en la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Es la playa principal del pueblo Paralia Ofryniou. Como es habitual en Grecia, tambi&eacute;n esta playa es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con un tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n una autocaravana, y se puede aparcar directamente en frente de la playa. Las caracter&iacute;sticas de la playa son impresionantes, es una playa muy larga, m&aacute;s de 1 km, y tambi&eacute;n es muy ancha, 75 metros. La inclinaci&oacute;n en la playa es normal, casi plana y el punto de ba&ntilde;o ya est&aacute; a 3 metros. Aqu&iacute; encontrar&aacute; mucha infraestructura de playa, muchos campos deportivos diferentes est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, por supuesto, el habitual voleibol de playa y, por supuesto, un campo de baloncesto. En algunas partes incluso hay c&eacute;sped y hay algunos &aacute;rboles para protegerse del sol. La cantidad de tiendas y bares es incre&iacute;ble, hay tantas, realmente tienes tantas opciones gastron&oacute;micas, un verdadero lugar tur&iacute;stico. Te encantar&aacute; este lugar. Y si tienes un perro, puedes traerlo tambi&eacute;n a la playa. No hay necesidad de preocuparse por un alojamiento aqu&iacute;, hay muchas opciones diferentes disponibles, principalmente apartamentos y algunos hoteles. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3420, 'es', 1),
(1754, 'Bienvenido a Paralia Ofryniu, una playa de arena muy especial. Si est&aacute; buscando playas de arena en Grecia, pronto descubrir&aacute; que hay muchas. De hecho, la mayor&iacute;a de ellos son del tipo arena. El que estamos describiendo aqu&iacute; se encuentra en la parte oriental de Grecia, en la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Es la playa principal del pueblo Paralia Ofryniou. Como es habitual en Grecia, tambi&eacute;n esta playa es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con un tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n una autocaravana, y se puede aparcar directamente en frente de la playa. Las caracter&iacute;sticas de la playa son impresionantes, es una playa muy larga, m&aacute;s de 1 km, y tambi&eacute;n es muy ancha, 75 metros. La inclinaci&oacute;n en la playa es normal, casi plana y el punto de ba&ntilde;o ya est&aacute; a 3 metros. Aqu&iacute; encontrar&aacute; mucha infraestructura de playa, muchos campos deportivos diferentes est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, por supuesto, el habitual voleibol de playa y, por supuesto, un campo de baloncesto. En algunas partes incluso hay c&eacute;sped y hay algunos &aacute;rboles para protegerse del sol. La cantidad de tiendas y bares es incre&iacute;ble, hay tantas, realmente tienes tantas opciones gastron&oacute;micas, un verdadero lugar tur&iacute;stico. Te encantar&aacute; este lugar. Y si tienes un perro, puedes traerlo tambi&eacute;n a la playa. No hay necesidad de preocuparse por un alojamiento aqu&iacute;, hay muchas opciones diferentes disponibles, principalmente apartamentos y algunos hoteles. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3420, 'fr', 1),
(1755, 'Benvenuti a Paralia Ofryniu, una spiaggia sabbiosa molto speciale. Se stai cercando spiagge sabbiose in Grecia, scoprirai presto che ce ne sono molte. In effetti, la maggior parte di loro sono di tipo sabbia. Quello che stiamo descrivendo qui si trova nella parte orientale della Grecia, nella regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. &Egrave; la spiaggia principale del villaggio di Paralia Ofryniou. Come &egrave; consuetudine in Grecia, anche questa spiaggia &egrave; molto facilmente accessibile con e tipo di veicolo, anche un camper, e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare direttamente davanti alla spiaggia. Le caratteristiche della spiaggia sono fantastiche, &egrave; una spiaggia molto lunga, pi&ugrave; di 1 km, ed &egrave; anche molto ampia, 75 metri. L&#39;inclinazione sulla spiaggia &egrave; normale, quasi pianeggiante e il punto di balneazione &egrave; gi&agrave; a 3 metri. Qui troverai molte infrastrutture da spiaggia, molti campi sportivi diversi sono disponibili qui, ovviamente il solito beach volley e ovviamente un campo da basket. In alcune parti c&#39;&egrave; anche l&#39;erba e ci sono degli alberi per proteggerti dal sole. Il numero di negozi e bar &egrave; incredibile, ce ne sono cos&igrave; tanti, hai davvero cos&igrave; tante opzioni di cucina, un vero posto turistico. Amerai questo posto. E se possiedi un cane, puoi portarlo anche in spiaggia. Non c&#39;&egrave; bisogno di preoccuparsi di un alloggio qui, sono disponibili molte opzioni diverse, principalmente appartamenti e alcuni hotel. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3420, 'it', 1),
(1756, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na paraliji Ofryniu, prav posebni pe&scaron;čeni plaži. Če i&scaron;čete pe&scaron;čene plaže v Grčiji, boste kmalu ugotovili, da jih je veliko. Pravzaprav je večina peska. Ta, ki jo tukaj opisujemo, se nahaja v vzhodnem delu Grčije, v regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Je glavna plaža v vasi Paralia Ofryniou. Kot je običajno v Grčiji, je tudi ta plaža zelo lahko dostopna z vrsto vozila in tudi avtodomom, parkirate pa lahko neposredno pred plažo. Značilnosti plaže so izjemne, zelo dolga, več kot 1 km, zelo &scaron;iroka pa je tudi 75 metrov. Nagib na plaži je normalen, skoraj položen in plavalno mesto je že na 3 metrih. Tu boste na&scaron;li veliko infrastrukture za plaže, tukaj je na voljo veliko različnih &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č, seveda običajna odbojka na mivki in seveda igri&scaron;če za ko&scaron;arko. Na nekaterih delih je celo trava in nekaj dreves vas varuje pred soncem. &Scaron;tevilo trgovin in barov je neverjetno, toliko jih je, res imate toliko možnosti kulinarike, pravi turistični kraj. Ta kraj vam bo preprosto v&scaron;eč. In če ste lastnik psa, ga lahko pripeljete tudi na plažo. Za nastanitev tukaj ni treba skrbeti, na voljo je veliko različnih možnosti, večinoma apartmaji in nekateri hoteli. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, da najdete svojo sanjsko plažo.', 3420, 'sl', 1),
(1757, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li u Paraliju Ofryniu, vrlo posebnu pje&scaron;čanu plažu. Ako ste u potrazi za pje&scaron;čanim plažama u Grčkoj, uskoro ćete otkriti da ih ima mnogo. Zapravo je većina pijeska. Ovdje opisani nalazi se u istočnom dijelu Grčke, u regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. To je glavna plaža u selu Paralia Ofryniou. Kao &scaron;to je to uobičajeno u Grčkoj, ova je plaža također vrlo lako dostupna po tipu vozila, a također i po kamperima, a možete parkirati i neposredno ispred plaže. Karakteristike plaže su iznimne, vrlo duge, vi&scaron;e od 1 km i vrlo &scaron;iroke, čak 75 metara. Nagib na plaži je normalan, gotovo ravan, a kupali&scaron;te je već udaljeno 3 metra. Ovdje ćete naći puno infrastrukture za plaže, postoji mnogo različitih sportskih terena, naravno uobičajena odbojka na pijesku i naravno ko&scaron;arka&scaron;ko igrali&scaron;te. U nekim dijelovima ima čak i trave, a nekoliko stabala &scaron;titi vas od sunca. Broj trgovina i barova je nevjerojatan, toliko ih je, zaista imate toliko kulinarskih mogućnosti, pravo turističko odredi&scaron;te. Jednostavno ćete zavoljeti ovo mjesto. A ako ste vlasnik psa, možete ga i dovesti na plažu. Ovdje ne trebate brinuti o smje&scaron;taju, na raspolaganju je mnogo različitih opcija, uglavnom apartmana i nekih hotela. I ne zaboravite, uvijek koristite BeachRex kako biste prona&scaron;li plažu iz snova.', 3420, 'hr', 1),
(1761, 'In der N&auml;he der antiken griechischen Stadt Kavala befindet sich das kleine Touristendorf Paleo Tsifliki mit atemberaubenden Sandstr&auml;nden. Der Sand hat an den Str&auml;nden eine besondere gelbe Farbe, die wirklich einzigartig ist. Dieser Strand befindet sich in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki und ist mit Ihrem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen. Obwohl Sie keine sehr gro&szlig;en Parkpl&auml;tze in der N&auml;he haben, ist die h&auml;ufigste Art zu parken die Stra&szlig;e, aber Sie sollten sich der Tatsache bewusst sein, dass die Parkpl&auml;tze schwer zu finden sind. Diese sandige Sch&ouml;nheit ist von vielen Apartments und einigen sch&ouml;nen Restaurants umgeben. Am Strand gibt es auch eine Strandbar, in der Sie Liegest&uuml;hle und Sonnenschirme mieten k&ouml;nnen. Das Besondere an diesem Strand sind die Wellen, die auch zum Surfen oder f&uuml;r andere Wassersportarten genutzt werden k&ouml;nnen. Sie haben hier 100 Meter L&auml;nge zur Verf&uuml;gung und 20 Meter Breite, die Neigung am Strand ist ziemlich flach und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 20 Metern. Die Strandinfrastruktur am Strand ist anst&auml;ndig und Sie haben alle notwendigen Dienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wenn Sie nach einer Unterkunft suchen, befinden Sie sich in der N&auml;he, nur wenige Meter entfernt. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3414, 'de', 1),
(1762, 'Pr&egrave;s de l&#39;ancienne ville grecque de Kavala, il y a un petit village touristique, Paleo Tsifliki, avec de superbes plages de sable. Le sable a sur les plages une couleur jaune sp&eacute;ciale, vraiment unique. Cette plage est situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki et est facilement accessible avec votre v&eacute;hicule. Bien que vous n&#39;ayez pas de tr&egrave;s grandes places de parking &agrave; proximit&eacute;, le moyen le plus courant de se garer est dans la rue, mais vous devez &ecirc;tre conscient du fait que le parking est difficile &agrave; trouver. Cette beaut&eacute; sablonneuse est entour&eacute;e de nombreux appartements et de bons restaurants. Sur la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement un bar de plage o&ugrave; vous pouvez louer des transats et des parasols. La particularit&eacute; de cette plage est les vagues, qui peuvent &eacute;galement &ecirc;tre utilis&eacute;es pour le surf ou d&#39;autres sports nautiques. Vous avez ici 100 m&egrave;tres de longueur disponibles et 20 m&egrave;tres de largeur, l&#39;inclinaison sur la plage est assez plate et le point de baignade est &agrave; 20 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage sur la plage est d&eacute;cente et vous disposez de tous les services n&eacute;cessaires. Le logement, si vous en cherchez un, est &agrave; proximit&eacute;, &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3414, 'fr', 1),
(1763, 'Vicino all&#39;antica citt&agrave; greca di Kavala c&#39;&egrave; un piccolo villaggio turistico, Paleo Tsifliki, con meravigliose spiagge sabbiose. La sabbia ha sulle spiagge un colore giallo speciale, davvero unico. Questa spiaggia si trova nella regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki ed &egrave; facile da raggiungere con il tuo veicolo. Sebbene non ci siano parcheggi molto grandi in giro, il modo pi&ugrave; comune per parcheggiare &egrave; sulla strada, ma dovresti essere consapevole del fatto che il parcheggio &egrave; difficile da trovare. Questa bellezza sabbiosa &egrave; circondata da molti appartamenti e alcuni bei ristoranti. In spiaggia &egrave; presente anche un beach bar dove &egrave; possibile noleggiare sdraio e ombrelloni. Particolarit&agrave; di questa spiaggia sono le onde, che possono essere utilizzate anche per il surf o altri sport acquatici. Avete qui 100 metri di lunghezza a disposizione e 20 metri di larghezza, l&#39;inclinazione sulla spiaggia &egrave; abbastanza piatta e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 20 metri. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia sulla spiaggia &egrave; decente e hai tutti i servizi necessari disponibili. L&#39;alloggio, se ne cercate uno, &egrave; nelle vicinanze, a pochi metri di distanza. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3414, 'it', 1),
(1764, 'Cerca de la antigua ciudad griega de Kavala hay un peque&ntilde;o pueblo tur&iacute;stico, Paleo Tsifliki, con incre&iacute;bles playas de arena. La arena tiene en las playas un color amarillo especial, realmente &uacute;nico. Esta playa se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki y es de f&aacute;cil acceso con su veh&iacute;culo. Aunque no tiene lugares de estacionamiento muy grandes, la forma m&aacute;s com&uacute;n de estacionar es en la calle, pero debe tener en cuenta el hecho de que el estacionamiento es dif&iacute;cil de encontrar. Esta belleza arenosa est&aacute; rodeada de muchos apartamentos y algunos buenos restaurantes. En la playa tambi&eacute;n tienes un chiringuito donde puedes alquilar tumbonas y sombrillas. Lo especial de esta playa son las olas, que tambi&eacute;n se pueden utilizar para practicar surf u otros deportes acu&aacute;ticos. Aqu&iacute; tienes 100 metros de largo disponibles y 20 metros de ancho, la inclinaci&oacute;n en la playa es bastante plana y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a 20 metros. La infraestructura de la playa en la playa es decente y tiene todos los servicios necesarios disponibles. El alojamiento, si est&aacute; buscando uno, se encuentra en las inmediaciones, a solo unos metros de distancia. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3414, 'es', 1),
(1765, 'V bližini starogr&scaron;kega mesta Kavala je majhna turistična vasica Paleo Tsifliki z neverjetnimi pe&scaron;čenimi plažami. Pesek ima na plažah posebno rumeno barvo, resnično edinstveno. Do te plaže v regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki se lahko pripeljete z vsemi tipi vozil. Čeprav v bližini nimate zelo velikih parkirnih mest, je najpogostej&scaron;i način parkiranja ob ulici, vendar se morate zavedati, da je prosto parkirno mesto težko najti. Ta pe&scaron;čena lepota je obdana s &scaron;tevilnimi apartmaji in nekaj prijetnimi restavracijami. Na plaži imate tudi bar na plaži, kjer lahko najamete ležalnike in senčnike. Na tej plaži so posebni valovi, ki jih lahko uporabite tudi za deskanje ali druge vodne &scaron;porte. Tu imate na voljo 100 metrov dolžine in 20 metrov &scaron;irine, naklon na plaži je precej položen, točka kopanja pa je 20 metrov. Infrastruktura na plaži je spodobna in na voljo imate vse potrebne storitve. Če jo i&scaron;čete, je nastanitev v bližini, le nekaj metrov stran. Uživajte na svoji plaži z BeachRex.', 3414, 'sl', 1),
(1766, 'U blizini drevnog grčkog grada Kavala nalazi se malo turističko mjesto Paleo Tsifliki s nevjerojatnim pje&scaron;čanim plažama. Pijesak ima posebnu žutu boju na plažama, zaista jedinstven. Do ove plaže u regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki može se doći svim vrstama vozila. Iako u blizini nemate jako velika parkirna mjesta, najče&scaron;ći način parkiranja je na ulici, no trebali biste biti svjesni da je slobodno parkirno mjesto te&scaron;ko pronaći. Ova pje&scaron;čana ljepotica okružena je mnogim apartmanima i nekim ugodnim restoranima. Na plaži se nalazi i beach bar u kojem možete unajmiti ležaljke i suncobrane. Na ovoj plaži postoje posebni valovi koje možete koristiti i za surfanje ili druge vodene sportove. Ovdje imate 100 metara dužine i 20 metara &scaron;irine, nagib na plaži prilično je ravan, a kupali&scaron;te je 20 metara. Infrastruktura na plaži je pristojna i na raspolaganju su vam sve potrebne usluge. Ako ga tražite, smje&scaron;taj je u blizini, na samo nekoliko metara udaljenosti. Uživajte na svojoj plaži uz BeachRex.', 3414, 'hr', 1),
(1767, 'Willkommen in Kavala und am Stadtstrand Paralia Kalamitsa. Es ist ein wahrer Stadtstrand mitten in der Stadt Kavala. Kavala liegt im &ouml;stlichen Teil Griechenlands in der Region Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist Sand und aufgrund der Strandeigenschaften am besten f&uuml;r Familien geeignet. Das Parken Ihres Fahrzeugs hier ist kein Problem. Sie k&ouml;nnen dies direkt vor dem Strand tun. Beachten Sie jedoch, dass das Parken &uuml;ber eine H&ouml;henbarriere verf&uuml;gt, die jedoch von einigen niedrigen Wohnmobilen durchfahren werden kann. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 750 Meter, 15 Meter ist die maximale Breite und die Hangneigung ist etwas erh&ouml;ht, was bedeutet, dass Sie bereits nach 5 Metern nach dem Eintritt ins Wasser mit dem Schwimmen beginnen k&ouml;nnen. Hier steht Ihnen jede Art von Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung. Um die gesamte Liste anzuzeigen, lesen Sie bitte unsere Beschreibung der Strandinfrastruktur. Kinder werden diesen Ort auch lieben; Sie haben hier viele Kinderspielpl&auml;tze. Im Hintergrund des Strandes befindet sich ein gro&szlig;es Sportzentrum mit vielen verschiedenen Sportfeldern. Hotel, Apartments und freie Zimmer sind in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar. Wie es an einem Stadtstrand &uuml;blich ist, k&ouml;nnen Sie direkt am Strand griechische K&uuml;che probieren. Viele Restaurants und Strandbars stehen Ihnen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand und denken Sie daran, immer BeachRex zu verwenden, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden.', 3412, 'de', 1),
(1768, 'Benvenuti a Kavala e alla spiaggia cittadina Paralia Kalamitsa. &Egrave; una vera spiaggia cittadina nel mezzo della citt&agrave; di Kavala. Kavala si trova nella parte orientale della Grecia nella regione Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia e per le sue caratteristiche &egrave; pi&ugrave; adatta alle famiglie. Parcheggiare qui il tuo veicolo non &egrave; un problema, puoi farlo direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia, ma tieni presente che il parcheggio ha una barriera di altezza, ma alcuni camper bassi possono attraversarlo. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 750 metri, 15 metri &egrave; la larghezza massima e l&#39;inclinazione del pendio &egrave; leggermente aumentata, il che significa che si pu&ograve; gi&agrave; iniziare a nuotare dopo soli 5 metri dall&#39;ingresso in acqua. Hai tutti i tipi di infrastrutture balneari disponibili qui, per vedere l&#39;elenco completo controlla la nostra descrizione delle infrastrutture della spiaggia. Anche i bambini adoreranno questo posto; hai molti parchi giochi per bambini qui. Sullo sfondo della spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un grande centro sportivo, con tanti campi sportivi diversi. Hotel, appartamenti e camere libere sono disponibili nelle vicinanze. Come &egrave; consuetudine su una spiaggia cittadina, puoi provare alcuni piatti della cucina greca direttamente sulla spiaggia, molti ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia sono a tua disposizione. Goditi la tua spiaggia e ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta.', 3412, 'it', 1),
(1769, 'Bienvenido a Kavala y la playa de la ciudad Paralia Kalamitsa. Es una verdadera playa urbana en medio de la ciudad de Kavala. Kavala se encuentra en la parte oriental de Grecia en la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. La superficie principal de la playa es de arena y, debido a las caracter&iacute;sticas de la playa, es la m&aacute;s adecuada para familias. Estacionar su veh&iacute;culo aqu&iacute; no es un problema, puede hacerlo directamente frente a la playa, pero tenga en cuenta que el estacionamiento tiene una barrera de altura, pero algunas autocaravanas bajas pueden atravesarlo. La longitud total de la playa es de 750 metros, 15 metros es el ancho m&aacute;ximo y la inclinaci&oacute;n de la pendiente aumenta un poco, lo que significa que ya puede comenzar a nadar despu&eacute;s de solo 5 metros despu&eacute;s de ingresar al agua. Tiene todo tipo de infraestructura de playa disponible aqu&iacute;, para ver la lista completa, consulte nuestra descripci&oacute;n de infraestructura de playa. A los ni&ntilde;os tambi&eacute;n les encantar&aacute; este lugar; tienes muchos parques infantiles aqu&iacute;. Al fondo de la playa hay un gran polideportivo, con muchos campos deportivos diferentes. Hotel, apartamentos y habitaciones libres est&aacute;n disponibles en las inmediaciones. Como es habitual en una playa de la ciudad, puede probar algo de cocina griega directamente en la playa, muchos restaurantes y chiringuitos est&aacute;n a su disposici&oacute;n. Disfruta de tu playa y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta.', 3412, 'es', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1770, 'Bienvenido a Kavala y la playa de la ciudad Paralia Kalamitsa. Es una verdadera playa urbana en medio de la ciudad de Kavala. Kavala se encuentra en la parte oriental de Grecia en la regi&oacute;n Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. La superficie principal de la playa es de arena y, debido a las caracter&iacute;sticas de la playa, es la m&aacute;s adecuada para familias. Estacionar su veh&iacute;culo aqu&iacute; no es un problema, puede hacerlo directamente frente a la playa, pero tenga en cuenta que el estacionamiento tiene una barrera de altura, pero algunas autocaravanas bajas pueden atravesarlo. La longitud total de la playa es de 750 metros, 15 metros es el ancho m&aacute;ximo y la inclinaci&oacute;n de la pendiente aumenta un poco, lo que significa que ya puede comenzar a nadar despu&eacute;s de solo 5 metros despu&eacute;s de ingresar al agua. Tiene todo tipo de infraestructura de playa disponible aqu&iacute;, para ver la lista completa, consulte nuestra descripci&oacute;n de infraestructura de playa. A los ni&ntilde;os tambi&eacute;n les encantar&aacute; este lugar; tienes muchos parques infantiles aqu&iacute;. Al fondo de la playa hay un gran polideportivo, con muchos campos deportivos diferentes. Hotel, apartamentos y habitaciones libres est&aacute;n disponibles en las inmediaciones. Como es habitual en una playa de la ciudad, puede probar algo de cocina griega directamente en la playa, muchos restaurantes y chiringuitos est&aacute;n a su disposici&oacute;n. Disfruta de tu playa y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta.', 3412, 'fr', 1),
(1771, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li v mestu Kavala in mestni plaži Paralia Kalamitsa. Je prava mestna plaža sredi mesta Kavala. Kavala se nahaja v vzhodnem delu Grčije v regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Glavna povr&scaron;ina na plaži je pesek in je zaradi značilnosti plaže najprimernej&scaron;a za družine. Parkiranje va&scaron;ega vozila tukaj ni težava, to lahko storite neposredno pred plažo, vas pa opozarjamo, da ima parkiri&scaron;če vi&scaron;insko pregrado, vendar lahko pod njo pelje nekaj nizkih avtodomov. Skupna dolžina plaže je 750 metrov, 15 metrov je največja &scaron;irina in naklon pobočja je nekoliko povečan, kar pomeni, da lahko začnete plavati že po 5 metrih po vstopu v vodo. Tu imate na voljo vse vrste infrastrukture za plaže, če si želite ogledati celoten seznam, si oglejte opis na&scaron;e infrastrukture za plaže. Otrokom bo ta plaža zelo v&scaron;eč; tukaj imate veliko otro&scaron;kih igri&scaron;č. V ozadju plaže je velik &scaron;portni center s &scaron;tevilnimi različnimi &scaron;portnimi igri&scaron;či. Hotel, apartmaji in proste sobe so na voljo v bližini. Kot je običajno na mestni plaži, lahko na plaži preizkusite nekatere gr&scaron;ke jedi, na voljo so vam &scaron;tevilne restavracije in bari na plaži. Uživajte na svoji plaži in ne pozabite: vedno uporabite BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo popolno plažo.', 3412, 'sl', 1),
(1772, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na gradsku plažu Kavala i Paralia Kalamitsa. To je prava gradska plaža usred Kavale. Kavala se nalazi u istočnom dijelu Grčke u regiji Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki. Glavno područje na plaži je pijesak, a zbog karakteristika plaže najprikladnije je za obitelji. Parkiranje va&scaron;eg vozila ovdje nije problem, to možete učiniti neposredno ispred plaže, a mi vas upozoravamo da parkirali&scaron;te ima visinsku ogradu, ali ispod njega mogu voziti i neki niski kamperji. Ukupna dužina plaže je 750 metara, maksimalna &scaron;irina je 15 metara, a nagib je malo povećan, &scaron;to znači da plivanje možete započeti nakon 5 metara nakon ulaska u vodu. Ovdje su vam na raspolaganju sve vrste infrastrukture za plažu. Ako želite vidjeti cijeli popis, pogledajte opis na&scaron;e infrastrukture za plaže. Djeca će jako voljeti ovu plažu; ovdje imate puno igrali&scaron;ta. U pozadini plaže nalazi se veliki sportski centar s mnogo različitih sportskih terena. Hotel, apartmani i slobodne sobe dostupni su u blizini. Kao i obično na gradskoj plaži, na plaži možete probati neka grčka jela, postoje mnogi restorani i barovi na plaži. Uživajte na svojoj plaži i zapamtite: uvijek koristite BeachRex kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju savr&scaron;enu plažu.', 3412, 'hr', 1),
(1773, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Willkommen am wundersch&ouml;nen griechischen Feinkiesstrand Paralia Ierissou. Die Halbinsel Chalkidiki ist voller sch&ouml;ner Str&auml;nde. In der Stadt Ierissos gibt es einen sehr langen, mehr als 1 km langen Strand, der aus Sand und teilweise aus kleinen und sehr kleinen Steinen besteht. Die maximale Breite des Strandes betr&auml;gt 25 Meter und der Strand hat eine normale Neigung. Das Wasser f&auml;llt hier ziemlich schnell ab; Sie k&ouml;nnen bereits nach 5 Metern nach dem Betreten des Wassers mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Es wird f&uuml;r Familien empfohlen. Parkpl&auml;tze f&uuml;r alle Arten von Fahrzeugen, auch f&uuml;r Wohnmobile, stehen direkt vor dem Strand zur Verf&uuml;gung. Neben dem Strand gibt es einen Campingplatz und vor dem Campingplatz einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist auf einem hohen Niveau und rund um den Strand gibt es viele Strandbars und viele Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten. Die Gesamtliste der Strandinfrastruktur ist sehr lang. Wenn Sie einen Hund besitzen, d&uuml;rfen Sie ihn mit an den Strand nehmen. Kinder k&ouml;nnen auf den Kinderspielpl&auml;tzen spielen, und diejenigen, die gerne sportlich sind, k&ouml;nnen auf einigen Sportfeldern trainieren. Am Strand gibt es auch einen Pier, von dem aus Sie ins Wasser springen oder Fische fangen k&ouml;nnen. Unterkunft und griechische K&uuml;che sind am Strand oder in der N&auml;he in vielen verschiedenen Formen erh&auml;ltlich. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand und denken Sie daran, immer BeachRex zu verwenden, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden.</div>\n', 3427, 'de', 1),
(1774, 'Bienvenue sur la magnifique plage de gravier fin grecque Paralia Ierissou. La p&eacute;ninsule de Halkidiki regorge de belles plages. Dans la ville d&#39;Ierissos, il y a une tr&egrave;s longue plage de plus de 1 km de long, qui est faite de sable et en partie de petites et tr&egrave;s petites pierres. La largeur maximale de la plage est de 25 m&egrave;tres et la plage a une inclinaison normale. L&#39;eau tombe ici assez rapidement; vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager d&eacute;j&agrave; apr&egrave;s 5 m&egrave;tres apr&egrave;s &ecirc;tre entr&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. Il est recommand&eacute; aux familles. Un parking pour tous types de v&eacute;hicules, y compris les camping-cars, est disponible directement en face de la plage. &Agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, il y a une place de camping et &agrave; l&#39;avant du camping une grande place de parking. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage est &agrave; un niveau &eacute;lev&eacute; et autour de la plage, il y a de nombreux bars de plage et de nombreuses options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement. La liste totale des infrastructures de plage est tr&egrave;s longue. Si vous poss&eacute;dez un chien, vous &ecirc;tes autoris&eacute; &agrave; l&#39;emmener avec vous &agrave; la plage. Les enfants peuvent jouer sur les aires de jeux pour enfants, et ceux qui aiment &ecirc;tre sportifs, ils peuvent faire de l&#39;exercice sur certains terrains de sport. Sur la plage, il y a aussi une jet&eacute;e &agrave; partir de laquelle vous pouvez sauter dans l&#39;eau ou aller p&ecirc;cher du poisson. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement et la cuisine grecque sont sur la plage, ou &agrave; proximit&eacute;, disponibles sous de nombreuses formes diff&eacute;rentes. Profitez de votre plage et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre plage parfaite.', 3427, 'fr', 1),
(1775, 'Bienvenido a la hermosa playa griega de grava fina Paralia Ierissou. La pen&iacute;nsula de Halkidiki est&aacute; llena de bonitas playas. En el pueblo de Ierissos hay una playa muy larga, de m&aacute;s de 1 km de longitud, que est&aacute; hecha de arena y en parte de piedras peque&ntilde;as y muy peque&ntilde;as. El ancho m&aacute;ximo de la playa es de 25 metros y la playa tiene una inclinaci&oacute;n normal. El agua cae aqu&iacute; bastante r&aacute;pido; ya puede empezar a nadar despu&eacute;s de 5 metros despu&eacute;s de entrar al agua. Recomendado para familias. Aparcamiento, para todo tipo de veh&iacute;culos, tambi&eacute;n autocaravanas, est&aacute; disponible directamente en frente de la playa. Junto a la playa hay un lugar para acampar y en la parte delantera del camping un amplio estacionamiento. La infraestructura de la playa es de alto nivel y alrededor de la playa hay muchos chiringuitos y muchas opciones de alojamiento. La lista total de infraestructura de playa es muy larga. Si tienes un perro, puedes llevarlo contigo a la playa. Los ni&ntilde;os pueden jugar en los parques infantiles, y los que les gusta hacer deporte, pueden ejercitarse en algunos campos deportivos. En la playa tambi&eacute;n hay un muelle desde el que puedes saltar al agua o pescar. El alojamiento y la cocina griega se encuentran en la playa o en los alrededores, disponibles en muchas formas diferentes. Disfruta de tu playa y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta.', 3427, 'es', 1),
(1776, 'Benvenuti nella bellissima spiaggia greca di ghiaia fine Paralia Ierissou. La penisola di Halkidiki &egrave; piena di belle spiagge. Nella citt&agrave; di Ierissos c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia molto lunga, lunga pi&ugrave; di 1 km, che &egrave; fatta di sabbia e in parte di piccole e piccolissime pietre. La larghezza massima della spiaggia &egrave; di 25 metri e la spiaggia ha un&#39;inclinazione normale. L&#39;acqua scende qui abbastanza rapidamente; puoi iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; dopo 5 metri dopo essere entrato in acqua. &Egrave; consigliato per le famiglie. Il parcheggio, per tutti i tipi di veicoli, anche per camper, &egrave; disponibile direttamente davanti alla spiaggia. Accanto alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un campeggio e di fronte al campeggio un ampio parcheggio. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; di alto livello e intorno alla spiaggia ci sono molti bar sulla spiaggia e molte opzioni di alloggio. L&#39;elenco totale delle infrastrutture balneari &egrave; molto lungo. Se possiedi un cane, puoi portarlo con te in spiaggia. I bambini possono giocare nei parchi giochi per bambini e quelli a cui piace essere sportivi possono fare esercizio su alcuni campi sportivi. Sulla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; anche un molo dal quale &egrave; possibile tuffarsi in acqua o andare a pescare. Gli alloggi e la cucina greca sono sulla spiaggia o nelle vicinanze, disponibili in molte forme diverse. Goditi la tua spiaggia e ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta.', 3427, 'it', 1),
(1777, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na čudoviti gr&scaron;ki plaži z drobnim gramozom Paralia Ierissou. Polotok Halkidiki je poln lepih plaž. V mestu Ierissos je zelo dolga plaža, dolga več kot 1 km, ki je narejena iz peska in delno iz majhnih in zelo majhnih kamnov. Največja &scaron;irina plaže je 25 metrov in ima normalno naklon. Voda tu kar hitro pade; lahko začnete plavati že po 5 metrih po vstopu v vodo. Priporočljiva je za družine. Parkiri&scaron;če za vsa vozila, tudi avtodome, je na voljo neposredno pred plažo. Poleg plaže imate možnost kampiranja, pred kampom pa se nahaja veliko parkiri&scaron;če. Infrastruktura na plaži je na visoki ravni, okoli plaže pa je veliko barov na plaži in veliko možnosti za namestitev. Celoten seznam plažne infrastrukture je zelo dolg. Če ste lastnik psa, ga lahko pripeljete s seboj na plažo. Otroci se lahko igrajo na otro&scaron;kih igri&scaron;čih, tisti, ki so radi &scaron;portni, pa na nekaterih &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;čih. Na plaži je tudi pomol, s katerega lahko skočite v vodo ali greste loviti ribe. Nastanitev in gr&scaron;ka kuhinja sta na plaži ali v njeni bližini, na voljo v &scaron;tevilnih različnih oblikah. Uživajte na svoji plaži in ne pozabite: vedno uporabite BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo popolno plažo.', 3427, 'sl', 1),
(1778, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na prekrasnu grčku plažu s sitnim &scaron;ljunkom Paralia Ierissou. Poluotok Halkidiki prepun je prekrasnih plaža. U gradu Ierissos nalazi se vrlo duga plaža, dugačka vi&scaron;e od 1 km, izrađena od pijeska i dijelom od sitnog i vrlo sitnog kamenja. Maksimalna &scaron;irina plaže je 25 metara i ima normalan nagib. Voda ovdje pada prilično brzo; plivanje možete započeti već 5 metara nakon ulaska u vodu. Preporučuje se obiteljima. Parkirali&scaron;te za sva vozila, uključujući i kamp kućice, dostupno je neposredno ispred plaže. Uz plažu imate mogućnost kampiranja, a ispred kampa je veliko parkirali&scaron;te. Infrastruktura na plaži je na visokoj razini, a oko plaže ima mnogo barova na plaži i mnogo mogućnosti smje&scaron;taja. Čitav popis infrastrukture plaža vrlo je dugačak. Ako ste vlasnik psa, možete ga ponijeti sa sobom na plažu. Djeca se mogu igrati na igrali&scaron;tima, a oni koji vole sport mogu se igrati na nekim od igrali&scaron;ta. Na plaži se nalazi i mol s kojeg možete skočiti u vodu ili ići u ribolov. Smje&scaron;taj i grčka kuhinja dostupni su na plaži ili u blizini plaže, dostupni u mnogo različitih oblika. Uživajte na svojoj plaži i zapamtite: uvijek koristite BeachRex kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju savr&scaron;enu plažu.', 3427, 'hr', 1),
(1779, 'Einer der letzten Str&auml;nde auf der Halbinsel Chalkidiki, bevor Sie die Grenze zum Berg Athos erreichen, ist der Strand Nea Roda. Es befindet sich in der Region Kentriki Makedonia im Osten Griechenlands. Es ist ein Strand vom Typ Familie und wegen der Kinderspielpl&auml;tze werden Ihre Kinder diesen Strand lieben. Der Parkplatz befindet sich vor dem Strand und der Parkplatz ist sehr gro&szlig;. Hier k&ouml;nnen Sie auch Ihr Wohnmobil parken. Am Strand selbst gibt es &uuml;berwiegend Sand. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Handtuch auf eine sehr gro&szlig;e Strandoberfl&auml;che legen, die L&auml;nge betr&auml;gt 500 Meter, es ist 15 Meter breit und hat eine normale Neigung. Sie k&ouml;nnen nach 10 Metern Wassereintritt mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. In der Umgebung gibt es viele Restaurants und viele Unterkunftsarten. Hier stehen Ihnen viele Strandinfrastrukturen zur Verf&uuml;gung, viele Strandservices stehen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Neben dem Strand gibt es auch einen Pier und einen Yachthafen. Wenn Sie einen Hund besitzen, ist er hier willkommen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand und denken Sie daran, immer BeachRex zu verwenden, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden.', 3428, 'de', 1),
(1780, 'Una de las &uacute;ltimas playas de la pen&iacute;nsula de Halkidiki antes de llegar a la frontera con el Monte Athos es la playa Nea Roda. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Kentriki Makedonia, que se encuentra en la parte oriental de Grecia. Es una playa de tipo familiar y debido a los parques infantiles a sus hijos les encantar&aacute; esta playa. El parking est&aacute; frente a la playa y el parking es muy amplio, tambi&eacute;n puedes aparcar tu autocaravana aqu&iacute;. En la propia playa predomina la arena. Puede colocar su toalla en una superficie de playa muy grande, la longitud es de 500 metros, tiene 15 metros de ancho y tiene una inclinaci&oacute;n normal. Puede comenzar a nadar despu&eacute;s de 10 metros de entrar al agua. En los alrededores hay muchos restaurantes y muchos tipos de alojamiento. Tiene muchas infraestructuras de playa a su disposici&oacute;n aqu&iacute;, muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles. Junto a la playa tambi&eacute;n hay un muelle y un puerto deportivo. Si tienes un perro, aqu&iacute; es bienvenido. Disfruta de tu playa y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta.', 3428, 'es', 1),
(1781, 'L&#39;une des derni&egrave;res plages de la p&eacute;ninsule de Halkidiki avant d&#39;atteindre la fronti&egrave;re avec le mont Athos est la plage de Nea Roda. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Kentriki Makedonia, qui est situ&eacute;e dans la partie orientale de la Gr&egrave;ce. C&#39;est une plage de type familial et en raison des aires de jeux pour enfants, vos enfants adoreront cette plage. Le parking est en face de la plage et le parking est tr&egrave;s grand, vous pouvez &eacute;galement garer votre camping-car ici. Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, il y a principalement du sable. Vous pouvez poser votre serviette sur une tr&egrave;s grande surface de plage, la longueur est de 500 m&egrave;tres, elle fait 15 m&egrave;tres de largeur et a une inclinaison normale. Vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s 10 m&egrave;tres d&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau. Dans les environs, il y a de nombreux restaurants et de nombreux types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement. Vous avez ici de nombreuses infrastructures de plage &agrave; votre disposition, de nombreux services de plage sont disponibles. &Agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, il y a aussi une jet&eacute;e et une marina. Si vous poss&eacute;dez un chien, il est le bienvenu ici. Profitez de votre plage et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre plage parfaite.', 3428, 'fr', 1),
(1782, 'Una delle ultime spiagge della penisola Calcidica prima di raggiungere il confine con il Monte Athos &egrave; la spiaggia di Nea Roda. Si trova nella regione Kentriki Makedonia, che si trova nella parte orientale della Grecia. &Egrave; una spiaggia di tipo familiare e grazie ai parchi giochi per bambini i tuoi bambini adoreranno questa spiaggia. Il parcheggio &egrave; di fronte alla spiaggia e il parcheggio &egrave; molto ampio, qui puoi parcheggiare anche il tuo camper. Sulla spiaggia stessa c&#39;&egrave; prevalentemente sabbia. Puoi stendere il tuo asciugamano su una superficie di spiaggia molto ampia, la lunghezza &egrave; di 500 metri, &egrave; larga 15 metri e ha un&#39;inclinazione normale. Puoi iniziare a nuotare dopo 10 metri dall&#39;ingresso in acqua. Nei dintorni ci sono molti ristoranti e molte tipologie di alloggio. Hai molte infrastrutture balneari a tua disposizione qui, molti servizi spiaggia sono disponibili. Accanto alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; anche un molo e un porto turistico. Se possiedi un cane, &egrave; accolto qui. Goditi la tua spiaggia e ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta.', 3428, 'it', 1),
(1783, 'Ena zadnjih plaž na polotoku Halkidiki, preden pridete do meje z goro Atos, je plaža Nea Roda. Nahaja se v regiji Kentriki Makedonia, ki se nahaja v vzhodnem delu Grčije. Je plaža družinskega tipa in zaradi otro&scaron;kih igri&scaron;č bodo va&scaron;i otroci uživali na tej plaži. Parkiri&scaron;če je pred plažo in je zelo veliko, tukaj lahko parkirate tudi svoj avtodom. Na sami plaži je pretežno pesek. Brisačo lahko položite na zelo veliko povr&scaron;ino plaže, dolga je 500 metrov, &scaron;iroka je 15 metrov in ima normalen naklon. Plavati lahko začnete po 10 metrih vstopa v vodo. V okolici je veliko restavracij in veliko tipov nastanitev. Tu imate na voljo veliko plažne infrastrukture, na voljo je veliko plažnih storitev. Zraven plaže je tukaj tudi pomol in marina. Če ste lastnik psa, je ta tu dobrodo&scaron;el. Uživajte na svoji plaži in ne pozabite: vedno uporabite BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo popolno plažo.', 3428, 'sl', 1),
(1784, 'Jedna od posljednjih plaža na poluotoku Halkidiki prije nego &scaron;to stignete do granice sa Svetom Gorom je plaža Nea Roda. Smje&scaron;teno je u regiji Kentriki Makedonia, smje&scaron;tenoj u istočnom dijelu Grčke. To je plaža obiteljskog tipa i zbog dječjih igrali&scaron;ta va&scaron;a će djeca uživati ​​na ovoj plaži. Parkirali&scaron;te je ispred plaže i vrlo je veliko, ovdje također možete parkirati svoj kamper. Sama plaža je uglavnom pje&scaron;čana. Ručnik se može postaviti na vrlo veliko područje plaže, dugačak je 500 metara, &scaron;irok 15 metara i ima normalan nagib. Plivanje možete započeti nakon 10 metara ulaska u vodu. U okolici se nalazi mnogo restorana i mnogo vrsta smje&scaron;taja. Ovdje je dostupno puno infrastrukture za plažu, dostupno je puno usluga na plaži. Uz plažu se nalazi i mol i marina. Ako ste vlasnik psa, ovaj je ovdje dobrodo&scaron;ao. Uživajte na svojoj plaži i zapamtite: uvijek koristite BeachRex kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju savr&scaron;enu plažu.', 3428, 'hr', 1),
(1787, '', 2577, 'ru', 2),
(1788, 'Добро пожаловать на прекрасный песчаный пляж городка Керамоти. Он расположен в восточной части Греции в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки. Если вы хотите посетить соседний остров Тасос, вы можете сесть на паром из гавани, которая находится очень близко к пляжу. Чтобы добраться до пляжа на автомобиле, также очень легко добраться до автодома, и у вас есть очень большая парковка прямо перед пляжем. Когда вы окажетесь на пляже, у вас будет в общей сложности более 1000 метров длины пляжа и более 100 метров ширины пляжа. Если вы предпочитаете естественную тень на пляже, у вас есть много таких теней. Инфраструктура пляжа здесь не только базовая, но и более развитая, есть даже спортивные площадки. Несколько пляжных баров и ресторанов также расположены прямо на пляже. После того, как вы закончите пляжный отдых, вы можете посетить город, где вы найдете еще больше магазинов, баров и рынков. Жилье доступно очень близко к пляжу, некоторые менее чем в 100 метрах от него, в основном апартаменты и несколько отелей. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти свой идеальный пляж.', 3408, 'ru', 1),
(1789, 'Рядом с аэропортом Кавалы, на краю сельскохозяйственных полей, есть красивый песчаный пляж под названием Тирала. До него очень легко добраться на любом транспортном средстве, в том числе с автодомом, и вы можете припарковаться почти прямо перед пляжем. Этот пляж очень длинный, несколько километров, а максимальная ширина - 15 метров. Точка плавания начинается очень быстро, уже через 5 метров. Вход в воду крутой, не очень подходит для маленьких детей. Еще одна хорошая характеристика пляжа - это то, что он предлагает много естественной тени, поэтому вы защищены от жаркого южного средиземноморского солнца. Здесь расположена вся необходимая пляжная инфраструктура, а также у вас есть хороший пляжный бар, чтобы насладиться прекрасным видом на Эгейское море. Жилье поблизости недоступно, но оно находится дальше, в нескольких километрах. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.', 3409, 'ru', 1),
(1790, 'Добро пожаловать на прекрасный песчаный пляж Паралия Аспри Аммос. Если вы находитесь недалеко от греческого города Кавала, который с его 70 000 жителей является очень многолюдным местом, и вы хотите провести день на тихом пляже с очень маленькими туристами, мы предлагаем вам посетить этот пляж, всего в нескольких километрах. вдали от центра Кавалы. В городе Кавала есть много пляжей. Первый с восточной стороны города - это паралия Аспри Аммос. Он расположен между двумя небольшими холмами, основная поверхность которого - песок. Из-за особенностей пляжа он в основном рекомендуется для семейного отдыха. Добраться до пляжа на автомобиле очень легко, вы также можете приехать с автодомом, и у вас есть большая парковка прямо перед пляжем. Общая длина пляжа составляет 300 метров, максимальная ширина - 25 метров, имеет нормальный уклон, а точка плавания находится на высоте 15 метров. Здесь имеется вся необходимая пляжная инфраструктура, и если вы владелец собаки, вы также можете взять с собой собаку на пляж. В непосредственной близости находится ресторан и несколько апартаментов. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.', 3410, 'ru', 1),
(1791, 'Добро пожаловать на самый длинный песчаный пляж греческого города Кавала. Этот песчаный пляж расположен недалеко от центра Кавалы, рядом со спортивным центром и спортивным / футбольным стадионом. До пляжа очень легко добраться на любом транспортном средстве, и у вас есть парковка прямо перед пляжем. Семейный пляж, подходящий и для тех, кто живет с собаками. Здесь есть вся необходимая пляжная инфраструктура, а поблизости есть даже спортивные площадки. Общая длина пляжа составляет 1 км, максимальная ширина - 25 метров. Вода здесь очень быстро проникает вглубь, так что плавать можно уже через 5 метров. Некоторые пляжные бары также находятся на пляже, рестораны также находятся недалеко, поэтому не нужно брать с собой всю еду. Жилье также доступно поблизости, в основном в виде квартир или комнат. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.', 3411, 'ru', 1),
(1792, 'Добро пожаловать в Кавалу и на городской пляж Паралия Каламица. Это настоящий городской пляж в центре города Кавала. Кавала расположена в восточной части Греции в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки. Основная поверхность пляжа - песок, и благодаря своим характеристикам он лучше всего подходит для семейного отдыха. Припарковать свой автомобиль здесь не проблема, вы можете сделать это прямо перед пляжем, но имейте в виду, что парковка имеет барьер высоты, но некоторые низкие автодома могут пройти через него. Общая длина пляжа 750 метров, максимальная ширина - 15 метров, а наклон склона немного увеличен, а это значит, что уже можно начинать плавать уже через 5 метров после входа в воду. Здесь есть вся необходимая пляжная инфраструктура, чтобы увидеть весь список, пожалуйста, ознакомьтесь с нашим описанием пляжной инфраструктуры. Детям тоже понравится это место; у вас здесь много детских площадок. На фоне пляжа находится большой спортивный центр с множеством различных спортивных площадок. Отель, апартаменты и бесплатные комнаты доступны в непосредственной близости. Как обычно на городском пляже, вы можете попробовать блюда греческой кухни прямо на пляже, в вашем распоряжении множество ресторанов и пляжных баров. Наслаждайтесь пляжем и помните: всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти свой идеальный пляж.', 3412, 'ru', 1),
(1793, 'Она настоящая красавица, паралия Батис. Это песчаный пляж, подходящий для семей и тех, кто любит разбивать лагеря рядом с пляжем. Его длина составляет 200 метров, а ширина - до 25 метров. Наклон склона местами немного крутой, но в основном нормальный. Лагерь со всей возможной пляжной инфраструктурой находится прямо рядом с пляжем, а также несколько ресторанов и пляжных баров. Парковочное место немного выше и примерно в 100 метрах от него, но оно очень большое, и вы можете добраться до пляжа с парковки по лестнице, но примите во внимание разницу в высоте в 15 метров ..', 3413, 'ru', 1),
(1794, 'Es una verdadera belleza, la paralia Batis. Es una playa de arena, apta para familias y para aquellos que aman acampar cerca de la playa. Tiene 200 m de largo y hasta 25 m de ancho. La pendiente de la pendiente es en algunos lugares un poco empinada, pero en su mayor&iacute;a normal. El campamento, con toda la infraestructura de playa posible, est&aacute; justo al lado de la playa, as&iacute; como algunos restaurantes y chiringuitos. La plaza de aparcamiento es un poco m&aacute;s alta ya unos 100 m de distancia, pero es muy grande y se puede llegar a la playa desde el parking por unas escaleras, pero ten en cuenta los 15 m de desnivel.', 3413, 'es', 1),
(1795, 'Une vraie beaut&eacute; qu&#39;elle est, la paralia Batis. C&#39;est une plage de sable, adapt&eacute;e aux familles et &agrave; ceux qui aiment camper pr&egrave;s d&#39;une plage. Il mesure 200 m de long et 25 m de large. L&#39;inclinaison de la pente est &agrave; certains endroits un peu raide, mais surtout normale. Le camp, avec toutes les infrastructures de plage possibles, se trouve juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, ainsi que de quelques restaurants et bars de plage. L&#39;espace de stationnement est un peu plus haut et &agrave; environ 100 m, mais il est tr&egrave;s grand et vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage depuis le parking par des escaliers, mais tenez compte de la diff&eacute;rence de 15 m.', 3413, 'fr', 1),
(1796, 'Una vera bellezza lei &egrave;, la paralia Batis. &Egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa, adatta alle famiglie ea chi ama campeggiare vicino ad una spiaggia. &Egrave; lungo 200 me largo fino a 25 m. La pendenza del pendio &egrave; in alcuni punti un po &#39;ripida, ma per lo pi&ugrave; normale. Il campo, con tutte le infrastrutture balneari possibili, si trova proprio accanto alla spiaggia, cos&igrave; come alcuni ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia. Il parcheggio &egrave; un po &#39;pi&ugrave; alto e dista circa 100 m, ma &egrave; molto ampio ed &egrave; possibile raggiungere la spiaggia dal parcheggio tramite scale, ma tenendo conto dei 15 m di dislivello ..', 3413, 'it', 1),
(1797, 'Resnična lepotica je, paralia Batis. To je pe&scaron;čena plaža, primerna za družine in tiste, ki radi kampirajo v bližini plaže. Dolga je 200 m in &scaron;iroka do 25 m. Naklon pobočja je ponekod nekoliko strm, a večinoma normalen. Kamp z vso možno infrastrukturo na plaži je tik ob plaži, pa tudi nekaj restavracij in barov na plaži. Parkiri&scaron;če je nekoliko vi&scaron;je in oddaljeno kakih 100 m, vendar je zelo veliko in do plaže lahko pridete s parkiri&scaron;ča po stopnicah, vendar upo&scaron;tevajte 15 m vi&scaron;inske razlike.', 3413, 'sl', 1),
(1798, 'Ona je prava ljepotica, paralia Batis. Ovo je pje&scaron;čana plaža pogodna za obitelji i one koji vole kampirati u blizini plaže. Dug je 200 m, a &scaron;irok do 25 m. Nagib je ponegdje ne&scaron;to strm, ali uglavnom normalan. Kamp sa svom mogućom infrastrukturom na plaži nalazi se neposredno uz plažu, kao i nekoliko restorana i barova na plaži. Parkirali&scaron;te je ne&scaron;to vi&scaron;e i udaljeno je oko 100 m, ali je vrlo veliko i do plaže se s parkirali&scaron;ta može doći stepenicama, ali uzmite u obzir visinu od 15 m.', 3413, 'hr', 1),
(1799, 'Недалеко от древнегреческого города Кавала находится небольшая туристическая деревня Палео Цифлики с прекрасными песчаными пляжами. Песок на пляжах имеет особый желтый цвет, действительно уникальный. Этот пляж расположен в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки, и до него легко добраться на автомобиле. Хотя у вас нет очень больших парковочных мест, чаще всего припарковаться на улице, но вы должны знать, что парковку найти сложно. Эта песчаная красавица окружена множеством апартаментов и хороших ресторанов. На пляже у вас также есть пляжный бар, где вы можете арендовать шезлонги и зонтики. Особенностью этого пляжа являются волны, которые также можно использовать для серфинга или других водных видов спорта. У вас есть 100 метров длины и 20 метров ширины, уклон на пляже довольно пологий, а точка плавания находится на высоте 20 метров. Инфраструктура на пляже приличная, есть все необходимые услуги. Жилье, если вы ищете, находится поблизости, всего в нескольких метрах от отеля. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.', 3414, 'ru', 1),
(1800, 'Если вам нравятся длинные песчаные пляжи, паралия Ираклица - это то, что вам нужно. Он подходит для семей, и у вас есть пляж длиной более 1 км и шириной до 30 м, доступный практически прямо из машины. Точка заплыва начинается уже на 10 м. Парковка бесплатная, и здесь действительно много места, в том числе и для автодомов. Есть несколько спортивных площадок и детская площадка. Пляжные бары и другие заведения для катания на воде, а также апартаменты также находятся в непосредственной близости от пляжа или прямо на пляже.', 3415, 'ru', 1),
(1801, 'Če imate radi dolge pe&scaron;čene plaže, je paralia Iraklitsa prava za vas. Primerna je za družine in ima parkiri&scaron;če direktno pred plažo. Na voljo je več kot 1 km dolžine in do 30 m &scaron;irine plaže. Točka plavanja se začne že pri 10 m. Parkiri&scaron;če je brezplačno in na voljo je res veliko prostora, tudi za avtodome. Na voljo je nekaj &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č in otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če. Na plaži ali pa v bližini so bari in različne restavracije. Enako velja za nastanitev, ki je večinoma v obliki apartmajev dostopna v bližini plaže. In zapomnite si, vedno uporabljajte BeachRex ko boste iskali svojo sanjsko plažo.', 3415, 'sl', 1),
(1802, 'Ako volite duge pje&scaron;čane plaže, Iraklitsa paralia je pravi za vas. Pogodan je za obitelji i ima parkirali&scaron;te neposredno ispred plaže. Duga je vi&scaron;e od 1 km i &scaron;iroka do 30 m. Točka plivanja počinje na 10 m. Parkiranje je besplatno i na raspolaganju je zaista puno prostora, čak i za kamp kućice. Postoji nekoliko sportskih terena i dječje igrali&scaron;te. Na plaži ili u blizini nalaze se barovi i razni restorani. Isto se odnosi i na smje&scaron;taj koji je uglavnom u obliku apartmana dostupnih u blizini plaže. I ne zaboravite, uvijek koristite BeachRex kada tražite plažu iz snova.', 3415, 'hr', 1),
(1803, 'Si vous aimez les longues plages de sable, la paralia Iraklitsa est faite pour vous. Il convient aux familles et dispose d&#39;un parking juste en face de la plage. Elle mesure plus de 1 km de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 30 m de large. Le point de baignade commence &agrave; 10 m. Le stationnement est gratuit et il y a vraiment beaucoup d&#39;espace disponible, m&ecirc;me pour les camping-cars. Vous trouverez plusieurs terrains de sport et une aire de jeux pour enfants. Il y a des bars et divers restaurants sur la plage ou &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Il en va de m&ecirc;me pour l&#39;h&eacute;bergement, qui se pr&eacute;sente principalement sous la forme d&#39;appartements accessibles &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la plage. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex lorsque vous recherchez la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3415, 'fr', 1),
(1804, 'Si le gustan las largas playas de arena, Iraklitsa paralia es la adecuada para usted. Es adecuado para familias y tiene un estacionamiento directamente en frente de la playa. Tiene m&aacute;s de 1 km de largo y hasta 30 m de ancho. El punto de ba&ntilde;o comienza a los 10 m. El aparcamiento es gratuito y hay mucho espacio disponible, incluso para autocaravanas. Hay varios campos deportivos y un parque infantil. Hay bares y varios restaurantes en la playa o cerca. Lo mismo se aplica al alojamiento, que es principalmente en forma de apartamentos accesibles cerca de la playa. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex cuando busque la playa de sus sue&ntilde;os.', 3415, 'es', 1),
(1805, 'Se ti piacciono le lunghe spiagge sabbiose, l&#39;Iraklitsa paralia &egrave; quello che fa per te. &Egrave; adatto alle famiglie e dispone di un parcheggio direttamente davanti alla spiaggia. &Egrave; lunga pi&ugrave; di 1 km e larga fino a 30 m. Il punto di balneazione inizia a 10 m. Il parcheggio &egrave; gratuito e c&#39;&egrave; davvero molto spazio a disposizione, anche per i camper. Sono presenti diversi campi sportivi e un parco giochi per bambini. Ci sono bar e vari ristoranti sulla spiaggia o nelle vicinanze. Lo stesso vale per l&#39;alloggio, che &egrave; per lo pi&ugrave; sotto forma di appartamenti accessibili vicino alla spiaggia. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex quando cerchi la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3415, 'it', 1),
(1806, 'Если вы ищете симпатичный песчаный пляж небольшой деревни, расположенный в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки, вам следует посетить греческий пляж Паралия Неа Перамос Кавалас. Это настоящий городской пляж с развитой пляжной инфраструктурой, пляжными барами и, конечно же, множеством близлежащих типов жилья. Этот пляж является главным пляжем поселка Неа Перамос. У вас здесь много коричневого песка, общей протяженностью более 1 км, но шириной всего 10 метров. Есть много вариантов парковки, некоторые прямо напротив пляжа. Окрестности очень туристические, поэтому вы можете посетить множество различных ресторанов и пляжных баров. Размещение в основном в квартирах и отелях поблизости. Инфраструктура пляжа также находится на высоком уровне, и вам доступно множество пляжных услуг. Для детей есть игровая площадка, а также несколько спортивных площадок для тех, кто любит играть в пляжный волейбол. Наклон пляжа нормальный, но точка плавания начинается очень быстро, можно уплыть уже через 5 метров после входа в воду. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти свой идеальный пляж.', 3416, 'ru', 1),
(1807, 'Это настоящая красота. Этот песчаный пляж с красивыми изгибами и кристально чистой водой останется в вашей памяти надолго, даже дома, когда вы будете далеко от него, но вы, вероятно, захотите вернуться на него в другой раз. Парковка большая и грязная, и вы можете припарковаться почти прямо на пляже. Сам пляж больше километра в длину и до 25 метров в ширину. Точка плавания начинается уже на 3 м, а это значит, что вы можете начать плавать практически сразу после входа в воду. Здесь также есть пляжные бары и некоторая пляжная инфраструктура. Жилье доступно не прямо на пляже, а в близлежащих деревнях. Вся пляжная зона более естественная, чем городская, поэтому здесь можно ожидать большего спокойствия.', 3417, 'ru', 1),
(1808, 'Questa &egrave; una vera bellezza. Questa spiaggia sabbiosa, con le sue belle curve e l&#39;acqua cristallina rimarr&agrave; nella tua memoria per molto tempo, anche a casa quando sarai lontano da essa, ma probabilmente vorrai tornarci per un&#39;altra volta. Il parcheggio &egrave; ampio e in terra battuta e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare quasi direttamente in spiaggia. La spiaggia stessa &egrave; lunga pi&ugrave; chilometri e larga fino a 25 m. Il punto di nuoto inizia gi&agrave; a 3 m, il che significa che puoi iniziare a nuotare quasi immediatamente dopo essere entrato in acqua. Qui sono presenti anche bar sulla spiaggia e alcune infrastrutture sulla spiaggia. La sistemazione non &egrave; disponibile direttamente in spiaggia ma nei paesi circostanti. L&#39;intera area della spiaggia &egrave; pi&ugrave; naturale che urbana, quindi puoi aspettarti pi&ugrave; pace l&igrave;.', 3417, 'it', 1),
(1809, 'Esta es una verdadera belleza. Esta playa de arena, con sus bonitas curvas y aguas cristalinas permanecer&aacute; en tu memoria durante mucho tiempo, incluso en casa cuando estar&aacute;s lejos de ella, pero probablemente querr&aacute;s volver a ella en otro momento. El estacionamiento es grande y est&aacute; hecho de tierra y se puede estacionar casi directamente en la playa. La playa en s&iacute; tiene m&aacute;s kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 25 m de ancho. El punto de nataci&oacute;n comienza ya a los 3 m, lo que significa que puede comenzar a nadar casi instant&aacute;neamente despu&eacute;s de ingresar al agua. Los chiringuitos tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n presentes aqu&iacute;, as&iacute; como alguna infraestructura de playa. El alojamiento no est&aacute; disponible directamente en la playa, sino en los pueblos de los alrededores. Toda la zona de la playa es m&aacute;s natural que urbana, por lo que puede esperar m&aacute;s paz all&iacute;.', 3417, 'es', 1),
(1810, 'Celui-ci est une vraie beaut&eacute;. Cette plage de sable, avec ses jolies courbes et son eau cristalline restera tr&egrave;s longtemps dans votre m&eacute;moire, m&ecirc;me chez vous lorsque vous en serez loin, mais vous voudrez probablement y revenir une autre fois. Le parking est grand et fait de terre et vous pouvez vous garer presque directement sur la plage. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me mesure plus de kilom&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 25 m de large. Le point de nage commence d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 3 m, ce qui signifie que vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager presque instantan&eacute;ment apr&egrave;s &ecirc;tre entr&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. Des bars de plage sont &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sents ici, ainsi que des infrastructures de plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas disponible directement &agrave; la plage mais dans les villages environnants. L&#39;ensemble de la plage est plus naturel qu&#39;urbain, vous pouvez donc vous attendre &agrave; plus de paix l&agrave;-bas.', 3417, 'fr', 1),
(1811, 'Ta plaža je prava lepotica. Je pe&scaron;čena plaža in s svojimi lepimi ovinki in kristalno čisto vodo bo ostala v va&scaron;ih spominih zelo dolgo, tudi doma, ko boste daleč od nje, verjetno pa se boste nanjo želeli vrniti &scaron;e kdaj. Parkiri&scaron;če je veliko in je narejeno iz proda, parkirate pa lahko skoraj neposredno pred plažo. Sama plaža je dolga več kilometrov in &scaron;iroka do 25 m. Točka plavanja se začne že na 3 m, kar pomeni, da lahko začnete plavati skoraj takoj po vstopu v vodo. Tu so prisotni tudi bari na plaži, pa tudi nekaj infrastrukture na plaži. Nastanitev ni na voljo neposredno na plaži, ampak v okoli&scaron;kih vaseh. Celotno območje plaže je bolj naravno kot mestno, zato lahko tam pričakujete več miru. Seveda pa lahko na plažo pripeljete va&scaron;ega psa, tako kot tudi na druge ostale plaže, kar je svetovna posebnost. Uživajte na va&scaron;i plaži in ko boste iskali va&scaron;o naslednjo sanjsko plažo, vendno uporabiti BeachRex.', 3417, 'sl', 1),
(1812, 'Ova je plaža prava ljepotica. To je pje&scaron;čana plaža i sa svojim prekrasnim zavojima i kristalno čistom vodom ostat će vam u sjećanju jako dugo, čak i kod kuće kad ste daleko od nje, ali vjerojatno ćete joj se jednom poželjeti vratiti. Parkirali&scaron;te je veliko i od &scaron;ljunka, a možete parkirati gotovo izravno ispred plaže. Sama plaža duga je nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;iroka do 25 m. Točka plivanja započinje već na 3 m, &scaron;to znači da možete početi plivati ​​gotovo odmah nakon ulaska u vodu. Ovdje se nalaze i barovi na plaži, kao i neka infrastruktura na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj nije dostupan izravno na plaži, već u okolnim selima. Cijelo područje plaže prirodnije je od urbanog, pa tamo možete očekivati ​​vi&scaron;e mira. Naravno, psa možete dovesti na plažu, kao i na druge plaže, &scaron;to je svjetska specijalnost. Uživajte na svojoj plaži, a kad tražite svoju sljedeću plažu iz snova, uvijek koristite BeachRex.', 3417, 'hr', 1),
(1813, 'Добро пожаловать на пляж Паралия Астир. Он расположен в городе Александруполис региона Анатолики Македония кай Фраки. Это песчаный пляж, но в нем также есть небольшая галька. Парковка находится всего в 50 м от пляжа, вмещает 70 автомобилей и расположена рядом с дорогой. Доступ к парковке очень легкий, независимо от транспортного средства. Общая длина пляжа 300 метров, максимальная ширина 15 метров. Наклон на пляже нормальный, заход в воду удобный, точка купания уже на 3 метре. Рядом с пляжем находится гостиничный комплекс с бассейном, детской площадкой и многими другими удобствами. Это семейный пляж, подходящий для детей постарше, а не для маленьких из-за большой глубины. Также возможно размещение в квартирах, комнатах или в кемпинге, который находится поблизости. Некоторая пляжная инфраструктура имеется и на пляже, но больше в вашем распоряжении в гостиничном комплексе. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.', 3388, 'ru', 1),
(1814, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на пляж Паралия Рейна. В районе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки, недалеко от города Александруполис, вы можете посетить с семьей песчаный пляж Рейна. Это очень длинный пляж, протяженностью более 1 км и шириной 20 м, который идеально подходит для бега по песчаному пляжу. Естественной тени нет, поэтому возьмите с собой зонтик. Размещение и рестораны находятся рядом с пляжем. Жилье доступно во многих формах, в основном в виде отелей и апартаментов, некоторых комнат и даже палаточного лагеря. Парковка также огромна, что делает ее идеальной для автодомов, и вы можете припарковаться прямо напротив пляжа, всего в нескольких метрах от отеля. Наклон на пляже нормальный, и у вас очень хороший вход в воду. Вода очень быстро становится глубокой, и можно почти сразу же начинать плавать. Здесь есть вся необходимая пляжная инфраструктура, но не ждите слишком многого, она базовая. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3389, 'ru', 1),
(1815, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на пляж Александр. Этот пляж - настоящий пляж для исследователей. Почему, потому что путь к пляжу трудный. Части лестницы сломаны, так что будьте осторожны. Будьте осторожны, идя по тропинке. Пляж расположен в городе Александруполис, который является частью региона Анатолики Македония кай Фраки. Прямо перед пляжем у вас есть очень большая парковка, к которой также очень легко добраться на любом транспортном средстве, даже на автодоме. Это галечный пляж с красивыми красноватыми скалами высотой 10 метров на заднем плане. Это действительно уникальный пляж. 100 метров - это длина и 10 метров - ширина пляжа. Заход в воду хороший, можно сразу плавать. На пляже нет пляжной инфраструктуры. Жилье доступно всего в нескольких метрах от отеля в виде отеля, который также является казино. Если вы предпочитаете апартаменты, они также есть поблизости. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3390, 'ru', 1),
(1816, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на пляж Анапафсей. Вы можете найти этот 2-километровый пляж шириной 20 км недалеко от города Александруполис в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки, который расположен на Дальнем Востоке Греции. Парковка доступна на всем протяжении пляжа, у автодомов также найдется место для парковки. Организованы несколько парковочных мест; некоторые более свободны. Это песчаный пляж с галькой и красной скалой высотой от 5 до 10 метров на заднем плане. Прямо на берегу моря расположены рестораны и ночлег, а также гостиница. Некоторая пляжная инфраструктура здесь имеется, но в основном она сосредоточена вокруг ресторанов. Наклон склона нормальный, вход в воду хороший, купание начинается уже с 3 метров. Если вы предпочитаете апартаменты для проживания, то ближайшие из них находятся всего в 100 метрах от отеля. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3391, 'ru', 1),
(1817, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на греческий пляж Макри. Паралия Макри все еще находится в ведении города Александруполис и принадлежит региону Анатолики Македония кай Фраки. Это пляж с гаванью, ресторанами и очень красивым окружением посреди множества оливковых деревьев. Подходит для семей, которые любят песок, гальку и мелкие ракушки на пляже. Парковка вымощена и подходит также для автодомов. Это всего в 50 метрах от пляжа. Если вам нравятся длинные пляжи, этот пляж вам подойдет, так как его длина составляет 500 метров, а максимальная ширина - 25 метров. Склон на пляже нормальный, а точка купания уже на 3 метре. Здесь также есть некоторая пляжная инфраструктура, больше есть возле ресторанов и пляжных баров. Жилье доступно только в виде квартир и комнат и находится в нескольких сотнях метров от деревни Макри. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3392, 'ru', 1),
(1818, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на греческий пляж Агиас Параскевис. Город Александруполис и регион Анатолики Македония кай Фраки известны множеством песчаных пляжей, одним из которых является паралия Агиас Параскевис. На этом семейном пляже есть много пляжной инфраструктуры, которая сделает ваше пребывание максимально приятным. Поскольку на пляже нет естественной тени, вы можете арендовать шезлонги и зонтики у пляжных баров. Это очень длинный пляж, около 2 километров, с максимальной шириной 40 метров. Рестораны и пляжные бары расположены прямо на пляже. Дорога к пляжу в хорошем состоянии, и вы можете припарковаться прямо перед пляжем, всего в нескольких метрах от отеля. Этот пляж имеет нормальный уклон, очень хороший вход в воду, и вы можете рассчитывать начать плавание уже на 5 метрах. Жилье также доступно поблизости, в основном в виде квартир и комнат. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3393, 'ru', 1),
(1819, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на греческий пляж Дикеллон. Последним очень длинным пляжем, многокилометровым и шириной 25 метров, в Александруполисе и в районе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки является пляж Дикеллон. До этого пляжа очень легко добраться, и вы можете припарковаться у дороги, прямо напротив пляжа. У этого семейного пляжа очень слабая инфраструктура, большая часть сосредоточена вокруг пляжных баров. Рестораны и пляжные бары расположены либо на пляже, либо рядом, и доступны вдоль всего участка пляжа. Основная поверхность на пляже - это мелкая галька, естественной тени, как и деревьев, здесь нет. Уклон пляжа нормальный, заход в воду удобный, точка купания - около 5 метров. Некоторое жилье здесь также доступно, но только в виде апартаментов или комнат. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3394, 'ru', 1),
(1820, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на греческий галечный пляж Сапес. Единственный пляж, который город Сапес называет своим, - это Паралия Сапес. Тем не менее в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки этот пляж больше подходит для тех, кто ищет приключений, а не комфорта. Здесь практически нет инфраструктуры, но совсем рядом есть археологические раскопки под названием Хорос Архея. Сам пляж в основном галечный. Парковка только у дороги, официальной парковки нет. Его длина составляет 1 километр, а максимальная ширина - 20 метров. Наклон на пляже нормальный, вход в воду удобный, точка купания - 20 метров. На этом пляже нет жилья, не поблизости, а в нескольких километрах от него. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3395, 'ru', 1),
(1821, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на греческий пляж Профитис Илиас. Натуральные оттенки не часто можно встретить на пляжах в окрестностях города Марония. Но эта паралия, или пляж по-английски, другая. Он по-прежнему принадлежит региону Anatoliki Makedonia kai Thraki, это семейный пляж со смесью песка, гальки и больших камней. Парковка возможна перед пляжем, также приветствуются автодома. Здесь есть базовая пляжная инфраструктура, но не ожидайте слишком многого. Здесь есть пляжный бар, ресторана нет. Длина пляжа 750 метров, ширина 30 метров, наклон пляжа нормальный. При входе в воду у вас есть удобный вход в воду, вы можете рассчитывать начать плавание уже с 5 метров. Размещение, особенно апартаменты, доступны в непосредственной близости. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3397, 'ru', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1822, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Настоящий пляж для приключений - это то, чего вы можете ожидать, посещая греческий пляж Паралия Глифада. Он расположен в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки, который является северо-восточной частью этой знаменитой страны и является частью муниципалитета города Комотини. Дорога, ведущая к пляжу, вымощена, и вы можете припарковаться прямо перед пляжем. Если вы поклонник пляжа, где почти нет инфраструктуры, только парковка, в том числе автодома, то этот пляж для вас. В противном случае вам следует избегать этого и посетить какой-нибудь пляж поближе к городку Фанари. Основная поверхность пляжа в основном состоит из песка, но у вас также есть немного гальки, смешанной с ним. Этот пляж очень длинный, более 1 километра, а максимальная ширина составляет всего 10 метров. Точка плавания уже на 10 метрах. Одной из особенностей, которая делает этот пляж особенным, являются небольшие скалы красного цвета на фоне пляжа. Жилье находится далеко, как и рестораны. Наслаждайтесь этим особенным пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3399, 'ru', 1),
(1823, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на прекрасный песчаный пляж Месис. Он расположен в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки, между городами Александруполи и Кавала. Добраться до этого пляжа на автомобиле очень легко, в том числе и с автодомом. Прямо перед пляжем, всего в 30 метрах от отеля, имеется очень большая парковка. Основная поверхность пляжа - песок, но на пляже есть трава и деревья за парковкой. Общая длина пляжа составляет несколько километров, а в самой широкой части - 40 метров в ширину. Если вы семья с маленькими детьми, которым требуется немного больше защиты от солнца, вам понравится этот пляж, потому что вы можете спокойно оставаться под естественной тенью деревьев. На пляже у вас есть вся необходимая пляжная инфраструктура, ресторан и кафе-бар также доступны прямо на пляже. Если вы влюбились в пляж Мезис и хотели бы провести здесь свой летний отпуск, у вас есть жилье в виде апартаментов и комнат всего в нескольких сотнях метров от отеля. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3400, 'ru', 1),
(1824, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на песчаный пляж Ароги Фанари. Греческий город Фанари известен своими прекрасными песчаными пляжами. Здесь есть много особых пляжей. Один из них, Ароги Фанари, - настоящая красавица. Дорога к пляжу заасфальтирована. Сюда можно приехать на любом транспортном средстве, в том числе и на автодоме. Парковка прямо перед пляжем, очень большая и вымощена. Пляж имеет длину несколько километров, ширину 50 метров и имеет хороший вход в воду, всего через 3 метра вы уже можете начинать плавание. Основная поверхность - песок, но у вас также есть естественная тень от некоторых небольших деревьев, присутствующих здесь. Здесь имеется вся необходимая пляжная инфраструктура, включая пляжную спортивную площадку. На этом пляже вы точно не проголодаетесь и не захотите пить, здесь много ресторанов и пляжных баров. Также доступно размещение, в основном апартаменты, и у вас даже есть гостиница поблизости. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3401, 'ru', 1),
(1825, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на греческий пляж Паралия Фанари кентро. В маленьком городке Фанари есть много хороших пляжей. Здесь мы представляем пляж, основная поверхность которого представляет собой смесь песка и гальки. Вы можете добраться до этого пляжа на любом транспортном средстве, в том числе на автодоме. Парковка очень большая, а поблизости есть автокемпинг. Характеристики пляжа следующие: общая длина - 500 метров, максимальная ширина - 30 метров, точка купания - 20 метров. Это не семейный пляж, но он больше подходит для любителей приключений. Инфраструктура пляжа очень плохая, поэтому не рассчитывайте на высокий комфорт, там нет туалетов и душевых. На самом пляже нет ресторанов или баров, за исключением одного ресторана, который находится недалеко от пляжа, примерно в 200 метрах от него, больше баров и тому подобных есть в сторону города. Когда дело доходит до размещения, у вас определенно больше услуг. Доступен широкий выбор квартир, комнат, отелей и даже кемпингов. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3402, 'ru', 1),
(1826, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на греческий городской пляж Фанари. Расположенный в греческом регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки, этот пляж обязательно нужно посетить, если вам нравится какое-то разнообразие пляжей на пляже. Хотя основная поверхность - песок, здесь также есть галька и даже камни. До него очень легко добраться на любом транспортном средстве, даже с автодомом, и у вас есть место для парковки прямо перед пляжем. Общая длина пляжа составляет 500 метров, ширина - 25 метров. Место для купания находится на высоте 10 метров, и у вас очень разнообразный наклон склонов. Этот пляж не прямой, но он представляет собой множество разных форм, некоторые из которых очень романтичны. Поскольку он расположен прямо в городе, здесь есть множество пляжных услуг, которые удовлетворят все ваши потребности. Рядом находится городская пристань для яхт и порт. Если вам нравится естественная тень на пляже, вы можете даже пойти в небольшой парк, чтобы защитить себя от летнего солнца. Питание доступно в самых разных формах. Жилье тоже рядом, в основном апартаменты или комнаты, недалеко находится кемпинг. Желаем вам удачного отдыха на Паралия Фанари с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3403, 'ru', 1),
(1827, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на греческий песчаный детский пляж Паралия Мандра. Этот пляж - один из немногих в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки, который действительно подходит для маленьких детей. Мелководье присутствует повсюду вдоль береговой линии пляжа. Он особенно подходит для маленьких детей, так как точка купания находится на 100 м и более, вода здесь действительно мелкая. Дорога к пляжу асфальтированная и находится в хорошем состоянии. Парковка находится прямо перед пляжем и может вместить несколько автомобилей, в том числе автодома. Это песчаный пляж с естественной тенью и множеством пляжных инфраструктур. Общая длина пляжа составляет несколько километров, а ширина - 30 метров. Уклон пляжа очень небольшой, он почти плоский, как и морское дно, что делает этот пляж очень безопасным для маленьких детей. Здесь имеется вся необходимая пляжная инфраструктура, включая детскую площадку, а также несколько спортивных площадок. Рядом находится автокемпинг, поэтому искать жилье в окрестностях не нужно. На пляже также есть пляжный бар и ресторан. Итак, если вы семья с маленькими детьми, вам стоит посетить пляж Мандра, вы не пожалеете об этом. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3404, 'ru', 1),
(1828, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на греческий пляж Ай Яннис. В Греции есть самые разные пляжи. Они бывают разных форм и размеров. Особый вид пляжа - это пляж, на котором вы едете по дороге на километры, причем пляж находится рядом с дорогой, всего в нескольких метрах от нее. Что ж, если вам нравятся такие пляжи, предлагаем вам посетить пляж Паралия Ай Яннис. Ближайший городок называется Авдира, и он славится множеством песчаных пляжей в окрестностях. Большинство из них длинные, но паралия Ай Яннис имеет длину всего 200 метров, максимальную ширину 15 метров и красивый и привлекательный пляжный изгиб. Здесь не так много вариантов парковки, некоторые из них доступны прямо напротив пляжа. По краю пляжа есть камни, а место для купания находится уже на высоте 3 метров. Здесь присутствует вся необходимая пляжная инфраструктура, также есть пляжный бар прямо на пляже. Жилье также доступно в непосредственной близости от пляжа, в основном в виде апартаментов и комнат, но у вас нет отелей. Наслаждайтесь пляжем с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3405, 'ru', 1),
(1829, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на песчаный пляж Паралия Миродато. Он расположен недалеко от городка Авдира в восточном греческом регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки. Вы можете проехать сюда на всех видах транспорта, а прямо напротив пляжа вас ждет очень большая парковка. Парковка асфальтированная и очень большая. Этот пляж не очень туристический, он более тихий, а в его окрестностях почти нет туристической инфраструктуры. Общая протяженность пляжа более 1 километра; ширина 100 метров. Здесь все еще есть развитая пляжная инфраструктура. Детям, особенно маленьким, понравится этот пляж. Заход в воду очень мелкий, точка купания находится на высоте 75 метров, а вокруг много детских и спортивных площадок. Если вы фанат пляжного волейбола, вам обязательно понравится этот песчаный пляж. Здесь также есть рестораны и пляжные бары, где вам предложат одни из лучших блюд греческой кухни. Если вы хотите остаться здесь на более длительный срок, вы можете остановиться в отеле или в квартире, которые находятся очень близко к пляжу. Наслаждайтесь отдыхом в Греции с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3406, 'ru', 1),
(1830, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на прекрасный песчаный пляж Паралия Мангана. Если вы любите песок на пляже, вы будете чувствовать себя здесь как дома. Этот пляж расположен в греческом графстве Топейрос, что находится в восточной части Греции в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки. Общая длина пляжа составляет более 1 километра, и он очень широкий, более 100 м, так что у вас действительно есть много места, чтобы найти себе место. Парковка находится прямо перед пляжем, она очень большая и очень подходит для автодомов. Пляж окружен болотом, поэтому не ждите размещения поблизости. Хотя он так удален от любой туристической индустрии, у вас действительно есть много пляжной инфраструктуры, включая поля для пляжного волейбола. Если вы проголодались или хотите пить, вы можете отведать блюда греческой кухни прямо на пляже в пляжном баре. Плавать можно после 30 метров входа в воду. И помните, всегда наслаждайтесь пляжным отдыхом с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3407, 'ru', 1),
(1831, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Как насчет греческого песчаного пляжа, где вы можете припарковать свой дом на колесах или любой другой автомобиль прямо напротив пляжа. Если вы ищете такой пляж в греческом регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки, мы рекомендуем вам посетить пляж Паралия Вриси. Парковка здесь очень плоская и очень широкая, у вас действительно много места для парковки. Здесь присутствует некоторая пляжная инфраструктура, в том числе детская и спортивная площадка. Также здесь есть пляжный бар. И, как это принято в Греции, вы также можете взять с собой собаку на пляж. Общая протяженность пляжа более 1 км, также довольно широкая, 30 метров. У него нормальный наклон и точка плавания находится уже на 5 метрах после входа в воду. Здесь нет естественной тени, поэтому возьмите с собой зонтики или арендуйте их на пляже. Здесь есть жилье, но не рядом с пляжем. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти пляж своей мечты.</div>\n', 3419, 'ru', 1),
(1832, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Если вы ищете средиземноморскую страну с множеством прекрасных пляжей, вы не ошибетесь с Грецией. Пляжи Греции, как известно, имеют, по крайней мере, небольшой уровень туристической индустрии вокруг пляжа. Что ж, если вам нравится противоположное, пляж без туристической индустрии, пляж для настоящих искателей приключений, мы рекомендуем вам посетить паралию Акротирир Аполлониас. Он расположен в восточной части Греции в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки. На пляже практически нет пляжной инфраструктуры, кроме парковки, состоящей из грязи. Вы можете припарковаться почти прямо перед пляжем. На самом пляже смесь песка и камней, а некоторые участки пляжа могут быть скользкими из-за мокрых камней. Вход в воду легкий, кроме скал. Собакам понравится это место. Общая длина пляжа составляет 500 метров, ширина - 25 метров, он имеет нормальный наклон, и вы можете начинать плавание уже после 3-х метрового входа в воду. Некоторые участки пляжа также отведены для нудистов. Возьмите с собой всю еду и напитки, потому что здесь нет пляжных баров и ресторанов. То же самое и с проживанием, поблизости его нет. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти пляж своей мечты.</div>\n', 3418, 'ru', 1),
(1833, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на Паралия Офриниу, особенный песчаный пляж. Если вы ищете песчаные пляжи в Греции, вы скоро обнаружите, что их много. Фактически, большинство из них относится к песчаному типу. Тот, который мы здесь описываем, расположен в восточной части Греции, в регионе Анатолики Македония кай Фраки. Это главный пляж в деревне Паралия Офриниу. Как это обычно бывает в Греции, к этому пляжу очень легко добраться на любом автомобиле, а также автодоме, и вы можете припарковаться прямо перед пляжем. Характеристики пляжа потрясающие, это очень длинный пляж, протяженностью более 1 км, и он также очень широкий, 75 метров. Наклон на пляже нормальный, почти пологий, точка купания уже на высоте 3 метра. Здесь много пляжной инфраструктуры, есть много разных спортивных площадок, конечно, обычный пляжный волейбол и, конечно же, баскетбольная площадка. В некоторых местах есть даже трава, и есть деревья, которые защищают вас от солнца. Количество магазинов и баров потрясающее, их так много, у вас действительно так много вариантов кухни, это настоящее туристическое место. Вам просто понравится это место. А если у вас есть собака, вы можете привести ее также на пляж. Не нужно беспокоиться о размещении здесь, доступно множество различных вариантов, в основном апартаменты и некоторые отели. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти пляж своей мечты.</div>\n', 3420, 'ru', 1),
(1834, 'Этот пляж - настоящий пляж для искателей приключений. Он очень длинный, более километров и до 25 метров в ширину. Сама парковка очень большая, и вы можете припарковаться даже под деревьями. Дорога к пляжу в конце грунтовая, местами немного крутая. Доступ к пляжу очень простой, плата за вход на пляж не взимается, наклон пляжа нормальный, и вы можете начинать плавание уже через 5 м от входа в воду. Инфраструктуры пляжа практически нет, но сам пляж стоит посетить. Здесь так много деревьев, которые дают вам убежище на случай, если солнце станет слишком жарким. Но имейте в виду, что официально вы не можете расположиться там лагерем.', 3426, 'ru', 1),
(1835, 'Ta plaža je prava avanturistična plaža. Je zelo dolga, več kilometrov in &scaron;iroka do 25 m. Samo parkiri&scaron;če je zelo veliko in parkirate lahko celo pod drevesi. Pot do plaže je na koncu makadamska, ponekod nekoliko strma. Dostop do plaže je zelo enostaven, vstopnine za plažo ni potrebno plačati, naklon plaže je normalen in z plavanjem lahko začnete že po 5 m vstopa v vodo. Infrastruktura na plaži skorajda ni prisotna, vendar je plažo vseeno vredno obiskati. Ker je tukaj veliko dreves, ki vam daje zavetje, če se sonce preveč segreje. Kampiranje na plaži uradno ni dovoljeno, če pa imate hi&scaron;nega ljubljenčka, psa, ga lahko pripeljete s seboj na plažo, tako kot je to običaj v Grčiji.', 3426, 'sl', 1),
(1836, 'Ova je plaža prava avanturistička plaža. Vrlo je dugačak, nekoliko kilometara i &scaron;irok do 25 m. Samo parkirali&scaron;te je vrlo veliko, a možete čak i parkirati ispod drveća. Put do plaže je na kraju makadamski, ponegdje ne&scaron;to strm. Pristup plaži je vrlo jednostavan, za nju se ne plaća ulaz, nagib plaže je normalan i možete početi plivati ​​nakon 5 m ulaska u vodu. Infrastruktura na plaži gotovo da i ne postoji, ali plažu je ipak vrijedno posjetiti. Jer ovdje ima puno drveća koje vam daje zaklon ako sunce postane prevruće. Kampiranje na plaži službeno nije dozvoljeno, ali ako imate kućnog ljubimca, psa, možete ga ponijeti sa sobom na plažu, kao &scaron;to je to običaj u Grčkoj.', 3426, 'hr', 1),
(1837, 'Cette plage est une v&eacute;ritable plage d&#39;aventure. Il est tr&egrave;s long, plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 25 m de large. Le parking lui-m&ecirc;me est tr&egrave;s grand et vous pouvez m&ecirc;me vous garer sous les arbres. Le chemin menant &agrave; la plage est en macadam &agrave; la fin, un peu raide &agrave; certains endroits. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s facile, il n&#39;y a pas de frais d&#39;entr&eacute;e pour la plage, la pente de la plage est normale et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; vous baigner apr&egrave;s 5 m d&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau. L&#39;infrastructure sur la plage est presque inexistante, mais la plage vaut tout de m&ecirc;me le d&eacute;tour. Parce qu&#39;il y a beaucoup d&#39;arbres ici qui vous offrent un abri si le soleil devient trop chaud. Le camping sur la plage n&#39;est pas officiellement autoris&eacute;, mais si vous avez un animal de compagnie, un chien, vous pouvez l&#39;emmener avec vous &agrave; la plage, comme c&#39;est la coutume en Gr&egrave;ce.', 3426, 'fr', 1),
(1838, 'Questa spiaggia &egrave; una vera spiaggia d&#39;avventura. &Egrave; molto lungo, diversi chilometri e largo fino a 25 m. Il parcheggio in s&eacute; &egrave; molto grande e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare anche sotto gli alberi. Il sentiero per la spiaggia &egrave; di macadam alla fine, un po &#39;ripido in alcuni punti. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto agevole, non &egrave; previsto l&#39;ingresso alla spiaggia, la pendenza della spiaggia &egrave; normale e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare dopo 5 m dall&#39;ingresso in acqua. L&#39;infrastruttura sulla spiaggia &egrave; quasi inesistente, ma la spiaggia merita comunque una visita. Perch&eacute; qui ci sono molti alberi che ti danno riparo se il sole diventa troppo caldo. Il campeggio sulla spiaggia non &egrave; ufficialmente consentito, ma se hai un animale domestico, un cane, puoi portarlo con te in spiaggia, come &egrave; consuetudine in Grecia.', 3426, 'it', 1),
(1839, 'Esta playa es una aut&eacute;ntica playa de aventuras. Es muy largo, varios kil&oacute;metros y hasta 25 m de ancho. El estacionamiento en s&iacute; es muy grande e incluso se puede estacionar debajo de los &aacute;rboles. El camino a la playa es de macad&aacute;n al final, algo empinado en algunos lugares. El acceso a la playa es muy f&aacute;cil, no hay tarifa de entrada a la playa, la pendiente de la playa es normal y se puede empezar a nadar a los 5 m de la entrada al agua. La infraestructura en la playa es casi inexistente, pero la playa a&uacute;n merece una visita. Porque aqu&iacute; hay muchos &aacute;rboles que te dan cobijo si el sol calienta demasiado. No se permite oficialmente acampar en la playa, pero si tienes una mascota, un perro, puedes llevarlo contigo a la playa, como es costumbre en Grecia.', 3426, 'es', 1),
(1840, 'Добро пожаловать на красивый греческий галечный пляж Паралия Иерису. Полуостров Халкидики полон хороших пляжей. В городе Иериссос есть очень длинный пляж, протяженностью более 1 км, который состоит из песка и частично из мелких и очень мелких камней. Максимальная ширина пляжа 25 метров, пляж имеет нормальный уклон. Вода здесь падает довольно быстро; можно начинать плавать уже через 5 метров после входа в воду. Рекомендуется для семейного отдыха. Парковка для всех видов транспортных средств, в том числе автодомов, доступна прямо перед пляжем. Рядом с пляжем есть место для кемпинга, а перед кемпингом большая автостоянка. Инфраструктура пляжа находится на высоком уровне, а вокруг пляжа много пляжных баров и множество вариантов для размещения. Общий перечень пляжной инфраструктуры очень длинный. Если у вас есть собака, вы можете взять ее с собой на пляж. Дети могут поиграть на детских площадках, а те, кто любит заниматься спортом, могут позаниматься на некоторых спортивных площадках. На пляже также есть пирс, с которого можно прыгнуть в воду или отправиться ловить рыбу. Размещение и греческая кухня на пляже или поблизости доступны во многих формах. Наслаждайтесь пляжем и помните: всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти свой идеальный пляж.', 3427, 'ru', 1),
(1841, 'Один из последних пляжей на полуострове Халкидики до границы с Афоном - пляж Неа Рода. Он расположен в регионе Кентрики Македония, который находится в восточной части Греции. Это пляж семейного типа, и из-за детских площадок он понравится вашим детям. Парковка находится напротив пляжа, и парковка очень большая, вы также можете припарковать здесь свой дом на колесах. На самом пляже преимущественно песок. Вы можете положить полотенце на очень большую поверхность пляжа, длина 500 метров, ширина 15 метров и нормальный наклон. Вы можете начинать плавание после 10 метров входа в воду. В окрестностях есть много ресторанов и много типов жилья. Здесь в вашем распоряжении множество пляжных инфраструктур, доступно множество пляжных услуг. Рядом с пляжем есть пирс и пристань для яхт. Если у вас есть собака, здесь ее ждут. Наслаждайтесь пляжем и помните: всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти свой идеальный пляж.', 3428, 'ru', 1),
(1842, 'После того, как вы посетите этот пляж, он обязательно станет пляжем вашей мечты, который вы будете посещать много раз. Это один из самых красивых пляжей, который вы когда-либо посещали в своей жизни. Он содержит все, что вы ищете. Здесь много песка, вода кристально чистая, немного естественной тени, а немного травы есть прямо на пляже. Заходить в воду приятно и комфортно. Это настоящая жемчужина Халкидики. Здесь тоже есть автостоянка, но ехать придется по гравийной дороге и иногда сложно добраться до бесплатного места для парковки. Там может быть 20 бесплатных парковочных мест, но их будет больше, если вы направитесь в соседний прибрежный курорт, где вам придется платить за парковку. Есть также ресторан и несколько апартаментов рядом с пляжем, если вы хотите остаться здесь на летние каникулы. Вся территория также очень привлекательна для некоторых хороших снимков для вашей учетной записи Instagram, так что возьмите с собой лучшее фото или видео оборудование. Вы можете найти более красивые и привлекательные пляжи в нашей обширной базе европейских пляжей. И помните, самый быстрый и простой способ найти пляж своей мечты - это BeachRex.', 3433, 'ru', 1),
(1843, 'Una vez que visite esta playa, sin duda se convertir&aacute; en la playa de sus sue&ntilde;os para visitar muchas veces. Es una de las playas m&aacute;s hermosas que jam&aacute;s visitar&aacute; en su vida. Tiene todo lo que buscas. Tiene mucha arena, el agua es cristalina, incluso hay algo de sombra natural y algo de c&eacute;sped disponible directamente en la playa. La entrada al agua es agradable y c&oacute;moda. Es un verdadero m&aacute;rmol de la regi&oacute;n de Halkidiki. El estacionamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;, pero debe conducir por un camino de tierra y, a veces, puede ser complicado llegar al lugar de estacionamiento. Quiz&aacute;s haya 20 espacios disponibles gratis o m&aacute;s si vas a un resort de playa, donde debes pagar por el estacionamiento. Un restaurante tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; aqu&iacute; y hay algunos apartamentos en las cercan&iacute;as de la playa si desea quedarse aqu&iacute; durante sus vacaciones de verano. Toda el &aacute;rea es muy atractiva tambi&eacute;n para algunas buenas fotos en su cuenta de Instagram, as&iacute; que traiga su mejor equipo de fotograf&iacute;a o video.', 3433, 'es', 1),
(1844, 'Una volta che visiti questa spiaggia, diventer&agrave; sicuramente la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni da visitare molte volte. &Egrave; una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; belle che tu abbia mai visitato nella tua vita. Ha tutto quello che stai cercando. Ha molta sabbia, l&#39;acqua &egrave; cristallina, c&#39;&egrave; anche un po &#39;d&#39;ombra naturale e un po&#39; d&#39;erba a disposizione direttamente sulla spiaggia. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e confortevole. &Egrave; un vero marmo nella regione di Halkidiki. Il parcheggio &egrave; disponibile anche qui, ma &egrave; necessario guidare su una strada sterrata e talvolta pu&ograve; essere difficile raggiungere il parcheggio. Ci sono forse 20 posti disponibili gratuitamente o pi&ugrave; se vai in uno stabilimento balneare, dove devi pagare il parcheggio. C&#39;&egrave; anche un ristorante qui e ci sono alcuni appartamenti nelle vicinanze della spiaggia se vuoi rimanere qui per le tue vacanze estive. L&#39;intera area &egrave; molto interessante anche per alcuni bei scatti sul tuo account instagram, quindi porta con te la tua migliore attrezzatura fotografica o video.', 3433, 'it', 1),
(1845, 'Une fois que vous aurez visit&eacute; cette plage, elle deviendra certainement la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves &agrave; visiter plusieurs fois. C&#39;est l&#39;une des plus belles plages que vous visiterez jamais de votre vie. Il a tout ce que vous recherchez. Il y a beaucoup de sable, l&#39;eau est limpide, il y a m&ecirc;me de l&#39;ombre naturelle et de l&#39;herbe disponible directement sur la plage. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et confortable. C&#39;est un vrai marbre de la r&eacute;gion de Halkidiki. Un parking est &eacute;galement disponible ici mais vous devez conduire sur un chemin de terre et il peut &ecirc;tre parfois difficile d&#39;atteindre la place de parking. Il y a peut-&ecirc;tre 20 places disponibles gratuitement ou plus si vous allez dans une station baln&eacute;aire, o&ugrave; vous devez payer le parking. Un restaurant est &eacute;galement ici et il y a quelques appartements &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la plage si vous souhaitez rester ici pour vos vacances d&#39;&eacute;t&eacute;. L&#39;ensemble de la zone est tr&egrave;s attractif &eacute;galement pour quelques jolis clich&eacute;s sur votre compte instagram, alors apportez votre meilleur &eacute;quipement photo ou vid&eacute;o avec vous.', 3433, 'fr', 1),
(1846, 'Ko enkrat obi&scaron;čete to plažo, bo zagotovo postala va&scaron;a sanjska plaža, ki jo boste obiskali velikokrat. Je ena najlep&scaron;ih plaž, ki jo boste kdaj obiskali v življenju. Vsebuje vse, kar i&scaron;čete. Ima veliko peska, voda je kristalno čista, nekaj naravne sence in nekaj trave je na voljo neposredno na plaži. Vstop v vodo je prijeten in udoben. Je pravi biser na območju Halkidikija. Tu je na voljo tudi parkiri&scaron;če, voziti pa morate po makadamski cesti in včasih je težko priti do prostega parkirnega mesta. Na voljo je morda 20 prostorov za brezplačno parkiranje , jih je pa več na voljo, če se odpravite na obalno letovi&scaron;če v bližini, kjer morate plačati parkiranje. Tu je tudi restavracija in v bližini plaže je nekaj apartmajev, če bi radi ostali tukaj na poletnih počitnicah. Celotno območje je zelo privlačno tudi za nekaj lepih posnetkov za va&scaron;em instagram računu, zato s seboj imejte svojo najbolj&scaron;o foto ali video opremo. Več lepih in privlačnih plaž lahko najdete v na&scaron;i ob&scaron;irni bazi plaže Evrope. In ne pozabite, najhitreje in najlažje boste na&scaron;li svojo sanjsko plažo z BeachRex-om.', 3433, 'sl', 1),
(1847, 'Jednom posjetite ovu plažu, zasigurno će postati va&scaron;a plaža iz snova koju ćete posjetiti mnogo puta. To je jedna od najljep&scaron;ih plaža koje ćete ikada posjetiti u životu. Sadrži sve &scaron;to tražite. Ima puno pijeska, voda je kristalno čista, ne&scaron;to prirodne hladovine i malo trave dostupno je izravno na plaži. Ulazak u vodu je ugodan i ugodan. Pravi je biser na području Halkidikija. Ovdje postoji i parkirali&scaron;te, ali morate se voziti makadamskom cestom i ponekad je te&scaron;ko doći do besplatnog parkirnog mjesta. Na raspolaganju će biti 20 besplatnih parkirnih mjesta, ali dostupno je i vi&scaron;e ako se uputite u obližnje obalno odmarali&scaron;te gdje morate platiti parkiranje. Tu je i restoran, a ima nekoliko apartmana u blizini plaže ako želite ovdje ostati na ljetovanju. Čitavo područje je također vrlo atraktivno za neke lijepe snimke za va&scaron; instagram račun, zato ponesite sa sobom najbolju foto ili video opremu. U na&scaron;oj &scaron;irokoj bazi europskih plaža možete pronaći ljep&scaron;e i atraktivnije plaže. I zapamtite, najbrži i najlak&scaron;i način da pronađete plažu iz snova je uz BeachRex.', 3433, 'hr', 1),
(1848, 'Ta neverjetna pe&scaron;čena plaža s kristalno čisto vodo z rahlo torkizno barvo vas bo prevzela in sigurno se boste zaljubili. Plaža pripada regiji Kentriki Makedonija in pripada mestu Ormos Panagias. Dolgo je več kot en kilometer in &scaron;iroka do 40 m, parkiri&scaron;če se nahaja tik ob plaži. V nevihtnem vremenu bo to idealno mesto za jadranje na deski ali kajtanje. V bližini so tudi nastanitve, kot so apartmaji in proste sobe. Nekaj plažne infrastrukture je na voljo tudi neposredno na plaži, vendar je večinoma zgo&scaron;čena okoli barov na plaži ali podobnih gostinskih lokalov. Vstop v vodo je zelo prijeten in že po 10 metrih vstopa v vodo lahko začnete plavati. Celotno območje je zelo privlačno tudi za nekaj lepih posnetkov za va&scaron;em instagram računu, zato s seboj imejte svojo najbolj&scaron;o foto ali video opremo. Več lepih in privlačnih plaž lahko najdete v na&scaron;i ob&scaron;irni bazi plaže Evrope. In ne pozabite, najhitreje in najlažje boste na&scaron;li svojo sanjsko plažo z BeachRex-om.', 3432, 'sl', 1),
(1849, 'Ova nevjerojatna pje&scaron;čana plaža s kristalno čistom vodom blage tirkizne boje iznenadit će vas i zasigurno ćete se zaljubiti. Plaža pripada regiji Kentriki Makedonija i pripada Ormosu Panagiasu. Dug je vi&scaron;e od jednog kilometra i &scaron;irok do 40 metara, parkirali&scaron;te se nalazi tik uz plažu. Po olujnom vremenu ovo će biti idealno mjesto za jedrenje na dasci ili kajtanje. Smje&scaron;taj kao &scaron;to su apartmani i slobodne sobe također su u blizini. Određena infrastruktura na plaži također je dostupna izravno na plaži, ali uglavnom je koncentrirana oko barova na plaži ili sličnih restorana. Ulazak u vodu je vrlo ugodan i nakon 10 metara ulaska u vodu možete početi plivati. Čitavo područje je također vrlo atraktivno za neke lijepe snimke za va&scaron; instagram račun, pa ponesite sa sobom najbolju foto ili video opremu. U na&scaron;oj &scaron;irokoj bazi europskih plaža možete pronaći ljep&scaron;e i atraktivnije plaže. I zapamtite, najbrži i najlak&scaron;i način da pronađete plažu iz snova je uz BeachRex.', 3432, 'hr', 1),
(1850, 'Этот удивительный песчаный пляж с кристально чистой водой слегка бирюзового цвета удивит вас и вы обязательно влюбитесь. Пляж принадлежит региону Кентрики Македония и принадлежит Ормос Панагиас. Его длина более километра, ширина до 40 метров, парковка находится прямо у пляжа. В ненастную погоду это будет идеальное место для виндсерфинга или кайтинга. Жилье, такое как апартаменты и свободные комнаты, также находится поблизости. Некоторая пляжная инфраструктура также доступна прямо на пляже, но в основном она сосредоточена вокруг пляжных баров или подобных ресторанов. Заходить в воду очень приятно, и через 10 метров можно начинать плавать. Вся территория также очень привлекательна для некоторых хороших снимков для вашей учетной записи Instagram, так что возьмите с собой лучшее фото или видео оборудование. Вы можете найти более красивые и привлекательные пляжи в нашей обширной базе европейских пляжей. И помните, самый быстрый и простой способ найти пляж своей мечты - это BeachRex.', 3432, 'ru', 1),
(1851, 'Esta incre&iacute;ble playa de arena de agua cristalina con un ligero color turquesa te sorprender&aacute; y seguro que te enamorar&aacute;s. La playa pertenece a la regi&oacute;n de Kentriki Macedonia y pertenece a Ormos Panagias. Tiene m&aacute;s de un kil&oacute;metro de largo y hasta 40 metros de ancho, el estacionamiento est&aacute; ubicado justo al lado de la playa. En tiempo de tormenta, este ser&aacute; un lugar ideal para practicar windsurf o kite. Alojamientos como apartamentos y habitaciones vac&iacute;as tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n cerca. Parte de la infraestructura de la playa tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible directamente en la playa, pero se concentra principalmente alrededor de chiringuitos o restaurantes similares. Entrar al agua es muy agradable y despu&eacute;s de 10 metros de entrar al agua se puede empezar a nadar. Toda el &aacute;rea tambi&eacute;n es muy atractiva para algunas buenas tomas para tu cuenta de instagram, as&iacute; que lleva contigo tu mejor equipo de fotograf&iacute;a o video. Puede encontrar playas m&aacute;s hermosas y atractivas en nuestra extensa base de playas europeas. Y recuerde, la forma m&aacute;s r&aacute;pida y sencilla de encontrar la playa de sus sue&ntilde;os es con BeachRex.', 3432, 'es', 1),
(1852, 'Cette incroyable plage de sable aux eaux cristallines avec une l&eacute;g&egrave;re couleur turquoise vous surprendra et vous tomberez s&ucirc;rement amoureux. La plage appartient &agrave; la r&eacute;gion Kentriki Mac&eacute;doine et appartient &agrave; Ormos Panagias. Il fait plus d&#39;un kilom&egrave;tre de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 40 m&egrave;tres de large, le parking est situ&eacute; juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage. Par temps orageux, ce sera un endroit id&eacute;al pour la planche &agrave; voile ou le kite. Des h&eacute;bergements tels que des appartements et des chambres vacantes sont &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Certaines infrastructures de plage sont &eacute;galement disponibles directement sur la plage, mais elles sont principalement concentr&eacute;es autour des bars de plage ou des restaurants similaires. Entrer dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et apr&egrave;s 10 m&egrave;tres d&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau, vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager. L&#39;ensemble de la zone est &eacute;galement tr&egrave;s attractif pour de jolis clich&eacute;s pour votre compte instagram, alors ayez votre meilleur &eacute;quipement photo ou vid&eacute;o avec vous. Vous pouvez trouver des plages plus belles et attrayantes dans notre vaste base de plages europ&eacute;ennes. Et n&#39;oubliez pas que le moyen le plus rapide et le plus simple de trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves est avec BeachRex.', 3432, 'fr', 1),
(1853, 'Questa meravigliosa spiaggia sabbiosa con acqua cristallina con un leggero colore turchese ti sorprender&agrave; e te ne innamorerai sicuramente. La spiaggia appartiene alla regione di Kentriki Macedonia e appartiene a Ormos Panagias. &Egrave; lungo pi&ugrave; di un chilometro e largo fino a 40 metri, il parcheggio si trova proprio accanto alla spiaggia. In caso di tempesta, questo sar&agrave; un luogo ideale per il windsurf o il kite. Anche alloggi come appartamenti e camere libere si trovano nelle vicinanze. Alcune infrastrutture balneari sono disponibili anche direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma sono per lo pi&ugrave; concentrate intorno a bar sulla spiaggia o ristoranti simili. Entrare in acqua &egrave; molto piacevole e dopo 10 metri di entrata in acqua si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare. L&#39;intera area &egrave; anche molto attraente per alcuni bei scatti per il tuo account Instagram, quindi porta con te la tua migliore attrezzatura fotografica o video. Puoi trovare spiagge pi&ugrave; belle e attraenti nella nostra vasta base di spiagge europee. E ricorda, il modo pi&ugrave; semplice e veloce per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni &egrave; con BeachRex.', 3432, 'it', 1),
(1854, 'La plage de Karidi est une plage de sable blanc. Et avec l&#39;eau cristalline, vous pouvez imaginer la beaut&eacute; de cet endroit. Cette plage est l&#39;une des plus belles de la r&eacute;gion de Halkidiki et c&#39;est une visite incontournable si vous &ecirc;tes pr&egrave;s de cette r&eacute;gion ou si vous aimez simplement de superbes plages. La surface du parking est en terre battue et vous pouvez laisser votre voiture sous les arbres o&ugrave; elle restera froide &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage. Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, il y a de nombreux arbres pour poser votre serviette et rester &agrave; l&#39;abri du soleil br&ucirc;lant. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &agrave; proximit&eacute;, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements et d&#39;h&ocirc;tels. Des restaurants et autres services de restauration sont &eacute;galement disponibles dans les environs. Toute la zone autour de la plage est tr&egrave;s photographi&eacute;e, vous trouverez donc de nombreux endroits pour prendre de belles photos de vous avec la plage en arri&egrave;re-plan pour vos souvenirs ou votre compte instagram. Vous pouvez trouver des plages plus belles et attrayantes dans notre vaste base de donn&eacute;es de plages europ&eacute;ennes. Et n&#39;oubliez pas que le moyen le plus rapide et le plus simple de trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves est avec BeachRex.', 3435, 'fr', 1),
(1855, 'Пляж Кариди - это пляж с белым песком. А с кристально чистой водой можно представить всю красоту этого места. Этот пляж является одним из самых красивых в районе Халкидики, и его обязательно нужно посетить, если вы находитесь рядом с этим районом или просто любите потрясающие пляжи. Поверхность парковки сделана из грязи, и вы можете оставить свою машину под деревьями, где она будет холодной, всего в нескольких метрах от пляжа. На самом пляже есть много деревьев, где можно сложить полотенце и защитить себя от палящего солнца. Жилье поблизости, в основном в виде квартир и гостиниц. Поблизости работают рестораны и другие заведения общественного питания. Вся территория вокруг пляжа очень живописна, поэтому вы найдете множество мест, где можно сделать красивые фотографии с пляжем на заднем плане для ваших воспоминаний или вашей учетной записи Instagram. Вы можете найти более красивые и привлекательные пляжи в нашей обширной базе данных европейских пляжей. И помните, самый быстрый и простой способ найти пляж своей мечты - это BeachRex.', 3435, 'ru', 1),
(1856, 'Questa meravigliosa spiaggia sabbiosa con acqua cristallina con un leggero colore turchese ti sorprender&agrave; e te ne innamorerai sicuramente. La spiaggia appartiene alla regione di Kentriki Macedonia e appartiene a Ormos Panagias. &Egrave; lungo pi&ugrave; di un chilometro e largo fino a 40 metri, il parcheggio si trova proprio accanto alla spiaggia. In caso di tempesta, questo sar&agrave; un luogo ideale per il windsurf o il kite. Anche alloggi come appartamenti e camere libere si trovano nelle vicinanze. Alcune infrastrutture balneari sono disponibili anche direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma sono per lo pi&ugrave; concentrate intorno a bar sulla spiaggia o ristoranti simili. Entrare in acqua &egrave; molto piacevole e dopo 10 metri di entrata in acqua si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare. L&#39;intera area &egrave; anche molto attraente per alcuni bei scatti per il tuo account Instagram, quindi porta con te la tua migliore attrezzatura fotografica o video. Puoi trovare spiagge pi&ugrave; belle e attraenti nella nostra vasta base di spiagge europee. E ricorda, il modo pi&ugrave; semplice e veloce per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni &egrave; con BeachRex.', 3435, 'it', 1),
(1857, 'La playa de Karidi es una playa de arena blanca. Y con el agua cristalina puedes imaginar la belleza de este lugar. Esta playa es una de las m&aacute;s hermosas de la zona de Halkidiki y es una visita obligada si est&aacute;s cerca de esta zona o simplemente te gustan las playas impresionantes. La superficie del aparcamiento est&aacute; hecha de tierra y puedes dejar tu coche bajo los &aacute;rboles donde se mantendr&aacute; fr&iacute;o a solo unos metros de la playa. En la misma playa hay muchos &aacute;rboles para dejar la toalla y protegerse del sol. El alojamiento est&aacute; cerca, principalmente en forma de apartamentos y hoteles. Restaurantes y otros servicios de catering tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles en las inmediaciones. Toda el &aacute;rea alrededor de la playa es muy fotogr&aacute;fica, por lo que encontrar&aacute;s muchos lugares para tomarte hermosas fotos con la playa de fondo para tus recuerdos o tu cuenta de instagram. Puede encontrar playas m&aacute;s hermosas y atractivas en nuestra extensa base de datos de playas europeas. Y recuerde, la forma m&aacute;s r&aacute;pida y sencilla de encontrar la playa de sus sue&ntilde;os es con BeachRex.', 3435, 'es', 1),
(1858, 'Plaža Karidi je bela pe&scaron;čena plaža. In s kristalno čisto vodo si lahko predstavljate lepoto tega kraja. Ta plaža je ena najlep&scaron;ih na območju Halkidikija, zato jo je kar dajte obiskati, če ste v bližini tega območja ali pa imate radi čudovite plaže. Parkiri&scaron;če je makadamsko, avto pa&nbsp; lahko pustite tudi pod drevesi, kjer bo hladen le nekaj metrov stran od plaže. Na sami plaži je veliko dreves, pod katere lahko položite brisačo in se za&scaron;čitite pred vročim soncem. Nastanitev je v bližini, večinoma v obliki apartmajev in hotelov. V bližini so na voljo tudi restavracije in druga gostinska ponudba. Celotno območje okoli plaže je zelo barvito, zato boste na&scaron;li veliko krajev, kjer vas lahko va&scaron; partner fotografira s plažo v ozadju, da boste s seboj odnesli lepe spomine ali pa ves dogodek objavili na va&scaron;em instagram računu. V na&scaron;i obsežni zbirki evropskih plaž najdete &scaron;e več lepih in privlačnih plaž. In ne pozabite: najhitreje in najlažje najdete svojo sanjsko plažo z BeachRexom.', 3435, 'sl', 1),
(1859, 'Plaža Karidi je bijela pje&scaron;čana plaža. A s kristalno čistom vodom možete zamisliti ljepotu ovog mjesta. Ova je plaža jedna od najljep&scaron;ih na području Halkidikija, pa je svakako posjetite ako ste u blizini ovog područja ili volite lijepe plaže. Parkirali&scaron;te je makadamsko, a automobil možete ostaviti i ispod drveća, gdje će biti hladno samo nekoliko metara od plaže. Na samoj plaži ima mnogo drveća ispod kojeg možete staviti ručnik i za&scaron;tititi se od vrućeg sunca. Smje&scaron;taj je u blizini, uglavnom u obliku apartmana i hotela. U blizini su i restorani i drugi ugostiteljski objekti. Cijelo područje oko plaže vrlo je živopisno, pa ćete pronaći mnoga mjesta na kojima vas partner može fotografirati s plažom u pozadini kako bi vam odnio lijepe uspomene ili objavio cijeli događaj na va&scaron;em instagram računu. U na&scaron;oj opsežnoj kolekciji europskih plaža pronaći ćete jo&scaron; ljep&scaron;e i atraktivnije plaže. I ne zaboravite: najbrži i najlak&scaron;i način da pronađete plažu iz snova je uz BeachRex.', 3435, 'hr', 1),
(1860, 'La spiaggia di Sarti, che si trova nella regione greca della Calcidica, &egrave; una lunghissima spiaggia sabbiosa con una vista molto spettacolare sul monte Athos. Fa parte della regione Kentriki Makedonija. Qui troverete molte infrastrutture balneari, un parco giochi per bambini &egrave; incluso e alcuni campi sportivi. Appartamenti, camere e hotel si trovano proprio accanto alla spiaggia. Anche il parcheggio &egrave; nelle vicinanze e per raggiungere la spiaggia &egrave; necessario camminare per soli 100 metri. I ristoranti e gli altri bar sono molti e qui &egrave; disponibile una grande variet&agrave; di cucine diverse. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; pi&ugrave; di 1 chilometro, &egrave; anche molto larga, 50 metri, l&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; normale, ma cade bruscamente verso l&#39;acqua, quindi si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; a 3 metri dopo essere entrati in acqua. A causa della formazione della spiaggia e in caso di tempesta, qui possono formarsi grandi onde, che possono essere molto attraenti per alcuni surfisti. Puoi trovare spiagge pi&ugrave; belle e attraenti nel nostro ampio database di spiagge europee. E ricorda, il modo pi&ugrave; semplice e veloce per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni &egrave; con BeachRex.', 3436, 'it', 1),
(1861, 'La playa de Sarti, que se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n griega de Halkidiki, es una playa de arena muy larga con una vista espectacular del monte Athos. Es parte de la regi&oacute;n Kentriki Makedonija. Aqu&iacute; encontrar&aacute; muchas infraestructuras de playa, se incluye un parque infantil y algunos campos deportivos. Apartamentos, habitaciones y hoteles est&aacute;n justo al lado de la playa. El aparcamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; cerca y solo tienes que caminar 100 metros para llegar a la playa. Los restaurantes y otros bares son abundantes y aqu&iacute; tienes una gran variedad de cocina diferente. La longitud total de la playa es de m&aacute;s de 1 kil&oacute;metro, tambi&eacute;n es muy ancho, 50 metros, la inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es normal, pero cae bruscamente hacia el agua, por lo que ya puedes empezar a nadar a los 3 metros despu&eacute;s de entrar al agua. Debido a la formaci&oacute;n de la playa y al clima tormentoso, se pueden formar grandes olas aqu&iacute;, que pueden ser muy atractivas para algunos surfistas. Puede encontrar playas m&aacute;s hermosas y atractivas en nuestra extensa base de datos de playas europeas. Y recuerde, la forma m&aacute;s r&aacute;pida y sencilla de encontrar la playa de sus sue&ntilde;os es con BeachRex.', 3436, 'es', 1),
(1862, 'La plage de Sarti, situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion grecque de Halkidiki, est une tr&egrave;s longue plage de sable avec une vue tr&egrave;s spectaculaire sur le mont Athos. Il fait partie de la r&eacute;gion Kentriki Makedonija. Ici, vous trouverez de nombreuses infrastructures de plage, une aire de jeux pour enfants est incluse ainsi que des terrains de sport. Les appartements, chambres et h&ocirc;tels sont juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage. Le parking est &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute; et vous n&#39;avez besoin de marcher que 100 m&egrave;tres pour atteindre la plage. Les restaurants et autres bars sont nombreux et vous avez une grande vari&eacute;t&eacute; de plats diff&eacute;rents disponibles ici. La longueur totale de la plage est sup&eacute;rieure &agrave; 1 kilom&egrave;tre, elle est &eacute;galement tr&egrave;s large, 50 m&egrave;tres, l&#39;inclinaison de la plage est normale, mais tombe brusquement vers l&#39;eau, vous pouvez donc commencer &agrave; nager d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 3 m&egrave;tres apr&egrave;s &ecirc;tre entr&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. En raison de la formation de la plage et par temps orageux, de grosses vagues peuvent se former ici, ce qui peut &ecirc;tre tr&egrave;s attrayant pour certains surfeurs. Vous pouvez trouver des plages plus belles et attrayantes dans notre vaste base de donn&eacute;es de plages europ&eacute;ennes. Et n&#39;oubliez pas que le moyen le plus rapide et le plus simple de trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves est avec BeachRex.', 3436, 'fr', 1),
(1863, 'Пляж Сарти, который расположен в регионе Греции Халкидики, представляет собой очень длинный песчаный пляж с очень захватывающим видом на гору Афон. Это часть региона Кентрики Македония. Здесь вы найдете много пляжной инфраструктуры, есть детская игровая площадка, а также несколько спортивных площадок. Квартиры, комнаты и отели рядом с пляжем. Парковка также находится поблизости, и вам нужно пройти всего 100 метров, чтобы добраться до пляжа. Здесь много ресторанов и других баров, и у вас есть большой выбор блюд различной кухни. Общая длина пляжа более 1 километра, он также очень широкий, 50 метров, наклон пляжа нормальный, но резко падает к воде, так что можно начинать плавать уже через 3 метра после входа в воду. Из-за формирования пляжа и в ненастную погоду здесь могут образовываться большие волны, что может быть очень привлекательно для некоторых серферов. Вы можете найти более красивые и привлекательные пляжи в нашей обширной базе данных европейских пляжей. И помните, самый быстрый и простой способ найти пляж своей мечты - это BeachRex.', 3436, 'ru', 1),
(1864, 'Plaža Sarti, ki se nahaja v gr&scaron;ki regiji Halkidiki, je zelo dolga pe&scaron;čena plaža z zelo spektakularnim pogledom na goro Atos. To je del regije Kentriki Makedonija. Tu boste na&scaron;li &scaron;tevilne plažne infrastrukture, vključeno je otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če in nekaj &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č. Apartmaji, sobe in hoteli so tik ob plaži. V bližini je tudi parkiri&scaron;če, do plaže pa morate hoditi le 100 metrov. Restavracij in drugih barov je na voljo veliko, na voljo pa je veliko različnih jedi. Skupna dolžina plaže je več kot 1 kilometer, prav tako je zelo &scaron;iroka, 50 metrov, naklon plaže je normalen, vendar močno pade proti vodi, tako da lahko začnete plavati že pri 3 metrih po vstopu v vodo. Zaradi oblike plaže in kadar je&nbsp; nevihtno vreme se tu lahko oblikujejo veliki valovi, ki so lahko zelo privlačni za nekatere deskarje. V na&scaron;i obsežni zbirki evropskih plaž lahko najdete &scaron;e ostale lepe in privlačne plaže. In ne pozabite: najhitreje in najlažje najdete svojo sanjsko plažo z BeachRexom.', 3436, 'sl', 1),
(1865, 'Plaža Sarti, smje&scaron;tena u grčkoj regiji Halkidiki, vrlo je duga pje&scaron;čana plaža s vrlo spektakularnim pogledom na Svetu Goru. Dio je regije Kentriki Makedonija. Ovdje ćete naći brojne sadržaje na plaži, uključujući dječje igrali&scaron;te i neke sportske terene. Apartmani, sobe i hoteli su tik uz plažu. U blizini se nalazi i parkirali&scaron;te, a plaža je udaljena samo 100 metara. Postoji mnogo restorana i drugih barova, a dostupno je i mnogo različitih jela. Ukupna dužina plaže je vi&scaron;e od 1 kilometra, također je vrlo &scaron;iroka, 50 metara, nagib plaže je normalan, ali naglo pada prema vodi, tako da možete početi plivati ​​već 3 metra nakon ulaska u more. voda. Zbog oblika plaže i kad je vrijeme olujno, ovdje se mogu stvoriti veliki valovi, koji nekim surferima mogu biti vrlo privlačni. U na&scaron;oj opsežnoj kolekciji europskih plaža možete pronaći i druge lijepe i atraktivne plaže. I ne zaboravite: najbrži i najlak&scaron;i način da pronađete plažu iz snova je uz BeachRex.', 3436, 'hr', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1866, 'В районе Кентрики Македония есть еще один потрясающе красивый пляж под названием Паралия Акратос. Это очень красивый песчаный пляж с очень интересными изгибами. Он определенно подходит для семей с детьми, так как здесь также есть естественная тень, парковка очень большая, а рядом с пляжем много отелей. На самом пляже можно арендовать лодки или другое водное снаряжение. Если вы хотите пить или голодать, есть даже пляжный бар и ресторан прямо на пляже. Вы можете найти более красивые и привлекательные пляжи в нашей обширной базе данных европейских пляжей. И помните, самый быстрый и простой способ найти пляж своей мечты - это BeachRex.', 3430, 'ru', 1),
(1867, 'Dans la r&eacute;gion de Kentriki Makedonija, il y a une autre magnifique plage magnifique appel&eacute;e Paralia Akrathos. C&#39;est une tr&egrave;s belle plage de sable avec des courbes tr&egrave;s int&eacute;ressantes. Il convient parfaitement aux familles avec enfants car il y a aussi de l&#39;ombre naturelle, le parking est tr&egrave;s grand et voici de nombreux h&ocirc;tels juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage. Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, vous pouvez louer des bateaux ou d&#39;autres &eacute;quipements nautiques. Si vous avez soif ou faim, il y a m&ecirc;me un bar de plage et un restaurant directement sur la plage. Vous pouvez trouver des plages plus belles et attrayantes dans notre vaste base de donn&eacute;es de plages europ&eacute;ennes. Et n&#39;oubliez pas que le moyen le plus rapide et le plus simple de trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves est avec BeachRex.', 3430, 'fr', 1),
(1868, 'En la regi&oacute;n de Kentriki Makedonija hay otra hermosa playa impresionante llamada Paralia Akrathos. Es una playa de arena muy bonita con curvas muy interesantes. Definitivamente es ideal para familias con ni&ntilde;os ya que tambi&eacute;n hay algo de sombra natural, el estacionamiento es muy grande y aqu&iacute; hay muchos hoteles que est&aacute;n justo al lado de la playa. En la misma playa se pueden alquilar botes u otros equipos acu&aacute;ticos. Si tiene sed o hambre, hay incluso un bar en la playa y un restaurante directamente en la playa. Puede encontrar playas m&aacute;s hermosas y atractivas en nuestra extensa base de datos de playas europeas. Y recuerde, la forma m&aacute;s r&aacute;pida y sencilla de encontrar la playa de sus sue&ntilde;os es con BeachRex.', 3430, 'es', 1),
(1869, 'Nella regione di Kentriki Makedonija c&#39;&egrave; un&#39;altra splendida spiaggia chiamata Paralia Akrathos. &Egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa molto bella con curve molto interessanti. &Egrave; sicuramente adatto a famiglie con bambini poich&eacute; c&#39;&egrave; anche un po &#39;di ombra naturale, il parcheggio &egrave; molto ampio e qui ci sono molti hotel che si trovano proprio accanto alla spiaggia. Sulla spiaggia stessa &egrave; possibile noleggiare alcune barche o altre attrezzature acquatiche. Se hai sete o fame c&#39;&egrave; anche un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante direttamente sulla spiaggia. Puoi trovare spiagge pi&ugrave; belle e attraenti nel nostro ampio database di spiagge europee. E ricorda, il modo pi&ugrave; semplice e veloce per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni &egrave; con BeachRex.', 3430, 'it', 1),
(1870, 'V regiji Kentriki Makedonija imaste na voljo naslednjo čudovito in prelepo plažo, imenovana Paralia Akrathos. To je zelo lepa pe&scaron;čena plaža z zelo zanimivo formacijo obale. Vsekakor je primerna za družine z otroki, saj je na plaži na voljo tudi nekaj naravne sence, prav tako pa so tukaj na voljo otro&scaron;ka igri&scaron;ča. Parkiri&scaron;če je zelo veliko in vam je na voljo direktno pred plažo. Za nastanitev vam ni potrebno skrbeti, tukaj je veliko hotelov, ki so tik ob plaži. Na sami plaži lahko najamete čolne ali drugo vodno opremo. Če ste žejni ali lačni, je na plaži celo bar na plaži in restavracija. V na&scaron;i obsežni zbirki evropskih plaž najdete ostale lepe in privlačne plaže. In ne pozabite: najhitreje in najlažje najdete svojo sanjsko plažo z BeachRexom.', 3430, 'sl', 1),
(1871, 'U regiji Kentriki Makedonija na raspolaganju vam je sljedeća lijepa i lijepa plaža Paralia Akrathos. Ovo je vrlo lijepa pje&scaron;čana plaža s vrlo zanimljivom formacijom obale. Svakako je pogodan za obitelji s djecom, jer na plaži ima i neke prirodne hladovine, a tu su i igrali&scaron;ta. Parking je vrlo velik i dostupan je neposredno ispred plaže. Ne morate brinuti o smje&scaron;taju, tik uz plažu ima mnogo hotela. Na samoj plaži možete unajmiti čamce ili drugu vodenu opremu. Ako ste žedni ili gladni, na plaži se nalaze čak i bar na plaži i restoran. U na&scaron;oj opsežnoj kolekciji europskih plaža pronaći ćete i druge lijepe i atraktivne plaže. I ne zaboravite: najbrži i najlak&scaron;i način da pronađete plažu iz snova je uz BeachRex.', 3430, 'hr', 1),
(1872, 'Paralia Stiladari je pe&scaron;čena in družinska plaža na zahodni strani drugega polotoka, polotoka Sitonija, v prelepi in zelo zanimivi gr&scaron;ki regiji Halkidiki. Vozilo lahko parkirate neposredno pred plažo, parkiri&scaron;če pa je dovolj veliko, da sprejme več vozil, avtodomi so tukaj tudi dobrodo&scaron;li. Na sami plaži je nekaj dreves, ki vam nudijo zavetje pred vročim poletnim soncem, &scaron;e posebej pa je senca dobrodo&scaron;la če boste na plažo pri&scaron;li z majhimi otroci, ki morajo biti večinoma časa za&scaron;čiteni pred soncem. Na plaži ali v bližini je na voljo veliko infrastrukture za plažo, na tej čudoviti plaži pa sta tudi bar na plaži in hotel. Na večini točk ob plaži je vstop v vodo zelo lep in plavati lahko začnete že po 3 m. Ponekod pa le pazite kako vstopate v vodo, saj je tudi kar nekaj neprijetnih skal. Zaradi teh dejstev o plaži in zelo slikovite okolice je ta lokacija med turisti zelo priljubljena. Skupna dolžina plaže je 500 metrov, njena &scaron;irina pa je 25 metrov. V na&scaron;i obsežni zbirki evropskih plaž najdete ostale lepe in privlačne plaže. In ne pozabite: najhitreje in najlažje najdete svojo sanjsko plažo z BeachRexom.', 3444, 'sl', 1),
(1873, 'Paralia Stiladari je pje&scaron;čana i obiteljska plaža na zapadnoj strani drugog poluotoka, poluotoka Sitonije, u prekrasnoj i vrlo zanimljivoj grčkoj regiji Halkidiki. Vozilo možete parkirati neposredno ispred plaže, a parkirali&scaron;te je dovoljno veliko za smje&scaron;taj vi&scaron;e vozila, ovdje su dobrodo&scaron;li i kamp kućice. Na plaži ima nekoliko stabala koja vam nude zaklon od vrućeg ljetnog sunca, a sjena je posebno dobrodo&scaron;la ako na plažu dolazite s malom djecom, koju većinu vremena treba za&scaron;tititi od sunca. Na plaži ili u blizini plaže ima puno infrastrukture za plažu, a na ovoj prekrasnoj plaži nalazi se i bar na plaži i hotel. Na većini mjesta uz plažu ulaz u vodu je vrlo lijep i možete početi plivati ​​nakon 3 m. Na nekim mjestima samo pripazite kako ulazite u vodu, jer ima i poprilično neugodnih stijena. Zbog ovih činjenica o plaži i vrlo slikovitom okruženju, ovo je mjesto vrlo popularno među turistima. Ukupna dužina plaže je 500 metara, a &scaron;irina 25 metara. U na&scaron;oj opsežnoj kolekciji europskih plaža pronaći ćete i druge lijepe i atraktivne plaže. I ne zaboravite: najbrži i najlak&scaron;i način da pronađete plažu iz snova je uz BeachRex.', 3444, 'hr', 1),
(1874, 'Паралия Стиладари - это песчаный семейный пляж на западной стороне второго полуострова, полуострова Ситония, в красивом и очень интересном греческом регионе Халкидики. Вы можете припарковать свой автомобиль прямо перед пляжем, и парковка достаточно большая, чтобы вместить больше автомобилей, здесь также приветствуются автодома. На пляже есть деревья, которые укрывают вас от жаркого летнего солнца, и тень особенно приветствуется, если вы приходите на пляж с маленькими детьми, которым необходимо защищаться от солнца большую часть времени. На пляже или рядом с ним развита пляжная инфраструктура, а еще на этом прекрасном пляже есть пляжный бар и отель. В большинстве мест вдоль пляжа вход в воду очень хороший, и вы можете начинать плавание через 3 метра. В некоторых местах просто будьте осторожны при входе в воду, так как здесь также довольно много неприятных камней. Благодаря этим фактам о пляже и очень живописных окрестностях, это место очень популярно среди туристов. Общая длина пляжа составляет 500 метров, а ширина - 25 метров. В нашей обширной коллекции европейских пляжей вы найдете и другие красивые и привлекательные пляжи. И не забывайте: самый быстрый и простой способ найти пляж своей мечты - это BeachRex.', 3444, 'ru', 1),
(1875, 'Paralia Stiladari &egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa e familiare sul lato ovest della seconda penisola, la penisola di Sithonia, nella bellissima e molto interessante regione greca di Halkidiki. Puoi parcheggiare il tuo veicolo direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia e il parcheggio &egrave; abbastanza grande da ospitare pi&ugrave; veicoli, anche i camper sono i benvenuti qui. Ci sono alcuni alberi sulla spiaggia che ti offrono riparo dal caldo sole estivo, e l&#39;ombra &egrave; particolarmente gradita se vieni in spiaggia con bambini piccoli, che hanno bisogno di essere protetti dal sole la maggior parte del tempo. Ci sono molte infrastrutture sulla spiaggia o vicino alla spiaggia, e c&#39;&egrave; anche un bar sulla spiaggia e un hotel su questa bellissima spiaggia. Nella maggior parte dei punti lungo la spiaggia, l&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare dopo 3 m. In alcuni punti, fai solo attenzione a come entri in acqua, poich&eacute; ci sono anche alcune rocce sgradevoli. A causa di questi fatti sulla spiaggia e sui dintorni molto pittoreschi, questa localit&agrave; &egrave; molto popolare tra i turisti. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 500 metri e la sua larghezza &egrave; di 25 metri. Nella nostra vasta collezione di spiagge europee troverai altre spiagge belle e attraenti. E non dimenticare: il modo pi&ugrave; semplice e veloce per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni &egrave; con BeachRex.', 3444, 'it', 1),
(1876, 'Paralia Stiladari es una playa familiar y de arena en el lado oeste de la segunda pen&iacute;nsula, la pen&iacute;nsula de Sithonia, en la hermosa y muy interesante regi&oacute;n griega de Halkidiki. Puede estacionar su veh&iacute;culo directamente en frente de la playa, y el estacionamiento es lo suficientemente grande para acomodar m&aacute;s veh&iacute;culos, las autocaravanas tambi&eacute;n son bienvenidas aqu&iacute;. Hay algunos &aacute;rboles en la playa que te ofrecen refugio del caluroso sol de verano, y la sombra es especialmente bienvenida si vienes a la playa con ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os, que necesitan estar protegidos del sol la mayor parte del tiempo. Hay mucha infraestructura de playa en la playa o cerca de ella, y tambi&eacute;n hay un bar en la playa y un hotel en esta hermosa playa. En la mayor&iacute;a de los puntos a lo largo de la playa, la entrada al agua es muy agradable y puedes empezar a nadar despu&eacute;s de 3 m. En algunos lugares, solo tenga cuidado con la forma en que ingresa al agua, ya que tambi&eacute;n hay bastantes rocas desagradables. Debido a estos datos sobre la playa y los alrededores muy pintorescos, este lugar es muy popular entre los turistas. La longitud total de la playa es de 500 metros y su ancho es de 25 metros. En nuestra extensa colecci&oacute;n de playas europeas encontrar&aacute; otras hermosas y atractivas playas. Y no lo olvide: la forma m&aacute;s r&aacute;pida y sencilla de encontrar la playa de sus sue&ntilde;os es con BeachRex.', 3444, 'es', 1),
(1877, 'Paralia Stiladari est une plage de sable et familiale sur le c&ocirc;t&eacute; ouest de la deuxi&egrave;me p&eacute;ninsule, la p&eacute;ninsule de Sithonia, dans la belle et tr&egrave;s int&eacute;ressante r&eacute;gion grecque de Halkidiki. Vous pouvez garer votre v&eacute;hicule directement devant la plage, et le parking est assez grand pour accueillir plus de v&eacute;hicules, les camping-cars sont &eacute;galement les bienvenus ici. Il y a quelques arbres sur la plage qui vous offrent un abri du soleil chaud de l&#39;&eacute;t&eacute;, et l&#39;ombre est particuli&egrave;rement bienvenue si vous venez &agrave; la plage avec de jeunes enfants, qui ont besoin d&#39;&ecirc;tre prot&eacute;g&eacute;s du soleil la plupart du temps. Il y a beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage sur ou pr&egrave;s de la plage, et il y a aussi un bar de plage et un h&ocirc;tel sur cette belle plage. &Agrave; la plupart des endroits le long de la plage, l&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s 3 m. &Agrave; certains endroits, faites attention &agrave; la fa&ccedil;on dont vous entrez dans l&#39;eau, car il y a aussi pas mal de rochers d&eacute;sagr&eacute;ables. En raison de ces faits sur la plage et les environs tr&egrave;s pittoresques, cet endroit est tr&egrave;s populaire parmi les touristes. La longueur totale de la plage est de 500 m&egrave;tres et sa largeur est de 25 m&egrave;tres. Dans notre vaste collection de plages europ&eacute;ennes, vous trouverez d&#39;autres plages magnifiques et attrayantes. Et n&#39;oubliez pas: le moyen le plus rapide et le plus simple de trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves est avec BeachRex.', 3444, 'fr', 1),
(1878, 'Willkommen an den d&auml;nischen Str&auml;nden. In der N&auml;he des Dorfes Otterup, auf der d&auml;nischen Insel F&uuml;nen, befindet sich an der Ostseek&uuml;ste ein sehr sch&ouml;ner Sandstrand namens Strand Fuglsang. Dieses Gebiet geh&ouml;rt zur Region Syddanmark. Sie k&ouml;nnen mit jedem Fahrzeug zu diesem Strand fahren und ihn nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt neben der Stra&szlig;e lassen. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes Sand ist, gibt es auch einige kleine Steine, Felsen und Gras. Es ist ein sehr langer Strand, mehrere Kilometer, er ist meistens 20 m breit, kann aber auch an manchen Stellen bis zu 50 m breit sein. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 10 m. Der Gro&szlig;teil der Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich in der N&auml;he des Parkplatzes und es ist ein typisch d&auml;nischer Standard, Toiletten und eine Dusche, mit einer Bank und einem Tisch, genau richtig f&uuml;r Ihr Strandpicknick. Restaurants sind hier nicht vorhanden, aber Sie haben in der N&auml;he einige Ferienwohnungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, die Sie f&uuml;r Ihre Sommerunterkunft mieten k&ouml;nnen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie auf schnellstem Weg den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r sich finden m&ouml;chten, verwenden Sie immer Beachrex.', 3927, 'de', 1),
(1879, 'Bienvenidos a las playas danesas. Cerca del pueblo Otterup, en la isla danesa de Fionia, tiene una playa de arena muy bonita llamada Strand Fuglsang, ubicada en la costa b&aacute;ltica. Esta &aacute;rea es parte de la regi&oacute;n Syddanmark. Puede llegar a esta playa con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y dejarlo junto a la carretera a solo 100 metros de la playa. El acceso a la playa es muy sencillo. Aunque la superficie principal de la playa es de arena, tambi&eacute;n tienes algunas piedras peque&ntilde;as, rocas y c&eacute;sped. Es una playa muy larga, de varios kil&oacute;metros, en su mayor&iacute;a tiene 20 m de ancho pero tambi&eacute;n puede tener en algunos lugares hasta 50 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es agradable y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a 10 m. La mayor parte de la infraestructura de la playa se encuentra cerca del lugar de estacionamiento y es un est&aacute;ndar t&iacute;pico dan&eacute;s, ba&ntilde;os y una ducha, con un banco y una mesa, ideal para su picnic en la playa. Los restaurantes no est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, pero tiene algunos apartamentos disponibles en las inmediaciones, que puede alquilar para su alojamiento de verano. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex, y recuerda que si quieres encontrar la playa perfecta para ti de la forma m&aacute;s r&aacute;pida, usa siempre Beachrex.', 3927, 'es', 1),
(1880, 'Benvenuti nelle spiagge danesi. Vicino al villaggio di Otterup, sull&#39;isola danese di Funen, c&#39;&egrave; una bellissima spiaggia di sabbia chiamata Strand Fuglsang, situata sulla costa baltica. Questa zona fa parte della regione Syddanmark. Puoi guidare fino a questa spiaggia con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e lasciarlo lungo la strada a soli 100 metri dalla spiaggia. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto facile. Sebbene la superficie principale della spiaggia sia sabbia, ci sono anche alcune piccole pietre, rocce ed erba. &Egrave; una spiaggia molto lunga, diversi chilometri, &egrave; larga per lo pi&ugrave; 20 m ma pu&ograve; essere larga anche in alcuni punti fino a 50 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 10 m. La maggior parte delle infrastrutture della spiaggia si trova vicino al parcheggio ed &egrave; un tipico standard danese, servizi igienici e doccia, con una panca e un tavolo, perfetti per il tuo picnic sulla spiaggia. I ristoranti non sono disponibili qui, ma hai alcuni appartamenti disponibili nelle vicinanze, che puoi affittare per il tuo soggiorno estivo. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex, e ricorda se vuoi trovare la spiaggia perfetta per te nel modo pi&ugrave; veloce, usa sempre Beachrex.', 3927, 'it', 1),
(1881, 'Bienvenue sur les plages danoises. Pr&egrave;s du village d&#39;Otterup, sur l&#39;&icirc;le danoise de Funen, vous avez une tr&egrave;s belle plage de sable appel&eacute;e Strand Fuglsang, situ&eacute;e sur la c&ocirc;te baltique. Cette zone fait partie de la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. Vous pouvez vous rendre &agrave; cette plage avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et le laisser au bord de la route &agrave; seulement 100 m&egrave;tres de la plage. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s facile. Bien que la surface principale de la plage soit du sable, vous avez &eacute;galement quelques petites pierres, des rochers et de l&#39;herbe. C&#39;est une plage tr&egrave;s longue, plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres, elle fait le plus souvent 20 m de large mais elle peut l&#39;&ecirc;tre aussi &agrave; certains endroits jusqu&#39;&agrave; 50 m de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de nage est &agrave; 10 m. La plupart des infrastructures de la plage se trouvent &agrave; proximit&eacute; du parking et il s&#39;agit d&#39;un standard danois typique, de toilettes et d&#39;une douche, avec un banc et une table, parfaits pour votre pique-nique sur la plage. Les restaurants ne sont pas disponibles ici, mais vous avez quelques appartements disponibles dans les environs, que vous pouvez louer pour votre h&eacute;bergement d&#39;&eacute;t&eacute;. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex, et n&#39;oubliez pas que si vous voulez trouver la plage parfaite pour vous le plus rapidement possible, utilisez toujours Beachrex.', 3927, 'fr', 1),
(1882, 'Si vous recherchez une plage de sable au Danemark, qui devrait avoir une grande aire de jeux pour enfants &agrave; proximit&eacute;, ainsi qu&#39;un camp, nous vous sugg&eacute;rons de visiter la plage Strand Vejlby Fed. Vous trouverez cette plage dans la r&eacute;gion de Syddanmark sur l&#39;&icirc;le de Funen, pr&egrave;s de la ville de Middelfart. Quel que soit le v&eacute;hicule avec lequel vous voyagez, cet endroit est facilement accessible et vous pouvez vous garer sur un grand parking &agrave; environ 200 m&egrave;tres de la plage. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s facile. Sur le chemin de la plage, vous disposez &eacute;galement de la plupart des infrastructures de plage, ainsi que de l&#39;aire de jeux pour enfants et des terrains de sport. Cette plage est recommand&eacute;e pour les familles avec de jeunes enfants. Non seulement vous avez ici un grand terrain de jeu moderne, mais vous avez &eacute;galement une plage tr&egrave;s plate et un fond marin plat. La plage fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et 30 m de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de nage se fait par le fond plat &agrave; environ 50 m. Le seul bistro ici est pr&egrave;s du camp. Le Camp est aussi l&#39;une de vos options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, l&#39;autre est la location d&#39;un appartement ou d&#39;une maison. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex et utilisez toujours notre plateforme si vous voulez trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves tr&egrave;s rapidement.', 3928, 'fr', 1),
(1883, 'Se stai cercando una spiaggia sabbiosa in Danimarca, che dovrebbe avere un grande parco giochi per bambini nelle vicinanze, oltre a un campo, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand Vejlby Fed. Troverai questa spiaggia nella regione Syddanmark sull&#39;isola di Funen, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Middelfart. Non importa quale sia il veicolo con cui viaggi, questa posizione &egrave; facilmente accessibile e puoi parcheggiare in un ampio parcheggio a circa 200 metri dalla spiaggia. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto facile. Sulla strada per la spiaggia hai anche la maggior parte delle infrastrutture balneari, cos&igrave; come il parco giochi per bambini e i campi sportivi. Questa spiaggia &egrave; consigliata alle famiglie con bambini piccoli. Non solo hai qui un grande e moderno parco giochi, hai anche una spiaggia molto piatta e un fondale piatto. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga 30 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; dato dal fondale piatto a circa 50 m. L&#39;unico bistrot qui &egrave; vicino al campo. Il campo &egrave; anche una delle tue opzioni per l&#39;alloggio, l&#39;altra &egrave; affittare un appartamento o una casa. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e usa sempre la nostra piattaforma se vuoi trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni molto velocemente.', 3928, 'it', 1),
(1884, 'Si est&aacute; buscando una playa de arena en Dinamarca, que deber&iacute;a tener un gran parque infantil cerca, as&iacute; como un campamento, le sugerimos que visite la playa Strand Vejlby Fed. Encontrar&aacute; esta playa en la regi&oacute;n de Syddanmark en la isla Funen, cerca de la ciudad Middelfart. Independientemente del veh&iacute;culo con el que viaje, esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de f&aacute;cil acceso y se puede aparcar en una gran plaza de aparcamiento a unos 200 metros de la playa. El acceso a la playa es muy sencillo. En su camino a la playa tambi&eacute;n tiene la mayor infraestructura de playa, as&iacute; como el parque infantil y los campos deportivos. Esta playa est&aacute; recomendada para familias con ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os. Aqu&iacute; no solo tienes un parque infantil grande y moderno, tambi&eacute;n tienes una playa muy plana y un fondo marino plano. La playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y 30 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de nadar es por el fondo plano del mar a unos 50 m. El &uacute;nico bistr&oacute; aqu&iacute; est&aacute; cerca del campamento. El Campamento es tambi&eacute;n una de tus opciones de alojamiento, las otras es alquilar un apartamento o una casa. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex y utiliza siempre nuestra plataforma si quieres encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os muy r&aacute;pido.', 3928, 'es', 1),
(1885, 'Wenn Sie in D&auml;nemark einen Sandstrand suchen, der einen gro&szlig;en Kinderspielplatz in der N&auml;he sowie einen Campingplatz haben sollte, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Strand Vejlby Fed zu besuchen. Sie finden diesen Strand in der Region Syddanmark auf der Insel F&uuml;nen, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Middelfart. Egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie unterwegs sind, dieser Standort ist leicht erreichbar und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz ca. 200 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach. Auf Ihrem Weg zum Strand haben Sie auch die meiste Strandinfrastruktur, sowie den Kinderspielplatz und die Sportpl&auml;tze. Dieser Strand ist f&uuml;r Familien mit kleinen Kindern zu empfehlen. Sie haben hier nicht nur einen gro&szlig;en und modernen Spielplatz, sondern auch einen sehr flachen Strand und einen flachen Meeresboden. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und 30 m breit. Der Wassereinstieg ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt aufgrund des flachen Meeresbodens auf ca. 50 m. Das einzige Bistro hier ist in der N&auml;he des Camps. Das Camp ist auch eine Ihrer Optionen f&uuml;r die Unterkunft, die andere ist die Anmietung einer Wohnung oder eines Hauses. Genie&szlig;e deinen Strand mit BeachRex und nutze immer unsere Plattform, wenn du ganz schnell deinen Traumstrand finden willst.', 3928, 'de', 1),
(1886, 'Bienvenidos a una playa muy especial. Cerca de la ciudad danesa Middelfart hay una peque&ntilde;a ciudad llamada Strib. Una playa de arena tambi&eacute;n se encuentra aqu&iacute; y es adecuada para familias que est&aacute;n o desean visitar la isla Funen. Este es tambi&eacute;n un lugar famoso de la Segunda Guerra Mundial, donde se encuentra el b&uacute;nker de torpedos. Si desea tomar una foto de los ca&ntilde;ones en la playa aqu&iacute;, tambi&eacute;n puede hacerlo. La regi&oacute;n en la que se encuentra esta playa se llama Syddanmark. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a este lugar con su veh&iacute;culo y un peque&ntilde;o estacionamiento lo espera directamente en la playa. Esta playa tiene 1 km de largo y 15 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es agradable y el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a unos 10 m. Aqu&iacute; se encuentra una infraestructura de playa t&iacute;pica danesa. Los restaurantes no est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa, sino a unos cientos de metros al fondo. Tambi&eacute;n tienes algunas opciones de alojamiento aqu&iacute;, principalmente como apartamentos. Y recuerda, disfruta siempre de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3929, 'es', 1),
(1887, 'Benvenuti in una spiaggia molto speciale. Vicino alla citt&agrave; danese Middelfart c&#39;&egrave; una piccola citt&agrave; chiamata Strib. Qui si trova anche una spiaggia sabbiosa ed &egrave; adatta alle famiglie che sono o desiderano visitare l&#39;isola di Funen. Questo &egrave; anche un famoso luogo della Seconda Guerra Mondiale, dove si trova il bunker di siluri. Se desideri scattare una foto dei cannoni sulla spiaggia qui, puoi farlo anche tu. La regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia si chiama Syddanmark. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungere questa localit&agrave; con il proprio veicolo e un piccolo parcheggio vi aspetta direttamente sulla spiaggia. Questa spiaggia &egrave; lunga 1 km e larga 15 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 10 m. Qui si trova una tipica infrastruttura balneare danese. I ristoranti non sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma a poche centinaia di metri sullo sfondo. Hai anche alcune opzioni per l&#39;alloggio qui, principalmente come appartamenti. E ricorda, goditi sempre la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3929, 'it', 1),
(1888, 'Bienvenue sur une plage tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale. Pr&egrave;s de la ville danoise Middelfart, il y a une petite ville nomm&eacute;e Strib. Une plage de sable se trouve &eacute;galement ici et convient aux familles qui visitent ou souhaitent visiter l&#39;&icirc;le de Funen. C&#39;est aussi un endroit c&eacute;l&egrave;bre de la Seconde Guerre mondiale, o&ugrave; se trouve un bunker de torpilles. Si vous souhaitez prendre une photo de canons sur la plage ici, vous pouvez &eacute;galement le faire. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve cette plage s&#39;appelle Syddanmark. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de se rendre &agrave; cet endroit avec votre v&eacute;hicule et un petit parking vous attend directement sur la plage. Cette plage mesure 1 km de long et 15 m de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de nage est &agrave; environ 10 m. Une infrastructure de plage danoise typique se trouve ici. Les restaurants ne sont pas disponibles directement sur la plage, mais &agrave; quelques centaines de m&egrave;tres en arri&egrave;re-plan. Vous avez &eacute;galement quelques options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement ici, principalement des appartements. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, profitez toujours de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3929, 'fr', 1),
(1889, 'Willkommen an einem ganz besonderen Strand. In der N&auml;he der d&auml;nischen Stadt Middelfart liegt eine kleine Stadt namens Strib. Hier befindet sich auch ein Sandstrand und eignet sich f&uuml;r Familien, die die Insel F&uuml;nen besuchen oder besuchen m&ouml;chten. Dies ist auch ein ber&uuml;hmter Ort aus dem Zweiten Weltkrieg, hier befinden sich Torpedobunker. Wer hier am Strand Kanonen fotografieren m&ouml;chte, kann das auch tun. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Syddanmark. Dieser Ort ist mit Ihrem Fahrzeug sehr einfach zu erreichen und ein kleiner Parkplatz erwartet Sie direkt am Strand. Dieser Strand ist 1 km lang und 15 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei ca. 10 m. Hier befindet sich eine typisch d&auml;nische Strandinfrastruktur. Restaurants gibt es nicht direkt am Strand, sondern ein paar hundert Meter weiter im Hintergrund. Sie haben hier auch einige M&ouml;glichkeiten der Unterbringung, haupts&auml;chlich als Apartments. Und denken Sie daran, genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand immer mit BeachRex.', 3929, 'de', 1),
(1890, 'Bienvenue sur une plage tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale. Pourquoi? Laissez-moi vous l&#39;expliquer. Sur le rivage de la ville danoise de Fredericia, vous pouvez explorer une belle plage de sable moderne et unique appel&eacute;e Strand &Oslash;sterstrand. Il est recommand&eacute; pour un type d&#39;utilisateur familial qui recherche une plage en ville avec de nombreuses infrastructures de plage, vous avez m&ecirc;me un sauna sur la plage. La ville Fredericia fait partie de la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. Si vous aimez ces plages, cet endroit est facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule, et vous pouvez vous garer &agrave; seulement 10 m de la plage sur une place de parking payante. La plage a une longueur totale de 750 m et une largeur de 40 m. Vous avez deux options pour entrer dans l&#39;eau, soit vous le faites par la plage, soit vous utilisez une &eacute;chelle d&#39;eau depuis la jet&eacute;e. Le point de nage se situe entre 0 et 10 m. Sur cette plage, vous avez vraiment beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures et de services de plage. Si vous &ecirc;tes un fan de beach-volley ou de beach-football, vous pouvez pratiquer ce sport ici. Ils ont m&ecirc;me install&eacute; un petit fitness en plein air ici, g&eacute;nial. Un petit bistrot est &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sent et pour votre h&eacute;bergement, vous pouvez choisir entre des appartements et des h&ocirc;tels dans le centre-ville. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours la plateforme BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3930, 'fr', 1),
(1891, 'Benvenuti in una spiaggia molto speciale. Come mai? Lascia che te lo spieghi. Sul litorale della citt&agrave; danese Fredericia puoi esplorare una bellissima spiaggia sabbiosa moderna e unica chiamata Strand &Oslash;sterstrand. &Egrave; raccomandato per un tipo di utente familiare che &egrave; alla ricerca di una spiaggia cittadina con molte infrastrutture balneari, hai persino una sauna sulla spiaggia. La citt&agrave; Fredericia fa parte della regione Syddanmark. Se ti piacciono queste spiagge, questa posizione &egrave; facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi parcheggiare a soli 10 metri dalla spiaggia in un parcheggio a pagamento. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 750 m ed &egrave; larga 40 m. Hai due opzioni per entrare in acqua, o lo fai dalla spiaggia o usi una scala d&#39;acqua dal molo. Il punto di nuoto &egrave; compreso tra 0 e 10 m. Su questa spiaggia ci sono davvero molte infrastrutture e servizi balneari. Se sei un fan del beach volley o del beach soccer puoi goderti questo sport qui. Hanno installato anche una piccola palestra all&#39;aperto qui, fantastico. C&#39;&egrave; anche un piccolo bistrot e per il tuo alloggio puoi scegliere tra appartamenti e hotel nel centro della citt&agrave;. E ricorda, usa sempre la piattaforma BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3930, 'it', 1),
(1892, 'Bienvenidos a una playa muy especial. &iquest;Por qu&eacute;? D&eacute;jame explicarte. En la costa de la ciudad danesa de Fredericia, puede explorar una hermosa, moderna y &uacute;nica playa de arena llamada Strand &Oslash;sterstrand. Se recomienda para un tipo de usuario familiar que busca una playa urbana con mucha infraestructura de playa, incluso tiene una sauna en la playa. La ciudad Fredericia forma parte de la regi&oacute;n Syddanmark. Si le gustan estas playas, esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, y puede estacionar a solo 10 m de la playa en un lugar de estacionamiento de pago. La playa tiene una longitud total de 750 my 40 m de ancho. Tienes dos opciones para entrar al agua, o lo haces por la playa o usas una escalera de agua desde el muelle. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; entre 0 y 10 m. En esta playa realmente tienes mucha infraestructura y servicios de playa. Si eres aficionado al v&oacute;ley playa o al f&uacute;tbol playa puedes disfrutar de este deporte aqu&iacute;. Han instalado incluso un peque&ntilde;o gimnasio al aire libre aqu&iacute;, incre&iacute;ble. Un peque&ntilde;o bistr&oacute; tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; aqu&iacute; y para su alojamiento puede elegir entre apartamentos y hoteles en el centro de la ciudad. Y recuerda, usa siempre la plataforma BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3930, 'es', 1),
(1893, 'Willkommen an einem ganz besonderen Strand. Wieso denn? Lass es dir erkl&auml;ren. An der K&uuml;ste der d&auml;nischen Stadt Fredericia k&ouml;nnen Sie einen wundersch&ouml;nen, modernen und einzigartigen Sandstrand namens Strand &Oslash;sterstrand erkunden. Es empfiehlt sich f&uuml;r einen Familienbenutzertyp, der einen Stadtstrand mit viel Strandinfrastruktur sucht, Sie haben sogar eine Sauna am Strand. Die Stadt Fredericia geh&ouml;rt zur Region Syddanmark. Wenn Sie solche Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, ist dieser Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen nur 10 m vom Strand entfernt auf einem geb&uuml;hrenpflichtigen Parkplatz parken. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 750 m und ist 40 m breit. Sie haben zwei M&ouml;glichkeiten, ins Wasser zu gelangen, entweder Sie tun es am Strand oder Sie verwenden eine Wasserleiter vom Pier aus. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt zwischen 0 und 10 m. An diesem Strand gibt es wirklich viel Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen. Wenn Sie ein Fan von Beachvolleyball oder Strandfu&szlig;ball sind, k&ouml;nnen Sie diesen Sport hier genie&szlig;en. Sie haben hier sogar eine kleine Outdoor-Fitnessanlage installiert, genial. Ein kleines Bistro ist auch hier und f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft k&ouml;nnen Sie zwischen Apartments und Hotels in der Innenstadt w&auml;hlen. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer die BeachRex-Plattform, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3930, 'de', 1),
(1894, 'Un poco fuera de la ciudad danesa de Fredericia, una ciudad junto al mar B&aacute;ltico, en el medio de una peque&ntilde;a pen&iacute;nsula, tiene una playa familiar llamada Strand Trelde N&aelig;s. Esta parte de Dinamarca pertenece a la regi&oacute;n Syddanmark. Esta playa est&aacute; ubicada junto a un gran bosque, con muchos &aacute;rboles altos. Si te gustan estas playas puedes acceder a este lugar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y dejarlo en un amplio aparcamiento a tan solo 200m de la playa. El camino a la playa es f&aacute;cil, muy c&oacute;modo. La superficie principal de la playa es de arena, pero tambi&eacute;n hay algo de hierba y algunas piedras peque&ntilde;as. En total, esta playa tiene 750 metros de largo y hasta 30 metros de ancho. La entrada al agua es agradable y puedes empezar a nadar a unos 10 metros, despu&eacute;s de entrar al agua. La infraestructura de la playa ubicada aqu&iacute; es un est&aacute;ndar t&iacute;pico dan&eacute;s. No tienes opciones para comer o beber aqu&iacute;, excepto en el campamento cercano, que tambi&eacute;n es el &uacute;nico alojamiento posible en las cercan&iacute;as. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3931, 'es', 1),
(1895, 'Appena fuori dalla citt&agrave; danese Fredericia, una citt&agrave; sul Mar Baltico, nel mezzo della piccola penisola, c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie chiamata Strand Trelde N&aelig;s. Questa parte della Danimarca appartiene alla regione Syddanmark. Questa spiaggia si trova vicino a una grande foresta, con molti alberi ad alto fusto. Se ti piacciono queste spiagge puoi accedere a questa localit&agrave; con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e lasciarla in un ampio parcheggio a soli 200 metri dalla spiaggia. Il percorso per la spiaggia &egrave; facile, molto comodo. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; sabbia, ma c&#39;&egrave; anche un po&#39; d&#39;erba e alcune piccole pietre. Nel complesso questa spiaggia &egrave; lunga 750 metri e larga fino a 30 metri. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare a circa 10 metri, dopo essere entrati in acqua. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia situata qui &egrave; un tipico standard danese. Non hai alcuna opzione per mangiare o bere qualcosa qui, tranne nel campo vicino, che &egrave; anche l&#39;unico alloggio possibile nelle vicinanze. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3931, 'it', 1),
(1896, 'Juste un peu &agrave; l&#39;ext&eacute;rieur de la ville danoise de Fredericia, une ville au bord de la mer Baltique, au milieu d&#39;une petite p&eacute;ninsule, vous avez une plage familiale appel&eacute;e Strand Trelde N&aelig;s. Cette partie du Danemark appartient &agrave; la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. Cette plage est situ&eacute;e &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; d&#39;une grande for&ecirc;t, avec beaucoup de grands arbres. Si vous aimez ces plages, vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cet endroit avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et le laisser sur un grand parking &agrave; seulement 200 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Le chemin vers la plage est facile, tr&egrave;s confortable. La surface principale de la plage est du sable, mais vous avez aussi de l&#39;herbe et quelques petites pierres. Au total, cette plage mesure 750 m&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 30 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager &agrave; environ 10 m&egrave;tres, apr&egrave;s &ecirc;tre entr&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. L&#39;infrastructure de plage situ&eacute;e ici est une norme danoise typique. Vous n&#39;avez pas d&#39;options pour vous restaurer ou boire ici, sauf dans le camp &agrave; proximit&eacute;, qui est &eacute;galement le seul h&eacute;bergement possible &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3931, 'fr', 1),
(1897, 'Etwas au&szlig;erhalb der d&auml;nischen Stadt Fredericia, einer Stadt an der Ostsee, inmitten einer kleinen Halbinsel, befindet sich der Familienstrand Strand Trelde N&aelig;s. Dieser Teil D&auml;nemarks geh&ouml;rt zur Region Syddanmark. Dieser Strand liegt neben einem gro&szlig;en Wald mit vielen hohen B&auml;umen. Wenn Sie solche Str&auml;nde m&ouml;gen, k&ouml;nnen Sie diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen und auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 200 m vom Strand entfernt abstellen. Der Weg zum Strand ist einfach, sehr bequem. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che am Strand ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch etwas Gras und einige kleine Steine. Insgesamt ist dieser Strand 750 Meter lang und bis zu 30 Meter breit. Der Wassereinstieg ist sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen nach ca. 10 Metern schwimmen, nachdem Sie ins Wasser gegangen sind. Die hier befindliche Strandinfrastruktur entspricht einem typisch d&auml;nischen Standard. Du hast hier keine M&ouml;glichkeiten etwas zu essen oder zu trinken, au&szlig;er im nahegelegenen Camp, welches auch die einzig m&ouml;gliche &Uuml;bernachtungsm&ouml;glichkeit in der N&auml;he ist. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3931, 'de', 1),
(1898, 'Le Danemark a beaucoup de belles plages. Il y a un fait qui leur est commun &agrave; tous, ils n&#39;ont pas d&#39;ombre naturelle, mais ce n&#39;est pas le cas pour cette plage. Si vous &ecirc;tes celui qui recherche une plage de sable avec des arbres sur la plage, alors la plage Strand Albuen est ici l&#39;exception danoise et nous vous recommandons fortement de la visiter. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark, pr&egrave;s de la ville de Vejle. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s, quel que soit le v&eacute;hicule avec lequel vous voyagez et vous pouvez vous garer presque directement devant la plage &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres. La surface de la plage est un m&eacute;lange de sable et d&#39;herbe et vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreux arbres ici pour vous prot&eacute;ger du soleil. Au total, la plage mesure 200 m de long et 50 m de large. C&#39;est une plage plate avec une belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et le point de baignade &eacute;tant &agrave; 5 m. Vous disposez de nombreuses infrastructures et services de plage ici, y compris une salle de fitness en plein air, un terrain de volley-ball, un bistro et de la restauration rapide. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas disponible directement sur la plage, mais dans les environs. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3932, 'fr', 1),
(1899, 'La Danimarca ha molte belle spiagge. C&#39;&egrave; un fatto che la strega &egrave; comune a tutti loro, non hanno un&#39;ombra naturale, ma questo non &egrave; il caso di questa spiaggia. Se sei quello che sta cercando una spiaggia sabbiosa con alberi sulla spiaggia, allora la spiaggia Strand Albuen &egrave; qui l&#39;eccezione danese e ti consigliamo vivamente di visitarla. Si trova nella regione Syddanmark, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Vejle. Raggiungerla &egrave; molto semplice, qualunque sia il mezzo con cui si viaggia e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare quasi direttamente davanti alla spiaggia a pochi metri di distanza. La superficie della spiaggia &egrave; un misto di sabbia ed erba e qui ci sono anche molti alberi per proteggerti dal sole. Complessivamente la spiaggia &egrave; lunga 200 m e larga 50 m. &Egrave; una spiaggia piatta con una bella entrata d&#39;acqua e il punto di nuoto &egrave; a 5 m. Hai molte infrastrutture e servizi sulla spiaggia qui, inclusi un fitness all&#39;aperto, un campo da pallavolo, un bistrot e alcuni fast food. L&#39;alloggio non &egrave; disponibile direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma nei dintorni. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3932, 'it', 1),
(1900, 'Dinamarca tiene muchas playas hermosas. Hay un hecho que es com&uacute;n para todos ellos, no tienen sombra natural, pero este no es el caso de esta playa. Si usted es el que est&aacute; buscando una playa de arena con &aacute;rboles en la playa, entonces la playa Strand Albuen es aqu&iacute; la excepci&oacute;n danesa y le recomendamos encarecidamente que la visite. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Syddanmark, cerca de la ciudad Vejle. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a &eacute;l, sin importar el veh&iacute;culo con el que viaje y se puede estacionar casi directamente frente a la playa a solo unos metros de distancia. La superficie de la playa es una mezcla de arena y c&eacute;sped y tambi&eacute;n tienes muchos &aacute;rboles aqu&iacute; para protegerte del sol. En total, la playa tiene 200 m de largo y 50 m de ancho. Es una playa plana con una bonita entrada de agua y el punto de ba&ntilde;o a 5 m. Aqu&iacute; tiene mucha infraestructura y servicios de playa, incluido un gimnasio al aire libre, un campo de voleibol, un bistr&oacute; y algo de comida r&aacute;pida. El alojamiento no est&aacute; disponible directamente en la playa, sino en los alrededores. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3932, 'es', 1),
(1901, 'D&auml;nemark hat viele sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde. Eine Tatsache ist allen gemeinsam, sie haben keinen nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten, aber das ist bei diesem Strand nicht der Fall. Wenn Sie einen Sandstrand mit B&auml;umen am Strand suchen, dann ist der Strand Albuen hier die d&auml;nische Ausnahme und wir empfehlen Ihnen dringend, ihn zu besuchen. Es befindet sich in der Region Syddanmark, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Vejle. Es ist sehr gut zu erreichen, egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie unterwegs sind und Sie k&ouml;nnen fast direkt vor dem Strand nur wenige Meter entfernt parken. Die Oberfl&auml;che am Strand ist eine Mischung aus Sand und Gras und Sie haben hier auch viele B&auml;ume, die Sie vor der Sonne sch&uuml;tzen. Insgesamt ist der Strand 200m lang und 50m breit. Es ist ein flacher Strand mit einem sch&ouml;nen Wasserzugang und der Badepunkt liegt bei 5 m. Sie haben hier jede Menge Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen, darunter ein Outdoor-Fitness, ein Volleyballfeld, ein Bistro und etwas Fast Food. Unterk&uuml;nfte gibt es nicht direkt am Strand, sondern in der Umgebung. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3932, 'de', 1),
(1902, 'La playa danesa Strand Tirsb&aelig;k es otra playa familiar de arena cerca de la ciudad de Vejle con sombra natural. Es un lugar muy popular para las familias y aquellos que aman hacer un picnic en la playa. Es parte de la regi&oacute;n Syddanmark. Si quieres visitarlo, es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tienes una amplia plaza de aparcamiento justo enfrente de la playa. La playa tiene una longitud total de 250 my 20 m de ancho. Es una playa plana con una bonita entrada de agua y un punto de ba&ntilde;o a 10 m. La infraestructura de la playa aqu&iacute; es un est&aacute;ndar t&iacute;pico dan&eacute;s, con muchos bancos para hacer un picnic. Tambi&eacute;n tiene un peque&ntilde;o quiosco de comida aqu&iacute; y el alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en forma de apartamentos en los alrededores. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta.', 3933, 'es', 1),
(1903, 'La spiaggia danese Strand Tirsb&aelig;k &egrave; un&#39;altra spiaggia sabbiosa per famiglie vicino alla citt&agrave; di Vejle con ombra naturale. &Egrave; un luogo molto popolare per le famiglie e per coloro che amano fare un picnic sulla spiaggia. Fa parte della regione Syddanmark. Se desideri visitarla, &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e hai un ampio parcheggio proprio di fronte alla spiaggia. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 250 m ed &egrave; larga 20 m. &Egrave; una spiaggia piatta con una bella entrata d&#39;acqua e un punto di balneazione a 10 m. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia qui &egrave; un tipico standard danese, con molte panchine per fare un picnic. Hai anche un piccolo chiosco di cibo qui e l&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile sotto forma di appartamenti nella zona circostante. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta.', 3933, 'it', 1),
(1904, 'La plage danoise Strand Tirsb&aelig;k est une autre plage familiale de sable pr&egrave;s de la ville de Vejle avec une ombre naturelle. C&#39;est un endroit tr&egrave;s populaire pour les familles et ceux qui aiment pique-niquer sur la plage. Il fait partie de la r&eacute;gion Syddanmark. Si vous souhaitez le visiter, il est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez d&#39;un grand parking juste en face de la plage. La plage a une longueur totale de 250 m et une largeur de 20 m. C&#39;est une plage plate avec une belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et un point de nage &agrave; 10 m. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage ici est une norme danoise typique, avec de nombreux bancs pour pique-niquer. Vous disposez &eacute;galement d&#39;un petit kiosque de restauration et des logements sont disponibles sous forme d&#39;appartements dans les environs. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre plage parfaite.', 3933, 'fr', 1),
(1905, 'Der d&auml;nische Strand Strand Tirsb&aelig;k ist ein weiterer Sandstrand in der N&auml;he der Stadt Vejle mit nat&uuml;rlichem Schatten. Es ist ein sehr beliebter Ort f&uuml;r Familien und diejenigen, die gerne ein Picknick am Strand machen. Es ist Teil der Region Syddanmark. Wenn Sie ihn besuchen m&ouml;chten, ist er mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr gut erreichbar und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz direkt vor dem Strand. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 250 m und ist 20 m breit. Es ist ein flacher Strand mit einem sch&ouml;nen Wassereinstieg und einem Badepunkt auf 10 m. Die Strandinfrastruktur hier ist typisch d&auml;nischer Standard, mit vielen B&auml;nken zum Picknicken. Au&szlig;erdem gibt es hier einen kleinen Food-Kiosk und &Uuml;bernachtungsm&ouml;glichkeiten in Form von Apartments in der Umgebung. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden.', 3933, 'de', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1906, 'Strand Daugaard est le nom de la plage de sable danoise dans la r&eacute;gion Midtjylland. Il est tr&egrave;s proche du village Daug&aring;rd et il est facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. &Agrave; seulement 100 m&egrave;tres de la plage, un grand parking est disponible. Le long du chemin menant &agrave; la plage, vous trouverez &eacute;galement des infrastructures danoises typiques de la plage, telles que des toilettes, des terrains de sport, des bancs et un &eacute;quipement de sauveteur. Au total, la plage a une longueur totale de 250 m et une largeur de 5 m. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, la surface principale est en sable, mais vous disposez &eacute;galement d&#39;un grand terrain en herbe avec des bancs pour votre pique-nique. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; 10 m. Les restaurants ou similaires ne sont pas disponibles ici, mais vous avez quelques options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, comme un terrain de camping &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3934, 'fr', 1),
(1907, 'Strand Daugaard &egrave; il nome della spiaggia sabbiosa danese nella regione del Midtjylland. &Egrave; molto vicino al villaggio di Daug&aring;rd ed &egrave; facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. A soli 100 mt dalla spiaggia &egrave; disponibile un ampio parcheggio. Lungo il sentiero per la spiaggia ci sono anche alcune tipiche infrastrutture danesi da spiaggia, come servizi igienici, campi sportivi, panchine e attrezzature per bagnini. Complessivamente la spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 250 m ed &egrave; larga 5 m. Vicino alla spiaggia la superficie principale &egrave; di sabbia ma hai anche un grande campo in erba con alcune panchine per il tuo picnic. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 10 m. Ristoranti o simili non sono disponibili qui, ma hai alcune opzioni per l&#39;alloggio, come un campeggio nelle vicinanze. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3934, 'it', 1),
(1908, 'Strand Daugaard es el nombre de la playa de arena danesa en la regi&oacute;n de Midtjylland. Est&aacute; muy cerca del pueblo de Daug&aring;rd y es de f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. A s&oacute;lo 100 metros de la playa hay un gran aparcamiento disponible. Por el camino hacia la playa tambi&eacute;n tiene una infraestructura t&iacute;pica de playa danesa, como ba&ntilde;os, canchas deportivas, bancos y un equipo de socorrista. En total, la playa tiene una longitud total de 250 my 5 m de ancho. Cerca de la playa, la superficie principal es de arena, pero tambi&eacute;n tienes un gran campo de c&eacute;sped con algunos bancos para tu picnic. La entrada de agua es agradable y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a 10 m. Los restaurantes o similares no est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, pero tiene algunas opciones de alojamiento, como un camping cercano. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3934, 'es', 1),
(1909, 'Strand Daugaard ist der Name des d&auml;nischen Sandstrandes in der Region Midtjylland. Es liegt ganz in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Daug&aring;rd und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen. Nur 100m vom Strand entfernt steht ein gro&szlig;er Parkplatz zur Verf&uuml;gung. Auf dem Weg zum Strand finden Sie auch einige strandtypische d&auml;nische Infrastruktur, wie Toiletten, Sportpl&auml;tze, B&auml;nke und eine Rettungsschwimmerausr&uuml;stung. Insgesamt hat der Strand eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 250m und ist 5m breit. In der N&auml;he des Strandes ist die Hauptfl&auml;che Sand, aber Sie haben auch eine gro&szlig;e Wiese mit einigen B&auml;nken f&uuml;r Ihr Picknick. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt ist 10 m entfernt. Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches gibt es hier nicht, aber Sie haben einige &Uuml;bernachtungsm&ouml;glichkeiten, wie einen Campingplatz in der N&auml;he. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3934, 'de', 1),
(1910, 'Si la forma de una playa es importante para ti y est&aacute;s buscando playas danesas con hermosas bah&iacute;as, entonces la playa Strand Husodde es la indicada para ti. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Midtjylland cerca de la ciudad Horsens. Es una playa de tipo familiar, de f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y se puede aparcar casi directamente enfrente de la playa a escasos metros. La superficie principal aqu&iacute; es arena, pero tambi&eacute;n tiene un poco de c&eacute;sped donde se colocan bonitos bancos para su tiempo de picnic. En total, la playa tiene una longitud de 200 my en algunos lugares tiene incluso 50 m de ancho. Tienes dos opciones para entrar al agua, ya sea en la playa o usando una escalera de agua en el muelle. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; entre 0 y 30 m. Aqu&iacute; tiene una infraestructura de playa t&iacute;pica danesa, sin restaurantes ni quioscos de comida, sino diferentes tipos de alojamiento, como un camping cercano. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3936, 'es', 1),
(1911, 'Se la forma di una spiaggia &egrave; importante per te e stai cercando spiagge danesi con belle baie, allora la spiaggia Strand Husodde &egrave; quella che fa per te. Si trova nella regione Midtjylland vicino alla citt&agrave; di Horsens. &Egrave; una spiaggia di tipo familiare, &egrave; di facile accesso con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare quasi direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia a pochi metri di distanza. La superficie principale qui &egrave; sabbia, ma c&#39;&egrave; anche un po&#39; di erba dove sono sistemate delle belle panchine per il tuo picnic. In totale la spiaggia ha una lunghezza di 200 m ed &egrave; larga in alcuni punti anche 50 m. Hai due opzioni per entrare in acqua, dalla spiaggia o usando una scaletta d&#39;acqua sul molo. Il punto di nuoto &egrave; compreso tra 0 e 30 m. Hai una tipica infrastruttura da spiaggia danese qui, niente ristoranti o chioschi di cibo, ma diversi tipi di alloggio, come un campeggio nelle vicinanze. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3936, 'it', 1),
(1912, 'Si la forme d&#39;une plage est importante pour vous et que vous recherchez des plages danoises avec de belles baies, alors la plage Strand Husodde est faite pour vous. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Midtjylland pr&egrave;s de la ville Horsens. C&#39;est une plage de type familial, facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer presque directement en face de la plage &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres. La surface principale ici est du sable, mais vous avez aussi de l&#39;herbe o&ugrave; de jolis bancs sont plac&eacute;s pour votre pique-nique. Au total, la plage a une longueur de 200 m et une largeur de 50 m &agrave; certains endroits. Vous avez deux options pour aller dans l&#39;eau, soit par la plage, soit en utilisant une &eacute;chelle d&#39;eau sur la jet&eacute;e. Le point de nage se situe entre 0 et 30 m. Vous avez ici une infrastructure de plage typiquement danoise, pas de restaurants ou de kiosques de restauration, mais diff&eacute;rents types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, comme un terrain de camping &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3936, 'fr', 1),
(1913, 'Wenn Ihnen die Form eines Strandes wichtig ist und Sie d&auml;nische Str&auml;nde mit sch&ouml;nen Buchten suchen, dann ist der Strand Strand Husodde der richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Es liegt in der Region Midtjylland in der N&auml;he der Stadt Horsens. Es ist ein Familienstrand, der mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen ist und Sie k&ouml;nnen fast direkt vor dem Strand nur wenige Meter entfernt parken. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che hier ist Sand, aber Sie haben auch etwas Gras, auf dem sch&ouml;ne B&auml;nke f&uuml;r Ihre Picknickzeit aufgestellt sind. Insgesamt hat der Strand eine L&auml;nge von 200m und ist an manchen Stellen sogar 50m breit. Sie haben zwei M&ouml;glichkeiten, ins Wasser zu gehen, entweder am Strand oder &uuml;ber eine Wasserleiter am Pier. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt zwischen 0 und 30 m. Sie haben hier eine typisch d&auml;nische Strandinfrastruktur, keine Restaurants oder Imbissst&auml;nde, aber verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften, wie einen Campingplatz in der N&auml;he. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3936, 'de', 1),
(1914, 'Au milieu d&#39;une belle for&ecirc;t, pr&egrave;s de la ville d&#39;Aarhus, une belle plage de sable appel&eacute;e Strand H&oslash;jbjerg attend votre visite. Il fait partie de la r&eacute;gion danoise du Midtjylland et est situ&eacute; pr&egrave;s du village de H&oslash;jbjerg. Vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cet endroit avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez de places de stationnement le long de la rue et de quelques parkings plus petits. Du parking &agrave; la plage, il vous faudra environ 100 m de long et environ 15 m de d&eacute;nivel&eacute; pour atteindre la plage. Vous pouvez soit utiliser les marches, soit emprunter un chemin plus long. La plage a une longueur totale de 1 km et est &agrave; certains endroits 40 m de large. Tout au long de la plage, vous avez de nombreuses petites baies. Le point de nage est &agrave; 10 m. Une infrastructure de plage typique danoise est disponible ici, vous avez &eacute;galement une jet&eacute;e avec une &eacute;chelle ici. Les restaurants ou similaires ne sont pas disponibles sur la plage et il n&#39;y a pas d&#39;options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement directement sur la plage, mais un peu plus loin dans les villages voisins. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3940, 'fr', 1),
(1915, 'Nel mezzo di una bellissima foresta, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Aarhus, una bellissima spiaggia sabbiosa chiamata Strand H&oslash;jbjerg sta aspettando la tua visita. Fa parte della regione danese del Midtjylland e si trova vicino al villaggio di H&oslash;jbjerg. Puoi accedere a questa posizione con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e hai posti auto lungo la strada e alcuni parcheggi pi&ugrave; piccoli. Dal parcheggio alla spiaggia si impiegano circa 100 m di lunghezza e circa 15 m di dislivello per raggiungere la spiaggia. Puoi utilizzare i passaggi o seguire un percorso pi&ugrave; lungo. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 1 km ed &egrave; larga in alcuni punti 40 m. Lungo tutto il tratto di spiaggia ci sono tante piccole baie. Il punto di nuoto &egrave; a 10 m. Qui &egrave; disponibile una tipica infrastruttura da spiaggia danese, qui c&#39;&egrave; anche un molo con una scala. Ristoranti o similari non sono disponibili sulla spiaggia cos&igrave; come non ci sono possibilit&agrave; di alloggio direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma un po&#39; pi&ugrave; distanti nei paesini limitrofi. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.', 3940, 'it', 1),
(1916, 'En medio de un hermoso bosque, cerca de la ciudad de Aarhus, una hermosa playa de arena llamada Strand H&oslash;jbjerg est&aacute; esperando su visita. Es parte de la regi&oacute;n danesa Midtjylland y se encuentra cerca del pueblo H&oslash;jbjerg. Puede acceder a esta ubicaci&oacute;n con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tiene lugares de estacionamiento a lo largo de la calle y algunos estacionamientos m&aacute;s peque&ntilde;os. Desde el aparcamiento hasta la playa se tardan unos 100 m de longitud y unos 15 m de desnivel para llegar a la playa. Puede seguir los pasos o seguir un camino m&aacute;s largo. La playa tiene una longitud total de 1 km y en algunos puntos tiene 40 m de ancho. A lo largo de todo el tramo de la playa hay muchas peque&ntilde;as bah&iacute;as. El punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a 10 m. Una infraestructura de playa t&iacute;pica danesa est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;, tambi&eacute;n tiene un muelle con una escalera aqu&iacute;. Los restaurantes o similares no est&aacute;n disponibles en la playa y tampoco hay opciones de alojamiento directamente en la playa, sino un poco m&aacute;s lejos en los pueblos vecinos. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os.', 3940, 'es', 1),
(1917, 'Inmitten eines sch&ouml;nen Waldes, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Aarhus, wartet ein sch&ouml;ner Sandstrand namens Strand H&oslash;jbjerg auf Ihren Besuch. Es ist Teil der d&auml;nischen Region Midtjylland und liegt in der N&auml;he des Dorfes H&oslash;jbjerg. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen und haben Parkpl&auml;tze entlang der Stra&szlig;e und einige kleinere Parkpl&auml;tze. Vom Parkplatz bis zum Strand sind es ca. 100m L&auml;nge und ca. 15m H&ouml;henunterschied bis zum Strand. Sie k&ouml;nnen entweder die Schritte verwenden oder einen l&auml;ngeren Weg gehen. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 1 km und ist an einigen Stellen 40 m breit. Entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts gibt es viele kleine Buchten. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 10 m. Eine d&auml;nisch typische Strandinfrastruktur ist hier vorhanden, auch einen Steg mit Leiter haben Sie hier. Restaurants o.&auml;. gibt es am Strand ebenso wenig wie &Uuml;bernachtungsm&ouml;glichkeiten direkt am Strand, sondern etwas weiter entfernt in den Nachbarorten. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 3940, 'de', 1),
(1918, 'En condiciones de viento y con el fondo marino tan plano, esta playa danesa de Strand Sk&aelig;ring es ideal para practicar deportes acu&aacute;ticos serios, como kitesurf y windsurf. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es parte de la regi&oacute;n Midtjylland. Si buscas este tipo de playas puedes llegar aqu&iacute; con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana y simplemente aparcar a tan solo 30 m de la playa. Aunque la superficie principal aqu&iacute; es arena, tambi&eacute;n tienes algunos campos de hierba. Aqu&iacute; hay muy poca infraestructura de playa. En verano tal vez lleguen algunos quioscos de comida r&aacute;pida y posiblemente puedas alquilar un apartamento en el barrio. La playa tiene una longitud total de 1 km y en algunos lugares tiene 20 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es c&oacute;moda y debido al fondo plano del mar, el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a m&aacute;s de 100 metros. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3942, 'es', 1),
(1919, 'In condizioni ventose e con il fondale marino cos&igrave; piatto, questa spiaggia danese Strand Sk&aelig;ring &egrave; l&#39;ideale per alcuni sport acquatici seri, come il kitesurf e il windsurf. Questa localit&agrave; fa parte della regione Midtjylland. Se stai cercando questo tipo di spiagge puoi arrivare qui con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con un camper e parcheggiare semplicemente a soli 30 metri dalla spiaggia. Sebbene la superficie principale qui sia sabbia, ci sono anche alcuni campi in erba. Qui si trovano pochissime infrastrutture per la spiaggia. In estate magari arrivano dei chioschi di fast food e magari si pu&ograve; affittare un appartamento nelle vicinanze. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 1 km ed &egrave; larga in alcuni punti 20 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; comodo e grazie al fondale piatto il punto di balneazione dista pi&ugrave; di 100 metri. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3942, 'it', 1),
(1920, 'Dans des conditions venteuses et avec des fonds marins si plats, cette plage danoise Strand Sk&aelig;ring est id&eacute;ale pour certains sports nautiques s&eacute;rieux, comme le kitesurf et la planche &agrave; voile. Cet endroit fait partie de la r&eacute;gion Midtjylland. Si vous recherchez ce type de plages, vous pouvez arriver ici avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule, &eacute;galement avec un camping-car et simplement vous garer &agrave; seulement 30 m de la plage. Bien que la surface principale ici soit du sable, vous avez &eacute;galement des champs d&#39;herbe. Tr&egrave;s peu d&#39;infrastructures de plage se trouvent ici. En &eacute;t&eacute;, des kiosques de restauration rapide arrivent peut-&ecirc;tre et vous pouvez &eacute;ventuellement louer un appartement dans le quartier. La plage a une longueur totale de 1 km et &agrave; certains endroits une largeur de 20 m. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est confortable et en raison des fonds marins plats, le point de baignade est &agrave; plus de 100 m&egrave;tres. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3942, 'fr', 1),
(1921, 'Bei windigen Bedingungen und einem so flachen Meeresboden ist dieser d&auml;nische Strand Strand Sk&aelig;ring einfach ideal f&uuml;r ernsthafte Wassersportarten wie Kitesurfen und Windsurfen. Dieser Ort ist Teil der Region Midtjylland. Wenn Sie diese Art von Str&auml;nden suchen, k&ouml;nnen Sie mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, hierher kommen und einfach nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Obwohl die Hauptoberfl&auml;che hier Sand ist, gibt es auch einige Grasfelder. Hier befindet sich nur sehr wenig Strandinfrastruktur. Im Sommer kommen vielleicht ein paar Fastfood-Kioske und vielleicht kannst du eine Wohnung in der Nachbarschaft mieten. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 1 km und ist an einigen Stellen 20 m breit. Der Wassereinstieg ist bequem und durch den flachen Meeresboden ist die Badestelle mehr als 100m entfernt. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3942, 'de', 1),
(1922, 'Der Strand Gr&uuml;ner Brink liegt auf der norddeutschen Insel Fehmarn. Aufgrund des sehr flachen Bades und der Kinderspielpl&auml;tze am Strand ist es f&uuml;r einen Familienbenutzertyp zu empfehlen. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Schleswig-Holstein. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohnmobil, erreichen und auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken. Vom Parkplatz bis zum Strand sind es nur 100 Meter bequemer Spaziergang. Am Strand stehen Ihnen ca. 500 Meter L&auml;nge und 50 Meter Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Strand ist sehr flach, ebenso das Wasser, ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder, die sicher im Wasser spielen k&ouml;nnen und die Eltern weniger Stress haben. Einige Stranddienste sind hier verf&uuml;gbar, aber mehr oder weniger sind sie nur einfacher Natur. Ein kleines Restaurant ist auch hier, aber keine Unterkunft. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 3858, 'de', 1),
(1923, 'La plage Strand Gr&uuml;ner Brink est situ&eacute;e sur l&#39;&icirc;le de Fehmarn, au nord de l&#39;Allemagne. En raison de la mer tr&egrave;s plate et des aires de jeux pour enfants &agrave; la plage, il est recommand&eacute; pour un type d&#39;utilisateur familial. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve cette plage s&#39;appelle Schleswig-Holstein. Vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cet endroit avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule, m&ecirc;me avec un camping-car, et vous garer sur un grand parking. Du parking &agrave; la plage, il n&#39;y a que 100 m&egrave;tres de marche confortable. &Agrave; la plage, vous disposez d&#39;environ 500 m&egrave;tres de longueur et 50 m&egrave;tres de largeur. La plage est tr&egrave;s plate et l&#39;eau aussi, ce qui est id&eacute;al pour les petits enfants, qui peuvent jouer dans l&#39;eau en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;, et les parents ayant moins de stress. Certains services de plage sont disponibles ici, mais plus ou moins ils ne sont que de base. Un petit restaurant est &eacute;galement ici, mais pas d&#39;h&eacute;bergement. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 3858, 'fr', 1),
(1924, 'La playa Strand Gr&uuml;ner Brink se encuentra en la isla Fehmarn, en el norte de Alemania. Debido a que el mar es muy plano y los parques infantiles en la playa, se recomienda para un tipo de usuario familiar. La regi&oacute;n donde se encuentra esta playa se llama Schleswig-Holstein. Se puede llegar a este lugar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana, y aparcar en un amplio aparcamiento. Desde el lugar de estacionamiento hasta la playa hay solo 100 metros de caminata c&oacute;moda. En la playa tienes aproximadamente 500 metros de largo y 50 metros de ancho disponibles. La playa es muy plana y tambi&eacute;n el agua, que es ideal para los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os, que pueden jugar en el agua de forma segura y los padres tienen menos estr&eacute;s. Algunos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, pero m&aacute;s o menos son solo de naturaleza b&aacute;sica. Un peque&ntilde;o restaurante tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; aqu&iacute;, pero no hay alojamiento. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 3858, 'es', 1),
(1925, 'La spiaggia Strand Gr&uuml;ner Brink si trova sull&#39;isola di Fehmarn, nel nord della Germania. A causa del mare molto piatto e dei parchi giochi per bambini in spiaggia, &egrave; consigliato per un tipo di utente familiare. La regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia si chiama Schleswig-Holstein. &Egrave; possibile raggiungere questa localit&agrave; con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con camper, e parcheggiare in un ampio parcheggio. Dal parcheggio alla spiaggia sono solo 100 metri di comoda passeggiata. In spiaggia hai a disposizione circa 500 metri di lunghezza e 50 metri di larghezza. La spiaggia &egrave; molto piatta, cos&igrave; come l&#39;acqua, ideale per i bambini piccoli, che possono giocare in acqua in tutta sicurezza, e per i genitori che hanno meno stress. Alcuni servizi di spiaggia sono disponibili qui, ma pi&ugrave; o meno sono solo di natura elementare. C&#39;&egrave; anche un piccolo ristorante, ma nessun alloggio. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 3858, 'it', 1),
(1926, 'En la isla alemana de Fehmarn hay muchas zonas de protecci&oacute;n natural donde tiene la oportunidad &uacute;nica de observar algunas aves raras. Pero, por supuesto, tambi&eacute;n tiene la opci&oacute;n de estar en una playa justo al lado de dicha zona, como en la playa Strand Gammendorf. La regi&oacute;n en la que se encuentran estas zonas es Schleswig-Holstein del norte de Alemania. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo; Las autocaravanas tambi&eacute;n son bienvenidas. Solo te tomar&aacute; 100 metros de caminata para llegar a la playa. Antes de entrar en la playa, debe pagar 2,5 &euro; de impuesto de playa. La longitud total de la playa es de varios kil&oacute;metros y tiene hasta 30 metros de ancho. La superficie principal de la playa son peque&ntilde;os guijarros, pero tambi&eacute;n hay algo de arena y algo de c&eacute;sped en la playa. Ya puedes empezar a nadar despu&eacute;s de 15 m. Algunos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, pero son principalmente b&aacute;sicos. Un restaurante y una cafeter&iacute;a tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n cerca, as&iacute; como un gran terreno para acampar para su alojamiento. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 3859, 'es', 1),
(1927, 'Sur l&#39;&icirc;le allemande de Fehmarn, il existe de nombreuses zones de protection naturelle o&ugrave; vous avez une occasion unique d&#39;observer des oiseaux rares. Mais bien s&ucirc;r, vous avez &eacute;galement la possibilit&eacute; d&#39;&ecirc;tre sur une plage juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; d&#39;une telle zone, comme sur la plage Strand Gammendorf. La r&eacute;gion dans laquelle ces zones sont situ&eacute;es est le Schleswig-Holstein de l&#39;Allemagne du Nord. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule; les camping-cars sont &eacute;galement les bienvenus. Il ne vous faudra que 100 m&egrave;tres de marche pour vous rendre &agrave; la plage. Avant d&#39;entrer sur la plage, vous devez payer 2,5 &euro; de taxe de plage. La longueur totale de la plage est de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et sa largeur peut atteindre 30 m&egrave;tres. La surface principale de la plage est constitu&eacute;e de petits cailloux, mais vous avez &eacute;galement du sable et de l&#39;herbe sur la plage. Vous pouvez d&eacute;j&agrave; commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s 15 m. Certains services de plage sont disponibles ici, mais ils sont principalement basiques. Un restaurant et un caf&eacute;-bar se trouvent &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;, ainsi qu&#39;un grand terrain de camping pour votre h&eacute;bergement. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.​', 3859, 'fr', 1),
(1928, 'Sull&#39;isola tedesca di Fehmarn ci sono molte zone di protezione naturale dove hai l&#39;opportunit&agrave; unica di osservare alcuni uccelli rari. Ma ovviamente hai anche la possibilit&agrave; di essere su una spiaggia proprio accanto a una tale zona, come sulla spiaggia Strand Gammendorf. La regione in cui si trovano queste zone &egrave; lo Schleswig-Holstein della Germania settentrionale. Questa localit&agrave; &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo; anche i camper sono i benvenuti. Ci vorranno solo 100 metri a piedi per raggiungere la spiaggia. Prima di entrare in spiaggia &egrave; necessario pagare 2,5&euro; di beach tax. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di diversi chilometri ed &egrave; larga fino a 30 metri. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; costituita da piccoli ciottoli, ma c&#39;&egrave; anche un po&#39; di sabbia e un po&#39; d&#39;erba sulla spiaggia. Puoi iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; dopo 15 m. Alcuni servizi in spiaggia sono disponibili qui, ma sono principalmente di base. Nelle vicinanze si trovano anche un ristorante e un bar, nonch&eacute; un ampio campeggio per il vostro alloggio. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.​', 3859, 'it', 1),
(1929, 'Auf der deutschen Insel Fehmarn gibt es viele Naturschutzgebiete, in denen Sie die einmalige Gelegenheit haben, einige seltene V&ouml;gel zu beobachten. Aber nat&uuml;rlich haben Sie auch die M&ouml;glichkeit, direkt neben einer solchen Zone an einem Strand zu sein, wie zum Beispiel am Strand Gammendorf. Die Region, in der sich diese Zonen befinden, ist das norddeutsche Schleswig-Holstein. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen; Auch Wohnmobile sind willkommen. Zum Strand sind es nur 100 Meter zu Fu&szlig;. Bevor Sie den Strand betreten, m&uuml;ssen Sie 2,5 &euro; Strandsteuer bezahlen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und er ist bis zu 30 Meter breit. Die Hauptfl&auml;che am Strand sind kleine Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben auch etwas Sand und etwas Gras am Strand. Bereits nach 15 m k&ouml;nnen Sie mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Einige Stranddienstleistungen sind hier verf&uuml;gbar, aber sie sind haupts&auml;chlich einfach. Ein Restaurant und eine Kaffeebar sind ebenfalls in der N&auml;he, sowie ein gro&szlig;er Campingplatz f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun. ​', 3859, 'de', 1),
(1930, 'Benvenuti in una spiaggia molto speciale per camper e sport acquatici. Questa spiaggia, che prende il nome di Strand Altenteil, &egrave; consigliata a chi ama praticare alcuni sport acquatici, come windsurf e kitesurf. Per questo motivo &egrave; per lo pi&ugrave; consigliato per un tipo di utente pi&ugrave; avventuriero. Si trova sull&#39;isola tedesca Fehmarn nella regione settentrionale dello Schleswig-Holstein. &Egrave; molto facile accedervi con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, camper inclusi e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare a soli 10 metri dalla spiaggia. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; costituita da piccoli ciottoli, ma &egrave; inclusa anche della sabbia marrone. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il nuoto inizia gi&agrave; a 10 metri. La maggior parte dei servizi spiaggia &egrave; disponibile solo nel campeggio. Se sei proprietario di un cane, qui sei il benvenuto. Il campeggio &egrave; anche l&#39;unico alloggio possibile in questa zona, nonch&eacute; l&#39;unico posto dove hai un bistrot, che serve cibo da queste parti. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 3860, 'it', 1),
(1931, 'Bienvenue sur une plage de camping-car / sports nautiques tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale. Cette plage, qui porte le nom de Strand Altenteil, est recommand&eacute;e pour ceux qui aiment pratiquer des sports nautiques, comme la planche &agrave; voile et le kitesurf. De ce fait, il est principalement recommand&eacute; pour un type d&#39;utilisateur plus aventurier. Il est situ&eacute; sur l&#39;&icirc;le allemande de Fehmarn dans la r&eacute;gion nord du Schleswig-Holstein. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;y acc&eacute;der avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, camping-cars inclus et vous pouvez vous garer &agrave; seulement 10 m&egrave;tres de la plage. La surface principale de la plage est constitu&eacute;e de petits cailloux, mais vous avez &eacute;galement du sable brun inclus. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et la baignade commence d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 10 m&egrave;tres. La plupart des services de plage sont disponibles uniquement dans le camp. Si vous &ecirc;tes propri&eacute;taire d&#39;un chien, vous &ecirc;tes le bienvenu ici. Le camp est aussi le seul h&eacute;bergement possible dans cette zone ainsi que le seul endroit o&ugrave; vous avez un bistro, qui sert de la nourriture par ici. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 3860, 'fr', 1),
(1932, 'Bienvenido a una playa muy especial para autocaravanas / deportes acu&aacute;ticos. Esta playa, que se conoce con el nombre de Strand Altenteil, es recomendada para los amantes de la pr&aacute;ctica de deportes acu&aacute;ticos, como windsurf y kitesurf. Debido a este hecho, se recomienda principalmente para un tipo de usuario m&aacute;s aventurero. Se encuentra en la isla alemana Fehmarn en la regi&oacute;n norte de Schleswig-Holstein. Es muy f&aacute;cil acceder a &eacute;l con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, autocaravanas incluidas y se puede aparcar a tan solo 10 metros de la playa. La superficie principal de la playa son peque&ntilde;os guijarros, pero tambi&eacute;n tiene arena marr&oacute;n incluida. La entrada de agua es agradable y la nataci&oacute;n comienza ya a los 10 metros. La mayor&iacute;a de los servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles solo en el campamento. Si eres due&ntilde;o de un perro, aqu&iacute; eres bienvenido. El campamento es tambi&eacute;n el &uacute;nico alojamiento posible en esta &aacute;rea, as&iacute; como el &uacute;nico lugar donde tienes un bistr&oacute;, que sirve comida por aqu&iacute;. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 3860, 'es', 1),
(1933, 'Willkommen an einem ganz besonderen Wohnmobil-/ Wassersportstrand. Dieser Strand, der den Namen Strand Altenteil tr&auml;gt, ist f&uuml;r diejenigen zu empfehlen, die Wassersport wie Windsurfen und Kiteboarden lieben. Aus diesem Grund wird es haupts&auml;chlich f&uuml;r einen eher abenteuerlustigen Benutzertyp empfohlen. Es liegt auf der deutschen Insel Fehmarn in der Nordregion Schleswig-Holstein. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, einschlie&szlig;lich Wohnmobilen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen nur 10 Meter vom Strand entfernt parken. Die Hauptfl&auml;che am Strand sind kleine Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben auch etwas braunen Sand. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und das Schwimmen beginnt bereits bei 10 Metern. Die meisten Stranddienstleistungen sind nur im Camp verf&uuml;gbar. Wenn Sie Hundebesitzer sind, sind Sie hier herzlich willkommen. Das Camp ist auch die einzig m&ouml;gliche Unterkunft in dieser Gegend sowie der einzige Ort, an dem Sie ein Bistro haben, das hier Essen serviert. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 3860, 'de', 1),
(1934, 'La mayor&iacute;a de las playas alemanas tienen arena como superficie principal. Si est&aacute; buscando otro tipo, como peque&ntilde;os guijarros, le recomendamos que visite la playa Strand Bojendorf. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Schleswig-Holstein, en el norte de Alemania, en la famosa isla Fehmarn. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, autocaravanas incluidas, y puede dejar su veh&iacute;culo a solo 200 metros de la playa. La playa tiene una longitud total de varios kil&oacute;metros y 25 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy bonita y c&oacute;moda y ya puedes empezar a nadar despu&eacute;s de 10 m de entrar al agua. Es obligatorio pagar una tasa de playa de 2,5 &euro; por adulto por d&iacute;a. Algunos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, pero m&aacute;s o menos son b&aacute;sicos. Alrededor del estacionamiento tambi&eacute;n tiene una tienda y un bistr&oacute;, un parque infantil tambi&eacute;n se encuentra all&iacute;. El alojamiento en esta ubicaci&oacute;n est&aacute; disponible en el campamento. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 3861, 'es', 1),
(1935, 'La plupart des plages allemandes ont du sable comme surface principale. Si vous recherchez un autre type, comme les petits cailloux, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage Strand Bojendorf. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion nord-allemande du Schleswig-Holstein sur la tr&egrave;s c&eacute;l&egrave;bre &icirc;le de Fehmarn. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, camping-car inclus, et vous pouvez laisser votre v&eacute;hicule &agrave; seulement 200m de la plage. La plage a une longueur totale de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et une largeur de 25 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et confortable et vous pouvez d&eacute;j&agrave; commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s 10 m apr&egrave;s &ecirc;tre entr&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. Il est obligatoire de payer une taxe de plage de 2,5&euro; pour un adulte par jour. Certains services de plage sont disponibles ici, mais ils sont plus ou moins basiques. Autour du parking vous avez &eacute;galement une boutique et un bistro, une aire de jeux pour enfants s&#39;y trouve &eacute;galement. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement sur cet emplacement est disponible dans le camp. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.​', 3861, 'fr', 1),
(1936, 'La maggior parte delle spiagge tedesche ha la sabbia come superficie principale. Se stai cercando un altro tipo, come i piccoli ciottoli, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand Bojendorf. Si trova nella regione della Germania settentrionale Schleswig-Holstein sulla famosissima isola di Fehmarn. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, camper inclusi, e puoi lasciare il tuo veicolo a soli 200 metri dalla spiaggia. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di diversi chilometri ed &egrave; larga 25 metri. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e comodo e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; dopo 10 m dopo essere entrati in acqua. &Egrave; obbligatorio pagare una tassa di spiaggia di 2,5&euro; per un adulto al giorno. Alcuni servizi in spiaggia sono disponibili qui, ma pi&ugrave; o meno sono essenziali. Intorno al parcheggio ci sono anche un negozio e un bistrot, c&#39;&egrave; anche un parco giochi per bambini. L&#39;alloggio in questa posizione &egrave; disponibile nel campo. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.​', 3861, 'it', 1),
(1937, 'Die meisten deutschen Str&auml;nde haben Sand als Hauptoberfl&auml;che. Wenn Sie nach einer anderen Art suchen, wie zum Beispiel kleinen Kieselsteinen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Bojendorf zu besuchen. Es liegt in der norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein auf der sehr bekannten Insel Fehmarn. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr gut zu erreichen, auch mit Wohnmobilen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug nur 200 m vom Strand entfernt abstellen. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und ist 25m breit. Der Wassereinstieg ist sehr sch&ouml;n und komfortabel und man kann bereits nach 10 m nach dem Eintauchen ins Wasser mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Es ist obligatorisch, eine Strandsteuer von 2,5 &euro; f&uuml;r einen Erwachsenen pro Tag zu zahlen. Einige Strandservices sind hier verf&uuml;gbar, aber mehr oder weniger sind sie einfach. Um den Parkplatz herum haben Sie auch einen Laden und ein Bistro, ein Kinderspielplatz befindet sich auch dort. Unterkunft an diesem Ort ist im Camp verf&uuml;gbar. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun. ​', 3861, 'de', 1),
(1938, 'Benvenuti in una spiaggia dove i kiters trovano il loro paradiso. La spiaggia tedesca Strand Fl&uuml;gge si trova sulla famosa isola di Fehmarn. A causa del fondale piatto e del forte vento, &egrave; adatto ad un utente avventuroso, soprattutto a chi ama fare windsurf e kiteboarding. La regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia si chiama Schleswig-Holstein. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, camper inclusi. Ci vogliono solo 50 metri dal parcheggio per raggiungere la spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga fino a 10 metri. Il punto di nuoto inizia a 75 metri, molto tardi, che &egrave; l&#39;ideale per alcuni seri sport acquatici sul vento. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; quasi assente qui, anche ristoranti e simili non sono presenti qui. Inoltre non troverete alcun alloggio nelle vicinanze, un vero paradiso per gli amanti della natura. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 3862, 'it', 1),
(1939, 'Bienvenue sur une plage o&ugrave; les kiters trouvent leur paradis. La plage allemande Strand Fl&uuml;gge est situ&eacute;e sur la c&eacute;l&egrave;bre &icirc;le de Fehmarn. En raison des fonds marins plats et des vents forts, il convient &agrave; un type d&#39;utilisateur d&#39;aventure, en particulier pour ceux qui aiment faire de la planche &agrave; voile et du kitesurf. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve cette plage s&#39;appelle Schleswig-Holstein. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, camping-car inclus. Il vous faut seulement 50 m&egrave;tres du parking pour rejoindre la plage. La plage mesure plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 10 m&egrave;tres de large. Le point de nage commence &agrave; 75 m&egrave;tres, tr&egrave;s tard, ce qui est id&eacute;al pour certains sports nautiques de vent s&eacute;rieux. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage n&#39;est presque pas pr&eacute;sente ici, les restaurants et similaires ne sont pas non plus pr&eacute;sents ici. Vous ne trouverez pas non plus d&#39;h&eacute;bergement &agrave; proximit&eacute;, un v&eacute;ritable paradis pour les amoureux de la nature. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 3862, 'fr', 1),
(1940, 'Bienvenido a una playa donde los kiters encuentran su para&iacute;so. La playa alemana Strand Fl&uuml;gge se encuentra en la famosa isla Fehmarn. Debido al fondo marino plano y a los fuertes vientos, es adecuado para un tipo de usuario aventurero, especialmente para aquellos a los que les gusta hacer windsurf y kitesurf. La regi&oacute;n en la que se encuentra esta playa se llama Schleswig-Holstein. Es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, autocaravanas incluidas. Se tarda solo 50 metros desde el lugar de estacionamiento para llegar a la playa. La playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 10 metros de ancho. El punto de nataci&oacute;n comienza a los 75 metros, muy tarde, lo que es ideal para algunos deportes acu&aacute;ticos de viento serios. La infraestructura de la playa casi no est&aacute; presente aqu&iacute;, los restaurantes y similares tampoco est&aacute;n presentes aqu&iacute;. Tampoco encontrar&aacute; ning&uacute;n alojamiento cerca, un verdadero para&iacute;so para los amantes de la naturaleza. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 3862, 'es', 1),
(1941, 'Willkommen an einem Strand, an dem Kiter ihr Paradies finden. Der deutsche Strand Fl&uuml;gge liegt auf der ber&uuml;hmten Insel Fehmarn. Aufgrund des flachen Meeresbodens und der starken Winde ist es f&uuml;r Abenteuerlustige geeignet, insbesondere f&uuml;r diejenigen, die gerne Windsurfen und Kitesurfen. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Schleswig-Holstein. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit Wohnmobilen, sehr gut zu erreichen. Vom Parkplatz sind es nur 50 Meter bis zum Strand. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und bis zu 10 Meter breit. Der Schwimmpunkt beginnt bei 75 Metern, sehr sp&auml;t, was ideal f&uuml;r ernsthafte Windwassersportarten ist. Strandinfrastruktur ist hier fast nicht vorhanden, Restaurants und &auml;hnliches sind hier ebenfalls nicht vorhanden. Auch finden Sie in der N&auml;he keine Unterkunft, ein wahres Paradies f&uuml;r Naturliebhaber. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 3862, 'de', 1),
(1942, 'Si te gusta practicar deportes acu&aacute;ticos serios en la playa, como windsurf o kitesurf, te recomendamos que visites la playa alemana Strand Orthfeld. Este lugar es ideal para la pr&aacute;ctica de esos deportes antes mencionados, debido a los fondos marinos muy planos y los fuertes vientos, que en la mayor&iacute;a de los casos est&aacute;n presentes durante todo el a&ntilde;o. La regi&oacute;n en la que se encuentra esta playa pertenece a Schleswig-Holstein. Puede acceder a esta ubicaci&oacute;n con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n una autocaravana. La plaza de aparcamiento est&aacute; a s&oacute;lo 50 m de la playa. La playa tiene 1 km de largo y 25 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy bonita y el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a m&aacute;s de 100 metros en el mar. Aqu&iacute; tiene muy poco servicio de playa, los restaurantes y bares tampoco est&aacute;n presentes. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en forma de apartamentos en un pueblo cercano. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 3863, 'es', 1),
(1943, 'Si vous aimez pratiquer des sports nautiques s&eacute;rieux sur la plage, comme la planche &agrave; voile ou le kitesurf, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage allemande Strand Orthfeld. Cet endroit est id&eacute;al pour les sports mentionn&eacute;s ci-dessus, en raison des fonds marins tr&egrave;s plats et des vents forts, qui dans la plupart des cas sont pr&eacute;sents toute l&#39;ann&eacute;e. La r&eacute;gion, cette plage est situ&eacute;e, appartient au Schleswig-Holstein. Vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cet emplacement avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, m&ecirc;me un camping-car. Le parking est &agrave; seulement 50 m de la plage. La plage mesure 1 km de long et 25 m de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de nage est &agrave; plus de 100m dans la mer. Vous avez tr&egrave;s peu de service de plage ici, les restaurants et les bars sont &eacute;galement absents. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible sous forme d&#39;appartements dans un village voisin. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 3863, 'fr', 1),
(1944, 'Se ti piacciono gli sport acquatici sulla spiaggia, come il windsurf o il kitesurf, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia tedesca Strand Orthfeld. Questo luogo &egrave; l&#39;ideale per gli sport citati prima, a causa dei fondali molto piatti e dei venti forti, che nella maggior parte dei casi sono presenti tutto l&#39;anno. La regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia appartiene allo Schleswig-Holstein. Puoi accedere a questa posizione con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche un camper. Il parcheggio &egrave; a soli 50 metri dalla spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 1 km e larga 25 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di nuoto &egrave; a pi&ugrave; di 100 metri nel mare. Hai pochissimo servizio spiaggia qui, anche ristoranti e bar non sono presenti. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile sotto forma di appartamenti in un villaggio vicino. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 3863, 'it', 1),
(1945, 'Wenn Sie am Strand ernsthafte Wassersportarten wie Windsurfen oder Kitesurfen aus&uuml;ben m&ouml;chten, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den deutschen Strand Orthfeld zu besuchen. Dieser Ort ist aufgrund des sehr flachen Meeresbodens und der starken Winde, die in den meisten F&auml;llen das ganze Jahr &uuml;ber pr&auml;sent sind, ideal f&uuml;r die oben genannten Sportarten. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, geh&ouml;rt zu Schleswig-Holstein. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen, auch mit einem Wohnmobil. Der Parkplatz ist nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Strand ist 1 km lang und 25 m breit. Der Wassereinstieg ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt mehr als 100m im Meer. Sie haben hier sehr wenig Strandservice, Restaurants und Bars sind auch nicht vorhanden. Die Unterbringung erfolgt in Form von Apartments in einem nahen gelegenen Dorf. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 3863, 'de', 1),
(1946, 'Benvenuti sulla spiaggia baltica tedesca molto speciale. Una spiaggia di sabbia molto ben organizzata e bellissima aspetta la tua visita nella citt&agrave; di Heiligenhafen. Uno dei motivi per cui questa &egrave; una spiaggia speciale &egrave; a causa dei grandi massi e rocce, che si trovano in alcune parti. Questa localit&agrave; fa parte della regione della Germania settentrionale dello Schleswig-Holstein. Questa spiaggia &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche camper. Ci vogliono solo 50 m di facile camminata per raggiungere la spiaggia. Quando si entra in spiaggia, &egrave; necessario pagare una tassa sulla spiaggia. In totale hai a disposizione 1 km di lunghezza e 50 m di larghezza. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto carino e silenzioso. Il punto di balneazione parte sia dal molo che dalla spiaggia e va da 0 a 25 m. Hai molti servizi in spiaggia disponibili qui. Vicino alla spiaggia hai anche la possibilit&agrave; di prendere qualcosa da mangiare o da bere. Se desideri rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo e stai cercando un alloggio, hai pi&ugrave; opzioni tra cui scegliere. Nelle vicinanze sono disponibili molti hotel, appartamenti e camere libere. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 3864, 'it', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1947, 'Bienvenue sur la plage baltique allemande tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale. Une tr&egrave;s bien organis&eacute;e et une belle plage de sable attend votre visite dans la ville de Heiligenhafen. L&#39;une des raisons pour lesquelles cette plage est sp&eacute;ciale est due aux gros rochers et rochers, qui se trouvent sur certaines parties. Cet endroit fait partie de la r&eacute;gion nord-allemande du Schleswig-Holstein. Cette plage est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, m&ecirc;me en camping-car. Il ne faut que 50 m de marche facile pour se rendre &agrave; la plage. En entrant sur la plage, vous devez payer une taxe de plage. Au total, vous avez 1 km de longueur et 50 m de largeur disponibles. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et calme plat. Le point de baignade part soit de l&#39;embarcad&egrave;re, soit de la plage et s&#39;&eacute;chelonne entre 0 et 25 m. Vous avez beaucoup de services de plage disponibles ici. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement la possibilit&eacute; de prendre quelque chose &agrave; manger ou &agrave; boire. Si vous souhaitez rester ici plus longtemps et que vous recherchez un logement, vous avez le choix entre plusieurs options. De nombreux h&ocirc;tels, appartements et chambres gratuites sont disponibles dans les environs. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 3864, 'fr', 1),
(1948, 'Bienvenido a la playa b&aacute;ltica alemana muy especial. Una playa de arena muy bien organizada y hermosa espera su visita en la ciudad de Heiligenhafen. Una de las razones por las que se trata de una playa especial es por los grandes cantos rodados y rocas que se encuentran en algunas partes. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es parte de la regi&oacute;n del norte de Alemania, Schleswig-Holstein. Esta playa es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n autocaravanas. Solo se necesitan 50 m de caminata para llegar a la playa. Al ingresar a la playa, debe pagar un impuesto de playa. En total tienes 1 km de largo y 50 m de ancho disponibles. La entrada al agua es llana muy bonita y tranquila. El punto de ba&ntilde;o comienza desde el muelle o desde la playa y oscila entre 0 y 25 m. Tienes muchos servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;. Cerca de la playa tambi&eacute;n tienes la opci&oacute;n de comer o beber algo. Si desea quedarse aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo y est&aacute; buscando un alojamiento, tiene m&uacute;ltiples opciones para elegir. Muchos hoteles, apartamentos y habitaciones libres est&aacute;n disponibles en las inmediaciones. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 3864, 'es', 1),
(1949, 'Willkommen am ganz besonderen deutschen Ostseestrand. Ein sehr gut organisierter und sch&ouml;ner Sandstrand wartet in der Stadt Heiligenhafen auf Ihren Besuch. Einer der Gr&uuml;nde, warum dies ein besonderer Strand ist, sind die gro&szlig;en Felsbrocken und Felsen, die sich an einigen Stellen befinden. Dieser Ort geh&ouml;rt zur norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein. Dieser Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch Wohnmobil, sehr gut zu erreichen. Zum Strand sind es nur 50 m bequem zu Fu&szlig;. Beim Betreten des Strandes m&uuml;ssen Sie eine Strandsteuer bezahlen. Insgesamt stehen Ihnen 1 km L&auml;nge und 50 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und ruhig flach. Der Schwimmpunkt beginnt entweder am Pier oder am Strand und liegt zwischen 0 und 25 m. Hier stehen Ihnen viele Strandservices zur Verf&uuml;gung. In Strandn&auml;he haben Sie auch die M&ouml;glichkeit etwas zu essen oder zu trinken. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hier bleiben m&ouml;chten und auf der Suche nach einer Unterkunft sind, haben Sie mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten zur Auswahl. Viele Hotels, Appartements und freie Zimmer sind in der n&auml;heren Umgebung vorhanden. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 3864, 'de', 1),
(1950, '&iquest;Qu&eacute; tal una playa en el Binnensee alem&aacute;n? En cierto modo es un lago, pero todav&iacute;a est&aacute; conectado a trav&eacute;s de un peque&ntilde;o canal con el mar. Uno es seguro, esta playa es nueva, es artificial, pero sin embargo muy bonita y hermosa construida. se encuentra en la ciudad del norte de Alemania Heiligenhafen, donde la mayor&iacute;a de las playas est&aacute;n orientadas hacia el Mar B&aacute;ltico, pero esta est&aacute; orientada hacia el interior. La regi&oacute;n a la que pertenece esta playa se llama Schleswig-Holstein. Se puede llegar a esta playa muy f&aacute;cilmente con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana. Se tarda s&oacute;lo 30 m desde el aparcamiento para llegar a la playa. La longitud total de la playa es de 750 my puede llegar a tener en algunos lugares hasta 25 m de ancho. El lago es muy llano, lo que lo convierte tambi&eacute;n en el punto de nadar a unos 50 m. Aqu&iacute; tiene mucha infraestructura de playa, tambi&eacute;n un campo de deportes y algunos parques infantiles. Lo que realmente me gusta de esta playa son los bancos de verano especialmente dise&ntilde;ados, que miran hacia el sol, para que puedas maximizar tu bronceado. Si eres propietario de un barco, aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n tienes un puerto. Tambi&eacute;n hay muchas opciones disponibles para el alojamiento, si desea permanecer aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo. Cerca del puerto tambi&eacute;n tengo algunos restaurantes y cafeter&iacute;as. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 3866, 'es', 1),
(1951, 'Que diriez-vous d&#39;une plage sur le Binnensee allemand. C&#39;est en quelque sorte un lac, mais toujours reli&eacute; par un petit canal &agrave; la mer. On est s&ucirc;r, cette plage est neuve, elle est artificielle, mais n&eacute;anmoins tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et belle construite. il est situ&eacute; dans la ville du nord de l&#39;Allemagne, Heiligenhafen, o&ugrave; la plupart des plages font face &agrave; la mer Baltique, mais celle-ci fait face &agrave; l&#39;int&eacute;rieur des terres. La r&eacute;gion &agrave; laquelle appartient cette plage s&#39;appelle Schleswig-Holstein. Vous pouvez rejoindre cette plage tr&egrave;s facilement avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule, m&ecirc;me avec un camping-car. Il ne vous faut que 30 m du parking pour rejoindre la plage. La longueur totale de la plage est de 750 m et elle peut atteindre &agrave; certains endroits jusqu&#39;&agrave; 25 m de large. Le lac est tr&egrave;s plat ce qui fait aussi le point de nager &agrave; environ 50m. Vous avez ici de nombreuses infrastructures de plage, un terrain de sport et des aires de jeux pour enfants. Ce que j&#39;aime vraiment sur cette plage, ce sont les bancs d&#39;&eacute;t&eacute; sp&eacute;cialement con&ccedil;us, qui font tous face au soleil, afin que vous puissiez maximiser votre bronzage. Si vous &ecirc;tes propri&eacute;taire d&#39;un bateau, vous avez &eacute;galement un port ici. De nombreuses options sont &eacute;galement disponibles pour l&#39;h&eacute;bergement, si vous souhaitez rester ici plus longtemps. Pr&egrave;s du port, j&#39;ai aussi quelques restaurants et caf&eacute;s. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 3866, 'fr', 1),
(1952, 'Che ne dici di una spiaggia sul Binnensee tedesco. In un certo senso &egrave; un lago, ma &egrave; comunque collegato al mare tramite un piccolo canale. Uno &egrave; sicuro, questa spiaggia &egrave; nuova, &egrave; artificiale, ma comunque molto bella e ben costruita. si trova nella citt&agrave; della Germania settentrionale Heiligenhafen, dove la maggior parte delle spiagge sono rivolte verso il Mar Baltico, ma questa &egrave; rivolta verso l&#39;entroterra. La regione a cui appartiene questa spiaggia si chiama Schleswig-Holstein. Puoi raggiungere questa spiaggia molto facilmente con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con un camper. Ci vogliono solo 30 m dal parcheggio per raggiungere la spiaggia. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 750 m e in alcuni punti pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 25 m. Il lago &egrave; molto piatto, il che rende anche il punto di fare il bagno a circa 50 m. Hai molte infrastrutture per la spiaggia qui, anche un campo sportivo e alcuni campi da gioco per bambini. Quello che mi piace davvero di questa spiaggia sono le panchine estive appositamente progettate, tutte rivolte verso il sole, cos&igrave; puoi massimizzare la tua abbronzatura. Se sei proprietario di una barca, qui hai anche un porto. Molte opzioni sono disponibili anche per l&#39;alloggio, se desideri rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo. Vicino al porto ho anche alcuni ristoranti e bar. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 3866, 'it', 1),
(1953, 'Wie w&auml;re es mit einem Strand am deutschen Binnensee. Es ist gewisserma&szlig;en ein See, aber dennoch &uuml;ber einen kleinen Kanal mit dem Meer verbunden. Eins ist sicher, dieser Strand ist neu, er ist k&uuml;nstlich, aber trotzdem sehr sch&ouml;n und sch&ouml;n angelegt. Es liegt in der norddeutschen Stadt Heiligenhafen, wo die meisten Str&auml;nde zur Ostsee ausgerichtet sind, dieser jedoch zum Landesinneren. Die Region, zu der dieser Strand geh&ouml;rt, hei&szlig;t Schleswig-Holstein. Sie erreichen diesen Strand ganz einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem Wohnmobil. Vom Parkplatz sind es nur 30 m bis zum Strand. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 750 m und kann an einigen Stellen bis zu 25 m breit sein. Der See ist sehr flach, was auch den Punkt zum Schwimmen auf etwa 50 m macht. Sie haben hier viel Strandinfrastruktur, auch einen Sportplatz und einige Kinderspielpl&auml;tze. Was ich an diesem Strand wirklich mag, sind die speziell entworfenen Sommerb&auml;nke, die alle der Sonne zugewandt sind, damit Sie Ihre Sonnenbr&auml;une maximieren k&ouml;nnen. Wenn Sie Eigent&uuml;mer eines Bootes sind, haben Sie hier auch einen Hafen. Auch f&uuml;r die Unterbringung stehen Ihnen viele M&ouml;glichkeiten zur Verf&uuml;gung, wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten. In der N&auml;he des Hafens habe ich auch einige Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 3866, 'de', 1),
(1954, 'Se ti piace una spiaggia sabbiosa lunga e ampia, con molta superficie, anche un luogo dove il tuo cane pu&ograve; godersi il mare, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia tedesca Strand Sehlendorf. Si trova nella regione tedesca settentrionale dello Schleswig-Holstein vicino al villaggio di Blekendorf. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungere questa localit&agrave; con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, camper inclusi. Il parcheggio si trova proprio accanto alla spiaggia, a soli 50 m di distanza. Come molte altre spiagge tedesche anche questa &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e nella parte pi&ugrave; larga supera i 50 metri. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; abbastanza piatta, cos&igrave; come il fondale, che fa s&igrave; che il punto di balneazione sia a circa 100 m. Questo rende questa spiaggia ideale per far giocare i bambini piccoli in acqua in sicurezza. Hai molti servizi in spiaggia disponibili qui, un parco giochi per bambini &egrave; incluso e un piccolo club velico. Come di consueto in Germania, su questa spiaggia &egrave; possibile noleggiare anche una sedia a sdraio tedesca speciale, chiamata Strandkorb. Hai anche molte opzioni per prendere qualcosa da mangiare o da bere qui. Per le tue vacanze estive la sistemazione pi&ugrave; vicina che puoi scegliere &egrave; un campeggio che si trova nelle vicinanze. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 3868, 'it', 1),
(1955, 'Si te gusta una playa de arena larga y ancha, con mucha superficie, tambi&eacute;n un lugar donde tu perro pueda disfrutar del mar, te recomendamos que visites la playa alemana Strand Sehlendorf. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n del norte de Alemania, Schleswig-Holstein, cerca del pueblo Blekendorf. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a esta ubicaci&oacute;n con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, autocaravanas incluidas. El aparcamiento est&aacute; justo al lado de la playa, a solo 50 m. Como muchas otras playas alemanas, esta tambi&eacute;n tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y en la parte m&aacute;s ancha tiene m&aacute;s de 50 metros de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es bastante plana y tambi&eacute;n lo es el fondo marino, lo que provoca que el punto de nado est&eacute; a unos 100 m. Esto hace que esta playa sea ideal para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen en el agua de forma segura. Tiene muchos servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;, un parque infantil est&aacute; incluido, as&iacute; como un peque&ntilde;o club de vela. Como es habitual en Alemania, por supuesto, tambi&eacute;n puede alquilar una silla de playa alemana especial, llamada Strandkorb, en esta playa. Tambi&eacute;n tienes muchas opciones para comer o beber aqu&iacute;. Para sus vacaciones de verano, el alojamiento m&aacute;s cercano que puede elegir es un camping cercano. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 3868, 'es', 1),
(1956, 'Si vous aimez une longue et large plage de sable, avec beaucoup de surface, &eacute;galement un endroit o&ugrave; votre chien peut profiter de la mer, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage allemande Strand Sehlendorf. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion nord de l&#39;Allemagne Schleswig-Holstein pr&egrave;s du village de Blekendorf. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&eacute;der &agrave; cet endroit avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, camping-cars inclus. Le parking est juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, &agrave; seulement 50 m. Comme beaucoup d&#39;autres plages allemandes, celle-ci fait &eacute;galement plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et sur la partie la plus large elle fait plus de 50 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est assez plate, de m&ecirc;me que les fonds marins, ce qui fait que le point de nage se situe &agrave; environ 100 m. Cela rend cette plage id&eacute;ale pour que les petits enfants puissent jouer dans l&#39;eau en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;. Vous avez de nombreux services de plage disponibles ici, une aire de jeux pour enfants est incluse, ainsi qu&#39;un petit club de voile. Comme il est d&#39;usage en Allemagne, vous pouvez bien s&ucirc;r louer une chaise de plage allemande sp&eacute;ciale, appel&eacute;e Strandkorb, &eacute;galement sur cette plage. Vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreuses options pour prendre quelque chose &agrave; manger ou &agrave; boire ici. Pour vos vacances d&#39;&eacute;t&eacute;, l&#39;h&eacute;bergement le plus proche que vous pouvez choisir est un terrain de camping qui se trouve &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 3868, 'fr', 1),
(1957, 'Wenn Sie einen langen und breiten Sandstrand mit viel Fl&auml;che m&ouml;gen, an dem auch Ihr Hund das Meer genie&szlig;en kann, empfehlen wir Ihnen den deutschen Strand Sehlendorf zu besuchen. Es liegt in der norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Blekendorf. Es ist sehr einfach, diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen, einschlie&szlig;lich Wohnmobilen. Der Parkplatz befindet sich direkt am Strand, nur ca. 50 m entfernt. Wie viele andere deutsche Str&auml;nde ist auch dieser mehrere Kilometer lang und an der breitesten Stelle &uuml;ber 50 Meter breit. Die Neigung am Strand ist ziemlich flach, ebenso wie der Meeresboden, wodurch der Schwimmpunkt bei etwa 100 m liegt. Dies macht diesen Strand ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder, um sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Hier stehen Ihnen viele Stranddienste zur Verf&uuml;gung, ein Kinderspielplatz ist inklusive, sowie ein kleiner Segelclub. Wie in Deutschland &uuml;blich, k&ouml;nnen Sie nat&uuml;rlich auch an diesem Strand einen Strandkorb mieten. Auch haben Sie hier viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, etwas zu essen oder zu trinken. F&uuml;r Ihren Sommerurlaub ist die n&auml;chstgelegene Unterkunft ein Campingplatz in der N&auml;he. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 3868, 'de', 1),
(1958, 'Si vous aimez une plage de sable avec de nombreuses petites baies, qui donnent &agrave; la plage une forme unique, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage allemande Strand Hohwacht. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion nord-allemande du Schleswig-Holstein, pr&egrave;s du village de Hohwacht. Cet endroit est facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec toutes sortes de v&eacute;hicules et le parking est &agrave; seulement 50 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Sur la plage, vous avez beaucoup d&#39;espace, o&ugrave; la longueur totale de la plage est de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et la largeur maximale est de 50 m. L&#39;entr&eacute;e de l&#39;eau ici est agr&eacute;able et en raison du fond marin plat, le point de nage est &agrave; 75 m&egrave;tres, quelque part encore plus &agrave; l&#39;ext&eacute;rieur. Ce fait devrait &ecirc;tre encore plus int&eacute;ressant pour les familles avec de jeunes enfants, car ici les enfants peuvent jouer dans l&#39;eau de mani&egrave;re plus s&ucirc;re qu&#39;&agrave; d&#39;autres endroits. De nombreux services de plage sont disponibles ici, vous avez &eacute;galement une aire de jeux pour enfants &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Une fois que vous &ecirc;tes sur la plage, vous ne devriez pas manquer l&#39;opportunit&eacute; de louer une chaise de plage allemande et de vivre une exp&eacute;rience de plage unique. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreuses options pour manger et boire et si vous cherchez un logement, certains h&ocirc;tels et appartements sont &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 3869, 'fr', 1),
(1959, 'Si le gusta una playa de arena con muchas bah&iacute;as peque&ntilde;as, que le dan una forma &uacute;nica, le recomendamos que visite la playa alemana Strand Hohwacht. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n del norte de Alemania Schleswig-Holstein, cerca del pueblo Hohwacht. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de f&aacute;cil acceso con todo tipo de veh&iacute;culos y el lugar de estacionamiento est&aacute; a solo 50 metros de la playa. En la playa tienes mucho espacio, donde la longitud total de la playa es de varios kil&oacute;metros y la anchura m&aacute;xima es de 50 m. La entrada de agua aqu&iacute; es agradable y debido al fondo marino plano el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a 75 metros, en alg&uacute;n lugar a&uacute;n m&aacute;s alejado. Este hecho deber&iacute;a ser a&uacute;n m&aacute;s interesante para las familias con ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os, porque aqu&iacute; los ni&ntilde;os pueden jugar en el agua de forma m&aacute;s segura que en otros lugares. Muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, tambi&eacute;n hay un parque infantil cerca. Una vez que est&eacute; en la playa, no debe perderse la oportunidad de alquilar una silla de playa alemana y tener una experiencia de playa &uacute;nica. Cerca de la playa tambi&eacute;n tienes muchas opciones para comer y beber y si est&aacute;s buscando alojamiento, hay algunos hoteles y apartamentos cerca. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 3869, 'es', 1),
(1960, 'Se ti piace una spiaggia sabbiosa con molte piccole baie, che danno alla spiaggia una forma unica, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia tedesca Strand Hohwacht. Si trova nella regione della Germania settentrionale dello Schleswig-Holstein, vicino al villaggio di Hohwacht. Questa posizione &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con tutti i tipi di veicoli e il parcheggio &egrave; a soli 50 metri dalla spiaggia. Sulla spiaggia hai molto spazio, dove la lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di diversi chilometri e la larghezza massima &egrave; di 50 m. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua qui &egrave; piacevole e per via del fondale piatto il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 75 metri, da qualche parte ancora pi&ugrave; fuori. Questo fatto dovrebbe essere ancora pi&ugrave; interessante per le famiglie con bambini piccoli, perch&eacute; qui i bambini possono giocare in acqua in modo pi&ugrave; sicuro che in altri luoghi. Molti servizi in spiaggia sono disponibili qui, hai anche un parco giochi per bambini nelle vicinanze. Una volta in spiaggia, non dovresti perdere l&#39;opportunit&agrave; di noleggiare una sedia a sdraio tedesca e vivere un&#39;esperienza in spiaggia davvero unica. Vicino alla spiaggia hai anche molte opzioni per prendere qualcosa da mangiare e da bere e se stai cercando un alloggio, alcuni hotel e appartamenti sono nelle vicinanze. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 3869, 'it', 1),
(1961, 'Wenn Sie einen Sandstrand mit vielen kleinen Buchten m&ouml;gen, die dem Strand eine einzigartige Form verleihen, empfehlen wir Ihnen den deutschen Strand Hohwacht zu besuchen. Es liegt in der norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Hohwacht. Dieser Ort ist mit allen Arten von Fahrzeugen leicht zu erreichen und der Parkplatz ist nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt. Am Strand haben Sie viel Platz, wobei die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes mehrere Kilometer betr&auml;gt und die maximale Breite 50 m betr&auml;gt. Der Wassereinstieg hier ist sch&ouml;n und wegen des flachen Meeresbodens liegt der Schwimmpunkt bei 75 Metern, irgendwo noch weiter drau&szlig;en. F&uuml;r Familien mit Kleinkindern d&uuml;rfte diese Tatsache noch interessanter sein, denn hier k&ouml;nnen die Kinder sicherer im Wasser spielen als an anderen Orten. Viele Strandservices sind hier verf&uuml;gbar, Sie haben auch einen Kinderspielplatz in der N&auml;he. Am Strand sollten Sie sich die Gelegenheit nicht entgehen lassen, einen deutschen Strandkorb zu mieten und ein ganz besonderes Stranderlebnis zu erleben. In Strandn&auml;he haben Sie auch viele M&ouml;glichkeiten etwas zu essen und zu trinken und falls Sie auf der Suche nach einer Unterkunft sind, sind einige Hotels und Apartments in der N&auml;he. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 3869, 'de', 1),
(1962, 'Se stai cercando una spiaggia tedesca, che ha sulla sua superficie un misto di sabbia e ciottoli e il parcheggio &egrave; a soli 10 m di distanza, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand Hohenfelde. Si trova nella regione della Germania settentrionale dello Schleswig-Holstein, vicino al villaggio di Hohenfelde. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Vicino alla spiaggia possono parcheggiare solo le auto, i camper possono parcheggiare un po&#39; in sottofondo. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga fino a 15 m. La superficie della spiaggia &egrave; un misto di ciottoli piccoli e grandi e sabbia. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 20 m. Hai alcuni servizi di spiaggia di base disponibili qui. Un ristorante e un bar si trovano direttamente sulla spiaggia. Non lontano c&#39;&egrave; un campeggio e alcuni appartamenti per il vostro alloggio. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 3870, 'it', 1),
(1963, 'Si est&aacute;s buscando una playa alemana, que tenga en su superficie una mezcla de arena y guijarros y la plaza de aparcamiento est&aacute; a solo 10 m, te recomendamos que visites la playa Strand Hohenfelde. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n del norte de Alemania Schleswig-Holstein, cerca del pueblo Hohenfelde. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. Cerca de la playa solo se pueden estacionar los autos, las autocaravanas se pueden estacionar un poco al fondo. La playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 15 m de ancho. La superficie de la playa es una mezcla de guijarros grandes y peque&ntilde;os, adem&aacute;s de arena. La entrada de agua es agradable y el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; a unos 20 m. Tienes algunos servicios b&aacute;sicos de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;. Un restaurante y una cafeter&iacute;a se encuentran directamente en la playa. No muy lejos hay un camping y algunos apartamentos para su alojamiento. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 3870, 'es', 1),
(1964, 'Si vous recherchez une plage allemande, qui a &agrave; sa surface un m&eacute;lange de sable et de galets et dont le parking n&#39;est qu&#39;&agrave; 10 m, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage Strand Hohenfelde. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion nord-allemande du Schleswig-Holstein, pr&egrave;s du village de Hohenfelde. Cet endroit est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, seules les voitures peuvent se garer, les camping-cars peuvent se garer un peu en retrait. La plage mesure plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 15 m de large. La surface de la plage est un m&eacute;lange de petits et gros galets ainsi que de sable. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 20 m. Vous avez quelques services de plage de base disponibles ici. Un restaurant et un caf&eacute;-bar sont situ&eacute;s directement sur la plage. Non loin de l&agrave; se trouve un terrain de camping et quelques appartements pour votre h&eacute;bergement. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 3870, 'fr', 1),
(1965, 'Wenn Sie einen deutschen Strand suchen, der an seiner Oberfl&auml;che eine Mischung aus Sand und Kieselsteinen hat und der Parkplatz nur 10 m entfernt ist, empfehlen wir Ihnen den Strand Hohenfelde zu besuchen. Es liegt in der norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Hohenfelde. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr gut zu erreichen. In Strandn&auml;he k&ouml;nnen nur Autos parken, Wohnmobile k&ouml;nnen etwas im Hintergrund parken. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und bis zu 15 m breit. Die Strandoberfl&auml;che ist eine Mischung aus kleinen und gro&szlig;en Kieselsteinen sowie Sand. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei ca. 20 m. Hier stehen Ihnen einige grundlegende Strandservices zur Verf&uuml;gung. Direkt am Strand befinden sich ein Restaurant und eine Caf&eacute;-Bar. Nicht weit entfernt befindet sich ein Campingplatz und einige Appartements f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 3870, 'de', 1),
(1966, 'Vicino alla citt&agrave; olandese Julianadorp c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa molto bella, chiamata Strand Zandloper, che &egrave; consigliata alle famiglie. Si trova nella regione Noord-Holland e si affaccia sul Mare del Nord. Se vuoi visitarlo, &egrave; molto facile arrivarci con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, che puoi lasciare in un parcheggio molto ampio a circa 500 metri dalla spiaggia. Il sentiero per la spiaggia &egrave; facile, basta attraversare una duna alta 15 m. La spiaggia &egrave; molto ampia, &egrave; lunga diversi km e larga almeno 50 m, e con la bassa marea diventa ancora pi&ugrave; ampia. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; lontano, a causa dell&#39;acqua bassa. Hai alcune infrastrutture di base sulla spiaggia qui, un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante si trovano anche qui. Nessun alloggio &egrave; disponibile direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma nelle vicinanze, per lo pi&ugrave; sotto forma di campeggio, resort, hotel e appartamenti. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 4055, 'it', 1),
(1967, 'Pr&egrave;s de la ville n&eacute;erlandaise de Julianadorp, vous avez une tr&egrave;s belle plage de sable, appel&eacute;e Strand Zandloper, qui est recommand&eacute;e pour les familles. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Noord-Holland et fait face &agrave; la mer du Nord. Si vous souhaitez le visiter, il est tr&egrave;s facile de s&#39;y rendre avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule, que vous pouvez laisser sur un tr&egrave;s grand parking &agrave; 500 m de la plage. Le chemin vers la plage est facile, il suffit de traverser une dune de 15 m de haut. La plage a beaucoup de superficie, elle fait plusieurs km de long et au moins 50 m de large, et &agrave; mar&eacute;e basse elle s&#39;&eacute;largit encore. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &eacute;loign&eacute;, &agrave; cause de l&#39;eau peu profonde. Vous disposez d&#39;une infrastructure de plage de base ici, un bar de plage et un restaurant se trouvent &eacute;galement ici. Aucun h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est disponible directement sur la plage, mais &agrave; proximit&eacute;, principalement sous la forme d&#39;un camp, de stations baln&eacute;aires, d&#39;h&ocirc;tels et d&#39;appartements. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 4055, 'fr', 1),
(1968, 'Cerca de la ciudad holandesa de Julianadorp tienes una playa de arena muy bonita, llamada Strand Zandloper, que se recomienda para familias. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Holanda Septentrional y se enfrenta al Mar del Norte. Si quieres visitarlo, es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, que puedes dejar en un aparcamiento muy amplio a unos 500 metros de la playa. El camino a la playa es f&aacute;cil, solo hay que cruzar una duna de 15 m de altura. La playa tiene mucha extensi&oacute;n, tiene varios km de largo y un m&iacute;nimo de 50 m de ancho, y con la marea baja se ensancha a&uacute;n m&aacute;s. La entrada de agua es agradable y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; lejos, debido a la poca profundidad del agua. Aqu&iacute; tiene una infraestructura de playa b&aacute;sica, un bar en la playa y un restaurante tambi&eacute;n se encuentran aqu&iacute;. No hay alojamiento disponible directamente en la playa, sino en los alrededores, principalmente en forma de campamentos, complejos tur&iacute;sticos, hoteles y apartamentos. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 4055, 'es', 1),
(1969, 'In der N&auml;he der niederl&auml;ndischen Stadt Julianadorp gibt es einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand namens Strand Zandloper, der f&uuml;r Familien zu empfehlen ist. Es liegt in der Region Noord-Holland und blickt auf die Nordsee. Wenn Sie es besuchen m&ouml;chten, ist es sehr einfach, mit jedem Fahrzeug dorthin zu gelangen, das Sie auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz etwa 500 m vom Strand entfernt abstellen k&ouml;nnen. Der Weg zum Strand ist einfach, man muss nur eine 15 m hohe D&uuml;ne &uuml;berqueren. Der Strand hat eine gro&szlig;e Fl&auml;che, er ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mindestens 50 m breit, und bei Ebbe wird er noch breiter. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und die Badestelle ist wegen des seichten Wassers weit weg. Sie haben hier eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur, eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant befinden sich ebenfalls hier. Es gibt keine Unterk&uuml;nfte direkt am Strand, sondern in der N&auml;he, meist in Form von Camps, Resorts, Hotels und Apartments. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 4055, 'de', 1),
(1970, 'En Holanda tienes todo tipo de playas. Puede optar por tener una experiencia de playa en una playa de arena junto al lago o puede optar por probar una playa de arena en el Mar del Norte. La mayor&iacute;a de las playas de arena m&aacute;s largas y anchas del Mar del Norte se encuentran en la regi&oacute;n holandesa de Holanda Septentrional. El que aqu&iacute; presentamos se llama Strand Groote Keeten y est&aacute; ubicado cerca de la ciudad de Callantsoog. Es una playa de tipo familiar, de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. La plaza de aparcamiento es muy grande y est&aacute; a unos 400 metros de la playa. Cerca de la plaza de aparcamiento tambi&eacute;n tienes un parque infantil y un peque&ntilde;o campo deportivo, en la propia playa no hay ninguno. Cuando vas por el camino a la playa tambi&eacute;n tienes un restaurante, un chiringuito tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible en verano en la misma playa. El acceso a la playa es sencillo. La playa tiene varios km de largo y 75 m de ancho. Cerca del agua, la playa es bastante plana y tambi&eacute;n lo es el agua poco profunda, lo que hace que el agua entre muy agradable pero aleja el punto de nadar. En la playa tienes muchos servicios, servicio de socorrista incluido. Alrededor de la plaza de aparcamiento tambi&eacute;n tiene la opci&oacute;n de alojamiento, en forma de apartamentos. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 4058, 'es', 1),
(1971, 'Aux Pays-Bas, vous avez toutes sortes de plages. Vous pouvez choisir de vivre une exp&eacute;rience de plage sur une plage de sable au bord du lac ou vous pouvez choisir d&#39;essayer une plage de sable au bord de la mer du Nord. La plupart des plages de sable les plus longues et les plus larges de la mer du Nord se trouvent dans la r&eacute;gion n&eacute;erlandaise de Noord-Holland. Celui que nous pr&eacute;sentons ici s&#39;appelle Strand Groote Keeten et il est situ&eacute; pr&egrave;s de la ville de Callantsoog. C&#39;est une plage de type familial, tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. Le parking est tr&egrave;s grand et se trouve &agrave; environ 400 m de la plage. Pr&egrave;s du parking, vous avez &eacute;galement une aire de jeux pour enfants et un petit terrain de sport, sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me il n&#39;y en a pas. Lorsque vous descendez le chemin de la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement un restaurant, un bar de plage est &eacute;galement disponible en &eacute;t&eacute; sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est facile. La plage fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et 75 m de large. Pr&egrave;s de l&#39;eau, la plage est assez plate, tout comme l&#39;eau peu profonde, ce qui rend l&#39;eau tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able &agrave; l&#39;entr&eacute;e mais met le point de nager loin. Sur la plage vous avez de nombreux services, un service de sauveteur inclus. Autour du parking, vous avez &eacute;galement la possibilit&eacute; de vous loger, sous forme d&#39;appartements. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 4058, 'fr', 1),
(1972, 'Nei Paesi Bassi ci sono tutti i tipi di spiagge. Puoi scegliere di vivere un&#39;esperienza in spiaggia su una spiaggia sabbiosa in riva al lago o puoi scegliere di provare una spiaggia sabbiosa in riva al Mare del Nord. La maggior parte delle spiagge sabbiose pi&ugrave; lunghe e larghe del Mare del Nord si trovano nella regione olandese dell&#39;Olanda Settentrionale. Quello che presentiamo qui si chiama Strand Groote Keeten e si trova vicino alla citt&agrave; di Callantsoog. &Egrave; una spiaggia di tipo familiare, molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Il parcheggio &egrave; molto grande e dista circa 400 mt dalla spiaggia. Vicino al parcheggio hai anche un parco giochi per bambini e un piccolo campo sportivo, sulla spiaggia stessa non ce ne sono. Quando scendi lungo il sentiero per la spiaggia hai anche un ristorante, un bar sulla spiaggia &egrave; disponibile anche in estate sulla spiaggia stessa. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; facile. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi km e larga 75 m. Vicino all&#39;acqua la spiaggia &egrave; abbastanza piatta, cos&igrave; come l&#39;acqua bassa, che fa entrare l&#39;acqua molto bene ma allontana il punto di nuotare. In spiaggia sono disponibili tanti servizi, compreso il servizio bagnino. Intorno al parcheggio si ha anche la possibilit&agrave; di alloggio, sotto forma di appartamenti. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 4058, 'it', 1),
(1973, 'In den Niederlanden gibt es alle Arten von Str&auml;nden. Sie haben die Wahl zwischen einem Stranderlebnis an einem Sandstrand am See oder einem Sandstrand an der Nordsee. Am weitesten verbreitet sind die l&auml;ngsten und breitesten Sandstr&auml;nde an der Nordsee in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Noord-Holland. Der hier vorgestellte Strand hei&szlig;t Strand Groote Keeten und befindet sich in der N&auml;he der Stadt Callantsoog. Es ist ein Familienstrand, der mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen ist. Der Parkplatz ist sehr gro&szlig; und ca. 400m vom Strand entfernt. In der N&auml;he des Parkplatzes gibt es auch einen Kinderspielplatz und einen kleinen Sportplatz, am Strand selbst gibt es keine. Wenn Sie den Weg zum Strand hinuntergehen, haben Sie auch ein Restaurant, eine Strandbar ist im Sommer auch am Strand selbst verf&uuml;gbar. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und 75 m breit. In der N&auml;he des Wassers ist der Strand ziemlich flach, ebenso das seichte Wasser, wodurch das Wasser sehr sch&ouml;n eintaucht, aber der Schwimmpunkt weit weg liegt. Am Strand haben Sie viele Dienstleistungen, einen Rettungsschwimmer-Service inklusive. Rund um den Parkplatz haben Sie auch die M&ouml;glichkeit der Unterbringung in Form von Appartements. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 4058, 'de', 1),
(1974, 'Alcune spiagge in Olanda sono per le famiglie che hanno bisogno di molti servizi in spiaggia, e alcune sono per quelle che si accontentano del minimo indispensabile. Tale spiaggia &egrave; Strand Voordijk nella regione Noord-Holland, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Callantsoog. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si dispone di un parcheggio a circa 300 metri dalla spiaggia. Per accedere alla spiaggia &egrave; necessario attraversare una duna alta 10 m, ma non preoccupatevi il sentiero &egrave; in cemento ed &egrave; in buone condizioni. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di sabbia e ne hai davvero tanta, perch&eacute; la lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di diversi km e ha una larghezza minima di 75 m, con la bassa marea se ne pu&ograve; arrivare anche di pi&ugrave;. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 75 m. Come ho detto prima, qui non si trova nessuna infrastruttura da spiaggia e nemmeno un ristorante. Un piccolo chiosco fast food si trova vicino al parcheggio. Possibilit&agrave; di alloggio anche nei dintorni. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno, come gi&agrave; fanno da anni milioni di appassionati di spiaggia.', 4059, 'it', 1),
(1975, 'Certaines plages aux Pays-Bas sont destin&eacute;es aux familles qui ont besoin de beaucoup de services de plage, et d&#39;autres &agrave; celles qui se satisfont du strict minimum. Une telle plage est Strand Voordijk dans la r&eacute;gion Noord-Holland, &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville de Callantsoog. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;y acc&eacute;der avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez d&#39;un parking &agrave; environ 300 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage, il faut traverser une dune de 10 m de haut, mais ne vous inqui&eacute;tez pas le chemin est b&eacute;tonn&eacute; et en bon &eacute;tat. La surface principale de la plage est du sable et vous en avez vraiment beaucoup, car la longueur totale de la plage est de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et elle a une largeur minimale de 75 m, &agrave; mar&eacute;e basse elle peut aller encore plus loin. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; 75 m. Comme je l&#39;ai d&eacute;j&agrave; dit, aucune infrastructure de plage n&#39;est situ&eacute;e ici, pas plus qu&#39;un restaurant. Un petit kiosque de restauration rapide est situ&eacute; pr&egrave;s du parking. Des logements sont &eacute;galement disponibles dans les environs. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves, comme le font d&eacute;j&agrave; des millions d&#39;amateurs de plage depuis des ann&eacute;es.', 4059, 'fr', 1),
(1976, 'Algunas playas de los Pa&iacute;ses Bajos son para familias que necesitan muchos servicios de playa, y otras son para aquellas que est&aacute;n satisfechas con lo m&iacute;nimo. Una de estas playas es Strand Voordijk en la regi&oacute;n de Holanda Septentrional, cerca de la ciudad de Callantsoog. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tienes una plaza de aparcamiento a unos 300 m de la playa. Para acceder a la playa hay que cruzar una duna de 10 m de altura, pero no te preocupes, el camino es de cemento y est&aacute; en buenas condiciones. La superficie principal de la playa es arena y realmente tienes mucha, porque la longitud total de la playa es de varios km y tiene un ancho m&iacute;nimo de 75 m, con marea baja se puede llegar a incluso m&aacute;s. La entrada de agua es muy bonita y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a 75 m. Como dije antes, aqu&iacute; no hay infraestructura de playa, ni restaurante. Un peque&ntilde;o quiosco de comida r&aacute;pida se encuentra junto al estacionamiento. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible en los alrededores. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os, como ya lo est&aacute;n haciendo millones de amantes de la playa durante a&ntilde;os.', 4059, 'es', 1),
(1977, 'Einige Str&auml;nde in den Niederlanden sind f&uuml;r Familien gedacht, die viel Strandservice ben&ouml;tigen, und andere sind f&uuml;r diejenigen, die mit dem N&ouml;tigsten zufrieden sind. Ein solcher Strand ist Strand Voordijk in der Region Noord-Holland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Callantsoog. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen Parkplatz etwa 300 m vom Strand entfernt. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, m&uuml;ssen Sie eine 10 m hohe D&uuml;ne &uuml;berqueren, aber keine Sorge, der Weg ist betoniert und in gutem Zustand. Die Hauptfl&auml;che am Strand ist Sand und davon gibt es wirklich viel, denn die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere km und er hat eine Mindestbreite von 75 m, bei Ebbe kann es sogar noch mehr werden. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und die Badestelle liegt auf 75 m. Wie gesagt, hier befindet sich keine Strandinfrastruktur und auch kein Restaurant. Am Parkplatz befindet sich ein kleiner Fastfood-Kiosk. &Uuml;bernachtungsm&ouml;glichkeiten gibt es auch in der Umgebung. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden, wie es bereits Millionen von Strandbegeisterten seit Jahren tun.', 4059, 'de', 1),
(1978, 'La ciudad holandesa de Callantsoog es uno de los destinos tur&iacute;sticos m&aacute;s populares de la regi&oacute;n Noord-Holland, no solo para los holandeses, sino tambi&eacute;n para los turistas extranjeros, principalmente los alemanes. La ciudad en s&iacute; tiene en su n&uacute;cleo muchos tipos diferentes de todo tipo de tiendas, diferentes restaurantes y, por supuesto, diferentes tipos de alojamiento para ofrecer y, por supuesto, tambi&eacute;n tienen una playa de arena muy hermosa, que se conoce con el nombre de Strand Kiefteglop, con muchos infraestructura y servicios de playa. Es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y dispone de una plaza de aparcamiento muy amplia a unos 500 metros de la playa. Como es habitual en este tipo de playas en esta regi&oacute;n, es necesario atravesar una duna de 10 m de altura por un camino de hormig&oacute;n. Si tiene una bicicleta, no necesita caminar hasta la playa, hay un lugar de estacionamiento para bicicletas junto a la entrada de la playa. Esta belleza arenosa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y un m&iacute;nimo de 100 m de ancho, con marea baja a&uacute;n m&aacute;s. La entrada al agua es agradable y debido a la poca profundidad del agua, el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; muy lejos. No solo tiene aqu&iacute; toda la infraestructura de playa esencial, tambi&eacute;n tiene diferentes tipos de restaurantes en la playa, algunos est&aacute;n ubicados cerca de la entrada de la playa, otros un poco m&aacute;s lejos. Alrededor del estacionamiento hay muchos tipos de apartamentos y hoteles disponibles y en los alrededores tambi&eacute;n hay muchos campamentos. Y recuerda, si est&aacute;s buscando la playa perfecta para ti, utiliza siempre BeachRex y utiliza nuestro potente motor de b&uacute;squeda, que te proporcionar&aacute; los resultados &oacute;ptimos en cuesti&oacute;n de segundos. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 4061, 'es', 1),
(1979, 'La ville n&eacute;erlandaise de Callantsoog est l&#39;une des destinations touristiques les plus populaires de la r&eacute;gion Noord-Holland, non seulement pour les N&eacute;erlandais, mais aussi pour les touristes &eacute;trangers, principalement les Allemands. La ville elle-m&ecirc;me a en son c&oelig;ur de nombreux types de magasins de toutes sortes, diff&eacute;rents restaurants et bien s&ucirc;r diff&eacute;rents types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement &agrave; offrir et bien s&ucirc;r, ils ont aussi une tr&egrave;s belle plage de sable, qui s&#39;appelle Strand Kiefteglop, avec beaucoup de infrastructures et services de plage. Il est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez d&#39;un tr&egrave;s grand parking &agrave; 500m de la plage. Comme il est d&#39;usage pour ce type de plages dans cette r&eacute;gion, il faut traverser une dune de 10 m de haut par un chemin b&eacute;tonn&eacute;. Si vous avez un v&eacute;lo, vous n&#39;avez pas besoin de marcher jusqu&#39;&agrave; la plage, il y a un parking pour les v&eacute;los &agrave; l&#39;entr&eacute;e de la plage. Cette beaut&eacute; sablonneuse fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et a un minimum de 100 m de largeur, &agrave; mar&eacute;e basse encore plus. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et &agrave; cause de l&#39;eau peu profonde, le point de baignade est loin. Non seulement vous avez ici toutes les infrastructures essentielles de la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement diff&eacute;rents types de restaurants sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, certains sont situ&eacute;s pr&egrave;s de l&#39;entr&eacute;e de la plage, d&#39;autres un peu plus loin. Autour du parking de nombreux types d&#39;appartements et d&#39;h&ocirc;tels sont disponibles et dans les environs il y a aussi de nombreux camps. Et rappelez-vous, si vous recherchez la plage parfaite pour vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex et utilisez notre puissant moteur de recherche, qui vous fournira les r&eacute;sultats optimaux en quelques secondes. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 4061, 'fr', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(1980, 'La citt&agrave; olandese Callantsoog &egrave; una delle destinazioni turistiche pi&ugrave; popolari della regione Noord-Holland, non solo per gli olandesi, ma anche per i turisti stranieri, principalmente tedeschi. La citt&agrave; stessa ha nel suo centro molti diversi tipi di negozi di ogni genere, diversi ristoranti e ovviamente diversi tipi di alloggi da offrire e ovviamente hanno anche una bellissima spiaggia sabbiosa, che si chiama Strand Kiefteglop, con un sacco di infrastrutture e servizi balneari. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e dispone di un parcheggio molto ampio a circa 500 metri dalla spiaggia. Come &egrave; consuetudine per questo tipo di spiagge in questa regione, &egrave; necessario attraversare una duna alta 10 m attraverso un sentiero in cemento. Se hai una bici non devi andare in spiaggia a piedi, c&#39;&egrave; un parcheggio per le bici all&#39;ingresso della spiaggia. Questa bellezza sabbiosa &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e ha una larghezza minima di 100 m, con la bassa marea anche di pi&ugrave;. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e, a causa dell&#39;acqua bassa, il punto di nuoto &egrave; lontano. Non solo hai qui tutte le infrastrutture essenziali per la spiaggia, ma hai anche diversi tipi di ristoranti sulla spiaggia stessa, alcuni si trovano vicino all&#39;ingresso della spiaggia, altri un po&#39; pi&ugrave; lontano. Intorno al parcheggio sono disponibili molti tipi di appartamenti e hotel e nelle vicinanze ci sono anche molti campeggi. E ricorda, se stai cercando la spiaggia perfetta per te, usa sempre BeachRex e usa il nostro potente motore di ricerca, che ti fornir&agrave; i risultati ottimali in pochi secondi. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4061, 'it', 1),
(1981, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Die niederl&auml;ndische Stadt Callantsoog ist eines der beliebtesten Reiseziele in der Region Nord-Holland, nicht nur f&uuml;r die Niederl&auml;nder, sondern auch f&uuml;r ausl&auml;ndische Touristen, haupts&auml;chlich die Deutschen. Die Stadt selbst hat in ihrem Kern viele verschiedene Arten von Gesch&auml;ften aller Art, verschiedene Restaurants und nat&uuml;rlich verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften zu bieten und nat&uuml;rlich hat sie auch einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand, der auf den Namen Strand Kiefteglop h&ouml;rt, mit vielen Strandinfrastruktur und Dienstleistungen. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, etwa 500 m vom Strand entfernt. Wie es f&uuml;r diese Art von Str&auml;nden in dieser Region &uuml;blich ist, muss man &uuml;ber einen Beton weg eine 10 m hohe D&uuml;ne &uuml;berqueren. Wenn Sie ein Fahrrad haben, m&uuml;ssen Sie nicht zum Strand laufen, es gibt einen Parkplatz f&uuml;r Fahrr&auml;der am Strandeingang. Diese sandige Sch&ouml;nheit ist mehrere Kilometer lang und hat mindestens 100 m Breite, bei Ebbe sogar noch mehr. Der Wassereinstieg ist sch&ouml;n und wegen des seichten Wassers ist der Badepunkt weit weg. Du hast hier nicht nur die notwendige Strandinfrastruktur, sondern auch verschiedene Arten von Restaurants am Strand selbst, einige befinden sich in der N&auml;he des Strandeingangs, andere etwas weiter entfernt. Rund um den Parkplatz gibt es viele Arten von Appartements und Hotels und in der N&auml;he gibt es auch viele Campingpl&auml;tze. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r sich suchen, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex und nutzen Sie unsere leistungsstarke Suchmaschine, die Ihnen in Sekundenschnelle die optimalen Ergebnisse liefert. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.</div>\n', 4061, 'de', 1),
(1982, 'Strand Wijk aan Zee &egrave; una spiaggia olandese situata nella regione dell&#39;Olanda Settentrionale, sulla costa occidentale, di fronte al Mare del Nord. &Egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie con una superficie sabbiosa e una spiaggia molto ampia. Se vuoi visitarlo, &egrave; molto facile arrivarci con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, hai un parcheggio molto grande a soli 100 metri dalla spiaggia. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia avviene tramite un sentiero in cemento, adatto anche a portatori di handicap. &Egrave; una spiaggia lunga diversi km con una larghezza di almeno 100 m. La spiaggia ha in diversi punti diverse inclinazioni e dove inizia l&#39;acqua diventa piuttosto piatta. Insieme ad un fondale abbastanza basso, U ha una bella entrata d&#39;acqua e il punto di nuoto &egrave; a circa 75 m. Qui sono disponibili molti servizi di spiaggia, cos&igrave; come molti tipi di ristoranti, per lo pi&ugrave; situati direttamente sulla spiaggia. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile anche in molte tipologie e forme nelle vicinanze della spiaggia, il pi&ugrave; vicino &egrave; un hotel ma nelle vicinanze c&#39;&egrave; anche un campeggio. E ricorda, se stai cercando la spiaggia perfetta per te, usa sempre BeachRex e usa il nostro potente motore di ricerca, che ti fornir&agrave; i risultati ottimali in pochi secondi. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4066, 'it', 1),
(1983, 'Strand Wijk aan Zee est une plage hollandaise situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion Noord-Holland sur la c&ocirc;te ouest, face &agrave; la mer du Nord. C&#39;est une plage familiale avec une surface sablonneuse et une tr&egrave;s grande plage. Si vous souhaitez le visiter, il est tr&egrave;s facile de s&#39;y rendre avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule, vous disposez d&#39;un tr&egrave;s grand parking &agrave; seulement 100m de la plage. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage se fait par un chemin b&eacute;tonn&eacute;, &eacute;galement adapt&eacute; aux personnes &agrave; mobilit&eacute; r&eacute;duite. C&#39;est une plage de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long avec une largeur d&#39;au moins 100m. La plage a &agrave; diff&eacute;rents endroits une inclinaison diff&eacute;rente et l&agrave; o&ugrave; l&#39;eau commence, elle devient assez plate. Avec une eau assez peu profonde, vous avez une belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et le point de nage est &agrave; environ 75 m. De nombreux services de plage sont disponibles ici, ainsi que de nombreux types de restaurants, pour la plupart directement situ&eacute;s sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement disponible sous de nombreux types et formes &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la plage, le plus proche est un h&ocirc;tel mais un camp est &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Et rappelez-vous, si vous recherchez la plage parfaite pour vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex et utilisez notre puissant moteur de recherche, qui vous fournira les r&eacute;sultats optimaux en quelques secondes. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 4066, 'fr', 1),
(1984, 'Strand Wijk aan Zee es una playa holandesa ubicada en la regi&oacute;n de Noord-Holland en la costa oeste, frente al Mar del Norte. Es una playa familiar con una superficie arenosa y una zona de playa muy amplia. Si quieres visitarlo, es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tienes una plaza de aparcamiento muy amplia a tan solo 100m de la playa. El acceso a la playa se realiza por un camino de hormig&oacute;n, tambi&eacute;n apto para minusv&aacute;lidos. Es una playa de varios kil&oacute;metros de largo con un ancho de al menos 100 m. La playa tiene en diferentes puntos diferentes inclinaciones y donde el agua comienza se vuelve bastante plana. Junto con un agua bastante poco profunda, U tiene una entrada de agua agradable y el punto de nado est&aacute; a aproximadamente 75 m. Muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, as&iacute; como muchos tipos de restaurantes, la mayor&iacute;a de ellos ubicados directamente en la playa. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible en muchos tipos y formas en las cercan&iacute;as de la playa, el m&aacute;s cercano es un hotel, pero tambi&eacute;n hay un campamento cerca. Y recuerda, si est&aacute;s buscando la playa perfecta para ti, utiliza siempre BeachRex y utiliza nuestro potente motor de b&uacute;squeda, que te proporcionar&aacute; los resultados &oacute;ptimos en cuesti&oacute;n de segundos. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 4066, 'es', 1),
(1985, 'Strand Wijk aan Zee ist ein niederl&auml;ndischer Strand in der Region Nord-Holland an der Westk&uuml;ste mit Blick auf die Nordsee. Es ist ein Familienstrand mit sandiger Oberfl&auml;che und einem sehr gro&szlig;en Strandbereich. Wenn Sie es besuchen m&ouml;chten, ist es mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr einfach, hierher zu gelangen, Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Zugang zum Strand erfolgt &uuml;ber einen Beton weg, der auch f&uuml;r Behinderte geeignet ist. Es ist ein mehrere Kilometer langer Strand mit einer Breite von mindestens 100m. Der Strand hat an verschiedenen Stellen unterschiedliche Neigungen und wo das Wasser beginnt wird es recht flach. Zusammen mit einem recht seichten Wasser hat U einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereinstieg und der Badepunkt liegt bei ca. 75 m. Hier gibt es viele Strandservices sowie viele Arten von Restaurants, die meisten davon direkt am Strand. In der N&auml;he des Strandes gibt es auch Unterk&uuml;nfte in vielen Arten und Formen, die n&auml;chste ist ein Hotel, aber auch ein Campingplatz ist in der N&auml;he. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r sich suchen, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex und nutzen Sie unsere leistungsstarke Suchmaschine, die Ihnen in Sekundenschnelle die optimalen Ergebnisse liefert. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4066, 'de', 1),
(1986, '&iquest;Alguna vez has estado en una playa de arena donde podr&iacute;as tener una pista de carreras justo al lado de tu playa, donde los autos de carreras de todo tipo, tambi&eacute;n el famoso F1, y las motos deportivas est&aacute;n en la b&uacute;squeda del mejor tiempo, o qui&eacute;n cruza el primera l&iacute;nea de meta? Supongo que probablemente no, pero en los Pa&iacute;ses Bajos, en la ciudad de Zandvoort, incluso puedes tener esta experiencia. El nombre de la playa es Strand Zandvoort aan Zee Noord. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n holandesa de Noord-Holland. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y dispone de un amplio aparcamiento que se extiende a lo largo de todo el tramo de la playa. Las autocaravanas tambi&eacute;n pueden estacionarse aqu&iacute; en un lugar designado especial. El camino a la playa es bastante f&aacute;cil, o subes las escaleras o bajas por un camino de cemento. Al principio la playa es bastante empinada, pero se aplana hacia el agua. Tiene varios km de largo y m&aacute;s de 100 m de ancho. Debido al agua poco profunda, la entrada al agua es bastante agradable, pero el punto de nataci&oacute;n est&aacute; muy lejos. Este lugar es muy tur&iacute;stico, lo que significa que tiene muchos servicios de playa disponibles en la playa y en los alrededores. Los restaurantes tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles en muchos tipos y formas, lo que tambi&eacute;n es cierto para el alojamiento, donde puede elegir seg&uacute;n sus necesidades. Y recuerda, si est&aacute;s buscando la playa perfecta para ti, utiliza siempre BeachRex y utiliza nuestro potente motor de b&uacute;squeda, que te proporcionar&aacute; los resultados &oacute;ptimos en cuesti&oacute;n de segundos. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 4070, 'es', 1),
(1987, 'Sei mai stato in una spiaggia sabbiosa dove potresti effettivamente avere una pista da corsa proprio accanto alla tua spiaggia, dove auto da corsa di ogni tipo, anche la famosa F1, e moto sportive sono alla ricerca del tempo pi&ugrave; veloce, o chi attraversa il traguardo per primo? Immagino di no, ma nei Paesi Bassi, nella citt&agrave; di Zandvoort, puoi persino fare questa esperienza. Il nome della spiaggia &egrave; Strand Zandvoort aan Zee Noord. Si trova nella regione olandese Noord-Holland. Questa localit&agrave; &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si dispone di un ampio parcheggio che si estende lungo tutto il tratto di spiaggia. I camper possono anche parcheggiare qui in un luogo designato speciale. Il percorso per la spiaggia &egrave; abbastanza facile, o si prendono le scale o si scende per una strada cementata. All&#39;inizio la spiaggia &egrave; abbastanza ripida, ma si appiattisce verso l&#39;acqua. &Egrave; lungo diversi chilometri e largo pi&ugrave; di 100 metri. A causa dell&#39;acqua bassa, l&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piuttosto piacevole, ma il punto di nuoto &egrave; lontano. Questo posto &egrave; molto turistico, il che significa che hai molti servizi di spiaggia disponibili sulla spiaggia e nei dintorni. Anche i ristoranti sono disponibili in molte tipologie e forme, il che vale anche per l&#39;alloggio, dove puoi scegliere in base alle tue esigenze. E ricorda, se stai cercando la spiaggia perfetta per te, usa sempre BeachRex e usa il nostro potente motore di ricerca, che ti fornir&agrave; i risultati ottimali in pochi secondi. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4070, 'it', 1),
(1988, '&Ecirc;tes-vous d&eacute;j&agrave; all&eacute; sur une plage de sable o&ugrave; vous pourriez r&eacute;ellement avoir une piste de course juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de votre plage, o&ugrave; les voitures de course de toutes sortes, &eacute;galement les c&eacute;l&egrave;bres F1, et les motos de sport sont &agrave; la recherche du meilleur temps, ou qui traverse le ligne d&#39;arriv&eacute;e en premier ? Je suppose que probablement pas, mais aux Pays-Bas, dans la ville de Zandvoort, vous pouvez m&ecirc;me vivre cette exp&eacute;rience. Le nom de la plage est Strand Zandvoort aan Zee Noord. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion n&eacute;erlandaise Noord-Holland. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez d&#39;un grand parking qui s&#39;&eacute;tend sur toute la plage. Les camping-cars peuvent &eacute;galement se garer ici sur un endroit sp&eacute;cialement d&eacute;sign&eacute;. Le chemin vers la plage est assez facile, soit vous prenez les escaliers, soit vous descendez une route b&eacute;tonn&eacute;e. Au d&eacute;but, la plage est assez raide, mais elle s&#39;aplatit vers l&#39;eau. Il fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et plus de 100 m&egrave;tres de large. En raison de l&#39;eau peu profonde, l&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est assez agr&eacute;able, mais le point de baignade est loin. Cet endroit est tr&egrave;s touristique, ce qui signifie que vous avez de nombreux services de plage disponibles sur la plage et dans les environs. Les restaurants sont &eacute;galement disponibles sous de nombreux types et formes, ce qui est &eacute;galement vrai pour l&#39;h&eacute;bergement, o&ugrave; vous pouvez choisir en fonction de vos besoins. Et rappelez-vous, si vous recherchez la plage parfaite pour vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex et utilisez notre puissant moteur de recherche, qui vous fournira les r&eacute;sultats optimaux en quelques secondes. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 4070, 'fr', 1),
(1989, 'Warst du schon einmal an einem Sandstrand, an dem du eigentlich eine Rennstrecke direkt neben deinem Strand haben k&ouml;nntest, wo Rennwagen aller Art, auch die ber&uuml;hmte F1 und Sportmotorr&auml;der auf der Suche nach der schnellsten Zeit sind, oder wer den &uuml;berquert? Ziellinie zuerst? Wahrscheinlich nicht, aber in den Niederlanden, in der Stadt Zandvoort, kann man diese Erfahrung sogar machen. Der Strand hei&szlig;t Strand Zandvoort aan Zee Noord. Es liegt in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Noord-Holland. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr gut zu erreichen und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, der sich entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts erstreckt. Auch Wohnmobile k&ouml;nnen hier auf einem speziell gekennzeichneten Platz parken. Der Weg zum Strand ist recht einfach, entweder du nimmst die Treppe oder du gehst eine Betonstra&szlig;e hinunter. Der Strand ist anfangs recht steil, wird aber zum Wasser hin flach. Er ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 Meter breit. Wegen des seichten Wassers ist der Wassereinstieg recht sch&ouml;n, aber die Badestelle ist weit weg. Dieser Ort ist sehr touristisch, was bedeutet, dass Sie am Strand und in der Umgebung viele Strandservices zur Verf&uuml;gung haben. Auch Restaurants gibt es in vielen Arten und Formen, das gilt auch f&uuml;r die Unterk&uuml;nfte, in denen Sie nach Ihren Bed&uuml;rfnissen w&auml;hlen k&ouml;nnen. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r sich suchen, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex und nutzen Sie unsere leistungsstarke Suchmaschine, die Ihnen in Sekundenschnelle die optimalen Ergebnisse liefert. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4070, 'de', 1),
(1990, 'La ville n&eacute;erlandaise de Zandvoort n&#39;est pas seulement c&eacute;l&egrave;bre pour sa piste de course, mais aussi pour la plage de sable de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long qu&#39;elle a &agrave; offrir &agrave; ses visiteurs. Tout au long de la plage, vous disposez de nombreux points d&#39;entr&eacute;e pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Noord-Holland. Cet endroit particulier porte le nom de Strand Zandvoort aan Zee Centrum. Vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cet emplacement avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et de nombreuses options de stationnement sont disponibles, que ce soit par la rue ou sur un grand parking &agrave; quelques centaines de m&egrave;tres. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s facile et vous avez un chemin en b&eacute;ton qui m&egrave;ne &agrave; la plage. La plage est longue de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et large de plus de 100 m&egrave;tres. Lorsque vous acc&eacute;dez &agrave; la plage, vous avez une inclinaison tout &agrave; fait normale qui s&#39;aplatit vers la mer. Ce fait et l&#39;eau peu profonde rendent l&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able, mais le point de nage est loin. De nombreux services de plage sont disponibles ici ainsi que de nombreuses options de restaurants, ce qui est &eacute;galement vrai pour tous les diff&eacute;rents types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement dont vous disposez dans les environs. Et rappelez-vous, si vous recherchez la plage parfaite pour vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex et utilisez notre puissant moteur de recherche, qui vous fournira les r&eacute;sultats optimaux en quelques secondes. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 4071, 'fr', 1),
(1991, 'La citt&agrave; olandese Zandvoort non &egrave; famosa solo per il suo circuito automobilistico, ma anche per i diversi chilometri di spiaggia sabbiosa che ha da offrire ai suoi visitatori. Lungo tutto il tratto di spiaggia sono presenti numerosi punti di ingresso per accedere alla spiaggia. Si trova nella regione Noord-Holland. In questo punto particolare ha il nome Strand Zandvoort aan Zee Centrum. &Egrave; possibile accedere a questa location con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e sono disponibili numerose possibilit&agrave; di parcheggio, sia su strada che in un ampio parcheggio a poche centinaia di metri. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto facile e si dispone di un sentiero in cemento che conduce alla spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi km ed &egrave; larga pi&ugrave; di 100 m. Quando si accede alla spiaggia si ha un&#39;inclinazione abbastanza normale che si appiattisce verso il mare. Questo fatto e l&#39;acqua bassa rendono molto piacevole l&#39;ingresso in acqua, ma il punto di nuoto &egrave; lontano. Qui sono disponibili molti servizi di spiaggia e molte diverse opzioni di ristoranti, il che vale anche per tutti i diversi tipi di alloggio che hai a disposizione nelle vicinanze. E ricorda, se stai cercando la spiaggia perfetta per te, usa sempre BeachRex e usa il nostro potente motore di ricerca, che ti fornir&agrave; i risultati ottimali in pochi secondi. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4071, 'it', 1),
(1992, 'La ciudad holandesa de Zandvoort no solo es famosa por su circuito de carreras, sino tambi&eacute;n por la playa de arena de varios kil&oacute;metros de largo que tiene para ofrecer a sus visitantes. A lo largo de todo el tramo de la playa tienes numerosos puntos de entrada para acceder a la playa. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Holanda Septentrional. En este lugar en particular tiene el nombre Strand Zandvoort aan Zee Centrum. Puede acceder a esta ubicaci&oacute;n con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y hay muchas opciones de estacionamiento disponibles, ya sea en la calle o en un gran lugar de estacionamiento a unos cientos de metros de distancia. El acceso a la playa es muy f&aacute;cil y tienes un camino de cemento que conduce a la playa. La playa tiene varios km de largo y m&aacute;s de 100 m de ancho. Cuando accedes a la playa tienes una inclinaci&oacute;n bastante normal que se aplana hacia el mar. Este hecho y la poca profundidad del agua hacen que la entrada al agua sea muy agradable, pero el punto de nadar est&aacute; muy lejos. Muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, as&iacute; como muchas opciones diferentes de restaurantes, lo que tambi&eacute;n es cierto para todos los diferentes tipos de alojamiento que tiene disponibles en los alrededores. Y recuerda, si est&aacute;s buscando la playa perfecta para ti, utiliza siempre BeachRex y utiliza nuestro potente motor de b&uacute;squeda, que te proporcionar&aacute; los resultados &oacute;ptimos en cuesti&oacute;n de segundos. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 4071, 'es', 1),
(1993, 'Die niederl&auml;ndische Stadt Zandvoort ist nicht nur f&uuml;r ihre Rennstrecke bekannt, sondern auch f&uuml;r den kilometerlangen Sandstrand, den sie ihren Besuchern zu bieten hat. Entlang des gesamten Strandabschnitts gibt es zahlreiche Einstiegspunkte zum Strand. Es befindet sich in der Region Noord-Holland. An dieser Stelle tr&auml;gt der Name Strand Zandvoort aan Zee Centrum. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen und es stehen viele Parkm&ouml;glichkeiten zur Verf&uuml;gung, entweder an der Stra&szlig;e oder auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz einige hundert Meter entfernt. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und Sie haben einen betonierten Weg, der zum Strand f&uuml;hrt. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und &uuml;ber 100 m breit. Wenn Sie den Strand erreichen, haben Sie eine ganz normale Neigung, die zum Meer hin abflacht. Diese Tatsache und das flache Wasser machen den Wassereinstieg sehr sch&ouml;n, aber der Badepunkt ist weit weg. Hier gibt es viele Strandservices sowie viele verschiedene Restaurants, was auch f&uuml;r alle Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften gilt, die Sie in der N&auml;he haben. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r sich suchen, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex und nutzen Sie unsere leistungsstarke Suchmaschine, die Ihnen in Sekundenschnelle die optimalen Ergebnisse liefert. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4071, 'de', 1),
(1994, 'La ciudad holandesa Noordwijk, ubicada en la regi&oacute;n holandesa de Zuid-Holland, tiene un car&aacute;cter muy tur&iacute;stico y una playa de arena muy larga con mucha &aacute;rea de playa, muchos tipos diferentes de hoteles, as&iacute; como numerosos restaurantes y servicios de playa en toda la zona. El nombre de esta parte de la playa es Strand Noordwijk 18. Es una playa familiar, no solo por el agua poco profunda, sino tambi&eacute;n porque tienes un parque infantil en la playa. Puedes acceder a esta ubicaci&oacute;n con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tienes m&uacute;ltiples opciones para estacionarlo cerca de la playa por la carretera o un poco m&aacute;s lejos en una plaza de aparcamiento muy grande. La distancia m&iacute;nima para llegar a la playa es de 100 my es necesario descender por un camino de hormig&oacute;n para acceder a la playa. Tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y m&aacute;s de 100 m de ancho. Debido a que las aguas poco profundas y la playa se aplanan hacia el mar, tiene una entrada de agua muy agradable y un punto para nadar bastante alejado. Y recuerda, si est&aacute;s buscando la playa perfecta para ti, utiliza siempre BeachRex y utiliza nuestro potente motor de b&uacute;squeda, que te proporcionar&aacute; los resultados &oacute;ptimos en cuesti&oacute;n de segundos. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 4073, 'es', 1),
(1995, 'La citt&agrave; olandese di Noordwijk, situata nella regione olandese Zuid-Holland, ha un carattere molto turistico e una spiaggia sabbiosa molto lunga con molte spiagge, molti tipi diversi di hotel e numerosi ristoranti e servizi di spiaggia in tutta l&#39;area. Il nome di questa parte della spiaggia &egrave; Strand Noordwijk 18. &Egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie, non solo per l&#39;acqua bassa, ma anche perch&eacute; c&#39;&egrave; un parco giochi per bambini sulla spiaggia. Puoi accedere a questa posizione con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e hai pi&ugrave; opzioni per parcheggiarla vicino alla spiaggia lungo la strada o un po&#39; pi&ugrave; lontano in un parcheggio molto ampio. La distanza minima per raggiungere la spiaggia &egrave; di 100 m ed &egrave; necessario scendere lungo un sentiero in cemento per accedere alla spiaggia. &Egrave; lungo diversi chilometri e largo pi&ugrave; di 100 metri. A causa dell&#39;acqua bassa e della spiaggia che si appiattisce verso il mare, si ha un&#39;entrata d&#39;acqua molto bella e un punto di nuotata abbastanza lontano. E ricorda, se stai cercando la spiaggia perfetta per te, usa sempre BeachRex e usa il nostro potente motore di ricerca, che ti fornir&agrave; i risultati ottimali in pochi secondi. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4073, 'it', 1),
(1996, 'La ville n&eacute;erlandaise de Noordwijk, situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion n&eacute;erlandaise de Zuid-Holland, a un caract&egrave;re tr&egrave;s touristique et une tr&egrave;s longue plage de sable avec de nombreuses plages, de nombreux types d&#39;h&ocirc;tels ainsi que de nombreux restaurants et services de plage tout autour de la r&eacute;gion. Le nom de cette partie de la plage est Strand Noordwijk 18. C&#39;est une plage familiale, non seulement &agrave; cause de l&#39;eau peu profonde, mais aussi parce que vous avez une aire de jeux pour enfants sur la plage. Vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cet emplacement avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et vous avez plusieurs options pour le garer soit pr&egrave;s de la plage par la route ou un peu plus loin sur un tr&egrave;s grand parking. La distance minimale pour se rendre &agrave; la plage est de 100 m et vous devez descendre par un chemin en b&eacute;ton pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage. Il mesure plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et plus de 100 m&egrave;tres de large. En raison de l&#39;eau peu profonde et de la plage qui s&#39;aplatit vers la mer, vous avez une tr&egrave;s belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et un point de baignade assez &eacute;loign&eacute;. Et rappelez-vous, si vous recherchez la plage parfaite pour vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex et utilisez notre puissant moteur de recherche, qui vous fournira les r&eacute;sultats optimaux en quelques secondes. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 4073, 'fr', 1),
(1997, 'Die niederl&auml;ndische Stadt Noordwijk, in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zuid-Holland gelegen, hat einen sehr touristischen Charakter und einen sehr langen Sandstrand mit viel Strandbereich, vielen verschiedenen Arten von Hotels sowie zahlreichen Restaurants und Strandservices in der ganzen Umgebung. Der Name dieses Strandabschnitts ist Strand Noordwijk 18. Es ist ein Familienstrand, nicht nur wegen des flachen Wassers, sondern auch, weil es am Strand einen Kinderspielplatz gibt. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen und haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, ihn entweder in Strandn&auml;he an der Stra&szlig;e oder etwas weiter entfernt auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz zu parken. Die Mindestentfernung zum Strand betr&auml;gt 100 m und Sie m&uuml;ssen einen Betonweg hinuntersteigen, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Er ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 m breit. Durch das flache Wasser und den zum Meer hin flach werdenden Strand hat man einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Wassereinstieg und einen recht weit entfernten Badepunkt. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r sich suchen, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex und nutzen Sie unsere leistungsstarke Suchmaschine, die Ihnen in Sekundenschnelle die optimalen Ergebnisse liefert. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4073, 'de', 1),
(1998, 'Sur la c&ocirc;te ouest n&eacute;erlandaise, dans la r&eacute;gion Zuid-Holland, vous trouverez de nombreuses belles plages de sable, qui font face d&#39;un c&ocirc;t&eacute; &agrave; la mer du Nord et de l&#39;autre aux hautes dunes. Strand Katwijk 6 &amp; 8 est une telle plage et elle est situ&eacute;e dans la ville de Katwijk aan Zee. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, camping-cars inclus, et vous pourrez vous garer sur un tr&egrave;s grand parking &agrave; 200 m de la plage. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est &eacute;galement facile et il vous m&egrave;ne sur un chemin b&eacute;tonn&eacute;. Une fois que vous &ecirc;tes sur la plage, vous disposez d&#39;une tr&egrave;s grande plage. La longueur totale est de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et elle fait plus de 100 m de large. L&#39;inclinaison est tout &agrave; fait normale et elle s&#39;aplatit vers la mer. Le fond marin est tr&egrave;s peu profond, ce qui rend l&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able, mais &agrave; cause de cela le point de nage est loin. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage n&#39;est ici que sommaire, il n&#39;y a pas de toilettes publiques, sauf dans le restaurant sur la plage, qui par contre n&#39;est probablement ouvert qu&#39;en &eacute;t&eacute;. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible &agrave; proximit&eacute; sous de nombreuses formes, principalement sous forme d&#39;h&ocirc;tel, un camp est &eacute;galement disponible, mais il se trouve &agrave; quelques kilom&egrave;tres. Et rappelez-vous, si vous recherchez la plage parfaite pour vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex et utilisez notre puissant moteur de recherche, qui vous fournira les r&eacute;sultats optimaux en quelques secondes. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 4074, 'fr', 1),
(1999, 'Sulla costa occidentale olandese, nella regione Zuid-Holland, puoi trovare molte belle spiagge sabbiose, che si affacciano da un lato sul Mare del Nord e dall&#39;altro sulle alte dune. Strand Katwijk 6 &amp; 8 &egrave; una di queste spiagge e si trova nella citt&agrave; di Katwijk aan Zee. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, camper inclusi, e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare in un parcheggio molto ampio a 200 m dalla spiaggia. Anche l&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; facile e vi conduce su un sentiero in cemento. Una volta che sei in spiaggia hai una spiaggia molto ampia a tua disposizione. La lunghezza totale &egrave; di diversi chilometri ed &egrave; larga pi&ugrave; di 100 m. L&#39;inclinazione &egrave; abbastanza normale e si fa pi&ugrave; piatta verso il mare. Il fondale &egrave; molto basso, il che rende molto piacevole l&#39;ingresso in acqua, ma proprio per questo il punto di balneazione &egrave; lontano. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; qui solo di base, non ci sono bagni pubblici, tranne nel ristorante sulla spiaggia, che d&#39;altra parte &egrave; probabilmente aperto solo in estate. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile nelle vicinanze in molte forme, prevalentemente come hotel, &egrave; disponibile anche un campeggio, ma &egrave; a pochi chilometri di distanza. E ricorda, se stai cercando la spiaggia perfetta per te, usa sempre BeachRex e usa il nostro potente motore di ricerca, che ti fornir&agrave; i risultati ottimali in pochi secondi. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4074, 'it', 1),
(2000, 'En la costa oeste holandesa, en la regi&oacute;n de Zuid-Holland, puede encontrar muchas hermosas playas de arena, que se enfrentan por un lado al Mar del Norte y por el otro a las altas dunas. Strand Katwijk 6 &amp; 8 es una de estas playas y se encuentra en la ciudad Katwijk aan Zee. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, autocaravanas incluidas, y se puede aparcar en una plaza de aparcamiento muy amplia a 200 m de la playa. El acceso a la playa tambi&eacute;n es f&aacute;cil y te lleva por un camino de cemento. Una vez que est&eacute; en la playa, tendr&aacute; una zona de playa muy grande a su disposici&oacute;n. La longitud total es de varios kil&oacute;metros y tiene m&aacute;s de 100 m de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n es bastante normal y se vuelve m&aacute;s plana hacia el mar. El fondo marino es muy poco profundo, lo que hace que la entrada al agua sea muy agradable, pero por eso el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; muy lejos. La infraestructura de la playa es aqu&iacute; solo b&aacute;sica, no hay ba&ntilde;os p&uacute;blicos, excepto en el restaurante de la playa, que por otro lado probablemente solo est&eacute; abierto en verano. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en las cercan&iacute;as de muchas formas, principalmente como un hotel, tambi&eacute;n hay un campamento disponible, pero est&aacute; a pocos kil&oacute;metros de distancia. Y recuerda, si est&aacute;s buscando la playa perfecta para ti, utiliza siempre BeachRex y utiliza nuestro potente motor de b&uacute;squeda, que te proporcionar&aacute; los resultados &oacute;ptimos en cuesti&oacute;n de segundos. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 4074, 'es', 1),
(2001, 'An der niederl&auml;ndischen Westk&uuml;ste, in der Region Zuid-Holland, finden Sie viele sch&ouml;ne Sandstr&auml;nde, die auf der einen Seite der Nordsee und auf der anderen Seite den hohen D&uuml;nen zugewandt sind. Strand Katwijk 6 &amp; 8 ist ein solcher Strand und befindet sich in der Stadt Katwijk aan Zee. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr gut zu erreichen, auch mit Wohnmobilen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 200 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Zugang zum Strand ist ebenfalls einfach und f&uuml;hrt Sie auf einem betonierten Weg. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, steht Ihnen ein sehr gro&szlig;er Strandbereich zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und ist &uuml;ber 100 m breit. Die Neigung ist ganz normal und zum Meer hin wird es flacher. Der Meeresboden ist sehr flach, was den Wassereintritt sehr sch&ouml;n macht, aber dadurch ist der Badepunkt weit weg. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist hier nur einfach, es gibt keine &ouml;ffentlichen Toiletten, au&szlig;er im Restaurant am Strand, das aber wohl nur im Sommer ge&ouml;ffnet hat. &Uuml;bernachtungsm&ouml;glichkeiten gibt es in der n&auml;heren Umgebung in vielen Formen, &uuml;berwiegend als Hotel, auch ein Campingplatz ist vorhanden, ist aber wenige Kilometer entfernt. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r sich suchen, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex und nutzen Sie unsere leistungsstarke Suchmaschine, die Ihnen in Sekundenschnelle die optimalen Ergebnisse liefert. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4074, 'de', 1),
(2002, 'Strand Katwijk Boulevard Zeezijde 51 es una playa de arena holandesa ubicada en la costa oeste de la regi&oacute;n de Zuid-Holland. La playa es muy larga, se extiende por varios kil&oacute;metros y te ofrece a lo largo de todo el tramo numerosos puntos de entrada. Es muy f&aacute;cil y r&aacute;pido de acceder desde el lugar de estacionamiento, que est&aacute; a solo 50 m de distancia. Si te gustan todas esas caracter&iacute;sticas, puedes encontrar esta playa en la ciudad Katwijk aan Zee. Encontrar&aacute; f&aacute;cilmente esta ubicaci&oacute;n, sin importar el veh&iacute;culo con el que viaje. La zona de playa es muy amplia y adem&aacute;s de disponer de varios kil&oacute;metros de longitud de playa, tambi&eacute;n hay que saber que la playa es muy ancha, m&aacute;s de 100 m, con marea baja a&uacute;n m&aacute;s. M&aacute;s cerca del mar la playa se vuelve muy plana y junto con el agua poco profunda tienes una bonita entrada a la playa, pero si quieres nadar debes tener en cuenta que el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; muy lejos. Muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, as&iacute; como muchos tipos diferentes de bares y restaurantes en la playa. Tambi&eacute;n se encuentran disponibles diferentes opciones de alojamiento en las inmediaciones. Y recuerda, si est&aacute;s buscando la playa perfecta para ti, utiliza siempre BeachRex y utiliza nuestro potente motor de b&uacute;squeda, que te proporcionar&aacute; los resultados &oacute;ptimos en cuesti&oacute;n de segundos. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 4075, 'es', 1),
(2003, 'Strand Katwijk Boulevard Zeezijde 51 &egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa olandese situata sulla costa occidentale nella regione dell&#39;Olanda Meridionale. La spiaggia &egrave; molto lunga, si estende per diversi chilometri e offre lungo tutto il tratto numerosi punti di ingresso. &Egrave; molto facile e veloce accessibile dal parcheggio, che dista solo 50 m. Se ti piacciono tutte queste caratteristiche, puoi trovare questa spiaggia nella citt&agrave; di Katwijk aan Zee. Troverai facilmente questa posizione, indipendentemente dal veicolo con cui viaggi. La spiaggia &egrave; molto ampia e oltre ad avere a disposizione diversi chilometri di spiaggia, bisogna anche sapere che la spiaggia &egrave; molto ampia, pi&ugrave; di 100 m, con la bassa marea ancora di pi&ugrave;. Pi&ugrave; vicino al mare la spiaggia diventa molto piatta e insieme all&#39;acqua bassa si ha un bel ingresso in spiaggia, ma se si vuole fare il bagno bisogna tener conto che il punto di nuoto &egrave; molto lontano. Qui sono disponibili molti servizi in spiaggia e diversi tipi di bar e ristoranti sulla spiaggia. Nelle vicinanze sono disponibili anche diverse opzioni di alloggio. E ricorda, se stai cercando la spiaggia perfetta per te, usa sempre BeachRex e usa il nostro potente motore di ricerca, che ti fornir&agrave; i risultati ottimali in pochi secondi. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4075, 'it', 1),
(2004, 'Strand Katwijk Boulevard Zeezijde 51 est une plage de sable n&eacute;erlandaise situ&eacute;e sur la c&ocirc;te ouest de la r&eacute;gion Zuid-Holland. La plage est tr&egrave;s longue, elle s&#39;&eacute;tend sur plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et vous offre tout au long du tron&ccedil;on de nombreux points d&#39;entr&eacute;e. Il est tr&egrave;s facile et rapide d&#39;acc&egrave;s depuis le parking qui se trouve &agrave; seulement 50 m. Si vous aimez toutes ces caract&eacute;ristiques, vous pouvez trouver cette plage dans la ville de Katwijk aan Zee. Vous trouverez facilement cet endroit, quel que soit le v&eacute;hicule avec lequel vous voyagez. La zone de plage est tr&egrave;s grande et en plus d&#39;avoir plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de longueur de plage disponible, vous devez &eacute;galement savoir que la plage est tr&egrave;s large, plus de 100 m, &agrave; mar&eacute;e basse encore plus. Plus pr&egrave;s de la mer, la plage devient tr&egrave;s plate et avec l&#39;eau peu profonde, vous avez une belle entr&eacute;e de plage, mais si vous voulez nager, vous devez tenir compte du fait que le point de baignade est tr&egrave;s &eacute;loign&eacute;. De nombreux services de plage sont disponibles ici ainsi que de nombreux types de bars et de restaurants de plage. Diff&eacute;rentes options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement sont &eacute;galement disponibles &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Et rappelez-vous, si vous recherchez la plage parfaite pour vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex et utilisez notre puissant moteur de recherche, qui vous fournira les r&eacute;sultats optimaux en quelques secondes. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 4075, 'fr', 1),
(2005, 'Strand Katwijk Boulevard Zeezijde 51 ist ein niederl&auml;ndischer Sandstrand an der Westk&uuml;ste in der Region Zuid-Holland. Der Strand ist sehr lang, erstreckt sich &uuml;ber mehrere Kilometer und bietet Ihnen entlang der gesamten Strecke viele Einstiegspunkte. Vom Parkplatz, der nur 50 m entfernt ist, ist es sehr einfach und schnell zu erreichen. Wenn Sie all diese Eigenschaften m&ouml;gen, finden Sie diesen Strand in der Stadt Katwijk aan Zee. Sie werden diesen Ort leicht finden, egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie reisen. Der Strandbereich ist sehr gro&szlig; und neben mehreren Kilometern Strandl&auml;nge muss man auch wissen, dass der Strand sehr breit ist, mehr als 100 m, bei Ebbe sogar noch mehr. N&auml;her am Meer wird der Strand sehr flach und zusammen mit dem seichten Wasser hat man einen sch&ouml;nen Strandzugang, aber, wenn man schwimmen m&ouml;chte, muss man ber&uuml;cksichtigen, dass der Badepunkt sehr weit weg ist. Hier gibt es viele Strandservices sowie viele verschiedene Arten von Strandbars und Restaurants. Auch verschiedene Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten sind in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r sich suchen, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex und nutzen Sie unsere leistungsstarke Suchmaschine, die Ihnen in Sekundenschnelle die optimalen Ergebnisse liefert. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4075, 'de', 1),
(2006, 'La ville n&eacute;erlandaise de Den Haag a une plage nord et une plage sud. Si la plage nord est la destination touristique n&eacute;erlandaise la plus connue, la plage sud est tout le contraire. Donc, si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez une plage de sable avec presque aucune infrastructure de plage, pas de restaurants, mais un immense parking, la plage Zuiderstrand est faite pour vous. Comme la plage nord, la plage sud est &eacute;galement situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion Zuid-Holland. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, et vous pouvez vous garer sur un grand parking &agrave; seulement 50 m de la plage. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s facile et se fait par un chemin b&eacute;tonn&eacute;. La plage est tr&egrave;s vaste et vous disposez de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de longueur et plus de 100m de largeur. L&#39;inclinaison est normale et elle devient plus plate vers la mer, ce qui rend l&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade n&#39;est &eacute;galement qu&#39;&agrave; 40 m. Cet endroit est &eacute;galement un endroit populaire pour les surfeurs. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage n&#39;est ici que basique. En &eacute;t&eacute;, vous avez peut-&ecirc;tre un kiosque sur la plage ou de la restauration rapide. Les toilettes sont &eacute;ventuellement disponibles en &eacute;t&eacute; uniquement en style dixi. Certains logements sont &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute; sous forme d&#39;appartements et certains h&ocirc;tels sont un peu plus &eacute;loign&eacute;s. Et rappelez-vous, si vous recherchez la plage parfaite pour vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex et utilisez notre puissant moteur de recherche, qui vous fournira les r&eacute;sultats optimaux en quelques secondes. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 4078, 'fr', 1),
(2007, 'La citt&agrave; olandese Den Haag ha una spiaggia nord e una spiaggia sud. Se la spiaggia nord &egrave; la destinazione turistica olandese pi&ugrave; famosa, la spiaggia sud &egrave; l&#39;esatto opposto. Quindi, se preferisci una spiaggia sabbiosa con quasi zero infrastrutture balneari, senza ristoranti, ma un enorme parcheggio, la spiaggia Zuiderstrand &egrave; quella che fa per te. Come la spiaggia nord, anche quella sud si trova nella regione Zuid-Holland. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, ed &egrave; possibile parcheggiare in un ampio parcheggio a soli 50 m dalla spiaggia. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto facile e avviene tramite un sentiero in cemento. La spiaggia &egrave; molto ampia e hai a disposizione diversi chilometri di lunghezza e pi&ugrave; di 100 m di larghezza. L&#39;inclinazione &egrave; normale e diventa pi&ugrave; piatta verso il mare, il che rende molto piacevole l&#39;ingresso in acqua e anche il punto di balneazione &egrave; a soli 40 m di distanza. Questo posto &egrave; anche un luogo popolare per i surfisti. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; qui solo di base. In estate potresti avere un chiosco sulla spiaggia o qualche fast food a disposizione. I bagni sono possibilmente disponibili in estate solo in stile dixi. Alcuni alloggi sono anche nelle vicinanze sotto forma di appartamenti e alcuni hotel sono un po&#39; pi&ugrave; lontani. E ricorda, se stai cercando la spiaggia perfetta per te, usa sempre BeachRex e usa il nostro potente motore di ricerca, che ti fornir&agrave; i risultati ottimali in pochi secondi. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4078, 'it', 1),
(2008, 'La citt&agrave; olandese Den Haag ha una spiaggia nord e una spiaggia sud. Se la spiaggia nord &egrave; la destinazione turistica olandese pi&ugrave; famosa, la spiaggia sud &egrave; l&#39;esatto opposto. Quindi, se preferisci una spiaggia sabbiosa con quasi zero infrastrutture balneari, senza ristoranti, ma un enorme parcheggio, la spiaggia Zuiderstrand &egrave; quella che fa per te. Come la spiaggia nord, anche quella sud si trova nella regione Zuid-Holland. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, ed &egrave; possibile parcheggiare in un ampio parcheggio a soli 50 m dalla spiaggia. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto facile e avviene tramite un sentiero in cemento. La spiaggia &egrave; molto ampia e hai a disposizione diversi chilometri di lunghezza e pi&ugrave; di 100 m di larghezza. L&#39;inclinazione &egrave; normale e diventa pi&ugrave; piatta verso il mare, il che rende molto piacevole l&#39;ingresso in acqua e anche il punto di balneazione &egrave; a soli 40 m di distanza. Questo posto &egrave; anche un luogo popolare per i surfisti. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; qui solo di base. In estate potresti avere un chiosco sulla spiaggia o qualche fast food a disposizione. I bagni sono possibilmente disponibili in estate solo in stile dixi. Alcuni alloggi sono anche nelle vicinanze sotto forma di appartamenti e alcuni hotel sono un po&#39; pi&ugrave; lontani. E ricorda, se stai cercando la spiaggia perfetta per te, usa sempre BeachRex e usa il nostro potente motore di ricerca, che ti fornir&agrave; i risultati ottimali in pochi secondi. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4078, 'es', 1),
(2009, 'Die niederl&auml;ndische Stadt Den Haag hat einen Nordstrand und einen S&uuml;dstrand. Wenn der Nordstrand das bekannteste niederl&auml;ndische Touristenziel ist, ist der S&uuml;dstrand das genaue Gegenteil. Wer also einen Sandstrand mit nahezu null Strandinfrastruktur, keine Restaurants, daf&uuml;r aber einen riesigen Parkplatz bevorzugt, der ist am Zuiderstrand genau richtig. Wie der Nordstrand liegt auch der S&uuml;den in der Region Zuid-Holland. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr gut zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und f&uuml;hrt &uuml;ber einen Beton weg. Der Strandbereich ist sehr gro&szlig; und Ihnen stehen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und &uuml;ber 100m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Neigung ist normal und wird zum Meer hin flacher, was den Wassereinstieg sehr sch&ouml;n macht und die Badestelle auch nur 40 m entfernt ist. Dieser Ort ist auch ein beliebter Ort f&uuml;r Surfer. Strandinfrastruktur ist hier nur einfach. Im Sommer haben Sie eventuell einen Strandkiosk oder Fast Food zur Verf&uuml;gung. Toiletten sind im Sommer m&ouml;glicherweise nur im Dixi-Stil verf&uuml;gbar. Einige Unterk&uuml;nfte befinden sich auch in der N&auml;he in Form von Apartments und einige Hotels sind etwas weiter entfernt. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r sich suchen, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex und nutzen Sie unsere leistungsstarke Suchmaschine, die Ihnen in Sekundenschnelle die optimalen Ergebnisse liefert. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4078, 'de', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(2010, 'La ciudad holandesa de Rotterdam, el puerto log&iacute;stico m&aacute;s grande de Europa, tiene en sus cercan&iacute;as algunas playas de arena asombrosas, que puede visitar si est&aacute; cerca y le gustar&iacute;a pasar el d&iacute;a en una playa de arena. Este, que presentamos aqu&iacute;, se encuentra cerca de la ciudad s-Gravenzande en la regi&oacute;n Zuid-Holland y se conoce con el nombre de Strand Slag Beukel. Es una playa familiar, de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. Tiene a unos 200 metros de la playa una plaza de aparcamiento muy grande, que tambi&eacute;n admite autocaravanas, a su disposici&oacute;n. Para acceder a la playa hay que caminar sobre una duna de 10 m de altura, pero no te preocupes, el camino es de hormig&oacute;n, es muy ancho y est&aacute; en buen estado. Una vez que est&eacute;s en la playa te sorprender&aacute; el tama&ntilde;o del &aacute;rea de playa que tienes frente a ti. En total tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y m&aacute;s de 100 m de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n es normal y se aplana hacia el mar. Aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n tienes un agua bastante poco profunda, lo que hace que la entrada al agua sea muy agradable y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a 50 m. Toda la infraestructura y los servicios esenciales de la playa est&aacute;n disponibles para usted directamente en la playa o en el lugar de estacionamiento. En la propia playa tambi&eacute;n tienes un restaurante o un chiringuito. Tambi&eacute;n hay disponibles peque&ntilde;os parques infantiles y un campo de deportes. El alojamiento no est&aacute; disponible directamente en la playa, sino en forma de apartamentos en la ciudad m&aacute;s cercana no muy lejos. Y recuerda, si est&aacute;s buscando la playa perfecta para ti, utiliza siempre BeachRex y utiliza nuestro potente motor de b&uacute;squeda, que te proporcionar&aacute; los resultados &oacute;ptimos en cuesti&oacute;n de segundos. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 4081, 'es', 1),
(2011, 'La citt&agrave; olandese di Rotterdam, il pi&ugrave; grande porto logistico d&#39;Europa, ha nelle sue vicinanze alcune meravigliose spiagge sabbiose, che puoi visitare se ti trovi nelle vicinanze e desideri trascorrere la giornata su una spiaggia sabbiosa. Questo, che presentiamo qui, si trova vicino alla citt&agrave; s-Gravenzande nella regione Zuid-Holland e si chiama Strand Slag Beukel. &Egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie, facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Hai a circa 200 metri dalla spiaggia un parcheggio molto grande, che accoglie anche camper, a tua disposizione. Per accedere alla spiaggia bisogna percorrere a piedi una duna alta 10 m, ma niente paura, il sentiero &egrave; in cemento, &egrave; molto ampio ed &egrave; in buone condizioni. Una volta in spiaggia rimarrai stupito dalle dimensioni della spiaggia che hai di fronte. In totale &egrave; lungo diversi chilometri e largo pi&ugrave; di 100 metri. L&#39;inclinazione &egrave; normale e si appiattisce verso il mare. Qui si ha anche un fondale abbastanza basso, che rende molto piacevole l&#39;ingresso in acqua e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 50 m. Tutte le infrastrutture e i servizi essenziali per la spiaggia sono a tua disposizione direttamente sulla spiaggia o presso il parcheggio. Sulla spiaggia stessa hai anche un ristorante o un bar sulla spiaggia. Sono disponibili anche piccoli parchi giochi per bambini e un campo sportivo. L&#39;alloggio non &egrave; disponibile direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma sotto forma di appartamenti nella citt&agrave; pi&ugrave; vicina non lontana. E ricorda, se stai cercando la spiaggia perfetta per te, usa sempre BeachRex e usa il nostro potente motore di ricerca, che ti fornir&agrave; i risultati ottimali in pochi secondi. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4081, 'it', 1),
(2012, 'La ville n&eacute;erlandaise de Rotterdam, le plus grand port logistique d&#39;Europe, poss&egrave;de dans ses environs d&#39;&eacute;tonnantes plages de sable, que vous pouvez visiter si vous &ecirc;tes &agrave; proximit&eacute; et que vous souhaitez passer votre journ&eacute;e sur une plage de sable. Celui-ci, que nous pr&eacute;sentons ici, est situ&eacute; &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville de s-Gravenzande dans la r&eacute;gion Zuid-Holland et s&#39;appelle Strand Slag Beukel. C&#39;est une plage familiale, tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. Vous avez &agrave; votre disposition &agrave; environ 200m de la plage un tr&egrave;s grand parking, qui accueille &eacute;galement les camping-cars. Pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage, il faut traverser une dune de 10 m de haut, mais ne vous inqui&eacute;tez pas, le chemin est en b&eacute;ton, est tr&egrave;s large et est en bon &eacute;tat. Une fois sur la plage, vous serez &eacute;tonn&eacute; par la taille de la plage que vous avez devant vous. Au total, il fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et plus de 100m de large. L&#39;inclinaison est normale et elle s&#39;aplatit vers la mer. Ici vous avez &eacute;galement une eau assez peu profonde, ce qui rend l&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; 50 m. Toutes les infrastructures et services essentiels de la plage sont &agrave; votre disposition soit directement sur la plage, soit &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; du parking. Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, vous avez &eacute;galement un restaurant ou un bar de plage. De petites aires de jeux pour enfants et un terrain de sport sont &eacute;galement disponibles. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas disponible directement sur la plage, mais sous forme d&#39;appartements dans la ville la plus proche non loin. Et rappelez-vous, si vous recherchez la plage parfaite pour vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex et utilisez notre puissant moteur de recherche, qui vous fournira les r&eacute;sultats optimaux en quelques secondes. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 4081, 'fr', 1),
(2013, 'Die niederl&auml;ndische Stadt Rotterdam, Europas gr&ouml;&szlig;ter Logistikhafen, hat in der N&auml;he einige erstaunliche Sandstr&auml;nde, die Sie besuchen k&ouml;nnen, wenn Sie in der N&auml;he sind und Ihren Tag an einem Sandstrand verbringen m&ouml;chten. Dieser, den wir hier vorstellen, befindet sich in der N&auml;he der Stadt s-Gravenzande in der Region S&uuml;d-Holland und tr&auml;gt den Namen Strand Slag Beukel. Es ist ein Familienstrand, der mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen ist. Etwa 200 m vom Strand entfernt steht Ihnen ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz zur Verf&uuml;gung, der auch f&uuml;r Wohnmobile geeignet ist. Um zum Strand zu gelangen, muss man &uuml;ber eine 10 m hohe D&uuml;ne laufen, aber keine Sorge, der Weg ist aus Beton, ist sehr breit und in gutem Zustand. Sobald Sie am Strand sind, werden Sie von der Gr&ouml;&szlig;e des Strandes &uuml;berrascht sein, den Sie vor sich haben. Insgesamt ist er mehrere Kilometer lang und &uuml;ber 100m breit. Die Neigung ist normal und wird zum Meer hin flach. Hier hat man auch ein recht seichtes Wasser, was den Wassereinstieg sehr sch&ouml;n macht und die Badestelle liegt bei 50 m. Alle wesentlichen Strandinfrastrukturen und Dienstleistungen stehen Ihnen entweder direkt am Strand oder am Parkplatz zur Verf&uuml;gung. Am Strand selbst haben Sie auch ein Restaurant oder eine Strandbar. Kleine Kinderspielpl&auml;tze und ein Sportplatz sind ebenfalls vorhanden. Unterk&uuml;nfte gibt es nicht direkt am Strand, sondern in Form von Appartements in der n&auml;chstgelegenen Stadt nicht weit entfernt. Und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r sich suchen, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex und nutzen Sie unsere leistungsstarke Suchmaschine, die Ihnen in Sekundenschnelle die optimalen Ergebnisse liefert. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4081, 'de', 1),
(2014, 'Willkommen an einem weiteren wundersch&ouml;nen Sandstrand in der griechischen Provinz Kentriki Makedonia. Es befindet sich in der Stadt Stavros, neben dem Stadthafen. Der gepflasterte Parkplatz befindet sich direkt vor dem Strand und ist auch f&uuml;r Wohnmobile geeignet. In der N&auml;he des Strandes gibt es einen sch&ouml;nen Park mit vielen schattenspendenden B&auml;umen und auch am Strand selbst gibt es etwas Gras. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 400 Meter und an der breitesten Stelle ist der Strand 100 Meter breit. Die Steigung am Strand ist sehr flach, was beim Wassereintritt nicht der Fall ist. Sie k&ouml;nnen damit rechnen, bereits nach 5 Metern, nach dem Wasser eintritt, mit dem schwimmen zu beginnen. Auf dem Meeresboden findet man haupts&auml;chlich Sand und kleine Steine. Es ist ein frei zug&auml;nglicher Strand und wenn Sie einen Hund besitzen, werden Sie kein Problem haben, wenn Sie ihn mitbringen. Der Standard der Strandinfrastruktur ist hier auf einem hohen Niveau und es ist eine vollst&auml;ndige Liste der Annehmlichkeiten. Da es sich um einen Stadtstrand handelt, finden Sie hier viele verschiedene Unterkunftsarten, einige nur wenige Meter entfernt. Auch hier werden Sie weder hungrig noch durstig werden, viele verschiedene Arten von Restaurants sind in der N&auml;he vorhanden. Sie m&uuml;ssen die k&ouml;stliche griechische K&uuml;che probieren. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand.', 3423, 'de', 1),
(2015, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na &scaron;e eni čudoviti pe&scaron;čeni plaži v gr&scaron;ki provinci Kentriki Makedonia. Nahaja se v mestu Stavros, ob mestnem pristani&scaron;ču. Parkiri&scaron;če, ki je asfaltirano, se nahaja neposredno pred plažo in sprejema tudi avtodome. V bližini plaže imate lep park, s &scaron;tevilnimi senčnimi drevesi, na sami plaži pa imate tudi nekaj trave. Skupna dolžina plaže je 400 metrov, na naj&scaron;ir&scaron;em delu pa je plaža &scaron;iroka 100 metrov. Pobočje na plaži je zelo ravno, kar pa ne velja za vstop v vodo. Pričetek plavanja lahko pričakujete že po 5 metrih vstopa v vodo. Na morskem dnu boste na&scaron;li predvsem pesek in drobno kamenje. Je brezplačno dostopna plaža in če imate psa, ne boste imeli težav, če ga pripeljete s seboj. Infrastrukturni standard plaže je tukaj na visoki ravni in je popoln seznam dobrin. Ker je to mestna plaža, boste tukaj na&scaron;li veliko različnih tipov namestitve, nekatere le nekaj metrov stran. Tudi tukaj ne boste lačni ali žejni, v bližini je na voljo veliko različnih restavracij. Predlagam vam da ob priložnosti poskusite okusno gr&scaron;ko kuhinjo. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo popolno plažo. Uživajte na plaži.', 3423, 'sl', 1),
(2016, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na jo&scaron; jednu prekrasnu pje&scaron;čanu plažu u grčkoj pokrajini Kentriki Makedonia. Nalazi se u mjestu Stavros, pored gradske luke. Asfaltirano parkirali&scaron;te nalazi se neposredno ispred plaže i također prihvaća i kampere. U blizini plaže imate prekrasan park, s mnogo sjenovitih stabala, a na samoj plaži imate i malo trave. Ukupna dužina plaže je 400 metara, a na naj&scaron;irem dijelu plaža je &scaron;iroka 100 metara. Nagib na plaži je vrlo ravan, &scaron;to ne vrijedi za ulazak u vodu. Možete očekivati ​​početak plivanja nakon 5 metara ulaska u vodu. Na morskom dnu ćete naći uglavnom pijesak i sitno kamenje. To je besplatna plaža i ako imate psa, neće vam biti problem dovesti ga sa sobom. Infrastrukturni standard plaže ovdje je na visokoj razini i kompletan je popis sadržaja. Budući da je riječ o gradskoj plaži, ovdje ćete pronaći mnogo različitih tipova smje&scaron;taja, a neki su udaljeni samo nekoliko metara. Ni ovdje nećete biti ni gladni ni žedni, u blizini je mnogo različitih restorana. Predlažem da povremeno probate ukusnu grčku kuhinju. I zapamtite, uvijek koristite BeachRex da pronađete svoju savr&scaron;enu plažu. Uživajte na plaži.', 3423, 'hr', 1),
(2017, 'Benvenuti in un&#39;altra bellissima spiaggia sabbiosa nella provincia greca di Kentriki Makedonia. Si trova nella citt&agrave; di Stavros, vicino al porto della citt&agrave;. Il parcheggio pavimentato si trova direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia e accetta anche camper. Vicino alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un bellissimo parco, con molti alberi ombrosi, e sulla spiaggia stessa c&#39;&egrave; anche un po&#39; di erba. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 400 metri e nella parte pi&ugrave; larga la spiaggia &egrave; larga 100 metri. La pendenza sulla spiaggia &egrave; molto piatta, il che non si applica all&#39;ingresso in acqua. Puoi aspettarti di iniziare a nuotare dopo 5 metri dall&#39;ingresso in acqua. Sul fondale troverete principalmente sabbia e piccoli sassi. &Egrave; una spiaggia libera e accessibile e se hai un cane non avrai problemi a portarlo con te. Lo standard delle infrastrutture della spiaggia qui &egrave; di alto livello ed &egrave; un elenco completo di servizi. Poich&eacute; si tratta di una spiaggia cittadina, qui troverai molti tipi diversi di alloggi, alcuni a pochi metri di distanza. Non avrai n&eacute; fame n&eacute; sete qui, ci sono molti ristoranti diversi nelle vicinanze. Ti suggerisco di provare la deliziosa cucina greca di tanto in tanto. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta. Goditi la spiaggia.', 3423, 'it', 1),
(2018, 'Bienvenue sur une autre belle plage de sable de la province grecque de Kentriki Makedonia. Il est situ&eacute; dans la ville de Stavros, &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; du port de la ville. Le parking pav&eacute; est situ&eacute; directement en face de la plage et accepte &eacute;galement les camping-cars. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, vous avez un beau parc, avec de nombreux arbres ombrag&eacute;s, et sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, vous avez &eacute;galement de l&#39;herbe. La longueur totale de la plage est de 400 m&egrave;tres, et dans la partie la plus large la plage est de 100 m&egrave;tres de large. La pente sur la plage est tr&egrave;s plate, ce qui ne s&#39;applique pas &agrave; l&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau. Vous pouvez vous attendre &agrave; commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s 5 m&egrave;tres d&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau. Sur les fonds marins, vous trouverez principalement du sable et des petites pierres. C&#39;est une plage accessible gratuitement et si vous avez un chien, vous n&#39;aurez aucun probl&egrave;me &agrave; l&#39;amener avec vous. La norme d&#39;infrastructure de la plage ici est &agrave; un niveau &eacute;lev&eacute; et constitue une liste compl&egrave;te d&#39;&eacute;quipements. Comme il s&#39;agit d&#39;une plage de ville, vous y trouverez de nombreux types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement diff&eacute;rents, certains &agrave; quelques m&egrave;tres seulement. Ici non plus, vous n&#39;aurez ni faim ni soif, il y a de nombreux restaurants diff&eacute;rents &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Je vous sugg&egrave;re d&#39;essayer la d&eacute;licieuse cuisine grecque &agrave; l&#39;occasion. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre plage parfaite. Profites de la plage.', 3423, 'fr', 1),
(2019, 'Bienvenido a otra hermosa playa de arena en la provincia griega de Kentriki Makedonia. Se encuentra en la localidad de Stavros, junto al puerto de la ciudad. El estacionamiento pavimentado est&aacute; ubicado directamente en frente de la playa y tambi&eacute;n acepta autocaravanas. Cerca de la playa tienes un hermoso parque, con muchos &aacute;rboles a la sombra, y en la misma playa tambi&eacute;n tienes algo de c&eacute;sped. La longitud total de la playa es de 400 metros, y en la parte m&aacute;s ancha la playa tiene 100 metros de ancho. La pendiente de la playa es muy llana, lo que no se aplica a la entrada al agua. Puede esperar comenzar a nadar despu&eacute;s de 5 metros de ingresar al agua. En el fondo marino encontrar&aacute; principalmente arena y piedras peque&ntilde;as. Es una playa de libre acceso y si tienes un perro, no tendr&aacute;s problema en traerlo contigo. El est&aacute;ndar de infraestructura de la playa aqu&iacute; es de alto nivel y es una lista completa de comodidades. Dado que se trata de una playa urbana, aqu&iacute; encontrar&aacute; muchos tipos diferentes de alojamiento, algunos a solo unos metros de distancia. Aqu&iacute; tampoco tendr&aacute; hambre ni sed, hay muchos restaurantes diferentes cerca. Te sugiero que pruebes la deliciosa cocina griega de vez en cuando. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta. Disfruta la playa.', 3423, 'es', 1),
(2020, 'Добро пожаловать на еще один прекрасный песчаный пляж в греческой провинции Кентрики Македония. Он расположен в городе Ставрос, рядом с городским портом. Асфальтированная автостоянка расположена прямо перед пляжем и также принимает дома на колесах. Рядом с пляжем есть красивый парк с множеством тенистых деревьев, а на самом пляже также есть трава. Общая длина пляжа составляет 400 метров, а ширина в самой широкой части составляет 100 метров. Склон на пляже очень пологий, что не относится к заходу в воду. Вы можете рассчитывать начать плавание после 5 метров входа в воду. На морском дне вы найдете в основном песок и мелкие камни. Это бесплатный доступ к пляжу, и если у вас есть собака, у вас не будет проблем с ней взять ее с собой. Уровень инфраструктуры пляжа здесь на высоком уровне и представляет собой полный перечень удобств. Поскольку это городской пляж, вы найдете здесь много различных типов жилья, некоторые из которых находятся всего в нескольких метрах от отеля. Здесь тоже не будет ни голода, ни жажды, поблизости много разных ресторанов. Предлагаю вам при случае попробовать восхитительные блюда греческой кухни. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти свой идеальный пляж. Наслаждайтесь пляжем.', 3423, 'ru', 1),
(2021, 'Paralia Asprovalta je popolna plaža za va&scaron;o družino. Nahaja se v regiji Kentriki Makedonia v mestu Asprovalta in ima skoraj največ infrastrukture za plažo, ki si jo lahko predstavljate ali želite imeti na plaži. Tukaj boste na&scaron;li obilico peska, naravno senco in travo, da ne omenjamo nekaj kilometrov dolge plaže, ki se lahko razteza do največ 75 metrov &scaron;irine. Do plaže se lahko pripeljete z vsemi tipi vozil, tudi avtodomom, parkirate pa lahko skoraj neposredno pred plažo, le 50 metrov stran. Ker se ta plaža nahaja sredi turistične destinacije, lahko pričakujete, da boste imeli na voljo &scaron;tevilne turistične storitve. V visoki sezoni je zasedenost plaže velika. Pobočje plaže ima običajen naklon, ki po vstopu v vodo precej hitro pada, plavati lahko začnete že po 5 metrih po vstopu v vodo. Če ste ljubitelj naravnih senc, jih boste na&scaron;li tukaj. Tu je na voljo veliko različnih vrst prenoči&scaron;č, nekatere le nekaj metrov stran, na seznamu sta tudi hotel in kamp. Dolg je tudi seznam vseh vrst hrane, kar velja tudi za vse vrste plažnih barov. Če imate psa, ste dobrodo&scaron;li tukaj. Tudi tisti, ki se radi zabavajo in ple&scaron;ejo na moderno ali pa tradicionalno glasbo, bodo na&scaron;li nekaj mest. Ker se mnogi turisti radi ukvarjajo s &scaron;portom na mivki, je ta plaža opremljena tudi z nekaterimi tipičnimi &scaron;portnimi igri&scaron;či, kot je odbojka na mivki. Torej, kaj &scaron;e čaka&scaron;. Poi&scaron;čite pravo namestitev zase in se odpravite na svojo novo avanturo na plaži. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, če želite najti popolno plažo zase. Uživajte na plaži.', 3422, 'sl', 1),
(2022, 'Paralia Asprovalta savr&scaron;ena je plaža za va&scaron;u obitelj. Nalazi se u regiji Kentriki Makedonia u Asprovalti i ima gotovo najvi&scaron;e infrastrukture za plažu koju možete zamisliti ili želite imati na plaži. Ovdje ćete naći obilje pijeska, prirodnog hlada i trave, a da ne spominjemo nekoliko kilometara dugu plažu koja se može protegnuti do maksimalno 75 metara &scaron;irine. Do plaže se može doći svim vrstama vozila, uključujući i kampere, a parkirati se gotovo neposredno ispred plaže, udaljene svega 50 metara. Budući da se ova plaža nalazi u sredi&scaron;tu turističkog odredi&scaron;ta, možete očekivati ​​brojne turističke usluge. U visokoj sezoni plaža je vrlo prometna. Nagib plaže ima normalan nagib, koji dosta brzo pada nakon ulaska u vodu, možete početi plivati ​​nakon 5 metara nakon ulaska u vodu. Ako ste ljubitelj prirodnih nijansi, ovdje ćete ih pronaći. Na raspolaganju je mnogo različitih tipova smje&scaron;taja, neki udaljeni samo nekoliko metara, a na popisu su i hotel i kamp. Dugačak je i popis svih vrsta hrane, &scaron;to vrijedi i za sve vrste beach barova. Ako imate psa, dobrodo&scaron;li ste ovdje. Čak i oni koji se vole zabavljati i plesati uz modernu ili tradicionalnu glazbu naći će mjesta. Budući da se mnogi turisti vole baviti sportovima na plaži, ova plaža je opremljena i nekim tipičnim sportskim terenima, poput odbojke na pijesku. Pa &scaron;to čeka&scaron;. Pronađite odgovarajući smje&scaron;taj za sebe i krenite u svoju novu avanturu na plaži. I zapamtite, uvijek koristite BeachRex kako biste prona&scaron;li savr&scaron;enu plažu za vas. Uživajte na plaži.', 3422, 'hr', 1),
(2023, 'Паралия Аспровальта - идеальный пляж для вашей семьи. Он расположен в регионе Кентрики-Македония в Аспровальте и имеет почти самую пляжную инфраструктуру, которую вы можете себе представить или захотите иметь на пляже. Здесь вы найдете много песка, естественной тени и травы, не говоря уже о пляже протяженностью в несколько километров, ширина которого может достигать 75 метров. До пляжа можно добраться на всех типах транспортных средств, в том числе на автодомах, и вы можете припарковаться почти прямо перед пляжем, всего в 50 метрах от отеля. Поскольку этот пляж расположен в центре туристического направления, вы можете рассчитывать на наличие множества туристических услуг. В высокий сезон пляж очень загружен. Склон пляжа имеет нормальный уклон, который довольно быстро спадает после входа в воду, можно начинать плавание через 5 метров после входа в воду. Если вы поклонник натуральных оттенков, вы найдете их здесь. Есть много различных типов жилья, некоторые из которых находятся всего в нескольких метрах, а также отель и кемпинг. Существует также длинный список всевозможных блюд, который распространяется и на все виды пляжных баров. Если у вас есть собака, милости просим. Даже те, кто любит повеселиться и потанцевать под современную или традиционную музыку, найдут для себя места. Поскольку многие туристы любят заниматься пляжными видами спорта, этот пляж также оборудован некоторыми типичными спортивными площадками, такими как пляжный волейбол. Так чего же ты ждешь. Найдите подходящее жилье и отправляйтесь в новое приключение на пляже. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти идеальный пляж для вас. Наслаждайтесь пляжем.', 3422, 'ru', 1),
(2024, 'Paralia Asprovalta ist der perfekte Strand f&uuml;r Ihre Familie. Es liegt in der Region Kentriki Makedonia von Asprovalta und hat fast die meiste Strandinfrastruktur, die man sich am Strand vorstellen kann oder haben m&ouml;chte. Hier finden Sie viel Sand, nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten und Gras, ganz zu schweigen von einem wenigen Kilometer langen Strand, der sich bis zu einer maximalen Breite von 75 Metern erstrecken kann. Der Strand ist mit allen Arten von Fahrzeugen, einschlie&szlig;lich Wohnmobilen, erreichbar und Sie k&ouml;nnen fast direkt vor dem Strand parken, nur 50 Meter entfernt. Da sich dieser Strand mitten in einem Touristenziel befindet, k&ouml;nnen Sie mit vielen touristischen Dienstleistungen rechnen. In der Hochsaison ist der Strand sehr voll. Das Gef&auml;lle des Strandes hat ein normales Gef&auml;lle, das nach dem Betreten des Wassers recht schnell abf&auml;llt, man kann nach 5 Metern nach dem Betreten des Wassers mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Wenn Sie ein Fan von Natur schatten sind, finden Sie sie hier. Es gibt viele verschiedene Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften, einige nur wenige Meter entfernt, und auch das Hotel und der Campingplatz stehen auf der Liste. Es gibt auch eine lange Liste an Speisen aller Art, die auch f&uuml;r alle Arten von Strandbars gilt. Wenn Sie einen Hund haben, sind Sie hier herzlich willkommen. Auch wer gerne Spa&szlig; hat und zu moderner oder traditioneller Musik tanzt, wird einiges finden. Da viele Urlauber gerne Strandsport betreiben, ist dieser Strand auch mit einigen typischen Sportpl&auml;tzen, wie zum Beispiel Beachvolleyball, ausgestattet. Also, worauf wartest Du. Finden Sie die richtige Unterkunft f&uuml;r sich und starten Sie Ihr neues Abenteuer am Strand. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r Sie zu finden. Genie&szlig;e den Strand.', 3422, 'de', 1),
(2025, 'Paralia Asprovalta &egrave; la spiaggia perfetta per la tua famiglia. Si trova nella regione Kentriki Makedonia di Asprovalta e ha quasi la maggior parte delle infrastrutture balneari che puoi immaginare o desiderare di avere sulla spiaggia. Qui troverai molta sabbia, ombra naturale ed erba, per non parlare di una spiaggia lunga pochi chilometri che pu&ograve; estendersi fino a un massimo di 75 metri di larghezza. La spiaggia &egrave; raggiungibile con tutti i tipi di veicoli, camper compresi, ed &egrave; possibile parcheggiare quasi direttamente davanti alla spiaggia, a soli 50 metri di distanza. Poich&eacute; questa spiaggia si trova nel mezzo di una destinazione turistica, puoi aspettarti di avere molti servizi turistici disponibili. In alta stagione, la spiaggia &egrave; molto frequentata. La pendenza della spiaggia ha una pendenza normale, che scende abbastanza velocemente dopo essere entrati in acqua, si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare dopo 5 metri dopo essere entrati in acqua. Se sei un fan delle tonalit&agrave; naturali, le troverai qui. Ci sono molti diversi tipi di alloggi disponibili, alcuni a pochi metri di distanza, e anche l&#39;hotel e il campeggio sono nella lista. C&#39;&egrave; anche una lunga lista di tutti i tipi di cibo, che si applica anche a tutti i tipi di bar sulla spiaggia. Se hai un cane, qui sei il benvenuto. Anche chi ama divertirsi e ballare musica moderna o tradizionale trover&agrave; dei posti. Poich&eacute; molti turisti amano praticare sport da spiaggia, questa spiaggia &egrave; attrezzata anche con alcuni campi sportivi tipici, come il beach volley. Allora, cosa stai aspettando. Trova la sistemazione giusta per te e intraprendi la tua nuova avventura in spiaggia. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia perfetta per te. Goditi la spiaggia.', 3422, 'it', 1),
(2026, 'Paralia Asprovalta est la plage parfaite pour votre famille. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion de Kentriki Makedonia &agrave; Asprovalta et poss&egrave;de presque le plus d&#39;infrastructures de plage que vous puissiez imaginer ou vouloir avoir sur la plage. Ici, vous trouverez beaucoup de sable, d&#39;ombre naturelle et d&#39;herbe, sans oublier une plage de quelques kilom&egrave;tres de long qui peut s&#39;&eacute;tendre jusqu&#39;&agrave; un maximum de 75 m&egrave;tres de large. La plage est accessible par tous les types de v&eacute;hicules, y compris les camping-cars, et vous pouvez vous garer presque directement en face de la plage, &agrave; seulement 50 m&egrave;tres. Puisque cette plage est situ&eacute;e au milieu d&#39;une destination touristique, vous pouvez vous attendre &agrave; avoir de nombreux services touristiques disponibles. En haute saison, la plage est tr&egrave;s fr&eacute;quent&eacute;e. La pente de la plage a une pente normale, qui tombe assez rapidement apr&egrave;s &ecirc;tre entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau, vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s 5 m&egrave;tres apr&egrave;s &ecirc;tre entr&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. Si vous &ecirc;tes fan des teintes naturelles, vous les trouverez ici. Il existe de nombreux types d&#39;h&eacute;bergements diff&eacute;rents, certains &agrave; quelques m&egrave;tres seulement, et l&#39;h&ocirc;tel et le camping sont &eacute;galement sur la liste. Il existe &eacute;galement une longue liste de toutes sortes de nourriture, qui s&#39;applique &eacute;galement &agrave; toutes sortes de bars de plage. Si vous avez un chien, vous &ecirc;tes le bienvenu ici. M&ecirc;me ceux qui aiment s&#39;amuser et danser sur de la musique moderne ou traditionnelle trouveront des endroits. Comme de nombreux touristes aiment faire des sports de plage, cette plage est &eacute;galement &eacute;quip&eacute;e de quelques terrains de sport typiques, comme le beach-volley. Alors qu&#39;est-ce que tu attends. Trouvez le logement qui vous convient et embarquez pour votre nouvelle aventure sur la plage. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage parfaite pour vous. Profites de la plage.', 3422, 'fr', 1),
(2027, 'Paralia Asprovalta es la playa perfecta para tu familia. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Kentriki Makedonia de Asprovalta y tiene casi la mayor infraestructura de playa que pueda imaginar o desear tener en la playa. Aqu&iacute; encontrar&aacute; mucha arena, sombra natural y c&eacute;sped, sin olvidar una playa de pocos kil&oacute;metros que puede extenderse hasta un m&aacute;ximo de 75 metros de ancho. Se puede llegar a la playa en todo tipo de veh&iacute;culos, incluidas las autocaravanas, y se puede aparcar casi directamente en frente de la playa, a solo 50 metros de distancia. Dado que esta playa se encuentra en medio de un destino tur&iacute;stico, puede esperar tener muchos servicios tur&iacute;sticos disponibles. En temporada alta, la playa est&aacute; muy concurrida. La pendiente de la playa tiene una pendiente normal, la cual cae bastante r&aacute;pido despu&eacute;s de entrar al agua, puedes empezar a nadar a los 5 metros despu&eacute;s de entrar al agua. Si eres fan&aacute;tico de las tonalidades naturales, aqu&iacute; las encontrar&aacute;s. Hay muchos tipos diferentes de alojamiento disponibles, algunos a solo unos metros de distancia, y el hotel y el camping tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n en la lista. Tambi&eacute;n hay una larga lista de todo tipo de comida, que tambi&eacute;n se aplica a todo tipo de chiringuitos. Si tienes un perro, eres bienvenido aqu&iacute;. Incluso aquellos a los que les gusta divertirse y bailar con m&uacute;sica moderna o tradicional encontrar&aacute;n algunos lugares. Dado que a muchos turistas les gusta hacer deportes de playa, esta playa tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; equipada con algunos campos deportivos t&iacute;picos, como el voleibol de playa. Entonces, Qu&eacute; esperas. Encuentra el alojamiento adecuado para ti y emb&aacute;rcate en tu nueva aventura en la playa. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa perfecta para usted. Disfruta la playa.', 3422, 'es', 1),
(2028, 'Ta pe&scaron;čena plaža, ki je ena prvih turističnih plaž v regiji Kentriki Makedonia, se nahaja v bližini mesta Logkari. Parkiri&scaron;če je ogromno in ponuja parkiri&scaron;če tako za običajna vozila kot za avtodom. Ker lahko parkirate pred plažo, morate res hoditi le nekaj metrov do plaže. Na parkiri&scaron;ču je celo nekaj dreves, da bo va&scaron; avto hladen v vročem poletju. Družinam bo ta plaža v&scaron;eč. Skupna dolžina je približno 1 kilometer, največja &scaron;irina pa 40 metrov. Nagib plaže je normalen, plavalna točka pa je približno pri 30 metrih. Na plaži je celo nekaj trave. Kot je v Grčiji običajno, lahko psa pripeljete tudi na to plažo. Če vam je v&scaron;eč odbojka na mivki, imate tukaj igri&scaron;če. Za va&scaron;o varnost skrbi tudi re&scaron;evalec iz vode. Na plaži je bar na plaži in nekaj osnovne infrastrukture za plažo. Namestitev je možna samo v obliki apartmajev. Torej, kaj &scaron;e čaka&scaron;. Poi&scaron;čite pravo namestitev zase in se odpravite na svojo novo avanturo na plaži. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, če želite najti popolno plažo zase. Uživajte na plaži.', 3421, 'sl', 1),
(2029, 'Ova pje&scaron;čana plaža, jedna od prvih turističkih plaža u regiji Kentriki Makedonia, nalazi se u blizini grada Logkari. Parkirali&scaron;te je ogromno i nudi parking i za klasična vozila i za kamper. Budući da možete parkirati ispred plaže, zapravo morate pro&scaron;etati samo nekoliko metara do plaže. Na parkirali&scaron;tu je čak i nekoliko stabala kako bi va&scaron; automobil rashladio tijekom vrućeg ljeta. Obitelji će voljeti ovu plažu. Ukupna dužina je oko 1 kilometar, a maksimalna &scaron;irina 40 metara. Nagib plaže je normalan, a kupali&scaron;te je oko 30 metara. Na plaži ima čak i trave. Kako je u Grčkoj običaj, na ovu plažu možete dovesti i psa. Ako volite odbojku na pijesku, ovdje imate igrali&scaron;te. O va&scaron;oj sigurnosti brine se i spasilac iz vode. Na plaži se nalazi beach bar i osnovna infrastruktura za plažu. Smje&scaron;taj je moguć samo u obliku apartmana. Pa &scaron;to čeka&scaron;. Pronađite odgovarajući smje&scaron;taj za sebe i krenite u svoju novu avanturu na plaži. I zapamtite, uvijek koristite BeachRex kako biste prona&scaron;li savr&scaron;enu plažu za vas. Uživajte na plaži.', 3421, 'hr', 1),
(2030, 'Esta playa de arena, una de las primeras playas tur&iacute;sticas de la regi&oacute;n de Kentriki Makedonia, se encuentra cerca de la ciudad de Logkari. El estacionamiento es enorme y ofrece estacionamiento tanto para veh&iacute;culos convencionales como para autocaravanas. Como puedes aparcar frente a la playa, solo tienes que caminar unos metros hasta la playa. Incluso hay algunos &aacute;rboles en el estacionamiento para mantener su autom&oacute;vil fresco en el caluroso verano. A las familias les encantar&aacute; esta playa. La longitud total es de aproximadamente 1 kil&oacute;metro y la anchura m&aacute;xima es de 40 metros. La pendiente de la playa es normal y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a unos 30 metros. Incluso hay algo de c&eacute;sped en la playa. Como es costumbre en Grecia, tambi&eacute;n puedes traer un perro a esta playa. Si te gusta el voleibol de playa, aqu&iacute; tienes un parque infantil. Un socorrista del agua tambi&eacute;n se ocupa de su seguridad. En la playa hay un chiringuito y una infraestructura de playa b&aacute;sica. El alojamiento solo es posible en forma de apartamentos. Entonces, Qu&eacute; esperas. Encuentra el alojamiento adecuado para ti y emb&aacute;rcate en tu nueva aventura en la playa. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa perfecta para usted. Disfruta la playa.', 3421, 'es', 1),
(2031, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cette plage de sable, l&#39;une des premi&egrave;res plages touristiques de la r&eacute;gion de Kentriki Makedonia, est situ&eacute;e pr&egrave;s de la ville de Logkari. Le parking est immense et offre un parking pour les v&eacute;hicules conventionnels et un camping-car. Comme vous pouvez vous garer devant la plage, vous n&#39;avez vraiment qu&#39;&agrave; marcher quelques m&egrave;tres jusqu&#39;&agrave; la plage. Il y a m&ecirc;me quelques arbres dans le parking pour garder votre voiture au frais pendant l&#39;&eacute;t&eacute; chaud. Les familles adoreront cette plage. La longueur totale est d&#39;environ 1 kilom&egrave;tre et la largeur maximale est de 40 m&egrave;tres. La pente de la plage est normale et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 30 m&egrave;tres. Il y a m&ecirc;me de l&#39;herbe sur la plage. Comme il est de coutume en Gr&egrave;ce, vous pouvez &eacute;galement amener un chien sur cette plage. Si vous aimez le beach-volley, vous avez une aire de jeux ici. Un sauveteur de l&#39;eau veille &eacute;galement &agrave; votre s&eacute;curit&eacute;. Sur la plage, il y a un bar de plage et quelques infrastructures de plage de base. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est possible que sous forme d&#39;appartements. Alors qu&#39;est-ce que tu attends. Trouvez le logement qui vous convient et embarquez pour votre nouvelle aventure sur la plage. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage parfaite pour vous. Profites de la plage.</div>\n', 3421, 'fr', 1),
(2032, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Questa spiaggia sabbiosa, una delle prime spiagge turistiche della regione di Kentriki Makedonia, si trova vicino alla citt&agrave; di Logkari. Il parcheggio &egrave; enorme e offre parcheggio sia per veicoli convenzionali che per camper. Dato che puoi parcheggiare di fronte alla spiaggia, devi solo camminare per pochi metri per raggiungere la spiaggia. Ci sono anche alcuni alberi nel parcheggio per mantenere l&#39;auto fresca nella calda estate. Le famiglie adoreranno questa spiaggia. La lunghezza totale &egrave; di circa 1 chilometro e la larghezza massima &egrave; di 40 metri. La pendenza della spiaggia &egrave; normale e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 30 metri. C&#39;&egrave; anche un po&#39; d&#39;erba sulla spiaggia. Come &egrave; consuetudine in Grecia, puoi anche portare un cane su questa spiaggia. Se ti piace il beach volley, qui hai un parco giochi. Un bagnino dall&#39;acqua si prende cura anche della tua sicurezza. Sulla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un bar sulla spiaggia e alcune infrastrutture di base sulla spiaggia. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; possibile solo sotto forma di appartamenti. Allora, cosa stai aspettando. Trova la sistemazione giusta per te e intraprendi la tua nuova avventura in spiaggia. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia perfetta per te. Goditi la spiaggia.</div>\n', 3421, 'it', 1),
(2033, 'Dieser Sandstrand, einer der ersten Touristenstr&auml;nde in der Region Kentriki Makedonia, befindet sich in der N&auml;he der Stadt Logkari. Der Parkplatz ist riesig und bietet sowohl Stellpl&auml;tze f&uuml;r konventionelle Fahrzeuge als auch f&uuml;r ein Wohnmobil. Da man vor dem Strand parken kann, muss man wirklich nur wenige Meter zum Strand laufen. Es gibt sogar ein paar B&auml;ume auf dem Parkplatz, um Ihr Auto im hei&szlig;en Sommer k&uuml;hl zu halten. Familien werden diesen Strand lieben. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt etwa 1 Kilometer und die maximale Breite betr&auml;gt 40 Meter. Die Steigung des Strandes ist normal und die Badestelle betr&auml;gt ca. 30 Meter. Es gibt sogar etwas Gras am Strand. Wie in Griechenland &uuml;blich, k&ouml;nnen Sie an diesem Strand auch einen Hund mitbringen. Wenn Sie Beachvolleyball m&ouml;gen, haben Sie hier einen Spielplatz. Ein Bademeister aus dem Wasser sorgt auch f&uuml;r Ihre Sicherheit. Am Strand gibt es eine Strandbar und eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur. Die Unterbringung ist nur in Form von Appartements m&ouml;glich. Also, worauf wartest Du. Finden Sie die richtige Unterkunft f&uuml;r sich und starten Sie Ihr neues Abenteuer am Strand. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r Sie zu finden. Genie&szlig;e den Strand.', 3421, 'de', 1),
(2034, 'Этот песчаный пляж, один из первых туристических пляжей в регионе Кентрики Македония, расположен недалеко от города Логкари. Парковка огромна и предлагает парковку как для обычных транспортных средств, так и для автодома. Поскольку вы можете припарковаться перед пляжем, вам действительно нужно пройти всего несколько метров до пляжа. На парковке даже есть несколько деревьев, чтобы ваша машина оставалась прохладной жарким летом. Семьям понравится этот пляж. Общая длина составляет около 1 километра, а максимальная ширина - 40 метров. Уклон пляжа нормальный, место для купания около 30 метров. На пляже даже есть трава. Как это принято в Греции, на этот пляж можно также привести собаку. Если вам нравится пляжный волейбол, у вас есть детская площадка. Спасатель с воды также позаботится о вашей безопасности. На пляже есть пляжный бар и базовая пляжная инфраструктура. Размещение возможно только в виде квартир. Так чего же ты ждешь. Найдите подходящее жилье и отправляйтесь в новое приключение на пляже. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти идеальный пляж для вас. Наслаждайтесь пляжем.', 3421, 'ru', 1),
(2035, 'Если вы хотите почувствовать греческий олимпийский дух, вам следует посетить песчаный пляж Паралия Олимпиада в восточной части региона Кентраки Македония. Место, где вас ждет этот пляж, называется Олимпийскими играми. Доступ к пляжу очень легкий, и вы можете припарковаться почти прямо перед пляжем, всего в нескольких метрах от отеля. Также приветствуются автодома. Основная поверхность пляжа песчаная и простирается на 750 метров в длину и 30 метров в ширину. Уклон пляжа нормальный, можно начинать плавать с 5 метров, глубина увеличивается очень быстро. Естественной тени в виде деревьев здесь нет, но зонтики можно взять напрокат. Окрестности пляжа довольно туристические, не так сильно, как в небольшом туристическом городке, поэтому вы можете рассчитывать на наличие множества туристических услуг. Инфраструктура на пляже огромная; у вас есть много доступных пляжных услуг. Конечно, здесь много спортивных площадок и несколько детских площадок. Рядом с пляжем также есть парк с большим количеством травы. Пляжные бары и рестораны расположены на пляже или рядом с ним, до 50 метров от пляжа. Если вы хотите остаться здесь подольше, вы можете остановиться во многих апартаментах, расположенных в непосредственной близости от пляжа. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти свой идеальный пляж. Наслаждайтесь пляжем.', 3424, 'ru', 1),
(2036, 'Če želite začutiti nekaj gr&scaron;kega olimpijskega duha, morate obiskati to pe&scaron;čeno plažo po imenu Paralia Olympiada v vzhodnem delu regije Kentraki Makedonia. Mesto, kjer vas čaka ta plaža, se imenuje Olimpiada. Dostop do plaže je zelo enostaven in lahko parkirate skoraj neposredno pred plažo, le nekaj metrov stran, dobrodo&scaron;li so tudi avtodomi. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je pe&scaron;čena in se razteza 750 metrov v dolžino in 30 metrov v &scaron;irino. Nagib plaže je normalen in plavati lahko začnete že pri 5 metrih, globina se zelo hitro povečuje. Naravna senca v obliki dreves tukaj ni na voljo, lahko pa si najamete nekaj senčnikov. Okolica plaže je precej turistična, ne preveč, kot v majhnem turističnem mestu, tako da lahko pričakujete, da boste imeli na voljo kar nekaj turističnih storitev. Infrastruktura na plaži je ogromna; na voljo imate &scaron;tevilne storitve na plaži. Seveda je tukaj veliko &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č in nekaj otro&scaron;kih igri&scaron;č. V bližini plaže je tudi park z veliko trave. Bari in restavracije na plaži so na voljo na plaži ali v bližini, oddaljeni največ 50 metrov od plaže. Če bi radi tu ostali dlje, lahko bivate v mnogih apartmajih, ki se nahajajo zelo blizu plaže. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo popolno plažo. Uživajte na plaži.', 3424, 'sl', 1),
(2037, 'Ako želite osjetiti ne&scaron;to od grčkog olimpijskog duha, trebali biste posjetiti ovu pje&scaron;čanu plažu pod nazivom Paralia Olympiada u istočnom dijelu regije Kentraki Makedonia. Mjesto gdje vas čeka ova plaža zove se Olimpijske igre. Pristup plaži je vrlo jednostavan i možete parkirati gotovo direktno ispred plaže, samo nekoliko metara dalje, dobrodo&scaron;li su i motorni domovi. Glavna povr&scaron;ina plaže je pje&scaron;čana i proteže se 750 metara u dužinu i 30 metara u &scaron;irinu. Nagib plaže je normalan i možete početi plivati ​​na 5 metara, dubina se vrlo brzo povećava. Prirodni hlad u obliku drveća ovdje nije dostupan, ali možete iznajmiti neke suncobrane. Okolica plaže je prilično turistička, ne previ&scaron;e kao u malom turističkom mjestu, tako da možete očekivati ​​dosta turističkih usluga. Infrastruktura na plaži je ogromna; imate na raspolaganju mnoge usluge na plaži. Naravno, ovdje ima dosta sportskih terena i nekoliko dječjih igrali&scaron;ta. U blizini plaže nalazi se i park s puno trave. Beach barovi i restorani dostupni su na ili u blizini plaže, do 50 metara od plaže. Ako želite ostati ovdje duže, možete boraviti u brojnim apartmanima koji se nalaze u neposrednoj blizini plaže. I zapamtite, uvijek koristite BeachRex da pronađete svoju savr&scaron;enu plažu. Uživajte na plaži.', 3424, 'hr', 1),
(2038, 'Si desea sentir algo del esp&iacute;ritu ol&iacute;mpico griego, debe visitar esta playa de arena llamada Paralia Olympiada en la parte este de la regi&oacute;n de Kentraki Makedonia. El lugar donde te espera esta playa se llama Olimpiadas. El acceso a la playa es muy f&aacute;cil y se puede aparcar casi directamente en frente de la playa, a escasos metros, las autocaravanas tambi&eacute;n son bienvenidas. La superficie principal de la playa es de arena y tiene una longitud de 750 metros y una anchura de 30 metros. La pendiente de la playa es normal y puedes empezar a nadar a los 5 metros, la profundidad aumenta muy r&aacute;pido. La sombra natural en forma de &aacute;rboles no est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute;, pero puede alquilar algunas sombrillas. Los alrededores de la playa son bastante tur&iacute;sticos, no demasiado como en una peque&ntilde;a ciudad tur&iacute;stica, por lo que puede esperar tener bastantes servicios tur&iacute;sticos disponibles. La infraestructura en la playa es enorme; tienes muchos servicios de playa disponibles. Por supuesto, aqu&iacute; hay muchos campos deportivos y algunos parques infantiles. Cerca de la playa tambi&eacute;n hay un parque con mucho c&eacute;sped. Hay bares y restaurantes en la playa o cerca de la playa, hasta a 50 metros de la playa. Si quieres quedarte m&aacute;s tiempo aqu&iacute;, puedes alojarte en muchos apartamentos ubicados muy cerca de la playa. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta. Disfruta la playa.', 3424, 'es', 1),
(2039, 'Si vous voulez ressentir un peu de l&#39;esprit olympique grec, vous devriez visiter cette plage de sable appel&eacute;e Paralia Olympiada dans la partie orientale de la r&eacute;gion de Kentraki Makedonia. L&#39;endroit o&ugrave; cette plage vous attend s&#39;appelle les Jeux Olympiques. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s facile et vous pouvez vous garer presque directement devant la plage, &agrave; quelques m&egrave;tres seulement, les camping-cars sont &eacute;galement les bienvenus. La surface principale de la plage est sablonneuse et s&#39;&eacute;tend sur 750 m&egrave;tres de long et 30 m&egrave;tres de large. La pente de la plage est normale et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager &agrave; 5 m&egrave;tres, la profondeur augmente tr&egrave;s rapidement. L&#39;ombre naturelle sous forme d&#39;arbres n&#39;est pas disponible ici, mais vous pouvez louer des parasols. Les environs de la plage sont assez touristiques, pas trop comme dans une petite ville touristique, vous pouvez donc vous attendre &agrave; avoir pas mal de services touristiques disponibles. L&#39;infrastructure sur la plage est &eacute;norme ; vous avez de nombreux services de plage disponibles. Bien s&ucirc;r, il y a beaucoup de terrains de sport et quelques aires de jeux pour enfants ici. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, il y a aussi un parc avec beaucoup d&#39;herbe. Des bars et des restaurants de plage sont disponibles sur ou &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la plage, jusqu&#39;&agrave; 50 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Si vous souhaitez rester ici plus longtemps, vous pouvez s&eacute;journer dans de nombreux appartements situ&eacute;s tr&egrave;s pr&egrave;s de la plage. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre plage parfaite. Profites de la plage.', 3424, 'fr', 1),
(2040, 'Se vuoi sentire un po&#39; dello spirito olimpico greco, dovresti visitare questa spiaggia sabbiosa chiamata Paralia Olympiada nella parte orientale della regione del Kentraki Makedonia. Il luogo dove ti aspetta questa spiaggia si chiama Olimpiadi. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto facile e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare quasi direttamente davanti alla spiaggia, a pochi metri di distanza, anche i camper sono i benvenuti. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; sabbiosa e si estende per 750 metri di lunghezza e 30 metri di larghezza. La pendenza della spiaggia &egrave; normale e puoi iniziare a nuotare a 5 metri, la profondit&agrave; aumenta molto rapidamente. L&#39;ombra naturale sotto forma di alberi non &egrave; disponibile qui, ma &egrave; possibile noleggiare alcuni ombrelloni. I dintorni della spiaggia sono piuttosto turistici, non troppo come in una piccola citt&agrave; turistica, quindi puoi aspettarti di avere a disposizione parecchi servizi turistici. L&#39;infrastruttura sulla spiaggia &egrave; enorme; hai a disposizione molti servizi in spiaggia. Naturalmente, qui ci sono molti campi sportivi e alcuni parchi giochi per bambini. Vicino alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; anche un parco con tanto prato. Bar e ristoranti sulla spiaggia sono disponibili sulla o vicino alla spiaggia, fino a 50 metri dalla spiaggia. Se desideri rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo, puoi soggiornare in molti appartamenti situati molto vicino alla spiaggia. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta. Goditi la spiaggia.', 3424, 'it', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(2041, 'Wenn Sie etwas vom griechischen olympischen Geist sp&uuml;ren m&ouml;chten, sollten Sie diesen Sandstrand namens Paralia Olympiada im &ouml;stlichen Teil der Region Kentraki Makedonia besuchen. Der Ort, an dem Sie dieser Strand erwartet, hei&szlig;t Olympia. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und man kann fast direkt vor dem Strand parken, nur wenige Meter entfernt, auch Wohnmobile sind willkommen. Die Hauptfl&auml;che des Strandes ist sandig und erstreckt sich &uuml;ber 750 Meter L&auml;nge und 30 Meter Breite. Die Steigung des Strandes ist normal und man kann ab 5 Metern mit dem Schwimmen beginnen, die Tiefe nimmt sehr schnell zu. Nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten in Form von B&auml;umen gibt es hier nicht, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen einige Sonnenschirme mieten. Die Umgebung des Strandes ist ziemlich touristisch, nicht zu sehr wie in einer kleinen Touristenstadt, so dass Sie einige touristische Dienstleistungen erwarten k&ouml;nnen. Die Infrastruktur am Strand ist riesig; Sie haben viele Strandservices zur Verf&uuml;gung. Nat&uuml;rlich gibt es hier jede Menge Sportpl&auml;tze und ein paar Kinderspielpl&auml;tze. In der N&auml;he des Strandes gibt es auch einen Park mit viel Gras. Strandbars und Restaurants befinden sich am oder in Strandn&auml;he, bis zu 50 Meter vom Strand entfernt. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hier bleiben m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie in vielen Apartments in unmittelbarer Strandn&auml;he &uuml;bernachten. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden. Genie&szlig;e den Strand.', 3424, 'de', 1),
(2042, 'Ali i&scaron;čete veliko otro&scaron;kih igri&scaron;č in naravne sence, s pe&scaron;čeno plažo za svojo družino, ko greste na plažo? Če je tako, je paralia Stratoniu ravno prava za vas, ne boste razočarani, verjemite mi, videl sem veliko plaž in to bi priporočal vsaki družini. Na plaži je celo majhen park. Kot je običajno v Grčiji, je tudi ta plaža lahko dostopna in lahko parkirate neposredno pred plažo. Parkiri&scaron;če je dovolj veliko, da sprejme tudi avtodome. Mestece Stratoniu je znano po podzemnem rudniku srebra, svinca in cinka. Plaža je dolga 750 metrov in je &scaron;iroka do 50 metrov. Nagib plaže je normalen in plavati lahko začnete že pri 5 metrih po vstopu v vodo. Tukaj imate na voljo &scaron;tevilne objekte in storitve na plaži. Restavracije in nekateri bari na plaži so na voljo na plaži neposredno ali v njeni bližini. Namestitev je možna predvsem v obliki apartmajev ali prostih sob, ki so tudi v bližini. Torej, kaj &scaron;e čaka&scaron;. Poi&scaron;čite pravo namestitev zase in se odpravite na svojo novo avanturo na plaži. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, če želite najti popolno plažo zase. Uživajte na plaži.', 3425, 'sl', 1),
(2043, 'Tražite li puno dječjih igrali&scaron;ta i prirodne hladovine, s pje&scaron;čanom plažom za svoju obitelj, kada idete na plažu? Ako je tako, paralia Stratoniu je ba&scaron; prava za vas, nećete se razočarati, vjerujte, vidio sam mnogo plaža, a ovu bih preporučio svakoj obitelji. Na samoj plaži postoji čak i mali park. Kao &scaron;to je to uobičajeno u Grčkoj, ova plaža je lako dostupna i možete parkirati direktno ispred plaže. Parking je dovoljno velik da primi čak i kampere. Gradić Stratoniu poznat je po svom podzemnom rudniku srebra, olova i cinka. Plaža je ukupne dužine 750 metara i &scaron;irine do 50 metara. Nagib plaže je normalan i možete početi plivati ​​već na 5 metara nakon ulaska u vodu. Ovdje imate mnogo sadržaja i usluga na plaži. Restorani i neki beach barovi dostupni su na samoj plaži ili u njezinoj blizini. Smje&scaron;taj je moguć uglavnom u obliku apartmana ili slobodnih soba, koji se također nalaze u blizini. Pa &scaron;to čeka&scaron;. Pronađite odgovarajući smje&scaron;taj za sebe i krenite u svoju novu avanturu na plaži. I zapamtite, uvijek koristite BeachRex ako želite pronaći savr&scaron;enu plažu za vas. Uživajte na plaži.', 3425, 'hr', 1),
(2044, 'Вы ищете много детских площадок и естественной тени, с песчаным пляжем для вашей семьи, когда собираетесь на пляж? Если это так, то паралия Стратониу - это то, что вам нужно, вы не будете разочарованы, поверьте мне, я видел много пляжей, и этот я бы порекомендовал каждой семье. Прямо на берегу есть даже небольшой парк. Как и обычно в Греции, этот пляж легко доступен, и вы можете припарковаться прямо перед ним. Парковка достаточно большая, чтобы вместить даже автодома. Небольшой городок Стратониу знаменит своим подземным серебряно-свинцово-цинковым рудником. Пляж имеет общую длину 750 метров и ширину до 50 метров. Наклон пляжа нормальный, плавать можно уже через 5 метров после входа в воду. Здесь вам предложат множество пляжных удобств и услуг. Рестораны и некоторые пляжные бары расположены прямо на пляже или поблизости от него. Жилье доступно в основном в виде квартир или свободных комнат, которые также находятся поблизости. Так чего же ты ждешь. Найдите подходящее жилье для себя, и вы отправитесь в новое пляжное приключение. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, если хотите найти для себя идеальный пляж. Наслаждайтесь своим пляжем.', 3425, 'ru', 1),
(2045, '&iquest;Buscas muchos parques infantiles y sombra natural, con una playa de arena para tu familia, a la hora de ir a la playa? Si es as&iacute;, la paralia Stratoniu es la adecuada para ti, no te decepcionar&aacute;, cr&eacute;eme, he visto muchas playas, y estas las recomendar&iacute;a a todas las familias. Incluso hay un peque&ntilde;o parque en la playa. Como es habitual en Grecia, tambi&eacute;n esta playa es de f&aacute;cil acceso y se puede aparcar directamente en frente de la playa. El aparcamiento es lo suficientemente grande como para acoger incluso autocaravanas. La peque&ntilde;a ciudad de Stratoniu es famosa por su mina subterr&aacute;nea de plata, plomo y zinc. La playa tiene una longitud total de 750 metros y una anchura de hasta 50 metros. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es normal y ya puedes empezar a nadar a los 5 metros despu&eacute;s de entrar al agua. Tiene muchas instalaciones y servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;. Restaurantes y algunos chiringuitos est&aacute;n disponibles en la playa directamente o en sus alrededores. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible principalmente en forma de apartamentos o habitaciones libres, que tambi&eacute;n se encuentran en las inmediaciones. Entonces, Qu&eacute; esperas. Encuentra el alojamiento adecuado para ti y listo para tu nueva aventura en la playa. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex si desea encontrar la playa perfecta para usted. Disfruta tu playa.', 3425, 'es', 1),
(2046, 'Cherchez-vous beaucoup d&#39;aires de jeux pour enfants et d&#39;ombre naturelle, avec une plage de sable pour votre famille, lorsque vous allez &agrave; la plage ? Si c&#39;est le cas, le paralia Stratoniu est fait pour vous, vous ne serez pas d&eacute;&ccedil;u, croyez-moi, j&#39;ai vu de nombreuses plages, et celles-ci je la recommanderais &agrave; toutes les familles. Il y a m&ecirc;me un petit parc juste sur la plage. Comme d&#39;habitude en Gr&egrave;ce, cette plage est &eacute;galement facilement accessible et vous pouvez vous garer directement en face de la plage. Le parking est assez grand pour accueillir m&ecirc;me les camping-cars. La petite ville de Stratoniu est c&eacute;l&egrave;bre pour sa mine souterraine d&#39;argent-plomb-zinc. La plage a une longueur totale de 750 m&egrave;tres et une largeur allant jusqu&#39;&agrave; 50 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est normale et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager d&egrave;s 5 m&egrave;tres apr&egrave;s &ecirc;tre entr&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. Vous avez de nombreuses installations et services de plage disponibles ici. Des restaurants et quelques bars de plage sont disponibles sur la plage directement ou &agrave; proximit&eacute;. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements ou de chambres libres, qui sont &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Alors qu&#39;est-ce que tu attends. Trouvez l&#39;h&eacute;bergement qui vous convient et partez pour votre nouvelle aventure &agrave; la plage. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex si vous souhaitez trouver la plage parfaite pour vous. Profitez de votre plage.', 3425, 'fr', 1),
(2047, 'Suchen Sie viele Kinderspielpl&auml;tze und nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten, mit einem Sandstrand f&uuml;r Ihre Familie, wenn Sie an den Strand gehen? Dann ist das Paralia Stratoniu genau das Richtige f&uuml;r Sie, Sie werden nicht entt&auml;uscht sein, glauben Sie mir, ich habe viele Str&auml;nde gesehen, und diese w&uuml;rde ich jeder Familie empfehlen. Es gibt sogar einen kleinen Park direkt am Strand. Wie in Griechenland &uuml;blich ist auch dieser Strand gut erreichbar und man kann direkt vor dem Strand parken. Der Parkplatz ist gro&szlig; genug, um sogar Wohnmobile aufzunehmen. Die Kleinstadt Stratoniu ist ber&uuml;hmt f&uuml;r ihre unterirdische Silber-Blei-Zink-Mine. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 750 Metern und ist bis zu 50 Meter breit. Die Strandneigung ist normal und Sie k&ouml;nnen bereits ab 5 Metern nach dem Eintauchen ins Wasser mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Hier stehen Ihnen viele Strandeinrichtungen und Dienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Restaurants und einige Strandbars gibt es entweder direkt am Strand oder in dessen N&auml;he. Die Unterbringung erfolgt haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Appartements oder freien Zimmern, die sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he befinden. Also, worauf wartest Du. Finde die passende Unterkunft f&uuml;r dich und los geht&#39;s in dein neues Strandabenteuer. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, wenn Sie den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r sich finden m&ouml;chten. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand.', 3425, 'de', 1),
(2048, 'Cerchi tanti parchi giochi per bambini e ombra naturale, con una spiaggia sabbiosa per la tua famiglia, quando vai al mare? Se &egrave; cos&igrave;, il paralia Stratoniu &egrave; proprio quello che fa per te, non rimarrai deluso, credimi, ho visto molte spiagge e queste consiglierei a tutte le famiglie. C&#39;&egrave; anche un piccolo parco proprio sulla spiaggia. Come &egrave; consuetudine in Grecia anche questa spiaggia &egrave; facilmente accessibile e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. Il parcheggio &egrave; abbastanza grande da accogliere anche i camper. La cittadina Stratoniu &egrave; famosa per la sua miniera sotterranea di argento-piombo-zinco. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 750 metri ed &egrave; larga fino a 50 metri. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; normale e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; a 5 metri dopo essere entrati in acqua. Hai molti stabilimenti balneari e servizi disponibili qui. Ristoranti e alcuni bar sulla spiaggia sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia o nelle sue vicinanze. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti o camere libere, che si trovano anche nelle vicinanze. Allora, cosa stai aspettando. Trova la sistemazione giusta per te e parti per la tua nuova avventura in spiaggia. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex se vuoi trovare la spiaggia perfetta per te. Goditi la tua spiaggia.', 3425, 'it', 1),
(2049, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na popolni plaži za avtodome. Če i&scaron;čete popolno pe&scaron;čeno plažo, z veliko sence in kjer lahko parkirate svoje vozilo ali avtodom neposredno na plaži, boste nad to gr&scaron;ko lepotico navdu&scaron;eni. Plaža Fteroti je prava pustolovska plaža. Nahaja se v regiji Kantriki Makedonia, v bližini vasi Fteroti. Skupno imate tukaj na voljo 1 kilometer dolžine plaže, največja &scaron;irina je 10 metrov. Nagib plaže je normalen, skoraj raven. Ob vstopu v vodo se hitro poglobi, plavati lahko začnete že po 10 metrih po dotiku&nbsp; vode z va&scaron;o nogo. Tu ne boste na&scaron;li infrastrukture za plažo, saj sta plaža in okolica popolnoma divja. Parkiri&scaron;če je ob plaži, vendar morate do plaže ubrati makadamsko cesto. Na sami plaži si lahko najamete čoln in odkrijete otoke v bližini, ki so čudoviti in vam ponujajo &scaron;e bolj oddaljene in mirne plaže, večina jih je dosegljiva le s čolnom. Restavracije ali bari na plaži tukaj niso prisotni, vendar je v bližini na voljo nekaj prenoči&scaron;č, kot so apartmaji in sobe, večina v obliki apartmajev. S seboj lahko pripeljete tudi svojega psa in če imate majhne otroke, lahko brisačo položite pod drevo in jih za&scaron;čitite pred vročim gr&scaron;kim soncem. Torej, kaj &scaron;e čakate. Poi&scaron;čite pravo namestitev zase in se odpravite na svojo novo avanturo na plaži. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, če želite najti popolno plažo zase. Uživajte na plaži.', 3434, 'sl', 1),
(2050, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na savr&scaron;enu plažu za kampere. Tražite li savr&scaron;enu pje&scaron;čanu plažu, s puno hlada i na kojoj možete parkirati svoj automobil ili kamp kući direktno na plaži, odu&scaron;evit će vas ova grčka ljepotica. Plaža Fteroti prava je pustolovna plaža. Nalazi se u regiji Kantriki Makedonia, u blizini sela Fteroti. Ukupno, ovdje imate 1 kilometar dužine plaže, maksimalna &scaron;irina je 10 metara. Nagib plaže je normalan, gotovo ravan. Ulaskom u vodu brzo se produbljuje, možete početi plivati ​​već 10 metara nakon dodirivanja vode nogom. Ovdje nećete pronaći infrastrukturu za plažu, jer su plaža i okolica potpuno divlji. Parking je uz plažu, ali do plaže morate ići makadamskom cestom. Na samoj plaži možete iznajmiti čamac i otkriti obližnje otoke koji su prekrasni i nude vam jo&scaron; udaljenije i mirnije plaže, do kojih se do većine može doći samo brodom. Restorani i beach barovi ovdje ne postoje, ali u blizini se nalaze neki smje&scaron;taji, poput apartmana i soba, većinom u obliku apartmana. Sa sobom možete povesti i svog psa, a ako imate malu djecu, ispod stabla možete staviti ručnik i za&scaron;tititi ih od vrućeg grčkog sunca. Pa &scaron;to čeka&scaron;. Pronađite odgovarajući smje&scaron;taj za sebe i krenite u svoju novu avanturu na plaži. I zapamtite, uvijek koristite BeachRex kako biste prona&scaron;li savr&scaron;enu plažu za vas. Uživajte na plaži.', 3434, 'hr', 1),
(2051, 'Добро пожаловать на идеальный пляж для автодомов. Если вы ищете идеальный песчаный пляж с большим количеством тени и где вы можете припарковать свой автомобиль или автодом прямо на пляже, вы будете поражены этой греческой красотой. Пляж Фтероти - настоящий пляж для приключений. Он расположен в регионе Кантрики Македония, недалеко от деревни Фтероти. Всего у вас здесь 1 километр пляжа, максимальная ширина - 10 метров. Уклон пляжа нормальный, почти ровный. При входе в воду она быстро углубляется, можно начинать плавать уже через 10 метров, коснувшись воды ногой. Здесь нет пляжной инфраструктуры, пляж и окрестности совершенно дикие. Парковка находится у пляжа, но до пляжа нужно ехать по гравийной дороге. На самом пляже вы можете арендовать лодку и открыть для себя близлежащие острова, которые красивы и предлагают вам еще более удаленные и мирные пляжи, до большинства из которых можно добраться только на лодке. Здесь нет ресторанов или пляжных баров, но поблизости есть несколько жилых помещений, например, апартаменты и комнаты, большинство из которых имеют вид апартаментов. Вы также можете взять с собой собаку, а если у вас есть маленькие дети, вы можете положить полотенце под дерево и защитить их от жаркого греческого солнца. Так чего же ты ждешь. Найдите подходящее жилье и отправляйтесь в новое приключение на пляже. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти идеальный пляж для вас. Наслаждайтесь пляжем.', 3434, 'ru', 1),
(2052, 'Bienvenido a la playa perfecta para autocaravanas. Si est&aacute; buscando una playa de arena perfecta, con mucha sombra y donde pueda estacionar su autom&oacute;vil o autocaravana directamente en la playa, quedar&aacute; impresionado por esta belleza griega. Fteroti Beach es una verdadera playa de aventuras. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n de Kantriki Makedonia, cerca del pueblo de Fteroti. En total, tiene 1 kil&oacute;metro de longitud de playa aqu&iacute;, el ancho m&aacute;ximo es de 10 metros. La pendiente de la playa es normal, casi llana. Al entrar en el agua, se profundiza r&aacute;pidamente, puede comenzar a nadar a los 10 metros despu&eacute;s de tocar el agua con el pie. No encontrar&aacute; infraestructura de playa aqu&iacute;, ya que la playa y los alrededores son completamente salvajes. El aparcamiento est&aacute; junto a la playa, pero hay que tomar un camino de ripio hasta la playa. En la misma playa puede alquilar un barco y descubrir las islas cercanas, que son hermosas y le ofrecen playas a&uacute;n m&aacute;s remotas y tranquilas, a la mayor&iacute;a de las cuales solo se puede llegar en barco. Aqu&iacute; no hay restaurantes o chiringuitos, pero hay algunos alojamientos cercanos, como apartamentos y habitaciones, la mayor&iacute;a en forma de apartamentos. Tambi&eacute;n puedes traer a tu perro contigo y si tienes ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os, puedes colocar una toalla debajo del &aacute;rbol y protegerlos del ardiente sol griego. Entonces, Qu&eacute; esperas. Encuentra el alojamiento adecuado para ti y emb&aacute;rcate en tu nueva aventura en la playa. Y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la playa perfecta para usted. Disfruta la playa.', 3434, 'es', 1),
(2053, 'Benvenuti nella spiaggia perfetta per i camper. Se stai cercando una spiaggia sabbiosa perfetta, con molta ombra e dove puoi parcheggiare l&#39;auto o il camper direttamente sulla spiaggia, rimarrai colpito da questa bellezza greca. Fteroti Beach &egrave; una vera spiaggia d&#39;avventura. Si trova nella regione di Kantriki Makedonia, vicino al villaggio di Fteroti. In totale, qui hai 1 chilometro di lunghezza della spiaggia, la larghezza massima &egrave; di 10 metri. La pendenza della spiaggia &egrave; normale, quasi pianeggiante. Entrando in acqua si approfondisce rapidamente, si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; a 10 metri dopo aver toccato l&#39;acqua con il piede. Non troverai infrastrutture per la spiaggia qui, poich&eacute; la spiaggia e i dintorni sono completamente selvaggi. Il parcheggio &egrave; vicino alla spiaggia, ma per raggiungere la spiaggia bisogna prendere una strada sterrata. Sulla spiaggia stessa puoi noleggiare una barca e scoprire le isole vicine, che sono bellissime e ti offrono spiagge ancora pi&ugrave; remote e tranquille, la maggior parte delle quali &egrave; raggiungibile solo in barca. Ristoranti o bar sulla spiaggia non sono presenti qui, ma ci sono alcuni alloggi nelle vicinanze, come appartamenti e camere, la maggior parte sotto forma di appartamenti. Puoi anche portare con te il tuo cane e se hai bambini piccoli, puoi mettere un asciugamano sotto l&#39;albero e proteggerli dal caldo sole greco. Allora, cosa stai aspettando. Trova la sistemazione giusta per te e intraprendi la tua nuova avventura in spiaggia. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia perfetta per te. Goditi la spiaggia.', 3434, 'it', 1),
(2054, 'Bienvenue sur la plage parfaite pour les camping-cars. Si vous cherchez une plage de sable parfaite, avec beaucoup d&#39;ombre et o&ugrave; vous pouvez garer votre voiture ou votre camping-car directement sur la plage, vous serez impressionn&eacute; par cette beaut&eacute; grecque. La plage de Fteroti est une v&eacute;ritable plage d&#39;aventure. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion de Kantriki Makedonia, pr&egrave;s du village de Fteroti. Au total, vous avez ici 1 kilom&egrave;tre de longueur de plage, la largeur maximale est de 10 m&egrave;tres. La pente de la plage est normale, presque de niveau. En entrant dans l&#39;eau, elle s&#39;approfondit rapidement, vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager d&egrave;s 10 m&egrave;tres apr&egrave;s avoir touch&eacute; l&#39;eau avec votre pied. Vous ne trouverez pas d&#39;infrastructures de plage ici, car la plage et ses environs sont compl&egrave;tement sauvages. Le stationnement est pr&egrave;s de la plage, mais vous devez emprunter une route de gravier jusqu&#39;&agrave; la plage. Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, vous pouvez louer un bateau et d&eacute;couvrir les &icirc;les voisines, qui sont magnifiques et vous offrent des plages encore plus isol&eacute;es et paisibles, dont la plupart ne sont accessibles qu&#39;en bateau. Les restaurants ou les bars de plage ne sont pas pr&eacute;sents ici, mais il y a quelques logements &agrave; proximit&eacute;, comme des appartements et des chambres, la plupart sous forme d&#39;appartements. Vous pouvez &eacute;galement amener votre chien avec vous et si vous avez de jeunes enfants, vous pouvez placer une serviette sous l&#39;arbre et les prot&eacute;ger du chaud soleil grec. Alors qu&#39;est-ce que tu attends. Trouvez l&#39;h&eacute;bergement qui vous convient et embarquez pour votre nouvelle aventure sur la plage. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage parfaite pour vous. Profites de la plage.', 3434, 'fr', 1),
(2055, 'Willkommen am perfekten Wohnmobilstrand. Wenn Sie einen perfekten Sandstrand suchen, mit viel Schatten und wo Sie Ihr Auto oder Wohnmobil direkt am Strand parken k&ouml;nnen, werden Sie von dieser griechischen Sch&ouml;nheit beeindruckt sein. Fteroti Beach ist ein echter Abenteuerstrand. Es befindet sich in der Region Kantriki Makedonia, in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Fteroti. Insgesamt hat man hier 1 Kilometer Strandl&auml;nge, die maximale Breite betr&auml;gt 10 Meter. Die Steigung des Strandes ist normal, fast eben. Beim Betreten des Wassers wird es schnell tiefer, Sie k&ouml;nnen bereits 10 Meter nach dem Ber&uuml;hren des Wassers mit dem Fu&szlig; mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Strandinfrastruktur wirst du hier nicht finden, da der Strand und die Umgebung komplett wild sind. Parken ist am Strand, aber man muss eine Schotterstra&szlig;e zum Strand nehmen. Am Strand selbst k&ouml;nnen Sie ein Boot mieten und die nahegelegenen Inseln entdecken, die wundersch&ouml;n sind und Ihnen noch abgelegenere und friedlichere Str&auml;nde bieten, von denen die meisten nur mit dem Boot zu erreichen sind. Restaurants oder Strandbars sind hier nicht vorhanden, aber es gibt einige Unterk&uuml;nfte in der N&auml;he, wie Apartments und Zimmer, die meisten in Form von Apartments. Sie k&ouml;nnen auch Ihren Hund mitbringen und wenn Sie kleine Kinder haben, k&ouml;nnen Sie ein Handtuch unter den Baum legen und sie vor der hei&szlig;en griechischen Sonne sch&uuml;tzen. Also, worauf wartest Du. Finden Sie die richtige Unterkunft f&uuml;r sich und starten Sie Ihr neues Abenteuer am Strand. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um den perfekten Strand f&uuml;r Sie zu finden. Genie&szlig;e den Strand.', 3434, 'de', 1),
(2056, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Celotna regija Halkidiki je zelo zanimiva, ne le zaradi lepih plaž, ampak tudi zaradi svoje zgodovine, kulture in kuhinje. V majhni vasici Ouranoupoli lahko obi&scaron;čete pe&scaron;čeno plažo, ki slovi po svojih posebnih oblikah in zgodovinskih zgradbah, ki jo obdajajo. Ta plaža in okolica je tudi eden zadnjih krajev, preden se odpravite na pohod v regijo Mount Atos. To je družinska plaža in na plaži so dovoljeni tudi psi. Sama plaža je me&scaron;anica drobnih kamenčkov, peska in betona. Dolga je približno 400 metrov, &scaron;iroka 20 metrov in ponuja &scaron;tevilne plažne infrastrukture in storitve na plaži. Parkiri&scaron;če je na voljo povsod ob plaži, za nekatere morate plačati, nekaj je brezplačno, vendar vam bo do plaže vzelo manj kot minuto. Nagib plaže je normalen in skoraj takoj lahko začnete plavati, na nekaterih mestih lahko celo skočite v vodo, seveda s pomola. V samem mestu je veliko restavracij in barov na plaži, nekateri od njih so na voljo neposredno na plaži. V sredi&scaron;ču mesta je tudi trajektna točka. Iz Ouranoupolija lahko pridete s trajektom do Tripitija, Dafnija in Ammoulianija. Če bi radi tu ostali dlje, imate na voljo nekaj prenoči&scaron;č, predvsem v apartmajih, ali pa bivate v hotelu, ki je prav tako v bližini. Uživajte v dnevu na plaži in ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete naslednjo popolno plažo.</div>\n', 3429, 'sl', 1),
(2057, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cijela regija Halkidikija vrlo je zanimljiva, ne samo zbog prekrasnih plaža, već i zbog svoje povijesti, kulture i kuhinje. U malom selu Ouranoupoli možete posjetiti pje&scaron;čanu plažu, poznatu po svojim posebnim oblicima i povijesnim građevinama koje je okružuju. Ova plaža i okolica su također jedno od posljednjih mjesta prije nego &scaron;to krenete na planinarenje u regiji Svete Gore. Ovo je obiteljska plaža i psi su također dopu&scaron;teni na plaži. Sama plaža je mje&scaron;avina sitnog &scaron;ljunka, pijeska i betona. Dugačak je oko 400 metara, &scaron;irok 20 metara i nudi brojne infrastrukture za plažu i usluge na plaži. Parking je dostupan posvuda uz plažu, neke morate platiti, neke su besplatne, ali do plaže će vam trebati manje od minute. Nagib plaže je normalan i možete se početi kupati gotovo odmah, na nekim mjestima možete čak i skočiti u vodu, naravno s mola. U samom gradu postoji mnogo restorana i beach barova, od kojih su neki dostupni direktno na plaži. U centru grada postoji i trajektno mjesto. Iz Ouranoupolija možete uzeti trajekt za Tripiti, Daphne i Ammouliani. Želite li ovdje ostati duže, imate na raspolaganju neki smje&scaron;taj, posebno u apartmanima, ili ste odsjeli u hotelu koji je također u blizini. Uživajte u danu na plaži i zapamtite, uvijek koristite BeachRex da pronađete sljedeću savr&scaron;enu plažu.</div>\n', 3429, 'hr', 1),
(2058, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Toda la regi&oacute;n de Halkidiki es muy interesante, no solo por las hermosas playas, sino tambi&eacute;n por su historia, cultura y gastronom&iacute;a. En el peque&ntilde;o pueblo de Ouranoupoli se puede visitar la playa de arena, famosa por sus formas especiales y los edificios hist&oacute;ricos que la rodean. Esta playa y sus alrededores tambi&eacute;n son uno de los &uacute;ltimos lugares antes de hacer senderismo en la regi&oacute;n del Monte Athos. Esta es una playa familiar y tambi&eacute;n se permiten perros en la playa. La playa en s&iacute; es una mezcla de peque&ntilde;os guijarros, arena y hormig&oacute;n. Tiene unos 400 metros de largo, 20 metros de ancho y ofrece muchas infraestructuras y servicios de playa. Hay estacionamiento disponible en todas partes a lo largo de la playa, para algunos hay que pagar, algunos son gratuitos, pero te llevar&aacute; menos de un minuto llegar a la playa. La pendiente de la playa es normal y puedes empezar a nadar casi de inmediato, en algunos lugares incluso puedes saltar al agua, por supuesto desde el muelle. Hay muchos restaurantes y chiringuitos en la propia ciudad, algunos de los cuales est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa. Tambi&eacute;n hay un punto de ferry en el centro de la ciudad. Desde Ouranoupoli puede tomar un ferry a Tripiti, Daphne y Ammouliani. Si quieres quedarte m&aacute;s tiempo aqu&iacute;, tienes alg&uacute;n alojamiento disponible, especialmente en los apartamentos, o te alojas en un hotel que tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; cerca. Disfrute de un d&iacute;a en la playa y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa perfecta.</div>\n', 3429, 'es', 1),
(2059, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Весь регион Халкидики очень интересен не только своими прекрасными пляжами, но и своей историей, культурой и кухней. В небольшой деревне Уранополис вы можете посетить песчаный пляж, известный своими особенными формами и историческими зданиями, которые его окружают. Этот пляж и его окрестности также являются одним из последних мест перед походом по региону Афон. Это семейный пляж, на него также допускаются собаки. Сам пляж представляет собой смесь мелкой гальки, песка и бетона. Это около 400 метров в длину, 20 метров в ширину и предлагает множество пляжных инфраструктур и пляжных услуг. Парковка есть повсюду вдоль пляжа, за некоторые нужно платить, некоторые - бесплатно, но добраться до пляжа у вас займет меньше минуты. Уклон пляжа нормальный, купаться можно практически сразу, в некоторых местах можно даже прыгнуть в воду, конечно с пирса. В самом городе есть много ресторанов и пляжных баров, некоторые из которых расположены прямо на пляже. Также есть паромный причал в центре города. Из Уранополиса можно сесть на паром до Трипити, Дафны и Аммулиани. Если вы хотите остаться здесь подольше, у вас есть доступное жилье, особенно в апартаментах, или вы останавливаетесь в отеле, который также находится поблизости. Наслаждайтесь днем ​​на пляже и помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти следующий идеальный пляж.</div>\n', 3429, 'ru', 1),
(2060, 'L&#39;intera regione di Halkidiki &egrave; molto interessante, non solo per le bellissime spiagge, ma anche per la sua storia, cultura e cucina. Nel piccolo villaggio di Ouranoupoli &egrave; possibile visitare la spiaggia sabbiosa, famosa per le sue forme particolari e per gli edifici storici che la circondano. Questa spiaggia e i dintorni sono anche uno degli ultimi posti prima di fare escursioni nella regione del Monte Athos. Questa &egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie e anche i cani sono ammessi sulla spiaggia. La spiaggia stessa &egrave; un misto di piccoli ciottoli, sabbia e cemento. &Egrave; lunga circa 400 metri, larga 20 metri e offre numerose infrastrutture balneari e servizi balneari. Il parcheggio &egrave; disponibile ovunque lungo la spiaggia, per alcuni &egrave; a pagamento, per altri &egrave; gratuito, ma ci vorr&agrave; meno di un minuto per arrivare in spiaggia. La pendenza della spiaggia &egrave; normale e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare quasi subito, in alcuni punti ci si pu&ograve; anche tuffare in acqua, ovviamente dal molo. Ci sono molti ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia nella stessa citt&agrave;, alcuni dei quali sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. C&#39;&egrave; anche un punto di traghetto nel centro della citt&agrave;. Da Ouranoupoli puoi prendere un traghetto per Tripiti, Daphne e Ammouliani. Se desideri rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo, hai a disposizione degli alloggi, soprattutto negli appartamenti, oppure alloggi in un hotel che si trova nelle vicinanze. Goditi una giornata in spiaggia e ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la prossima spiaggia perfetta.', 3429, 'it', 1),
(2061, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Toute la r&eacute;gion de Halkidiki est tr&egrave;s int&eacute;ressante, non seulement pour ses belles plages, mais aussi pour son histoire, sa culture et sa cuisine. Dans le petit village d&#39;Ouranoupoli, vous pouvez visiter la plage de sable, c&eacute;l&egrave;bre pour ses formes sp&eacute;ciales et les b&acirc;timents historiques qui l&#39;entourent. Cette plage et ses environs sont &eacute;galement l&#39;un des derniers endroits avant de partir en randonn&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion du Mont Athos. C&#39;est une plage familiale et les chiens sont &eacute;galement autoris&eacute;s sur la plage. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me est un m&eacute;lange de petits cailloux, de sable et de b&eacute;ton. Il mesure environ 400 m&egrave;tres de long, 20 m&egrave;tres de large et offre de nombreuses infrastructures et services de plage. Des parkings sont disponibles partout le long de la plage, pour certains payants, certains sont gratuits, mais il vous faudra moins d&#39;une minute pour vous rendre &agrave; la plage. La pente de la plage est normale et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager presque imm&eacute;diatement, &agrave; certains endroits, vous pouvez m&ecirc;me sauter dans l&#39;eau, bien s&ucirc;r depuis la jet&eacute;e. Il existe de nombreux restaurants et bars de plage dans la ville m&ecirc;me, dont certains sont disponibles directement sur la plage. Il y a aussi un point de ferry dans le centre-ville. Depuis Ouranoupoli, vous pouvez prendre un ferry pour Tripiti, Daphne et Ammouliani. Si vous souhaitez rester ici plus longtemps, vous avez des logements disponibles, notamment dans les appartements, ou vous s&eacute;journez dans un h&ocirc;tel qui est &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez d&#39;une journ&eacute;e &agrave; la plage et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage parfaite.</div>\n', 3429, 'fr', 1),
(2062, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Die gesamte Region Chalkidiki ist nicht nur wegen der sch&ouml;nen Str&auml;nde, sondern auch wegen ihrer Geschichte, Kultur und K&uuml;che sehr interessant. In dem kleinen Dorf Ouranoupoli k&ouml;nnen Sie den Sandstrand besuchen, der f&uuml;r seine besonderen Formen und die ihn umgebenden historischen Geb&auml;ude bekannt ist. Dieser Strand und seine Umgebung sind auch einer der letzten Orte, bevor Sie in der Region des Berges Athos wandern gehen. Dies ist ein Familienstrand und Hunde sind auch am Strand erlaubt. Der Strand selbst ist eine Mischung aus kleinen Kieselsteinen, Sand und Beton. Er ist etwa 400 Meter lang, 20 Meter breit und bietet viele Strandinfrastrukturen und Strandservices. Parkpl&auml;tze gibt es &uuml;berall entlang des Strandes, f&uuml;r einige kostenpflichtig, f&uuml;r andere kostenlos, aber Sie ben&ouml;tigen weniger als eine Minute, um zum Strand zu gelangen. Das Gef&auml;lle des Strandes ist normal und man kann fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen, an manchen Stellen kann man sogar ins Wasser springen, nat&uuml;rlich vom Steg aus. Im Ort selbst gibt es viele Restaurants und Strandbars, einige davon direkt am Strand. Es gibt auch einen F&auml;hrhafen im Stadtzentrum. Von Ouranoupoli k&ouml;nnen Sie eine F&auml;hre nach Tripiti, Daphne und Ammouliani nehmen. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, stehen Ihnen einige Unterk&uuml;nfte, insbesondere in den Appartements, zur Verf&uuml;gung, oder Sie &uuml;bernachten in einem ebenfalls nahegelegenen Hotel. Genie&szlig;en Sie einen Tag am Strand und denken Sie daran, immer BeachRex zu verwenden, um den n&auml;chsten perfekten Strand zu finden.</div>\n', 3429, 'de', 1),
(2063, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Zvok veselja vam začne zaigrati v u&scaron;esih, ko prvič pogledate plažo Metagkitsi. To je &scaron;e ena lepa in romantična pe&scaron;čena plaža z zelo privlačno vodno barvo v regiji Kentriki Makedonija. Nahaja se med prvim in drugim polotokom regije Halkidiki. Najbližje mesto je Salonikiou. Ta plaža je zelo lahko dostopna, parkirni prostor je iz drobnega kamenja in je dovolj velik, da sprejme tudi avtodome. Parkirate lahko skoraj neposredno pred plažo. Ko vstopite na plažo, lahko uživate v celotnem 1 kilometru dolžine in največ 50 metrih &scaron;irine. Povr&scaron;ina plaže je res zelo velika. Naklon na plaži je normalen,&nbsp; bolj pade proti morju, kjer se lahko začnete kopati že po 10 metrih. Tukaj je na voljo vsa bistvena infrastruktura za plažo in nekaj storitev na plaži. Je družinska plaža in če imate psa, ga lahko pripeljete s seboj. V bližini je nekaj apartmajev, na plaži pa je celo bar na plaži. Torej, kaj &scaron;e čaka&scaron;. Spakirajte svoje stvari in gremo na plažo. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo popolno plažo. Lepo se imejte na plaži. Va&scaron;a ekipa BeachRex.</div>\n', 3431, 'sl', 1),
(2064, 'Zvuk radosti počinje zvoniti u va&scaron;im u&scaron;ima kada prvi put pogledate plažu Metagkitsi. Ovo je jo&scaron; jedna lijepa i romantična pje&scaron;čana plaža vrlo atraktivne vodene boje u regiji Kentriki Makedonija. Nalazi se između prvog i drugog poluotoka regije Halkidiki. Najbliži grad je Salonikiou. Ova plaža je vrlo lako dostupna, parking je napravljen od sitnog kamenja i dovoljno je velik da primi i kampere. Možete parkirati gotovo direktno ispred plaže. Kada uđete na plažu, možete uživati ​​u dužini punih 1 kilometar i &scaron;irini maksimalno 50 metara. Plaža je stvarno jako velika. Nagib na plaži je normalan, vi&scaron;e pada prema moru, gdje se već nakon 10 metara može početi kupati. Ovdje je dostupna sva neophodna infrastruktura za plažu i neke usluge na plaži. To je obiteljska plaža i ako imate psa, možete ga dovesti sa sobom. U blizini se nalazi nekoliko apartmana, a na plaži je čak i beach bar. Pa &scaron;to čeka&scaron;. Spakirajte svoje stvari i idemo na plažu. I zapamtite, uvijek koristite BeachRex da pronađete svoju savr&scaron;enu plažu. Lijepo se provedi na plaži. Va&scaron; BeachRex tim.', 3431, 'hr', 1),
(2065, 'Звук радости начинает звенеть в ушах, когда вы впервые смотрите на пляж Метагкиси. Это еще один красивый и романтичный песчаный пляж с очень привлекательной акварелью в регионе Кентрики Македония. Он расположен между первым и вторым полуостровами Халкидики. Ближайший город - Салоникиу. До этого пляжа очень легко добраться, парковка сделана из небольших камней и достаточно велика, чтобы разместить и дома на колесах. Вы можете припарковаться почти прямо перед пляжем. Когда вы входите на пляж, вы можете наслаждаться 1 километром в длину и максимум 50 метрами в ширину. Пляжная зона действительно очень большая. Склон на пляже нормальный, спускается больше к морю, где можно начинать купаться всего через 10 метров. Здесь доступна вся необходимая пляжная инфраструктура и некоторые пляжные услуги. Это семейный пляж, и если у вас есть собака, вы можете взять ее с собой. Рядом есть несколько квартир, и на пляже есть даже пляжный бар. Так чего же ты ждешь. Собирайте вещи и мы идем на пляж. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти свой идеальный пляж. Приятно провести время на пляже. Ваша команда BeachRex.', 3431, 'ru', 1),
(2066, 'El sonido de la alegr&iacute;a comienza a sonar en tus o&iacute;dos cuando miras por primera vez la playa de Metagkitsi. Esta es otra hermosa y rom&aacute;ntica playa de arena con un color de agua muy atractivo en la regi&oacute;n de Kentriki Macedonia. Se encuentra entre la primera y la segunda pen&iacute;nsulas de la regi&oacute;n de Halkidiki. La ciudad m&aacute;s cercana es Salonikiou. Esta playa es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso, el espacio de estacionamiento est&aacute; hecho de piedras peque&ntilde;as y es lo suficientemente grande como para acomodar autocaravanas. Puedes aparcar casi directamente en frente de la playa. Cuando entras a la playa, puedes disfrutar de un kil&oacute;metro completo de largo y un m&aacute;ximo de 50 metros de ancho. La zona de la playa es realmente muy grande. La pendiente en la playa es normal, cae m&aacute;s hacia el mar, donde se puede empezar a nadar despu&eacute;s de solo 10 metros. Toda la infraestructura de playa esencial y algunos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;. Es una playa familiar y si tienes perro puedes traerlo contigo. Hay algunos apartamentos cerca, e incluso hay un chiringuito en la playa. Entonces, Qu&eacute; esperas. Empaca tus cosas y nos vamos a la playa. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta. Divi&eacute;rtete en la playa. Tu equipo de BeachRex.', 3431, 'es', 1),
(2067, 'Il suono della gioia inizia a risuonare nelle tue orecchie quando guardi per la prima volta la spiaggia di Metagkitsi. Questa &egrave; un&#39;altra bellissima e romantica spiaggia di sabbia con un colore dell&#39;acqua molto attraente nella regione di Kentriki Macedonia. Si trova tra la prima e la seconda penisola della regione di Halkidiki. La citt&agrave; pi&ugrave; vicina &egrave; Salonikiou. Questa spiaggia &egrave; molto facilmente accessibile, il parcheggio &egrave; fatto di piccoli sassi ed &egrave; abbastanza grande da ospitare anche i camper. Puoi parcheggiare quasi direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. Quando entri in spiaggia, puoi goderti un intero chilometro di lunghezza e un massimo di 50 metri di larghezza. La spiaggia &egrave; davvero molto ampia. La pendenza sulla spiaggia &egrave; normale, scende pi&ugrave; verso il mare, dove si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare dopo soli 10 metri. Tutte le infrastrutture balneari essenziali e alcuni servizi di spiaggia sono disponibili qui. &Egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie e se hai un cane, puoi portarlo con te. Ci sono alcuni appartamenti nelle vicinanze e c&#39;&egrave; anche un bar sulla spiaggia. Allora, cosa stai aspettando. Prepara le tue cose e andiamo in spiaggia. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta. Divertiti in spiaggia. Il tuo team BeachRex.', 3431, 'it', 1),
(2068, 'Le son de la joie commence &agrave; r&eacute;sonner dans vos oreilles lorsque vous regardez pour la premi&egrave;re fois la plage de Metagkitsi. C&#39;est une autre plage de sable magnifique et romantique avec une couleur d&#39;eau tr&egrave;s attrayante dans la r&eacute;gion de Kentriki en Mac&eacute;doine. Il est situ&eacute; entre les premi&egrave;re et deuxi&egrave;me p&eacute;ninsules de la r&eacute;gion de Halkidiki. La ville la plus proche est Salonikiou. Cette plage est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible, l&#39;espace de stationnement est fait de petites pierres et est assez grand pour accueillir &eacute;galement des camping-cars. Vous pouvez vous garer presque directement en face de la plage. Lorsque vous entrez dans la plage, vous pouvez profiter d&#39;un kilom&egrave;tre complet de long et d&#39;un maximum de 50 m&egrave;tres de large. La plage est vraiment tr&egrave;s grande. La pente sur la plage est normale, elle descend plus vers la mer, o&ugrave; vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s seulement 10 m&egrave;tres. Toutes les infrastructures de plage essentielles et certains services de plage sont disponibles ici. C&#39;est une plage familiale et si vous avez un chien, vous pouvez l&#39;amener avec vous. Il y a quelques appartements &agrave; proximit&eacute;, et il y a m&ecirc;me un bar de plage sur la plage. Alors qu&#39;est-ce que tu attends. Emballez vos affaires et nous allons &agrave; la plage. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre plage parfaite. Passez un bon moment sur la plage. Votre &eacute;quipe BeachRex.', 3431, 'fr', 1),
(2069, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Der Klang der Freude beginnt in Ihren Ohren zu klingeln, wenn Sie zum ersten Mal den Strand von Metagkitsi betrachten. Dies ist ein weiterer sch&ouml;ner und romantischer Sandstrand mit einer sehr attraktiven Wasserfarbe in der Region Kentriki Mazedonien. Es liegt zwischen der ersten und zweiten Halbinsel der Chalkidiki-Region. Die n&auml;chste Stadt ist Salonikiou. Dieser Strand ist sehr gut erreichbar, der Stellplatz besteht aus kleinen Steinen und ist gro&szlig; genug um auch Wohnmobile unterzubringen. Sie k&ouml;nnen fast direkt vor dem Strand parken. Wenn Sie den Strand betreten, k&ouml;nnen Sie einen vollen Kilometer lang und maximal 50 Meter breit genie&szlig;en. Der Strandbereich ist wirklich sehr gro&szlig;. Das Gef&auml;lle am Strand ist normal, es f&auml;llt eher zum Meer hin ab, wo man schon nach 10 Metern mit dem Schwimmen beginnen kann. Alle wichtigen Strandinfrastrukturen und einige Strandservices sind hier verf&uuml;gbar. Es ist ein Familienstrand und wenn Sie einen Hund haben, k&ouml;nnen Sie ihn mitbringen. Es gibt ein paar Apartments in der N&auml;he und es gibt sogar eine Strandbar am Strand. Also, worauf wartest Du. Pack deine Sachen und wir gehen zum Strand. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden. Viel Spa&szlig; am Strand. Ihr BeachRex-Team.</div>\n', 3431, 'de', 1),
(2070, '&Scaron;e ena plaža, kjer lahko parkirate svoje vozilo tik pred plažo, lahko ga parkirate tako blizu, da bi skoraj lahko skočili iz pokrova avtomobila v vodo. Polotok Haldikiki je znan po svojih čudovitih plažah in plaža Tristinika je ena izmed njih, zagotovo bi jo ocenil med top 10 v tej regiji. Dolga je okoli 750 metrov do 40 metrov &scaron;iroka in ponuja veliko peska, nekaj trave in celo nekaj naravne sence. Od ostalih plaž se razlikuje tudi po tem, da ima pobočje večji kot naklona, ​​to je tudi razlog, da lahko kopanje začnete skoraj takoj, ko se va&scaron;e noge dotaknejo vode. Tukaj je prisotna vsa bistvena infrastruktura za plažo, vendar ne smete pričakovati preveč, saj to ni preveč turistična plaža. Tik ob plaži je kamp in nekaj apartmajev in celo en hotel. Na plaži sta na voljo tudi beach bar in restavracija, vendar ta ni v sredi&scaron;ču, temveč na enem robu plaže. Torej, kaj &scaron;e čaka&scaron;. Spakirajte svoje stvari in gremo na plažo. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo popolno plažo. Lepo se imejte na plaži. Va&scaron;a ekipa BeachRex.', 3442, 'sl', 1),
(2071, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Jo&scaron; jedna plaža na kojoj možete parkirati svoje vozilo tik ispred plaže, možete ga parkirati tako blizu da biste gotovo mogli skočiti s haube auta u vodu. Poluotok Haldikiki poznat je po svojim prekrasnim plažama, a plaža Tristinika je jedna od njih, svakako bih je ocijenio među prvih 10 u ovoj regiji. &Scaron;iroko je oko 750 do 40 metara i nudi puno pijeska, ne&scaron;to trave, pa čak i ne&scaron;to prirodnog hlada. Od ostalih plaža razlikuje se i po tome &scaron;to ima veći nagib od nagiba, &scaron;to je i razlog za&scaron;to se možete početi kupati gotovo čim vam noge dotaknu vodu. Ovdje je prisutna sva neophodna infrastruktura za plažu, ali ne treba očekivati ​​previ&scaron;e jer nije previ&scaron;e turistička plaža. Odmah do plaže nalazi se kamp i nekoliko apartmana pa čak i jedan hotel. Na plaži se nalazi i beach bar i restoran, ali ovaj nije u centru već na jednom rubu plaže. Pa &scaron;to čeka&scaron;. Spakirajte svoje stvari i idemo na plažu. I zapamtite, uvijek koristite BeachRex da pronađete svoju savr&scaron;enu plažu. Lijepo se provedi na plaži. Va&scaron; BeachRex tim.</div>\n', 3442, 'hr', 1),
(2072, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Еще один пляж, где вы можете припарковать свой автомобиль прямо перед пляжем, вы можете припарковать его так близко, что вы почти можете прыгнуть с капота автомобиля в воду. Полуостров Халдыкики известен своими прекрасными пляжами, и пляж Тристиника - один из них, я бы определенно поставил его в десятку лучших в этом регионе. Его ширина составляет от 750 до 40 метров, здесь много песка, немного травы и даже немного естественной тени. Он также отличается от других пляжей тем, что у него уклон больше, чем уклон, что также является причиной, по которой вы можете начать плавать почти, как только ноги коснутся воды. Здесь есть вся необходимая для пляжа инфраструктура, но не стоит ожидать слишком многого, так как это не слишком туристический пляж. Прямо рядом с пляжем есть кемпинг, несколько апартаментов и даже один отель. На пляже также есть пляжный бар и ресторан, но он находится не в центре, а на краю пляжа. Так чего же ты ждешь. Собирайте вещи и мы идем на пляж. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти свой идеальный пляж. Приятно провести время на пляже. Ваша команда BeachRex.</div>\n', 3442, 'ru', 1),
(2073, 'Otra playa donde puedes estacionar tu veh&iacute;culo justo en frente de la playa, puedes estacionarlo tan cerca que casi podr&iacute;as saltar del cap&oacute; del auto al agua. La pen&iacute;nsula de Haldikiki es conocida por sus hermosas playas y la playa de Tristinika es una de ellas, definitivamente la calificar&iacute;a entre las 10 mejores de esta regi&oacute;n. Tiene unos 750 metros a 40 metros de ancho y ofrece mucha arena, algo de c&eacute;sped e incluso algo de sombra natural. Tambi&eacute;n se diferencia de otras playas en que tiene una pendiente mayor que la pendiente, lo que tambi&eacute;n es la raz&oacute;n por la que puedes empezar a nadar casi nada m&aacute;s tocar el agua con los pies. Toda la infraestructura esencial para la playa est&aacute; presente aqu&iacute;, pero no debe esperar demasiado ya que no es una playa demasiado tur&iacute;stica. Justo al lado de la playa hay un camping y algunos apartamentos e incluso un hotel. Tambi&eacute;n hay un bar de playa y un restaurante en la playa, pero este no est&aacute; en el centro sino en un borde de la playa. Entonces, Qu&eacute; esperas. Empaca tus cosas y nos vamos a la playa. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta. Divi&eacute;rtete en la playa. Tu equipo de BeachRex.', 3442, 'es', 1),
(2074, 'Un&#39;altra spiaggia dove puoi parcheggiare il tuo veicolo proprio di fronte alla spiaggia, puoi parcheggiarlo cos&igrave; vicino che potresti quasi saltare dal cofano dell&#39;auto nell&#39;acqua. La penisola di Haldikiki &egrave; nota per le sue bellissime spiagge e Tristinika Beach &egrave; una di queste, la classificherei sicuramente tra le prime 10 in questa regione. &Egrave; largo circa 750 metri a 40 metri e offre molta sabbia, un po&#39; di erba e persino un po&#39; di ombra naturale. Si differenzia dalle altre spiagge anche per il fatto che ha una pendenza maggiore della pendenza, motivo per cui puoi iniziare a nuotare non appena i tuoi piedi toccano l&#39;acqua. Tutte le infrastrutture essenziali per la spiaggia sono presenti qui, ma non dovresti aspettarti troppo perch&eacute; non &egrave; una spiaggia turistica. Proprio accanto alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un campeggio e alcuni appartamenti e persino un hotel. C&#39;&egrave; anche un bar e un ristorante sulla spiaggia, ma questo non &egrave; in centro ma su un lato della spiaggia. Allora, cosa stai aspettando. Prepara le tue cose e andiamo in spiaggia. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta. Divertiti in spiaggia. Il tuo team BeachRex.', 3442, 'it', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(2075, 'Une autre plage o&ugrave; vous pouvez garer votre v&eacute;hicule juste en face de la plage, vous pouvez la garer si pr&egrave;s que vous pourriez presque sauter du capot de la voiture dans l&#39;eau. La p&eacute;ninsule d&#39;Haldikiki est connue pour ses belles plages et la plage de Tristinika en fait partie, je la classerais certainement parmi les 10 meilleures de cette r&eacute;gion. Il mesure environ 750 m&egrave;tres &agrave; 40 m&egrave;tres de large et offre beaucoup de sable, un peu d&#39;herbe et m&ecirc;me un peu d&#39;ombre naturelle. Elle diff&egrave;re &eacute;galement des autres plages en ce qu&#39;elle a une pente sup&eacute;rieure &agrave; la pente, ce qui est &eacute;galement la raison pour laquelle vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager presque d&egrave;s que vos pieds touchent l&#39;eau. Toutes les infrastructures essentielles pour la plage sont pr&eacute;sentes ici, mais il ne faut pas en attendre trop car ce n&#39;est pas trop une plage touristique. Juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage se trouve un camping et quelques appartements et m&ecirc;me un h&ocirc;tel. Il y a aussi un bar et un restaurant de plage sur la plage, mais celui-ci n&#39;est pas au centre mais sur un bord de la plage. Alors qu&#39;est-ce que tu attends. Emballez vos affaires et nous allons &agrave; la plage. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre plage parfaite. Passez un bon moment sur la plage. Votre &eacute;quipe BeachRex.', 3442, 'fr', 1),
(2076, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ein weiterer Strand, an dem Sie Ihr Fahrzeug direkt vor dem Strand parken k&ouml;nnen, k&ouml;nnen Sie so nah parken, dass Sie fast von der Motorhaube des Autos ins Wasser springen k&ouml;nnten. Die Halbinsel Haldikiki ist bekannt f&uuml;r ihre sch&ouml;nen Str&auml;nde und Tristinika Beach ist einer davon, ich w&uuml;rde ihn definitiv zu den Top 10 in dieser Region z&auml;hlen. Er ist etwa 750 Meter bis 40 Meter breit und bietet viel Sand, etwas Gras und sogar etwas nat&uuml;rlichen Schatten. Er unterscheidet sich auch von anderen Str&auml;nden dadurch, dass er ein gr&ouml;&szlig;eres Gef&auml;lle hat als das Gef&auml;lle, was auch der Grund daf&uuml;r ist, dass Sie fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen k&ouml;nnen, sobald Ihre F&uuml;&szlig;e das Wasser ber&uuml;hren. Die gesamte notwendige Infrastruktur f&uuml;r den Strand ist hier vorhanden, aber Sie sollten nicht zu viel erwarten, da es sich nicht um einen touristischen Strand handelt. Direkt neben dem Strand befindet sich ein Campingplatz und ein paar Apartments und sogar ein Hotel. Es gibt auch eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant am Strand, aber dieses befindet sich nicht im Zentrum, sondern an einem Rand des Strandes. Also, worauf wartest Du. Pack deine Sachen und wir gehen zum Strand. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden. Viel Spa&szlig; am Strand. Ihr BeachRex-Team.</div>\n', 3442, 'de', 1),
(2077, 'Ta pe&scaron;čena plaža, ki se nahaja na zahodni strani polotoka Sitonija, v mestu Neos Marmaras je prava družinska plaža. Svoje vozilo, tudi avtodom, lahko parkirate neposredno pred plažo in greste direktno v vodo ali pa najprej va&scaron;o brisačo položite pod drevo. Značilnosti plaže so naslednje: dolga je več kot 1 kilometer in &scaron;iroka do 25 metrov, naklon na plaži je normalen in skoraj takoj se lahko začnete kopati, saj voda precej hitro pade v globino. Po eni strani je ta plaža priporočljiva za družine, tukaj je na voljo otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če, priporočam pa jo tudi tistim, ki se radi zabavate. Tukaj imate res veliko čudovitih barov na plaži / lounge barov / barov za zabave na plaži, seveda moramo omeniti tudi različne restavracije z neverjetno gr&scaron;ko kuhinjo. Ker je ta plaža zelo turistična in privablja &scaron;tevilne ljubitelje plaže, imate na izbiro tudi veliko različnih možnosti namestitve, zelo blizu plaže je nekaj čudovitih letovi&scaron;č. Če želite, lahko igrate odbojko tudi na plaži, začnete s tečajem potapljanja, si izposodite opremo za vodne &scaron;porte ali igrate golf na bližnjem igri&scaron;ču. Torej, kaj &scaron;e čaka&scaron;. Izberite pravo nastanitev zase, rezervirajte datum in se odpravite na svojo naslednjo sanjsko plažo. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo popolno plažo. Lepo se imejte na plaži. Va&scaron;a ekipa BeachRex.', 3445, 'sl', 1),
(2078, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ova pje&scaron;čana plaža, smje&scaron;tena na zapadnoj strani poluotoka Sitonije, u mjestu Neos Marmaras prava je obiteljska plaža. Svoje vozilo, uključujući i kamper, možete parkirati direktno ispred plaže i otići izravno u vodu ili prvo staviti ručnik ispod drveta. Karakteristike plaže su sljedeće: duga je vi&scaron;e od 1 kilometra i &scaron;iroka do 25 metara, nagib na plaži je normalan i gotovo odmah se možete početi kupati jer voda vrlo brzo pada u dubinu. S jedne strane ova plaža je preporučljiva za obitelji, ovdje se nalazi i dječje igrali&scaron;te, a preporučam je i onima koji se vole zabavljati. Ovdje imate jako puno prekrasnih beach barova / lounge barova / beach party barova, naravno moramo spomenuti i razne restorane s nevjerojatnom grčkom kuhinjom. Kako je ova plaža vrlo turistička i privlači mnoge ljubitelje plaža, također imate izbor od mnogo različitih mogućnosti smje&scaron;taja, u neposrednoj blizini plaže nalaze se nekoliko prekrasnih ljetovali&scaron;ta. Po želji možete igrati odbojku na pijesku, pokrenuti tečaj ronjenja, iznajmiti opremu za vodene sportove ili igrati golf na obližnjem terenu. Pa &scaron;to čeka&scaron;. Odaberite odgovarajući smje&scaron;taj za sebe, rezervirajte datum i krenite na svoju sljedeću plažu iz snova. I zapamtite, uvijek koristite BeachRex da pronađete svoju savr&scaron;enu plažu. Lijepo se provedi na plaži. Va&scaron; BeachRex tim.</div>\n', 3445, 'hr', 1),
(2079, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Этот песчаный пляж, расположенный на западной стороне полуострова Ситония, в городке Неос Мармарас, является настоящим семейным пляжем. Вы можете припарковать свой автомобиль, в том числе автодом, прямо перед пляжем и пойти прямо в воду или сначала подложить полотенце под дерево. Характеристики пляжа следующие: его длина более 1 километра, ширина до 25 метров, уклон на пляже нормальный, купаться можно практически сразу, так как вода довольно быстро опускается в глубину. С одной стороны, этот пляж рекомендуется для семейного отдыха, здесь есть детская площадка, а также рекомендую его тем, кто любит развлекаться. Здесь действительно много замечательных пляжных баров / лаунж-баров / пляжных вечеринок, конечно, мы должны также упомянуть различные рестораны с восхитительной греческой кухней. Поскольку этот пляж очень туристический и привлекает многих любителей пляжного отдыха, у вас также есть выбор из множества различных вариантов размещения, недалеко от пляжа есть несколько замечательных курортов. При желании вы также можете поиграть в пляжный волейбол, заняться дайвингом, взять напрокат снаряжение для водных видов спорта или поиграть в гольф на близлежащем поле. Так чего же ты ждешь. Выберите подходящее жилье, забронируйте свидание и отправляйтесь на пляж своей следующей мечты. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex, чтобы найти свой идеальный пляж. Приятно провести время на пляже. Ваша команда BeachRex.</div>\n', 3445, 'ru', 1),
(2080, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Esta playa de arena, situada en el lado oeste de la pen&iacute;nsula de Sithonia, en la localidad de Neos Marmaras es una aut&eacute;ntica playa familiar. Puede estacionar su veh&iacute;culo, incluida una casa rodante, directamente frente a la playa e ir directamente al agua, o primero colocar su toalla debajo de un &aacute;rbol. Las caracter&iacute;sticas de la playa son las siguientes: tiene m&aacute;s de 1 kil&oacute;metro de largo y hasta 25 metros de ancho, la pendiente en la playa es normal y puedes empezar a nadar casi de inmediato, ya que el agua cae a las profundidades con bastante rapidez. Por un lado, esta playa es recomendada para familias, aqu&iacute; hay un parque infantil, y tambi&eacute;n la recomiendo a quienes les guste divertirse. Aqu&iacute; tiene realmente muchos bares de playa / bares lounge / bares de fiesta en la playa maravillosos, por supuesto, tambi&eacute;n debemos mencionar los diversos restaurantes con incre&iacute;ble cocina griega. Como esta playa es muy tur&iacute;stica y atrae a muchos amantes de la playa, tambi&eacute;n puede elegir entre muchas opciones de alojamiento diferentes, muy cerca de la playa hay algunos maravillosos complejos tur&iacute;sticos. Si lo desea, tambi&eacute;n puede jugar al voleibol de playa, iniciar un curso de buceo, alquilar equipos para deportes acu&aacute;ticos o jugar al golf en el campo cercano. Entonces, Qu&eacute; esperas. Elija el alojamiento adecuado para usted, reserve una fecha y dir&iacute;jase a la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os. Y recuerda, usa siempre BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta. Divi&eacute;rtete en la playa. Tu equipo de BeachRex.</div>\n', 3445, 'es', 1),
(2081, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Questa spiaggia di sabbia, situata sul lato ovest della penisola di Sithonia, nella citt&agrave; di Neos Marmaras, &egrave; una vera spiaggia per famiglie. Puoi parcheggiare il tuo veicolo, compreso un camper, direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia e andare direttamente in acqua, oppure posizionare prima il tuo asciugamano sotto un albero. Le caratteristiche della spiaggia sono le seguenti: &egrave; lunga pi&ugrave; di 1 chilometro e larga fino a 25 metri, la pendenza della spiaggia &egrave; normale e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare quasi subito, poich&eacute; l&#39;acqua scende in profondit&agrave; abbastanza rapidamente. Da un lato, questa spiaggia &egrave; consigliata alle famiglie, qui c&#39;&egrave; un parco giochi per bambini e la consiglio anche a chi ama divertirsi. Qui ci sono davvero tanti meravigliosi bar sulla spiaggia / lounge bar / bar per feste in spiaggia, ovviamente dobbiamo anche menzionare i vari ristoranti con una fantastica cucina greca. Dato che questa spiaggia &egrave; molto turistica e attrae molti amanti della spiaggia, hai anche una scelta di diverse opzioni di alloggio, molto vicino alla spiaggia ci sono alcuni meravigliosi resort. Se lo desideri, puoi anche giocare a beach volley, iniziare un corso di immersione, noleggiare attrezzature per sport acquatici o giocare a golf nel vicino campo. Allora, cosa stai aspettando. Scegli la sistemazione giusta per te, prenota una data e dirigiti verso la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta. Divertiti in spiaggia. Il tuo team BeachRex.</div>\n', 3445, 'it', 1),
(2082, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cette plage de sable, situ&eacute;e sur le c&ocirc;t&eacute; ouest de la p&eacute;ninsule de Sithonia, dans la commune de Neos Marmaras est une v&eacute;ritable plage familiale. Vous pouvez garer votre v&eacute;hicule, y compris un camping-car, directement devant la plage et aller directement dans l&#39;eau, ou placer d&#39;abord votre serviette sous un arbre. Les caract&eacute;ristiques de la plage sont les suivantes : elle fait plus d&#39;un kilom&egrave;tre de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 25 m&egrave;tres de large, la pente sur la plage est normale et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager presque imm&eacute;diatement, car l&#39;eau tombe assez rapidement dans les profondeurs. D&#39;une part, cette plage est recommand&eacute;e pour les familles, il y a une aire de jeux pour enfants ici, et je la recommande &eacute;galement &agrave; ceux qui aiment s&#39;amuser. Ici, vous avez vraiment beaucoup de merveilleux bars de plage / bars lounge / bars de f&ecirc;te sur la plage, bien s&ucirc;r, nous devons &eacute;galement mentionner les diff&eacute;rents restaurants proposant une cuisine grecque incroyable. Comme cette plage est tr&egrave;s touristique et attire de nombreux amoureux de la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement le choix entre de nombreuses options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement diff&eacute;rentes, tout pr&egrave;s de la plage, il y a de magnifiques stations baln&eacute;aires. Si vous le souhaitez, vous pouvez &eacute;galement jouer au beach-volley, commencer un cours de plong&eacute;e, louer des &eacute;quipements de sports nautiques ou jouer au golf sur le parcours voisin. Alors qu&#39;est-ce que tu attends. Choisissez l&#39;h&eacute;bergement qui vous convient, r&eacute;servez une date et dirigez-vous vers la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves. Et n&#39;oubliez pas, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre plage parfaite. Passez un bon moment sur la plage. Votre &eacute;quipe BeachRex.</div>\n', 3445, 'fr', 1),
(2083, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dieser Sandstrand auf der Westseite der Halbinsel Sithonia in der Stadt Neos Marmaras ist ein echter Familienstrand. Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug inklusive Wohnmobil direkt vor dem Strand abstellen und direkt ins Wasser gehen oder Ihr Handtuch zun&auml;chst unter einen Baum legen. Die Eigenschaften des Strandes sind wie folgt: Er ist &uuml;ber 1 Kilometer lang und bis zu 25 Meter breit, die Steigung am Strand ist normal und man kann fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen, da das Wasser recht schnell in die Tiefe f&auml;llt. Einerseits ist dieser Strand f&uuml;r Familien zu empfehlen, hier gibt es einen Kinderspielplatz, und ich empfehle ihn auch denen, die gerne Spa&szlig; haben. Hier gibt es wirklich viele wundervolle Strandbars / Loungebars / Strandpartybars, nat&uuml;rlich m&uuml;ssen wir auch die verschiedenen Restaurants mit hervorragender griechischer K&uuml;che erw&auml;hnen. Da dieser Strand sehr touristisch ist und viele Strandliebhaber anzieht, haben Sie auch die Wahl zwischen vielen verschiedenen &Uuml;bernachtungsm&ouml;glichkeiten, ganz in der N&auml;he des Strandes gibt es einige wundersch&ouml;ne Resorts. Wenn Sie m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie auch Beachvolleyball spielen, einen Tauchkurs starten, Wassersportger&auml;te ausleihen oder auf dem nahegelegenen Golfplatz Golf spielen. Also, worauf wartest Du. W&auml;hlen Sie die f&uuml;r Sie passende Unterkunft, buchen Sie ein Date und fahren Sie zu Ihrem n&auml;chsten Traumstrand. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden. Viel Spa&szlig; am Strand. Ihr BeachRex-Team.</div>\n', 3445, 'de', 1),
(2084, 'In der N&auml;he der d&auml;nischen Stadt Ebeltoft, in der Region Midtjylland, k&ouml;nnen Sie den Sandstrand Strand Bogens erkunden. Es ist ein sehr einfacher Strand und wird vor allem f&uuml;r diejenigen empfohlen, die mehr Natur als Geb&auml;ude um sich herumhaben m&ouml;chten. Ein Parkplatz befindet sich direkt neben dem Strand und ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen. Hier haben Sie auch eine grundlegende Strandinfrastruktur. Am Strand oder in der N&auml;he sind keine Restaurants oder Unterk&uuml;nfte verf&uuml;gbar. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 1 km und ist 10 m breit. Der Wassereinstieg ist sch&ouml;n und Sie k&ouml;nnen auch die Wasserleiter vom Pier benutzen, um ins Wasser zu gelangen. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 10 m. Wenn Sie ein Boot haben, k&ouml;nnen Sie es auch mit einer Wasserrampe ins Wasser bringen. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand.', 3944, 'de', 1),
(2085, 'Vicino alla citt&agrave; danese Ebeltoft, nella regione del Midtjylland, puoi esplorare la spiaggia sabbiosa di Strand Bogens. &Egrave; una spiaggia molto semplice ed &egrave; per lo pi&ugrave; consigliata a coloro che amano avere pi&ugrave; natura che edifici intorno a loro. Un parcheggio &egrave; proprio accanto alla spiaggia ed &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Qui hai anche alcune infrastrutture balneari di base. Non ci sono ristoranti o alloggi disponibili sulla spiaggia o nelle vicinanze. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 1 km ed &egrave; larga 10 m. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; carino e puoi anche usare la scala dell&#39;acqua dal molo per entrare in acqua. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 10 m. Se hai una barca puoi anche usare una rampa d&#39;acqua per metterla in acqua. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni. Goditi la tua spiaggia.', 3944, 'it', 1),
(2086, 'Pr&egrave;s de la ville danoise d&#39;Ebeltoft, dans la r&eacute;gion du Midtjylland, vous pourrez explorer la plage de sable Strand Bogens. C&#39;est une plage tr&egrave;s simple et est surtout recommand&eacute;e pour ceux qui aiment avoir plus de nature que de b&acirc;timents autour d&#39;eux. Une place de parking se trouve juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage et il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;y acc&eacute;der avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. Ici, vous avez &eacute;galement une infrastructure de plage de base. Aucun restaurant ou h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est disponible sur la plage ou &agrave; proximit&eacute;. La plage a une longueur totale de 1 km et une largeur de 10 m. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez &eacute;galement utiliser l&#39;&eacute;chelle d&#39;eau de la jet&eacute;e pour entrer dans l&#39;eau. Le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 10 m. Si vous avez un bateau, vous pouvez &eacute;galement utiliser une rampe d&#39;eau pour le mettre &agrave; l&#39;eau. Et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves. Profitez de votre plage.', 3944, 'fr', 1),
(2087, 'Cerca de la ciudad danesa de Ebeltoft, en la regi&oacute;n de Midtjylland, puedes explorar la playa de arena Strand Bogens. Es una playa muy sencilla y sobre todo recomendada para aquellos a los que les gusta tener m&aacute;s naturaleza que construcciones a su alrededor. Hay un aparcamiento justo al lado de la playa y es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo. Aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n tienes algunas infraestructuras b&aacute;sicas de playa. No hay restaurantes ni alojamiento disponibles en la playa o en las cercan&iacute;as. La playa tiene una longitud total de 1 km y tiene 10 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es agradable y tambi&eacute;n puedes usar la escalera de agua del muelle para entrar al agua. El punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a unos 10 m. Si tiene un bote, tambi&eacute;n puede usar una rampa de agua para llevarlo al agua. Y recuerda, siempre usa BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os. Disfruta de tu playa.', 3944, 'es', 1),
(2088, 'En la regi&oacute;n danesa de Midtjylland, cerca de la ciudad de Ebeltoft, tienes a tu disposici&oacute;n una playa de arena muy larga, llamada Strand Vib&aelig;k. El parking, que es muy grande y est&aacute; justo al lado de la playa, es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso, tambi&eacute;n puedes aparcar aqu&iacute; tu autocaravana siempre que no pese m&aacute;s de 2 toneladas. Esta playa tiene una longitud total de varios kil&oacute;metros y tiene 10 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es agradable y el punto de nado est&aacute; a unos 15 m. Tienes aqu&iacute; una t&iacute;pica infraestructura de playa danesa. Los restaurantes no est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa, sino m&aacute;s al fondo. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en muchas formas; un camping tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; cerca. Si eres fan&aacute;tico del voleibol de playa, admirar&aacute;s esta playa. El campo de voleibol se encuentra entre el aparcamiento y la playa. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex. Y recuerda, siempre usa BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3945, 'es', 1),
(2089, 'Dans la r&eacute;gion danoise du Midtjylland, pr&egrave;s de la ville d&#39;Ebeltoft, vous avez &agrave; votre disposition une tr&egrave;s longue plage de sable, appel&eacute;e Strand Vib&aelig;k. Le parking, qui est tr&egrave;s grand et juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s, vous pouvez &eacute;galement y garer votre camping-car tant qu&#39;il ne p&egrave;se pas plus de 2 tonnes. Cette plage a une longueur totale de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et une largeur de 10 m. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 15 m. Vous avez ici une infrastructure de plage danoise typique. Les restaurants ne sont pas disponibles directement sur la plage, mais plus en arri&egrave;re-plan. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible sous de nombreuses formes; un camping est &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Si vous &ecirc;tes amateur de beach-volley, vous admirerez cette plage. Le terrain de volley est situ&eacute; entre le parking et la plage. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex. Et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3945, 'fr', 1),
(2090, 'Nella regione danese Midtjylland, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Ebeltoft, hai a tua disposizione una lunghissima spiaggia sabbiosa, chiamata Strand Vib&aelig;k. Il parcheggio, che &egrave; molto grande e si trova proprio accanto alla spiaggia, &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere, puoi anche parcheggiare qui il tuo camper purch&eacute; non superi le 2 tonnellate. Questa spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di diversi chilometri ed &egrave; larga 10 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; piacevole e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 15 m. Hai qui una tipica infrastruttura balneare danese. I ristoranti non sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma pi&ugrave; in background. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile in molte forme; un campeggio &egrave; anche nelle vicinanze. Se sei un fan del beach volley, ammirerai questa spiaggia. Il campo da pallavolo si trova tra il parcheggio e la spiaggia. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3945, 'it', 1),
(2091, 'In der d&auml;nischen Region Midtjylland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Ebeltoft, steht Ihnen ein sehr langer Sandstrand namens Strand Vib&aelig;k zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der sehr gro&szlig;e Parkplatz direkt am Strand ist sehr gut zu erreichen, Sie k&ouml;nnen hier auch Ihr Wohnmobil abstellen, solange es nicht schwerer als 2 Tonnen ist. Dieser Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und ist 10 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 15 m. Sie haben hier eine typisch d&auml;nische Strandinfrastruktur. Restaurants gibt es nicht direkt am Strand, sondern eher im Hintergrund. Unterkunft ist in vielen Formen verf&uuml;gbar; ein Campingplatz ist auch in der N&auml;he. Wenn Sie ein Fan von Beachvolleyball sind, werden Sie diesen Strand bewundern. Das Volleyballfeld befindet sich zwischen dem Parkplatz und dem Strand. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3945, 'de', 1),
(2092, 'Questa spiaggia sabbiosa danese Strand Polderrev &egrave; una vera bellezza. Le dune verdi, la sabbia bianca, il cristallino Mar Baltico e il sole sorridente creano un&#39;esperienza unica e indimenticabile. Se vuoi che diventi parte della tua memoria, devi guidare verso la citt&agrave; di Gren&aring; nella regione di Midtjylland. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e hai un parcheggio proprio accanto alla spiaggia. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; facile ed &egrave; adatto anche ai portatori di handicap, non solo per accedere alla spiaggia ma anche per entrare in acqua tramite una rampa in cemento. La superficie principale &egrave; sabbia, che &egrave; una miscela di sabbia bianca e sabbia marrone. La lunghezza totale &egrave; di diversi km ed &egrave; larga fino a 25 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 30 metri. Hai anche alcune infrastrutture balneari qui ed &egrave; uno standard tipico danese. I ristoranti non sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia ma pi&ugrave; in background. Hai molte opzioni per l&#39;alloggio, un campeggio si trova nelle vicinanze, alcuni appartamenti e case e persino un hotel.', 3948, 'it', 1),
(2093, 'Cette plage de sable danoise Strand Polderrev est une vraie beaut&eacute;. Les dunes vertes, le sable blanc, la mer Baltique cristalline et le soleil souriant cr&eacute;ent une exp&eacute;rience unique et inoubliable. Si vous voulez que cela fasse partie de votre m&eacute;moire, vous devez vous diriger vers la ville de Gren&aring; dans la r&eacute;gion du Midtjylland. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;y acc&eacute;der avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez d&#39;une place de parking juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est facile et il est &eacute;galement adapt&eacute; aux personnes handicap&eacute;es, non seulement pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage mais aussi pour se mettre &agrave; l&#39;eau via une rampe en b&eacute;ton. La surface principale est du sable, qui est un m&eacute;lange de sable blanc et de sable brun. La longueur totale est de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et elle mesure jusqu&#39;&agrave; 25 m de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 30 m&egrave;tres. Vous avez &eacute;galement une infrastructure de plage ici et c&#39;est une norme danoise typique. Les restaurants ne sont pas disponibles directement sur la plage mais plut&ocirc;t en arri&egrave;re-plan. Vous avez de nombreuses possibilit&eacute;s d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, un terrain de camping se trouve &agrave; proximit&eacute; ainsi que des appartements et des maisons, et m&ecirc;me un h&ocirc;tel.', 3948, 'fr', 1),
(2094, 'Esta playa de arena danesa Strand Polderrev es una verdadera belleza. Las dunas verdes, la arena blanca, el mar B&aacute;ltico cristalino y el sol sonriente crean una experiencia &uacute;nica e inolvidable. Si quieres que sea parte de tu memoria, debes conducir hacia la ciudad Gren&aring; en la regi&oacute;n Midtjylland. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a &eacute;l con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tienes un aparcamiento justo al lado de la playa. El acceso a la playa es f&aacute;cil y tambi&eacute;n es apta para minusv&aacute;lidos, no s&oacute;lo para acceder a la playa sino tambi&eacute;n para meterse en el agua a trav&eacute;s de una rampa de hormig&oacute;n. La superficie principal es arena, que es una mezcla de arena blanca y arena marr&oacute;n. La longitud total es de varios km y tiene hasta 25 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de nado est&aacute; a unos 30 metros. Tambi&eacute;n tiene algunas infraestructuras de playa aqu&iacute; y es un est&aacute;ndar t&iacute;pico dan&eacute;s. Los restaurantes no est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa sino m&aacute;s al fondo. Tienes muchas opciones de alojamiento, hay un camping cerca, algunos apartamentos y casas, e incluso un hotel.', 3948, 'es', 1),
(2095, 'Dieser d&auml;nische Sandstrand Strand Polderrev ist eine wahre Sch&ouml;nheit. Die gr&uuml;nen D&uuml;nen, der wei&szlig;e Sand, die kristallklare Ostsee und die l&auml;chelnde Sonne schaffen ein einzigartiges unvergessliches Erlebnis. Wenn Sie m&ouml;chten, dass es ein Teil Ihrer Erinnerung wird, m&uuml;ssen Sie in Richtung der Stadt Gren&aring; in der Region Midtjylland fahren. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr einfach zu erreichen und Sie haben einen Parkplatz direkt neben dem Strand. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach und auch f&uuml;r Behinderte geeignet, nicht nur um den Strand zu erreichen, sondern auch &uuml;ber eine Betonrampe ins Wasser zu gehen. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che ist Sand, der eine Mischung aus wei&szlig;em Sand und braunem Sand ist. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und sie ist bis zu 25 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 30 Metern. Sie haben hier auch etwas Strandinfrastruktur und es ist ein typisch d&auml;nischer Standard. Restaurants gibt es nicht direkt am Strand, sondern eher im Hintergrund. Sie haben viele Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, ein Campingplatz ist in der N&auml;he sowie einige Apartments und H&auml;user und sogar ein Hotel.', 3948, 'de', 1),
(2096, 'Strand Br&oslash;ndstrup es una de las muchas playas danesas en las cercan&iacute;as de la ciudad Gren&aring; en la regi&oacute;n Midtjylland. Es m&aacute;s conocido por su superficie arenosa y su inmensa longitud, varios kil&oacute;metros y una anchura de unos 40 m. Si te gustan estas caracter&iacute;sticas de la playa debes empacar tus cosas de playa, ingresar tu veh&iacute;culo, no importa el tipo de veh&iacute;culo, una autocaravana tambi&eacute;n es una opci&oacute;n, y visitarla. Cuando llegue aqu&iacute;, tiene a su disposici&oacute;n un amplio estacionamiento a solo 200 m de la playa. Alrededor del lugar de estacionamiento tambi&eacute;n se encuentra la mayor infraestructura de playa, un est&aacute;ndar dan&eacute;s t&iacute;pico. Cuando est&aacute;s en la playa, tienes una bonita entrada de agua y el punto de nado est&aacute; a unos 30 m. En la playa o cerca no tienes ning&uacute;n tipo de restaurante, pero tienes algunas opciones de alojamiento como un camping y algunos apartamentos y casas. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex y recuerda utilizar siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3950, 'es', 1),
(2097, 'Strand Br&oslash;ndstrup est l&#39;une des nombreuses plages danoises &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville Gren&aring; dans la r&eacute;gion Midtjylland. Il est surtout connu pour sa surface sablonneuse et son immense longueur, plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et sa largeur d&#39;environ 40 m. Si vous aimez ces caract&eacute;ristiques de plage, vous devez emballer vos affaires de plage, entrer dans votre v&eacute;hicule, quel que soit le type de v&eacute;hicule, un camping-car est &eacute;galement une option, et le visiter. Lorsque vous arrivez ici, vous disposez d&#39;un grand parking &agrave; seulement 200 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Autour de la place de parking se trouve &eacute;galement la plupart des infrastructures de plage, une norme typiquement danoise. Quand on est sur la plage, on a une belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 30 m. Sur la plage ou &agrave; proximit&eacute;, vous n&#39;avez aucun type de restaurants, mais vous avez quelques options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement comme un terrain de camping et des appartements et des maisons. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex, et n&#39;oubliez pas de toujours utiliser BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.', 3950, 'fr', 1),
(2098, 'Strand Br&oslash;ndstrup &egrave; una delle tante spiagge danesi nelle vicinanze della citt&agrave; di Gren&aring;, nella regione del Midtjylland. &Egrave; meglio conosciuto per la sua superficie sabbiosa e la sua immensa lunghezza, diversi chilometri e larghezza di circa 40 m. Se ti piacciono queste caratteristiche da spiaggia, dovresti imballare la tua roba da spiaggia, entrare nel tuo veicolo, indipendentemente dal tipo di veicolo, anche un camper &egrave; un&#39;opzione e visitarlo. Quando arrivate qui avete a disposizione un ampio parcheggio a soli 200 mt dalla spiaggia. Intorno al parcheggio c&#39;&egrave; anche la maggior parte delle infrastrutture balneari, un tipico standard danese. Quando sei in spiaggia, hai un bel ingresso in acqua e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 30 m. Sulla spiaggia o nelle vicinanze non hai nessun tipo di ristorante, ma hai alcune opzioni per l&#39;alloggio come un campeggio e alcuni appartamenti e case. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e ricordati di utilizzare sempre BeachRex per trovare la prossima spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3950, 'it', 1),
(2099, 'Strand Br&oslash;ndstrup ist einer der vielen d&auml;nischen Str&auml;nde in der N&auml;he der Stadt Gren&aring; in der Region Midtjylland. Es ist vor allem f&uuml;r seine sandige Oberfl&auml;che und seine immense L&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und einer Breite von etwa 40 m bekannt. Wenn Sie solche Strandeigenschaften m&ouml;gen, sollten Sie Ihre Strandsachen packen, Ihr Fahrzeug, egal welcher Fahrzeugtyp, ein Wohnmobil ist auch eine Option, besteigen und es besuchen. Wenn Sie hier ankommen, steht Ihnen ein gro&szlig;er Parkplatz nur 200 m vom Strand entfernt zur Verf&uuml;gung. Rund um den Parkplatz befindet sich auch die meiste Strandinfrastruktur, ein typisch d&auml;nischer Standard. Wenn Sie am Strand sind, haben Sie einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 30 m. Am Strand oder in der N&auml;he gibt es keine Restaurants, aber einige Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten wie einen Campingplatz und einige Apartments und H&auml;user. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, immer BeachRex zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 3950, 'de', 1),
(2100, 'Strand B&oslash;sholmstein &egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa consigliata alle famiglie. Si estende per diversi chilometri e pu&ograve; raggiungere i 25 m di larghezza. Si trova vicino alla citt&agrave; di Glesborg nella regione di Midtjylland. Le famiglie con bambini piccoli adoreranno questa spiaggia, soprattutto per il fondale piatto, dove il punto di balneazione &egrave; lontano, almeno 100 metri o anche pi&ugrave; lontano. La maggior parte dell&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; vicino al parcheggio. Indipendentemente dal veicolo con cui viaggi, questo parcheggio &egrave; facile da raggiungere e dista solo 50 metri dalla spiaggia. I ristoranti non sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma ce ne sono alcuni pi&ugrave; vicini al centro del paese. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile vicino alla spiaggia sotto forma di appartamenti e case, e vicino al centro del paese c&#39;&egrave; anche un campeggio. Goditi il tuo tempo in spiaggia in Danimarca. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima vacanza al mare.', 3951, 'it', 1),
(2101, 'Strand B&oslash;sholmstein est une plage de sable recommand&eacute;e pour les familles. Il s&#39;&eacute;tend sur plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et peut mesurer jusqu&#39;&agrave; 25 m de large. Il est situ&eacute; &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville de Glesborg dans la r&eacute;gion Midtjylland. Les familles avec de jeunes enfants vont adorer cette plage, notamment &agrave; cause des fonds marins plats, o&ugrave; le point de baignade est &eacute;loign&eacute;, au moins 100 m&egrave;tres voire plus. La plupart des infrastructures de la plage se trouvent pr&egrave;s du parking. Quel que soit le v&eacute;hicule avec lequel vous voyagez, ce parking est facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s et se trouve &agrave; seulement 50 m de la plage. Les restaurants ne sont pas disponibles directement sur la plage, mais il y en a plus pr&egrave;s du centre du village. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible pr&egrave;s de la plage sous forme d&#39;appartements et de maisons, et pr&egrave;s du centre du village, vous avez &eacute;galement un camp. Profitez de votre s&eacute;jour &agrave; la plage au Danemark. Et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver vos prochaines vacances &agrave; la plage.', 3951, 'fr', 1),
(2102, 'Strand B&oslash;sholmstein es una playa de arena recomendada para familias. Se extiende a lo largo de varios kil&oacute;metros y puede tener hasta 25 m de ancho. Se encuentra cerca de la ciudad Glesborg en la regi&oacute;n Midtjylland. A las familias con ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os les encantar&aacute; esta playa, sobre todo por el fondo plano, donde el punto de nado est&aacute; alejado, al menos a 100 metros o m&aacute;s. La mayor parte de la infraestructura de la playa se encuentra junto al lugar de estacionamiento. Sea cual sea el veh&iacute;culo con el que viajes, este parking es de f&aacute;cil acceso y se encuentra a tan solo 50 m de la playa. Los restaurantes no est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa, pero hay algunos m&aacute;s cerca del centro del pueblo. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible cerca de la playa en forma de apartamentos y casas, y cerca del centro del pueblo tambi&eacute;n tienes un campamento. Disfruta de tu tiempo de playa en Dinamarca. Y recuerda, siempre usa BeachRex para encontrar tus pr&oacute;ximas vacaciones en la playa.', 3951, 'es', 1),
(2103, 'Strand B&oslash;sholmstein ist ein Sandstrand, der f&uuml;r Familien empfohlen wird. Er erstreckt sich &uuml;ber mehrere Kilometer und kann bis zu 25 m breit sein. Es liegt in der N&auml;he der Stadt Glesborg in der Region Midtjylland. Familien mit kleinen Kindern werden diesen Strand lieben, vor allem wegen des flachen Meeresbodens, wo der Badepunkt weit entfernt ist, mindestens 100 Meter oder noch weiter. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich am Parkplatz. Egal mit welchem Fahrzeug Sie anreisen, dieser Parkplatz ist einfach zu erreichen und nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt. Restaurants gibt es nicht direkt am Strand, aber einige n&auml;her am Dorfzentrum. Unterkunft gibt es in Strandn&auml;he in Form von Apartments und H&auml;usern, und in der N&auml;he des Dorfzentrums gibt es auch ein Camp. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihre Strandzeit in D&auml;nemark. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Strandurlaub zu finden.', 3951, 'de', 1),
(2104, 'Si est&aacute; buscando una playa de arena danesa cerca de un destino tur&iacute;stico popular, le sugerimos que visite la playa Strand &Oslash;ster Hurup. Se encuentra cerca de la ciudad de Hadsund, en la regi&oacute;n norte danesa de Nordjylland. Llegar hasta aqu&iacute; con tu veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n una autocaravana, no es un reto. Tienes muchas opciones para aparcar tu coche, la mayor&iacute;a muy cerca de la playa. Una vez en la playa tienes disponibles varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y unos 10 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y debido al fondo plano el punto de nado est&aacute; muy alejado, incluso a m&aacute;s de 100m. Este lugar tiene mucha infraestructura de playa; Incluso tienes un peque&ntilde;o puerto deportivo aqu&iacute;. Restaurantes y tipos similares est&aacute;n disponibles en muchas formas y formas diferentes. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n de muchas formas diferentes, se incluye un lugar para acampar. Disfrute de sus vacaciones en la playa y recuerde, siempre use BeachRex para encontrar la playa de sus sue&ntilde;os.', 3952, 'es', 1),
(2105, 'Si vous recherchez une plage de sable danoise proche d&#39;une destination touristique populaire, nous vous sugg&eacute;rons de visiter la plage Strand &Oslash;ster Hurup. Il est situ&eacute; pr&egrave;s de la ville de Hadsund dans la r&eacute;gion nord du Danemark Nordjylland. Arriver ici avec votre v&eacute;hicule, &eacute;galement un camping-car, ce n&#39;est pas un d&eacute;fi. Vous avez de nombreuses options pour garer votre voiture, la plupart tr&egrave;s proches de la plage. Une fois sur la plage, vous disposez de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de longueur et d&#39;environ 10 m de largeur. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et du fait des fonds plats le point de nage est tr&egrave;s &eacute;loign&eacute;, voire &agrave; plus de 100m. Cet endroit a beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage; vous avez m&ecirc;me une petite marina ici. Les restaurants et les types similaires sont disponibles dans de nombreuses formes et formes diff&eacute;rentes. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible ici aussi sous de nombreuses formes diff&eacute;rentes, un terrain de camping est inclus. Profitez de vos vacances &agrave; la plage et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3952, 'fr', 1),
(2106, 'Se stai cercando una spiaggia sabbiosa danese vicino a una popolare destinazione turistica, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand &Oslash;ster Hurup. Si trova vicino alla citt&agrave; di Hadsund, nella regione nord danese del Nordjylland. Arrivare qui con il proprio veicolo, anche un camper, non &egrave; una sfida. Hai molte opzioni per parcheggiare la tua auto, la maggior parte molto vicino alla spiaggia. Una volta sulla spiaggia si hanno a disposizione diversi chilometri di lunghezza e circa 10 m di larghezza. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e a causa del fondale piatto il punto di balneazione &egrave; molto lontano, anche pi&ugrave; di 100 m. Questo posto ha molte infrastrutture balneari; hai anche un piccolo porto turistico qui. Ristoranti e tipi simili sono disponibili in molte forme e forme diverse. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile qui anche in molte forme diverse, un campeggio &egrave; incluso. Goditi la tua vacanza al mare e ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3952, 'it', 1),
(2107, 'Wenn Sie nach einem d&auml;nischen Sandstrand in der N&auml;he eines beliebten Touristenziels suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand &Oslash;ster Hurup zu besuchen. Es liegt in der N&auml;he der Stadt Hadsund in der nordd&auml;nischen Region Nordjylland. Mit Ihrem Fahrzeug, auch Wohnmobil, hierher zu kommen, ist keine Herausforderung. Sie haben viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, Ihr Auto zu parken, die meisten davon in unmittelbarer N&auml;he zum Strand. Einmal am Strand stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und rund 10 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und aufgrund des flachen Meeresbodens ist der Schwimmpunkt sehr weit entfernt, sogar mehr als 100 m. Dieser Ort hat viel Strandinfrastruktur; Sie haben hier sogar einen kleinen Jachthafen. Restaurants und &auml;hnliche Arten gibt es in vielen verschiedenen Formen und Formen. Unterkunft gibt es hier auch in vielen verschiedenen Formen, ein Campingplatz ist inklusive. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandurlaub und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3952, 'de', 1),
(2108, 'Se ti piacciono le spiagge con fondali molto piatti, dove il punto di balneazione &egrave; lontano, e vorresti anche essere immerso nella natura, ti consigliamo di andare alla spiaggia danese Strand Toft &Oslash;st. La regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia si chiama Nordjylland ed &egrave; vicina alla citt&agrave; di Hadsund. Indipendentemente dal veicolo con cui viaggi, il parcheggio della spiaggia &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile. &Egrave; possibile parcheggiare a soli 50 m dalla spiaggia in un ampio parcheggio. La maggior parte dell&#39;infrastruttura balneare, che &egrave; un tipico standard danese, si trova intorno al parcheggio. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di diversi chilometri ed &egrave; larga fino a 15 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua, per via del fondale piatto, &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione dista pi&ugrave; di 100 metri. Ristoranti o simili non si trovano qui, inoltre non hai alloggi direttamente sulla spiaggia, ma nel villaggio vicino in molte forme diverse. Goditi le tue vacanze al mare e ricorda di utilizzare sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.', 3953, 'it', 1),
(2109, 'Si vous aimez les plages aux fonds marins tr&egrave;s plats, o&ugrave; le point de baignade est &eacute;loign&eacute;, et que vous souhaitez &eacute;galement &ecirc;tre entour&eacute; de nature, nous vous sugg&eacute;rons d&#39;aller &agrave; la plage danoise Strand Toft &Oslash;st. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve cette plage s&#39;appelle Nordjylland et elle est proche de la ville de Hadsund. Quel que soit le v&eacute;hicule avec lequel vous voyagez, le parking de la plage est facilement accessible. Vous pouvez vous garer &agrave; seulement 50 m de la plage sur un grand parking. La plupart des infrastructures de plage, qui sont une norme danoise typique, sont situ&eacute;es autour de la place de parking. La plage a une longueur totale de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 15 m de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau, du fait du fond plat, est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; plus de 100m. Les restaurants ou similaires ne sont pas situ&eacute;s ici, vous n&#39;avez pas non plus d&#39;h&eacute;bergement directement sur la plage, mais dans le village voisin sous de nombreuses formes diff&eacute;rentes. Profitez de vos vacances &agrave; la plage et n&#39;oubliez pas d&#39;utiliser BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3953, 'fr', 1),
(2110, 'Si te gustan las playas con un fondo marino muy plano, donde el punto de nado est&aacute; lejos, y adem&aacute;s te gustar&iacute;a estar rodeado de naturaleza, te sugerimos que vayas a la playa danesa Strand Toft &Oslash;st. La regi&oacute;n donde se encuentra esta playa se llama Nordjylland y est&aacute; cerca de la ciudad de Hadsund. No importa con qu&eacute; veh&iacute;culo viaje, el lugar de estacionamiento de la playa es de f&aacute;cil acceso. Puede aparcar a solo 50 m de la playa en un amplio aparcamiento. La mayor parte de la infraestructura de la playa, que es un est&aacute;ndar t&iacute;pico dan&eacute;s, se encuentra alrededor del lugar de estacionamiento. La playa tiene una longitud total de varios kil&oacute;metros y tiene hasta 15 m de ancho. La entrada de agua, por el fondo plano, es muy agradable y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a m&aacute;s de 100m. Los restaurantes o similares no se encuentran aqu&iacute;, tampoco tiene ning&uacute;n alojamiento en la playa directamente, sino en el pueblo vecino en muchas formas diferentes. Disfrute de sus vacaciones en la playa y recuerde siempre usar BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os.', 3953, 'es', 1),
(2111, 'Wenn Sie Str&auml;nde mit sehr flachem Meeresboden m&ouml;gen, wo der Badeplatz weit entfernt ist, und Sie auch gerne von Natur umgeben sein m&ouml;chten, empfehlen wir Ihnen, zum d&auml;nischen Strand Toft &Oslash;st zu gehen. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Nordjylland und liegt in der N&auml;he der Stadt Hadsund. Egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie anreisen, der Parkplatz des Strandes ist einfach zu erreichen. Sie k&ouml;nnen nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken. Der gr&ouml;&szlig;te Teil der Strandinfrastruktur, die ein typisch d&auml;nischer Standard ist, befindet sich rund um den Parkplatz. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und ist bis zu 15 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist aufgrund des flachen Meeresbodens sehr sch&ouml;n und die Schwimmstelle ist mehr als 100 m entfernt. Restaurants oder &auml;hnliches gibt es hier nicht, auch hast du keine Unterkunft direkt am Strand, sondern im Nachbarort in vielen verschiedenen Formen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandurlaub und denken Sie daran, immer BeachRex zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 3953, 'de', 1),
(2112, 'Strand Asaa &egrave; un&#39;altra spiaggia danese con fondale molto piatto. In caso di vento forte questa spiaggia potrebbe essere un punto caldo per il kiteboard, altrimenti &egrave; sicuramente interessante per le famiglie con bambini piccoli, che possono giocare in acqua in sicurezza. Molti visitatori, dotati di grandi macchine fotografiche, vengono qui anche per osservare gli uccelli. Nordjylland &egrave; il nome della regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia speciale ed &egrave; vicina al villaggio di Asaa. Se hai deciso di visitarla, &egrave; molto facile raggiungerla con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, e hai un ampio parcheggio a soli 100 metri dalla spiaggia. Anche i camper sono i benvenuti, come di consueto in Danimarca. C&#39;&egrave; un sentiero in legno che porta alla spiaggia. Complessivamente la spiaggia &egrave; lunga 500 me larga fino a 15 metri. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a pi&ugrave; di 100 metri di distanza. Hai anche alcune infrastrutture sulla spiaggia qui; nelle vicinanze si trova anche un piccolo porto turistico. Non lontano c&#39;&egrave; anche un bar e nel villaggio c&#39;&egrave; un campeggio e alcuni appartamenti o case da affittare. Goditi il ​​tuo tempo in spiaggia e ricorda di usare sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.', 3954, 'it', 1),
(2113, 'Strand Asaa es otra playa danesa con fondos muy planos. En caso de fuertes vientos, esta playa podr&iacute;a ser potencialmente un punto caliente para practicar kitesurf, de lo contrario, es ciertamente interesante para familias con ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os, que pueden jugar en el agua de forma segura. Muchos visitantes, equipados con grandes c&aacute;maras, vienen aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n para observar aves. Nordjylland es el nombre de la regi&oacute;n donde se encuentra esta playa especial y est&aacute; cerca del pueblo de Asaa. Si te has decidido a visitarlo, es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, y dispones de un amplio aparcamiento a tan solo 100m de la playa. Las autocaravanas tambi&eacute;n son bienvenidas, como es habitual en Dinamarca. Hay un camino de madera que conduce a la playa. En total, la playa tiene 500 m de largo y hasta 15 metros de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de nado est&aacute; a m&aacute;s de 100m. Tambi&eacute;n tienes algo de infraestructura de playa aqu&iacute;; un peque&ntilde;o puerto deportivo tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; cerca. Una cafeter&iacute;a tampoco est&aacute; muy lejos, y en el pueblo tienes un camping y algunos apartamentos o casas para alquilar. Disfruta de tu tiempo en la playa y recuerda usar siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3954, 'es', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(2114, 'Strand Asaa est une autre plage danoise avec des fonds marins tr&egrave;s plats. En cas de vents forts, cette plage pourrait potentiellement &ecirc;tre un point chaud pour le kitesurf, sinon elle est certainement int&eacute;ressante pour les familles avec de jeunes enfants, qui peuvent jouer dans l&#39;eau en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;. De nombreux visiteurs, &eacute;quip&eacute;s de grandes cam&eacute;ras, viennent ici aussi pour observer les oiseaux. Nordjylland est le nom de la r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve cette plage sp&eacute;ciale et elle est proche du village Asaa. Si vous avez d&eacute;cid&eacute; de le visiter, il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;y acc&eacute;der avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez d&#39;un grand parking &agrave; seulement 100 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Les camping-cars sont &eacute;galement les bienvenus, comme il est d&#39;usage au Danemark. Il y a un chemin en bois qui m&egrave;ne &agrave; la plage. Au total, la plage mesure 500 m de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 15 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; plus de 100m. Vous avez &eacute;galement une infrastructure de plage ici; un petit port de plaisance est &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Un caf&eacute;-bar n&#39;est pas loin non plus, et dans le village vous avez un terrain de camping et quelques appartements ou maisons &agrave; louer. Profitez de votre temps &agrave; la plage et n&#39;oubliez pas de toujours utiliser BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.', 3954, 'fr', 1),
(2115, 'Strand Asaa ist ein weiterer d&auml;nischer Strand mit sehr flachem Meeresboden. Bei starkem Wind k&ouml;nnte dieser Strand potenziell ein Hotspot zum Kitesurfen werden, ansonsten ist er sicherlich interessant f&uuml;r Familien mit kleinen Kindern, die hier gefahrlos im Wasser spielen k&ouml;nnen. Viele Besucher, ausgestattet mit gro&szlig;en Kameras, kommen auch hierher, um V&ouml;gel zu beobachten. Nordjylland ist der Name der Region, in der sich dieser besondere Strand befindet, und er liegt in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Asaa. Wenn Sie sich entschieden haben, es zu besuchen, ist es mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr einfach zu erreichen, und Sie haben einen gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 100 m vom Strand entfernt. Auch Wohnmobile sind willkommen, wie es in D&auml;nemark &uuml;blich ist. Es gibt einen Holzweg, der zum Strand f&uuml;hrt. Insgesamt ist der Strand 500 m lang und bis zu 15 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt ist mehr als 100 m entfernt. Sie haben hier auch eine Strandinfrastruktur; Ein kleiner Yachthafen ist ebenfalls in der N&auml;he. Auch ein Caf&eacute; ist nicht weit entfernt, und im Dorf gibt es einen Campingplatz und einige Wohnungen oder H&auml;user zu vermieten. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihre Strandzeit und denken Sie daran, immer BeachRex zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 3954, 'de', 1),
(2116, 'Pr&egrave;s de la ville danoise de S&aelig;by, dans la r&eacute;gion nord du Nordjylland, une plage de sable Strand Lyngs&aring; se trouve &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Il convient aux familles et &agrave; ceux qui souhaitent ramasser des coquillages sur la plage, ici vous en avez beaucoup. Vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cet emplacement tr&egrave;s facilement avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, m&ecirc;me un camping-car, et simplement laisser votre v&eacute;hicule sur un grand parking &agrave; seulement 30 m de la plage. La plage est tr&egrave;s longue, plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres au total, avec une largeur maximale de 30 m. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de nage est &agrave; 50 m. Autour du parking, vous avez &eacute;galement une infrastructure de plage typique danoise. Apportez votre nourriture et vos boissons avec vous, ici vous n&#39;avez aucune option pour acheter quoi que ce soit. Si vous souhaitez rester ici plus longtemps, vous pouvez louer un appartement ou une maison &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de vos vacances &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex.', 3955, 'fr', 1),
(2117, 'Cerca de la ciudad danesa de S&aelig;by, en la regi&oacute;n norte de Nordjylland, hay una playa de arena, Strand Lyngs&aring;. Es adecuado para familias y para aquellos que quieran recoger algunas conchas en la playa, aqu&iacute; tienes un mont&oacute;n de ellas. Puede acceder a este lugar muy f&aacute;cilmente con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n una autocaravana, y simplemente dejar su veh&iacute;culo en un amplio estacionamiento a solo 30 m de la playa. La playa es muy larga, en total varios kil&oacute;metros, con una anchura m&aacute;xima de 30 m. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de nado est&aacute; a 50 m. Alrededor del lugar de estacionamiento tambi&eacute;n tiene una infraestructura de playa t&iacute;pica danesa. Trae tu comida y bebida contigo, aqu&iacute; no tienes opciones de comprar nada. Si desea permanecer aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo, puede alquilar un apartamento o una casa cercana. Disfruta de tus vacaciones en la playa con BeachRex.', 3955, 'es', 1),
(2118, 'Vicino alla citt&agrave; danese S&aelig;by, nella regione settentrionale del Nordjylland, si trova una spiaggia sabbiosa Strand Lyngs&aring;. &Egrave; adatto alle famiglie ea chi vorrebbe collezionare delle conchiglie sulla spiaggia, qui ne trovi in abbondanza. Puoi accedere a questa posizione molto facilmente con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche un camper, e semplicemente lasciare il tuo veicolo in un ampio parcheggio a soli 30 m dalla spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; molto lunga, in tutto diversi chilometri, con una larghezza massima di 30 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 50 m. Intorno al parcheggio si dispone anche di una tipica infrastruttura balneare danese. Porta con te cibo e bevande, qui non hai opzioni per comprare nulla. Se desideri rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo puoi affittare un appartamento o una casa nelle vicinanze. Goditi la tua vacanza al mare con BeachRex.', 3955, 'it', 1),
(2119, 'In der N&auml;he der d&auml;nischen Stadt S&aelig;by in der n&ouml;rdlichen Region Nordjylland befindet sich ein Sandstrand Strand Lyngs&aring; in der N&auml;he. Es ist geeignet f&uuml;r Familien und diejenigen, die am Strand ein paar Muscheln sammeln m&ouml;chten, hier haben Sie viele davon. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Ort sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch einem Wohnmobil, erreichen und Ihr Fahrzeug einfach auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt abstellen. Der Strand ist sehr lang, insgesamt mehrere Kilometer, mit einer maximalen Breite von 30 m. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 50 m. Rund um den Parkplatz haben Sie auch eine d&auml;nisch typische Strandinfrastruktur. Bringen Sie Ihre Speisen und Getr&auml;nke mit, hier haben Sie keine M&ouml;glichkeit, etwas zu kaufen. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie eine Wohnung oder ein Haus in der N&auml;he mieten. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandurlaub mit BeachRex.', 3955, 'de', 1),
(2120, 'Sebbene il nome di questa spiaggia danese sia Strand Munkevang, in base alla superficie principale della spiaggia, dovrebbe essere come The beach shell. Come mai? Conchiglie ovunque, letteralmente ovunque, tonnellate e tonnellate di ogni tipo di forma. Se questo &egrave; ci&ograve; che stai cercando per essere su una spiaggia, ti consigliamo di visitare questa spiaggia, che si trova nella citt&agrave; di S&aelig;by, nella regione settentrionale del Nordjylland. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungere questa spiaggia, indipendentemente dal veicolo, e puoi parcheggiare direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia in un ampio parcheggio. Hai pochissime infrastrutture per la spiaggia qui, mancano i servizi igienici, quindi meno che essenziali. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 500 m ed &egrave; larga 25 m. Hai davvero bisogno di guardare dove stai calpestando questa spiaggia, perch&eacute; le conchiglie, alcune delle quali affilate, sono ovunque, specialmente nell&#39;acqua. Anche qui il punto di balneazione &egrave; lontano, a circa 100 m. I ristoranti non sono disponibili qui, nelle vicinanze c&#39;&egrave; un porto turistico, alcune opzioni di alloggio, come appartamenti e case. Goditi la tua vacanza al mare e ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.', 3956, 'it', 1),
(2121, 'Aunque el nombre de esta playa danesa es Strand Munkevang, de acuerdo con la superficie principal de la playa, deber&iacute;a ser como The beach shell. &iquest;Por qu&eacute;? Conchas por todas partes, literalmente por todas partes, toneladas y toneladas de todo tipo de formas y formas. Si esto es lo que buscas para estar en una playa, te recomendamos visitar esta playa, que se encuentra en la ciudad de S&aelig;by en la regi&oacute;n norte de Nordjylland. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a esta playa, sin importar el veh&iacute;culo, y puedes estacionar directamente en frente de la playa en un amplio estacionamiento. Tiene muy poca infraestructura de playa aqu&iacute;, faltan ba&ntilde;os, por lo que es menos que b&aacute;sico. La playa tiene una longitud total de 500 my 25 m de ancho. Hay que estar muy pendiente de d&oacute;nde pisas esta playa, porque las conchas, algunas de ellas afiladas, est&aacute;n por todas partes, especialmente en el agua. El punto de nado est&aacute; aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n lejos, y est&aacute; a unos 100 m. Los restaurantes no est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, cerca tiene un puerto deportivo, algunas opciones de alojamiento, como apartamentos y casas. Disfrute de sus vacaciones en la playa y recuerde, use siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os.', 3956, 'es', 1),
(2122, 'Bien que le nom de cette plage danoise soit Strand Munkevang, selon la surface principale de la plage, elle devrait ressembler &agrave; The beach shell. Pourquoi? Des coquillages partout, litt&eacute;ralement partout, des tonnes et des tonnes de toutes sortes de formes et de formes. Si c&#39;est ce que vous recherchez pour &ecirc;tre sur une plage, nous vous recommandons de visiter cette plage, qui est situ&eacute;e dans la ville de S&aelig;by dans la r&eacute;gion nord du Nordjylland. Il est tr&egrave;s facile de se rendre sur cette plage, quel que soit le v&eacute;hicule, et vous pouvez vous garer directement devant la plage sur une grande place de parking. Vous avez tr&egrave;s peu d&#39;infrastructures de plage ici, il manque des toilettes, donc moins que basiques. La plage a une longueur totale de 500 m et une largeur de 25 m. Il faut vraiment faire attention o&ugrave; l&#39;on met les pieds sur cette plage, car les coquillages, certains pointus, sont partout, surtout dans l&#39;eau. Le point de baignade est ici aussi loin, et se situe &agrave; environ 100 m. Les restaurants ne sont pas disponibles ici, &agrave; proximit&eacute; vous avez un port de plaisance, quelques options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, comme des appartements et des maisons. Profitez de vos vacances &agrave; la plage et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3956, 'fr', 1),
(2123, 'Obwohl der Name f&uuml;r diesen d&auml;nischen Strand Munkevang ist, sollte er, je nachdem, was die Hauptfl&auml;che des Strandes ist, wie die Strandmuschel aussehen. Warum? Muscheln &uuml;berall, buchst&auml;blich &uuml;berall, Tonnen und Tonnen in allen m&ouml;glichen Formen und Gestalten. Wenn es das ist, was Sie an einem Strand suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, diesen Strand zu besuchen, der sich in der Stadt S&aelig;by in der n&ouml;rdlichen Region Nordjylland befindet. Dieser Strand ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr einfach zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt vor dem Strand auf einem gro&szlig;en Parkplatz parken. Sie haben hier sehr wenig Strandinfrastruktur, Toiletten fehlen, also weniger als einfach. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 500 m und ist 25 m breit. An diesem Strand muss man wirklich aufpassen, wo man hintritt, denn die teils scharfen Muscheln liegen &uuml;berall, vor allem im Wasser. Auch der Schwimmpunkt ist hier weit entfernt und liegt bei etwa 100 m. Restaurants gibt es hier nicht, in der N&auml;he gibt es einen Jachthafen, einige Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, wie Wohnungen und H&auml;user. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandurlaub und denken Sie daran, nutzen Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 3956, 'de', 1),
(2124, 'Nordstrand S&aelig;by est la plage danoise que vous devez visiter si vous aimez &ecirc;tre dans un lieu touristique bien d&eacute;velopp&eacute;, avec de nombreuses infrastructures et services de plage. De nombreux terrains de sport sont ici, une aire de jeux pour enfants, une piscine, diff&eacute;rents types de restaurants et un h&ocirc;tel directement sur la plage. Bien s&ucirc;r, le parking est &eacute;galement &agrave; quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage. Vous pouvez trouver cette plage dans la r&eacute;gion Nordjylland dans la ville S&aelig;by. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&eacute;der &agrave; cette plage avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. En raison de sa situation tr&egrave;s touristique, l&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est &eacute;galement adapt&eacute; aux personnes handicap&eacute;es. La plage a une longueur totale de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 30 m de large. Vous avez ici de nombreuses petites baies qui donnent &agrave; la plage un caract&egrave;re particulier. Sur la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement une jet&eacute;e avec une &eacute;chelle d&#39;eau. De ce fait, le point de nage se situe entre 0 et 15 m. Si vous souhaitez passer vos vacances ici, vous avez de nombreuses options pour trouver le bon type d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, un terrain de camping est &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de vos vacances &agrave; la plage et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.', 3957, 'fr', 1),
(2125, 'Nordstrand S&aelig;by est la plage danoise que vous devez visiter si vous aimez &ecirc;tre dans un lieu touristique bien d&eacute;velopp&eacute;, avec de nombreuses infrastructures et services de plage. De nombreux terrains de sport sont ici, une aire de jeux pour enfants, une piscine, diff&eacute;rents types de restaurants et un h&ocirc;tel directement sur la plage. Bien s&ucirc;r, le parking est &eacute;galement &agrave; quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage. Vous pouvez trouver cette plage dans la r&eacute;gion Nordjylland dans la ville S&aelig;by. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&eacute;der &agrave; cette plage avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule. En raison de sa situation tr&egrave;s touristique, l&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est &eacute;galement adapt&eacute; aux personnes handicap&eacute;es. La plage a une longueur totale de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 30 m de large. Vous avez ici de nombreuses petites baies qui donnent &agrave; la plage un caract&egrave;re particulier. Sur la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement une jet&eacute;e avec une &eacute;chelle d&#39;eau. De ce fait, le point de nage se situe entre 0 et 15 m. Si vous souhaitez passer vos vacances ici, vous avez de nombreuses options pour trouver le bon type d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, un terrain de camping est &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de vos vacances &agrave; la plage et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.', 3957, 'es', 1),
(2126, 'Nordstrand S&aelig;by &egrave; la spiaggia danese che devi visitare se ti piace essere in un luogo turistico ben sviluppato, con molte infrastrutture e servizi balneari. Molti campi sportivi sono qui, un parco giochi per bambini, una piscina, diversi tipi di ristoranti e un hotel direttamente sulla spiaggia. Naturalmente anche il parcheggio &egrave; a pochi metri dalla spiaggia. Puoi trovare questa spiaggia nella regione Nordjylland nella citt&agrave; S&aelig;by. &Egrave; molto facile accedere a questa spiaggia con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo. Essendo una localit&agrave; molto turistica, l&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; adatto anche ai portatori di handicap. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di diversi km ed &egrave; larga fino a 30 m. Ci sono molte piccole baie qui, che conferiscono alla spiaggia un carattere speciale. Sulla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; anche un molo con scaletta d&#39;acqua. Per questo motivo, il punto di nuoto &egrave; compreso tra 0 e 15 m. Se vuoi trascorrere le tue vacanze qui, hai molte opzioni per trovare la giusta tipologia di alloggio, anche un campeggio si trova nelle vicinanze. Goditi la tua vacanza al mare e ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.', 3957, 'it', 1),
(2127, 'Nordstrand S&aelig;by ist der d&auml;nische Strand, den Sie besuchen m&uuml;ssen, wenn Sie an einem gut entwickelten touristischen Ort mit vielen Strandinfrastrukturen und Dienstleistungen sein m&ouml;chten. Viele Sportpl&auml;tze sind hier, ein Kinderspielplatz, ein Schwimmbad, verschiedene Restaurants und ein Hotel direkt am Strand. Nat&uuml;rlich ist der Parkplatz auch nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt. Sie finden diesen Strand in der Region Nordjylland in der Stadt S&aelig;by. Es ist sehr einfach, diesen Strand mit jedem Fahrzeug zu erreichen. Da es sich um einen sehr touristischen Ort handelt, ist der Zugang zum Strand auch f&uuml;r Behinderte geeignet. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und ist bis zu 30 m breit. Du hast hier viele kleine Buchten, die dem Strand einen besonderen Charakter verleihen. Am Strand haben Sie auch einen Pier mit einer Wasserleiter. Dadurch liegt der Schwimmpunkt zwischen 0 und 15 m. Wenn Sie hier Ihren Urlaub verbringen m&ouml;chten, haben Sie viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, die passende Unterkunft zu finden, ein Campingplatz ist auch in der N&auml;he. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandurlaub und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 3957, 'de', 1),
(2128, 'Se sei quello a cui piace stare su una spiaggia molto ben organizzata, con tanti servizi balneari, con Wi-Fi gratuito ad alta velocit&agrave; incluso, dove la superficie principale &egrave; sabbiosa, ma vorresti anche avere un po&#39; di erba , ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia della Germania settentrionale Strand Sch&ouml;nberg. Si trova sul Mar Baltico tedesco nella regione Schleswig-Holstein. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e hai pi&ugrave; opzioni per parcheggiare la tua auto. Ci vogliono solo 100 metri a piedi per raggiungere la spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e nella parte pi&ugrave; ampia &egrave; larga 30 m. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 50 m. Hai molti servizi in spiaggia qui e alcuni sono di altissimo livello. Ottenere qualcosa da mangiare o da bere qui non &egrave; un problema, hai pi&ugrave; opzioni. Se stai cercando un alloggio e vorresti rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo e trascorrere qui le tue vacanze, hai diverse possibilit&agrave; per scegliere quello giusto per te. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda di utilizzare sempre il motore di ricerca spiaggia BeachRex per trovare la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3871, 'it', 1),
(2129, 'Si vous &ecirc;tes celui qui aime &ecirc;tre sur une plage tr&egrave;s bien organis&eacute;e, avec de nombreux services de plage, avec une connexion Wi-Fi haut d&eacute;bit gratuite incluse, o&ugrave; la surface principale est du sable, mais vous aimeriez aussi avoir de l&#39;herbe , nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage nord-allemande Strand Sch&ouml;nberg. Il est situ&eacute; sur la mer Baltique allemande dans la r&eacute;gion du Schleswig-Holstein. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous avez plusieurs options pour garer votre voiture. Il vous faut seulement 100m de marche pour atteindre la plage. La plage fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et sur la partie la plus large de 30 m de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 50 m. Vous avez beaucoup de services de plage ici et certains sont au plus haut niveau. Obtenir quelque chose &agrave; manger ou &agrave; boire n&#39;est ici pas un probl&egrave;me, vous avez plusieurs options. Si vous &ecirc;tes &agrave; la recherche d&#39;un logement et que vous souhaitez rester ici plus longtemps et passer vos vacances ici, vous avez plusieurs possibilit&eacute;s pour choisir celui qui vous convient. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex et n&#39;oubliez pas de toujours utiliser le moteur de recherche de plage BeachRex pour trouver la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3871, 'fr', 1),
(2130, 'Si eres de los que le gusta estar en una playa muy bien organizada, con muchos servicios de playa, con wifi de alta velocidad gratis incluido, donde la superficie principal es arena, pero tambi&eacute;n te gustar&iacute;a tener algo de c&eacute;sped , le recomendamos visitar la playa del norte de Alemania Strand Sch&ouml;nberg. Se encuentra en el Mar B&aacute;ltico alem&aacute;n en la regi&oacute;n de Schleswig-Holstein. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tienes m&uacute;ltiples opciones para aparcar tu coche. Solo se necesitan 100 m de caminata para llegar a la playa. La playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y en la parte m&aacute;s ancha 30 m de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a unos 50 m. Tienes muchos servicios de playa aqu&iacute; y algunos est&aacute;n al m&aacute;s alto nivel. Conseguir algo para comer o beber aqu&iacute; no es un problema, tienes m&uacute;ltiples opciones. Si est&aacute;s buscando alojamiento y te gustar&iacute;a quedarte m&aacute;s tiempo aqu&iacute; y pasar tus vacaciones aqu&iacute;, tienes varias posibilidades para elegir el m&aacute;s adecuado para ti. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex, y recuerda utilizar siempre el buscador de playas de BeachRex para encontrar la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3871, 'es', 1),
(2131, 'Wenn Sie gerne an einem sehr gut organisierten Strand sind, mit vielen Strand Dienstleistungen, inklusive kostenlosem Highspeed-WLAN, wo die Hauptoberfl&auml;che Sand ist, Sie aber auch etwas Gras haben m&ouml;chten, empfehlen wir Ihnen den norddeutschen Strand Sch&ouml;nberg zu besuchen. Es liegt an der deutschen Ostsee in der Region Schleswig-Holstein. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr einfach zu erreichen und Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, Ihr Auto zu parken. Zum Strand sind es nur 100 m zu Fu&szlig;. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und an der breitesten Stelle 30 m breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 50 m. Sie haben hier viele Strandservices und einige sind auf h&ouml;chstem Niveau. Etwas zu essen oder zu trinken ist hier kein Problem, Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten. Wenn Sie auf der Suche nach einer Unterkunft sind und l&auml;nger hierbleiben und Ihren Urlaub hier verbringen m&ouml;chten, haben Sie mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, das Richtige f&uuml;r sich auszuw&auml;hlen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, immer die Strandsuchmaschine von BeachRex zu verwenden, um Ihren Traumstrand zu finden.', 3871, 'de', 1),
(2132, 'Algunas playas alemanas son realmente especiales, literalmente. Si eres fan&aacute;tico de los barcos y submarinos de la Segunda Guerra Mundial, en esta playa de Laboe, puedes echar un vistazo, por fuera y por dentro, a un submarino alem&aacute;n de la Segunda Guerra Mundial U-995. Junto al submarino tambi&eacute;n puedes echar un vistazo a un museo mar&iacute;timo militar alem&aacute;n. La regi&oacute;n donde se encuentra esta playa especial pertenece al norte de Alemania Schleswig-Holstein. Tienes que conducir hasta la peque&ntilde;a ciudad de Laboe, donde te espera un amplio aparcamiento, adecuado tambi&eacute;n para autocaravanas, a solo 200 m de la playa. La playa es apta para un usuario de tipo familiar. La longitud total de la playa es de 1 km, en algunos lugares el ancho puede alcanzar incluso los 100 m, en algunos solo 10 m. La entrada de agua aqu&iacute; es muy agradable y adem&aacute;s el fondo marino es muy muy plano. El punto de nado se encuentra a m&aacute;s de 100m, lo que hace de este lugar ideal para que los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os jueguen en el agua de forma segura. Tienes muchos servicios de playa disponibles aqu&iacute;, tambi&eacute;n un tobog&aacute;n de agua. Muchas formas diferentes de restaurantes y cafeter&iacute;as ofrecen sus servicios aqu&iacute;. Tambi&eacute;n tienes m&uacute;ltiples opciones de alojamiento, principalmente como apartamentos y hoteles. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex y recuerda, siempre usa BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3873, 'es', 1),
(2133, 'Certaines plages allemandes sont vraiment sp&eacute;ciales, litt&eacute;ralement. Si vous &ecirc;tes un fan des navires et des sous-marins de la Seconde Guerre mondiale, sur cette plage de Laboe, vous pouvez r&eacute;ellement jeter un coup d&#39;&oelig;il, &agrave; l&#39;ext&eacute;rieur et &agrave; l&#39;int&eacute;rieur, sur un sous-marin allemand de la Seconde Guerre mondiale U-995. &Agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; du sous-marin, vous pouvez &eacute;galement jeter un &oelig;il au mus&eacute;e maritime militaire allemand. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve cette plage sp&eacute;ciale appartient au nord du Schleswig-Holstein allemand. Vous devez conduire jusqu&#39;&agrave; la petite ville de Laboe, o&ugrave; un grand parking, adapt&eacute; &eacute;galement aux camping-cars, &agrave; seulement 200 m de la plage, vous attend. La plage convient &agrave; un utilisateur de type familial. La longueur totale de la plage est de 1 km, &agrave; certains endroits la largeur peut m&ecirc;me atteindre 100 m, sur certains seulement 10 m. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau ici est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et aussi le fond marin est tr&egrave;s tr&egrave;s plat. Le point de baignade est &agrave; plus de 100m, ce qui rend cet endroit id&eacute;al pour que les petits enfants puissent jouer dans l&#39;eau en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;. Vous avez de nombreux services de plage disponibles ici, ainsi qu&#39;un toboggan aquatique. De nombreuses formes diff&eacute;rentes de restaurants et de caf&eacute;s offrent leurs services ici. Vous avez &eacute;galement plusieurs options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, principalement des appartements et des h&ocirc;tels. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex, et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.', 3873, 'fr', 1),
(2134, 'Alcune spiagge tedesche sono davvero speciali, letteralmente. Se sei un fan delle navi e dei sottomarini della seconda guerra mondiale, su questa spiaggia di Laboe, puoi effettivamente dare un&#39;occhiata, all&#39;esterno e all&#39;interno, su un sottomarino tedesco della seconda guerra mondiale U-995. Accanto al sottomarino puoi anche dare un&#39;occhiata a un museo marittimo militare tedesco. La regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia speciale appartiene allo Schleswig-Holstein della Germania settentrionale. Devi raggiungere in auto la piccola citt&agrave; di Laboe, dove ti aspetta un ampio parcheggio, adatto anche ai camper, a soli 200 metri dalla spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; adatta ad un&#39;utenza di tipo familiare. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 1 km, in alcuni tratti la larghezza pu&ograve; raggiungere anche i 100 m, in altri solo 10 m. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua qui &egrave; molto bello e anche il fondale &egrave; molto piatto. Il punto di balneazione dista pi&ugrave; di 100 metri, il che rende questo luogo ideale per far giocare i bambini in acqua in sicurezza. Hai molti servizi in spiaggia disponibili qui, anche uno scivolo d&#39;acqua. Molte diverse forme di ristoranti e bar offrono i loro servizi qui. Hai anche pi&ugrave; opzioni per l&#39;alloggio, principalmente come appartamenti e hotel. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la prossima spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 3873, 'it', 1),
(2135, 'Einige deutsche Str&auml;nde sind im wahrsten Sinne des Wortes etwas ganz Besonderes. Wenn Sie ein Fan von Schiffen und U-Booten aus dem Zweiten Weltkrieg sind, k&ouml;nnen Sie an diesem Strand in Laboe tats&auml;chlich einen Blick von au&szlig;en und innen auf ein deutsches U-Boot U-995 aus dem Zweiten Weltkrieg werfen. Neben dem U-Boot k&ouml;nnen Sie auch ein deutsches Milit&auml;rschifffahrtsmuseum besichtigen. Die Region, in der sich dieser besondere Strand befindet, geh&ouml;rt zum norddeutschen Schleswig-Holstein. Sie m&uuml;ssen in die kleine Stadt Laboe fahren, wo ein gro&szlig;er Parkplatz, auch f&uuml;r Wohnmobile geeignet, nur 200 m vom Strand entfernt, auf Sie wartet. Der Strand ist f&uuml;r einen Familientyp geeignet. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 1 km, an einigen Stellen kann die Breite sogar 100 m erreichen, an manchen nur 10 m. Der Wassereintritt ist hier sehr sch&ouml;n und auch der Meeresboden ist sehr sehr flach. Die Schwimmstelle ist mehr als 100 m entfernt, was diesen Ort ideal f&uuml;r kleine Kinder macht, um sicher im Wasser zu spielen. Hier stehen Ihnen viele Stranddienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, auch eine Wasserrutsche. Viele verschiedene Formen von Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s bieten hier ihre Dienste an. Sie haben auch mehrere Optionen f&uuml;r die Unterkunft, haupts&auml;chlich als Apartments und Hotels. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 3873, 'de', 1),
(2136, 'Se stai cercando una grande spiaggia di sabbia marrone vicino alla citt&agrave; tedesca di Kiel, con molta superficie della spiaggia, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia di Strand Falckenstein. Si trova nella regione della Germania settentrionale Schleswig-Holstein. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche con un grande camper. Ci vogliono circa 400 metri a piedi dal parcheggio alla spiaggia. Una volta sulla spiaggia, hai a disposizione una lunghezza totale di diversi chilometri e fino a 100 metri di larghezza della spiaggia. L&#39;intera area della spiaggia &egrave; molto pianeggiante, il che rende l&#39;ingresso in acqua molto confortevole. Anche qui il fondale &egrave; molto piatto, per questo il punto di balneazione &egrave; di circa 75 metri. I servizi in spiaggia, che sono disponibili qui, sono solo di base. Sulla spiaggia sono disponibili alcuni bar e ristoranti sulla spiaggia. L&#39;alloggio su questa spiaggia non &egrave; disponibile direttamente, ma pi&ugrave; in direzione della citt&agrave; di Kiel. Goditi la tua spiaggia e ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.', 3875, 'it', 1),
(2137, 'Si vous recherchez une grande plage de sable brun pr&egrave;s de la ville allemande de Kiel, avec beaucoup de surface de plage, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage Strand Falckenstein. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion du nord de l&#39;Allemagne Schleswig-Holstein. Cet endroit est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, m&ecirc;me avec un grand camping-car. Il vous faut environ 400 m&egrave;tres de marche du parking &agrave; la plage. Une fois sur la plage, vous disposez d&#39;une longueur totale de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 100 m&egrave;tres de largeur de plage. Toute la plage est tr&egrave;s plate, ce qui rend l&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau tr&egrave;s confortable. Le fond marin est &eacute;galement tr&egrave;s plat ici, &agrave; cause de cela le point de nage est &agrave; environ 75 m&egrave;tres. Les services de plage, qui sont disponibles ici, ne sont que basiques. Certains bars et restaurants de plage sont disponibles sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement sur cette plage n&#39;est pas disponible directement, mais plut&ocirc;t en direction de la ville de Kiel. Profitez de votre plage et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 3875, 'fr', 1),
(2138, 'Si buscas una gran playa de arena marr&oacute;n cerca de la localidad alemana de Kiel, con mucha superficie de playa, te recomendamos visitar la playa Strand Falckenstein. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n alemana del norte de Schleswig-Holstein. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a esta ubicaci&oacute;n con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con una autocaravana grande. Te lleva unos 400 metros de caminata desde el estacionamiento hasta la playa. Una vez que est&aacute;s en la playa tienes una longitud total de varios kil&oacute;metros y hasta 100 metros de ancho de playa disponibles. Toda la zona de la playa es muy plana, lo que hace que la entrada al agua sea muy c&oacute;moda. El fondo marino tambi&eacute;n es muy plano aqu&iacute;, por lo que el punto de nado est&aacute; alrededor de los 75 metros. Los servicios de playa, que est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, son solo b&aacute;sicos. Algunos chiringuitos y restaurantes est&aacute;n disponibles en la playa. El alojamiento en esta playa no est&aacute; disponible directamente, sino m&aacute;s bien en direcci&oacute;n a la ciudad de Kiel. Disfruta de tu playa y recuerda, utiliza siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3875, 'es', 1),
(2139, 'Wenn Sie auf der Suche nach einem gro&szlig;en braunen Sandstrand in der N&auml;he der deutschen Stadt Kiel mit viel Strandfl&auml;che sind, empfehlen wir Ihnen den Strand Falckenstein zu besuchen. Es liegt in der norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit einem gro&szlig;en Wohnmobil, sehr gut zu erreichen. Vom Parkplatz bis zum Strand sind es etwa 400 Meter zu Fu&szlig;. Einmal am Strand angekommen, stehen Ihnen eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und bis zu 100 Meter Strandbreite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der gesamte Strandbereich ist sehr flach, was den Wassereinstieg sehr angenehm macht. Der Meeresboden ist hier auch sehr flach, weshalb der Schwimmpunkt bei etwa 75 Metern liegt. Die Stranddienste, die hier verf&uuml;gbar sind, sind nur grundlegend. Am Strand gibt es einige Strandbars und Restaurants. Unterk&uuml;nfte gibt es an diesem Strand nicht direkt, sondern eher Richtung Kiel. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 3875, 'de', 1),
(2140, 'La playa del norte de Alemania, situada en el Mar B&aacute;ltico, Strand Schilksee es una playa de tipo familiar con una superficie de arena. Se encuentra cerca de la ciudad de Kiel. La regi&oacute;n donde se encuentra la playa se llama Schleswig-Holstein. Si viaja con un autom&oacute;vil o una casa rodante, esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de f&aacute;cil acceso. Un aparcamiento muy grande le espera cerca de la playa. Se tarda unos 300 metros a pie para llegar desde el aparcamiento hasta la playa. La playa tiene una longitud total de 1 kil&oacute;metro y puede tener hasta 40 metros de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y ya puedes empezar a nadar despu&eacute;s de 15 metros. Cerca de la playa tienes un puerto y alguna infraestructura playera con muchos servicios de playa. Un restaurante y una cafeter&iacute;a tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n cerca. Para el alojamiento se puede elegir entre apartamentos y habitaciones libres. Disfruta de tu playa y recuerda usar siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os. Regularmente agregamos nuevas playas a nuestra plataforma, de todo el mundo, siempre hay una nueva playa para admirar y explorar.', 3876, 'es', 1),
(2141, 'Plage du nord de l&#39;Allemagne, situ&eacute;e sur la mer Baltique, Strand Schilksee est une plage de type familial avec une surface sablonneuse. Il est situ&eacute; pr&egrave;s de la ville de Kiel. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve la plage s&#39;appelle Schleswig-Holstein. Si vous voyagez avec une voiture ou un camping-car, cet endroit est facilement accessible. Un tr&egrave;s grand parking vous attend &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la plage. Il vous faudra environ 300 m&egrave;tres de marche pour vous rendre du parking &agrave; la plage. La plage a une longueur totale de 1 kilom&egrave;tre et peut mesurer jusqu&#39;&agrave; 40 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et vous pouvez d&eacute;j&agrave; commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s 15 m&egrave;tres. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, vous avez un port et des infrastructures de plage avec de nombreux services de plage. Un restaurant et un caf&eacute;-bar sont &eacute;galement &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Pour l&#39;h&eacute;bergement, vous pouvez choisir entre des appartements et des chambres libres. Profitez de votre plage et n&#39;oubliez pas de toujours utiliser BeachRex pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves. Nous ajoutons r&eacute;guli&egrave;rement de nouvelles plages &agrave; notre plateforme, du monde entier, il y a toujours une nouvelle plage &agrave; admirer et &agrave; explorer.', 3876, 'fr', 1),
(2142, 'La spiaggia della Germania settentrionale, situata sul Mar Baltico, Strand Schilksee &egrave; una spiaggia di tipo familiare con una superficie sabbiosa. Si trova vicino alla citt&agrave; di Kiel. La regione in cui si trova la spiaggia si chiama Schleswig-Holstein. Se viaggi con un&#39;auto o un camper questa posizione &egrave; facile da raggiungere. Un parcheggio molto ampio vi aspetta vicino alla spiaggia. Ci vogliono circa 300 metri a piedi per arrivare dal parcheggio alla spiaggia. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 1 chilometro e pu&ograve; essere larga fino a 40 metri. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; dopo 15 metri. Vicino alla spiaggia hai un porto e alcune infrastrutture balneari con molti servizi balneari. Nelle vicinanze si trovano anche un ristorante e un bar. Per l&#39;alloggio si pu&ograve; scegliere tra appartamenti e camere libere. Goditi la tua spiaggia e ricordati di utilizzare sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno. Aggiungiamo regolarmente nuove spiagge alla nostra piattaforma, da tutto il mondo, c&#39;&egrave; sempre una nuova spiaggia da ammirare ed esplorare.', 3876, 'it', 1),
(2143, 'Der norddeutsche Strand an der Ostsee, Strand Schilksee, ist ein Familienstrand mit einer sandigen Oberfl&auml;che. Es liegt in der N&auml;he der Stadt Kiel. Die Region, in der sich der Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Schleswig-Holstein. Wenn Sie mit einem Auto oder Wohnmobil anreisen, ist dieser Ort leicht zu erreichen. Ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz erwartet Sie in der N&auml;he des Strandes. Vom Parkplatz bis zum Strand sind es etwa 300 Meter zu Fu&szlig;. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 1 Kilometer und kann bis zu 40 Meter breit sein. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und man kann bereits nach 15 Metern mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. In der N&auml;he des Strandes gibt es einen Hafen und eine Strandinfrastruktur mit vielen Stranddiensten. Ein Restaurant und eine Kaffeebar befinden sich ebenfalls in der N&auml;he. Bei der Unterkunft k&ouml;nnen Sie zwischen Appartements und freien Zimmern w&auml;hlen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand und denken Sie daran, immer BeachRex zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden. Wir f&uuml;gen unserer Plattform regelm&auml;&szlig;ig neue Str&auml;nde aus der ganzen Welt hinzu, es gibt immer einen neuen Strand zu bestaunen und zu erkunden.', 3876, 'de', 1),
(2144, 'La spiaggia della Germania settentrionale Strand Schwedeneck &egrave; adatta a chi desidera avere una spiaggia sabbiosa vicino a un campeggio, con tanti servizi balneari, anche un circolo velico, sulla spiaggia. Per vivere un&#39;esperienza del genere &egrave; necessario guidare nella regione della Germania settentrionale Schleswig-Holstein. Questa posizione &egrave; accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, camper inclusi e dal parcheggio bastano solo 100 metri di camminata per raggiungere la spiaggia. La spiaggia ha una vasta area, &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga fino a 75 metri. Per accedere alla spiaggia &egrave; necessario pagare una tassa di 1,5&euro; a persona. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 50 metri. Sulla spiaggia sono disponibili molte infrastrutture e servizi balneari. Sono disponibili anche alcune opzioni per prendere qualcosa da mangiare e da bere. Per il tuo alloggio puoi scegliere un campeggio o alcuni appartamenti nel villaggio di Schwedeneck. Goditi la tua spiaggia e ricordati di usare sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.', 3877, 'it', 1),
(2145, 'La plage nord-allemande Strand Schwedeneck convient &agrave; ceux qui souhaitent avoir une plage de sable pr&egrave;s d&#39;un terrain de camping, avec de nombreux services de plage, ainsi qu&#39;un club de voile, sur la plage. Pour vivre une telle exp&eacute;rience, vous devez vous rendre dans la r&eacute;gion du nord de l&#39;Allemagne, le Schleswig-Holstein. Cet emplacement est accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, camping-cars inclus et depuis le parking, il ne vous faut que 100 m&egrave;tres de marche pour rejoindre la plage. La plage a une grande superficie, elle fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 75 m&egrave;tres de large. Pour acc&eacute;der &agrave; la plage, il faut s&#39;acquitter d&#39;une taxe de 1,5&euro; par personne. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de nage est &agrave; 50 m&egrave;tres. Sur la plage, vous disposez de nombreuses infrastructures et services de plage. Quelques options pour se restaurer et se d&eacute;salt&eacute;rer sont &eacute;galement disponibles. Pour votre h&eacute;bergement, vous pouvez choisir un terrain de camping ou des appartements dans le village de Schwedeneck. Profitez de votre plage et n&#39;oubliez pas de toujours utiliser BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.', 3877, 'fr', 1),
(2146, 'La playa del norte de Alemania, Strand Schwedeneck, es adecuada para aquellos a los que les gustar&iacute;a tener una playa de arena cerca de un camping, con muchos servicios de playa, tambi&eacute;n un club n&aacute;utico, en la playa. Para tener una experiencia as&iacute;, debe conducir hasta la regi&oacute;n del norte de Alemania, Schleswig-Holstein. A esta ubicaci&oacute;n se puede acceder con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, incluidas las autocaravanas, y desde el aparcamiento se tardan solo 100 metros a pie en llegar a la playa. La playa tiene una gran superficie, tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y hasta 75 metros de ancho. Para acceder a la playa hay que pagar una tasa de 1,5&euro; por persona. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de nado est&aacute; a 50 metros. En la playa tienes mucha infraestructura y servicios de playa disponibles. Algunas opciones para conseguir algo de comer y beber tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles. Para su alojamiento puede elegir un camping o algunos apartamentos en el pueblo de Schwedeneck. Disfruta de tu playa y recuerda utilizar siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 3877, 'es', 1),
(2147, 'Der norddeutsche Strand Schwedeneck ist f&uuml;r diejenigen geeignet, die einen Sandstrand in der N&auml;he eines Campingplatzes mit vielen Stranddiensten, auch einem Segelclub, am Strand haben m&ouml;chten. Um ein solches Erlebnis zu haben, m&uuml;ssen Sie in die norddeutsche Region Schleswig-Holstein fahren. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichbar, einschlie&szlig;lich Wohnmobilen, und vom Parkplatz aus sind es nur 100 Meter zu Fu&szlig; zum Strand. Der Strand hat eine gro&szlig;e Fl&auml;che, er ist mehrere Kilometer lang und bis zu 75 Meter breit. F&uuml;r den Zugang zum Strand m&uuml;ssen Sie eine Geb&uuml;hr von 1,5 &euro; pro Person entrichten. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 50 Metern. Am Strand stehen Ihnen viele Strandinfrastrukturen und Dienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung. Einige M&ouml;glichkeiten, etwas zu essen und zu trinken, sind ebenfalls vorhanden. F&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft k&ouml;nnen Sie einen Campingplatz oder einige Appartements im Dorf Schwedeneck w&auml;hlen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand und denken Sie daran, immer BeachRex zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 3877, 'de', 1),
(2148, 'En la playa del norte de Alemania, Strand Goosefeld, encontrar&aacute; mucha zona de playa. En algunos lugares tiene 100 m de ancho y hasta 1 km de largo. Si te gusta este tipo de playa y te gustar&iacute;a visitarla, se encuentra cerca de la ciudad de Eckernf&ouml;rde en la regi&oacute;n de Schleswig-Holstein. Tanto si viaja con el coche como con una autocaravana, puede aparcar casi directamente en la playa, donde le esperan plazas de aparcamiento muy amplias, a solo 30 m de la playa. La entrada de agua en la playa es c&oacute;moda y el punto de nado est&aacute; a 20 m. Tambi&eacute;n tiene algo de infraestructura de playa aqu&iacute;, incluido un parque infantil y algunos campos de voleibol de playa. Un chiringuito y algunos restaurantes tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n directamente en la playa, si tienes hambre o te gustar&iacute;a probar una cerveza alemana o un caf&eacute; de playa. La mayor parte del alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en forma de apartamentos cercanos. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 3878, 'es', 1),
(2149, 'Sur la plage nord-allemande Strand Goosefeld, vous trouverez de nombreuses plages. &Agrave; certains endroits, il mesure 100 m de large et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 1 km de long. Si vous aimez ce genre de plage et que vous souhaitez la visiter, elle est situ&eacute;e pr&egrave;s de la ville d&#39;Eckernf&ouml;rde dans la r&eacute;gion du Schleswig-Holstein. Que vous voyagiez en voiture ou en camping-car, vous pouvez vous garer presque directement sur la plage, o&ugrave; se trouvent de tr&egrave;s grandes places de parking, &agrave; seulement 30 m de la plage vous attend. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau sur la plage est confortable et le point de baignade est &agrave; 20 m. Vous avez &eacute;galement une infrastructure de plage ici, y compris une aire de jeux pour enfants et quelques terrains de beach-volley. Un bar de plage et quelques restaurants se trouvent &eacute;galement directement sur la plage, si vous avez faim ou si vous souhaitez d&eacute;guster une bi&egrave;re allemande ou un caf&eacute; de plage. La plupart des logements sont disponibles sous forme d&#39;appartements &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3878, 'fr', 1),
(2150, 'Sulla spiaggia della Germania settentrionale Strand Goosefeld troverai molte spiagge. In alcuni punti &egrave; largo 100 m e lungo fino a 1 km. Se ti piace questo tipo di spiaggia e vorresti visitarla, si trova vicino alla citt&agrave; di Eckernf&ouml;rde nella regione dello Schleswig-Holstein. Sia se viaggi con l&#39;auto che con un camper puoi parcheggiare quasi direttamente in spiaggia, dove ci sono parcheggi molto grandi, a soli 30 m dalla spiaggia ti aspettano. L&#39;ingresso in acqua della spiaggia &egrave; comodo e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 20 m. Hai anche alcune infrastrutture balneari qui, incluso un parco giochi per bambini e alcuni campi da beach volley. Un bar sulla spiaggia e alcuni ristoranti sono anche direttamente sulla spiaggia, se hai fame o vuoi assaggiare una birra tedesca o un caff&egrave; sulla spiaggia. La maggior parte degli alloggi &egrave; disponibile sotto forma di appartamenti nelle vicinanze. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3878, 'it', 1),
(2151, 'Am norddeutschen Strand Goosefeld finden Sie jede Menge Strandbereich. An einigen Stellen ist er 100 m breit und bis zu 1 km lang. Wenn Ihnen diese Art von Strand gef&auml;llt und Sie ihn besuchen m&ouml;chten, befindet er sich in der N&auml;he der Stadt Eckernf&ouml;rde in der Region Schleswig-Holstein. Egal, ob Sie mit dem Auto oder Wohnmobil anreisen, Sie k&ouml;nnen fast direkt am Strand parken, wo ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt auf Sie wartet. Der Wassereintritt am Strand ist bequem und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 20 m. Sie haben hier auch etwas Strandinfrastruktur, darunter ein Kinderspielplatz und ein paar Beachvolleyballfelder. Eine Strandbar und einige Restaurants befinden sich auch direkt am Strand, falls der Hunger kommt oder Sie mal ein deutsches Bier oder einen Strandkaffee probieren m&ouml;chten. Die meisten Unterk&uuml;nfte sind in Form von Apartments in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 3878, 'de', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(2152, 'Se stai cercando una spiaggia sabbiosa nella regione della Germania settentrionale Schleswig-Holstein, dove puoi parcheggiare il tuo veicolo quasi direttamente sulla spiaggia in una citt&agrave; moderna, ti consigliamo di visitare la citt&agrave; di Eckernf&ouml;rde. Il parcheggio, che dista solo 30 metri dalla spiaggia, pu&ograve; ospitare pi&ugrave; di 100 veicoli, anche camper. L&#39;intera area intorno alla spiaggia &egrave; molto organizzata con molte infrastrutture balneari e servizi balneari. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di diversi chilometri e nella parte pi&ugrave; larga &egrave; larga 50 metri. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; dovuto al fondale piatto a 50 metri. Sulla spiaggia ci sono anche molti campi da pallavolo e un parco giochi per bambini. Ristoranti e bar sono direttamente sulla spiaggia. Come di consueto in Germania, anche su questa spiaggia &egrave; possibile noleggiare la tipica sdraio da spiaggia tedesca. Hai diverse opzioni per scegliere il tuo alloggio, principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti, se desideri rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo. Trascorri una bella giornata al mare, una settimana o un mese sulla tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3879, 'it', 1),
(2153, 'Si vous recherchez une plage de sable dans la r&eacute;gion du nord de l&#39;Allemagne Schleswig-Holstein, o&ugrave; vous pouvez garer votre v&eacute;hicule presque directement sur la plage dans une ville moderne, nous vous sugg&eacute;rons de visiter la ville d&#39;Eckernf&ouml;rde. Le parking, situ&eacute; &agrave; seulement 30 m&egrave;tres de la plage, peut accueillir plus de 100 v&eacute;hicules, &eacute;galement des camping-cars. Toute la zone autour de la plage est tr&egrave;s organis&eacute;e avec de nombreuses infrastructures de plage et des services de plage. La longueur totale de la plage est de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et sa partie la plus large mesure 50 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et l&#39;int&eacute;r&ecirc;t de la nage est d&ucirc; au fond plat &agrave; 50 m&egrave;tres. Sur la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreux terrains de volley-ball et une aire de jeux pour enfants. Les restaurants et les caf&eacute;s sont directement sur la plage. Comme il est d&#39;usage en Allemagne, vous pouvez &eacute;galement louer la chaise de plage allemande typique sur cette plage. Vous avez plusieurs options pour choisir votre logement, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements, si vous souhaitez y rester plus longtemps. Passez une belle journ&eacute;e, semaine ou mois de plage sur votre plage avec BeachRex.', 3879, 'fr', 1),
(2154, 'Si est&aacute; buscando una playa de arena en la regi&oacute;n de Schleswig-Holstein, en el norte de Alemania, donde pueda estacionar su veh&iacute;culo casi directamente en la playa en una ciudad moderna, le sugerimos que visite la ciudad de Eckernf&ouml;rde. El parking, que se encuentra a tan solo 30 metros de la playa, tiene capacidad para m&aacute;s de 100 veh&iacute;culos, tambi&eacute;n autocaravanas. Toda el &aacute;rea alrededor de la playa est&aacute; muy organizada con mucha infraestructura y servicios de playa. La longitud total de la playa es de varios kil&oacute;metros, y en la parte m&aacute;s ancha tiene 50 metros de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de nado es por el fondo plano a 50 metros. En la playa tambi&eacute;n hay muchas canchas de voleibol y un parque infantil. Los restaurantes y cafeter&iacute;as est&aacute;n directamente en la playa. Como es habitual en Alemania puedes alquilar la t&iacute;pica tumbona alemana tambi&eacute;n en esta playa. Tienes varias opciones para elegir tu alojamiento, principalmente en forma de apartamentos, si deseas quedarte aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo. Que tengas un buen d&iacute;a de playa, semana o mes en tu playa con BeachRex.', 3879, 'es', 1),
(2155, 'Wenn Sie in der norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein einen Sandstrand suchen, an dem Sie Ihr Fahrzeug fast direkt am Strand in einer modernen Gro&szlig;stadt parken k&ouml;nnen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, die Stadt Eckernf&ouml;rde zu besuchen. Der nur 30 Meter vom Strand entfernte Parkplatz bietet Platz f&uuml;r mehr als 100 Fahrzeuge, auch Wohnmobile. Das gesamte Gebiet rund um den Strand ist sehr organisiert mit viel Strandinfrastruktur und Strandservices. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und an der breitesten Stelle ist er 50 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt wegen des flachen Meeresbodens bei 50 Metern. Am Strand gibt es auch viele Volleyballfelder und einen Kinderspielplatz. Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s befinden sich direkt am Strand. Wie in Deutschland &uuml;blich, kann man auch an diesem Strand den typisch deutschen Strandkorb mieten. Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, Ihre Unterkunft zu w&auml;hlen, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Apartments, wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten. Verbringen Sie mit BeachRex einen sch&ouml;nen Strandtag, eine Woche oder einen Monat an Ihrem Strand.', 3879, 'de', 1),
(2156, 'La playa Strand Eickholt es una verdadera playa de campamento. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n del norte de Alemania, Schleswig-Holstein, cerca del pueblo de Waabs. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es de f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo; Las autocaravanas tambi&eacute;n son bienvenidas aqu&iacute;. Si viajas con la autocaravana tambi&eacute;n puedes alojarte dentro del campamento y estar a escasos metros de la playa. La longitud total de la playa es de varios kil&oacute;metros y puede tener hasta 20 metros de ancho. La superficie principal de la playa son peque&ntilde;os guijarros, pero tambi&eacute;n hay algo de arena mezclada. El fondo del mar es bastante plano, lo que hace que el punto de nadar sea de 40 metros. Debido al campamento cercano, muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;. Tambi&eacute;n hay un restaurante en la playa, y para su alojamiento solo tiene disponible el campamento. Disfrute de su d&iacute;a de playa, su semana de playa o sus vacaciones en la playa en esta playa con BeachRex.', 3880, 'es', 1),
(2157, 'La plage Strand Eickholt est une v&eacute;ritable plage de camping. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion du nord de l&#39;Allemagne Schleswig-Holstein pr&egrave;s du village de Waabs. Cet emplacement est facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule; les camping-cars sont &eacute;galement les bienvenus ici. Si vous voyagez avec le camping-car, vous pouvez &eacute;galement rester &agrave; l&#39;int&eacute;rieur du camping et n&#39;&ecirc;tre qu&#39;&agrave; quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage. La longueur totale de la plage est de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et elle peut mesurer jusqu&#39;&agrave; 20 m&egrave;tres de large. La surface principale de la plage est constitu&eacute;e de petits galets, mais vous avez aussi du sable m&ecirc;l&eacute; &agrave; dedans. Le fond marin est assez plat ce qui fait le point de nager &agrave; 40 m&egrave;tres. En raison du camp &agrave; proximit&eacute;, de nombreux services de plage sont disponibles ici. Un restaurant se trouve &eacute;galement sur la plage, et pour votre h&eacute;bergement vous n&#39;avez que le camp disponible. Profitez de votre journ&eacute;e &agrave; la plage, de votre semaine &agrave; la plage ou de vos vacances &agrave; la plage sur cette plage avec BeachRex.', 3880, 'fr', 1),
(2158, 'La spiaggia Strand Eickholt &egrave; una vera spiaggia da campeggio. Si trova nella regione della Germania settentrionale Schleswig-Holstein vicino al villaggio di Waabs. Questa localit&agrave; &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo; anche i camper sono i benvenuti qui. Se viaggi con il camper puoi anche stare all&#39;interno del campeggio ed essere a pochi metri dalla spiaggia. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di diversi chilometri e pu&ograve; raggiungere i 20 metri di larghezza. La superficie principale della spiaggia &egrave; di piccoli ciottoli, ma c&#39;&egrave; anche della sabbia mista a dentro. Il fondale &egrave; abbastanza piatto, il che rende il punto di bagno a 40 metri. A causa del vicino campeggio, qui sono disponibili molti servizi di spiaggia. Sulla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; anche un ristorante e per il tuo alloggio hai a disposizione solo il campo. Goditi la tua giornata al mare, la tua settimana al mare o la tua vacanza al mare su questa spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3880, 'it', 1),
(2159, 'Der Strand Strand Eickholt ist ein wahrer Campingstrand. Es liegt in der norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein in der N&auml;he des Dorfes Waabs. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug leicht zu erreichen; Auch Wohnmobile sind hier willkommen. Wenn Sie mit dem Wohnmobil unterwegs sind, k&ouml;nnen Sie auch im Camp &uuml;bernachten und sind nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und kann bis zu 20 Meter breit sein. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che des Strandes sind kleine Kieselsteine, aber Sie haben auch etwas Sand eingemischt. Der Meeresboden ist ziemlich flach, was den Punkt zum Schwimmen auf 40 Meter bringt. Aufgrund des nahe gelegenen Camps sind hier viele Stranddienste verf&uuml;gbar. Ein Restaurant befindet sich auch am Strand, und f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft steht Ihnen nur das Camp zur Verf&uuml;gung. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandtag, Ihre Strandwoche oder Ihren Strandurlaub an diesem Strand mit BeachRex.', 3880, 'de', 1),
(2160, 'La maggior parte delle spiagge tedesche sul Mar Baltico sono di tipo sabbioso, ma ce ne sono anche alcune che hanno per lo pi&ugrave; piccoli ciottoli sulla spiaggia o sono una miscela di entrambi. Se ti piacciono le spiagge con piccoli ciottoli, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand Schwastrum. Si trova nella regione della Germania settentrionale Schleswig-Holstein. Il parcheggio, che dista solo 50 mt dalla spiaggia, &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile con qualsiasi mezzo, anche camper. Quando arrivi in ​​spiaggia hai a disposizione diversi chilometri di lunghezza, oltre a 25 metri di larghezza. La maggior parte dei ciottoli si trova all&#39;inizio della spiaggia, pi&ugrave; ci si avvicina al mare pi&ugrave; sabbia si ha, il che rende l&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua pi&ugrave; confortevole. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 30 m. Alcuni servizi in spiaggia sono disponibili qui, e se vuoi puoi noleggiare alcune attrezzature per gli sport acquatici estremi. Un ristorante e un bistrot si trovano direttamente sulla spiaggia. Su questa spiaggia l&#39;unica sistemazione possibile &egrave; quella del campeggio. Ci auguriamo che tu abbia una bella giornata in spiaggia con BeachRex. Goditi la tua spiaggia.', 3881, 'it', 1),
(2161, 'La plupart des plages allemandes de la mer Baltique sont de type sablonneux, mais il y en a aussi qui ont principalement de petits cailloux sur la plage ou qui sont un m&eacute;lange des deux. Si vous aimez les plages de petits galets, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage Strand Schwastrum. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion du nord de l&#39;Allemagne Schleswig-Holstein. Le parking, situ&eacute; &agrave; seulement 50 m&egrave;tres de la plage, est facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, m&ecirc;me un camping-car. Lorsque vous arrivez &agrave; la plage, vous disposez de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de longueur, ainsi que de 25 m&egrave;tres de largeur. La plupart des galets sont au d&eacute;but de la plage, plus on se rapproche de la mer plus on a de sable, ce qui rend l&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau plus confortable. Le point de nage est &agrave; environ 30 m. Certains services de plage sont disponibles ici, et si vous le souhaitez, vous pouvez louer du mat&eacute;riel pour les sports nautiques extr&ecirc;mes. Un restaurant et un bistro sont situ&eacute;s directement sur la plage. Sur cette plage, le seul logement possible est au camping. Nous esp&eacute;rons que vous passerez une belle journ&eacute;e &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex. Profitez de votre plage.', 3881, 'fr', 1),
(2162, 'La mayor&iacute;a de las playas alemanas en el mar B&aacute;ltico son del tipo arenoso, pero tambi&eacute;n hay algunas que tienen en su mayor&iacute;a peque&ntilde;os guijarros en la playa o son una mezcla de ambos. Si te gustan las playas con guijarros peque&ntilde;os, te recomendamos visitar la playa Strand Schwastrum. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n alemana del norte de Schleswig-Holstein. El parking, que se encuentra a tan solo 50m de la playa, es de f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana. Cuando llegas a la playa tienes disponibles varios kil&oacute;metros de largo, as&iacute; como 25 metros de ancho. La mayor&iacute;a de los cantos rodados est&aacute;n al principio de la playa, cuanto m&aacute;s te acercas al mar m&aacute;s arena tienes, lo que hace que la entrada al agua sea m&aacute;s c&oacute;moda. El punto de nado est&aacute; a unos 30 m. Algunos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;, y si lo desea, puede alquilar algunos equipos para deportes acu&aacute;ticos extremos. Un restaurante y un bistr&oacute; se encuentran directamente en la playa. En esta playa el &uacute;nico alojamiento posible es en el camping. Esperamos que tengas un buen d&iacute;a de playa con BeachRex. Disfruta de tu playa.', 3881, 'es', 1),
(2163, 'Die meisten deutschen Ostseestr&auml;nde sind Sandstr&auml;nde, es gibt aber auch welche, die meist kleine Kieselsteine ​​am Strand haben oder eine Mischung aus beidem sind. Wenn Sie Str&auml;nde mit kleinen Kieselsteinen m&ouml;gen, empfehlen wir Ihnen den Strand Schwastrum zu besuchen. Es liegt in der norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein. Der nur 50m vom Strand entfernte Parkplatz ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch Wohnmobil, gut zu erreichen. Wenn Sie den Strand erreichen, stehen Ihnen mehrere Kilometer L&auml;nge und 25 Meter Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die meisten Kieselsteine ​​befinden sich am Anfang des Strandes, je n&auml;her Sie dem Meer kommen, desto mehr Sand haben Sie, was das Eintreten ins Wasser angenehmer macht. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 30 m. Einige Strandservices sind hier verf&uuml;gbar, und wenn Sie m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie Ausr&uuml;stung f&uuml;r extreme Wassersportarten mieten. Ein Restaurant und ein Bistro befinden sich direkt am Strand. An diesem Strand ist die einzig m&ouml;gliche Unterkunft auf dem Campingplatz. Wir w&uuml;nschen Ihnen einen sch&ouml;nen Strandtag mit BeachRex. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand.', 3881, 'de', 1),
(2164, 'Lejos en la regi&oacute;n del norte de Alemania, Schleswig-Holstein, cerca de Dinamarca, tienes una ciudad muy hermosa, Gl&uuml;cksburg, con una playa a&uacute;n m&aacute;s hermosa, llamada Strand Gl&uuml;cksburg. La playa est&aacute; completamente cubierta de arena, es muy organizada, con una hermosa forma arquitect&oacute;nica y es recomendada para usuarios de tipo familiar. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravana. Tienes m&uacute;ltiples opciones para aparcar tu coche, y la m&aacute;s cercana est&aacute; a tan solo 50 metros de la playa. En esta playa tienes mucha infraestructura y servicios de playa, por lo que tambi&eacute;n tienes que pagar una tasa de playa de 2,6&euro;. La playa tiene una longitud total de 300 metros y tiene 30 metros de ancho. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de nado est&aacute; a unos 15 metros. Tienes muchas opciones para encontrar algo para comer o beber aqu&iacute;. Y para tu alojamiento puedes elegir un hotel directamente en la playa o algunos apartamentos en el barrio. Le deseamos un buen d&iacute;a de playa y recuerde usar siempre BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os.', 3886, 'es', 1),
(2165, 'Loin dans la r&eacute;gion du nord de l&#39;Allemagne, le Schleswig-Holstein, pr&egrave;s du Danemark, vous avez une tr&egrave;s belle ville de Gl&uuml;cksburg avec une plage encore plus belle, appel&eacute;e Strand Gl&uuml;cksburg. La plage est enti&egrave;rement recouverte de sable, est tr&egrave;s organis&eacute;e, avec une belle forme architecturale et est recommand&eacute;e pour les utilisateurs de type familial. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;y acc&eacute;der avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, m&ecirc;me un camping-car. Vous avez plusieurs options pour garer votre voiture, et la plus proche se trouve &agrave; seulement 50 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Sur cette plage, vous avez beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures et de services de plage, c&#39;est aussi la raison pour laquelle vous devez payer une taxe de plage de 2,6 &euro;. La plage a une longueur totale de 300 m&egrave;tres et une largeur de 30 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de nage est &agrave; environ 15 m&egrave;tres. Vous avez beaucoup d&#39;options pour trouver quelque chose &agrave; manger ou &agrave; boire ici. Et pour votre h&eacute;bergement, vous pouvez choisir un h&ocirc;tel directement sur la plage ou des appartements dans le quartier. Nous vous souhaitons une belle journ&eacute;e &agrave; la plage et n&#39;oubliez pas de toujours utiliser BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.', 3886, 'fr', 1),
(2166, 'Lontano nella regione della Germania settentrionale Schleswig-Holstein, vicino alla Danimarca, hai una bellissima citt&agrave; Gl&uuml;cksburg con una spiaggia ancora pi&ugrave; bella, chiamata Strand Gl&uuml;cksburg. La spiaggia &egrave; completamente ricoperta di sabbia, &egrave; molto organizzata, con una bella forma architettonica ed &egrave; consigliata per un&#39;utenza di tipo familiare. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungerlo con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche un camper. Hai pi&ugrave; opzioni per parcheggiare la tua auto e quella pi&ugrave; vicina &egrave; a soli 50 metri dalla spiaggia. Su questa spiaggia hai molte infrastrutture e servizi balneari, motivo per cui devi pagare una tassa sulla spiaggia di 2,6&euro;. La spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di 300 metri ed &egrave; larga 30 metri. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 15 metri. Hai molte opzioni per trovare qualcosa da mangiare o da bere qui. E per il tuo alloggio puoi scegliere un hotel direttamente sulla spiaggia o alcuni appartamenti nelle vicinanze. Ti auguriamo una buona giornata al mare e ricordati di utilizzare sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.', 3886, 'it', 1),
(2167, 'Weit oben in der norddeutschen Region Schleswig-Holstein, in der N&auml;he von D&auml;nemark, haben Sie eine sehr sch&ouml;ne Stadt Gl&uuml;cksburg mit einem noch sch&ouml;neren Strand namens Strand Gl&uuml;cksburg. Der Strand ist vollst&auml;ndig mit Sand bedeckt, sehr organisiert, mit einer sch&ouml;nen architektonischen Form und wird f&uuml;r Familien empfohlen. Es ist sehr einfach mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch einem Wohnmobil, zu erreichen. Sie haben mehrere M&ouml;glichkeiten, Ihr Auto zu parken, und der n&auml;chste ist nur 50 Meter vom Strand entfernt. An diesem Strand gibt es viele Strandinfrastrukturen und -dienste, weshalb Sie auch eine Strandgeb&uuml;hr von 2,6 &euro; zahlen m&uuml;ssen. Der Strand hat eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von 300 Metern und ist 30 Meter breit. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 15 Metern. Hier haben Sie viele M&ouml;glichkeiten, etwas zu essen oder zu trinken. Und f&uuml;r Ihre Unterkunft k&ouml;nnen Sie ein Hotel direkt am Strand oder einige Apartments in der Nachbarschaft w&auml;hlen. Wir w&uuml;nschen Ihnen einen sch&ouml;nen Strandtag und denken Sie daran, immer BeachRex zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 3886, 'de', 1),
(2168, 'Se stai cercando una spiaggia sabbiosa vicino alla citt&agrave; di Flensburg, nella Germania settentrionale, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand Harrislee. Non &egrave; lontano dal confine danese e anche molto vicino alla citt&agrave; di Flensburg. La regione in cui si trova la spiaggia &egrave; Schleswig-Holstein. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche camper di grandi dimensioni e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare quasi direttamente sulla spiaggia, a soli 30 m. Quando arrivi in ​​spiaggia hai molta superficie a disposizione. La lunghezza della spiaggia &egrave; di 500 metri ed &egrave; larga 75 m. La pendenza della spiaggia &egrave; abbastanza pianeggiante, il che rende molto piacevole l&#39;ingresso in acqua e il punto di balneazione a circa 20 m. In spiaggia sono disponibili molti servizi spiaggia, hai anche a disposizione tanti diversi parchi giochi per bambini e alcuni campi sportivi. Molti ristoranti e bar sono disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia. Se desideri rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo, hai molte diverse opzioni di alloggio disponibili direttamente sulla spiaggia o nelle sue vicinanze. Ti auguriamo una piacevole giornata al mare o una vacanza al mare con BeachRex.', 3887, 'it', 1),
(2169, 'Si vous cherchez une plage de sable pr&egrave;s de la ville nord-allemande de Flensburg, nous vous recommandons de visiter la plage Strand Harrislee. Ce n&#39;est pas loin de la fronti&egrave;re danoise et aussi tr&egrave;s pr&egrave;s de la ville de Flensburg. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve la plage est le Schleswig-Holstein. Cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, y compris les grands camping-cars et vous pouvez vous garer presque directement sur la plage, &agrave; seulement 30 m. Lorsque vous arrivez &agrave; la plage, vous avez beaucoup de surface de plage disponible. La longueur de la plage est de 500 m&egrave;tres et sa largeur de 75 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;inclinaison sur la plage est assez plate, ce qui en fait une entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade &agrave; environ 20 m. De nombreux services de plage sont disponibles sur la plage, vous disposez &eacute;galement de nombreuses aires de jeux pour enfants et de quelques terrains de sport. De nombreux restaurants et caf&eacute;s sont disponibles directement sur la plage. Si vous souhaitez rester ici plus longtemps, vous avez de nombreuses options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement disponibles directement sur la plage ou &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Nous vous souhaitons une agr&eacute;able journ&eacute;e &agrave; la plage ou des vacances &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex.', 3887, 'fr', 1),
(2170, 'Si est&aacute; buscando una playa de arena cerca de la ciudad de Flensburg, en el norte de Alemania, le recomendamos que visite la playa Strand Harrislee. No est&aacute; lejos de la frontera danesa y tambi&eacute;n muy cerca de la ciudad de Flensburg. La regi&oacute;n en la que se encuentra la playa es Schleswig-Holstein. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a esta ubicaci&oacute;n con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n con autocaravanas grandes y se puede aparcar casi directamente en la playa, a solo 30 m. Cuando llegas a la playa tienes mucha superficie de playa disponible. La longitud de la playa es de 500 metros y tiene 75 m de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es bastante llana, lo que hace que la entrada al agua sea muy agradable y el punto de nado a unos 20 m. Muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles en la playa, tambi&eacute;n tienes disponibles diferentes parques infantiles y algunos campos deportivos. Muchos restaurantes y cafeter&iacute;as est&aacute;n disponibles directamente en la playa. Si desea quedarse aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo, tiene muchas opciones de alojamiento diferentes disponibles directamente en la playa o en sus alrededores. Le deseamos un agradable d&iacute;a de playa o unas vacaciones en la playa con BeachRex.', 3887, 'es', 1),
(2171, 'Wenn Sie auf der Suche nach einem Sandstrand in der N&auml;he der norddeutschen Stadt Flensburg sind, empfehlen wir Ihnen den Strand Harrislee zu besuchen. Es ist nicht weit von der d&auml;nischen Grenze entfernt und auch ganz in der N&auml;he der Stadt Flensburg. Die Region, in der sich der Strand befindet, ist Schleswig-Holstein. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug, auch mit gro&szlig;en Wohnmobilen, sehr gut zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen fast direkt am Strand parken, nur 30 m entfernt. Wenn Sie den Strand erreichen, steht Ihnen viel Strandfl&auml;che zur Verf&uuml;gung. Der Strand ist 500 Meter lang und 75 Meter breit. Die Neigung am Strand ist recht flach, was einen sehr angenehmen Wassereintritt und den Schwimmpunkt bei etwa 20 m erm&ouml;glicht. Am Strand stehen Ihnen viele Strandservices zur Verf&uuml;gung, Ihnen stehen auch viele verschiedene Kinderspielpl&auml;tze und einige Sportpl&auml;tze zur Verf&uuml;gung. Direkt am Strand gibt es viele Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s. Wenn Sie l&auml;nger hierbleiben m&ouml;chten, stehen Ihnen viele verschiedene Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten direkt am Strand oder in seiner N&auml;he zur Verf&uuml;gung. Wir w&uuml;nschen Ihnen einen angenehmen Strandtag oder Strandurlaub mit BeachRex.', 3887, 'de', 1),
(2172, 'Se sei a Rotterdam e stai cercando la spiaggia sabbiosa pi&ugrave; vicina, ti consigliamo di visitare la spiaggia Strand Slag Zeekant, situata nella citt&agrave; di Hook of Holland. &Egrave; una spiaggia dalle proporzioni immense, la spiaggia &egrave; davvero enorme, la lunghezza totale &egrave; di diversi chilometri ed &egrave; larga pi&ugrave; di 100 m. L&#39;intero circondario della spiaggia &egrave; molto turistico e hai molte infrastrutture e servizi balneari disponibili, inoltre ci sono numerosi ristoranti di ogni tipo e non abbiamo dimenticato i negozi che ti aspettano anche qui. Hai anche la possibilit&agrave; di affittare e alloggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia sotto forma di appartamenti in container. La regione in cui si trova questa spiaggia si chiama Zuid-Holland. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e qui si trova un parcheggio molto ampio, a 200 metri dalla spiaggia. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; facile. Questa spiaggia ha una normale inclinazione che scende costantemente verso il mare. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e a causa del basso fondale il punto di balneazione &egrave; di circa 50 m. Anche i bambini di tutte le et&agrave; adoreranno questo posto, non solo l&#39;acqua &egrave; poco profonda, ma hai anche numerosi parchi giochi per bambini direttamente sulla spiaggia. Goditi una meravigliosa giornata in spiaggia con BeachRex. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la prossima spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.', 4082, 'it', 1),
(2173, 'Si vous &ecirc;tes &agrave; Rotterdam et que vous recherchez la plage de sable la plus proche, nous vous sugg&eacute;rons de visiter la plage Strand Slag Zeekant, situ&eacute;e dans la ville de Hook of Holland. C&#39;est une plage aux proportions immenses, la plage est vraiment immense, la longueur totale est de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et elle fait plus de 100m de large. Tout l&#39;environnement autour de la plage est tr&egrave;s touristique et vous avez beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures et de services de plage disponibles, de nombreux restaurants de tous types sont &eacute;galement ici, et nous n&#39;avons pas oubli&eacute; les magasins qui vous attendent ici aussi. Vous avez &eacute;galement la possibilit&eacute; de louer et de loger directement sur la plage sous forme d&#39;appartements dans des containers. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; se trouve cette plage s&#39;appelle Zuid-Holland. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et un tr&egrave;s grand parking, &agrave; 200 m&egrave;tres de la plage, se trouve ici. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est facile. Cette plage a une inclinaison normale qui descend r&eacute;guli&egrave;rement vers la mer. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et du fait de la faible profondeur de l&#39;eau le point de nage est &agrave; environ 50 m. Les enfants de tous &acirc;ges adoreront &eacute;galement cet endroit, non seulement l&#39;eau est peu profonde, mais vous avez &eacute;galement de nombreuses aires de jeux pour enfants directement sur la plage. Profitez d&#39;une merveilleuse journ&eacute;e &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex. Et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.', 4082, 'fr', 1),
(2174, 'Si est&aacute;s en R&oacute;terdam y est&aacute;s buscando la playa de arena m&aacute;s cercana, te sugerimos que visites la playa Strand Slag Zeekant, ubicada en la ciudad Hook de Holanda. Es una playa de proporciones inmensas, la extensi&oacute;n de la playa es realmente enorme, la longitud total es de varios kil&oacute;metros y tiene m&aacute;s de 100m de ancho. Todo el entorno alrededor de la playa es muy tur&iacute;stico y tienes mucha infraestructura y servicios de playa disponibles, tambi&eacute;n hay numerosos restaurantes de todo tipo aqu&iacute;, y tampoco nos olvidamos de las tiendas que te esperan aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n. Tambi&eacute;n tienes la opci&oacute;n de alquiler y alojamiento directamente en la playa en forma de apartamentos en contenedores. La regi&oacute;n donde se encuentra esta playa se llama Zuid-Holland. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y aqu&iacute; se encuentra un aparcamiento muy grande, a 200 m de la playa. El acceso a la playa es f&aacute;cil. Esta playa tiene una inclinaci&oacute;n normal que desciende progresivamente hacia el mar. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y debido a la poca profundidad del agua el punto de nado est&aacute; a unos 50 m. A los ni&ntilde;os de todas las edades tambi&eacute;n les encantar&aacute; este lugar, no solo el agua es poco profunda, sino que tambi&eacute;n hay numerosos parques infantiles para ellos directamente en la playa. Disfruta de un maravilloso d&iacute;a de playa con BeachRex. Y recuerda, siempre usa BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 4082, 'es', 1),
(2175, 'Wenn Sie in Rotterdam sind und nach dem n&auml;chsten Sandstrand suchen, empfehlen wir Ihnen, den Strand Slag Zeekant in der Stadt Hoek van Holland zu besuchen. Es ist ein Strand mit immensen Ausma&szlig;en, die Strandfl&auml;che ist wirklich riesig, die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und er ist mehr als 100 m breit. Die gesamte Umgebung rund um den Strand ist sehr touristisch und Sie haben viele Strandinfrastrukturen und Dienstleistungen zur Verf&uuml;gung, auch zahlreiche Restaurants aller Art sind hier, und wir haben auch nicht die Gesch&auml;fte vergessen, die auch hier auf Sie warten. Sie haben auch die M&ouml;glichkeit direkt am Strand in Form von Apartments in Containern zu mieten und zu &uuml;bernachten. Die Region, in der sich dieser Strand befindet, hei&szlig;t Zuid-Holland. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz, 200 m vom Strand entfernt, befindet sich hier. Der Zugang zum Strand ist einfach. Dieser Strand hat eine normale Neigung, die stetig zum Meer hinabf&auml;llt. Der Wassereinstieg ist sehr sch&ouml;n und aufgrund des seichten Wassers liegt der Schwimmpunkt bei etwa 50 m. Auch Kinder jeden Alters werden diesen Ort lieben, denn das Wasser ist nicht nur seicht, sondern Sie haben auch zahlreiche Kinderspielpl&auml;tze direkt am Strand f&uuml;r sie. Genie&szlig;en Sie einen wundersch&ouml;nen Strandtag mit BeachRex. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 4082, 'de', 1),
(2176, 'Holanda tiene realmente algunas playas &uacute;nicas. No hay muchos lugares en el mundo donde puedas ir a una playa de arena casi en medio del puerto m&aacute;s grande del mundo, en R&oacute;terdam. Por un lado, puede disfrutar de la playa de arena y, por otro lado, puede ver la carga y descarga de los contenedores de barcos m&aacute;s grandes del mundo. Esta playa es recomendada para un tipo de usuario de playa aventurero, aqu&iacute; casi no hay infraestructura de playa, ni restaurantes y, por supuesto, tampoco alojamiento. Si a&uacute;n prefieres este tipo de playas, por cierto se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Zuid-Holland, este lugar es muy f&aacute;cil de llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y puedes aparcar al lado de la carretera a solo 30 m de la playa. La playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y m&aacute;s de 100 m de ancho. Tiene una bonita entrada de agua y el punto de nado est&aacute; a unos 50 m. Cerca de la playa tambi&eacute;n hay una parte de la playa que est&aacute; reservada para nudistas y una parte para actividades deportivas. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex. Y recuerda, siempre usa BeachRex para encontrar tu playa perfecta.', 4083, 'es', 1),
(2177, 'Les Pays-Bas ont vraiment des plages uniques. Il n&#39;y a pas beaucoup d&#39;endroits au monde o&ugrave; vous pourriez aller sur une plage de sable presque au milieu du plus grand port du monde, &agrave; Rotterdam. D&#39;un c&ocirc;t&eacute;, vous pourrez profiter de la plage de sable et de l&#39;autre, vous pourrez observer le chargement et le d&eacute;chargement des plus grands conteneurs de navires du monde. Cette plage est recommand&eacute;e pour un utilisateur de plage aventurier, vous n&#39;avez ici presque aucune infrastructure de plage, pas de restaurants et bien s&ucirc;r pas d&#39;h&eacute;bergement. Si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez toujours ce genre de plages, d&#39;ailleurs il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Zuid-Holland, cet endroit est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer au bord de la route &agrave; seulement 30 m de la plage. La plage fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et plus de 100 m de large. Il a une belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau et le point de baignade est &agrave; environ 50 m. Pr&egrave;s de la plage, il y a aussi une partie de la plage qui est r&eacute;serv&eacute;e aux nudistes et une partie aux activit&eacute;s sportives. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex. Et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex pour trouver votre plage parfaite.', 4083, 'fr', 1),
(2178, 'I Paesi Bassi hanno davvero delle spiagge uniche. Non ci sono molti posti al mondo dove potresti andare su una spiaggia sabbiosa quasi nel mezzo del porto pi&ugrave; grande del mondo, a Rotterdam. Da un lato puoi goderti la spiaggia sabbiosa e dall&#39;altro puoi guardare il carico e lo scarico dei container pi&ugrave; grandi del mondo. Questa spiaggia &egrave; consigliata per un tipo di utente della spiaggia avventuriero, qui non hai quasi nessuna infrastruttura balneare, nessun ristorante e ovviamente nemmeno un alloggio. Se preferisci ancora questo tipo di spiagge, tra l&#39;altro si trova nella regione Zuid-Holland, questa localit&agrave; &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi parcheggiare lungo la strada a soli 30 metri dalla spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga pi&ugrave; di 100 m. Ha un bel ingresso in acqua e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a circa 50 m. Vicino alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; anche una parte della spiaggia riservata ai nudisti e una parte alle attivit&agrave; sportive. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex per trovare la tua spiaggia perfetta.', 4083, 'it', 1),
(2179, 'Niederlande hat wirklich einige einzigartige Str&auml;nde. Es gibt nicht viele Orte auf der Welt, an denen man fast mitten im gr&ouml;&szlig;ten Hafen der Welt, in Rotterdam, an einen Sandstrand gehen k&ouml;nnte. Auf der einen Seite k&ouml;nnen Sie den Sandstrand genie&szlig;en und auf der anderen Seite das Beladen und Entladen der gr&ouml;&szlig;ten Schiffscontainer der Welt beobachten. Dieser Strand ist f&uuml;r einen Abenteurer-Strandbenutzer-Typ zu empfehlen, du hast hier fast keine Strandinfrastruktur, keine Restaurants und nat&uuml;rlich auch keine Unterk&uuml;nfte. Wenn Sie diese Art von Str&auml;nden dennoch bevorzugen, ist dieser Ort &uuml;brigens in der Region Zuid-Holland mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen neben der Stra&szlig;e nur 30 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Der Strand ist mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 m breit. Es hat einen sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 50 m. In der N&auml;he des Strandes gibt es auch einen Teil des Strandes, der f&uuml;r FKK-Anh&auml;nger reserviert ist, und einen Teil f&uuml;r sportliche Aktivit&auml;ten. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex, um Ihren perfekten Strand zu finden.', 4083, 'de', 1),
(2180, 'Secondo gli olandesi anche questo, la spiaggia Strand Rockanje 1e slag, come la vicina 2e slag, &egrave; una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; belle di tutti i Paesi Bassi. &Egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa con alcune piccole conchiglie, una spiaggia molto vasta e molti ristoranti e servizi balneari disponibili su di essa. La regione in cui si trova &egrave; Zuid-Holland ed &egrave; una spiaggia orgogliosa della citt&agrave; di Rockanje. Indipendentemente dal veicolo che stai viaggiando, questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere e hai un parcheggio molto ampio a 200 metri dalla spiaggia. Il sentiero per la spiaggia &egrave; molto facile ed &egrave; in cemento, adatto anche a portatori di handicap. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; piuttosto piatta verso il mare. Complessivamente la spiaggia &egrave; lunga diversi chilometri e larga pi&ugrave; di 100 m, con la bassa marea anche di pi&ugrave;. Hai una bella entrata in spiaggia e, a causa dell&#39;acqua poco profonda, il punto di nuoto &egrave; lontano. Una certa parte della spiaggia, un po&#39; pi&ugrave; distante dal punto di ingresso, &egrave; riservata anche ai cani. Anche i bambini adoreranno questo posto, hai un parco giochi per bambini sulla spiaggia e un parco giochi sportivo. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile anche nelle vicinanze principalmente come hotel, appartamenti e persino un campo. Goditi la tua giornata in spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda, se desideri trovare la prossima spiaggia dei tuoi sogni, usa sempre BeachRex.', 4087, 'it', 1),
(2181, 'Selon les N&eacute;erlandais &eacute;galement, la plage Strand Rockanje 1e slag, comme la 2e slag voisine, est l&#39;une des plus belles plages de tous les Pays-Bas. C&#39;est une plage de sable avec quelques petits coquillages, une tr&egrave;s grande plage et de nombreux restaurants et services de plage disponibles. La r&eacute;gion o&ugrave; elle se trouve est Zuid-Holland et c&#39;est une plage fi&egrave;re de la ville Rockanje. Quel que soit le v&eacute;hicule avec lequel vous voyagez, cet emplacement est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s et vous disposez d&#39;un tr&egrave;s grand parking &agrave; 200 m&egrave;tres de la plage. Le chemin d&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s facile et est en b&eacute;ton, &eacute;galement adapt&eacute; aux personnes handicap&eacute;es. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est assez plate vers la mer. Au total, la plage fait plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de long et plus de 100 m de large, &agrave; mar&eacute;e basse encore plus. Vous avez une tr&egrave;s belle entr&eacute;e sur la plage et &agrave; cause de l&#39;eau peu profonde, le point de baignade est loin. Une certaine partie de la plage, un peu plus &eacute;loign&eacute;e de l&#39;entr&eacute;e est &eacute;galement r&eacute;serv&eacute;e aux chiens. Les enfants aimeront aussi cet endroit, vous avez une aire de jeux pour enfants sur la plage ainsi qu&#39;une aire de jeux de sport. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement disponible dans les environs principalement sous forme d&#39;h&ocirc;tels, d&#39;appartements et m&ecirc;me d&#39;un camp. Profitez de votre journ&eacute;e &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex, et rappelez-vous, si vous souhaitez trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve, utilisez toujours BeachRex.', 4087, 'fr', 1),
(2182, 'Seg&uacute;n los holandeses, la playa Strand Rockanje 1e slag, al igual que la vecina 2e slag, es una de las playas m&aacute;s hermosas de toda Holanda. Es una playa de arena con algunas conchas peque&ntilde;as, una playa muy grande y muchos restaurantes y servicios de playa disponibles en ella. La regi&oacute;n donde se encuentra es Zuid-Holland y es una playa orgullosa de la ciudad de Rockanje. No importa el veh&iacute;culo en el que viaje, esta ubicaci&oacute;n es muy f&aacute;cil de alcanzar y tiene un lugar de estacionamiento muy grande a 200 m de la playa. El camino a la playa es muy f&aacute;cil y es de hormig&oacute;n, tambi&eacute;n apto para minusv&aacute;lidos. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es bastante llana hacia el mar. En total la playa tiene varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y m&aacute;s de 100m de ancho, con marea baja a&uacute;n m&aacute;s. Tienes una entrada a la playa muy agradable y, debido a las aguas poco profundas, el punto de nado est&aacute; muy lejos. Cierta parte de la playa, un poco m&aacute;s alejada del punto de entrada, tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; reservada para los perros. A los ni&ntilde;os tambi&eacute;n les encantar&aacute; este lugar, tienes un parque infantil en la playa, as&iacute; como un parque infantil deportivo. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible en los alrededores principalmente como hoteles, apartamentos e incluso un campamento. Disfruta de tu d&iacute;a de playa con BeachRex y recuerda, si quieres encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os, utiliza siempre BeachRex.', 4087, 'es', 1),
(2183, 'Laut den Niederl&auml;ndern ist auch dieser Strand Rockanje 1e Schlacke, wie der benachbarte 2e Schlacke, einer der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde in den ganzen Niederlanden. Es ist ein Sandstrand mit einigen kleinen Muscheln, einem sehr gro&szlig;en Strandbereich und vielen Restaurants und Strandservices. Die Region, in der es sich befindet, ist Zuid-Holland und es ist ein stolzer Strand der Stadt Rockanje. Egal mit welchem ​​Fahrzeug Sie reisen, dieser Ort ist sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 200 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Weg zum Strand ist sehr einfach und aus Beton, auch f&uuml;r Behinderte geeignet. Die Neigung am Strand ist recht flach zum Meer hin. Insgesamt ist der Strand mehrere Kilometer lang und mehr als 100 m breit, bei Ebbe sogar noch mehr. Sie haben einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Strandzugang und aufgrund des flachen Wassers ist der Badepunkt weit entfernt. Ein gewisser Teil des Strandes, etwas weiter vom Einstieg entfernt, ist auch f&uuml;r die Hunde reserviert. Auch Kinder werden diesen Ort lieben, Sie haben einen Kinderspielplatz am Strand sowie einen Sportspielplatz. Unterkunft ist auch in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Hotels, Apartments und sogar einem Campingplatz. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandtag mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand finden m&ouml;chten, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex.', 4087, 'de', 1),
(2184, 'La regi&oacute;n holandesa Zuid-Holland tiene muchas playas hermosas, la mayor&iacute;a de ellas en la costa oeste del Mar del Norte, pero tambi&eacute;n puedes encontrar algunas playas de arena en lagos, como la playa Strand Hellecat. Se recomienda para familias y se encuentra cerca de la ciudad Hellevoetsluis. A este lugar se puede acceder con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y muy cerca de la playa, a escasos metros, se encuentra una plaza de aparcamiento. La longitud total de la playa es de 500 metros y tiene 50 metros de ancho. La playa tiene una inclinaci&oacute;n normal y una entrada de agua muy agradable. El punto de nado ya est&aacute; a 5 m. En la playa tienes toda la infraestructura playera imprescindible, socorrista incluido. Un chiringuito y un restaurante tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n en la playa. El alojamiento no est&aacute; disponible directamente en la playa sino en los alrededores, principalmente en forma de apartamentos. Disfruta de tu d&iacute;a de playa con BeachRex.', 4088, 'es', 1),
(2185, 'La r&eacute;gion n&eacute;erlandaise Zuid-Holland poss&egrave;de de nombreuses belles plages, la plupart sur la c&ocirc;te ouest de la mer du Nord, mais vous pouvez &eacute;galement trouver des plages de sable sur des lacs, comme la plage Strand Hellecat. Il est recommand&eacute; pour les familles et est situ&eacute; &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville Hellevoetsluis. Vous pouvez acc&eacute;der &agrave; cet endroit avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et une place de parking est situ&eacute;e tr&egrave;s pr&egrave;s de la plage, &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres. La longueur totale de la plage est de 500 m&egrave;tres et sa largeur est de 50 m&egrave;tres. La plage a une inclinaison normale et une tr&egrave;s belle entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau. Le point de nage est d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 5 m. Sur la plage, vous avez toutes les infrastructures de plage essentielles, un sauveteur inclus. Un bar de plage et un restaurant se trouvent &eacute;galement sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas disponible directement sur la plage mais dans les environs, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements. Profitez de votre journ&eacute;e &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex.', 4088, 'fr', 1),
(2186, 'La regione olandese Zuid-Holland ha molte belle spiagge, la maggior parte delle quali sulla costa occidentale del Mare del Nord, ma puoi anche trovare alcune spiagge sabbiose sui laghi, come la spiaggia di Strand Hellecat. &Egrave; raccomandato per le famiglie e si trova vicino alla citt&agrave; Hellevoetsluis. &Egrave; possibile accedere a questa posizione con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e un parcheggio si trova molto vicino alla spiaggia, a pochi metri di distanza. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 500 metri ed &egrave; larga 50 metri. La spiaggia ha una pendenza normale e un ingresso in acqua molto bello. Il punto di balneazione &egrave; gi&agrave; a 5 m. Sulla spiaggia hai tutte le infrastrutture essenziali per la spiaggia, incluso un bagnino. Sulla spiaggia si trovano anche un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante. L&#39;alloggio non &egrave; disponibile direttamente sulla spiaggia ma nella zona circostante, principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti. Goditi la tua giornata in spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4088, 'it', 1),
(2187, 'Die niederl&auml;ndische Region Zuid-Holland hat viele sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde, die meisten davon an der Westk&uuml;ste an der Nordsee, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen auch einige Sandstr&auml;nde an Seen finden, wie den Strand Hellecat. Es ist f&uuml;r Familien zu empfehlen und liegt in der N&auml;he der Stadt Hellevoetsluis. Sie k&ouml;nnen diesen Ort mit jedem Fahrzeug erreichen und ein Parkplatz befindet sich ganz in der N&auml;he des Strandes, nur wenige Meter entfernt. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 500 Meter und er ist 50 Meter breit. Der Strand hat ein normales Gef&auml;lle und einen sehr sch&ouml;nen Wassereintritt. Der Schwimmpunkt liegt bereits bei 5 m. Am Strand haben Sie alle notwendigen Strandinfrastrukturen, einschlie&szlig;lich eines Rettungsschwimmers. Eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant befinden sich ebenfalls am Strand. Unterk&uuml;nfte gibt es nicht direkt am Strand, sondern in der n&auml;heren Umgebung, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Apartments. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandtag mit BeachRex.', 4088, 'de', 1),
(2188, 'Strand Haringvlietsluizen &egrave; il nome della spiaggia che dovresti ricordare, se stai cercando una spiaggia sabbiosa olandese per un tipo di utente avventuriero, che, a parte la spiaggia, non ha bisogno di nient&#39;altro sulla spiaggia. Ci&ograve; significa che qui non hai quasi nessuna infrastruttura balneare, nessun ristorante, nessun alloggio e anche pochissime persone che visiteranno questa spiaggia. Si trova nella regione olandese Zuid-Holland, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Hellevoetsluis. &Egrave; molto facile raggiungere questa localit&agrave; con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si dispone di un parcheggio molto ampio a 500 m dalla spiaggia. Il sentiero per la spiaggia &egrave; molto bello e conduce attraverso un piccolo tunnel e qualche piccola forestazione. Complessivamente la spiaggia ha una lunghezza totale di diversi chilometri ed &egrave; larga pi&ugrave; di 100 m. Si tratta di una spiaggia molto ampia e piuttosto pianeggiante. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 75 m, con l&#39;alta marea possibilmente inferiore. Sebbene nessun ristorante sia disponibile sulla spiaggia stessa, hai un ristorante disponibile vicino al parcheggio e alcune sistemazioni nell&#39;area circostante. Goditi la tua avventura in spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex se desideri trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.', 4089, 'it', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(2189, 'Strand Haringvlietsluizen est le nom de la plage &agrave; retenir si vous recherchez une plage de sable hollandaise pour un type d&#39;utilisateur aventurier qui, &agrave; l&#39;exception de la plage, n&#39;a besoin de rien de plus sur la plage. Cela signifie que vous n&#39;avez ici presque aucune infrastructure de plage, aucun restaurant, aucun h&eacute;bergement et aussi tr&egrave;s peu de personnes qui visiteront cette plage. Il est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion n&eacute;erlandaise Zuid-Holland, &agrave; proximit&eacute; de la ville Hellevoetsluis. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;atteindre cet endroit avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez d&#39;un tr&egrave;s grand parking &agrave; 500 m de la plage. Le chemin d&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s beau et passe par un petit tunnel et un petit reboisement. Au total, la plage a une longueur totale de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et une largeur de plus de 100 m. C&#39;est une plage tr&egrave;s grande et assez plate. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; 75 m, avec mar&eacute;e haute &eacute;ventuellement moins. Bien qu&#39;aucun restaurant ne soit disponible sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, vous avez un restaurant disponible pr&egrave;s du parking et quelques logements dans les environs. Profitez de votre aventure &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex, et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex si vous souhaitez trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.', 4089, 'fr', 1),
(2190, 'Strand Haringvlietsluizen es el nombre de la playa que debe recordar si est&aacute; buscando una playa de arena holandesa para un usuario aventurero que, excepto la playa, no necesita nada m&aacute;s en la playa. Eso significa que aqu&iacute; casi no hay infraestructura de playa, ni restaurante, ni alojamiento y tambi&eacute;n muy poca gente que visitar&aacute; esta playa. Se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n holandesa Zuid-Holland, cerca de la ciudad Hellevoetsluis. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar a este lugar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tiene un estacionamiento muy grande a 500 m de la playa. El camino a la playa es muy hermoso y conduce a trav&eacute;s de un peque&ntilde;o t&uacute;nel y una peque&ntilde;a forestaci&oacute;n. En total, la playa tiene una longitud total de varios kil&oacute;metros y tiene m&aacute;s de 100 m de ancho. Es una zona de playa muy grande y bastante llana. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a 75 m, con marea alta posiblemente menos. Aunque no hay restaurante disponible en la playa, hay un restaurante disponible junto al aparcamiento y algunos alojamientos en los alrededores. Disfruta de tu aventura en la playa con BeachRex y recuerda, siempre usa BeachRex si quieres encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 4089, 'es', 1),
(2191, 'Strand Haringvlietsluizen ist der Name des Strandes, den Sie sich merken sollten, wenn Sie auf der Suche nach einem holl&auml;ndischen Sandstrand f&uuml;r Abenteurer sind, die au&szlig;er dem Strand nichts mehr am Strand brauchen. Das bedeutet, dass Sie hier fast keine Strandinfrastruktur, kein Restaurant, keine Unterkunft und auch sehr wenige Menschen haben, die diesen Strand besuchen werden. Es liegt in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zuid-Holland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Hellevoetsluis. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr einfach zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 500 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Weg zum Strand ist sehr sch&ouml;n und f&uuml;hrt durch einen kleinen Tunnel und etwas kleine Bewaldung. Insgesamt hat der Strand eine Gesamtl&auml;nge von mehreren Kilometern und ist &uuml;ber 100 m breit. Es ist ein sehr gro&szlig;er und recht flacher Strandbereich. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Badepunkt liegt bei 75 m, bei Flut evtl. weniger. Obwohl es am Strand selbst kein Restaurant gibt, gibt es ein Restaurant am Parkplatz und einige Unterk&uuml;nfte in der Umgebung. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihr Strandabenteuer mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, immer BeachRex zu verwenden, wenn Sie Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand finden m&ouml;chten.', 4089, 'de', 1),
(2192, 'En el lago holand&eacute;s Haringvliet en la regi&oacute;n Zuid-Holland tienes una peque&ntilde;a playa de arena muy hermosa, llamada Strand Vuurtoren. Est&aacute; ubicado en la ciudad de Hellevoetsluis, cerca de un puerto y de las hist&oacute;ricas fortificaciones de agua, que son una visita obligada si visita la ciudad o si desea disfrutar de un tiempo en la playa. Esta ubicaci&oacute;n es muy f&aacute;cil de alcanzar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y se puede estacionar al lado de la carretera directamente en frente de la playa. El acceso a la playa es muy f&aacute;cil y una vez que est&aacute;s en la playa tienes en total una playa de 400 m de largo que tiene un ancho m&aacute;ximo de 30 metros. La entrada al agua es muy agradable y el punto de ba&ntilde;o est&aacute; a 10 m. La playa es bastante plana y a los ni&ntilde;os les encantar&aacute; esta playa, porque tiene un parque infantil de barco de madera y algunas otras instalaciones experimentales para ni&ntilde;os ubicadas aqu&iacute;. Toda la infraestructura esencial de la playa est&aacute; disponible aqu&iacute; para usted, un restaurante est&aacute; muy cerca y tambi&eacute;n tiene algunas opciones de alojamiento, las m&aacute;s cercanas son algunos hoteles y un campamento, aprox. 1 kil&oacute;metro de distancia. Si desea encontrar m&aacute;s playas con las mismas caracter&iacute;sticas, utilice nuestro filtro de playa avanzado y BeachRex le mostrar&aacute; las playas adecuadas para usted. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex.', 4090, 'es', 1),
(2193, 'Sur le lac hollandais Haringvliet dans la r&eacute;gion Zuid-Holland vous avez une tr&egrave;s belle petite plage de sable, appel&eacute;e Strand Vuurtoren. Il est situ&eacute; dans la ville Hellevoetsluis, &agrave; proximit&eacute; d&#39;un port et des fortifications historiques de l&#39;eau, incontournables si vous visitez la ville ou si vous souhaitez passer du temps sur la plage. Cet endroit est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer au bord de la route juste en face de la plage. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s facile et une fois sur la plage, vous disposez d&#39;une plage de 400 m&egrave;tres de long et d&#39;une largeur maximale de 30 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et le point de baignade est &agrave; 10 m. La plage est assez plate et les enfants vont adorer cette plage, car vous avez une aire de jeux pour enfants en bateau en bois et quelques autres installations exp&eacute;rimentales pour enfants situ&eacute;es ici. Toutes les infrastructures de plage essentielles sont disponibles ici pour vous, un restaurant est tr&egrave;s proche et vous avez &eacute;galement quelques options d&#39;h&eacute;bergement, les plus proches sont quelques h&ocirc;tels et un camp, &agrave; env. &agrave; 1 km. Si vous souhaitez trouver plus de plages avec les m&ecirc;mes caract&eacute;ristiques, utilisez notre filtre de plage avanc&eacute;, et BeachRex vous montrera les plages qui vous conviennent. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex.', 4090, 'fr', 1),
(2194, 'Sul lago olandese Haringvliet nella regione Zuid-Holland si trova una bellissima piccola spiaggia sabbiosa, chiamata Strand Vuurtoren. Si trova nella citt&agrave; Hellevoetsluis, vicino a un porto e alle storiche fortificazioni sull&#39;acqua, che sono assolutamente da visitare se stai visitando la citt&agrave; o se vuoi goderti un po&#39; di tempo sulla spiaggia. Questa posizione &egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e si pu&ograve; parcheggiare a lato della strada direttamente di fronte alla spiaggia. L&#39;accesso alla spiaggia &egrave; molto facile e una volta sulla spiaggia si ha in tutto una spiaggia lunga 400 metri che ha una larghezza massima di 30 metri. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; molto bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 10 m. La spiaggia &egrave; piuttosto piatta e i bambini adoreranno questa spiaggia, perch&eacute; hai un parco giochi per bambini con una nave di legno e alcune altre installazioni sperimentali per bambini situate qui. Tutta l&#39;infrastruttura balneare essenziale &egrave; disponibile qui per te, un ristorante &egrave; molto vicino e hai anche alcune opzioni per l&#39;alloggio, il pi&ugrave; vicino sono alcuni hotel e un campeggio, a ca. 1 km di distanza. Se desideri trovare pi&ugrave; spiagge con le stesse caratteristiche, utilizza il nostro filtro avanzato per le spiagge e BeachRex mostrer&agrave; le spiagge giuste per te. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex.', 4090, 'it', 1),
(2195, 'Am niederl&auml;ndischen See Haringvliet in der Region Zuid-Holland gibt es einen sehr sch&ouml;nen kleinen Sandstrand namens Strand Vuurtoren. Es befindet sich in der Stadt Hellevoetsluis, in der N&auml;he eines Hafens und der historischen Wasserfestungen, die ein Muss sind, wenn Sie die Stadt besuchen oder etwas Zeit am Strand genie&szlig;en m&ouml;chten. Dieser Ort ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie k&ouml;nnen neben der Stra&szlig;e direkt vor dem Strand parken. Der Zugang zum Strand ist sehr einfach und sobald Sie am Strand sind, haben Sie insgesamt einen 400 m langen Strand mit einer maximalen Breite von 30 Metern. Der Wassereintritt ist sehr sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 10 m. Der Strand ist ziemlich flach und Kinder werden diesen Strand lieben, denn hier gibt es einen Holzschiff-Kinderspielplatz und einige andere experimentelle Installationen f&uuml;r Kinder. Hier steht Ihnen die gesamte Strandinfrastruktur zur Verf&uuml;gung, ein Restaurant ist ganz in der N&auml;he und Sie haben auch einige Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten, die n&auml;chsten sind ein paar Hotels und ein Camp, ca. 1 km entfernt. Wenn Sie weitere Str&auml;nde mit den gleichen Eigenschaften finden m&ouml;chten, verwenden Sie unseren erweiterten Strandfilter, und BeachRex zeigt Ihnen die richtigen Str&auml;nde. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex.', 4090, 'de', 1),
(2196, 'Questa spiaggia sabbiosa, situata nella regione olandese Zuid-Holland, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Ouddorp, &egrave; davvero molto speciale. Il fatto che lo rende cos&igrave; unico &egrave; la sua planarit&agrave;, soprattutto con la bassa marea quando l&#39;acqua si sposta molto lontano, probabilmente pi&ugrave; di un chilometro. Se ti piacciono queste caratteristiche da spiaggia, allora la spiaggia Strand Oosterduinpad &egrave; quella che fa per te. &Egrave; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e dispone di un parcheggio molto ampio a 500 metri dalla spiaggia. Il sentiero che porta alla spiaggia &egrave; asfaltato e passa sopra una duna alta 5 m. Una volta sulla spiaggia si ha a disposizione una spiaggia molto ampia con diversi chilometri di lunghezza e pi&ugrave; di 100 m di larghezza, con la bassa marea pi&ugrave; di 1 km. Questo rende l&#39;ingresso in acqua ovviamente molto bello, ma dovresti camminare abbastanza per un po&#39; di tempo per raggiungere il punto di nuoto. L&#39;acqua poco profonda insieme ad alcuni parchi giochi per bambini rende questo luogo un luogo perfetto per i bambini piccoli, sia per giocare in acqua in sicurezza che per rilassarsi nel parco giochi. Tutta l&#39;infrastruttura balneare essenziale si trova qui, hai anche un ristorante sulla spiaggia e se stai cercando un alloggio intorno al parcheggio hai molte opzioni diverse per trovarne uno. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda, usa sempre il filtro avanzato BeachRex se desideri trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno in pochi secondi.', 4091, 'it', 1),
(2197, 'Cette plage de sable, situ&eacute;e dans la r&eacute;gion n&eacute;erlandaise Zuid-Holland, pr&egrave;s de la ville d&#39;Ouddorp, est vraiment tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale. Ce qui le rend si unique, c&#39;est sa plan&eacute;it&eacute;, surtout &agrave; mar&eacute;e basse quand l&#39;eau s&#39;&eacute;loigne, probablement de plus d&#39;un kilom&egrave;tre. Si vous aimez ces caract&eacute;ristiques de plage, alors la plage Strand Oosterduinpad est faite pour vous. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et vous disposez d&#39;un tr&egrave;s grand parking &agrave; 500 m de la plage. Le chemin qui m&egrave;ne &agrave; la plage est goudronn&eacute; et passe sur une dune de 5 m de haut. Une fois que vous &ecirc;tes sur la plage, vous disposez d&#39;une tr&egrave;s grande plage avec plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres de longueur et plus de 100 m de largeur disponible, &agrave; mar&eacute;e basse plus de 1 km. Cela rend l&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau bien s&ucirc;r tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able, mais il faudrait marcher assez longtemps pour atteindre le point de nage. L&#39;eau peu profonde ainsi que quelques aires de jeux pour enfants font de cet endroit un endroit parfait pour les petits enfants, soit pour jouer dans l&#39;eau en toute s&eacute;curit&eacute;, soit pour tra&icirc;ner sur l&#39;aire de jeux. Toutes les infrastructures essentielles de la plage se trouvent ici, vous avez &eacute;galement un restaurant sur la plage, et si vous cherchez un logement autour du parking, vous avez de nombreuses options pour en trouver un. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex, et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours le filtre avanc&eacute; BeachRex si vous souhaitez trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve en quelques secondes seulement.', 4091, 'fr', 1),
(2198, 'Esta playa de arena, ubicada en la regi&oacute;n holandesa de Zuid-Holland, cerca de la ciudad de Ouddorp, es realmente muy especial. Lo que lo hace tan &uacute;nico es su llanura, especialmente durante la marea baja cuando el agua se aleja, probablemente m&aacute;s de un kil&oacute;metro. Si te gustan estas caracter&iacute;sticas de la playa, entonces la playa Strand Oosterduinpad es la indicada para ti. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tienes un parking muy amplio a 500m de la playa. El camino que lleva a la playa est&aacute; asfaltado y pasa por una duna de 5 m de altura. Una vez que est&aacute;s en la playa tienes un &aacute;rea de playa muy grande con varios kil&oacute;metros de largo y m&aacute;s de 100 m de ancho disponibles, con marea baja m&aacute;s de 1 km. Por supuesto, esto hace que la entrada al agua sea muy agradable, pero tendr&iacute;as que caminar bastante durante un tiempo para llegar al punto de nadar. El agua poco profunda junto con algunos parques infantiles hacen de este lugar un lugar perfecto para los ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os, ya sea para jugar en el agua de forma segura o pasar el rato en el parque infantil. Toda la infraestructura esencial de la playa se encuentra aqu&iacute;, tambi&eacute;n tiene un restaurante en la playa, y si est&aacute; buscando alojamiento alrededor del lugar de estacionamiento, tiene muchas opciones diferentes para encontrar uno. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex y recuerda, utiliza siempre el filtro avanzado de BeachRex si quieres encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os en solo unos segundos.', 4091, 'es', 1),
(2199, 'Dieser Sandstrand in der niederl&auml;ndischen Region Zuid-Holland, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Ouddorp, ist wirklich etwas ganz Besonderes. Was ihn so einzigartig macht, ist seine Flachheit, besonders bei Ebbe, wenn sich das Wasser weit weg bewegt, wahrscheinlich mehr als einen Kilometer. Wenn Sie solche Strandeigenschaften m&ouml;gen, dann ist der Strand Oosterduinpad genau das Richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz 500 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Weg zum Strand ist asphaltiert und f&uuml;hrt &uuml;ber eine 5 m hohe D&uuml;ne. Am Strand angekommen steht Ihnen ein sehr gro&szlig;er Strandbereich mit mehreren Kilometern L&auml;nge und &uuml;ber 100 m Breite zur Verf&uuml;gung, bei Ebbe &uuml;ber 1 km. Dies macht den Wassereintritt nat&uuml;rlich sehr sch&ouml;n, aber Sie m&uuml;ssten ziemlich lange laufen, um den Schwimmpunkt zu erreichen. Das flache Wasser zusammen mit einigen Kinderspielpl&auml;tzen machen diesen Ort zu einem perfekten Ort f&uuml;r kleine Kinder, um entweder sicher im Wasser zu spielen oder sich auf dem Spielplatz auszuruhen. Hier befindet sich die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur, Sie haben auch ein Restaurant am Strand, und wenn Sie nach einer Unterkunft in der N&auml;he des Parkplatzes suchen, haben Sie viele verschiedene M&ouml;glichkeiten, eine zu finden. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer den erweiterten BeachRex-Filter, wenn Sie Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand in nur wenigen Sekunden finden m&ouml;chten.', 4091, 'de', 1),
(2200, 'Alrededor de la ciudad holandesa de Ouddorp, que se encuentra en la costa oeste, frente al Mar del Norte y pertenece a la regi&oacute;n Zuid-Holland, tienes numerosas hermosas playas de arena. Todos ellos son de muy f&aacute;cil acceso y ser&iacute;a una pena no visitarlos si est&aacute;s cerca. Esta playa, que lleva por nombre Strand 3e Blok, es de muy f&aacute;cil acceso con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo, tambi&eacute;n se permite aparcar autocaravanas aqu&iacute;, y tienes un parking muy amplio a unos 400m de la playa. El camino a la playa es muy bonito y est&aacute; pavimentado, pero pasa por dunas de 5 m de altura. La longitud total de la playa es de varios kil&oacute;metros y tiene al menos 100 m de ancho, con marea baja a&uacute;n m&aacute;s. La entrada al agua es agradable y el punto de nado es con marea alta a unos 40 m, con marea baja hay que caminar unos metros m&aacute;s para poder nadar. La playa es bastante llana y te ofrece toda la infraestructura playera imprescindible, adem&aacute;s de un chiringuito y un restaurante. Tambi&eacute;n tienes la opci&oacute;n de alojamiento cercano en forma de campamento, no hay otro tipo de alojamiento disponible. Disfrute de su d&iacute;a de playa con BeachRex y recuerde, use siempre el filtro avanzado de BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os en cuesti&oacute;n de segundos.', 4092, 'es', 1),
(2201, 'Autour de la ville n&eacute;erlandaise d&#39;Ouddorp, qui est situ&eacute;e sur la c&ocirc;te ouest, face &agrave; la mer du Nord et appartient &agrave; la r&eacute;gion Zuid-Holland, vous avez de nombreuses belles plages de sable. Tous sont tr&egrave;s facilement accessibles et il serait dommage de ne pas les visiter si vous &ecirc;tes &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Cette plage, qui porte le nom de Strand 3e Blok, est tr&egrave;s facilement accessible avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule, les camping-cars sont &eacute;galement autoris&eacute;s &agrave; s&#39;y garer et vous disposez d&#39;un tr&egrave;s grand parking &agrave; environ 400 m de la plage. Le chemin d&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able et goudronn&eacute;, mais il passe par dessus des dunes de 5 m de haut. La longueur totale de la plage est de plusieurs kilom&egrave;tres et elle fait au moins 100m de large, &agrave; mar&eacute;e basse encore plus. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et le point de nage se fait &agrave; mar&eacute;e haute &agrave; environ 40 m, &agrave; mar&eacute;e basse il faut marcher quelques m&egrave;tres suppl&eacute;mentaires pour pouvoir nager. La plage est assez plate et vous offre toutes les infrastructures de plage essentielles, ainsi qu&#39;un bar de plage et un restaurant. Vous avez &eacute;galement la possibilit&eacute; de vous loger &agrave; proximit&eacute; sous forme de bivouac, les autres types d&#39;h&eacute;bergement ne sont pas disponibles. Profitez de votre journ&eacute;e &agrave; la plage avec BeachRex, et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours le filtre avanc&eacute; BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve en quelques secondes.', 4092, 'fr', 1),
(2202, 'Intorno alla citt&agrave; olandese di Ouddorp, che si trova sulla costa occidentale, di fronte al Mare del Nord e appartiene alla regione Zuid-Holland, ci sono numerose belle spiagge sabbiose. Sono tutti molto facilmente accessibili e sarebbe un peccato non visitarli se ci si trova nelle vicinanze. Questa spiaggia, che prende il nome di Strand 3e Blok, &egrave; molto facilmente accessibile con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo, anche i camper possono parcheggiare qui e hai un parcheggio molto ampio a circa 400 metri dalla spiaggia. Il sentiero per la spiaggia &egrave; molto bello e asfaltato, ma supera dune alte 5 m. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di diversi chilometri ed &egrave; larga almeno 100 m, con la bassa marea anche di pi&ugrave;. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; bello e il punto di balneazione &egrave; con l&#39;alta marea a circa 40 m, con la bassa marea &egrave; necessario camminare qualche metro in pi&ugrave; per poter nuotare. La spiaggia &egrave; piuttosto pianeggiante e offre tutte le infrastrutture balneari essenziali, oltre a un bar sulla spiaggia e un ristorante. Hai anche la possibilit&agrave; di alloggio nelle vicinanze sotto forma di campo, altri tipi di alloggio non sono disponibili. Goditi la tua giornata in spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda, usa sempre il filtro avanzato BeachRex per trovare la prossima spiaggia dei tuoi sogni in pochi secondi.', 4092, 'it', 1),
(2203, 'Rund um die niederl&auml;ndische Stadt Ouddorp, die an der Westk&uuml;ste mit Blick auf die Nordsee liegt und zur Region Zuid-Holland geh&ouml;rt, gibt es zahlreiche sch&ouml;ne Sandstr&auml;nde. Alle von ihnen sind sehr leicht zug&auml;nglich und es w&auml;re schade, sie nicht zu besuchen, wenn Sie in der N&auml;he sind. Dieser Strand, der den Namen Strand 3e Blok tr&auml;gt, ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen, Wohnmobile d&uuml;rfen hier auch parken, und Sie haben einen sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, etwa 400 m vom Strand entfernt. Der Weg zum Strand ist sehr sch&ouml;n und asphaltiert, geht aber &uuml;ber 5 m hohe D&uuml;nen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt mehrere Kilometer und er ist mindestens 100 m breit, bei Ebbe sogar noch mehr. Der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei Flut bei etwa 40 m, bei Ebbe m&uuml;ssen Sie einige Meter weitergehen, um schwimmen zu k&ouml;nnen. Der Strand ist ziemlich flach und bietet Ihnen alle notwendigen Strandinfrastrukturen sowie eine Strandbar und ein Restaurant. Sie haben auch die M&ouml;glichkeit, in der N&auml;he in Form eines Camps zu &uuml;bernachten, andere Unterkunftsarten sind nicht verf&uuml;gbar. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strandtag mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, immer den erweiterten Filter von BeachRex zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand in Sekundenschnelle zu finden.', 4092, 'de', 1),
(2204, 'Le Maldive non si sono mai sentite cos&igrave; vicine nei Paesi Bassi che su questa spiaggia. Sebbene la spiaggia sia completamente artificiale, gli architetti hanno fatto un ottimo lavoro e ne hanno fatto una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; belle d&#39;Europa e sicuramente dei Paesi Bassi. Intorno alla spiaggia ci sono anche case e appartamenti molto carini e alcuni di loro possono anche essere affittati. Se ti piace una spiaggia del genere, si chiama Strand De Punt Grevelingen, si trova vicino alla citt&agrave; di Ouddorp e appartiene alla regione Zuid-Holland. E&#39; molto facile da raggiungere con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e un parcheggio molto ampio, a 100 metri dalla spiaggia &egrave; qui a vostra disposizione. La superficie principale &egrave; ovviamente sabbia. Ha molte forme e forme diverse e in totale ha una lunghezza di 1 km ed &egrave; larga 20 m. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua &egrave; molto bello, inoltre puoi anche usare la scala dell&#39;acqua. Il punto di nuoto inizia molto velocemente, in alcuni punti si pu&ograve; anche saltare in acqua. Molti servizi spiaggia sono disponibili qui. C&#39;&egrave; anche un ristorante che &egrave; anche un bar sulla spiaggia. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda, se desideri trovare altre spiagge da sogno per la tua prossima avventura in spiaggia, usa sempre il nostro filtro avanzato BeachRex.', 4095, 'it', 1),
(2205, 'Les Maldives ne se sont jamais senties plus proches aux Pays-Bas que sur cette plage. Bien que la plage soit compl&egrave;tement artificielle, les architectes ont fait un excellent travail et ont cr&eacute;&eacute; l&#39;une des plus belles plages d&#39;Europe et certainement des Pays-Bas. Autour de la plage, vous avez &eacute;galement de tr&egrave;s belles maisons et appartements et certains d&#39;entre eux peuvent m&ecirc;me &ecirc;tre lou&eacute;s. Si vous aimez une telle plage, elle s&#39;appelle Strand De Punt Grevelingen, et elle est situ&eacute;e pr&egrave;s de la ville d&#39;Ouddorp et appartient &agrave; la r&eacute;gion Zuid-Holland. Il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;acc&egrave;s avec tout type de v&eacute;hicule et un tr&egrave;s grand parking, &agrave; 100 m de la plage est ici &agrave; votre disposition. La surface principale est &eacute;videmment du sable. Il a de nombreuses formes et formes diff&eacute;rentes et au total, il a une longueur de 1 km et une largeur de 20 m. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau est tr&egrave;s agr&eacute;able, en plus vous pouvez &eacute;galement utiliser l&#39;&eacute;chelle d&#39;eau. Le point de nage commence tr&egrave;s vite, &agrave; certains endroits on peut m&ecirc;me sauter dans l&#39;eau. De nombreux services de plage sont disponibles ici. Un restaurant qui est aussi un bar de plage se trouve &eacute;galement ici. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex, et rappelez-vous, si vous souhaitez trouver plus de plages de r&ecirc;ve pour votre prochaine aventure &agrave; la plage, utilisez toujours notre filtre avanc&eacute; BeachRex.', 4095, 'fr', 1),
(2206, 'Maldivas nunca se sinti&oacute; m&aacute;s cerca en los Pa&iacute;ses Bajos que en esta playa. Aunque la playa es completamente artificial, los arquitectos han hecho un gran trabajo y han creado una de las playas con mejor aspecto de Europa y, sin duda, de los Pa&iacute;ses Bajos. Alrededor de la playa tambi&eacute;n tienes casas y apartamentos muy bonitos y algunos de ellos incluso puedes alquilar. Si te gusta una playa as&iacute;, se llama Strand De Punt Grevelingen, se encuentra cerca de la ciudad de Ouddorp y pertenece a la regi&oacute;n Zuid-Holland. Es muy f&aacute;cil llegar con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y tiene a su disposici&oacute;n un aparcamiento muy grande, a 100 m de la playa. La superficie principal es obviamente arena. Tiene muchas formas y formas diferentes y en total tiene una longitud de 1 km y 20 m de ancho. La entrada de agua es muy agradable, adicional tambi&eacute;n puede usar la escalera de agua. El punto de nadar comienza muy r&aacute;pido, en algunos puntos incluso puedes saltar al agua. Muchos servicios de playa est&aacute;n disponibles aqu&iacute;. Un restaurante que tambi&eacute;n es un chiringuito tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; aqu&iacute;. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex y recuerda, si deseas encontrar m&aacute;s playas de ensue&ntilde;o para tu pr&oacute;xima aventura playera, utiliza siempre nuestro filtro avanzado BeachRex.', 4095, 'es', 1),
(2207, 'Die Malediven haben sich in den Niederlanden nie n&auml;her angef&uuml;hlt als an diesem Strand. Obwohl der Strand vollst&auml;ndig k&uuml;nstlich ist, haben die Architekten gro&szlig;artige Arbeit geleistet und einen der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde in Europa und sicherlich in den Niederlanden geschaffen. Rund um den Strand gibt es auch sehr sch&ouml;ne H&auml;user und Apartments, von denen einige sogar gemietet werden k&ouml;nnen. Wenn Sie einen solchen Strand m&ouml;gen, er hei&szlig;t Strand De Punt Grevelingen, liegt in der N&auml;he der Stadt Ouddorp und geh&ouml;rt zur Region Zuid-Holland. Es ist mit jedem Fahrzeug sehr leicht zu erreichen und ein sehr gro&szlig;er Parkplatz, 100 m vom Strand entfernt, steht Ihnen hier zur Verf&uuml;gung. Die Hauptoberfl&auml;che ist offensichtlich Sand. Er hat viele verschiedene Formen und Formen und hat insgesamt eine L&auml;nge von 1 km und eine Breite von 20 m. Der Wassereinstieg ist sehr sch&ouml;n, zus&auml;tzlich kann man auch die Wasserleiter benutzen. Der Schwimmpunkt beginnt sehr schnell, an einigen Stellen kann man sogar ins Wasser springen. Viele Strandservices sind hier verf&uuml;gbar. Hier befindet sich auch ein Restaurant, das gleichzeitig eine Strandbar ist. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie weitere Traumstr&auml;nde f&uuml;r Ihr n&auml;chstes Strandabenteuer finden m&ouml;chten, verwenden Sie immer unseren BeachRex-Erweitert Filter.', 4095, 'de', 1),
(2208, 'En el lago holand&eacute;s Gravelingenmeer, que se encuentra en la regi&oacute;n Zuid-Holland, tienes una bonita playa de arena, llamada Strand Grevelingenstrand, en la peque&ntilde;a pen&iacute;nsula Port Z&eacute;lande. Esta pen&iacute;nsula est&aacute; unida al Brouwersdam. La ciudad m&aacute;s cercana aqu&iacute; es Ouddorp. En la misma playa tambi&eacute;n tienes un pueblo tur&iacute;stico con bonitas casas peque&ntilde;as ubicadas directamente en la playa. Si te gusta esta caracter&iacute;stica, es muy f&aacute;cil llegar hasta aqu&iacute; con cualquier tipo de veh&iacute;culo y puedes aparcar junto a la carretera a tan solo 50 m de la playa. Esta playa es artificial y se presenta en muchas formas y formas diferentes, que se encuentran dispersas por toda la playa. La entrada de agua en la mayor&iacute;a de los lugares de la playa es bastante empinada y el punto de nado est&aacute; alrededor de los 10 m. La longitud total de la playa es de 300 my tiene una anchura m&aacute;xima de 10 m. Toda la infraestructura esencial de la playa se encuentra aqu&iacute;, los restaurantes no est&aacute;n disponibles y tienes el alojamiento disponible directamente en la playa o puedes elegir alg&uacute;n otro en las inmediaciones. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex, y recuerda, utiliza siempre nuestro filtro avanzado de playas, si quieres encontrar de la forma m&aacute;s r&aacute;pida posible la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.', 4098, 'es', 1),
(2209, 'Sur le lac n&eacute;erlandais Gravelingenmeer, qui est situ&eacute; dans la r&eacute;gion Zuid-Holland, vous avez une belle plage de sable, appel&eacute;e Strand Grevelingenstrand, sur la petite p&eacute;ninsule de Port Z&eacute;lande. Cette presqu&#39;&icirc;le est rattach&eacute;e au Brouwersdam. La ville la plus proche ici est Ouddorp. Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, vous avez &eacute;galement un village touristique avec de jolies petites maisons situ&eacute;es directement sur la plage. Si vous aimez cette caract&eacute;ristique, il est tr&egrave;s facile d&#39;arriver ici avec n&#39;importe quel type de v&eacute;hicule et vous pouvez vous garer au bord de la route &agrave; seulement 50 m de la plage. Cette plage est artificielle et se pr&eacute;sente sous de nombreuses formes et formes diff&eacute;rentes, qui sont dispers&eacute;es sur toute la plage. L&#39;entr&eacute;e d&#39;eau sur la plupart des spots de la plage est assez raide et le point de nage est &agrave; environ 10m. La longueur totale de la plage est de 300 m et elle a une largeur maximale de 10 m. Toutes les infrastructures essentielles de la plage se trouvent ici, les restaurants ne sont pas disponibles et vous avez le logement disponible directement sur la plage ou vous pouvez en choisir un autre &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex, et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours notre filtre de plage avanc&eacute;, si vous souhaitez trouver le plus rapidement possible votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.', 4098, 'fr', 1),
(2210, 'Sul lago olandese Gravelingenmeer, che si trova nella regione Zuid-Holland, hai una bella spiaggia sabbiosa, chiamata Strand Grevelingenstrand, sulla piccola penisola di Port Z&eacute;lande. Questa penisola &egrave; collegata al Brouwersdam. La citt&agrave; pi&ugrave; vicina qui intorno &egrave; Ouddorp. Sulla spiaggia stessa c&#39;&egrave; anche un villaggio turistico con belle casette situate direttamente sulla spiaggia. Se ti piace questa caratteristica, &egrave; molto facile arrivarci con qualsiasi tipo di veicolo e puoi parcheggiare lungo la strada a soli 50 m dalla spiaggia. Questa spiaggia &egrave; artificiale e si presenta in molte forme e forme diverse, che sono disperse intorno all&#39;intera spiaggia. L&#39;ingresso dell&#39;acqua nella maggior parte dei punti della spiaggia &egrave; piuttosto ripido e il punto di nuoto &egrave; di circa 10 m. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 300 me ha una larghezza massima di 10 m. Tutta l&#39;infrastruttura balneare essenziale si trova qui, i ristoranti non sono disponibili e hai l&#39;alloggio disponibile direttamente sulla spiaggia o puoi sceglierne un altro nelle vicinanze. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda, usa sempre il nostro filtro avanzato per la spiaggia, se desideri trovare nel modo pi&ugrave; veloce possibile la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.', 4098, 'it', 1),
(2211, 'Am niederl&auml;ndischen See Gravelingenmeer, der in der Region Zuid-Holland liegt, gibt es auf der kleinen Halbinsel Port Z&eacute;lande einen sch&ouml;nen Sandstrand namens Strand Grevelingenstrand. Diese Halbinsel ist mit dem Brouwersdam verbunden. Die n&auml;chste Stadt hier in der N&auml;he ist Ouddorp. Am Strand selbst gibt es auch ein touristisches Dorf mit netten kleinen H&auml;usern, die direkt am Strand liegen. Wenn Sie diese Eigenschaft m&ouml;gen, ist es sehr einfach, mit jedem Fahrzeug hierher zu kommen, und Sie k&ouml;nnen neben der Stra&szlig;e nur 50 m vom Strand entfernt parken. Dieser Strand ist k&uuml;nstlich angelegt und kommt in vielen verschiedenen Formen vor, die &uuml;ber den ganzen Strand verteilt sind. Der Wassereintritt an den meisten Stellen des Strandes ist ziemlich steil und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei etwa 10 m. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 300 m und hat eine maximale Breite von 10 m. Die gesamte notwendige Strandinfrastruktur befindet sich hier, Restaurants sind nicht verf&uuml;gbar und Sie haben die Unterkunft direkt am Strand zur Verf&uuml;gung oder Sie k&ouml;nnen eine andere in der N&auml;he w&auml;hlen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer unseren erweiterten Strandfilter, wenn Sie auf dem schnellsten Weg Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand finden m&ouml;chten.', 4098, 'de', 1),
(2212, 'Die Halbinsel Chalkidiki ist einer der sch&ouml;nsten Orte Griechenlands. Hier finden Sie die sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde und eine erstaunliche Natur. Es ist in drei kleinere Halbinseln unterteilt, von denen eine die Halbinsel Sithonia ist. Von Sithonia aus k&ouml;nnen Sie die anderen beiden Halbinseln sehen, eine davon ist der Berg Athos, der sich im Osten befindet, und im Westen haben Sie die Halbinsel Kassandra. Der Strand Platania bietet dir einen direkten Blick auf den Berg Athos, ist ein Sandstrand und bestens f&uuml;r Familien geeignet. Das Gute am Strand ist die Tatsache, dass man direkt am Strand parken kann, und wenn man m&ouml;chte, kann man hier auch mit einem Wohnmobil &uuml;bernachten. Aber Sand ist nicht die einzige Oberfl&auml;che, die Sie hier finden werden, Gras ist hier ebenso vorhanden wie einige Felsformationen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 200 Meter und er kann bis zu 20 Meter breit sein. Die Hangneigung hat hier einen gro&szlig;en Winkel, es ist mehr als &uuml;blich, was auch bedeutet, dass man fast sofort losschwimmen kann, schon bei 5 Metern. Strandinfrastruktur ist ebenfalls vorhanden, aber mehr oder weniger einfach. Unterkunft ist in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar, haupts&auml;chlich in Form von Apartments, Studios und Zimmern. Auch um Essen und Trinken brauchen Sie sich hier nicht zu k&uuml;mmern, eine Taverne oder ein Restaurant mit leckerem Essen ist gleich in der N&auml;he. Und nat&uuml;rlich sind auch Hundebesitzer hier willkommen, wie &uuml;berall in Griechenland. Also, worauf warten Sie noch, buchen Sie ein Apartment am Strand, organisieren Sie alles und besuchen Sie Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand. Und denken Sie daran, verwenden Sie immer BeachRex und unseren erweiterten Filter, um Ihr n&auml;chstes unvergessliches Stranderlebnis zu finden.', 3437, 'de', 1),
(2213, 'La penisola di Khalkidhiki &egrave; uno dei posti pi&ugrave; belli della Grecia. Qui troverai le spiagge pi&ugrave; belle e la natura straordinaria. &Egrave; divisa in tre penisole pi&ugrave; piccole, una delle quali &egrave; la penisola di Sithonia. Da Sithonia puoi vedere le altre due penisole, una delle quali &egrave; il Monte Athos, che si trova ad est, e ad ovest hai la penisola Kassandra. La spiaggia Platania offre una vista diretta sul Monte Athos, &egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa ed &egrave; pi&ugrave; adatta alle famiglie. La cosa bella della spiaggia &egrave; il fatto che puoi parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia, e se vuoi puoi stare qui anche con un camper. Ma la sabbia non &egrave; l&#39;unica superficie che troverai qui, qui &egrave; presente anche l&#39;erba e alcune formazioni rocciose. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 200 metri e pu&ograve; arrivare a 20 metri di larghezza. L&#39;inclinazione del pendio ha qui un angolo ampio, pi&ugrave; del solito, il che significa anche che puoi iniziare a nuotare quasi subito, gi&agrave; a 5 metri. Sono disponibili anche infrastrutture balneari, ma pi&ugrave; o meno basilari. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile nelle vicinanze, principalmente sotto forma di appartamenti, monolocali e camere. Inoltre, non devi preoccuparti di cibo o bevande qui, una Taverna o un ristorante, con cibo delizioso, &egrave; proprio nelle vicinanze. E, naturalmente, se possiedi un cane, qui sei il benvenuto, come ovunque in Grecia. Allora, cosa aspetti, prenota un appartamento sulla spiaggia, organizza tutto e visita la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno. E ricorda, usa sempre BeachRex e il nostro filtro avanzato per trovare la tua prossima esperienza indimenticabile in spiaggia.', 3437, 'it', 1),
(2214, 'La p&eacute;ninsule de Khalkidhiki est l&#39;un des plus beaux endroits de Gr&egrave;ce. Vous y trouverez les plus belles plages et une nature &eacute;tonnante. Elle est divis&eacute;e en trois p&eacute;ninsules plus petites, l&#39;une d&#39;elles &eacute;tant la p&eacute;ninsule de Sithonie. De Sithonia, vous pouvez voir les deux autres p&eacute;ninsules, l&#39;une d&#39;elles &eacute;tant le mont Athos, qui est situ&eacute; &agrave; l&#39;est, et &agrave; l&#39;ouest, vous avez la p&eacute;ninsule de Kassandra. La plage Platania vous offre une vue directe sur le Mont Athos, c&#39;est une plage de sable et convient mieux aux familles. Ce qui est bien avec la plage, c&#39;est le fait que vous pouvez vous garer directement sur la plage, et si vous le souhaitez, vous pouvez &eacute;galement rester ici avec un camping-car. Mais le sable n&#39;est pas la seule surface que vous trouverez ici, l&#39;herbe est &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sente ici ainsi que quelques formations rocheuses. La longueur totale de la plage est de 200 m&egrave;tres et elle peut mesurer jusqu&#39;&agrave; 20 m&egrave;tres de large. L&#39;inclinaison de la pente a ici un grand angle, c&#39;est plus que d&#39;habitude, ce qui signifie aussi que vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager presque imm&eacute;diatement, d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 5 m&egrave;tres. Des infrastructures de plage sont &eacute;galement disponibles, mais elles sont plus ou moins basiques. Des logements sont disponibles &agrave; proximit&eacute;, principalement sous forme d&#39;appartements, de studios et de chambres. Vous n&#39;avez pas non plus &agrave; vous soucier de la nourriture ou des boissons ici, une taverne ou un restaurant, avec une cuisine d&eacute;licieuse, se trouve juste &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Et bien s&ucirc;r, si vous &ecirc;tes propri&eacute;taire d&#39;un chien, vous &ecirc;tes le bienvenu ici, comme partout ailleurs en Gr&egrave;ce. Alors, qu&#39;attendez-vous, r&eacute;servez un appartement sur la plage, organisez tout et visitez votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve. Et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours BeachRex et notre filtre avanc&eacute; pour trouver votre prochaine exp&eacute;rience de plage inoubliable.', 3437, 'fr', 1),
(2215, 'La pen&iacute;nsula de Khalkidhiki es uno de los lugares m&aacute;s bellos de Grecia. Aqu&iacute; encontrar&aacute; las playas m&aacute;s hermosas y la naturaleza incre&iacute;ble. Se divide en tres pen&iacute;nsulas m&aacute;s peque&ntilde;as, siendo una de ellas la pen&iacute;nsula de Sithonia. Desde Sithonia puedes ver las otras dos pen&iacute;nsulas, una de ellas es el Monte Athos, que se encuentra al este, y al oeste tienes la pen&iacute;nsula Kassandra. La playa Platania le ofrece una vista directa del Monte Athos, es una playa de arena y es ideal para familias. Lo bueno de la playa es el hecho de que puedes aparcar directamente en la playa, y si quieres puedes quedarte aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n con una autocaravana. Pero la arena no es la &uacute;nica superficie que encontrar&aacute;s aqu&iacute;, la hierba tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; presente aqu&iacute;, as&iacute; como algunas formaciones rocosas. La longitud total de la playa es de 200 metros y puede tener hasta 20 metros de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la pendiente tiene aqu&iacute; un gran &aacute;ngulo, es m&aacute;s de lo habitual, lo que tambi&eacute;n significa que puedes empezar a nadar casi de inmediato, ya a los 5 metros. La infraestructura de la playa tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible, pero es m&aacute;s o menos b&aacute;sica. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en los alrededores, principalmente en forma de apartamentos, estudios y habitaciones. Tampoco necesita preocuparse por la comida o las bebidas aqu&iacute;, una taberna o un restaurante, con comida deliciosa, est&aacute; cerca. Y, por supuesto, si tienes un perro, eres bienvenido aqu&iacute;, como en cualquier otro lugar de Grecia. Entonces, &iquest;a qu&eacute; esperas? Reserva un apartamento en la playa, organ&iacute;zalo todo y visita la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os. Y recuerda, siempre usa BeachRex y nuestro filtro avanzado para encontrar tu pr&oacute;xima experiencia inolvidable en la playa.', 3437, 'es', 1),
(2216, 'Полуостров Халкидики &mdash; одно из самых красивых мест Греции. Здесь вы найдете самые красивые пляжи и удивительную природу. Он разделен на три небольших полуострова, один из которых &mdash; полуостров Ситония. Из Ситонии вы можете увидеть два других полуострова, один из которых &mdash; гора Афон, расположенная на востоке, а на западе &mdash; полуостров Кассандра. Пляж Платания предлагает вам прямой вид на гору Афон, это песчаный пляж, который лучше всего подходит для семей. Что хорошо на пляже, так это то, что вы можете припарковаться прямо на пляже, а при желании вы можете остановиться здесь и с домом на колесах. Но песок - не единственная поверхность, которую вы найдете здесь, здесь также присутствует трава, а также некоторые скальные образования. Общая длина пляжа составляет 200 метров, а ширина может достигать 20 метров. Наклон склона здесь имеет большой угол, он больше, чем обычно, что также означает, что вы можете начать плавать практически сразу, уже на 5-ти метрах. Пляжная инфраструктура тоже имеется, но она более-менее базовая. Жилье доступно поблизости, в основном в виде квартир, студий и комнат. Вам также не нужно беспокоиться о еде или напитках здесь, таверна или ресторан с вкусной едой совсем рядом. И конечно же, если вы владелец собаки, вам здесь рады, как и везде в Греции. Итак, чего же вы ждете, забронируйте апартаменты на пляже, организуйте все и посетите следующий пляж своей мечты. И помните, всегда используйте BeachRex и наш расширенный фильтр, чтобы найти следующий незабываемый отдых на пляже.', 3437, 'ru', 1),
(2217, 'Polotok Khalkidhiki je eden najlep&scaron;ih krajev v Grčiji. Tukaj boste na&scaron;li najlep&scaron;e plaže in čudovito naravo. Razdeljen je na tri manj&scaron;e polotoke, eden od njih je polotok Sitonija. S Sitonije lahko vidite druga dva polotoka, eden od njih je gora Atos, ki se nahaja na vzhodu, na zahodu pa je polotok Kasandra. Plaža Platania vam ponuja neposreden pogled na goro Atos, je pe&scaron;čena plaža in je najbolj primerna za družine. Kar je dobro pri plaži, je dejstvo, da lahko parkirate neposredno na plaži, če želite pa lahko tu ostanete tudi z avtodomom. Toda pesek ni edina povr&scaron;ina, ki jo boste na&scaron;li tukaj, tukaj je prisotna tudi trava in nekaj kamnitih formacij. Skupna dolžina plaže je 200 metrov in je lahko &scaron;iroka do 20 metrov. Naklon pobočja ima tukaj velik kot, je večji kot običajno, kar tudi pomeni, da lahko začnete plavati skoraj takoj, že na 5 metrih. Na voljo je tudi infrastruktura na plaži, vendar je bolj ali manj osnovna. Namestitev je na voljo v bližini, predvsem v obliki apartmajev, studiev in sob. Tukaj vam tudi ni treba skrbeti za hrano ali pijačo, taverna ali restavracija z okusno hrano je v bližini. In seveda, če ste lastnik psa, ste tukaj dobrodo&scaron;li, kot povsod drugje v Grčiji. Torej, kaj &scaron;e čakate, rezervirajte apartma na plaži, organizirajte vse in obi&scaron;čite svojo naslednjo sanjsko plažo. In ne pozabite, vedno uporabite BeachRex in na&scaron; napredni filter, da poi&scaron;čete svojo naslednjo nepozabno izku&scaron;njo na plaži.', 3437, 'sl', 1),
(2218, 'Poluotok Khalkidhiki jedno je od najljep&scaron;ih mjesta u Grčkoj. Ovdje ćete pronaći najljep&scaron;e plaže i nevjerojatnu prirodu. Podijeljen je na tri manja poluotoka, a jedan od njih je poluotok Sitonija. Sa Sitonije možete vidjeti druga dva poluotoka, jedan od njih je planina Atos, koja se nalazi na istoku, a na zapadu imate poluotok Kasandra. Plaža Platania nudi vam direktan pogled na planinu Atos, to je pje&scaron;čana plaža i najprikladnija je za obitelji. Ono &scaron;to je dobro kod plaže je činjenica da možete parkirati direktno na plaži, a ako želite možete ovdje boraviti i s kamperom. Ali pijesak nije jedina povr&scaron;ina koju ćete ovdje pronaći, ovdje je prisutna i trava, kao i neke kamene formacije. Ukupna dužina plaže je 200 metara, a može biti &scaron;iroka do 20 metara. Nagib padine ovdje ima veliki kut, veći je nego obično, &scaron;to također znači da možete početi plivati ​​gotovo odmah, već na 5 metara. Infrastruktura na plaži je također dostupna, ali je vi&scaron;e-manje osnovna. Smje&scaron;taj je dostupan u blizini, uglavnom u obliku apartmana, studija i soba. Također ne morate brinuti o hrani ili piću ovdje, Taverna ili restoran, s ukusnom hranom, je u neposrednoj blizini. I naravno, ako ste vlasnik psa, ovdje ste dobrodo&scaron;li, kao i svugdje u Grčkoj. Dakle, &scaron;to čekate, rezervirajte apartman na plaži, organizirajte sve i posjetite svoju sljedeću plažu iz snova. I zapamtite, uvijek koristite BeachRex i na&scaron; napredni filtar kako biste prona&scaron;li svoje sljedeće nezaboravno iskustvo na plaži.', 3437, 'hr', 1),
(2219, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Die sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde Griechenlands befinden sich sicherlich auf der Halbinsel Chalkidiki. Wenn Sie auf der Suche nach sch&ouml;nen Str&auml;nden und erstaunlicher Natur sind, m&uuml;ssen Sie diesen Ort einfach besuchen, so viele Leute sprechen dar&uuml;ber, und nach Ihrem Besuch werden Sie mit Sicherheit einer von ihnen sein. Die Halbinsel Chalkidhiki ist in drei kleinere Halbinseln unterteilt, eine davon ist die Halbinsel Sithonia, dann gibt es die Halbinsel Berg Athos und die Halbinsel Kassandra. Die Paralia Katerina befindet sich auf der zweiten Halbinsel von Chalkidhiki, genannt Sithonia. Diese Region geh&ouml;rt zu Kantriki Makedonia. Der Strand selbst ist ein Sandstrand und eignet sich am besten f&uuml;r Familienbesucher. Die dem Strand am n&auml;chsten gelegene Stadt ist Sykia, nur wenige Kilometer vom Meer entfernt. Sie werden hier keine Probleme mit dem Parken haben, Sie k&ouml;nnen einfach neben dem Strand parken, wie Sie auf unseren Bildern sehen k&ouml;nnen, ehrlich gesagt, es gibt nicht viele Str&auml;nde auf der Welt mit dieser Parkfunktion. Der Strand ist 300 Meter lang und bis zu 20 Meter breit. Sie haben viele sch&ouml;ne Formen am Strand, einige kleinere Str&auml;nde, die durch einige Felsformationen unterteilt sind. Die Strandneigung ist normal und Sie k&ouml;nnen fast sofort mit dem Schwimmen beginnen, bereits nach nur drei Metern. Etwas Strandinfrastruktur ist auch hier vorhanden, aber mehr oder weniger nur grundlegend. Neben dem Strand gibt es einen Campingplatz mit etwas einfacher Infrastruktur, ansonsten ist die ganze Gegend nat&uuml;rlicher. Am Strand selbst gibt es keine Verpflegungsm&ouml;glichkeit, aber am Nachbarstrand, etwa 300 Meter entfernt, gibt es einige Restaurants. Wenn Sie ein Hundebesitzer sind, ist Ihr Haustier hier willkommen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, immer unseren BeachRex-Filter zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.</div>\n', 3438, 'de', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(2220, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Las playas m&aacute;s hermosas de Grecia se encuentran ciertamente en la pen&iacute;nsula de Khalkidhiki. Si buscas hermosas playas y una naturaleza asombrosa simplemente tienes que visitar este lugar, mucha gente habla de &eacute;l, y despu&eacute;s de tu visita, seguro que ser&aacute;s uno de ellos. La pen&iacute;nsula de Khalkidhiki se divide en tres pen&iacute;nsulas m&aacute;s peque&ntilde;as, una de ellas es la pen&iacute;nsula Sithonia, que es la pen&iacute;nsula del Monte Athos y la pen&iacute;nsula Kassandra. La paralia Katerina se encuentra en la segunda pen&iacute;nsula de Khalkidhiki, llamada Sithonia. Esta regi&oacute;n pertenece a Kantriki makedonia. La playa en s&iacute; es una playa de arena y es m&aacute;s adecuada para un tipo de visitante familiar. El pueblo m&aacute;s cercano a la playa es Sykia, a pocos kil&oacute;metros de la costa. No tendr&aacute;s ning&uacute;n problema con el estacionamiento aqu&iacute;, simplemente puedes estacionar al lado de la playa, como puedes ver en nuestras fotos, sinceramente, no hay muchas playas en el mundo con esta funci&oacute;n de estacionamiento. La playa tiene 300 metros de largo y hasta 20 metros de ancho. Tienes muchas formas agradables en la playa, algunas playas m&aacute;s peque&ntilde;as, que est&aacute;n divididas por algunas formaciones rocosas. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es normal y puedes empezar a nadar casi de inmediato, ya despu&eacute;s de solo tres metros. Algunas infraestructuras de playa tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n presentes aqu&iacute;, pero son m&aacute;s o menos b&aacute;sicas. Al lado de la playa hay un camping con algunas infraestructuras b&aacute;sicas, por lo dem&aacute;s toda la zona es m&aacute;s natural. En la propia playa no hay opci&oacute;n de restauraci&oacute;n, pero tienes algunos restaurantes en la playa vecina, a unos 300 metros. Si usted es due&ntilde;o de un perro, su mascota es bienvenida aqu&iacute;. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex y recuerda usar siempre nuestro filtro BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.</div>\n', 3438, 'es', 1),
(2221, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Les plus belles plages de Gr&egrave;ce sont certainement situ&eacute;es sur la p&eacute;ninsule de Khalkidhiki. Si vous recherchez de belles plages et une nature &eacute;tonnante, vous devez simplement visiter cet endroit, tant de gens en parlent, et apr&egrave;s votre visite, vous serez l&#39;un d&#39;entre eux, c&#39;est s&ucirc;r. La p&eacute;ninsule de Khalkidhiki est divis&eacute;e en trois p&eacute;ninsules plus petites, l&#39;une d&#39;elles est la p&eacute;ninsule de Sithonia, puis il y a la p&eacute;ninsule du mont Athos et la p&eacute;ninsule de Kassandra. La paralia Katerina est situ&eacute;e sur la deuxi&egrave;me p&eacute;ninsule du Khalkidhiki, nomm&eacute;e Sithonia. Cette r&eacute;gion appartient &agrave; la makedonia Kantriki. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me est une plage de sable et convient mieux &agrave; un type de visiteur familial. La ville la plus proche de la plage est Sykia, &agrave; quelques kilom&egrave;tres du bord de mer. Vous n&#39;aurez aucun probl&egrave;me de stationnement ici, vous pouvez simplement vous garer &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, comme vous pouvez le voir sur nos photos, honn&ecirc;tement, il n&#39;y a pas beaucoup de plages dans le monde avec cette fonction de stationnement. La plage mesure 300 m&egrave;tres de long et jusqu&#39;&agrave; 20 m&egrave;tres de large. Vous avez beaucoup de belles formes sur la plage, des plages plus petites, qui sont divis&eacute;es par des formations rocheuses. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est normale et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager presque imm&eacute;diatement, d&eacute;j&agrave; apr&egrave;s seulement trois m&egrave;tres. Certaines infrastructures de plage sont &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sentes ici, mais elles sont plus ou moins basiques. &Agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage, il y a un camping avec une infrastructure de base, sinon toute la zone est plus naturelle. Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, il n&#39;y a pas d&#39;option de restauration, mais vous avez quelques restaurants sur la plage voisine, &agrave; environ 300 m&egrave;tres. Si vous &ecirc;tes propri&eacute;taire d&#39;un chien, votre animal de compagnie est le bienvenu ici. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex et n&#39;oubliez pas de toujours utiliser notre filtre BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.</div>\n', 3438, 'fr', 1),
(2222, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Le spiagge pi&ugrave; belle della Grecia si trovano sicuramente nella penisola di Khalkidhiki. Se stai cercando spiagge bellissime e una natura sorprendente, devi semplicemente visitare questo posto, ne parlano cos&igrave; tante persone e, dopo la tua visita, sarai sicuramente uno di loro. La penisola di Khalkidhiki &egrave; divisa in tre penisole pi&ugrave; piccole, una delle quali &egrave; la penisola di Sithonia, poi c&#39;&egrave; la penisola del Monte Athos e la penisola di Kassandra. La paralia Katerina si trova sulla seconda penisola del Khalkidhiki, chiamata Sithonia. Questa regione appartiene alla Makedonia di Kantriki. La spiaggia stessa &egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa ed &egrave; pi&ugrave; adatta per un tipo di visitatore familiare. Il paese pi&ugrave; vicino alla spiaggia &egrave; Sykia, a pochi chilometri dal mare. Non avrai problemi con il parcheggio qui, puoi semplicemente parcheggiare vicino alla spiaggia, come puoi vedere nelle nostre foto, onestamente, non ci sono molte spiagge al mondo con questa funzione di parcheggio. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga 300 metri e larga fino a 20 metri. Hai molte belle forme sulla spiaggia, alcune spiagge pi&ugrave; piccole, che sono divise da alcune formazioni rocciose. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; normale e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare quasi subito, gi&agrave; dopo soli tre metri. Qui sono presenti anche alcune infrastrutture balneari, ma pi&ugrave; o meno solo di base. Accanto alla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un campeggio con alcune infrastrutture di base, altrimenti l&#39;intera area &egrave; pi&ugrave; naturale. Sulla spiaggia stessa non c&#39;&egrave; possibilit&agrave; di ristorazione, ma ci sono alcuni ristoranti sulla spiaggia vicina, a circa 300 metri di distanza. Se sei un proprietario di cane, il tuo animale domestico &egrave; il benvenuto qui. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda di utilizzare sempre il nostro filtro BeachRex per trovare la prossima spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.</div>\n', 3438, 'it', 1),
(2223, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Самые красивые пляжи Греции, безусловно, расположены на полуострове Халкидики. Если вы ищете прекрасные пляжи и удивительную природу, вы просто обязаны посетить это место, так много людей говорят об этом, и после вашего визита вы обязательно станете одним из них. Полуостров Халкидики делится на три меньших полуострова, один из них - полуостров Ситония, далее идут полуостров Афон и полуостров Кассандра. Паралия Катерина расположена на втором полуострове Халкидики, называемом Ситония. Этот регион принадлежит македонии Кантрики. Сам пляж песчаный и лучше всего подходит для семейного отдыха. Ближайший к пляжу город Сикия находится в нескольких километрах от моря. У вас не будет проблем с парковкой здесь, вы можете просто припарковаться рядом с пляжем, как вы можете видеть на наших фотографиях, честно говоря, в мире не так много пляжей с такой функцией парковки. Пляж имеет длину 300 метров и ширину до 20 метров. У вас есть много красивых форм на пляже, несколько небольших пляжей, которые разделены скальными образованиями. Наклон пляжа нормальный, купаться можно практически сразу, уже через три метра. Некоторая пляжная инфраструктура здесь тоже присутствует, но она более-менее базовая. Рядом с пляжем есть кемпинг с базовой инфраструктурой, в остальном вся территория более естественная. На самом пляже нет питания, но есть несколько ресторанов на соседнем пляже, примерно в 300 метрах. Если вы владелец собаки, здесь рады вашему питомцу. Наслаждайтесь своим пляжем с BeachRex и не забывайте всегда использовать наш фильтр BeachRex, чтобы найти следующий пляж своей мечты.</div>\n', 3438, 'ru', 1),
(2224, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Najlep&scaron;e plaže v Grčiji se zagotovo nahajajo na polotoku Khalkidhiki. Če i&scaron;čete čudovite plaže in osupljivo naravo, preprosto morate obiskati ta kraj, toliko ljudi govori o tem in po obisku boste zagotovo eden izmed njih. Polotok Halkidhiki je razdeljen na tri manj&scaron;e polotoke, eden od njih je polotok Sitonija, nato &scaron;e polotok Atos in polotok Kasandra. Paralia Katerina se nahaja na drugem polotoku Khalkidhiki, imenovanem Sithonia. Ta regija spada v Kantriki makedonijo. Sama plaža je pe&scaron;čena in je najbolj primerna za družinski tip obiskovalca. Plaža najbližje mesto je Sykia, nekaj kilometrov stran od morja. Tukaj ne boste imeli težav s parkiranjem, lahko preprosto parkirate ob plaži, kot vidite na na&scaron;ih slikah, res ni veliko plaž na svetu s to možnostjo parkiranja. Plaža je dolga 300 metrov in &scaron;iroka do 20 metrov. Na plaži imate veliko lepih oblik, nekaj manj&scaron;ih plaž, ki jih deli nekaj skalnih formacij. Naklon plaže je normalen in kopanje lahko začnete skoraj takoj, že po treh metrih. Nekaj ​​plažne infrastrukture je tudi tukaj, vendar je bolj ali manj le osnovna. Ob plaži je kamp z nekaj osnovne infrastrukture, sicer pa je celotno območje bolj naravno. Na sami plaži ni gostinske ponudbe, imate pa nekaj restavracij na sosednji plaži, približno 300 metrov stran. Če ste lastnik psa, je va&scaron; ljubljenček tukaj dobrodo&scaron;el. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom in ne pozabite vedno uporabiti na&scaron;ega filtra BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo naslednjo sanjsko plažo.</div>\n', 3438, 'sl', 1),
(2225, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Najljep&scaron;e plaže u Grčkoj zasigurno se nalaze na poluotoku Khalkidhiki. Ako ste u potrazi za prekrasnim plažama i nevjerojatnom prirodom jednostavno morate posjetiti ovo mjesto, o kojem mnogi pričaju, a nakon posjete sigurno ćete biti jedan od njih. Poluotok Halkidhiki podijeljen je na tri manja poluotoka, jedan od njih je poluotok Sitonija, zatim poluotok Atos i poluotok Kasandra. Paralija Katerina nalazi se na drugom poluotoku Halkidikija, po imenu Sitonija. Ova regija pripada Makedoniji Kantriki. Sama plaža je pje&scaron;čana i najprikladnija je za obiteljski tip posjetitelja. Najbliži grad plaži je Sykia, nekoliko kilometara udaljen od mora. Ovdje nećete imati problema s parkiranjem, jednostavno možete parkirati uz plažu, kao &scaron;to vidite na na&scaron;im slikama, iskreno, nema puno plaža na svijetu s ovom funkcijom parkiranja. Plaža je duga 300 metara, a &scaron;iroka do 20 metara. Imate puno lijepih oblika na plaži, nekoliko manjih plaža, koje su podijeljene kamenim formacijama. Nagib plaže je normalan i možete početi plivati ​​gotovo odmah, već nakon samo tri metra. Ovdje postoji i određena infrastruktura na plaži, ali manje-vi&scaron;e samo osnovna. Pored plaže nalazi se kamp s osnovnom infrastrukturom, inače je cijelo područje prirodnije. Na samoj plaži nema ugostiteljske ponude, ali imate nekoliko restorana na susjednoj plaži, udaljenoj oko 300 metara. Ako ste vlasnik psa, va&scaron; ljubimac je ovdje dobrodo&scaron;ao. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex i ne zaboravite uvijek koristiti na&scaron; BeachRex filter kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju sljedeću plažu iz snova.</div>\n', 3438, 'hr', 1),
(2226, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ova prekrasna pje&scaron;čana plaža, nazvana Paralia Sikia, nalazi se na poluotoku Sithonia u regiji Kentriki Makedonija. Budući da je dio poluotoka Khalkidhiki, sigurno je to jedna od najčudesnijih i najljep&scaron;ih plaža u Grčkoj. To je vrlo duga pje&scaron;čana plaža s vrlo velikim parkirnim prostorom, do koje se dolazi makadamskom cestom. Možete parkirati direktno na plaži, potpuna sloboda, ova činjenica čini Grčku vrlo jedinstvenom, u usporedbi s drugim zemljama, gdje je režim parkiranja vrlo strog. Naravno, kamper možete ostaviti i na plaži, neki čak i prespavati. To je obiteljska plaža, ali nije prikladna za vrlo malu djecu, voda prebrzo postaje duboka. Cijelo područje plaže je vrlo veliko, sama plaža je duga vi&scaron;e od 1000 metara, &scaron;iroka 100 metara, a nagib plaže je malo povećan. Zbog povećanog kuta nagiba točka plivanja je već na 3 metra. Ovdje postoji i određena infrastruktura na plaži. Ovdje ćete pronaći sve bitne sadržaje, kao i dječja igrali&scaron;ta, neke sportske terene, od kojih jedan teniski teren, teren za odbojku i ko&scaron;arku. Ako vam se sviđaju sve ove značajke plaže, ovdje ćete pronaći i smje&scaron;taj, neki kampovi i apartmani dostupni su u pozadini plaže. Plaža je pogodna za pse, gdje imaju dovoljno prostora za trčanje. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex i ne zaboravite uvijek koristiti na&scaron; BeachRex filter kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju sljedeću plažu iz snova.</div>\n', 3439, 'hr', 1),
(2227, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ta čudovita pe&scaron;čena plaža, imenovana Paralia Sikia, se nahaja na polotoku Sitonija v regiji Kentriki Makedonija. Ker je del polotoka Khalkidhiki, to zagotovo pomeni eno najbolj neverjetnih in najlep&scaron;ih plaž v Grčiji. To je zelo dolga pe&scaron;čena plaža z zelo velikim parkiri&scaron;čem, do katere pridete po makadamski cesti. Lahko parkirate neposredno na plaži, popolna svoboda, zaradi tega je Grčija zelo edinstvena v primerjavi z drugimi državami, kjer je režim parkiranja zelo strog. Seveda lahko avtodom pustite tudi na plaži, nekateri ostanejo tudi čez noč. Je družinska plaža, vendar ni primerna za zelo majhne otroke, voda se prehitro poglobi. Celotno območje plaže je zelo veliko, sama plaža je dolga več kot 1000 metrov, &scaron;iroka 100 metrov in naklon plaže je rahlo povečan. Zaradi povečanega naklona je točka plavanja že na 3 metrih. Nekaj ​​plažne infrastrukture je tudi tukaj. Tu boste na&scaron;li vse bistvene dobrine, kot tudi otro&scaron;ka igri&scaron;ča, nekaj &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č, eno od njih igri&scaron;če za tenis, igri&scaron;če za odbojko in ko&scaron;arko. Če vam je v&scaron;eč vse te značilnosti plaže, boste tukaj na&scaron;li tudi nekaj namestitev, nekaj kampov in apartmajev pa je na voljo v ozadju plaže. Plaža je primerna za pse, kjer imajo dovolj prostora za tekanje. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom in ne pozabite vedno uporabiti na&scaron;ega filtra BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo naslednjo sanjsko plažo.</div>\n', 3439, 'sl', 1),
(2228, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Этот красивый песчаный пляж под названием Паралия Сикия расположен на полуострове Ситония в регионе Кентрики Македония. Будучи частью полуострова Халкидики, это, безусловно, один из самых удивительных и красивых пляжей в Греции. Это очень длинный песчаный пляж с очень большой парковкой, до которой можно добраться по грунтовой дороге. Вы можете припарковаться прямо на пляже, полная свобода, этот факт делает Грецию очень уникальной по сравнению с другими странами, где режим парковки очень строгий. Конечно, вы также можете оставить свой дом на колесах на пляже, а некоторые даже остаться на ночь. Это семейный пляж, но он не подходит для очень маленьких детей, вода слишком быстро становится глубокой. Вся пляжная зона очень большая, сам пляж более 1000 метров в длину, 100 метров в ширину и наклон пляжа немного увеличен. Из-за увеличенного угла наклона точка заплыва находится уже на 3-х метрах. Некоторая пляжная инфраструктура здесь тоже присутствует. Здесь вы найдете все необходимые удобства, а также детские игровые площадки, несколько спортивных площадок, в том числе теннисную площадку, волейбольную площадку и баскетбольную площадку. Если вам нравятся все эти пляжные особенности, вы также найдете здесь жилье, некоторые кемпинги и апартаменты доступны на заднем плане пляжа. Пляж подходит для собак, где им есть где побегать. Наслаждайтесь своим пляжем с BeachRex и не забывайте всегда использовать наш фильтр BeachRex, чтобы найти следующий пляж своей мечты.</div>\n', 3439, 'ru', 1),
(2229, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dieser sch&ouml;ne Sandstrand namens Paralia Sikia liegt auf der Halbinsel Sithonia in der Region Kentriki Makedonija. Als Teil der Halbinsel Chalkidhiki ist es sicherlich einer der erstaunlichsten und sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde Griechenlands. Es ist ein sehr langer Sandstrand mit einem sehr gro&szlig;en Parkplatz, den man &uuml;ber einen Feldweg erreicht. Sie k&ouml;nnen direkt am Strand parken, v&ouml;llige Freiheit, diese Tatsache macht Griechenland im Vergleich zu anderen L&auml;ndern, in denen das Parkregime sehr streng ist, einzigartig. Nat&uuml;rlich kannst du dein Wohnmobil auch am Strand stehen lassen, einige bleiben sogar &uuml;ber Nacht. Es ist ein Familienstrand, aber er ist nicht f&uuml;r die ganz kleinen Kinder geeignet, das Wasser wird zu schnell tief. Der gesamte Strandbereich ist sehr gro&szlig;, der Strand selbst ist &uuml;ber 1000 Meter lang, 100 Meter breit und die Strandneigung leicht erh&ouml;ht. Durch den erh&ouml;hten B&ouml;schungswinkel liegt der Schwimmpunkt bereits bei 3 Metern. Einige Strandinfrastruktur ist auch hier vorhanden. Hier finden Sie alle wesentlichen Annehmlichkeiten sowie Kinderspielpl&auml;tze, einige Sportpl&auml;tze, darunter einen Tennisplatz, einen Volleyballplatz und einen Basketballplatz. Wenn Sie all diese Strandmerkmale m&ouml;gen, finden Sie hier auch einige Unterk&uuml;nfte, einige Camps und Apartments sind im Hintergrund des Strandes verf&uuml;gbar. Der Strand ist f&uuml;r Hunde geeignet, wo sie viel Platz zum Toben haben. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, immer unseren BeachRex-Filter zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.</div>\n', 3439, 'de', 1),
(2230, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Questa bellissima spiaggia sabbiosa, chiamata Paralia Sikia si trova sulla penisola di Sithonia nella regione Kentriki Makedonija. Far parte della penisola di Khalkidhiki significa che &egrave; sicuramente una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; incredibili e pi&ugrave; belle della Grecia. E&#39; una lunghissima spiaggia sabbiosa con un parcheggio molto ampio, che si raggiunge tramite una strada sterrata. Puoi parcheggiare direttamente sulla spiaggia, in totale libert&agrave;, questo fatto rende la Grecia davvero unica, rispetto ad altri paesi, dove il regime di parcheggio &egrave; molto rigido. Naturalmente puoi anche lasciare il tuo camper sulla spiaggia, alcuni anche pernottare. &Egrave; una spiaggia per famiglie, ma non &egrave; adatta ai bambini molto piccoli, l&#39;acqua diventa profonda troppo velocemente. L&#39;intera spiaggia &egrave; molto grande, la spiaggia stessa &egrave; lunga pi&ugrave; di 1000 metri, larga 100 metri e l&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; leggermente aumentata. A causa dell&#39;aumento dell&#39;angolo di inclinazione, il punto di nuoto &egrave; gi&agrave; a 3 metri. Anche qui sono presenti alcune infrastrutture balneari. Qui troverete tutti i servizi essenziali, oltre a parchi giochi per bambini, alcuni campi sportivi, uno dei quali un campo da tennis, un campo da pallavolo e un campo da basket. Se ti piacciono tutte queste caratteristiche della spiaggia, troverai anche degli alloggi qui, alcuni campi e appartamenti sono disponibili sullo sfondo della spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; adatta ai cani, dove hanno molto spazio per correre. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda di utilizzare sempre il nostro filtro BeachRex per trovare la prossima spiaggia dei tuoi sogni.</div>\n', 3439, 'it', 1),
(2231, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cette belle plage de sable, appel&eacute;e Paralia Sikia, est situ&eacute;e sur la p&eacute;ninsule Sithonia dans la r&eacute;gion Kentriki Makedonija. Faire partie de la p&eacute;ninsule de Khalkidhiki en fait certainement l&#39;une des plages les plus &eacute;tonnantes et les plus belles de Gr&egrave;ce. C&#39;est une tr&egrave;s longue plage de sable avec un tr&egrave;s grand parking, &agrave; laquelle on acc&egrave;de par un chemin de terre. Vous pouvez vous garer directement sur la plage, en toute libert&eacute;, ce fait rend la Gr&egrave;ce tr&egrave;s unique, par rapport &agrave; d&#39;autres pays, o&ugrave; le r&eacute;gime de stationnement est tr&egrave;s strict. Bien s&ucirc;r, vous pouvez &eacute;galement laisser votre camping-car sur la plage, certains passent m&ecirc;me la nuit. C&#39;est une plage familiale, mais elle ne convient pas aux tout petits, l&#39;eau s&#39;enfonce trop vite. Toute la plage est tr&egrave;s grande, la plage elle-m&ecirc;me mesure plus de 1000 m&egrave;tres de long, 100 m&egrave;tres de large et l&#39;inclinaison de la plage est l&eacute;g&egrave;rement augment&eacute;e. En raison de l&#39;augmentation de l&#39;angle de la pente, le point de nage est d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 3 m&egrave;tres. Certaines infrastructures de plage sont &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sentes ici. Vous y trouverez toutes les commodit&eacute;s essentielles, ainsi que des aires de jeux pour enfants, des terrains de sport dont un terrain de tennis, un terrain de volley et un terrain de basket. Si vous aimez toutes ces caract&eacute;ristiques de la plage, vous trouverez &eacute;galement des h&eacute;bergements ici, des camps et des appartements sont disponibles en arri&egrave;re-plan de la plage. La plage est adapt&eacute;e aux chiens, o&ugrave; ils ont beaucoup d&#39;espace pour courir. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex et n&#39;oubliez pas de toujours utiliser notre filtre BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.</div>\n', 3439, 'fr', 1),
(2232, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Esta hermosa playa de arena, llamada Paralia Sikia, se encuentra en la pen&iacute;nsula de Sithonia, en la regi&oacute;n de Kentriki Makedonija. Ser parte de la pen&iacute;nsula de Khalkidhiki significa que es sin duda una de las playas m&aacute;s incre&iacute;bles y hermosas de Grecia. Es una playa de arena muy larga con un aparcamiento muy grande, a la que se llega por un camino de tierra. Puedes aparcar directamente en la playa, total libertad, este hecho hace que Grecia sea &uacute;nica, en comparaci&oacute;n con otros pa&iacute;ses, donde el r&eacute;gimen de estacionamiento es muy estricto. Por supuesto, tambi&eacute;n puede dejar su autocaravana en la playa, algunos incluso pasan la noche. Es una playa familiar, pero no es apta para ni&ntilde;os muy peque&ntilde;os, el agua se profundiza demasiado r&aacute;pido. Toda el &aacute;rea de la playa es muy grande, la playa en s&iacute; tiene m&aacute;s de 1000 metros de largo, 100 metros de ancho y la inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa aumenta ligeramente. Debido al aumento del &aacute;ngulo de la pendiente, el punto de nado ya est&aacute; a 3 metros. Algunas infraestructuras de playa tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n presentes aqu&iacute;. Aqu&iacute; encontrar&aacute; todas las comodidades esenciales, as&iacute; como parques infantiles, algunos campos deportivos, uno de ellos un campo de tenis, un campo de voleibol y un campo de baloncesto. Si te gustan todas estas caracter&iacute;sticas de la playa, tambi&eacute;n encontrar&aacute;s algunos alojamientos aqu&iacute;, algunos campamentos y apartamentos est&aacute;n disponibles en el fondo de la playa. La playa es apta para perros, donde tienen mucho espacio para correr. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex y recuerda usar siempre nuestro filtro BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os.</div>\n', 3439, 'es', 1),
(2233, 'Ta pe&scaron;čena plaža, ki se nahaja na zahodni strani polotoka Sithonia, vas bo presenetila s svojo neprimerljivo lepoto. To je zelo dolga in zelo romantična plaža, večinoma primerna za družine. Več kot 1000 metrov je dolžina plaže, na voljo pa imate 20 metrov &scaron;irine. Naklon plaže je povečan, tako da lahko pričakujete, da lahko že po približno 3 metrih začnete s plavanjem. Infrastruktura plaže je na visoki ravni. Po celotnem delu plaže so name&scaron;čene klopi in cestne luči, zaradi česar je sprehod ponoči &scaron;e bolj romantičen. Na plaži je na voljo celo nekaj trave in nekaj naravne sence, kar je kot nala&scaron;č, če želite svoje majhne otroke za&scaron;čititi pred žgočim soncem. Vozilo pa morate parkirati ob cesti, ki je poleg tega le nekaj metrov stran od plaže, tako da ne skrbite, da boste svoje stvari nosili daleč. Na plaži lahko igrate tudi ko&scaron;arko, za ta &scaron;port je na voljo &scaron;portno igri&scaron;če. Otroci se lahko igrajo na otro&scaron;kem igri&scaron;ču. Tukaj je prisoten tudi re&scaron;evalec, tako da ste vedno varovani, če se kaj zgodi v morju. Zelo dobra kuhinja je na voljo v &scaron;tevilnih različnih restavracijah, ki so na voljo na sami plaži ali v bližini. Namestitev je na voljo v &scaron;tevilnih različnih oblikah. Vzdolž celotne plaže imate na voljo veliko apartmajev in nekaj hotelov. Va&scaron; hi&scaron;ni ljubljenček, ki naredi hov hov, je tudi tukaj dobrodo&scaron;el, kot je to običajno v Grčiji. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom in ne pozabite vedno uporabiti na&scaron;ega naprednega filtra BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo naslednjo čudovito plažo.', 3441, 'sl', 1),
(2234, 'Ova pje&scaron;čana plaža, smje&scaron;tena na zapadnoj strani poluotoka Sitonije, iznenadit će vas svojom neusporedivom ljepotom. To je vrlo duga i vrlo romantična plaža, uglavnom pogodna za obitelji. Plaža je duga vi&scaron;e od 1000 metara i &scaron;iroka 20 metara. Nagib plaže je povećan, tako da možete očekivati ​​da možete početi plivati ​​nakon otprilike 3 metra. Infrastruktura plaže je na visokoj razini. Duž cijelog dijela plaže postavljene su klupe i gromobrani, &scaron;to noćnu &scaron;etnju čini jo&scaron; romantičnijom. Plaža ima čak i ne&scaron;to trave i malo prirodnog hlada, savr&scaron;eno ako želite za&scaron;tititi svoje mali&scaron;ane od pržećeg sunca. Ali svoje vozilo morate parkirati uz cestu, koja je također udaljena samo nekoliko metara od plaže, tako da ne morate brinuti hoćete li svoje stvari nositi daleko. Također možete igrati ko&scaron;arku na plaži, za ovaj sport je na raspolaganju sportski teren. Djeca se mogu igrati na dječjem igrali&scaron;tu. Ovdje je prisutan i spasilac, tako da ste uvijek za&scaron;tićeni ako se ne&scaron;to dogodi u moru. Vrlo dobra kuhinja dostupna je u mnogim različitim restoranima na samoj plaži ili u blizini. Smje&scaron;taj dolazi u mnogo različitih oblika. Duž cijele plaže imate mnogo apartmana i nekoliko hotela. Ovdje je dobrodo&scaron;ao i va&scaron; kućni ljubimac, koji pravi hov hov, kao &scaron;to je to uobičajeno u Grčkoj. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex i ne zaboravite uvijek koristiti na&scaron; napredni BeachRex filter kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju sljedeću sjajnu plažu.', 3441, 'hr', 1),
(2235, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ubicada en el lado oeste de la pen&iacute;nsula de Sithonia, esta playa de arena te sorprender&aacute; con su incomparable belleza. Es una playa muy larga y muy rom&aacute;ntica, en su mayor&iacute;a apta para familias. M&aacute;s de 1000 metros es la longitud de la playa, y tienes disponibles 20 metros de ancho. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa aumenta, por lo que puede esperar que ya pueda comenzar a nadar despu&eacute;s de unos 3 metros. La infraestructura de la playa es de alto nivel. Hay bancos a lo largo de todo el tramo de la playa y postes de luz, lo que hace que un paseo nocturno sea a&uacute;n m&aacute;s rom&aacute;ntico. Incluso hay algo de c&eacute;sped y algo de sombra natural disponible en la playa, lo cual es perfecto si desea proteger a sus ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os del calor del sol. Pero necesitas aparcar tu veh&iacute;culo a lo largo de la carretera, que tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; a pocos metros de la playa, as&iacute; que no te preocupes por llevar tus cosas mucho tiempo. Tambi&eacute;n puede jugar al baloncesto en la playa, hay un campo de deportes para este deporte disponible. Los ni&ntilde;os pueden jugar en el parque infantil. Un salvavidas tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; presente aqu&iacute;, por lo que siempre est&aacute; vigilado en caso de que algo suceda en el mar. Una muy buena cocina est&aacute; disponible en muchos restaurantes diferentes, que est&aacute;n disponibles en la misma playa o en las cercan&iacute;as. El alojamiento est&aacute; disponible en muchas formas diferentes. Tienes muchos apartamentos as&iacute; como algunos hoteles disponibles a lo largo de todo el tramo de la playa. Tu mascota, que hace c&oacute;mo, tambi&eacute;n es bienvenida aqu&iacute;, como es habitual en Grecia. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex y recuerda usar siempre nuestro filtro avanzado BeachRex para encontrar tu pr&oacute;xima playa incre&iacute;ble.</div>\n', 3441, 'es', 1),
(2236, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Situ&eacute;e sur le c&ocirc;t&eacute; ouest de la p&eacute;ninsule de Sithonie, cette plage de sable vous surprendra par sa beaut&eacute; incomparable. C&#39;est une plage tr&egrave;s longue et tr&egrave;s romantique, id&eacute;ale pour les familles. Plus de 1000 m&egrave;tres est la longueur de la plage, et vous disposez d&#39;une largeur de 20 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est augment&eacute;e, vous pouvez donc vous attendre &agrave; pouvoir commencer la baignade apr&egrave;s environ 3 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage est d&#39;un niveau &eacute;lev&eacute;. Des bancs sont dispos&eacute;s tout le long de la plage ainsi que des paratonnerres, ce qui rend la promenade nocturne encore plus romantique. Il y a m&ecirc;me de l&#39;herbe et de l&#39;ombre naturelle sur la plage, ce qui est parfait si vous souhaitez prot&eacute;ger vos petits enfants du soleil br&ucirc;lant. Mais vous devez garer votre v&eacute;hicule le long de la route, qui n&#39;est &eacute;galement qu&#39;&agrave; quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage, alors ne vous inqui&eacute;tez pas de transporter vos affaires sur une longue distance. Vous pouvez &eacute;galement jouer au basket sur la plage, il y a un terrain de sport pour ce sport disponible. Les enfants peuvent jouer sur l&#39;aire de jeux pour enfants. Un sauveteur est &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sent ici, vous &ecirc;tes donc toujours surveill&eacute; au cas o&ugrave; quelque chose se passerait dans la mer. Une tr&egrave;s bonne cuisine est disponible dans de nombreux restaurants diff&eacute;rents, qui sont disponibles soit sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, soit &agrave; proximit&eacute;. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est disponible sous de nombreuses formes diff&eacute;rentes. Vous avez beaucoup d&#39;appartements ainsi que quelques h&ocirc;tels disponibles tout le long de la plage. Votre animal de compagnie, ce qui fait qu&#39;il est aussi bien accueilli ici, comme il est d&#39;usage en Gr&egrave;ce. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex et n&#39;oubliez pas de toujours utiliser notre filtre avanc&eacute; BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage incroyable.</div>\n', 3441, 'fr', 1),
(2237, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Situata sul lato occidentale della penisola di Sithonia, questa spiaggia sabbiosa ti sorprender&agrave; con la sua incomparabile bellezza. &Egrave; una spiaggia molto lunga e molto romantica, adatta soprattutto alle famiglie. Pi&ugrave; di 1000 metri &egrave; la lunghezza della spiaggia e hai a disposizione 20 metri di larghezza. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; aumentata, quindi puoi aspettarti di poter iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; dopo circa 3 metri. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; di alto livello. Lungo tutto il tratto di spiaggia sono dislocate panchine cos&igrave; come i pali dei fulmini, il che rende ancora pi&ugrave; romantica una passeggiata notturna. C&#39;&egrave; anche dell&#39;erba e dell&#39;ombra naturale disponibili sulla spiaggia, il che &egrave; perfetto se vuoi proteggere i tuoi bambini dal sole cocente. Ma devi parcheggiare il tuo veicolo lungo la strada, che &egrave; anche a pochi metri dalla spiaggia, quindi non preoccuparti di portare le tue cose a lungo. Puoi anche giocare a basket sulla spiaggia, c&#39;&egrave; un campo sportivo per questo sport a disposizione. I bambini possono giocare nel parco giochi per bambini. Qui &egrave; presente anche un bagnino, quindi sei sempre sorvegliato nel caso succeda qualcosa in mare. Un&#39;ottima cucina &egrave; disponibile in molti ristoranti diversi, disponibili sia sulla spiaggia stessa, sia nelle vicinanze. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile in molte forme diverse. Hai molti appartamenti e alcuni hotel disponibili lungo tutto il tratto di spiaggia. Anche il tuo animale domestico, che fa hov hov, &egrave; il benvenuto qui, come al solito in Grecia. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda di utilizzare sempre il nostro filtro avanzato BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima fantastica spiaggia.</div>\n', 3441, 'it', 1),
(2238, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Расположенный на западной стороне полуострова Ситония, этот песчаный пляж удивит вас своей несравненной красотой. Это очень длинный и очень романтичный пляж, в основном подходящий для семейного отдыха. Длина пляжа составляет более 1000 метров, а у вас есть 20 метров ширины. Наклон пляжа увеличился, поэтому вы можете ожидать, что сможете начать плавание уже примерно через 3 метра. Инфраструктура пляжа находится на высоком уровне. На всем протяжении пляжа расположены скамейки, а также молниеотводы, что делает ночную прогулку еще более романтичной. На пляже есть даже немного травы и естественная тень, что идеально, если вы хотите защитить своих маленьких детей от жаркого солнца. Но вам нужно припарковать свой автомобиль вдоль дороги, которая также находится всего в нескольких метрах от пляжа, поэтому не беспокойтесь о том, чтобы нести свои вещи далеко. Вы также можете поиграть в баскетбол на пляже, для этого вида спорта имеется спортивная площадка. Дети могут играть на детской игровой площадке. Здесь также присутствует спасатель, так что вы всегда под охраной на случай, если что-то случится в море. Очень хорошая кухня доступна во многих различных ресторанах, которые доступны либо на самом пляже, либо поблизости. Размещение доступно во многих различных формах. У вас есть много квартир, а также несколько отелей на всем протяжении пляжа. Вашего питомца, который делает как-то, здесь тоже приветствуют, как это принято в Греции. Наслаждайтесь своим пляжем с BeachRex и не забывайте всегда использовать наш расширенный фильтр BeachRex, чтобы найти следующий удивительный пляж.</div>\n', 3441, 'ru', 1),
(2239, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Se su questa spiaggia non ci fosse il beach bar, questa sarebbe una spiaggia consigliata agli avventurieri, ma dato che ce n&#39;&egrave; uno lo consiglierei alle famiglie. Non vedresti nemmeno, quando guidi su strada, che c&#39;&egrave; una spiaggia lungo la strada. La posizione esatta della spiaggia &egrave; tra la penisola di Kassandra a ovest e la penisola di Sithonia a sud. Il parcheggio si trova a circa 15 metri sopra la spiaggia ed &egrave; abbastanza grande da ospitare anche camper. Il sentiero per la spiaggia &egrave; di 100 metri ed &egrave; necessario utilizzare alcune scale. La spiaggia stessa &egrave; un misto di sabbia e alcuni scogli, ma c&#39;&egrave; solo un&#39;infrastruttura balneare di base, ci&ograve; che dovrebbe essere sufficiente per renderti felice. La lunghezza totale &egrave; di 150 metri e la larghezza massima &egrave; di 20 metri. L&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; piuttosto piccola, normale. Puoi iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; a 3 metri, dopo essere entrato in acqua. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; qui solo di base, non aspettarti troppo. Puoi prendere delle bevande e del fast-food direttamente sulla spiaggia. L&#39;alloggio non &egrave; disponibile sulla spiaggia stessa, ma nelle vicinanze, dove sono disponibili alcuni appartamenti e hotel. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e ricorda di utilizzare sempre il nostro filtro avanzato BeachRex per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia.</div>\n', 3451, 'it', 1),
(2240, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Si sur cette plage il n&#39;y avait pas le bar de la plage, ce serait une plage recommand&eacute;e pour les aventuriers, mais comme il y en a une je la recommanderais aux familles. Vous ne verriez m&ecirc;me pas, en conduisant sur la route, qu&#39;il y a une plage au bord de la route. L&#39;emplacement exact de la plage se situe entre la p&eacute;ninsule de Kassandra &agrave; l&#39;ouest et la p&eacute;ninsule de Sithonie au sud. Le parking est &agrave; environ 15 m au-dessus de la plage et il est assez grand pour accueillir m&ecirc;me les camping-cars. Le chemin d&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; la plage est &agrave; 100 m&egrave;tres et vous devrez emprunter des escaliers. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me est un m&eacute;lange de sable et de rochers mais il n&#39;y a qu&#39;une infrastructure de plage de base, ce qui devrait suffire &agrave; vous rendre heureux. La longueur totale est de 150 m&egrave;tres et la largeur maximale est de 20 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;inclinaison de la plage est assez faible, normale. Vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 3 m&egrave;tres, apr&egrave;s &ecirc;tre entr&eacute; dans l&#39;eau. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage n&#39;est ici que basique, n&#39;en attendez pas trop. Vous pouvez prendre des boissons et des fast-foods directement sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est pas disponible sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, mais dans les environs, o&ugrave; vous avez des appartements et des h&ocirc;tels disponibles. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex et n&#39;oubliez pas de toujours utiliser notre filtre avanc&eacute; BeachRex pour trouver votre prochaine plage.</div>\n', 3451, 'fr', 1),
(2241, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Если бы на этом пляже не было пляжного бара, это был бы пляж, рекомендованный для искателей приключений, но, поскольку он есть, я бы порекомендовал его семьям. Вы даже не увидите, когда едете по дороге, что рядом с дорогой есть пляж. Точное расположение пляжа &mdash; между полуостровом Кассандра на западе и полуостровом Ситония на юге. Парковка находится примерно в 15 м над пляжем и достаточно велика, чтобы вместить даже автодома. Путь к пляжу составляет 100 метров, и вам нужно использовать лестницу. Сам пляж представляет собой смесь песка и некоторых камней, но есть только базовая пляжная инфраструктура, которой должно быть достаточно, чтобы вы были счастливы. Общая длина 150 метров, максимальная ширина 20 метров. Уклон пляжа совсем небольшой, нормальный. Начинать плавать можно уже с 3-х метров после входа в воду. Пляжная инфраструктура здесь только базовая, не ожидайте слишком многого. Вы можете заказать напитки и фаст-фуд прямо на пляже. Размещение доступно не на самом пляже, а в окрестностях, где у вас есть апартаменты и отели. Наслаждайтесь своим пляжем с BeachRex и не забывайте всегда использовать наш расширенный фильтр BeachRex, чтобы найти следующий пляж.</div>\n', 3451, 'ru', 1),
(2242, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Wenn es an diesem Strand keine Strandbar g&auml;be, w&auml;re dies ein Strand, der f&uuml;r Abenteurer empfohlen wird, aber da es einen gibt, w&uuml;rde ich ihn Familien empfehlen. Wenn Sie auf der Stra&szlig;e fahren, w&uuml;rden Sie nicht einmal sehen, dass sich neben der Stra&szlig;e ein Strand befindet. Die genaue Lage des Strandes liegt zwischen der Halbinsel Kassandra im Westen und der Halbinsel Sithonia im S&uuml;den. Der Parkplatz befindet sich etwa 15 m &uuml;ber dem Strand und ist gro&szlig; genug, um sogar Wohnmobile abzustellen. Der Weg zum Strand ist 100 Meter lang und Sie m&uuml;ssen einige Treppen benutzen. Der Strand selbst ist eine Mischung aus Sand und einigen Felsen, aber es gibt nur eine einfache Strandinfrastruktur, was ausreichen sollte, um Sie gl&uuml;cklich zu machen. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt 150 Meter, die maximale Breite 20 Meter. Strandneigung ist ziemlich klein, normal. Sie k&ouml;nnen bereits auf 3 Meter schwimmen, nachdem Sie ins Wasser gegangen sind. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist hier nur grundlegend, erwarten Sie nicht zu viel. Getr&auml;nke und Fast Food bekommt man direkt am Strand. Unterk&uuml;nfte gibt es nicht am Strand selbst, sondern in der N&auml;he, wo einige Apartments und Hotels zur Verf&uuml;gung stehen. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und denken Sie daran, immer unseren erweiterten BeachRex-Filter zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Strand zu finden.</div>\n', 3451, 'de', 1),
(2243, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Si en esta playa no estuviera el chiringuito, ser&iacute;a una playa recomendada para aventureros, pero como lo hay se la recomendar&iacute;a a las familias. Ni siquiera ver&iacute;a, al conducir por la carretera, que hay una playa al lado de la carretera. La ubicaci&oacute;n exacta de la playa es entre la pen&iacute;nsula Kassandra en el oeste y la pen&iacute;nsula Sithonia en el sur. El estacionamiento est&aacute; a unos 15 m sobre la playa y es lo suficientemente grande como para albergar incluso autocaravanas. El camino a la playa es de 100 metros y hay que usar unas escaleras. La playa en s&iacute; es una mezcla de arena y algunas rocas, pero solo hay una infraestructura b&aacute;sica de playa, lo que deber&iacute;a ser suficiente para hacerte feliz. La longitud total es de 150 metros y la anchura m&aacute;xima de 20 metros. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es bastante peque&ntilde;a, normal. Puedes empezar a nadar ya a los 3 metros, despu&eacute;s de entrar al agua. La infraestructura de la playa es aqu&iacute; solo b&aacute;sica, no esperes demasiado. Puedes conseguir algunas bebidas y algo de comida r&aacute;pida en la playa directamente. El alojamiento no est&aacute; disponible en la propia playa, sino en las inmediaciones, donde tienes disponibles algunos apartamentos y hoteles. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex y recuerda utilizar siempre nuestro filtro avanzado BeachRex para encontrar tu pr&oacute;xima playa.</div>\n', 3451, 'es', 1),
(2244, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Če na tej plaži ne bi bilo beach bara, bi bila to plaža priporočljiva za avanturiste, ker pa obstaja, bi jo priporočal družinam. Sploh ne bi opazili, ko bi se vozili po cesti, da je ob cesti plaža. Točna lokacija plaže je med polotokom Kasandra na zahodu in polotokom Sitonija na jugu. Parkiri&scaron;če je približno 15 m nad plažo in je dovolj veliko, da sprejme tudi avtodome. Pot do plaže je 100 metrov in morate uporabiti nekaj stopnic. Sama plaža je me&scaron;anica peska in nekaj skal, vendar je na plaži le osnovna infrastruktura, kar bi moralo biti dovolj, da ste zadovoljni. Skupna dolžina je 150 metrov, največja &scaron;irina pa 20 metrov. Naklon plaže je dokaj majhen, normalen. Plavati lahko začnete že na 3 metrih, po vstopu v vodo. Infrastruktura na plaži je tukaj le osnovna, ne pričakujte preveč. Neposredno na plaži lahko dobite pijačo in nekaj hitre hrane. Namestitev ni na voljo na sami plaži, ampak v bližini, kjer imate na voljo nekaj apartmajev in hotelov. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom in ne pozabite vedno uporabiti na&scaron;ega naprednega filtra BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo naslednjo plažo.</div>\n', 3451, 'sl', 1),
(2245, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Da na ovoj plaži ne postoji beach bar, ovo bi bila plaža za avanturiste, ali kako postoji, preporučio bih je obiteljima. Ne biste ni vidjeli, vozeći se po cesti, da je pokraj ceste plaža. Tačna lokacija plaže je između poluotoka Kasandra na zapadu i poluotoka Sithonia na jugu. Parking je oko 15 metara iznad plaže i dovoljno je velik da ugosti čak i kampere. Put do plaže je 100 metara i potrebno je koristiti nekoliko stepenica. Sama plaža je mje&scaron;avina pijeska i ne&scaron;to kamenja, ali postoji samo osnovna infrastruktura na plaži, &scaron;to bi trebalo biti dovoljno da budete zadovoljni. Ukupna dužina je 150 metara, a najveća &scaron;irina 20 metara. Nagib plaže je dosta mali, normalan. Možete početi plivati ​​već na 3 metra, nakon ulaska u vodu. Infrastruktura na plaži je ovdje samo osnovna, ne očekujte previ&scaron;e. Direktno na plaži možete dobiti piće i ne&scaron;to brze hrane. Smje&scaron;taj nije moguć na samoj plaži, već u blizini, gdje imate na raspolaganju nekoliko apartmana i hotela. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex i ne zaboravite uvijek koristiti na&scaron; napredni BeachRex filtar kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju sljedeću plažu.</div>\n', 3451, 'hr', 1),
(2246, 'Suchen Sie einen Sandstrand mit viel Strandinfrastruktur? Wenn ja, dann ist die Paralia Psakudia genau das Richtige f&uuml;r Sie. Es liegt auf der Halbinsel Chalkidiki, zwischen Kassandra und Sithonia, die zur Makedonia von Kentriki geh&ouml;rt. Der Parkplatz befindet sich direkt neben dem Strand und ist gro&szlig; genug, um auch Wohnmobile aufzunehmen. Familien werden diesen Strand lieben, denn der ganze Strand ist eher familienorientiert, ein Kinderspielplatz ist hier selbstverst&auml;ndlich, ebenso ein paar nat&uuml;rliche Schattenpl&auml;tze unter den B&auml;umen, und es gibt sogar einen kleinen Park mit viel Gras. Es ist ein sehr langer Strand, mehr als 1000 Meter, und er ist auch sehr breit, mehr als 30 Meter. Die Hangneigung ist normal und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bei 20 Metern. Am Strand befindet sich auch ein Pier, der aber zu kurz ist, sodass man nicht von dort ins Wasser springen kann. Auch ein Sportplatz ist hier und Sie k&ouml;nnen sogar einen Sonnenschirm und einen Liegestuhl mieten, wenn Sie m&ouml;chten. M&ouml;chten Sie am Strand Wassersport betreiben, kein Problem, Sie k&ouml;nnen Kajaks, Sup-Boards, Tretboote und &auml;hnliches mieten. Am Strand selbst gibt es eine Strandbar und einige Restaurants, einige befinden sich direkt auf der anderen Stra&szlig;enseite. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier auch l&auml;nger bleiben oder sogar einen Urlaub hier verbringen, da ein Resort, einige Hotels und Apartments in der N&auml;he verf&uuml;gbar sind. Also, worauf warten Sie noch, buchen Sie eine Unterkunft auf unserer Website, buchen Sie einen Flug oder nehmen Sie Ihr Auto und machen Sie sich auf den Weg zu Ihrem Traumstrand. Wir w&uuml;nschen Ihnen ein tolles Stranderlebnis und denken Sie daran, immer unseren erweiterten BeachRex-Filter zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.', 3450, 'de', 1),
(2247, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cerchi una spiaggia sabbiosa con molte infrastrutture balneari? Se &egrave; cos&igrave;, allora il paralia Psakudia &egrave; quello che fa per te. Si trova sulla penisola di Halkidiki, tra Kassandra e Sithonia, che appartiene alla Kentriki makedonia. Il parcheggio &egrave; proprio accanto alla spiaggia ed &egrave; abbastanza grande da accogliere anche i camper. Le famiglie adoreranno questa spiaggia, perch&eacute; l&#39;intera spiaggia &egrave; pi&ugrave; orientata alle famiglie, qui c&#39;&egrave; un parco giochi per bambini, cos&igrave; come alcune opzioni di ombra naturale sotto gli alberi, e c&#39;&egrave; anche un piccolo parco con molta erba. &Egrave; una spiaggia molto lunga, pi&ugrave; di 1000 metri, ed &egrave; anche molto ampia, pi&ugrave; di 30 metri. L&#39;inclinazione del pendio &egrave; normale e il punto di balneazione &egrave; a 20 metri. Sulla spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; anche un molo, ma &egrave; troppo corto, quindi non puoi saltare da esso in acqua. Qui c&#39;&egrave; anche un campo sportivo e se lo desideri puoi anche noleggiare un ombrellone e una sdraio. Ti piacerebbe fare qualche sport acquatico in spiaggia, nessun problema, puoi noleggiare kayak, sup, pedal&ograve; e simili. Sulla spiaggia stessa c&#39;&egrave; un bar sulla spiaggia e alcuni ristoranti, alcuni sono disponibili proprio dall&#39;altra parte della strada. Puoi anche rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo o persino trascorrere una vacanza qui perch&eacute; un resort, alcuni hotel e appartamenti sono disponibili nelle vicinanze. Allora cosa aspetti, prenota un alloggio sul nostro sito, prenota un volo o prendi la tua auto e parti verso la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni. Ti auguriamo una fantastica esperienza in spiaggia e ricorda, usa sempre il nostro filtro avanzato BeachRex, per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.</div>\n', 3450, 'it', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(2248, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vous recherchez une plage de sable avec beaucoup d&#39;infrastructures de plage ? Si oui, alors le paralia Psakudia est fait pour vous. Il est situ&eacute; sur la p&eacute;ninsule de Halkidiki, entre Kassandra et Sithonia, qui appartient &agrave; la makedonia Kentriki. Le parking est juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage et il est assez grand pour accueillir aussi les camping-cars. Les familles vont adorer cette plage, car toute la plage est plus familiale, une aire de jeux pour enfants est bien s&ucirc;r ici, ainsi que quelques options d&#39;ombre naturelle sous les arbres, et il y a m&ecirc;me un petit parc avec beaucoup d&#39;herbe. C&#39;est une tr&egrave;s longue plage, plus de 1000 m&egrave;tres, et elle est aussi tr&egrave;s large, plus de 30 m&egrave;tres. L&#39;inclinaison de la pente est normale et le point de nage est &agrave; 20 m&egrave;tres. Une jet&eacute;e se trouve &eacute;galement sur la plage, mais elle est trop courte, vous ne pouvez donc pas sauter dans l&#39;eau. Un terrain de sport s&#39;y trouve &eacute;galement et vous pourrez m&ecirc;me louer un parasol et un transat si vous le souhaitez. Souhaitez-vous pratiquer des sports nautiques sur la plage, pas de probl&egrave;me, vous pouvez louer des kayaks, des sup boards, des p&eacute;dalos et autres. Sur la plage elle-m&ecirc;me, il y a un bar de plage et quelques restaurants, certains sont disponibles juste de l&#39;autre c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la rue. Vous pouvez &eacute;galement y rester plus longtemps, voire y passer des vacances car une station baln&eacute;aire, des h&ocirc;tels et des appartements sont disponibles dans les environs. Alors qu&#39;attendez-vous, r&eacute;servez un h&eacute;bergement sur notre site, r&eacute;servez un vol ou prenez votre voiture et dirigez-vous vers la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves. Nous vous souhaitons une exp&eacute;rience de plage incroyable, et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours notre filtre avanc&eacute; BeachRex, pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.</div>\n', 3450, 'fr', 1),
(2249, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&iquest;Busca una playa de arena con mucha infraestructura de playa? Si es as&iacute;, la paralia Psakudia es para ti. Est&aacute; ubicado en la pen&iacute;nsula de Halkidiki, entre Kassandra y Sithonia, que pertenece a Kentriki makedonia. El aparcamiento est&aacute; justo al lado de la playa y es lo suficientemente grande como para recibir tambi&eacute;n autocaravanas. A las familias les encantar&aacute; esta playa, porque toda la playa est&aacute; m&aacute;s orientada a la familia, aqu&iacute; hay un parque infantil, por supuesto, as&iacute; como algunas opciones de sombra natural debajo de los &aacute;rboles, e incluso hay un peque&ntilde;o parque con mucho c&eacute;sped. Es una playa muy larga, m&aacute;s de 1000 metros, y tambi&eacute;n muy ancha, m&aacute;s de 30 metros. La inclinaci&oacute;n de la pendiente es normal y el punto de nado est&aacute; a 20 metros. Tambi&eacute;n hay un muelle en la playa, pero es demasiado corto, por lo que no puedes saltar al agua. Aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n hay un campo de deportes e incluso puedes alquilar una sombrilla y una tumbona si lo deseas. &iquest;Le gustar&iacute;a practicar alg&uacute;n deporte acu&aacute;tico en la playa? No hay problema, puede alquilar kayak, tablas de surf, botes de remo y similares. En la misma playa hay un chiringuito y algunos restaurantes, algunos est&aacute;n disponibles al otro lado de la calle. Tambi&eacute;n puede quedarse aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo, o incluso pasar unas vacaciones aqu&iacute; porque hay un resort, algunos hoteles y apartamentos disponibles en los alrededores. Entonces, &iquest;qu&eacute; est&aacute;s esperando? Reserva un alojamiento en nuestro sitio web, reserva un vuelo o coge tu coche y pon rumbo a la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os. Le deseamos una incre&iacute;ble experiencia en la playa y recuerde, use siempre nuestro filtro avanzado BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os.</div>\n', 3450, 'es', 1),
(2250, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ищете песчаный пляж с развитой пляжной инфраструктурой? Если да, то паралия Псакудия для вас. Он расположен на полуострове Халкидики, между Кассандрой и Ситонией, которая принадлежит Македонии Кентрики. Парковка находится рядом с пляжем, и она достаточно большая, чтобы вместить также автодома. Семьям понравится этот пляж, потому что весь пляж больше ориентирован на семью, здесь есть детская игровая площадка, а также несколько вариантов естественной тени под деревьями, и есть даже небольшой парк с большим количеством травы. Это очень длинный пляж, более 1000 метров, и очень широкий, более 30 метров. Наклон склона нормальный, точка заплыва находится на высоте 20 метров. На пляже тоже есть пирс, но он слишком короткий, чтобы с него не прыгнуть в воду. Здесь также есть спортивная площадка, и вы даже можете арендовать зонтик и шезлонг, если хотите. Если вы хотите заняться водными видами спорта на пляже, нет проблем, вы можете арендовать каяк, доски для сапинга, катамараны и тому подобное. На самом пляже есть пляжный бар и несколько ресторанов, некоторые из которых расположены прямо через дорогу. Вы также можете остаться здесь подольше или даже провести здесь отпуск, потому что поблизости есть курорт, несколько отелей и апартаментов. Так чего же вы ждете, забронируйте жилье на нашем сайте, забронируйте рейс или возьмите машину и отправляйтесь к пляжу своей мечты. Мы желаем вам незабываемых впечатлений от пляжа и помните, всегда используйте наш расширенный фильтр BeachRex, чтобы найти следующий пляж своей мечты.</div>\n', 3450, 'ru', 1),
(2251, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">I&scaron;čete pe&scaron;čeno plažo z veliko plažne infrastrukture? Če je tako, potem je paralia Psakudia prava za vas. Nahaja se na polotoku Halkidiki, med Kasandro in Sitonijo, ki pripada Kentri&scaron;ki makedoniji. Parkiri&scaron;če je tik ob plaži in je dovolj veliko, da sprejme tudi avtodome. Družinam bo v&scaron;eč ta plaža, saj je celotna plaža bolj družinsko naravnana, tu je seveda otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če, pa tudi nekaj naravnih senčnih možnosti pod drevesi, na voljo pa je celo majhen park z veliko trave. Plaža je zelo dolga, več kot 1000 metrov, pa tudi zelo &scaron;iroka, več kot 30 metrov. Naklon pobočja je normalen, točka plavanja pa je na 20 metrih. Na plaži je tudi pomol, vendar je prekratek, tako da z njega ne morete skočiti v vodo. Tu je tudi &scaron;portno igri&scaron;če, po želji pa lahko najamete tudi senčnik in ležalnik. Če bi radi imeli vodne &scaron;porte na plaži, ni problema, lahko si izposodite kajak, sup desko, veslanje in podobno. Na sami plaži je beach bar in nekaj restavracij, nekatere pa so na voljo čez cesto. Tu lahko ostanete tudi dlje ali celo preživite počitnice, saj so v bližini na voljo letovi&scaron;ča, nekateri hoteli in apartmaji. Torej, kaj &scaron;e čakate, rezervirajte namestitev na na&scaron;i spletni strani, rezervirajte let ali pa vzemite svoj avto in se odpravite proti va&scaron;i sanjski plaži. Želimo vam čudovito izku&scaron;njo na plaži in ne pozabite, vedno uporabite na&scaron; napredni filter BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo naslednjo sanjsko plažo.</div>\n', 3450, 'sl', 1),
(2252, 'Tražite li pje&scaron;čanu plažu s puno plažne infrastrukture? Ako je tako, onda je paralia Psakudia prava stvar za vas. Nalazi se na poluotoku Halkidiki, između Kasandre i Sitonije, koji pripada Kentriki Makedoniji. Parkirali&scaron;te je odmah uz plažu i dovoljno je veliko za dobrodo&scaron;licu i kamperima. Obitelji će obožavati ovu plažu, jer je cijela plaža vi&scaron;e orijentirana na obitelj, ovdje je naravno dječje igrali&scaron;te, kao i nekoliko prirodnih opcija u sjeni ispod drveća, a postoji čak i mali park s puno trave. To je vrlo duga plaža, vi&scaron;e od 1000 metara, a također je vrlo &scaron;iroka, vi&scaron;e od 30 metara. Nagib padine je normalan, a točka plivanja je na 20 metara. Na plaži je i mol, ali je prekratak pa se s njega ne može skočiti u vodu. Tu je i sportski teren, a po želji možete iznajmiti i suncobran i ležaljku. Želite li se baviti vodenim sportom na plaži, nema problema, možete iznajmiti kajak, sup dasku, veslanje i slično. Na samoj plaži nalazi se beach bar i nekoliko restorana, neki su dostupni preko puta. Ovdje možete ostati i duže, pa čak i provesti odmor jer se u blizini nalazi ljetovali&scaron;te, neki hoteli i apartmani. Dakle, &scaron;to čekate, rezervirajte smje&scaron;taj na na&scaron;oj web stranici, rezervirajte let ili uzmite automobil i krenite prema plaži iz snova. Želimo vam nevjerojatno iskustvo na plaži i zapamtite, uvijek koristite na&scaron; BeachRex napredni filtar kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju sljedeću plažu iz snova.', 3450, 'hr', 1),
(2253, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na prekrasnu obiteljsku grčku plažu paralia Gerakinis. Ako ste ljubitelj pje&scaron;čanih plaža, a imate malu djecu koja se vole igrati u pijesku, ovu plažu stavite na svoj TO DO popis. Pripada regiji Kentriki Makedonija. Pristup ovoj plaži je vrlo jednostavan, svoje vozilo možete parkirati na javnom parkingu, udaljenom samo nekoliko metara od plaže, dobrodo&scaron;li su i kamperi. Karakteristike plaže su sljedeće: ukupna dužina je 750 metara, maksimalna &scaron;irina je 40 metara, nagib plaže je normalan, a točka za kupanje je već na 5 metara. Uzmite u obzir smisao plivanja kada imate malu djecu, ona bi se trebala igrati u blizini vode samo s odraslima. Mno&scaron;tvo hotela, apartmana, soba, restorana, sportskih terena i druge plažne infrastrukture je ono &scaron;to možete očekivati ​​ovdje. Tijekom ljetne sezone možete iznajmiti suncobrane i ležaljke. A ako ste ljubitelj ko&scaron;arke, čak možete igrati utakmicu na ko&scaron;arka&scaron;kom igrali&scaron;tu direktno na plaži. Smje&scaron;taj na ovoj plaži zaista nije problem, dostupni su mnogi hoteli, čak i hotel s 5 zvjezdica s prekrasnim privatnim bazenima. Ako vi&scaron;e volite stan, i ovdje ćete ih pronaći mnogo. Jednom kada vam je dosta plaže, a poželjeli biste vidjeti ili pro&scaron;etati između maslina, možete i to, cijelo dvori&scaron;te plaže prekriveno je njima. Ako imate takvu turističku plažu, možete biti sigurni da ćete imati mnogo barova i restorana na plaži da utažite svoju glad. Stoga, ne gubite vrijeme, rezervirajte smje&scaron;taj na na&scaron;oj web stranici, potražite let ili dođite svojim automobilom i krenite prema plaži iz snova. Želimo vam nezaboravno iskustvo na plaži i zapamtite, kada razmi&scaron;ljate o plažama, sjetite se nas i uvijek koristite na&scaron; napredni filter BeachRex kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju sljedeću plažu iz snova.</div>\n', 3453, 'hr', 1),
(2254, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na čudoviti družinski gr&scaron;ki plaži paralia Gerakinis. Če ste navdu&scaron;enec nad pe&scaron;čenimi plažami in imate majhne otroke, ki se radi igrajo v mivki, morate to plažo uvrstiti na svoj seznam TO DO. Spada v regijo Kentriki makedonija. Dostop do te plaže je zelo enostaven, svoje vozilo lahko parkirate na javnem parkiri&scaron;ču, le nekaj metrov stran od plaže, dobrodo&scaron;li so tudi avtodomi. Značilnosti plaže so naslednje: skupna dolžina je 750 metrov, maksimalna &scaron;irina je 40 metrov, naklon plaže je normalen in točka plavanja je že na 5 metrih. Upo&scaron;tevajte smisel plavanja, ko imate majhne otroke, ob vodi naj se igrajo le z odraslimi. Veliko hotelov, apartmajev, sob, restavracij, &scaron;portnih igri&scaron;č in druge plažne infrastrukture je tisto, kar lahko pričakujete tukaj. V poletni sezoni lahko najamete nekaj senčnikov in ležalnikov. In če ste ljubitelj ko&scaron;arke, lahko celo igrate tekmo na ko&scaron;arkarskem igri&scaron;ču neposredno na plaži. Namestitev na tej plaži res ni problem, na voljo je veliko hotelov, tudi hotel s 5 zvezdicami z lepimi zasebnimi bazeni. Če imate raje stanovanje, jih boste na&scaron;li tudi tukaj. Ko imate dovolj plaže in bi radi videli ali se sprehodili med nekaj oljkami, lahko tudi to storite, celotno dvori&scaron;če plaže je prekrito z njimi. Če imate tako turistično plažo, ste lahko prepričani, da boste imeli na voljo veliko barov in restavracij na plaži, da pote&scaron;ite svojo lakoto. Zato ne izgubljajte časa, rezervirajte nastanitev kar na na&scaron;i spletni strani, poi&scaron;čite let ali pridite z avtom in se odpravite proti va&scaron;i sanjski plaži. Želimo vam nepozabno izku&scaron;njo na plaži in ne pozabite, ko razmi&scaron;ljate o plažah, pomislite na nas in vedno uporabite na&scaron; napredni filter BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo naslednjo sanjsko plažo.</div>\n', 3453, 'sl', 1),
(2255, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Willkommen am wundersch&ouml;nen griechischen Familienstrand Paralia Gerakinis. Wenn Sie ein Liebhaber von Sandstr&auml;nden sind und kleine Kinder haben, die gerne im Sand spielen, sollten Sie diesen Strand auf Ihre TO DO-Liste setzen. Es geh&ouml;rt zur Region Kentriki Makedonia. Der Zugang zu diesem Strand ist sehr einfach, Sie k&ouml;nnen Ihr Fahrzeug auf einem &ouml;ffentlichen Parkplatz parken, nur wenige Meter vom Strand entfernt, Wohnmobile sind ebenfalls willkommen. Die Strandeigenschaften sind wie folgt: Die Gesamtl&auml;nge betr&auml;gt 750 Meter, die maximale Breite 40 Meter, die Strandneigung ist normal und der Schwimmpunkt liegt bereits bei 5 Metern. Ber&uuml;cksichtigen Sie das Schwimmen, wenn Sie kleine Kinder haben, sie sollten nur mit Erwachsenen in der N&auml;he des Wassers spielen. Viele Hotels, Apartments, Zimmer, Restaurants, Sportpl&auml;tze und andere Strandinfrastruktur erwarten Sie hier. W&auml;hrend der Sommersaison k&ouml;nnen Sie einige Sonnenschirme und Liegest&uuml;hle mieten. Und wenn Sie ein Basketball-Fan sind, k&ouml;nnen Sie sogar ein Match auf dem Basketballfeld direkt am Strand spielen. Die Unterkunft ist an diesem Strand wirklich kein Problem, es stehen viele Hotels zur Verf&uuml;gung, sogar ein 5-Sterne-Hotel mit sch&ouml;nen privaten Swimmingpools. Wenn Sie eine Wohnung bevorzugen, finden Sie auch hier viele. Wenn Sie genug vom Strand haben und einige Olivenb&auml;ume sehen oder zwischen ihnen spazieren gehen m&ouml;chten, k&ouml;nnen Sie sogar das tun, der ganze Hinterhof des Strandes ist mit ihnen bedeckt. Wenn Sie einen so touristischen Strand haben, k&ouml;nnen Sie sicher sein, dass Ihnen viele Strandbars und Restaurants zur Verf&uuml;gung stehen, um Ihren Hunger zu stillen. Verlieren Sie also keine Zeit, buchen Sie direkt auf unserer Website eine Unterkunft, suchen Sie einen Flug oder kommen Sie mit Ihrem Mietwagen und machen Sie sich auf den Weg zu Ihrem Traumstrand. Wir w&uuml;nschen Ihnen ein unvergessliches Stranderlebnis und denken Sie daran, wenn Sie an Str&auml;nde denken, denken Sie an uns und verwenden Sie immer unseren BeachRex-Erweitertfilter, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.</div>\n', 3453, 'de', 1),
(2256, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenue &agrave; la belle plage familiale grecque paralia Gerakinis. Si vous &ecirc;tes un passionn&eacute; de plage de sable et que vous avez de jeunes enfants qui aiment jouer dans le sable, vous devriez mettre cette plage sur votre liste de choses &agrave; faire. Il appartient &agrave; la r&eacute;gion de Kentriki makedonia. L&#39;acc&egrave;s &agrave; cette plage est tr&egrave;s facile, vous pouvez garer votre v&eacute;hicule sur un parking public, &agrave; seulement quelques m&egrave;tres de la plage, les camping-cars sont &eacute;galement les bienvenus. Les caract&eacute;ristiques de la plage sont les suivantes : la longueur totale est de 750 m&egrave;tres, la largeur maximale est de 40 m&egrave;tres, l&#39;inclinaison de la plage est normale et le point de baignade est d&eacute;j&agrave; &agrave; 5 m&egrave;tres. Tenez compte du point de nage lorsque vous avez de jeunes enfants, ils ne doivent jouer pr&egrave;s de l&#39;eau qu&#39;avec des adultes. Vous pouvez vous attendre ici &agrave; de nombreux h&ocirc;tels, appartements, chambres, restaurants, terrains de sport et autres infrastructures de plage. Pendant la saison estivale, vous pouvez louer des parasols et des transats. Et si vous &ecirc;tes fan de basket, vous pourrez m&ecirc;me disputer un match sur le terrain de basket directement sur la plage. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement n&#39;est vraiment pas un probl&egrave;me sur cette plage, de nombreux h&ocirc;tels sont disponibles, m&ecirc;me un h&ocirc;tel 5 &eacute;toiles avec de belles piscines priv&eacute;es. Si vous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rez un appartement, vous en trouverez &eacute;galement beaucoup ici. Une fois que vous en avez assez de la plage et que vous aimeriez voir ou vous promener entre des oliviers, vous pouvez m&ecirc;me le faire, tout le jardin de la plage en est couvert. Si vous avez une plage aussi touristique, vous pouvez &ecirc;tre s&ucirc;r que vous aurez de nombreux bars et restaurants de plage disponibles pour satisfaire votre faim. Alors, ne perdez pas de temps, r&eacute;servez un h&eacute;bergement directement sur notre site, recherchez un vol ou venez avec votre voiture et dirigez-vous vers la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves. Nous vous souhaitons une exp&eacute;rience de plage inoubliable, et rappelez-vous, lorsque vous pensez aux plages, pensez &agrave; nous et utilisez toujours notre filtre avanc&eacute; BeachRex, pour trouver la prochaine plage de vos r&ecirc;ves.</div>\n', 3453, 'fr', 1),
(2257, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenido a la hermosa familia griega playa paralia Gerakinis. Si eres un entusiasta de la playa de arena y tienes ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os a los que les gusta jugar en la arena, debes poner esta playa en tu lista de TAREAS PARA HACER. Pertenece a la regi&oacute;n de Kentriki makedonia. El acceso a esta playa es muy f&aacute;cil, puedes aparcar tu veh&iacute;culo en un parking p&uacute;blico, a pocos metros de la playa, tambi&eacute;n son bienvenidas las autocaravanas. Las caracter&iacute;sticas de la playa son las siguientes: la longitud total es de 750 metros, la anchura m&aacute;xima es de 40 metros, la inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es normal y el punto de nado ya est&aacute; a 5 metros. Ten en cuenta el punto de nadar cuando tengas ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os, deben jugar cerca del agua solo con adultos. Una gran cantidad de hoteles, apartamentos, habitaciones, restaurantes, campos deportivos y otras infraestructuras de playa es lo que puede esperar aqu&iacute;. Durante la temporada de verano se pueden alquilar algunas sombrillas y tumbonas. Y si eres fan&aacute;tico del baloncesto, incluso puedes jugar un partido en el campo de baloncesto directamente en la playa. El alojamiento realmente no es un problema en esta playa, hay muchos hoteles disponibles, incluso un hotel de 5 estrellas con hermosas piscinas privadas. Si prefieres un apartamento, aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n encontrar&aacute;s muchos. Una vez que tenga suficiente de la playa, y le gustar&iacute;a ver o caminar entre algunos olivos, incluso puede hacerlo, todo el patio trasero de la playa est&aacute; cubierto de ellos. Si tienes una playa tan tur&iacute;stica, puedes estar seguro de que tendr&aacute;s muchos chiringuitos y restaurantes disponibles para saciar tu hambre. As&iacute; que no pierdas tiempo, reserva alojamiento directamente en nuestra web, busca un vuelo o ven con tu coche y pon rumbo a la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os. Le deseamos una experiencia inolvidable en la playa, y recuerde, cuando piense en playas, piense en nosotros y use siempre nuestro filtro avanzado BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os.</div>\n', 3453, 'es', 1),
(2258, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Benvenuti nella bellissima spiaggia di famiglia greca paralia Gerakinis. Se sei un appassionato di spiagge sabbiose e hai bambini piccoli a cui piace giocare nella sabbia, dovresti inserire questa spiaggia nella tua lista delle cose da fare. Appartiene alla regione di Kentriki Makedonia. L&#39;accesso a questa spiaggia &egrave; molto facile, &egrave; possibile parcheggiare il proprio veicolo in un parcheggio pubblico, a pochi metri dalla spiaggia, i camper sono i benvenuti. Le caratteristiche della spiaggia sono le seguenti: la lunghezza totale &egrave; di 750 metri, la larghezza massima &egrave; di 40 metri, l&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; normale e il punto di balneazione &egrave; gi&agrave; a 5 metri. Tieni in considerazione il punto di nuoto quando hai bambini piccoli, dovrebbero giocare vicino all&#39;acqua solo con gli adulti. Molti hotel, appartamenti, camere, ristoranti, campi sportivi e altre infrastrutture balneari sono ci&ograve; che puoi aspettarti qui. Durante la stagione estiva &egrave; possibile noleggiare ombrelloni e sdraio. E se sei un appassionato di basket, puoi anche giocare una partita sul campo da basket direttamente sulla spiaggia. L&#39;alloggio non &egrave; davvero un problema su questa spiaggia, sono disponibili molti hotel, anche un hotel a 5 stelle con bellissime piscine private. Se preferisci un appartamento, qui ne troverai molti anche. Una volta che ne hai abbastanza della spiaggia e vorresti vedere o passeggiare tra alcuni ulivi, puoi anche farlo, l&#39;intero cortile della spiaggia ne &egrave; coperto. Se hai una spiaggia cos&igrave; turistica, puoi star certo che avrai molti bar e ristoranti sulla spiaggia a disposizione per soddisfare la tua fame. Quindi, non perdere tempo, prenota un alloggio direttamente sul nostro sito, cerca un volo o vieni con la tua auto e dirigiti verso la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni. Ti auguriamo un&#39;esperienza indimenticabile sulla spiaggia e ricorda, quando pensi alle spiagge, pensa a noi e usa sempre il nostro filtro avanzato BeachRex, per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.</div>\n', 3453, 'it', 1),
(2259, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на прекрасный семейный греческий пляж Паралия Геракинис. Если вы любитель песчаных пляжей, и у вас есть маленькие дети, которые любят играть в песке, вы должны внести этот пляж в свой список дел. Он принадлежит к региону Кентрики Македония. Доступ к этому пляжу очень прост, вы можете припарковать свой автомобиль на общественной парковке, всего в нескольких метрах от пляжа, также приветствуются автодома. Характеристики пляжа следующие: общая длина 750 м, максимальная ширина 40 м, уклон пляжа нормальный, точка заплыва уже на 5 м. Учитывайте особенности плавания, когда у вас есть маленькие дети, они должны играть у воды только со взрослыми. Множество отелей, апартаментов, номеров, ресторанов, спортивных площадок и прочей пляжной инфраструктуры &ndash; вот что вас ждет. В летний сезон вы можете арендовать зонтики и шезлонги. А если вы любитель баскетбола, то можете даже сыграть матч на баскетбольном поле прямо на пляже. Размещение на этом пляже действительно не проблема, доступно множество отелей, даже 5-звездочный отель с красивыми частными бассейнами. Если вы предпочитаете квартиру, вы также найдете много здесь. Как только вам надоест пляж, и вы захотите увидеть или прогуляться между оливковыми деревьями, вы даже можете это сделать, весь задний двор пляжа покрыт ими. Если у вас есть такой туристический пляж, вы можете быть уверены, что у вас будет много пляжных баров и ресторанов, чтобы утолить голод. Так что не теряйте времени, бронируйте жилье прямо на нашем сайте, ищите рейс или приезжайте на машине и направляйтесь к пляжу своей мечты. Мы желаем вам незабываемых пляжных впечатлений, и помните, когда вы думаете о пляжах, думайте о нас и всегда используйте наш расширенный фильтр BeachRex, чтобы найти следующий пляж своей мечты.</div>\n', 3453, 'ru', 1),
(2260, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Добро пожаловать на особенный пляж Паралия Куйони. Если бы мы сказали вам, что этот пляж является частью полуострова Халкидики, вы бы уже поняли, если вы инсайдер, что речь идет о прекрасном пляже, как и пляжи региона Халкидики, безусловно. Этот пляж лучше всего подходит для семей с детьми, тем более, что на заднем плане пляжа находится парк с детской площадкой и баскетбольным полем, и оба они окружены деревьями, чтобы дать вам некоторую защиту от солнца. Парк находится в полной тени и имеет много травы. В парке также есть ресторан и пляжный бар, а по соседству несколько апартаментов и гостиница, а чуть поодаль есть даже палаточный лагерь. Как только вы приедете сюда на своем автомобиле, вы можете оставить его на улице. До пляжа всего 100 метров ходьбы. Общая длина пляжа 300 м, ширина 15 м, он имеет нормальный уклон и купаться можно уже после 20-метрового входа в воду, а в некоторых случаях и больше. Заход в воду удобный, иногда можно сразу купаться, а в некоторых местах нужно пройти 20 метров, прежде чем начать плавать. Здесь есть все необходимые пляжные удобства. Так чего же вы ждете, забронируйте жилье на нашем сайте, забронируйте рейс или возьмите машину и отправляйтесь к пляжу своей мечты. Мы желаем вам незабываемых впечатлений от пляжа и помните, всегда используйте наш расширенный фильтр BeachRex, чтобы найти следующий пляж своей мечты.</div>\n', 3452, 'ru', 1),
(2261, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Benvenuti nella spiaggia molto speciale, la paralia Kouyoni. Se ti dicessimo che questa spiaggia fa parte della penisola Calcidica, puoi gi&agrave; capire, se sei un insider, che stiamo parlando di una bellissima spiaggia, come lo sono sicuramente le spiagge della regione Calcidica. Questa spiaggia &egrave; la migliore per le famiglie con bambini, soprattutto perch&eacute; sullo sfondo della spiaggia c&#39;&egrave; un parco con giochi per bambini e un campo da basket, e sono entrambi circondati da alberi, per proteggerti dal sole. Il parco &egrave; in piena ombra e ha molta erba. Nel parco c&#39;&egrave; anche un ristorante e un bar sulla spiaggia, e alcuni appartamenti e un hotel si trovano nelle vicinanze, e un po&#39; lontano c&#39;&egrave; anche un campeggio. Una volta arrivato qui con il tuo veicolo, puoi lasciarlo accanto alla strada. Ci vogliono solo 100 metri a piedi per raggiungere la spiaggia. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 300 metri, &egrave; larga 15 metri, ha un&#39;inclinazione normale e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare dopo soli 20 metri di entrata in acqua, in alcuni casi anche di pi&ugrave;. L&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; comodo e a volte si pu&ograve; nuotare subito e in alcuni punti &egrave; necessario camminare per 20 metri prima di poter iniziare a nuotare. Tutti i servizi essenziali per la spiaggia sono presenti qui. Allora cosa aspetti, prenota un alloggio sul nostro sito, prenota un volo o prendi la tua auto e parti verso la spiaggia dei tuoi sogni. Ti auguriamo una fantastica esperienza in spiaggia e ricorda, usa sempre il nostro filtro avanzato BeachRex, per trovare la tua prossima spiaggia da sogno.</div>\n', 3452, 'it', 1),
(2262, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenido a la playa muy especial, la paralia Kouyoni. Si te dijimos que esta playa es parte de la pen&iacute;nsula de Chalkidiki, ya puedes darte cuenta, si eres un conocedor, de que estamos hablando de una playa hermosa, como ciertamente lo son las playas de la regi&oacute;n de Chalkidiki. Esta playa es la mejor para familias con ni&ntilde;os, sobre todo porque al fondo de la playa hay un parque con juegos infantiles y una cancha de baloncesto, y ambos est&aacute;n rodeados de &aacute;rboles, para protegerte del sol. El parque est&aacute; en plena sombra y tiene mucho c&eacute;sped. En el parque tambi&eacute;n hay un restaurante y un chiringuito, y en las inmediaciones hay unos apartamentos y un hotel, y un poco m&aacute;s lejos hay incluso un camping. Una vez que venga aqu&iacute; con su veh&iacute;culo, puede dejarlo al lado de la calle. Solo se necesitan 100 metros de caminata para llegar a la playa. La longitud total de la playa es de 300 metros, tiene 15 metros de ancho, tiene una inclinaci&oacute;n normal y se puede empezar a nadar a los 20 metros de entrar al agua, en algunos casos incluso m&aacute;s. La entrada al agua es c&oacute;moda ya veces puedes nadar enseguida y en algunos lugares necesitas caminar 20 metros antes de poder empezar a nadar. Todas las comodidades esenciales de la playa est&aacute;n presentes aqu&iacute;. Entonces, &iquest;qu&eacute; est&aacute;s esperando? Reserva un alojamiento en nuestro sitio web, reserva un vuelo o coge tu coche y pon rumbo a la playa de tus sue&ntilde;os. Le deseamos una incre&iacute;ble experiencia en la playa y recuerde, use siempre nuestro filtro avanzado BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de sus sue&ntilde;os.</div>\n', 3452, 'es', 1),
(2263, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bienvenue sur la plage tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;ciale, la paralia Kouyoni. Si nous vous avons dit que cette plage fait partie de la p&eacute;ninsule de Chalkidiki, vous pouvez d&eacute;j&agrave; comprendre, si vous &ecirc;tes un initi&eacute;, que nous parlons d&#39;une belle plage, comme le sont certainement les plages de la r&eacute;gion de Chalkidiki. Cette plage est id&eacute;ale pour les familles avec enfants, notamment parce qu&#39;&agrave; l&#39;arri&egrave;re-plan de la plage, il y a un parc avec une aire de jeux pour enfants et un terrain de basket-ball, et ils sont tous deux entour&eacute;s d&#39;arbres, pour vous prot&eacute;ger du soleil. Le parc est enti&egrave;rement ombrag&eacute; et a beaucoup d&#39;herbe. Dans le parc, il y a aussi un restaurant et un bar de plage, et quelques appartements et un h&ocirc;tel se trouvent &agrave; proximit&eacute;, et un peu plus loin, il y a m&ecirc;me un terrain de camping. Une fois que vous venez ici avec votre v&eacute;hicule, vous pouvez le laisser &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la rue. Il ne faut que 100 m&egrave;tres de marche pour atteindre la plage. La longueur totale de la plage est de 300 m&egrave;tres, elle a une largeur de 15 m&egrave;tres, elle a une inclinaison normale et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s seulement 20 m&egrave;tres d&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau, dans certains cas m&ecirc;me plus. L&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est confortable et parfois on peut nager tout de suite et &agrave; certains endroits il faut marcher 20 m&egrave;tres avant de pouvoir commencer &agrave; nager. Toutes les commodit&eacute;s essentielles de la plage sont pr&eacute;sentes ici. Alors qu&#39;attendez-vous, r&eacute;servez un h&eacute;bergement sur notre site, r&eacute;servez un vol ou prenez votre voiture et dirigez-vous vers la plage de vos r&ecirc;ves. Nous vous souhaitons une exp&eacute;rience de plage incroyable, et rappelez-vous, utilisez toujours notre filtre avanc&eacute; BeachRex, pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve.</div>\n', 3452, 'fr', 1),
(2264, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Willkommen am ganz besonderen Strand, dem Paralia Kouyoni. Wenn wir Ihnen gesagt haben, dass dieser Strand ein Teil der Halbinsel Chalkidiki ist, k&ouml;nnen Sie sich als Insider bereits denken, dass es sich um einen wundersch&ouml;nen Strand handelt, wie es die Str&auml;nde der Region Chalkidiki sicherlich sind. Dieser Strand ist am besten f&uuml;r Familien mit Kindern geeignet, vor allem, weil sich im Hintergrund des Strandes ein Park mit Kinderspielplatz und einem Basketballfeld befindet und beide von B&auml;umen umgeben sind, um Ihnen etwas Sonnenschutz zu bieten. Der Park liegt im vollen Schatten und hat viel Gras. Im Park gibt es auch ein Restaurant und eine Strandbar, und einige Apartments und ein Hotel sind in der N&auml;he, und ein bisschen weiter weg gibt es sogar einen Campingplatz. Wenn Sie mit Ihrem Fahrzeug hierher kommen, k&ouml;nnen Sie es neben der Stra&szlig;e abstellen. Zum Strand sind es nur 100 Meter zu Fu&szlig;. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 300 Meter, er ist 15 Meter breit, hat eine normale Neigung und Sie k&ouml;nnen nach nur 20 Metern im Wasser schwimmen, in einigen F&auml;llen sogar noch mehr. Der Einstieg ins Wasser ist bequem und manchmal kann man gleich schwimmen und an manchen Stellen muss man 20 Meter laufen, bevor man losschwimmen kann. Alle wesentlichen Strandeinrichtungen sind hier vorhanden. Also, worauf warten Sie noch, buchen Sie eine Unterkunft auf unserer Website, buchen Sie einen Flug oder nehmen Sie Ihr Auto und machen Sie sich auf den Weg zu Ihrem Traumstrand. Wir w&uuml;nschen Ihnen ein tolles Stranderlebnis und denken Sie daran, immer unseren erweiterten BeachRex-Filter zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand zu finden.</div>\n', 3452, 'de', 1),
(2265, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Dobrodo&scaron;li na vrlo posebnu plažu, paraliju Kouyoni. Ako smo vam rekli da je ova plaža dio poluotoka Chalkidiki, već ste shvatili, ako ste insajderi, da je riječ o prekrasnoj plaži, kakve plaže regije Chalkidiki svakako jesu. Ova plaža je najbolja za obitelji s djecom, posebno jer se u pozadini plaže nalazi park s dječjim igrali&scaron;tem i ko&scaron;arka&scaron;kim terenom, a oba su okružena drvećem, kako bi vas za&scaron;titili od sunca. Park je u punoj sjeni i ima puno trave. U parku se također nalazi restoran i bar na plaži, au blizini su i neki apartmani i hotel, a malo dalje čak i kamp. Kada jednom dođete ovdje sa svojim vozilom možete ga ostaviti pored ulice. Do plaže je potrebno samo 100 metara hoda. Ukupna dužina plaže je 300 metara, &scaron;iroka je 15 metara, normalnog je nagiba i možete se kupati nakon samo 20 metara od ulaska u vodu, u nekim slučajevima i vi&scaron;e. Ulazak u vodu je ugodan i ponekad se može odmah zaplivati, a na nekim mjestima potrebno je proći i 20 metara prije nego &scaron;to počnete plivati. Ovdje su prisutni svi bitni sadržaji na plaži. Dakle, &scaron;to čekate, rezervirajte smje&scaron;taj na na&scaron;oj web stranici, rezervirajte let ili uzmite automobil i krenite prema plaži iz snova. Želimo vam nevjerojatno iskustvo na plaži i zapamtite, uvijek koristite na&scaron; BeachRex napredni filtar kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju sljedeću plažu iz snova.</div>\n', 3452, 'hr', 1),
(2266, 'Dobrodo&scaron;li na prav posebni plaži, paralia Kouyoni. Če smo vam povedali, da je ta plaža del polotoka Chalkidiki, lahko že ugotovite, če ste insajder, da govorimo o čudoviti plaži, kot so plaže regije Chalkidiki. Ta plaža je najbolj&scaron;a za družine z otroki, &scaron;e posebej zato, ker je v ozadju plaže park z otro&scaron;kim igri&scaron;čem in igri&scaron;čem za ko&scaron;arko, oba pa sta obdana z drevesi, ki vam nudijo za&scaron;čito pred soncem. Park je v popolni senci in ima veliko trave. V parku je tudi restavracija in bar na plaži, v bližini pa je nekaj apartmajev in hotel, malo stran pa je celo kamp. Ko pridete sem s svojim vozilom, ga lahko pustite ob ulici. Do plaže je le 100 metrov hoje. Skupna dolžina plaže je 300 metrov, &scaron;iroka je 15 metrov, ima normalen naklon in kopanje lahko začnete že po 20 metrih vstopa v vodo, ponekod tudi več. Vstop v vodo je udoben in včasih lahko zaplava&scaron; takoj, ponekod pa mora&scaron; prehoditi 20 metrov, preden lahko začne&scaron; plavati. Vse bistvene ugodnosti na plaži so tukaj. Torej, kaj &scaron;e čakate, rezervirajte namestitev na na&scaron;i spletni strani, rezervirajte let ali pa vzemite svoj avto in se odpravite proti va&scaron;i sanjski plaži. Želimo vam čudovito izku&scaron;njo na plaži in ne pozabite, vedno uporabite na&scaron; napredni filter BeachRex, da poi&scaron;čete svojo naslednjo sanjsko plažo.', 3452, 'sl', 1),
(2267, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Paralia Kalives se nahaja v mestu Kalives Poligirou, ki je del regije Kentriki Makedonia. Gre za pe&scaron;čeno plažo, najbolj primerno za družine, dolga skoraj 1 kilometer, &scaron;iroka 40 metrov, ima normalen naklon in že po 10 metrih lahko začnete plavati. Če ne marate dlje časa hoditi od avtomobila do plaže, vam bo ta plaža v&scaron;eč, saj je parkiri&scaron;če tik ob plaži, primerna pa je tudi za avtodome. Tu je tudi infrastruktura za plažo, ki je na dobri ravni. Pričakujete lahko nekaj prh, otro&scaron;ko igri&scaron;če, &scaron;portna igri&scaron;ča itd. Nekatere restavracije in beach bari so na voljo tudi na plaži ali v bližini. Tukaj lahko ostanete tudi dlje in si zagotovite namestitev, večinoma v obliki apartmaja ali proste sobe. V bližini imate na voljo tudi hotel in resort. Tukaj je prisoten tudi pomol in če želite ujeti nekaj rib, lahko to storite iz te strukture. Imate psa in bi ga radi pripeljali s seboj, na tej plaži ni problema? To je z na&scaron;e strani, zdaj je odvisno od vas. Če vam je ta plaža v&scaron;eč, pojdite naprej, rezervirajte hotel na na&scaron;i spletni strani, organizirajte vse in uživajte v poletnih počitnicah. Uživajte na plaži s BeachRexom in ne pozabite vedno uporabiti na&scaron;ega naprednega filtra za plažo BeachRex, da v nekaj sekundah najdete svojo naslednjo sanjsko plažo.</div>\n', 3454, 'sl', 1),
(2268, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Paralia Kalives se encuentra en la ciudad de Kalives Poligirou, que forma parte de la regi&oacute;n Kentriki Makedonia. Es una playa de arena, ideal para familias, de casi 1 kil&oacute;metro de largo, 40 metros de ancho, tiene una inclinaci&oacute;n normal y ya se puede empezar a nadar a los 10 metros. Si no te gusta andar mucho tiempo desde tu coche hasta llegar a la playa, esta playa te encantar&aacute;, porque el parking est&aacute; justo al lado de la playa, y tambi&eacute;n es apto para autocaravanas. La infraestructura de la playa tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; presente aqu&iacute; y est&aacute; en un buen nivel. Puede esperar algunas duchas, parque infantil, campos deportivos, etc. Algunos restaurantes y chiringuitos tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n disponibles en la playa o en los alrededores. Tambi&eacute;n puede quedarse aqu&iacute; por m&aacute;s tiempo y conseguir alojamiento, principalmente en forma de apartamento o habitaci&oacute;n libre. En las inmediaciones tambi&eacute;n tienes a tu disposici&oacute;n un hotel y un resort. Aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n hay un muelle y si te gusta pescar, puedes hacerlo desde esta estructura. &iquest;Tienes un perro y te gustar&iacute;a traerlo contigo, no hay problema en esta playa? Esto es de nuestra parte, ahora depende de ti. Si te gusta esta playa, an&iacute;mate, haz una reserva de hotel en nuestra web, organ&iacute;zalo todo y disfruta de tus vacaciones de verano. Disfruta de tu playa con BeachRex y no olvides utilizar siempre nuestro filtro de playa avanzado BeachRex para encontrar la pr&oacute;xima playa de tus sue&ntilde;os en cuesti&oacute;n de segundos.</div>\n', 3454, 'es', 1),
(2269, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Paralia Kalives est situ&eacute;e dans la ville de Kalives Poligirou, qui fait partie de la r&eacute;gion Kentriki Makedonia. C&#39;est une plage de sable, id&eacute;ale pour les familles, longue de pr&egrave;s d&#39;un kilom&egrave;tre, large de 40 m&egrave;tres, avec une inclinaison normale et vous pouvez d&eacute;j&agrave; commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s 10 m&egrave;tres. Si vous n&#39;aimez pas marcher plus longtemps depuis votre voiture jusqu&#39;&agrave; la plage, vous allez adorer cette plage, car le parking est juste &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de la plage et convient &eacute;galement aux camping-cars. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage est &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sente ici et elle est &agrave; un bon niveau. Vous pouvez vous attendre &agrave; des douches, une aire de jeux pour enfants, des terrains de sport, etc. Certains restaurants et bars de plage sont &eacute;galement disponibles sur la plage ou &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Vous pouvez &eacute;galement rester ici plus longtemps et vous trouver un logement, le plus souvent sous la forme d&#39;un appartement ou d&#39;une chambre libre. Dans les environs, vous avez &eacute;galement un h&ocirc;tel et un complexe &agrave; votre disposition. Une jet&eacute;e est &eacute;galement pr&eacute;sente ici et si vous aimez attraper du poisson, vous pouvez le faire depuis cette structure. Vous poss&eacute;dez un chien, et vous aimeriez l&#39;amener avec vous, pas de probl&egrave;me sur cette plage ? C&#39;est de notre c&ocirc;t&eacute;, maintenant c&#39;est &agrave; vous de d&eacute;cider. Si vous aimez cette plage, n&#39;h&eacute;sitez plus, faites une r&eacute;servation d&#39;h&ocirc;tel sur notre site internet, organisez tout et profitez de vos vacances d&#39;&eacute;t&eacute;. Profitez de votre plage avec BeachRex, et n&#39;oubliez pas de toujours utiliser notre filtre de plage avanc&eacute; BeachRex, pour trouver votre prochaine plage de r&ecirc;ve en quelques secondes.</div>\n', 3454, 'fr', 1),
(2270, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Paralia Kalives si trova nella citt&agrave; di Kalives Poligirou, che fa parte della regione Kentriki Makedonia. &Egrave; una spiaggia sabbiosa, pi&ugrave; adatta alle famiglie, lunga quasi 1 chilometro, larga 40 metri, ha una pendenza normale e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; dopo 10 metri. Se non ti piace camminare per un periodo di tempo pi&ugrave; lungo dalla tua auto fino a raggiungere la spiaggia, adorerai questa spiaggia, perch&eacute; il parcheggio &egrave; proprio accanto alla spiaggia ed &egrave; adatto anche per i camper. Anche l&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia &egrave; presente qui ed &egrave; di buon livello. Puoi aspettarti docce, parco giochi per bambini, campi sportivi e cos&igrave; via. Alcuni ristoranti e bar sulla spiaggia sono disponibili anche sulla spiaggia o nelle vicinanze. Puoi anche rimanere qui pi&ugrave; a lungo e procurarti un alloggio, principalmente sotto forma di appartamento o stanza libera. Nelle vicinanze avete anche un hotel e un resort a vostra disposizione. Qui &egrave; presente anche un molo e se vi piace pescare qualche pesce potete farlo da questa struttura. Possiedi un cane e vorresti portarlo con te, nessun problema su questa spiaggia? Questo &egrave; da parte nostra, ora tocca a te. Se ti piace questa spiaggia, continua, prenota un hotel sul nostro sito web, organizza tutto e goditi le tue vacanze estive. Goditi la tua spiaggia con BeachRex e non dimenticare di utilizzare sempre il nostro filtro spiaggia avanzato BeachRex, per trovare la prossima spiaggia dei tuoi sogni in pochi secondi.</div>\n', 3454, 'it', 1),
(2271, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Paralia Kalives nalazi se u gradu Kalives Poligirou, koji je dio regije Kentriki Makedonija. Pje&scaron;čana plaža, najprikladnija za obitelji, duga gotovo 1 kilometar, &scaron;iroka 40 metara, normalnog je nagiba i već nakon 10 metara možete se kupati. Ako ne volite dugo hodati od auta do plaže, ova plaža će vam se svidjeti, jer je parking odmah uz plažu, a pogodna je i za kampere. Infrastruktura plaže je također prisutna i na dobroj je razini. Možete očekivati ​​nekoliko tu&scaron;eva, dječje igrali&scaron;te, sportske terene i tako dalje. Neki restorani i beach barovi također su dostupni na plaži ili u blizini. Ovdje možete ostati i duže te si izboriti smje&scaron;taj, uglavnom u obliku apartmana ili slobodne sobe. U blizini također imate hotel i resort na raspolaganju. Ovdje se nalazi i pristani&scaron;te, a ako volite uloviti ribu, to možete učiniti s ovog objekta. Posjedujete li psa i htjeli biste ga povesti sa sobom, nema problema na ovoj plaži? Ovo je s na&scaron;e strane, sada je na vama. Ako vam se sviđa ova plaža, izvolite, rezervirajte hotel na na&scaron;oj stranici, organizirajte sve i uživajte u ljetovanju. Uživajte na plaži uz BeachRex i ne zaboravite uvijek koristiti na&scaron; BeachRex napredni filtar za plažu kako biste prona&scaron;li svoju sljedeću plažu iz snova u roku od nekoliko sekundi.</div>\n', 3454, 'hr', 1),
(2272, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Paralia Kalives befindet sich in der Stadt Kalives Poligirou, die Teil der Region Kentriki Makedonia ist. Es ist ein f&uuml;r Familien bestens geeigneter Sandstrand, fast 1 Kilometer lang, 40 Meter breit, hat eine normale Neigung und man kann bereits nach 10 Metern mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Wenn Sie nicht gerne l&auml;ngere Zeit vom Auto bis zum Strand laufen, werden Sie diesen Strand lieben, denn der Parkplatz befindet sich direkt neben dem Strand und ist auch f&uuml;r Wohnmobile geeignet. Die Strandinfrastruktur ist auch hier vorhanden und befindet sich auf einem guten Niveau. Es erwarten Sie einige Duschen, Kinderspielpl&auml;tze, Sportpl&auml;tze und so weiter. Einige Restaurants und Strandbars sind auch am Strand oder in der N&auml;he vorhanden. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier auch l&auml;nger bleiben und sich eine Unterkunft, meist in Form einer Wohnung oder eines freien Zimmers, sichern. In der N&auml;he stehen Ihnen auch ein Hotel und ein Resort zur Verf&uuml;gung. Hier ist auch ein Pier vorhanden, und wenn Sie gerne Fische fangen, k&ouml;nnen Sie dies von dieser Struktur aus tun. Besitzen Sie einen Hund und m&ouml;chten ihn mitbringen, an diesem Strand kein Problem? Dies ist von unserer Seite, jetzt liegt es an Ihnen. Wenn Ihnen dieser Strand gef&auml;llt, machen Sie eine Hotelreservierung auf unserer Website, organisieren Sie alles und genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Sommerurlaub. Genie&szlig;en Sie Ihren Strand mit BeachRex und vergessen Sie nicht, immer unseren erweiterten BeachRex-Strandfilter zu verwenden, um Ihren n&auml;chsten Traumstrand in Sekundenschnelle zu finden.</div>\n', 3454, 'de', 1),
(2273, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Паралия Каливес находится в городе Каливес Полигиру, который является частью региона Кентрики Македония. Это песчаный пляж, наиболее подходящий для семейного отдыха, длиной почти 1 километр, шириной 40 метров, с нормальным уклоном, купаться можно уже через 10 метров. Если вы не любите долго ходить пешком от машины до пляжа, вам понравится этот пляж, потому что парковка находится прямо рядом с пляжем, а также он подходит для автодомов. Пляжная инфраструктура здесь тоже присутствует и находится на хорошем уровне. Вы можете ожидать душевые, детскую площадку, спортивные площадки и так далее. Некоторые рестораны и пляжные бары также расположены на пляже или поблизости. Здесь также можно остаться подольше и получить себе жилье, чаще всего в виде квартиры или бесплатной комнаты. В окрестностях у вас также есть отель и курорт в вашем распоряжении. Здесь также есть пирс, и если вы хотите половить рыбу, вы можете сделать это с этой конструкции. У вас есть собака, и вы хотели бы взять ее с собой, нет проблем на этом пляже? Это с нашей стороны, теперь дело за вами. Если вам нравится этот пляж, бронируйте отель на нашем сайте, организуйте все и наслаждайтесь летним отдыхом. Наслаждайтесь своим пляжем с BeachRex и не забывайте всегда использовать наш расширенный пляжный фильтр BeachRex, чтобы найти следующий пляж своей мечты за считанные секунды.</div>\n', 3454, 'ru', 1),
(2274, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Пляж Портес &mdash; один из самых длинных песчаных пляжей Греции. Он имеет длину более 10 километров и предлагает множество различных вариантов проведения дня на пляже. Поскольку он расположен на полуострове Халкидики, а точнее в начале полуострова Кассандра, вы можете быть уверены, что получите совершенно уникальные пляжные впечатления. Полуостров Халкидики является для пляжей знаком качества. Он определенно подходит для владельцев автодомов, а также для семей и для тех, кто любит тишину на пляже. Дорога к пляжу в основном грунтовая, и вам нужно проехать больше километров, чтобы добраться до желаемого места, но вы, конечно, можете остановиться раньше. На части пляжа есть пляжные бары, но на большей части пляжа нет туристической инфраструктуры. Так что в некоторых местах есть какая-то пляжная инфраструктура, но в большинстве нет никакой. Размещение также доступно за пляжем, но в основном в виде апартаментов или бесплатных комнат. Ширина пляжа всего 10 метров, уклон пляжа нормальный, заход в воду удобный и уже через три метра можно начинать уплывать. Если у вас есть собака, она приветствуется здесь, как и везде на пляжах Греции. В следующий раз, когда вы будете искать другой качественный пляж, попробуйте наш расширенный фильтр BeachRex, и вы будете удивлены, как быстро он покажет вам подходящий пляж. Желаем вам отличного пляжного отдыха.</div>\n', 3455, 'ru', 1),
(2275, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Plaža Portes je jedna od najdužih pje&scaron;čanih plaža u Grčkoj. Duga je vi&scaron;e od 10 kilometara i nudi mnogo različitih opcija za provesti dan na plaži. Budući da se nalazi na poluotoku Chalkidiki, točnije na početku poluotoka Kasandra, možete biti sigurni da ćete dobiti jedinstveno iskustvo na plaži. Poluotok Chalkidiki je za plaže kao kvalitetan tuljan. Svakako je pogodan za vlasnike kampera, kao i za obitelji i one koji vole mir na plaži. Cesta do plaže uglavnom je zemljana i potrebno je voziti vi&scaron;e kilometara do željenog mjesta, ali naravno možete stati ranije. Na nekim dijelovima plaže postoje beach barovi, ali na većem dijelu plaže nema turističke infrastrukture. Dakle, neka mjesta imaju neku plažnu infrastrukturu, ali većina je nema. Smje&scaron;taj je također dostupan iza plaže ali uglavnom u tipu apartmana ili slobodnih soba. &Scaron;irina plaže je svega 10 metara, nagib plaže je normalan, ulazak u vodu udoban i već nakon tri metra možete početi otplivati. Ako imate psa, ovdje je dobrodo&scaron;ao, kao i bilo gdje drugdje na grčkim plažama. Sljedeći put kada budete tražili drugu kvalitetnu plažu isprobajte na&scaron; napredni BeachRex filtar, iznenadit ćete se koliko brzo će vam pokazati pravu plažu za vas. Želimo vam izvrsno iskustvo na plaži.</div>\n', 3455, 'hr', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(2276, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Der Strand Portes ist einer der l&auml;ngsten Sandstr&auml;nde Griechenlands. Er ist mehr als 10 Kilometer lang und bietet viele verschiedene M&ouml;glichkeiten, den Tag am Strand zu verbringen. Da es sich auf der Halbinsel Chalkidiki befindet, genauer gesagt am Anfang der Halbinsel Kassandra, k&ouml;nnen Sie sicher sein, dass Sie ein einzigartiges Stranderlebnis erleben werden. Die Halbinsel Chalkidiki ist f&uuml;r die Str&auml;nde wie ein G&uuml;tesiegel. Es ist definitiv geeignet f&uuml;r Wohnmobilbesitzer sowie f&uuml;r Familien und f&uuml;r diejenigen, die es lieben, etwas Ruhe am Strand zu haben. Die Stra&szlig;e zum Strand besteht gr&ouml;&szlig;tenteils aus Schotter und Sie m&uuml;ssen mehr Kilometer fahren, um Ihren bevorzugten Ort zu erreichen, aber Sie k&ouml;nnen nat&uuml;rlich fr&uuml;her anhalten. An einem Teil des Strandes gibt es Strandbars, aber auf der gr&ouml;&szlig;ten L&auml;nge des Strandes gibt es keine touristische Infrastruktur. Einige Orte haben also eine gewisse Strandinfrastruktur, aber die meisten haben keine. Unterk&uuml;nfte gibt es auch hinter dem Strand, aber meistens in Form von Apartments oder freien Zimmern. Die Strandbreite betr&auml;gt nur 10 Meter, die Strandneigung ist normal, der Wassereintritt ist angenehm und schon nach drei Metern kann man losschwimmen. Wenn Sie einen Hund besitzen, ist er hier wie &uuml;berall an den Str&auml;nden Griechenlands willkommen. Wenn Sie das n&auml;chste Mal nach einem anderen Qualit&auml;tsstrand suchen, probieren Sie unseren fortschrittlichen BeachRex-Filter aus, Sie werden erstaunt sein, wie schnell er Ihnen den richtigen Strand f&uuml;r Sie zeigt. Wir w&uuml;nschen Ihnen ein tolles Stranderlebnis.</div>\n', 3455, 'de', 1),
(2277, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">La playa Portes es una de las playas de arena m&aacute;s largas de Grecia. Tiene m&aacute;s de 10 kil&oacute;metros de largo y ofrece muchas opciones diferentes para pasar el d&iacute;a en la playa. Debido a que est&aacute; ubicado en la pen&iacute;nsula Chalkidiki, m&aacute;s precisamente al comienzo de la pen&iacute;nsula de Kassandra, puede estar seguro de que obtendr&aacute; una experiencia de playa &uacute;nica. La pen&iacute;nsula de Chalkidiki es para las playas como un sello de calidad. Definitivamente es adecuado para propietarios de autocaravanas, as&iacute; como para familias y para aquellos que aman tener un poco de paz en la playa. El camino a la playa es en su mayor&iacute;a de tierra y necesita conducir m&aacute;s kil&oacute;metros para llegar a su lugar preferido, pero por supuesto puede detenerse antes. En alguna parte de la playa hay chiringuitos, pero en la mayor parte de la playa no hay infraestructura tur&iacute;stica. Entonces, algunos lugares tienen alguna infraestructura de playa, pero la mayor&iacute;a no tiene. El alojamiento tambi&eacute;n est&aacute; disponible detr&aacute;s de la playa, pero principalmente en el tipo de apartamento o habitaciones libres. El ancho de la playa es de solo 10 metros, la inclinaci&oacute;n de la playa es normal, la entrada al agua es c&oacute;moda y ya puedes comenzar a nadar despu&eacute;s de tres metros. Si tienes un perro, es bienvenido aqu&iacute;, como en cualquier otro lugar de las playas de Grecia. La pr&oacute;xima vez que est&eacute; buscando otra playa de calidad, pruebe nuestro filtro avanzado BeachRex, se sorprender&aacute; de lo r&aacute;pido que le mostrar&aacute; la playa adecuada para usted. Le deseamos una gran experiencia en la playa.</div>\n', 3455, 'es', 1),
(2278, 'La plage des Portes est l&#39;une des plus longues plages de sable de Gr&egrave;ce. Il fait plus de 10 kilom&egrave;tres de long et offre de nombreuses options diff&eacute;rentes pour passer votre journ&eacute;e sur la plage. Parce qu&#39;il est situ&eacute; sur la p&eacute;ninsule de Chalkidiki, plus pr&eacute;cis&eacute;ment au d&eacute;but de la p&eacute;ninsule de Kassandra, vous pouvez &ecirc;tre s&ucirc;r que vous vivrez une exp&eacute;rience de plage unique. La p&eacute;ninsule de Chalcidique est pour les plages comme un label de qualit&eacute;. Il convient parfaitement aux propri&eacute;taires de camping-cars, aux familles et &agrave; ceux qui aiment avoir la paix sur la plage. La route de la plage est principalement faite de terre et vous devez parcourir plus de kilom&egrave;tres pour atteindre votre endroit pr&eacute;f&eacute;r&eacute;, mais vous pouvez bien s&ucirc;r vous arr&ecirc;ter plus t&ocirc;t. Sur une partie de la plage, il y a des bars de plage, mais sur la plus grande longueur de la plage, il n&#39;y a pas d&#39;infrastructure touristique. Ainsi, certains endroits ont une infrastructure de plage, mais la plupart n&#39;en ont aucune. L&#39;h&eacute;bergement est &eacute;galement disponible derri&egrave;re la plage mais principalement dans le type d&#39;appartement ou de chambres libres. La largeur de la plage n&#39;est que de 10 m&egrave;tres, l&#39;inclinaison de la plage est normale, l&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est confortable et vous pouvez d&eacute;j&agrave; commencer &agrave; nager apr&egrave;s trois m&egrave;tres. Si vous poss&eacute;dez un chien, il est le bienvenu ici, comme partout ailleurs sur les plages grecques. La prochaine fois que vous chercherez une autre plage de qualit&eacute;, essayez notre filtre avanc&eacute; BeachRex, vous serez &eacute;tonn&eacute; de la rapidit&eacute; avec laquelle il vous montrera la plage qui vous convient. Nous vous souhaitons une excellente exp&eacute;rience de plage.', 3455, 'fr', 1),
(2279, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">La spiaggia Portes &egrave; una delle spiagge sabbiose pi&ugrave; lunghe della Grecia. &Egrave; lungo pi&ugrave; di 10 chilometri e offre molte opzioni diverse per trascorrere la giornata in spiaggia. Poich&eacute; si trova sulla penisola Calcidica, pi&ugrave; precisamente all&#39;inizio della penisola di Kassandra, puoi essere certo che otterrai un&#39;esperienza balneare davvero unica. La penisola Calcidica &egrave; per le spiagge come un sigillo di qualit&agrave;. Sicuramente &egrave; adatto ai proprietari di camper cos&igrave; come alle famiglie ea chi ama la tranquillit&agrave; in spiaggia. La strada per la spiaggia &egrave; per lo pi&ugrave; sterrata e devi percorrere pi&ugrave; chilometri per raggiungere il tuo posto preferito, ma puoi ovviamente fermarti prima. In alcune parti della spiaggia ci sono bar sulla spiaggia, ma nella maggior parte della spiaggia non ci sono infrastrutture turistiche. Quindi alcuni posti hanno alcune infrastrutture balneari ma la maggior parte ne ha zero. L&#39;alloggio &egrave; disponibile anche dietro la spiaggia ma principalmente nella tipologia di appartamento o camere libere. La larghezza della spiaggia &egrave; di soli 10 metri, l&#39;inclinazione della spiaggia &egrave; normale, l&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; comodo e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; dopo tre metri. Se possiedi un cane, &egrave; il benvenuto qui, come in qualsiasi altro posto sulle spiagge della Grecia. La prossima volta che cercherai un&#39;altra spiaggia di qualit&agrave;, prova il nostro filtro avanzato BeachRex, rimarrai stupito di quanto velocemente ti mostrer&agrave; la spiaggia giusta per te. Vi auguriamo una fantastica esperienza in spiaggia.</div>\n', 3455, 'it', 1),
(2280, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Plaža Portes je ena najdalj&scaron;ih pe&scaron;čenih plaž v Grčiji. Dolga je več kot 10 kilometrov in ponuja veliko različnih možnosti za preživljanje dneva na plaži. Ker se nahaja na polotoku Chalkidiki, natančneje na začetku polotoka Kasandra, ste lahko prepričani, da boste dobili zelo edinstveno izku&scaron;njo na plaži. Polotok Chalkidiki je za plaže kot znamka za kvaliteto. Vsekakor je primeren tako za lastnike avtodomov kot tudi za družine in za tiste, ki radi uživate v miru na plaži. Cesta do plaže je večinoma makadamska in morate prevoziti več kilometrov, da pridete do želenega mesta, seveda pa se lahko ustavite prej. Na nekaterih delih plaže so bari na plaži, vendar na večjem delu plaže ni turistične infrastrukture. Nekateri kraji imajo nekaj plažne infrastrukture, večina pa je nima. Namestitev je na voljo tudi za plažo, vendar večinoma v obliki apartmajev ali prostih sob. &Scaron;irina plaže je le 10 metrov, naklon plaže je normalen, vstop v vodo udoben in že po treh metrih lahko začnete plavati. Če imate psa, je tukaj dobrodo&scaron;el, tako kot povsod drugje na gr&scaron;kih plažah. Ko boste naslednjič iskali drugo kakovostno plažo, preizkusite na&scaron; napredni filter BeachRex, presenečeni boste, kako hitro vam bo pokazal pravo plažo za vas. Želimo vam odlično izku&scaron;njo na plaži.</div>\n', 3455, 'sl', 1),
(2281, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Če imate radi plaže z naravno senco ali potrebujete senco dreves, da vas ali va&scaron;e otroke za&scaron;čiti pred soncem, morate obiskati plažo Lagomandra na polotoku Halkidiki v regiji Kantriki Makedonija. Tudi va&scaron;emu avtomobilu, morda tudi avtodomu bo parkiri&scaron;če na plaži v&scaron;eč, saj je celotno parkiri&scaron;če v senci, tako da ste lahko vedno prepričani, da vas čaka kul avto, ko se vrnete nazaj vanj. Sama plaža je pe&scaron;čena in je najbolj priporočljiva za družine, &scaron;e posebej za tiste z majhnimi otroki, va&scaron;i otroci bodo res za&scaron;čiteni, če ostanejo pod drevesi. Skupna dolžina plaže je 500 metrov, &scaron;iroka je 20 metrov, vstop v vodo je lep in udoben in kopanje lahko začnete že po 10 metrih vstopa v vodo. Infrastruktura na plaži je na povprečnem gr&scaron;kem standardu, kar je v redu, če niste preveč zahtevni. V poletnem času imate na plaži tudi re&scaron;evalca. Tu je tudi bar na plaži in nekaj restavracij v bližini, vendar ne neposredno na plaži. Tukaj si lahko izposodite tudi opremo za plažo, nekaj čolnov, sup, kajak in podobno. V bližini je nekaj apartmajev in zelo poseben in zagotovo zelo lep hotel. Želimo vam odlično izku&scaron;njo na plaži z BeachRexom.</div>\n', 3446, 'sl', 1),
(2282, 'Se ami le spiagge con ombra naturale o hai bisogno dell&#39;ombra degli alberi per proteggere te oi tuoi bambini dal sole, devi visitare la spiaggia Lagomandra sulla penisola di Halkidiki nella regione di Kantriki Makedonia. La tua auto, forse anche un camper, adorer&agrave; anche il parcheggio in spiaggia perch&eacute; tutto il parcheggio &egrave; in ombra, cos&igrave; puoi sempre essere sicuro che un&#39;auto fresca ti aspetta, quando ci torni. La spiaggia stessa &egrave; di sabbia ed &egrave; consigliata alle famiglie, soprattutto a quelle con bambini piccoli, i vostri bambini saranno davvero protetti se rimarranno sotto gli alberi. La lunghezza totale della spiaggia &egrave; di 500 metri, &egrave; larga 20 metri, l&#39;ingresso in acqua &egrave; bello e comodo e si pu&ograve; iniziare a nuotare gi&agrave; dopo 10 metri dall&#39;ingresso in acqua. L&#39;infrastruttura della spiaggia qui &egrave; su uno standard medio della Grecia, il che va bene, se non sei troppo esigente. In estate hai anche un bagnino in spiaggia. C&#39;&egrave; anche un bar sulla spiaggia e alcuni ristoranti nelle vicinanze, ma non direttamente sulla spiaggia. Puoi anche noleggiare dell&#39;attrezzatura da spiaggia qui, alcune piccole barche, un sup, un kayak e simili. Ci sono alcuni appartamenti e un hotel molto speciale e sicuramente molto bello nelle vicinanze. Ti auguriamo una fantastica esperienza in spiaggia con BeachRex.', 3446, 'it', 1),
(2283, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ako volite plaže s prirodnom sjenom ili vam je potrebna hladovina drveća da vas ili va&scaron;u djecu za&scaron;titi od sunca, trebate posjetiti plažu Lagomandra na poluotoku Halkidiki u regiji Kantriki Makedonija. Va&scaron; automobil, možda i kamper, također će se svidjeti parkingu na plaži jer je cijeli parking u sjeni, tako da uvijek možete biti sigurni da vas čeka cool auto, kada se vratite na njega. Sama plaža je pje&scaron;čana i najbolje ju je preporučiti za obitelji, posebno za one s malom djecom, va&scaron;a djeca će biti zaista za&scaron;tićena ako borave ispod drveća. Ukupna dužina plaže je 500 metara, &scaron;iroka 20 metara, ulazak u vodu je lijep i udoban, a kupanje se može početi već nakon 10 metara od ulaska u vodu. Infrastruktura plaže je na prosječnom grčkom standardu, &scaron;to je u redu, ako niste prezahtjevni. Ljeti imate i spasioca na plaži. Beach bar je također ovdje, a neki restorani u blizini, ali ne direktno na plaži. Ovdje možete iznajmiti i ne&scaron;to opreme za plažu, neke male čamce, sup, kajak i slično. U blizini se nalazi nekoliko apartmana i vrlo poseban i zasigurno vrlo lijep hotel. Želimo vam sjajno iskustvo na plaži uz BeachRex.</div>\n', 3446, 'hr', 1),
(2284, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Si vous aimez les plages &agrave; l&#39;ombre naturelle ou si vous avez besoin de l&#39;ombre des arbres pour vous prot&eacute;ger ou prot&eacute;ger vos enfants du soleil, vous devez visiter la plage Lagomandra sur la p&eacute;ninsule de Halkidiki dans la r&eacute;gion de Kantriki Makedonia. Votre voiture, peut-&ecirc;tre aussi un camping-car, adorera &eacute;galement le parking de la plage car tout le parking est &agrave; l&#39;ombre, vous pouvez donc toujours &ecirc;tre s&ucirc;r qu&#39;une voiture cool vous attend lorsque vous y reviendrez. La plage elle-m&ecirc;me est faite de sable et il est pr&eacute;f&eacute;rable de la recommander aux familles, en particulier &agrave; celles qui ont de jeunes enfants, vos enfants seront vraiment prot&eacute;g&eacute;s s&#39;ils restent sous les arbres. La longueur totale de la plage est de 500 m&egrave;tres, sa largeur est de 20 m&egrave;tres, l&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau est agr&eacute;able et confortable et vous pouvez commencer &agrave; nager d&eacute;j&agrave; apr&egrave;s 10 m&egrave;tres d&#39;entr&eacute;e dans l&#39;eau. L&#39;infrastructure de la plage ici est au niveau moyen de la Gr&egrave;ce, ce qui est correct, si vous n&#39;&ecirc;tes pas trop exigeant. En &eacute;t&eacute;, vous avez &eacute;galement un sauveteur sur la plage. Un bar de plage est &eacute;galement ici, et quelques restaurants &agrave; proximit&eacute;, mais pas directement sur la plage. Vous pouvez &eacute;galement louer du mat&eacute;riel de plage ici, des petits bateaux, un sup, un kayak, etc. Il y a quelques appartements et un tr&egrave;s sp&eacute;cial et &agrave; coup s&ucirc;r un tr&egrave;s bel h&ocirc;tel &agrave; proximit&eacute;. Nous vous souhaitons une excellente exp&eacute;rience de plage avec BeachRex.</div>\n', 3446, 'fr', 1),
(2285, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Si te encantan las playas con sombra natural o necesitas la sombra de los &aacute;rboles para protegerte a ti o a tus hijos del sol, debes visitar la playa Lagomandra en la pen&iacute;nsula de Halkidiki en la regi&oacute;n de Kantriki Makedonia. A su autom&oacute;vil, tal vez tambi&eacute;n a una autocaravana, tambi&eacute;n le encantar&aacute; el estacionamiento de la playa porque todo el estacionamiento est&aacute; a la sombra, por lo que siempre puede estar seguro de que un autom&oacute;vil genial lo espera cuando regrese. La playa en s&iacute; es de arena y es m&aacute;s recomendable para familias, especialmente para las que tienen ni&ntilde;os peque&ntilde;os, sus hijos estar&aacute;n muy protegidos si se quedan debajo de los &aacute;rboles. La longitud total de la playa es de 500 metros, tiene 20 metros de ancho, la entrada al agua es agradable y c&oacute;moda y ya puedes empezar a nadar despu&eacute;s de 10 metros de entrar al agua. La infraestructura de la playa aqu&iacute; est&aacute; en un est&aacute;ndar promedio de Grecia, lo cual est&aacute; bien, si no eres demasiado exigente. En verano tambi&eacute;n tienes socorrista en la playa. Aqu&iacute; tambi&eacute;n hay un chiringuito y algunos restaurantes en las inmediaciones, pero no directamente en la playa. Tambi&eacute;n puedes alquilar algunos equipos de playa aqu&iacute;, algunos botes peque&ntilde;os, un sup, kayak y similares. Hay algunos apartamentos y un hotel muy especial y seguro que muy bonito cerca. Le deseamos una gran experiencia en la playa con BeachRex.</div>\n', 3446, 'es', 1),
(2286, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Если вы любите пляжи с естественной тенью или вам нужна тень деревьев, чтобы защитить вас или ваших детей от солнца, вам нужно посетить пляж Лагомандра на полуострове Халкидики в регионе Кантрики Македония. Вашему автомобилю, а может и автодому тоже понравится пляжная парковка, ведь вся парковка находится в тени, так что вы всегда можете быть уверены, что вас ждет крутая тачка, когда вы вернетесь к ней обратно. Сам пляж сделан из песка и лучше всего рекомендуется для семей, особенно для тех, у кого есть маленькие дети, ваши дети будут действительно защищены, если останутся под деревьями. Общая длина пляжа 500 м, ширина 20 м, вход в воду красивый и удобный, купаться можно уже через 10 м входа в воду. Пляжная инфраструктура здесь соответствует среднему греческому стандарту, и это нормально, если вы не слишком требовательны. В летнее время у вас также есть спасатель на пляже. Здесь также есть пляжный бар и несколько ресторанов поблизости, но не непосредственно на пляже. Вы также можете арендовать здесь пляжное снаряжение, небольшие лодки, суп, каяк и тому подобное. Рядом есть несколько квартир и очень особенный и, безусловно, очень красивый отель. Желаем вам отличного отдыха на пляже с BeachRex.</div>\n', 3446, 'ru', 1),
(2287, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Wenn Sie Str&auml;nde mit nat&uuml;rlichem Schatten lieben oder den Schatten der B&auml;ume brauchen, um sich oder Ihre Kinder vor der Sonne zu sch&uuml;tzen, m&uuml;ssen Sie den Strand Lagomandra auf der Halbinsel Chalkidiki in der Region Kantriki Makedonia besuchen. Ihr Auto, vielleicht auch ein Wohnmobil, wird den Strandparkplatz ebenfalls lieben, denn der gesamte Parkplatz liegt im Schatten, sodass Sie immer sicher sein k&ouml;nnen, dass ein cooles Auto auf Sie wartet, wenn Sie dorthin zur&uuml;ckkehren. Der Strand selbst besteht aus Sand und ist am besten f&uuml;r Familien zu empfehlen, besonders f&uuml;r diejenigen mit kleinen Kindern, Ihre Kinder sind wirklich gesch&uuml;tzt, wenn sie unter den B&auml;umen bleiben. Die Gesamtl&auml;nge des Strandes betr&auml;gt 500 Meter, er ist 20 Meter breit, der Wassereintritt ist sch&ouml;n und bequem und Sie k&ouml;nnen bereits nach 10 Metern nach dem Eintritt ins Wasser mit dem Schwimmen beginnen. Die Strandinfrastruktur entspricht hier einem durchschnittlichen griechischen Standard, was in Ordnung ist, wenn Sie nicht zu anspruchsvoll sind. Im Sommer haben Sie auch einen Rettungsschwimmer am Strand. Eine Strandbar ist auch hier und einige Restaurants in der N&auml;he, aber nicht direkt am Strand. Sie k&ouml;nnen hier auch Strandausr&uuml;stung mieten, einige kleine Boote, ein Sup, Kajak und &auml;hnliches. Es gibt einige Apartments und ein ganz besonderes und sicherlich ein sehr sch&ouml;nes Hotel in der N&auml;he. Wir w&uuml;nschen Ihnen ein tolles Stranderlebnis mit BeachRex.</div>\n', 3446, 'de', 1),
(2288, '<p a=\"\" and=\"\" apple=\"\" background-color:=\"\" beach=\"\" beautiful=\"\" breathtaking=\"\" by=\"\" capo=\"\" city=\"\" civinini=\"\" cliffs=\"\" coast=\"\" color=\"\" font-size:=\"\" golden=\"\" helvetica=\"\" is=\"\" it=\"\" livorno.=\"\" located=\"\" long=\"\" near=\"\" noto=\"\" of=\"\" on=\"\" p=\"\" providing=\"\" sand=\"\" segoe=\"\" stretch=\"\" style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(217, 217, 227); box-sizing: border-box; --tw-border-spacing-x:0; --tw-border-spacing-y:0; --tw-translate-x:0; --tw-translate-y:0; --tw-rotate:0; --tw-skew-x:0; --tw-skew-y:0; --tw-scale-x:1; --tw-scale-y:1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness:proximity; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width:0px; --tw-ring-offset-color:#fff; --tw-ring-color:rgba(59,130,246,0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow:0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow:0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow:0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored:0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; color: rgb(55, 65, 81); text-align: justify;\" surrounded=\"\" that=\"\" the=\"\" tyrrhenian=\"\" ui=\"\" views=\"\" visitors=\"\" western=\"\" white-space:=\"\" with=\"\">Capo Civinini is a beautiful beach located on the western coast of Italy, near the city of Livorno. It is a long stretch of golden sand that is surrounded by cliffs and hills, providing visitors with breathtaking views of the Tyrrhenian Sea.&nbsp;The beach is known for its clear blue waters and soft, powdery sand, making it a popular destination for swimming, sunbathing, and beach games. It is also an ideal spot for water sports such as windsurfing, kite surfing, and kayaking.&nbsp;Capo Civinini is an excellent place to escape the hustle and bustle of city life and relax in the sun. The beach is usually not too crowded, so you can find plenty of space to spread out and enjoy the peaceful surroundings. There are also several restaurants and cafes nearby where you can grab a bite to eat or enjoy a refreshing drink.The area surrounding Capo Civinini is also worth exploring. You can take a walk along the scenic coastal path, which offers stunning views of the sea and the surrounding landscape. There are also several small coves and hidden beaches that you can discover if you are feeling adventurous.&nbsp;Overall, Capo Civinini is a must-visit destination for anyone who loves the sun, sea, and sand. It is a beautiful beach with plenty to offer, from water sports to relaxation and everything in between.<br />\n<br />\nPunta Ala is a picturesque coastal town located on the western coast of Italy, in the region of Tuscany. It is situated between the Gulf of Follonica and the Gulf of Baratti and is known for its stunning beaches, crystal-clear waters, and lush greenery.The town is popular among tourists for its beautiful marina, where you can find luxury yachts and sailboats. It is also home to several exclusive resorts and hotels that offer breathtaking views of the sea and the surrounding hills.&nbsp;Punta Ala has a long and rich history, dating back to the Etruscan era. It was later inhabited by the Romans, who built several villas in the area. Today, visitors can explore the ancient ruins of the Roman villa and see some of the mosaics and frescoes that have been preserved over the centuries.&nbsp;The town is also home to several beautiful beaches, including the Cala Violina, which is often considered one of the most beautiful beaches in Italy. The beach has crystal-clear waters and soft, white sand, and is surrounded by lush Mediterranean vegetation.&nbsp;In addition to its natural beauty, Punta Ala is also known for its excellent cuisine. The town is home to several restaurants that serve delicious seafood dishes and other Tuscan specialties.<br />\n<br />\nOverall, Punta Ala is a beautiful and charming coastal town that is well worth a visit. It offers a perfect blend of history, natural beauty, and luxury, making it an ideal destination for anyone looking for a relaxing and memorable holiday.&nbsp;Punta Ala is known for its beautiful beaches that attract visitors from all over the world. Here are some of the most popular beaches in Punta Ala:</p>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cala Violina: This stunning beach is located about 20 minutes away from Punta Ala and is considered one of the most beautiful beaches in Italy. The beach is surrounded by lush Mediterranean vegetation and has crystal-clear waters and soft, white sand. It is a popular spot for swimming, snorkeling, and sunbathing.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Spiaggia delle Rocchette: This beach is located just a few kilometers from Punta Ala and is known for its clear waters and fine, golden sand. It is backed by a dense pine forest, making it a picturesque spot for a day at the beach. The beach is also popular among windsurfers and kitesurfers due to the windy conditions.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cala Martina: This secluded beach is located on the southern coast of Punta Ala and is accessible only by boat or a steep path from the nearby village of Pian d&#39;Alma. The beach has crystal-clear waters and is surrounded by rocky cliffs, making it an ideal spot for snorkeling and diving.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bagno Punta Hidalgo: This beach is located in the heart of Punta Ala and is a popular spot for families with children. It has shallow waters, making it safe for children to swim, and is equipped with all the amenities you need for a day at the beach, including sun loungers, umbrellas, and showers.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p a=\"\" and=\"\" apple=\"\" background-color:=\"\" beach=\"\" beautiful=\"\" breathtaking=\"\" by=\"\" capo=\"\" city=\"\" civinini=\"\" cliffs=\"\" coast=\"\" color=\"\" font-size:=\"\" golden=\"\" helvetica=\"\" is=\"\" it=\"\" livorno.=\"\" located=\"\" long=\"\" near=\"\" noto=\"\" of=\"\" on=\"\" p=\"\" providing=\"\" sand=\"\" segoe=\"\" stretch=\"\" style=\"border: 0px solid rgb(217, 217, 227); box-sizing: border-box; --tw-border-spacing-x:0; --tw-border-spacing-y:0; --tw-translate-x:0; --tw-translate-y:0; --tw-rotate:0; --tw-skew-x:0; --tw-skew-y:0; --tw-scale-x:1; --tw-scale-y:1; --tw-pan-x: ; --tw-pan-y: ; --tw-pinch-zoom: ; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness:proximity; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width:0px; --tw-ring-offset-color:#fff; --tw-ring-color:rgba(59,130,246,0.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow:0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow:0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow:0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored:0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; margin: 1.25em 0px; color: rgb(55, 65, 81); text-align: justify;\" surrounded=\"\" that=\"\" the=\"\" tyrrhenian=\"\" ui=\"\" views=\"\" visitors=\"\" western=\"\" white-space:=\"\" with=\"\">Overall, Punta Ala&#39;s beaches offer a perfect blend of natural beauty, crystal-clear waters, and modern amenities, making it an ideal destination for a beach holiday in Italy.</p>\n', 2068, 'en', 1),
(2289, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Roccamare Beach is a stunning stretch of coastline located in the southern part of Tuscany, Italy. This beautiful beach is situated between the towns of Castiglione della Pescaia and Punta Ala, and is known for its crystal-clear waters, fine white sand, and natural beauty. One of the unique features of Roccamare Beach is its location within a protected pine forest. The beach is surrounded by a dense forest of tall pine trees that provide shade and a sense of tranquility. Visitors can take a leisurely walk through the forest or simply relax on the beach and enjoy the natural surroundings.The beach itself is long and wide, offering plenty of space for sunbathing and water activities. The waters are shallow and calm, making it an ideal spot for families with children. There are also several beach clubs and restaurants along the shoreline, where visitors can enjoy a refreshing drink or a delicious meal while taking in the beautiful views of the sea. Roccamare Beach is a popular destination for water sports enthusiasts, with opportunities for windsurfing, kitesurfing, and sailing. The beach is also a great spot for snorkeling and scuba diving, as the waters are teeming with marine life such as colorful fish, sea turtles, and even dolphins. Overall, Roccamare Beach is a beautiful and peaceful spot where visitors can escape the hustle and bustle of everyday life and immerse themselves in nature. With its stunning coastline, clear waters, and tranquil surroundings, it is a must-visit destination for anyone traveling to Tuscany.<br />\n<br />\nLe Rocchette is a beautiful beach located in the southern part of Tuscany, Italy, near the town of Castiglione della Pescaia. There are several accommodation options available for visitors who want to stay near this stunning beach. One of the most popular types of accommodation near Le Rocchette is holiday apartments. These apartments are typically fully furnished and equipped with all the necessary amenities, making them an ideal choice for families or groups of friends who want to enjoy a comfortable and independent stay. Many of these apartments are located close to the beach or in the nearby town, making it easy for visitors to explore the area and enjoy all that Le Rocchette has to offer. Another popular option for accommodation near Le Rocchette is hotels. The town of Castiglione della Pescaia, which is located nearby, has several high-quality hotels ranging from luxurious 5-star resorts to more affordable options. These hotels typically offer a range of services and facilities, including swimming pools, restaurants, bars, and spas, making them a great choice for those who want a more pampered and indulgent vacation experience. For those who prefer a more rustic and traditional experience, Le Rocchette also offers a range of agriturismos, or farm stays. These accommodations are typically located in the surrounding countryside and offer visitors a chance to experience the authentic Tuscan way of life. Visitors can enjoy fresh, locally sourced food, take part in agricultural activities such as wine tasting and olive oil making, and relax in a peaceful and tranquil environment. Overall, whether you are looking for a luxurious beachfront resort, a comfortable holiday apartment, or a rustic farm stay, Le Rocchette has plenty of options to suit your needs and preferences. With its stunning natural beauty, rich cultural heritage, and diverse range of accommodation options, Le Rocchette is the perfect destination for a memorable and enjoyable vacation.<br />\n<br />\nCastiglione della Pescaia is a beautiful coastal town located in the southern part of Tuscany, Italy. This town is famous for its pristine beaches, crystal-clear waters, and picturesque surroundings. Here are some of the top beaches to visit in Castiglione della Pescaia:</div>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cala Violina: This stunning beach is located in the heart of the Maremma Nature Reserve and is considered one of the most beautiful beaches in Tuscany. The beach is known for its crystal-clear waters, fine white sand, and the unique sound it produces when walked upon. The beach is accessible only by foot, and visitors can enjoy a leisurely hike through the pine forest before arriving at the beach.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Spiaggia delle Rocchette: This beach is located just a few kilometers south of Castiglione della Pescaia and is known for its clear waters and fine white sand. The beach is surrounded by a pine forest and offers plenty of opportunities for water sports activities such as windsurfing and kitesurfing.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Spiaggia di Ponente: This long and wide beach is located in the western part of Castiglione della Pescaia and offers a great view of the town&#39;s medieval fortress. The beach is ideal for swimming and sunbathing and has several beach clubs and restaurants along the shoreline.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Spiaggia di Levante: This is the main beach of Castiglione della Pescaia and is located on the eastern side of the town. The beach is wide and long, and its crystal-clear waters are ideal for swimming and water sports activities. The beach is equipped with several facilities such as showers, toilets, and changing rooms.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Spiaggia di Punta Ala: This beach is located just a few kilometers north of Castiglione della Pescaia and is known for its long, wide stretch of fine white sand and crystal-clear waters. The beach is surrounded by a pine forest and offers a peaceful and relaxing environment for visitors.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Overall, Castiglione della Pescaia offers a diverse range of beautiful beaches, each with its own unique features and attractions. Whether you are looking for a secluded cove, a wide and open beach, or a beach with plenty of facilities and activities, Castiglione della Pescaia has something to offer for everyone.<br />\n&nbsp;<br />\n&nbsp;</div>\n', 2106, 'en', 1),
(2290, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Roccamare Beach ist ein atemberaubender K&uuml;stenabschnitt im s&uuml;dlichen Teil der Toskana, Italien. Dieser wundersch&ouml;ne Strand liegt zwischen den St&auml;dten Castiglione della Pescaia und Punta Ala und ist bekannt f&uuml;r sein kristallklares Wasser, seinen feinen wei&szlig;en Sand und seine nat&uuml;rliche Sch&ouml;nheit. Eines der einzigartigen Merkmale von Roccamare Beach ist seine Lage in einem gesch&uuml;tzten Pinienwald. Der Strand ist von einem dichten Wald aus hohen Pinien umgeben, die Schatten spenden und ein Gef&uuml;hl der Ruhe vermitteln. Besucher k&ouml;nnen einen gem&uuml;tlichen Spaziergang durch den Wald machen oder einfach am Strand entspannen und die nat&uuml;rliche Umgebung genie&szlig;en. Der Strand selbst ist lang und breit und bietet viel Platz zum Sonnenbaden und f&uuml;r Wasseraktivit&auml;ten. Das Wasser ist flach und ruhig, was es zu einem idealen Ort f&uuml;r Familien mit Kindern macht. Es gibt auch mehrere Strandclubs und Restaurants entlang der K&uuml;ste, wo Besucher ein erfrischendes Getr&auml;nk oder eine k&ouml;stliche Mahlzeit genie&szlig;en k&ouml;nnen, w&auml;hrend sie die sch&ouml;ne Aussicht auf das Meer genie&szlig;en. Roccamare Beach ist ein beliebtes Ziel f&uuml;r Wassersportler mit M&ouml;glichkeiten zum Windsurfen, Kitesurfen und Segeln. Der Strand ist auch ein gro&szlig;artiger Ort zum Schnorcheln und Tauchen, da das Wasser von Meereslebewesen wie bunten Fischen, Meeresschildkr&ouml;ten und sogar Delfinen nur so wimmelt. Insgesamt ist Roccamare Beach ein sch&ouml;ner und friedlicher Ort, an dem Besucher der Hektik des Alltags entfliehen und in die Natur eintauchen k&ouml;nnen. Mit seiner atemberaubenden K&uuml;ste, dem klaren Wasser und der ruhigen Umgebung ist es ein Muss f&uuml;r jeden, der in die Toskana reist.<br />\n<br />\nLe Rocchette ist ein wundersch&ouml;ner Strand im s&uuml;dlichen Teil der Toskana, Italien, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Castiglione della Pescaia. Es gibt mehrere Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten f&uuml;r Besucher, die in der N&auml;he dieses atemberaubenden Strandes &uuml;bernachten m&ouml;chten. Eine der beliebtesten Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften in der N&auml;he von Le Rocchette sind Ferienwohnungen. Diese Apartments sind in der Regel komplett m&ouml;bliert und mit allen notwendigen Annehmlichkeiten ausgestattet, was sie zu einer idealen Wahl f&uuml;r Familien oder Gruppen von Freunden macht, die einen komfortablen und unabh&auml;ngigen Aufenthalt genie&szlig;en m&ouml;chten. Viele dieser Apartments befinden sich in der N&auml;he des Strandes oder in der nahe gelegenen Stadt, was es Besuchern leicht macht, die Gegend zu erkunden und alles zu genie&szlig;en, was Le Rocchette zu bieten hat. Eine weitere beliebte Option f&uuml;r die Unterkunft in der N&auml;he von Le Rocchette sind Hotels. Die Stadt Castiglione della Pescaia, die sich in der N&auml;he befindet, verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber mehrere hochwertige Hotels, die von luxuri&ouml;sen 5-Sterne-Resorts bis hin zu g&uuml;nstigeren Optionen reichen. Diese Hotels bieten in der Regel eine Reihe von Dienstleistungen und Einrichtungen, darunter Schwimmb&auml;der, Restaurants, Bars und Spas, was sie zu einer gro&szlig;artigen Wahl f&uuml;r diejenigen macht, die sich ein verw&ouml;hntes und verw&ouml;hnendes Urlaubserlebnis w&uuml;nschen. F&uuml;r diejenigen, die eine rustikalere und traditionellere Erfahrung bevorzugen, bietet Le Rocchette auch eine Reihe von Agriturismos oder Bauernh&ouml;fen. Diese Unterk&uuml;nfte befinden sich typischerweise in der umliegenden Landschaft und bieten Besuchern die M&ouml;glichkeit, die authentische toskanische Lebensweise zu erleben. Besucher k&ouml;nnen frische Lebensmittel aus der Region genie&szlig;en, an landwirtschaftlichen Aktivit&auml;ten wie Weinproben und Oliven&ouml;lherstellung teilnehmen und sich in einer friedlichen und ruhigen Umgebung entspannen. Ganz gleich, ob Sie nach einem luxuri&ouml;sen Strandresort, einer komfortablen Ferienwohnung oder einem rustikalen Bauernhof suchen, Le Rocchette bietet zahlreiche Optionen f&uuml;r Ihre Bed&uuml;rfnisse und Vorlieben. Mit seiner atemberaubenden nat&uuml;rlichen Sch&ouml;nheit, seinem reichen kulturellen Erbe und seinem vielf&auml;ltigen Angebot an Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten ist Le Rocchette das perfekte Ziel f&uuml;r einen unvergesslichen und angenehmen Urlaub.<br />\n<br />\nCastiglione della Pescaia ist eine wundersch&ouml;ne K&uuml;stenstadt im s&uuml;dlichen Teil der Toskana, Italien. Diese Stadt ist ber&uuml;hmt f&uuml;r ihre unber&uuml;hrten Str&auml;nde, das kristallklare Wasser und die malerische Umgebung. Hier sind einige der besten Str&auml;nde in Castiglione della Pescaia:<br />\n1. Cala Violina: Dieser atemberaubende Strand liegt im Herzen des Naturschutzgebietes Maremma und gilt als einer der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde der Toskana. Der Strand ist bekannt f&uuml;r sein kristallklares Wasser, seinen feinen wei&szlig;en Sand und das einzigartige Ger&auml;usch, das er beim Gehen erzeugt. Der Strand ist nur zu Fu&szlig; erreichbar, und Besucher k&ouml;nnen eine gem&uuml;tliche Wanderung durch den Pinienwald unternehmen, bevor sie den Strand erreichen.<br />\n2. Spiaggia delle Rocchette: Dieser Strand liegt nur wenige Kilometer s&uuml;dlich von Castiglione della Pescaia und ist bekannt f&uuml;r sein klares Wasser und seinen feinen wei&szlig;en Sand. Der Strand ist von einem Pinienwald umgeben und bietet viele M&ouml;glichkeiten f&uuml;r Wassersportaktivit&auml;ten wie Windsurfen und Kitesurfen.<br />\n3. Spiaggia di Ponente: Dieser lange und breite Strand liegt im westlichen Teil von Castiglione della Pescaia und bietet einen tollen Blick auf die mittelalterliche Festung des Ortes. Der Strand ist ideal zum Schwimmen und Sonnenbaden und hat mehrere Strandclubs und Restaurants entlang der K&uuml;ste.<br />\n4. Spiaggia di Levante: Dies ist der Hauptstrand von Castiglione della Pescaia und liegt an der Ostseite der Stadt. Der Strand ist breit und lang und sein kristallklares Wasser ist ideal zum Schwimmen und Baden&nbsp;nach sportlichen Aktivit&auml;ten. Der Strand ist mit mehreren Einrichtungen wie Duschen, Toiletten und Umkleidekabinen ausgestattet.<br />\n5. Spiaggia di Punta Ala: Dieser Strand liegt nur wenige Kilometer n&ouml;rdlich von Castiglione della Pescaia und ist bekannt f&uuml;r seinen langen, breiten Streifen aus feinem wei&szlig;en Sand und kristallklarem Wasser. Der Strand ist von einem Pinienwald umgeben und bietet Besuchern eine friedliche und entspannende Umgebung.<br />\nInsgesamt bietet Castiglione della Pescaia eine vielf&auml;ltige Auswahl an wundersch&ouml;nen Str&auml;nden, jeder mit seinen eigenen Besonderheiten und Attraktionen. Egal, ob Sie eine einsame Bucht, einen breiten und offenen Strand oder einen Strand mit vielen Einrichtungen und Aktivit&auml;ten suchen, Castiglione della Pescaia hat f&uuml;r jeden etwas zu bieten.</div>\n', 2106, 'de', 1),
(2291, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">La spiaggia di Roccamare &egrave; uno splendido tratto di costa situato nella parte meridionale della Toscana, in Italia. Questa bellissima spiaggia si trova tra i comuni di Castiglione della Pescaia e Punta Ala, ed &egrave; conosciuta per le sue acque cristalline, la sabbia bianca e fine e le bellezze naturali. Una delle caratteristiche uniche della spiaggia di Roccamare &egrave; la sua posizione all&#39;interno di una pineta protetta. La spiaggia &egrave; circondata da un fitto bosco di alti pini che donano ombra e un senso di tranquillit&agrave;. I visitatori possono fare una piacevole passeggiata attraverso la foresta o semplicemente rilassarsi sulla spiaggia e godersi l&#39;ambiente naturale. La spiaggia stessa &egrave; lunga e ampia e offre molto spazio per prendere il sole e attivit&agrave; acquatiche. Le acque sono poco profonde e calme, rendendolo un luogo ideale per famiglie con bambini. Ci sono anche diversi stabilimenti balneari e ristoranti lungo il litorale, dove i visitatori possono gustare un drink rinfrescante o un pasto delizioso ammirando la splendida vista sul mare. La spiaggia di Roccamare &egrave; una destinazione popolare per gli appassionati di sport acquatici, con opportunit&agrave; per il windsurf, il kitesurf e la vela. La spiaggia &egrave; anche un luogo ideale per lo snorkeling e le immersioni subacquee, poich&eacute; le acque pullulano di vita marina come pesci colorati, tartarughe marine e persino delfini. Nel complesso, la spiaggia di Roccamare &egrave; un luogo bellissimo e tranquillo dove i visitatori possono sfuggire al trambusto della vita quotidiana e immergersi nella natura. Con la sua splendida costa, le acque limpide e i dintorni tranquilli, &egrave; una destinazione imperdibile per chiunque si rechi in Toscana.<br />\n<br />\nLe Rocchette &egrave; una bellissima spiaggia situata nella parte meridionale della Toscana, in Italia, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Castiglione della Pescaia. Ci sono diverse opzioni di alloggio disponibili per i visitatori che vogliono stare vicino a questa splendida spiaggia. Una delle tipologie di alloggio pi&ugrave; popolari vicino a Le Rocchette &egrave; quella degli appartamenti per vacanze. Questi appartamenti sono tipicamente completamente arredati e dotati di tutti i comfort necessari, rendendoli una scelta ideale per famiglie o gruppi di amici che desiderano trascorrere un soggiorno confortevole e indipendente. Molti di questi appartamenti si trovano vicino alla spiaggia o nella vicina citt&agrave;, rendendo facile per i visitatori esplorare la zona e godere di tutto ci&ograve; che Le Rocchette ha da offrire. Un&#39;altra opzione popolare per l&#39;alloggio vicino a Le Rocchette sono gli hotel. La citt&agrave; di Castiglione della Pescaia, che si trova nelle vicinanze, ha diversi hotel di alta qualit&agrave; che vanno dai lussuosi resort a 5 stelle alle opzioni pi&ugrave; convenienti. Questi hotel in genere offrono una gamma di servizi e strutture, tra cui piscine, ristoranti, bar e spa, rendendoli un&#39;ottima scelta per coloro che desiderano un&#39;esperienza di vacanza pi&ugrave; coccolata e indulgente. Per chi preferisce un&#39;esperienza pi&ugrave; rustica e tradizionale, Le Rocchette offre anche una serie di agriturismi o agriturismi. Questi alloggi sono tipicamente situati nella campagna circostante e offrono ai visitatori la possibilit&agrave; di sperimentare l&#39;autentico stile di vita toscano. I visitatori possono gustare cibi freschi e di provenienza locale, prendere parte ad attivit&agrave; agricole come la degustazione di vini e la produzione di olio d&#39;oliva e rilassarsi in un ambiente tranquillo e sereno. Nel complesso, che tu stia cercando un lussuoso resort sulla spiaggia, un confortevole appartamento per le vacanze o un rustico agriturismo, Le Rocchette ha molte opzioni per soddisfare le tue esigenze e preferenze. Con la sua straordinaria bellezza naturale, il ricco patrimonio culturale e la vasta gamma di opzioni di alloggio, Le Rocchette &egrave; la destinazione perfetta per una vacanza indimenticabile e divertente.<br />\n<br />\nCastiglione della Pescaia &egrave; una bellissima citt&agrave; costiera situata nella parte meridionale della Toscana, in Italia. Questa citt&agrave; &egrave; famosa per le sue spiagge incontaminate, le acque cristalline e i pittoreschi dintorni. Ecco alcune delle migliori spiagge da visitare a Castiglione della Pescaia:<br />\n1. Cala Violina: questa splendida spiaggia si trova nel cuore della Riserva Naturale della Maremma ed &egrave; considerata una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; belle della Toscana. La spiaggia &egrave; nota per le sue acque cristalline, la sabbia bianca e fine e il suono unico che produce quando viene calpestata. La spiaggia &egrave; accessibile solo a piedi e i visitatori possono godersi una piacevole escursione attraverso la pineta prima di arrivare in spiaggia.<br />\n2. Spiaggia delle Rocchette: Questa spiaggia si trova a pochi chilometri a sud di Castiglione della Pescaia ed &egrave; conosciuta per le sue acque limpide e la sabbia bianca e fine. La spiaggia &egrave; circondata da una pineta e offre numerose opportunit&agrave; per praticare sport acquatici come il windsurf e il kitesurf.<br />\n3. Spiaggia di Ponente: questa lunga e ampia spiaggia si trova nella parte occidentale di Castiglione della Pescaia e offre una splendida vista sulla rocca medievale del paese. La spiaggia &egrave; l&#39;ideale per nuotare e prendere il sole e ha diversi stabilimenti balneari e ristoranti lungo il litorale.<br />\n4. Spiaggia di Levante: &egrave; la spiaggia principale di Castiglione della Pescaia e si trova nella parte orientale del paese. La spiaggia &egrave; ampia e lunga, e le sue acque cristalline sono l&#39;ideale per nuotare e dopo le attivit&agrave; sportive. La spiaggia &egrave; dotata di diversi servizi come docce, servizi igienici e spogliatoi.<br />\n5. Spiaggia di Punta Ala: questa spiaggia si trova a pochi chilometri a nord di Castiglione della Pescaia ed &egrave; conosciuta per la sua lunga e ampia distesa di sabbia bianca e fine e acque cristalline. La spiaggia &egrave; circondata da una pineta e offre un ambiente tranquillo e rilassante per i visitatori.<br />\nNel complesso, Castiglione della Pescaia offre una vasta gamma di bellissime spiagge, ognuna con le sue caratteristiche e attrazioni uniche. Che tu stia cercando una caletta appartata, una spiaggia ampia e aperta o una spiaggia ricca di servizi e attivit&agrave;, Castiglione della Pescaia ha qualcosa da offrire a tutti.</div>\n', 2106, 'it', 1);
INSERT INTO `beach_description` (`id`, `description`, `beach_id`, `language_short_name`, `status_id`) VALUES
(2292, 'Capo Civinini &egrave; una bellissima spiaggia situata sulla costa occidentale dell&#39;Italia, vicino alla citt&agrave; di Livorno. &Egrave; una lunga distesa di sabbia dorata circondata da scogliere e colline, che offre ai visitatori una vista mozzafiato sul Mar Tirreno. La spiaggia &egrave; nota per le sue acque cristalline e la sabbia soffice e polverosa, che la rendono una destinazione popolare per nuotare, prendere il sole e giocare in spiaggia. &Egrave; anche un luogo ideale per gli sport acquatici come il windsurf, il kitesurf e il kayak. Capo Civinini &egrave; un luogo eccellente per sfuggire al trambusto della vita cittadina e rilassarsi al sole. La spiaggia di solito non &egrave; troppo affollata, quindi puoi trovare molto spazio per distenderti e goderti l&#39;ambiente tranquillo. Nelle vicinanze troverete anche numerosi ristoranti e caffetterie dove potrete mangiare un boccone o sorseggiare un drink rinfrescante. Vale la pena esplorare anche l&#39;area che circonda Capo Civinini. Puoi fare una passeggiata lungo il panoramico sentiero costiero, che offre una vista mozzafiato sul mare e sul paesaggio circostante. Ci sono anche diverse piccole insenature e spiagge nascoste che puoi scoprire se ti senti avventuroso. Nel complesso, Capo Civinini &egrave; una meta imperdibile per chi ama il sole, il mare e la sabbia. &Egrave; una bellissima spiaggia con molto da offrire, dagli sport acquatici al relax e tutto il resto.<br />\n<br />\nPunta Ala &egrave; una pittoresca cittadina costiera situata sulla costa occidentale d&#39;Italia, nella regione Toscana. Si trova tra il Golfo di Follonica e il Golfo di Baratti ed &egrave; noto per le sue splendide spiagge, le acque cristalline e la vegetazione lussureggiante. La citt&agrave; &egrave; popolare tra i turisti per il suo bellissimo porto turistico, dove &egrave; possibile trovare lussuosi yacht e barche a vela. Ospita anche numerosi resort e hotel esclusivi che offrono viste mozzafiato sul mare e sulle colline circostanti. Punta Ala ha una storia lunga e ricca, che risale all&#39;epoca etrusca. Successivamente fu abitata dai Romani, che costruirono diverse ville nella zona. Oggi i visitatori possono esplorare le antiche rovine della villa romana e vedere alcuni dei mosaici e degli affreschi che si sono conservati nel corso dei secoli. La citt&agrave; ospita anche diverse bellissime spiagge, tra cui la Cala Violina, che &egrave; spesso considerata una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; belle d&#39;Italia. La spiaggia ha acque cristalline e soffice sabbia bianca, ed &egrave; circondata da una rigogliosa vegetazione mediterranea. Oltre che per le sue bellezze naturali, Punta Ala &egrave; nota anche per l&#39;ottima cucina. La citt&agrave; ospita diversi ristoranti che servono deliziosi piatti di pesce e altre specialit&agrave; toscane.<br />\n<br />\nNel complesso, Punta Ala &egrave; una bella e affascinante localit&agrave; costiera che merita una visita. Offre una miscela perfetta di storia, bellezza naturale e lusso, rendendola una destinazione ideale per chi cerca una vacanza rilassante e indimenticabile. Punta Ala &egrave; conosciuta per le sue bellissime spiagge che attirano visitatori da tutto il mondo. Ecco alcune delle spiagge pi&ugrave; frequentate di Punta Ala:<br />\n1. Cala Violina: questa splendida spiaggia si trova a circa 20 minuti da Punta Ala ed &egrave; considerata una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; belle d&#39;Italia. La spiaggia &egrave; circondata da una rigogliosa vegetazione mediterranea e presenta acque cristalline e soffice sabbia bianca. &Egrave; un luogo popolare per nuotare, fare snorkeling e prendere il sole.<br />\n2. Spiaggia delle Rocchette: Questa spiaggia si trova a pochi chilometri da Punta Ala ed &egrave; conosciuta per le sue acque limpide e la sabbia fine e dorata. &Egrave; sostenuto da una fitta pineta, che lo rende un luogo pittoresco per una giornata in spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; anche popolare tra i windsurfisti e kitesurf a causa delle condizioni ventose.<br />\n3. Cala Martina: questa spiaggia appartata si trova sulla costa meridionale di Punta Ala ed &egrave; accessibile solo in barca o tramite un ripido sentiero dal vicino villaggio di Pian d&#39;Alma. La spiaggia ha acque cristalline ed &egrave; circondata da scogliere rocciose, che la rendono un luogo ideale per lo snorkeling e le immersioni.<br />\n4. Bagno Punta Hidalgo: Questa spiaggia si trova nel cuore di Punta Ala ed &egrave; un luogo popolare per le famiglie con bambini. Ha fondali bassi, che rendono sicura la balneazione dei bambini, ed &egrave; dotata di tutti i servizi necessari per una giornata in spiaggia, compresi lettini, ombrelloni e docce.<br />\nNel complesso, le spiagge di Punta Ala offrono una miscela perfetta di bellezze naturali, acque cristalline e comfort moderni, rendendola una destinazione ideale per una vacanza al mare in Italia.', 2068, 'it', 1),
(2293, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Capo Civinini ist ein wundersch&ouml;ner Strand an der Westk&uuml;ste Italiens, in der N&auml;he der Stadt Livorno. Es ist ein langer goldener Sandstrand, der von Klippen und H&uuml;geln umgeben ist und den Besuchern einen atemberaubenden Blick auf das Tyrrhenische Meer bietet. Der Strand ist bekannt f&uuml;r sein klares blaues Wasser und seinen weichen, pudrigen Sand, was ihn zu einem beliebten Ziel zum Schwimmen, Sonnenbaden und Strandspielen macht. Es ist auch ein idealer Ort f&uuml;r Wassersportarten wie Windsurfen, Kitesurfen und Kajakfahren. Capo Civinini ist ein ausgezeichneter Ort, um der Hektik des Stadtlebens zu entfliehen und in der Sonne zu entspannen. Der Strand ist normalerweise nicht zu voll, sodass Sie viel Platz finden, um sich auszubreiten und die friedliche Umgebung zu genie&szlig;en. Es gibt auch mehrere Restaurants und Caf&eacute;s in der N&auml;he, wo Sie etwas essen oder ein erfrischendes Getr&auml;nk genie&szlig;en k&ouml;nnen.Die Gegend um Capo Civinini ist ebenfalls einen Besuch wert. Unternehmen Sie einen Spaziergang entlang des malerischen K&uuml;stenwegs, der einen atemberaubenden Blick auf das Meer und die umliegende Landschaft bietet. Es gibt auch mehrere kleine Buchten und versteckte Str&auml;nde, die Sie entdecken k&ouml;nnen, wenn Sie sich abenteuerlustig f&uuml;hlen. Insgesamt ist Capo Civinini ein Muss f&uuml;r alle, die Sonne, Meer und Sand lieben. Es ist ein wundersch&ouml;ner Strand, der viel zu bieten hat, von Wassersport bis Entspannung und alles dazwischen.<br />\n<br />\nPunta Ala ist eine malerische K&uuml;stenstadt an der Westk&uuml;ste Italiens in der Region Toskana. Es liegt zwischen dem Golf von Follonica und dem Golf von Baratti und ist bekannt f&uuml;r seine atemberaubenden Str&auml;nde, das kristallklare Wasser und das &uuml;ppige Gr&uuml;n. Die Stadt ist bei Touristen wegen ihres sch&ouml;nen Jachthafens beliebt, in dem Sie Luxusyachten und Segelboote finden. Es ist auch die Heimat mehrerer exklusiver Resorts und Hotels, die einen atemberaubenden Blick auf das Meer und die umliegenden H&uuml;gel bieten. Punta Ala hat eine lange und reiche Geschichte, die bis in die Zeit der Etrusker zur&uuml;ckreicht. Sp&auml;ter wurde es von den R&ouml;mern bewohnt, die in der Gegend mehrere Villen bauten. Heute k&ouml;nnen Besucher die antiken Ruinen der r&ouml;mischen Villa erkunden und einige der Mosaike und Fresken sehen, die im Laufe der Jahrhunderte erhalten geblieben sind. Die Stadt beherbergt auch mehrere sch&ouml;ne Str&auml;nde, darunter die Cala Violina, die oft als einer der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde Italiens gilt. Der Strand hat kristallklares Wasser und weichen, wei&szlig;en Sand und ist von &uuml;ppiger mediterraner Vegetation umgeben. Neben seiner nat&uuml;rlichen Sch&ouml;nheit ist Punta Ala auch f&uuml;r seine hervorragende K&uuml;che bekannt. Die Stadt beherbergt mehrere Restaurants, die k&ouml;stliche Fischgerichte und andere toskanische Spezialit&auml;ten servieren.<br />\n<br />\nInsgesamt ist Punta Ala eine sch&ouml;ne und charmante K&uuml;stenstadt, die einen Besuch wert ist. Es bietet eine perfekte Mischung aus Geschichte, nat&uuml;rlicher Sch&ouml;nheit und Luxus und ist damit ein ideales Reiseziel f&uuml;r alle, die einen erholsamen und unvergesslichen Urlaub verbringen m&ouml;chten. Punta Ala ist bekannt f&uuml;r seine wundersch&ouml;nen Str&auml;nde, die Besucher aus aller Welt anziehen. Hier sind einige der beliebtesten Str&auml;nde in Punta Ala:<br />\n1. Cala Violina: Dieser atemberaubende Strand liegt etwa 20 Minuten von Punta Ala entfernt und gilt als einer der sch&ouml;nsten Str&auml;nde Italiens. Der Strand ist von &uuml;ppiger mediterraner Vegetation umgeben und hat kristallklares Wasser und weichen, wei&szlig;en Sand. Es ist ein beliebter Ort zum Schwimmen, Schnorcheln und Sonnenbaden.<br />\n2. Spiaggia delle Rocchette: Dieser Strand liegt nur wenige Kilometer von Punta Ala entfernt und ist bekannt f&uuml;r sein klares Wasser und seinen feinen, goldenen Sand. Es ist von einem dichten Pinienwald umgeben, was es zu einem malerischen Ort f&uuml;r einen Tag am Strand macht. Aufgrund der windigen Bedingungen ist der Strand auch bei Windsurfern und Kitesurfern beliebt.<br />\n3. Cala Martina: Dieser abgelegene Strand liegt an der S&uuml;dk&uuml;ste von Punta Ala und ist nur mit dem Boot oder einem steilen Pfad vom nahe gelegenen Dorf Pian d&#39;Alma aus erreichbar. Der Strand hat kristallklares Wasser und ist von felsigen Klippen umgeben, was ihn zu einem idealen Ort zum Schnorcheln und Tauchen macht.<br />\n4. Bagno Punta Hidalgo: Dieser Strand liegt im Herzen von Punta Ala und ist ein beliebter Ort f&uuml;r Familien mit Kindern. Er hat seichtes Wasser, was das Schwimmen f&uuml;r Kinder sicher macht, und ist mit allen Annehmlichkeiten ausgestattet, die Sie f&uuml;r einen Tag am Strand ben&ouml;tigen, einschlie&szlig;lich Sonnenliegen, Sonnenschirmen und Duschen.<br />\nInsgesamt bieten die Str&auml;nde von Punta Ala eine perfekte Mischung aus nat&uuml;rlicher Sch&ouml;nheit, kristallklarem Wasser und modernen Annehmlichkeiten, was es zu einem idealen Ziel f&uuml;r einen Strandurlaub in Italien macht.</div>\n', 2068, 'de', 1),
(2294, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">The main beach in Castiglione della Pescaia is called &quot;Spiaggia di Ponente&quot; (West Beach). It&#39;s located in the heart of the town and is one of the most popular beaches in the area. Here are some features of this beach. The beach is about 3 kilometers long and features fine white sand and crystal-clear waters. There are several beach clubs along the beach where you can rent umbrellas and loungers, and enjoy a drink or a snack. The beach is wide and spacious, so even on the busiest days, there is plenty of room to spread out and relax. The sea is generally calm and safe for swimming, making it ideal for families with children. The beach is cleaned daily and is well-maintained. There are several restaurants and bars along the beach, where you can enjoy a meal or a drink while taking in the beautiful view. The beach is easily accessible from the town center and is just a short walk from many hotels and restaurants.There are several activities available on the beach, including paddleboarding, kayaking, and beach volleyball.<br />\nOverall, Spiaggia di Ponente is a beautiful and popular beach that offers something for everyone.<br />\nCastiglione della Pescaia is a charming medieval town located on the Tuscan coast in Italy. Here are some of the top sightseeing spots to check out:</div>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Castello di Castiglione: This impressive castle dates back to the 12th century and offers a stunning view of the town and the surrounding countryside.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Spiaggia delle Rocchette: This beautiful beach boasts crystal-clear waters and fine sand. It&#39;s a great place to relax and soak up the sun.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Chiesa di San Giovanni Battista: This historic church features beautiful frescoes and artwork.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Torre di Castiglione: This tower was once used as a lookout for pirate attacks and is now a popular spot for tourists to take in the view.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Centro Storico: Wander through the charming streets of the historic center, lined with shops, cafes, and restaurants.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Parco Naturale della Maremma: This nature reserve offers hiking trails and stunning views of the coastline and countryside.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Museo Archeologico di Vetulonia: This museum showcases the Etruscan civilization that once inhabited the area.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cala Violina: This pristine beach is known for its clear waters and white sand.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Fattoria delle Rocche: This family-run farm offers tours and tastings of their olive oil and wine.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cattedrale dei Santi Simone e Giuda: This beautiful cathedral features stunning artwork and a peaceful atmosphere.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Castiglione della Pescaia offers a wide variety of accommodation options to suit every budget and preference. Here are some suggestions. Hotel L&#39;Approdo: This 4-star hotel is located right on the beach and offers a rooftop terrace with stunning views. Camping Maremma Sans Souci: This family-friendly campground offers bungalows, mobile homes, and pitches for tents and RVs. Hotel Kinda: This charming hotel is located in the historic center of Castiglione della Pescaia and features bright, airy rooms. Hotel Lucerna: This modern hotel is located just a short walk from the beach and offers a swimming pool and garden. L&#39;Andana Tenuta La Badiola: This luxurious 5-star resort is located in the countryside just outside of Castiglione della Pescaia and features a spa, golf course, and gourmet restaurant. Residence Teclini: This apartment-style hotel is located just a few steps from the beach and offers spacious, comfortable apartments. Hotel Riva del Sole: This 4-star hotel is located on the beach and features a swimming pool, tennis courts, and restaurant. Appartamenti Cala Piccola: These apartments are located in a scenic spot overlooking the sea and feature a swimming pool and private beach access. Hotel Tirreno: This beachfront hotel offers comfortable rooms and a restaurant with sea views. Podere Santa Maria: This charming bed and breakfast is located in the countryside and offers cozy rooms and a pool.</div>\n', 2107, 'en', 1),
(2295, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Der Hauptstrand in Castiglione della Pescaia hei&szlig;t &bdquo;Spiaggia di Ponente&ldquo; (Weststrand). Er befindet sich im Herzen der Stadt und ist einer der beliebtesten Str&auml;nde der Gegend. Hier sind einige Merkmale dieses Strandes. Der Strand ist etwa 3 Kilometer lang und bietet feinen wei&szlig;en Sand und kristallklares Wasser. Entlang des Strandes gibt es mehrere Strandclubs, in denen Sie Sonnenschirme und Liegen mieten und ein Getr&auml;nk oder einen Snack genie&szlig;en k&ouml;nnen. Der Strand ist breit und ger&auml;umig, sodass selbst an den gesch&auml;ftigsten Tagen viel Platz ist, um sich auszubreiten und zu entspannen. Das Meer ist im Allgemeinen ruhig und sicher zum Schwimmen, was es ideal f&uuml;r Familien mit Kindern macht. Der Strand wird t&auml;glich gereinigt und ist gepflegt. Entlang des Strandes gibt es mehrere Restaurants und Bars, in denen Sie eine Mahlzeit oder ein Getr&auml;nk genie&szlig;en k&ouml;nnen, w&auml;hrend Sie die sch&ouml;ne Aussicht genie&szlig;en. Der Strand ist vom Stadtzentrum aus leicht zu erreichen und nur einen kurzen Spaziergang von vielen Hotels und Restaurants entfernt. Am Strand werden verschiedene Aktivit&auml;ten angeboten, darunter Paddleboarding, Kajakfahren und Beachvolleyball.<br />\n<br />\nInsgesamt ist Spiaggia di Ponente ein sch&ouml;ner und beliebter Strand, der f&uuml;r jeden etwas zu bieten hat.<br />\n<br />\nCastiglione della Pescaia ist eine charmante mittelalterliche Stadt an der toskanischen K&uuml;ste in Italien. Hier sind einige der besten Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten, die Sie sich ansehen sollten:<br />\n1. Castello di Castiglione: Diese beeindruckende Burg stammt aus dem 12. Jahrhundert und bietet einen atemberaubenden Blick auf die Stadt und die umliegende Landschaft.<br />\n2. Spiaggia delle Rocchette: Dieser sch&ouml;ne Strand bietet kristallklares Wasser und feinen Sand. Es ist ein gro&szlig;artiger Ort, um sich zu entspannen und die Sonne zu genie&szlig;en.<br />\n3. Chiesa di San Giovanni Battista: Diese historische Kirche verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber wundersch&ouml;ne Fresken und Kunstwerke.<br />\n4. Torre di Castiglione: Dieser Turm diente einst als Aussichtspunkt f&uuml;r Piratenangriffe und ist heute ein beliebter Ort f&uuml;r Touristen, um die Aussicht zu genie&szlig;en.<br />\n5. Centro Storico: Schlendern Sie durch die charmanten Stra&szlig;en des historischen Zentrums, ges&auml;umt von Gesch&auml;ften, Caf&eacute;s und Restaurants.<br />\n6. Parco Naturale della Maremma: Dieses Naturschutzgebiet bietet Wanderwege und einen atemberaubenden Blick auf die K&uuml;ste und die Landschaft.<br />\n7. Museo Archeologico di Vetulonia: Dieses Museum zeigt die etruskische Zivilisation, die einst die Gegend bewohnte.<br />\n8. Cala Violina: Dieser unber&uuml;hrte Strand ist bekannt f&uuml;r sein klares Wasser und seinen wei&szlig;en Sand.<br />\n9. Fattoria delle Rocche: Dieser familiengef&uuml;hrte Bauernhof bietet F&uuml;hrungen und Verkostungen von Oliven&ouml;l und Wein an.<br />\n10. Cattedrale dei Santi Simone e Giuda: Diese wundersch&ouml;ne Kathedrale bietet atemberaubende Kunstwerke und eine friedliche Atmosph&auml;re.<br />\n<br />\nCastiglione della Pescaia bietet eine gro&szlig;e Auswahl an Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten f&uuml;r jedes Budget und jede Vorliebe. Hier sind ein paar Vorschl&auml;ge. Hotel L&#39;Approdo: Dieses 4-Sterne-Hotel liegt direkt am Strand und bietet eine Dachterrasse mit atemberaubender Aussicht. Camping Maremma Sans Souci: Dieser familienfreundliche Campingplatz bietet Bungalows, Mobilheime und Stellpl&auml;tze f&uuml;r Zelte und Wohnmobile. Hotel Kinda: Dieses charmante Hotel befindet sich im historischen Zentrum von Castiglione della Pescaia und verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber helle, luftige Zimmer. Hotel Lucerna: Dieses moderne Hotel liegt nur einen kurzen Spaziergang vom Strand entfernt und bietet einen Swimmingpool und einen Garten. L&#39;Andana Tenuta La Badiola: Dieses luxuri&ouml;se 5-Sterne-Resort liegt auf dem Land etwas au&szlig;erhalb von Castiglione della Pescaia und verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber ein Spa, einen Golfplatz und ein Gourmetrestaurant. Residence Teclini: Dieses Hotel im Apartmentstil liegt nur wenige Schritte vom Strand entfernt und bietet ger&auml;umige, komfortable Apartments. Hotel Riva del Sole: Dieses 4-Sterne-Hotel liegt direkt am Strand und verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber einen Swimmingpool, Tennispl&auml;tze und ein Restaurant. Appartamenti Cala Piccola: Diese Apartments befinden sich an einem malerischen Ort mit Blick auf das Meer und verf&uuml;gen &uuml;ber einen Swimmingpool und Zugang zum Privatstrand. Hotel Tirreno: Dieses Strandhotel bietet komfortable Zimmer und ein Restaurant mit Meerblick. Podere Santa Maria: Dieses charmante Bed &amp; Breakfast liegt auf dem Land und bietet gem&uuml;tliche Zimmer und einen Pool.</div>\n', 2107, 'de', 1),
(2296, 'La spiaggia principale di Castiglione della Pescaia si chiama &quot;Spiaggia di Ponente&quot;. Si trova nel cuore del paese ed &egrave; una delle spiagge pi&ugrave; frequentate della zona. Ecco alcune caratteristiche di questa spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga circa 3 chilometri ed &egrave; caratterizzata da sabbia bianca e fine e acque cristalline. Ci sono diversi stabilimenti balneari lungo la spiaggia dove &egrave; possibile noleggiare ombrelloni e lettini e gustare un drink o uno spuntino. La spiaggia &egrave; ampia e spaziosa, quindi anche nei giorni pi&ugrave; affollati c&#39;&egrave; molto spazio per distendersi e rilassarsi. Il mare &egrave; generalmente calmo e sicuro per nuotare, rendendolo ideale per famiglie con bambini. La spiaggia viene pulita quotidianamente ed &egrave; ben tenuta. Ci sono diversi ristoranti e bar lungo la spiaggia, dove &egrave; possibile gustare un pasto o un drink ammirando la splendida vista. La spiaggia &egrave; facilmente accessibile dal centro della citt&agrave; ed &egrave; a pochi passi da molti hotel e ristoranti. Ci sono diverse attivit&agrave; disponibili sulla spiaggia, tra cui paddleboarding, kayak e beach volley.<br />\n<br />\nNel complesso, la Spiaggia di Ponente &egrave; una spiaggia bella e popolare che offre qualcosa per tutti.<br />\n<br />\nCastiglione della Pescaia &egrave; un affascinante borgo medievale situato sulla costa toscana in Italia. Ecco alcuni dei migliori luoghi turistici da visitare:<br />\n1. Castello di Castiglione: questo imponente castello risale al XII secolo e offre una vista mozzafiato sulla citt&agrave; e sulla campagna circostante.<br />\n2. Spiaggia delle Rocchette: Questa bellissima spiaggia vanta acque cristalline e sabbia fine. &Egrave; un ottimo posto per rilassarsi e prendere il sole.<br />\n3. Chiesa di San Giovanni Battista: questa chiesa storica presenta splendidi affreschi e opere d&#39;arte.<br />\n4. Torre di Castiglione: questa torre un tempo era utilizzata come punto di osservazione per gli attacchi dei pirati ed &egrave; ora un luogo popolare per i turisti per ammirare il panorama.<br />\n5. Centro Storico: passeggia per le affascinanti strade del centro storico, fiancheggiate da negozi, caffetterie e ristoranti.<br />\n6. Parco Naturale della Maremma: questa riserva naturale offre sentieri escursionistici e viste mozzafiato sulla costa e sulla campagna.<br />\n7. Museo Archeologico di Vetulonia: questo museo mette in mostra la civilt&agrave; etrusca che un tempo abitava la zona.<br />\n8. Cala Violina: questa spiaggia incontaminata &egrave; nota per le sue acque limpide e la sabbia bianca.<br />\n9. Fattoria delle Rocche: questa fattoria a conduzione familiare offre tour e degustazioni del loro olio d&#39;oliva e vino.<br />\n10. Cattedrale dei Santi Simone e Giuda: questa bellissima cattedrale presenta splendide opere d&#39;arte e un&#39;atmosfera tranquilla.<br />\n<br />\nCastiglione della Pescaia offre un&#39;ampia variet&agrave; di opzioni di alloggio per soddisfare ogni budget e preferenza. Ecco alcuni suggerimenti. Hotel L&#39;Approdo: questo hotel a 4 stelle si trova proprio sulla spiaggia e offre una terrazza panoramica con vista mozzafiato. Camping Maremma Sans Souci: questo campeggio per famiglie offre bungalow, case mobili e piazzole per tende e camper. Hotel Kinda: Questo affascinante hotel &egrave; situato nel centro storico di Castiglione della Pescaia e dispone di camere luminose e ariose. Hotel Lucerna: questo moderno hotel si trova a pochi passi dalla spiaggia e offre una piscina e un giardino. L&#39;Andana Tenuta La Badiola: questo lussuoso resort a 5 stelle si trova nella campagna appena fuori Castiglione della Pescaia e dispone di spa, campo da golf e ristorante gourmet. Residence Teclini: Questo hotel in stile appartamento si trova a pochi passi dalla spiaggia e offre appartamenti spaziosi e confortevoli. Hotel Riva del Sole: questo hotel a 4 stelle si trova sulla spiaggia e dispone di piscina, campi da tennis e ristorante. Appartamenti Cala Piccola: Questi appartamenti sono situati in un punto panoramico con vista sul mare e dispongono di piscina e accesso privato alla spiaggia. Hotel Tirreno: questo hotel fronte mare offre camere confortevoli e un ristorante con vista sul mare. Podere Santa Maria: Questo affascinante bed and breakfast si trova in campagna e offre camere accoglienti e una piscina.', 2107, 'it', 1),
(2297, 'The main beach in Marina di Grosseto is a long and wide stretch of sandy coastline, which is popular with both locals and tourists. Here are some features of this beach. The beach is about 7 kilometers long and features fine golden sand and clear water. The sea is generally calm, making it ideal for swimming and other water activities. There are several beach clubs and rental services along the beach, where you can rent umbrellas, sunbeds, and other beach equipment. The beach is easily accessible and is located just a few minutes walk from the town center. There are many restaurants and bars along the beach where you can enjoy a meal or a drink with a view of the sea. There are several activities available on the beach, including beach volleyball, paddleboarding, and kayaking. The beach is surrounded by a beautiful pine forest, which provides shade and a cool breeze during the hot summer months.<br />\n<br />\nOverall, the Marina di Grosseto main beach is a great place to spend a day or two enjoying the sun, sand, and sea. It&#39;s perfect for families with children or anyone who loves the beach lifestyle.<br />\n&nbsp;<br />\nMarina di Grosseto is a popular seaside town located in Tuscany, Italy. Here are some of the top sightseeing attractions in the area:\n<ol>\n	<li>Marina di Grosseto Beach: The main attraction of this town is its beautiful long sandy beach, which is ideal for swimming and sunbathing. There are also many beach bars and restaurants along the promenade.</li>\n	<li>Natural Park of Maremma: This large protected area is located just a few kilometers from Marina di Grosseto and offers beautiful natural landscapes, including hills, forests, and beaches. It&#39;s a great place for hiking, cycling, and birdwatching.</li>\n	<li>Castello di Scarlino: This medieval castle is located on a hill overlooking the sea and offers stunning views of the coastline. The castle is open to visitors and hosts cultural events and exhibitions.</li>\n	<li>Church of San Francesco: This historic church is located in the center of Marina di Grosseto and features beautiful architecture and artwork.</li>\n	<li>Coastal Tower of Marina di Grosseto: This historic tower was built in the 16th century to defend against pirates and offers beautiful views of the sea and the town.</li>\n	<li>Rocca di Montemassi: This medieval fortress is located in the nearby town of Montemassi and offers a glimpse into the history of the area. The fortress is open to visitors and hosts cultural events and exhibitions.</li>\n	<li>Giardino delle Farfalle: This beautiful butterfly garden is located in the nearby town of Alberese and features hundreds of different species of butterflies and moths.</li>\n	<li>Marina di Alberese: This beautiful beach is located in the heart of the Maremma Natural Park and is accessible only by foot or bike. It&#39;s an unspoiled and peaceful beach, ideal for nature lovers.</li>\n	<li>Etruscan Tombs of Vetulonia: This ancient Etruscan necropolis is located in the nearby town of Vetulonia and features several well-preserved tombs and artifacts from the Etruscan civilization.</li>\n	<li>Archaeological Museum of Grosseto: This museum is located in the nearby town of Grosseto and features a collection of artifacts from the Etruscan, Roman, and Medieval periods. It&#39;s a great place to learn about the history of the area.</li>\n</ol>\n&nbsp;<br />\nMarina di Grosseto offers a range of accommodation options to suit different budgets and preferences. Here are some of the most popular types of accommodation in the area. Hotels: There are several hotels in Marina di Grosseto, ranging from budget to luxury. Many hotels are located close to the beach, and some offer facilities such as swimming pools, restaurants, and spa services. Villas and apartments: If you prefer a self-catering option, there are many villas and apartments available for rent in the area. These are particularly popular with families or groups of friends who want more space and privacy. Camping: Camping is a popular option in Marina di Grosseto, with several campsites located near the beach. These campsites offer a range of facilities, including swimming pools, restaurants, and activities for children. Agriturismo: Agriturismo is a type of accommodation that is popular in rural areas of Italy. It involves staying on a working farm or vineyard and experiencing the local culture and cuisine. There are several agriturismi located in the countryside around Marina di Grosseto. Bed and breakfast: There are several bed and breakfast options in Marina di Grosseto, particularly in the town center. These offer a more intimate and personalized experience than hotels or resorts.<br />\n<br />\nOverall, Marina di Grosseto offers a wide range of accommodation options to suit different budgets and preferences. Whether you&#39;re looking for a luxury hotel or a rustic agriturismo, you&#39;re sure to find something that meets your needs in this beautiful seaside town.<br />\n&nbsp;<br />\n&nbsp;<br />\n&nbsp;', 2109, 'en', 1),
(2298, 'La spiaggia principale di Marina di Grosseto &egrave; un lungo e ampio tratto di litorale sabbioso, frequentato sia dai locali che dai turisti. Ecco alcune caratteristiche di questa spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; lunga circa 7 chilometri e presenta sabbia fine e dorata e acqua limpida. Il mare &egrave; generalmente calmo, il che lo rende ideale per nuotare e altre attivit&agrave; acquatiche. Ci sono diversi stabilimenti balneari e servizi di noleggio lungo la spiaggia, dove &egrave; possibile noleggiare ombrelloni, lettini e altre attrezzature da spiaggia. La spiaggia &egrave; facilmente raggiungibile e si trova a pochi minuti a piedi dal centro del paese. Ci sono molti ristoranti e bar lungo la spiaggia dove &egrave; possibile gustare un pasto o un drink con vista sul mare. Ci sono diverse attivit&agrave; disponibili sulla spiaggia, tra cui beach volley, paddleboarding e kayak. La spiaggia &egrave; circondata da una bellissima pineta, che offre ombra e una fresca brezza durante i caldi mesi estivi.<br />\nNel complesso, la spiaggia principale di Marina di Grosseto &egrave; un luogo ideale per trascorrere una o due giornate godendosi il sole, la sabbia e il mare. &Egrave; perfetto per famiglie con bambini o per chi ama lo stile di vita da spiaggia.<br />\n<br />\nMarina di Grosseto &egrave; una rinomata localit&agrave; balneare situata in Toscana, in Italia. Ecco alcune delle principali attrazioni turistiche della zona:<br />\n1. Spiaggia di Marina di Grosseto: l&#39;attrazione principale di questa localit&agrave; &egrave; la sua bellissima e lunga spiaggia sabbiosa, ideale per nuotare e prendere il sole. Ci sono anche molti bar sulla spiaggia e ristoranti lungo la passeggiata.<br />\n2. Parco Naturale della Maremma: Questa vasta area protetta si trova a pochi chilometri da Marina di Grosseto e offre splendidi paesaggi naturali, tra colline, boschi e spiagge. &Egrave; un luogo ideale per escursioni a piedi, in bicicletta e birdwatching.<br />\n3. Castello di Scarlino: questo castello medievale si trova su una collina che domina il mare e offre una vista mozzafiato sulla costa. Il castello &egrave; visitabile e ospita eventi culturali e mostre.<br />\n4. Chiesa di San Francesco: questa chiesa storica si trova nel centro di Marina di Grosseto e presenta una splendida architettura e opere d&#39;arte.<br />\n5. Torre costiera di Marina di Grosseto: questa storica torre fu costruita nel XVI secolo per difendersi dai pirati e offre splendide viste sul mare e sulla citt&agrave;.<br />\n6. Rocca di Montemassi: questa fortezza medievale si trova nella vicina citt&agrave; di Montemassi e offre uno scorcio della storia della zona. La fortezza &egrave; visitabile e ospita eventi culturali e mostre.<br />\n7. Giardino delle Farfalle: questo bellissimo giardino delle farfalle si trova nella vicina citt&agrave; di Alberese e presenta centinaia di specie diverse di farfalle e falene.<br />\n8. Marina di Alberese: Questa bellissima spiaggia si trova nel cuore del Parco Naturale della Maremma ed &egrave; accessibile solo a piedi o in bicicletta. &Egrave; una spiaggia incontaminata e tranquilla, ideale per gli amanti della natura.<br />\n9. Tombe Etrusche di Vetulonia: questa antica necropoli etrusca si trova nella vicina citt&agrave; di Vetulonia e presenta diverse tombe e manufatti ben conservati della civilt&agrave; etrusca.<br />\n10. Museo Archeologico di Grosseto: questo museo si trova nella vicina citt&agrave; di Grosseto e presenta una collezione di reperti di epoca etrusca, romana e medievale. &Egrave; un ottimo posto per conoscere la storia della zona.<br />\n<br />\nMarina di Grosseto offre una gamma di opzioni di alloggio per soddisfare budget e preferenze diverse. Ecco alcune delle tipologie di alloggio pi&ugrave; popolari della zona. Hotel: ci sono diversi hotel a Marina di Grosseto, che vanno dall&#39;economico al lusso. Molti hotel si trovano vicino alla spiaggia e alcuni offrono servizi come piscine, ristoranti e servizi termali. Ville e appartamenti: se preferisci un&#39;opzione self-catering, ci sono molte ville e appartamenti disponibili per l&#39;affitto nella zona. Questi sono particolarmente apprezzati da famiglie o gruppi di amici che desiderano pi&ugrave; spazio e privacy. Campeggio: il campeggio &egrave; un&#39;opzione popolare a Marina di Grosseto, con diversi campeggi situati vicino alla spiaggia. Questi campeggi offrono una vasta gamma di servizi, tra cui piscine, ristoranti e attivit&agrave; per bambini. Agriturismo: l&#39;agriturismo &egrave; un tipo di alloggio popolare nelle zone rurali d&#39;Italia. Si tratta di soggiornare in una fattoria o in un vigneto e sperimentare la cultura e la cucina locale. Ci sono diversi agriturismi situati nelle campagne intorno a Marina di Grosseto. Bed and breakfast: a Marina di Grosseto ci sono diverse possibilit&agrave; di bed and breakfast, in particolare nel centro del paese. Questi offrono un&#39;esperienza pi&ugrave; intima e personalizzata rispetto agli hotel o ai resort.<br />\nNel complesso, Marina di Grosseto offre una vasta gamma di opzioni di alloggio per soddisfare budget e preferenze diverse. Che tu stia cercando un hotel di lusso o un agriturismo rustico, troverai sicuramente qualcosa che soddisfi le tue esigenze in questa splendida localit&agrave; di mare.', 2109, 'it', 1),
(2299, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Der Hauptstrand in Marina di Grosseto ist ein langer und breiter Sandstrand, der sowohl bei Einheimischen als auch bei Touristen beliebt ist. Hier sind einige Merkmale dieses Strandes. Der Strand ist etwa 7 Kilometer lang und bietet feinen goldenen Sand und klares Wasser. Das Meer ist im Allgemeinen ruhig, was es ideal zum Schwimmen und f&uuml;r andere Wasseraktivit&auml;ten macht. Entlang des Strandes gibt es mehrere Strandclubs und Verleihdienste, wo Sie Sonnenschirme, Sonnenliegen und andere Strandausr&uuml;stung mieten k&ouml;nnen. Der Strand ist leicht zug&auml;nglich und liegt nur wenige Gehminuten vom Stadtzentrum entfernt. Entlang des Strandes gibt es viele Restaurants und Bars, in denen Sie eine Mahlzeit oder ein Getr&auml;nk mit Blick auf das Meer genie&szlig;en k&ouml;nnen. Am Strand werden verschiedene Aktivit&auml;ten angeboten, darunter Beachvolleyball, Paddleboarding und Kajakfahren. Der Strand ist von einem wundersch&ouml;nen Pinienwald umgeben, der in den hei&szlig;en Sommermonaten Schatten und eine k&uuml;hle Brise spendet.<br />\n<br />\nInsgesamt ist der Hauptstrand von Marina di Grosseto ein gro&szlig;artiger Ort, um ein oder zwei Tage damit zu verbringen, Sonne, Sand und Meer zu genie&szlig;en. Es ist perfekt f&uuml;r Familien mit Kindern oder alle, die den Strandlebensstil lieben.<br />\n<br />\nMarina di Grosseto ist eine beliebte K&uuml;stenstadt in der Toskana, Italien. Hier sind einige der Top-Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten in der Umgebung:<br />\n1. Strand von Marina di Grosseto: Die Hauptattraktion dieser Stadt ist ihr wundersch&ouml;ner langer Sandstrand, der ideal zum Schwimmen und Sonnenbaden ist. Entlang der Promenade gibt es auch viele Strandbars und Restaurants.<br />\n2. Naturpark Maremma: Dieses gro&szlig;e Naturschutzgebiet liegt nur wenige Kilometer von Marina di Grosseto entfernt und bietet wundersch&ouml;ne Naturlandschaften mit H&uuml;geln, W&auml;ldern und Str&auml;nden. Es ist ein gro&szlig;artiger Ort zum Wandern, Radfahren und Vogelbeobachten.<br />\n3. Castello di Scarlino: Diese mittelalterliche Burg liegt auf einem H&uuml;gel mit Blick auf das Meer und bietet einen atemberaubenden Blick auf die K&uuml;ste. Das Schloss ist f&uuml;r Besucher ge&ouml;ffnet und beherbergt kulturelle Veranstaltungen und Ausstellungen.<br />\n4. Kirche San Francesco: Diese historische Kirche befindet sich im Zentrum von Marina di Grosseto und bietet wundersch&ouml;ne Architektur und Kunstwerke.<br />\n5. K&uuml;stenturm von Marina di Grosseto: Dieser historische Turm wurde im 16. Jahrhundert zur Verteidigung gegen Piraten erbaut und bietet eine sch&ouml;ne Aussicht auf das Meer und die Stadt.<br />\n6. Rocca di Montemassi: Diese mittelalterliche Festung befindet sich in der nahe gelegenen Stadt Montemassi und bietet einen Einblick in die Geschichte der Gegend. Die Festung ist f&uuml;r Besucher ge&ouml;ffnet und beherbergt kulturelle Veranstaltungen und Ausstellungen.<br />\n7. Giardino delle Farfalle: Dieser wundersch&ouml;ne Schmetterlingsgarten befindet sich in der nahe gelegenen Stadt Alberese und beherbergt Hunderte verschiedener Arten von Schmetterlingen und Motten.<br />\n8. Marina di Alberese: Dieser wundersch&ouml;ne Strand liegt im Herzen des Naturparks Maremma und ist nur zu Fu&szlig; oder mit dem Fahrrad erreichbar. Es ist ein unber&uuml;hrter und friedlicher Strand, ideal f&uuml;r Naturliebhaber.<br />\n9. Etruskische Gr&auml;ber von Vetulonia: Diese alte etruskische Nekropole befindet sich in der nahe gelegenen Stadt Vetulonia und verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber mehrere gut erhaltene Gr&auml;ber und Artefakte der etruskischen Zivilisation.<br />\n10. Arch&auml;ologisches Museum von Grosseto: Dieses Museum befindet sich in der nahe gelegenen Stadt Grosseto und zeigt eine Sammlung von Artefakten aus der etruskischen, r&ouml;mischen und mittelalterlichen Zeit. Es ist ein gro&szlig;artiger Ort, um etwas &uuml;ber die Geschichte der Gegend zu erfahren.<br />\n<br />\nMarina di Grosseto bietet eine Reihe von Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten f&uuml;r unterschiedliche Budgets und Vorlieben. Hier sind einige der beliebtesten Arten von Unterk&uuml;nften in der Gegend. Hotels: Es gibt mehrere Hotels in Marina di Grosseto, von Budget bis Luxus. Viele Hotels befinden sich in Strandn&auml;he und einige bieten Einrichtungen wie Swimmingpools, Restaurants und Wellnessangebote. Villen und Apartments: Wenn Sie eine Selbstversorger-Option bevorzugen, gibt es viele Villen und Apartments, die in der Gegend gemietet werden k&ouml;nnen. Diese sind besonders beliebt bei Familien oder Freundesgruppen, die sich mehr Platz und Privatsph&auml;re w&uuml;nschen. Camping: Camping ist eine beliebte Option in Marina di Grosseto, mit mehreren Campingpl&auml;tzen in Strandn&auml;he. Diese Campingpl&auml;tze bieten eine Reihe von Einrichtungen, darunter Schwimmb&auml;der, Restaurants und Aktivit&auml;ten f&uuml;r Kinder. Agriturismo: Agriturismo ist eine Art Unterkunft, die in l&auml;ndlichen Gebieten Italiens beliebt ist. Es beinhaltet den Aufenthalt auf einem bewirtschafteten Bauernhof oder Weinberg und das Erleben der lokalen Kultur und K&uuml;che. Auf dem Land rund um Marina di Grosseto gibt es mehrere Agriturismi. Bed and Breakfast: In Marina di Grosseto, insbesondere im Stadtzentrum, gibt es mehrere Bed and Breakfast-Optionen. Diese bieten ein intimeres und pers&ouml;nlicheres Erlebnis als Hotels oder Resorts.<br />\nInsgesamt bietet Marina di Grosseto eine gro&szlig;e Auswahl an Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten f&uuml;r unterschiedliche Budgets und Vorlieben. Ob Sie ein Luxushotel oder einen rustikalen Agriturismo suchen, in dieser sch&ouml;nen K&uuml;stenstadt finden Sie sicher etwas, das Ihren Bed&uuml;rfnissen entspricht.</div>\n', 2109, 'de', 1),
(2300, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">The main beach in Albinia is called &quot;Spiaggia Lunga&quot; (Long Beach), and it&#39;s located just a short walk from the town center. The beach is a long, sandy stretch that offers plenty of space for sunbathing and swimming. Spiaggia Lunga has a few different sections, some of which are free and others that are equipped with beach umbrellas, sun loungers, and other amenities for a fee. There are also a few beach bars and restaurants where you can grab a drink or a bite to eat. In addition to Spiaggia Lunga, there are a few other beaches in the area that are worth checking out. Just a short drive from Albinia, you&#39;ll find the beaches of Giannella and Feniglia. These beaches are located within the Tombolo della Feniglia Nature Reserve, and they offer stunning views of the Mediterranean Sea and the urrounding landscape.<br />\nOverall, if you&#39;re looking for a beautiful beach to relax and soak up the sun during your visit to Albinia, you won&#39;t be disappointed by Spiaggia Lunga and the other nearby beaches.<br />\nAlbinia is a small town located in the province of Grosseto, in the Tuscany region of Italy. While the town itself is relatively small, there are several interesting sightseeing opportunities in the surrounding area. Here are a few options to consider:</div>\n\n<ol>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Orbetello - Just a few miles from Albinia, Orbetello is a charming coastal town that&#39;s worth a visit. It&#39;s situated on a narrow strip of land that separates the Mediterranean Sea from a lagoon, and it&#39;s home to a historic center, a 16th-century Spanish fortress, and a scenic waterfront area.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Monte Argentario - This stunning promontory is located just south of Albinia, and it offers some of the most breathtaking views in the region. You can hike or drive to the top of the mountain, where you&#39;ll find a historic Spanish fort and panoramic vistas of the sea and surrounding countryside.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Saturnia Hot Springs - If you&#39;re looking for a relaxing escape, the Saturnia Hot Springs are a must-visit. This natural thermal spa is located about 30 minutes from Albinia, and it features warm, mineral-rich waters that are said to have healing properties.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Talamone - This picturesque seaside village is located a short drive from Albinia, and it&#39;s known for its scenic harbor, historic castle, and tranquil beaches.</li>\n	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Maremma Regional Park - This nature reserve is located a short distance from Albinia, and it offers miles of hiking trails, scenic vistas, and a chance to spot local wildlife such as deer, wild boar, and birds of prey.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Overall, there are plenty of sightseeing opportunities in and around Albinia that offer a chance to explore the natural beauty and rich history of this region of Italy. Albinia is a small town located in the province of Grosseto, in the Tuscany region of Italy. There are a few different types of accommodation options available in Albinia, including hotels, bed and breakfasts, vacation rentals, and campsites. Some of the most popular hotels in Albinia include Hotel Corallo, Hotel La Rosa dei Venti, and Hotel Fontermosa. These hotels offer comfortable rooms, on-site restaurants, and other amenities. If you&#39;re looking for a more cozy and intimate experience, you might consider staying at a bed and breakfast in Albinia. Some options include B&amp;B La Residenza del Poggio, B&amp;B La Lanterna, and B&amp;B Il Gabbiano. For those who prefer the flexibility and privacy of a vacation rental, there are a number of apartments and villas available in and around Albinia. Websites such as Airbnb and Vrbo offer a range of options to choose from. Finally, if you&#39;re looking for an affordable and outdoorsy option, you might consider camping in Albinia. There are a few different campsites in the area, such as Camping Village Africa and Camping Village Il Gabbiano. Overall, there are plenty of accommodation options available in Albinia to suit a range of budgets and preferences.<br />\n<br />\n&nbsp;<br />\n&nbsp;</div>\n', 2110, 'en', 1),
(2301, '<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Der Hauptstrand in Albinia hei&szlig;t &quot;Spiaggia Lunga&quot; (Long Beach) und liegt nur einen kurzen Spaziergang vom Stadtzentrum entfernt. Der Strand ist ein langer Sandstrand, der viel Platz zum Sonnenbaden und Schwimmen bietet. Spiaggia Lunga hat ein paar verschiedene Bereiche, von denen einige kostenlos sind und andere gegen Geb&uuml;hr mit Sonnenschirmen, Liegest&uuml;hlen und anderen Annehmlichkeiten ausgestattet sind. Es gibt auch ein paar Strandbars und Restaurants, in denen Sie etwas trinken oder etwas essen k&ouml;nnen. Neben Spiaggia Lunga gibt es noch einige andere Str&auml;nde in der Umgebung, die einen Besuch wert sind. Nur eine kurze Autofahrt von Albinia entfernt finden Sie die Str&auml;nde von Giannella und Feniglia. Diese Str&auml;nde befinden sich im Naturschutzgebiet Tombolo della Feniglia und bieten einen atemberaubenden Blick auf das Mittelmeer und die umliegende Landschaft.&nbsp;Alles in allem, wenn Sie auf der Suche nach einem sch&ouml;nen Strand zum Entspannen und Sonnenbaden w&auml;hrend Ihres Besuchs in Albinia sind, werden Sie von Spiaggia Lunga und den anderen nahe gelegenen Str&auml;nden nicht entt&auml;uscht sein.<br />\n<br />\nAlbinia ist eine kleine Stadt in der Provinz Grosseto in der italienischen Region Toskana. Obwohl die Stadt selbst relativ klein ist, gibt es in der Umgebung mehrere interessante Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten. Hier sind einige Optionen, die Sie in Betracht ziehen sollten:<br />\n1. Orbetello - Nur wenige Kilometer von Albinia entfernt, ist Orbetello eine charmante K&uuml;stenstadt, die einen Besuch wert ist. Es liegt auf einem schmalen Landstreifen, der das Mittelmeer von einer Lagune trennt, und beherbergt ein historisches Zentrum, eine spanische Festung aus dem 16. Jahrhundert und eine malerische Ufergegend.<br />\n2. Monte Argentario &ndash; Dieses atemberaubende Vorgebirge liegt s&uuml;dlich von Albinia und bietet einige der atemberaubendsten Ausblicke in der Region. Sie k&ouml;nnen auf den Gipfel des Berges wandern oder fahren, wo Sie eine historische spanische Festung und einen Panoramablick auf das Meer und die umliegende Landschaft finden.<br />\n3. Saturnia Hot Springs &ndash; Wenn Sie auf der Suche nach einem entspannenden Zufluchtsort sind, sind die Saturnia Hot Springs ein Muss. Dieses nat&uuml;rliche Thermalbad liegt etwa 30 Minuten von Albinia entfernt und verf&uuml;gt &uuml;ber warmes, mineralreiches Wasser, dem heilende Eigenschaften nachgesagt werden.<br />\n4. Talamone - Dieses malerische K&uuml;stendorf liegt nur eine kurze Autofahrt von Albinia entfernt und ist bekannt f&uuml;r seinen malerischen Hafen, die historische Burg und die ruhigen Str&auml;nde.<br />\n5. Maremma Regional Park - Dieses Naturschutzgebiet liegt nicht weit von Albinia entfernt und bietet kilometerlange Wanderwege, malerische Ausblicke und die M&ouml;glichkeit, einheimische Wildtiere wie Hirsche, Wildschweine und Raubv&ouml;gel zu beobachten.<br />\n<br />\nInsgesamt gibt es in und um Albinia viele Sehensw&uuml;rdigkeiten, die die M&ouml;glichkeit bieten, die nat&uuml;rliche Sch&ouml;nheit und die reiche Geschichte dieser Region Italiens zu erkunden.<br />\n<br />\nAlbinia ist eine kleine Stadt in der Provinz Grosseto in der italienischen Region Toskana. Es gibt ein paar verschiedene Arten von Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten in Albinia, darunter Hotels, Bed &amp; Breakfasts, Ferienwohnungen und Campingpl&auml;tze. Zu den beliebtesten Hotels in Albinien z&auml;hlen Hotel Corallo, Hotel La Rosa dei Venti und Hotel Fontermosa. Diese Hotels bieten komfortable Zimmer, hauseigene Restaurants und andere Annehmlichkeiten. Wenn Sie auf der Suche nach einer gem&uuml;tlicheren und intimeren Erfahrung sind, sollten Sie in Betracht ziehen, in einem Bed &amp; Breakfast in Albinia zu &uuml;bernachten. Einige Optionen sind B&amp;B La Residenza del Poggio, B&amp;B La Lanterna und B&amp;B Il Gabbiano. F&uuml;r diejenigen, die die Flexibilit&auml;t und Privatsph&auml;re einer Ferienwohnung bevorzugen, gibt es eine Reihe von Apartments und Villen in und um Albinia. Websites wie Airbnb und Vrbo bieten eine Reihe von Optionen zur Auswahl. Wenn Sie nach einer erschwinglichen Option im Freien suchen, sollten Sie schlie&szlig;lich in Betracht ziehen, in Albinia zu campen. Es gibt einige verschiedene Campingpl&auml;tze in der Umgebung, wie Camping Village Africa und Camping Village Il Gabbiano. Insgesamt gibt es in Albinia viele Unterkunftsm&ouml;glichkeiten f&uuml;r verschiedene Budgets und Vorlieben.</div>\n', 2110, 'de', 1);
